ng>Coworking Budget</strong> – $200/month to rent a coworking space.</p></li><li><p><strong>Continuous Learning Culture</strong> – We support curiosity, experimentation, and growth.</p></li><li><p><strong>Annual Company Off-sites</strong> – Connect with your teammates in person at various locations around the globe.</p></li></ul><p style=\";\"></p><p>Find more <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-17 01:40:10.351', '2026-06-17 01:40:10.351', '', '', '', 'Europe', '', 'Arbeitnow', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/scholarshipowl/account-executive-full-cycle-berlin-305687', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/scholarshipowl/account-executive-full-cycle-berlin-305687', '[{\"url\":\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/scholarshipowl/account-executive-full-cycle-berlin-305687\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
