(65, 6, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'Sure, here are my contact details:\n\nEmail: smshagor.ru@gmail.com\nPhone: +79954949836\n\nFeel free to reach out any time.', '2026-05-10 13:21:43.383', '', ''),
