(70, 6, 'visitor', 'Shagor', 'can you shear exprience', '2026-05-10 13:23:09.491', '', ''),
(71, 6, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'I worked as a Web Developer at DataSoft LTD. in Dhaka from 2021 to 2022. I delivered end-to-end freelance web projects, including API development, responsive UI work with Laravel and Tailwind CSS, and deployment support. I also built and maintained backend features, handled database migrations, and collaborated closely with the team on bug fixes and code reviews.\n\nBeyond that, I\'ve built an AI-powered financial app where I developed the backend using Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB, integrated OpenAI assistants, voice-to-text with AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF generation from Google Sheets. That project gave me strong hands-on experience with cloud services, authentication flows, and performance optimization.\n\nLet me know if you\'d like more detail on any specific area.', '2026-05-10 13:23:23.363', '', ''),
(72, 6, 'visitor', 'Shagor', 'in backend development', '2026-05-10 13:24:17.668', '', ''),
(73, 6, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'I focus on backend systems that are robust and scalable. Most of my work involves Node.js with Express and TypeScript, but I’m also strong with Laravel. For example, in the AI-powered financial app I built, the backend handled authentication, AI orchestration, document generation, and cloud integrations (AWS SES, S3, EC2) with MongoDB for flexible data storage.\n\nIf you\'re thinking about SaaS backends, that’s a good fit too — I’ve built subscription logic, role-based access, and secure APIs. Let me know if you’d like to talk through your specific needs.', '2026-05-10 13:24:35.804', '', ''),
(74, 6, 'visitor', 'Shagor', 'no thanks', '2026-05-10 13:25:13.440', '', ''),
(75, 6, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'No problem at all. If you ever want to chat about a project or have any questions, just let me know.', '2026-05-10 13:25:30.134', '', ''),
