(84, 7, 'visitor', 'Shagor', 'can you give me some detials about it', '2026-05-13 12:38:31.043', '', ''),
(85, 7, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'Sure, that\'s the AI-powered financial app I worked on. I built the backend using Express and TypeScript, wired up OpenAI’s models for a conversational assistant, handled authentication via Google/Facebook and OTP through AWS SES, and integrated voice-to-text with Amazon Transcribe. The app pulls data from Google Sheets to automatically generate PDF term sheets and sends them via email, so a lot of manual financial paperwork gets removed from the user’s side.', '2026-05-13 12:38:42.374', '', ''),
(86, 7, 'visitor', 'Shagor', 'can give me the contact info', '2026-05-13 12:39:23.908', '', ''),
(87, 7, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'I don’t have the contact details handy right now, but Shagor will reply to you personally with the info. You’ll hear back soon.', '2026-05-13 12:39:35.753', '', ''),
(88, 7, 'visitor', 'Shagor', 'give me shagor contact info', '2026-05-13 12:39:48.824', '', ''),
(89, 7, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'You can reach me directly at:\n\nEmail: smshagor.ru@gmail.com\nPhone: +79954949836\nAddress: 87, Lomonosova, Voronezh - 394087, Russia\n\nIf you\'re reaching out about a project, the contact form on the site is usually the easiest way to start.', '2026-05-13 12:40:03.900', '', ''),
(90, 7, 'visitor', 'Shagor', 'ok thank you', '2026-05-13 12:40:32.639', '', ''),
(91, 7, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'You\'re welcome! Let me know if you need anything else.', '2026-05-13 12:40:41.845', '', ''),
(92, 8, 'visitor', 'Akash Afraz', 'Hey Shagor, your work on GPS-denied autonomous systems really caught my attention. I’m building a startup and currently testing a GPS-free drone navigation system as well.\r\n\r\nFeels like we’re solving similar problems around GPS vulnerability in drones. Would love to connect and explore possible collaboration or idea sharing.', '2026-05-16 07:42:30.493', '', ''),
(93, 8, 'assistant', 'Shagor Assistant', 'I could not answer that properly right now. Please wait for Shagor and he will reply personally.', '2026-05-16 07:42:56.031', '', ''),
(94, 8, 'admin', 'support@smshagor.com', 'Hi Akash Afraz,\r\n\r\nGreat to connect. Building for autonomous infrastructure without relying on GPS is no small feat, so it’s always exciting to meet fellow builders in this niche.\r\n\r\nLately, I’ve been diving deep into autonomous drone technologies, specifically swarm intelligence, decentralized systems, and hardware-level resilience. I\'d love to learn more about your system\'s architecture and the specific testing milestones your startup is hitting.\r\n\r\nDefinitely down for a deep dive into research and ideas. Let me know what your availability looks like next week!\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nShagor', '2026-05-16 15:06:21.956', '', ''),
