(1, 1, 1, 'dmaurath@linkedin.com', 'Application for Md Shahanur Islam: your job alert for Intership In Germany in Germany has been created', 'Hello,\n\nI am interested in the Md Shahanur Islam: your job alert for Intership In Germany in Germany has been created opportunity at Unknown company. My background as Md Shahanur Islam Shagor aligns well with this role, especially around HTML and CSS, including work on AI Powered Financial App.\n\nI have attached my CV and cover letter for your review. I would appreciate the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', 'OPENED', '2026-06-04 19:48:28.597', '2026-06-05 04:39:36.215', '<69d4dd51-e4b8-eebe-b44e-af337c854630@gmail.com>', '2026-06-04 19:45:16.807', '2026-06-05 17:17:02.406', 'cmpzwn8qu0001kssona3ffv4b', '2026-06-05 04:39:48.248', '2026-06-05 17:17:02.404', 4, NULL, 0, 'DEEPSEEK', 'deepseek-chat', 'Task: Create a recruiter outreach email.\nReturn strict JSON only: {\"emailSubject\":\"...\",\"emailBody\":\"...\"}.\nGenerate a clear subject and body.\nSubject format: Application for {jobTitle} - Md Shahanur Islam Shagor.\nEmail body should be 90-140 words and never exceed 160 words.\nUse a simple greeting. If recruiter name exists, use it; otherwise use \'Hello\'.\nThe first sentence must be direct and specific to the role and company.\nConnect only the strongest 1-2 relevant skills or projects from the portfolio context to the job.\nAdd one sentence explaining why the role fits the applicant.\nIf attachments are enabled, include this exact sentence: I\'ve attached my CV and cover letter for your review.\nInclude portfolio link only if available in the context.\nSound confident, polite, and human.\nNo emojis.\nNo markdown.\nNo bullet points.\nDo not mention missing skills, weak fit, uncertainty, or anything negative.\nAvoid these generic phrases: I am writing to express my interest; I am excited to leverage; dynamic professional; synergy; passionate individual; fast-paced environment.\nContext:\n{\n  \"applicant\": {\n    \"name\": \"Hi there, I\'m Shagor\",\n    \"designation\": \"Full-Stack & AI Engineer\",\n    \"summary\": \"Hi, I\'m Shahanur Islam Shagor. I am a Software Engineer specializing in Full Stuck Web Development, Autonomous Systems and AI Engineering Enthusiast focused on building intelligent real-world technologies that combine software engineering, robotics, cybersecurity, and distributed autonomous systems.\\nI am passionate about designing intelligent systems capable of operating in complex real-world environments where AI, autonomy, and cybersecurity work together to solve advanced technological challenges.\",\n    \"email\": \"smshagor.ru@gmail.com\",\n    \"portfolio\": \"md_shahanurislamshagor_\",\n    \"cvUrl\": \"/uploads/1780329910238-shahanur-islam-shagor-resume.pdf\",\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"HTML\",\n      \"CSS\",\n      \"Javascript\",\n      \"Typescript\",\n      \"React\",\n      \"Next JS\",\n      \"Tailwind\",\n      \"MongoDB\",\n      \"MySQL\",\n      \"PostgreSQL\",\n      \"Git\",\n      \"AWS\",\n      \"Bootstrap\",\n      \"Docker\",\n      \"Go\",\n      \"Figma\",\n      \"Firebase\",\n      \"MaterialUI\",\n      \"Nginx\",\n      \"Strapi\",\n      \"PHP\",\n      \"Laravel\",\n      \"Express JS\",\n      \"Node JS\",\n      \"GraphQL\",\n      \"C++\",\n      \"C#\",\n      \"Vue JS\",\n      \"Angular JS\",\n      \"React Native\",\n      \"Linux\",\n      \"Apache\",\n      \"CI/CD\",\n      \"CMake\",\n      \"Flutter\",\n      \"Kotlin\",\n      \"Jetson Nano\",\n      \"Google Cloud\",\n      \"Digital Ocean\",\n      \"Kubernetes\",\n      \"Prometheus\",\n      \"Grafana\",\n      \"Jest\",\n      \"PHPUnit\",\n      \"PyTest\",\n      \"Redis\",\n      \"Socket.IO\",\n      \"Microservices\"\n    ],\n    \"education\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"strongestProjects\": [\n      {},\n      {},\n      {}\n    ],\n    \"sourceTablesUsed\": [\n      \"Profile\",\n      \"Skill\",\n      \"Education\",\n      \"Project\",\n      \"Experience\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"job\": {\n    \"title\": \"Md Shahanur Islam: your job alert for Intership In Germany in Germany has been created\",\n    \"company\": \"Unknown company\",\n    \"location\": \"\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/comm/jobs/view/4299035855?alertAction=markasviewed&savedSearchId=5294295113&savedSearchAuthToken=1&AQGZExsvekHscQAAAZ57FP0Cf96PifxfbF8fo3or6AJiZPOG8AOQhsnehdspNy12uHaVoNvIZhfGt4QWD-zwwRvnjksc2ku5BQqTLvOaQKQNH_ELDxFgf_DISP2zBaS_bsoGfy5evyupWrZ2ezRZw2W3YTv0FCrQe174IaBF0KZqG1cgQvL9kvm7Y2pE9EMPQsiKahk1Bzp6iliGaMVaRRv6e96r1xFCmNbCpclScmgADtTBLXFbr_T1Rj8Q4Bfz8PiqLkQlsKDKrJNF2I-Jh28a7p-nkdIRPrdiBfJfKXYQ3Ofh_XpeyPk=&AUoy7tC0MMF8NZrOQzOrMZOGIfAi=&trackingId=JCfM%2FTXXRATblP78RDB7IQ%3D%3D&refId=tNNG3zkzC7V3RfmgW2qYRg%3D%3D&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_job_alert_confirmation_01%3Bh3x9CXMLTm6sod43Hzw1Gw%3D%3D&midToken=AQHw9rRSnl3Tiw&midSig=0KYSumn5mqKsg1&trk=eml-email_job_alert_confirmation_01-email_job_alert_confirmation-0-view_job&trkEmail=eml-email_job_alert_confirmation_01-email_job_alert_confirmation-0-view_job-null-s2og1v~mpt1hi1l~1g-null-null&eid=s2og1v-mpt1hi1l-1g&otpToken=MTMwMzE3ZTcxNzJiY2JjM2I0MjkwZmViNDExNmU3YjU4N2M5ZDE0OTlkYWY4ZDZjN2JkYTA3NmM0ZjUyNThmYWYyZDVkMGU5NjdiOGYwZDIwNGJmZjNiMTBjZjkwZDQ0ZjE3YmY1MmRiOThlN2U5ZmMxZmI1MzVlLDEsMQ%3D%3D\"\n  },\n  \"recruiter\": null,\n  \"match\": null,\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"tone\": \"professional-natural\",\n    \"maxEmailWords\": 160,\n    \"maxCoverLetterWords\": 450,\n    \"attachCv\": true,\n    \"attachCoverLetterPdf\": true\n  }\n}', 'Task: Write a customized cover letter for this job.\nReturn strict JSON only: {\"coverLetterText\":\"...\"}.\nGenerate clean cover letter text for a PDF.\nUse 3-4 short paragraphs only.\nOpening should mention the role/company and direct interest.\nMiddle should connect the strongest real portfolio skills, projects, or experience to the job requirements.\nClosing should be polite and mention the attached CV if available.\nKeep it recruiter-friendly and ATS-friendly.\nKeep it under 450 words.\nPrefer natural human wording.\nNo markdown.\nNo fake achievements.\nDo not invent facts. Do not exaggerate. Do not mention missing skills negatively.\nAvoid generic filler and AI-style language.\nContext:\n{\n  \"applicant\": {\n    \"name\": \"Hi there, I\'m Shagor\",\n    \"designation\": \"Full-Stack & AI Engineer\",\n    \"summary\": \"Hi, I\'m Shahanur Islam Shagor. I am a Software Engineer specializing in Full Stuck Web Development, Autonomous Systems and AI Engineering Enthusiast focused on building intelligent real-world technologies that combine software engineering, robotics, cybersecurity, and distributed autonomous systems.\\nI am passionate about designing intelligent systems capable of operating in complex real-world environments where AI, autonomy, and cybersecurity work together to solve advanced technological challenges.\",\n    \"email\": \"smshagor.ru@gmail.com\",\n    \"portfolio\": \"md_shahanurislamshagor_\",\n    \"cvUrl\": \"/uploads/1780329910238-shahanur-islam-shagor-resume.pdf\",\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"HTML\",\n      \"CSS\",\n      \"Javascript\",\n      \"Typescript\",\n      \"React\",\n      \"Next JS\",\n      \"Tailwind\",\n      \"MongoDB\",\n      \"MySQL\",\n      \"PostgreSQL\",\n      \"Git\",\n      \"AWS\",\n      \"Bootstrap\",\n      \"Docker\",\n      \"Go\",\n      \"Figma\",\n      \"Firebase\",\n      \"MaterialUI\",\n      \"Nginx\",\n      \"Strapi\",\n      \"PHP\",\n      \"Laravel\",\n      \"Express JS\",\n      \"Node JS\",\n      \"GraphQL\",\n      \"C++\",\n      \"C#\",\n      \"Vue JS\",\n      \"Angular JS\",\n      \"React Native\",\n      \"Linux\",\n      \"Apache\",\n      \"CI/CD\",\n      \"CMake\",\n      \"Flutter\",\n      \"Kotlin\",\n      \"Jetson Nano\",\n      \"Google Cloud\",\n      \"Digital Ocean\",\n      \"Kubernetes\",\n      \"Prometheus\",\n      \"Grafana\",\n      \"Jest\",\n      \"PHPUnit\",\n      \"PyTest\",\n      \"Redis\",\n      \"Socket.IO\",\n      \"Microservices\"\n    ],\n    \"education\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"strongestProjects\": [\n      {},\n      {},\n      {}\n    ],\n    \"sourceTablesUsed\": [\n      \"Profile\",\n      \"Skill\",\n      \"Education\",\n      \"Project\",\n      \"Experience\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"job\": {\n    \"title\": \"Md Shahanur Islam: your job alert for Intership In Germany in Germany has been created\",\n    \"company\": \"Unknown company\",\n    \"location\": \"\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/comm/jobs/view/4299035855?alertAction=markasviewed&savedSearchId=5294295113&savedSearchAuthToken=1&AQGZExsvekHscQAAAZ57FP0Cf96PifxfbF8fo3or6AJiZPOG8AOQhsnehdspNy12uHaVoNvIZhfGt4QWD-zwwRvnjksc2ku5BQqTLvOaQKQNH_ELDxFgf_DISP2zBaS_bsoGfy5evyupWrZ2ezRZw2W3YTv0FCrQe174IaBF0KZqG1cgQvL9kvm7Y2pE9EMPQsiKahk1Bzp6iliGaMVaRRv6e96r1xFCmNbCpclScmgADtTBLXFbr_T1Rj8Q4Bfz8PiqLkQlsKDKrJNF2I-Jh28a7p-nkdIRPrdiBfJfKXYQ3Ofh_XpeyPk=&AUoy7tC0MMF8NZrOQzOrMZOGIfAi=&trackingId=JCfM%2FTXXRATblP78RDB7IQ%3D%3D&refId=tNNG3zkzC7V3RfmgW2qYRg%3D%3D&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_job_alert_confirmation_01%3Bh3x9CXMLTm6sod43Hzw1Gw%3D%3D&midToken=AQHw9rRSnl3Tiw&midSig=0KYSumn5mqKsg1&trk=eml-email_job_alert_confirmation_01-email_job_alert_confirmation-0-view_job&trkEmail=eml-email_job_alert_confirmation_01-email_job_alert_confirmation-0-view_job-null-s2og1v~mpt1hi1l~1g-null-null&eid=s2og1v-mpt1hi1l-1g&otpToken=MTMwMzE3ZTcxNzJiY2JjM2I0MjkwZmViNDExNmU3YjU4N2M5ZDE0OTlkYWY4ZDZjN2JkYTA3NmM0ZjUyNThmYWYyZDVkMGU5NjdiOGYwZDIwNGJmZjNiMTB