ducation\",\n      \"Project\",\n      \"Experience\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"job\": {\n    \"title\": \"Freelance Writer\",\n    \"company\": \"IAPWE\",\n    \"location\": \"Worldwide\",\n    \"description\": \"<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\">Our organization is seeking content writers to create articles and blog posts on a variety of topics.</p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\"> </p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\">The rate of pay is $20 per 100 words (this comes out to approximately $100 per article or $50 per hour).</p>\\n<p> </p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\">Some topics you may be asked to write about include the following (you can always turn down a topic if you do not feel comfortable writing about it, however if you have experience or expertise in a specific area, please let us know):</p>\\n<p> </p>\\n<ul class=\\\"ul1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Health &amp; beauty</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Fitness</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Home Decor</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Fashion</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Sports</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Do it yourself</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Finance</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Legal</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Medical</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Family/Parenting</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Relationships</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Real Estate</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Restaurants</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Contracting (plumbing, pool building, remodeling, etc.)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p> </p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">These are just some of the more general industries and topics that we cover.</span></p>\\n<p> </p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 600; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.75px;\\\">Requirements</span><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">We ask that all work be completed using a word processor such as Microsoft Word or Open Office</li>\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">A reliable internet connection and the ability to meet deadlines</li>\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">Good communication skills and respond in a timely manner to editorial staff when they ask for updates on tasks, etc</li>\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">Work well as a team member with the rest of our content management and editorial staff</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><br><br><em><strong>Note</strong>: Applicants to this job signaled that accessing some writing tasks may require payment.</em></p>\\n<img src=\\\"https://remotive.com/job/track/1185979/blank.gif?source=public_api\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"/>\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/writing/freelance-writer-1185979\"\n  },\n  \"recruiter\": null,\n  \"match\": null,\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"tone\": \"professional-natural\",\n    \"maxEmailWords\": 160,\n    \"maxCoverLetterWords\": 450,\n    \"attachCv\": true,\n    \"attachCoverLetterPdf\": true\n  }\n}', 'Task: Write a customized cover letter for this job.\nReturn strict JSON only: {\"coverLetterText\":\"...\"}.\nGenerate clean cover letter text for a PDF.\nUse 3-4 short paragraphs only.\nOpening should mention the role/company and direct interest.\nMiddle should connect the strongest real portfolio skills, projects, or experience to the job requirements.\nClosing should be polite and mention the attached CV if available.\nKeep it recruiter-friendly and ATS-friendly.\nKeep it under 450 words.\nPrefer natural human wording.\nNo markdown.\nNo fake achievements.\nDo not invent facts. Do not exaggerate. Do not mention missing skills negatively.\nAvoid generic filler and AI-style language.\nContext:\n{\n  \"applicant\": {\n    \"name\": \"Hi there, I\'m Shagor\",\n    \"designation\": \"Full-Stack & AI Engineer\",\n    \"summary\": \"Hi, I\'m Shahanur Islam Shagor. I am a Software Engineer specializing in Full Stuck Web Development, Autonomous Systems and AI Engineering Enthusiast focused on building intelligent real-world technologies that combine software engineering, robotics, cybersecurity, and distributed autonomous systems.\\nI am passionate about designing intelligent systems capable of operating in complex real-world environments where AI, autonomy, and cybersecurity work together to solve advanced technological challenges.\",\n    \"email\": \"smshagor.ru@gmail.com\",\n    \"portfolio\": \"md_shahanurislamshagor_\",\n    \"cvUrl\": \"/uploads/1780329910238-shahanur-islam-shagor-resume.pdf\",\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"HTML\",\n      \"CSS\",\n      \"Javascript\",\n      \"Typescript\",\n      \"React\",\n      \"Next JS\",\n      \"Tailwind\",\n      \"MongoDB\",\n      \"MySQL\",\n      \"PostgreSQL\",\n      \"Git\",\n      \"AWS\",\n      \"Bootstrap\",\n      \"Docker\",\n      \"Go\",\n      \"Figma\",\n      \"Firebase\",\n      \"MaterialUI\",\n      \"Nginx\",\n      \"Strapi\",\n      \"PHP\",\n      \"Laravel\",\n      \"Express JS\",\n      \"Node JS\",\n      \"GraphQL\",\n      \"C++\",\n      \"C#\",\n      \"Vue JS\",\n      \"Angular JS\",\n      \"React Native\",\n      \"Linux\",\n      \"Apache\",\n      \"CI/CD\",\n      \"CMake\",\n      \"Flutter\",\n      \"Kotlin\",\n      \"Jetson Nano\",\n      \"Google Cloud\",\n      \"Digital Ocean\",\n      \"Kubernetes\",\n      \"Prometheus\",\n      \"Grafana\",\n      \"Jest\",\n      \"PHPUnit\",\n      \"PyTest\",\n      \"Redis\",\n      \"Socket.IO\",\n      \"Microservices\"\n    ],\n    \"education\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"strongestProjects\": [\n      {},\n      {},\n      {}\n    ],\n    \"sourceTablesUsed\": [\n      \"Profile\",\n      \"Skill\",\n      \"Education\",\n      \"Project\",\n      \"Experience\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"job\": {\n    \"title\": \"Freelance Writer\",\n    \"company\": \"IAPWE\",\n    \"location\": \"Worldwide\",\n    \"description\": \"<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\">Our organization is seeking content writers to create articles and blog posts on a variety of topics.</p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\"> </p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\">The rate of pay is $20 per 100 words (this comes out to approximately $100 per article or $50 per hour).</p>\\n<p> </p>\\n<p class=\\\"p1\\\" style=\\\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: #000000;\\\">Some topics you may be asked to write about include the following (you can always turn down a topic if you do not feel comfortable writing about it, however if you have experience or expertise in a specific area, please let us know):</p>\\n<p> </p>\\n<ul class=\\\"ul1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Health &amp; beauty</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Fitness</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Home Decor</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Fashion</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Sports</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Do it yourself</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Finance</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Legal</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Medical</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Family/Parenting</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Relationships</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Real Estate</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Restaurants</li>\\n<li class=\\\"li1\\\" style=\\\"\\\">Contracting (plumbing, pool building, remodeling, etc.)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p> </p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">These are just some of the more general industries and topics that we cover.</span></p>\\n<p> </p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 600; color: #000000; letter-spacing: 0.75px;\\\">Requirements</span><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">We ask that all work be completed using a word processor such as Microsoft Word or Open Office</li>\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">A reliable internet connection and the ability to meet deadlines</li>\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">Good communication skills and respond in a timely manner to editorial staff when they ask for updates on tasks, etc</li>\\n<li style=\\\"\\\">Work well as a team member with the rest of our content management and editorial staff</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><br><br><em><strong>Note</strong>: Applicants to this job signaled that accessing some writing tasks may require payment.</em></p>\\n<img src=\\\"https://remotive.com/job/track/1185979/blank.gif?source=public_api\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"/>\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/writing/freelance-writer-1185979\"\n  },\n  \"recruiter\": null,\n  \"match\": null,\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"tone\": \"professional-natural\",\n    \"maxEmailWords\": 160,\n    \"maxCoverLetterWords\": 450,\n    \"attachCv\": true,\n    \"attachCoverLetterPdf\": true\n  }\n}', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor\n\nDear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Freelance Writer role at IAPWE. My portfolio background shows practical experience across Go, and I focus on building reliable, user-friendly software with clean implementation details.\n\nThe role stood out to me because it connects closely with the kind of work I enjoy: solving real problems, learning quickly, and delivering thoughtful web experiences. Based on the provided job details, I believe my skills, projects, and experience would let me contribute with honesty and care from the start.\n\nThank you for reviewing my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support your team.\n\nSincerely,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '/uploads/job-agent/cover-letter-85-1780602846113.pdf', '/uploads/1780329910238-shahanur-islam-shagor-resume.pdf', 0, 'NOT_REQUIRED', '', NULL, '', 'sent', '', '', NULL);
INSERT INTO `job_email_drafts` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `recruiterContactId`, `toEmail`, `subject`, `body`, `status`, `approvedAt`, `sentAt`, `providerMessageId`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `trackingId`, `openedAt`, `lastOpenedAt`, `openCount`, `clickedAt`, `clickCount`, `aiProvider`, `aiModel`, `emailPromptUsed`, `coverLetterPromptUsed`, `coverLetterText`, `coverLetterPdfUrl`, `cvUrl`, `adminApprovalRequired`, `approvalStatus`, `approvedBy`, `rejectedAt`, `rejectionReason`, `sendStatus`, `skipReason`, `errorMessage`, `lastSendAttemptAt`) VALUES
(86, 83, 12, 'rodolphe@remotive.com', 'Application for Inside Sales Contractor', 'Hello,\n\nI am interested in the Inside Sales Contractor opportunity at Credit Wellness, LLC. My background as Md Shahanur Islam Shagor aligns well with this role, especially around Git and Go, including work on AI Powered Financial App.\n\nI have attached my CV and cover letter for your review. I would appreciate the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', 'OPENED', NULL, '2026-06-05 04:40:08.085', '<dae4905e-ff80-1883-ed13-ae35943ace4a@gmail.com>', '2026-06-04 19:54:09.823', '2026-06-09 06:35:28.206', 'cmpzwyo0v004rkssopl3s2bp4', '2026-06-05 04:40:11.387', '2026-06-09 06:35:28.205', 2, NULL, 0, 'DEEPSEEK', 'deepseek-chat', 'Task: Create a recruiter outreach email.\nReturn strict JSON only: {\"emailSubject\":\"...\",\"emailBody\":\"...\"}.\nGenerate a clear subject and body.\nSubject format: Application for {jobTitle} - Md Shahanur Islam Shagor.\nEmail body should be 90-140 words and never exceed 160 words.\nUse a simple greeting. If recruiter name exists, use it; otherwise use \'Hello\'.\nThe first sentence must be direct and specific to the role and company.\nConnect only the strongest 1-2 relevant skills or projects from the portfolio context to the job.\nAdd one sentence explaining why the role fits the applicant.\nIf attachments are enabled, include this exact sentence: I\'ve attached my CV and cover letter for your review.\nInclude portfolio link only if available in the context.\nSound confident, polite, and human.\nNo emojis.\nNo markdown.\nNo bullet points.\nDo not mention missing skills, weak fit, uncertainty, or anything negative.\nAvoid these generic phrases: I am writing to express my interest; I am excited to leverage; dynamic professional; synergy; passionate individual; fast-paced environment.\nContext:\n{\n  \"applicant\": {\n    \"name\": \"Hi there, I\'m Shagor\",\n    \"designation\": \"Full-Stack & AI Engineer\",\n    \"summary\": \"Hi, I\'m Shahanur Islam Shagor. I am a Software Engineer specializing in Full Stuck Web Development, Autonomous Systems and AI Engineering Enthusiast focused on building intelligent real-world technologies that combine software engineering, robotics, cybersecurity, and distributed autonomous systems.\\nI am passionate about designing intelligent systems capable of operating in complex real-world environments where AI, autonomy, and cybersecurity work together to solve advanced technological challenges.\",\n    \"email\": \"smshagor.ru@gmail.com\",\n    \"portfolio\": \"md_shahanurislamshagor_\",\n    \"cvUrl\": \"/uploads/1780329910238-shahanur-islam-shagor-resume.pdf\",\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"HTML\",\n      \"CSS\",\n      \"Javascript\",\n      \"Typescript\",\n      \"React\",\n      \"Next JS\",\n      \"Tailwind\",\n      \"MongoDB\",\n      \"MySQL\",\n      \"PostgreSQL\",\n      \"Git\",\n      \"AWS\",\n      \"Bootstrap\",\n      \"Docker\",\n      \"Go\",\n      \"Figma\",\n      \"Firebase\",\n      \"MaterialUI\",\n      \"Nginx\",\n      \"Strapi\",\n      \"PHP\",\n      \"Laravel\",\n      \"Express JS\",\n      \"Node JS\",\n      \"GraphQL\",\n      \"C++\",\n      \"C#\",\n      \"Vue JS\",\n      \"Angular JS\",\n      \"React Native\",\n      \"Linux\",\n      \"Apache\",\n      \"CI/CD\",\n      \"CMake\",\n      \"Flutter\",\n      \"Kotlin\",\n      \"Jetson Nano\",\n      \"Google Cloud\",\n      \"Digital Ocean\",\n      \"Kubernetes\",\n      \"Prometheus\",\n      \"Grafana\",\n      \"Jest\",\n      \"PHPUnit\",\n      \"PyTest\",\n      \"Redis\",\n      \"Socket.IO\",\n      \"Microservices\"\n    ],\n    \"education\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"strongestProjects\": [\n      {},\n      {},\n      {}\n    ],\n    \"sourceTablesUsed\": [\n      \"Profile\",\n      \"Skill\",\n      \"Education\",\n      \"Project\",\n      \"Experience\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"job\": {\n    \"title\": \"Inside Sales Contractor\",\n    \"company\": \"Credit Wellness, LLC\",\n    \"location\": \"Worldwide\",\n    \"description\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">About Us</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">We are a financial services start up focusing on helping to improve consumer credit profiles. We are currently seeking KPI driven sales representatives looking to earn up to 45K in their first year while working remotely. We offer comprehensive training and continuous sales coaching to help you meet your financial goals.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">During our training period we offer a guaranteed training stipend while our trainees are acclimating to the position (*see weekly pay below). If you are a seasoned sales professional looking for the autonomy of a remote position combined with great compensation, we want to hear from you!</span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"h2\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 6pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Compensation Structure</span></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">This role is </span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">100% commission-based</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">, which means your earning potential is unlimited. In addition, we regularly offer </span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">competitive performance-based bonuses</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> to reward hard work and results.</span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"h3\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 2pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Training Period (Weeks 1–4)</span></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding: 8pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">We invest in your success and want to make sure you’re supported as you get up to speed:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 1:</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> Commission-only (a chance to start earning right away while learning the ropes).</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"><br><br></span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Weeks 2–4:</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> Guaranteed training stipend of </span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">$1,000 total</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> – or your commission if it’s higher. You’ll always receive whichever amount benefits you most.</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"><br><br></span></p>\\n</li>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 2: $250 guaranteed minimum</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 3: $325 guaranteed minimum</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 4: $425 guaranteed minimum</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">By the end of training, you’ll have the skills to maximize commissions, with the safety net of a guaranteed base during your ramp-up period.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Post Training Period:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Average first year OTE: 25K-35K (US) Annually</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Top Rep first year OTE: 35K-45K (US) Annually</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">*The above is the average pay you can expect, however, there is unlimited earning potential for those who are financially motivated top performers looking to exceed sales targets.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">What will you be doing?</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Educating inbound callers on their credit standing by providing consultations with the goal of enrolling them in one of our services should they be a good fit.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">We are looking for team members who are:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Tech savvy with the ability to navigate digital tools such as SLACK, CRM software, google sheets, etc. Our team uses these digital tools daily.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Growth oriented and always looking to learn and acquire new skills.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Autonomous self starters who can work independently and efficiently.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Team players with the ability to implement feedback from their sales coaches.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Patient and professional with clients. Finances can be a difficult topic for some clients to discuss. We are looking for individuals who showcase empathy and professionalism especially under pressure!</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Financially motivated individuals who can meet and exceed sales targets.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Outgoing with outstanding rapport building and active listening skills. Can you carry a conversation with anyone? This may be for you!</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">You will need:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Home office or a quiet place to work.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; backgro