preserve;\\\">Work Location:</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"> Remote</span></span></p>\\n<img src=\\\"https://remotive.com/job/track/2086540/blank.gif?source=public_api\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"/>\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/inside-sales-contractor-2086540\"\n  },\n  \"recruiter\": null,\n  \"match\": null,\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"tone\": \"professional-natural\",\n    \"maxEmailWords\": 160,\n    \"maxCoverLetterWords\": 450,\n    \"attachCv\": true,\n    \"attachCoverLetterPdf\": true\n  }\n}', 'Task: Write a customized cover letter for this job.\nReturn strict JSON only: {\"coverLetterText\":\"...\"}.\nGenerate clean cover letter text for a PDF.\nUse 3-4 short paragraphs only.\nOpening should mention the role/company and direct interest.\nMiddle should connect the strongest real portfolio skills, projects, or experience to the job requirements.\nClosing should be polite and mention the attached CV if available.\nKeep it recruiter-friendly and ATS-friendly.\nKeep it under 450 words.\nPrefer natural human wording.\nNo markdown.\nNo fake achievements.\nDo not invent facts. Do not exaggerate. Do not mention missing skills negatively.\nAvoid generic filler and AI-style language.\nContext:\n{\n  \"applicant\": {\n    \"name\": \"Hi there, I\'m Shagor\",\n    \"designation\": \"Full-Stack & AI Engineer\",\n    \"summary\": \"Hi, I\'m Shahanur Islam Shagor. I am a Software Engineer specializing in Full Stuck Web Development, Autonomous Systems and AI Engineering Enthusiast focused on building intelligent real-world technologies that combine software engineering, robotics, cybersecurity, and distributed autonomous systems.\\nI am passionate about designing intelligent systems capable of operating in complex real-world environments where AI, autonomy, and cybersecurity work together to solve advanced technological challenges.\",\n    \"email\": \"smshagor.ru@gmail.com\",\n    \"portfolio\": \"md_shahanurislamshagor_\",\n    \"cvUrl\": \"/uploads/1780329910238-shahanur-islam-shagor-resume.pdf\",\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"HTML\",\n      \"CSS\",\n      \"Javascript\",\n      \"Typescript\",\n      \"React\",\n      \"Next JS\",\n      \"Tailwind\",\n      \"MongoDB\",\n      \"MySQL\",\n      \"PostgreSQL\",\n      \"Git\",\n      \"AWS\",\n      \"Bootstrap\",\n      \"Docker\",\n      \"Go\",\n      \"Figma\",\n      \"Firebase\",\n      \"MaterialUI\",\n      \"Nginx\",\n      \"Strapi\",\n      \"PHP\",\n      \"Laravel\",\n      \"Express JS\",\n      \"Node JS\",\n      \"GraphQL\",\n      \"C++\",\n      \"C#\",\n      \"Vue JS\",\n      \"Angular JS\",\n      \"React Native\",\n      \"Linux\",\n      \"Apache\",\n      \"CI/CD\",\n      \"CMake\",\n      \"Flutter\",\n      \"Kotlin\",\n      \"Jetson Nano\",\n      \"Google Cloud\",\n      \"Digital Ocean\",\n      \"Kubernetes\",\n      \"Prometheus\",\n      \"Grafana\",\n      \"Jest\",\n      \"PHPUnit\",\n      \"PyTest\",\n      \"Redis\",\n      \"Socket.IO\",\n      \"Microservices\"\n    ],\n    \"education\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"experience\": [\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\",\n      \"[object Object]\"\n    ],\n    \"strongestProjects\": [\n      {},\n      {},\n      {}\n    ],\n    \"sourceTablesUsed\": [\n      \"Profile\",\n      \"Skill\",\n      \"Education\",\n      \"Project\",\n      \"Experience\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"job\": {\n    \"title\": \"Inside Sales Contractor\",\n    \"company\": \"Credit Wellness, LLC\",\n    \"location\": \"Worldwide\",\n    \"description\": \"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">About Us</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">We are a financial services start up focusing on helping to improve consumer credit profiles. We are currently seeking KPI driven sales representatives looking to earn up to 45K in their first year while working remotely. We offer comprehensive training and continuous sales coaching to help you meet your financial goals.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">During our training period we offer a guaranteed training stipend while our trainees are acclimating to the position (*see weekly pay below). If you are a seasoned sales professional looking for the autonomy of a remote position combined with great compensation, we want to hear from you!</span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"h2\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 6pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Compensation Structure</span></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 8pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">This role is </span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">100% commission-based</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">, which means your earning potential is unlimited. In addition, we regularly offer </span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">competitive performance-based bonuses</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> to reward hard work and results.</span></p>\\n<div class=\\\"h3\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 2pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Training Period (Weeks 1–4)</span></div>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; padding: 8pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">We invest in your success and want to make sure you’re supported as you get up to speed:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 1:</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> Commission-only (a chance to start earning right away while learning the ropes).</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"><br><br></span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Weeks 2–4:</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> Guaranteed training stipend of </span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">$1,000 total</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"> – or your commission if it’s higher. You’ll always receive whichever amount benefits you most.</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"><br><br></span></p>\\n</li>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 2: $250 guaranteed minimum</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 3: $325 guaranteed minimum</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Week 4: $425 guaranteed minimum</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">By the end of training, you’ll have the skills to maximize commissions, with the safety net of a guaranteed base during your ramp-up period.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Post Training Period:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Average first year OTE: 25K-35K (US) Annually</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Top Rep first year OTE: 35K-45K (US) Annually</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">*The above is the average pay you can expect, however, there is unlimited earning potential for those who are financially motivated top performers looking to exceed sales targets.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">What will you be doing?</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Educating inbound callers on their credit standing by providing consultations with the goal of enrolling them in one of our services should they be a good fit.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">We are looking for team members who are:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Tech savvy with the ability to navigate digital tools such as SLACK, CRM software, google sheets, etc. Our team uses these digital tools daily.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Growth oriented and always looking to learn and acquire new skills.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Autonomous self starters who can work independently and efficiently.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Team players with the ability to implement feedback from their sales coaches.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Patient and professional with clients. Finances can be a difficult topic for some clients to discuss. We are looking for individuals who showcase empathy and professionalism especially under pressure!</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Financially motivated individuals who can meet and exceed sales targets.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Outgoing with outstanding rapport building and active listening skills. Can you carry a conversation with anyone? This may be for you!</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">You will need:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Home office or a quiet place to work.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Strong internet connection.</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Desktop or laptop</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">(*Please Note: Devices such as Chromebooks, IPADs and laptops with 8G’s of RAM and under will have issues supporting our system)</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Scheduling</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Training: The schedule for the first four weeks of our training period is 10 AM - 6 PM EST.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">*The first week of training is mandatory for all new trainees. If a day is missed you may be asked to restart the first week of training.</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Post Training:</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">We are currently seeking representatives to work on the following schedule:</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Monday - Friday</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Shift hours to be discussed with our hiring manager based on our company\'s needs at the time of hire. Shifts are as follows:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">8:00 AM - 4:00 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">8:30 AM - 4:30 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">9:00 AM - 5:00 AM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">9:30 AM - 5:30 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">10:00 AM - 6:00 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">10:30 AM - 6:30 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">11:00 AM - 7:00 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">11:30 AM - 7:30 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">12:30 PM - 8:30 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">1:30 PM - 9:30 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">2:30 PM - 10:30 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">3:00 PM - 11:00 PM EST</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Job Type: </span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Contract</span></p>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Shift:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">8 hour shift</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Day shift</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Evening shift</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Morning shift</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Night shift</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Supplemental Pay:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Bonus opportunities</span></p>\\n</li>\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Commission pay</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Experience:</span></p>\\n<ul style=\\\"\\\">\\n<li dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">Sales: 1 year (Required)</span></p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><span id=\\\"docs-internal-guid-fb56535d-7fff-ad8c-90af-e1aecd67fa7c\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">Work Location:</span><span style=\\\"color: #2d2d2d; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\"> Remote</span></span></p>\\n<img src=\\\"https://remotive.com/job/track/2086540/blank.gif?source=public_api\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"/>\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/inside-sales-contractor-2086540\"\n  },\n  \"recruiter\": null,\n  \"match\": null,\n  \"settings\": {\n    \"tone\": \"professional-natural\",\n    \"maxEmailWords\": 160,\n    \"maxCoverLetterWords\": 450,\n    \"attachCv\": true,\n    \"attachCoverLetterPdf\": true\n  }\n}', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor\n\nDear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Inside Sales Contractor role at Credit Wellness, LLC. My portfolio background shows practical experience across Git, Go, and I focus on building reliable, user-friendly software with clean implementation details.\n\nThe role stood out to me because it connects closely with the kind of work I enjoy: solving real problems, learning quickly, and delivering thoughtful web experiences. Based on the provided job details, I believe my skills, projects, and experience would let me contribute with honesty and care from the start.\n\nThank you for reviewing my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support your team.\n\nSincerely,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '/uploads/job-agent/cover-letter-86-1780602849834.pdf', '/uploads/1780329910238-shahanur-islam-shagor-resume.pdf', 0, 'NOT_REQUIRED', '', NULL, '', 'sent', '', '', NULL);
INSERT INTO `job_email_drafts` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `recruiterContactId`, `toEmail`, `subject`, `body`, `status`, `approvedAt`, `sentAt`, `providerMessageId`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `trackingId`, `openedAt`, `lastOpenedAt`, `openCount`, `clickedAt`, `clickCount`, `aiProvider`, `aiModel`, `emailPromptUsed`, `coverLetterPromptUsed`, `coverLetterText`, `coverLetterPdfUrl`, `cvUrl`, `adminApprovalRequired`, `approvalStatus`, `approvedBy`, `rejectedAt`, `rejectionReason`, `sendStatus`, `skipReason`, `errorMessage`, `lastSendAttemptAt`) VALUES
(87, 82, 13, 'rodolphe@remotive.com', 'Application for iOS Developer', 'Hello,\n\nI am interested in the iOS Developer opportunity at nooro. My background as Md Shahanur Islam Shagor aligns well with this role, especially around Git and Figma, including work on AI Powered Financial App.\n\nI have attached my CV and cover letter for your review. I would appreciate the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', 'OPENED', NULL, '2026-06-05 04:40:11.524', '<27607a55-ce7c-3e92-f3a6-da60f0e6f4ab@gmail.com>', '2026-06-04 19:54:13.415', '2026-06-09 06:35:22.585', 'cmpzwyqsn004tkssodm5jeblv', '2026-06-05 04:42:05.490', '2026-06-09 06:35:22.584', 5, NULL, 0, 'DEEPSEEK', 'deepseek-chat', 'Task: Create a recruiter outreach email.\nReturn strict JSON only: {\"emailSubject\":\"...\",\"emailBody\":\"...\"}.\nGenerate a clear subject and body.\nSubject format: Application for {jobTitle} - Md Shahanur Islam Shagor.\nEmail body should be 90-140 words and never exceed 160 words.\nUse a simple greeting. If recruiter name exists, use it; otherwise use \'Hello\'.\nThe first sentence must be direct and specific to the role and company.\nConnect only the strongest 1-2 relevant skills or projects from the portfolio context to the job.\nAdd one sentence explaining why the role fits the applicant.\nIf attachments are enabled, include this exact sentence: I\'ve attached my CV and cover letter for your review.\nInclude portfolio link only if available in the context.\nSound confident, polite, and human.\nNo emojis.\nNo markdown.\nNo bullet points.\nDo not mention missing skills, weak fit, uncertainty, or anything negative.\nAvoid these generic phrases: I am writing to express my interest; I am excited to leverage; dynamic professional; synergy; passionate individual; fast-paced environment.\nContext:\n{\n  \"applicant\": {\n    \"name\": \"Hi there, I\'m Shagor\",\n    \"designation\": \"Full-Stack & AI Engineer\",\n    \"summary\": \"Hi, I