secure payment gateway integration. I also handled deployment and maintenance on Linux servers using Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines. This hands-on experience has given me a practical understanding of the full development lifecycle, from architecture to production.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your needs. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '/uploads/job-agent/cover-letter-151-1780663605436.pdf', '/uploads/job-agent/cv/agent-cv-1780650102256-c81c423a75e8.pdf', 0, 'REJECTED', '', '2026-06-07 18:41:29.653', 'duplicate', 'pending', '', '', NULL),
(459, 456, 18, 'dmaurath@linkedin.com', 'Application for AI Systems Engineer (Offensive Cyber)', 'Hello Snatch UP Jobs Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the AI Systems Engineer (Offensive Cyber) position.\n\nMy background combines AI engineering with cybersecurity and autonomous systems. I have hands-on experience building secure communication protocols, implementing encryption (AES, secure key exchange), and developing privacy-preserving frameworks using Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography. I have also worked on GPS-denied navigation and sensor fusion for resilient drone systems.\n\nThrough my research on secure UAV networks, I have designed tamper-proof communication layers using blockchain and SHA3-256 chaining, addressing spoofing, jamming, and unauthorized control threats. This aligns directly with offensive cyber and systems security work.\n\nI\'ve attached my CV and cover letter for your review.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', 'READY', NULL, NULL, '', '2026-06-10 03:14:38.425', '2026-06-10 03:14:42.365', 'cmq7hwdsq00h9ksp496jdvi5g', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 'DEEPSEEK', 'deepseek-chat', 'Task: Create a highly customized professional job application email.\nReturn strict JSON only: {\"emailSubject\":\"...\",\"emailBody\":\"...\"}.\nRead the complete job description before writing. Identify job title, company, required skills, preferred skills, responsibilities, domain, seniority, work type, tools, and soft skills.\nCompare the job description with the candidate profile in the context. Mention only matching skills, responsibilities, and projects that are supported by the profile.\nDo not mention missing skills in the final email.\nSelect the strongest single positioning based on the job type. Web: Laravel, Next.js, React, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, REST APIs, MySQL, responsive UI, web application development. Backend: Laravel, Node.js, REST APIs, GraphQL, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Redis, authentication, RBAC, A