(119, 119, NULL, 50, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\"]', '[]', 'Mock-safe content generated because no configured AI provider succeeded.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":true,\"errors\":[\"DEEPSEEK: Authentication Fails, Your api key: ****4f17 is invalid\"],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the Pflichtpraktikum im Bereich Grafikdesign (m/w/d) role at eFLY Marketplace Services GmbH. With more than four years of professional experience across AI, research, and autonomous systems, I bring a combination of production-grade development skill and research-driven engineering judgment.\n\nMy background aligns with this opportunity through autonomous drone systems, VIO, UWB TDOA, EKF fusion, C++20, Go, Python, and applied AI engineering. I have delivered scalable applications and complete technical systems while keeping architecture, performance, security, and maintainability at the center of the work.\n\nThe job description especially connects with my experience in HTML, CSS, Javascript, Typescript. My related work includes including GPS-denied UAV navigation research and complete sensor-fusion system design, which reflects my ability to move between implementation, research, and real-world constraints.\n\nI work well across teams and disciplines, communicate clearly in English and Bengali, and stay self-directed when solving complex problems. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and discuss how my background aligns with your goals.', '2026-06-05 07:42:19.470', '2026-06-05 07:42:19.470'),
(120, 120, NULL, 50, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\"]', '[]', 'Mock-safe content generated because no configured AI provider succeeded.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":true,\"errors\":[\"DEEPSEEK: Authentication Fails, Your api key: ****4f17 is invalid\"],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the Pflichtpraktikum Online Marketing Manager (m/w/d) role at eFLY Marketplace Services GmbH. With more than four years of professional experience across software engineering and applied AI, I bring a combination of production-grade development skill and research-driven engineering judgment.\n\nMy background aligns with this opportunity through full-stack engineering, applied AI, autonomous systems research, secure communications, and maintainable production delivery. I have delivered scalable applications and complete technical systems while keeping architecture, performance, security, and maintainability at the center of the work.\n\nThe job description especially connects with my experience in HTML, CSS, Javascript, Typescript. My related work includes including production web applications and research systems across C++20, Go, Python, and modern web stacks, which reflects my ability to move between implementation, research, and real-world constraints.\n\nI work well across teams and disciplines, communicate clearly in English and Bengali, and stay self-directed when solving complex problems. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and discuss how my background aligns with your goals.', '2026-06-05 07:42:20.019', '2026-06-05 07:42:20.019'),
(121, 121, NULL, 50, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\"]', '[]', 'Mock-safe content generated because no configured AI provider succeeded.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":true,\"errors\":[\"DEEPSEEK: Authentication Fails, Your api key: ****4f17 is invalid\"],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the Online Marketing Manager (m/w/d) role at eFLY Marketplace Services GmbH. With more than four years of professional experience across full-stack web development, I bring a combination of production-grade development skill and research-driven engineering judgment.\n\nMy background aligns with this opportunity through Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, GraphQL, scalable architecture, payment integrations, WebSockets, CI/CD, Docker, and Nginx. I have delivered scalable applications and complete technical systems while keeping architecture, performance, security, and maintainability at the center of the work.\n\nThe job description especially connects with my experience in HTML, CSS, Javascript, Typescript. My related work includes including production multivendor platforms, real-time features, API integrations, and Linux-based deployments, which reflects my ability to move between implementation, research, and real-world constraints.\n\nI work well across teams and disciplines, communicate clearly in English and Bengali, and stay self-directed when solving complex problems. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and discuss how my background aligns with your goals.', '2026-06-05 07:42:20.548', '2026-06-05 07:42:20.548'),
