(143, 143, NULL, 50, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'Mock-safe content generated because no configured AI provider succeeded.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":true,\"errors\":[\"DEEPSEEK: Authentication Fails, Your api key: ****4f17 is invalid\"],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the Online Yoga Instructor Flexible Role Â£20 Â£40 hr role at FindTutors. With more than four years of professional experience across AI, research, and autonomous systems, I bring a combination of production-grade development skill and research-driven engineering judgment.\n\nMy background aligns with this opportunity through autonomous drone systems, VIO, UWB TDOA, EKF fusion, C++20, Go, Python, and applied AI engineering. I have delivered scalable applications and complete technical systems while keeping architecture, performance, security, and maintainability at the center of the work.\n\nThe job description especially connects with my experience in Go. My related work includes including GPS-denied UAV navigation research and complete sensor-fusion system design, which reflects my ability to move between implementation, research, and real-world constraints.\n\nI work well across teams and disciplines, communicate clearly in English and Bengali, and stay self-directed when solving complex problems. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and discuss how my background aligns with your goals.', '2026-06-05 07:42:32.084', '2026-06-05 07:42:32.084'),
(144, 144, NULL, 50, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[]', 'Mock-safe content generated because no configured AI provider succeeded.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":true,\"errors\":[\"DEEPSEEK: Authentication Fails, Your api key: ****4f17 is invalid\"],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the Technical Writer role at Nabu Casa. With more than four years of professional experience across AI, research, and autonomous systems, I bring a combination of production-grade development skill and research-driven engineering judgment.\n\nMy background aligns with this opportunity through autonomous drone systems, VIO, UWB TDOA, EKF fusion, C++20, Go, Python, and applied AI engineering. I have delivered scalable applications and complete technical systems while keeping architecture, performance, security, and maintainability at the center of the work.\n\nThe job description especially connects with my experience in Git, AWS, Go. My related work includes including GPS-denied UAV navigation research and complete sensor-fusion system design, which reflects my ability to move between implementation, research, and real-world constraints.\n\nI work well across teams and disciplines, communicate clearly in English and Bengali, and stay self-directed when solving complex problems. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and discuss how my background aligns with your goals.', '2026-06-05 07:42:32.641', '2026-06-05 07:42:32.641'),
(145, 145, 1, 0, '[]', '[]', 'No job description provided. This is a job alert confirmation, not a specific job posting. Cannot calculate a meaningful match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Software Engineering position in Germany. With a strong foundation in full-stack development and a growing focus on autonomous systems and AI, I am well positioned to contribute to engineering teams working on modern, scalable applications.\n\nMy professional experience spans over four years of web and full-stack development. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js to build production-grade applications, including multi-vendor e-commerce platforms, real-time dashboards, and AI-powered financial tools. On the backend, I design RESTful APIs with Node.js and Express, manage relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and implement secure authentication, role-based access control, and payment gateway integrations.\n\nOn the frontend, I build responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. I have delivered real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. My work at Explo-IT involved optimizing Eloquent queries, implementing caching strategies, and integrating third-party services such as cloud storage and social logins.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with your team\'s needs.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 12:46:31.678', '2026-06-05 12:46:31.678'),
(146, 146, 1, 65, '[\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Bun\",\"ETL\"]', 'Strong match on core fullstack technologies: TypeScript, Node.js, Next.js, React, and databases. Missing explicit experience with Bun and ETL pipelines, but overall skill set is highly relevant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fullstack Developer position. With professional experience in TypeScript, Node.js, and Next.js, I build scalable full-stack applications that handle real-world complexity.\n\nIn my work as a Web Developer, I have delivered production applications using TypeScript, Node.js, and Next.js. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and worked with both SQL and NoSQL databases. I also have experience with ETL-like data processing and real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO.\n\nOne project that reflects this is Smart Finance, a full-stack personal finance platform built with Next.js 16, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Prisma ORM. It features 16 finance modules, real-time updates via Server-Sent Events, Docker-based deployment, and a modular architecture that reduced code duplication. I designed the API integration pattern and state management approach myself.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your team\'s needs.', '2026-06-05 12:46:38.720', '2026-06-05 12:46:38.720'),
(147, 147, 1, 70, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[]', 'Strong match for a Web Developer role. The applicant has 4+ years of professional web development experience with Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, MySQL, and deployment on Linux servers. The profile shows hands-on experience building full-stack applications, RESTful APIs, real-time features, and secure authentication systems.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Web Developer position in Germany. With over 4 years of professional experience building modern web applications, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy technical focus has been on full-stack development using Laravel and Next.js, combined with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS for the frontend. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and worked with both MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. Performance optimization through query tuning, caching, and database indexing has been a consistent part of my workflow.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I delivered scalable web applications that included real-time features using WebSockets, responsive and SEO-friendly interfaces, and secure payment gateway integration. I also handled deployment and maintenance on Linux servers using Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines. This hands-on experience has given me a practical understanding of the full development lifecycle, from architecture to production.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your needs. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-05 12:46:45.429', '2026-06-05 12:46:45.429'),
(148, 148, 1, 65, '[\"Go\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Microservices\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Java/Spring Boot\",\"Angular (though Angular JS is listed)\",\"Crossplane\",\"ArgoCD\",\"Helm\",\"Terraform/IaC\",\"German language fluency\",\"Enterprise architecture experience\",\"C-level stakeholder management\"]', 'Shahanur has a solid foundation in cloud-native technologies (Go, Node.js, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, GCP) and full-stack development (React, Next.js). He has practical experience with AI agent integration and real-time systems. However, the role requires senior-level enterprise architecture experience, German language fluency, and specific tools (Spring Boot, Crossplane, ArgoCD) not present in his profile. His profile is a moderate match for a junior-to-mid-level cloud engineering role, but lacks the senior architecture and consulting depth this position demands.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technologie Architekt - Cloud-Innovation role at Accenture. The opportunity to shape cloud strategies and build hands-on prototypes for enterprise clients aligns directly with the kind of technical work I enjoy most.\n\nMy experience centers on cloud-native engineering and platform development. I have worked with Node.js, Go, and React to build microservice architectures, and I have deployed containerized applications using Docker and Kubernetes on AWS and Google Cloud. I have also set up CI/CD pipelines and monitoring stacks with Prometheus and Grafana, ensuring that systems remain observable and reliable in production.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of cloud architecture and AI. I have built full-stack applications that integrate AI agents using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, combining deterministic backend logic with LLM-based workflows. This experience gives me a practical understanding of where agentic systems are production-ready today and where they still require careful architectural boundaries.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background fits the needs of your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:14:39.331', '2026-06-05 15:14:39.331'),
(149, 149, 1, 45, '[\"C#\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"REST APIs (via Express JS, Node JS, Laravel)\"]', '[\"C# (listed in profile but no professional experience with C# demonstrated)\",\"Microsoft Visual Studio\",\"Azure\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C#, SQL databases, Docker, Kubernetes, and cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud) that partially match the job requirements. However, the applicant lacks demonstrated professional experience with C# backend development, Microsoft Visual Studio, and Azure, which are key requirements for this role. The match is moderate but not strong for this specific C# backend position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the C# Backend Entwickler position at Intercon Solutions GmbH. Your focus on building scalable cloud applications for international travel operators aligns with my experience in backend development and API integration.\n\nMy technical background includes working with C#, SQL databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL), and building RESTful APIs. I have hands-on experience with Docker and Kubernetes for containerized deployments, and I have worked with cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud. I am comfortable designing modern software architectures and integrating external services.\n\nIn previous work, I developed and maintained backend services for web applications, focusing on API design, database optimization, and real-time features. I have experience with authentication systems, role-based access control, and payment gateway integration. I also have practical knowledge of deploying and monitoring applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-05 15:14:47.118', '2026-06-05 15:14:47.118'),
(150, 150, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Medical degree (MD or equivalent)\",\"3+ years oncology/clinical trials experience\",\"Fluent German\",\"Clinical trial workflows\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no medical degree, oncology experience, or clinical trial background. The role requires an MD, 3+ years in oncology/clinical trials, and fluent German. The applicant does not meet the core requirements for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Study Coordinator (Oncology / Clinical Trials) position at Subject Well Inc. Your mission to accelerate patient enrollment in clinical trials and help patients access life-changing medications is meaningful work that I would be proud to support.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills through managing complex, multi-stakeholder projects. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I coordinated between clients, team members, and third-party services to deliver reliable systems on time. This experience has taught me to communicate clearly, document thoroughly, and respect confidentiality in every interaction.\n\nI understand that this role requires empathetic, unscripted conversations with cancer patients about clinical trial options. I am comfortable discussing sensitive topics with professionalism and respect for patient autonomy. I am fluent in English and have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which supports clear communication in diverse settings.\n\nI am organized, detail-oriented, and committed to maintaining ethical standards in all patient interactions. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and support cancer patients in understanding their clinical trial options.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support Subject Well Inc.\'s important work.', '2026-06-05 15:14:53.814', '2026-06-05 15:14:53.814'),
(151, 151, 1, 75, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"German language proficiency (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Professional experience with AI/ML tools in production\"]', 'Strong match for a Junior Software Engineer role. The candidate has extensive full-stack web development experience with Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, and cloud deployment. They have worked with APIs, databases, Docker, and CI/CD. The role emphasizes learning, collaboration, and AI tool integration, which aligns with the candidate\'s background. The main gaps are German language proficiency and formal AI/ML production experience, though the candidate has used AI APIs in projects.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Software Engineer position at Ray Sono GmbH. Your focus on modern software solutions, cross-functional collaboration, and continuous learning aligns well with my background in full-stack development and my curiosity for emerging technologies.\n\nThrough professional experience and hands-on project work, I have built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. I have developed and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and worked with both SQL and NoSQL databases. I am comfortable working across frontend, backend, and cloud environments, and I actively use modern development tools and AI-assisted workflows to improve efficiency and code quality.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer, I contributed to the full lifecycle of client-facing applications. I built responsive UIs, optimized database queries, integrated real-time features using WebSockets, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I also participated in code reviews, technical discussions, and knowledge-sharing sessions with the team. This experience has given me a solid foundation in engineering practices and the ability to take ownership of features while learning from senior colleagues.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI tools into the development process. I have worked with OpenAI APIs and Replicate for image processing in full-stack applications, and I actively explore how AI can support prototyping, testing, and automation. I am eager to bring this curiosity to Ray Sono and contribute to evaluating and adopting new approaches alongside experienced engineers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-05 15:15:03.274', '2026-06-05 15:15:03.274'),
(152, 152, 1, 55, '[\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Computer Vision\",\"Deep Learning\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Regression Analysis\",\"Colour Normalisation\",\"Mixed-class Modelling\",\"CNN\",\"Embedded Systems\",\"IEC 62304\",\"EU AI Act\",\"MedTech or Diagnostics exp.\",\"Research background\",\"Medical / sensitive data exp.\",\"Min. Master\'s Degree\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong foundational skills in Python, C++, computer vision, and deep learning, demonstrated through a relevant project (WVAB) using YOLOv8n. He also has Docker, Linux, and Git experience. However, the role requires specific expertise in regression analysis, colour normalisation, mixed-class modelling, CNN architectures, embedded systems, medical device regulations (IEC 62304, EU AI Act), and a minimum Master\'s degree, which are not present in his profile. The match is moderate, with potential for growth in the AI/ML domain but significant gaps in medical diagnostics and regulatory knowledge.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software & AI Lead position at BugSense Diagnostics. Your work on paper-based diagnostic tests for urinary tract infections and antibiotic resistance is exactly the kind of real-world AI challenge I want to be part of. The opportunity to build the computer vision and machine learning stack from the ground up, with direct impact on clinical decisions, aligns with my background and interests.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built practical computer vision systems. One example is WVAB (Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind), a real-time assistive system I architected using YOLOv8n for object detection. The system runs fully offline on low-cost hardware, performing colour-based analysis and delivering directional audio feedback. I worked on model selection, inference optimization, and the full capture-to-result pipeline using Python, C++, and edge devices like Raspberry Pi and ESP32-CAM. This experience directly maps to the computer vision and image interpretation work at BugSense.\n\nI am comfortable working across the hardware-software boundary. In the WVAB project, I designed a custom UDP streaming protocol to connect the camera module to the processing unit, ensuring ultra-low latency communication. I also have experience deploying software on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx, and I understand the importance of building systems that are reliable, documented, and ready for production environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background in computer vision, AI, and software engineering can contribute to BugSense\'s mission.', '2026-06-05 15:15:12.352', '2026-06-05 15:15:12.352'),
(153, 153, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Google Cloud\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Vaadin\",\"UI/UX\"]', 'The applicant has strong frontend skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and experience with Docker and cloud platforms, which are mentioned as advantages. However, the job requires Java and Vaadin experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial, with a score of 35.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Java Fullstack Entwickler position at Intercon Solutions GmbH. Your focus on building modern frontends for international travel software solutions aligns with my experience in full-stack development and my interest in creating user-friendly, scalable applications.\n\nMy frontend expertise includes HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, along with modern frameworks like React and Next.js. I have built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Tailwind CSS and Material UI, and I am comfortable working with object-oriented architectures. I also have experience with Docker and cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud, which are valued in your technology stack.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I developed and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel and Next.js. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I also worked on real-time features using WebSockets and integrated third-party services like payment gateways and cloud storage.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:15:18.783', '2026-06-05 15:15:18.783'),
(154, 154, 1, 2, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Fully German-qualified lawyer\",\"8+ years of corporate and financing law experience\",\"Shareholder agreements, guarantees, security documents\",\"Business fluent in German\",\"C-level negotiation skills\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no legal qualifications or corporate law experience. This role requires a fully German-qualified lawyer with 8+ years in corporate and financing law, which does not match the applicant\'s profile at all.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Principal Corporate Law & Corporate Financing (m/f/d) position at Flix.\n\nAfter carefully reviewing the job description, I understand that this role requires a fully German-qualified lawyer with extensive experience in corporate governance, financing agreements, and legal negotiation. My professional background is in software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI systems, which does not align with the legal qualifications and senior-level corporate law experience this position demands.\n\nI respect the specialized nature of this role and the depth of expertise required. Submitting an application for a position where I cannot meet the fundamental requirements would not be a productive use of your time.\n\nI wish you success in finding the right candidate for this important role.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:15:24.545', '2026-06-05 15:15:24.545'),
(155, 155, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Fully German-qualified lawyer\",\"8+ years corporate law experience\",\"Corporate governance expertise\",\"Financing law experience\",\"Shareholder agreement drafting\",\"Business fluent in German\",\"C-level negotiation skills\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no legal qualifications or corporate law experience. This role requires a fully German-qualified lawyer with 8+ years of corporate law and financing expertise. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Senior Corporate Law & Corporate Financing Expert position at Flix. After reviewing the role requirements, I recognize that this position demands a fully German-qualified lawyer with extensive corporate law and financing experience.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI systems. I have worked on building scalable web applications, real-time communication systems, and AI-powered platforms using technologies like Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and Python. While these skills are relevant to Flix\'s tech-driven approach to travel, they do not align with the legal expertise required for this specific role.\n\nThe position requires 8+ years of corporate law experience, German legal qualifications, and fluency in German and English. I do not hold legal qualifications or have professional experience in corporate law or financing.\n\nI respect the specific requirements you have outlined and appreciate that Flix encourages applications from candidates who may not meet 100% of the qualifications. However, I want to be transparent about my background so your team can focus on candidates whose expertise directly matches this role.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV for your reference and wish you success in finding the right candidate for this position.', '2026-06-05 15:15:31.243', '2026-06-05 15:15:31.243'),
(156, 156, 1, 15, '[\"CSS\",\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing experience (2-4 years in B2B/medtech/healthtech)\",\"Paid campaigns (Google Ads, Meta, LinkedIn)\",\"HubSpot or comparable CRM/marketing automation platform\",\"SEO tools (Semrush, Ahrefs)\",\"Event coordination or congress marketing\",\"Based in Munich\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks direct marketing experience, paid campaign management, CRM/marketing automation proficiency, SEO tool familiarity, event coordination background, and is not based in Munich. The match is low for this specific Marketing Analyst role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Analyst position at Custom Surgical GmbH. Your work at the intersection of hardware and software, building AI tools that improve global eye health, is genuinely compelling. I am drawn to the ownership-driven culture and the opportunity to contribute directly to campaigns, content, and operational workflows that drive real pipeline impact.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong analytical and technical foundation that aligns well with the execution-focused nature of this role. Through my experience building and deploying full-stack applications, I have developed a disciplined approach to tracking metrics, running experiments, and optimizing performance. I am comfortable working with data, dashboards, and reporting tools to monitor outcomes and flag opportunities.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the campaign and analytics side of this position. In previous work, I have built systems that required continuous monitoring of key performance indicators, A/B testing, and iterative improvements based on data. I am confident I can apply that same structured, results-oriented mindset to managing Google Ads campaigns, optimizing toward pipeline metrics, and maintaining clean, actionable data in HubSpot.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-05 15:15:38.810', '2026-06-05 15:15:38.810'),
(157, 157, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Civil Engineering degree\",\"Structural engineering\",\"CAD programs\",\"Static calculations\",\"Production drawings\",\"Construction project coordination\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and full-stack development, with no background in civil engineering, structural engineering, CAD, or construction. There is a fundamental mismatch between the applicant\'s qualifications and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter Bauingenieurswesen position at Impledio GmbH. After reviewing the job description, I understand that this role requires a civil engineering background with expertise in structural engineering, production drawings, and static calculations.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering and full-stack web development. I have experience building scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React, as well as developing real-time systems and AI-powered platforms. However, I do not have a degree in civil engineering or professional experience in structural engineering, CAD software, or construction project coordination.\n\nI respect the technical requirements of this position and believe it is important to be transparent about my qualifications. My expertise lies in software engineering, autonomous systems, and AI, which does not align with the core responsibilities of this role.\n\nI wish you success in finding the right candidate for this position.\n\nI have attached my CV for your reference.', '2026-06-05 15:15:44.257', '2026-06-05 15:15:44.257'),
(158, 158, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Ads\",\"SA360\",\"Merchant Center\",\"SEA (Search Engine Advertising)\",\"C2 German\",\"5+ years SEA experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this Senior SEA Manager role. The job requires 5+ years of full-funnel SEA experience, expertise in Google Ads, SA360, and Merchant Center, and C2-level German. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) with no mention of paid search, SEA, or the required marketing tools. The only potential overlap is a general analytical and technical mindset, but the core required skills and experience are entirely absent from the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior SEA Manager (m/w/d) Paid Search & Strategy position at hurra.com. Your approach of combining performance marketing with proprietary technology development is particularly interesting, as it reflects my own focus on building data-driven, efficient systems.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years developing and optimizing full-stack web applications. This experience has given me a strong analytical foundation, particularly in areas like data tracking, performance optimization, and conversion-focused development. I am accustomed to thinking in terms of metrics, identifying bottlenecks, and implementing systematic improvements to achieve measurable results.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for optimizing application performance through Eloquent query tuning, caching strategies, and database indexing. I also built and integrated RESTful APIs and implemented real-time features. This technical discipline and focus on efficiency are directly applicable to managing complex search campaigns, where every optimization and data point contributes to the overall return on investment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I understand you also request a short video introduction, which I will prepare and send separately. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-05 15:15:53.039', '2026-06-05 15:15:53.039'),
(159, 159, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"handwerkliches Geschick\",\"sehr gutes Deutsch\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Reisebereitschaft\",\"Montageerfahrung\",\"Netzwerkerfahrung\",\"POS-Systeme\",\"Digital Signage\",\"Display-Installation\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and embedded systems, but this role is primarily a field service technician position requiring hands-on hardware installation, mounting, and on-site customer work. The applicant\'s skills in Linux, Docker, and Git show some technical overlap, but the core requirements of the role (handyman skills, German language, driving license, travel readiness, and retail hardware experience) are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Servicetechniker / POS-Techniker position at Franke + Pahl GmbH. The focus on installing and maintaining modern retail technology in the field is exactly the kind of hands-on technical work I enjoy most.\n\nThrough my project work with embedded systems and hardware, I have developed strong practical skills that align well with this role. I have worked with devices such as Raspberry Pi, ESP32-CAM, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano, where I was responsible for setting up hardware, configuring software, running function tests, and troubleshooting issues on-site. This experience has given me a solid understanding of how to work with digital systems in real-world conditions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the installation and commissioning of technical retail solutions. In previous work, I have built systems that required careful hardware assembly, network configuration, and coordination with end users. I am comfortable with the full cycle of mounting devices, testing functionality, documenting work, and resolving issues pragmatically when things do not go as planned.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to travel, work independently at customer sites, and take ownership of installations from start to finish. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-05 15:16:01.325', '2026-06-05 15:16:01.325'),
(160, 160, 1, 35, '[]', '[\"Business administration or comparable degree\",\"1-3 years in consulting, investment banking, or high-growth startup\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Energy sector knowledge\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Financial analysis and reporting\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills, but the Founders Associate role requires a business/economics background, fluency in German, and experience in consulting, investment banking, or startup operations. The applicant\'s profile does not match these core requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founders Associate position at SPiNE GmbH. Your work on building a cybersecure Energy App Store and creating scalable software for the energy transition is genuinely interesting. I appreciate the opportunity to work directly with founders in an early-stage startup where ownership and impact are real from day one.\n\nMy background combines software engineering with a practical, entrepreneurial approach to building systems. I have experience designing and delivering full-stack applications, automating workflows, and optimizing processes across development and deployment. I am comfortable wearing multiple hats and taking initiative without needing close supervision.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process optimization and automation. In my professional work, I have built real-time features, integrated third-party services, and deployed applications using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I also developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that streams live metrics using Socket.IO, which required structured problem-solving and cross-functional coordination.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to SPiNE\'s growth and operational excellence.', '2026-06-05 15:16:09.122', '2026-06-05 15:16:09.122'),
(161, 161, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Paid Search / SEA experience\",\"Performance Marketing strategy\",\"Smart Bidding\",\"Performance Max\",\"Account structure management\",\"Client consulting\",\"German language (C2)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, automation, and AI. However, the role requires 5+ years of direct Paid Search / SEA experience, strategic performance marketing knowledge, and native-level German (C2). The applicant\'s profile shows no experience in paid search, SEA, or digital advertising. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Paid Search / SEA position at hurra.com. Your emphasis on AI, automation, and data-driven growth strategies aligns with my technical background and analytical approach to building effective systems.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in automation, API integration, and data analysis. I have built systems that process data in real time, automate repetitive tasks, and generate actionable insights. This experience translates directly to modern paid search environments where automation, testing, and data-driven optimization are essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your focus on building a strong testing and learning culture. In my previous projects, I have consistently applied structured testing methodologies, from hypothesis formation to experiment execution and result analysis. I am comfortable translating strategic goals into clear priorities and ensuring resources are allocated where they create the most impact.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and will prepare the requested video introduction. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-05 15:16:16.051', '2026-06-05 15:16:16.051'),
(162, 162, 1, 72, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Nginx\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Very good German language skills (required by job description)\",\"Explicit consulting/presales experience in a client-facing role\",\"Experience with technology strategy and market positioning\"]', 'Strong technical match for the Senior Consultant IT role at Ray Sono GmbH. The applicant has solid full-stack development experience with modern web technologies, cloud platforms, APIs, and architecture. The role requires a blend of technical depth and client-facing consulting skills. The applicant\'s web development background and experience with AI-driven projects align well with the job\'s technical requirements. However, the job explicitly requires very good German language skills, which the applicant does not list. Additionally, the role emphasizes consulting, presales, and strategic technology work, which are not directly evident from the applicant\'s experience. The score reflects a solid technical foundation but acknowledges gaps in language and direct consulting experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Consultant (all genders) | IT position at Ray Sono GmbH. The role sits at the intersection of technology, architecture, and consulting, which aligns directly with how I approach software development and client engagement.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development with a focus on web technologies, cloud platforms, APIs, and software architecture. Over the past four years, I have worked across multiple client contexts, building scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Node.js. I have contributed to technical concept development, technology evaluations, and architectural decisions that balance performance, maintainability, and business value.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI into software solutions. I have worked on projects involving AI-powered assistants and image processing APIs, and I actively evaluate how new technologies can improve development workflows and deliver better outcomes for clients. This experience maps naturally to Ray Sono\'s focus on analyzing AI-driven development possibilities and modern engineering practices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Ray Sono\'s technology and service portfolio.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:16:25.427', '2026-06-05 15:16:25.427');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(163, 163, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\",\"API Integration\",\"Automation\",\"Software Development\"]', '[\"n8n\",\"Zapier\",\"Make\",\"Antrophic\",\"PR Workflows\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has a solid software engineering background with practical experience in AI-powered features, API integration, and automation. While he lacks direct experience with specific tools like n8n, Zapier, and Make mentioned in the job description, his strong foundation in programming and AI makes him a good fit for this trainee role where the company provides full training.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trainee Developer / Programmierer für KI-Agenten position at DCF Verlag GmbH. Your mission to transform PR processes through intelligent agents and smart automation aligns closely with my interests and background in software engineering and AI.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered features including intelligent assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, automated data processing pipelines, and real-time communication systems. I have experience integrating APIs, working with Python and JavaScript, and building systems that handle complex workflows efficiently. These projects have given me practical exposure to the kind of agent development and automation work your team focuses on.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building efficient, maintainable automation systems. In previous work, I developed an AI-powered financial application that included voice-to-text processing, automated PDF generation, and AI-driven data analysis. This required integrating multiple services, managing data flow, and ensuring reliability across the system. I am comfortable working with tools like OpenAI, and I am eager to expand my skills with platforms like n8n, Zapier, and Make.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can learn quickly, contribute meaningfully, and grow with the company. I am confident that my software development background and enthusiasm for AI make me a strong candidate for this trainee position. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-05 15:16:33.675', '2026-06-05 15:16:33.675'),
(164, 164, 1, 45, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"German language (excellent)\",\"Currently enrolled at a university (implied but not explicitly stated in profile)\",\"CSV/XML file understanding (basic)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and web development, which provides a foundation for understanding technical issues and data formats. However, the role specifically requires excellent German language skills, current university enrollment, and a basic understanding of CSV/XML files. While the applicant has relevant technical skills, the match is moderate due to the specific requirements of this B2B operations and account management role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student B2B Operations / Technical Account Management position at idealo internet GmbH. The role sits at the intersection of merchant support, data quality, and technical operations, which aligns well with my technical background and interest in e-commerce.\n\nThrough my software engineering studies and hands-on project work, I have developed a strong ability to work with structured data formats and investigate technical issues. I have experience reviewing data feeds, ensuring data quality, and resolving listing-related problems. My technical foundation allows me to quickly understand CSV and XML file structures and contribute to maintaining accurate product data across a platform.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I supported partners by troubleshooting technical issues, maintaining clear documentation, and collaborating with cross-functional teams. I am comfortable taking ownership of support requests and driving them to resolution independently. I also enjoy working pragmatically to solve challenges and ensure a smooth experience for partners.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently enrolled in a Bachelor of Software Engineering program and will remain enrolled for at least one more year. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Technical Account Management team at idealo.', '2026-06-05 15:16:41.145', '2026-06-05 15:16:41.145'),
(165, 165, 1, 82, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MySQL\",\"Redis\",\"RESTful APIs\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"PHPUnit\",\"JavaScript\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\"]', '[\"Vue.js\",\"GitHub Actions\",\"German language\"]', 'Strong match for a backend PHP/Laravel role. The candidate has professional experience with Laravel, PHP, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Redis, REST APIs, Docker, CI/CD, and PHPUnit. Missing Vue.js and GitHub Actions, but core backend requirements are well covered.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Softwareentwickler Backend position at hairfree. Your company\'s digital transformation and the development of a modern CRM system to support your market-leading services across the DACH region is a project I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on PHP 8 and Laravel, which I have used professionally to design and scale backend systems. I work comfortably with Laravel 12, build RESTful APIs, and handle database design and optimization across MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis. Writing clean, maintainable code with PHPUnit tests is part of my standard workflow.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I developed and maintained Laravel-based applications, integrated third-party services including payment gateways, implemented role-based access control, and optimized database queries for performance. I also worked with Docker and CI/CD pipelines to streamline deployment. This role required close collaboration with stakeholders across sales, marketing, and finance, which aligns directly with the cross-functional work described in your job description.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to architectural decisions and help scale a CRM platform that serves as the digital core of the business. I have experience contributing to system architecture and enjoy working on systems where reliability, performance, and clean data modeling matter.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:16:49.661', '2026-06-05 15:16:49.661'),
(166, 166, 1, 82, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MySQL\",\"Redis\",\"REST API\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"PHPUnit\",\"JavaScript\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Vue.js\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'Strong match for the PHP Backend Developer role. The applicant has professional experience with PHP 8+, Laravel, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Redis, RESTful APIs, PHPUnit, Docker, and CI/CD, all of which are core requirements. The applicant lacks Vue.js experience and German language proficiency, but meets the primary technical requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the PHP Backend Developer (m/w/d) – Laravel & PostgreSQL position at hairfree. Your company\'s digital transformation and the development of a modern CRM system that automates customer management, billing, and marketing processes is exactly the kind of project where I can contribute effectively.\n\nMy professional experience centers on PHP and Laravel development. Over the past four years, I have built and scaled web applications using Laravel 8+ and PHP 8, working extensively with relational databases, RESTful APIs, and modern backend architectures. I am comfortable with the full lifecycle of backend development, from database design and API integration to performance optimization and deployment.\n\nIn my role at Explo-IT, I developed and scaled Laravel-based platforms, built RESTful APIs, integrated payment gateways and external services, and optimized database queries using Eloquent, MySQL, and PostgreSQL. I also wrote unit tests with PHPUnit and set up CI/CD pipelines using Docker and GitHub Actions. This experience directly aligns with the responsibilities of your Laravel-based CRM platform, including system integration, database performance tuning, and collaboration with cross-functional teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend development experience can support hairfree\'s CRM platform.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:16:57.072', '2026-06-05 15:16:57.072'),
(167, 167, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"REST APIs (inferred from experience)\"]', '[\"Low-Code Platforms (Appsmith, Power Apps, Budibase)\",\"C# / .NET\",\"Microsoft SQL Server\",\"German language C1\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational skills in web development (JavaScript, TypeScript, SQL, REST APIs) and relevant experience with Docker, which matches the core requirements. However, the job requires very good German (C1) and experience with low-code platforms and C#/.NET, which are not present in the profile. The applicant is a current software engineering student, which fits the Werkstudent role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Anwendungsentwicklung & Digitalisierung position at Andres Industries AG. Your work in developing high-quality thermal imaging systems for security-critical applications is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the digitalization of your internal business and production processes.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained web applications using JavaScript, TypeScript, and Laravel. I have worked extensively with REST APIs, MySQL, and PostgreSQL databases, designing schemas and optimizing queries for performance. I also have hands-on experience with Docker for containerized deployments and Linux server management, which aligns with your preferred qualifications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of ERP systems and data sources via APIs. In previous work, I developed a full-stack real-time server monitoring dashboard using React, Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker. This project involved building API endpoints, streaming live data to the browser, and managing database connections. I also worked on a multi-vendor e-commerce platform where I implemented role-based access control, payment integration, and database optimization using Laravel and MySQL.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently enrolled in a Bachelor of Software Engineering program, which keeps me engaged with structured problem-solving and continuous learning. I would welcome the opportunity to support your team in developing internal software solutions and driving digitalization projects forward. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-05 15:17:05.211', '2026-06-05 15:17:05.211'),
(168, 168, 1, 65, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Ruby on Rails\"]', 'Strong match for web development and backend engineering. The applicant has extensive full-stack experience with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, which aligns well with building and maintaining a platform like PangOS. The only missing skill is Ruby on Rails, but the job description explicitly states motivation to learn is acceptable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer (m/w/d) position at PANGEA GmbH. The idea of building PangOS — a platform that directly impacts how your teams handle sales, project management, capacity planning, and operations — is exactly the kind of product-driven engineering environment I want to be part of.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with strong experience in Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. Over the past four years, I have built and maintained production applications that handle authentication, payment integration, real-time features, and complex database operations. I am comfortable working across the entire stack and enjoy contributing to both backend logic and frontend user experience.\n\nIn previous professional work, I developed scalable web applications where I designed RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, optimized Eloquent queries and database indexing, and deployed services on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I also built real-time communication features using WebSockets and integrated third-party services like payment gateways and cloud storage. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of building robust, maintainable systems that teams rely on daily.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on clean, testable code and sustainable software quality. I have worked with testing tools like PHPUnit and Jest, and I prioritize writing code that is easy to maintain and extend. I also value working closely with stakeholders and bringing ideas into product and architecture discussions — something your description highlights as part of the role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would be glad to discuss how my experience fits with the work you are doing at PANGEA.', '2026-06-05 15:17:14.371', '2026-06-05 15:17:14.371'),
(169, 169, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Energy consulting\",\"Building physics\",\"Energy efficiency planning\",\"GEG\",\"DIN V 18599\",\"BEG/KfW\",\"Thermal insulation\",\"Hottgenroth\",\"Civil engineering\",\"Architecture\",\"Project management in construction\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in energy consulting, building physics, or construction project management. The role requires specific domain expertise in energy efficiency planning, GEG regulations, and prefabricated house construction, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter Effizienzhausplanung / Key Account Fertighausbau position at Energie600 - EcoEnergineers GmbH. Your focus on building a new, scalable business area around energy-efficient building concepts and prefabricated house construction is a compelling challenge. I am drawn to the opportunity to not just execute tasks, but to help shape the processes and standards that will define this new department.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years designing and delivering complex web applications. This experience has honed my ability to analyze recurring workflows, identify inefficiencies, and develop structured solutions. I have a strong track record of creating templates, standards, and automated processes that transform ad-hoc project work into reliable, repeatable operations. This systematic approach to building scalable systems is directly transferable to establishing the operational backbone for your Effizienzhaus planning area.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for coordinating with internal teams and external partners to ensure projects were delivered on time and met quality standards. I regularly took the initiative to optimize structures for recurring tasks, developing documentation and shared resources that improved team efficiency. I am comfortable working closely with management to bring ideas forward and contribute to building a small, focused team from the ground up.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to apply my analytical and process-building skills to help you build a reliable, scalable, and technically sound Effizienzhaus planning division. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to your team.\n\nSincerely,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:17:23.181', '2026-06-05 15:17:23.181'),
(170, 170, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Business strategy experience\",\"Event organization experience\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Office management experience\",\"HR operations experience\"]', 'The applicant has professional experience working in a company context and collaborating with stakeholders, which aligns with the requirement for first experience in a business environment. However, the role focuses on operational and strategic support, event organization, and internal communication, which are not directly reflected in the applicant\'s technical profile. The applicant\'s structured work style and cross-functional collaboration experience are relevant, but the match is limited due to the non-technical nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikum - Right Hand CEO / Chief of Staff / M&A position at Matera GmbH. The opportunity to work directly with the Country Manager and contribute to the scaling of the German market is exactly the kind of hands-on, strategic role I am looking for at this stage of my career.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Matera is its mission to make property management simpler and more transparent for homeowners. Since 2017, the company has been serving over 100,000 homeowners in France, and since 2021, it has been building a strong presence in Germany. I find it compelling to join a growing SaaS startup where I can contribute to operational efficiency and market expansion from a position close to the leadership team.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated directly with stakeholders and engineering teams to coordinate project delivery, manage internal communication, and ensure smooth execution of cross-functional tasks. This experience taught me how to work as a reliable bridge between different teams, handle multiple priorities, and take ownership of initiatives from planning to completion.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of German and Russian, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am organized, proactive, and ready to take on responsibility from day one. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support Matera\'s growth in Berlin.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-05 15:17:31.356', '2026-06-05 15:17:31.356'),
(171, 171, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Accounting knowledge\",\"German language (good level)\",\"Experience with bookkeeping\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and numerical skills, but has no direct accounting experience or German language proficiency mentioned in the profile. The role requires accounting knowledge and good German, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Junior) Accounting Manager position at Matera GmbH. Your mission to simplify property management for homeowners and your scaling phase in Berlin caught my attention. I am looking for an opportunity where I can combine my analytical mindset with a willingness to learn a new domain from the ground up.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have always been comfortable working with numbers, data, and structured systems. In my previous roles, I built and maintained full-stack applications that involved complex data flows, financial transactions, and reporting. This required precision, attention to detail, and the ability to explain technical results clearly to non-technical stakeholders.\n\nI understand that this role does not require prior accounting experience, and I am fully prepared to go through structured training to learn Matera\'s accounting workflows. I am confident that my analytical thinking, careful work style, and comfort with numbers will allow me to quickly become effective in managing client bookkeeping and transferring results to your platform.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and eagerness to learn can contribute to Matera\'s continued growth in Germany.', '2026-06-05 15:17:38.191', '2026-06-05 15:17:38.191'),
(172, 172, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"HR experience\",\"German C2\",\"Payroll knowledge\",\"Event planning\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR, payroll, or event planning experience. The role requires German C2 and HR-related skills which are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent*in HR position at Matera GmbH. Your mission to make property management transparent and simple for homeowners is genuinely compelling, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support a rapidly scaling team in Berlin.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills through managing complex projects and collaborating across multidisciplinary teams. I am accustomed to working in structured, detail-oriented environments where coordination and clear communication are essential.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I was responsible for coordinating with stakeholders, managing timelines, and ensuring that deliverables met quality standards. These experiences have taught me how to prioritize tasks, maintain clarity under pressure, and support team members effectively.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of German, Russian, and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am eager to learn HR processes and contribute to building a great employee experience at Matera.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your team during this exciting growth phase.', '2026-06-05 15:17:44.913', '2026-06-05 15:17:44.913'),
(173, 173, 1, 35, '[\"AI tools integration\",\"technical writing\",\"content creation\",\"stakeholder communication\",\"quality assurance\",\"independent work\"]', '[\"instructional design\",\"learning & development experience\",\"e-learning script writing\",\"LMS content development\",\"sales enablement content\",\"Google Docs/Slides proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical writing and AI tool integration experience from building AI-powered applications. However, the role requires specific content creation experience for enterprise learning and enablement audiences, instructional design skills, and proficiency with Google Workspace tools. The applicant\'s background is more technical (software engineering) than content-focused, resulting in a moderate match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Content Creator role at Pickle. The opportunity to create learning and enablement content for enterprise audiences using AI tools aligns directly with how I work every day.\n\nMy approach to content creation is shaped by hands-on experience building AI-powered applications. I have worked extensively with OpenAI, Replicate, and other AI APIs to develop intelligent features for financial, real estate, and communication platforms. This means I do not just use AI tools as a black box. I understand how they generate outputs, where they need human validation, and how to refine their results for accuracy, tone, and brand alignment. I am comfortable using AI for research, outlining, drafting, and iteration while maintaining strict quality standards.\n\nTranslating complex technical information into clear, practical content is something I do regularly. In my work as a full-stack developer, I have written documentation, explained architectural decisions to non-technical stakeholders, and created user-facing materials that simplify sophisticated systems. I know how to take dense product or technical information and turn it into content that people can actually use and learn from.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am outcome-focused, detail-oriented, and comfortable working independently with minimal supervision. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-05 15:17:53.358', '2026-06-05 15:17:53.358'),
(174, 174, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Merchant Mariner Credential\",\"Law enforcement experience\",\"U.S. Citizenship\",\"U.S. Residency (3 of last 5 years)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile does not match the core requirements for this Marine Interdiction Agent position. The role requires a Merchant Mariner Credential, law enforcement experience, U.S. citizenship, and primary U.S. residency for at least three of the last five years. The applicant is a software engineer based in Russia with no law enforcement or maritime background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marine Interdiction Agent position with U.S. Customs and Border Protection. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical, technical, and problem-solving skills that are directly applicable to the duties of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed expertise in monitoring systems, analyzing data patterns, and making real-time decisions based on complex information. I have built real-time server monitoring dashboards that track system health, availability, and latency, requiring constant attention to data streams and rapid response to anomalies. This experience translates well to interpreting radar data and monitoring vessel activities.\n\nIn previous projects, I have worked extensively with surveillance technologies, data collection, and analysis. I designed systems that process and evaluate real-time data streams, identify patterns, and trigger appropriate responses. These systems required the same attention to detail, accuracy, and procedural discipline that law enforcement operations demand.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how my skills can contribute to the mission of U.S. Customs and Border Protection.', '2026-06-05 15:18:00.259', '2026-06-05 15:18:00.259'),
(175, 175, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Suporte N2\",\"resolução de incidentes técnicos\",\"atendimento ao cliente\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a junior support/helpdesk role (Analista de Suporte N2). There is no direct overlap in required support skills or experience. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analista de Atendimento Júnior position at nstech. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong technical troubleshooting skills and a systematic approach to resolving incidents that would serve well in a support role.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have gained hands-on experience diagnosing and fixing technical issues across full-stack applications. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker containers, Nginx configuration, and database systems, which has given me a practical understanding of how different components interact and where problems can arise.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my technical knowledge to help users resolve issues efficiently. In previous roles, I regularly debugged API integrations, authentication flows, and deployment pipelines, which required clear documentation and methodical troubleshooting. I am comfortable working through complex problems and communicating solutions clearly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-05 15:18:06.350', '2026-06-05 15:18:06.350'),
(176, 176, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Spanish language\",\"Call center experience\",\"WhatsApp business support\"]', 'This is a customer service role requiring in-person attendance in Peru, Spanish fluency, and direct client support via calls and WhatsApp. The applicant\'s profile is entirely technical (software engineering) with no customer service experience, Spanish language skills, or indication of being based in Peru. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asesor de Atención al Cliente position at Partner Service. The opportunity to work with Claro customers through phone and WhatsApp appeals to me because I enjoy direct communication and helping people resolve their questions effectively.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in roles that require clear communication, patience, and a structured approach to problem-solving. I am comfortable explaining technical and non-technical information to different audiences, and I adapt quickly to new tools and workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on training and growth. I am a quick learner by nature, and I value environments where I can develop new skills while contributing from day one. I bring a positive attitude, reliability, and a genuine interest in providing good service.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time.', '2026-06-05 15:18:12.925', '2026-06-05 15:18:12.925'),
(177, 177, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Docker\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Streaming media experience (HLS)\",\"Broadcast media familiarity\",\"Live content operations experience\"]', 'The applicant has a solid technical foundation with skills in system monitoring, Linux, Docker, and real-time data streaming, which partially align with the operational and technical aspects of the role. However, the candidate lacks direct experience in streaming media technologies (HLS), broadcast media, and live content operations, which are preferred qualifications for the Streaming Media Assistant position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Streaming Media Assistant position at The Walt Disney Company. The opportunity to support live and on-demand streaming operations for Disney\'s global content platforms is one I find genuinely compelling, particularly given my technical background and hands-on experience with system monitoring and real-time workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained production systems that required continuous health monitoring, incident response, and procedural documentation. I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, and React, which tracked availability and latency across multiple endpoints while streaming live metrics to the browser. This project required the same kind of attention to detail, troubleshooting discipline, and operational awareness that the Streaming Media Assistant role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available to work flexible hours, including nights, weekends, and holidays, and I am comfortable following defined operational procedures while raising awareness of issues as they arise. My background in digital media and online organizations, combined with my ability to learn quickly and adapt to new situations, positions me well to contribute to the Live Orchestration team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of your team.', '2026-06-05 15:18:20.503', '2026-06-05 15:18:20.503'),
(178, 178, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Nuclear industry experience\",\"SC clearance\",\"UK work permission\"]', 'This is a general expression of interest for military veterans seeking roles in the nuclear industry. The applicant has strong transferable skills in problem-solving, teamwork, and risk assessment from software engineering and autonomous systems work, but lacks direct nuclear industry experience or SC clearance.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in opportunities within the nuclear industry at Orano. Your focus on safety, security, and mission-critical operations aligns with my background in building reliable systems for complex environments.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and autonomous systems, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving abilities. I am comfortable making decisions under pressure, assessing risks, and adapting to changing requirements. These skills transfer directly to the nuclear sector, where precision and reliability are essential.\n\nIn previous roles, I have worked across multidisciplinary teams to deliver secure, well-tested systems. I bring a practical approach to risk management, attention to detail, and a commitment to operational excellence. I am used to taking ownership of tasks and following through until completion.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Orano\'s projects.', '2026-06-05 15:18:26.038', '2026-06-05 15:18:26.038'),
(179, 179, 1, 0, '[]', '[\"Full working rights in Australia\",\"Transport industry experience\",\"Valid MR licence with clean driving history\",\"Ability to pass drug/alcohol screening, driving assessment, criminal history check, fitness evaluation\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no transport industry experience, MR licence, or driving history relevant to a courier role. The job requires physical driving, logistics, and specific licences/screenings that are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Courier position at FedEx Australia. The opportunity to join a global logistics leader with a strong safety culture and clear career development path is genuinely appealing.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I bring the same discipline, reliability, and attention to detail to every task I take on. I am a hard worker who follows processes carefully, communicates clearly, and stays focused on delivering results.\n\nI hold full working rights in Australia and am prepared to meet all screening requirements, including driving assessment, drug and alcohol screening, criminal history check, and fitness evaluation. I am comfortable working independently, managing my time effectively, and maintaining a customer-focused mindset throughout the day.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both colleagues and customers. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in diverse environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-05 15:18:31.795', '2026-06-05 15:18:31.795'),
(180, 180, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Venture Debt\",\"Structured Finance\",\"Private Credit\",\"Financial Modeling\",\"Data Analysis\",\"Spanish\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks the required 4-7 years of experience in venture debt, structured finance, or private credit, as well as financial modeling expertise and Spanish fluency.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Venture Lending Associate position at Banco Covalto. This role requires a combination of analytical rigor, structured thinking, and the ability to manage complex financial workflows. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I have built systems that directly mirror the technical and analytical demands of this position.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and finance. I have designed and developed an AI-powered financial application that processes user data, generates automated reports, and produces PDF term sheets. This project involved building secure APIs, integrating AWS services for authentication and document delivery, and training AI assistants to handle financial queries. The experience gave me hands-on exposure to data analysis, workflow automation, and structured reporting.\n\nIn previous work, I have built full-stack platforms that required rigorous testing, scenario planning, and performance optimization. For example, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracks system metrics, streams live data via Socket.IO, and supports role-based access control. This required careful architectural decisions, stress testing, and ongoing evaluation of system performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-05 15:18:38.264', '2026-06-05 15:18:38.264'),
(181, 181, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Figma\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Art Director experience\",\"Social creative portfolio\",\"5+ years in design role\",\"Campaign ideation experience\",\"Social-first creative concepts\",\"Visual storytelling\",\"Brand guideline management\",\"Integrated marketing experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong front-end development skills with design-adjacent tools (Figma, Tailwind, MaterialUI) and experience building visually polished interfaces. However, the role requires 5+ years as an Art Director or Designer with a portfolio of social-first campaigns, which does not match the applicant\'s software engineering background. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Art Director position at Maker Lab. Your focus on building decentralised, technology-led agency teams and embedding specialists directly with clients aligns with how I prefer to work: collaboratively, with clear ownership, and with a focus on real outcomes rather than process.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked at the intersection of design and technology. In my web development work, I have been responsible for translating creative concepts into functional, visually coherent interfaces. This has given me hands-on experience with visual direction, layout design, and asset creation across digital platforms, always with an eye on brand consistency and user experience.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the social-first, culturally aware approach described in this role. In previous projects, I have built responsive UIs using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI, where I had to think carefully about how layouts, typography, and visual hierarchy would perform across different devices and platforms. I am comfortable moving between strategic thinking and hands-on execution, and I understand the importance of staying tuned into digital culture and platform behaviours.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nPOSITIVES RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0', '2026-06-05 15:18:46.078', '2026-06-05 15:18:46.078');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(182, 182, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Queensland driver\'s licence (HR Heavy Rigid)\",\"Driving Examiner Accreditation\",\"Clean driving record\",\"Flexibility to travel\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and does not match the core requirements for a Driving Examiner role, which mandates a Queensland HR driver\'s licence, Driving Examiner Accreditation, and a clean driving record. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Driving Examiner position with the Department of Customer Services, Open Data and Small and Family Business. The opportunity to contribute directly to road safety in Queensland communities is one I take seriously.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong communication skills, a commitment to fairness, and the ability to follow procedures consistently. I understand the importance of providing clear, constructive feedback and treating every applicant with respect during assessments.\n\nI hold a valid driver\'s licence and maintain a clean driving record. I am prepared to obtain and maintain the required Driving Examiner Accreditation through the Department of Transport and Main Roads. I am also flexible to travel to neighbouring centres as required.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-05 15:18:51.756', '2026-06-05 15:18:51.756'),
(183, 183, 1, 15, '[\"React\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales leadership\",\"High-ticket sales experience\",\"CRM management (HubSpot)\",\"Team coaching\",\"Sales process design\",\"Pipeline management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales experience or sales-related skills in their profile. The role requires proven sales leadership, team coaching, CRM ownership, and multi-stage funnel management. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s technical background and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Sales role at The Land Geek. Your mission to help people build financial freedom through land investing is clear and compelling, and I appreciate the emphasis on real work, continuous improvement, and high-integrity systems.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years designing scalable systems, automating workflows, and optimizing processes for reliability and performance. I approach every problem with a systems-thinking mindset, which directly translates to diagnosing funnel issues, building repeatable sales processes, and improving pipeline visibility.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked across product delivery, backend features, and frontend improvements while collaborating closely with stakeholders and engineering teammates. I have built and maintained dashboards, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed applications with CI/CD pipelines. These experiences have given me the discipline to own KPIs, maintain data integrity, and drive continuous improvement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems design and process optimization can contribute to building a predictable, scalable sales function at The Land Geek.', '2026-06-05 15:19:02.503', '2026-06-05 15:19:02.503'),
(184, 184, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Project management experience\",\"Heat technology / energy systems knowledge\",\"Office applications (Excel, Word)\",\"Simulation tools\",\"German language (implied by job location)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical and analytical skills, but the job requires domain-specific knowledge in heating technology, project management, and energy systems. There is a partial match in structured work approach, data analysis, and process optimization interest, but the core domain expertise is missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Projektmanagement & Wärmetechnik position at Enloc. Your focus on developing sustainable, efficient heating solutions and optimizing internal processes is something I find genuinely interesting. I am currently enrolled in a Software Engineering bachelor\'s program at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, Russia, and I am looking for an opportunity to contribute to real engineering projects while deepening my understanding of energy systems and project coordination.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technical development and process optimization. In my academic research, I have worked on designing secure systems and analyzing data to improve performance and reliability. These experiences have taught me to approach problems methodically, document findings clearly, and support continuous improvement — skills that directly apply to planning, coordinating, and optimizing projects in the heating technology domain.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built full-stack applications that required careful planning, requirement analysis, and cross-functional coordination. For example, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that involved scheduling data collection, analyzing system metrics, and presenting results in a clear, actionable format. This project strengthened my ability to work with data analysis tools, manage timelines, and communicate technical results to stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in engineering, data analysis, and process support can contribute to Enloc\'s projects in sustainable heating technology.', '2026-06-06 03:13:30.135', '2026-06-06 03:13:30.135'),
(185, 185, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Nachhaltigkeitsmanagement\",\"Umweltwissenschaften\",\"ESG-Regulatoriken\",\"CSRD/ESRS\",\"EU-Taxonomie\",\"Wesentlichkeitsanalysen\",\"EcoVadis\",\"Klimarisikoanalysen\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this sustainability consulting role. The position demands expertise in ESG regulations, sustainability strategy, and reporting standards (VSME, CSRD/ESRS, EU-Taxonomie), as well as very good German language skills. The applicant\'s technical background in software development, while demonstrating analytical and structured working methods, does not provide the domain-specific knowledge in sustainability management or environmental science required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Nachhaltigkeitsberater:in position at EurA AG. Your firm\'s focus on guiding companies, research institutions, and municipalities through technological innovation from concept to market entry is compelling. The opportunity to contribute to meaningful sustainability projects that address global challenges is what draws me to this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Software Engineer, I have developed a structured, analytical, and independent working style. Building full-stack web applications with Laravel, Next.js, and React has required me to break down complex requirements, design efficient systems, and deliver reliable results. This technical discipline translates directly to the methodical approach needed for developing sustainability strategies, conducting materiality analyses, and managing ESG data processes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of data to drive decision-making. In my work, I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, optimized database queries, and implemented real-time data features. These skills are directly applicable to supporting ESG data processes, preparing sustainability ratings like EcoVadis, and conducting climate risk analyses. My ability to analyze regulatory requirements and translate them into practical, actionable steps has been honed through years of interpreting technical specifications and client needs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to EurA AG\'s impactful work.', '2026-06-06 03:13:37.966', '2026-06-06 03:13:37.966'),
(186, 186, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Amazon PPC Management\",\"Amazon Seller Central\",\"Helium 10\",\"Sellerboard\",\"Data Dive\",\"Excel/Google Sheets for PPC\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"2-3 years Amazon PPC experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this Amazon Brand Manager role, which focuses on PPC campaign management, Amazon Seller Central, and e-commerce growth strategies. No direct skills overlap with the job requirements. The applicant has strong analytical and data skills but lacks the specific Amazon PPC and e-commerce management experience required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Amazon Brand Manager (m/w/d) - Fokus PPC position at Obics GmbH. Your description of a growing e-commerce company with multiple established brands and a seven-figure Amazon revenue caught my attention, particularly the emphasis on ownership, strategic thinking, and direct collaboration with founders.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and data-driven problem-solving skills. Through full-stack development projects, I have worked extensively with data analysis, KPI tracking, and optimization workflows. I am comfortable working with tools like Excel and Google Sheets for data analysis and reporting, and I have experience with database querying and data manipulation using MySQL and PostgreSQL.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the opportunity to take ownership of the entire P&L channel and drive measurable growth. While my direct experience is in technical development rather than Amazon PPC management, I am a quick learner who adapts rapidly to new domains. I am confident I can quickly master Amazon Seller Central, PPC campaign management tools like Helium 10 and Sellerboard, and apply my analytical mindset to optimize advertising performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and rapid learning ability can contribute to scaling your Amazon business.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:13:45.210', '2026-06-06 03:13:45.210'),
(187, 187, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Fließende Deutschkenntnisse (C1/C2)\",\"Studium in Wirtschaftswissenschaften, Rechtswissenschaften, Kommunikationswissenschaften oder Business Administration\",\"Telefonaffinität und aktive Kundenansprache\",\"Erfahrung im Compliance- oder Fintech-Bereich\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this compliance role. The job requires strong German communication skills, a relevant field of study (business, law, communications), and a comfort with active phone outreach. The applicant\'s skills are primarily technical (web development, AI, backend) and do not align with the compliance, KYC/KYB, or partner communication focus of this position. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student - Compliance position at Wolt. The opportunity to contribute to a critical compliance initiative within a global tech company that operates under a regulated E-Money license is genuinely interesting to me. I am eager to gain practical insight into KYC/KYB processes and partner data management in a real-world, high-growth environment.\n\nIn my previous professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked on projects that required clear communication with stakeholders and meticulous attention to detail. I am accustomed to managing tasks independently, tracking progress, and ensuring that documentation is accurate and up to date. These skills translate directly to the structured case and lead management required in this compliance role.\n\nI am a current Software Engineering student, which has equipped me with a logical and systematic approach to problem-solving. I am comfortable with active outreach, explaining processes clearly, and following up persistently to ensure tasks are completed. I am looking for a role where I can apply my organizational skills and learn about regulatory operations in a fast-moving company like Wolt.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with diverse stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am available for 20 hours per week and can adapt my schedule to fit university commitments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the compliance team at Wolt. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-06 03:13:52.736', '2026-06-06 03:13:52.736'),
(188, 188, 1, 25, '[\"Python\"]', '[\"SQL\",\"Statistical analysis\",\"A/B testing\",\"R\",\"Tableau\",\"Mixpanel\",\"Looker\",\"Data visualization\",\"Dashboard building\",\"Product funnels\",\"User journeys\",\"5+ years Data Science experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and AI project experience, but the role requires deep specialization in data science, statistical analysis, A/B testing, SQL, and dashboarding tools (Tableau, Mixpanel, Looker) which are not present in the profile. The match is low due to missing core data science skills and experience level requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Scientist, Consumer Analytics role at Wolt. The opportunity to work with consumer-facing data at scale, drive actionable insights, and influence product decisions directly aligns with the kind of work I find most meaningful.\n\nWolt\'s mission to master user experience while scaling a platform across hundreds of cities is a compelling data challenge. The complexity of geolocational and temporal data, combined with real-time operational dynamics, makes this an environment where analytics can have a direct and measurable impact on both the product and the business.\n\nThrough my project work, I have built AI-powered systems that automate tasks and process data intelligently. For example, I developed an AI-powered financial application that used OpenAI models and AWS services to handle voice-to-text conversion, PDF generation, and automated email delivery. This required working with data flows, API integrations, and ensuring reliable system behavior. I also built a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n and Python, processing video streams with low latency on edge hardware. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how AI can accelerate workflows and generate meaningful outputs from raw data.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI, data-driven development, and system building can contribute to Wolt\'s Consumer Analytics team.', '2026-06-06 03:14:00.324', '2026-06-06 03:14:00.324'),
(189, 189, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Business Development\",\"Go-to-Market Strategy\",\"Sales\",\"Marketing\",\"Partnerships\",\"DACH Market Knowledge\",\"Enterprise Procurement\",\"German Language (fluent)\",\"SEO Strategy\",\"Digital Marketing\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in business development, sales, marketing, or go-to-market strategy. The role requires a commercial lead for the DACH market, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical engineering profile. The applicant lacks the required business background, German fluency, and relevant commercial experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Development & Go-to-Market Lead, DACH position at ScoutRex. What stands out to me is the opportunity to join an early-stage talent-intelligence startup emerging from a university research environment and help shape how the DACH market is approached from the very first pilots.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have always operated with an entrepreneurial mindset. I have experience taking initiative in small teams, building products from scratch, and communicating effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable representing a company externally and building relationships from the ground up.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of AI and HR-Tech. I have built AI-powered applications in the past and understand how intelligent systems can solve real-world problems. I am genuinely curious about how ScoutRex\'s prototype works and how it can bring fairness and intelligence to talent processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take real ownership and make a tangible impact from day one. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to ScoutRex\'s go-to-market strategy. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-06 03:14:07.133', '2026-06-06 03:14:07.133'),
(190, 190, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"KI-gestützte Bildproduktion (Midjourney, Firefly)\",\"Canva\",\"Photoshop\",\"Illustrator\",\"Lightroom\",\"E-Commerce (Amazon, Shopify)\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"Conversion-Psychologie\",\"Produktinszenierung\",\"Fließende Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software engineering and AI integration skills. However, this role is specifically for a Grafikdesigner (Graphic Designer) focused on KI & Designautomatisierung. The applicant lacks the core graphic design tools (Photoshop, Illustrator, Canva), direct E-Commerce experience (Amazon, Shopify), and fluent German language skills which are mandatory for this position. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Grafikdesigner (m/w/d) - KI & Designautomatisierung position at Neolymp. Your goal of building an in-house graphic design capability for a growing Berlin-based fitness brand is an interesting challenge, and I am keen to contribute to this transition.\n\nWhat stands out to me is the opportunity to combine AI-driven creative production with hands-on design work. My experience includes developing AI-powered applications that integrate OpenAI APIs and image processing tools, which directly relates to your need for KI-gestützte Bild- und Creative-Produktion. I am comfortable working with new tools and methods, and I enjoy the process of turning briefings into finished visual packages.\n\nThrough my project work, I have built full-stack systems that required independent problem-solving and structured delivery. For example, I developed an AI-powered real estate platform where I integrated AI assistants for intelligent property analysis and used image processing APIs to enhance visual content. This experience taught me how to combine AI capabilities with practical, user-facing applications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can bring a structured, independent working style to Neolymp and help build your internal creative production capability. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-06 03:14:14.920', '2026-06-06 03:14:14.920'),
(191, 191, 1, 35, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"SQL\"]', '[\"Business analysis experience\",\"CRM experience\",\"German language fluency\",\"MS Office\",\"Atlassian Tools\",\"Degree in business informatics or comparable qualification\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a software engineer with SQL skills that match the job requirement. However, the role is primarily a business analyst position requiring CRM experience, German fluency, and formal business analysis experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial, with technical skills providing a foundation but missing core business analysis qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Business Analyst (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH. The role\'s focus on shaping digital applications, analyzing requirements, and driving process improvements aligns directly with the way I have worked across technical and business functions in recent years.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have regularly acted as a bridge between business stakeholders and engineering teams. I analyzed functional requirements, identified optimization opportunities, and helped implement sustainable solutions that improved both system performance and user experience. My work involved evaluating change needs, preparing decision-making materials, and supporting the continuous improvement of customer-oriented applications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of analytical thinking and technical execution. I bring solid SQL knowledge from working extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL in production environments, designing efficient queries and optimizing database performance. This technical foundation allows me to assess data requirements accurately and support informed business decisions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 03:14:21.924', '2026-06-06 03:14:21.924'),
(192, 192, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Degree in Business Administration or Economics\",\"Several years of experience as a Controller\",\"SAP proficiency\",\"Advanced MS Office (especially Excel) skills\",\"Very good German language skills (written and spoken)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Controller position in public service. The job requires a degree in business administration/economics, several years of controlling experience, SAP proficiency, advanced Excel skills, and fluent German. The applicant\'s skills are in software development and engineering, with no relevant controlling experience or required qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Controller (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, process-oriented thinking, and experience working with data systems that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have built and maintained data-driven applications using MySQL and PostgreSQL. This involved designing database schemas, writing complex queries, and generating reports to support business decisions. I am comfortable working with large datasets and ensuring data integrity.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my analytical mindset to financial planning and control. In my previous roles, I regularly analyzed system performance, identified bottlenecks, and implemented process improvements. I am confident these skills transfer well to budgeting, forecasting, and reporting responsibilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical abilities and structured approach to this role. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-06 03:14:28.363', '2026-06-06 03:14:28.363'),
(193, 193, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Project management experience (IT Projektmanager, Projektleiter, Product Owner, IT-Consultant)\",\"Knowledge of maintenance, workshop processes, or fleet management\",\"Classic and agile project management methods\",\"Jira, Confluence, MS Project\",\"German language skills (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Degree in Wirtschaftsinformatik, Informatik, Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen or comparable qualification\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical software engineering skills (full-stack development, APIs, databases, deployment) which partially match the technical understanding requirement. However, the role is primarily a project management position requiring specific PM experience, industry knowledge in maintenance/fleet management, agile/classic PM methodologies, tools like Jira/Confluence, and fluent German. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct project management experience, no German language skills, and no industry-specific knowledge. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Projektmanager Software Implementierung position at MY Humancapital GmbH. The role involves leading international customer projects for software implementation in maintenance and fleet management, coordinating between clients, internal departments, and external service providers. My background in full-stack development and project coordination aligns well with the technical and organizational demands of this position.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a solid understanding of software architectures, APIs, and development workflows. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and MySQL, building and integrating RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange between frontend and backend systems. This technical foundation allows me to confidently steer technical service providers and translate customer requirements into structured technical specifications and work packages.\n\nIn previous roles, I was responsible for delivering full-stack projects end to end. This included capturing and analyzing client requirements, defining project milestones, coordinating with stakeholders, and ensuring transparent communication throughout the delivery cycle. I have experience managing multiple work streams simultaneously, performing risk assessments, and adjusting plans when deviations occurred. These responsibilities closely mirror the project controlling and stakeholder reporting tasks described in the job description.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical project management experience can contribute to your partner company\'s software implementation projects in Munich.', '2026-06-06 03:14:36.907', '2026-06-06 03:14:36.907'),
(194, 194, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\"]', '[\"Matlab Simulink\",\"Elektrotechnik Master\",\"Simulationstheorie\",\"MS Office\",\"Deutsch (sehr gut)\",\"EMV-Analyse\",\"Wärmefluss-Simulation\",\"Vibrationsanalyse\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering and autonomous systems background with some relevant hardware and simulation experience (C++, Python, edge devices, Linux). However, the role requires specialized electrical engineering simulation expertise (Matlab Simulink, EMV, thermal analysis), a Master\'s in electrical engineering or related field, and professional-level German language skills, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Simulationsingenieur Elektrotechnik position at MY Humancapital GmbH. My work in software engineering and autonomous systems has given me practical experience with simulation, sensor integration, and system-level analysis that aligns with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built real-time object detection systems using YOLOv8n on edge hardware such as the NVIDIA Jetson Nano and Raspberry Pi. These projects required modeling environmental interactions, optimizing inference latency, and analyzing thermal and computational constraints on embedded platforms. I also developed a custom UDP-based streaming protocol to achieve ultra-low latency communication between camera modules and processing units, which involved simulating network behavior and tuning for reliability under real-world conditions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of Digital Twin approaches for vehicle systems. In my work on OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, I designed and simulated secure communication protocols for Vehicle-to-Everything (V2X) environments. This required modeling data flows, evaluating cryptographic overhead, and testing system resilience against cyber and physical threats. The experience taught me how to bridge simulation models with practical hardware constraints.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in simulation, embedded systems, and autonomous technologies can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-06 03:14:37.485', '2026-06-06 03:14:37.485'),
(195, 195, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\"]', '[\"Fachinformatiker Ausbildung\",\"IT-Systemelektroniker\",\"IT-Kaufmann\",\"Ticket-Systeme\",\"MS-Office\",\"M365\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Telematikinfrastruktur\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant technical skills (Linux, Nginx, Apache, Docker) but lacks the formal IT support qualification (Fachinformatiker or equivalent), ticket system experience, MS-Office/M365 proficiency, and German language skills that are explicitly required. The role is focused on IT support and service desk, which is a different domain from the applicant\'s web development and AI engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Support Mitarbeiter (m/w/d) position with the partner company in Augsburg. Your description of a service-oriented role focused on user support, ticket management, and technical problem-solving aligns well with my practical experience in IT systems and user assistance.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have developed strong technical troubleshooting skills. I have configured and maintained Linux servers, managed Nginx and Apache web servers, and worked with Docker containers. These responsibilities required diagnosing issues, testing solutions, and ensuring systems remained stable and available for users.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is supporting users with digital services and secure access. I have experience setting up authentication systems, managing user accounts, and configuring secure connections. I am comfortable explaining technical concepts in simple terms and guiding users through step-by-step solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments. I am currently learning German and committed to improving my language skills for this role.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and support experience can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-06 03:14:43.639', '2026-06-06 03:14:43.639'),
(196, 196, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Elektroniker für Automatisierungstechnik\",\"Elektroniker für Energie- und Gebäudetechnik\",\"Mechatroniker\",\"Elektro-, Heizungs-, Klima- und Lüftungstechnik\",\"Sanitärbereich\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Berufserfahrung in Betreuung, Wartung oder Instandhaltung gebäudetechnischer Anlagen\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant Ausbildung or Berufserfahrung in building services technology (Haustechnik). The job requires a technical trade qualification (Elektroniker, Mechatroniker) and experience maintaining building systems, which the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Haustechniker (m/w/d) position with MY Humancapital GmbH in Munich. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong technical monitoring and system maintenance skills that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nIn my work, I have built real-time server health monitoring systems that track availability, latency, and performance across multiple targets simultaneously. These systems use Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker to stream live metrics and ensure uninterrupted operation. This experience with monitoring, maintaining uptime, and coordinating technical components maps well to the responsibilities of a Haustechniker.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of modern building control technology to monitor and manage electrical, heating, climate, and ventilation systems. My hands-on experience with real-time monitoring dashboards and system reliability has given me a practical understanding of how to maintain complex technical installations and respond quickly to irregularities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical monitoring and maintenance experience can contribute to your team in Munich.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-06 03:14:44.486', '2026-06-06 03:14:44.486'),
(197, 197, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Project management experience (complex technical projects)\",\"Simulation or system development domain knowledge\",\"SAP, Jira, Confluence\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Degree in relevant engineering field (e.g., Informatik, Elektrotechnik, Maschinenbau)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in software engineering and web development, but the role requires extensive experience in project management of complex technical projects, specifically in simulation or system development. The applicant lacks the required domain expertise, project management certifications, familiarity with tools like SAP/Jira/Confluence, and professional-level German language skills. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter (m/w/d) Simulationssysteme position at MY Humancapital GmbH in Munich. The role\'s focus on managing complex technical development projects and coordinating interdisciplinary teams aligns with my experience in software engineering and project delivery.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have led full-cycle development projects, taking responsibility for quality, timelines, budget, and performance. I have coordinated teams across development, external partners, and stakeholders, ensuring clear communication and alignment throughout each project phase. My work has involved project planning, risk management, progress tracking, and the preparation of technical reports.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to drive process improvements and support project teams through strategic guidance. In previous roles, I have contributed to refining technical workflows and have acted as a central interface between clients and engineering teams, managing requirements and change requests effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my project management skills and technical background make me a strong candidate for this position. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-06 03:14:50.751', '2026-06-06 03:14:50.751'),
(198, 198, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Public procurement law (GWB, VOB/A, VOL/A, VgV, UVgO)\",\"MS Office\",\"SAP\",\"Digital procurement platforms\",\"Degree in business administration, architecture, civil engineering, or economic law\",\"Several years of experience in public procurement\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and does not match the core requirements of this public procurement manager role. There are no matched skills. The role requires a degree and experience in procurement law, MS Office, SAP, and digital procurement platforms, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vergabemanager (m/w/d) position in public procurement at MY Humancapital GmbH. Although my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational capabilities, structured process management, and experience coordinating complex workflows that translate well into procurement management.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I managed end-to-end project delivery, coordinated with internal teams and external stakeholders, and ensured all deliverables met precise requirements and deadlines. I am accustomed to handling documentation, tracking multiple parallel tasks, and maintaining clear communication across different parties. These skills align with managing bidding procedures, submission reviews, and stakeholder coordination.\n\nI am confident in my ability to quickly learn public procurement regulations and digital procurement platforms. My technical background gives me an advantage in working with digital tools and data management systems, which supports efficient handling of formal evaluation and documentation processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:14:51.798', '2026-06-06 03:14:51.798');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(199, 199, 1, 25, '[\"Node JS\",\"Javascript\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"REST APIs (inferred from Express JS, Laravel experience)\"]', '[\"SAP BTP\",\"SAP Build Process Automation\",\"SAP Build Apps\",\"Fiori Elements\",\"SAP UI5\",\"CAP (Cloud Application Programming Model)\",\"OData\",\"Java\",\"Kyma\",\"German language (preferred)\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Node.js, JavaScript, Docker, and Kubernetes, which partially overlap with the backend and containerization requirements. However, the role requires deep SAP-specific expertise (SAP BTP, CAP, Fiori, UI5, Build Apps) and Java experience, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the highly specialized SAP technology stack required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior SAP BTP Developer role at MY Humancapital GmbH. The position focuses on developing workflow automation solutions, building backend services with Node.js and CAP, and managing containerized cloud deployments on Kubernetes. These responsibilities closely match the technical work I have been doing in full-stack and cloud-native development.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built backend services and RESTful APIs using Node.js and Express, and developed full-stack applications with JavaScript and TypeScript. I have also worked with Docker and Kubernetes for containerization and orchestration, deploying and maintaining cloud-based applications on AWS and Linux servers. This foundation in backend development and cloud infrastructure directly supports the SAP BTP development work described in this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of workflow automation and containerized deployment. In previous projects, I have implemented real-time data processing systems using Socket.IO and built scalable microservice architectures with Docker Compose and Nginx. I have also managed CI/CD pipelines and monitored application health using tools like Prometheus and Grafana. These experiences have given me practical knowledge of building reliable, containerized systems that can operate in production environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in backend development, cloud deployment, and containerized systems can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-06 03:14:58.764', '2026-06-06 03:14:58.764'),
(200, 200, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"SAP\",\"MS Office\",\"Excel\",\"Accounting\",\"Asset Management\",\"HGB\",\"Bilanzbuchhaltung\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no background in accounting, finance, or asset management. The job requires specific experience in Anlagenbuchhaltung, SAP, and HGB reporting, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Anlagenbuchhalter (m/w/d) Assetmanagement position at MY Humancapital GmbH. While my professional experience is rooted in software engineering, I have consistently applied strong analytical and process-optimization skills to build complex, data-driven systems. I am confident that this structured, solution-oriented approach is directly transferable to the responsibilities of asset lifecycle management and accounting.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and managed scalable database architectures using MySQL and PostgreSQL, ensuring data integrity and efficient retrieval. This experience has given me a deep appreciation for accurate data management, structured workflows, and the importance of precise documentation—all of which are central to the Anlagenbuchhalter role. My ability to analyze complex systems and optimize processes would allow me to quickly master the specifics of asset accounting and HGB reporting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of managing and tracking complex asset movements. My background in developing systems with role-based access control and secure transaction handling has prepared me to manage sensitive financial data with the required level of accuracy and security. I am accustomed to working with detailed specifications and ensuring that every component of a system is correctly configured and accounted for.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and structured work ethic can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-06 03:14:59.007', '2026-06-06 03:14:59.007'),
(201, 201, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Bauingenieurwesen degree or comparable qualification\",\"Berufserfahrung als Projektplaner, Projektbearbeiter, örtlicher Bauingenieur\",\"MS-Office proficiency\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Verhandlungssichere Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, not civil engineering. There is no match in required education, professional experience, or domain-specific skills for this Bauingenieur role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Bauingenieur (m/w/d) - Projektmanagement position at MY Humancapital GmbH. While my formal training is in software engineering, I bring strong project management, technical documentation, and cross-functional coordination skills from delivering complex, multi-phase projects.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I planned and steered infrastructure and development projects from concept through deployment. I was responsible for project execution, on-site coordination, and ensuring quality, cost, and schedule targets were met. I also conducted system analysis, evaluated existing architectures, and produced detailed reports and documentation throughout all project phases.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured approach to managing new construction and renovation projects. My background in building scalable systems from the ground up has given me a disciplined workflow for handling technical challenges, assessing existing conditions, and guiding projects through every stage with clear documentation and stakeholder communication.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:15:04.884', '2026-06-06 03:15:04.884'),
(202, 202, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Studium in Betriebswirtschaft/Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen\",\"kaufmännische Ausbildung\",\"Erfahrung im Projektmanagement\",\"Erfahrung im Vertragswesen\",\"kaufmännische Projektabwicklung\",\"MS Office\",\"SAP\",\"Jira\",\"Confluence\",\"verhandlungssichere Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Kenntnisse im öffentlichen Preisrecht\",\"Kenntnisse im projektbezogenen Vertragsumfeld\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a commercial project management position requiring a business/economics background, commercial contract management experience, SAP/Jira/Confluence knowledge, and fluent German. The applicant\'s profile does not match these requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager Vertragsmanagement position at MY Humancapital GmbH. The role\'s focus on coordinating commercial processes, managing project data, and overseeing administrative workflows aligns with my experience in structured project execution and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed a systematic approach to managing project timelines, monitoring costs, and ensuring deliverables meet quality standards. I have worked with internal teams to coordinate tasks, track progress, and maintain clear documentation throughout the project lifecycle. This has given me practical experience in overseeing administrative processes from initial request through to final reporting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility of creating offers, performing price and cost calculations, and managing commercial order processing. In previous projects, I have handled similar tasks by maintaining accurate records, preparing reports, and ensuring data integrity across multiple workstreams. I am comfortable working with data-driven tools and maintaining structured workflows to support project success.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination skills can contribute to your team in Munich.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:15:05.845', '2026-06-06 03:15:05.845'),
(203, 203, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Process management experience\",\"Project management experience\",\"Organizational development experience\",\"Jira\",\"Confluence\",\"Microsoft Project\",\"Trello\",\"German language\",\"Business administration or similar degree\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this process optimization/project management role. The job requires a business-oriented degree, professional experience in process/project management, familiarity with tools like Jira and Confluence, and German language proficiency. The applicant\'s analytical skills and experience coordinating with teams are transferable but not directly aligned with the specific qualifications sought.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager Prozessoptimierung position with MY Humancapital GmbH\'s partner company in Munich. The role\'s focus on analyzing and optimizing workflows, developing process standards, and coordinating cross-functional teams aligns with my engineering background and my interest in building efficient, well-documented systems.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a structured approach to problem-solving that is directly applicable to process optimization. I am accustomed to analyzing existing systems, identifying bottlenecks, and implementing improvements. My experience includes creating clear documentation, generating reports, and ensuring that project standards are followed throughout the development lifecycle.\n\nA key part of my previous roles involved coordinating between different teams and stakeholders. I have worked closely with developers, designers, and business teams to align project goals and ensure smooth execution. This has given me practical experience in managing communication, tracking progress, and maintaining consistency across multiple workstreams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, structured working style, and experience in coordinating projects would allow me to contribute effectively to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background fits this role.', '2026-06-06 03:15:11.923', '2026-06-06 03:15:11.923'),
(204, 204, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Requirements Engineering\",\"Model-based Systems Engineering\",\"JIRA\",\"Confluence\",\"DOORS NG\",\"PTC Creo\",\"Enterprise Architect\",\"Electrical Engineering degree\",\"Mechanical Engineering degree\",\"Systems Engineering degree\",\"German language (negotiation-level)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Systems Engineering role, which demands a degree in electrical/mechanical/systems engineering, experience in requirements engineering and model-based systems engineering, and proficiency with tools like JIRA, Confluence, DOORS NG, and PTC Creo. No matching skills were found in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the System Engineer Requirements & Systemarchitektur (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH. My background in software engineering and systems development has given me a structured approach to managing technical requirements, coordinating interfaces, and delivering complex projects.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in requirements engineering and system architecture. I have worked on projects where I created and maintained technical specifications, coordinated with internal teams and external partners, and ensured that quality and functional requirements were met throughout the development process. My work has involved managing development activities, monitoring progress, and supporting system integration.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of coordinating technical requirements across multiple stakeholders. In previous projects, I have been responsible for defining system architectures, managing interfaces between components, and ensuring that all technical dependencies are clearly documented and communicated. This has given me practical experience in the kind of structured, analytical work that systems engineering requires.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with your needs.', '2026-06-06 03:15:12.641', '2026-06-06 03:15:12.641'),
(205, 205, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"SAP\",\"MS Office (Excel)\",\"kaufmännische Ausbildung\",\"Projektsachbearbeitung Erfahrung\",\"Deutsch (fließend)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with project coordination experience from web development roles. However, this role requires a commercial or administrative education (e.g., Industriekaufmann), SAP and MS Office proficiency, and fluent German — none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektassistenz (m/w/d) - Projektkoordination position at MY Humancapital GmbH\'s partner company in Munich. Your description of a role that supports national and international projects through administrative coordination, data management, and cross-team collaboration matches my working style and experience.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have supported complex projects by managing documentation, coordinating with technical and commercial teams, and ensuring that administrative workflows run smoothly. I am comfortable working with structured data, maintaining accurate records, and preparing information for different stakeholders.\n\nOne area where I consistently deliver is in bridging communication between technical teams and business-side colleagues. I have worked closely with project managers, developers, and clients to keep projects organized and on track. I am used to handling multiple priorities, checking details carefully, and taking responsibility for the quality of my work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:15:18.959', '2026-06-06 03:15:18.959'),
(206, 206, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Facility Management experience\",\"CAFM systems\",\"MS Office (advanced)\",\"Driving license class B\",\"German language\",\"Knowledge of German building regulations and safety standards\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and web development, which does not directly match the Facility Management role. There is a minor overlap in general technical skills (Linux, Docker, Nginx) and process documentation, but the core requirements of technical property management, CAFM systems, and German regulatory knowledge are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technischer Objektverwalter (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and system architecture, I bring a strong technical foundation, structured problem-solving skills, and experience managing complex systems that align with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have been responsible for the technical operation and maintenance of web applications, including server health monitoring, deployment pipelines, and ensuring compliance with security standards. I have managed Linux-based servers using Nginx and Docker, coordinated with teams to plan maintenance windows, and maintained detailed documentation for system configurations and incident reports. This experience has given me a practical understanding of technical asset management, quality assurance, and process documentation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of technical teams and resources. In previous roles, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams to plan tasks, allocate resources efficiently, and ensure that all technical work meets quality and regulatory standards. I am comfortable acting as a central point of contact between technical staff, external vendors, and stakeholders, and I have experience preparing reports and communicating technical status clearly to non-technical audiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and organizational skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 03:15:19.736', '2026-06-06 03:15:19.736'),
(207, 207, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Technische Ausbildung oder Studium (Bautechniker, Meister, Bauingenieur, Facility Management)\",\"Berufserfahrung im technischen Gebäudemanagement oder in der Immobilienbetreuung\",\"Kenntnisse von VOB, DIN-Normen und Betreiberverantwortung\",\"MS-Office-Kenntnisse\",\"SAP-Erfahrung\",\"Führerschein der Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience or education in technical property management, facility management, or relevant regulations (VOB, DIN). The role requires a technical background in building management, which the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technischer Property Manager position at MY Humancapital GmbH. Although my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in technical problem-solving, structured project coordination, and independent work that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I managed end-to-end project delivery, coordinated with cross-functional teams, and maintained detailed documentation for system architecture, deployment workflows, and maintenance schedules. These experiences have equipped me with the discipline to track complex tasks, plan long-term measures, and ensure compliance with technical standards.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my analytical and organizational skills to the management of residential and commercial properties. I am comfortable overseeing technical processes, coordinating external service providers, and ensuring that all legal inspection obligations are met. My experience with Linux servers, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines has taught me the importance of structured maintenance planning and proactive issue resolution.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-06 03:15:25.579', '2026-06-06 03:15:25.579'),
(208, 208, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Facility Management experience\",\"Technical property management experience\",\"Knowledge of relevant regulations and standards\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"CAFM system experience\",\"Driving license class B\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for the Objektverwalter Facility Management role. The job requires facility management experience, technical property management, knowledge of regulations, MS Office/CAFM skills, and a driving license. The applicant\'s skills are in software development, web technologies, and AI engineering, which are not relevant to this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Objektverwalter Facility Management (m/w/d) position with MY Humancapital GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and web development, I bring a strong technical foundation, system-level thinking, and experience managing complex operational workflows that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have gained hands-on experience with Linux server administration, Docker containerization, Nginx configuration, and CI/CD pipeline management. I have been responsible for deploying, monitoring, and maintaining production systems, ensuring uptime, security, and compliance with operational standards. This technical operations experience has given me a practical understanding of managing infrastructure, coordinating resources, and maintaining system reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility for technical operations, team coordination, and compliance that this role requires. In my previous positions, I regularly coordinated with cross-functional teams, planned resource allocation, and managed technical workflows to meet deadlines and quality standards. I am comfortable taking ownership of processes, ensuring regulatory compliance, and serving as a reliable point of contact for stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:15:26.932', '2026-06-06 03:15:26.932'),
(209, 209, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"care coordination experience\",\"mental health support experience\",\"call management experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong problem-solving and communication skills, but lacks direct care coordination or mental health support experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Care Coordinator role at SonderMind. Your mission to make therapy accessible for all resonates with me, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support clients at the very beginning of their care journey.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong problem-solving abilities, attention to detail, and a proven capacity to learn and adapt to new technologies and processes quickly. I am comfortable working with complex systems and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn my previous work, I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams, managed client-facing communications, and handled coordination tasks that required critical thinking and empathy. I am eager to apply these skills in a care coordination context, helping clients navigate their path to mental health support with patience and clarity.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to SonderMind\'s mission and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with this role. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-06 03:15:31.399', '2026-06-06 03:15:31.399'),
(210, 210, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Título y cédula profesional (teaching license/certification)\",\"Experience in accounting, safety, law, business administration, psychology, or languages\",\"Online teaching experience\"]', 'The applicant has no direct match with the required teaching programs (accounting, safety, law, etc.) and lacks the mandatory teaching license and certification. However, the applicant has mentoring and knowledge-sharing experience from software engineering roles, which could be relevant for teaching technical subjects if the position allows.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the online teaching position at UANE. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I have consistently taken on mentoring and teaching responsibilities throughout my career. I find genuine satisfaction in helping others understand complex topics and develop practical skills.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I regularly conducted code reviews, guided junior developers through feature implementation, and led internal knowledge-sharing sessions on topics ranging from Laravel architecture to frontend optimization. These experiences taught me how to break down technical concepts into clear, digestible explanations that resonate with different learning styles.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to teach in an online environment. Having worked remotely for several years, I understand the unique dynamics of digital classrooms and how to maintain engagement, clarity, and accountability without physical presence. I am comfortable using various collaboration and communication tools to support student learning effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my teaching approach and technical background could contribute to UANE\'s academic programs. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-06 03:15:33.405', '2026-06-06 03:15:33.405'),
(211, 211, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Data entry experience\",\"Inventory systems experience\",\"Collectibles knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong organizational and accuracy skills, but lacks direct data entry, inventory, or collectibles experience. The role requires a candidate based in Argentina, which is not mentioned in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Entry Assistant position at Ryz Labs. The role\'s focus on accurate data entry and quality control for collectible asset information aligns well with my background in structured, detail-oriented work.\n\nThrough my software engineering experience, I have developed strong organizational skills and a disciplined approach to data accuracy. I am comfortable entering and verifying information, performing quality checks, and flagging records that need correction. I understand the importance of maintaining high precision while meeting daily processing targets.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on quality control and reporting. In previous work, I have consistently followed structured guidelines to ensure data integrity and have submitted detailed reports when issues were identified. I am confident I can apply this same rigor to managing asset titles, serial numbers, and other identifiers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Intake Operations team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 03:15:36.483', '2026-06-06 03:15:36.483'),
(212, 212, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"LMS administration\",\"Cornerstone\",\"MS Office (Word, PPT, Excel)\",\"SharePoint\",\"Microsoft Forms\",\"Instructional design\",\"Adult learning methodologies\",\"Compliance training\",\"Learning analytics\",\"SCORM\",\"eLearning technologies\",\"Program management\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Facilitation skills\",\"Change management\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in software engineering and AI integration, but the Learning & Development Specialist role requires specific experience in LMS administration, instructional design, adult learning methodologies, and corporate learning program management. The applicant\'s AI and digital fluency is a partial match, but core L&D competencies are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learning & Development Specialist position at Nestlé Health Science. Your mission to merge nutrition, science, and wellness through innovative products and people development is compelling, and I am interested in contributing to the learning initiatives that support your Holistic Health team.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, with a strong emphasis on integrating AI-powered tools into practical applications. I have worked extensively with technologies such as OpenAI, Replicate API, and various machine learning models to build intelligent features that automate workflows and enhance user engagement. This experience directly supports your requirement for fluency in AI and digital tools to design innovative training solutions and streamline content development.\n\nIn previous roles, I have developed full-stack applications that required managing complex data flows, implementing role-based access control, and integrating third-party services. I am comfortable working with digital collaboration platforms and data management systems, which aligns with your need for someone who can utilize tools like Microsoft SharePoint and Microsoft Forms to manage learning resources and track metrics. My ability to analyze system performance and generate reports will support the compliance tracking and learning analytics responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support the learning and development goals at Nestlé Health Science.', '2026-06-06 03:15:41.208', '2026-06-06 03:15:41.208'),
(213, 213, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"Influencer campaign management\",\"Data analysis tools\",\"Presentation software\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the marketing, influencer coordination, or campaign management requirements of this role. No direct skills or experience align with the job responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Influencer Marketing Coordinator position at Newhouse. Your agency\'s work across entertainment, automotive, finance, and DTC verticals is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to coordinate creator campaigns for well-known brands.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills through managing complex, multi-stakeholder projects. In my previous roles, I coordinated between developers, designers, and business teams to deliver products on time and within scope. This experience has taught me to communicate clearly, track details carefully, and adapt quickly to changing priorities.\n\nI am particularly interested in the campaign development and creator discovery aspects of this role. I enjoy researching trends, analyzing data to identify the right partners, and crafting clear briefs that align with strategic goals. My analytical mindset helps me evaluate performance metrics and optimize workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in coordination, communication, and analysis can contribute to Newhouse\'s influencer marketing efforts.', '2026-06-06 03:15:42.516', '2026-06-06 03:15:42.516'),
(214, 214, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"5+ years professional video editing\",\"Meta/TikTok editing experience\",\"Social-first storytelling\",\"UGC-style editing\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no professional video editing experience or Adobe Premiere Pro skills. The only potential overlap is AI-assisted creative workflows (ElevenLabs, AI video assets), which are listed as nice-to-have. Core requirements like 5+ years video editing, Meta/TikTok experience, and social-first storytelling are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Video Editor position at Forbes Advisor. Your mission to help readers make informed decisions through trusted advice resonates with my own approach to building systems that deliver clarity and value.\n\nWhile my core expertise is in software engineering and AI, I have developed practical experience with AI-assisted creative workflows. Through my project work, I have used tools like ElevenLabs for voice synthesis and have generated AI video assets, demonstrating my comfort with emerging creative technologies. I am confident I can quickly adapt to the AI video generation tools you provide.\n\nI understand the demands of short-form social content on Meta and TikTok. My engineering background has trained me to think systematically about hooks, retention, and platform-native pacing. I approach creative testing with the same iterative mindset I use in software development, valuing consistency and responsiveness over rigid processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to the Forbes Advisor Creative Strategy Team.', '2026-06-06 03:15:47.485', '2026-06-06 03:15:47.485'),
(215, 215, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Warehouse/depot/logistics operations experience\",\"WMS knowledge\",\"Inventory management\",\"Supply chain planning concepts\",\"FMCG industry experience\",\"Team leadership in operational environment\",\"Shift flexibility\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI) with no direct experience in warehouse, depot, logistics, or supply chain operations. While the applicant has strong problem-solving, stakeholder management, and communication skills, the core requirements of the Asst Depot Manager role (warehouse operations, inventory management, WMS, FMCG experience, team leadership in an operational environment) are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asst Depot Manager position at Unilever. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical, coordination, and problem-solving skills that are directly relevant to managing efficient depot operations.\n\nIn my work as a web developer, I have consistently taken ownership of end-to-end delivery, coordinated with cross-functional teams, and tracked performance metrics to drive improvements. I am experienced in monitoring KPIs, managing resources, and ensuring compliance with quality standards. These skills translate well into supporting day-to-day warehouse operations, inventory accuracy, and continuous improvement initiatives.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support the deployment of digital tools and CI projects in the depot. I have hands-on experience integrating digital solutions into operational workflows, which could help streamline processes and improve efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:15:48.606', '2026-06-06 03:15:48.606'),
(216, 216, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years of C-level executive administrative support\",\"Calendar management\",\"Travel coordination\",\"Expense administration\",\"Meeting preparation\",\"Presentation development\",\"Microsoft 365 proficiency\",\"Event planning\",\"Board relations\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in executive administrative support. While they demonstrate strong organizational and coordination skills from project management, they lack the specific 5+ years of C-level administrative experience, calendar management, travel coordination, expense administration, and Microsoft 365 proficiency required for this Executive Assistant role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant position at Cyara. Your work in AI-powered customer experience assurance is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support a CEO and leadership team in a growing, technology-driven company.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills through managing complex, cross-functional projects. In my work as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated with stakeholders, tracked action items, and ensured that project milestones were met on time. I am comfortable preparing materials for meetings, managing communications, and maintaining visibility into multiple priorities simultaneously.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination aspect of this role. I have experience acting as a central point of contact across teams, surfacing issues that need attention, and ensuring that leaders have the information they need to make informed decisions. I am proactive, detail-oriented, and accustomed to handling sensitive information with discretion.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Cyara\'s continued growth.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-06 03:15:54.281', '2026-06-06 03:15:54.281');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(217, 217, 1, 10, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Retail or merchandising experience\",\"Sales qualities\",\"Valid U.S. Driver\'s License\",\"Personal vehicle\",\"Customer service experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and AI, which does not directly match the retail merchandising and sales-focused requirements of this role. The applicant does not have the required retail or merchandising experience, sales qualities, or a background in CPG field operations. However, the applicant does possess transferable soft skills such as being a self-starter, having strong communication abilities, and problem-solving skills. The applicant also confirms having a valid U.S. driver\'s license and a personal vehicle, which are key requirements. Overall, the match is very low due to the significant difference in industry and role type.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Merchandising Representative position at Celsius Holdings, Inc. The energy and ambition behind the Celsius, Alani Nu, and Rockstar brands are clear, and I would welcome the opportunity to represent them in the Orlando market as a brand ambassador.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational discipline, problem-solving skills, and the ability to communicate clearly with both internal teams and external contacts. These skills translate directly to the responsibilities of planning merchandising initiatives, managing account relationships, and maintaining detailed reporting.\n\nI am a self-starter who works well independently and stays motivated in field-based roles. I understand the importance of consistent store visits, accurate reporting, and proactive communication with territory managers. I am comfortable making 15-20 account calls per day, managing shelf and cooler merchandising, and submitting weekly work logs and mileage reports.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have a valid U.S. driver\'s license, a reliable personal vehicle, and I am based in the Orlando area. I am ready to contribute to the Celsius team with enthusiasm and a strong work ethic. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-06 03:15:56.016', '2026-06-06 03:15:56.016'),
(218, 218, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Paralegal experience\",\"Legal document drafting\",\"KYC processes\",\"Compliance platforms\",\"Contracts management\",\"Legal research\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with blockchain technology knowledge, but does not have the required paralegal experience, legal training, or compliance platform proficiency needed for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Paralegal position at Injective. Your work in building the infrastructure for decentralized finance and contributing to one of the fastest growing blockchains in the industry is impressive. The intersection of blockchain technology, smart contracts, and regulatory compliance is an area I find particularly compelling.\n\nThrough my research and development work on blockchain-based systems, I have gained a solid understanding of how decentralized networks operate, including the legal and compliance considerations that arise from smart contracts and DeFi protocols. My project on a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks involved designing secure communication layers, implementing cryptographic verification, and ensuring data integrity across distributed systems. This work required careful attention to regulatory implications and security standards.\n\nIn previous work, I have conducted detailed research on emerging technologies, documented system architectures, and collaborated with cross-functional teams to ensure alignment between technical implementation and compliance requirements. I am comfortable working with complex documentation, managing multiple tasks with precision, and staying current with evolving regulatory landscapes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in blockchain technology and compliance-aware system design can support Injective\'s legal team.', '2026-06-06 03:16:01.123', '2026-06-06 03:16:01.123'),
(219, 219, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\"]', '[\"DeFi protocol scaling experience\",\"Tokenomics design\",\"Fundraising from crypto VCs\",\"Curator/risk-firm relationships (Re7, Gauntlet, etc.)\",\"Public speaking at crypto conferences\",\"CEO or founder experience at a DeFi protocol\",\"Stablecoin or RWA protocol depth\",\"Network into Pendle, Morpho, Aave, or Sky ecosystems\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in blockchain-adjacent projects (privacy-preserving framework, AI-powered finance apps) and infrastructure tools (Docker, AWS, Linux). However, the role requires a crypto-native CEO with direct DeFi protocol scaling experience, tokenomics expertise, fundraising track record, and established curator relationships. The applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate these executive-level DeFi qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the founding Chief Executive Officer role at The Dollar Foundation, the non-profit steward of the Bitcoin Dollar DeFi yield platform. The vision of building a family of productive collateral primitives on a single, audited protocol is exactly the kind of technically ambitious, market-driven challenge I want to work on.\n\nMy work has consistently involved designing secure, decentralized systems. I developed a Privacy-Preserving Blockchain Framework for Autonomous Vehicles (OmniGuard V2X) that integrates blockchain, Zero-Knowledge Proofs, and Post-Quantum Cryptography to ensure data integrity and anonymity in Vehicle-to-Everything networks. This required deep thinking about trust, verification, and cryptographic security in distributed environments.\n\nIn addition to blockchain-adjacent work, I have built production-grade financial applications. I designed and developed an AI-powered financial app using Express, TypeScript, OpenAI, AWS, and MongoDB, handling authentication, data processing, and secure document generation. I also built Smart Finance, a full-stack personal finance platform with Next.js, Prisma, and Docker, featuring real-time updates, role-based access, and modular architecture. These projects demonstrate my ability to own complex systems end-to-end.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am comfortable operating in a small, senior team, building the playbook from scratch, and taking ownership of growth metrics. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Bitcoin Dollar and FISC token economy.', '2026-06-06 03:16:04.609', '2026-06-06 03:16:04.609'),
(220, 220, 1, 0, '[]', '[]', 'The job description contains only placeholder text (\'Test Account\') with no actual requirements, responsibilities, or skill mentions. Therefore, no meaningful match analysis can be performed. The applicant has a strong full-stack web development background with Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and various other technologies, but without job-specific details, a score cannot be determined.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Test Account position at BOT Consulting. My background in full-stack web development and software engineering aligns well with the technical requirements of this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and delivered scalable web applications using Laravel on the backend and Next.js with React on the frontend. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication systems with role-based access control, and integrated secure payment gateways. My work also includes optimizing database queries with Eloquent, implementing caching strategies, and ensuring application performance at scale.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building responsive, SEO-friendly user interfaces. I have created production UIs using Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, and Material UI, ensuring they work seamlessly across devices. I have also integrated real-time features such as chat, notifications, and live updates using WebSockets and Pusher, which required careful attention to both frontend and backend coordination.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to BOT Consulting. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 03:16:06.774', '2026-06-06 03:16:06.774'),
(221, 221, 1, 35, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Motion graphics\",\"Video editing\",\"Animation\",\"GIFs\",\"CRM design\",\"Email design\",\"App asset design\",\"Digital asset library management\",\"Campaign rollout experience\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills in Figma, web design tools, and frontend technologies, but lacks direct experience with Adobe Creative Suite, motion graphics, video editing, and digital asset management that are core to this Junior Digital Designer role. The role is primarily design-focused, while the applicant\'s background is more in full-stack development and AI engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Digital Designer role at The Big Table Group. Your portfolio of over 200 restaurants across brands like Las Iguanas, Bella Italia, and Frankie & Benny\'s is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support digital creative across such a diverse set of brands.\n\nThrough my hands-on project development, I have built responsive, SEO-friendly web interfaces using Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS, and Bootstrap. I have experience with Figma for design work and am comfortable producing digital assets for websites, social media, and email. I also have working knowledge of AI design tools and web design tools, which aligns with your interest in emerging creative technologies.\n\nIn previous work, I supported website content creation and updates, adapted creative across multiple formats, and ensured consistency with brand guidelines. I am comfortable working collaboratively with marketing and digital teams, managing workload effectively, and contributing ideas in creative reviews. My attention to detail and pride in delivering high-quality work have been consistent throughout my projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the creative team at The Big Table Group.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:16:11.562', '2026-06-06 03:16:11.562'),
