(225, 225, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Chat platform experience (NICE CXOne)\",\"Sales experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development) and does not match the customer service, sales, and chat-based support focus of this role. No direct skills or experience align with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Digital Sales and Service Representative position at 1-800 Contacts. The company\'s focus on making vision care simple and accessible through customer-first service is something I genuinely respect, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to that mission.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong digital communication skills through building real-time chat systems and customer-facing platforms. In my work as a Web Developer, I designed and implemented live chat and notification features using WebSockets and Pusher, which required managing simultaneous conversations and ensuring fast, accurate responses. This experience has prepared me to handle multiple customer chats efficiently while maintaining a helpful and professional tone.\n\nI am comfortable learning new platforms quickly and adapting to digital workflows. The NICE CXOne platform mentioned in the job description is a tool I am ready to master during training. I value clear communication, problem-solving, and delivering a positive experience to every customer I interact with.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for the full-time schedule, including afternoon/evening shifts and weekends, and I am committed to completing the mandatory training. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of joining the 1-800 Contacts team.', '2026-06-06 03:16:23.506', '2026-06-06 03:16:23.506'),
(226, 226, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"JWT\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Security platform engineering experience\",\"Vulnerability management\",\"Security incident response\",\"Compliance frameworks\",\"SIEM tools\",\"Threat modeling\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, CI/CD, and secure API development, but lacks direct security platform engineering experience, vulnerability management, incident response, compliance frameworks, and SIEM tools. The match is moderate for a security-focused platform engineering role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Security Platform Engineer role at Lumin Digital. Your focus on building secure, reliable platform infrastructure aligns directly with the kind of engineering work I enjoy most.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built and maintained secure backend systems using Laravel, Node.js, and Express, with a strong emphasis on authentication, role-based access control, and secure API design. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines to deploy and monitor production applications. My understanding of security extends to practical areas like JWT-based authentication, encrypted data handling, and secure third-party integrations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building resilient platform infrastructure. In previous work, I deployed and maintained applications on Linux environments, configured reverse proxies with Nginx, containerized services with Docker, and set up automated deployment pipelines. I also implemented real-time monitoring and logging to ensure system reliability and quick incident response.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in secure platform engineering can contribute to Lumin Digital.', '2026-06-06 03:16:25.821', '2026-06-06 03:16:25.821'),
