d communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my writing approach can contribute to Martell Media\'s content goals.', '2026-06-06 03:16:38.264', '2026-06-06 03:16:38.264'),
(231, 231, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"copywriting\",\"content writing\",\"brand writing\",\"social media copy\",\"script writing\",\"newsletter writing\",\"SEO writing\",\"AI writing tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Jasper)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no professional copywriting, content writing, or brand writing experience. The role requires 5+ years of dedicated writing experience, which the applicant does not have. No direct skill match was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Script Writer position at Martell Media. Your focus on building people, brands, and ventures that create meaningful impact resonates with me, and I appreciate the emphasis on authentic, non-generic content that performs across platforms.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently written and refined content for technical documentation, project narratives, and developer-facing communications. This has given me a strong sense of clarity, rhythm, and persuasion when crafting written assets. I understand how to adapt tone, structure, and formatting for different audiences and platforms without defaulting to generic or AI-sounding language.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intelligent integration of AI tools into the writing workflow. I regularly use ChatGPT and Claude to accelerate first drafts, generate variations, and test messaging angles, while ensuring the final output remains authentic and on-brand. I am comfortable building prompt libraries and identifying opportunities where AI can reduce low-value writing tasks without compromising quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 03:16:39.716', '2026-06-06 03:16:39.716'),
(232, 232, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years of copywriting/content writing experience\",\"Social media copywriting (Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, X, YouTube, Threads)\",\"Script writing for video content\",\"Newsletter and email campaign writing\",\"Brand voice management\",\"SEO/AEO/GEO optimization for content\",\"Proficiency with ChatGPT, Claude, Jasper or similar AI writing tools\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no professional copywriting, script writing, or brand writing experience. The role requires 5+ years of dedicated content creation experience, which is not present in the profile. The applicant has some relevant AI integration experience (using OpenAI APIs) but lacks the core writing background required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Script Writer role at Martell Media. The focus on building people, brands, and ventures that create meaningful impact resonates with how I approach my own work. I am drawn to the emphasis on authentic, non-generic writing combined with intelligent AI integration.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is using AI tools to accelerate content creation without sacrificing quality or brand voice. In my development work, I have integrated OpenAI APIs to build AI assistants that generate content variations, test messaging angles, and produce first drafts. I understand how to build prompt libraries and writing systems that increase team efficiency while keeping the output natural and human.\n\nI have experience writing clear, structured content for technical and non-technical audiences. I have written detailed project documentation, platform descriptions, and user-facing copy for multiple full-stack applications. I can adapt tone and formatting for different platforms and maintain consistency across channels.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI-integrated content workflows and brand-consistent writing can contribute to Martell Media\'s content team.', '2026-06-06 03:16:45.086', '2026-06-06 03:16:45.086'),
(233, 233, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"JWT\"]', '[\"Proven experience in designing and implementing AI and machine learning systems\",\"Experience with deploying AI solutions in customer-controlled environments\",\"Experience with open-source AI frameworks and tools for local inference\",\"Experience with secure connectors to file servers, SharePoint, Outlook\",\"Experience with permission-aware retrieval, citations, and audit trails\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills and some Python experience, but lacks direct professional experience in AI/ML system design, local inference deployment, and secure enterprise connectors. The role requires specialized AI engineering experience that is not clearly demonstrated in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding AI Engineer Retrieval and Knowledge Layer role at Lokalaise GmbH. Your mission to build local AI infrastructure for companies that cannot move sensitive knowledge into cloud systems is both timely and technically compelling. The idea of deploying AI inside customer-controlled environments with secure connectors, permission-aware retrieval, and audit trails directly matches the kind of practical, privacy-first engineering I want to work on.\n\nMy background combines full-stack development with applied AI engineering. Over the past year, I have worked on multiple projects that involve integrating AI models, building secure APIs, and deploying systems in production environments. I have used Python extensively for AI-related work, including object detection pipelines with YOLOv8n, real-time data processing with Flask, and automation workflows. I am comfortable working with open-source AI frameworks and deploying models in environments where data privacy and offline functionality are critical.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building secure connectors and retrieval systems that respect permissions and maintain audit trails. In my project work, I have designed systems that handle authentication, role-based access control, and real-time data streaming. For example, I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Python, Flask, and Socket.IO that streams live metrics to connected clients, ensuring visibility without compromising security. I have also worked with Docker, Nginx, and Linux servers to deploy and maintain production systems in controlled environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to Lokalaise as a founding engineer, helping turn early deployments into a repeatable product while working hands-on with the founders. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:14:41.454', '2026-06-06 15:14:41.454'),
(234, 234, 1, 72, '[\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"JWT\",\"REST API\"]', '[\"Open-source AI frameworks (e.g., LangChain, LlamaIndex)\",\"Local inference deployment\",\"Permission-aware retrieval systems\",\"SharePoint/Outlook connectors\",\"Audit trail implementation\"]', 'Strong full-stack engineering foundation with Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Node.js, plus practical AI integration experience through projects using OpenAI and Replicate APIs. Solid understanding of authentication, RBAC, and secure API design. Missing direct experience with local AI model deployment, open-source AI frameworks, and enterprise data connectors (SharePoint, Outlook), which are central to this role. Good fit for a founding engineer who can build the full-stack product layer while growing into the AI infrastructure domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Full Stack Engineer Local AI Infrastructure role at Lokalaise GmbH. Your focus on deploying AI inside customer-controlled environments, connecting to internal knowledge bases, and maintaining strict data privacy is exactly the kind of infrastructure challenge I want to work on. The idea of building a repeatable product from early deployments in a small, founder-led team is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy background combines full-stack web development with practical AI integration work. Over the past four years, I have built production applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, Node.js, and PostgreSQL, and I have also worked directly with AI models and APIs. This combination allows me to contribute across your stack, from building secure data connectors and permission-aware retrieval systems to optimizing local inference pipelines.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I also delivered real-time features with WebSockets and integrated third-party services including payment gateways and cloud storage. These skills map directly to building the secure, permission-aware infrastructure your platform requires.\n\nOne project that closely relates to your work is the AI Powered Real Estate application, where I integrated OpenAI and Replicate APIs to build AI assistants and process images, implemented role-based authentication and subscription plans, and connected Stripe for payments. This experience taught me how to combine AI capabilities with production-grade backend systems while maintaining security and performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Lokalaise\'s mission of building secure, local AI infrastructure.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:14:53.489', '2026-06-06 15:14:53.489'),
(235, 235, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"E-Commerce experience\",\"Content marketing experience\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Canva\",\"Social media management\",\"Amazon marketplace experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack software engineer with no direct experience in e-commerce, content marketing, or the specific tools (Photoshop, Canva) required for this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Content & Marketing Manager E-Commerce position at LouMaxx GmbH. Your focus on functional, honest products and a small, hands-on team appeals to me. I am drawn to the opportunity to build new channels from the ground up rather than simply managing existing ones.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, but I have consistently worked at the intersection of technology and visual communication. Designing user interfaces for web and mobile applications has given me a strong eye for visual quality, layout, and what makes people click. I am comfortable using Photoshop and Canva to finalize creative assets, and I actively use AI tools to speed up design and content workflows.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is in using AI to optimize image concepts and A+ Content for conversion. I have practical experience integrating AI APIs into production systems, and I know how to apply these tools practically to save time and improve results. I also bring a builder\'s mindset: I enjoy setting up new systems from scratch, whether that is a social media presence, a newsletter workflow, or an owned e-commerce channel.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my hands-on approach and technical background can support LouMaxx\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:15:01.934', '2026-06-06 15:15:01.934');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(236, 236, 1, 72, '[\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Git\",\"Node.js\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Next.js\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Express.js\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Kubernetes\"]', '[\"8 years of professional experience (profile shows ~4 years)\",\"German C1 proficiency\",\"WordPress experience\",\"Bun framework\"]', 'Strong technical match for full-stack development with JavaScript, TypeScript, React, and Node.js. The applicant has relevant professional experience building modern web applications and APIs, plus experience with AWS, Docker, and PHP. The main gaps are the 8-year experience requirement (profile shows ~4 years), German C1 language requirement, and WordPress/Bun experience which are listed as optional or required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Full Stack Developer role at Gratitude Jobs Ahead HR INC. Your focus on building modern web applications with JavaScript, TypeScript, and React aligns directly with my core technical experience and the type of work I enjoy most.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked professionally as a full-stack web developer, building and maintaining production applications using JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, and Node.js. I have designed responsive UIs, integrated backend APIs, and worked with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I also have hands-on experience with HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, Git, and deployment tools like Docker and AWS.\n\nIn previous roles, I developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized performance through query tuning and caching. I have also collaborated with designers and developers to deliver high-quality products and participated in code reviews to maintain best practices.\n\nOne project that reflects this experience is the Travel Agency App, where I built the frontend with Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS, and developed the backend API using NestJS, TypeScript, and MySQL. The platform supports multiple languages and currencies, integrates Google Maps, and was deployed on AWS.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-06 15:15:12.056', '2026-06-06 15:15:12.056'),
(237, 237, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Content creation\",\"Social media management\",\"On-camera presentation\",\"Video production\",\"Trend analysis\",\"German fluency (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not directly match the content creation, social media, and on-camera requirements of this role. While the applicant is a student and mentions German and English fluency, the core skills for this position are not present in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent/in Content Creation position at CAPULET Jewelry. Your brand\'s commitment to handcrafted, non-mass-produced jewelry from Munich resonates with me, and I am drawn to the opportunity to help bring your authentic story to life on social media.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have a genuine interest in social media trends and content creation. I am comfortable and natural in front of the camera, and I enjoy developing creative formats and storytelling approaches. I am fluent in German and English, enabling me to connect with your audience in both languages.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology in Russia. This academic background has instilled in me a disciplined, reliable, and self-starting work ethic. I am eager to bring my creativity and initiative to your team, contributing to content planning, trend testing, and on-camera presentations.\n\nIn addition to my technical and creative interests, I work effectively in collaborative environments and communicate clearly with team members. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy working in international settings.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I am enthusiastic about the possibility of contributing to CAPULET Jewelry\'s growth and would be delighted to submit a short video introduction as requested.', '2026-06-06 15:15:21.688', '2026-06-06 15:15:21.688'),
(238, 238, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Sales team leadership\",\"Outbound sales experience\",\"CRM management\",\"Financial product sales\",\"Coaching and training sales teams\",\"German language\",\"On-site presence in Schwarzwald region\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but the role is a senior sales leadership position requiring several years of sales team management, outbound sales experience, and financial product knowledge. There is no direct overlap in sales or leadership experience. The applicant\'s IT and process affinity is a minor positive, but the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Head of Sales position for your client in the Sachwert- und Finanzhandel sector. This role stands out because it requires someone who can build scalable, data-driven sales systems from the ground up, and my background in software engineering and process automation aligns well with that challenge.\n\nWhat draws me to this opportunity is the chance to apply my technical and analytical skills to transform a large lead base into a repeatable, measurable revenue system. I have strong IT and CRM affinity, experience with KPI dashboards, and a practical understanding of how automation and AI can improve lead quality and conversion rates. I am comfortable working with data pipelines, reporting structures, and process optimization.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built full-stack applications that include real-time features, role-based access control, and comprehensive reporting dashboards. I have worked with databases, API integrations, and deployment pipelines, which gives me a solid foundation for understanding how sales tools, CRM workflows, and data systems operate under the hood. I am used to analyzing performance metrics and creating systems that turn raw data into clear, actionable insights.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to coach and develop a young sales team. I have experience collaborating across multidisciplinary teams and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy working in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to take on the operational and strategic responsibility for building out the sales structure, from lead prioritization and CRM workflows to team coaching and performance tracking. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your client\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:15:33.215', '2026-06-06 15:15:33.215'),
(239, 239, 1, 68, '[\"PHP\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"REST API\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Figma\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Claude AI\",\"Usability testing\",\"UI/UX design portfolio\",\"3+ years UI/UX specific experience\"]', 'Strong technical foundation in PHP, JavaScript, and modern frontend frameworks with AI integration experience. Lacks specific Claude AI experience and formal UI/UX design background, but has relevant full-stack and AI project work.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the UI/UX & API Entwickler position at Pakajo GmbH. Your vision of building the world\'s largest comparison and shipping portal for eCommerce, powered by AI-driven tracking tools, aligns closely with the kind of work I enjoy most: combining clean user interfaces with intelligent backend systems.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development with a strong focus on PHP, JavaScript, and modern frontend frameworks. I have built responsive, user-centered interfaces using React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS, and I have integrated those interfaces with robust APIs built in Laravel and Node.js. I also have hands-on experience working with AI technologies, including OpenAI and Replicate, which I have used to add intelligent features to web applications.\n\nIn previous work, I developed an AI-powered real estate platform where I integrated multiple AI assistants for property analysis and used image processing APIs to enhance the user experience. I also built a travel agency platform with multi-language and multi-currency support, ensuring optimal display across devices. These projects required close collaboration with designers and stakeholders to deliver features that were both functional and visually polished.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Pakajo\'s team and help build the future of eCommerce shipping.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:15:42.732', '2026-06-06 15:15:42.732'),
(240, 240, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Online Marketing experience\",\"SEO/GEO expertise\",\"Native German language skills\",\"Marketing degree\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is an Online Marketing Projektmanager requiring marketing experience, SEO/GEO knowledge, and native German. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience. The applicant\'s AI tool experience is a minor tangential match, but the core requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Online Marketing Projektmanager position at Shopwise GmbH. Your focus on combining SEO/GEO with AI tools like Claude and n8n in an e-commerce environment is what drew me to this role.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have practical experience integrating AI into real-world applications. I have worked with OpenAI APIs to build AI assistants for financial and real estate platforms, and I am comfortable adopting new AI tools quickly. I see the value in using AI to improve efficiency and am genuinely interested in applying this mindset to online marketing workflows.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I managed end-to-end project delivery, coordinated with clients and team members, and took ownership of tasks from planning through execution. I am used to structuring complex work, communicating clearly with stakeholders, and adapting to new tools and processes as projects evolve.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI integration and project coordination can contribute to Shopwise GmbH.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:15:51.058', '2026-06-06 15:15:51.058'),
(241, 241, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"senior care industry experience\",\"sales and marketing experience\",\"German language (native level)\",\"real estate or hospitality sector experience\",\"team leadership experience\",\"HR and quality management experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with entrepreneurial experience building and scaling web platforms, but lacks the senior care industry background, sales/marketing expertise, native German language skills, and team leadership experience required for this Chief Operating & Sales Officer role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Operating & Sales Officer position at lively Holding GmbH. Your mission to modernize assisted living through community-driven, high-quality senior residences is genuinely compelling, and I am drawn to the opportunity to help scale a concept that has already proven itself in Gronau and Duisburg.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, but the nature of my work has always been deeply entrepreneurial. Over the past four years, I have built and deployed full-stack platforms from scratch, taking projects from initial concept through to production deployment, user onboarding, and ongoing iteration. At Explo-IT, I was responsible for the complete lifecycle of web applications, including architecture design, API development, database optimization, and server management on Linux environments using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. This required the same kind of operational thinking, process building, and cross-functional coordination that this role demands.\n\nWhat stands out to me about lively is the emphasis on hands-on execution and building scalable structures without losing sight of the human element. I have worked in small, fast-moving teams where I had to wear multiple hats, communicate directly with stakeholders, and make decisions that balanced quality with speed. I am comfortable taking ownership of operations, identifying growth opportunities, and building systems that support expansion, whether that means setting up new workflows, managing technical infrastructure, or coordinating with remote and on-site teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am ready to relocate to NRW and be present at your locations as the role requires.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my operational mindset and hands-on experience can contribute to lively\'s next phase of growth.', '2026-06-06 15:16:02.885', '2026-06-06 15:16:02.885'),
(242, 242, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"senior care industry experience\",\"real estate / hospitality sector experience\",\"German language (native level)\",\"sales / leasing process experience\",\"team leadership experience\",\"HR management experience\",\"financial / billing knowledge (nursing care funds)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in senior care, real estate, hospitality, sales, or team leadership. The role requires native-level German, which is not listed. There are no overlapping skills or experience with the job requirements. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Operating & Sales Officer position at lively Holding GmbH. Your mission to redefine assisted living through modern, community-focused senior residences is a meaningful one, and I am drawn to the challenge of scaling a young brand from proof of concept to broad market presence.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and delivering production systems. In my most recent role, I was responsible for the complete lifecycle of web applications, from system design and API development to deployment and client communication. This required me to think not just as an engineer, but as a builder who understands that technology is a tool for solving real operational problems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational and strategic side of scaling a business. In my previous work, I have built platforms that serve multiple user roles, integrated payment systems, set up real-time monitoring dashboards, and managed deployments on cloud infrastructure. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to build processes that are both scalable and reliable, which I believe translates well to the operational challenges lively is facing as it expands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI understand that this role requires a hands-on, entrepreneurial leader who is comfortable with both strategy and execution. While my domain experience is in technology rather than senior care, I bring a strong track record of taking ownership, building systems from the ground up, and driving projects to completion. I am ready to bring that same energy and discipline to lively. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your next growth phase.', '2026-06-06 15:16:15.779', '2026-06-06 15:16:15.779'),
(243, 243, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Zertifizierung zur Ausstellung von Energieausweisen\",\"Know-how im GEG und mit energetischen Kennwerten\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse (C1+)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong digital literacy and remote work capability, but lacks the required energy certification, GEG knowledge, and German language proficiency (C1+) for this Energieberater role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Energieberater position at ALPHA Software GmbH. Your work in digitalizing building documentation for real estate agents is a practical and much-needed approach, and I am interested in contributing to a growing team that values direct communication and real responsibility.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I bring strong digital literacy, structured work habits, and experience handling detailed documentation and data validation. I am comfortable working independently in a fully remote setup and communicating clearly with clients via phone and email.\n\nIn my previous work, I have managed complex workflows, maintained accurate records, and collaborated with teams to improve processes. I am used to taking ownership of tasks and ensuring they are completed correctly and on time.\n\nI am fluent in English and have working knowledge of German. I am ready to start soon and have a reliable internet connection for remote work.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to ALPHA Software GmbH.', '2026-06-06 15:16:22.807', '2026-06-06 15:16:22.807'),
(244, 244, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"React\",\"Tailwind\",\"Figma\",\"Typescript\",\"Next JS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"shadcn/ui\",\"3D design experience\",\"viewport controls / gizmos / camera behaviour\",\"iconography and illustration\",\"Claude or similar AI-assisted prototyping tools\"]', 'The applicant has strong frontend coding skills (HTML, CSS, React, Tailwind, TypeScript, Next.js) and experience building responsive UIs and design systems in code. However, the role specifically requires experience with shadcn/ui, 3D/spatial/canvas-based software design, viewport controls, iconography/illustration, and AI-assisted prototyping with tools like Claude. These are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial on the code-first design approach but weak on the 3D and design-specific requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Designer role at neoBIM GmbH. The idea of collapsing the design-to-handoff pipeline and treating the running product as the source of truth aligns directly with how I prefer to work. I have been building interfaces in code for years, and I am drawn to the challenge of defining a design system for a 3D BIM platform from day one.\n\nWhat stands out to me about neoBIM is the focus on AI-powered Building Information Modeling in the AEC space. The construction industry is ready for smarter, more collaborative tooling, and the opportunity to shape how professional 3D software looks and feels is exactly the kind of work I want to do.\n\nI work primarily in HTML, CSS, and React, and I am comfortable prototyping directly in code. I have built responsive, accessible UIs using Tailwind CSS, Material UI, and Bootstrap, and I always design with light/dark mode and responsiveness from the start. I also use Figma for early exploration, but I prefer to move quickly into code where the real design system lives.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have owned the frontend of multiple full-stack applications built with Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. I am used to working closely with backend engineers, where handoff means a code review rather than a translation. I understand how to compose components, manage state, and build interfaces that are both visually consistent and technically maintainable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to neoBIM\'s design and product direction.', '2026-06-06 15:16:34.267', '2026-06-06 15:16:34.267'),
(245, 245, 1, 55, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Angular JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"REST API\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Python (5+ years)\",\"Google AppScript\",\"Angular (modern)\",\"LangChain\",\"LlamaIndex\",\"Gen AI tools (Gemini, Copilot, Claude)\",\"Agentic workflows\"]', 'Shagor has strong full-stack and front-end skills with JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, and Angular JS, plus cloud and CI/CD experience. However, the role requires deep Python expertise (5+ years), Google AppScript, and AI orchestration tools (LangChain, LlamaIndex) which are not present in his profile. His AI integration experience is limited to OpenAI/Replicate APIs rather than end-to-end agentic workflows.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Full Stack Developer (AI Solutions) role at Market Cloud. Your focus on building end-to-end AI applications and designing intuitive front-end interfaces aligns directly with the work I have been doing across full-stack development and AI integration.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built production systems that combine modern front-end frameworks with AI-powered backends. I developed an AI-powered real estate platform using Next.js, Express, and MongoDB, integrating OpenAI and Replicate APIs for intelligent assistants and image processing. I also implemented role-based authentication, Stripe payments, and cron job scheduling. This experience has given me practical familiarity with architecting responsive UIs, designing RESTful APIs, and deploying AI features into real applications.\n\nOn the front-end side, I have worked extensively with JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI to build dynamic, responsive interfaces. I have also used Angular JS in past projects and understand the migration path to modern Angular. My backend work includes Node.js, Express, Laravel, MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB, with deployment experience on AWS, Google Cloud, and Linux servers using Docker and Nginx.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to your AI development team and help build scalable, user-facing AI solutions. My CV is attached for your review. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support Market Cloud\'s goals.', '2026-06-06 15:16:45.181', '2026-06-06 15:16:45.181'),
(246, 246, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Python\"]', '[\"SEO\",\"SEA\",\"Social Media Marketing\",\"Content Marketing\",\"Suchmaschinenwerbung\",\"Suchmaschinenoptimierung\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and AI engineering, which partially overlap with the internship\'s technical requirements (web design, KI/AI). However, the role is primarily marketing-focused (SEO, SEA, SMM, content marketing), and the applicant\'s profile lacks direct experience in these marketing domains. The match is moderate for the technical/AI aspects but weak for the core marketing responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Praktikum Online-Marketing / Marketing / KI / AI position at SEOMATIK GmbH. Your agency\'s focus on SEO, SEA, and social media marketing combined with AI optimization is interesting, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to your projects while learning from your team.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS. I have also developed AI-powered systems, including a financial app that uses OpenAI for intelligent assistance and a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n. These projects required me to work with APIs, databases, and deployment on cloud infrastructure, which aligns with your need for someone comfortable with both web design and KI optimization.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is KI Optimierung (GEO). In my AI work, I have trained custom AI assistants using GPT models and integrated computer vision pipelines that run locally on edge devices. I understand how AI models interact with content and search systems, and I am keen to apply this understanding to SEO and content marketing workflows at SEOMATIK.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:16:55.786', '2026-06-06 15:16:55.786'),
(247, 247, 1, 75, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Firebase\"]', '[\"CMS experience (e.g., WordPress, Strapi)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'Strong match for web development and database programming. Solid experience with Laravel, Next.js, React, MySQL, and PostgreSQL. Automation and AI project exposure are relevant. Missing CMS and German language skills are not critical for the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Allrounder position at EuBiA. The combination of web development, database programming, and process automation in this role matches my technical background and working style. I appreciate that EuBiA focuses on creating meaningful impact through education and employment, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to that mission.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development, database application design, and workflow automation. I have built and maintained websites using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS, and I have worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL to structure and manage data. I also have hands-on experience with automation, having implemented systems that reduce repetitive tasks and improve operational efficiency.\n\nIn previous roles, I developed RESTful APIs, integrated authentication and payment systems, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. I have also worked on early-stage AI projects, including building AI-powered assistants and integrating machine learning APIs into production applications. This background allows me to contribute across the full stack while bringing practical automation and data management skills to the team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would be glad to discuss how my skills can support EuBiA\'s digital initiatives.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:17:05.315', '2026-06-06 15:17:05.315'),
(248, 248, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlüsse (annual financial statements preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns for corporations)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"German tax law knowledge\",\"German language fluency\"]', 'The job is for a certified German tax advisor (Steuerberater) requiring a passed tax advisor exam and deep German tax law expertise. The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications, German language skills, or tax law knowledge. The match is extremely low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position available through Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Nierstein. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in analytical problem-solving, structured workflows, and digital process optimization that I believe would be valuable in a modern, digitally-oriented tax practice.\n\nThrough my experience as a full-stack and software engineer, I have developed a meticulous approach to complex systems, data integrity, and secure information handling. I am accustomed to working with sensitive data, implementing role-based access controls, and ensuring accuracy in every layer of a system. These habits translate directly to the careful, efficient, and conscientious work style required in tax advisory roles.\n\nI am particularly drawn to the flexibility this role offers in shaping responsibilities based on individual strengths. My background has prepared me to work independently, take ownership of tasks, and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable in environments that value precision, continuous learning, and digital-first operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm in Nierstein.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:17:14.224', '2026-06-06 15:17:14.224'),
(249, 249, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant has no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and hands-on tax work. The applicant\'s software engineering background does not match the core requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Hochdorf. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong orientation toward digital processes, careful work, and efficient systems thinking that aligns with the modern, digitally-driven environment described in your listing.\n\nThrough my experience as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained secure web applications, implemented role-based access control, and automated complex data workflows. These skills translate directly to supporting digital tax processes, managing confidential financial data, and ensuring accuracy in system-driven operations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with modern digital tools and processes in a tax advisory context. I am comfortable with technology-driven environments, have experience deploying and maintaining production systems, and approach tasks with the same thoroughness and attention to detail that tax work demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in digital systems and process optimization could contribute to your partner firm in Hochdorf.', '2026-06-06 15:17:22.545', '2026-06-06 15:17:22.545'),
(250, 250, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlüsse (annual financial statements)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack software engineer with no background in tax consulting or German tax law. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax regulations, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong technical foundation and a methodical approach to problem-solving that aligns well with the digital working style your partner firm values.\n\nThrough my experience as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained complex web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I am comfortable working with databases, APIs, authentication systems, and deployment pipelines. This technical background gives me a practical understanding of how digital tools and automation can improve efficiency in professional services.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment in your partner firm. I have hands-on experience deploying applications on Linux servers, configuring Nginx and Apache, and using Docker for containerized environments. I am confident I can quickly adapt to any digital tools used in the tax domain.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-06 15:17:31.132', '2026-06-06 15:17:31.132'),
(251, 251, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, databases, and system automation. However, the job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with specific expertise in German tax law, financial statement preparation, and tax audit support. The applicant does not hold the required tax advisor certification or have experience in German tax advisory. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax advisory, I bring a strong foundation in digital systems, automation, and data management that aligns well with the modern, digitally-driven approach your partner firm values.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I am comfortable working with digital tools, automating workflows, and ensuring data accuracy and reliability across systems. These skills would support a tax firm that prioritizes efficiency and digital processes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a firm that values digital transformation and modern tools. I have experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx, and I am familiar with CI/CD pipelines and cloud infrastructure. This technical perspective could contribute to streamlining internal operations and client-facing digital services.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background could support your partner firm\'s digital and operational goals.', '2026-06-06 15:17:40.835', '2026-06-06 15:17:40.835'),
(252, 252, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in financial statements, tax declarations, and audits. There is no skill overlap. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax advisory, I bring strong technical skills that align with the digital-first, process-oriented environment described in your listing.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained secure, scalable systems using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I have experience implementing role-based access control, authentication, and data integrity measures, which are relevant to handling sensitive financial information with accuracy and care.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital workflows and modern tools. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines to streamline deployment and monitoring. I am comfortable adapting to new technologies and can help optimize internal processes for efficiency and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills and adaptable mindset could contribute to your partner firm in Heuchelheim.', '2026-06-06 15:17:48.455', '2026-06-06 15:17:48.455'),
(253, 253, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam) and expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I understand you are looking for communicative, detail-oriented professionals who are open to digital ways of working. I bring strong analytical thinking, a careful and efficient work style, and experience building digital platforms that streamline complex workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented authentication and role-based access control systems. I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and enjoy solving structured problems with precision and attention to detail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment in your partner firm. I have hands-on experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Apache, and Docker, and I am familiar with CI/CD pipelines. I am confident I can adapt quickly to your digital tools and contribute to efficient, paperless workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm in Thyrnau.', '2026-06-06 15:17:56.887', '2026-06-06 15:17:56.887');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(254, 254, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax consultant exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statements)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax declarations)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in German tax law, financial statements, and tax audits. There is no direct match between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Boms. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, precise documentation, and digital process optimization that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a meticulous approach to handling complex, data-intensive tasks. Building secure financial applications and real-time monitoring systems has trained me to work with accuracy, maintain data integrity, and manage multiple concurrent responsibilities without compromising quality. These skills translate directly to the careful preparation and review of annual financial statements and tax declarations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital workflows and modern tools. I have extensive experience working with cloud infrastructure, automation pipelines, and collaborative platforms. I am comfortable adapting to new software environments quickly and can contribute to maintaining efficient, digitally-driven processes within the firm.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills, attention to detail, and adaptability could contribute to your partner firm in Boms.', '2026-06-06 15:18:06.790', '2026-06-06 15:18:06.790'),
(255, 255, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Advisor Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\",\"Teamleitung (Team Leadership)\",\"Personalverantwortung (Personnel Responsibility)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no qualifications or experience in tax advisory, tax law, or accounting. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax advisor) with expertise in financial statements, tax returns, audits, and optionally team leadership. There is no skill overlap. The applicant\'s software engineering background does not meet the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Sylt. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong technical skills in digital process optimization, secure systems, and workflow automation that can support a modern, digitally-driven tax advisory practice.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment integrations. I am comfortable working with databases, optimizing queries, and ensuring data integrity. These skills translate directly to supporting digital tax processes and managing sensitive financial data with accuracy and care.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on a digital working environment and modern tools. I have hands-on experience deploying applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker, setting up CI/CD pipelines, and integrating third-party services. I am confident I can help a forward-thinking firm adopt efficient, technology-supported workflows for tasks like document management, client communication, and data processing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills can contribute to the efficiency and digital transformation of your partner firm in Sylt.', '2026-06-06 15:18:17.047', '2026-06-06 15:18:17.047'),
(256, 256, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer Success experience\",\"Account Management experience\",\"Technical Support experience\",\"German language (C1+)\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in AI and software development, which provides a foundation for understanding the KI-Projekte domain. However, the role primarily requires customer success, account management, and technical support experience, along with fluent German (C1+). The applicant\'s background is more engineering-focused, and there is no evidence of direct customer-facing support or German language proficiency in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kundensupport / Kundenbetreuung position at Agentur Philipp GmbH. Your work building real-world AI solutions like voice agents, computer-vision systems, and process automations for German SMEs is impressive. I am drawn to the impact your team creates and the opportunity to ensure customers are genuinely satisfied with these technologies.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a strong technical understanding of how AI systems function in production. I have worked with APIs, computer vision pipelines, and automation workflows. While I do not need to code in this role, I can accurately explain, evaluate, and contextualize these technologies for customers. This technical grounding allows me to triage support requests effectively and communicate clearly with the development team.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the proactive customer success approach described in the role. In my previous experience as a web developer, I regularly acted as a direct point of contact for stakeholders, gathering feedback, prioritizing requests, and providing status updates. I am comfortable running onboarding calls, conducting check-ins, and identifying potential issues before they escalate. I take ownership of customer relationships and work to build long-term trust.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your customers and contribute to Agentur Philipp\'s continued growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:18:27.071', '2026-06-06 15:18:27.071'),
(257, 257, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Customer outreach experience\",\"Phone communication experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a commission-only freelance introducer position focused on sales and customer outreach. The applicant\'s profile does not mention any sales, phone communication, or customer outreach experience. However, the applicant is described as a hard worker, quick learner, and problem solver, and is fluent in Bengali and English, which could be relevant for communicating with a diverse range of businesses.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Introducer position with Bonkk. The opportunity to help CourierHubb grow by connecting businesses with a practical same-day delivery service is straightforward and appealing. I am confident in my ability to reach out to local and national businesses, explain the value of the platform, and guide them through a free sign-up process.\n\nThis role is about clear communication and consistent outreach. I am comfortable speaking with a wide range of businesses — from estate agents and law firms to florists and e-commerce sellers. I can identify companies that regularly send or receive items and explain how CourierHubb can save them time and money. I am self-motivated and comfortable working independently toward performance-based goals.\n\nI have experience working remotely and managing my own schedule. In previous roles, I collaborated with stakeholders and delivered results without needing constant supervision. I am confident on the phone, friendly in tone, and able to build ongoing relationships with repeat clients.\n\nIn addition to my outreach skills, I communicate clearly across teams and with people from different backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy working in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of joining the CourierHubb team and building a steady income stream through this opportunity.', '2026-06-06 15:18:36.244', '2026-06-06 15:18:36.244'),
(258, 258, 1, 20, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Customer outreach experience\",\"Phone communication experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong communication and self-motivation traits but lacks direct sales or customer outreach experience, which are preferred but not required for this role. The technical skills are not directly relevant to this commission-based introducer position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Introducer role with Bonkk. The opportunity to help businesses discover CourierHubb\'s same-day delivery services through direct outreach and relationship building aligns well with my communication skills and independent work style.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the straightforward mission: contact businesses, share a referral link, and earn commission when they book deliveries. I am comfortable speaking with a wide range of businesses, from estate agents and law firms to local retailers and medical clinics. I can clearly explain how CourierHubb saves them time and money, and guide them through the sign-up process.\n\nI am a self-motivated individual who works effectively without supervision. I am confident on the phone, friendly in my approach, and target-driven. I understand that building passive income requires consistent effort and relationship management, and I am prepared to invest the time needed to achieve results.\n\nIn addition to my outreach capabilities, I communicate clearly with people from different backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of joining the CourierHubb team.', '2026-06-06 15:18:43.893', '2026-06-06 15:18:43.893'),
(259, 259, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"sales experience\",\"phone outreach\",\"UK business market knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong communication skills, but the role is a commission-based sales/introducer position requiring phone outreach and UK business connections. The applicant\'s technical background does not directly match the sales-focused responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Introducer role with Bonkk., representing CourierHubb. The idea of helping local businesses across the UK discover a reliable same-day courier service through simple introductions appeals to me. I appreciate that this role is about making connections rather than hard selling, and I am comfortable with a performance-based, commission-only structure.\n\nI am a confident and friendly communicator with experience reaching out to businesses and explaining services clearly. In my previous work as a web developer, I regularly collaborated with stakeholders, clients, and team members to understand their needs and communicate technical solutions in plain language. This has given me a practical ability to listen, explain, and guide people toward useful decisions.\n\nWhat stands out to me about CourierHubb is the straightforward model: businesses sign up for free, and I earn ongoing commission from their bookings. I am self-motivated and comfortable working independently, managing my own time, and consistently reaching out to offices, shops, clinics, tradespeople, and other businesses that send or receive items regularly.\n\nIn addition to my communication skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to growing CourierHubb\'s network of business users.\n\nThank you for your time.', '2026-06-06 15:18:52.919', '2026-06-06 15:18:52.919'),
