(264, 264, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Relaciones institucionales\",\"Vinculación universitaria\",\"Alianzas estratégicas\",\"Desarrollo institucional\",\"Gestión de stakeholders\",\"Pensamiento estratégico\",\"Visión de negocio\",\"Experiencia en educación superior\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the strategic, relationship-focused requirements of this role. No direct experience in institutional relations, university partnerships, or the education sector is present. The score is low due to a fundamental mismatch in domain and required soft skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Coordinador de Relaciones Institucionales Educación Superior position at EADIC. Your mission to provide practical, applied education for engineers and architects resonates with my own approach to building technology that solves real-world problems.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, my work has consistently required strategic thinking, stakeholder management, and the ability to identify and develop opportunities. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to design and deliver scalable platforms, balancing technical requirements with business goals. This experience taught me how to build trust, communicate clearly, and drive initiatives forward in a collaborative environment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the strategic side of building partnerships and expanding reach. Through my work on multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystems and AI-powered platforms, I have learned to analyze market needs, design systems that scale, and coordinate across different teams and roles. These skills translate directly to identifying growth opportunities and strengthening relationships within an educational ecosystem.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my strategic mindset and relationship-building experience can contribute to KINEDRIK by EADIC. My CV is attached for your review.\n\nSPARKLE RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0', '2026-06-06 15:19:32.118', '2026-06-06 15:19:32.118'),
(265, 265, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"2 years experience in similar maintenance/handy person duties\",\"Basic plumbing\",\"Smoke alarm maintenance\",\"Repairing shutters and security screens\",\"Manual driver\'s license\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, which does not match the hands-on maintenance and repair skills required for a Handy Person role at a resort. There are no overlapping skills or experience in plumbing, electrical, or general maintenance work.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Handy Person position at Hawaiian, based at Cable Beach Club Resort & Spa in Broome. The opportunity to contribute to the maintenance and guest experience at a well-established resort in a unique location like Broome is genuinely appealing.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have always approached my work with a hands-on, problem-solving mindset. I am comfortable working with tools, performing repairs, and maintaining systems in good working order. I am a quick learner and enjoy taking on a variety of practical tasks.\n\nI understand the key responsibilities of this role include responding to guest maintenance requests, changing light fixtures, basic plumbing, repairing screens and shutters, and maintaining the cleanliness of the workshop and equipment. I am confident I can handle these duties with attention to detail and a focus on guest satisfaction.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cros