(267, 267, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Masters in Arts Business\",\"6-8 years experience in art/artwork domain\",\"Excellent Interpersonal Skills\",\"Excellent Negotiation Skills\",\"Good Networking Ability\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not art or artwork consultation. No direct skill overlap with the job requirements. The role requires a Masters in Arts Business and 6-8 years of art-related experience, which the applicant does not have. The applicant\'s interpersonal and communication skills are transferable but not a strong match for this specialized art role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Team Member Special Assignment position at Reliance Industries Limited. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering, I bring strong client-facing experience, relationship management skills, and the ability to understand and deliver on specific visual and functional requirements.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I regularly met with clients to discuss project spaces, understand their desired outcomes, and communicate effectively throughout the consultation and delivery process. I collaborated with designers, artists, and external partners to ensure that the final product matched the client\'s vision, mood, and functional needs.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is working within diverse budgets and spaces. I have experience managing projects with varying scopes and resource constraints, always focusing on delivering quality results while maintaining strong relationships with stakeholders, vendors, and team members.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and