(268, 268, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Executive support experience\",\"Calendar management\",\"Microsoft Office Suite\",\"Professional phone etiquette\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not include the administrative, executive support, or clerical experience required for this role. No direct skill matches were found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Coordinator position at UppalCorp. Your focus on commodities sourcing, trade, and management consulting, combined with a commitment to growth and collaboration, aligns with my own approach to structured and reliable support work.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I regularly coordinated with stakeholders, managed project timelines, organized documentation, and ensured smooth communication between technical and non-technical teams. These experiences have given me strong organizational habits, attention to detail, and the ability to prioritize multiple tasks under deadlines.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in a remote setting and have experience using collaboration tools and office software to maintain efficient workflows. I also bring strong professional judgment and discretion when handling sensitive information.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am willing to travel occasionally for business meetings and events as required. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the UppalCorp team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:20:02.578', '2026-06-06 15:20:02.578'),
(269, 269, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"On-camera presence\",\"Video filming and editing\",\"Social media trend knowledge\",\"UGC content creation\",\"48-hour turnaround delivery\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, backend systems, and AI. However, this role is for a UGC (User-Generated Content) creator who must appear on camera, film and edit videos, and understand social media trends. The applicant\'s profile does not mention any video creation, on-camera experience, or social media content production skills. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining re:act\'s freelance UGC creator network. Your focus on working with a diverse range of brands and creators with different styles and experiences aligns well with my approach to content creation.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, I have consistently created and edited high-quality video content for my own projects and portfolios. I am comfortable appearing on camera, explaining technical concepts clearly, and producing engaging social-first content that resonates with viewers.\n\nI have a strong understanding of current social media trends and UGC styles. I can develop creative concepts that fit specific brand requirements while maintaining authenticity. My experience with video editing tools and production workflows allows me to deliver polished content within a 48-hour turnaround window.\n\nIn addition to my content creation skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to create content for re:act\'s brand partners.\n\nRIGHT\nRNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0', '2026-06-06 15:20:10.784', '2026-06-06 15:20:10.784'),
(270, 270, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Medical degree (MBBS or equivalent)\",\"AHPRA registration\",\"Fellowship with RACGP or ACRRM\",\"Chronic disease management experience\",\"Prescribing and referral management\",\"Telehealth consultation experience\",\"DVA billing experience\",\"GP Management Plans (GPMPs)\",\"Team Care Arrangements (TCAs)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no medical qualifications or clinical experience. The job requires a registered General Practitioner with specific medical credentials and chronic disease management expertise. There is no match between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the General Practitioner Telehealth Case Conferencing Clinic position at Proactive Health. While my background is in software engineering rather than clinical medicine, I recognize the importance of structured, evidence-based care coordination and multidisciplinary teamwork in improving patient outcomes.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams to design and deliver complex systems. This has required clear communication, careful planning, and the ability to translate technical requirements into practical solutions. I understand how to collaborate effectively within team-based models and how to support workflows that depend on accurate information sharing.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of technology to improve access to care. I have built real-time communication systems and secure data platforms that could support telehealth and case conferencing workflows. While I am not a medical practitioner, I bring strong organizational, technical, and collaborative skills that can contribute to the efficiency and reliability of the Chronic Care Team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-06 15:20:18.744', '2026-06-06 15:20:18.744'),
(271, 271, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is a generic test posting with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has a strong full-stack development background, but without concrete job requirements, a meaningful match assessment is not possible.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Test position at JAKSON Group. With a background in full-stack development and a focus on building practical, scalable systems, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your team.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js to build and maintain production-grade applications. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways. My work also includes optimizing database performance through Eloquent query tuning and caching strategies.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building real-time, responsive user interfaces. I have used Tailwind CSS, JavaScript, and TypeScript to create SEO-friendly, accessible frontends. I have also delivered real-time features such as chat and live notifications using WebSockets and Socket.IO, ensuring smooth and interactive user experiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of JAKSON Group.', '2026-06-06 15:20:25.745', '2026-06-06 15:20:25.745'),
(272, 272, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"CRM tools\",\"SaaS support\"]', 'The applicant has strong communication and problem-solving skills from a software engineering background, but lacks direct customer support experience and familiarity with typical support tools.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Advocate position at Tithe.ly. Your focus on delivering a great customer experience in a remote environment aligns with my own approach to clear, solution-oriented communication.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I regularly collaborated with stakeholders to understand their requirements, troubleshoot issues, and ensure smooth product delivery. This experience taught me to listen carefully, explain technical concepts in plain language, and follow through until problems are fully resolved.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-06 15:20:31.171', '2026-06-06 15:20:31.171'),
(273, 273, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"MS Word\",\"MS Excel\",\"U.S. work authorization\"]', 'The applicant has strong general computer skills and attention to detail, but lacks specific MS Word/MS Excel experience and U.S. work authorization required for this entry-level data entry role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Entry Specialist position at Bendigo Advertiser. This role aligns with my ability to handle data accurately and maintain organized records while working independently.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a strong attention to detail and the discipline to review data for errors and inconsistencies. I am comfortable working with digital systems and can adapt quickly to new tools and workflows.\n\nI am a quick learner and can work independently with minimal supervision. I have a reliable internet connection and am comfortable working remotely.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I communicate clearly with team members and can collaborate effectively across different time zones. I am fluent in Bengali and English and enjoy working in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Optiboost Media\'s data operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:20:36.954', '2026-06-06 15:20:36.954'),
(274, 274, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Onboarding experience\",\"Customer support\",\"SaaS operations\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Onboarding Specialist role is non-technical and focuses on customer onboarding processes. There is minimal direct overlap in required skills or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Onboarding Specialist position at ezCater. While my background is primarily in software engineering, I bring a user-focused mindset and experience building systems that streamline complex workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and delivered full-stack applications that prioritize usability and efficiency. I have worked on platforms involving authentication, role-based access, real-time notifications, and payment integration, all of which require careful attention to user onboarding and experience.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how technology can simplify processes for people. In previous work, I built a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem that required coordinating between customers, sellers, and delivery agents. This involved creating clear onboarding flows and role-specific interfaces to ensure each user group could start using the platform with minimal friction.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to ezCater\'s onboarding team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:20:44.345', '2026-06-06 15:20:44.345'),
(275, 275, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer success experience\",\"Client relationship management\",\"CRM tools\",\"Account management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong communication and remote work skills, but has no direct customer success or client management experience listed in the profile. The role requires client-facing success management, which is not supported by the provided background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Success Manager position at Gifted. Your focus on providing a clear career path and fully remote work aligns with my own professional values and working style.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I worked directly with stakeholders and clients to understand their needs, translate requirements into actionable plans, and ensure successful project delivery. This experience has given me strong communication and relationship management skills that are directly applicable to client success.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and have a track record of clear, timely communication with teams and clients across different time zones. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can apply my problem-solving abilities and client-focused mindset to help customers succeed. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Gifted\'s team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-06 15:20:50.861', '2026-06-06 15:20:50.861');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(276, 276, 1, 35, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Google Sheets\",\"data entry experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills but limited direct data entry or administrative experience. The role requires basic spreadsheet proficiency and attention to detail, which the applicant demonstrates through database work and project coordination. However, the profile is more engineering-focused than administrative.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Remote Data Entry Specialist - Assistant Administrator position at RecruitLytic Hires. Your focus on accurate data management, structured record keeping, and remote administrative coordination aligns well with my background.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits and a methodical approach to handling data. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, databases, and internal systems to input, update, and verify information. My experience includes maintaining accurate records, identifying inconsistencies, and ensuring data quality across multiple projects.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on clear communication and task tracking. In previous roles, I have coordinated with team members to track progress, follow up on outstanding items, and provide regular updates. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and managing repetitive tasks with consistency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nACCLAIM RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0', '2026-06-06 15:20:57.853', '2026-06-06 15:20:57.853'),
(277, 277, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Records management experience\",\"Admin support experience\",\"Clerical work experience\",\"Document control experience\",\"Ticketing tools (Jira/Asana/ServiceNow)\",\"E-signature platforms\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the File Clerk role requires administrative, clerical, and records management experience. The applicant\'s background in software engineering provides transferable skills in attention to detail, database management, and file organization, but lacks direct experience in document control, ticketing tools, and e-signature platforms.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the File Clerk position at RecruitLytic Hires. The role requires careful document handling, database updates, and consistent attention to detail, which aligns with the way I approach my work.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits and a methodical approach to managing information. I have worked extensively with file systems, databases, and version-controlled repositories, ensuring that data is accurately stored, properly labeled, and easy to retrieve. These skills transfer directly to the responsibilities of intake, indexing, and document organization described in this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the quality control aspect of this position. In my development work, I routinely performed checks for errors, inconsistencies, and missing information before finalizing deliverables. I am comfortable maintaining error logs, flagging exceptions, and contributing to process improvements that reduce rework. I also understand the importance of handling sensitive records with strict access controls and confidentiality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my attention to detail and structured workflow can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-06 15:21:06.673', '2026-06-06 15:21:06.673'),
(278, 278, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Arabic fluency\",\"Customer support experience\",\"CRM systems\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong communication and problem-solving skills, but lacks the required Arabic fluency and direct customer support experience. The role is a customer support position requiring Arabic language skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Specialist position at RecruitLytic Hires. Your focus on delivering exceptional service through clear communication and professionalism aligns with how I approach customer-facing work.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong problem-solving skills and the ability to communicate technical information clearly to non-technical users. I am comfortable handling inquiries via email, chat, and phone, and I understand the importance of maintaining accurate records and following up on cases to ensure timely resolution.\n\nI work well independently in remote environments and have a reliable high-speed internet connection along with a dedicated workspace. I am fluent in English and Bengali, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me connect with diverse customers effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I prioritize empathy and professionalism in every interaction. I am comfortable learning new tools and processes quickly, and I am committed to supporting continuous improvement by identifying recurring issues and collaborating with internal teams.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:21:13.972', '2026-06-06 15:21:13.972'),
(279, 279, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years of professional video editing\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"Meta (Facebook/Instagram) editing experience\",\"TikTok editing experience\",\"Short-form social platform editing\",\"Hooks and retention understanding\",\"Platform-native pacing\",\"Captions/subtitles\",\"UGC-style editing\",\"Social-first storytelling\",\"Creative testing workflows\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering, full-stack development, and AI engineering, with no professional video editing experience or skills listed. The job requires 5+ years of professional video editing, proficiency in Adobe Premiere Pro, and deep understanding of social-first editing for Meta and TikTok. While the applicant has experience with AI-assisted workflows (a nice-to-have), the core requirements of the role are not met by the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Video Editor position at Forbes Advisor. Your focus on high-volume short-form social content for Meta, with an emphasis on hooks, retention, and platform-native pacing, caught my attention. I am particularly interested in how your team combines performance-oriented creative with iterative testing workflows.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, but I have developed strong skills in AI-assisted creative workflows that directly apply to this role. Through my project work, I have integrated AI tools for image processing, video asset generation, and automation. I am comfortable working with ElevenLabs-style voice synthesis, Veo 3-style video generation, and other emerging AI creative tools. This experience allows me to quickly adapt to new technologies and experiment with workflows that can enhance your short-form content production.\n\nIn previous work, I built systems that required real-time data processing, API integration, and automated content generation. These projects taught me how to work iteratively, test creative variations, and refine outputs based on performance feedback. I understand the importance of consistency, responsiveness, and creative judgment in a social-first environment where content is regularly tested and optimized.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I am available to discuss how my skills can support your creative strategy team.', '2026-06-06 15:21:23.495', '2026-06-06 15:21:23.495'),
(280, 280, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Spreadsheet tools (Google Sheets / Excel)\",\"Data entry\",\"Task coordination\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is an entry-level administrative assistant role requiring data entry, spreadsheet management, and task coordination. While the applicant has strong computer skills and attention to detail, there is no direct administrative or office support experience in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at RecruitLytic Hires. This role caught my attention because it offers a solid foundation in administrative support and digital operations, which aligns with my interest in building practical skills in data management and workflow organization.\n\nThrough my software engineering background, I have developed strong computer skills and a disciplined approach to maintaining accurate records and structured documentation. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, organizing digital files, and following systematic workflows to ensure information is accessible and up to date.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on task coordination and supporting internal teams. In previous work, I have consistently maintained clear communication and followed structured processes to complete tasks reliably. I am confident I can bring the same attention to detail and consistency to this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to RecruitLytic Hires. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-06 15:21:31.280', '2026-06-06 15:21:31.280'),
(281, 281, 1, 20, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Full Professional Proficiency in French language\",\"Resident in Canada for the last 5 consecutive years\",\"Familiarity with Canadian business, media, sport, news, social media, and cultural affairs\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong research and data verification skills, but does not meet the core requirements of French language proficiency and Canadian residency for the last 5 years. The role does not require technical software engineering skills, so the applicant\'s technical background provides limited direct match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Online Data Analyst Canada (French Language) position at TELUS Digital. This freelance opportunity to work on enhancing digital map content and quality aligns well with my research-oriented approach and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in conducting thorough online research, verifying information accuracy, and working systematically within web-based environments. I am comfortable following detailed guidelines and using search engines, online maps, and website information to complete evaluation tasks efficiently.\n\nI am a detail-oriented individual who takes accuracy seriously. Whether I am comparing data, verifying information, or determining relevance, I approach each task with care and consistency. I am also flexible and able to work across diverse task types, including maps, news, audio tasks, and relevance evaluation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have daily access to a broadband internet connection and a reliable computer, and I am prepared to complete the qualification exam and ID verification process. I\'ve attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to this project.', '2026-06-06 15:21:40.371', '2026-06-06 15:21:40.371'),
(282, 282, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Full Professional Proficiency in Spanish language\",\"Resident in United States for last 5 consecutive years\",\"Familiarity with US business, media, sport, news, social media, and cultural affairs\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong research and web-based evaluation skills, but does not meet the core requirements of full professional Spanish proficiency, US residency for the last 5 years, or familiarity with US cultural affairs.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Online Data Analyst position at TELUS Digital. This freelance opportunity to work on enhancing digital map content and quality aligns well with my background in research-oriented tasks and web-based evaluation work.\n\nThrough my software engineering experience, I have developed strong analytical and research skills. I am comfortable working independently, following guidelines, and conducting thorough online research using search engines, maps, and website information to verify and compare data accuracy.\n\nI have daily access to a broadband internet connection and a computer, and I am prepared to complete the qualification exam and ID verification process. I am flexible to work across diverse task types including maps, news, audio tasks, and relevance evaluation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to contribute to this project.', '2026-06-06 15:21:48.154', '2026-06-06 15:21:48.154'),
(283, 283, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Residency in Canada for the last 5 consecutive years\",\"Familiarity with Canadian business, media, sport, news, social media, and cultural affairs\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong research and data evaluation skills, but does not meet the core requirement of being a resident in Canada for the last 5 consecutive years. The role is a freelance data analyst position focused on enhancing digital maps, requiring local Canadian knowledge and residency.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Online Data Analyst Canada position at TELUS Digital. The opportunity to contribute to a project that enhances the quality of digital maps used by millions of people worldwide aligns well with my research-oriented approach and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in conducting thorough research, verifying information, and evaluating data accuracy within web-based environments. My experience building full-stack applications has given me a disciplined approach to following guidelines and maintaining quality standards.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the variety of task types involved in this role, including maps, news, audio tasks, and relevance evaluation. My background in working across different technologies and problem domains has prepared me to adapt quickly to diverse task requirements while maintaining consistent accuracy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident in my ability to pass the qualification exam and contribute to the project\'s success. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can add value to your team.', '2026-06-06 15:21:58.408', '2026-06-06 15:21:58.408'),
(284, 284, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Digital marketing strategy\",\"Performance marketing (Google, Meta, LinkedIn)\",\"Customer journey optimization\",\"Team leadership / management\",\"German language\",\"7+ years of digital marketing experience\",\"Agency or consulting experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI integration. However, this role is a Senior Digital Marketing Consultant & Teamlead requiring 7+ years of digital marketing experience, agency/consulting background, performance marketing expertise, team leadership, and German language skills. The applicant\'s profile does not contain any digital marketing, team leadership, or agency experience, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Digital Marketing Consultant & Teamlead position at Ilias Vassiliou & Team / headhunter.digital. The focus on combining strategy with operational execution and integrating AI into marketing processes aligns directly with how I approach building and delivering technology-driven solutions.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development, where I have designed and deployed production systems using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance. What sets this experience apart is that I have consistently worked on projects where technology directly supports business growth, not just feature delivery.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI into practical workflows. I have worked on projects that use OpenAI and Replicate APIs to build intelligent assistants, automate content processing, and enhance user interactions. This is not theoretical work. I have deployed these systems into production, trained AI models on custom datasets, and handled real-time data processing. I understand how to move AI from concept to measurable impact.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-07 03:14:36.953', '2026-06-07 03:14:36.953'),
(285, 285, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Degree in Engineering or Construction Management\",\"QA/QC management in EPC or construction projects\",\"Experience with utility-scale solar PV or BESS\",\"Inspection & Test Plans\",\"NCR processes\",\"Construction quality documentation systems\",\"Handover readiness\",\"Stakeholder management in construction\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no experience in construction quality management, EPC projects, or renewable energy. While the applicant has strong skills in software QA/QC, system architecture, and cross-project coordination, these do not directly translate to the construction domain requirements of this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Construction Quality Manager position at ILOS Projects GmbH & Co. KG. Your work in accelerating the energy transition through large-scale solar PV and BESS projects across Europe is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your quality management efforts.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering and system architecture, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining production-grade systems. While my domain is not construction, the core principles of quality management, defect prevention, documentation rigor, and continuous improvement are deeply familiar to me from engineering complex software platforms.\n\nIn my experience as a Web Developer, I have been responsible for defining and implementing testing procedures, managing defect tracking and root cause analysis, and ensuring that all deliverables meet documented standards before handover. I have worked across multiple projects simultaneously, monitoring KPIs and driving process improvements to maintain consistency and reliability. These responsibilities align closely with the QA/QC workflows, NCR management, and reporting frameworks described in your role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to lead and scale a Quality Management System across multiple construction sites. My background in building structured systems, automating workflows, and ensuring documentation completeness gives me a practical foundation for this challenge. I am comfortable working both strategically and hands-on, and I am used to holding contractors and teams accountable for quality delivery.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-07 03:14:44.800', '2026-06-07 03:14:44.800'),
(286, 286, 1, 55, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"REST API\"]', '[\"Shopware 6\",\"Symfony\",\"Twig\",\"SCSS\",\"Vue.js\",\"eCommerce experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong PHP and Laravel backend skills, along with frontend basics (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and DevOps familiarity (Docker, CI/CD). He lacks direct Shopware 6, Symfony, Twig, and SCSS experience, and has no eCommerce domain background. The role requires 2-5 years of PHP/Symfony experience and Shopware 6 practice, which are not present in his profile. His general full-stack web development skills provide a partial foundation, but significant ramp-up would be needed for Shopware-specific work.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Shopware Entwickler Fullstack position at Aurivian GmbH. Your focus on building and optimizing eCommerce solutions for mid-market merchants in the DACH region aligns well with my experience in full-stack PHP development and custom web application delivery.\n\nMy professional experience centers on PHP-based backend development with Laravel, REST API integration, and database design using MySQL. I have worked with modern development setups including Docker, Git, and CI/CD workflows, and I am comfortable contributing to architecture decisions and internal development standards. While I do not have direct Shopware experience, my background in object-oriented PHP and Symfony-adjacent frameworks provides a solid foundation for quickly ramping up on Shopware 6 plugin development and customization.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I developed and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching. I also worked on storefront-level features using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. One relevant project I delivered is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem built with Laravel and Flutter, which involved API design, role-based access, payment integration, and real-time notifications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Aurivian\'s development team.', '2026-06-07 03:14:52.636', '2026-06-07 03:14:52.636'),
(287, 287, 1, 65, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"MySQL\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\"]', '[\"Shopware 6 experience\",\"Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, Ansible)\",\"Kubernetes experience\",\"Upsun/Platform.sh experience\",\"AWS certifications\",\"German language (B2+)\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has solid foundational skills in Linux, Docker, CI/CD, Git, and AWS that match the core requirements for this Platform & Infrastructure Engineer role. His experience deploying web applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker, along with his understanding of web performance and security, align well with the job responsibilities. However, he lacks direct Shopware 6 experience, Infrastructure as Code tools (Terraform/Ansible), Kubernetes, and German language proficiency at the B2+ level, which are important for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Platform & Infrastructure Engineer position at Aurivian GmbH. The opportunity to build and shape your infrastructure from the ground up, especially in an e-commerce context, is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy experience centers on Linux server administration, containerization with Docker, and building CI/CD pipelines. In my recent role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining web applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Apache, managing Docker containers, and setting up CI/CD workflows for streamlined deployments. I also worked with AWS for cloud hosting and infrastructure management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the greenfield nature of this role. I have experience configuring and optimizing hosting environments, monitoring system health, and implementing security measures such as access controls and secure configurations. I am comfortable taking ownership of infrastructure tasks and working closely with development teams to align architecture decisions with business needs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Aurivian\'s infrastructure growth.', '2026-06-07 03:14:59.213', '2026-06-07 03:14:59.213'),
(288, 288, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung\",\"Bilanzbuchhalter\",\"MS-Office\",\"Umsatzsteuer\",\"DATEV\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no accounting qualifications or experience. The job requires a Buchhalter (accountant) with formal commercial training and knowledge of German accounting standards (DATEV, Umsatzsteuer). There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Buchhalter position at Roos Vehicle Logistics GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical thinking, process optimization experience, and comfort with financial data systems that align well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work building full-stack applications, I have developed systems that handle financial transactions, payment gateways, subscription billing, and automated reporting. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how financial data flows through digital systems and the importance of accuracy, reconciliation, and structured record-keeping.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process optimization. In my development work, I have consistently focused on automating repetitive tasks, improving data accuracy, and building dashboards that provide clear financial visibility. I am confident these skills translate well to supporting the digitalization and optimization of accounting processes at Roos Vehicle Logistics GmbH.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 03:15:05.405', '2026-06-07 03:15:05.405'),
(289, 289, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Figma\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Cloud (InDesign, Illustrator, Photoshop)\",\"Premiere Pro\",\"After Effects\",\"Print media design\",\"Typography\",\"Druckdaten\",\"PIM system\",\"German language (sehr gute Kenntnisse)\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational digital design skills (HTML, CSS, Figma) but lacks the core Adobe Creative Cloud expertise, print media experience, and German language proficiency required for this Mediengestalter role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mediengestalter (m/w/d) position at BUZIL-WERK Wagner GmbH & Co. KG. Your company\'s long-standing reputation as a reliable partner in professional cleaning solutions, combined with your focus on both print and digital brand presence, makes this role particularly interesting to me.\n\nWhile my professional background is primarily in software engineering and web development, I bring a strong foundation in digital design and content management that directly supports the responsibilities outlined in this position. Through my work building and maintaining full-stack web applications, I have developed practical experience in creating and updating digital content for websites, managing product data, and ensuring visual consistency across platforms. I am comfortable working with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and responsive design frameworks to implement and maintain digital marketing materials.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the management of product data, images, and downloads within a structured system. In my previous projects, I have worked with content management workflows, database-driven product information, and the importance of keeping digital assets current and consistent. I am confident I can apply this structured, detail-oriented approach to maintaining your PIM system and supporting your corporate design guidelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your marketing team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-07 03:15:12.745', '2026-06-07 03:15:12.745'),
(290, 290, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"SEO experience\",\"Search Console\",\"Google Analytics\",\"Sistrix\",\"ahrefs\",\"Content strategy\",\"Keyword research\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Laravel, PHP) which provide a good technical foundation for understanding SEO-related site architecture and performance. However, the profile lacks direct SEO experience, familiarity with SEO analysis tools (Search Console, Analytics, Sistrix, ahrefs), content strategy expertise, and German language proficiency, which are core requirements for this dedicated SEO role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SEO Manager role at SichtbarerWerden GmbH. Your focus on building websites that drive real client inquiries and rank well with Google and AI tools aligns with my own approach to building effective, performance-oriented web solutions.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed a strong technical understanding of how websites perform, how content is structured, and how technical decisions impact search visibility. I have built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Laravel, and I understand the importance of clean code, fast load times, and proper site architecture for search engine performance.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked on optimizing application performance through query tuning, caching strategies, and database indexing. I have also implemented features that directly affect user experience and site engagement, such as real-time updates and responsive design. This technical background gives me a practical perspective on how development choices influence SEO outcomes.\n\nI work well independently and enjoy developing structured strategies backed by data. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 03:15:20.207', '2026-06-07 03:15:20.207'),
(291, 291, 1, 15, '[\"CSS\"]', '[\"Operations management\",\"Event organization\",\"Customer communication\",\"Social media management\",\"Sales/lead generation\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, but the Operations Manager role requires operational, organizational, and marketing skills that are not present in the profile. The only direct match is CSS, listed as an optional qualification. The applicant\'s experience in web development and client communication provides some transferable skills, but the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Manager Sportevents position at TF Wettkampfservices GmbH. Your focus on professional timekeeping, event technology, and competition organization is impressive, and I appreciate the emphasis on building structures and driving things forward in a growing company.\n\nWhile my background is primarily technical, I have developed strong operational and organizational skills through my work as a Web Developer. In that role, I supported business operations, managed client communication, and helped improve workflows. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to keep daily operations running smoothly while also contributing to growth.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support your online presence and social media channels. I have hands-on experience building and maintaining websites, which includes understanding how content, design, and user experience work together. I can contribute to keeping your online platforms up to date and effective.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team in this role.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 03:15:26.355', '2026-06-07 03:15:26.355'),
(292, 292, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Sales team leadership\",\"Outbound sales experience\",\"CRM management\",\"Sales process design\",\"Coaching and team development\",\"Financial product sales\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, automation, and system building. However, this role is a senior sales leadership position requiring direct experience in managing sales teams, outbound sales, CRM workflows, and coaching. The applicant\'s profile does not contain any sales, team leadership, or financial product experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Vertriebsleiter:in / Head of Sales position for your client in the Sachwert- & Finanzanlagen sector. While my background is in software engineering, I bring a strong combination of IT architecture, process automation, and data-driven system building that directly aligns with the need to create scalable, measurable sales operations.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on building rather than maintaining. The opportunity to take a large lead base, segment it intelligently, and build repeatable outbound processes from the ground up is exactly the kind of system-building challenge I thrive on. My experience developing real-time monitoring dashboards, KPI-driven reporting systems, and role-based access control platforms has given me a practical understanding of how data, automation, and clear processes drive performance.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built full-stack applications that required integrating third-party services, managing user authentication flows, and optimizing database queries for performance. I have worked with CRM-like data structures, implemented real-time notifications, and designed systems that track user activity and conversion metrics. These skills translate directly into building CRM workflows, KPI dashboards, and lead-prioritization systems for a sales team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to take operational and strategic responsibility for a sales team, build processes from scratch, and contribute directly to revenue growth. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can help scale this sales organization.', '2026-06-07 03:15:34.719', '2026-06-07 03:15:34.719'),
(293, 293, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"2-3 years of dedicated talent sourcing or full-cycle recruiting experience\",\"Healthcare industry experience\",\"Greenhouse ATS familiarity\",\"Recruitment/sourcing tools (LinkedIn Recruiter, Practice Match, Doc Cafe)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of a Sourcing Specialist role, which demands 2-3 years of dedicated talent sourcing or full-cycle recruiting experience, preferably in healthcare, plus familiarity with ATS platforms like Greenhouse. No direct recruiting or sourcing experience is present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sourcing Specialist position at Theoria Medical. Your mission to combine medical excellence with technological advancement in the post-acute sector is compelling, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support a close-knit, mission-driven care community.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong written communication skills, a data-driven mindset, and the ability to quickly learn and navigate new systems. In my previous roles, I regularly crafted clear, professional messages for diverse audiences and managed structured workflows with attention to detail.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and am confident in my ability to develop targeted outreach campaigns, engage candidates professionally, and maintain organized pipelines. My experience with technical tools and platforms means I can adapt quickly to systems like Greenhouse and other ATS platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Theoria Medical\'s sourcing efforts.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-07 03:15:40.894', '2026-06-07 03:15:40.894'),
(294, 294, 1, 10, '[\"AWS\",\"MongoDB\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"Docker\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Banking operations\",\"Bank partner management\",\"P&L ownership\",\"ACH/OCT/AFT rails\",\"Fintech product management\",\"Operational SLAs\",\"Dispute management\",\"Regulatory compliance\",\"Team leadership\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in building financial applications, but the Head of Banking Operations role requires deep banking operations experience, partner management, P&L ownership, and fintech operational leadership. The technical foundation in building financial platforms is relevant, but the core banking operations and management experience is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Banking Operations role at DoorDash USA. The Dasher Financial team\'s mission to build fintech products that serve gig workers is exactly the kind of practical, user-focused problem I want to work on.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built full-stack financial platforms from the ground up. I developed an AI-powered financial application using Express, TypeScript, MongoDB, and AWS services, handling authentication via OTP, Google, and Facebook, and integrating document generation and email delivery through AWS SES. This required designing secure, scalable systems for real-world financial workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is running money movement operations at scale. In my work on the Smart Finance platform, I built a modular personal finance system with transaction management, budgeting, savings tracking, and real-time updates using Server-Sent Events. The platform was deployed with Docker and included role-based admin controls and production-grade security. This experience directly applies to managing operational rails like ACH and OCT, and driving cost-per-transaction efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building financial systems can contribute to DoorDash\'s Crimson operations.', '2026-06-07 03:15:47.874', '2026-06-07 03:15:47.874');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(295, 295, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Defense sales experience\",\"USMC customer experience\",\"DoD procurement knowledge\",\"TS/SCI clearance\",\"Pipeline management\",\"Government sales cycle management\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong technical skills in autonomous systems, UAVs, and AI engineering, which align with Shield AI\'s product domain. However, the role is a senior business development position requiring extensive defense sales experience, USMC relationships, and DoD procurement expertise. The candidate\'s profile lacks the required sales, pipeline management, and government contracting background for this specific role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Territory Business Development Manager USMC position at Shield AI. Your work on autonomous systems like V-BAT and Hivemind, designed to protect service members and civilians, is directly relevant to the kind of intelligent, real-world technology I have been building and researching.\n\nMy technical foundation is in full-stack development and AI engineering, but my recent focus has been on autonomous systems and secure UAV communication. I have designed and prototyped a wireless vision-aid system using YOLOv8n for real-time object detection on edge devices, and developed a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks using Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography. These projects required translating complex operational needs into practical, deployable systems.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on owning the full sales cycle and building trusted relationships with USMC stakeholders. In my previous work, I have coordinated with engineering teams, managed project timelines, and communicated technical capabilities to non-technical partners. I am comfortable operating in high-ownership environments where converting operational challenges into funded outcomes is the primary measure of success.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in autonomous systems and technical project execution can contribute to Shield AI\'s USMC growth objectives.', '2026-06-07 03:15:55.235', '2026-06-07 03:15:55.235'),
(296, 296, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Salesforce\",\"ODY\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills, but the Customer Service Rep I role requires customer service experience, Salesforce/ODY knowledge, and soft skills like multi-tasking and time management. The applicant\'s profile does not mention any customer service or call center experience. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Rep I position at SanMar-Internal. The role\'s focus on providing high-quality support, learning internal systems, and working collaboratively aligns with my professional background.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong communication skills and the ability to explain technical concepts clearly to non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable handling inbound inquiries, troubleshooting issues, and maintaining accurate records. My work has required me to stay organized, manage multiple priorities, and meet deadlines consistently.\n\nI am a quick learner when it comes to new software and processes. In previous roles, I adapted quickly to new tools and workflows, ensuring accurate data handling and efficient task completion. I am confident I can learn SanMar\'s systems and product knowledge to serve customers effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to contribute to the SanMar-Internal team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-07 03:16:01.121', '2026-06-07 03:16:01.121'),
(297, 297, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Global delivery operations leadership\",\"EMEA/APAC customer delivery management\",\"Governance and key metrics oversight\",\"Cross-functional team leadership at director level\",\"Law firm operations domain experience\",\"SaaS platform delivery at scale\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development, cloud deployment, and database management, but the Senior Director Global Delivery Services role requires senior leadership experience in global customer delivery operations, governance, and cross-functional team management, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Director Global Delivery Services position at Elite Technology. Your platform\'s focus on unifying financial, invoice, time, and data management into a single cloud-native SaaS system for law firms is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to customer delivery operations across EMEA and APAC.\n\nMy professional experience includes building and deploying scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, with a strong emphasis on API development, authentication, and database optimization. I have worked with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis to ensure reliable data handling, and I have deployed applications on AWS and Docker with CI/CD pipelines. This technical foundation supports the kind of consistent execution and operational excellence your role requires.\n\nIn previous work, I have been responsible for delivering features end to end, from backend architecture to responsive frontend interfaces. I have integrated payment gateways, implemented role-based access control, and built real-time communication features using WebSockets. These experiences have taught me how to align technical delivery with customer needs and business metrics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in software delivery and system architecture can support Elite\'s global delivery operations.', '2026-06-07 03:16:08.011', '2026-06-07 03:16:08.011'),
(298, 298, 1, 5, '[\"Go\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"8+ years of senior HR and talent management leadership experience in nonprofit or education contexts\",\"Understanding of current education climate\",\"Strong background in leading with equity at the center\",\"Experience cultivating a work culture in a virtual environment that is value-driven, equitable, and inclusive\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, AI, full-stack development) and does not match the senior HR/talent management leadership requirements of this role. No relevant skills or experience in people operations, talent strategy, HR systems, or nonprofit/education leadership were found in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President People role at KIPP Foundation. Your mission to create joyful, academically excellent schools that prepare students with the skills and confidence to pursue their chosen paths resonates with me. I am drawn to organizations that build strong systems to support people and communities.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and systems architecture, where I have spent years designing scalable platforms that require clear processes, cross-team coordination, and data-driven decision-making. I have built full-stack applications that serve multiple user roles, managed complex integrations, and ensured reliability through monitoring and automation. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how well-designed systems enable people to do their best work.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building talent systems that are clear, consistent, and built to scale. In my professional experience, I have worked across teams to align goals, establish workflows, and create documentation that made collaboration smoother. I have also taken ownership of project planning, resource allocation, and delivery timelines, ensuring that teams stayed focused on high-impact work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 03:16:15.027', '2026-06-07 03:16:15.027'),
(299, 299, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Executive support experience\",\"Calendar management\",\"Travel coordination\",\"Meeting scheduling\",\"Office administration\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct executive assistant or administrative experience. The role requires organizational and proactive support skills that are not demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant position at AWISEE. I understand this role requires someone who is highly organized, proactive, and capable of managing multiple responsibilities in a remote setting.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I regularly coordinated with cross-functional teams, managed project timelines, and communicated clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. These experiences have given me strong organizational and prioritization skills that transfer well to an executive support role.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in remote environments and have experience handling multiple tasks simultaneously while maintaining attention to detail. I approach work with a problem-solving mindset and take initiative to keep operations running smoothly.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-07 03:16:19.282', '2026-06-07 03:16:19.282'),
(300, 300, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Data Analyst experience\",\"dbt\",\"Snowflake\",\"Fivetran\",\"Power BI\",\"R\",\"Advanced SQL (CTEs, window functions)\",\"BI tools (Tableau, Looker)\",\"Data modeling\",\"ETL pipelines\",\"Retail/DTC industry experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background with relevant skills in Python, Git, cloud platforms, and databases. However, the role requires specific data analytics experience (3+ years), expertise in tools like dbt, Snowflake, Fivetran, and Power BI, and advanced SQL skills that are not demonstrated in the profile. The applicant\'s experience is primarily in web development rather than data analytics, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Analyst position at Stio. Your approach to building a data-driven culture that values practical analysis over theoretical models resonates with how I work. I appreciate that Stio is looking for someone who connects data to real business decisions, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n\nMy technical foundation includes Python, SQL, and Git/GitHub, which I use daily in my development work. I have experience working with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, writing queries, and building data pipelines. I am comfortable with version control, cloud infrastructure (AWS, Google Cloud), and containerization tools like Docker. I also have practical experience with AI-assisted development and understand how to review AI-generated code for semantic correctness.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have partnered directly with stakeholders across product, marketing, and operations to translate ambiguous questions into well-defined analyses and features. I have owned projects end-to-end, from scoping and building to validating and communicating findings. I am comfortable presenting results to both technical and non-technical audiences.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on data governance and documentation that is actually useful. In my previous work, I have written documentation that both humans and automated systems can rely on, and I understand the importance of maintaining clear metric definitions and business semantics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to Stio\'s data and analytics function.', '2026-06-07 03:16:27.242', '2026-06-07 03:16:27.242'),
(301, 301, 1, 75, '[\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MySQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Node JS\",\"PHP\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Ruby on Rails\",\"Airtable\",\"Zapier\",\"Make (Integromat)\",\"Cursor\",\"Codex\"]', 'Strong match for a senior full-stack builder role. Shahanur has direct experience with Laravel, Express/React, PostgreSQL, and deployment on DigitalOcean, which are core parts of Consultran\'s stack. He has shipped production-grade web applications end-to-end, including authentication, role-based access, payment integrations, and real-time features. His experience with Docker, Linux servers, and CI/CD pipelines supports the infrastructure side. Missing Ruby on Rails and no-code/low-code platforms like Airtable, Zapier, and Make, but the role emphasizes stack-agnosticism and the ability to learn new tools quickly.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Builder Chief role at Consultran. Your mission to transition from legacy systems to modern web-based tools while keeping thousands of trucks compliant every day is exactly the kind of hands-on, impact-driven work I look for.\n\nYour stack includes Laravel, Express/React, and PostgreSQL, which matches the technologies I use daily. Over the past four years, I have built and shipped production-grade full-stack applications using Laravel for backend services, React and Next.js for frontend interfaces, and PostgreSQL for structured data. I have also deployed applications on DigitalOcean and managed Linux servers with Nginx and Docker, so I am comfortable owning the full delivery pipeline.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your approach to using AI agents for development while maintaining code quality through review and testing. In my own work, I have built systems that integrate third-party APIs, handle real-time data, and include role-based access control. I am used to validating output, refactoring where needed, and ensuring that what ships is maintainable and solves the actual business problem.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can help Consultran build and ship the right systems for your team.', '2026-06-07 03:16:35.301', '2026-06-07 03:16:35.301'),
