(311, 311, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Web design experience (via full-stack projects)\"]', '[\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Print design experience\",\"Data visualization (charts, infographics)\",\"Long-form document/publication layout\",\"Video editing\",\"3+ years of graphic design experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong web development and UI design skills using Figma, Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, and MaterialUI. However, the role requires proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, InDesign, Photoshop), print design, data visualization, and long-form publication layout, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low for this specific graphic design role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Designer contract position at PowerLines. Your mission to modernize the utility regulatory system and make complex energy policy accessible to everyday consumers is both timely and important. I am interested in contributing my design and communication skills to support your public engagement efforts.\n\nWhile my professional background is rooted in software engineering and full-stack development, I have consistently worked at the intersection of design and technology. Through my experience building web applications, I have developed a strong eye for layout, typography, color, and visual hierarchy. I have used tools like Figma, Tailwind CSS, and MaterialUI to design and implement responsive interfaces, web graphics, and data-driven dashboards that prioritize clarity and usability.\n\nOne area where my experience aligns with this role is in translating complex information into clear visual formats. I have designed and built interfaces for financial platforms, real estate systems, and server monitoring dashboards that required presenting data, metrics, and workflows in an intuitive and engaging way. I am comfortable working with multi-page layouts, creating templates, and maintaining consistent brand identity across digital materials.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am organized, adaptable, and comfortable managing multiple projects with shifting deadlines.\n\nI am available for 20-30 hours per week on a contract basis and am open to discussing compensation structure. I have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nSTEADFASTNESS', '2026-06-07 03:17:38.214', '2026-06-07 03:17:38.214'),
(312, 312, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"10+ years of K12 edtech sales experience\",\"Enterprise sales to senior district leadership\",\"Consultative selling and procurement navigation\",\"Demand creation campaign execution\",\"Territory management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no K12 sales, enterprise sales, or educational leadership experience. The role requires 10+ years of proven success selling high-value edtech solutions to senior district leadership, which is not reflected in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Executive Director K12 Academic Partnerships role at Dreamscape Learn. Your approach to immersive, VR-enabled learning experiences that place students at the center of their own educational journey is a compelling vision for transforming STEM education.\n\nMy professional experience has been rooted in building full-stack web applications and AI-powered platforms, which has given me a strong understanding of how technology products are architected, deployed, and scaled. I have worked directly with stakeholders to translate business requirements into technical solutions, and I am comfortable communicating across technical and non-technical audiences.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of bringing innovative edtech solutions into complex institutional environments. Through my work developing platforms for travel agencies, real estate, and financial services, I have learned how to navigate multi-stakeholder requirements and align product capabilities with real-world operational needs. I understand that selling to school districts requires building trust, demonstrating measurable impact, and tailoring messaging to the priorities of superintendents and curriculum leaders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in technology and systems thinking could contribute to Dreamscape Learn\'s K12 growth strategy.', '2026-06-07 03:17:44.086', '2026-06-07 03:17:44.086'),
(313, 313, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Enterprise sales experience\",\"K12 education sales\",\"Executive-level relationship building\",\"Territory management\",\"Lead generation campaign execution\",\"10+ years of edtech sales experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, AI, and autonomous systems. However, this role is an enterprise sales leadership position requiring 10+ years of direct K12 edtech sales experience, executive-level relationship building, and territory management. The applicant\'s profile does not contain any sales, business development, or K12 education experience, resulting in a very low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Director K12 Academic Partnerships role at Dreamscape Learn. Your mission to transform STEM education through immersive, VR-enabled learning experiences is genuinely compelling, and I am interested in contributing to your K12 growth strategy.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI engineering, where I have built scalable platforms and integrated intelligent systems for real-world use. I have experience working across multidisciplinary teams, communicating with both technical and non-technical stakeholders, and aligning product direction with market needs.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated closely with internal teams and clients to deliver end-to-end solutions. I am accustomed to understanding complex requirements, building stakeholder alignment, and ensuring that technical execution supports broader business objectives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-07 03:17:49.479', '2026-06-07 03:17:49.479');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(314, 314, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience (B2C)\",\"CRM tools experience\",\"Google Workspace proficiency\",\"Office suite proficiency\",\"Phone support experience\",\"Shift availability\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct customer service experience. While the applicant has strong written communication skills and experience with structured workflows, the role requires specific B2C customer service experience, CRM tool proficiency, and phone support skills that are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Specialist position at albo. Your mission to provide financial freedom to individuals and small businesses through accessible fintech products is something I find genuinely meaningful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to that goal.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, my work has consistently required strong written communication, attention to detail, and a structured approach to problem-solving. I have experience managing client-facing interactions, documenting processes clearly, and ensuring that requests are followed through to completion. These skills align directly with the responsibilities outlined for this role.\n\nIn my previous roles, I worked closely with internal teams and external stakeholders, handling inquiries, tracking cases, and maintaining clear communication across different channels. I am comfortable using CRM tools, Google Workspace, and Office applications to organize information and ensure nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and I am comfortable collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am also available to work rotating shifts and weekends as needed.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-07 03:17:55.944', '2026-06-07 03:17:55.944'),
(315, 315, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"DATEV experience\",\"Fluency in German (required)\",\"Customer support experience\",\"Accounting/finance domain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and problem-solving skills but lacks the mandatory DATEV experience, fluency in German, and direct customer support background required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kundensupport / Onboarding position at pathway solutions GmbH. Your mission to automate accounting processes for e-commerce businesses and startups is a compelling one, and I am interested in contributing to your team\'s success.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving abilities through years of building and maintaining complex systems. I am skilled at identifying recurring issues, improving workflows, and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. These skills translate directly into providing effective customer support and ensuring a smooth onboarding experience.\n\nI am fluent in English and have working knowledge of German, which allows me to communicate comfortably with your clients. I am also comfortable working remotely, managing my time independently, and collaborating with teams across different functions. I am genuinely interested in the digitalization of the accounting industry and eager to learn more about DATEV and your platform.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to pathway solutions.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 15:14:36.646', '2026-06-07 15:14:36.646'),
(316, 316, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Meta Ads Expertise\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"TikTok Ads\",\"Customer Communication\",\"Campaign Optimization\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the job requires deep expertise in Meta Ads, performance marketing, and client management. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Paid Ads - Online Werbung auf Facebook / Instagram position at Hommel Hired. VOGGSMEDIA\'s focus on measurable growth and data-driven performance marketing aligns with my experience building systems that track, analyze, and optimize outcomes.\n\nMy technical background is in full-stack development and AI engineering, with a strong emphasis on data analysis, automation, and performance monitoring. I have built real-time server health dashboards that stream live metrics using Socket.IO, and developed AI-powered applications that process user data to generate actionable insights. These projects required continuous performance analysis and proactive optimization.\n\nIn previous work, I developed a real-time server monitoring system that tracked availability, latency, and system health across multiple endpoints. This involved building a dashboard that pushed live data to users, enabling immediate identification of issues and data-driven decision-making. I also integrated third-party APIs and automated workflows to improve efficiency and reduce manual effort.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to VOGGSMEDIA\'s continued success.', '2026-06-07 15:14:43.829', '2026-06-07 15:14:43.829'),
(317, 317, 1, 78, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Python\",\"Figma\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Vue JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"API\",\"REST API\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\"]', '[\"Astro\",\"Svelte\",\"Shopware 6\",\"WordPress\",\"TYPO3\",\"SEO/SEA/GEO expertise\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Canva\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'Strong match for web development and AI-assisted implementation. The applicant has solid experience with React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, Git, Docker, and Python — all core technologies mentioned in the job description. Experience with AI tools for prototyping and automation is also relevant. Key gaps include Astro, Svelte, specific CMS platforms (Shopware, WordPress, TYPO3), and German language proficiency, which is explicitly required for client communication and content creation.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Web- & KI-Umsetzer:in role at plehn media. The combination of web development, AI-assisted prototyping, and conversion-focused design makes this position a strong match for my experience and working style.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development with React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Laravel, complemented by practical use of Python for scripting, automation, and API integrations. I regularly use AI tools like ChatGPT to accelerate development, generate content, and build small internal tools. This aligns directly with your need for someone who can build landing pages, optimize product pages, and implement AI-supported workflows.\n\nIn previous professional work as a Web Developer, I built and maintained scalable web applications, integrated RESTful APIs, implemented role-based authentication, and optimized database performance. I also created responsive, SEO-friendly UIs and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I am comfortable working across the full stack and taking ownership of features from concept to deployment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the blend of design and conversion. I have experience evaluating UI layouts, improving user flows, and building interfaces that drive measurable results. I also have hands-on experience with Figma for design collaboration and Git for clean version control.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to plehn media\'s projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 15:14:53.498', '2026-06-07 15:14:53.498'),
(318, 318, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Adobe Photoshop/Illustrator\",\"Shopify\",\"Canva\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant design tools (Figma, CSS, Bootstrap, Tailwind) but lacks core graphic design tools like Adobe Photoshop/Illustrator, Canva, and Shopify experience. German language skills are also missing. The role is primarily graphic design focused, while the applicant\'s background is in full-stack web development and AI engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Graphic Designer position at nuvallo. Your focus on developing functional, study-based joint snacks for horses and building a strong online shop presence caught my attention. I appreciate the opportunity to contribute to a growing brand that values both design quality and authentic customer connection.\n\nThrough my work in web development and UI design, I have developed a practical understanding of visual design principles and user-centered layouts. I am comfortable working with Figma to create mockups, banners, and product visuals, and I have experience translating design concepts into responsive interfaces using Tailwind CSS and Bootstrap. I enjoy the process of shaping a consistent visual language that resonates with a specific audience.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is maintaining and evolving a brand\'s visual identity across different touchpoints. In previous projects, I worked on designing and updating product pages, landing pages, and promotional banners. I am familiar with the importance of clean, modern aesthetics and ensuring that every visual element supports the brand\'s message. I am also comfortable making small layout and template adjustments to keep the shop looking polished and up to date.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio samples for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my design and technical background can support nuvallo\'s continued growth.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-07 15:15:01.393', '2026-06-07 15:15:01.393'),
(319, 319, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\"]', '[\"Loxone\",\"Gebäudeautomation\",\"Elektrotechnik\",\"Energiemanagement\",\"Photovoltaik\",\"Wärmepumpen\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering and automation background, with skills in C++, Python, Linux, Docker, and system integration. However, the role requires specific experience with Loxone building automation systems and energy management components (photovoltaics, heat pumps), which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s general automation and problem-solving skills are relevant, but the domain-specific knowledge is missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Loxone Programmierer / Gebäudeautomatisierer position at Enerdies Energieberatung. Your work on intelligent energy management systems for hotels is a compelling application of automation technology, and I am keen to contribute to your team.\n\nThrough my academic background in software engineering and hands-on project work, I have developed a solid foundation in building automated systems that integrate hardware and software. My experience includes developing a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that streams live metrics using Socket.IO, and an AI-powered financial application that automates workflows through API integration and cloud services. These projects required structured problem-solving, system integration, and independent technical decision-making.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of diverse technical components into a unified automated system. In my project work, I have connected sensors, cloud APIs, and real-time data pipelines to create responsive and reliable systems. This experience directly translates to programming and configuring automation servers, integrating energy components like photovoltaic systems and heat pumps, and optimizing system performance through testing and iteration.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my technical skills and enthusiasm for automation to Enerdies Energieberatung. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 15:15:09.445', '2026-06-07 15:15:09.445'),
(320, 320, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"tax accounting\",\"financial statement preparation\",\"tax law knowledge\",\"client advisory experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no matching qualifications for this tax advisor role. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and experience in tax consulting, financial statements, and tax law. The applicant\'s skills in web development and AI engineering do not align with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for your partner firm in Krumbach. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong technical skills that support a modern, digital, and efficient working style.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I am comfortable with Linux servers, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, and I have experience implementing secure authentication systems and role-based access control. These skills align well with your emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment.\n\nIn previous work, I developed a full-stack multi-vendor e-commerce platform that connected customers, sellers, and logistics teams within a unified system. This required careful attention to data integrity, secure transactions, and clear communication between different stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am open to flexible working arrangements and value a strong team environment. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background could contribute to your partner firm in Krumbach.', '2026-06-07 15:15:16.760', '2026-06-07 15:15:16.760'),
(321, 321, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax consultant exam)\",\"Tax accounting experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Knowledge of German tax law\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in tax consulting, tax law, or accounting. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and experience with financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no domain overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Dachau. I understand you are looking for someone with a communicative nature, careful working style, openness to digital processes, and a completed tax consultant exam. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax advisory, I bring strong analytical discipline, structured problem-solving, and a commitment to precision that I believe would serve well in this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and software engineer, I have developed a methodical approach to handling complex, multi-step processes. I am comfortable working with detailed regulations, verifying data accuracy, and maintaining thorough documentation. I am also open to digital workflows and modern tools, which aligns with the firm\'s emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in discussing how my analytical skills and careful work ethic could contribute to your partner firm in Dachau. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to speak further.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-07 15:15:23.629', '2026-06-07 15:15:23.629'),
(322, 322, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with a completed tax advisory exam. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s technical profile and the job requirements. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. I understand you are looking for a qualified tax consultant for a partner firm in Heimsheim, and while my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong technical skills that align with the digital and modern working environment you offer.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed a thorough understanding of building secure, scalable systems. I am comfortable with digital tools, automation, and data integrity, which are increasingly important in modern tax consulting practices. My experience with Linux, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines has given me a practical approach to maintaining reliable and efficient digital workflows.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have worked with sensitive data, implemented role-based access control, and built systems that require precision and attention to detail. I am accustomed to working independently and taking ownership of tasks, which aligns with the optional team leadership and personal responsibility mentioned in the job description.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and digital workflow expertise could contribute to your partner firm in Heimsheim.', '2026-06-07 15:15:30.593', '2026-06-07 15:15:30.593'),
(323, 323, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (transformation tax law)\",\"Führungsverständnis (leadership understanding)\",\"German language proficiency (implied)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications, experience, or German language skills mentioned in the profile. The job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with expertise in German tax law, financial statement preparation, and client advisory. The match score is very low (10/100) due to a complete domain mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a methodical approach to complex data, and a genuine openness to digital workflows that align with the modern, tech-forward environment you describe.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. These systems required careful attention to data integrity, secure role-based access, and accurate reporting. I am comfortable working with structured financial data, automating repetitive tasks, and ensuring that systems operate reliably under real-world conditions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment. I have hands-on experience deploying applications on Linux servers, managing databases, and integrating third-party services. I am confident I can adapt quickly to the specific tax software and digital tools used in your partner firm.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm in Bad Friedrichshall.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-07 15:15:39.455', '2026-06-07 15:15:39.455'),
(324, 324, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with a completed tax consultancy exam. There is no skill overlap. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for the partner firm in Plessa. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong orientation toward digital workflows, precise data handling, and structured problem-solving that aligns well with the requirements of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed and maintained complex systems that require careful attention to accuracy, security, and efficiency. I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and platforms, and I enjoy optimizing processes to reduce manual effort and improve reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support the digital transformation of tax advisory services. I have hands-on experience with automation, data integration, and secure system architecture, which could contribute to streamlining annual financial statement preparation, tax return processing, and audit support workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, digital fluency, and commitment to quality would make me a valuable addition to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the success of your partner firm in Plessa.', '2026-06-07 15:15:46.587', '2026-06-07 15:15:46.587'),
(325, 325, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"tax accounting experience\",\"German language proficiency (implied)\",\"knowledge of German tax law\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, and tax declarations. There is no meaningful skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Landau. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in analytical problem-solving, structured data management, and digital process optimization that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and software engineer, I have developed a meticulous approach to handling complex systems, ensuring accuracy, efficiency, and reliability. I have experience building and maintaining applications that manage sensitive financial data, implement role-based access control, and automate workflows. This has given me a disciplined mindset for working with structured information, reviewing outputs for correctness, and maintaining high standards of quality.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital workflows and modern tools in your partner firm. I have worked extensively with digital platforms, cloud infrastructure, and automation tools, and I am comfortable adapting to new technologies quickly. I am also experienced in working collaboratively within teams and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and digital fluency could contribute to your partner firm in Landau.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-07 15:15:54.522', '2026-06-07 15:15:54.522'),
(326, 326, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"tax consulting experience\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development skills, but the job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with a completed tax consultancy exam and experience in tax-related tasks. There is no overlap in required qualifications or domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for their partner firm in Ahrensburg. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in building digital platforms and automating workflows that could support the digital transformation goals of your partner firm.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways. I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and cloud infrastructure, including Docker, Nginx, and AWS.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment in your partner firm. I have experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with CI/CD pipelines, and I have worked with real-time features using WebSockets. I am confident I could contribute to streamlining digital workflows and improving operational efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm\'s success. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-07 15:16:01.914', '2026-06-07 15:16:01.914'),
(327, 327, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Consultant Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (Tax Declaration Preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (Tax Audit Support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\",\"Führungsverständnis (Leadership Understanding)\",\"German language fluency (implied)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications, experience, or certifications. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in German tax law, financial statements, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a structured approach to complex problem-solving, and a proven ability to work with precision and accountability.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed systems that require careful data handling, process automation, and rigorous attention to detail. These skills are directly relevant to preparing annual financial statements, tax declarations, and supporting tax audits. I am comfortable working with complex regulations and translating them into reliable, repeatable workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with digital processes and modern tools in a tax advisory context. I have experience building and maintaining secure, data-driven platforms, and I am confident in my ability to adapt quickly to the specific software and methodologies used in tax consulting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and approach could contribute to your partner firm in Steyerberg.', '2026-06-07 15:16:09.512', '2026-06-07 15:16:09.512'),
(328, 328, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\",\"Jest\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"CRM tools (Zendesk, Gorgias, Salesforce, HubSpot)\",\"Spanish language\",\"E-commerce or retail experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this customer service role, which demands 2-3 years of customer service experience, CRM tool proficiency, and Spanish fluency. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service role at Singularu. Your focus on making every client feel special and supported resonates with how I approach working with people.\n\nThrough my experience as a web developer, I have worked closely with clients and stakeholders to understand their needs, resolve issues, and deliver solutions that meet their expectations. This has given me strong communication skills and the ability to handle inquiries clearly and empathetically.\n\nI am comfortable working in digital environments and using various tools to manage tasks and track interactions. I am organized, proactive, and enjoy collaborating with teams to improve processes and ensure a positive experience for everyone involved.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Singularu team.', '2026-06-07 15:16:14.737', '2026-06-07 15:16:14.737'),
(329, 329, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Content creation\",\"Video editing\",\"Graphic design\",\"Copywriting\",\"Pizza industry knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong web development skills but limited direct experience in social media content creation. While they have relevant technical skills like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Figma, the role requires content creation expertise that is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Content Creator position at FuseGlobal. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a combination of technical skills and creative thinking that can support content creation in the pizza industry.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained web applications using React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS. I am comfortable with design tools like Figma and understand how to create visually consistent and user-friendly interfaces. These skills translate directly into creating engaging social media content that is both technically sound and visually appealing.\n\nIn previous projects, I have worked with multimedia content, including integrating Google Maps, image processing APIs, and responsive layouts. I am also experienced in working remotely and communicating clearly across teams, which is essential for a remote content creator role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-07 15:16:21.023', '2026-06-07 15:16:21.023'),
(330, 330, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Behavioral health coordination\",\"Medical scheduling\",\"Healthcare experience\",\"Patient care coordination\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not directly match the Behavioral Health Care Coordinator Scheduler role at Ennoble Care. No direct healthcare coordination or scheduling experience is present in the profile. However, the applicant demonstrates strong organizational, communication, and remote collaboration skills that could be transferable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Behavioral Health Care Coordinator Scheduler position at Ennoble Care. Your organization\'s focus on mobile primary care, palliative care, and hospice services is meaningful work that requires careful coordination and genuine attention to patient needs.\n\nThrough my experience as a web developer working remotely with teams across different time zones, I have developed strong organizational and scheduling skills. I regularly coordinated project timelines, managed task priorities, and ensured clear communication between developers, stakeholders, and clients. These responsibilities required the same attention to detail and follow-through that care coordination demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my ability to organize complex workflows, communicate clearly, and work independently in a remote setting would allow me to contribute positively to your scheduling and coordination operations.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Ennoble Care\'s mission.', '2026-06-07 15:16:27.395', '2026-06-07 15:16:27.395'),
(331, 331, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Financial management\",\"Executive leadership\",\"Accounting\",\"Strategic planning\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct CFO or executive financial management experience. The role requires executive leadership and financial expertise, which are not present in the profile. Minimal match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Financial Officer position at ThisWay Global. While my background is in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring a strong analytical mindset, experience with financial systems, and a track record of building secure, scalable platforms that support business operations.\n\nThrough my professional work, I have developed and deployed applications that handle payments, user authentication, role-based access, and real-time data processing. These systems required careful attention to accuracy, security, and performance—qualities that are equally important in financial management and executive decision-making.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and finance. I have built AI-powered financial applications that automate data processing, generate reports, and integrate with third-party services. This experience has given me practical insight into how financial workflows can be streamlined and made more reliable through technology.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-07 15:16:33.280', '2026-06-07 15:16:33.280'),
(332, 332, 1, 25, '[\"Good team worker\",\"Good communication in Local/Hindi/English language\"]', '[\"High organizational commitment\",\"Preferably knows basic Computers\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant soft skills like teamwork and multilingual communication, but lacks the required hub background experience, local geography knowledge, and explicit organizational commitment mentioned in the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Staff position at Blue Dart. The role requires a dependable team player with strong organizational commitment and practical computer skills, which align well with my background.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed a disciplined approach to task management, documentation, and coordination. Working across remote and onsite teams has strengthened my ability to follow processes, meet deadlines, and communicate clearly with colleagues and stakeholders.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Hindi and Russian. This allows me to communicate effectively with diverse teams and local communities, which I understand is important for this role.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Blue Dart team.', '2026-06-07 15:16:38.022', '2026-06-07 15:16:38.022'),
(333, 333, 1, 15, '[\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Non-profit leadership experience\",\"10+ years leadership experience\",\"5+ years people management\",\"Bachelor\'s in Business Administration\",\"MBA/MA/JD\",\"HR management experience\",\"Budget planning experience\",\"Board reporting experience\",\"Salesforce experience\",\"Animal law knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technology operations skills (Docker, AWS, Linux, CI/CD, monitoring tools). However, the role requires senior executive leadership experience in a non-profit setting, 10+ years of progressive leadership, people management, HR/operations oversight, and domain knowledge in animal law. The applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate the required leadership tenure, non-profit experience, or management of HR/operations teams. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Operating Officer position at Rose, Klein & Marias. While my professional background is in software engineering and technology operations, I bring a structured approach to managing infrastructure, optimizing workflows, and leading technical teams that aligns with the operational leadership this role requires.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have overseen the full lifecycle of web application delivery, from architecture design to deployment and monitoring. I have managed Linux servers, configured Nginx and Apache, set up Docker containers, and implemented CI/CD pipelines for reliable releases. I have also worked with monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to maintain system health and performance.\n\nA relevant example is the Real-Time Server Health Monitoring project I built, where I designed a full-stack dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker to track system metrics in real time. This project required coordinating between frontend and backend components, managing data flow, and ensuring the system remained responsive under load. It reflects the kind of cross-functional, operations-focused thinking that a COO role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my operational and technical background can contribute to the continued success of Rose, Klein & Marias.', '2026-06-07 15:16:46.788', '2026-06-07 15:16:46.788');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(334, 334, 1, 45, '[\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"OpenAI API\",\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Vision models\",\"LLM fine-tuning\",\"Document parsing pipelines\",\"OCR\",\"Heuristics for layout analysis\",\"Graph-to-table conversion\",\"Retrieval pipelines\",\"Metadata-based chunking\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack and AI integration skills, with experience in building web applications and integrating AI APIs. However, the job focuses on agentic document processing using vision models, LLMs, and custom heuristics for complex PDFs, which are not directly covered in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate, with potential for growth in document-specific AI workflows.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Reducto. Your approach to solving the unstructured data problem with vision models, LLMs, and layout-aware parsing is impressive. The fact that you have grown rapidly and serve leading AI teams tells me this is a place where engineering quality and real-world impact matter.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI integration. Over the past four years, I have built web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and I have worked with AI APIs including OpenAI and Replicate to add intelligent features to production systems. I am comfortable working across the stack, from designing RESTful APIs and managing MySQL databases to deploying on AWS and Docker.\n\nOne project that connects well with Reducto\'s work is an AI-powered real estate platform I developed. The system uses OpenAI assistants trained on custom datasets and Replicate API for image processing. It includes role-based authentication, subscription plans, Stripe payment integration, and cron job scheduling. This required integrating multiple AI services into a cohesive backend while keeping the user experience smooth.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I could contribute to Reducto\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-07 15:16:55.343', '2026-06-07 15:16:55.343'),
(335, 335, 1, 10, '[\"React\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Childcare experience (1+ year)\",\"CPR/First Aid certification\",\"California Trustline\",\"High School Diploma or GED\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is focused on software engineering and AI, with no childcare experience, certifications, or relevant background for a nanny position. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the FT PT Nanny position at Jovie. Your focus on meaningful connections, joyful moments, and supporting families in the Los Gatos community resonates with me. I value reliability, clear communication, and creating a positive environment for children.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have always enjoyed spending time with children and helping them learn and grow. I am comfortable assisting with homework up to 5th-grade Math and English, and I enjoy planning creative activities like arts and crafts, reading, and outdoor play. I understand the importance of being a dependable and engaging presence in a child\'s day.\n\nI meet the key requirements for this role: I am at least 18 years old, have a valid driver\'s license and reliable transportation, and am available at least three days per week between 7am and 7pm. I am committed to clear communication with parents and coworkers, and I take reliability seriously.\n\nIn addition to my childcare experience, I work effectively with people from diverse backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in team-oriented environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Jovie team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-07 15:17:02.320', '2026-06-07 15:17:02.320'),
(336, 336, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Performance Marketing\",\"Google Ads\",\"Social Media Marketing\",\"E-Mail-Marketing\",\"PR & Media Planning\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and data-driven skills, but lacks direct experience in performance marketing, Google Ads, social media marketing, and other core marketing tasks required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Junior) Performance Marketer position at BrainersHub GmbH. Your focus on healthcare innovation and digital marketing campaigns in the Pharma and Gesundheitsbereich is an area I find genuinely compelling, and I am eager to contribute to your team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and data-driven problem-solving skills. I have experience working with data, tracking metrics, and optimizing systems for performance. I am a quick learner who enjoys taking a hands-on approach to new challenges, and I am confident I can apply this mindset to performance marketing.\n\nIn my previous work, I have built and maintained web applications, integrated APIs, and managed deployments. This has given me a solid foundation in working with data, understanding user behavior, and optimizing digital processes. I am comfortable learning new platforms and tools, and I am eager to develop my skills in Google Ads, Meta, and LinkedIn campaign management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical thinking, learning ability, and hands-on mentality to BrainersHub GmbH. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-08 03:14:35.485', '2026-06-08 03:14:35.485'),
(337, 337, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Content creation\",\"Social media management\",\"Photo and video production\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Canva/Adobe/CapCut\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in press, content creation, or social media. The role requires skills in writing, content production, and media tools, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Studentische Hilfskraft im Bereich Presse & Content position at BELKAW GmbH. Your focus on authentic storytelling and making energy visible in the region caught my attention. I appreciate the opportunity to contribute to content that connects people with real projects and meaningful stories.\n\nAlthough my primary background is in software engineering, I have developed strong written communication skills through years of documenting technical systems, writing project descriptions, and preparing content for diverse audiences. I am comfortable working with MS Office and have practical experience with design tools like Canva and Figma, which I have used to create layouts and visual content. I also enjoy photography and video work as a personal interest, and I am eager to develop these skills further in a professional content environment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of on-site content production and editorial planning. I am comfortable working independently and in teams, and I am used to managing multiple tasks with attention to detail. I am confident I can support your press and content team with research, drafting, and content preparation while learning from experienced colleagues.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 03:14:42.769', '2026-06-08 03:14:42.769'),
(338, 338, 1, 35, '[\"API integrations\",\"Cross-functional collaboration\",\"Technical communication\",\"Project delivery\",\"E-commerce\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"REST APIs\",\"Authentication\",\"Role-based access control\"]', '[\"4+ years managing technical projects or solution delivery in consulting or high growth environment\",\"Spanish business fluency\",\"Pre-sales experience\",\"Experience with ground transportation or travel tech\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in API integrations, full-stack development, and cross-functional collaboration, but lacks direct experience in technical project management, pre-sales, and Spanish fluency. The role requires a senior project manager with 4+ years in consulting or high-growth environments, which is not clearly demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Senior Technical Project Manager, LatAm role at Distribusion Technologies. Your platform connects ground transportation operators with global retailers like Google and Booking.com, and I find the challenge of scaling API-driven B2B marketplace infrastructure across 70+ countries genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have spent over 4 years delivering full-stack applications and managing complex API integrations. I regularly navigate technical topics such as RESTful API design, architecture diagrams, authentication flows, and database optimization. Even when I am not writing code, I am confident translating technical complexity into clear, actionable plans for both engineering teams and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nOne area that directly aligns with this role is my experience leading cross-functional delivery of e-commerce and API-heavy projects. At Explo-IT, I built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control and secure payment gateways, and delivered real-time features using WebSockets. I also developed blueprint processes for standard product rollouts, ensuring consistency across deployments. This required close collaboration with product, engineering, and operations teams to capture market needs and align technical delivery with business goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in technical project delivery and API integrations can support Distribusion\'s growth in Latin America.', '2026-06-08 03:14:50.109', '2026-06-08 03:14:50.109'),
(339, 339, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Recruiting\",\"Talent Acquisition\",\"People Operations\",\"JOIN\",\"LinkedIn Recruiter\",\"ClickUP\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Personio\",\"HR processes\",\"Onboarding\",\"Interview coordination\",\"Active Sourcing\",\"Talent Pool Management\",\"Employment Contracts\",\"Internal Documentation\",\"People Routines\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and process-building skills, but lacks direct experience in recruiting, talent acquisition, people operations, and HR-specific tools. The match is low for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Hiring & Talent Manager position at Dreamlight Labs GmbH. Your focus on building structured hiring processes, onboarding systems, and people operations for a growing team resonates with how I approach my own work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years building systems from the ground up. In my role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for designing scalable architectures, managing project pipelines, coordinating with stakeholders, and ensuring that nothing fell through the cracks. This required strong organizational skills, clear communication, and the ability to build repeatable processes where none existed before.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Dreamlight Labs is the emphasis on moving from a fast-moving 20-person team to a professionally structured organization. I have experience working in growing teams and understand the importance of having clean recruiting workflows, structured onboarding, and well-maintained documentation. I am comfortable taking ownership of these areas and building systems that make hiring and people oper