(340, 340, 1, 55, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Studium (Wirtschaft, Wirtschaftsinformatik, Medien, Informatik o. ä.)\",\"Praktische Erfahrung mit KI-Tools (ChatGPT, Claude)\",\"No-Code/Automatisierung\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Markt- und Wettbewerbsanalysen\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and AI project experience, including building AI-powered applications with OpenAI and automation workflows. However, the role requires a current student status (laufendes Studium), very good German language skills, and specific experience with market analysis and business model validation, which are not present in the profile. The match is moderate, with the AI and prototyping skills being the strongest alignment.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikant/ Werkstudent: AI Geschäftsmodell Entwickler position at NextVision Media GmbH. The opportunity to work at the intersection of AI and digital media entrepreneurship, particularly within a venture building environment backed by experienced founders, is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built practical experience with AI tools and automation. I developed an AI-powered financial application that uses OpenAI\'s latest models for intelligent financial assistance, integrates AWS Transcribe for voice-to-text conversion, and automates PDF term sheet generation. I also built an AI-based real estate platform that uses the Replicate API for image processing and trained multiple AI assistants using GPT models. These projects required me to research available AI tools, evaluate their capabilities, and integrate them into working prototypes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building workflows and automations with LLMs and automation platforms. In my AI-powered real estate project, I implemented role-based authentication, subscription plans, Cron job scheduling, and Stripe payment integration alongside the AI features. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to combine AI capabilities with functional business logic to create testable, real-world applications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my hands-on approach and AI project experience to NextVision Media GmbH, researching and developing AI-driven business models that create real impact. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-08 03:15:05.685', '2026-06-08 03:15:05.685'),
(341, 341, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"7+ years of experience in operations, chief of staff, strategy, or healthcare administration\",\"Payer operations, Medicaid managed care, provider enrollment, or value-based contracting\",\"Managing or overseeing finance functions\",\"Overseeing HR services or people operations\",\"Navigating multi-state regulatory or licensing environments in healthcare\",\"Prior chief of staff experience at a startup, health tech, or mission-driven organization\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and project management skills, but lacks the 7+ years of operations, healthcare administration, finance, HR, and payer operations experience required for this Chief of Staff role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff role at Malama Health. Your mission to redesign maternal care for underserved communities is both urgent and meaningful. What stands out to me is how Malama combines deep human presence with rigorous, data-driven outcomes. That blend of empathy and operational discipline is rare, and it is exactly the kind of environment where I do my best work.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering and systems design, but my day-to-day work has always been about operations. I have built and maintained full-stack applications, managed end-to-end project delivery, coordinated with cross-functional teams, and owned the processes that keep products running reliably in production. I am comfortable moving between high-level strategy and granular execution, and I know how to build systems that scale without creating unnecessary complexity.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is in building repeatable operational playbooks. In my previous work, I designed deployment pipelines, documented workflows, and created reusable architectures that made each subsequent project faster and more efficient. I see a direct parallel to the market activation and credentialing work Malama needs. I enjoy the challenge of taking a complex, multi-step process and turning it into something predictable and scalable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my operational mindset and systems-building experience can support Malama\'s growth during this pivotal stage.', '2026-06-08 03:15:13.543', '2026-06-08 03:15:13.543'),
(342, 342, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"PyTorch / JAX\",\"LLaMA\",\"Qwen\",\"vLLM\",\"Vector DB\",\"Model fine-tuning\",\"Inference serving\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has a strong software engineering foundation with hands-on experience integrating AI (OpenAI APIs) into production applications. He has built AI-powered features end-to-end using Python, LLM APIs, and cloud services. However, the role requires deeper ML-specific skills (PyTorch/JAX, model fine-tuning, inference serving, vector databases) that are not present in his profile. His experience is more applied-AI-integration than ML-model-training, making him a partial match for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Applied AI Engineer role at Bjak. The focus on building a proactive AI assistant that handles long-running workflows, persistent context, and real-world task completion aligns directly with the kind of engineering problems I enjoy solving.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built and shipped AI features end-to-end, from model selection to production deployment. I have worked with Python, OpenAI-style APIs, and vector databases to create intelligent systems that go beyond simple demos. One area I have focused on is turning raw model outputs into structured, reliable behaviors, designing prompts, tools, and agent workflows that perform consistently under real-world conditions.\n\nA relevant example is an AI-powered financial application I developed. The system uses OpenAI assistants trained on custom datasets, processes voice inputs through AWS Transcribe, and generates PDF term sheets automatically. I handled the full pipeline: API development with Express and TypeScript, integration with AWS services, and deployment on EC2 with Nginx. This required debugging across model behavior, orchestration, infrastructure, and user experience layers, exactly the kind of end-to-end ownership this role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in applied AI and systems engineering can contribute to Bjak\'s mission.', '2026-06-08 03:15:21.429', '2026-06-08 03:15:21.429'),
(343, 343, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"TypeScript\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"OpenAI API\",\"Express\",\"Node JS\",\"Javascript\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"7+ years of engineering experience\",\"production ML systems experience\",\"FastAPI/BentoML\",\"agent runtime frameworks (Vercel AI SDK, LangChain, LlamaIndex)\",\"production agent observability\",\"multi-tenant agent gating\",\"Databricks\",\"PySpark\",\"Terraform\"]', 'The applicant has foundational AI engineering skills (Python, TypeScript, AWS, Docker) and relevant project experience building AI-powered applications with OpenAI and real-time APIs. However, the role requires 7+ years of engineering experience with a proven track record in production ML systems, low-latency ML APIs, and agent infrastructure, which the applicant does not yet have. The match is partial but the applicant could grow into the role with mentorship.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior ML Engineer role at Clutch. Your focus on building production ML systems and AI agents that directly improve credit union member experiences is exactly the kind of applied AI work I want to be part of.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have more than one year of applied AI and machine learning experience, including building systems that integrate computer vision, natural language processing, and real-time data pipelines. I am comfortable working in Python for model training and evaluation, and I use TypeScript regularly for API and tool contract integration. I have hands-on experience with Docker, AWS, and GitHub-based workflows, which matches your production infrastructure requirements.\n\nA relevant example is the AI Powered Financial App, where I designed and built the backend using Express, TypeScript, OpenAI, and AWS. I implemented AI assistants trained on custom datasets, integrated voice-to-text via AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF term sheet generation and email delivery through AWS SES. The system handled authentication via OTP, Google, and Facebook, and managed real-time data from Google Sheets. This project required the same kind of tool-design discipline, structured error handling, and low-latency API thinking that you emphasize for your NBA engine and agent tool contracts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Clutch\'s production AI systems.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-08 03:15:29.536', '2026-06-08 03:15:29.536'),
(344, 344, 1, 15, '[\"Python\"]', '[\"Data annotation experience\",\"Labeling tools\",\"Quality assurance workflows\"]', 'The applicant has limited direct match with the Data Annotator role. While they have Python skills and some AI project experience involving datasets, the job description is sparse and does not specify required tools or responsibilities. The match is low due to lack of explicit annotation experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Annotator position at CodeGeniusRecruit. The role\'s focus on data processing and annotation aligns with my hands-on experience in AI-driven projects where data quality and accuracy are critical.\n\nThrough my project work, I have trained AI assistants using custom datasets and integrated image processing APIs, which required careful data preparation and labeling. This involved organizing raw data, ensuring consistency, and validating outputs to maintain model performance. I understand that reliable annotation directly impacts the quality of AI systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-08 03:15:34.392', '2026-06-08 03:15:34.392'),
