'2026-06-08 03:16:13.837', '2026-06-08 03:16:13.837'),
(352, 352, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Biotech leadership experience\",\"Capital raising / venture financing\",\"FDA botanical drug guidance knowledge\",\"CNS drug pipeline experience\",\"PhD or MD in life sciences\",\"MBA or business credential\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, AI systems, and infrastructure. However, the CEO role at Magdalena Biosciences requires deep biotech leadership experience, capital raising track record, FDA regulatory knowledge, and an advanced degree in life sciences or medicine. The applicant\'s profile does not match these core requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Executive Officer position at Magdalena Biosciences. Your mission to develop plant-derived, pharmaceutical-grade medicines for mental health disorders is ambitious and meaningful. I am drawn to the challenge of leading a seed-stage venture through pipeline development and Series A financing.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI systems, where I have built complex platforms from the ground up in lean, resource-constrained settings. I have experience designing scalable architectures, integrating AI capabilities, and delivering production-ready applications that serve real users. This requires the same strategic clarity, prioritization, and disciplined execution that early-stage biotech demands.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I delivered full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and cloud infrastructure. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, optimized database performance, and deployed systems on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I also led the development of an AI-powered financial application that integrated OpenAI, AWS services, and real-time data processing.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and healthcare. I have designed systems that handle sensitive data, require secure communication protocols, and must operate reliably under real-world conditions. These are the same principles that apply to building a validated clinical pipeline and managing vendor relationships in a biotech context.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 03:16:21.566', '2026-06-08 03:16:21.566');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(353, 353, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"German language proficiency\",\"Client support experience\",\"Data entry experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills but lacks the specific client support, data entry, and German language requirements emphasized in this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter (m/w/d) Kundenbetreuung & Datenerfassung position at Dein-Finanzmanagment. Your focus on helping individuals track expenses and identify savings opportunities aligns with my interest in building systems that bring clarity and structure to everyday processes.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a reliable and organized approach to managing data, maintaining records, and supporting client-facing operations. I am comfortable working with digital applications and databases, which allows me to handle data entry tasks accurately and efficiently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of structured data management with direct client support. In previous roles, I worked with client information systems, maintained accurate records, and supported appointment preparation and follow-up tasks. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how careful data handling and clear communication work together to support client relationships.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:14:36.240', '2026-06-08 15:14:36.240'),
(354, 354, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Einzelhandelsausbildung\",\"Führungserfahrung im Einzelhandel\",\"Getränkehandelserfahrung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no retail or beverage industry experience. The role requires retail management, team leadership, and merchandising skills which are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marktleitung (m/w/d) im Getränkehandel position at GPG Getränke GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong leadership, organizational, and communication skills that are directly applicable to managing a retail operation.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for leading the delivery of full-stack web applications. This involved coordinating with stakeholders, planning development sprints, managing timelines, and ensuring that each project was completed on schedule and to specification. I regularly took ownership of the full project lifecycle, from initial requirement gathering to deployment and post-launch support.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to lead a team and drive operational excellence. At Explo-IT, I worked closely with cross-functional teams, communicated technical decisions to non-technical stakeholders, and ensured smooth collaboration between developers, designers, and business leads. I am comfortable taking responsibility for outcomes, motivating team members, and maintaining high standards of quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my leadership experience, problem-solving mindset, and ability to manage complex workflows will allow me to contribute effectively as a Marktleitung. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team in Bochum.', '2026-06-08 15:14:43.520', '2026-06-08 15:14:43.520'),
(355, 355, 1, 25, '[\"MySQL\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\"]', '[\"3+ years of E-Commerce or Category Management experience\",\"Shopify or comparable shop system experience\",\"CRM experience\",\"Marketing experience\",\"Data analysis tools (e.g., Excel, Google Analytics)\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and e-commerce platform building (Laravel, MySQL, full-stack development), which provides a solid foundation for understanding e-commerce systems. However, the role is primarily a business and management position requiring 3+ years of direct E-Commerce Category Management experience, market analysis, and product strategy skills. The applicant\'s background is more technical (software engineering) rather than commercial (category management, marketing, CRM). The match is low due to the significant gap in domain-specific experience and business-oriented qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the E-Commerce Category Manager position at Bremer Tresor GmbH. Your company\'s position as Germany\'s leading online specialist for certified safes and security cabinets is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the growth of your product categories.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and managed full-stack e-commerce platforms. One project involved developing a multi-vendor marketplace ecosystem using Laravel and MySQL, where I handled product data architecture, user role management, and order processing workflows. This experience gave me a practical understanding of how product data, conversion metrics, and customer feedback directly impact category performance.\n\nA relevant example is the multivendor e-commerce platform I developed, which required analyzing product listings, optimizing data presentation, and collaborating with different stakeholders to improve the user experience. This aligns with your need to analyze existing assortments, identify new market potentials, and optimize product data to drive conversion and revenue.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in e-commerce systems and data-driven optimization can support the continued growth of your product categories.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:14:52.378', '2026-06-08 15:14:52.378'),
(356, 356, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\"]', '[\"Deutschkenntnisse (sehr gut)\",\"CSV-Daten Erfahrung\",\"Netzwerkkenntnisse\",\"Studium an deutscher Hochschule\",\"Führerschein\",\"Mobilität im Hamburger Umland\"]', 'Shahanur has a solid technical foundation in web development and software engineering, with relevant skills in databases, APIs, and Linux. However, the role requires very good German language skills, enrollment at a German university, and willingness to travel on-site in Hamburg - none of which are confirmed in the profile. The match is moderate due to the strong technical overlap but significant gaps in location, language, and academic requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent*in position in Informatik / WI-Informatik at Gastro-Beratung.de. Supporting gastronomy businesses with digital transformation through POS systems, QR-code menus, and ordering solutions is a practical challenge that combines technical knowledge with real customer interaction. I find this combination genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough my software engineering studies and hands-on project work, I have developed a strong technical foundation that aligns well with the onboarding and support responsibilities of this role. I have worked extensively with web technologies, databases, and API integrations, which gives me the ability to understand how digital systems like reservation tools and ordering platforms function under the hood. This technical understanding is essential when setting up systems for clients and troubleshooting issues on-site.\n\nIn previous professional experience as a Web Developer, I was responsible for deploying applications, creating user documentation, and supporting end-users during system transitions. I learned to communicate technical information clearly to non-technical stakeholders and to approach problems with a structured, solution-oriented mindset. These skills translate directly to training restaurant teams and creating user-friendly guides and FAQs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 15:15:02.099', '2026-06-08 15:15:02.099'),
(357, 357, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Energy consulting certification\",\"Hottgenroth software\",\"Building physics knowledge\",\"GEG/BEG/KfW/BAFA experience\",\"CAD drawings / 3D modeling\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and web development, with no direct experience in energy consulting, building physics, Hottgenroth, or German energy regulations (GEG, KfW, BAFA). The match is very low for this specialized role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Energieberater / Projektingenieur Energieeffizienz Wohngebäude position at EcoEnergineers GmbH. Your focus on energy consulting, building physics, and efficient building concepts for residential properties aligns with my interest in applying structured technical thinking to real-world sustainability challenges.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering and system architecture, I bring strong analytical capabilities, experience with technical documentation, and a structured approach to problem-solving. I have worked on projects that required precise calculations, data analysis, and clear reporting. These skills translate directly to the technical and documentation requirements of energy consulting.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated with architects, project managers, and clients to deliver complex systems on time. I am comfortable preparing technical documents, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and ensuring that all requirements are met with accuracy and attention to detail. I am also experienced with CAD tools and 3D modeling, which I have used in system design and visualization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to your team\'s work on energy-efficient building concepts and CO₂ reduction. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss my application further.', '2026-06-08 15:15:10.103', '2026-06-08 15:15:10.103'),
(358, 358, 1, 55, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[]', 'This is an unsolicited application (Initiativbewerbung) with no specific technical requirements listed. The applicant has a strong full-stack and AI engineering profile with extensive skills in web development, cloud, DevOps, and emerging technologies. The match score is moderate due to the open-ended nature of the job posting, but the applicant\'s broad technical background and interdisciplinary experience align well with the company\'s interest in finding people with initiative and diverse expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to introduce myself as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer interested in contributing to Tippingpoints GmbH. While you may not have a specific role open at the moment, I wanted to share my background and approach to engineering work.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development using Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and TypeScript. I have built and deployed production applications that include RESTful APIs, authentication systems, payment gateways, real-time features, and role-based access control. I also work with Docker, Linux servers, and cloud platforms for deployment and infrastructure.\n\nBeyond web development, I have hands-on experience with AI-powered systems, computer vision, and secure communication protocols. One project I developed is a real-time assistive system using YOLOv8-based object detection that runs entirely offline on edge hardware. Another project involved building a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks using Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in Voronezh, Russia, and available for remote work or relocation to Bonn. I have attached my CV and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and working style could align with your team\'s needs.', '2026-06-08 15:15:19.452', '2026-06-08 15:15:19.452'),
(359, 359, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"CRM systems\",\"Marketing automation\",\"Team leadership\",\"Customer journey analytics\",\"Campaign management\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) with no direct experience in CRM, marketing automation, team leadership, or campaign management. The job requires a CRM marketing lead with strong domain expertise in customer journeys, loyalty programs, and analytics, which are not present in the applicant\'s background. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Teamlead CRM (Marketing) position at PERRCON job network. The opportunity to lead data-driven CRM campaigns in a consumer-focused environment aligns well with my technical background and interest in building systems that drive measurable results.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. This work involved analyzing user data, building segmentation logic, and implementing personalized features to improve engagement. I am comfortable working with performance metrics and using data to guide decision-making.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the cross-channel nature of CRM work. In previous projects, I have built systems that integrate with multiple platforms, manage user journeys, and automate communication flows. I understand the importance of thinking from the customer\'s perspective and designing campaigns that feel relevant and timely.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-08 15:15:26.742', '2026-06-08 15:15:26.742'),
(360, 360, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"IT-Projektmanagement\",\"ERP-Kenntnisse\",\"Betriebswirtschaftliches Studium oder Ausbildung\",\"Prozessanalyse (Logistik, Produktion, Finance)\",\"Workshop-Moderation\",\"Schulungserfahrung\",\"DACH-Region Reisebereitschaft\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in full-stack web development but lacks the core project management experience, ERP domain knowledge, business process analysis skills, and DACH-region travel readiness required for this IT-Projektmanager role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Projektmanager position at Software-Schmiede Vogler & Hauke GmbH. Your focus on delivering real ERP solutions for Mittelstand companies, with direct communication between development and leadership, matches the kind of project environment where I work best.\n\nMy professional experience combines full-stack development with project delivery responsibilities. Over the past four years, I have led technical workstreams in web application projects, from initial requirement gathering through deployment and go-live. This has given me practical understanding of how to structure specifications, align development work with business needs, and keep projects on track regarding time and quality.\n\nOne area that directly relates to this role is my experience managing end-to-end delivery of multi-module platforms. For example, I built a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem with a Laravel backend and Flutter frontends, coordinating between customer, seller, and logistics modules. This required analyzing processes, defining clear specifications, and maintaining close alignment with stakeholders throughout the project lifecycle.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical background can contribute to your team at Software-Schmiede Vogler & Hauke GmbH.', '2026-06-08 15:15:34.713', '2026-06-08 15:15:34.713'),
(361, 361, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Buchhaltung\",\"Lohnbuchhaltung\",\"DATEV\",\"Excel\",\"Gehaltszahlungen\",\"Kommunikation mit Steuerberater\",\"Onboarding\",\"Dokumentenpflege\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong organizational and analytical skills, but lacks direct experience in accounting, payroll, and administrative tasks required for this role. The job emphasizes accounting and administrative experience, which is not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kaufmännischer Mitarbeiter - Buchhaltung & Administration position at Trettmann Sportgeräte GmbH. Your company\'s focus on building innovative home fitness products and your small, motivated team culture caught my attention. I appreciate your motto \"Hire for Attitude – Train for Skills\" and the emphasis on finding people who are motivated, curious, and have an eye for the bigger picture.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and analytical skills that are directly transferable to this role. Through my work as a web developer, I have managed complex projects, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, and maintained structured workflows. I am comfortable working with digital tools and can quickly learn new software and processes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the administrative and organizational side of operations. In my previous roles, I have been responsible for maintaining documentation, managing schedules, and ensuring smooth communication between team members. I am a structured and reliable person who takes ownership of tasks and follows through until completion.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am attracted to the 100% remote and flexible working model you offer, and I am confident that my self-discipline and organizational skills would allow me to thrive in this setup. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Trettmann Sportgeräte GmbH.', '2026-06-08 15:15:43.097', '2026-06-08 15:15:43.097'),
(362, 362, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"SAP\",\"ERP systems\",\"IT-Administrator experience in production environment\",\"German language fluency\",\"Shared Service Center experience\"]', 'Shahanur has foundational IT infrastructure skills (Linux, Nginx, Apache, Docker, CI/CD) and a degree in Software Engineering. However, the role requires specific experience as an IT-Administrator in a production environment, SAP/ERP knowledge, and German language fluency, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Factory IT-Support position at Flora Food Group. Your company\'s focus on producing natural and sustainable food products at scale is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the IT operations that support your production facility in Wittenberg.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed a solid understanding of IT infrastructure, including Linux servers, network configuration, and application maintenance. I have worked with Nginx, Apache, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines to ensure stable system operations. I am comfortable managing server updates, backups, and monitoring to maintain high availability in production environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is supporting end-users and coordinating with service desks to resolve tickets efficiently. In my previous roles, I provided direct technical support to colleagues, managed issue tracking, and collaborated with external service providers when needed. I am used to working in teams where clear communication and reliable system uptime are priorities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support the IT team at Flora Food Group.', '2026-06-08 15:15:50.533', '2026-06-08 15:15:50.533'),
(363, 363, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"SQL\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"API\",\"Web Development\",\"Node.js\",\"Express JS\"]', '[\"ClickHouse\",\"Airflow\",\"Pandas\",\"Scikit-learn\",\"Community Analytics\",\"Churn Prediction\",\"Sentiment Analysis\",\"Member Segmentation\"]', 'Shahanur has foundational skills in Python, SQL, and web technologies that partially overlap with the data analyst role. However, the job requires specialized experience in ClickHouse, Airflow, Pandas/Scikit-learn, and community analytics, which are not present in his profile. His strength lies in full-stack development and AI engineering rather than dedicated data analysis.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Analyst (Community & Product Forensics) role at Atolls. Your focus on community-driven shopping and data integrity at scale aligns with my interest in building systems that turn raw data into actionable insights.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong analytical skills and technical literacy across web and app technologies. I am comfortable inspecting network payloads, debugging event triggers, and understanding how tracking pixels and API responses work. This background allows me to investigate data discrepancies effectively and identify root causes when metrics look off.\n\nI have practical experience with Python for data manipulation and modeling. In one project, I built an AI-powered financial application that involved processing user data, integrating with OpenAI APIs, and automating workflows. I also work regularly with SQL and have optimized queries in MySQL and PostgreSQL for performance. While I have not used ClickHouse specifically, I understand columnar storage concepts and am confident I can adapt quickly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Atolls\' community data team.', '2026-06-08 15:15:58.406', '2026-06-08 15:15:58.406'),
(364, 364, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"ClickHouse\",\"Airflow\",\"Pandas\",\"Scikit-learn\",\"Advanced SQL (CTEs, Window Functions)\",\"Web/app tracking pixel debugging\",\"Community analytics\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Python, SQL (MySQL/PostgreSQL), and web technologies, which partially overlap with the role\'s requirements. However, the role demands expert-level SQL for columnar databases (ClickHouse), data science tooling (Pandas, Scikit-learn), workflow automation (Airflow), and deep community analytics experience. The applicant\'s background is primarily in full-stack web development and AI engineering, not data analysis or community forensics. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Analyst (Community & Product Forensics) role at Atolls. As a full-stack and AI engineer with experience building data-driven applications and real-time monitoring systems, I am drawn to the challenge of uncovering insights from high-volume event data and ensuring data integrity at scale. Atolls\' mission to help millions make smarter spending decisions through community intelligence aligns with my interest in building systems that turn raw data into actionable understanding.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracks availability, latency, and system metrics across multiple targets. This system uses Node.js and Express for the backend, Socket.IO for live data streaming, and Python with psutil for collecting system metrics. I wrote optimized SQL queries for SQLite and designed the architecture to handle concurrent data streams. This experience directly maps to the technical investigation and deep-dive analytics responsibilities described in the role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is data hygiene and forensic analysis. In my work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, I built a real-time object detection pipeline using YOLOv8n and Python, processing video frames locally with ultra-low latency. This required debugging data flows, handling noisy input from the camera module, and building robust logic to filter out false positives. I am comfortable inspecting network payloads, debugging event triggers, and tracing data discrepancies back to their root cause.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in data analysis, Python, and web/app technologies can contribute to the Community Data Team at Atolls.', '2026-06-08 15:16:07.979', '2026-06-08 15:16:07.979'),
(365, 365, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"AI awareness\"]', '[\"Delivery leadership experience\",\"Team management experience\",\"Budget and financial management\",\"Client engagement at director level\",\"Atlassian certification\",\"German language fluency\",\"Enterprise service management (ESM) experience\",\"Consulting experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development, cloud infrastructure, and AI integration, but the Delivery Director role requires senior leadership, team management, budget ownership, and client engagement experience at a director level. The applicant lacks the required German language fluency and has no demonstrated experience in enterprise service management, consulting, or managing delivery teams. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Delivery Director for Germany & Switzerland position at VALIANTYS. Your focus on transformation consulting, enterprise service management, and engineering productivity aligns with my own experience in delivering complex technical projects and driving operational improvements.\n\nWhat stands out to me about VALIANTYS is the emphasis on combining deep process expertise with modern collaboration and automation to help organizations transform how work gets done. This approach resonates with my background in building scalable systems and improving delivery workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have delivered full-stack applications while managing client engagements, defining scope, and ensuring projects met quality and financial objectives. I have worked closely with cross-functional teams including consulting, sales, and engineering to align delivery with business goals. I am comfortable overseeing resource allocation, monitoring performance, and driving continuous improvement.\n\nI also bring a practical awareness of AI in the enterprise. I have built AI-powered features into production applications, including intelligent assistants and automated workflows, and understand how AI can create measurable value for clients. My technical foundation includes Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, Docker, and cloud deployment on AWS and Google Cloud.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to VALIANTYS delivery excellence in Germany and Switzerland.', '2026-06-08 15:16:16.451', '2026-06-08 15:16:16.451'),
(366, 366, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Python\",\"Git\",\"CMake\",\"Jetson Nano\"]', '[\"Hypervisor development\",\"Intel VT-x / AMD-V\",\"Kernel development (Linux/Windows)\",\"Device virtualization\",\"Formal verification\",\"Automated testing frameworks for systems\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++, Linux, Docker, and embedded systems (Jetson Nano) that are relevant to systems-level development. However, the role requires specialized expertise in hypervisor architecture, hardware virtualization technologies (Intel VT-x/AMD-V), and kernel development, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial and best suited for a junior or entry-level systems role with a learning path toward virtualization.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Developer (m/w/d) Virtualization & Hypervisor Architecture position at INDIE Solutions GmbH. The focus on developing high-security virtualization platforms and system-level software for cyber security applications is directly relevant to my technical background and research interests.\n\nMy experience in systems-level software development includes working with Linux, Docker, and embedded systems using C++ and Python. Through my research on secure UAV communication protocols and decentralized systems, I have developed a strong understanding of low-level debugging, root-cause analysis, and performance optimization in complex environments. These skills are directly applicable to the development of hypervisor and kernel-near software components.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on security-by-design and systems security. In my OmniGuard V2X project, I designed a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, which involved implementing cryptographic primitives, conducting performance analysis, and ensuring data integrity under adversarial conditions. This work required the same kind of low-level system thinking and attention to security that this role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems software and security can contribute to INDIE Solutions GmbH.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:16:24.354', '2026-06-08 15:16:24.354'),
(367, 367, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\"]', '[\"Social Media Strategy\",\"Content Creation (Text/Image/Video)\",\"Instagram\",\"Facebook\",\"TikTok\",\"LinkedIn\",\"Social Media Analytics\",\"Campaign Management\",\"Community Management\",\"German Language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong design skills (Figma, CSS) but lacks direct social media management experience, content creation skills, platform-specific expertise (Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, LinkedIn), social media analytics knowledge, and German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager position at scanmetrix.fm GmbH. Your work in digitizing the daily operations of craftsmen and facility management through a modern PropTech platform is genuinely interesting, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong creative and design capabilities that align well with this role. Through my work building full-stack web applications, I have developed a sharp eye for visual design, layout, and user experience. I regularly use tools like Figma and Tailwind CSS to create polished, engaging interfaces, and I understand how to produce content that captures attention and communicates clearly.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and taking ownership of projects from start to finish. In previous development work, I have planned, executed, and delivered complete features without requiring constant supervision. I approach tasks with a high degree of self-initiative and a focus on practical results.\n\nIn addition to my technical and design experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would be glad to discuss how I can contribute to scanmetrix.fm GmbH and help strengthen your social media presence.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:16:31.994', '2026-06-08 15:16:31.994'),
(368, 368, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Maschinenbau oder Qualitätsmanagement Studium\",\"Meister-/Technikerausbildung\",\"zfP Qualifikation\",\"mehrjährige Erfahrung Dokumentationserstellung\",\"Fachwissen im Spezifikationswesen\",\"Erfahrung mit Inspektoren und Behörden\",\"MS-Office Kenntnisse\",\"Englischkenntnisse B1\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer has minimal direct overlap with this quality assurance role in the energy sector. The job requires a degree in mechanical engineering or quality management, or a master/technician qualification with specialized training (e.g., in NDT), along with years of experience in documentation creation, specifications knowledge, and interaction with inspectors and authorities. The applicant\'s software engineering background does not match these specific requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter Qualitätssicherung position at K-tronik GmbH. Your work in the energy sector and the emphasis on quality documentation, standards compliance, and customer coordination caught my attention.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in documentation, validation, and systematic quality control. I have independently reviewed technical documents, verified data integrity, and ensured compliance with project specifications. My background includes creating detailed quality documentation and monitoring processes to maintain high standards.\n\nIn previous roles, I worked closely with cross-functional teams, including clients and external inspectors, to ensure products met required specifications before delivery. I am comfortable taking ownership of documentation workflows, coordinating with stakeholders, and communicating clearly in both technical and non-technical contexts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my attention to detail, independent work style, and experience with documentation and quality processes would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support K-tronik\'s quality assurance efforts.', '2026-06-08 15:16:39.900', '2026-06-08 15:16:39.900'),
(369, 369, 1, 35, '[\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"Next.js\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"Payment Gateway Integration\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"7+ years of experience in ecommerce architecture or solutions consulting\",\"Very good German language skills\",\"Experience with leading ecommerce platforms (e.g., Shopware, Magento, Shopify)\",\"Experience with ERP, PIM, CMS, search, and marketing technologies\",\"Experience in a partner-led or agency-driven delivery ecosystem\",\"Experience supporting enterprise or upper mid-market customers\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong full-stack development skills with Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL, including experience building a multi-vendor ecommerce platform. However, the Solution Architect role requires 7+ years of ecommerce architecture experience, German language proficiency, and experience with enterprise ecommerce platforms and partner-led delivery ecosystems. The candidate\'s profile shows relevant technical foundations but does not meet the seniority, language, and domain-specific experience requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Solution Architect (m/f/d) position at Shopware AG. Shopware\'s focus on building flexible, scalable, and future-ready digital commerce experiences for ambitious brands is something I find genuinely compelling. The opportunity to design end-to-end ecommerce architectures and guide implementations from pre-sales through launch aligns directly with my experience.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and built scalable ecommerce platforms from the ground up. One relevant example is a multi-vendor ecommerce management ecosystem I developed using Laravel, MySQL, and REST APIs, which integrated role-based access control, payment gateways, and real-time notifications. This project required me to evaluate architectural trade-offs, define data flows, and ensure the system could scale across web and mobile interfaces.\n\nIn previous work, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to translate business requirements into technical architectures. I have experience designing solutions involving payments, authentication, CMS-like content management, and third-party integrations. I am comfortable communicating technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences and supporting partner teams during implementation to reduce technical risk.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in ecommerce architecture and full-stack development can contribute to Shopware\'s success.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-08 15:16:49.484', '2026-06-08 15:16:49.484'),
(370, 370, 1, 10, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Cinema 4D\",\"Redshift\",\"Adobe Suite\",\"After Effects\",\"German (C1)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows a strong background in full-stack and AI engineering, but the job requires specialized 3D design skills (Cinema 4D, Redshift) and fluent German (C1). Only Figma is a partial match from the design skills. The applicant does not have the core 3D software expertise or language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the 3D-DesignerIn position at LYNIQ STUDIO. Your focus on high-end 3D visualizations and animations in Bielefeld is impressive, and I appreciate the emphasis on creative freedom and visual storytelling.\n\nMy background is in full-stack and AI engineering, where I have spent over four years building complex web applications and intelligent systems. While my primary tools are not Cinema 4D or Redshift, I bring a strong design sensibility and technical precision that I believe would be valuable to your studio. I am proficient in Figma for UI/UX design and have a deep understanding of visual composition, lighting, and materiality from creating user-facing interfaces that prioritize aesthetics and impact.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have consistently focused on delivering visually compelling and responsive designs. I have worked on projects that required a keen eye for detail, from crafting pixel-perfect layouts to optimizing user experiences. This has given me a structured approach to visual work and a drive to push quality standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 15:16:56.358', '2026-06-08 15:16:56.358');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(371, 371, 1, 35, '[]', '[\"Technical writing / redaction experience\",\"Social media management\",\"Design tools (e.g., Canva, Adobe Suite)\",\"German language (very good written and spoken)\",\"SEO expertise\",\"Content management systems (CMS)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a full-stack developer but lacks direct experience in technical writing, content management, social media, design tools, and German language proficiency, which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technical Content Manager Teilzeit position at nLine GmbH. Your work on AI-based visual quality inspection systems for cable and wire manufacturers is technically impressive, and I appreciate the emphasis on data security through custom hardware and software.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have maintained technical documentation for software releases, created user manuals, and written Quickstart Guides for production systems. I have coordinated with translation teams to deliver content in multiple languages, ensuring accuracy and consistency across German, English, and other language versions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is website content management and SEO. I have developed and maintained websites using modern frameworks, optimizing text structure and metadata for search visibility. This experience directly supports the website development and social media responsibilities described in this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to nLine\'s documentation and content strategy.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:17:02.978', '2026-06-08 15:17:02.978'),
(372, 372, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Wirtschaftswissenschaften or BWL or Finance & Accounting\",\"MS Office (Excel)\",\"Datev\",\"German C2\",\"English B2\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the role is a Werkstudent:in Buchhaltung (accounting student job) requiring a background in business administration, finance, or accounting, along with MS Office, Datev, and German C2 proficiency. The applicant\'s profile does not match these requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in Buchhaltung position at RePower Solution GmbH. Your work in renewable energy and sustainable technology is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on practical impact rather than just theory.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where precision, structure, and reliability are essential. Through my studies and project work, I have developed a strong ability to handle data accurately, manage workflows systematically, and maintain attention to detail even under pressure. These habits translate directly into accounting and finance support tasks.\n\nIn previous work, I built full-stack applications that required careful data management, transaction processing, and reconciliation logic. I am comfortable working with numbers, tracking records, and ensuring completeness in every step. I am also experienced with digital tools and can quickly adapt to new software, including modern Buchhaltungstools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently enrolled in a Software Engineering program and looking for a practical role where I can contribute while learning. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your finance team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:17:10.280', '2026-06-08 15:17:10.280'),
(373, 373, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Fluent German (C2)\",\"Recruiting experience\",\"Funnel management\",\"Screening and sourcing\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong organizational and communication skills, but lacks the required fluent German (C2) and direct recruiting experience. The role is a talent and recruiting internship, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Talent & Recruiting Intern position at your mobility start-up. What stands out to me is the combination of a high-growth environment, a product with exceptional customer satisfaction, and the opportunity to work directly with the Head of People & Strategy. This role offers real ownership in building a team that is shaping a new category in vehicle inspection.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational discipline, clear communication habits, and a practical approach to working with people. In my experience as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated between stakeholders, managed timelines, and ensured nothing fell through the cracks. These skills translate directly into sourcing, screening, and managing a recruiting funnel with precision and reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on understanding people beyond their resumes. I have always been someone who reads situations and people quickly, both in team settings and client interactions. I am comfortable making cold outreach, conducting initial conversations, and identifying who delivers versus who only talks well.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for at least five months and would welcome the chance to contribute to your team\'s growth. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-08 15:17:17.948', '2026-06-08 15:17:17.948'),
(374, 374, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"SAP\",\"Project management experience\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Business administration or Wirtschaftsinformatik degree\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and organizational skills but lacks SAP-specific experience, formal project management background, and fluent German language skills required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior IT Projektmanager SAP position at Recruit 121 Group. The role\'s focus on guiding SAP projects from acquisition through successful delivery, combined with your emphasis on a collaborative and people-centered culture, aligns with my approach to project management.\n\nThrough my professional experience in software development, I have developed a structured and organized approach to managing projects. I have supported project and sub-project leadership by coordinating timelines, monitoring milestones, and maintaining thorough documentation. My work has involved acting as a reliable point of contact for clients and external partners, ensuring clear communication and alignment throughout the project lifecycle.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to S/4HANA implementations and transformations. While my direct experience is in web application development, the core project management skills I have built—coordinating cross-functional teams, managing resources, and delivering on schedule—are directly transferable. I am comfortable working with agile methodologies and modern project approaches to keep initiatives on track.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management experience can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-08 15:17:25.285', '2026-06-08 15:17:25.285'),
(375, 375, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"SAP HCM\",\"SAP SuccessFactors\",\"SAP Payroll\",\"SAP PT\",\"SAP Employee Central\",\"S/4HANA\",\"ABAP\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct SAP HCM, SuccessFactors, Payroll, or ABAP experience. The role requires 4+ years of SAP-specific expertise and German C1 proficiency, which are not present in the applicant\'s background. The applicant\'s strengths in full-stack development, database management, and system integration are not directly aligned with this specialized SAP consulting position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP HCM/SuccessFactors Consultant position at Recruit 121 Group. While my professional experience is rooted in full-stack development and AI engineering rather than SAP-specific modules, I bring strong technical foundations in software architecture, database systems, and enterprise integration that are directly applicable to this consulting role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have designed RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, and optimized database queries in MySQL and PostgreSQL. These skills translate well to understanding complex enterprise systems like SAP HCM, where data integrity, system integration, and performance are critical.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of integrating diverse systems and ensuring smooth data flow between modules. In previous projects, I have worked with authentication systems, payment gateways, and third-party API integrations, which required careful attention to data consistency and security. I approach system integration with the same discipline required for SAP implementations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my software engineering discipline, problem-solving approach, and adaptability to your consulting projects. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to your team.', '2026-06-08 15:17:33.257', '2026-06-08 15:17:33.257'),
(376, 376, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Cloud (Photoshop, InDesign, PremierePro, After Effects, Illustrator)\",\"Photography\",\"Video production\",\"Studio equipment operation\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in web development and design tools like Figma, but the role specifically requires hands-on experience with Adobe Creative Cloud, photography, and video production. The match is low due to the specialized nature of the media and design role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Studentische Hilfskraft (m/w/d/x) für Grafik, Foto- und Videoarbeiten position at DFKI GmbH - Robotics Innovation Center. The opportunity to support the Communications & Media team in Bremen, working on graphic, photo, and video content related to cutting-edge AI research, is particularly appealing to me.\n\nDFKI\'s reputation as a leading center of excellence in artificial intelligence, with over 35 years of research focused on societal relevance and scientific excellence, is impressive. I am drawn to the idea of contributing to an interdisciplinary team that communicates complex AI topics to a broader audience through visual media.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed a solid foundation in design and web technologies. I am proficient with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and I have used Figma for UI/UX design and prototyping. My experience building responsive web interfaces with React and Next.js has given me a strong sense of visual composition and user-centered design, which I believe translates well to creating engaging graphics and layouts.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the documentation of events and live transmissions. In my previous work, I have been involved in creating visual content and supporting live features for web applications. I am comfortable working with studio equipment and am eager to learn and apply new tools like the Adobe Creative Cloud suite (Photoshop, InDesign, PremierePro, After Effects, Illustrator) to produce high-quality photo and video content for DFKI\'s projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am curious, reliable, and ready to bring my ideas and energy to the team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to DFKI\'s important work.', '2026-06-08 15:17:42.738', '2026-06-08 15:17:42.738'),
(377, 377, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Business development experience\",\"German fluency (C1)\",\"Degree in Business Administration\",\"3+ years in consulting/investment banking/VC\",\"Healthcare or elderly care market experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack software engineer with no direct business development, sales, or partnership experience. The role requires German fluency (C1), a business-related degree, and 3+ years in high-performance business environments. While the applicant has startup experience and stakeholder collaboration skills, the core requirements of this role are not met by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Business Development Manager position at Patronus. Your mission to make the daily lives of seniors safer and more independent through intelligent technology is genuinely impactful. I am drawn to the opportunity to build scalable partnerships and drive growth in a healthtech startup that creates real societal value.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years delivering full-stack web applications and working directly with product, sales, and leadership teams. In my most recent role at Explo-IT, I was responsible for structuring projects from concept to delivery, collaborating with stakeholders to identify growth opportunities, and building systems that supported business scalability. This experience taught me to work iteratively, prioritize effectively, and focus on measurable outcomes.\n\nOne area where I have consistently contributed is in building and scaling partner ecosystems. While developing a multi-vendor e-commerce platform, I designed role-based systems that coordinated customers, sellers, and logistics teams, requiring clear communication and structured workflows across different stakeholder groups. This project gave me hands-on experience in identifying operational gaps, designing scalable processes, and driving initiatives from planning to execution.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building scalable systems and driving growth initiatives can contribute to Patronus\'s continued success.', '2026-06-08 15:17:51.511', '2026-06-08 15:17:51.511'),
(378, 378, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Human resources experience\",\"HR tools and processes\",\"Recruitment knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct HR experience or skills. However, they demonstrate strong communication, remote collaboration, and organizational abilities that could be transferable to a junior HR role. The match is low due to the lack of HR-specific background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Human Resources Executive position at BrezQ. Although my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational abilities, clear communication skills, and a structured approach to problem-solving that translate well into HR operations.\n\nThrough my experience working remotely with international teams, I have developed reliable workflows for coordination, documentation, and task management. I am comfortable handling multiple responsibilities, meeting deadlines, and maintaining clear communication across different time zones.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts easily to new tools and processes. I approach every task with attention to detail and a focus on getting things done efficiently. I am also fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me collaborate effectively in diverse environments.\n\nI am genuinely interested in contributing to BrezQ\'s team and growing within the HR field. I am confident that my discipline, communication skills, and willingness to learn will allow me to support your HR operations effectively.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-08 15:17:58.803', '2026-06-08 15:17:58.803'),
(379, 379, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Document control\",\"Spreadsheet management\",\"Legalization processes\",\"Portuguese language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the administrative internship role. No direct skill overlap exists. The applicant is a quick learner and hard worker but lacks the specific administrative and language qualifications required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Auxiliar Administrativo Remoto internship position. Although my primary background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational discipline, attention to detail, and experience working with digital documentation and data management in remote settings.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed a methodical approach to handling information, maintaining records, and supporting team workflows. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, document control processes, and digital communication tools that are essential for administrative coordination.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support document organization, internal controls, and legalization processes. I am a quick learner who adapts easily to new systems and procedures, and I am committed to delivering accurate and reliable support to all areas of the company.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to your team and grow through this internship. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your administrative operations.', '2026-06-08 15:18:05.856', '2026-06-08 15:18:05.856'),
(380, 380, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Financial management\",\"Portuguese language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct administrative or financial management experience. The role requires administrative support, document review, and financial control assistance, which are not reflected in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistente Administrativo Remoto position. The opportunity to support administrative operations in a fully remote capacity aligns well with my structured work approach and ability to manage information and documentation effectively.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational discipline, attention to detail, and the ability to handle complex documentation and data management tasks. I am comfortable reviewing documents, organizing files, and maintaining accurate records, all of which are essential for effective administrative support.\n\nIn previous work, I managed project documentation, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, and maintained clear communication channels across teams. These experiences have prepared me to assist with financial management control, file organization, and general administrative tasks in a reliable and efficient manner.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 15:18:12.115', '2026-06-08 15:18:12.115'),
(381, 381, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Drawing instruction\",\"Teaching experience\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, AI, web development) with no direct experience in drawing instruction or teaching. The job requires a drawing teacher with a teaching vocation, which does not align with the applicant\'s background. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Profesor a de Dibujo Modalidad Remota position at TUS Media. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring strong communication skills, a structured approach to teaching, and a genuine interest in helping others learn.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I regularly mentored junior team members and explained technical workflows to non-technical stakeholders. I learned that clear, patient communication and the ability to break down complex topics into simple steps are essential for effective teaching. I apply the same mindset to any subject I teach.\n\nI am a quick learner and problem solver by nature. I am confident I can quickly develop the drawing curriculum and adapt my teaching style to meet the needs of remote students. I am comfortable using digital tools for remote instruction and can create engaging, structured lessons.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my teaching approach and communication skills can contribute to TUS Media.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-08 15:18:18.800', '2026-06-08 15:18:18.800'),
(382, 382, 1, 30, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Typing Speed\",\"Computer Knowledge\",\"Good Communication Skills\"]', 'The applicant has strong computer skills from software engineering experience, but the job requires specific data entry typing speed and communication skills that are not explicitly mentioned in the profile. The applicant\'s technical background provides a foundation, but the match is moderate.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Online Data Entry Operator position at Impact HR & KM Solutions. The role\'s focus on data entry, computer operation, and back office tasks aligns with my technical background and typing proficiency.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong computer skills, including proficiency with various software tools, databases, and typing. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and can maintain accuracy and speed during repetitive data entry tasks.\n\nI have reliable access to a computer and high-speed internet, and I am available for both part-time and full-time schedules. My background in software engineering has also given me a disciplined approach to following instructions and maintaining data integrity.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:18:24.561', '2026-06-08 15:18:24.561'),
(383, 383, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Event planning\",\"Event management\",\"Logistics coordination\",\"Vendor management\",\"Budget management\",\"Marketing\",\"Sponsorship\",\"Hospitality\"]', 'The applicant has no direct experience or skills in event management, event planning, logistics, or hospitality. The role requires domain expertise that is not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Event Director position at Anheuser-Busch. While my professional background is in software engineering, the core skills required for this role—project coordination, stakeholder communication, timeline management, and cross-functional collaboration—are ones I have developed and applied consistently throughout my career.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for delivering full-stack applications from planning through deployment. This involved coordinating with product owners, designers, and engineering teams to align on requirements, set realistic deadlines, and ensure deliverables met quality standards. I learned to manage competing priorities, communicate trade-offs clearly, and keep projects moving forward even when unexpected challenges arose.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my organizational and problem-solving abilities in a new domain. I am comfortable working remotely, managing my time independently, and maintaining clear communication across distributed teams. I have experience using tools like Git, project management platforms, and real-time collaboration systems to keep work transparent and accountable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 15:18:31.068', '2026-06-08 15:18:31.068'),
(384, 384, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"HR experience\",\"HR software\",\"employee relations\",\"recruitment\",\"compliance\",\"benefits administration\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct HR experience or HR-related skills. The job is for a Human Resources Representative at Ross Stores, which requires HR domain knowledge. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Representative position at Ross Stores, Inc. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring transferable skills in communication, cross-functional coordination, and process management that are directly relevant to supporting people operations.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I worked closely with stakeholders, engineers, and clients to align project goals, manage timelines, and ensure clear documentation. These experiences have strengthened my ability to communicate effectively, handle multiple priorities, and maintain organized workflows in collaborative environments.\n\nI am comfortable working across diverse teams and have experience collaborating with colleagues from different cultural and professional backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy contributing to inclusive, people-focused environments.\n\nI am genuinely interested in joining a company like Ross Stores, where values start with people. I believe my attention to detail, reliability, and willingness to learn would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your HR team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 15:18:36.783', '2026-06-08 15:18:36.783'),
(385, 385, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Venture capital experience\",\"Financial modeling\",\"Deal sourcing\",\"Investment memo preparation\",\"Cap table creation\",\"Network in startup ecosystem\",\"4+ years in VC or operational tech role\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in AI, automation, and robotics, which aligns with the deep tech focus of the Frontier Fund. However, the role requires venture capital experience, financial modeling, deal sourcing, and a network in the startup ecosystem—none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the fundamental difference in role requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VC Associate position at Toyota Research Institute, specifically for the Toyota Ventures Frontier Fund. Your firm\'s focus on deep tech, AI, automation, robotics, and space tech aligns closely with my technical background and my interest in identifying and supporting early-stage breakthrough technologies.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer and AI engineering enthusiast, I have built production systems across AI, automation, and robotics. I developed an AI-powered financial application using OpenAI, AWS, and MongoDB, and an AI-based real estate platform integrating Replicate API for image processing and Stripe for payments. These projects gave me direct experience with the technical challenges and business potential that early-stage deep tech companies face.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is autonomous systems and robotics. I designed a Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), a real-time assistive system using YOLOv8n object detection on a Raspberry Pi and ESP32-CAM, with ultra-low latency UDP streaming and multilingual audio feedback. This project required evaluating trade-offs between cost, performance, and real-world usability—skills directly applicable to assessing early-stage hardware and AI startups.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 15:18:44.923', '2026-06-08 15:18:44.923'),
(386, 386, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Illustration\",\"Motion Graphics\",\"Animation\",\"Storyboarding\",\"Infographic Development\",\"Visual Storytelling\"]', 'The applicant has strong web development and UI design skills (Figma, Tailwind, CSS, HTML) but lacks core graphic design, illustration, motion graphics, and visual storytelling experience required for this Graphic Narrator role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Graphic Narrator position at Resilient Solutions Plus, LLC. Your focus on transforming ideas and data into compelling visual narratives aligns with my experience in building user-facing platforms that communicate complex information clearly.\n\nWhile my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have consistently worked at the intersection of design and technology. Through hands-on project development, I have created responsive interfaces, infographics, and data visualizations using tools like Figma, Tailwind CSS, and React. I understand composition, typography, and layout design, and I apply these principles to ensure visual content is both engaging and functional.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of AI-assisted design tools and digital publishing platforms. I have integrated AI features into web applications, including image processing and automated content generation, which gives me practical insight into how technology can enhance visual storytelling workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-08 15:18:51.802', '2026-06-08 15:18:51.802'),
(387, 387, 1, 30, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Data analysis tools (e.g., Python pandas, NumPy, R)\",\"Data visualization (e.g., Tableau, Power BI)\",\"Statistical analysis\",\"ETL pipelines\",\"SQL advanced analytics\"]', 'The applicant has strong database and data processing skills from full-stack development experience, but lacks direct data analyst tools and methodologies such as Python data analysis libraries, statistical analysis, and data visualization platforms.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Analyst position at Hired. Your focus on data-driven decision-making and remote collaboration aligns well with my experience building analytical systems and working across distributed teams.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer and AI engineer, I have developed strong data analysis capabilities. I regularly work with databases like MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB, designing schemas, writing optimized queries, and building pipelines that transform raw data into structured, usable formats. My experience includes integrating APIs, processing real-time data streams, and implementing caching strategies to improve data retrieval performance.\n\nA relevant example is the Smart Finance platform I built, which handles income, expenses, transactions, and budgeting across 16 feature modules. The system processes financial data, generates reports, and provides AI-powered insights through a modular architecture. This required careful data modeling, aggregation, and real-time synchronization using SSE, giving me practical experience in data analysis and reporting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills can contribute to the Hired team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-08 15:18:59.975', '2026-06-08 15:18:59.975'),
(388, 388, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"BSI IT-Grundschutz\",\"ISO 27001\",\"ISMS\",\"Führungserfahrung\",\"Hochschulumfeld / öffentliche Verwaltung\",\"Gremienarbeit\",\"Business Continuity Management (BCM)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and cybersecurity research, but the role requires deep domain expertise in BSI IT-Grundschutz, ISO 27001, ISMS implementation, and leadership experience specifically within the university or public administration sector. The applicant\'s cybersecurity experience is research-oriented (blockchain, post-quantum cryptography, UAV security) rather than operational ISMS or BCM management. The role also requires team leadership and stakeholder coordination at a state level, which is not reflected in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leitung Servicezentrum Informationssicherheit position at Hochschul-IT-Services.nrw. The opportunity to shape the information security framework for universities across NRW, working at the intersection of strategy, coordination, and technical implementation, is exactly the kind of challenge I want to take on.\n\nMy work has consistently focused on building secure, resilient systems. Through research and development, I designed OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks that integrates Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography to protect data integrity and anonymity. This project required deep thinking about threat models, cryptographic guarantees, and decentralized trust architectures. I also developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard with role-based access control and secure authentication, ensuring only authorized users could access sensitive system metrics.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the chance to move beyond individual system security and help build a unified information security framework for 36 universities. The responsibilities around developing BSI-standard-compliant ISMS, advising institutions on cybersecurity strategy, and coordinating working groups across ministries and academic stakeholders align with my experience in cross-functional collaboration and technical communication. I am comfortable translating complex security concepts into actionable guidance for diverse audiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cybersecurity, secure systems, and technical coordination can contribute to SISB.nrw and the broader digital infrastructure of NRW\'s universities.', '2026-06-09 03:14:37.487', '2026-06-09 03:14:37.487'),
(389, 389, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Facility management experience\",\"Technical infrastructure coordination\",\"Invoice processing\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong coordination and communication skills from professional web development experience. However, the role requires facility management knowledge, technical infrastructure coordination, invoice processing, and likely German language skills, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Facility Management position at TIGER Deutschland GmbH. Your description of a role where someone takes ownership of coordination, analyzes situations, and brings structure to workflows resonates with me. I am currently a Software Engineering student at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, Russia, and I am looking for a working student position where I can contribute meaningfully rather than just observe.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on independent thinking and responsibility. You are looking for someone who wants to think along, take ownership, and truly make a difference. That matches my approach to work. In my previous professional experience as a web developer, I was responsible for coordinating with stakeholders, managing task priorities, and ensuring transparent communication across teams. These experiences have prepared me to handle the coordination and documentation tasks described in this position.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in Voronezh and willing to relocate to Cologne for this on-site position. I am available for 16-20 hours per week and can adapt my schedule around my studies. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-09 03:14:44.430', '2026-06-09 03:14:44.430'),
(390, 390, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"Social Media Campaigns\",\"Google Ads\",\"SEA\",\"Email Marketing\",\"Content Publishing\",\"Campaign Monitoring\",\"Data Interpretation\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct marketing, performance marketing, or campaign management experience. The role requires a student in marketing or a related field with practical experience in running social media and SEA campaigns. While the applicant has strong analytical and technical skills, the core requirements of the position are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Performance Marketer position at BrainersHub GmbH. Your focus on hands-on campaign work in the healthcare sector and long-term development of student talent aligns well with what I am looking for in a working student role.\n\nAlthough my primary background is in software engineering, I bring a strong analytical and data-driven approach that is directly relevant to performance marketing. Through my web development work, I have built systems involving user engagement tracking, content management, and real-time data monitoring. These experiences have trained me to interpret metrics, identify patterns, and make data-informed decisions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is campaign monitoring and optimization. In previous projects, I have implemented features that track user interactions and generate performance reports. I am comfortable working with analytics tools, interpreting key performance indicators, and using data to guide improvements. I am eager to apply this analytical mindset to social media campaigns, Google Ads, and other performance marketing channels.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a quick learner with a hands-on mentality, ready to take responsibility from day one. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-09 03:14:52.712', '2026-06-09 03:14:52.712');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(391, 391, 1, 35, '[\"Kotlin\",\"AWS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Spring ecosystem (Spring Boot, Spring Data)\",\"Event-driven design (asynchronous processing, messaging, domain events)\",\"5 years of Kotlin experience\",\"NoSQL (DynamoDB)\"]', 'The applicant has Kotlin listed as a skill and has experience with AWS, databases, and backend services, but lacks the required 5 years of Kotlin experience, Spring ecosystem expertise, and event-driven design experience that are core to this senior role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Kotlin Backend Engineer position at Flix. The role\'s focus on building reliable, data-correct backend systems for finance technology aligns with my experience in designing scalable services and owning features end-to-end.\n\nMy backend engineering background includes working with Kotlin, Node.js, Express.js, and building RESTful APIs with authentication, role-based access control, and database optimization. I have practical experience with AWS, Docker, and Linux for deployment and monitoring, and I am comfortable working with both relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL as well as NoSQL systems like MongoDB.\n\nIn previous work, I owned features from technical design through implementation, testing, deployment, and ongoing maintenance. I collaborated closely with product owners and stakeholders to translate business requirements into robust technical solutions, ensuring data accuracy and system reliability. I have also worked on event-driven features using WebSockets and Socket.IO for real-time data processing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend engineering skills can contribute to Flix\'s finance technology stream.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:14:59.966', '2026-06-09 03:14:59.966'),
(392, 392, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"YouTube strategy\",\"scriptwriting\",\"storytelling\",\"content packaging\",\"analytics-driven content optimization\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong communication and technical explanation skills, but lacks direct YouTube strategy, scriptwriting, and content packaging experience. The role requires specific YouTube content creation skills that are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the YouTube-Stratege & Skript-Autor position at TäglichTechnik. The opportunity to help a company grow its YouTube presence by turning complex technical topics into compelling, watchable content aligns directly with how I approach communication in my own work.\n\nAs a full-stack and AI engineer, I regularly explain intricate systems, architectures, and technical decisions to both technical and non-technical audiences. Whether documenting API workflows, writing project overviews, or presenting research findings, I focus on clarity, structure, and engagement. I understand that a strong hook, clear pacing, and thoughtful storytelling are what separate content that gets watched from content that gets scrolled past.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on making complex topics simple without making them shallow. That is a balance I work hard to maintain in everything I build and write. I am comfortable analyzing performance metrics and using them to refine both strategy and execution. I also enjoy thinking about packaging, including titles, thumbnails, and hooks that drive CTR and watch time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would be happy to share writing samples. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to TäglichTechnik\'s YouTube growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:15:08.199', '2026-06-09 03:15:08.199'),
(393, 393, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Video editing\",\"2D animation\",\"YouTube content creation\",\"Music and sound design\",\"Storytelling for video\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no video editing or YouTube content creation experience listed in their profile. While they mention being a quick learner and having an understanding of YouTube mechanics in their cover letter, their professional background does not include any video editing, 2D animation, or storytelling skills relevant to this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Video Editor/Cutter position for YouTube at TäglichTechnik. Your approach to making complex topics accessible and engaging through well-crafted video content is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nAlthough my primary career path has been in software engineering, I have developed a solid understanding of what makes YouTube content work effectively. I understand the importance of hooks, pacing, and watchtime, and I have experience structuring content to maintain viewer attention from start to finish.\n\nWhat I bring to this role is a strong sense of timing, flow, and storytelling. I enjoy working with raw footage and shaping it into something polished and engaging. I am comfortable with 2D animation concepts and have an eye for clean, modern edits that feel dynamic without being distracting.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a quick learner who works independently and is eager to dive into new topics. I would be happy to share work samples as requested. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-09 03:15:15.714', '2026-06-09 03:15:15.714'),
(394, 394, 1, 45, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Python\"]', '[\"Kafka\",\"Snowflake\",\"Terraform\",\"GitLab CI/CD\",\"Datadog\",\"dbt\",\"PySpark\",\"Data Warehousing\",\"Streaming Technologies\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational experience with AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana), which partially matches the infrastructure and DevOps aspects of the Data Platform Engineer role. However, the profile lacks direct experience with data-specific technologies such as Kafka, Snowflake, Terraform, and data warehousing, which are core to this position. The match is moderate, with potential for growth in data platform engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Platform Engineer (Mid-Level) position at Flix. Your work in building scalable data infrastructure to support mobility services like network planning and pricing is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to a platform that processes millions of daily events.\n\nMy experience includes working with AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, which directly supports the design and maintenance of scalable data infrastructure. I have deployed applications on AWS EC2, managed containerized environments with Docker and Kubernetes, and set up monitoring using Prometheus and Grafana. These skills align with the responsibilities of building reliable data systems and ensuring platform performance.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have owned features end-to-end, from development and testing to deployment and monitoring. I have also implemented Infrastructure as Code practices and automated deployment workflows. This background prepares me to contribute to the reliability and automation of your data platform.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support the FlixTech data platform team.', '2026-06-09 03:15:23.301', '2026-06-09 03:15:23.301'),
(395, 395, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"HR / People Operations experience (4+ years)\",\"German language (C1)\",\"German labor law knowledge\",\"HRIS systems (Workday, SAP SuccessFactors, BambooHR)\",\"Stakeholder management in HR context\",\"Mixed workforce management (blue-collar/white-collar)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR operations experience, German language skills, or HR compliance knowledge. The only potential overlap is the nice-to-have AI/automation experience for HR process optimization, but this is insufficient for a Senior HR Operations Manager role requiring 4+ years of HR experience and native-level German.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior HR Operations Manager position at Flix. What stands out to me about FlixTrain is the combination of sustainable mobility and a pragmatic, action-oriented culture where people build systems instead of just reacting to problems. That approach matches how I work.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, with a focus on building automated systems that reduce manual effort and improve operational reliability. Over the past four years, I have developed full-stack applications, real-time monitoring dashboards, and AI-powered tools that streamline complex workflows. I am comfortable identifying inefficiencies, designing scalable solutions, and implementing them end to end.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process automation using AI tools. I have built systems that integrate OpenAI and Replicate APIs for intelligent task processing, automated reporting pipelines with Cron job scheduling, and real-time data dashboards using Socket.IO and Grafana. These experiences align directly with your goal of using KI-Tools to optimize HR processes and reduce manual workloads.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my automation and process optimization experience can contribute to Flix\'s People Team.', '2026-06-09 03:15:31.183', '2026-06-09 03:15:31.183'),
(396, 396, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"4+ years HR/People Operations experience\",\"German language (C1)\",\"German labor law knowledge\",\"HRIS systems (Workday, SAP SuccessFactors, BambooHR)\",\"Stakeholder management in HR context\",\"Mixed workforce management (blue/white collar)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR or People Operations experience. The role requires 4+ years of HR experience, German language proficiency (C1), German labor law knowledge, and HRIS system expertise. The applicant\'s skills in AI tools and process automation are relevant to the nice-to-have requirements, but the core HR qualifications are missing. Overall match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Manager People Operations role at Flix. What draws me to this opportunity is the chance to apply my technical and process-oriented mindset to a domain where operational excellence directly impacts people and business outcomes.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have spent years designing systems that are efficient, scalable, and automated. I have practical experience using AI tools and workflow automation to identify inefficiencies, build dashboards, and create reporting structures that support data-driven decisions. This aligns directly with the process optimization and digitalization responsibilities outlined in the role.\n\nIn previous work, I have built systems that reduced manual effort through automation, improved data quality, and enabled real-time monitoring. I approach problems with a builder\'s mindset: I document processes, design scalable solutions, and focus on long-term improvement rather than quick fixes. I am comfortable working under tight deadlines and collaborating across teams to ensure smooth operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in process automation and operational design can contribute to the People Operations team at Flix.', '2026-06-09 03:15:38.900', '2026-06-09 03:15:38.900'),
(397, 397, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Product Management experience\",\"German language (fluent/native)\",\"Construction industry experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with experience building and shipping products end-to-end, which provides a good technical foundation for a Product Manager role. However, the profile lacks direct Product Management experience, German language proficiency (required at native level), and experience in the construction/handwerk industry. The role is a Founding Product Manager position at a Y Combinator startup, requiring customer discovery, product ownership, and project management skills that are not explicitly demonstrated in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Product Manager position at CoCrafter (YC W24). Your mission to build the operating system for subcontractor management in the construction industry is exactly the kind of ambitious, real-world problem I want to work on. The opportunity to join a Y Combinator-backed startup at this early stage and shape a product that addresses inefficiencies in a traditional industry is compelling.\n\nMy background combines strong technical understanding with hands-on product delivery. As a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have built and shipped complete features end-to-end, from initial concept and customer discovery through design, development, and deployment. I am used to working directly with users, understanding their pain points, and translating those insights into practical solutions that engineering teams can execute.\n\nIn previous roles, I have owned product streams independently, managed project timelines, and coordinated across teams to deliver complex features. I have experience with authentication systems, payment integrations, real-time features, and scalable API design. This technical foundation allows me to communicate effectively with engineers while keeping the customer\'s needs at the center of every decision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my product thinking, technical skills, and startup mindset to CoCrafter. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-09 03:15:47.510', '2026-06-09 03:15:47.510'),
(398, 398, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Tag Manager (GTM)\",\"Google Analytics 4 (GA4)\",\"Google Ads Conversion Tracking\",\"Google Tag\",\"Lead-Tracking\",\"E-Commerce Tracking\",\"dataLayer\",\"Shopify\",\"WooCommerce\",\"Shopware\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills but lacks direct experience with Google Ads tracking, GA4, GTM, and e-commerce tracking platforms. The match is low for this specialized tracking role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Tracking Spezialist Google Ads position at Die SEA-Experten GmbH & Co. KG. Your focus on conversion tracking, GA4, and Google Tag Manager aligns with my technical background in building and debugging complex web systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with web technologies including JavaScript, TypeScript, and various backend frameworks. This has given me a strong understanding of how data flows through web applications, how events are triggered, and how to implement and verify tracking mechanisms. I am comfortable working with dataLayer structures, event configurations, and debugging tools to ensure data accuracy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of diagnosing and resolving tracking issues. In my previous work, I regularly debugged API integrations, data pipelines, and third-party service connections. I approach problems methodically, isolating variables and testing systematically until the root cause is found. This structured approach would serve me well in identifying and fixing tracking discrepancies in Google Ads, GA4, and GTM setups.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:15:55.166', '2026-06-09 03:15:55.166'),
(399, 399, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Ausbildung als Steuerfachangestellte/r oder vergleichbare Ausbildung\",\"Umfangreiche Erfahrung in Abläufen und Prozessen in Steuerkanzleien\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Berufserfahrung in einer Steuerkanzlei oder in der Beratung von Steuerkanzleien\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong analytical and problem-solving skills, but lacks the required tax-specific education, experience in tax firm processes, German language proficiency, and direct tax consulting background that this role demands.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerfachangestellte / Steuerfachwirt / Steuerassistent position at Desch Digital GmbH. Your focus on helping tax firms digitize their processes, streamline operations, and reduce administrative burden is exactly the kind of environment where my analytical and technical background can add value.\n\nAlthough my formal training is in software engineering, the core of your role requires structured thinking, the ability to understand complex workflows, and clear communication with stakeholders. These are skills I have developed and applied consistently throughout my career. In my work as a Web Developer, I regularly engaged with clients and team members to understand their operational challenges, translated those into clear requirements, and built solutions that fit into real daily workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on automation to relieve workload in tax firms. Through my development experience, I have built systems that automate repetitive tasks, maintain up-to-date templates, and create tools that people can use immediately without training overhead. I am comfortable working independently, preparing thoroughly for client meetings, and following through on commitments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical approach and structured working style can support Desch Digital\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:16:02.968', '2026-06-09 03:16:02.968'),
(400, 400, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"MS Office\",\"Administration experience\",\"Healthcare billing knowledge\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong analytical and data management skills but lacks direct experience in administration, healthcare billing, MS Office, and German language, which are key requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sachbearbeiter (m/w/d) position at DHG Deutsche Hörakustik GmbH. Your company\'s mission to improve hearing and quality of life through mobile service is meaningful work, and I would be glad to support your team in the backoffice.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed a precise and structured approach to handling data, documentation, and process optimization. My work has involved managing complex databases, ensuring data integrity, and maintaining clear records across multiple systems.\n\nIn previous roles, I built and maintained applications that required careful attention to detail, accurate data entry, and systematic problem-solving. I am comfortable working independently, following established procedures, and collaborating with team members to keep operations running smoothly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:16:09.583', '2026-06-09 03:16:09.583'),
(401, 401, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Abgeschlossene kaufmännische Ausbildung oder Studium\",\"Erfahrung in oder mit Steuerkanzleien\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong analytical and process-oriented skills. However, the role requires a business economist (Betriebswirt) with a commercial background, experience in tax firms, and very good German language skills. The applicant\'s profile does not match these core requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Betriebswirt (m/w/d) position at Desch Digital GmbH. Your focus on helping tax firms digitize their processes, improve profitability, and operate more strategically is a challenge that aligns well with my analytical and systems-oriented approach.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, the core of my work has always been about understanding complex operational workflows, identifying bottlenecks, and designing structured improvements. I have spent years analyzing how systems and people interact, and translating those observations into practical, measurable changes. This analytical and solution-oriented mindset is directly applicable to the strategic consulting work your team does with partner tax firms.\n\nIn my experience delivering full-stack web applications, I worked closely with business stakeholders to understand their daily challenges and goals. I regularly conducted analysis of their existing processes, developed concrete action plans, and implemented solutions that improved efficiency and clarity. This required clear communication, structured preparation, and the ability to follow through on commitments without dropping details.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured work style, analytical thinking, and ability to drive process improvements would make me a strong addition to your team. I have attached my CV for your consideration and look forward to the possibility of contributing to Desch Digital\'s mission.', '2026-06-09 03:16:18.169', '2026-06-09 03:16:18.169'),
(402, 402, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Abgeschlossene kaufmännische Ausbildung oder Studium\",\"Erfahrung in oder mit Steuerkanzleien\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but the Kundenberater role at Desch Digital GmbH is a client-facing consulting position requiring commercial education, tax firm experience, and very good German language skills. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct match in these areas. The score is low because the role is non-technical and domain-specific.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kundenberater (m/w/d) position at Desch Digital GmbH. Your focus on helping tax firms digitalize their processes and improve client acquisition aligns with my own interest in using technology to solve practical business challenges.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, the core of my work has always been client-facing and solution-oriented. In my role as a Web Developer, I regularly conducted 1:1 meetings with stakeholders to understand their operational pain points, discuss requirements, and collaboratively develop solutions that worked in their daily workflows. This experience taught me how to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and ensure that recommendations translate into real-world action.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Desch Digital is your structured approach combining 1:1 consulting, a dedicated training platform, and community support. I am comfortable preparing thoroughly for client meetings, following up systematically, and adapting my communication style to different audiences. I also enjoy contributing ideas to improve service offerings based on direct client feedback.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team in Hamburg.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:16:26.116', '2026-06-09 03:16:26.116'),
(403, 403, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Hörakustiker (Geselle oder Meister)\",\"Erfahrung in der Krankenkassenabrechnung in der Hörakustik\",\"Sicherer Umgang mit Amparex oder vergleichbarer Hörakustik-Branchensoftware\"]', 'The applicant has no background in hearing acoustics, audiology, or health insurance billing. The required qualifications (certified hearing acoustician, experience with health insurance billing in hearing acoustics, and familiarity with Amparex or similar industry software) are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Hörakustiker im Innendienst position at DHG Deutsche Hörakustik GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than hearing acoustics, I bring a strong foundation in structured data management, documentation, and process optimization that directly supports the core responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with data systems, including designing and maintaining databases, building APIs for secure data exchange, and implementing role-based access control. These responsibilities required careful attention to detail, accuracy in record-keeping, and the ability to manage complex workflows. I am confident these skills translate well to handling billing processes, maintaining customer records, and supporting administrative operations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to process improvement. In previous roles, I have supported the optimization of internal workflows by identifying inefficiencies and implementing practical solutions. I approach tasks with a structured and precise mindset, ensuring that documentation is thorough and systems remain reliable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-09 03:16:33.997', '2026-06-09 03:16:33.997'),
(404, 404, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Healthcare billing experience\",\"Insurance/Krankenkassen knowledge\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in healthcare operations, billing, or administration. The role requires backoffice and administrative skills specific to the German healthcare system, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Manager (m/w/d) position at DHG Deutsche Hörakustik GmbH. Your focus on enabling a mobile hearing aid service through efficient backoffice operations and process improvement is something I find genuinely meaningful. The opportunity to contribute to a team that directly improves people\'s quality of life is what draws me to this role.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed a strong set of transferable skills that align well with the responsibilities of this position. Through my work as a Web Developer, I have managed complex data flows, maintained meticulous documentation, and ensured accuracy in every detail. I am comfortable working with numbers and data, and I approach problems with a structured, solution-oriented mindset.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process improvement. In my previous roles, I have actively contributed to refining workflows and implementing more efficient ways of handling data and communication. I am confident I can bring this same proactive approach to your backoffice operations, helping to streamline billing processes and maintain clean, traceable records.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to take on responsibility and contribute to your team\'s success. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support your mobile hearing aid service.', '2026-06-09 03:16:41.591', '2026-06-09 03:16:41.591'),
(405, 405, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"MS Office (Word, Excel, Outlook)\",\"MAC iOS\",\"kaufmännische Erfahrung\",\"Deutschkenntnisse (gut in Wort und Schrift)\",\"Buchhaltungskenntnisse\",\"Büroorganisation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is for a Büroassistenz (office assistant) role requiring administrative experience, MS Office proficiency, and good German language skills. The applicant\'s profile does not match these requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Büroassistenz position at Shan GmbH. Your concept store at KaDeWe combines luxury services under one roof, and I appreciate the professionalism required to support such an environment. I am a reliable and organized individual who enjoys administrative work and takes pride in keeping operations running smoothly.\n\nThrough my previous work in software development, I developed strong skills in documentation, email management, scheduling, and structured task coordination. I am accustomed to handling multiple responsibilities simultaneously while maintaining accuracy and clear communication. These habits transfer naturally to office administration.\n\nI am comfortable with MS Office and MAC iOS, and I can quickly adapt to your existing workflows. I approach every task with care, whether it is managing correspondence, organizing documents, or supporting the Geschäftsleitung with daily administrative needs.\n\nIn addition to my organizational abilities, I work well in team environments and communicate clearly with colleagues at all levels. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of German and Russian, and enjoy collaborating in international settings.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team at Shan GmbH.', '2026-06-09 03:16:48.678', '2026-06-09 03:16:48.678'),
(406, 406, 1, 65, '[\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\"]', '[\"LLM-Erfahrung (beyond OpenAI API)\",\"RAG / Retrieval-Systeme (Qdrant, Weaviate, ChromaDB)\",\"Vektordatenbanken\",\"Strukturierte Datenpipelines\",\"Sicheres Deutsch im Arbeitskontext\"]', 'The applicant has strong Python and AI project experience, including building applications with OpenAI APIs and data processing. However, the job requires specific experience with RAG systems, vector databases, and structured data pipelines, which are not explicitly mentioned in the profile. The applicant also lacks the required German language proficiency. Overall, there is a moderate match with potential for growth.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior AI Engineer Anwendungen & Daten position at Kivvo. Building a data-sovereign business AI for the German Mittelstand is a meaningful challenge, and I want to contribute to making it a reality.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered applications that combine Python, LLM APIs, and data processing. For example, I developed an AI-powered financial application where I integrated OpenAI\'s latest models, trained AI assistants on custom datasets, and built data pipelines that process voice messages via AWS Transcribe and generate PDF term sheets automatically. This required working with real data flows, not just prototypes.\n\nI have also worked on an AI-powered real estate platform where I integrated the Replicate API for image processing and built multiple AI assistants using GPT models. These projects gave me practical experience with LLM APIs, data preparation, and building features that rely on retrieval and contextual understanding. I am comfortable experimenting with RAG concepts and vector-based retrieval systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can build real products, take ownership, and learn from a small team. Kivvo sounds like that place. I have attached my CV and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute.', '2026-06-09 03:16:57.110', '2026-06-09 03:16:57.110'),
(407, 407, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"RAG/Retrieval systems\",\"Vector databases (Qdrant, Weaviate, ChromaDB)\",\"Structured data pipelines\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has solid Python experience from an internship and multiple AI projects using OpenAI APIs and LLMs, which aligns with the core Python and LLM requirements. However, the role specifically requires RAG/retrieval systems, vector databases, and structured data pipelines, which are not present in the profile. German language proficiency is also a requirement. The applicant\'s hands-on AI project work and independent learning ability are strong positives, but the specialized retrieval and data pipeline skills are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Python Developer Kl & Retrieval position at Kivvo. Your focus on building a truly data-sovereign business AI for German SMEs, hosted in Germany with privacy embedded in the architecture, is exactly the kind of practical, high-impact AI work I want to be part of.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered applications that go beyond prototypes. I developed the backend for an AI-powered financial app using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI, where I created AI assistants trained on custom datasets, implemented voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe, and built secure authentication with OTP, Google, and Facebook login. I also built an AI-powered real estate platform that integrated OpenAI assistants with Replicate AI for image processing, role-based access, subscription plans, and Stripe payments. These projects gave me practical experience with LLM APIs, data processing, and building features that users actually interact with.\n\nI am comfortable working with Python, processing and preparing data for AI workflows, and experimenting with LLMs and retrieval concepts. My internship at Global IT involved building Python and Django applications, optimizing PostgreSQL databases, and debugging production systems. I approach problems pragmatically, whether writing custom code or integrating existing tools, and I am used to working independently on new topics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to building Kivvo.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:17:05.832', '2026-06-09 03:17:05.832'),
(408, 408, 1, 25, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Docker\"]', '[\"LabVIEW\",\"Beckhoff/Siemens SPS\",\"CAN-Bus\",\"USB\",\"RS232\",\"Elektrotechnik degree\",\"Mechatronik degree\",\"Automatisierungstechnik degree\"]', 'The applicant has foundational programming skills in C++ and Python, along with experience in Linux, Git, and Docker, which are transferable to embedded and automation contexts. However, the role specifically requires LabVIEW or PLC programming experience, expertise with industrial bus systems (CAN-Bus, RS232), and a degree in electrical engineering, mechatronics, or automation technology. The applicant\'s background in software engineering and UAV research provides some adjacent experience, but there is a significant gap in the core hardware and automation skills required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entwicklungsingenieur position at WSK Elektronik GmbH, part of Edelmut Media GmbH. The description of a role where one person owns the full development cycle from concept and schematic through LabVIEW code to commissioning matches exactly the kind of engineering work I find most meaningful.\n\nThrough my research and project work, I have built systems that combine embedded hardware, real-time software, and sensor integration. One project that directly relates to this role is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), where I developed a complete system using a Raspberry Pi, ESP32-CAM, and YOLOv8n for real-time object detection. I handled the full pipeline: hardware selection, UDP-based low-latency streaming, C++ and Python programming for inference, and multilingual audio feedback. This required working with bus-level communication, testing in a lab environment, and documenting the technical architecture.\n\nI am comfortable with the technical mix this role demands. I have programmed in C++ and Python for embedded applications, worked with Ethernet TCP/IP communication, and developed systems that require both hardware understanding and clean software implementation. I approach projects with the mindset of building something that works reliably from the first prototype through to deployment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system-level development could contribute to the projects at WSK Elektronik.', '2026-06-09 03:17:14.725', '2026-06-09 03:17:14.725');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(409, 409, 1, 72, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Vue JS\",\"Figma\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Vue.js (listed as Vue JS in profile, but job requires Vue.js with Inertia)\",\"Inertia.js\",\"Vite\",\"GitHub Actions/GitLab CI\",\"Domain Driven Design\",\"Electron\",\"Desktop Applications\",\"German language proficiency (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Claude Code/Cursor/AI-IDEs as daily driver\",\"Anthropic API/LLM APIs\",\"MCP/Agentic Workflows\",\"Custom GPTs\"]', 'Strong match on core Laravel/PHP and JavaScript/TypeScript full-stack skills with professional experience. Profile shows Laravel, React, Next.js, MySQL, and API development. Missing specific Vue.js/Inertia.js experience, Vite, and the AI-native toolset (Claude Code, Anthropic API, agentic workflows) that the job emphasizes. German language requirement is not mentioned in profile. Overall a solid technical foundation with gaps in the specific stack and AI workflow tools.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Full Stack Developer Laravel & Vue.js position at ZEP GmbH. Your work building the next product generation for over 3,000 Mittelstand companies, combined with your focus on AI-native development, stands out to me. I appreciate the emphasis on combining solid engineering with AI-driven workflows rather than treating AI as a separate feature.\n\nMy professional background is rooted in full-stack development with Laravel and modern JavaScript frameworks. Over the past several years, I have built and maintained production web applications where Laravel served as the backbone for backend logic, API design, and database management. I have worked extensively with MySQL, Eloquent query optimization, and caching strategies to ensure performance at scale. On the frontend side, I am comfortable with TypeScript, React, and Next.js, and I have experience building responsive, component-driven interfaces that prioritize user experience.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your plan to build AI products and agentic workflows directly into the platform. I have integrated OpenAI and Replicate APIs into full-stack applications, building AI assistants trained on custom datasets and handling image processing pipelines. I understand the difference between AI as a prototype and AI as a production architecture, and I approach both with the same engineering discipline.\n\nIn my previous role, I was responsible for architecting features from data model to deployment, including role-based access control, real-time notifications via WebSockets, and third-party integrations like payment gateways and cloud storage. I also participated in code reviews, maintained coding standards, and worked closely with designers and product managers to align technical decisions with business goals. I am comfortable working in agile setups and contributing to strategic discussions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to ZEP\'s next generation of products.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-09 03:17:25.209', '2026-06-09 03:17:25.209'),
(410, 410, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Energy market domain knowledge (PPA, Bilanzkreis, Spot/term trading)\",\"Product Manager or Product Owner experience\",\"German native-level language\",\"Residence in Germany\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack engineering and product delivery skills but lacks the required energy market domain expertise, product management experience, German language proficiency, and residence in Germany. The role is a senior product position requiring deep energy trading knowledge, which is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Manager role at Otark GmbH. Your mission to build the operating system for renewable energy procurement and trading is ambitious and timely, and I find the intersection of energy markets, platform design, and automation genuinely compelling.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering and product delivery. Over the past four years, I have designed, built, and shipped production platforms from concept to deployment. I have worked directly with stakeholders to translate market and user needs into clear technical requirements, and I have owned features end-to-end, from validation through to launch. I am comfortable working autonomously and making decisions based on user impact rather than feature volume.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is in bridging the gap between domain complexity and software execution. I have experience building platforms that handle multi-role workflows, real-time data, and third-party integrations. I also actively use AI tools to prototype ideas, validate assumptions, and accelerate development cycles. I understand how to structure requirements so that engineering teams can move fast without ambiguity.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product and engineering experience could support Otark\'s platform vision.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-09 03:17:33.426', '2026-06-09 03:17:33.426'),
(411, 411, 1, 45, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Claude AI\",\"NoCoDB\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has general AI and automation experience from building AI-powered applications with OpenAI and integrating APIs. However, the job specifically requires Claude AI expertise, NoCoDB database skills, and German language proficiency, none of which are present in the profile. The match is moderate for general AI knowledge but weak for the specific tools and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/q) KI Künstliche Intelligenz Claude position at FREQUENTUM. Your work in helping property managers and energy providers build new business areas around e-mobility, charging technology, and sustainable energy solutions is genuinely interesting. The opportunity to apply AI directly to real-world business processes in this sector is what draws me to this role.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered systems that combine language models with automated workflows. I developed an AI assistant using OpenAI\'s latest models, integrated it with a financial application, and connected it to features like voice-to-text transcription, automated email generation, and PDF document creation. This experience directly applies to using Claude for sales processes, automated mailings, and planning tasks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building structured databases and connecting them with AI tools. I have worked with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB in production environments, and I am comfortable setting up data pipelines that feed into AI-driven workflows. I am confident I can quickly adapt to NoCoDB and help your team build the database infrastructure needed for your projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to FREQUENTUM\'s mission of bringing innovative AI projects to life.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:17:41.424', '2026-06-09 03:17:41.424'),
(412, 412, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Legal expertise\",\"Litigation experience\",\"Legal document review\",\"Case law research\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no legal background or experience. The job requires legal expertise and litigation contract work, which does not match the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Judicial Law Clerk position at LegalTrustAI. Your focus on legal technology and AI-driven solutions is an area I find genuinely compelling, and I believe my technical background can contribute meaningfully to your team.\n\nThrough my research and development work, I have built secure, data-driven systems that prioritize integrity, authentication, and role-based access control. These are the same principles that underpin reliable legal document management and case workflow systems. My experience designing APIs and database architectures has given me a strong foundation in handling sensitive information with precision and accountability.\n\nIn previous work, I developed full-stack applications where data validation, audit trails, and user permissions were critical requirements. I am comfortable working with structured data, implementing secure authentication flows, and ensuring that systems maintain accuracy under real-world usage. These skills translate directly to the meticulous handling of legal documents and case information.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-09 03:17:48.115', '2026-06-09 03:17:48.115'),
(413, 413, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Open Heavy Rigid (HR) class licence\",\"Driving assessment experience\",\"Clear driving record\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct match with the Driving Examiner role requirements. The position requires a Heavy Rigid (HR) licence, driving assessment experience, and a clear driving record, none of which are present in the applicant\'s software engineering background. The applicant\'s strong analytical and procedural skills are transferable but do not meet the core licensing and assessment requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Driving Examiner position at the Department of Customer Services, Open Data and Small and Family Business. The role\'s focus on conducting fair assessments, promoting road safety, and contributing to community services aligns with my disciplined approach and commitment to quality.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, attention to detail, and the ability to follow structured procedures precisely. These qualities are directly transferable to evaluating driving skills, ensuring compliance with standards, and providing clear feedback to candidates.\n\nI hold a valid driving license with a clean record and understand the importance of road safety. I am prepared to undergo any required training to meet the specific requirements of this role, including obtaining the necessary Heavy Rigid licence.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and dedication can contribute to the department\'s goals.', '2026-06-09 03:17:53.878', '2026-06-09 03:17:53.878'),
(414, 414, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[]', 'The job description for \'Farmer REMOTO\' at ADVBOX is very brief and lacks specific technical requirements. It mentions making legal services more efficient and digital, but does not list any required skills, tools, or responsibilities. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development skills, but without a clear job description, the match cannot be accurately assessed. The score is low due to insufficient job information.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Farmer REMOTO position at ADVBOX. Your mission to make legal services more efficient, human, and digital resonates with my approach to building practical, user-focused software.\n\nWith over four years of professional web development experience, I have built full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I focus on clean architecture, secure authentication, and responsive interfaces that work well for both users and administrators.\n\nIn my previous work, I have developed scalable platforms with REST APIs, role-based access control, payment integration, and real-time features using WebSockets. I have also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to ADVBOX.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 03:17:59.606', '2026-06-09 03:17:59.606'),
(415, 415, 1, 30, '[]', '[\"Studio coordination experience\",\"Architectural visualization knowledge\",\"Project management tools\"]', 'The applicant has strong organizational and remote collaboration skills from software engineering roles but lacks direct studio coordination or architectural visualization experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Studio Coordinator position at Rockhunter. While my background is primarily in software engineering, I bring strong organizational skills, remote collaboration experience, and a track record of managing complex workflows across distributed teams.\n\nIn my recent work as a full-stack developer, I coordinated project timelines, communicated with stakeholders, and ensured deliverables were completed on schedule. I am accustomed to managing multiple moving parts simultaneously and maintaining clarity in fast-moving environments.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical team members.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Rockhunter\'s studio operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-09 03:18:05.351', '2026-06-09 03:18:05.351'),
(416, 416, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Medical terminology\",\"CPT codes\",\"ICD-9/10 codes\",\"10-key proficiency\",\"Facets platform\",\"Medical office experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering and web development, which does not directly align with the medical claims processing role. While the applicant has strong general skills in data entry, organization, and analytical reasoning, they lack the specific medical terminology, coding knowledge, and healthcare industry experience required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Medical Claims Processor I position at Moda Health. Your company\'s long-standing commitment to quality healthcare and community support is impressive, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I bring strong data entry skills, attention to detail, and the ability to work accurately under deadlines. I am comfortable navigating multiple screens and systems, and I follow procedures carefully to ensure quality and compliance.\n\nIn previous work, I have consistently demonstrated punctuality, organization, and the flexibility to adapt to changing priorities. I am comfortable working independently in a remote setting and maintaining balanced performance across production and quality metrics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-09 03:18:11.710', '2026-06-09 03:18:11.710'),
(417, 417, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"SAP FI/CO\",\"SAP ECC\",\"S/4HANA\",\"German (C1)\"]', 'The applicant has no matching skills for this SAP FI/CO Consultant role. The profile is focused on full-stack web development and AI engineering, with no SAP experience or German language proficiency.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP Finance Control Consultant role at Recruit 121 Group. While my professional background is in full-stack and AI engineering, I am drawn to the challenge of complex system transformations and the opportunity to work with established consulting firms serving international clients.\n\nMy technical foundation includes strong skills in Laravel, React, Node.js, and database systems like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have experience building scalable web applications, integrating third-party services, and deploying on cloud infrastructure. This background has given me a solid understanding of how enterprise systems are architected, integrated, and maintained.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I designed and developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance. I also collaborated closely with stakeholders to deliver features on time. These experiences have prepared me to work independently on project modules and communicate effectively with clients.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 15:14:34.528', '2026-06-09 15:14:34.528'),
(418, 418, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"SAP Retail\",\"SAP SD/MM\",\"SAP FI\",\"S/4HANA\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Consulting experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no SAP, retail consulting, or German language experience. The role requires deep SAP Retail or SAP SD/MM expertise, S/4HANA transformation experience, and fluent German — none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP Retail Consultancy position at Recruit 121 Group. Your firm\'s focus on guiding medium-sized retail and wholesale companies through complex SAP transformations, including S/4HANA migrations and greenfield implementations, aligns with my interest in building robust, end-to-end systems that solve real business problems.\n\nWhile my professional experience is rooted in software engineering rather than SAP consulting, I bring a strong systems-thinking approach and hands-on experience with full-stack development, database design, and integration work. In my previous roles, I have designed and built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL, and I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and third-party service integrations. This technical foundation gives me the ability to quickly understand complex enterprise systems and contribute to analysis, configuration, and integration tasks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work on end-to-end process design and customer-facing consulting. In my work as a web developer, I have collaborated directly with stakeholders to gather requirements, propose solutions, and deliver features that meet business needs. I am comfortable communicating with both technical and non-technical audiences, and I enjoy the problem-solving aspect of translating business challenges into practical system designs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to your team\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-09 15:14:42.111', '2026-06-09 15:14:42.111'),
(419, 419, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"German (native level)\",\"Social media understanding\",\"Marketing/communications studies\",\"Campaign management experience\",\"Dutch/French\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills, but the internship requires native-level German, a background in communications/marketing studies, and direct campaign management experience. There is minimal skill overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Internship Brand Partnerships & Campaign Management position at Meet5 GmbH. Your platform brings people together through shared experiences, and I find the mission of building meaningful social connections genuinely compelling. I am eager to contribute to your B2B team and learn how successful campaigns are created and managed for well-known partners.\n\nAlthough my academic background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills through hands-on project work and team collaboration. I am comfortable working independently, taking initiative, and supporting operational workflows. I enjoy contributing to process improvements and ensuring that tasks are completed reliably and on time.\n\nIn previous project work, I have been responsible for coordinating between different stakeholders, managing content updates, and monitoring system performance. These experiences have taught me to work in a structured way, pay close attention to detail, and communicate clearly with team members. I am confident I can apply the same discipline to campaign management, community moderation, and reporting tasks at Meet5.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi. I enjoy collaborating in diverse teams and am motivated to learn from experienced professionals in a startup environment. I am particularly interested in understanding how digital products and social media drive user engagement and brand partnerships.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team during this internship.', '2026-06-09 15:14:50.470', '2026-06-09 15:14:50.470'),
(420, 420, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"HR administration\",\"Recruiting\",\"MS Office (PowerPoint, Excel, Word)\",\"German language (very good)\",\"Business/Social Sciences/Psychology degree\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core HR Operations requirements. There are no matched skills. The applicant lacks HR-specific experience, relevant degree background, MS Office proficiency, and very good German language skills. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent*in (m/w/d) HR Operations position at inno2grid GmbH. Your work in the energy sector, particularly as a joint venture between DB E.C.O Group and Schneider Electric, is genuinely interesting to me. I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to a young, dynamic team while gaining practical experience in HR operations.\n\nAlthough my academic and professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and process-oriented skills through my work. In my previous role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for managing project workflows, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and ensuring that tasks were completed on time and with attention to detail. These experiences have taught me to work independently, prioritize effectively, and maintain clarity even when handling several responsibilities simultaneously.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, Russia. My studies have reinforced my ability to learn new concepts quickly, work systematically, and adapt to unfamiliar domains. I am confident that these qualities will allow me to quickly understand HR processes and contribute meaningfully to your team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to inno2grid.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 15:14:58.670', '2026-06-09 15:14:58.670'),
(421, 421, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Microsoft Purview\",\"Microsoft 365 (Defender XDR)\",\"GDPR/HIPAA/CCPA compliance\",\"5+ years Microsoft Cloud\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a strong foundation in cybersecurity research (encryption, blockchain, post-quantum cryptography) but lacks direct experience with Microsoft Purview, M365 Defender XDR, data protection regulations, and the required 5+ years of Microsoft Cloud experience. The role demands specialized Purview expertise which is not present in the candidate\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Cloud Security Expert (m/w/d) - specialised in Purview position at NVISO. Your mission to protect European society from cyber attacks through proactive security services is exactly the kind of impactful work I want to contribute to.\n\nMy cybersecurity experience centers on building secure, privacy-preserving systems for distributed and autonomous environments. Through research and development work, I have focused on data integrity, encryption, and resilience against cyber threats. I have worked with cryptographic primitives including SHA3-256 hashing, secure key exchange, and authentication mechanisms to protect sensitive data in transit and at rest.\n\nOne area that directly relates to this role is my work on OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks. In this project, I designed a decentralized security layer that ensures data integrity, anonymity, and resistance to post-quantum threats. The system uses cryptographic chaining and Zero-Knowledge Proofs to validate inter-vehicle communication without exposing sensitive information. This experience has given me practical understanding of data classification, encryption, and compliance-oriented security design.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in secure systems and data protection can support NVISO\'s mission.', '2026-06-09 15:15:06.003', '2026-06-09 15:15:06.003'),
(422, 422, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"KFZ-Mechatroniker Ausbildung (automotive mechanic training)\",\"vehicle disassembly experience\",\"automotive fluid handling\",\"professional automotive tools experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no formal automotive mechanic training or professional vehicle disassembly experience. While he has hands-on experience with embedded hardware and autonomous vehicle systems from research projects, this does not match the core requirements of a KFZ-Mechatroniker role which requires formal automotive training and practical vehicle maintenance skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the KFZ-Mechatroniker:in / Mechaniker:in position at LRP Autorecycling GmbH. Your company\'s focus on sustainable vehicle recycling and future-oriented technologies aligns with my hands-on experience in hardware systems and autonomous vehicle technologies.\n\nThrough my research and development work in autonomous systems, I have gained practical experience working with embedded hardware platforms including Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano. This work involved assembling, testing, and troubleshooting hardware components, as well as integrating sensors and communication modules into functional systems. I am comfortable with systematic disassembly, component handling, and following technical specifications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of vehicle technology and sustainable practices. In my project work on autonomous vehicle security and UAV systems, I developed a methodical approach to hardware testing, component verification, and system-level debugging. These experiences have given me strong attention to detail and the ability to work precisely according to quality standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my technical aptitude, hands-on experience with hardware systems, and structured approach to work would make me a valuable addition to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to LRP Autorecycling\'s continued success.', '2026-06-09 15:15:14.262', '2026-06-09 15:15:14.262'),
(423, 423, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Performance Marketing\",\"Account Management\",\"CRM\",\"Paid Marketing\",\"HubSpot\",\"Asana\",\"Google Ads\",\"Meta\",\"Retainer Management\",\"Agency Experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical project management and coordination skills from web development, but lacks direct experience in performance marketing, account management, or agency operations. The core responsibilities of this role are marketing-domain specific, which the profile does not cover.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Project & Account Manager (m/w/d) Performance Marketing position at ADLOCA GmbH. Your description of this role as the central hub connecting Paid, CRM, and Data teams while managing 15 to 20 retainer clients resonates with my experience coordinating complex technical projects across multiple teams and stakeholders.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I managed the full lifecycle of web application projects, balancing priorities across frontend development, backend engineering, and deployment operations. I regularly coordinated between designers, developers, and clients to ensure that expectations, timelines, and deliverables remained aligned. This required the same kind of structured oversight and clear communication that your role demands.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on data-driven decision-making. In my development work, I have built systems that track performance metrics, automate reporting, and surface actionable insights. I am comfortable reading data, identifying patterns, and making decisions based on numbers rather than intuition. I understand the importance of maintaining visibility across a broad portfolio and catching misalignments before they become problems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am drawn to the opportunity to grow into a leadership role within the agency over the next two years. The chance to help build processes and shape the direction of a growing team is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to ADLOCA GmbH.', '2026-06-09 15:15:23.063', '2026-06-09 15:15:23.063'),
(424, 424, 1, 65, '[\"Node JS\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Kubernetes\"]', '[\"NestJS\",\"Terraform\",\"Domain-Driven Design\",\"Hexagonal Architecture\",\"Ports & Adapters\",\"Key-value stores (e.g., Redis)\",\"5+ years distributed systems\",\"3+ years Node.js\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong foundational skills in Node.js, TypeScript, React, Express, MySQL, PostgreSQL, AWS, Docker, CI/CD, and Kubernetes. However, the job requires 5+ years of distributed systems experience, 3+ years of professional Node.js, and specific experience with NestJS, Terraform, Domain-Driven Design, and Hexagonal/Ports & Adapters architecture, which are not present in the profile. The match is moderate but the candidate\'s full-stack and DevOps experience provides a reasonable base.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer position at Flix. The mission of your Revenue Management Products team to build a cohesive ecosystem for pricing tools and services is exactly the kind of challenge I enjoy solving.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering with a strong focus on Node.js, TypeScript, React, and distributed system design. I have professional experience building and evolving products that handle real-time data, user authentication, and complex business logic. I am comfortable working with Express and React, and I apply TypeScript rigorously to ensure type safety and maintainability in production systems.\n\nIn previous work, I developed RESTful APIs, integrated third-party services, and deployed applications on AWS using Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I have worked with MySQL and PostgreSQL for structured data, and I understand the importance of clean architecture patterns like Domain-Driven Design and SOLID principles when building services that need to scale and evolve over time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to the continued evolution of Flix\'s Revenue Management Products.', '2026-06-09 15:15:30.727', '2026-06-09 15:15:30.727'),
(425, 425, 1, 55, '[\"Go\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"CI/CD\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Kotlin\",\"Java\",\"Elixir\",\"Production experience with Kotlin\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong backend engineering skills with Node.js, Express, Go, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and relational databases. He lacks production experience with Kotlin, Java, and Elixir, which are preferred for this role. His experience with distributed systems, API design, and containerization is relevant, but the Kotlin requirement is a gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer - Cards position at SumUp. Your mission to build simple, affordable financial tools for small businesses, combined with the technical depth of the Cards squad\'s high-throughput, distributed systems, makes this role particularly compelling to me.\n\nMy backend engineering experience centers on building production-ready services with Node.js, Express, and Laravel, and I have a solid understanding of distributed systems, API design, and relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have worked with containerization (Docker), orchestration (Kubernetes), and CI/CD practices to deliver reliable, scalable services. I also have experience with Go, which aligns with the languages your team uses.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have owned the end-to-end delivery of backend services, from architectural discussions and code reviews to production support and incident response. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database queries for performance. I am comfortable taking ambiguous product problems, defining the technical approach, and leading implementation with minimal guidance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend engineering skills can contribute to the Cards squad at SumUp.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-09 15:15:38.717', '2026-06-09 15:15:38.717'),
(426, 426, 1, 45, '[\"Go\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"REST API\",\"Node JS\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Kafka\",\"Kotlin\",\"Elixir\",\"Fintech experience\",\"Growth engineering experience\",\"Rules engines\",\"Reward/Incentive systems\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has solid backend engineering skills including Go, PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, and RESTful API design. However, the role requires specific experience with Golang in a production environment, Kafka for async processing, and fintech/growth engineering background, which are not clearly demonstrated in the provided profile. The candidate\'s experience is more aligned with full-stack web development using Laravel and Node.js rather than pure backend engineering with Go and event-driven architectures.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer - Activation and Revenue role at SumUp. Your mission to build a greenfield activation platform that converts millions of merchants into active banking users is exactly the kind of high-impact, growth-focused engineering challenge I want to be part of.\n\nWith professional experience in backend development using Go, Node.js, and Laravel, I have built and maintained RESTful APIs, designed database schemas in PostgreSQL and MySQL, and worked with Redis for caching and performance optimization. I am comfortable with system architecture, data modeling, and event-driven design principles. The opportunity to architect services like Banners, Rewards, and Feature Toggles from the ground up aligns directly with my technical background.\n\nIn previous work, I owned the full lifecycle of features from architectural design to production monitoring. I have deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, set up CI/CD pipelines, and implemented real-time communication using Socket.IO. I value clean, maintainable code and regularly refactor to keep systems simple and scalable. I am used to working in environments that move fast, test hypotheses, and iterate based on real-world data.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Bank Activation and Revenue team at SumUp.', '2026-06-09 15:15:47.692', '2026-06-09 15:15:47.692'),
(427, 427, 1, 55, '[\"Go\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Kotlin\",\"Elixir\",\"Java\",\"Kafka\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has solid backend engineering skills in Go, PostgreSQL, AWS, Docker, and Kubernetes, which match parts of SumUp\'s tech stack. However, the role requires primary expertise in Kotlin and significant experience with Kafka and event-driven architecture, which are not present in his profile. His experience with distributed systems and observability tools is relevant but not at the senior level this role demands.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer - Accounts role at SumUp. Your mission to build a unified global banking infrastructure for small merchants is exactly the kind of large-scale, high-impact engineering challenge I want to contribute to.\n\nMy backend engineering experience spans Go, PostgreSQL, AWS, Docker, and Kubernetes—technologies that directly overlap with your stack. I have designed and built RESTful APIs, modeled relational databases for consistency and performance, and deployed cloud-native applications on Linux servers with Nginx and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable working with distributed systems and understand the importance of decoupled, observable architectures.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is event-driven design. In a recent project, I built a real-time server monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, and Docker. The system streamed live metrics from multiple target URLs to connected clients, handling concurrent data streams with low latency. This experience gave me practical exposure to building resilient, event-driven systems that push data in real time—similar to the Kafka-based architecture your team relies on.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend engineering background can support SumUp\'s Global Accounts platform.', '2026-06-09 15:15:56.348', '2026-06-09 15:15:56.348');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(428, 428, 1, 15, '[\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\"]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"Go-to-market strategy experience\",\"Product portfolio management\",\"Native-level German language\",\"Azure cloud services\",\"Business development leadership\",\"VP/Growth leadership experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development, cloud infrastructure, and DevOps that match Coduct\'s software engineering domain. However, this is a senior executive growth role requiring B2B sales, go-to-market strategy, product portfolio management, and native German fluency. The applicant\'s profile is primarily engineering-focused without evidence of the required business development, sales leadership, or strategic growth experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President of Growth role at Coduct Solutions GmbH. Your focus on cloud-first, AI-driven solutions and scalable service offerings aligns with my background in full-stack software engineering and my understanding of how technical capabilities translate into market-ready products.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and deployed scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js on cloud infrastructure including AWS and Docker. I have worked on projects that required structuring repeatable service packages, integrating third-party APIs, and ensuring smooth delivery from development to production. This has given me a clear view of how product, technology, and delivery must align to create offerings that can scale.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the productization of services. In my previous work, I have been involved in defining service boundaries, optimizing deployment workflows, and collaborating across teams to turn technical solutions into structured, repeatable offerings. I am comfortable working with KPIs, pipeline metrics, and conversion data to guide decisions and improve outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my engineering background and growth-oriented mindset can contribute to Coduct\'s next phase of expansion.', '2026-06-09 15:16:06.157', '2026-06-09 15:16:06.157'),
(429, 429, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\"]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"Go-to-market strategy experience\",\"Portfolio management experience\",\"German language (native level)\",\"Azure cloud experience\",\"Business development experience\",\"Leadership/management experience\",\"Sales operations experience\",\"Product management experience\",\"KPI/OKR framework experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development and cloud infrastructure that match Coduct\'s technology domain, but the VP of Growth role is primarily a business leadership and sales position requiring B2B sales experience, go-to-market strategy, portfolio management, native German language, and leadership experience. The applicant\'s profile does not contain evidence of these business-oriented qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President of Growth position at Coduct Solutions GmbH. Your company\'s focus on cloud-first, AI-driven solutions and scalable service offerings is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your next growth phase.\n\nMy background combines full-stack software engineering with practical AI implementation. I have built and deployed production systems using Laravel, Next.js, and cloud infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud. I understand how technical capabilities translate into marketable services because I have been involved in the full delivery cycle from architecture to deployment.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked closely with stakeholders to define requirements, structure deliverables, and ensure that technical solutions aligned with business goals. I have experience building scalable web applications, integrating third-party services, and optimizing performance. This has given me a practical understanding of how software products are positioned, packaged, and delivered to clients.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in the opportunity to help Coduct structure its portfolio and build repeatable go-to-market processes. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my background aligns with your growth objectives.', '2026-06-09 15:16:15.441', '2026-06-09 15:16:15.441'),
(430, 430, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"PHP\",\"MySQL\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AI (via AI-powered projects)\"]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"Go-to-market strategy experience\",\"Product portfolio management experience\",\"German language (native level)\",\"Azure cloud experience\",\"Business development experience\",\"Leadership/management experience\",\"KPI/OKR framework experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development, cloud infrastructure, and AI integration, which align with Coduct\'s technical domain. However, the role is a senior growth leadership position requiring B2B sales, go-to-market strategy, product portfolio management, native German, and business development experience. The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical and does not demonstrate the required business, sales, or leadership experience for this VP-level role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President of Growth position at Coduct Solutions GmbH. Your focus on cloud-first, AI-driven solutions and scalable service offerings aligns with my background in full-stack development and AI engineering.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and deployed scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with cloud infrastructure including AWS, Docker, and Linux servers, and have integrated AI tools into production systems. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of the software and IT business models that Coduct operates within.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the productization of services. In my work