(431, 431, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"SAP HCM\",\"PA (Personnel Administration)\",\"PY-DE (German Payroll)\",\"PT (Time Management)\",\"OM (Organizational Management)\",\"SAP ESS/MSS\",\"FITV\",\"ABAP\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and full-stack development skills but no SAP HCM experience, ABAP knowledge, or German language proficiency (C1 required). The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP HCM Consultant position at Gratitude Jobs Ahead HR INC. While my professional experience is rooted in software engineering and full-stack development, I am eager to bring my technical discipline, problem-solving skills, and structured approach to SAP HCM consulting.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained complex systems using PHP, Laravel, and MySQL, with a strong focus on database optimization, role-based access control, and secure API design. These skills translate well into managing and optimizing SAP HCM application landscapes, where structured data handling and system reliability are essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with PA, PY-DE, and PT modules. My experience with modular system architecture, authentication workflows, and third-party integrations has taught me how to navigate complex enterprise systems and deliver reliable solutions. I am confident I can quickly learn SAP HCM processes and contribute meaningfully to client support and system optimization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-09 15:16:32.015', '2026-06-09 15:16:32.015'),
(432, 432, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Material knowledge (neoprene, leather, metals)\",\"Technical drawing interpretation\",\"Product development lifecycle in physical goods\",\"Excel/Google Sheets for product data\",\"English communication with suppliers\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily software engineering focused, with no direct experience in physical product development, materials, or equipment design. However, strong transferable skills in project management, cross-functional collaboration, international communication, and structured problem-solving are present. The applicant is a quick learner with genuine interest in sports equipment, suitable for a junior role with training.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Produktentwickler Equipment position at GORNATION GmbH. Your mission to strengthen calisthenics sports and develop functional fitness equipment resonates with me. I am drawn to the hands-on, pragmatic culture you describe, where ambition and real impact matter more than hierarchy.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong project management and organizational skills that transfer directly to product development. In my previous roles, I managed multiple projects simultaneously, coordinated with international teams, maintained clear timelines, and ensured deliverables met quality standards. I am accustomed to taking ownership of tasks, communicating clearly with stakeholders, and adapting quickly to new domains.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the systematic improvement of products. In my work, I have regularly identified optimization opportunities, implemented changes, and tracked results. I am confident I can apply this same structured, improvement-driven mindset to GORNATION\'s equipment, from analyzing materials and prototypes to coordinating samples and providing clear feedback.\n\nI am a quick learner with a strong technical foundation. I am ready to immerse myself in the world of calisthenics equipment, understand materials like neoprene, leather, and metals, and contribute to developing products that meet GORNATION\'s quality standards. I value clear communication, teamwork, and working in an environment where feedback is direct and constructive.\n\nIn addition to my technical and organizational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the GORNATION team and help develop equipment that athletes worldwide will use and trust.', '2026-06-09 15:16:42.126', '2026-06-09 15:16:42.126'),
(433, 433, 1, 65, '[\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"Node JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"REST APIs\",\"WebSockets\",\"Clean Code\",\"Unit Testing\"]', '[\"Dart\",\"Java\",\"Fließendes Deutsch (fluent German)\"]', 'Strong match on core full-stack technologies (TypeScript, JavaScript, React, Laravel, Next.js) and software engineering practices (clean code, unit testing, code reviews). Missing fluent German and 5+ years of professional experience (profile shows ~4 years).', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Developer position at Biga Software GmbH. Your approach to building what customers truly need, combined with clean code standards and a focus on long-term maintainability, aligns closely with how I work.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on TypeScript, JavaScript, React, and Laravel, with additional experience across Node.js, Next.js, and Go. I have spent the last several years delivering end-to-end solutions in client-facing projects, where understanding unspoken requirements and translating them into working software has been a core part of my daily work. I write clean, testable code as a standard practice, not as an afterthought.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have owned features from requirement analysis through deployment. I built scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance. I also delivered real-time features using WebSockets and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. Working in small teams, I have regularly participated in code reviews, pair programming, and knowledge sharing.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how technology evolves and how AI is changing both work and business models. I actively follow these developments and have built AI-powered features into projects, including assistants and image processing pipelines. I enjoy bringing fresh ideas to the table where they create real value for clients.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Biga Software GmbH.', '2026-06-09 15:16:50.793', '2026-06-09 15:16:50.793'),
(434, 434, 1, 35, '[\"CI/CD\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"AI\",\"Laravel\",\"Next.js\",\"Node.js\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\",\"C++\",\"Python\"]', '[\"10+ years of experience\",\"Leadership/management experience\",\"German language\",\"Multi-tenant architecture experience\",\"Cybersecurity company experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development, DevOps, and AI, but lacks the required 10+ years of experience, leadership/management experience, and German language proficiency for this senior Head of Engineering role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Engineering position at ANGEHEUERT GmbH Personalberatung. The opportunity to lead engineering teams through technological transformation, particularly in the security and compliance domain, aligns with my technical background and career direction.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and deployed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, with a strong focus on system architecture, API design, and database optimization. I have worked with CI/CD pipelines, Docker, and Linux server environments, ensuring stable releases and reliable production deployments. My work has involved implementing secure authentication, role-based access control, and real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the transformation of legacy systems to modern SaaS platforms. I have experience migrating applications to cloud infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud, containerizing services with Docker, and setting up monitoring with Prometheus and Gr