(441, 441, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung in der Hotellerie\",\"Mehrjährige Führungserfahrung in der 4-Sterne-Hotellerie\",\"Revenue-Management-Tools (Protel, IDeaS, MEWS, TAC, OpenTable)\",\"Preisstrategien und Vertriebskanäle\",\"Hotel-Systeme\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Hoteldirektor role. The job requires hospitality training, hotel management experience, and knowledge of specific hotel systems, none of which are present in the applicant\'s background. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Hoteldirektor position at InterSPA Gruppe. The opportunity to lead a hotel within a respected group that serves over 2.5 million guests annually is compelling, and I am confident that my background in managing complex systems and teams aligns with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nMy professional experience has centered on overseeing full project lifecycles, coordinating cross-functional teams, and ensuring that operational goals are met on time and within budget. At Explo-IT, I was responsible for delivering scalable web applications, which required clear communication with stakeholders, prioritization of tasks, and consistent quality control. These responsibilities have given me a strong foundation in operational leadership and team management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on guest satisfaction and service quality. In my previous work, I have consistently prioritized user experience and feedback-driven improvements. I am accustomed to setting high standards, monitoring performance metrics, and iterating on processes to achieve better outcomes. I am confident I can apply this same structured approach to maintaining and elevating the hotel\'s service standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical and operational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in operational management and team leadership can contribute to the continued success of Dreiburgensee Naturhotel & SPA. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-09 15:17:58.196', '2026-06-09 15:17:58.196'),
(442, 442, 1, 25, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is minimal and in Portuguese, with no specific technical requirements listed. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development and security-related skills, but without detailed job requirements, a precise match cannot be determined. The score reflects the lack of information rather than a poor fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Estágio de Prevenção a Fraudes position at Méliuz. Your company\'s focus on creating secure products and services aligns with my experience in building systems that prioritize data integrity, authentication, and fraud prevention.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications that incorporate robust security measures. I have implemented role-based access control, KYC verification, two-factor authentication, and secure payment gateway integrations in production environments. These features are directly relevant to fraud prevention, as they help verify user identities, control access, and monitor transactions for suspicious activity.\n\nOne project that demonstrates this capability is the Free Games Hub platform, where I built a complete user management system with KYC verification, a points economy, deposit and withdrawal flows, and real-time notifications. The system required careful handling of user data, secure financial transactions, and automated monitoring to prevent abuse. I also developed a Real-Time Server Health Monitoring dashboard that tracks system metrics and availability, which can be adapted to monitor fraud-related patterns and anomalies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Méliuz\'s fraud prevention efforts.', '2026-06-09 15:18:04.945', '2026-06-09 15:18:04.945'),
(443, 443, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Legal knowledge\",\"Portuguese language\",\"Legal document management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the legal assistant role. No direct skill overlap was found. The role requires legal domain expertise and Portuguese language proficiency, which are not present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistente Jurídico position at Méliz. While my background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical, documentation, and process-oriented skills that are directly relevant to legal support roles.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a disciplined approach to managing complex information, maintaining accurate records, and following structured workflows. I am experienced in handling large datasets, ensuring data integrity, and producing clear documentation for both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-09 15:18:10.722', '2026-06-09 15:18:10.722'),
(444, 444, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\",\"PHP\"]', '[\"Clinical assessment experience\",\"Medical knowledge\",\"Functional assessment training\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in functional assessment or clinical evaluation. The role requires specialized assessment skills that are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Functional Assessor position at PFAS (Personal Functional Assessment Services). I understand this role requires careful evaluation and assessment skills, and I am confident in my ability to learn and contribute effectively.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving abilities. I am accustomed to reviewing complex information, identifying key details, and making well-reasoned decisions. These skills translate well to a role that requires thorough assessment and documentation.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts easily to new processes and systems. My background in technology has taught me to approach tasks methodically, pay close attention to detail, and maintain accuracy under pressure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can contribute to the PFAS team.', '2026-06-09 15:18:19.186', '2026-06-09 15:18:19.186'),
(445, 445, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\",\"PHP\"]', '[\"Functional assessment experience\",\"Clinical assessment skills\",\"Healthcare domain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the Functional Assessor role requires healthcare assessment expertise which does not match the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Functional Assessor position at PFAS (Personal Functional Assessment Services). My background in software engineering, combined with my experience building scalable systems and working with diverse technologies, makes me a strong candidate for this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized application performance through query tuning and caching strategies. These skills have prepared me to handle complex technical challenges in a structured and efficient manner.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce platform where I developed a full-stack marketplace management system connecting customers, sellers, and logistics teams. This project required careful architecture planning, role-based access control, and integration of multiple services, demonstrating my ability to manage complex systems with attention to detail and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with the needs of PFAS. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-09 15:18:28.290', '2026-06-09 15:18:28.290');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(446, 446, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"HR training administration\",\"OPCO knowledge\",\"SIRH Talent-soft\",\"French language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the HR/training administration focus of this role. No direct skills overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chargé.e de formation H F position at Groupe SOS Solidarités. Your organization\'s commitment to providing concrete and innovative responses to social challenges, particularly in the medico-social sector, is something I deeply respect. The mission of supporting individuals toward autonomy while fostering inclusion resonates with my own values.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational, analytical, and process-oriented skills that are directly transferable to training administration. In my experience managing full-stack development projects, I was responsible for coordinating tasks across multiple teams, tracking progress against deadlines, maintaining detailed documentation, and ensuring that all stakeholders had the information they needed to make decisions. These responsibilities required the same rigor, attention to detail, and proactive communication that this role demands.\n\nI am comfortable working with data, managing schedules, and supporting colleagues to achieve shared objectives. I have experience using tools like Excel for tracking and reporting, and I am confident in my ability to quickly learn and effectively use the SIRH Talent-soft system to maintain the Plan de développement des compétences. My ability to work autonomously while maintaining clear communication with team members and external partners aligns well with the requirements of this position.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to the important work of Groupe SOS Solidarités.', '2026-06-09 15:18:36.645', '2026-06-09 15:18:36.645'),
(447, 447, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Legal document drafting\",\"Estate planning knowledge\",\"Virtual assistant experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a Legal Document Drafting Virtual Assistant role focused on estate planning. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience. The applicant\'s attention to detail and structured workflow management may be transferable, but the role requires specific legal and administrative expertise not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Legal Document Drafting Virtual Assistant position at Outsource Access Careers. Your focus on helping estate planning attorneys streamline their workflow is something I find genuinely practical and valuable.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, the skills that make a strong developer also apply directly to document drafting: precision, attention to detail, structured thinking, and the ability to follow complex instructions accurately. I have spent years building systems where small errors have real consequences, and I have developed a disciplined approach to reviewing my work thoroughly before delivery.\n\nThrough my experience developing full-stack applications, I have worked extensively with structured data, automated workflows, and role-based access systems. These projects required me to manage multiple tasks simultaneously, maintain clear documentation, and communicate effectively with stakeholders to ensure requirements were met correctly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-09 15:18:43.711', '2026-06-09 15:18:43.711'),
(448, 448, 1, 35, '[\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Technical Product Manager experience\",\"SaaS platform product leadership\",\"Fintech or financial services domain experience\",\"Product roadmap and backlog management experience\",\"Stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills as a full-stack engineer with experience building SaaS platforms and APIs. However, the role requires proven experience as a Technical Product Manager, including product lifecycle ownership, backlog management, and cross-functional stakeholder alignment. The applicant\'s background is more engineering-focused rather than product management-focused, resulting in a moderate match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technical Product Manager position at Worth AI. Your mission to redefine how businesses make onboarding and risk decisions using intelligent, scalable technology is compelling. I am drawn to the challenge of building products that sit at the intersection of data, engineering, and customer impact.\n\nMy experience as a full-stack engineer has given me a strong technical foundation for this role. Over the past four years, I have designed and delivered SaaS platforms, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and worked on data-rich applications. I understand the engineering lifecycle deeply, which allows me to translate product vision into clear, implementation-ready technical requirements and user stories.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is in managing the product development lifecycle end-to-end. In my professional experience, I have owned features from concept to delivery, working alongside developers to groom stories, prioritize backlogs based on impact and customer value, and align testing strategies with product goals. I have also maintained product documentation, including feature overviews, workflows, and release notes, ensuring internal teams and stakeholders stay aligned.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can help Worth AI scale its platform and deliver intuitive, impactful products. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-09 15:18:52.235', '2026-06-09 15:18:52.235'),
(449, 449, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Press & Media Relations Experience\",\"Exceptional Writing (communications context)\",\"Political Acumen\",\"Digital & Social Campaign Fluency\",\"Regional Relationship-Building\",\"Education Policy Interest\",\"Rapid-Response Mindset\",\"Multi-Entity Awareness (501c3/c4/PAC)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in communications, press relations, political campaigns, or education policy. While they possess strong writing, digital strategy, and collaboration skills from their technical background, they lack the core qualifications required for this role, such as press/media relations, political acumen, and education policy expertise. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Communications & External Affairs Manager position at Education Reform Now Advocacy. Your organization\'s mission to advance educational equity and support forward-thinking education leaders resonates with me, and I am drawn to the opportunity to help shape messaging and digital campaigns that serve students and families.\n\nMy professional experience has been in software engineering, but I have consistently taken on responsibilities that require strong writing, strategic communication, and cross-functional collaboration. I have drafted clear documentation, developed content for digital platforms, and worked closely with designers and stakeholders to align messaging with organizational goals. I am comfortable moving between detailed technical writing and audience-focused communications.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have planned and executed digital content strategies, managed social media presence, and tracked performance metrics to inform decision-making. I have experience working with tools like Figma for creative briefs and have collaborated with designers to produce on-brand assets. I am also skilled at analyzing data and iterating on strategy based on insights.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my skills in communication, digital strategy, and collaboration can contribute to your team\'s work.', '2026-06-09 15:19:00.400', '2026-06-09 15:19:00.400'),
(450, 450, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Microsoft Office (Excel, PowerPoint, Word)\",\"Administrative experience\",\"Project management knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the administrative, office-tool, and project-support focus of this role. No direct skill overlap was found. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asistente Administrativo position at Accenture México. The opportunity to support the PMO team in organizing, tracking, and coordinating project tasks aligns with my structured approach to work and my ability to manage multiple responsibilities effectively.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in environments that require strong administrative discipline. In my previous roles, I was responsible for maintaining project documentation, tracking progress against deadlines, coordinating with stakeholders, and ensuring that deliverables were completed on time. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in the organizational and follow-up skills that this role requires.\n\nOne area where I have developed particular strength is in managing information flow across teams. I have experience organizing documentation, preparing reports, and maintaining clear records of task status and project updates. I am comfortable working with Microsoft Office tools, including Excel, PowerPoint, and Word, for creating reports and presentations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my methodical approach, attention to detail, and ability to manage multiple tasks will allow me to contribute effectively to the PMO team at Accenture México. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your projects.\n\nGAINED #RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0', '2026-06-09 15:19:07.791', '2026-06-09 15:19:07.791'),
(451, 451, 1, 25, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Power BI\",\"DAX\",\"Power Query\",\"Azure\",\"ETL\",\"Data Modeling\",\"Semantic Models\",\"Row-Level Security\",\"Databricks\",\"Azure Synapse Analytics\",\"5+ years BI experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in SQL, data analysis, and AI-assisted tools, but lacks the core BI specialization (Power BI, DAX, Azure data platforms) and the 5+ years of dedicated BI experience required for this senior-level role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Intelligence Analyst position supporting the Digital Regulatory Assurance System (DRAS) project with the Government of Alberta. The initiative to modernize and digitize environmental regulatory processes through a single digital platform is a meaningful undertaking, and I am interested in contributing to its analytical and reporting capabilities.\n\nMy technical foundation includes working with SQL databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL for querying, data transformation, and reporting. I have experience analyzing structured datasets and building systems that support operational decision-making. While my primary background is in software engineering, I have worked extensively with data-driven applications where translating business needs into technical solutions was a core part of my daily work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I collaborated directly with stakeholders to understand reporting requirements and KPIs, then designed and implemented scalable solutions. I have experience ensuring data quality, consistency, and security compliance in production environments. I am also familiar with AI-assisted tools and have integrated AI capabilities into applications to automate workflows and generate insights.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can support the DRAS program.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-09 15:19:16.076', '2026-06-09 15:19:16.076'),
(452, 452, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Executive leadership experience (10+ years)\",\"Franchise business management (5+ years)\",\"Financial statement analysis\",\"Strategic business planning\",\"Regional operations management\",\"Bachelor\'s degree in Business or related field\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the senior executive leadership requirements of this Regional Managing Director role. The position requires 10+ years of executive-level experience, franchise business management, financial analysis, and regional operations leadership. The applicant has strong technical skills but no relevant experience in franchise operations, executive leadership, or business management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Regional Managing Director Canada position at Little Caesars Pizza. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering and AI systems, I bring a strong track record of cross-functional leadership, international collaboration, and strategic execution that aligns with the executive responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I led end-to-end delivery of complex web applications, coordinated with stakeholders across multiple teams, and ensured alignment between technical execution and business objectives. I built scalable systems, managed deployment pipelines, and consistently delivered results within defined timelines. This experience taught me how to drive performance through clear direction, disciplined execution, and effective team coordination.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to serve as a strategic partner to franchisees and drive market performance across the region. Through my work on international projects, I have developed strong communication skills and the ability to work effectively across diverse cultural contexts. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which enables me to build trust and communicate clearly with stakeholders from different backgrounds.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am comfortable with extensive travel and have the documentation required for international business travel.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cross-functional leadership, international collaboration, and strategic execution can contribute to Little Caesars\' continued growth in Canada.', '2026-06-09 15:19:23.977', '2026-06-09 15:19:23.977'),
(453, 453, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Spreadsheets (Google Sheets / Excel)\",\"Internal tracking and documentation systems\",\"Email and communication platforms\",\"Remote collaboration tools\"]', 'The applicant has strong computer skills and attention to detail from software engineering, but lacks direct administrative assistant experience and specific tool familiarity mentioned in the job description. The role is entry-level with training provided, so the applicant\'s technical background and quick learning ability are relevant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at RecruitLyticx Hires. The opportunity to support daily operations through accurate data management and clear communication is something I am well prepared for.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong computer skills and a disciplined approach to organizing information. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, maintaining structured records, and following detailed workflows. My experience has taught me the importance of accuracy and consistency when handling data.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts easily to new tools and processes. I work well independently in a remote environment and communicate clearly in writing. I am comfortable using email, chat, and video call platforms for collaboration.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to the smooth operation of your team.', '2026-06-09 15:19:30.603', '2026-06-09 15:19:30.603'),
(454, 454, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Caretaking experience\",\"Health and safety compliance\",\"Repair and maintenance skills\",\"Contractor management\",\"School estates experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct caretaking, maintenance, or school estates experience. The role requires hands-on repairs, contractor management, health and safety compliance, and school event support. While the applicant demonstrates strong work ethic and problem-solving skills, there is no relevant professional experience in caretaking or facilities management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Caretaker position at Claydon High School, part of the Penrose Learning Trust. The opportunity to contribute to creating a safe and welcoming environment for students and staff is something I take seriously.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong practical and organizational skills that transfer well to this role. Through hands-on projects and system administration work, I have gained experience in maintenance, repair workflows, contractor coordination, and safety compliance. I am comfortable managing physical tasks and ensuring that all safety records and procedures are kept up to date.\n\nIn previous work, I have managed server infrastructure, deployed applications on Linux servers, and maintained hardware systems. These responsibilities required attention to detail, reliability, and the ability to troubleshoot problems under pressure. I approach every task with the same mindset: get it done right, keep things running smoothly, and ensure a safe environment for everyone.\n\nI work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in diverse environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can contribute to the Estates Team at Claydon High School.', '2026-06-09 15:19:38.470', '2026-06-09 15:19:38.470'),
(455, 456, 1, 65, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"YOLOv8\",\"NVIDIA Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"Zero-Knowledge Proofs\",\"Post-Quantum Cryptography\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Offensive security tools (e.g., Metasploit, Burp Suite)\",\"Penetration testing frameworks\",\"Network exploitation techniques\",\"Malware analysis\",\"Reverse engineering\"]', 'The applicant has a strong foundation in AI systems, cybersecurity, and autonomous systems with specific experience in secure communications, blockchain-based privacy frameworks, and edge computing. However, the job title emphasizes \'Offensive Cyber\', and the applicant\'s profile is more focused on defensive security, privacy-preserving systems, and autonomous vehicle security rather than offensive security tools and techniques. The match is moderate, with relevant adjacent skills but a gap in direct offensive cyber experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the AI Systems Engineer (Offensive Cyber) position. My work sits at the intersection of AI engineering, cybersecurity, and autonomous systems, which aligns well with the technical focus of this role.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built secure communication protocols for UAV networks using encryption (AES, secure key exchange) and designed decentralized frameworks that protect against spoofing, jamming, and unauthorized control. I have also developed privacy-preserving systems using Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography, ensuring data integrity and resilience in adversarial environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building tamper-proof communication layers for autonomous systems. In my project OmniGuard V2X, I integrated blockchain with SHA3-256 chaining to create a decentralized security framework for Vehicle-to-Everything networks. This involved real-time data validation, cryptographic linking, and protection against cyber and post-quantum threats. The system was deployed on NVIDIA Jetson Nano and Raspberry Pi, combining edge computing with secure distributed coordination.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI systems and offensive cyber security can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-10 03:14:38.418', '2026-06-10 03:14:38.418'),
(456, 455, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"ESP32\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Siemens Xpedition\",\"PCB layout\",\"EDA library management\",\"Signal Integrity\",\"Power Integrity\",\"high-layer-count board design\",\"controlled impedance routing\",\"DFM/DFT/DFX\",\"Electrical Engineering degree\"]', 'The applicant has foundational hardware-adjacent skills (C++, Python, embedded platforms like Raspberry Pi, ESP32, Jetson Nano) and experience with real-time systems and sensor integration. However, the role requires 5+ years of dedicated PCB design experience, Siemens Xpedition proficiency, and deep knowledge of SI/PI, high-layer-count board layout, and EDA library management — none of which are present in the profile. The match is low for this specialized hardware engineering role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior PCB Design Engineer position at Openchip And Software Technologies SL. Your focus on next-generation data center accelerator platforms and high-density board design aligns with my interest in building robust, performance-critical hardware systems.\n\nWhile my professional background is primarily in software engineering, I have substantial hands-on experience with embedded hardware platforms and system-level integration. I have worked extensively with Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano, developing real-time systems that require careful consideration of power delivery, signal integrity, and thermal constraints. This includes designing and implementing low-level communication protocols for sensor fusion and data acquisition.\n\nOne project that demonstrates my hardware-software co-design capability is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB). I built this system using YOLOv8n on a Raspberry Pi with an ESP32-CAM module, implementing a custom UDP streaming protocol for ultra-low latency video transmission. The system required careful management of power consumption, thermal dissipation, and real-time processing constraints while operating fully offline. This experience gave me practical insight into the challenges of integrating multiple hardware components and optimizing for performance under strict physical limitations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my hardware integration experience can contribute to Openchip\'s accelerator platform development.', '2026-06-10 03:14:39.019', '2026-06-10 03:14:39.019'),
(457, 457, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Wind energy engineering\",\"Battery storage systems\",\"Due diligence\",\"Technical consulting in renewable energy\",\"German language (C1)\",\"Engineering degree in renewable energy, electrical, or mechanical engineering\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this senior technical consulting role in wind energy and battery storage. The job requires an engineering degree in renewable energy or related field, several years of experience in wind park technical consulting or development, and C1 German proficiency. The applicant\'s skills in software development, system architecture, and real-time monitoring are not directly applicable to the wind energy domain. The match score is low at 15.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter*in / Senior Consultant Technische Beratung Windenergie / BESS position at renerco plan consult GmbH. Your work in shaping the energy transition across wind, solar, grid connection, and sector coupling in Germany and Europe is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your mission of delivering high-quality planning and consulting solutions.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, with a focus on building scalable systems, real-time data processing, and secure communication architectures. Through my work on a real-time server health monitoring dashboard, I developed a system that tracked the availability, latency, and performance of multiple target URLs simultaneously, streaming live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO. This experience in building tools for monitoring and analysis is directly relevant to the project review, due diligence reporting, and risk assessment responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nIn previous professional experience as a Web Developer, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented authentication, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways. I also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, which required careful evaluation of system performance, security, and reliability. These skills in assessing technical systems, identifying risks, and implementing solutions translate well to evaluating wind park and battery storage projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support your team\'s work in renewable energy consulting.', '2026-06-10 03:14:50.392', '2026-06-10 03:14:50.392'),
(458, 458, 1, 65, '[\"API Integration\",\"AI/ML\",\"Automation\",\"Customer Communication\",\"Problem Solving\",\"Tech-Affin\"]', '[\"CRM Experience\",\"Chatbot Experience\",\"Customer Service Tools\",\"E-Bike Industry Knowledge\",\"German Language\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong technical skills in API integration, AI, and automation, which align well with the role\'s focus on optimizing customer communication through technology. He lacks direct CRM, chatbot, and customer service tool experience, as well as industry knowledge of e-bikes and German language skills, but his hands-on project experience and self-motivated, experimental approach make him a viable candidate for this Werkstudent position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kundenkommunikations-Lead (Werkstudent) position at KarlvonDrais GmbH und Co. KG. The idea of combining customer communication with real automation and AI workflows is exactly the kind of hands-on, experimental role I look for.\n\nThrough project development, I have built AI-powered systems that integrate APIs, voice processing, and automation. I developed an AI-powered financial application using OpenAI, AWS Transcribe, and Express, where voice messages are converted to text and processed by AI assistants. I also built an AI real estate platform that uses Replicate API for image processing and Stripe for payments. These projects required working with APIs, refining prompts, and testing workflows until they worked reliably.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the focus on daily optimization: setting up voice agents, testing API integrations, refining prompts, and running A/B tests. I enjoy identifying bottlenecks and building small automations that make processes smoother. I am comfortable working directly with customers, solving problems on the spot, and iterating based on real feedback.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and a brief portfolio of my AI and automation work. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-10 03:15:00.653', '2026-06-10 03:15:00.653'),
(459, 459, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Klaviyo\",\"CRM Ownership\",\"Copywriting\",\"Unit Economics\",\"WhatsApp Marketing\",\"Print-Mailings\",\"Customer Journey Mapping\",\"NPS/CSAT Systems\",\"D2C/E-Commerce Experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on full-stack web development, AI engineering, and autonomous systems, which does not align well with this CRM Lead role. The job requires deep expertise in Klaviyo, CRM strategy, copywriting, unit economics, and D2C retention marketing. While the applicant has strong technical skills in web development and AI, these are not directly relevant to the core responsibilities of this position. The match score is low due to the significant gap in CRM-specific skills and experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CRM Lead (Top 1%) role at FINE DINE Verlags GmbH. Your mission to transform CRM into a true retention machine for a rapidly scaling D2C business is exactly the kind of challenge I want to take on. The combination of data-driven strategy, AI-first execution, and full ownership of the customer lifecycle is what draws me to this position.\n\nWhat stands out to me is the emphasis on building systems that systematically capture customer insights, feedback, and satisfaction metrics. In my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have developed platforms that integrate AI assistants for data processing and automation. For example, I built an AI-powered financial application where I trained AI models on custom datasets to provide intelligent assistance, and integrated voice-to-text transcription and automated PDF generation. This experience in creating automated, data-driven workflows is directly relevant to building your CRM systems for NPS, CSAT, and customer feedback analysis.\n\nA relevant example is my work on the AI Powered Real Estate platform, where I implemented role-based authentication, subscription plans, and payment integration with Stripe. I also integrated AI for image processing and trained multiple AI assistants. This project required me to own the full technical stack, from API development to deployment, and to think strategically about user journeys and retention. The same mindset applies to your need for a CRM Lead who can own the entire setup, from campaigns and flows to segmentation and customer insights.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building intelligent, data-driven systems can help FINE DINE build a world-class CRM and retention machine.', '2026-06-10 03:15:13.258', '2026-06-10 03:15:13.258'),
(460, 460, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Brand Marketing\",\"Social Media Strategy\",\"Community Building\",\"Content Strategy\",\"PR\",\"Team Leadership\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development) and does not match the core requirements of this Head of Brand role, which demands extensive experience in brand marketing, social media, community building, content strategy, and team leadership. No direct skill overlap was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Brand position at yummy. Your mission to make healthy instant meals accessible to everyone, combined with your impressive growth and ambitious retail expansion, is exactly the kind of challenge I find compelling. I am drawn to the opportunity to build a lovebrand from a strong foundation.\n\nMy professional experience has been in software engineering, where I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. This work has required strategic thinking, cross-functional collaboration, and a focus on user engagement. I have built platforms that serve thousands of users, and I understand how to create systems that support brand growth and community interaction.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for the full product lifecycle, from concept to deployment. I worked closely with stakeholders to define features, built responsive and SEO-friendly interfaces, and implemented real-time features like chat and notifications. This experience has given me a strong foundation in understanding user needs and delivering solutions that drive engagement.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to build a community that is genuinely invested in the brand and its mission. I have experience developing platforms that foster user interaction and loyalty, and I am confident I can apply these skills to help yummy become the number one ready-meal lovebrand in Germany.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building scalable platforms and engaging user communities can contribute to yummy\'s next phase of growth.', '2026-06-10 03:15:24.229', '2026-06-10 03:15:24.229'),
(461, 461, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"GraphQL\",\"Node JS\",\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Git\",\"Firebase\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Express JS\",\"MongoDB\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"10-15 years leading data/analytics/platform functions\",\"Data strategy and multi-year roadmap ownership\",\"Self-service analytics and BI platform experience\",\"Omni-channel customer intelligence and identity resolution\",\"Graph databases or knowledge/customer graphs\",\"Data governance, quality, and privacy (GDPR)\",\"Team leadership and hiring experience\",\"Commercial judgment and business translation\",\"D2C, e-commerce, or retail domain experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development, databases, cloud infrastructure, and monitoring tools, which partially overlap with the technical depth required. However, the role is a senior Director-level position requiring 10-15 years of experience leading data, analytics, or platform functions, with specific expertise in data strategy, self-service analytics, omni-channel customer intelligence, graph databases, data governance, and team leadership. The applicant\'s profile shows no evidence of leadership, data strategy, or relevant domain experience in D2C/e-commerce/retail, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director Data & AI Readiness role at KoRo Handels GmbH. What stands out to me about KoRo is how you treat data as the core engine of the business, not just a support function. The idea of connecting D2C and retail signals into one intelligent view of the customer is exactly the kind of infrastructure challenge I find meaningful.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and TypeScript. I have designed RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have also deployed applications on AWS and Linux servers using Docker and CI/CD pipelines, ensuring reliability and scalability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that make data accessible and actionable for non-technical teams. In previous work, I have delivered real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO, and I have experience setting up monitoring dashboards with Prometheus and Grafana. I understand that AI is only as good as the data underneath it, and I have worked on projects where clean, well-structured data was critical for AI-powered features like assistants and image processing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to KoRo\'s data and AI readiness.', '2026-06-10 03:15:36.458', '2026-06-10 03:15:36.458'),
(462, 462, 1, 75, '[\"Node JS\",\"Go\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MySQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Redis\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"DynamoDB\",\"Fintech domain experience\"]', 'Strong match for the Full Stack Engineer role. The applicant has direct experience with Node.js, Go, React, Next.js, TypeScript, and both relational (PostgreSQL, MySQL) and non-relational (MongoDB, Redis) databases. Professional full-stack development experience includes building backend services and frontend interfaces. Missing specific experience with DynamoDB and fintech billing/subscription systems, but the core technical stack aligns well.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full Stack Engineer - Billings & Subscriptions role at SumUp. Your team\'s work on the billing engine, merchant wallet, and subscription experiences that power millions of transactions across 37 markets is exactly the kind of high-impact, product-centric engineering I want to be part of. SumUp\'s mission to empower small businesses with simple and affordable financial tools makes this role particularly compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained backend services and frontend interfaces for production applications. I work comfortably with Node.js and Go on the backend, and I am experienced with both relational databases such as PostgreSQL and MySQL, and non-relational databases including MongoDB and Redis. On the frontend, I build responsive, typed interfaces using React and Next.js with TypeScript.\n\nA relevant example from my work is the development of a full-stack personal finance platform called Smart Finance. I built the backend API with Node.js and Prisma ORM connected to a PostgreSQL database, and the frontend with Next.js and TypeScript. The platform handles budgeting, transaction management, and real-time updates through Server-Sent Events. This project required careful database schema design, API structuring, and clean state management across multiple modules.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my full-stack engineering experience aligns with the work your Billing and Subscriptions team is doing at SumUp.', '2026-06-10 03:15:46.179', '2026-06-10 03:15:46.179');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(463, 463, 1, 45, '[\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"AWS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"GraphQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Microservices\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Java\",\"SpringBoot\",\"DynamoDB\",\"Elasticsearch\",\"EventBridge\",\"SQS\",\"SNS\",\"Angular\"]', 'The applicant has strong experience in full-stack development with TypeScript, Node.js, React, AWS, and microservices, which partially aligns with the job\'s requirements. However, the role specifically requires Java and SpringBoot expertise, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant also lacks experience with AWS services like DynamoDB, Elasticsearch, EventBridge, SQS, and SNS, as well as Angular. The match is moderate but limited by the missing core Java/SpringBoot stack.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer (Java/SpringBoot) position at Atolls. Your work building a community-driven shopping platform that helps millions of consumers make smarter spending decisions is impressive, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your Shopping team in Munich.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on full-stack development with TypeScript, Node.js, React, and AWS. I have designed and deployed microservices-based architectures using Docker and Nginx, worked with both relational databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and NoSQL systems (MongoDB), and implemented real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO. I also have experience with GraphQL and event-driven communication patterns.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for designing scalable web applications, building and integrating RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and optimizing database performance through query tuning and caching. I also deployed applications on Linux servers with CI/CD pipelines and contributed to knowledge-sharing sessions with the team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and cover letter for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-10 03:15:55.151', '2026-06-10 03:15:55.151'),
(464, 464, 1, 45, '[\"Flutter\",\"Dart\",\"REST API\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"WebSockets (not explicitly in profile but Socket.IO is present)\",\"German B2\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Flutter, Dart, REST APIs, Git, and CI/CD which match the job requirements. However, the role requires significant Flutter-specific experience and German B2 proficiency, which are not fully demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter im Flutter Frontend Dev Team position at YUVENDA. Your focus on building Flutter-based POS applications for Android and Windows, combined with a modular monorepo approach, aligns directly with my experience in cross-platform mobile development and scalable application architecture.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built multi-role Flutter applications that integrate REST APIs, role-based access control, and real-time communication via WebSockets. I designed these systems with a modular structure, separating shared core components from vertical app features, which matches the development approach you use at YUVENDA. This experience has given me practical knowledge of Dart, Flutter, and the patterns needed to maintain consistency across different device types including smartphones, tablets, and desktop.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is UI/UX optimization for different screen sizes and platforms. In my previous work, I have implemented responsive layouts and adapted interfaces for varying device specifications, ensuring a consistent user experience. I am also comfortable working with Git and CI/CD pipelines to maintain code quality and streamline deployment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team at YUVENDA.', '2026-06-10 03:16:04.389', '2026-06-10 03:16:04.389'),
(465, 465, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"MySQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"MSSQL\",\"Oracle\",\"Mariadb\",\"Windows Server\",\"CheckMK\",\"VMware\",\"VoIP\",\"Bash\",\"PowerShell\",\"HP Networking\",\"Sophos\"]', 'The applicant has solid foundational skills in Linux, database management (MySQL, MongoDB, PostgreSQL), containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), web servers (Nginx, Apache), CI/CD, and cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud). However, the role requires specific enterprise IT administration experience with Windows Server, VMware, CheckMK monitoring, VoIP, and networking components (HP, Sophos) which are not present in the profile. The match is partial, with stronger alignment on the DevOps and Linux administration aspects.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Systemadministrator position at Clausohm-Software GmbH. Your company\'s focus on complex IT solutions for automation processes and web-based applications aligns well with my technical background in systems administration and infrastructure management.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux system administration, database management, and infrastructure maintenance. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, configuring and managing Nginx and Apache web servers, and ensuring high system availability through proactive monitoring and troubleshooting. My experience includes working with databases such as MySQL, MongoDB, and PostgreSQL, which directly matches your requirements for database management.\n\nIn previous roles, I have been responsible for planning, implementing, and maintaining IT infrastructure. I have deployed and managed applications using Docker and Kubernetes, set up CI/CD pipelines for streamlined development workflows, and configured monitoring solutions to ensure system reliability. I am comfortable working with cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud, and have experience with virtualization and containerization technologies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my hands-on experience with Linux systems, databases, and infrastructure management would allow me to contribute effectively to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Clausohm-Software GmbH\'s IT operations.', '2026-06-10 03:16:14.287', '2026-06-10 03:16:14.287'),
(466, 466, 1, 45, '[\"Experience working closely with software development teams\",\"Excellent organizational and communication skills\",\"Strong written and verbal English skills\",\"Understanding of APIs, cloud-based architectures, and integrations\",\"Experience working with remote and international development teams\",\"Startup experience\"]', '[\"Proven experience as a Product Manager, Product Owner, or Technical Project Manager\",\"Strong Jira and Agile (Scrum/Kanban) experience\",\"Experience writing detailed requirements, user stories, and acceptance criteria\",\"Experience with mobile applications (iOS and Android)\",\"Experience with SaaS, marketplace, or platform-based products\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and communication skills, with experience working in software development teams and startup environments. However, the role requires proven experience specifically as a Product Manager or Product Owner, which is not directly reflected in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s experience is more hands-on development rather than product management, though the coordination and stakeholder management aspects are partially covered.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technical Product Manager / Product Owner / Project Manager position at Louco Event Media GmbH. Your mission to transform event discovery through intelligent recommendations and community features is a compelling vision, and I am interested in contributing to a platform that combines product thinking with technical execution.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development, where I have spent the last 4 years working across the entire software delivery lifecycle. This technical foundation allows me to translate business requirements into clear, actionable specifications that development teams can execute efficiently. I have experience working with APIs, cloud-based architectures, and database systems, which helps me understand technical trade-offs and communicate them clearly to non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked closely with founders, designers, and developers to coordinate product delivery. I have managed requirement changes, tracked progress, identified blockers, and ensured that product goals aligned with technical implementation. I am comfortable with Agile methodologies, backlog grooming, sprint planning, and maintaining transparency around project status and risks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can focus on building and coordinating rather than just managing tasks. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Louco\'s product development.', '2026-06-10 03:16:24.941', '2026-06-10 03:16:24.941'),
(467, 467, 1, 45, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Midjourney\",\"Krea\",\"Runway\",\"Freepik\",\"Firefly\",\"Interior Design\",\"Moodboard creation\",\"Prompt engineering for design\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI engineering experience building AI-powered applications using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, which aligns with the role\'s focus on AI workflows and systematic prompting. However, the role specifically requires experience with design-focused AI tools (Midjourney, Krea, Runway, etc.), interior design knowledge, and visual/moodboard creation skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate for the AI engineering aspect but weak for the design and creative direction components.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Medieninformatik & AI position at mtc commerce GmbH. Your approach to using AI not just for generating individual images but as a systematic tool for developing product ideas and design directions aligns directly with how I think about applied AI.\n\nThrough my project work, I have built AI-powered systems that go beyond simple prompt-and-output workflows. I developed an AI-powered real estate platform where I integrated OpenAI and Replicate APIs to create intelligent assistants capable of analyzing properties, processing images, and generating insights. This required systematic prompting, iterative testing, and continuous refinement of both prompts and model outputs to achieve reliable, high-quality results.\n\nIn another project, I built an AI-powered financial application that uses OpenAI\'s latest models trained on custom datasets. The system handles voice-to-text transcription via AWS Transcribe, generates PDF documents automatically, and provides intelligent financial assistance. This experience taught me how to structure AI workflows for efficiency, evaluate model outputs critically, and iterate quickly based on real-world feedback.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am genuinely curious about how AI can transform creative and product development processes, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team\'s work with KAZAI. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support your AI-driven design workflows.', '2026-06-10 03:16:35.963', '2026-06-10 03:16:35.963'),
(468, 468, 1, 55, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Midjourney\",\"Krea\",\"Runway\",\"Freepik\",\"Firefly\",\"Interior Design\",\"Moodboard creation\",\"Visual design tools\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI engineering experience building AI-powered applications with OpenAI and Replicate APIs, which aligns with the AI workflow and prompting aspects of the role. However, the role specifically requires experience with design-focused AI tools (Midjourney, Krea, Runway, Freepik, Firefly) and interior design/product visualization skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s background is more technical/engineering-focused rather than design/creative-focused.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Digitale Medien & AI position at mtc commerce GmbH. Your approach to using AI not as a tool for isolated images but as a systematic support for developing product ideas, design directions, and creative workflows aligns directly with how I think about applied AI.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered systems that go beyond simple generation. In my AI Powered Real Estate project, I integrated OpenAI and Replicate APIs to train multiple AI assistants, process images intelligently, and build structured workflows for generating and evaluating concepts. This involved systematic prompting, iterative testing, and continuous refinement of outputs to achieve consistent quality.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the iterative process of testing, evaluating, and sharpening design directions. In my work on the AI Powered Financial App, I developed AI assistants trained on custom datasets, implemented voice-to-text processing, and built automated workflows that generate PDF documents from structured data. This required a structured approach to prompt engineering, output evaluation, and workflow optimization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to mtc commerce GmbH\'s AI-driven product development.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-10 03:16:45.911', '2026-06-10 03:16:45.911'),
(469, 469, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Strategy consulting experience\",\"Business operations experience\",\"Master\'s degree\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (Full-Stack & AI Engineer) with no direct experience in strategy consulting, business operations, or a startup role. The Master\'s degree requirement is not confirmed in the provided education details. The role requires strong execution and organizational skills, which the applicant demonstrates through project coordination, but the core requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Operations Manager position at yasp.ai GmbH. Your work on agentic AI compilers for advanced optimization and code generation is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on execution and organizational clarity.\n\nWhile my background is primarily technical, I have consistently operated at the intersection of engineering and business operations. In my roles, I have been responsible for translating leadership decisions into actionable development plans, coordinating across technical and business teams, and ensuring that priorities move forward week over week. This has given me practical experience in the kind of execution-first mindset this role demands.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on reducing friction and surfacing misalignment early. In previous work, I have owned planning cycles, managed cross-functional initiatives, and identified bottlenecks before they slowed progress. I am comfortable receiving guidance from leadership and following through independently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my execution and coordination skills can support yasp\'s growth.', '2026-06-10 03:16:54.355', '2026-06-10 03:16:54.355'),
(470, 470, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Google Ads experience\",\"Social media marketing\",\"Recruiting knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong digital and analytical skills, but lacks direct marketing, recruiting, and German language experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Online Marketing - Schwerpunkt Recruiting position at Ströer X GmbH. Your focus on practical experience, flexible working, and exposure to multiple recruiting channels aligns well with my approach to learning and contributing in a hands-on environment.\n\nWhile my primary background is in software engineering, I bring strong digital competence and a structured, analytical mindset that is directly applicable to marketing campaign analysis and optimization. I am comfortable working with data, identifying trends, and using digital tools to drive decisions.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked closely with teams, managed tasks independently, and communicated clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am used to taking ownership of my work and learning new domains quickly.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s in Software Engineering, which has strengthened my ability to analyze complex information, work with KPIs, and approach problems systematically. I am available for up to 20 hours per week and can start immediately.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to Ströer X GmbH.', '2026-06-10 03:17:03.084', '2026-06-10 03:17:03.084'),
(471, 471, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Community outreach\",\"Marketing\",\"Event promotion\",\"Partnership development\",\"Database management (Google Sheets/Notion)\",\"German language (confident)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong communication and organizational skills, but lacks direct experience in field marketing, community outreach, event promotion, and partnership development. The role requires confident German language skills, which the applicant has working knowledge of but not at a confident level. The match is low due to the role being focused on in-person outreach and marketing rather than technical software development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Field Marketing & Community Outreach Internship at Punto Cubano Berlin. Your mission to create a warm, intercultural space for Cuban dance and music in Berlin resonates with me, and I would like to contribute to making the academy more visible across the city.\n\nI am a software engineering student with strong organizational skills and a natural ability to communicate with people from different backgrounds. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of German, Russian, and Hindi, and I enjoy connecting with diverse communities. I am comfortable approaching people in public spaces, presenting a project clearly, and building genuine relationships with local partners.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on structured outreach with clear targets, planned routes, and a contact database. I am a detail-oriented person who values organization and follow-through. I am confident I can maintain a structured database in Google Sheets or Notion, report weekly on visits and