(472, 472, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"SEO experience\",\"SEA experience\",\"Content marketing\",\"Growth strategy\",\"Marketing analytics\",\"Consulting skills\",\"AI Search / LLMs / AI Overviews experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI, but lacks the core marketing, SEO, and growth strategy experience required for this Growth Marketing Specialist role. No direct marketing or SEO experience is present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Growth Marketing Specialist (m/w/d) position at VDB Digital GmbH. Your focus on delivering high-impact results for B2B software and IT companies through SEO, content, and performance-driven strategies aligns with my technical background and my approach to building systems that produce measurable outcomes.\n\nWhile my professional experience is rooted in full-stack web development and AI engineering, this technical foundation is directly relevant to the role. I have spent years building and optimizing web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React, which has given me a strong understanding of website architecture, performance optimization, and the technical factors that influence search rankings and user experience. I know how to analyze a website from both a development and a marketing perspective, identifying opportunities to improve speed, structure, and content delivery.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of AI and search. I have worked extensively with AI technologies, including integrating OpenAI and Replicate APIs into full-stack applications. Through my work on the AI Powered Financial App, I built AI assistants and trained