(473, 473, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"4+ years experience in Influencer Marketing or Account Management\",\"Experience with YouTube and Creator Economy\",\"Experience with Mobile App clients\",\"Strong communication and negotiation skills\",\"Experience in the US market\",\"Understanding of performance marketing and data-driven campaigns\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this Influencer Marketing Manager role, which demands 4+ years of experience in influencer marketing, client management, YouTube creator relations, and US market knowledge. No direct overlap in skills or experience was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Influencer Marketing Manager (m/w/d) - YouTube position at Adspace. Your focus on data-driven creator partnerships and the US market is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your team\'s growth.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong project coordination and client management skills through years of delivering technical projects. I am experienced in planning workflows, managing timelines and budgets, and ensuring deliverables are met on schedule. I communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn my previous roles, I acted as a primary point of contact for clients and internal teams, coordinating across departments to ensure successful project outcomes. I am comfortable with structured, independent work and take a solution-oriented approach to challenges.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-10 03:17:31.394', '2026-06-10 03:17:31.394'),
(474, 474, 1, 35, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"CRM project management experience\",\"IT business analysis experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Degree in Wirtschaftsinformatik or equivalent\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background but lacks direct CRM project management experience, IT business analysis experience, and German language skills which are key requirements for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CRM IT Projekt Manager position at Sandra Lochmann. The opportunity to work with a leading European CRM/CX software company that values innovation in customer relationship management, marketing automation, and machine learning aligns well with my technical background and project experience.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development and project delivery, where I have led the design and implementation of scalable applications. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, and modern JavaScript frameworks, building RESTful APIs, integrating third-party services, and managing database architectures. This technical foundation allows me to understand software projects deeply and communicate effectively with development teams.\n\nIn my role at Explo-IT, I was responsible for delivering web applications from concept to deployment. This involved gathering requirements, coordinating with stakeholders, managing timelines, and ensuring quality through testing and optimization. I implemented authentication systems, payment gateways, and real-time features while maintaining clean code and documentation. These experiences have given me practical skills in project coordination, risk management, and cross-functional collaboration