(475, 475, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Social Media Marketing\",\"Paid Ads\",\"Multiplattform-Kampagnen\",\"Projektmanagement\",\"Kundenberatung\",\"Stakeholder-Kommunikation\",\"Performance-Analyse\",\"Deutsch (C2)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI engineering) with no direct experience in social media marketing, strategic campaign planning, paid ads, or client consulting. The role requires 5+ years in social media agencies, which is not reflected in the applicant\'s background. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Social Media Manager position at gocomo GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, the strategic thinking, project coordination, and data-driven decision-making required in this role align well with my experience delivering complex technical projects.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have planned and executed multi-phase projects from concept to deployment, coordinating with designers, backend engineers, and external partners. This has given me strong project management skills and the ability to bring structure to complex workflows.\n\nA relevant example is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I coordinated across customer, seller, and logistics modules, ensuring smooth integration and timely delivery. This required clear communication with stakeholders and continuous alignment on priorities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and strategic planning experience can contribute to gocomo GmbH.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-10 03:17:48.527', '2026-06-10 03:17:48.527'),
(476, 476, 1, 35, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"CRM project management experience\",\"IT business analysis experience\",\"German language proficiency (required)\",\"Degree in Wirtschaftsinformatik or equivalent\",\"Industry knowledge (Energy, Utilities, Banking, Insurance, Retail)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background but lacks the specific CRM project management experience, IT business analysis background, and German language proficiency required for this role. The position requires 2-3 years of leading software/CRM projects, which is not reflected in the applicant\'s profile. The technical skills are present but the role is more focused on project management and business analysis rather than hands-on development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CRM IT Projekt Manager position at Sandra Lochmann. The opportunity to work with a leading European CRM/CX software company that combines modern technology with practical innovation in customer relationship management, marketing automation, and machine learning is genuinely compelling.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and project delivery. Over the past four years, I have worked across the full development lifecycle, from gathering requirements and designing architecture to deployment and stakeholder communication. I have led technical projects involving Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, where coordinating cross-functional teams and managing timelines was a regular part of my work.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with stakeholders and engineering teammates to deliver scalable web applications. This involved translating business needs into technical specifications, managing API