(477, 477, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Meta Ads\",\"Social Paid Campaigns\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"Creative Testing Frameworks\",\"CAC/ROAS/CPO Analysis\",\"E-commerce Marketing\",\"UGC Concepts\",\"Attribution & Tracking\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in performance marketing, social paid campaigns, or Meta advertising. While they have strong analytical and data-driven skills from software development, they lack the core marketing expertise, platform knowledge (Meta), and domain experience required for this senior marketing role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Performance Marketing Manager – Social Paid (Meta Fokus) position at KoRo Handels GmbH. Your focus on scaling new customer growth through a creative-first, data-driven approach aligns with my experience in building systems that optimize user acquisition and performance.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong analytical capabilities by designing and implementing data-driven applications. I have experience working with performance metrics, analyzing user behavior data, and building testing frameworks to continuously improve outcomes. My technical background gives me a structured approach to understanding and optimizing customer acquisition funnels.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the ownership of creative strategy and testing frameworks. In my professional experience, I have collaborated with cross-functional teams including analytics, content, and product teams to deliver features that directly impacted user growth and engagement. I am comfortable working with large datasets, extracting insights, and translating them into actionable improvements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to KoRo\'s growth. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-10 03:18:09.123', '2026-06-10 03:18:09.123'),
(478, 478, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Meta Ads platform experience\",\"Performance marketing (CAC, ROAS, CPO)\",\"Creative strategy and UGC concepts\",\"E-commerce or DTC marketing\",\"Attribution and tracking\",\"4+ years in social paid campaigns\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong analytical and data skills, but lacks direct experience in performance marketing, Meta advertising, creative strategy, or e-commerce/DTC marketing. The role requires deep domain expertise in social paid channels, which is not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Performance Marketing Manager – Social Paid (Meta Focus) role at KoRo Handels GmbH. Your focus on scaling new customer growth through a creative-first, data-driven approach to social paid channels is a challenge I find compelling.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and data-driven platforms. In my professional experience, I have worked extensively with analytics, performance metrics, and system optimization. I have designed and implemented real-time monitoring dashboards that track key performance indicators, latency, and availability, enabling teams to make data-informed decisions quickly. This experience has given me a strong foundation in working with large datasets, deriving actionable insights, and continuously improving system efficiency.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured testing and iteration of performance creatives. In previous work, I have built and deployed platforms that required rigorous A/B testing, user behavior analysis, and iterative optimization. I am comfortable