(609, 609, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"AWS\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"FP&A experience\",\"Revenue planning\",\"Financial modelling\",\"Excel/Google Sheets\",\"SQL (working knowledge)\",\"Business analytics\",\"Management consulting\",\"Finance business partnering\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in software development, databases, and cloud infrastructure. However, this role is a senior commercial planning and finance position requiring FP&A, financial modelling, and business analytics experience. The applicant\'s background does not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Commercial Planning Senior Associate role at SumUp. Your mission to empower small businesses with simple financial tools is something I find genuinely compelling, and the opportunity to work on scalable planning models at the heart of SumUp\'s commercial engine aligns well with my analytical and technical background.\n\nMy experience building data-intensive applications has given me a strong foundation in working with complex datasets and translating them into meaningful business insights. I developed an AI-powered financial platform that processes real-time financial data, generates forecasts, and automates reporting workflows. This required extracting and manipulating data from databases using SQL, building scalable models, and presenting findings to non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I owned end-to-end feature delivery, from designing database schemas and building RESTful APIs to deploying applications on cloud infrastructure. I worked closely with cross-functional teams to understand requirements, influence decisions through data, and ensure that technical solutions directly supported commercial goals. This has given me practical experience in acting as a bridge between technical execution and business strategy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the migration of commercial planning from spreadsheets to scalable forecasting tools. I have hands-on experience automating manual workflows, building dashboards, and reducing operational overhead through technology. I am comfortable working in environments where priorities shift and structure is still being built, and I enjoy contributing to both the analytical and the operational sides of a business.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to SumUp\'s Commercial Planning team.', '2026-06-11 15:16:17.707', '2026-06-11 15:16:17.707'),
(610, 610, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"BDR/SDR management\",\"German market knowledge\",\"Salesforce\",\"LinkedIn Sales Navigator\",\"HR knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales or BDR management experience. The role requires 5+ years in sales and front-line management, which the applicant does not have. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Development Senior Manager position at Wellhub. Your mission to make every company a wellness company through a platform that connects employees to fitness, mindfulness, and wellbeing resources is genuinely impactful. I am interested in contributing to a team that builds meaningful partnerships and drives measurable business outcomes.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and automation systems. This experience has given me strong analytical capabilities and a data-driven approach to problem-solving. I am comfortable working with metrics, identifying inefficiencies in processes, and implementing systematic improvements.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams to deliver features, manage stakeholder expectations, and ensure projects are completed on time. I have also mentored junior developers, conducted code reviews, and helped onboard new team members. These experiences have developed my ability to coach others, communicate clearly, and foster a collaborative environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-11 15:16:25.329', '2026-06-11 15:16:25.329'),
(611, 611, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"BDR/SDR management\",\"German market knowledge\",\"HR knowledge\",\"Salesforce\",\"LinkedIn Sales Navigator\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no sales or BDR management experience. The role requires 5+ years in sales and 1-2 years as a front-line manager, which the applicant does not have. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Development Senior Manager position at Wellhub. Your mission to make every company a wellness company through a platform that connects employees to fitness, mindfulness, and wellbeing resources is both meaningful and ambitious. I am drawn to the challenge of building a high-value prospecting engine that directly contributes to improving health and happiness across Germany.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have spent years designing systems that solve complex problems. I have strong analytical skills and experience using data to identify bottlenecks and optimize performance. I understand how to leverage technology—from AI tools to CRM platforms—to drive measurable business outcomes. This technical foundation gives me a unique perspective on how to maximize ROI from sales tech stacks and coach teams to use them effectively.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked closely with stakeholders to deliver features that improved user engagement and conversion rates. I have built authentication systems, payment integrations, and real-time features that required careful coordination between engineering, product, and business teams. I am comfortable communicating with both technical and non-technical audiences and translating business needs into actionable plans.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Wellhub’s mission.', '2026-06-11 15:16:33.692', '2026-06-11 15:16:33.692'),
(612, 612, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Quality management methods (QS-Methoden)\",\"Process management\",\"Root cause analysis\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Energy or building technology domain knowledge\",\"Degree in industrial engineering, electrical engineering, or quality management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) and does not match the core requirements of this quality management role. There are no overlapping skills in quality assurance methods, process management, or the energy/building technology domain. The applicant\'s analytical and problem-solving abilities are relevant, but the role requires specialized QS expertise and domain experience that the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Spezialist:in Qualitätsmanagement position at Solvis GmbH. Your focus on building a comprehensive quality system across product lines and driving a \"Quality First\" culture aligns with my approach to engineering and process improvement.\n\nThrough my work in software development and system monitoring, I have developed a structured, data-driven approach to quality. I have built real-time dashboards that track system health, availability, and performance metrics, enabling teams to identify issues early and make informed decisions. This experience directly supports the role\'s emphasis on developing and maintaining dashboards for transparent quality and process metrics.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the definition of QS-gateways and test specifications along the entire product lifecycle. In previous projects, I have implemented monitoring pipelines and automated checks that catch problems before they reach production. I am comfortable working across teams to define quality standards and ensure they are followed from design through deployment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Solvis GmbH\'s quality management goals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-11 15:16:41.540', '2026-06-11 15:16:41.540');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(613, 613, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Elektrotechnik degree or certification\",\"VOB and HOAI knowledge\",\"DiaLux experience\",\"German B2 level\",\"Technical building equipment (TGA) experience\",\"Client negotiation experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and full-stack development, which does not match the core requirements of an electrical engineering planning role. The job requires a degree or certification in electrical engineering, knowledge of VOB/HOAI, experience with DiaLux, and German B2 proficiency. None of these are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fachplaner Elektrotechnik im Ingenieurbüro position at ETB Solution GmbH. Your focus on sustainable, energy-efficient building concepts and integrated technical planning stands out, and I am interested in contributing to a startup that values cross-disciplinary thinking and customer-oriented solutions.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and full-stack development, where I have spent over four years designing and delivering complex technical systems. Through my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in system architecture, project coordination, and technical documentation. I am accustomed to working independently on technical concepts and ensuring that all project deliverables are clearly documented and aligned with quality standards.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured planning and coordination of technical projects from concept through to completion. In my previous work, I have managed end-to-end delivery of web applications, including requirement analysis, system design, implementation, testing, and deployment. This experience has given me a disciplined approach to project workflows and a strong attention to detail in documentation and reporting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am also actively working to improve my German language skills.\n\nI am confident that my technical discipline, structured approach to project work, and ability to adapt quickly would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support ETB Solution GmbH\'s projects.', '2026-06-11 15:16:50.520', '2026-06-11 15:16:50.520'),
(614, 614, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"BWL/Finance/Accounting degree\",\"HGB knowledge\",\"SAP/ERP experience\",\"Accounting experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no accounting background, HGB knowledge, SAP experience, or German language skills. The role requires a finance/accounting degree, years of accounting experience, and fluency in German. There is minimal overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Team Lead Accounting DACH position at YOC AG. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than accounting, I bring strong analytical capabilities, process optimization experience, and a structured approach to problem-solving that I believe would be valuable in this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed expertise in building complex systems that require meticulous attention to data integrity, accurate reporting, and efficient workflows. I have experience designing and implementing role-based access control systems, managing database schemas, and creating dashboards for real-time monitoring. These skills translate well to accounting environments where accuracy, traceability, and process standardization are critical.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have led projects involving system optimization, automation of repetitive tasks, and integration of third-party services. I am comfortable working with cross-functional teams, communicating with stakeholders, and taking ownership of deliverables from start to finish. I approach problems methodically and focus on building solutions that are both reliable and maintainable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical mindset and process improvement experience could contribute to YOC AG\'s accounting team.', '2026-06-11 15:16:58.754', '2026-06-11 15:16:58.754'),
(615, 615, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Business administration degree\",\"Accounting experience\",\"HGB knowledge\",\"ERP systems (SAP, Oracle, DATEV)\",\"German fluency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no accounting, finance, or business administration background. The job requires a degree in business/finance, several years of accounting experience, HGB knowledge, ERP system expertise, and German fluency. None of these requirements are met by the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Team Lead Accounting DACH (m/f/x) position at YOC AG. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a structured approach to problem-solving, and a proven ability to drive process optimization and automation.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for designing scalable systems, optimizing performance, and standardizing workflows across multiple projects. These experiences have honed my ability to analyze complex operations, identify inefficiencies, and implement structured solutions.\n\nI am particularly interested in YOC AG because of its position in the mobile advertising market and its emphasis on progress and connectedness. The opportunity to contribute to the digitalization and optimization of financial processes aligns with my hands-on mentality and my interest in improving operational efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and process-oriented mindset can contribute to the YOC team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-11 15:17:05.853', '2026-06-11 15:17:05.853'),
(616, 616, 1, 45, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Microservices\",\"Redis\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Python\",\"C++\"]', '[\"Azure\",\"Data engineering\",\"Digital Workplace\",\"Enterprise cloud architecture experience\",\"Client-facing consulting experience\"]', 'The applicant has a solid foundation in cloud technologies (AWS, Google Cloud, Docker, Kubernetes) and AI integration (OpenAI, Replicate), but lacks direct experience with Azure, enterprise-level cloud architecture, and client-facing consulting roles that the job emphasizes. The match is moderate, with potential for growth into the senior architect role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Cloud & AI Architect role at TEQWERK GmbH. The opportunity to design cloud and AI architectures from concept to scalable reality aligns directly with the kind of technical work I enjoy most.\n\nMy experience spans cloud infrastructure, AI system integration, and full-stack development. I have worked with AWS, Google Cloud, Docker, and Kubernetes to deploy and manage production systems. I have also built AI-powered features using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, integrating them into real applications with secure authentication, payment flows, and real-time data processing.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is translating business requirements into technical solutions. In previous projects, I have taken complex stakeholder needs and turned them into working architectures that balance performance, security, and maintainability. I have also set development standards and best practices within teams, ensuring long-term code quality and operational reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cloud and AI architecture could contribute to TEQWERK\'s projects.', '2026-06-11 15:17:14.548', '2026-06-11 15:17:14.548'),
(617, 617, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Retail Design\",\"Innenarchitektur\",\"Szenografie\",\"Rhino\",\"Cinema 4D\",\"Enscape\",\"Twinmotion\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with a strong software engineering background, but this role is a spatial and retail design internship requiring specialized design skills (3D software, Adobe Creative Suite, interior architecture) and fluent German. The only overlapping skill is Figma, and the applicant\'s AI/computer vision experience is tangentially related but not a direct match for the core design responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikum Spatial & Retail Design position at LIGANOVA GmbH in Berlin. Your focus on creating immersive brand experiences in three-dimensional space aligns with my interest in building systems that bridge the digital and physical worlds.\n\nAlthough my formal training is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in visual thinking and AI-powered design tools. Through my research and development work, I have built computer vision systems using YOLOv8 for real-time object detection, which required precise spatial reasoning and an understanding of how visual information translates into actionable outputs. I also use Figma regularly for UI/UX design and prototyping, and I am comfortable working with rendering and visualization workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your use of innovative AI tools like Midjourney for rapid ideation. I have practical experience integrating AI APIs into production systems, including OpenAI and Replicate, for image processing and content generation. This technical background allows me to quickly adopt and experiment with new creative tools while understanding their underlying capabilities and limitations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am structured, self-driven, and solution-oriented, and I am eager to bring my analytical mindset to your spatial design projects.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the Creative League at LIGANOVA.', '2026-06-11 15:17:23.700', '2026-06-11 15:17:23.700'),
(618, 618, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"B2B marketing experience\",\"Paid marketing (Google Ads, Meta)\",\"Workflow automation (n8n, Zapier, Make)\",\"German native proficiency\",\"Marketing operations\",\"Event management\",\"Sales enablement\",\"Team leadership\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with AI integration experience, but the role requires B2B marketing expertise, paid marketing skills, workflow automation tools (n8n/Zapier), German fluency, and marketing operations experience. The technical AI skills are relevant to the AI tools requirement, but the core marketing and commercial responsibilities are not supported by the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founders Associate Marketing & Commercial role at hellomateo. Your mission to strengthen customer relationships for Mittelstand companies through personalized communication is compelling, and the 4x growth over two years shows real product-market fit.\n\nAs a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I work with AI tools daily in my development workflow. I have integrated OpenAI and Replicate APIs into production applications for content generation, personalization, and data processing. I built AI assistants trained on custom datasets and automated workflows that replaced manual operations. This practical experience with AI in real products aligns with your need for someone who actively uses AI tools rather than just having theoretical interest.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process automation. In my projects, I have built systems that automate lead handling, data processing, and reporting pipelines. I understand how to design workflows that reduce manual effort and scale reliably. While my background is technical rather than pure marketing, I am comfortable working with data, optimizing based on performance metrics, and taking ownership of projects from start to finish.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take real ownership and grow quickly. hellomateo\'s startup environment and direct work with the founder team is exactly the kind of setting where I can contribute and develop. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-11 15:17:32.824', '2026-06-11 15:17:32.824'),
(619, 619, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Paid Social Management\",\"Meta Ads\",\"TikTok Ads\",\"Pinterest Ads\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"KPI Analysis\",\"Budget Management\",\"Client Consulting\",\"German Language (verhandlungssicher)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in paid social management, performance marketing, or social media advertising. While they have strong technical and analytical skills, they lack the core marketing expertise, platform knowledge (Meta, TikTok, Pinterest), and client consulting experience required for this senior-level role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Paid Social Manager position at Sunlab GmbH. Your focus on data, creatives, and technology to drive measurable results for category-leading clients like Thomann aligns well with my background in building data-driven systems and optimizing performance.\n\nAs a Full-Stack and AI Engineer with over 4 years of professional experience, I have developed and deployed systems that rely on real-time monitoring, KPI tracking, and performance optimization. In my previous work, I built a Real-Time Server Health Monitoring dashboard that streams live metrics using Socket.IO, enabling instant visibility into system health and latency. This experience has given me a strong foundation in data analysis, automation, and performance measurement.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of AI for performance analysis. I have worked on projects integrating AI assistants and machine learning models for data processing and automation. I am comfortable with the technical side of tracking, monitoring, and AI-powered performance evaluations, which directly supports the responsibilities outlined for this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to Sunlab\'s mission of driving performance marketing forward.', '2026-06-11 15:17:41.006', '2026-06-11 15:17:41.006'),
(620, 620, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Ads\",\"Google Analytics\",\"Looker Studio\",\"Google Spreadsheets\",\"SEA experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks direct SEA (Search Engine Advertising) experience, knowledge of Google Ads, Google Analytics, Looker Studio, and German language proficiency which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Senior SEA Manager (m/w/d) position at Sunlab GmbH. Your focus on combining data, smart strategies, and technology to scale performance resonates with my own approach to building intelligent, data-driven systems.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong analytical skills and a systematic approach to problem-solving. I have experience integrating AI tools and automation workflows into existing platforms, which directly supports your goal of automating processes and extracting maximum value from campaigns.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of automation and AI into operational workflows. In previous projects, I have built systems that leverage AI for real-time decision-making and automated reporting. I am confident I can apply this experience to help Sunlab identify hidden growth levers and scale campaign performance through smarter automation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Sunlab\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-11 15:17:48.504', '2026-06-11 15:17:48.504'),
(621, 621, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Degree in Economics or Business Administration\",\"Controlling experience\",\"Excel proficiency\",\"ERP systems\",\"BI tools\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this Senior Controller role. The job requires a degree in economics/business, years of controlling experience, Excel, ERP, and BI tools expertise, and fluent German. The applicant is a software engineer with no controlling, finance, or business administration background, and no German language proficiency mentioned. The only transferable skills are analytical thinking and data handling, but these are not sufficient for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Controller (gn) - Consumer Goods position at Argus Search GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and data systems, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a structured approach to problem-solving, and experience building data-driven reporting tools that support management decisions.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and maintained systems that track, analyze, and report on key metrics in real time. I built monitoring dashboards that stream live system health data, created financial reporting modules for a personal finance platform, and developed role-based access control systems that ensure data integrity and security. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in working with numbers, identifying trends, and presenting actionable insights.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the process of turning raw data into clear, decision-ready reports. I have experience working with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB to structure data efficiently, and I have built custom reporting interfaces using React and Next.js. I am comfortable analyzing variances, preparing presentations, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to ensure data quality and plausibility.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-11 15:17:57.287', '2026-06-11 15:17:57.287'),
(622, 622, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Building services experience\",\"Property maintenance experience\",\"Facilities management\"]', 'The job is for an Improver role in building services/property maintenance, which is a facilities management position. The applicant\'s profile is focused on software engineering, web development, and AI systems. There is no direct overlap between the applicant\'s technical skills and the job requirements for building maintenance work.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Improver position at Jaguar Building Services Ltd. With over 4 years of professional experience in software engineering and web development, I bring a practical, hands-on approach to building and maintaining reliable systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed and deployed full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker containers, Nginx, and Apache configurations. I have also set up CI/CD pipelines and managed deployments on AWS and DigitalOcean.\n\nIn previous roles, I built RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database queries for performance. I have experience with real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO, and I have maintained production systems with monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of Jaguar Building Services Ltd.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-11 15:18:04.487', '2026-06-11 15:18:04.487'),
(623, 623, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer relationship management\",\"Client coordination\",\"Portuguese language\",\"CRM software\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the client relationship coordination role. No direct skills overlap. The role requires customer relationship management and likely Portuguese language skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Coordenador de Relacionamento com Cliente position at Checkout RH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong client relationship and coordination skills developed through years of direct stakeholder collaboration on complex technical projects.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I worked closely with clients and internal teams to understand requirements, communicate progress, and ensure deliverables met expectations. This involved regular client communication, gathering feedback, managing expectations, and coordinating between developers, designers, and business stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my structured problem-solving approach and clear communication style to client relationship management. I am comfortable translating technical concepts for non-technical audiences and ensuring that client needs are understood and addressed effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my client coordination and communication skills can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-11 15:18:11.061', '2026-06-11 15:18:11.061'),
(624, 624, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service or account management experience (2-4 years)\",\"Salesforce\",\"Slack\",\"Invoicing tools\",\"Shipping logistics platforms\",\"Order fulfillment processes\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but lacks direct customer service or account management experience, as well as proficiency with Salesforce, Slack, invoicing, and shipping logistics tools. The role requires 2-4 years of customer service experience and specific platform expertise, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is low due to the significant gap in required non-technical skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Specialist position at SORACOM. Your mission of connecting devices and empowering customers through IoT is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the emphasis on building a global, remote-first team.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and problem-solving skills through years of client-facing work. In my role as a Web Developer, I regularly managed stakeholder communications, handled inquiries, and ensured that project requirements were met accurately and on time. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and have experience collaborating across different time zones and cultures.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your focus on using emerging AI tools to enhance efficiency. I have hands-on experience integrating AI into practical applications, including building AI-powered assistants and automation workflows. I am confident I can apply this familiarity to improve customer service processes and deliver faster, more accurate support.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to SORACOM\'s growth by providing excellent support to your customers and partners. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can help your team.', '2026-06-11 15:18:20.046', '2026-06-11 15:18:20.046'),
(625, 625, 1, 15, '[\"Javascript\",\"AWS\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Salesforce\",\"customer service experience\",\"account management experience\",\"invoicing tools\",\"shipping logistics platforms\",\"order fulfillment\",\"Slack (not explicitly in profile)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering), while the job is a customer service role requiring 2-4 years of direct customer service or account management experience, Salesforce proficiency, and logistics/invoicing skills. The applicant has strong communication and remote work abilities, and familiarity with AWS and AI tools, but lacks the core customer service experience and Salesforce expertise required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Specialist position at SORACOM. Your mission of making connectivity work for a world that works together is compelling, and I appreciate the emphasis on building a global, remote-first team that values diverse perspectives.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong problem-solving skills, attention to detail, and the ability to work independently across distributed teams. I have experience communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders, managing multiple priorities, and ensuring accuracy in data handling and reporting.\n\nIn previous roles, I collaborated with teammates across different time zones, managed project documentation, and supported client-facing communication. I am comfortable using tools like Slack and AWS, and I am quick to learn new platforms. I also actively explore emerging AI tools to improve efficiency and creativity in my work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to SORACOM\'s customer and partner support operations with the same dedication and precision I bring to every project. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.', '2026-06-11 15:18:28.801', '2026-06-11 15:18:28.801'),
(626, 626, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"2-4 years of customer service or account management experience\",\"Proficiency with invoicing tools and shipping logistics platforms\",\"Salesforce experience\",\"Slack experience\",\"Order fulfillment and logistics processes\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not include the customer service, account management, invoicing, Salesforce, or logistics experience required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Specialist position at SORACOM. Your mission of making connectivity work for businesses around the world and the emphasis on building a collaborative, globally distributed team resonates with me.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in roles that required strong communication, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple responsibilities independently. I am comfortable working across time zones and cultures, and I enjoy helping people solve problems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support customer and partner accounts through clear communication, accurate reporting, and proactive follow-up. I have experience collaborating with cross-functional teams, managing data carefully, and ensuring that information flows to the right people at the right time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-11 15:18:35.195', '2026-06-11 15:18:35.195'),
(627, 627, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Biology domain expertise\",\"Academic or lab experience in biology\",\"Advanced degree in Biology or related field\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and AI engineering skills but lacks the required biology domain expertise, academic or lab experience, and advanced degree in biology. The role requires a biology expert to train AI systems, which does not match the applicant\'s software engineering profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Biology Expert role at YO IT Consulting. The opportunity to apply domain expertise toward training next-generation AI systems aligns closely with my background in building intelligent, data-driven technologies.\n\nMy work as a software and AI engineer has involved extensive data analysis, technical document review, and content generation. I have designed systems that process complex datasets, train AI models, and produce high-quality outputs. This experience has given me a strong foundation in analyzing information, ensuring accuracy, and delivering clear, structured feedback.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the interdisciplinary nature of this role. I have collaborated with teams across engineering, product, and research domains, and I am comfortable working with technical documentation and translating complex information into actionable insights. My ability to work independently and manage multiple priorities makes me well-suited for a remote contractor position.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-11 15:18:43.405', '2026-06-11 15:18:43.405'),
(628, 628, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Courier operations\",\"Dispatch\",\"Ground ops\",\"Customer service\",\"Picking and packing\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant courier, dispatch, or ground operations experience. The profile does not match the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Courier position at FedEx. Your company\'s reputation for reliable global delivery and its People-Service-Profit philosophy stand out to me. I am drawn to organizations that prioritize their people and operational excellence.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong problem-solving abilities, attention to detail, and the discipline to follow processes accurately and safely. These skills transfer well to operational roles that require precision, organization, and teamwork.\n\nIn previous work, I have consistently demonstrated the ability to plan, organize, and complete tasks efficiently while maintaining high standards. I am comfortable working in structured environments where safety, timeliness, and customer service are the top priorities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-11 15:18:49.741', '2026-06-11 15:18:49.741'),
(629, 629, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Previous Cleaning Experience\",\"Manual cleaning skills\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no cleaning experience or relevant skills for this role. The job requires manual cleaning, which is not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Cleaner position at OCS. Your company\'s commitment to making people and places the best they can be, along with the award-winning workplace culture, is something I genuinely respect.\n\nI bring strong interpersonal skills and the ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a team. I communicate clearly in English and am comfortable following management directions while also taking initiative when needed.\n\nI am used to maintaining high standards in my work and take pride in completing tasks thoroughly and reliably. I understand the importance of building good relationships with clients and handling queries or complaints promptly and professionally.\n\nI am a hard worker and quick learner, and I am ready to contribute to OCS\'s mission by delivering consistent, quality cleaning services. I value trust, respect, and teamwork, which align well with your company\'s TRUE values.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-11 15:18:55.628', '2026-06-11 15:18:55.628'),
(630, 630, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"eBay marketing\",\"e-commerce platform management (Flipkart, Amazon, Snapdeal, etc.)\",\"automobile industry experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong IT and web development background but lacks direct eBay marketing or e-commerce specialist experience. The combined IT and marketing background mentioned in the job description is partially met through full-stack development skills, but specific e-commerce platform familiarity is not demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Specialist position at SHRI KRISHNA PLACEMENT. With a background in full-stack development and a strong understanding of e-commerce workflows, I am well positioned to contribute to the eBay marketing and web shop operations this role requires.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I have implemented RESTful APIs, role-based authentication, and payment gateway integrations, all of which are directly relevant to managing an e-commerce platform. My work has involved creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces and ensuring smooth data flow between frontend and backend systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of IT and e-commerce. I have developed full-stack platforms that handle product management, user accounts, and transaction workflows. These projects required a clear understanding of how online marketplaces operate, from listing products to processing orders and managing customer data.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with this role.', '2026-06-11 15:19:03.392', '2026-06-11 15:19:03.392'),
(631, 631, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Clinical research expertise\",\"Biomedical domain knowledge\",\"Pharmaceutical evaluation experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software engineering and AI system development skills, but the profile does not contain clinical, biomedical, or pharmaceutical research expertise. The match is low for this specialized domain role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pharmaceutical & Clinical Research Expert role at CuraSenseAI. Your focus on evaluating clinical, biomedical, and pharmaceutical domains aligns with my technical background in building intelligent systems that process complex data and support decision-making.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have designed AI-powered platforms that integrate real-time data processing, API communication, and automated workflows. One relevant example is an AI-powered financial application where I built backend services using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI, and implemented features such as voice-to-text transcription, PDF generation, and secure authentication. This experience required careful handling of structured data, system reliability, and cross-service integration.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to CuraSenseAI\'s evaluation work.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-11 15:19:10.816', '2026-06-11 15:19:10.816'),
(632, 632, 1, 25, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Data analysis tools (e.g., Python pandas, R, Tableau, Power BI)\",\"Statistical analysis\",\"Data visualization\",\"ETL processes\",\"SQL expertise beyond basic queries\"]', 'The applicant has foundational database skills (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB) and experience with data processing in projects, but lacks explicit data analysis tools, statistical analysis, and data visualization skills typically required for a Data Analyst role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Analyst position at Work Force Nexus. The opportunity to work with data in a structured, analytical capacity aligns well with my technical background and problem-solving approach.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed strong data handling skills across multiple database systems including MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB. I am comfortable writing complex queries, cleaning datasets, and extracting meaningful insights from raw information. My experience building RESTful APIs and managing data flows between frontend and backend systems has given me a practical understanding of how data moves, transforms, and can be used to drive decisions.\n\nIn previous projects, I have worked extensively with data processing and analysis. For example, in developing the AI Powered Financial App, I integrated data from Google Sheets, processed it through OpenAI\'s models, and generated PDF reports automatically. This required careful data validation, transformation, and output formatting. I also built real-time server monitoring dashboards that tracked system metrics and visualized performance data, further strengthening my ability to work with structured data in production environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to the Work Force Nexus team.', '2026-06-11 15:19:18.925', '2026-06-11 15:19:18.925');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(633, 633, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Diploma in Fire Fighting Technology\",\"Certification from accredited firefighting academy\",\"2-3 years firefighting experience\",\"ARFF operations experience\",\"Fire suppression techniques\",\"Emergency medical services (BLS)\",\"Firefighting equipment maintenance\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no firefighting, ARFF, or emergency response experience. The role requires a Diploma in Fire Fighting Technology, accredited firefighting certification, and 2-3 years of hands-on firefighting experience. There is no skill overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Assistant ARFF position at Adani Airport Holdings Ltd. While my professional background is in software engineering and autonomous systems rather than firefighting operations, I bring a strong foundation in real-time monitoring, emergency response coordination, and system reliability that could support airport safety and engineering teams.\n\nThrough my work on UAV and autonomous systems projects, I have developed expertise in real-time data processing, system monitoring, and secure communication protocols. I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracks system availability and latency, streaming live metrics to operators using Socket.IO. This experience has given me a disciplined approach to operational readiness, incident documentation, and maintaining detailed logs for compliance purposes.\n\nI have also worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker containers, and CI/CD pipelines, ensuring systems remain operational under varying loads. My experience coordinating with cross-functional teams during development and deployment cycles has prepared me to collaborate effectively with airport operations, engineering, and emergency response teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to Adani Airport Holdings Ltd\'s safety and operational excellence.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-11 15:19:26.615', '2026-06-11 15:19:26.615'),
(634, 634, 1, 0, '[]', '[\"Diploma in Fire Fighting Technology or equivalent\",\"Certification from accredited firefighting academy\",\"2-3 years firefighting experience\",\"Aircraft Rescue and Fire Fighting (ARFF) operations experience\",\"Emergency medical services (first aid, BLS)\",\"Fire suppression techniques\",\"Hazardous material incident response\",\"ICAO-mandated training\",\"Firefighting vehicle and equipment maintenance\",\"Incident report writing\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Fire Fighter role at Adani Airport Holdings Ltd. The job requires firefighting certifications, ARFF experience, emergency medical skills, and fire suppression expertise. The applicant has no firefighting qualifications, certifications, or relevant experience in this domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', '', '2026-06-11 15:19:31.359', '2026-06-11 15:19:31.359'),
(635, 635, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Medical Devices / Surgical / Pharma Sales experience (4-6 years)\",\"Local candidate in Madhya Pradesh\",\"CRM update experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in medical device or pharma sales. The job requires 4-6 years of specific sales experience in the healthcare industry and local presence in Madhya Pradesh. The applicant\'s skills in communication and reporting are generic and do not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the District Associate Manager position at Meril. Meril\'s work in developing innovative healthcare solutions for cardiology and orthopedics, reaching over 150 countries, is impressive. I am interested in contributing to a company that directly improves patient lives through its products.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and delivering full-stack applications. Through this work, I have developed strong discipline in managing complex workflows, meeting deadlines, and maintaining clear reporting structures. These skills are directly transferable to managing sales territories, tracking performance metrics, and achieving monthly and quarterly targets.\n\nA key part of my previous roles involved building and maintaining relationships with clients and stakeholders to ensure project success. I am accustomed to understanding client needs, communicating clearly, and coordinating efforts to deliver results. This experience aligns well with the responsibility of building strong relationships with doctors and distributors in a hospital and lab setting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured approach, communication skills, and focus on achieving targets will allow me to contribute effectively to Meril\'s growth in the Madhya Pradesh region. My CV is attached for your detailed review.', '2026-06-11 15:19:39.132', '2026-06-11 15:19:39.132'),
(636, 636, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Legal qualification\",\"Constitutional law expertise\",\"Statutory interpretation\",\"Human Rights Act 2019 knowledge\",\"High Court litigation experience\",\"Legal advisory experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no legal background, education, or experience. The job requires a qualified lawyer with expertise in constitutional law, statutory interpretation, and human rights. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Lawyer position within the Constitutional Law Team at Crown Law, Queensland Government. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI systems, I bring strong analytical reasoning, attention to detail, and the ability to work with complex frameworks that I believe are transferable to legal practice.\n\nMy work as a full-stack and AI engineer has required me to interpret detailed technical specifications, analyze multi-layered problems, and provide clear, reasoned advice to stakeholders. These skills in statutory interpretation and logical analysis align with the demands of constitutional law and human rights advisory work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am drawn to Crown Law\'s commitment to integrity, excellence, respect, and responsibility. The opportunity to contribute to matters of fundamental importance to the State is genuinely appealing.\n\nI have attached my CV for your consideration and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support the Constitutional Law Team.\n\nThank you for your time.', '2026-06-11 15:19:45.503', '2026-06-11 15:19:45.503'),
(637, 637, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"NHS England Approved Clinical Coding Trainer certification\",\"Clinical coding experience\",\"NHS experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and AI, with no clinical coding or NHS experience. The role requires an NHS England Approved Clinical Coding Trainer with substantial NHS experience. While the applicant has transferable training and mentoring skills, they lack the mandatory qualifications and domain expertise required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Clinical Coding Trainer position at Torbay and South Devon NHS Foundation Trust. The opportunity to contribute to a team that directly impacts patient care quality and income recovery through accurate clinical coding is genuinely compelling. Your focus on staff development and supportive team culture aligns with my own approach to professional growth and collaboration.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering rather than clinical coding, I bring transferable skills that are directly relevant to this training role. Over four years of web development experience, I have regularly designed and delivered training sessions, created comprehensive documentation, and mentored junior developers through complex technical concepts. These experiences have given me practical expertise in assessing learning needs, structuring training pathways, and providing constructive feedback to improve performance.\n\nIn my role at Explo-IT, I was responsible for onboarding new team members and conducting regular knowledge-sharing sessions on Laravel, Next.js, and API development. I developed training materials that broke down complex workflows into clear, actionable steps, and I worked closely with each developer to ensure they understood both the technical implementation and the underlying standards. This hands-on mentoring approach helped new team members become productive contributors more quickly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my training and mentoring experience can support the Clinical Coding team at Torbay and South Devon NHS Foundation Trust. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-11 15:19:54.179', '2026-06-11 15:19:54.179'),
(638, 638, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"CAP/Master del Profesorado/Certificado de docencia\",\"600+ hours teaching experience\",\"Moodle experience\",\"Degree in Administración y Gestión\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no formal teaching credentials, no degree in administration/management, and no documented experience with Moodle or 600+ hours of teaching. The role requires specific teaching certifications and agroalimentaria domain knowledge that are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Tutor a E Learning Industria Agroalimentaria position at Grupo Coremsa. Your company\'s 20-year track record in vocational training and commitment to inclusive, equitable education aligns with my own values of clear communication and practical knowledge sharing.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have direct experience with Moodle and online learning platforms from building and managing educational tools. I understand how to navigate teleformación environments, support learners remotely, and keep course content organized and accessible.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, MySQL, and Linux servers. I have built systems that require clear documentation, structured workflows, and user-friendly interfaces. These skills translate directly to managing course materials, tracking learner progress, and troubleshooting technical issues in a virtual classroom.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for the flexible teleformación schedule and can start from June 2026. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to Grupo Coremsa\'s training programs.', '2026-06-11 15:20:02.595', '2026-06-11 15:20:02.595'),
(639, 639, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Compliance services\",\"HR services\",\"Health & safety services\",\"Customer support (Hypercare)\"]', 'The job description for Hypercare at The Citation Group focuses on mission-critical compliance, HR, and health & safety services. The applicant\'s profile is centered on full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems, with no direct overlap in compliance, HR, or health & safety domains. The match score is low due to the lack of relevant industry-specific skills and experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Hypercare role at The Citation Group. Your work providing mission-critical compliance, HR, and health & safety services to over 120,000 businesses across the UK, Australia, and Canada is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to a team that supports such a large and diverse client base.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways. My work has involved optimizing database performance through Eloquent query tuning and caching strategies, as well as deploying applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Apache, and Docker.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building reliable systems that support real-world operations. In previous work, I delivered real-time features such as chat and notifications using WebSockets, and integrated third-party services including cloud storage and social logins. I also created responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks, ensuring a smooth user experience across devices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-11 15:20:09.931', '2026-06-11 15:20:09.931'),
(640, 640, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"2 years media monitoring experience\",\"PR/communication/marketing degree\",\"Greek language\",\"Innews\",\"Clip News\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this PR/media monitoring role, which demands a PR/communication background, Greek language fluency, and experience with media monitoring platforms.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Media Monitoring & Reporting Executive position at AEA Relate. Your agency\'s reputation as a leading PR and communication firm in Greece is well known, and I am interested in contributing to your media monitoring team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and reporting skills. I have built full-stack applications that require careful tracking of data, real-time monitoring, and structured reporting. For example, I created a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracks availability and latency across multiple targets, streaming live metrics and generating clear reports. This work required the same attention to detail, critical thinking, and ability to manage multiple data streams that media monitoring demands.\n\nI am proficient in MS Office and comfortable learning new tools and platforms quickly. I am a critical thinker who can prioritize tasks and work under pressure within tight deadlines. I have experience managing multiple projects and deliverables simultaneously, ensuring accuracy and consistency in all outputs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, attention to detail, and ability to produce accurate, timely reports would make me a valuable addition to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to AEA Relate.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-11 15:20:18.079', '2026-06-11 15:20:18.079'),
(641, 641, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"healthcare domain experience\",\"project management certification\",\"healthcare project specialist experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and project delivery skills but lacks direct healthcare domain experience and specific project specialist qualifications. The role requires healthcare project management expertise, which is not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Project Specialist Healthcare position at iMPROve Health. While my background is primarily in software engineering and AI, I bring strong project execution skills, technical problem-solving ability, and experience delivering complex systems from concept to deployment.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance. These projects required careful planning, cross-functional coordination, and clear communication with stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my technical project management skills in a healthcare context. I have experience managing full application lifecycles, from requirement analysis and architecture design to deployment and maintenance. I am comfortable working with multidisciplinary teams and translating technical requirements into actionable plans.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent i