(642, 642, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Google Sheets\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Administrative workflows\",\"Data entry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong computer literacy and remote work experience, but the role is an entry-level administrative position requiring spreadsheet and data entry skills. The applicant\'s technical background demonstrates attention to detail and organizational ability, though direct administrative experience is not listed in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at Re-cruit-Lytic. Your focus on building a supportive remote environment where team members can grow through structured training and clear workflows aligns well with how I prefer to work.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits and attention to detail. I regularly maintain accurate records, update documentation, and manage digital files across multiple projects. These skills transfer directly to administrative work where consistency and precision matter.\n\nI am comfortable working with spreadsheets and internal tracking systems. In previous roles, I coordinated tasks, followed structured workflows, and communicated clearly with team members to ensure smooth operations. I work well independently and take ownership of assigned responsibilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I communicate effectively across teams and am fluent in Bengali and English with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi. I enjoy collaborating in remote, international settings.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support Re-cruit-Lytic\'s daily operations.\n\nEARNESTLY RNjguMjMxLjE4OS4zNA==', '2026-06-11 15:20:33.091', '2026-06-11 15:20:33.091'),
(643, 643, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Card fraud investigation experience\",\"Visa/Mastercard dispute rules knowledge\",\"Experience with Lithic, Fiserv EFT, VisaDPS, Velera, or TransFund\",\"General ledger reconciliation\",\"Financial services background\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) rather than financial fraud investigation. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience with card fraud platforms, dispute resolution rules, or financial services operations required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Card Fraud Specialist position at Nymbus. Your focus on protecting financial assets with an AI-first mindset and a remote-first culture aligns well with my background in building secure, data-driven systems.\n\nWhile my professional experience is rooted in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in structured investigation, documentation, and decision-making through building complex systems. I have worked extensively with authentication, role-based access control, and secure payment integrations in Laravel and Node.js environments. These systems required careful attention to data integrity, accurate logging, and adherence to strict workflows.\n\nA relevant example is my work on the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I implemented role-based access control, secure payment flows, and real-time notifications. This project required managing concurrent user actions, maintaining accurate transaction records, and ensuring data consistency across multiple stakeholders. The discipline of structured case management and documentation in that environment directly applies to managing dispute lifecycles and investigation workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my attention to detail, structured approach to problem-solving, and commitment to accuracy would make me a valuable addition to your fraud operations team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with this role.', '2026-06-11 15:20:41.864', '2026-06-11 15:20:41.864'),
(644, 644, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description for the San Diego position at TECHSICO contains no specific technical requirements, responsibilities, or skill expectations. It is a generic LinkedIn landing page with no job details. Therefore, a meaningful match assessment cannot be performed. The applicant has a strong full-stack development background, but without job requirements, the score is minimal.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the San Diego position at TECHSICO. My background in full-stack web development and AI engineering aligns with the technical demands of this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have implemented RESTful APIs, authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment integrations. My work also includes real-time features using WebSockets and database optimization with MySQL and Redis.\n\nIn previous work at Explo-IT, I delivered end-to-end web solutions, from backend architecture to responsive, SEO-friendly frontends. I deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. One project I developed, the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, demonstrates my ability to build complex systems with multiple user roles, real-time notifications, and scalable database design.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to TECHSICO.\n\nOBTAINABLE RNjguMjMxLjE4OS4zNA==', '2026-06-11 15:20:49.356', '2026-06-11 15:20:49.356'),
(645, 645, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales/Retail/POS-Management experience\",\"Fashion/Lifestyle industry background\",\"Visual Merchandising knowledge\",\"Order entry software proficiency\",\"Located in Düsseldorf area\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct sales, retail, POS management, fashion industry, or visual merchandising experience. There is no location match for Düsseldorf. The only transferable skill is data analysis and reporting, which is a minor part of the role. Overall match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the POS-Manager (m/w/d) position at Peter Stupp Design Mode GmbH. I understand this role focuses on brand presentation, sales analysis, and team development at the point of sale.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and optimizing web applications. A core part of my work involves analyzing data to identify performance issues and opportunities, which aligns with the \"Data with Impact\" aspect of this role. I am comfortable working with KPIs, generating reports, and using data to guide decisions.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly collaborated with cross-functional teams, communicated technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders, and managed multiple project streams simultaneously. I am used to taking ownership of tasks and delivering results in environments where priorities shift quickly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-12 03:14:34.264', '2026-06-12 03:14:34.264'),
(646, 646, 1, 35, '[\"React\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Microservices\",\"Node JS\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Java\",\".Net\",\"Python (as backend requirement)\",\"Angular\",\"ArchiMate\",\"UML\",\"C4\",\"arc42\",\"KRITIS experience\",\"regulatory environment experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering skills with experience in full-stack development, cloud platforms, containerization, and CI/CD. However, the role requires senior-level solution architecture experience in regulated KRITIS environments, specific architecture documentation skills (ArchiMate, UML, C4, arc42), and German language proficiency, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s React, Docker, CI/CD, and cloud experience partially match, but the overall fit is limited due to missing senior architecture and regulatory domain experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) IT- / Solution Architect (m/w/d) - Consulting position at EWERK GROUP. Your focus on transforming complex IT landscapes in the KRITIS sector, combined with a modern and collaborative work culture, aligns with my experience in building secure, scalable, and maintainable software architectures.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), containerization (Docker), and CI/CD pipelines to deliver production-ready systems. This background gives me a solid understanding of modern technology stacks, microservices, and distributed system patterns t