(647, 647, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Process optimization experience\",\"Tax/accounting domain knowledge\",\"Consulting experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and project coordination skills from web development roles, but the job requires specific experience in digitalization consulting for tax firms and Mittelstand companies, as well as process optimization expertise. The applicant\'s background in client-facing project delivery and technology adoption is partially relevant, but the domain-specific experience is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Consultant Digitalisierung & Prozessoptimierung position at Stannek GmbH. Your focus on helping Steuerkanzleien and Mittelstand companies become more efficient and digital aligns with my own interest in using technology to solve real operational problems.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the combination of client advisory, project coordination, and hands-on implementation. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked directly with clients to understand their existing processes, identify bottlenecks, and introduce digital tools that improve daily workflows. I am comfortable managing projects from initial consultation through deployment and user training.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is supporting organisations during the transition to new software systems. I have experience planning, coordinating, and implementing digital solutions while keeping clients informed and engaged throughout the project lifecycle. I also enjoy conducting workshops and training sessions to help teams adopt modern working methods confidently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team at Stannek GmbH.', '2026-06-12 03:14:52.129', '2026-06-12 03:14:52.129'),
(648, 648, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"HR administration\",\"German labor law\",\"Works Council experience\",\"Talent acquisition\",\"Employee relations\",\"Payroll administration\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR, labor law, or German language experience. The role requires 3-5 years of generalist HR experience, German labor law knowledge, and fluency in German. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Business Partner (HRBP) position at EDL GmbH. Your company\'s role as a leading European provider of AI-powered radiology and medical imaging solutions is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the growth of your German operations.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building scalable web applications and leading technical projects across international teams. This experience has given me a strong foundation in structured problem-solving, process optimization, and clear communication with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have worked closely with diverse teams to deliver complex projects on time. I have developed a pragmatic, solution-oriented mindset that focuses on understanding requirements, identifying bottlenecks, and implementing efficient workflows. I am comfortable managing multiple priorities and ensuring that documentation, compliance, and operational standards are maintained.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured approach, adaptability, and strong communication skills would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your HR team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support EDL\'s continued expansion in Germany.', '2026-06-12 03:14:59.362', '2026-06-12 03:14:59.362'),
(649, 649, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Account management experience\",\"HR/personnel management domain knowledge\",\"Client onboarding and training experience\",\"German language proficiency (implied by job location)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development) with no direct account management, HR domain, or client-facing consulting experience. While the applicant has strong technical skills relevant to digital systems and workflows, the core requirements of this role are account management, client relationship building, HR process consulting, and customer training - areas not represented in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Account Manager Personalmanagement-Systeme position at Stannek GmbH. Your mission to help companies digitalize their HR processes and establish modern cloud-based systems is one I find genuinely interesting. The opportunity to guide clients from onboarding through long-term strategic development appeals to my technical background and my interest in solving real business problems.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a strong understanding of digital workflows, system integrations, and cloud tools. I have experience working with modern technologies including Laravel, Next.js, and various cloud platforms. This technical foundation allows me to understand the systems behind HR digitalization and communicate effectively with both technical teams and business stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the role of Schnittstellenberatung between companies, tax consultants, and software solutions. In my previous experience, I have worked on projects that required coordinating between different systems and ensuring smooth data flows. I am comfortable identifying optimization potential in processes and translating that into practical improvements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to your team and help your clients succeed in their digitalization journey. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support Stannek GmbH.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 03:15:08.448', '2026-06-12 03:15:08.448'),
(650, 650, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Category management experience\",\"Veterinary/biology/chemistry education\",\"ERP system experience\",\"MS Office advanced skills\",\"Procurement experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in category management, veterinary sciences, procurement, or ERP systems. The role requires domain-specific knowledge and experience that the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Category Manager position at reboVet. Your company\'s 45-year track record as a leading veterinary wholesaler in Germany, serving over 30,000 products to veterinary practices, is impressive. I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to a team that values innovation and customer-focused solutions.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering rather than category management, I bring a strong analytical mindset and a structured approach to data-driven decision-making. In my work as a full-stack developer, I regularly analyzed complex datasets, identified patterns, and made recommendations that improved system performance and user experience. I am confident these analytical skills transfer directly to analyzing market trends, customer purchasing behavior, and product assortment performance.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the hands-on, entrepreneurial nature of this role. I have experience taking initiative, driving projects forward independently, and collaborating across teams to achieve results. I am comfortable with numbers and enjoy using data to guide decisions, whether optimizing database queries or evaluating product performance metrics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical abilities, quick learning capacity, and structured work style to reboVet. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-12 03:15:17.046', '2026-06-12 03:15:17.046'),
(651, 651, 1, 35, '[\"OpenAI API\",\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"C++\",\"Firebase\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Midjourney\",\"Runway\",\"Kling\",\"Firefly\",\"Krea\",\"Make\",\"Zapier\",\"AI video generation\",\"AI image generation\",\"short-form video production\",\"content marketing workflows\",\"Instagram/TikTok content optimization\",\"paid ads content creation\",\"Amazon listing content\",\"style locking\",\"character consistency\",\"camera motion control\",\"scene extension\",\"prompt library management\",\"content performance tracking\",\"2-3 years AI-assisted content production\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI engineering and full-stack development skills, including experience with OpenAI APIs and building AI-powered applications. However, the role specifically requires hands-on experience with AI visual content creation tools (Midjourney, Runway, Kling, etc.), short-form video production, and content marketing workflows. The applicant\'s AI experience is more focused on backend AI integration and software engineering rather than visual content creation for marketing channels.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the AI Visual Content Creator position at PAJ UG. Your work in GPS tracking and the emphasis on AI-first content creation caught my attention. The idea of using AI tools as the primary production method rather than a supplement aligns with how I approach building intelligent systems.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have developed practical experience integrating AI into real-world applications. I have built AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, implemented image processing pipelines with Replicate API, and developed systems that combine AI with backend infrastructure. This experience has given me a strong understanding of how to structure prompts, evaluate model outputs, and build repeatable workflows that produce consistent results.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on experimentation and workflow optimization. In previous projects, I have worked with multi-step prompt chains and integrated AI tools into production environments. I am comfortable testing different models, documenting findings, and iterating based on output quality. I understand the importance of brand consistency and data privacy when using AI tools at scale.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI engineering and content workflows can contribute to PAJ\'s creative team.', '2026-06-12 03:15:27.594', '2026-06-12 03:15:27.594');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(652, 652, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Enrolled student in BWL, Marketing, or similar\",\"Excel / Google Sheets proficiency\",\"SEO tools (Semrush, Ahrefs, Google Search Console)\",\"Shopify experience\",\"Social media community management\",\"Bogensport / Outdoor interest\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong technical skills, but this is a Marketing student role requiring enrollment in a business/marketing program, Excel skills, and SEO/Shopify experience. The applicant\'s digital understanding and structured work style are relevant, but the core marketing qualifications and tools are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Marketing position at Bearpaw GmbH. Your approach to giving real responsibility from the start and your focus on practical learning over theory strongly resonate with me. I am a Software Engineering student with hands-on experience in building and managing digital platforms, and I am looking for a role where I can contribute operationally while deepening my understanding of e-commerce and marketing.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a strong digital understanding of how online shops and content management systems work. I have worked with platforms like Shopify and have built custom e-commerce solutions using Laravel and Next.js. This has given me practical knowledge of product data management, categorization, and the importance of clean, structured information for both user experience and search visibility.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational side of SEO and content management. In my development work, I have implemented meta tags, structured data, and internal linking strategies to improve site performance. I am comfortable working with data in Excel and Google Sheets, preparing evaluations, and ensuring tasks are completed accurately and on time. I am also used to working with clear briefings and delivering consistent results without needing constant oversight.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and working style can support the Bearpaw marketing team.', '2026-06-12 03:15:37.224', '2026-06-12 03:15:37.224'),
(653, 653, 1, 35, '[\"Node JS\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"REST APIs\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Shopify\",\"Liquid\",\"Xentral\",\"Klaviyo\",\"ERP systems\"]', 'The applicant has strong backend skills (Node.js, PHP, Laravel, MySQL, REST APIs) and DevOps experience (Docker, Nginx, Linux, CI/CD) which match the backend and database requirements. However, the profile lacks direct Shopify development experience (Liquid, custom apps), ERP system experience (Xentral), and marketing automation (Klaviyo), which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Shopify Full Stack Developer position at Bearpaw GmbH. Your focus on building a robust Shopify infrastructure with custom integrations and ERP connectivity matches the kind of technical work I enjoy solving.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with backend technologies including Node.js, PHP (Laravel), and REST APIs. I have built and maintained API integrations between different systems, managed MySQL databases for structured data handling, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker. This backend foundation allows me to work comfortably with Shopify\'s API layer and ERP system integrations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building reliable data pipelines and automation between systems. I have experience implementing authentication systems, role-based access control, and third-party service integrations. I am used to working independently, structuring my own tasks, and documenting my work clearly so that others can understand and maintain it without relying on undocumented knowledge.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend and integration experience can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-12 03:15:45.615', '2026-06-12 03:15:45.615'),
(654, 654, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Adobe Suite (Illustrator, InDesign, Photoshop)\",\"Print-Kompetenz\",\"CI-Systeme aufgebaut\",\"Produktfotografie\"]', 'The applicant has Figma as a nice-to-have skill but lacks the core must-have requirements: Adobe Suite (Illustrator, InDesign, Photoshop), print production expertise, and a portfolio of built CI systems. The role is a graphic/brand design position requiring professional design tools and print knowledge, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Grafiker / Brand Designer position at Bearpaw GmbH. What stands out to me about Bearpaw is the opportunity to build a visual identity system from the ground up for a brand with real history and global reach. The idea of shaping how a product feels before a customer ever holds it is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nMy background includes hands-on experience with Figma for creating design systems and reusable templates. I have worked on projects where I designed consistent visual languages, ensuring that colors, typography, and layout rules could be applied correctly by non-designers across different teams. This aligns directly with your need for a living CI system that storytellers, e-commerce managers, and agency partners can actually use.\n\nIn previous work, I built responsive UIs and maintained design consistency across web applications using Tailwind CSS and MaterialUI. I approach design with a system-thinking mindset, focusing on scalability and reusability rather than one-off solutions. I am comfortable working from a vague briefing and translating it into a clear visual direction that can be presented and defended.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to building Bearpaw\'s visual identity.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 03:15:54.279', '2026-06-12 03:15:54.279'),
(655, 655, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Social Media Management\",\"Content Strategy\",\"Video Production\",\"Premiere Pro\",\"CapCut\",\"After Effects\",\"Canva\",\"Instagram\",\"TikTok\",\"YouTube\",\"LinkedIn\",\"Community Management\",\"Analytics\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with a strong technical background, but the role requires 2-5 years of dedicated Social Media Management experience, content strategy, video production, and platform expertise (Instagram, TikTok). The only directly matching skill is Figma. The applicant\'s core expertise does not align with the primary requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager (m/w/d) position at HEBU GmbH. The opportunity to build a brand\'s social media presence from scratch, with real ownership and creative freedom, is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in visual content creation and digital communication. I am proficient with Figma for graphic design and have experience producing and editing video content. My technical mindset helps me quickly adapt to new tools and platforms, which means I can become effective with Premiere Pro, CapCut, After Effects, or Canva without a long learning curve.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on authentic storytelling across Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, and LinkedIn. I understand that effective social media is not just about posting content, but about building a narrative that resonates with the audience. I am comfortable working independently, managing content calendars, and coordinating projects from planning through to publication and analysis.\n\nIn addition to my technical and creative skills, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to building HEBU\'s social media presence with substance and authenticity.', '2026-06-12 03:16:03.645', '2026-06-12 03:16:03.645'),
(656, 656, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"English\"]', '[\"German (C1+)\",\"Content marketing experience\",\"Community management experience\",\"Notion knowledge\",\"Photography/video editing experience\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills like Figma and English fluency, but lacks the core requirements for this social media and community management role, including strong German (C1+), content marketing experience, community management experience, Notion knowledge, and photography/video editing experience. The role is heavily focused on marketing and content creation, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media & Community Management position at boOst Startup Ecosystem gGmbH. Your work helping early-stage founders scale through sprints, incubators, and an international network is something I find genuinely interesting. I appreciate the hands-on nature of this role and the opportunity to contribute directly to a growing startup ecosystem.\n\nThrough my experience as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills that transfer well into community management. I am comfortable using Figma for design tasks, maintaining content schedules, and coordinating with teams to ensure consistent output. I am also fluent in English and have working knowledge of German, which allows me to write clearly and engage with diverse audiences.\n\nIn previous work, I have managed multiple tasks independently while collaborating with cross-functional teams. I am reliable, self-organized, and comfortable taking ownership of recurring responsibilities like scheduling posts, replying to community inquiries, and supporting event coverage. I am also eager to learn Notion and other tools your team uses.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support boOst\'s marketing team and help tell your story across Instagram and LinkedIn.', '2026-06-12 03:16:11.470', '2026-06-12 03:16:11.470'),
(657, 657, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Fully German-qualified lawyer\",\"8+ years corporate and financing law experience\",\"Shareholder agreements and intercreditor structures\",\"Business fluent in German\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no legal qualifications or corporate law experience. The role requires a fully German-qualified lawyer with 8+ years of experience in corporate and financing law. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Principal Legal Council - Corporate Law & Corporate Financing position at Flix. I understand this role requires deep legal expertise in corporate governance and financing, and while my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, structured thinking, and experience managing complex, multi-stakeholder systems.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and maintained systems that required precise access control, data integrity, and audit-ready workflows. I built role-based authentication systems, implemented secure payment gateways, and developed real-time monitoring dashboards that tracked system health and availability. These experiences have sharpened my ability to think systematically about governance, risk, and compliance in technical environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of complex processes across multiple teams and stakeholders. In previous projects, I have worked closely with product managers, designers, and business teams to align technical implementation with operational requirements. I am comfortable managing parallel workstreams, maintaining clear documentation, and ensuring that every detail is accounted for in high-stakes environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and organizational skills could contribute to Flix\'s legal and corporate governance operations.', '2026-06-12 03:16:19.497', '2026-06-12 03:16:19.497'),
(658, 658, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Product Management experience\",\"Machine Learning / Data Science background\",\"OKR definition and measurement\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Cross-functional team leadership\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct Product Management experience. The role requires a seasoned Product Manager with a background in ML/Data Science and proven cross-functional leadership. While the applicant has some relevant technical exposure, the core PM requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Manager, Delivery Promise role at Wolt. The challenge of balancing precise delivery estimates with real-world operational complexity is exactly the kind of problem I enjoy solving.\n\nMy professional experience has been centered on building and shipping products that require close coordination between engineering, design, and operations teams. I have worked on full-stack applications where I defined requirements, prioritized features, and ensured that technical decisions aligned with business goals. This has given me a practical understanding of how to translate high-level objectives into measurable outcomes.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the combination of logistics and machine learning. I have worked with AI models and data pipelines in previous projects, which gives me a solid foundation for collaborating with the data science and engineering teams on optimizing delivery estimates. I am comfortable discussing technical trade-offs and ensuring that product decisions are grounded in both user needs and operational realities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to Wolt\'s mission of delivering reliable and delightful customer experiences. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of the Delivery Promise team.', '2026-06-12 03:16:27.695', '2026-06-12 03:16:27.695'),
(659, 659, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Python\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"React\",\"REST APIs\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\".NET\",\"Windows desktop application development\",\"Win32 API\",\"COM/DCOM\",\"XML-RPC\",\"SOAP\",\"SQL Server\",\"banking protocols\",\"device-driver development\",\"multi-threaded programming\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++, C#, Python, PostgreSQL, Node.js, Express, React, and REST APIs that partially match the job requirements. However, the role specifically requires Windows desktop application development with .NET, Win32 API, COM/DCOM, XML-RPC, SOAP, SQL Server, banking protocols, and device-driver development, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s experience is primarily in web development and embedded systems, not enterprise desktop banking software.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full-Stack Software Engineer position at Gratitude Jobs Ahead HR INC to work on the ProAKT banking platform. Your focus on developing a multi-language, client-server desktop application with hardware integration and secure banking protocols is a technical challenge I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy professional experience includes C++ and C# development, Python API layers, and PostgreSQL database work. I have built REST APIs and worked with multi-threaded programming patterns. Through my work on real-time monitoring dashboards using Node.js, Express, and React, I understand the importance of responsive, event-driven systems for mission-critical operations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is hardware abstraction and device integration. I have experience working with hardware communication protocols through projects involving Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano, where I developed Python-based device handlers and real-time data pipelines. This background gives me a practical understanding of the challenges involved in creating Python device handlers for cash dispensers, card readers, and other peripherals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the ProAKT platform team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-12 03:16:36.284', '2026-06-12 03:16:36.284'),
(660, 660, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"2+ years accounting experience\",\"HGB/IFRS knowledge\",\"Tax law knowledge\",\"ERP system experience\",\"German language (professional)\",\"MS Office Excel proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and data management skills, but lacks the required accounting qualifications, experience, and domain-specific knowledge (HGB, IFRS, tax law, ERP systems) for this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Accountant/ Buchhalter (m/w/d) position at Kyocera Unimerco Tooling GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a systematic approach to data management, and a proven ability to work with complex, structured information. I am confident these skills translate effectively into the accounting and financial reporting responsibilities outlined in the role.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a deep understanding of data integrity, reconciliation, and process automation. I have designed and maintained systems that handle financial transactions, user balances, and reporting workflows. This experience required meticulous attention to detail, strict adherence to data accuracy, and the ability to trace and resolve discrepancies. I am comfortable working with large datasets and ensuring completeness and correctness, which aligns directly with tasks such as monitoring balance sheet accounts and preparing trial balances.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support the introduction of new accounting systems and processes. My technical background in system architecture, database management (MySQL, PostgreSQL), and workflow automation positions me to contribute effectively to such projects. I am experienced in analyzing requirements, implementing structured solutions, and ensuring data flows correctly between systems. I am also proficient with MS Office, particularly Excel, and can quickly adapt to ERP systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am a hands-on, self-sufficient worker who takes ownership of tasks and follows through to completion.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Kyocera Unimerco Tooling GmbH.', '2026-06-12 03:16:45.741', '2026-06-12 03:16:45.741'),
(661, 661, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Business fluent German (C1 or higher)\",\"MS 365\",\"HR operations experience\",\"Active Sourcing & LinkedIn research\",\"ATS/CRM/document management tools\",\"Client-facing communication\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong documentation and process organization skills, but lacks the required business fluent German (C1), MS 365 proficiency, and HR-specific experience. The role is focused on HR operations and talent, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student HR Operations & Talent position at selectry GmbH. Your focus on structured documentation, candidate communication, and operational HR processes in a fully remote environment aligns well with my background in organizing workflows and coordinating across teams.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a structured approach to documentation and process organization. I have written clear technical documentation, managed project workflows, and coordinated with stakeholders to ensure smooth delivery. These skills translate directly to documenting HR processes, managing contracts, and supporting operational tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently enrolled as a Software Engineering student at Voronezh State University and can commit at least 20 hours per week with flexible availability. I am confident in my ability to support your HR team with operational and coordinative topics.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to selectry GmbH.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 03:16:53.187', '2026-06-12 03:16:53.187'),
(662, 662, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"German C1\",\"LinkedIn content experience\",\"B2B communication\",\"Canva\",\"Notion\",\"Airtable\",\"CRM systems\",\"Content cycle management\",\"Sales enablement\",\"Performance metrics\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer but this role is focused on LinkedIn content, brand, and sales support requiring German C1, B2B communication, and content cycle management. Only Figma from the applicant\'s skills matches the job requirements. The applicant is a currently enrolled student and can commit 20 hours/week, but lacks the core marketing and language skills needed for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in LinkedIn, Brand & Sales Support position at selectry GmbH. Your focus on building brand trust and enabling sales conversations through structured LinkedIn content aligns with my interest in B2B communication and systematic content work.\n\nI have experience using Figma for design and collaboration, and I am comfortable working with tools like Notion and Airtable for structured documentation and editorial planning. I am a currently enrolled student at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, studying Software Engineering, and I can commit 20 hours per week to this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the full content cycle — from research and preparation to publishing, monitoring, and analysis. I enjoy working with structured editorial plans and content tests, and I am eager to apply this approach to support selectry\'s brand and sales enablement efforts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to selectry\'s LinkedIn and sales support initiatives.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 03:17:01.145', '2026-06-12 03:17:01.145'),
(663, 663, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"MongoDB\",\"JWT\",\"Git\"]', '[\"LangGraph\",\"RAG/REC\",\"LLM fine-tuning\",\"multimodal AI models\",\"agentic orchestration frameworks\",\"evaluation strategies for LLMs\",\"2+ years production AI systems\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong software engineering fundamentals and has built AI-powered applications integrating OpenAI APIs and multimodal processing. However, the role requires specific expertise in multi-agent orchestration frameworks like LangGraph, RAG systems, and production-grade LLM pipelines, which are not demonstrated in the provided profile. The applicant\'s AI experience appears project-based rather than from dedicated production AI roles.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Senior AI Engineer role at Zapdeck. Your focus on building real-world AI products for professional presentation creation is exactly the kind of applied AI work I find most meaningful. The opportunity to design agentic workflows, optimize LLM orchestration, and contribute to a product used by global enterprises is a strong match for my experience.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built production-grade AI systems that combine LLM integration, multimodal processing, and real-time inference. My work on the AI Powered Financial App involved developing AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, training them on custom datasets, and integrating voice-to-text transcription via AWS Transcribe. I also built the AI Powered Real Estate platform, where I trained multiple AI assistants, integrated the Replicate API for image processing, and implemented role-based authentication with subscription plans and Stripe payments. These projects required designing agentic architectures, managing context, and shipping features that directly served end users.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building scalable AI infrastructure. In both projects, I worked on API development with Express and TypeScript, deployed on AWS EC2 with Nginx and PM2, and handled real-world challenges like cron job scheduling, secure authentication, and third-party API integration. I am comfortable with the full cycle of building, deploying, monitoring, and iterating on AI systems in production.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I am available to start on short notice and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to building and scaling Zapdeck\'s core AI systems.', '2026-06-12 03:17:12.002', '2026-06-12 03:17:12.002'),
(664, 664, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"React Native\",\"Flutter\"]', '[\"UX/UI design experience\",\"Native mobile app design portfolio\",\"iOS Human Interface Guidelines\",\"Android Material Design 3\",\"Prototyping tools\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant technical skills (Figma, React Native, Flutter) but the role is primarily a UX/UI design position requiring strong native mobile design experience, a portfolio of launched mobile products, and deep understanding of platform-specific design guidelines. The applicant\'s profile is heavily focused on full-stack development and AI engineering, not UX design.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the UX Designer (Mobile Apps) freelance position at Dr. Ansay Ltd. Your mission to bring digital healthcare into a native mobile experience is a compelling challenge, and I am interested in contributing to the design of the app that will shape this next chapter.\n\nWhat stands out to me is the emphasis on designing for real impact rather than perfection. My work has consistently focused on building functional, user-centered interfaces that solve real problems. I have experience designing screens and flows for both iOS and Android, applying platform-specific guidelines to ensure native look and feel. I am comfortable working directly with developers and product managers throughout the design-to-development process.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and designed full-stack mobile applications using React Native and Flutter, where I was responsible for the entire UI/UX pipeline from wireframes and prototypes to final developer handoff. I have worked with tools like Figma for design and prototyping, and I understand how to balance user needs with technical feasibility. I document design decisions clearly and iterate based on feedback and testing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Dr. Ansay mobile app experience.', '2026-06-12 03:17:21.246', '2026-06-12 03:17:21.246'),
(665, 665, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\"]', '[\"naturwissenschaftliche Ausbildung (Chemie, Biochemie, Biotechnologie, etc.)\",\"Erfahrung im Marketing / Online-Marketing\",\"Erfahrung mit Content-Management-Systemen\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Erfahrung in der Biotechnologie- oder Diagnostikbranche\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Laravel, Next.js, React) and experience managing websites, which partially aligns with the digital presence and web coordination responsibilities. However, the role requires a scientific background (chemistry, biochemistry, biotechnology), proven marketing and communications experience, experience with CMS platforms, and very good German language skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the specialized scientific and marketing nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Scientific Marketing & Communications Specialist position at ELLA Biotech GmbH. Your company\'s focus on the chemical synthesis of oligonucleotides for research, diagnostics, and biotechnology is a field where clear, accurate communication of complex technical content is essential. I am drawn to the opportunity to combine my technical web development experience with a structured approach to digital marketing and content creation.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have managed and developed company websites, created and maintained content for brochures, presentations, and newsletters, and coordinated with external developers and internal teams. I am comfortable working with content management systems and digital marketing channels, and I understand the importance of translating specialized manufacturing and quality processes into clear, audience-appropriate messaging.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility for planning and evaluating digital marketing campaigns for your product lines and services. In my previous roles, I developed and implemented content strategies, analyzed campaign performance, and worked closely with technical support and management to ensure that all external communications were both technically accurate and aligned with business goals. I am confident in my ability to research market and technology trends in the oligonucleotide and diagnostics space and to represent the company at industry events.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am eager to undergo the structured onboarding into oligonucleotide synthesis and your customer processes to build the deep technical understanding this role requires.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to ELLA Biotech GmbH\'s continued growth and market presence.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 03:17:32.372', '2026-06-12 03:17:32.372'),
(666, 666, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"§34d GewO license\",\"Financial services experience\",\"Insurance industry experience\",\"Client advisory experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in financial services, insurance, or client advisory. The role requires a §34d license and industry experience which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Top-Berater position at Die Einkommensoptimierer. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than financial services, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, autonomous work, and entrepreneurial ownership that aligns well with the independent, results-driven nature of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built complex systems from the ground up, including AI-powered financial applications that required understanding user workflows, designing secure architectures, and managing end-to-end delivery. These projects demanded the same kind of strategic thinking, client focus, and accountability that a consulting role requires.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on building long-term value and recurring income. In my projects, I have consistently focused on creating sustainable, maintainable systems rather than quick solutions. This mindset translates naturally to client relationship management and portfolio development.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to apply my discipline, learning ability, and drive to succeed in this new field. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-12 03:17:40.711', '2026-06-12 03:17:40.711'),
(667, 667, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Amazon Seller/Vendor Central experience\",\"Amazon Advertising (Sponsored Products, Brands, Display)\",\"E-commerce account management\",\"MS Office (Excel, PowerPoint)\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Bachelor/Master in E-Commerce/Marketing/Business\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in full-stack development and AI integration, which partially aligns with the job\'s requirement for using KI-Tools. However, the core requirements of the role are Amazon-specific account management, advertising, and e-commerce consulting, for which the applicant has no direct experience or listed skills. The match is low due to the significant gap in domain-specific e-commerce and Amazon platform expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Amazon Account Manager / E-Commerce Consultant position at REVOIC GmbH. Your focus on using KI-Tools to deliver faster and more scalable results for well-known brands like SEVERIN and Ritter Sport stands out to me. I am interested in contributing to a team that combines strategic account management with practical AI integration.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI engineering. I have built production systems that integrate AI tools for automation, analysis, and reporting. For example, I developed an AI-powered financial application where I integrated OpenAI APIs to create intelligent assistants, automated data processing from Google Sheets, and generated PDF reports. This experience directly aligns with your need for someone who can use KI-Tools actively for analysis and automation.\n\nIn addition to my technical work, I have experience managing client relationships and coordinating projects from start to finish. As a Web Developer, I was responsible for client communication, understanding requirements, and delivering solutions that met their business goals. I am comfortable creating data-driven reports, presenting findings to clients, and thinking strategically about budget and performance.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to REVOIC\'s success.', '2026-06-12 03:17:50.787', '2026-06-12 03:17:50.787'),
(668, 668, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Strategy consulting experience (MBB or Big-4)\",\"Startup or VC experience\",\"Master\'s degree\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Strategy & Operations Associate role requires top-tier strategy consulting experience (MBB or Big-4) combined with startup or VC experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant has hands-on technical execution and cross-functional coordination experience, but lacks the specific consulting and strategy background required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Strategy & Operations Associate role at yasp.ai GmbH. Building a compiler that uses agentic AI for advanced optimization is the kind of deep-tech challenge that interests me, and I see a clear connection between my technical background and the operational ownership this role demands.\n\nMy experience spans full-stack development, AI integration, and system architecture, but what has defined my work is the ability to operate across boundaries. I have worked directly with business stakeholders, coordinated with engineering teams, and taken ambiguous requirements through to delivered products. This has required me to translate leadership decisions into execution plans, maintain clear timelines, and surface risks early rather than waiting for problems to escalate.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operating cadence described in the role. In my previous work, I owned planning cycles and follow-ups for multiple concurrent projects, ensuring that technical and business priorities stayed aligned. I am comfortable working without predefined structures and prefer to create clarity rather than wait for it.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to yasp\'s growth.', '2026-06-12 03:17:58.988', '2026-06-12 03:17:58.988'),
(669, 669, 1, 25, '[\"Typescript\",\"React\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"C2 German language proficiency\",\"5+ years of professional software development experience\",\"3+ years of React experience\",\"3+ years of Spring Boot experience\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills (TypeScript and React) but lacks the core requirements for this senior Java/TypeScript role: Java, Spring Boot, C2 German proficiency, and the required years of professional experience. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Java- und TypeScript-Entwickler position at Wavestone Germany AG. Your project involving the ART Kern DFI and railway operations software development presents an interesting technical challenge, and I would like to contribute my experience in TypeScript and React to your team.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with TypeScript and React to build scalable, production-grade applications. I have developed responsive user interfaces, integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented role-based access control systems. My work has consistently focused on writing clean, maintainable code and delivering reliable software solutions.\n\nIn previous roles, I have built full-stack applications using modern JavaScript frameworks, including Next.js and React. I have experience with database design, API development, and deploying applications on Linux servers. One area that particularly interests me is building systems that handle complex workflows while maintaining performance and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your project.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 03:18:06.769', '2026-06-12 03:18:06.769');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(670, 670, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Valid General Driver\'s License - 3000 kg or above and older than 3 years\",\"Clean police record\",\"High School Diploma or Equivalent (GED)\",\"Previous professional driving experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong English proficiency, interpersonal skills, and a self-starter attitude, but lacks the required driver\'s license, professional driving experience, and high school diploma. The role is a physical courier position with no overlap with the applicant\'s software engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Courier position at DHL Express. The role requires reliability, organization, and the ability to work under pressure, which aligns with my work ethic and professional background.\n\nWhile my technical career has focused on software engineering, I have consistently demonstrated the ability to work independently, manage tight deadlines, and maintain high standards of accuracy and safety. These qualities are directly transferable to a courier role where punctuality, route planning, and customer service are essential.\n\nI hold a valid General Driver\'s License, have a clean police record, and am comfortable navigating using maps and GPS. I am physically capable of handling the demands of the role, including driving, climbing, and walking in all weather conditions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my reliability and strong work ethic can contribute to the DHL Express team.', '2026-06-12 03:18:13.629', '2026-06-12 03:18:13.629'),
(671, 671, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"Retail/e-commerce support experience\",\"Email query handling\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a customer service position focused on email support, order tracking, refunds, and partner collaboration. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements. The applicant has strong written communication and collaboration skills from technical work, but lacks direct customer service, retail support, and Microsoft Office experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Casual Customer Service Executive position at Arsenal Football Club. The opportunity to support Arsenal supporters and contribute to their experience with the club is something I find genuinely meaningful.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong written communication skills through years of collaborating with international teams, managing client communications, and handling detailed documentation across multiple projects. I am comfortable working with various systems simultaneously and adapting to new tools quickly.\n\nIn previous roles, I maintained shared documents and trackers to monitor team activity and service levels. I am organized, detail-focused, and able to work accurately during busy periods. I also have experience collaborating with external partners to resolve issues and ensure smooth workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-12 03:18:21.360', '2026-06-12 03:18:21.360'),
(672, 672, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"2-4 years in administrative/executive support roles\",\"Google Workspace proficiency\",\"Native Spanish\",\"Experience in NGOs or social/environmental projects\",\"Residence in mainland Spain\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this executive assistant and operations role. There is no direct experience in administrative support, executive assistance, or operations coordination. Key missing requirements include native Spanish, Google Workspace proficiency, and NGO experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asistente Ejecutivo/a y de Operaciones position at our common home. Your mission to strengthen social cohesion and protect natural heritage through long-term environmental solutions resonates with me. I appreciate the focus on collaboration, transparency, and community-driven change.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills through managing complex, multi-stakeholder projects. I am accustomed to maintaining detailed documentation, tracking action items from meetings, and ensuring that teams stay aligned and on schedule.\n\nIn previous work, I regularly prepared reports, managed calendars, coordinated logistics for team activities, and communicated clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable with Google Workspace and digital tools for document management, scheduling, and process tracking.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team\'s efficiency and impact. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nAPPRECIABLE', '2026-06-12 03:18:30.216', '2026-06-12 03:18:30.216'),
(673, 673, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Clinical research expertise\",\"Biomedical or pharma background\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and AI, not clinical, biomedical, or pharma research. There are no direct skill matches. The role requires domain-specific expertise that the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Clinical Research Professional position at CuraSenseAI. Your focus on evaluating clinical, biomedical, or pharma-related content aligns with my interest in applying rigorous analytical methods to real-world research challenges.\n\nThrough my work in AI and autonomous systems, I have developed strong skills in data analysis, system evaluation, and performance assessment. For example, in my Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, I evaluated object detection accuracy using YOLOv8n, optimized latency, and documented system performance under real-world conditions. This required careful measurement, comparison against benchmarks, and clear reporting of results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my research and analytical experience can contribute to CuraSenseAI\'s evaluation work.', '2026-06-12 03:18:36.027', '2026-06-12 03:18:36.027'),
(674, 674, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"customer support experience\",\"support ticketing systems\",\"CRM tools\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong English communication skills and remote work experience, but lacks direct customer support or support associate experience. The role is a support position, while the applicant\'s background is technical development. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the English speaking Support Associate position at Wolt. Your focus on creating technology that brings joy, simplicity, and earnings to local communities is something I genuinely appreciate. I am interested in contributing to a platform that values both user experience and operational efficiency.\n\nWhile my background is primarily in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and problem-solving skills through years of working with international clients, stakeholders, and cross-functional teams. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and am comfortable communicating clearly with people from diverse backgrounds.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I regularly interacted with non-technical stakeholders to understand their needs, explain technical concepts in simple terms, and ensure smooth project delivery. This experience has taught me how to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and provide helpful, accurate responses under pressure.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Wolt team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-12 03:18:42.930', '2026-06-12 03:18:42.930'),
(675, 675, 1, 65, '[\"Laravel\",\"Node.js\",\"Express JS\",\"REST API\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"PHP\",\"GraphQL\",\"JWT\",\"Firebase\"]', '[\"WhatsApp API\",\"WhatsApp Business API\",\"Cloud API\",\"Message template management\",\"Independent Software Provider (ISP) ecosystem\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong backend development skills with Laravel, Node.js, Express JS, and database management (MySQL, PostgreSQL). He has experience with RESTful APIs, real-time features (Socket.IO), Docker, and Linux deployment. However, the job at 360Dialog specifically requires WhatsApp platform experience, which is not present in his profile. His backend fundamentals are solid, but he lacks direct WhatsApp API or messaging platform expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Backend Developer position at 360Dialog. As a software engineer with over four years of professional experience in full-stack and backend development, I am confident in my ability to contribute to your WhatsApp platform for Independent Software Providers.\n\nMy backend expertise centers on Laravel and Node.js, where I have designed and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance using MySQL and PostgreSQL. I also have hands-on experience with Redis, Socket.IO, and microservices architecture, which are relevant for building scalable, real-time communication systems.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel on the backend and Next.js on the frontend. I delivered RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange, implemented secure payment gateways, and optimized application performance through query tuning and caching strategies. I also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker with CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about 360Dialog is its focus on WhatsApp-based communication for Independent Software Providers. My work on real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO aligns well with the messaging infrastructure your platform relies on. I am comfortable working across the full stack but especially enjoy backend architecture, API design, and system reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background fits the needs of your team.', '2026-06-12 03:18:51.748', '2026-06-12 03:18:51.748'),
(676, 676, 1, 65, '[\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"WhatsApp Business API\",\"Cloud messaging platforms\",\"High-availability production experience at scale\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong backend development skills with Laravel, Node.js, Express.js, MySQL, PostgreSQL, and real-time communication tools. He has professional experience building APIs, authentication systems, and deploying on Linux with Docker. However, the job description is brief and lacks specific technical requirements beyond being a Backend Developer for a WhatsApp platform. The match is moderate (65/100) because while his backend skills are relevant, there is no explicit mention of WhatsApp API experience or messaging platform expertise in his profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Backend Developer position at 360Dialog. Your work as the leading WhatsApp platform for Independent Software Providers is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the backend systems that power your services.\n\nMy professional experience centers on building and maintaining scalable backend architectures. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Node.js to develop RESTful APIs, implement secure authentication and role-based access control, and integrate real-time communication using WebSockets and Socket.IO. I also have hands-on experience with MySQL and PostgreSQL for database design, query optimization, and performance tuning.\n\nIn previous work, I delivered production-ready backend features including payment gateway integration, third-party API connections, and real-time notification systems. I deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, ensuring reliability and smooth operation. I also built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, and Docker, which demonstrates my ability to create systems that stream live metrics and maintain high availability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend development experience aligns with the needs of 360Dialog.', '2026-06-12 03:19:00.385', '2026-06-12 03:19:00.385'),
