(684, 684, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[]', 'This is an open application (CANDIDATURA SPONTANEA) with no specific technical requirements listed. The candidate has a strong and broad technical profile spanning full-stack web development, AI, DevOps, and mobile development. The score reflects a general fit for a software engineering role, but cannot be higher without specific job requirements to match against.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Irion. Your focus on data management innovation for large enterprises and the emphasis on continuous growth, flexibility, and a supportive work environment align well with what I value in a professional setting.\n\nI am a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with over four years of professional experience building and deploying web applications. My technical foundation includes Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, TypeScript, and modern frontend frameworks. I have worked extensively with RESTful APIs, MySQL, PostgreSQL, and real-time communication using WebSockets and Socket.IO.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel for backend logic and Next.js for responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces. I implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways. I also optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx.\n\nOne project I am particularly proud of is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem built with Laravel and Flutter. It involved role-based access control, real-time notifications via Firebase, and integration with Google Maps API and Redis. The system coordinated customers, sellers, and delivery agents within a unified infrastructure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Irion\'s mission.', '2026-06-12 03:19:58.980', '2026-06-12 03:19:58.980'),
