(688, 688, 1, 15, '[\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Supply chain experience\",\"ERP system experience (NetSuite, SAP, Odoo)\",\"Manufacturer coordination\",\"Logistics coordination\",\"Inventory management\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in DevOps, cloud platforms, and automation tools, which are mentioned as nice-to-haves in the job description. However, the core requirements of the role—4+ years of supply chain/logistics experience, ERP systems, manufacturer coordination, and inventory management—are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supply & Logistics Coordinator role at Nabu Casa. Your mission to build a sustainable, community-funded smart home platform that prioritizes privacy and choice is something I genuinely respect. The opportunity to own the end-to-end hardware supply chain for Home Assistant, a project used by millions, is compelling.\n\nMy technical background includes working with AI-assisted workflows and automation tools, which directly supports your goal of using modern technology to improve supply chain efficiency. I have experience deploying and maintaining systems on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable working with cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud. This technical fluency allows me to analyze forecast data, manage inventory systems, and build the structured, repeatable processes this role requires.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have taken full ownership of projects from planning through deployment. I coordinated with stakeholders, documented workflows as standard operating procedures, and ensured smooth delivery across multiple environments. I am used to working independently in remote settings and driving issues to resolution without needing daily oversight.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my skills can support Nabu Casa\'s growing hardware operations.', '2026-06-12 03:20:34.490', '2026-06-12 03:20:34.490'),
(689, 689, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"AI tools and automation workflows\"]', '[\"Supply chain experience\",\"ERP system experience (NetSuite, SAP, Odoo)\",\"Manufacturer coordination\",\"Inventory management\",\"Logistics coordination\",\"Purchase order management\",\"RMA process experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks the core supply chain, logistics, and ERP experience required for this role. Some transferable skills in AI/automation, process documentation, and cross-functional collaboration exist, but the match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supply & Logistics Coordinator role at Nabu Casa. Your mission to build a sustainable, community-funded open-source smart home platform is genuinely compelling. The opportunity to own the end-to-end hardware supply chain for a product used by millions of households is exactly the kind of operational challenge I want to take on.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and process-oriented skills that are directly applicable to supply chain coordination. I have experience using AI tools and automation to streamline workflows, which aligns with your emphasis on using modern tools to improve operational efficiency. I am comfortable working with data to make informed decisions and have a track record of documenting processes and creating repeatable workflows.\n\nIn my previous roles, I managed end-to-end project delivery, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, and took ownership of complex systems. I am used to working independently with minimal structure and driving issues to resolution. I have experience working with international teams and communicating across cultural boundaries, which would support coordination with manufacturers and distributors globally.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Nabu Casa\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-12 03:20:43.100', '2026-06-12 03:20:43.100');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(690, 690, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Supply chain management\",\"Logistics coordination\",\"Inventory management\",\"ERP systems (NetSuite, SAP, Odoo)\",\"Purchase order management\",\"Manufacturer coordination\",\"International shipping\",\"RMA process\",\"Forecast analysis\",\"SOP documentation\",\"Distributor support\",\"Hardware operations\",\"Consumer electronics\"]', 'The applicant is a skilled software engineer with strong analytical and process-building abilities. However, the role requires 4+ years of direct supply chain, logistics, and purchasing experience, including manufacturer coordination, ERP system use, and inventory management. The applicant\'s profile does not contain any of these core requirements. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supply & Logistics Coordinator position at Nabu Casa. Your mission to build a sustainable, community-funded open-source smart home platform is something I genuinely respect, and I am drawn to the autonomy and ownership this role offers.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent years designing, building, and maintaining complex systems. This experience has given me a strong analytical mindset, the ability to break down problems into manageable parts, and a disciplined approach to documentation and process improvement. I am comfortable working with data to make informed decisions and have a track record of creating standard operating procedures for the systems I build.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I coordinated with stakeholders, managed project timelines, and ensured smooth delivery across multiple teams. I am used to taking full ownership of my work, identifying bottlenecks, and driving issues to resolution without needing constant oversight. I am also familiar with AI tools and automation workflows, which I have integrated into my projects to improve efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can bring structure, reliability, and a problem-solving mindset to your supply chain operations. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to Nabu Casa\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-12 03:20:53.035', '2026-06-12 03:20:53.035'),
(691, 691, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Supply chain coordination\",\"Logistics management\",\"Manufacturer coordination\",\"ERP systems (NetSuite, SAP, Odoo)\",\"Inventory management\",\"International shipping\",\"RMA process management\",\"Purchase order management\",\"Distributor support\",\"SOP documentation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct supply chain, logistics, or operations experience. The role requires 4+ years of hands-on supply chain coordination, manufacturer management, ERP system use, and international logistics. While the applicant has strong analytical skills, AI familiarity, and remote work experience, the core supply chain competencies required for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supply & Logistics Coordinator position at Nabu Casa. Your work behind Home Assistant, the world\'s largest open-source smart home platform, is genuinely impressive. The mission to keep privacy, choice, and sustainability at the core while serving over two million households is something I find meaningful.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but I bring a strong analytical mindset, experience with AI-assisted workflows, and a practical understanding of automation that aligns with how Nabu Casa approaches operational efficiency. I have worked extensively with data analysis, reporting, and process documentation in my development work, which maps well to the analytical and structural aspects of this role.\n\nIn previous work, I have been responsible for end-to-end delivery of complex systems, which required coordinating with multiple stakeholders, managing timelines, and resolving issues independently. I am comfortable taking ownership of a function, identifying bottlenecks, and creating repeatable processes that scale. The idea of building SOPs and improving workflows from the ground up is something I have done before and genuinely enjoy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-12 03:21:02.338', '2026-06-12 03:21:02.338'),
(692, 692, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Supply chain management\",\"Logistics coordination\",\"ERP systems (NetSuite, SAP, Odoo)\",\"Manufacturer coordination\",\"Inventory management\",\"Purchase order management\",\"International shipping and logistics\",\"RMA process management\",\"SOP creation\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) with no direct experience in supply chain, logistics, purchasing, or operations. While the applicant has strong analytical and problem-solving skills, the core requirements of the role (4+ years in supply chain, manufacturer coordination, ERP systems, inventory management, international logistics) are not met. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supply & Logistics Coordinator role at Nabu Casa. The mission behind Home Assistant and the Open Home Foundation is genuinely inspiring, and I appreciate how your organization prioritizes privacy, choice, and sustainability in the smart home space.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving skills. I have experience working with data, building automated workflows, and using modern tools to improve efficiency. I am comfortable analyzing forecast data and using reporting to support decision-making, which directly connects to the analytical mindset this role requires.\n\nOne area where I can contribute is in bringing structure and documentation to processes. In my previous work, I have created clear documentation and standard operating procedures for technical systems. I am confident I can apply the same approach to supply chain workflows, helping to build repeatable processes as Nabu Casa scales.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to take ownership of the end-to-end hardware flow and contribute to Nabu Casa\'s continued growth. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support your team.', '2026-06-12 03:21:11.308', '2026-06-12 03:21:11.308'),
(693, 693, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Supply chain management\",\"Logistics coordination\",\"Manufacturer coordination\",\"Inventory management\",\"ERP systems (NetSuite, SAP, Odoo)\",\"International shipping\",\"RMA processes\",\"SOP creation\",\"4+ years supply chain experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct supply chain, logistics, or operations experience. The role requires 4+ years of hands-on supply chain coordination, manufacturer management, ERP system use, and international logistics. The applicant\'s skills in AI tools and automation workflows are a minor positive, but the core requirements of the role are not met by the candidate\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supply & Logistics Coordinator role at Nabu Casa. Your work behind Home Assistant, the world\'s largest open-source smart home platform, is genuinely impressive. The mission to build sustainable, privacy-focused technology that serves millions of real homes is something I find meaningful.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving skills that are directly applicable to this role. I am comfortable working with data to make informed decisions, and I have experience using AI tools and automation to improve workflows and efficiency.\n\nIn previous work, I have taken ownership of complex systems end-to-end, documented processes, and built repeatable workflows. I am used to operating with autonomy and taking initiative to resolve issues. I enjoy bringing structure to operations and continuously finding ways to improve how things work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nWONDEROUSLY', '2026-06-12 03:21:19.158', '2026-06-12 03:21:19.158'),
(694, 694, 1, 15, '[\"CSS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"HubSpot (Marketing Hub and Sales Hub)\",\"CRM and marketing automation project implementation\",\"Direct client consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Zapier or similar automation tools\",\"Klaviyo experience\",\"Agency experience managing multiple accounts\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in full-stack web development and AI engineering, with no direct experience in HubSpot, CRM consulting, marketing automation, or client-facing agency roles. The job requires deep HubSpot expertise, German language skills, and agency experience, which are not present in the candidate\'s background. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior CRM Consultant HubSpot role at ADLOCA GmbH. Your approach to data-driven performance marketing and long-term client partnerships aligns with how I prefer to work: focused on measurable outcomes and clear communication.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack engineer, I have built and automated complex systems that connect multiple platforms, manage user roles, and process data in real time. I have integrated third-party services, set up authentication workflows, and designed reporting pipelines. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to structure CRM logic, automate lead nurturing, and ensure clean handoffs between marketing and sales systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is using AI tools to improve efficiency in marketing workflows. I have worked with AI APIs and automation in previous projects, and I see clear applications for workflow drafting, segmentation, and reporting in a CRM context. I am comfortable taking ownership of client accounts, translating business goals into system configurations, and presenting results directly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system automation, client-facing delivery, and AI integration can contribute to ADLOCA\'s team. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-12 13:40:03.073', '2026-06-12 13:40:03.073'),
(695, 695, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Wirtschaftswissenschaften or comparable degree\",\"3-5 years experience in interest rate and liquidity risk management\",\"Risk-bearing capacity calculation (Risikotragfähigkeitsrechnung)\",\"IRRBB strategy\",\"VR-Control, Ziabris, or okular ZIRIS\",\"Funds Transfer Pricing\",\"Scenario simulation and impact analysis\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and full-stack development, with no direct experience or education in banking, finance, risk management, or the specific tools (VR-Control, Ziabris, okular ZIRIS) required for this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Gesamtbanksteuerungsspezialist (m/w/d) für Marktpreis- und Liquiditätsrisiko position at Polarstern Experts. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, structured thinking, and experience building complex, data-driven systems that align with the analytical depth this role requires.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and optimized application performance through Eloquent query tuning, caching strategies, and database indexing. These responsibilities required careful analysis, modeling, and a structured approach to problem-solving.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the modeling and analysis of complex systems. In my projects, I have worked extensively with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, designing schemas, writing optimized queries, and ensuring data integrity. This experience has strengthened my ability to work with structured data, perform impact analysis, and build reliable systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-12 13:40:10.104', '2026-06-12 13:40:10.104'),
(696, 696, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Operations Management\",\"General Management\",\"product / market launches\",\"leading people\",\"German C2\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and project execution skills but lacks the 3+ years of operations management, general management, and product launch experience required. German C2 proficiency is also missing. The role is non-technical and focused on launching and running train operations, which does not align with the applicant\'s software engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Strategy & Operations Manager (f/m/d) position at Nox Mobility. Your mission to replace short-haul flights with premium overnight trains is a bold, practical solution to a real environmental and travel problem. I want to help bring that vision to life.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but my work has always been about more than writing code. I have consistently taken ownership of end-to-end product delivery, managed complex projects with multiple stakeholders, and made data-informed decisions to meet commercial and operational goals. I am comfortable building from scratch, prioritising ruthlessly, and adapting quickly to new challenges.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have led the development and launch of full-stack platforms, coordinated with external partners, and delivered measurable results. I have used AI tools and data analysis to inform strategic decisions, and I have built systems that scale. I am used to taking responsibility from day one and shaping outcomes with my own hands.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my execution-focused mindset, strategic thinking, and hands-on approach to Nox. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to launching and running your first line.', '2026-06-12 13:40:18.839', '2026-06-12 13:40:18.839'),
(697, 697, 1, 55, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Python\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Windows administration\",\"Networking (explicitly listed)\",\"Virtualization (explicitly listed)\",\"Business Intelligence (BI) tools\",\"German language (fluent required)\"]', 'Shahanur has solid Linux, Docker, cloud (AWS, Google Cloud), and CI/CD experience, plus AI project work. However, the role requires Windows admin skills, explicit networking/virtualization knowledge, BI tools, and fluent German, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Systemadministrator Infrastruktur & KI Consultant role at Intercon Solutions GmbH. The combination of infrastructure administration, automation, and AI consulting described in the position aligns directly with my technical background and professional interests.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with Linux environments, Docker containerization, and cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud. I have deployed and maintained production systems using Nginx and Apache, set up CI/CD pipelines for automated deployments, and managed server monitoring with tools like Prometheus and Grafana. These skills directly support the administration and development of modern IT infrastructures mentioned in the role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI solutions into existing infrastructure. I have built AI-powered applications using OpenAI APIs and Replicate, developed real-time object detection systems with YOLOv8n running on edge devices, and implemented automation workflows that reduce manual operational overhead. I am comfortable analyzing existing system landscapes and developing future-ready concepts that combine infrastructure reliability with intelligent automation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in infrastructure, automation, and AI can contribute to Intercon Solutions GmbH.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 13:40:26.193', '2026-06-12 13:40:26.193'),
(698, 698, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Performance marketing\",\"Paid campaigns (Google, Meta, YouTube)\",\"Marketing analytics\",\"German language (C2)\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack software engineer with no direct marketing experience. The role requires 4+ years of performance marketing expertise, paid campaign management, and native-level German. The applicant\'s analytical and technical skills are transferable but do not match the core marketing requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Performance Marketing Manager - Freelancer role at FinMent GmbH. Your mission to democratize access to institutional investment strategies through technology is compelling, and I am interested in contributing to a fast-growing FinTech startup.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and process-oriented skills. I have experience building and monitoring complex systems, analyzing performance data, and optimizing workflows. These skills translate directly to data-driven marketing funnel analysis and KPI reporting.\n\nIn previous work, I took ownership of technical deliverables, collaborated across teams, and consistently focused on measurable outcomes. I am comfortable working in a startup environment where responsibility extends beyond a defined role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical background can support FinMent\'s growth.', '2026-06-12 13:40:32.736', '2026-06-12 13:40:32.736'),
(699, 699, 1, 35, '[\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"PHP\"]', '[\"TOGAF\",\"IT-Governance\",\"Öffentliche IT-Strukturen\",\"IT-Architekturframeworks\",\"IT-Beratungserfahrung im öffentlichen Umfeld\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development, cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), and DevOps tools (Docker, CI/CD), which partially match the job\'s requirements for modern cloud technologies and IT architecture. However, the role specifically requires experience with architecture frameworks like TOGAF, IT governance, and public-sector IT structures, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate, with the applicant\'s hands-on development and system design experience being relevant but lacking the strategic consulting and governance focus.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Architekt / IT Berater (m/w/d) Digitale Transformation position at Intercon Solutions GmbH. The combination of strategic IT architecture, digital transformation, and public-sector projects described in the role aligns well with my experience in designing and modernizing complex IT systems.\n\nThrough my professional work as a Web Developer, I have developed and evolved modern IT architectures using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have analyzed existing IT landscapes, identified areas for improvement, and implemented scalable solutions that integrate infrastructure, applications, and interfaces. My experience includes performing architecture reviews and evaluating technical approaches to ensure alignment with strategic goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of security and data protection requirements into modern IT solutions. In my projects, I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways. I have also worked with cloud technologies including AWS and Google Cloud, and used Docker and CI/CD pipelines to streamline deployment and maintain system reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your digital transformation projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 13:40:40.599', '2026-06-12 13:40:40.599'),
(700, 700, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Recruiting/Headhunting experience\",\"MS-Office\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not directly match the headhunting/recruiting role. However, the applicant demonstrates strong self-organization, remote work experience, communication skills, and a quick-learning ability that could be transferable. The main gaps are the lack of recruiting experience, fluent German, and MS-Office skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the self-employed partner opportunity at Beutler Saghari & Partner GmbH. Your approach of proactively identifying and approaching candidates directly in the market is a strategy I find both effective and aligned with my own work style. I am drawn to the idea of building a client and candidate network from the ground up with the support of an established organization.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong self-organization, structured workflows, and goal-oriented discipline through years of managing complex technical projects independently. I am comfortable working from home, managing my own schedule, and communicating clearly with stakeholders across different cultures and time zones.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a quick learner with a problem-solving mindset. I am confident I can apply the training and certification you provide to build a successful practice in headhunting and recruiting. I am ready to start with a real search project and grow step by step.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute as a partner in your team.', '2026-06-12 13:40:47.957', '2026-06-12 13:40:47.957'),
(701, 701, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Betriebswirtschaftliches Studium (Controlling/Finanzen)\",\"GuV-Rechnung und Bilanzierung\",\"Produktionscontrolling\",\"ERP-Systeme\",\"MS Excel\",\"BI-/Reporting-Tools\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in controlling, finance, or production processes. There is no match between the applicant\'s skills and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Controller (m/w/d) position at pritidenta GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a structured approach to data, and experience building systems that track, report, and optimize key metrics.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I designed and developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracked availability, latency, and performance of multiple systems simultaneously. This required defining KPIs, setting up data pipelines, creating visual reports, and continuously refining the system based on operational needs. I worked closely with cross-functional teams to ensure the metrics were accurate and actionable.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to build and maintain a KPI-driven steering system for management and departments. My experience with databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL), reporting tools, and process optimization aligns well with the responsibilities of this role. I am comfortable working with data, identifying trends, and presenting findings clearly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and structured approach can contribute to pritidenta GmbH.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-12 13:40:54.528', '2026-06-12 13:40:54.528'),
(702, 702, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"BWL/VWL/Wirtschaftswissenschaften degree\",\"MS Office (Excel, Word)\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Finance/accounting knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and data handling skills, but the role requires a business/finance degree, MS Office proficiency, German fluency, and finance/accounting knowledge. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Referent:in Finanzen & Geschäftsleitung position at PAPA OSCAR Ventures. Your work as a VC/Accelerator supporting D2C and lifestyle brands is interesting, and I appreciate the opportunity to work directly with the management team on both operational and strategic projects.\n\nAlthough my formal background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and organizational skills through building complex, data-driven systems. I enjoy working with numbers, analyzing data, and preparing clear reports that support informed decision-making. My experience includes designing dashboards, monitoring system metrics, and generating structured analyses for stakeholders.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I regularly supported management with operational tasks, prepared presentations and decision documents, and conducted market research to guide project direction. I am comfortable taking initiative, working independently, and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical team members.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to financial analysis, business case development, and investment evaluation. I have a strong foundation in data analysis and reporting, and I am eager to apply my structured thinking to support PAPA OSCAR\'s portfolio companies and M&A initiatives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-12 13:41:02.108', '2026-06-12 13:41:02.108'),
(703, 703, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Project management experience\",\"Marketing operations experience\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Budget management\",\"Jira/Airtable experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (Full-Stack & AI Engineer) with no direct marketing, operations, or project management experience listed. While the applicant has coordinated projects in a development context, the role requires 2+ years of dedicated project management experience in marketing or agency environments, which is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Operations & Project Manager position at CKM Group. Your work in eHealth and telemedicine, particularly the focus on accessible, technology-driven healthcare solutions, stands out to me. I am drawn to the challenge of coordinating complex marketing initiatives that directly impact patient access and quality of life.\n\nWhile my technical background is in software engineering, my day-to-day work has always been rooted in project management. Over the past four years, I have planned, prioritized, and tracked multiple web development projects simultaneously, coordinating timelines and resources across internal teams and external partners. This experience has given me a structured approach to project coordination and a strong sense of ownership over delivery.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem, where I managed the full project lifecycle from requirement gathering with stakeholders to deployment. This involved coordinating between frontend and backend developers, aligning priorities, managing timelines, and ensuring smooth communication across all parties. I also handled reporting and data preparation for leadership, similar to the reporting and organizational management responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my organizational skills, hands-on project coordination experience, and ability to manage multiple priorities would allow me to support your marketing team effectively. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to CKM Group.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-12 13:41:09.571', '2026-06-12 13:41:09.571'),
(704, 704, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Figma\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Suite (After Effects, Premiere Pro)\",\"Motion Design\",\"Video Editing\",\"Performance Marketing Experience\",\"Creative Production Experience\",\"Stakeholder Management\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational skills in HTML, CSS, Figma, and front-end frameworks (Next.js, React, Tailwind) that are listed as plus points in the job description. However, the core requirements for this role—extensive experience in creative production, performance marketing, motion design, video editing, and proficiency with Adobe Creative Suite—are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Performance Creative Producer role at CKM Group. Your work in eHealth and telemedicine, particularly the focus on making healthcare more accessible through modern digital solutions, is an area I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy professional experience is grounded in full-stack web development, but my approach has always been design-conscious. I have built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS, and I regularly use Figma to prototype and refine user experiences before writing code. I understand how visual design, layout, and interaction patterns directly impact user engagement and conversion.\n\nOne area where I bring a practical edge is in integrating AI into creative workflows. In recent projects, I have worked with OpenAI and Replicate APIs to build intelligent assistants and automated image processing features. I am comfortable using modern AI tools to speed up production, generate assets, and iterate quickly, which aligns directly with your focus on KI-gestützte Workflows and efficient creative production.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in creative development and AI-driven workflows can contribute to CKM Group\'s growth initiatives.', '2026-06-12 13:41:17.283', '2026-06-12 13:41:17.283'),
(705, 705, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"ERP system knowledge (e.g. NTS Apollo)\",\"Team leadership experience\",\"German language (C1)\",\"Technical understanding of metal construction / sheet metal technology\",\"Ability to read technical drawings\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this sales and team leadership role in sheet metal technology. The job requires sales experience, ERP system knowledge, team leadership, German language proficiency (C1), and technical understanding of metal construction. The applicant has none of these skills or experience. The score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Vertriebsleiter/ Teamleiter Vertrieb und Arbeitsvorbereitung position at FBT Feinblechtechnik GmbH, part of the VEAXO Unternehmensgruppe. The combination of technical understanding, customer development, and team leadership in a hands-on industrial environment is exactly the kind of responsibility I am looking for.\n\nWhat stands out to me about FBT is the focus on combining technical precision with business growth. The role requires someone who can read technical drawings, assess feasibility, and translate that into profitable offers and efficient workflows. My background in software engineering has given me a strong analytical mindset and the ability to understand complex technical systems quickly.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked on full project cycles from requirement analysis to delivery. I have coordinated with cross-functional teams, optimized internal processes, and taken ownership of results. I am comfortable with ERP-like systems, data-driven decision making, and ensuring that operations run smoothly and profitably.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured approach, technical aptitude, and willingness to take responsibility would allow me to contribute meaningfully to FBT\'s growth. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 13:41:25.148', '2026-06-12 13:41:25.148'),
(706, 706, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"HR experience\",\"Recruiting experience\",\"Active Sourcing experience\",\"German language (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"MS Office\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong organizational and digital tool skills, but lacks the required HR, recruiting, Active Sourcing experience, and German language proficiency explicitly requested in the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in im Recruiting position at enVoice. Your focus on practical HR experience and the opportunity to contribute to real recruiting processes in a growing company caught my attention. I am a Software Engineering student with a structured working style and a strong sense of ownership.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I bring the organizational discipline, attention to detail, and digital tool proficiency that this role requires. I am comfortable managing documents, organizing information, and communicating clearly with candidates and team members. I understand the importance of discretion when handling confidential application materials.\n\nIn my previous professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked remotely, coordinated with stakeholders, and maintained organized documentation for projects and workflows. I am used to taking ownership of tasks, meeting deadlines, and supporting team operations in a structured way.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and structured approach can support enVoice\'s HR and recruiting team.', '2026-06-12 13:41:31.706', '2026-06-12 13:41:31.706'),
(707, 707, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Procurement experience\",\"Supply chain management\",\"Team leadership experience\",\"ERP systems\",\"Negotiation skills\",\"German language\",\"Technical purchasing\",\"6+ years in plant engineering\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) and does not match the core requirements of this technical procurement and team lead role. There is no overlap in skills, experience, or domain knowledge with procurement, supply chain, plant engineering, or team leadership. The score is very low due to the fundamentally different career field.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technischer Einkäufer mit Teamleiterfunktion position at connect people & company GmbH, supporting KITZMANN GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical thinking, structured process management, and cross-functional collaboration skills that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with stakeholders across departments to gather requirements, prepare documentation, and ensure alignment between technical teams and business goals. This has given me a practical understanding of how to manage procurement-related workflows, evaluate technical specifications, and coordinate with multiple parties to meet project needs.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process optimization. In my previous roles, I have actively contributed to improving workflows, identifying inefficiencies, and implementing structured solutions. I am comfortable working with data, analyzing market information, and supporting decision-making through clear documentation and reporting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured approach, technical understanding, and ability to work collaboratively would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support KITZMANN GmbH in this role.', '2026-06-12 13:41:39.034', '2026-06-12 13:41:39.034'),
(708, 708, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"CRM system experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"MS Office proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills but lacks direct sales, CRM, and German language experience required for this sales-focused Werkstudent role. The match is low due to the role being primarily sales-oriented rather than technical.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in im Vertrieb position at enVoice. Your focus on digitalization, cybersecurity, and innovation aligns with my background in software engineering and secure systems. I am particularly interested in contributing to your sales operations while gaining practical experience in a growing company.\n\nAs a Software Engineering student at Voronezh State University, I bring strong analytical and organizational skills to this role. My technical background has given me a structured, detail-oriented approach to handling data, maintaining quality standards, and optimizing processes. I am comfortable working independently and taking ownership of tasks.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong communication skills through regular client interaction, requirement gathering, and documentation. I am confident in my ability to manage customer information accurately in CRM systems, verify appointment quality, and support your sales team with administrative tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to enVoice\'s sales operations.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 13:41:46.176', '2026-06-12 13:41:46.176');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(709, 709, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"AWS\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Online Marketing\",\"Performance-Marketing\",\"Growth Marketing\",\"Kampagnenoptimierung\",\"Conversion Rate Optimization\",\"SEO\",\"Social Media Marketing\",\"Google Ads\",\"Facebook Ads\",\"Marketing Analytics\",\"CRM\",\"Deutsch (C2)\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and AI, but the role is focused on online marketing, performance marketing, and growth marketing. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s technical engineering background and the marketing-specific requirements of the role. The applicant\'s experience with building landing pages and AI-powered applications could be relevant to the \'interdisciplinary collaboration\' aspect, but core marketing skills are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Online Marketing position at FinMent GmbH. Your mission to democratize access to institutional investment strategies through innovative technology is something I find genuinely compelling, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a fast-growing FinTech startup in Berlin.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, created responsive, SEO-friendly user interfaces with Tailwind CSS, and integrated third-party services including payment gateways and cloud storage. I have also worked on AI-powered applications, such as an AI-powered financial app that used OpenAI and AWS services for intelligent assistance and automation. This technical foundation allows me to contribute effectively to the development of digital campaigns, landing pages, and technology-driven marketing initiatives.\n\nThe role\'s emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration and using modern technology to create high-quality content matches my working style. I have experience working closely with cross-functional teams, managing my own areas of responsibility, and taking ownership of projects from concept to deployment. I am comfortable in startup environments where short decision-making paths and direct impact are part of daily work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to FinMent\'s continued growth and success.', '2026-06-12 13:41:54.194', '2026-06-12 13:41:54.194'),
(710, 710, 1, 75, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Next JS\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"German language (B2 level not confirmed)\",\"Scrum/Agile experience not explicitly mentioned\"]', 'Strong match for a dual study software development role. The applicant has hands-on experience with the required tech stack (JavaScript, React, Node.js, HTML, CSS) and has built full-stack applications including an AI-powered financial platform. The profile shows a solid foundation in web development, API building, and modern tools. The main gap is German language proficiency, which is required at B2 level, and explicit Scrum experience is not detailed in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Duales Studium - Softwareentwicklung position at FinMent GmbH. Your mission to democratize access to institutional investment strategies through technology resonates with my own interest in building practical, user-focused financial systems.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built full-stack web applications using JavaScript, React.js, Node.js, HTML5, and CSS — the core technologies you mentioned. I have experience working across the entire development cycle, from architecture design to deployment, which aligns with your full-stack development responsibilities.\n\nOne project that directly relates to your work is an AI-powered financial application I developed. I built the backend API using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI, integrated AWS services for authentication and file processing, and implemented AI assistants trained on custom datasets. This experience connects to your focus on feature engineering and using modern AI tools to write smarter code.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to FinMent\'s product development team.', '2026-06-12 13:42:01.428', '2026-06-12 13:42:01.428'),
(711, 711, 1, 85, '[\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"Node.js\",\"HTML5\",\"CSS\",\"Next.js\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"REST API\"]', '[\"WordPress\"]', 'Strong match for the Junior Webentwickler role. The applicant has professional experience with the core tech stack (JavaScript, React, Node.js, HTML5, CSS) and has built full-stack applications including a finance-related project. Missing WordPress experience, but the role does not emphasize it heavily.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Webentwickler (m/w/d) - Node / React position at FinMent GmbH. Your mission to democratize access to institutional investment strategies through innovative technology is something I find genuinely compelling, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your FinTech platform.\n\nMy technical background is built around the same technologies you are using. I have professional experience developing full-stack applications with JavaScript, React, Node.js, HTML5, and CSS. I prioritize clean code, component reusability, and responsive design in every project I work on.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer, I was involved in the full development lifecycle of web applications. I built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and created responsive, SEO-friendly user interfaces with Next.js and Tailwind CSS. I also worked with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx.\n\nOne project that closely aligns with this role is Smart Finance, a full-stack personal finance management platform I built using Next.js and Node.js. It features real-time updates, secure authentication, and a modular architecture designed for maintainability and performance. This experience has prepared me well to contribute to building innovative investment systems for private investors.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to FinMent\'s mission.', '2026-06-12 13:42:08.808', '2026-06-12 13:42:08.808'),
(712, 712, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Team leadership experience in customer service\",\"Coaching and feedback skills\",\"KPI and performance management\",\"Customer service experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no customer service or team leadership experience. The job requires 2+ years as a team leader in customer service, coaching, KPI management, and strong communication skills. The applicant\'s profile does not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Teamleiter (m/w/d) im Kundenservice position at hey contact heroes GmbH. Your focus on team leadership, quality standards, and cross-functional collaboration in a remote-first environment aligns with my experience in managing technical workflows and stakeholder communication.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have led development teams, coordinated with project managers and clients, and ensured that deliverables met quality and performance benchmarks. I have conducted code reviews, mentored junior developers, and facilitated team meetings to align on goals and improve processes. This has given me practical experience in motivating teams and driving continuous improvement.\n\nI am experienced in tracking KPIs, generating reports, and optimizing workflows to maintain service and performance standards. My background in building scalable systems has taught me the importance of structured, reliable processes and clear communication across departments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in the Hamburg area and available for the 3-week on-site onboarding. I look forward to contributing to your team and helping deliver excellent customer service. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-12 13:42:15.021', '2026-06-12 13:42:15.021'),
(713, 713, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Finance or Asset Management degree\",\"Capital market experience\",\"Stock/options/futures trading experience\",\"Client advisory experience\",\"German language (negotiation level)\",\"Office applications proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) with no direct finance, capital markets, or investment analysis experience. The role requires a finance background, stock/options/futures trading knowledge, client advisory skills, and fluent German. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Investment Analyst position at DeltaValue GmbH. Your focus on capital markets education and client support aligns with my interest in combining analytical rigor with clear communication.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and data-driven system design. Through professional experience and project work, I have developed strong skills in data analysis, process automation, and precise reporting. I am comfortable working with structured data, following established workflows, and maintaining accuracy under deadlines.\n\nIn previous work, I built full-stack applications that required careful data handling, API integration, and real-time monitoring. These projects taught me to break down complex problems, document processes clearly, and deliver reliable results. I enjoy working systematically and continuously improving my knowledge.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently based in Russia and looking to relocate to Essen. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-12 13:42:21.994', '2026-06-12 13:42:21.994'),
