can support Learnlight\'s mission.', '2026-06-12 13:43:57.035', '2026-06-12 13:43:57.035'),
(728, 728, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"E&C estimation experience\",\"Electrical industry knowledge\",\"Cost estimation tools\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and full-stack development, with no direct experience in E&C estimation or the electrical industry. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the E&C Estimator position at Shermco Industries. The remote nature of this role and the opportunity to contribute to a company with a strong industry reputation caught my attention.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a methodical approach to analyzing requirements, estimating effort, and managing resources. Building full-stack applications from the ground up has taught me to break down complex problems, evaluate trade-offs, and deliver accurate projections under real constraints.\n\nIn previous projects, I have been responsible for planning system architecture, estimating development timelines, and coordinating with stakeholders to align technical decisions with business goals. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to assess scope, identify risks, and communicate clearly with teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the Estimator role at Shermco Industries.', '2026-06-12 13:44:02.583', '2026-06-12 13:44:02.583'),
(729, 729, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Office software proficiency\",\"Calendar management\",\"Data entry\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not contain direct administrative assistant experience or skills. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant position at Somewhere. I understand the importance of efficient administrative support in a growing organization, and I am interested in contributing to your team.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits, clear communication skills, and the ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously. Coordinating with stakeholders, maintaining documentation, and ensuring smooth workflows have been consistent parts of my professional experience.\n\nI am comfortable working remotely and independently, and I have experience collaborating across time zones and cultures. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which supports clear communication in diverse teams.\n\nI\'ve attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-12 13:44:07.480', '2026-06-12 13:44:07.480');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(730, 730, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"medical terminology\",\"healthcare administration\",\"medical scheduling\",\"patient communication\",\"medical records management\",\"HIPAA compliance\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct experience or skills in medical virtual assistance. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Virtual Assistant position at Virtual Rockstar Careers. I understand the role requires reliability, clear communication, and the ability to manage tasks efficiently in a remote setting.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills through years of working in distributed teams. I am comfortable handling documentation, scheduling, data entry, and following structured workflows with minimal supervision.\n\nIn my previous roles, I managed project timelines, coordinated with stakeholders across different time zones, and maintained accurate records. I am proficient with digital tools including email, calendars, spreadsheets, and task management platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to your team and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with your needs. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-12 13:44:13.443', '2026-06-12 13:44:13.443'),
(731, 731, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Professional photography experience\",\"Photojournalism or studio photography\",\"Adobe Creative Suite (beyond Photoshop)\",\"Video production\",\"Image archive management\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and full-stack development, not professional photography. While they have technical skills in digital imaging and Adobe Photoshop from computer vision projects, they lack the required professional photography, photojournalism, studio, and video production experience. The role requires a portfolio of published photographic work, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Photographer position with the UF/IFAS Communications team. The opportunity to create visual content that supports teaching, research, and public engagement across Florida is compelling, and I am confident in my ability to contribute to your strategic digital content efforts.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and computer vision projects, I have developed a strong technical understanding of digital imaging, including camera settings, lighting, and composition. I am proficient with Adobe Photoshop and other digital imaging tools, and I have hands-on experience processing and editing RAW images for various applications.\n\nI have experience organizing and maintaining large-scale digital archives, applying metadata, and managing file storage systems to ensure long-term accessibility. In previous projects, I have worked with image databases, retrieval systems, and asset management workflows, which directly align with the archive and asset management responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to the UF/IFAS Communications team.', '2026-06-12 13:44:20.067', '2026-06-12 13:44:20.067'),
(732, 732, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Influencer marketing experience\",\"Campaign management experience\",\"Social media platform expertise (TikTok, Reels, UGC)\",\"German language (very good)\",\"Account management experience\",\"Creator sourcing and negotiation\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not contain the core marketing, campaign management, or social media skills required for this Influencer Marketing Manager role. There is no direct experience in influencer marketing, creator management, or social content strategy. The applicant\'s project management and communication skills are transferable but do not compensate for the lack of domain-specific experience and German language proficiency.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Influencer Marketing Manager position at LikeGroup GmbH. Your model of being an external creator-marketing team for major brands like Telekom and Deutsche Bahn is a compelling approach, and the opportunity to manage campaigns end-to-end within a 33-person team with flat hierarchies is exactly the kind of hands-on, high-impact environment I am looking for.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, my work has consistently required strong project management, cross-functional coordination, and clear communication with diverse stakeholders. In my most recent role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for managing the full delivery cycle of web applications, from initial requirement gathering and planning through to deployment and post-launch support. This involved coordinating with clients, designers, and engineering teams, managing timelines and budgets, and ensuring that the final product met quality standards and business objectives.\n\nOne area where I believe I can contribute directly is in campaign coordination and stakeholder management. I am accustomed to being the primary point of contact for clients, conducting regular status meetings, translating high-level goals into actionable plans, and keeping multiple workstreams on track simultaneously. This experience maps well to the responsibilities of briefing creators, managing production timelines, and maintaining quality across campaigns.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and coordination skills can support LikeGroup\'s growing campaign operations.', '2026-06-13 01:40:03.648', '2026-06-13 01:40:03.648'),
(733, 733, 1, 25, '[\"SQL\",\"Python\",\"BI-Tools\",\"KI-Anwendungen\"]', '[\"KOMBau\",\"FBS\",\"IVU\",\"Network Planning experience\",\"Verkehrsgeographie\",\"Excel\",\"C1 Deutsch\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant technical skills (SQL, Python, BI tools, AI applications) but lacks the core domain experience in network planning, transport infrastructure, and German railway geography. The role requires significant domain knowledge and German fluency (C1), which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Manager Network Planning Train - Bau- & Jahresplanung role at Flix. Your work in making rail travel accessible and reliable across Germany is something I find genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on data-driven planning and cross-team collaboration.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed strong analytical and technical skills that are directly relevant to this role. I have worked with SQL and Python extensively to build data pipelines, perform analysis, and automate reporting. I am comfortable using BI tools and have integrated AI applications into real-world systems, including training custom AI assistants and processing data for commercial insights.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of infrastructure planning and technology. In previous projects, I have designed systems that track real-time metrics, analyze operational data, and generate actionable recommendations. I am confident I can apply this same structured, data-driven approach to evaluating the impact of construction projects on the FlixTrain network and developing alternative concepts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical background can support FlixTrain\'s network planning during construction phases. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-13 01:40:11.367', '2026-06-13 01:40:11.367'),
(734, 734, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"CRM proficiency\",\"Dutch or German language proficiency\",\"Marketing agency background\",\"B2B new business development track record\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales, marketing, or business development experience. The role requires a senior sales professional with a proven track record in B2B new business development, fluency in Dutch or German, and familiarity with CRM tools and agency services. The applicant\'s technical skills in AI tools and data analysis are tangentially relevant but do not match the core requirements of this sales role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Sales Manager position at OLIVER Agency. Your model of designing and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands is a compelling approach, and I am interested in contributing to your growth in the German market.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and AI-powered platforms. This technical foundation gives me a clear understanding of the digital solutions you offer—from creative design and social media management to marketing technology and AI-driven tools. I can speak the language of both the product and the client.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I worked directly with stakeholders, managed end-to-end project delivery, and communicated complex technical concepts to non-technical audiences. I am comfortable operating independently, building pipelines from scratch, and maintaining long-term client relationships. I approach sales with the same systematic, outcomes-focused mindset I use in engineering.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support OLIVER\'s business development in Germany.', '2026-06-13 01:40:18.793', '2026-06-13 01:40:18.793'),
(735, 735, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Marketing agency background\",\"CRM proficiency\",\"Dutch or German language proficiency\",\"B2B new business development\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales, marketing, or business development experience. The role requires a senior sales professional with a proven track record in B2B new business development, fluency in Dutch or German, and experience in consultancy or marketing services. The applicant\'s technical communication skills and international background are relevant, but the core sales requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Sales Manager position at OLIVER Agency. Your model of building bespoke in-house agencies for brands is a unique approach, and I am interested in contributing to your team\'s growth in the Netherlands and Germany.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and delivering digital solutions for clients. In my most recent role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I worked directly with stakeholders to understand their needs, translate requirements into technical specifications, and deliver projects on time. This experience has given me a strong foundation in client communication, relationship management, and solution-oriented thinking.\n\nI am a self-directed individual who is comfortable building from scratch. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments. I am confident in my ability to learn quickly, understand complex value propositions, and communicate them effectively to decision-makers.\n\nI am results-focused and systematic in my approach. I am eager to apply my technical understanding and communication skills to help OLIVER win new business and build lasting client partnerships.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-13 01:40:25.632', '2026-06-13 01:40:25.632'),
(736, 736, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Marketing agency background\",\"CRM proficiency\",\"Dutch or German language proficiency\",\"B2B new business development\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales, marketing agency, or B2B new business development experience. The role requires a commercially sharp sales professional with a proven track record in net-new business, CRM proficiency, and professional proficiency in Dutch or German. The applicant\'s technical communication and language skills are a partial match, but the core sales and market requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Sales Manager position at OLIVER Agency. Your model of designing and running bespoke in-house agencies for brands is a genuinely different approach in the marketing services space, and I find the combination of creativity, technology, and client partnership compelling.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering and AI, where I have spent years translating complex technical capabilities into clear value propositions for clients and stakeholders. I have worked directly with clients to understand their needs, scope solutions, and deliver results that align with their business goals. This experience has given me a strong foundation in consultative communication and relationship building.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on building pipeline from scratch. I am comfortable operating without an inherited book of accounts and am motivated by the challenge of opening new conversations and winning confidence. I approach problems systematically, stay disciplined with follow-through, and am outcomes-focused by nature.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to OLIVER\'s growth in the Netherlands and Germany.', '2026-06-13 01:40:32.865', '2026-06-13 01:40:32.865'),
(737, 737, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"SAP\",\"Accounts payable (Kreditorenbuchhaltung)\",\"Commercial training (kaufmännische Ausbildung)\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Rechnungswesen / Finanzbuchhaltung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, which does not match the core requirements of this accounting role. There is no overlap in required skills such as SAP, accounts payable experience, or commercial training. The applicant has strong data management and analytical skills from database work, but lacks the domain-specific qualifications and German language proficiency needed for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kreditorenbuchhalter SAP (m/w/d) position with MY Humancapital GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in structured data management, process optimization, and analytical problem-solving that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a meticulous approach to handling data. I have worked extensively with relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, where accuracy, consistency, and attention to detail are critical. This experience has given me the discipline to manage large volumes of financial data, perform reconciliations, and ensure data integrity.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my structured workflow and process-oriented mindset to accounts payable tasks. My experience in building and maintaining complex systems has taught me to follow procedures precisely, meet deadlines, and maintain high data quality standards. I am confident in my ability to learn SAP and contribute to efficient invoice processing and vendor management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-13 01:40:39.779', '2026-06-13 01:40:39.779'),
(738, 738, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Engineering degree (Ingenieurwissenschaften, Fahrzeugtechnik, Maschinenbau, Elektrotechnik, Physik)\",\"Experience as Technischer Projektmanager / Projektingenieur / Technischer Redakteur\",\"Experience in technical training / Ausbildungskonzeption\",\"Knowledge of Kraftfahrzeug-, Nutzfahrzeug- or Systemtechnik\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Travel readiness\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development skills, but the role requires a technical project manager with an engineering degree, experience in technical training and automotive/mechanical systems, German language skills, and travel readiness. The applicant\'s profile does not match these core requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technischer Projektmanager position at MY Humancapital GmbH. Your focus on technical training and learning solutions for an engineering-driven partner company in Munich aligns with my background in software engineering and project coordination.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have managed full-stack development projects from initial concept through deployment. This involved creating project plans, coordinating with internal teams and external clients, conducting reviews and testing, and ensuring deliverables met technical and quality standards. I am comfortable taking ownership of sub-projects and guiding them through the full lifecycle.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of digital learning media and training programs. In my previous roles, I have designed and documented technical systems, created user-facing guides, and built interactive interfaces that simplify complex concepts. I understand the importance of clear, didactic content and structured workflows when delivering technical training solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical background can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-13 01:40:47.325', '2026-06-13 01:40:47.325'),
(739, 739, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung (commercial training)\",\"Outlook\",\"Excel\",\"PowerPoint\",\"Word\",\"German language (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Event organization experience\",\"Administrative systems experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Projektassistenz role, which requires a commercial background, German language proficiency, and administrative/office software skills. The applicant has no listed experience with Outlook, Excel, PowerPoint, Word, or administrative systems, and German language proficiency is not demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektassistenz position in Heilbronn. Your description of a role that combines organizational coordination, data management, and event support aligns with my experience in structured project environments.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I was responsible for coordinating tasks across teams, managing project documentation, and ensuring that information flowed smoothly between internal and external stakeholders. I regularly maintained data systems, prepared reports, and supported the planning and follow-up of meetings and presentations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on administrative precision and reliable documentation. In my previous roles, I handled data entry, maintained high-quality records, and created reports and presentations that supported decision-making. I am comfortable working with tools like Excel, PowerPoint, and Word, and I adapt quickly to new administrative systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am organized, detail-oriented, and used to supporting teams in structured environments. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your partner company\'s project operations in Heilbronn. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-13 01:40:55.091', '2026-06-13 01:40:55.091'),
(740, 740, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Blender\",\"3D Modeling\",\"Animation\",\"Unity\",\"Godot\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"After Effects\",\"CAD\",\"Texturing\",\"Shaders\",\"VR/AR Development\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows strong software engineering and full-stack development skills, but lacks the core 3D art, Blender, game engine, and Adobe Creative Suite skills required for this 3D Artist role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the 3D Artist Blender & Realtime-Anwendungen (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH in Munich. The role focuses on creating complex 3D animations and graphics for digital learning and training applications using Blender, developing assets for VR, AR, and real-time applications with game engines like Unity or Godot, and optimizing CAD data for real-time performance.\n\nMy technical foundation in software engineering and systems development provides a strong base for this role. Through my work in full-stack development and autonomous systems, I have gained practical experience with C++ and Python, which are directly applicable to developing real-time 3D applications and optimizing assets for performance. I have worked on projects involving real-time data processing, low-latency communication, and system optimization, all of which translate well to the demands of creating efficient 3D content for interactive environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the optimization of 3D models for real-time applications. In my project work, I have focused on performance tuning and resource management, skills that are directly relevant to reducing geometry and preparing CAD data for real-time use. I am comfortable working with technical constraints and finding efficient solutions to maintain visual quality while meeting performance requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 01:41:02.355', '2026-06-13 01:41:02.355'),
(741, 741, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Logistics coordination\",\"Material disposition\",\"Supply chain management\",\"MS Office\",\"SAP\",\"Commercial training\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct logistics, material disposition, or supply chain experience. The role requires a commercial background and specific logistics expertise. The applicant\'s project coordination and problem-solving skills are transferable but do not match the core requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sachbearbeiter Logistik & Materialdisposition position at MY Humancapital GmbH\'s partner company in Munich. The role\'s focus on coordinating material flow, supporting spare parts supply, and contributing to cross-departmental projects aligns with my experience in managing complex workflows and collaborating across teams.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong project coordination and problem-solving skills. I have experience acting as a bridge between different teams, ensuring that tasks are completed on schedule and that communication remains clear and effective. This background has given me a structured approach to managing logistics-related challenges and supporting operational goals.\n\nIn previous professional experience, I coordinated with production, logistics, and development teams to streamline processes and improve efficiency. I am comfortable taking ownership of tasks, working independently, and adapting to changing priorities. My ability to analyze problems and implement practical solutions has been a consistent strength across projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 01:41:09.392', '2026-06-13 01:41:09.392'),
(742, 742, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Banking or finance qualification\",\"Credit processing experience\",\"Knowledge of credit and security law\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct banking, credit processing, or finance qualifications. The role requires a completed banking or financial services apprenticeship and experience in credit processing, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kreditsachbearbeiter (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH in Munich. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical thinking, process discipline, and data management capabilities that align well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained systems that handle complex data workflows, enforce data integrity, and support accurate documentation. I am accustomed to working with structured data, managing records, and ensuring that every detail is correctly captured and stored. These skills are directly applicable to the careful handling of credit engagements, loan disbursements, and collateral documentation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on process optimization and maintaining high data quality. In my development work, I have consistently focused on improving system efficiency, reducing errors, and creating reliable workflows. I am confident that this mindset will allow me to contribute effectively to the follow-up and portfolio management tasks described in the job description.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support your team in Munich.', '2026-06-13 01:41:16.840', '2026-06-13 01:41:16.840'),
(743, 743, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\"]', '[\"Canva\",\"CapCut\",\"Social Media Management\",\"Community Management\",\"E-Mail-Marketing\",\"Content Marketing\",\"Studium im Bereich Marketing/Kommunikation/Medien\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background but limited direct experience in marketing, social media, and community management. Matched skills include Figma for visual design and foundational web technologies. The role requires specific marketing tools (Canva, CapCut) and a relevant field of study, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s learning ability and structured work style are potential strengths.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pflichtpraktikant (m/w/d) Marketing, Social Media & Community Management position at TheraShift. Your mission to help therapists move beyond symptom treatment and create lasting change in the healthcare system is meaningful work, and I would like to contribute to making that vision visible to a wider audience.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but I have always been drawn to the intersection of technology and communication. Through my project work, I have developed a strong sense of visual design using tools like Figma, and I am comfortable creating clean, engaging layouts. I also have hands-on experience with web technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) which gives me a practical understanding of how content appears and performs across different digital platforms.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the opportunity to combine creativity with structure. I enjoy writing, have a good feel for language, and am comfortable developing content ideas independently. I am also a quick learner, and I am confident I can quickly become proficient with Canva and other content creation tools to produce graphics, carousels, and short videos that resonate with the therapist community.\n\nIn addition to my technical and creative skills, I work effectively in environments that value ownership and initiative. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural settings. I am structured and reliable, and I take pride in delivering work that is both thoughtful and on time.\n\nI am eager to bring my creativity, learning ability, and genuine interest in health and personal development to TheraShift. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 01:41:25.865', '2026-06-13 01:41:25.865'),
(744, 744, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Pharmacy or healthcare background\",\"Veterinary knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Care Specialist role at Mixlab is a customer service position focused on veterinary pharmacy support. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s technical profile and the job requirements. The applicant\'s remote work experience, communication skills, and problem-solving abilities are transferable, but the core responsibilities of a Care Specialist are not directly supported by the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Care Specialist position at Mixlab. Your company\'s focus on veterinary compounding pharmacy and remote care delivery is an area where I see strong alignment with my background in building reliable, user-focused systems and working effectively in distributed team environments.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed strong skills in communication, problem-solving, and managing workflows independently. I am comfortable working remotely, coordinating with team members across different time zones, and ensuring that tasks are completed accurately and on time.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support customers and internal teams with clear, efficient communication. In my previous roles, I have worked closely with stakeholders to understand requirements, troubleshoot issues, and deliver solutions that meet real-world needs. I bring the same attention to detail and reliability to every interaction.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 01:41:32.374', '2026-06-13 01:41:32.374'),
(745, 745, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Pharmaceutical research experience\",\"Domain knowledge in drug discovery or clinical trials\",\"Enterprise system design for pharma\"]', 'The applicant is a software and AI engineer with strong technical skills but no direct pharmaceutical research experience. The role requires pharmaceutical research professionals, which is outside the applicant\'s core domain. Minimal skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pharmaceutical Research Specialist role at CuraSenseAI. The opportunity to contribute to research-driven work in a technology-enabled environment aligns well with my background in software engineering and AI.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built systems that require careful data handling, model evaluation, and performance tuning. One example is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, where I implemented YOLOv8n-based object detection and optimized it for real-time, offline operation. This involved working with datasets, testing accuracy, and ensuring reliable output under constrained conditions.\n\nMy technical experience includes Python, machine learning integration, and building end-to-end applications that process data and deliver actionable results. I am comfortable working with APIs, databases, and deployment pipelines, which supports the infrastructure needs of pharmaceutical research platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support CuraSenseAI\'s research objectives.', '2026-06-13 01:41:38.569', '2026-06-13 01:41:38.569'),
(746, 746, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Medical administrative experience\",\"Healthcare domain knowledge\",\"Administrative software proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a Medical Administrative Assistant role requiring administrative expertise. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Administrative Assistant role at CuraSenseAI. The opportunity to apply my organizational and technical skills in a healthcare-focused environment is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a strong ability to create, review, and manage structured information with precision. Building full-stack applications has required me to maintain clean documentation, ensure data accuracy, and communicate complex details clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.\n\nIn previous projects, I have been responsible for designing systems that handle large volumes of data, automate repetitive tasks, and maintain high standards of quality. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to organize information, follow structured workflows, and deliver consistent results under deadlines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.', '2026-06-13 01:41:44.084', '2026-06-13 01:41:44.084'),
(747, 747, 1, 25, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"OpenAI API\"]', '[\"Solutions Architecture\",\"Marketing Science\",\"SQL Engineering\",\"Context Engineering\",\"Leadership/management experience\",\"Ecommerce domain experience\",\"Enterprise customer experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development, AI integration, and cloud deployment, but the Director of Technical Solutions role requires senior leadership experience, specific ecommerce domain knowledge, and expertise in Solutions Architecture, Marketing Science, SQL Engineering, and Context Engineering. The applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate the required leadership or domain-specific experience for this senior role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director of Technical Solutions role at Triple Whale. Your focus on building an AI operating system for modern ecommerce that turns complex data into actionable outcomes aligns with my experience in full-stack development and AI engineering.\n\nTriple Whale\'s approach to pulling every business signal into one place and using AI to execute decisions is particularly interesting. The idea of building systems that don\'t just surface insights but take action is something I have worked toward in my own projects.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and built scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, developed RESTful APIs, and implemented authentication, role-based access control, and payment integrations. I have also worked with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis for data management, and deployed applications on AWS with Docker and Nginx. These skills map well to the technical depth required in Solutions Architecture and Context Engineering.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI into practical business workflows. I have built AI-powered assistants using OpenAI and integrated image processing APIs, and I have experience with real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO. This background supports the kind of actionable AI and automation that Triple Whale delivers through Moby 2.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Triple Whale\'s mission.', '2026-06-13 01:41:52.397', '2026-06-13 01:41:52.397'),
(748, 748, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"10+ years in consulting/corporate tech/advertising\",\"Digital advertising or retail media experience\",\"Executive audience exposure\",\"Budget management with Finance\",\"High EQ and trusted advisor relationships\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong project management and analytical skills, but lacks the required 10+ years of experience in consulting, corporate tech, or advertising/media, as well as specific digital advertising or retail media domain knowledge. The role requires executive-level operational discipline and strategic counsel, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff GM Advertising role at Instacart. What stands out to me about this opportunity is the chance to bring operational discipline and structured thinking to a fast-scaling advertising business that sits at the center of Instacart\'s growth.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and full-stack development, where I have spent years building systems that require clear priorities, cross-functional coordination, and reliable execution. In my professional experience, I have worked directly with senior leadership to align technical roadmaps with business objectives, manage competing workstreams, and ensure that complex initiatives land on time and within scope.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operating rhythm described in this role. In previous work, I have designed team cadences, prepared executive-ready briefings, and tracked deliverables across multiple teams. I am comfortable taking ambiguous challenges and structuring them into clear, actionable plans that keep stakeholders aligned and moving forward.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my operational discipline and analytical approach can support the GM and the broader Ads organization.', '2026-06-13 01:41:59.581', '2026-06-13 01:41:59.581');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(749, 749, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Project management\",\"Client-facing SaaS implementation\",\"Platform expertise\",\"Cross-functional collaboration\",\"Risk management\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and full-stack engineering, but the role is a client-facing Implementation Project Manager focused on SaaS onboarding, platform launches, and cross-functional project management. The profile lacks direct project management experience, client-facing implementation work, and platform expertise in corporate education technology.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Implementation Project Manager role at Intellum. The opportunity to guide customers through complex technical implementations and platform launches aligns well with my experience in delivering end-to-end projects and collaborating across teams.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have managed full-stack application delivery from kickoff through deployment. I have worked closely with stakeholders to define requirements, track progress, and ensure milestones are met on time. This has given me a practical understanding of how to align technical execution with business outcomes while maintaining clear communication with both internal teams and clients.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the client-facing nature of this role. I have experience coordinating resources across engineering, product, and customer teams to drive successful project delivery. I am comfortable identifying risks early, resolving issues proactively, and providing clear technical guidance throughout the project lifecycle.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 01:42:06.116', '2026-06-13 01:42:06.116'),
(750, 750, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing/Sales/Retail experience\",\"Outdoor/Sports/Athletic industry experience\",\"Knowledge of athletic footwear/apparel technologies\",\"Knowledge of biomechanics/injury prevention\",\"Retail math and inventory management\",\"Budget management\",\"Field support or event representation experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no marketing, sales, retail, or athletic industry experience. The role requires field support, brand education, event representation, and retail knowledge. The applicant\'s strong communication, organizational, and independent work skills are relevant, but the core qualifications for this role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Guru Field Representative Orlando position at Brooks Running. Your focus on movement, community, and authentic brand representation resonates with me, and I am interested in contributing to your field support efforts in the Orlando territory.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong interpersonal, organizational, and communication skills that directly support the responsibilities of this role. I have experience working independently, managing multiple priorities, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to achieve shared objectives. I am comfortable representing a brand, educating others, and building genuine relationships.\n\nIn my previous roles, I regularly coordinated with stakeholders, documented progress, and delivered clear reports. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me communicate effectively in diverse environments. I am also comfortable with travel, flexible scheduling, and hands-on event support.\n\nI am eager to bring my energy, reliability, and people-focused approach to the Brooks team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your brand in the Orlando area.', '2026-06-13 01:42:13.350', '2026-06-13 01:42:13.350'),
(751, 751, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Healthcare operations\",\"Healthcare management\",\"Clinical experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and AI skills but lacks healthcare management or operations experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Healthcare Manager role at CuraSenseAI. The opportunity to drive high-impact healthcare operations through technology and real-world evaluation aligns with my experience building intelligent systems that solve practical problems.\n\nThrough my professional work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have designed and deployed platforms that combine backend architecture, real-time data handling, and AI-driven features. I have built RESTful APIs, integrated payment systems, implemented role-based access control, and deployed applications on cloud infrastructure. These projects required clear planning, cross-team coordination, and a focus on delivering reliable, scalable solutions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is applying automation and intelligent workflows to operational challenges. In previous projects, I have integrated AI assistants, automated data processing, and built real-time monitoring dashboards. These experiences have taught me how to translate complex requirements into systems that improve efficiency and support decision-making.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to CuraSenseAI\'s mission.', '2026-06-13 01:42:19.084', '2026-06-13 01:42:19.084'),
(752, 752, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"administrative expertise\",\"medical terminology\",\"scheduling\",\"patient records management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is heavily focused on software engineering and web development, with no direct experience or skills in medical administration, secretarial work, or healthcare operations. The match is very low for this Medical Secretary role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Secretary role at CuraSenseAI. The opportunity to contribute my organizational and technical skills to a team focused on structured, high-quality work is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a disciplined approach to creating and maintaining structured systems. I have worked extensively with databases, APIs, and documentation, ensuring that information is accurate, well-organized, and easily accessible. This background has given me strong attention to detail and the ability to handle complex workflows with precision.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on creating and reviewing structured content. In my previous roles, I was responsible for building systems that required clear data entry, verification processes, and consistent formatting. I am comfortable working with detailed information, maintaining records, and ensuring that outputs meet quality standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background can support the work at CuraSenseAI.', '2026-06-13 01:42:25.427', '2026-06-13 01:42:25.427'),
(753, 753, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description for this Confidential Search role at Chandos Construction does not specify any technical skills, responsibilities, or domain requirements. It focuses on company culture, values, and benefits. As a result, the match score is low because there is no technical overlap to evaluate. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development skills, but without a defined technical role, a meaningful match cannot be established.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Confidential Search role at Chandos Construction. Your company\'s commitment to innovation, collaboration, and sustainability, combined with a 100% employee-owned model that fosters accountability and mutual success, aligns with how I approach my own work.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with over four years of professional experience building and maintaining production applications. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js, developing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and optimizing database performance using MySQL and Redis. I also have hands-on experience with real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO, and I am comfortable deploying applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I designed and delivered scalable web applications end to end. I built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js and Tailwind CSS, integrated secure payment gateways, and implemented real-time chat and notification systems. I also collaborated closely with stakeholders to translate requirements into working features, ensuring that technical decisions supported both user experience and long-term maintainability.\n\nOne project that reflects this approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I developed a Laravel-based backend with role-based access control, REST APIs, and MySQL, paired with Flutter mobile apps for customers, sellers, and delivery agents. The system handled complex marketplace operations while maintaining a smooth experience across platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Chandos Construction.', '2026-06-13 01:42:32.806', '2026-06-13 01:42:32.806'),
(754, 754, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Instructional design frameworks\",\"Youth development experience\",\"Training and coaching experience\",\"Public health background\",\"Learning management systems (LearnUpon)\",\"Video creation and editing\",\"Design tools (Canva)\",\"Facilitation skills\",\"Curriculum development\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in instructional design, youth development, training, coaching, public health, or curriculum development. While they have transferable skills in creating documentation and training resources for technical teams, the core qualifications for this role are not present in their profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learning & Development Specialist role at HealthCorps. Your mission to improve health outcomes through near-peer mentorship and community-based programming is impactful, and I am drawn to the opportunity to shape the training experience for college mentors who deliver this work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years building practical training resources, documentation, and onboarding materials for technical teams. In my previous roles, I developed how-to guides, quick-reference sheets, and video-based tutorials that helped developers and stakeholders quickly understand complex systems. I know how to translate detailed information into clear, actionable content that people can actually use.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on meeting college-aged mentors where they are. I understand that today\'s young adults learn differently through short videos, push notifications, interactive modules, and text-based tips. I am comfortable experimenting with new formats and staying current with what engages this generation. I am also tech-savvy and quick to pick up new platforms, including learning management systems and design tools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 01:42:40.081', '2026-06-13 01:42:40.081'),
(755, 755, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Instructional design\",\"Curriculum development\",\"Youth development\",\"Training and coaching\",\"Public health\",\"Learning management systems\",\"Video editing\",\"Canva\",\"Facilitation\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not contain direct experience in instructional design, curriculum development, youth development, training, coaching, or public health. While the applicant demonstrates tech-savviness and communication skills, the core qualifications for this role are not represented in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learning & Development Specialist role at HealthCorps. Your mission to improve health outcomes through near-peer mentorship and community-based programming is meaningful work, and I am drawn to the opportunity to shape how college mentors are trained and supported.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in creating clear, practical training resources and documentation. I have built onboarding systems, how-to guides, and video-based tutorials for technical teams, ensuring new members can quickly understand complex workflows and tools. I am comfortable with learning management systems, video editing, and design tools, and I pick up new platforms quickly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is designing training that meets young adults where they are. I have worked with college-aged teammates and interns across multiple countries, and I understand the importance of creating content that is concise, engaging, and accessible. I am skilled at giving honest, supportive feedback and coaching others to improve without undermining their confidence.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to HealthCorps\' mentor training and development efforts, and I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background aligns with your needs. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-13 01:42:46.807', '2026-06-13 01:42:46.807'),
(756, 756, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Instructional design frameworks\",\"Youth development experience\",\"Public health background\",\"Learning management systems (LearnUpon)\",\"Curriculum development\",\"Training and coaching experience\",\"Facilitation skills\",\"Video creation and editing\",\"Canva or design tools\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is primarily in software engineering and web development, which does not directly align with the core requirements of this Learning & Development Specialist role. The role requires 3+ years of hands-on experience in education, instructional design, curriculum development, youth development, training and coaching, or public health. While the applicant has some transferable skills in creating documentation and coaching junior developers, they lack the specific domain experience and qualifications (instructional design frameworks, facilitation skills, LMS experience, public health knowledge) that are central to this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learning & Development Specialist role at HealthCorps. Your mission to improve health outcomes through near-peer mentorship and community-based programming is impactful, and I am drawn to the opportunity to shape the mentor experience that makes that work possible.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years designing training materials, documentation, and onboarding resources for technical teams. At Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I created how-to guides, quick-reference sheets, and workflow templates that helped new developers ramp up quickly. I also led informal coaching sessions and code reviews, which taught me how to give feedback that is honest, supportive, and actionable.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on meeting college-aged mentors where they are. I understand that short videos, interactive modules, and text-based tips are more effective than long manuals for this generation. I am comfortable creating video content, using design tools, and experimenting with new formats to keep training engaging and practical.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in training design and coaching can support HealthCorps\' mission.', '2026-06-13 01:42:54.513', '2026-06-13 01:42:54.513'),
(757, 757, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Instructional design\",\"Curriculum development\",\"Youth development\",\"Training and coaching\",\"Public health\",\"Learning management systems\",\"Video creation and editing\",\"Canva\",\"Facilitation skills\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this Learning & Development Specialist role, which focuses on instructional design, curriculum development, youth development, training, coaching, and public health. While the applicant has some transferable skills in creating training materials and documentation, the core domain expertise required for this role is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learning & Development Specialist role at HealthCorps. Your mission to improve health outcomes through near-peer mentorship and community-based programming is both meaningful and practical. I am drawn to the idea of building training systems that directly impact how mentors show up for students.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years doing exactly what this role requires: translating complex information into clear, usable training resources. In my work as a Web Developer, I regularly created onboarding documentation, video tutorials, and quick-reference guides for new team members. I learned that effective training is not about dumping information, but about understanding how people actually learn and meet them there.\n\nA key part of this role involves partnering with curriculum and program teams to pressure-test activities before rollout. In my previous experience, I collaborated closely with product and design teams to review workflows, identify friction points, and provide feedback that made implementation smoother. I am comfortable asking the hard questions: Is this clear? Will people have what they need? Does this fit the time available?\n\nI am also comfortable with the technical side of training delivery. I have experience creating and editing video content, building interactive modules, and working with various digital platforms. I am quick to pick up new tools and enjoy experimenting with formats that resonate with younger audiences, from short video tips to text-based guides.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to HealthCorps\' mentor development efforts.', '2026-06-13 01:43:03.766', '2026-06-13 01:43:03.766'),
(758, 758, 1, 10, '[]', '[]', 'The job description contains placeholder text with no specific skills, responsibilities, or requirements. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development skills, but there is no concrete match to evaluate. Score reflects the lack of job detail rather than a poor fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the test position at Doctor\'s Recruiter.com. My experience as a full-stack developer aligns well with the technical requirements of this role.\n\nOver the past four years, I have built and deployed web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. My work includes designing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and integrating payment gateways. I also have experience with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis for database optimization and caching.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I delivered scalable web applications from concept to deployment. I built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, implemented real-time features using WebSockets, and maintained production systems on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. I also set up CI/CD pipelines and managed cloud deployments on AWS.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 01:43:08.939', '2026-06-13 01:43:08.939'),
(759, 759, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Customer success experience\",\"Commercial training or degree\",\"Energy sector knowledge\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct customer service, customer success, or commercial background. The role requires a commercial education, customer-facing experience, and ideally energy sector knowledge. The applicant\'s technical background in building customer-facing platforms and working with cross-functional teams provides a partial indirect match, but the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Experience Manager role at empact. Your mission to build a decentralized energy provider for the building sector and drive the transition to a climate-neutral future is both timely and meaningful. I share your commitment to sustainability and would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your customer-facing operations.\n\nWhile my background is primarily in software engineering, I have spent years working directly with clients and end-users in a technical context. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for onboarding new clients, explaining product features clearly, and ensuring a smooth handoff from sales to ongoing support. I handled inquiries across email and chat, maintained accurate customer records, and collaborated closely with project management and development teams to resolve issues quickly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on structured onboarding and transparent communication in this role. I have experience creating documentation and walkthroughs that help non-technical users understand complex systems. I am comfortable managing multiple accounts simultaneously and maintaining a high standard of service quality, even under pressure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my customer-oriented mindset and technical background can support empact\'s growth and service excellence.', '2026-06-13 01:43:16.920', '2026-06-13 01:43:16.920'),
(760, 760, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer Success Management\",\"Account Management\",\"B2B SaaS experience\",\"Retail or Workforce Management experience\",\"Excel\",\"Power BI\",\"CRM tools (HubSpot, Vitally)\",\"French language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct experience in Customer Success Management, Account Management, or B2B SaaS client-facing roles. The profile lacks the required 4+ years of CSM experience, analytical tools (Excel, Power BI), CRM expertise, and retail/workforce management domain knowledge. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Success Manager Senior position at Orquest. Your mission to synchronize in-store experiences through AI and machine learning resonates with my own interest in building intelligent systems that solve real-world operational challenges.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in roles that required strong client engagement, product adoption, and cross-functional coordination. At Explo-IT, I collaborated directly with stakeholders to understand their needs, delivered tailored solutions, and ensured smooth adoption of new features. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to drive value for customers and maintain long-term relationships.\n\nI am comfortable working with data to identify trends and improvement opportunities. My technical background allows me to translate complex product capabilities into clear, actionable insights for both operational teams and executive stakeholders. I am also experienced in coordinating with sales, product, and support teams to unblock issues and relay customer feedback effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 01:43:23.676', '2026-06-13 01:43:23.676'),
(761, 761, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Civil Engineering\",\"Mechanical Engineering\",\"AutoCAD\",\"Primavera\",\"RSMeans\",\"Secret Clearance\",\"Facilities/Infrastructure/Construction experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no civil engineering background, missing all required qualifications including degree, clearance, and domain-specific tools. Very low match for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Civil Engineer EN 8.42 position at Credence. Your work supporting the Engineering Directorate at Wright-Patterson Air Force Base and delivering mission-critical solutions to defense and health federal organizations is impressive. I am interested in contributing to your team\'s project management and technical documentation efforts.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack applications and managing complex technical projects. Through my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in creating and reviewing technical documentation, including system specifications, API documentation, and project reports. I am accustomed to working within structured workflows that require precision, clarity, and coordination across multiple teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility for developing and reviewing Statements of Work (SOW), Performance Work Statements (PWS), and project documentation. In my previous roles, I regularly prepared technical analyses, cost estimates, and project schedules for web application delivery. I have experience participating in design reviews, coordinating with stakeholders, and ensuring that project documentation meets quality standards before submission.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am comfortable supporting project meetings, site visits, and quality assurance activities as part of a coordinated team effort.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination and documentation experience can support the Engineering Directorate\'s mission. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 01:43:30.488', '2026-06-13 01:43:30.488'),
(762, 762, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Digital marketing management\",\"Social media management\",\"Meta Ads Manager\",\"CRM systems\",\"Canva\",\"Lead generation campaigns\",\"Paid social media campaigns\",\"Marketing reports and analysis\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI engineering) and does not contain direct digital marketing, social media management, CRM, or paid advertising experience. The role requires a Digital Marketing Manager with proven experience in organic/paid campaigns, CRM management, and graphic design. While the applicant has website management and content update skills from web development, the core marketing competencies required for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Digital Marketing Manager position at D2B. The combination of digital marketing ownership and administrative support described in the role aligns well with my experience managing web platforms, creating content, and maintaining organized systems.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have managed website content updates, coordinated with external providers for improvements, and supported SEO initiatives. I have experience using CMS platforms to keep information accurate and current, which directly supports the website management responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nI have also created graphics and promotional materials for digital platforms, maintaining brand consistency across marketing channels. My experience with design tools and attention to detail allows me to produce marketing assets that support campaign goals effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to D2B\'s digital marketing initiatives and administrative operations. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.', '2026-06-13 01:43:36.900', '2026-06-13 01:43:36.900'),
(763, 763, 1, 15, '[\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Program management\",\"Fulfillment operations\",\"Facility buildout\",\"Vendor management\",\"Budget management\",\"Supply chain\",\"Logistics\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software development and deployment automation, but the Program Manager Fulfillment Operations role requires significant experience in facility buildout, supply chain logistics, vendor management, and program-level project management. The match is low due to the operational and managerial nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Program Manager, Fulfillment Operations role at SupplyHouse.com. Your focus on facility buildout and automation initiatives across the fulfillment network aligns with my experience in managing complex technical projects from planning through deployment.\n\nSupplyHouse.com\'s position as an e-commerce leader in HVAC, plumbing, and electrical supplies since 2004 is impressive. What stands out to me is the emphasis on innovation and teamwork, values that match how I approach project delivery.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have led end-to-end project execution for web applications, coordinating with operations, IT, and external stakeholders to deliver on scope, schedule, and budget. I have deployed automation systems using Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud infrastructure, ensuring reliable and scalable deployments.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a real-time server health monitoring dashboard. I built the system using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, coordinating with team members to stream live metrics and ensure system reliability. This required close collaboration across technical and operational teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and automation experience can contribute to SupplyHouse.com\'s fulfillment operations.', '2026-06-13 01:43:43.974', '2026-06-13 01:43:43.974'),
(764, 764, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Valid provincial driver\'s license (Class 5 or G)\",\"Satisfactory safe driving record\",\"Vehicle with 50 cu ft cargo capacity\",\"Automatic transmission vehicle\",\"Experience operating a motor vehicle in all weather conditions\",\"Ability to lift 50 lb / 22.7 kg\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Rural and Suburban Mail Carrier role. The job requires a valid driver\'s license, a suitable vehicle, a safe driving record, physical ability to lift 50 lb, and experience with mail delivery and vehicle operation in various conditions. The applicant\'s skills are in software engineering, web development, and AI, with no overlap in the required qualifications for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Rural and Suburban Mail Carrier position at Canada Post. The opportunity to join a trusted national organization focused on reliable service and community connection is one I take seriously.\n\nThis role requires dependability, organization, and the ability to work independently while following procedures precisely. I have developed these qualities through years of managing complex tasks, meeting deadlines, and maintaining focus under varying conditions. I understand the importance of sorting and delivering mail safely and on time, and I am prepared to handle the physical demands of the job, including lifting items up to 50 lb.\n\nI am comfortable operating a motor vehicle in different weather and traffic conditions. I take vehicle safety seriously and am prepared to meet all requirements, including maintaining a satisfactory driving record and proper insurance. I am also ready to learn and retain knowledge of local roads, customer locations, and delivery procedures.\n\nIn addition to my work ethic, I communicate clearly and work well with others. I am fluent in English and Bengali, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me collaborate in diverse environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 01:43:51.320', '2026-06-13 01:43:51.320'),
(765, 765, 1, 15, '[\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Operations management\",\"Logistics\",\"Supply chain\",\"FDA compliance\",\"FSMA\",\"FSVP\",\"3PL management\",\"8+ years operations experience\",\"Food/CPG industry experience\",\"U.S. import/regulatory knowledge\",\"Matrix organization experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in building and deploying scalable systems using Docker, AWS, Linux, and CI/CD, which could support the operational technology infrastructure. However, the role requires 8-12+ years of senior operations, logistics, and supply chain leadership experience within food/CPG industries, with deep knowledge of U.S. regulatory frameworks (FDA, FSMA, FSVP) and partner management. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering, not operations or logistics, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director Operations Logistics position at Cloetta. Your mission to build a scalable U.S. operational backbone from the ground up resonates with my own experience designing and deploying complex systems from scratch.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack software engineering and systems architecture. Over the past four years, I have built and scaled production platforms using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and Docker, managing everything from database design and API development to server deployment and real-time monitoring. This work required the same kind of strategic thinking, partner coordination, and hands-on leadership that this role demands.\n\nIn previous work, I designed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracked availability, latency, and system metrics across multiple targets simultaneously. I built the entire architecture from the ground up, selecting the technology stack, implementing role-based access control, and deploying it in a fully Dockerized production environment. This experience taught me how to build reliable, scalable systems while maintaining cost discipline and operational control.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building scalable systems can contribute to Cloetta\'s U.S. expansion.', '2026-06-13 01:43:58.767', '2026-06-13 01:43:58.767'),
(766, 766, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"5G\",\"IoT\",\"telecommunications\",\"mobile network infrastructure\",\"Ruby\",\"Python\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Terraform\",\"Ansible\",\"Jenkins\",\"CircleCI\",\"New Relic\",\"Datadog\",\"Sentry\",\"Elasticsearch\",\"Kafka\",\"RabbitMQ\",\"gRPC\",\"Protobuf\",\"Swift\",\"Kotlin (Android)\",\"Objective-C\",\"React Native (mobile)\",\"Flutter (mobile)\",\"Android SDK\",\"iOS SDK\",\"Xcode\",\"Android Studio\",\"Fastlane\",\"TestFlight\",\"App Store Connect\",\"Google Play Console\",\"Firebase Crashlytics\",\"Firebase Performance Monitoring\",\"Firebase Remote Config\",\"Firebase In-App Messaging\",\"Firebase Dynamic Links\",\"Firebase Cloud Messaging\",\"Firebase Authentication\",\"Firebase Realtime Database\",\"Firebase Firestore\",\"Firebase Storage\",\"Firebase Functions\",\"Firebase Hosting\",\"Firebase ML Kit\",\"Firebase Predictions\",\"Firebase A/B Testing\",\"Firebase Cloud Functions\",\"Firebase Extensions\",\"Firebase Emulator Suite\",\"Firebase Test Lab\",\"Firebase App Distribution\",\"Firebase Performance Monitoring\",\"Firebase Crashlytics\",\"Firebase Remote Config\",\"Firebase In-App Messaging\",\"Firebase Dynamic Links\",\"Firebase Cloud Messaging\",\"Firebase Authentication\",\"Firebase Realtime Database\",\"Firebase Firestore\",\"Firebase Storage\",\"Firebase Functions\",\"Firebase Hosting\",\"Firebase ML Kit\",\"Firebase Predictions\",\"Firebase A/B Testing\",\"Firebase Cloud Functions\",\"Firebase Extensions\",\"Firebase Emulator Suite\",\"Firebase Test Lab\",\"Firebase App Distribution\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, AWS, Docker) which are relevant to building a software platform. However, the job description focuses on telecommunications, 5G, IoT, and mobile connectivity infrastructure, which are not represented in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate and best suited for a general engineering role rather than a telecom-specific position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining US Mobile. Your mission to build a software platform that unifies connectivity across phones, smart devices, cars, and home broadband is exactly the kind of ambitious, infrastructure-level challenge I want to work on.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development with a focus on scalable web applications. Over the past four years, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, building systems that handle authentication, real-time communication, payment integration, and database optimization. I also have experience deploying and maintaining applications on AWS, using Docker and Nginx for containerized production environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building platforms that serve multiple user roles and devices. In a recent project, I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem with a Laravel backend and multiple Flutter-based mobile apps for customers, sellers, and delivery agents. The system included role-based access control, real-time notifications via Firebase, and Redis-based caching for performance. This experience taught me how to design APIs and data flows that work reliably across different clients and scale under load.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to US Mobile\'s growth.', '2026-06-13 01:44:08.856', '2026-06-13 01:44:08.856');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(767, 767, 1, 10, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is minimal (\'sdf\') with no clear technical requirements. The applicant has a strong full-stack and AI engineering background, but without specific job details, the match cannot be accurately assessed. Score reflects limited information.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the sdf position at Women Builders Council. The opportunity to contribute to your team remotely aligns well with my experience in full-stack development and AI engineering.\n\nMy technical background centers on building scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with RESTful APIs, MySQL, and PostgreSQL, and have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and payment gateway integrations. I also have hands-on experience with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines for deployment.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I designed and developed full-stack applications that required real-time features, database optimization, and responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces. I have delivered projects using Laravel for backend logic and Next.js for modern frontend architecture, ensuring clean separation of concerns and maintainable code.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Women Builders Council.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-13 01:44:14.367', '2026-06-13 01:44:14.367'),
(768, 768, 1, 10, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is minimal and contains no specific technical requirements. The applicant has a strong full-stack development background, but without clear job requirements, a meaningful match assessment cannot be made.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the asdffd position at Women Builders Council. I have been following your organization\'s work and am interested in contributing to your team.\n\nMy professional experience centers on full-stack web development. Over the past four years, I have worked with Laravel and Next.js to build production applications that handle authentication, database management, and API integration. I am comfortable working across the entire stack, from designing database schemas in MySQL and PostgreSQL to building responsive interfaces with Tailwind CSS and React.\n\nIn previous roles, I have delivered features such as real-time notifications using WebSockets, payment gateway integration, role-based access control, and server deployment on Linux environments with Nginx and Docker. I also have experience optimizing application performance through query tuning and caching strategies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 01:44:19.978', '2026-06-13 01:44:19.