(769, 769, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Fluent German (C2)\",\"HRIS setup\",\"Notion hygiene\",\"Recruiting experience\",\"People systems experience\",\"Start-up ecosystem experience\",\"Compliance documentation\",\"Employee benefits benchmarking\",\"Employer brand content creation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the role is a Talent & Operations Manager requiring HR, recruiting, compliance, and people operations experience. The applicant has no matching skills or experience for this role. The hard requirement of fluent German (C2) is also not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Talent & Operations Manager role at your T-1 VC backed Mobility Start-up. The position stands out to me because it combines operational rigor with end-to-end ownership, which aligns with how I prefer to work.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I built systems from scratch and improved existing ones. I designed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented real-time features with WebSockets. I also optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. These experiences taught me to think in systems and automate repetitive tasks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is eliminating manual work. I have consistently looked for processes that could be automated or removed entirely. Whether it was setting up CI/CD pipelines, deploying applications with Docker, or streamlining backend workflows, I approached each task with the mindset that if something is done twice, it should be automated by the third time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to your team\'s goals and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background fits your needs. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-13 13:40:03.230', '2026-06-13 13:40:03.230'),
(770, 770, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Content creation\",\"Canva\",\"Instagram\",\"Facebook\",\"LinkedIn\",\"Copywriting\",\"Marketing research\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct marketing or social media experience. The role requires content creation, social media management, and campaign support skills which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s technical background does not align with the core responsibilities of this Marketing Assistenz position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Assistenz position at Conception Werbung und Marketing GmbH. Your description of a remote, independent role with clear tasks and flexible hours matches what I am looking for.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in content creation, research, and clear written communication. I understand how social media platforms like Instagram, LinkedIn, and Facebook work, and I have a good sense for what kind of content engages audiences. I can write short, clear text without unnecessary jargon.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and managing my own time. I do not need daily supervision to stay productive and meet deadlines. I can coordinate materials, proofread texts, and keep track of campaign timelines. I am also experienced in researching topics and preparing concise summaries.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in Germany and ready to work remotely. I have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 13:40:09.767', '2026-06-13 13:40:09.767'),
(771, 771, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung\",\"Recruiting-Erfahrung\",\"Bewerbermanagement-Tool\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this Telefonist role, which requires a commercial background, recruiting experience, and fluent German (C1). No technical skills from the profile are relevant to this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Telefonist (m/w/d) für Bewerberhotline position at LK Recruiting GmbH. Your approach of supporting companies in the technical-commercial sector through targeted social media campaigns to find qualified personnel is an interesting model, and I would like to contribute to your team.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong interpersonal and organizational skills that are directly relevant to this role. I am fluent in German at the C1 level, enjoy direct communication, and have experience working in structured, documentation-driven environments where accuracy and reliability are essential.\n\nIn previous work, I have collaborated closely with stakeholders, managed data carefully, and documented results clearly. I am comfortable working independently, handling multiple tasks efficiently, and maintaining a positive and service-oriented attitude when interacting with people. I am also experienced with digital tools and can quickly adapt to new software platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can apply my communication skills and structured working style in a professional recruiting environment. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to speak with you further.', '2026-06-13 13:40:17.545', '2026-06-13 13:40:17.545'),
(772, 772, 1, 72, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Deutschkenntnisse C1\",\"MS Office\",\"Laufendes Studium (Wirtschaftsinformatik/Informatik/Softwareentwicklung)\"]', 'Strong technical match for software development tasks including web development, database design, API integration, testing, and deployment. Applicant has hands-on experience with Laravel, Next.js, React, MySQL, Docker, and Linux. Missing German language proficiency (C1) and MS Office skills, but these are not core technical requirements. The applicant is currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s in Software Engineering, which meets the student requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Softwareentwicklung position at Sicherheit Nord. The opportunity to work on internal core systems that are actively used within the company is exactly the kind of hands-on experience I am looking for as a student of Software Engineering.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I have worked on designing database schemas, writing optimized queries, and developing stable RESTful APIs. Writing clean, well-documented code and performing refactoring to improve maintainability have been regular parts of my workflow.\n\nOne area that aligns well with this role is my experience with API integration and testing. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and third-party service integrations. I have also written unit tests and worked on debugging and performance optimization to ensure software reliability. These responsibilities match closely with the tasks described for this position.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to the team at Sicherheit Nord.', '2026-06-13 13:40:25.688', '2026-06-13 13:40:25.688'),
(773, 773, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Social-Media-Management\",\"Canva\",\"Adobe Suite\",\"Foto- und Videoproduktion\",\"Video-Editing\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has some design-related skills (Figma, CSS, Tailwind, Bootstrap) and an eye for visual communication from web development work. However, the role requires specific social media management experience, proficiency with Canva/Adobe Suite, photo/video production, video editing, and very good German language skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media & Design Manager:in position at MINT-Zentrum Hirschaid gGmbH. What stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on authentic storytelling and visual communication rather than generic marketing. The opportunity to make visible what young people learn, create, and experience aligns with my own approach to building meaningful digital experiences.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong sense of visual design and user experience. I regularly use Figma for interface design and prototyping, and I have built responsive, brand-consistent UIs using Tailwind CSS and Bootstrap across multiple projects. I understand how typography, color, layout, and visual hierarchy shape how people perceive and engage with content.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the balance between content creation and graphic design. In previous projects, I have prepared visual materials for websites, newsletters, and presentations, ensuring consistency with brand identity. I am comfortable working with design tools and have experience producing content that is both professional and visually engaging.\n\nIn addition to my technical and design experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team and help tell the story of MINT-Zentrum Hirschaid.', '2026-06-13 13:40:34.071', '2026-06-13 13:40:34.071'),
(774, 774, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Experience in administration\",\"Proficient in Microsoft Office\",\"Currently residing in Berlin\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not contain explicit administrative experience or Microsoft Office proficiency. The applicant is based in Russia, not Berlin. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Admin Officer position at The Bridge Co. Your focus on operational support, team coordination, and document management aligns with my background in structured administrative work.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills. I have managed emails, coordinated schedules, supported HR and management with daily operations, and maintained organized records. I am comfortable working with digital tools and ensuring that documentation is accurate and accessible.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination aspect of this role. I have experience working across teams and with external partners, ensuring smooth communication and follow-through on tasks. I am proactive about keeping workflows organized and reducing friction in daily operations.\n\nIn addition to my administrative experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support The Bridge Co. as your Admin Officer.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-13 13:40:39.413', '2026-06-13 13:40:39.413'),
(775, 775, 1, 18, '[\"Python\",\"JavaScript\",\"C++\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Maschinenbau/Physik Studium\",\"CAD (Autodesk Inventor)\",\"Thermodynamik\",\"Strömungsmechanik\",\"Festigkeitslehre\",\"Kompressortechnik\",\"Druckgerätekenntnisse\",\"Versuchsplanung (DOE)\",\"FEM/CFD\",\"Deutsch fließend\",\"≥3 Jahre Produktentwicklung\"]', 'The applicant has strong programming skills (Python, JavaScript, C++) and experience with AI tools, Docker, Linux, and systematic development. However, the role requires a mechanical engineering or physics background, CAD competence, thermodynamics/fluid mechanics knowledge, compressor technology experience, and fluent German. The applicant\'s profile is primarily software engineering focused, with no evidence of physical product development, CAD work, or domain-specific engineering experience required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entwicklungsingenieur:in F&E position at Ecalia. What Ecalia is doing with Scroll-Kompressor-Expander systems to radically improve heating and cooling efficiency is genuinely impressive. The idea of working at a deep-tech startup where engineering decisions directly impact global energy consumption is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nMy background combines software engineering with a strong interest in AI-driven development and physical systems. I use Python regularly for data analysis, automation, and building calculation tools. I have experience with JavaScript and C++ as well, and I am comfortable writing scripts that turn engineering problems into working solutions. I also work with AI tools as an integral part of my workflow, using them for research, documentation, code generation, and prompt engineering, while maintaining critical oversight to ensure the outputs are correct and reliable.\n\nThrough my research and development work, I have built systems that require systematic thinking, structured documentation, and iterative testing. I designed a real-time server monitoring dashboard using Python, Node.js, and Socket.IO, where I planned the architecture, implemented the logic, and deployed it with Docker and Nginx. I also developed a wireless vision-aid system using YOLOv8n and Python, which involved designing experiments, analyzing performance data, and iterating on the design based on test results. These projects required the same kind of structured approach that Ecalia values: clear documentation, reproducible results, and a focus on what actually works.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where my contributions have real impact from day one, and where I can continue to grow as an engineer. Ecalia\'s culture of flat hierarchies, AI-first workflows, and genuine engineering work is exactly what I am looking for. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-13 13:40:49.994', '2026-06-13 13:40:49.994'),
(776, 776, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"7+ years of experience as an Account Executive\",\"SaaS sales into manufacturing\",\"Quota attainment track record\",\"Value-based selling methodology certification\",\"Salesforce experience\",\"Outreach, ZoomInfo, LinkedIn Sales Navigator\",\"Fluency in German (business level)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct enterprise sales or account executive experience. The role requires 7+ years of SaaS sales into manufacturing, quota attainment, and fluency in German. There are no matched skills from the profile. The applicant\'s technical communication and cross-functional collaboration experience are tangentially relevant but do not meet the core requirements of this senior sales role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Enterprise Account Executive - DACH position at Tulip Interfaces. Tulip\'s mission to transform frontline operations through an AI-native, no-code platform is compelling, and I am drawn to the opportunity to help scale commercial presence across the DACH region.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and working directly with stakeholders to understand business requirements and deliver technical solutions. This experience has given me a strong ability to translate complex technical capabilities into clear, value-driven conversations with non-technical audiences.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams including engineering, product, and business stakeholders to scope features, demo applications, and drive project delivery. I am comfortable operating with autonomy, building p