(780, 780, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Tax advisory\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and deep expertise in German tax law, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Weil der Stadt. I understand that this role requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and deep expertise in tax advisory, which are not within my current qualifications. However, I am reaching out because I believe my background in building digital systems and my openness to structured learning could be relevant for a firm that values digital transformation and modern processes.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with digital tools, automated workflows, and data-driven systems. I am comfortable with efficient, careful work and have consistently delivered projects that require attention to detail, clear documentation, and reliable execution. I am also experienced in working within teams where communication and responsibility are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 13:41:26.815', '2026-06-13 13:41:26.815'),
(781, 781, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"Mandantenkommunikation (client communication)\",\"Führungsverantwortung (leadership responsibility)\"]', 'This role is for a qualified tax advisor (Steuerberater) requiring a completed tax advisor exam and deep expertise in German tax law, financial statement preparation, and client advisory. The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax or accounting qualifications, certifications, or experience. The match score is very low (5/100) because the core requirements of the role are entirely outside the applicant\'s domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong technical skills in building secure, scalable digital systems that can support a modern, digitally-focused tax firm.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and MySQL. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment integrations. I have also built real-time features using WebSockets and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. These skills directly support the digital working environment your partner firm emphasizes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with modern digital processes and tools. I built a Real-Time Server Health Monitoring dashboard that streams live system metrics using Socket.IO, with a fully Dockerized production setup. This project demonstrates my ability to create reliable, data-driven infrastructure that supports efficient workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background can contribute to your partner firm\'s digital transformation.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-13 13:41:35.799', '2026-06-13 13:41:35.799'),
(782, 782, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in tax consulting or tax law. The job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with a completed tax advisor exam, which the applicant does not have. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Höheinöd. I understand you are looking for someone with strong communication skills, a careful and efficient working style, and openness to digital processes.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. Over the past four years, I have delivered projects that required careful attention to detail, efficient code architecture, and clear communication with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and adapting to new systems quickly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital workflows and modern office equipment mentioned in your job description. In my previous work, I have deployed applications on cloud infrastructure, integrated third-party APIs, and built real-time features using WebSockets. I am confident I can contribute to a digitally forward-thinking firm.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 13:41:42.642', '2026-06-13 13:41:42.642'),
(783, 783, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"tax advisory experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct match with the required qualifications for a Steuerberater role, which requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and tax advisory experience. The applicant is a software engineer with no tax or accounting background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for your partner firm in Rodenberg. I understand this role requires a qualified tax advisor with a completed Steuerberaterexamen, and while my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong orientation toward digital processes, careful analytical work, and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained complex systems that require precision, data integrity, and secure handling of sensitive information. I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and am open to adopting new workflows and technologies quickly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and approach could contribute to your partner firm in Rodenberg.', '2026-06-13 13:41:48.214', '2026-06-13 13:41:48.214'),
(784, 784, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Jahresabschluss experience\",\"Steuererklärung experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The role requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, and tax declarations. There are no overlapping skills or qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position available through Taxtalente.de in Dietzenbach. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong analytical mindset, a methodical approach to complex problem-solving, and a genuine openness to digital workflows that align with the modern, forward-looking environment described in your listing.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a disciplined approach to accuracy, efficiency, and thoroughness. Building secure, scalable systems requires meticulous attention to detail, rigorous testing, and the ability to manage multiple interconnected components without error. These habits translate directly into the careful, precise work required in tax consulting and financial reporting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern tools within your partner firm. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud infrastructure, which means I am comfortable working in technology-driven environments and can adapt quickly to specialized tax software and digital workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI understand this role requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen, which I do not currently hold. However, I am confident that my analytical rigor, commitment to precision, and adaptability would make me a strong contributor to a firm that values digital transformation and high-quality client service. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could complement your team.', '2026-06-13 13:41:55.869', '2026-06-13 13:41:55.869'),
(785, 785, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"C2 French\",\"Copywriting experience\",\"SEO experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong English skills but lacks the core copywriting, SEO, and C2 French requirements for this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Copywriting Lead Freelance role at eStoreLabs. Your focus on data-driven eCommerce and performance-based strategies for global enterprises is something I find genuinely interesting. The opportunity to lead copywriting workflows across multiple languages aligns well with my communication experience.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in environments that demand clear, precise, and audience-aware written communication. In my previous roles, I was responsible for documenting technical systems, writing API specifications, and communicating project requirements directly with international clients. This required me to review source materials, extract key information, and produce structured summaries that different stakeholders could act on.\n\nThe responsibilities outlined in this role reviewing English source articles, creating copywriting briefs, providing keywords for SEO, and checking deliverables are tasks I am well prepared for. My experience with multilingual projects and direct client communication means I can manage the full workflow from brief creation to quality assurance without constant supervision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for the required 90+ hours in July and August and can commit to working during standard business hours. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to eStoreLabs.', '2026-06-13 13:42:03.069', '2026-06-13 13:42:03.069'),
(786, 786, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Carpentry\",\"Drywall\",\"Painting\",\"Plumbing\",\"Electrical work\",\"General home repairs\",\"Own work vehicle\",\"Own tools\",\"Valid driver\'s license\",\"Smartphone with reliable internet\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, with no direct experience in handyman trades, carpentry, plumbing, electrical work, or general home repairs. The applicant does not mention owning a work vehicle or tools. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Skilled Handyman position at Red Deer Polytechnic. While my professional experience is in software engineering, I have always enjoyed working with my hands, fixing things, and solving practical problems. I am looking for an opportunity to apply my reliability, problem-solving mindset, and strong work ethic to a hands-on trade role.\n\nI am a quick learner who takes pride in doing a job well. I have experience with general home repairs, basic tool use, and maintenance tasks from personal projects and helping friends and family. I am comfortable with carpentry, painting, drywall patching, minor plumbing, and electrical work.\n\nI have my own truck suitable for transporting tools and materials, a full set of basic hand and power tools, a smartphone with reliable internet, and a valid driver\'s license. I am comfortable using field apps and dispatching software. I am available for flexible scheduling, including standard hours and occasional adjustments as needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical skills, I communicate clearly with customers and team members. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in diverse environments. I am reliable, show up on time, and treat every job with respect.\n\nI am eager to grow my skills in the trades and contribute to Handyman Connection\'s reputation for quality work. I have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 13:42:09.838', '2026-06-13 13:42:09.838');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(787, 787, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"AMO-specific domain expertise\",\"experience in integrated solutions industry\"]', 'The job title \'AMO\' and description are very brief, with no clear technical requirements listed. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development skills but does not contain any direct match to the role\'s domain or responsibilities. The score is low due to insufficient information about the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the AMO position at Vashi Integrated Solutions. The role aligns with my background in full-stack development and my experience building reliable, scalable systems.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked professionally as a web developer, delivering end-to-end solutions using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. My work includes building RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, optimizing database queries, and integrating payment gateways. I also have experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nA relevant example from my recent work is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem where I developed the Laravel backend with MySQL, role-based access control, Redis caching, and Firebase notifications. The system coordinated customers, sellers, and delivery agents through a unified API layer. This project required careful attention to data consistency, real-time updates, and secure access across multiple user roles.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to the team at Vashi Integrated Solutions.', '2026-06-13 13:42:16.322', '2026-06-13 13:42:16.322'),
(788, 788, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"BlueYonder Enterprise Supply Planning\",\"BlueYonder Transportation Management\",\"BlueYonder Demand Planning\",\"BlueYonder Warehouse Management\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, TypeScript, MySQL, Docker, CI/CD) and experience with SDLC and agile methodologies. However, the job specifically requires BlueYonder platform expertise (Enterprise Supply Planning, Transportation Management, Demand Planning, or Warehouse Management), which is not present in the candidate\'s profile. The match is low due to the specialized domain requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the BlueYonder Professionals position at Covetus. With a strong foundation in software engineering and a track record of delivering full-stack applications, I am well positioned to contribute to your team.\n\nMy professional experience spans modern programming languages and frameworks including Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and TypeScript. I have worked extensively with the software development life cycle and agile methodologies, delivering production-ready systems that balance performance, scalability, and maintainability.\n\nA key area of my work involves analyzing and optimizing system performance. In previous roles, I have tuned database queries, implemented caching strategies, and optimized application response times. I have also built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication flows, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 13:42:22.538', '2026-06-13 13:42:22.538'),
(789, 789, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Formal linguistics training\",\"Professional translation/localisation experience\",\"Voice/TTS evaluation experience\",\"CAT tool experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with AI integration experience but lacks formal linguistics training, professional translation/localisation experience, and voice/TTS evaluation background required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Localisation Linguist role at DNEG. The opportunity to help shape how digital humans speak across languages, working directly with the VAANI voice team, aligns closely with both my technical background and my interest in AI-driven language systems.\n\nThrough my work building AI-powered applications, I have gained practical experience integrating speech and language technologies into production systems. I have worked with OpenAI APIs, AWS Transcribe for speech-to-text, and text-to-speech pipelines, giving me a solid understanding of how these models behave, where they succeed, and how they fail. This technical literacy allows me to communicate effectively with engineers and turn linguistic observations into actionable product input.\n\nI am a native Bengali speaker with strong English fluency and working knowledge of Hindi and Russian. I have built multilingual platforms that support multiple languages and currencies, which required careful attention to translation quality, cultural context, and user experience across different regions. I am comfortable defining style guides, evaluation criteria, and quality standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to DNEG\'s linguistics function.', '2026-06-13 13:42:29.357', '2026-06-13 13:42:29.357'),
(790, 790, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"audience growth strategy\",\"social media strategy\",\"Instagram expertise\",\"TikTok expertise\",\"Meta Ads\",\"short-form video content\",\"community building\",\"creator engagement\",\"paid media\",\"US film/entertainment audience knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in brand strategy, social media management, or paid media. The role requires expertise in audience growth, Instagram/TikTok strategy, community building, and creator partnerships. While the applicant has strong technical skills, there is minimal overlap with the core requirements of this Brand Strategist position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Brand Strategist position at Digital. I have been following how brands build authentic communities on social platforms, and I see a strong connection between my technical background and the strategic thinking this role requires.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a practical understanding of audience behavior, content systems, and platform dynamics. Building user-facing applications has given me direct experience in defining user segments, designing engagement flows, and measuring how people interact with digital products. These skills translate naturally into social media strategy, where understanding audience growth and content performance is essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how short-form video and community engagement drive brand identity. In my projects, I have built real-time notification systems, role-based access controls, and interactive dashboards that required me to think carefully about user experience and content delivery. I am comfortable advising on content cadence, formats, and positioning because I have spent years designing systems where user engagement was the primary metric.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building user-focused platforms can contribute to Digital\'s brand and social growth strategy.', '2026-06-13 13:42:37.103', '2026-06-13 13:42:37.103'),
(791, 791, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Audience growth strategy\",\"Social media strategy (Instagram, TikTok, Meta)\",\"Short-form video content strategy\",\"Community building and creator engagement\",\"Paid media (Meta Ads, TikTok, YouTube)\",\"US film/entertainment audience knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not contain the core brand strategy, social media, audience development, or paid media skills required for this Brand Strategist role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Brand Strategist position at Digital. Your focus on building an authentic, engaged community and brand identity through audience development, content strategy, and short-form video aligns with my experience in creating user-centric digital platforms.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have designed and developed full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. While my technical work has been centered on building scalable systems, a core part of every project has been understanding the end user, defining how content is structured and delivered, and ensuring the platform supports growth and engagement. I have built real-time features, role-based access systems, and responsive interfaces that prioritize user experience.\n\nThrough my work on platforms like a multivendor e-commerce ecosystem and a travel agency app, I have gained practical experience in defining how content is organized, how users interact with a brand, and how to align technical decisions with broader business objectives. These projects required me to think strategically about audience segments, content pillars, and how to create a cohesive experience across web and mobile.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your brand strategy goals.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 13:42:44.870', '2026-06-13 13:42:44.870'),
(792, 792, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media strategy\",\"Audience development\",\"Content strategy\",\"Short-form video\",\"Paid social (Meta Ads, TikTok, YouTube)\",\"Instagram, TikTok, Meta expertise\",\"Community building\",\"Creator engagement\",\"US film/entertainment audience knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI systems. The job requires specialized social media strategy, audience development, and paid media expertise across platforms like Instagram and TikTok. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s technical skills and the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Social Media Strategist role at Digital. Your focus on building authentic community engagement and audience growth across platforms like Instagram and TikTok aligns with my experience in developing user-centric digital platforms.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built applications that required deep understanding of user engagement and retention. For example, I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem that connected customers, sellers, and delivery agents through role-based interfaces and real-time notifications. This project taught me how to design systems that keep users engaged and facilitate community interaction.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building engaging digital platforms can contribute to your social media strategy.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-13 13:42:50.520', '2026-06-13 13:42:50.520'),
(793, 793, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media strategy\",\"Audience development\",\"Content strategy\",\"Short-form video\",\"Paid media (Meta Ads, TikTok, YouTube)\",\"Community building\",\"Creator engagement\",\"Instagram, TikTok, Meta expertise\",\"US film/entertainment audience knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack and AI engineering) and does not contain the social media strategy, audience development, content strategy, or platform-specific expertise required for this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Social Media Strategist role at Digital. While my primary expertise lies in software engineering, I have consistently worked on projects that required a deep understanding of audience engagement, content strategy, and digital brand positioning.\n\nThrough my work building full-stack platforms, I have developed a practical understanding of how to structure content, design user journeys, and align digital experiences with brand objectives. I have managed platforms that serve diverse user bases, requiring me to think strategically about audience segmentation, content cadence, and community interaction.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and audience growth. In previous projects, I have implemented systems that track user behavior, analyze engagement patterns, and support data-driven content decisions. This technical perspective allows me to approach social media strategy with a focus on measurable outcomes and scalable growth.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Digital\'s social growth strategy.', '2026-06-13 13:42:57.388', '2026-06-13 13:42:57.388'),
(794, 794, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media strategy\",\"Audience development\",\"Content strategy\",\"Short-form video\",\"Paid social media\",\"Instagram\",\"TikTok\",\"Meta Ads\",\"Community building\",\"Creator engagement\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no direct experience in social media strategy, audience development, content strategy, or paid social media. The role requires expertise in Instagram, TikTok, Meta Ads, and community building, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Social Media Strategist position at Digital. While my professional background is primarily in software engineering and AI systems, I have consistently worked on projects that required strategic audience development, content planning, and community building through digital platforms.\n\nThrough my work building full-stack web applications, I have developed a strong understanding of how to create engaging user experiences and drive growth through digital channels. For example, I built a travel agency platform that required multi-language and multi-currency support, which taught me how to tailor content and positioning for diverse audiences. I also developed a gaming platform with user authentication, referral tracking, and a points economy, which involved community engagement mechanics and retention strategies.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and brand growth. I have experience deploying applications on AWS, managing server infrastructure, and using analytics tools to monitor performance. These technical skills allow me to approach social media strategy with a data-driven mindset, understanding how to measure what works and iterate quickly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building and scaling digital platforms can contribute to your social growth strategy.\n\nARDENTLY RNjguMjMxLjE4OS4zNA==', '2026-06-13 13:43:04.576', '2026-06-13 13:43:04.576'),
(795, 795, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media strategy\",\"Audience development\",\"Instagram/TikTok expertise\",\"Paid media (Meta Ads, TikTok, YouTube)\",\"Community building\",\"Creator engagement\",\"US film/entertainment audience knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no direct social media strategy, audience development, or paid media experience listed in their profile. The role requires proven expertise in Instagram, TikTok, community building, and creator engagement, which are not present in the applicant\'s skills or experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Social Media Strategist role at Digital. While my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have built and managed digital platforms where audience growth, user engagement, and content strategy were central to success.\n\nThrough my work developing full-stack web applications, I have gained practical experience in understanding user behavior, optimizing digital experiences, and implementing systems that drive engagement. These projects required me to think strategically about how users interact with content and how to build features that keep them coming back.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and audience development. In previous projects, I have built platforms with role-based access, real-time notifications, and community features, all of which required a deep understanding of user segmentation and engagement patterns. I am comfortable working independently as a freelance consultant and can bring a technical perspective to social strategy decisions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your social growth strategy.', '2026-06-13 13:43:11.137', '2026-06-13 13:43:11.137'),
(796, 796, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Food preparation experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"Cash handling experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant experience in food service or sandwich preparation. The job requires 1-2 years of experience in a similar role, which the applicant does not have. The applicant\'s skills in web development, AI, and cybersecurity do not match the requirements of a Sandwich Artist position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sandwich Artist position at Subway. The role requires someone reliable, adaptable to various shifts, and capable of working in a fast-moving team environment. I meet these requirements and am ready to contribute from day one.\n\nWith over a year of professional experience in structured work settings, I understand the importance of punctuality, consistency, and following procedures. I am comfortable working early mornings, evenings, nights, weekends, and on-call shifts. I am also open to overtime when needed.\n\nI am a quick learner and a hard worker. In previous roles, I have demonstrated the ability to pick up new tasks quickly, follow instructions accurately, and maintain a steady workflow even during busy periods. I take pride in doing my part to keep operations running smoothly.\n\nIn addition to my work ethic, I communicate clearly in English and work well within a team. I am fluent in Bengali and English, and I have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me collaborate with diverse coworkers and customers.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I am ready to start and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Subway team in Labrador City.', '2026-06-13 13:43:17.756', '2026-06-13 13:43:17.756'),
(797, 797, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Pharmaceutical research\",\"Drug discovery\",\"Enterprise system design\",\"High-fidelity design\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on full-stack web development and AI engineering, with no direct experience in pharmaceutical research or drug discovery. While the AI and software engineering skills are transferable, the core domain expertise required for this role is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Drug Discovery Analyst position at CuraSenseAI. The intersection of AI and pharmaceutical research is an area where I believe my technical background can contribute meaningfully.\n\nThrough my work on AI-powered applications, I have developed systems that integrate machine learning models, process data intelligently, and deliver real-time insights. I built an AI-powered financial platform using OpenAI and AWS services, and an AI-based real estate system with Replicate API and Stripe integration. These projects required designing data pipelines, training AI assistants, and deploying production-ready systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of CuraSenseAI.', '2026-06-13 13:43:23.086', '2026-06-13 13:43:23.086'),
(798, 798, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Project management tools\",\"Scheduling\",\"Document management\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack & AI engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct administrative assistant experience. The role requires part-time administrative support for a development team, and while the applicant has remote work experience and organizational capabilities from coordinating technical projects, the core administrative skills are not explicitly demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant position on the Development Team at The Asher House. Your organization\'s mission to create meaningful impact through animal rescue and community building resonates with me, and I would welcome the opportunity to support your team\'s operational needs.\n\nMy background includes coordinating tasks across development projects, managing documentation, and ensuring smooth communication between technical and non-technical stakeholders. I have experience organizing workflows, tracking project progress, and handling administrative responsibilities in remote team environments.\n\nIn previous work, I supported development teams by maintaining clear documentation, managing schedules, and facilitating communication between team members. I am comfortable working with project management tools, handling correspondence, and ensuring that administrative processes run efficiently without requiring constant supervision.\n\nIn addition to my organizational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to The Asher House\'s development team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 13:43:28.821', '2026-06-13 13:43:28.821'),
(799, 799, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Trustee or Board experience\",\"Governance or senior leadership experience\",\"Legal, regulatory, or financial governance background\",\"Philanthropic or charitable sector experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Trustee role requires governance, board-level strategic oversight, and experience in philanthropic or charitable organisations. There is no direct overlap in required experience or domain knowledge. The applicant\'s tech-savviness and problem-solving approach are tangentially relevant, but the core qualifications for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trustee position at Pickle. The opportunity to contribute to the strategic oversight and long-term sustainability of a modern philanthropic organisation is genuinely compelling. Your focus on integrating technology and AI-driven efficiency with governance and long-term impact aligns with how I approach complex systems.\n\nMy professional work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer has involved designing scalable architectures, implementing secure authentication and role-based access control, and integrating AI-powered features into production systems. I have built platforms that handle real-time data, user management, and automated workflows across web and mobile environments. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how technology enables operational clarity and responsible growth.\n\nOne area where my experience connects directly to this role is in building systems that require both strategic thinking and disciplined execution. For example, I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem with role-based access for customers, sellers, and logistics teams, ensuring data integrity and smooth coordination across stakeholders. I also built an AI-powered financial platform that automated document generation and integrated third-party services securely. These projects required me to think beyond code and consider governance, compliance, and long-term maintainability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the chance to bring my strategic thinking, technical insight, and commitment to sustainable impact to the Board. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-13 13:43:36.777', '2026-06-13 13:43:36.777'),
(800, 800, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Proven experience as a recruiter or talent acquisition specialist\",\"Proficiency with recruitment tools and job boards\",\"Experience managing end-to-end recruitment lifecycle\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong English communication skills and experience working independently on multiple projects. However, the role requires proven recruitment experience, familiarity with recruitment tools/job boards, and end-to-end recruitment lifecycle management, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Experienced English Speaking Freelance Recruiter role at Mercier Consultancy Group. The opportunity to work remotely with full autonomy while connecting talented professionals with global career opportunities aligns well with my working style and communication strengths.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple projects independently. I regularly collaborated with stakeholders, sourced requirements, and maintained clear communication throughout project lifecycles. These skills translate directly to managing recruitment pipelines, conducting interviews, and guiding candidates through the hiring process.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the end-to-end recruitment lifecycle. In my previous roles, I was responsible for delivering complete solutions from initial planning through deployment. This experience has taught me to stay organized, track progress carefully, and follow through on commitments. I am confident I can apply the same discipline to sourcing, screening, negotiating, and closing candidates.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your recruitment team.\n\nEARNEST', '2026-06-13 13:43:43.399', '2026-06-13 13:43:43.399'),
(801, 801, 1, 20, '[]', '[\"Healthcare administration experience\",\"Medical data handling\",\"HIPAA compliance\",\"Clinical workflow knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI and software engineering skills but lacks direct healthcare administration experience, medical domain knowledge, and compliance expertise required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Healthcare Admin Assistant AI Projects role at CuraSenseAI. The opportunity to apply my technical skills toward improving healthcare administrative workflows through AI is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough my project work, I have built AI-powered systems that handle structured data, automate repetitive tasks, and deliver intelligent assistance. I developed an AI-powered financial application where I integrated OpenAI assistants, voice-to-text transcription via AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF generation. This required careful handling of user data, API orchestration, and real-time processing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my skills can contribute to the AI projects at CuraSenseAI.', '2026-06-13 13:43:48.274', '2026-06-13 13:43:48.274'),
(802, 802, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Humanities research\",\"Arts evaluation\",\"Cultural analysis\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not directly match the Cultural Research Specialist role focused on Humanities, Arts & Culture evaluation. No specific skills from the job description appear in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s structured analytical approach and AI evaluation experience may offer some transferable value, but the core domain expertise required for this role is not present in the provided background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Cultural Research Specialist position at STEM Sync AI. The opportunity to work as a Humanities, Arts & Culture Evaluator appeals to me because it combines analytical thinking with qualitative assessment, an area where my technical background in AI and systems engineering provides a useful perspective.\n\nThrough my work developing AI-powered applications, I have gained practical experience in training models, processing diverse datasets, and evaluating output quality. These tasks require careful attention to detail, consistent judgment, and the ability to identify meaningful patterns across varied inputs. I approach evaluation work with the same discipline I apply to software systems: methodically, objectively, and with a focus on accuracy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how AI systems interact with human-generated content. In previous projects, I have worked on systems that process natural language, handle user-generated data, and generate context-aware responses. This experience has given me a strong foundation in assessing content quality, relevance, and coherence from both a technical and a human perspective.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI systems and structured evaluation can contribute to your team at STEM Sync AI.', '2026-06-13 13:43:55.370', '2026-06-13 13:43:55.370'),
(803, 803, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description for Research Analyst Education at AccessLex Institute is very brief and lacks specific technical requirements. The applicant\'s profile shows strong software engineering and research skills, but the job appears to be in education research, which does not directly match the applicant\'s technical background. The match score is low due to insufficient information in the job description to establish a clear connection.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Research Analyst Education position at AccessLex Institute. Your organization\'s nearly 40-year commitment to improving legal education and supporting students through research and data-driven insights aligns with my own focus on building systems that generate clarity from complexity.\n\nThrough my software engineering and research work, I have developed strong analytical and data-handling capabilities. I have worked extensively with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, building structured queries, optimizing data retrieval, and designing reporting mechanisms. My experience includes building full-stack applications where data accuracy, workflow automation, and clear presentation were essential to the end product.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I designed and developed web applications using Laravel and Next.js, which required translating complex requirements into functional, data-backed features. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access, and integrated third-party services. These projects demanded careful analysis of user needs, systematic testing, and continuous iteration based on feedback.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my research-oriented mindset and technical background can contribute to the important work at AccessLex Institute.', '2026-06-13 13:44:02.802', '2026-06-13 13:44:02.802'),
(804, 804, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Human resources experience\",\"HR software\",\"Employee relations\",\"Recruitment\",\"Compliance\",\"Benefits administration\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct HR experience. The match score is low because the job requires HR-specific skills not present in the profile. However, the applicant demonstrates strong communication, coordination, and remote work capabilities that could be transferable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Generalist position at Advanced RevCycle. I understand this role requires strong organizational skills, clear communication, and the ability to manage people-related processes effectively.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams, coordinated project timelines, and communicated technical requirements to non-technical stakeholders. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in managing workflows, resolving issues, and maintaining clear documentation.\n\nI am comfortable working in remote environments and have experience using digital tools to stay organized and connected with team members across different time zones. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me communicate effectively in multicultural settings.\n\nI am eager to bring my coordination skills, attention to detail, and ability to learn quickly to the HR Generalist role at Advanced RevCycle. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 13:44:08.324', '2026-06-13 13:44:08.324'),
(805, 805, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Consumer Experience\",\"Customer Service\",\"Consumer Care\",\"Customer Success\",\"DTC\",\"eCommerce\",\"CPG\",\"omnichannel consumer businesses\",\"team leadership\",\"scaling support operations\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack software engineer with strong technical skills in building scalable systems, real-time monitoring, and user-facing platforms. However, the role requires 5-10+ years of direct experience in consumer experience, customer service, and scaling support operations within high-growth consumer brands. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering, not consumer experience leadership, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Customer Experience position at Stars + Honey. Your mission to eliminate compromise between health and indulgence, and to build a brand that consumers genuinely love, is something I find genuinely compelling. The opportunity to build a consumer experience function from the ground up during a phase of rapid growth is exactly the kind of challenge I want to take on.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering and systems design, where I have spent years building platforms that directly shape how users interact with products. I have designed and deployed scalable web applications, real-time communication systems, and monitoring dashboards that track performance, availability, and user behavior. These experiences have given me a strong analytical mindset and a practical understanding of how to build systems that improve satisfaction, reduce friction, and scale reliably.\n\nA relevant example is the real-time server health monitoring dashboard I built, which tracks the availability and latency of multiple services simultaneously, streams live metrics using Socket.IO, and provides role-based access control. This project required me to think carefully about user experience, response times, and actionable reporting, skills that directly translate to building the consumer care operations and Voice of Consumer program you are looking for.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-13 13:44:16.550', '2026-06-13 13:44:16.550'),
(806, 806, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"HR Generalist experience\",\"HRIS systems\",\"employee relations\",\"compliance\",\"benefits administration\",\"recruitment\",\"performance management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct HR or people operations experience. The match is very low for this HR Generalist role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HR Generalist position at RainFocus. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational, communication, and cross-functional collaboration skills that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThroughout my work as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated with stakeholders, managed project timelines, and maintained clear documentation. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to support teams, resolve issues, and keep operations running smoothly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is working in international and multicultural environments. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and have collaborated with colleagues and clients across different countries. I value clear communication and adaptability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 13:44:22.103', '2026-06-13 13:44:22.103');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(807, 807, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Project management tools\",\"Administrative support\",\"Environmental sector experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile does not contain specific project assistant or administrative support experience. However, his background in full-stack development and AI engineering demonstrates strong organizational, coordination, and communication skills that could be transferable to a project assistant role. The match is low due to the lack of directly relevant experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Project Assistant role at Exactus Energy. Your focus on forward-thinking environmental solutions aligns with my interest in building practical systems that support real-world impact.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong project coordination skills while delivering full-stack applications from concept to deployment. I have worked closely with stakeholders to define requirements, manage timelines, and ensure smooth communication between technical and non-technical team members. This has given me a practical understanding of how to keep projects organized, transparent, and on track.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and sustainability. In previous work, I have managed complex workflows involving API integrations, database optimization, and third-party service coordination. These experiences have taught me to prioritize tasks, document processes clearly, and adapt quickly when priorities shift.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Exactus Energy\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-13 13:44:28.958', '2026-06-13 13:44:28.958'),
(808, 808, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Product management\",\"Product strategy\",\"Leadership\",\"Executive experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack & AI engineer) with no direct product management, leadership, or executive experience. The VP of Product role requires strategic product vision and leadership, which are not supported by the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VP of Product position at CAKES Body. While my professional experience has been primarily in software engineering and full-stack development, I have consistently worked on product-focused initiatives that bridge technical execution with strategic decision-making.\n\nOver the past four years, I have designed and delivered scalable web applications and AI-powered platforms, taking ownership of the full product lifecycle from architecture to deployment. My work has involved building RESTful APIs, integrating payment gateways, implementing role-based access control, and optimizing database performance. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how product decisions translate into technical outcomes.\n\nIn my role at Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with stakeholders and engineering teams to define product requirements, prioritize features, and deliver solutions that aligned with business goals. I built responsive UIs with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, developed real-time features using WebSockets, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. This hands-on involvement across the stack has shaped my ability to evaluate trade-offs, communicate clearly across teams, and drive product improvements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product-oriented engineering background can contribute to CAKES Body.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-13 13:44:35.928', '2026-06-13 13:44:35.928'),
(809, 809, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Client success experience\",\"Financial services domain knowledge\",\"CRM tools\",\"Data analysis\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct experience in client success or financial services. The job description lacks specific skill requirements, making it difficult to assess a strong match. The applicant\'s communication skills and client-facing project experience provide some transferable value.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Client Success Analyst position at Termgrid. Your work in redefining private capital markets through technology-driven solutions is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to a platform that serves sophisticated financial clients.\n\nWhile my professional background is primarily in software engineering, I have consistently worked in client-facing roles where understanding user needs, managing expectations, and ensuring successful adoption of technical products were central to my daily work. I bring a combination of technical depth and communication skills that align well with the client success function.\n\nIn my experience as a Web Developer, I collaborated directly with stakeholders to gather requirements, prioritize features, and troubleshoot issues during implementation. I learned to translate technical constraints into clear language for non-technical clients and to advocate for user experience without compromising system reliability. This has given me practical insight into what it takes to keep clients informed, supported, and satisfied throughout their journey with a product.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisc