(810, 810, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"German language fluency\",\"Resident in Germany for 5 consecutive years\",\"Quality assurance experience\",\"Content moderation experience\",\"Data annotation experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and research skills, but does not meet the core requirements for this role: German language fluency and residency in Germany for the last 5 consecutive years. The role requires a freelancer based in Germany with excellent German communication skills, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Quality Assurance Rater - German (Germany) position at TELUS Digital. The opportunity to contribute to high-quality validation data that directly influences search engines and AI technologies aligns well with my background in software engineering and AI systems.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have developed strong analytical and research capabilities. I regularly evaluate system outputs, verify information accuracy, and apply consistent quality standards across complex projects. My experience building AI-powered applications has given me a practical understanding of how data quality impacts model performance and search relevance.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the evaluation of AI-generated content and search results. In my project work, I have trained AI assistants and integrated models into production systems, which required careful assessment of output quality, relevance, and accuracy. This has given me a solid foundation for the rating and feedback responsibilities described in this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team and completing the project-specific training and qualification assessments.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-13 13:44:52.517', '2026-06-13 13:44:52.517'),
(811, 811, 1, 35, '[\"Python\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"NumPy\",\"Pandas\",\"4+ years commercial Data Scientist experience\",\"3+ years NumPy/Pandas\",\"3+ years Python\",\"GCP\",\"Azure\",\"Data Science commercial experience\"]', 'The applicant has Python and AWS skills that partially match the job requirements, but lacks the required commercial Data Scientist experience, NumPy/Pandas expertise, and dedicated data science background. The profile is stronger in full-stack web development and AI engineering rather than data science.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Scientist role at Lemon.io. Your model of connecting senior engineers directly with US and European startups aligns well with how I prefer to work: independently, with clear communication, and without unnecessary overhead.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built AI-powered systems that combine Python, computer vision, and cloud infrastructure. One project involved developing a real-time object detection pipeline using YOLOv8n, optimized for edge deployment on low-cost hardware. I handled everything from model selection and training to building a custom UDP streaming protocol for ultra-low latency inference. This required strong Python skills, practical experience with data processing, and the ability to architect a complete system from scratch.\n\nOn the cloud side, I have used AWS extensively across multiple projects. For an AI-powered financial application, I built the backend using Express and TypeScript, integrated OpenAI APIs, and deployed on AWS EC2 with services like SES, S3, and Transcribe. I am comfortable designing scalable architectures, managing deployments, and making technical decisions that balance performance with maintainability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background fits your current needs.', '2026-06-13 13:44:59.754', '2026-06-13 13:44:59.754'),
