(813, 813, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Windows Server Administration\",\"Microsoft 365 / Office 365\",\"HyperV\",\"VMware\",\"Networking (Firewalls, Routing, VPN, WLAN)\",\"Hardware Knowledge\",\"Client Support\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, and cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud) which partially overlap with system administration. However, the role requires deep expertise in Windows Server, Microsoft 365, HyperV/VMware virtualization, and networking (firewalls, routing, VPN) which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low for this specific system integration role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fachinformatiker Systemintegration / Systemadministrator position at IT Fabrik Systemhaus GmbH u. Co.KG. Your focus on delivering reliable IT infrastructure and customer-oriented solutions in the Hamburg region matches my own approach to building and maintaining stable systems.\n\nMy technical foundation includes hands-on work with Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and web server configuration using Nginx and Apache. I have practical experience deploying applications on AWS and Google Cloud, and I am comfortable managing virtualized environments and setting up CI/CD pipelines. These skills directly support the responsibilities of configuring Windows servers, managing virtual systems, and building customer networks that your role requires.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have deployed and maintained production applications on Linux servers, implemented monitoring solutions using Prometheus and Grafana, and handled server maintenance tasks. I have worked independently on IT projects, from initial setup through ongoing support, and I am comfortable communicating with clients to understand their needs and deliver reliable solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to your team in Hamburg.', '2026-06-14 01:40:09.304', '2026-06-14 01:40:09.304'),
(814, 814, 1, 15, '[\"React\",\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Key Account Management experience\",\"Sales or Customer Success experience\",\"German native or fluent proficiency\",\"Expertise in Excel/Google Sheets\",\"Experience in the padel industry\",\"HubSpot experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this Partner Success role, which demands 2-4 years of Key Account Management, Sales, or Customer Success experience, German fluency, and expertise in Excel/Google Sheets. The applicant has no direct experience in these areas. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Partner Success Specialist Central European Market position at Playtomic. As the world\'s largest racket sports platform, Playtomic is transforming how players connect and clubs operate, and I am keen to contribute to this mission in the German market.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong client-facing and operational skills through years of cross-functional collaboration. In my role as a Web Developer, I worked directly with stakeholders to understand their needs, communicate technical solutions clearly, and ensure timely delivery. This experience has made me comfortable with business reviews, proactive communication, and building long-term relationships.\n\nI am a data-driven problem solver. In previous projects, I regularly analyzed performance metrics, identified bottlenecks, and implemented improvements. I am proficient with Excel and Google Sheets and can quickly adapt to tools like HubSpot. My ability to break down complex information and present actionable insights will help me support partner clubs effectively.\n\nI am fluent in English and have working knowledge of German. I am based in Germany and fully prepared to travel up to 15% for face-to-face meetings. As a racket sports enthusiast with knowledge of the padel industry, I understand the culture and needs of sports clubs. I am organized, detail-oriented, and comfortable working in a high-growth environment.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in communication, analysis, and relationship management can contribute to Playtomic\'s growth in the Central European market.', '2026-06-14 01:40:16.787', '2026-06-14 01:40:16.787'),
(815, 815, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Studium im technischen Umfeld oder Meisterschule\",\"Berufserfahrung in Tief- und Leitungsbauprojekten\",\"Kenntnisse im Bereich HDD-Spülbohrverfahren\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Baustelleneinsatz im Bundesgebiet\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, which does not match the civil engineering and cable construction project management requirements of this role. There are no overlapping technical skills or relevant experience in trenching, cable laying, or construction project management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter im Bereich Kabelleitungsbau position at ONT Oberhausener Nachrichtentechnik GmbH. Your company\'s focus on communication technology and system integration across telecommunications, energy, and industrial sectors aligns with my technical background and project management experience.\n\nWhile my core expertise is in software engineering and system architecture, I have consistently taken on project leadership responsibilities in my professional work. Over the past four years, I have planned, coordinated, and delivered full-stack web applications and integrated systems, managing timelines, resources, and cross-functional communication from concept to deployment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of complex technical projects involving multiple stakeholders and subcontractors. In my previous roles, I acted as the primary technical contact for clients, managed development workflows, ensured quality and deadline compliance, and maintained clear documentation throughout the project lifecycle. These responsibilities closely mirror the project steering, resource planning, and subcontractor coordination described in your job posting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical background can contribute to ONT\'s continued success.', '2026-06-14 01:40:23.468', '2026-06-14 01:40:23.468'),
(816, 816, 1, 72, '[\"React\",\"Typescript\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Firebase\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Next JS\",\"REST APIs\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Supabase\",\"Stripe\",\"Resend/SendGrid\",\"Lovable\",\"Claude Code\",\"Vercel deployment\"]', 'Starke Übereinstimmung bei React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, SQL-Datenbanken und Git. Erfahrung mit Firebase ist ein Vorteil für die Einarbeitung in Supabase. Offenheit für KI-Tools ist vorhanden. Keine direkte Erfahrung mit Supabase, Stripe oder Lovable/Claude Code, aber Bereitschaft zur schnellen Einarbeitung ist gegeben. Wohnsitz in Deutschland und Deutschkenntnisse sind vorhanden.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'Sehr geehrtes Team von uNaice GmbH,\n\niPioniere im Bereich automatisierter Contentproduktion und Datenaufbereitung zu unterstützen – das ist genau die Art von Herausforderung, die mich reizt. Ihre Arbeit mit Kunden wie adidas und TUI zeigt, wie wertvoll durchdachte Automatisierung in der Praxis ist. Für die Position als Junior Full-Stack Developer bringe ich praktische Erfahrung in React, TypeScript und moderner Webentwicklung mit.\n\nIn meiner beruflichen Laufbahn als Web Developer habe ich umfassend mit React und TypeScript gearbeitet – von Komponenten und Props über State-Management mit Hooks bis hin zur Fehlerbehebung im Compiler. Ich habe REST-APIs entwickelt, SQL-Datenbanken wie MySQL und PostgreSQL modelliert und responsive Oberflächen mit Tailwind CSS umgesetzt. Der Umgang mit Git, Branching und Pull Requests ist für mich Alltag.\n\nEin Bereich, der mich besonders anspricht, ist Ihre Offenheit für KI-Tools wie Lovable und Claude Code. Ich habe in Projekten bereits mit KI-APIs gearbeitet und bin überzeugt, dass solche Werkzeuge die Entwicklung beschleunigen, wenn man sie richtig einsetzt. Meine Erfahrung mit Firebase erleichtert mir zudem die schnelle Einarbeitung in Supabase und dessen Konzepte wie Row Level Security und Echtzeit-Subscriptions.\n\nNeben meiner technischen Arbeit kommuniziere ich klar im Team und mit Stakeholdern. Ich spreche fließend Deutsch und Englisch, habe Grundkenntnisse in Russisch und Hindi und arbeite gern in internationalen Umgebungen. Eigenverantwortliches Arbeiten und wöchentliche Abstimmungen sind für mich selbstverständlich.\n\nMeinen Lebenslauf habe ich beigefügt. Ich freue mich darauf, in einem Gespräch mehr über Ihre aktuellen Projekte zu erfahren.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-14 01:40:33.416', '2026-06-14 01:40:33.416'),
(817, 817, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"GraphQL\",\"API\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"ServiceNow\",\"CSDM\",\"CMDB\",\"SPM\",\"Service Catalogue\",\"ADOIT\",\"Archer\",\"OneTrust\",\"Data Governance\",\"CDE\"]', 'The applicant has strong backend and API development skills with MySQL, PostgreSQL, GraphQL, and Docker, which are relevant to data modeling and integration aspects of the role. However, the applicant lacks direct ServiceNow platform expertise, including CSDM, CMDB, SPM, and Service Catalogue knowledge, which are core requirements for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior ServiceNow Technical Consultant role at Wavestone Germany AG. The position involves leading architectural discussions, designing data models, and implementing cross-system integrations for a global financial services provider. This aligns with my experience in building scalable systems and working with complex data structures.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange between frontend and backend systems. I have also implemented authentication, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways, which required careful data modeling and referential integrity across multiple modules.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on data modeling, service data mapping, and ensuring end-to-end data consistency. In previous projects, I have worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL, designing database schemas, optimizing queries, and enforcing data integrity. I have also used GraphQL for flexible API design and Redis for caching strategies to improve performance. These experiences support the ability to translate logical enterprise data models into physical implementations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the success of this program. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-14 01:40:40.349', '2026-06-14 01:40:40.349'),
(818, 818, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Brand management experience\",\"Social media marketing\",\"TV and OOH campaign experience\",\"TikTok UGC engine experience\",\"German language fluency\",\"Copywriting and content creation\",\"Influencer and creator management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no brand management, marketing, or social media experience. The role requires 3+ years of brand building, narrative creation, TV and social channel ownership, and German fluency. The applicant\'s profile does not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Brand Manager role at Joy_. What you have built with your Universal Purchasing Infrastructure is genuinely impressive, and the opportunity to shape the narrative around a product that redefines a 20 billion euro market is rare.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, but I have spent years building products from scratch and owning how they are communicated to the world. I understand the gap between what technology does and how people perceive it. At Joy_, the technology is done, and the story is what will make it land. I know how to bridge that gap.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I was responsible for the full lifecycle of product delivery, from backend architecture to frontend experience. I worked directly with stakeholders to translate technical capabilities into clear, user-facing value. I have shipped features that required making complex systems feel simple and intuitive, which is exactly the challenge of making a \"too good to be true\" gift card believable.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the blend of data fluency and creative ins