(819, 819, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Performance Marketing\",\"Amazon Ads\",\"E-commerce marketplace management\",\"Keyword-optimized product text creation\",\"Excel data analysis\",\"German language (C1 level)\",\"Marketing or business degree\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and data-driven skills, but the role requires specific performance marketing, Amazon Ads, and e-commerce marketplace experience. The applicant lacks the required German language proficiency (C1) and a marketing/business degree. The match is low, though the applicant\'s analytical mindset and startup-friendly attitude could be relevant if the company is open to training.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Performance Marketing Manager Amazon (m/w/d) position at BonaTea GmbH. Your journey from a shared apartment in 2021 to becoming a top seller on Amazon is impressive, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your next growth phase.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong analytical and data-driven approach that directly supports the responsibilities of this role. My work building full-stack web applications has required me to constantly analyze performance metrics, optimize system efficiency, and make decisions based on quantitative data. I am comfortable working with numbers, identifying patterns, and translating insights into actionable improvements.\n\nIn previous work, I have developed and maintained complex systems involving user authentication, payment integrations, and real-time data processing. These projects demanded structured, data-driven thinking and the ability to optimize for performance under real-world conditions. I