(821, 821, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Microsoft Office Suite\",\"Calendar management\",\"Customer service\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no administrative or office support experience listed in the profile. The role requires organizational skills, calendar management, and office software proficiency, which are not present in the applicant\'s skills or experience. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant position at Aramco. Your emphasis on creating a supportive, organized environment where people can do their best work aligns with how I approach my own professional contributions.\n\nThrough my experience as a web developer, I have developed strong organizational discipline, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously. Coordinating project timelines, maintaining documentation, and communicating clearly with stakeholders have been central to my daily work. These skills translate directly into the administrative support this role requires.\n\nI am comfortable handling data entry, preparing documents, and ensuring information remains accurate and up to date. I have experience working independently on complex tasks while also collaborating effectively within teams. I take pride in being reliable, respectful, and proactive in supporting those around me.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-14 01:41:08.367', '2026-06-14 01:41:08.367'),
(822, 822, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Microsoft Office Suite proficiency\",\"Customer service experience\",\"Calendar management experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Administrative Assistant role requires office support, calendar management, customer service, and Microsoft Office proficiency. There is minimal direct overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant position at Aramco. Your description of an organized, dependable, and people-focused professional who supports daily operations and creates a positive environment aligns with how I approach my work.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, the core of my daily work has always been administrative in nature. Over the past four years, I have managed project timelines, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, maintained detailed documentation, scheduled meetings, and ensured that communication between technical and non-technical team members remained clear and efficient. These responsibilities have given me strong organizational habits and a practical understanding of what it takes to keep operations running smoothly.\n\nA relevant example is my work on the Travel Agency App project, where I coordinated frontend and backend development, managed task priorities across the team, maintained project documentation, and communicated directly with the client to ensure requirements were met on schedule. This required careful calendar management, clear reporting, and consistent follow-through on action items.\n\nIn addition to my organizational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-14 01:41:15.101', '2026-06-14 01:41:15.101'),
(823, 823, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Microsoft Office Suite\",\"Calendar management\",\"Customer service\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and web development, which does not directly match the administrative support, office management, and customer service focus of this role. No direct administrative or office support experience is present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant position at Aramco. Your description of an organized, dependable, and people-focused professional who supports daily operations and creates a positive environment aligns with how I approach my work.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have been responsible for coordinating with team members, managing project documentation, maintaining accurate records, and ensuring that communication flows clearly between technical and non-technical stakeholders. These responsibilities have built a strong foundation in organization, attention to detail, and reliability.\n\nI am comfortable managing multiple priorities, handling data entry tasks, and supporting managers and colleagues to keep operations running smoothly. I take pride in creating structure out of complexity and ensuring that nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Aramco team.', '2026-06-14 01:41:20.683', '2026-06-14 01:41:20.683'),
(824, 824, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative support experience\",\"Microsoft Office Suite proficiency\",\"Calendar management\",\"Customer service experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Administrative Assistant role requires office support, calendar management, and customer service experience which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant position at Aramco. Your description of an organized, dependable, and people-focused professional who supports daily operations and creates a positive environment aligns with how I approach my work.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational and time-management skills by coordinating project timelines, maintaining documentation, and communicating clearly with team members and stakeholders. I am comfortable managing multiple priorities and ensuring that details are handled accurately.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is supporting teams behind the scenes. In my previous roles, I regularly prepared reports, organized files, and assisted with scheduling and data entry. I take pride in keeping systems running smoothly so that others can focus on their core responsibilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-14 01:41:26.216', '2026-06-14 01:41:26.216'),
(825, 825, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"SEO strategy\",\"Content writing\",\"Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)\",\"Brand storytelling\",\"Edtech content experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and communication skills but lacks direct SEO content writing experience, SEO strategy knowledge, and edtech content background required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SEO Content Writer role at Inspira Education. Your mission to democratize access to high-quality coaching and your work across Inspira Advantage, Quad Education, and Juris Education is genuinely interesting. I appreciate how you combine software, services, and content to create equal opportunities for students worldwide.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have consistently worked at the intersection of technology and content. Over the past four years, I have built full-stack web applications where I was responsible not only for development but also for crafting clear, user-facing content. This included writing SEO-optimized landing pages, product descriptions, help documentation, and marketing copy for platforms in travel, real estate, and finance.\n\nOne area where I have direct experience is creating content that performs well in both traditional search engines and generative AI platforms. While developing the Travel Agency App and the AI-powered Real Estate platform, I wrote structured content that improved discoverability and user engagement. I also worked closely with subject matter experts and stakeholders to ensure accuracy and brand consistency across all written materials.\n\nIn addition to my technical and content experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-14 01:41:32.940', '2026-06-14 01:41:32.940');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(826, 826, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Pet industry experience\",\"Gladly or similar platform experience\",\"Bachelor\'s degree\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong communication and problem-solving skills, but lacks direct customer service, pet industry, or CRM platform experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Experience Associate role at Ollie. Your mission to improve the lives of pets and their parents through human-grade nutrition and genuine care resonates with me. I value building long-term relationships and delivering thoughtful, reliable support.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I regularly communicated with clients and stakeholders to understand their needs, resolve issues, and ensure satisfaction. I managed feedback across emails, calls, and project management tools, always aiming for clear and helpful responses. This experience taught me to listen carefully, explain technical details in plain language, and follow through on commitments.\n\nI approach every interaction with patience and a problem-solving mindset. Whether helping a customer troubleshoot an issue or finding a better way to handle a request, I focus on understanding the core need and delivering a practical solution. I am comfortable working across multiple channels and tracking details accurately.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work well in team environments and communicate clearly with people from different backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in diverse settings.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to Ollie\'s Canine Care team. My CV is attached for your review. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-14 01:41:39.440', '2026-06-14 01:41:39.440'),
(827, 827, 1, 25, '[]', '[]', 'The job posting is a general public notice flyer for anticipated vacancies across multiple disciplines. No specific technical skills or requirements are listed. The applicant has a broad engineering background in web development, AI, and autonomous systems, but without defined job criteria, the match cannot be precisely scored.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Interdisciplinary position with the US Army Corps of Engineers. The broad scope of this role aligns well with my technical background across software engineering, autonomous systems, and applied research.\n\nMy professional experience includes four years of full-stack development using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have built scalable web applications, RESTful APIs, and real-time systems with role-based access control, payment integration, and database optimization. I have also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to web development, I have worked on AI and autonomous systems projects. Through research and development work, I built a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n for visually impaired users, operating fully offline on edge hardware. I also developed a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, integrating Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography. These projects demonstrate my ability to work across software, hardware, and security domains.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-14 01:41:45.706', '2026-06-14 01:41:45.706'),
(828, 828, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Pacote Office\",\"Portuguese language\",\"Healthcare segment knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct customer service or healthcare experience. The role requires hybrid customer support in Portuguese for a healthcare company, which does not match the applicant\'s technical profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Atendimento ao cliente role at Pluris Mídia. Your focus on building genuine relationships between brands and people, combined with a commitment to diversity and employee growth, stands out to me.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong communication skills and a disciplined approach to client-facing work. In my previous roles, I regularly collaborated with stakeholders, documented processes clearly, and ensured that information was accurately recorded and shared across teams. These experiences have prepared me to handle hybrid customer service tasks, including inbound calls, email support, and proactive outreach, with patience and attention to detail.\n\nI am comfortable working with registration systems and maintaining organized records, which aligns with your need for accurate and complete documentation of patient interactions. I also have strong typing skills and clear diction, both in Bengali and English, and I am accustomed to communicating complex information in a simple, human way.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and grow with Pluris Mídia. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-14 01:41:51.817', '2026-06-14 01:41:51.817'),
(829, 829, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Logistics\",\"Operations\",\"Bilingual (Spanish)\",\"Administrative support\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not directly match the logistics/operations assistant role. No direct skill overlap was found. The applicant has general organizational and coordination experience from project management but lacks specific logistics, operations, or bilingual (Spanish) experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Logistics & Operations Assistant role at Valatam. Your mission to connect bilingual professionals across Latin America with meaningful remote opportunities is something I find genuinely valuable, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to your operational team.\n\nWhile my technical background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills through managing end-to-end project workflows, maintaining deployment pipelines, and ensuring smooth communication between development teams and stakeholders. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how operations, logistics, and technical execution need to work together.\n\nIn my previous roles, I was responsible for tracking project timelines, managing task priorities, documenting processes clearly, and supporting cross-team coordination. I am comfortable working with data, maintaining records, and using tools that help streamline operations. I also have hands-on experience with cloud platforms, databases, and monitoring systems that are useful for operational reporting and process optimization.\n\nIn addition to my technical and operational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Valatam\'s operations team.', '2026-06-14 01:41:58.400', '2026-06-14 01:41:58.400'),
(830, 830, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Communication\",\"Journalism\",\"Data analysis\",\"Social sciences\",\"Digital monitoring tools\",\"Social media monitoring\",\"Information verification\",\"Keyword classification\",\"Advanced Spanish\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the required experience in communication, journalism, data analysis, or social sciences. The role requires advanced Spanish (native level) and experience with digital monitoring tools, social media monitoring, and information verification, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s technical skills in web development and AI engineering are not relevant to this news monitoring assignment.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Online Volunteer assignment for monitoring news coverage with a focus on migration at IOM Venezuela. This role directly supports informed decision-making and strategic communication in a field that has real impact on people\'s lives.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in data analysis, information verification, and producing clear, structured summaries. I am comfortable working with keyword-based classification methodologies and digital monitoring tools to identify relevant trends and narratives.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the daily monitoring of national, regional, and international media and social networks. I understand the importance of identifying critical topics related to mobility, protection risks, and organizational visibility. My experience building systems that process and organize large volumes of information makes me well-suited to deliver the daily bulletin and immediate alerts required for this assignment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am disciplined about delivering outputs on time and working in a coordinated manner with a remote team. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to IOM\'s mission in Venezuela and support your communication and risk management efforts.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-14 01:42:05.693', '2026-06-14 01:42:05.693'),
(831, 831, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Senior account management\",\"Partnership management\",\"Client relationship leadership\",\"Project coordination\",\"Governance reporting\",\"Risk management\",\"Stakeholder engagement\",\"Digital education knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI), while the Strategic Partnerships Director role requires senior account management, partnership leadership, stakeholder relationship management, and education sector experience. There is minimal direct overlap in required skills or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Strategic Partnerships Director position at peopleworth. The opportunity to lead strategic partner relationships and drive operational excellence within a people-centred performance culture aligns well with my professional approach.\n\nWhile my technical background is in software engineering, my work has consistently involved managing complex stakeholder relationships, coordinating cross-functional teams, and ensuring delivery commitments are met. In my role as a Web Developer, I collaborated directly with stakeholders and engineering teammates to align project objectives with business outcomes, resolve escalated issues, and maintain clear communication across distributed teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on governance, reporting, and risk management within partnership engagements. In previous projects, I prepared performance updates, coordinated delivery activities across multiple contributors, and developed processes to improve operational efficiency. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to balance strategic objectives with day-to-day execution.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in stakeholder coordination and project delivery can contribute to the success of your partnership initiatives. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-14 01:42:12.166', '2026-06-14 01:42:12.166'),
(832, 832, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Medical claim processing experience\",\"Customer service experience in healthcare\",\"Facets system proficiency\",\"10-key proficiency\",\"Medical terminology knowledge\",\"COB/Medicare/Medicaid knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills from software engineering experience, but lacks the specific medical claims processing, customer service, and healthcare system experience required for this role. The role requires 6+ months of medical claim processing or healthcare customer service experience, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Claims Support I position at Moda Health. Your company\'s long-standing commitment to quality healthcare and community support in Oregon since 1955 is impressive, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, the analytical and detail-oriented nature of this role aligns well with my strengths. In my work developing web applications, I regularly analyzed complex data, identified discrepancies, and ensured accuracy in every component. I am accustomed to reviewing policies and procedures to maintain quality standards, much like the claims processing work described in this position.\n\nA key part of my previous work involved communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I handled inquiries, documented actions thoroughly, and collaborated across teams to resolve issues efficiently. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and have a reliable high-speed internet connection.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-14 01:42:18.566', '2026-06-14 01:42:18.566'),
(833, 833, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Office software proficiency\",\"Calendar management\",\"Data entry\",\"Customer service\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong organizational and communication skills from managing complex technical projects. While there is no direct administrative assistant experience, the applicant demonstrates transferable skills in coordination, documentation, remote work, and cross-cultural communication. The match is low due to the significant difference in role focus.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant role at Somewhere. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational, coordination, and communication skills that transfer well to administrative work.\n\nIn my previous roles, I managed project timelines, coordinated with stakeholders across different time zones, handled documentation, and maintained clear communication channels between technical and non-technical teams. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of scheduling, task prioritization, and workflow management.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in remote settings, learning new tools quickly, and maintaining reliable communication with team members. I pay close attention to detail and take a structured approach to managing tasks and deadlines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-14 01:42:23.987', '2026-06-14 01:42:23.987'),
(834, 834, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Retail knowledge\",\"Bilingual French/English\"]', 'The job description is for a customer-facing retail team member role (ÉQUIPE MET) at Home Depot Canada, written in French. The applicant\'s profile is for a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no retail or customer service experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the ÉQUIPE MET position at The Home Depot Canada. The role\'s focus on helping customers find the right solutions and building knowledge aligns with my approach to software development: understanding real needs and delivering practical, reliable results.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. My work has involved designing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and creating responsive, SEO-friendly user interfaces. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and ensuring applications perform well under real-world conditions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that are both functional and easy to use. In my projects, I have integrated payment gateways, real-time features using WebSockets, and third-party services like cloud storage and social logins. I have also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, with CI/CD pipelines for smooth delivery.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-14 01:42:29.726', '2026-06-14 01:42:29.726'),
(835, 835, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Content creation\",\"CapCut\",\"Premiere Pro\",\"Canva\",\"Meta Business Suite\",\"TikTok Studio\",\"Community management\",\"Digital marketing\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct social media coordination, content creation, or digital marketing experience. A few foundational web skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Tailwind) are tangentially related to content formatting, but the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Coordinator role at The Sociable Society. Your focus on connecting creators with brands through human-first, digitally-minded campaigns aligns with my own approach to building systems that prioritize clarity, engagement, and real-world impact.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but I have always been drawn to the intersection of technology and communication. Through my work developing full-stack web applications, I have gained a strong understanding of how content is structured, displayed, and optimized for different digital platforms. This includes creating responsive, visually consistent interfaces using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Tailwind CSS, skills that translate directly into formatting and optimizing social-first content for Instagram, TikTok, and LinkedIn.\n\nIn previous projects, I have built platforms that required managing user-generated content, scheduling updates, and ensuring a consistent brand voice across multiple touchpoints. These experiences have given me practical familiarity with content calendars, audience engagement, and the importance of timely, brand-appropriate communication. I am comfortable working with editing tools and tracking performance data to refine content strategies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to The Sociable Society\'s creative and entrepreneurial team. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-14 01:42:36.355', '2026-06-14 01:42:36.355'),
(836, 836, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Human resources experience\",\"HR software/tools\",\"Recruitment processes\",\"Employee relations\",\"Payroll administration\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct HR experience. The role is a Junior Human Resources Assistant, which requires HR-specific skills not present in the profile. The applicant\'s strengths in organization, remote work, and quick learning are transferable but do not directly match the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Human Resources Assistant position at Helic & Co. This role caught my attention because it requires organization, reliability, and the ability to work independently in a remote environment. I have developed these qualities through my experience managing complex software projects and coordinating across teams.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong administrative and coordination skills that transfer well into an HR support role. In my previous work, I managed task tracking, documentation, and communication across multiple stakeholders. I am comfortable handling structured workflows, maintaining records, and ensuring that nothing slips through the cracks.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts easily to new tools and processes. I have worked remotely for several years and understand the importance of clear communication, self-discipline, and timely follow-through. I am confident I can contribute to the efficiency of your HR operations from day one.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of Helic & Co. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-14 01:42:42.507', '2026-06-14 01:42:42.507'),
(837, 837, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Paralegal experience\",\"Commercial contracts expertise\",\"Legal document review\",\"Company secretarial / governance admin\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no paralegal or commercial contracts experience. The only potential alignment is a genuine interest in technology, which is mentioned in the job description. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Paralegal position with Obelisk Support, supporting a UK-based company specialising in flexible electronics. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational discipline, attention to detail, and a genuine interest in technology that aligns well with this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed the ability to manage complex workflows, track multiple moving pieces simultaneously, and maintain precise documentation. These skills translate directly to contract administration, filing, and keeping legal workflows moving efficiently.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and taking ownership of tasks that require careful tracking and organization. My experience building systems with role-based access control and secure authentication has given me a natural appreciation for governance, compliance, and structured processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support your legal team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-14 01:42:47.851', '2026-06-14 01:42:47.851'),
(838, 838, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'The job posting is an open application for PicCollage with no specific role or technical requirements listed. The applicant has a broad full-stack and AI engineering background, but without defined job criteria, a meaningful match score cannot be calculated. The score of 30 reflects the general fit as a software engineer with relevant skills, though no direct match to specific requirements is possible.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining PicCollage. While I understand there may not be a specific open role that matches my profile exactly, I wanted to introduce myself as a full-stack and AI engineer who enjoys building practical, user-focused software.\n\nMy technical background spans full-stack web development with Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and TypeScript, along with experience in API design, database management with MySQL and PostgreSQL, and deployment on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I have also worked on AI-powered applications integrating OpenAI APIs and computer vision models.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and delivered real-time features using WebSockets. I have also deployed applications with CI/CD pipelines and managed cloud infrastructure on AWS.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that are both technically solid and genuinely useful for end users. I have developed projects ranging from multi-vendor e-commerce platforms to AI-powered financial tools, always focusing on clean architecture, maintainability, and real-world usability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to PicCollage.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-14 01:42:54.225', '2026-06-14 01:42:54.225'),
(839, 839, 1, 25, '[\"SQL\",\"Python\",\"API Integrations\",\"Google Cloud\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Power BI\",\"Tableau\",\"Looker Studio\",\"DAX\",\"PowerQuery\",\"Qlik\",\"ETL\",\"Data Warehousing\",\"AppScripts\",\"PowerShell\",\"Google BigQuery\",\"Workforce Analytics\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in SQL, Python, API integrations, and cloud platforms (Google Cloud, AWS) which partially overlap with the Data Analyst role. However, the role requires 3+ years of dedicated data analysis experience with specific BI tools (Power BI, Tableau, Looker Studio), ETL/data warehousing, Google BigQuery, and workforce analytics — none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s background is primarily in full-stack web development rather than data analytics, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Analyst position at ActivTrak. Your focus on transforming productivity data into actionable insights for customers aligns with my experience in building data-driven systems and working across technical and business teams.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with SQL for querying and optimizing databases, including MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have integrated APIs, built data pipelines, and collaborated with engineers to validate data accuracy and consistency. I am comfortable working with cloud platforms such as Google Cloud and AWS, and I have used Python for automation and data processing tasks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of BI dashboards and reporting frameworks. In previous projects, I have designed systems that translate raw data into clear, usable insights for end users. I understand the importance of data quality control and have implemented validation processes to maintain high analytical standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to ActivTrak\'s data-driven team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-14 01:43:01.554', '2026-06-14 01:43:01.554'),
(840, 840, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Trade marketing experience\",\"Shopper marketing experience\",\"CPG industry experience\",\"Retailer program management\",\"Brand activation experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong project management and cross-functional collaboration skills, but lacks direct trade marketing, brand activation, or CPG industry experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trade Marketing & Brand Activation Manager position at Cloetta. Your mission to bring iconic European confectionery brands to American shoppers in a locally relevant way is compelling, and I am drawn to the opportunity to help translate global brand strategy into impactful U.S. market execution.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently operated at the intersection of technical delivery and business strategy. Over the past four years, I have led full-cycle product development projects, coordinated cross-functional teams, managed timelines, and ensured that stakeholder requirements were translated into actionable deliverables. This experience has given me strong project management, organizational, and communication skills that directly apply to managing trade marketing programs, retailer initiatives, and activation calendars.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility to adapt global assets for U.S. retailer and consumer needs. In my previous roles, I regularly worked with international teams to localize digital products for different markets, ensuring brand consistency while addressing regional preferences. I am comfortable managing agency partners, coordinating multiple workstreams, and delivering results in a growing business environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and execution skills can support Cloetta\'s U.S. growth.', '2026-06-14 01:43:08.771', '2026-06-14 01:43:08.771'),
(841, 841, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"CRM proficiency (Pipedrive)\",\"Outbound sales (cold calls, email sequences)\",\"German C1\",\"Sales negotiation\",\"Pipeline management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no B2B sales, CRM, or outbound sales experience. The only tangential match is familiarity with AI tools and LLMs, which the job mentions as part of an AI-augmented sales stack. The applicant lacks all core sales requirements including 1-3 years B2B sales experience, CRM proficiency, outbound prospecting, and German language skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Manager position at MILES Mobility. The opportunity to help build the B2B sales motion for MILES for Business 2.0, particularly in the SME segment, is exactly the kind of greenfield challenge I find most engaging.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have built AI-powered applications using LLMs, OpenAI APIs, and automation tools. I understand how AI-augmented sales stacks work from the inside out, including LLMs for personalization, enrichment tools, and automated workflows. This technical foundation allows me to not only use these tools effectively but also contribute to shaping and improving them as they grow.\n\nIn previous work, I have developed systems that integrate AI assistants, automate data processing, and streamline complex workflows. I am comfortable working with data pipelines, CRM-like systems, and tools that require disciplined daily use for accurate forecasting and pipeline management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and problem-solving skills can contribute to MILES Mobility\'s growth in the SME segment.', '2026-06-14 13:40:03.850', '2026-06-14 13:40:03.850'),
(842, 842, 1, 45, '[\"AI-affine (inferred from AI projects)\",\"Full-stack development\",\"Product ownership\",\"Independent execution\",\"English fluency\"]', '[\"German fluency (required, not in profile)\",\"Marketing and sales experience\",\"Startup or founding experience\",\"Customer interview and market validation experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong independent project-building experience and AI affinity, which partially matches the entrepreneurial and execution-focused nature of the role. However, the role explicitly requires German fluency, marketing/sales experience, and startup/founding experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate for the technical and execution aspects, but weak for the business and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entrepreneur in Residence position at Logic Joe GmbH. The opportunity to take ownership of a digital product from validation to execution, with the full support of an experienced agency team, is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy background combines full-stack development with a strong drive to build and ship products independently. I have designed, developed, and deployed multiple web applications from scratch, handling everything from backend architecture and API design to frontend implementation and server deployment. I am comfortable working across the full stack and making technical decisions that balance speed, quality, and scalability.\n\nA relevant example is Free Games Hub, a platform I built entirely on my own using Laravel and Tailwind CSS. I took it from an idea to a working product, managing the full lifecycle: system architecture, database design, user authentication, payment flows, real-time features, and deployment on a Linux server. This project taught me how to prioritize, make trade-offs, and deliver results without waiting for instructions.\n\nI am also AI-affine and have integrated AI features into several projects, including AI-powered assistants and image processing pipelines. I regularly explore new tools and apply them where they add real value. I work well across disciplines and can coordinate between tech, design, and business stakeholders to move a project forward.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Logic Joe\'s new product initiatives.', '2026-06-14 13:40:15.340', '2026-06-14 13:40:15.340'),
(843, 843, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Quality management knowledge (DIN, ISO, etc.)\",\"Audit and certification experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Business consulting background\"]', 'This role is in quality assurance and management consulting, which is outside the applicant\'s software engineering background. The applicant has strong analytical, documentation, and process-oriented skills that could transfer, but lacks direct experience in quality management systems, audits, and German language proficiency. The job description explicitly states no prior QA experience is required and training will be provided, which makes the role accessible. The match score is low due to the domain difference, but the applicant\'s willingness to learn and structured thinking are relevant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter Qualitätssicherung position at IfDQ Audit GmbH. Your approach of training new team members in quality management methods while valuing a genuine interest in quality standards aligns with how I prefer to work. I am looking for a role where I can grow into a new field with structured support.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining web applications. This work has required me to think carefully about processes, identify potential issues before they become problems, and ensure that every component of a system works as intended. I have developed a strong ability to analyze workflows, document requirements, and communicate technical details clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the documentation and implementation of standards. In my previous work, I have created technical documentation, written clear reports, and developed systems that follow specific guidelines. I am comfortable working with structured processes and enjoy the challenge of ensuring that every detail is correct. The role at IfDQ Audit GmbH offers the opportunity to apply these skills in a new context while learning about quality management systems, audits, and certification procedures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to learn the tools and methods your team uses and to contribute to your clients\' quality improvement projects. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can grow into this role at IfDQ Audit GmbH.', '2026-06-14 13:40:26.476', '2026-06-14 13:40:26.476'),
(844, 844, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Betriebswirtschaftslehre (BWL)\",\"Volkswirtschaftslehre (VWL)\",\"Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen\",\"Qualitätsmanagement\",\"Beratungserfahrung\",\"Deutschkenntnisse (sehr gut)\",\"Audit-Erfahrung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and process-oriented skills, but the job requires a business/economics/industrial engineering graduate for a consulting role in quality management. The applicant lacks the required educational background (BWL/VWL/Wirtschaftsingenieur), quality management knowledge, consulting experience, and German language proficiency. The match is low, though the applicant\'s analytical thinking and documentation skills are transferable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Absolvent BWL / VWL / Wirtschaftsingenieur position at IfDQ Audit GmbH. Your description of a consulting role where newcomers are trained in quality management methods and standards aligns well with my approach to learning and problem-solving.\n\nThrough my software engineering background, I have developed strong analytical and process-oriented thinking skills. I am accustomed to analyzing complex systems, identifying inefficiencies, and implementing structured improvements. This way of thinking translates naturally to quality management consulting, where understanding workflows and optimizing processes is central.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the documentation and implementation of standards. In my project work, I have created detailed technical documentation, user guides, and system specifications for digital platforms. I am comfortable translating complex requirements into clear, actionable documentation, which I understand is a key part of preparing quality management handbooks and supporting certification audits.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to learn your consulting methods and quality management tools from the ground up. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-14 13:40:36.263', '2026-06-14 13:40:36.263');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(845, 845, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Tax law knowledge\",\"Financial accounting experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no tax advisory qualifications, German language skills, or tax law experience. The role requires a certified Steuerberater (tax advisor) with expertise in financial statements, tax returns, and client advisory. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s technical profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position in Donauworth, as advertised by Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in digital process optimization, secure system architecture, and data-driven problem solving that aligns well with the modern, digitally oriented working environment your partner firm offers.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I have implemented role-based access control, secure authentication systems, and real-time data processing pipelines. These experiences have given me a structured approach to handling complex workflows, maintaining data integrity, and ensuring system reliability under operational pressure.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with digital tools and automated processes in a tax advisory context. I am comfortable with modern software stacks, cloud deployment (AWS, Docker), and database management. I believe my technical fluency can contribute to streamlining internal workflows, improving data accuracy, and supporting the firm\'s digital transformation goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills and structured approach can add value to your partner firm in Donauworth.', '2026-06-14 13:40:45.451', '2026-06-14 13:40:45.451'),
(846, 846, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statements)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in tax advisory, accounting, or German tax law. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam) and experience with annual financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Neustadt am Rübenberge. I understand you are looking for someone with strong communication skills, a careful and efficient working style, and openness to digital processes. While my core expertise is in software engineering, I bring a structured, analytical approach to problem-solving and a proven ability to build and manage complex digital systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with data management, automation, and secure system design. I have built platforms that handle user authentication, role-based access control, payment processing, and real-time data synchronization. These systems required careful attention to accuracy, security, and reliability, which I understand are equally important in tax advisory work.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital workflows and modern tools. I have hands-on experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable working with databases, APIs, and cloud infrastructure, and I enjoy optimizing processes to make them more efficient and transparent.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building reliable, secure digital systems can contribute to the efficiency and growth of your partner firm in Neustadt am Rübenberge.', '2026-06-14 13:40:55.155', '2026-06-14 13:40:55.155'),
(847, 847, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax consultant exam)\",\"Tax law expertise\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (tax audit support)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The job is for a qualified tax consultant (Steuerberater) requiring a completed tax consultant exam and deep expertise in German tax law. The applicant is a software engineer with no tax or accounting background. The match is very low (5/100) as there is no overlap in required qualifications, certifications, or domain knowledge.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Moisburg. I understand this role requires a completed tax consultant exam and deep expertise in tax law, which are not areas I have pursued professionally. However, I bring a strong foundation in digital systems, careful analytical work, and a structured approach to problem-solving that may be relevant to a modern, digitally-oriented firm.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained complex web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and modern JavaScript frameworks. I have worked extensively with RESTful APIs, authentication systems, role-based access control, and database optimization. These projects required careful attention to detail, efficient workflows, and the ability to manage multiple moving parts without error.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment mentioned in your job description. I have deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable working with cloud infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud, and I have experience integrating third-party services and managing real-time features. I believe my technical background could support a firm looking to strengthen its digital capabilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-14 13:41:04.618', '2026-06-14 13:41:04.618'),
(848, 848, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in annual financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. Although my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax advisory, I bring strong technical skills and a digital-first working style that align well with the modern, technology-driven environment your partner firm offers.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I am experienced with cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud, containerization with Docker, and Linux server management with Nginx and Apache. This technical foundation allows me to work efficiently with digital tools, automated workflows, and modern software systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment in your partner firm. I have hands-on experience integrating third-party services, managing databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and implementing secure authentication and role-based access control. I am comfortable working with complex systems and maintaining high attention to detail.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my technical skills, careful working style, and openness to digital ways of working would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your partner firm. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could support your needs.', '2026-06-14 13:41:14.404', '2026-06-14 13:41:14.404'),
(849, 849, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statements)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (transformation tax law)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax advisor) with expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Hachenburg. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in analytical problem-solving, a careful and efficient approach to complex work, and genuine openness to digital workflows.\n\nThrough my experience as a full-stack developer, I have developed a disciplined work style focused on accuracy, reliability, and clear communication. I am comfortable working with detailed regulations, managing multiple responsibilities simultaneously, and maintaining high standards even under pressure.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern tools. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud deployment, which means I can quickly adapt to and help optimize digital workflows within the firm.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both te