(850, 850, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax law, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater position in Renchen through Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong technical foundation that supports efficient, digital-first workflows and secure data management.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment integrations. My work has consistently focused on building reliable, well-structured systems that handle sensitive data securely.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern tools in your partner firm. I am experienced with Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable working in environments where technology drives efficiency. I have also worked with PostgreSQL, Redis, and real-time communication systems, which support data integrity and operational transparency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and Engl