(851, 851, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Advisor Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Declarations)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"German Language (Professional Fluency)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in tax advisory, accounting, or German tax law. The job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with a completed tax advisor exam and experience in financial statements, tax declarations, and audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Fellbach. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, structured problem-solving, and digital process management that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained complex systems that require careful attention to detail, data integrity, and efficient workflows. I have worked extensively with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, ensuring accurate data handling and reporting. These skills translate directly to tasks such as preparing annual financial statements and tax declarations, where precision and systematic review are essential.\n\nI am comfortable working in a digital environment and have experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers using Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I approach my work with a focus on accuracy, efficiency, and clear communication. I am used to collaborating with cross-functi