(852, 852, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Advisor Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (Tax Return Preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (Audit Support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\",\"Führungsverständnis (Leadership Understanding)\",\"German Language (implied by job location and language of description)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (Tax Advisor) with specific expertise in German tax law, financial statement preparation, and audit support. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. Although my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, data integrity, and process optimization that aligns well with the demands of tax advisory work.\n\nMy experience as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer has required me to work with complex, data-intensive systems where accuracy and attention to detail are critical. I have built and maintained applications that handle authentication, payment processing, and real-time data synchronization, all of which demand the same precision and compliance mindset required in tax consulting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with digital processes and modern tools. I am already comfortable with digital workflows, having deployed applications on cloud infrastructure, managed databas