(853, 853, 1, 30, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Government-specific domain experience\",\"Northern/remote community service experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, MySQL, Docker, Linux) that could support GNWT\'s technology needs. However, the job posting is a general government recruitment ad with no specific technical requirements, making direct skill matching limited. The applicant\'s professional web development experience and project portfolio demonstrate capability for government IT roles.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining the Government of Northwest Territories through the Various Positions listing. The opportunity to contribute to public service through technology is something I find genuinely meaningful, and I am eager to bring my software engineering experience to support the communities across the Northwest Territories.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with four years of professional experience building and maintaining production applications. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js, developing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and optimizing database performance with MySQL. I also have hands-on experience with real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO, and I am comfortable deploying and managing applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn previous roles, I delivered scalable web applications end to end, from backend architecture to responsive frontend interfaces. I have integrated third-party services such as payment gateways, social logins, and cloud storage, and I have worked on optimizing application performance through query tuning and caching strategies. One project that reflects this is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I built a Laravel backend with role-based access control, MySQL, and Firebase notifications, supporting multiple user roles across web and mobile platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the GNWT team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-14 13:41:59.873', '2026-06-14 13:41:59.873'),
(854, 854, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Previous chat/email support experience for a software or SaaS company\",\"Experience with help desk platforms (Intercom, Zendesk, Gorgias, Freshdesk, or similar)\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and communication skills but lacks direct experience in chat/email support roles for software companies and experience with common help desk platforms.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chat Support Specialist position at OnlineJobs.PH. Your software company\'s focus on delivering a great customer experience through live chat and email support aligns well with my background in technical communication and problem-solving.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and software engineer, I have developed strong written communication skills and the ability to explain technical concepts clearly to non-technical users. I am comfortable troubleshooting software issues, identifying root causes, and knowing when to escalate complex problems to the appropriate team members.\n\nIn previous professional experience, I worked closely with support and operations teams to document customer feedback and common issues. This helped improve product documentation and reduce repeat inquiries. I am accustomed to working independently in remote environments and maintaining reliable communication with team members across different time zones.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your support team.\n\nKEENLY RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0', '2026-06-14 13:42:07.366', '2026-06-14 13:42:07.366'),
(855, 855, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"TensorFlow\",\"PyTorch\",\"scikit-learn\",\"MLOps\",\"Data pipelines\"]', 'The applicant has foundational AI/ML project experience (YOLOv8, OpenAI API, Replicate) and strong software engineering skills, but lacks explicit experience with standard ML frameworks (TensorFlow, PyTorch) and MLOps tools typically expected for a Junior ML Engineer role. The match is moderate, with potential for growth.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior ML Engineer position at Work Force Nexus. The opportunity to work on machine learning systems in a remote, full-time capacity is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for at this stage of my career.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and deployed AI-powered applications that combine machine learning models with production-grade software engineering. My work includes training AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, integrating Replicate API for image processing, and developing a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n for assistive technology. These projects required me to handle everything from model selection and training to API integration and deployment on edge devices.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems where AI models operate reliably in real-world conditions. In my Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, I optimized a YOLOv8n pipeline for ultra-low latency inference on a Raspberry Pi, implemented a custom UDP streaming protocol, and integrated multilingual text-to-speech feedback. This experience taught me how to balance model accuracy with performance constraints and how to deploy AI systems that work offline without cloud dependencies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI engineering and software development aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-14 13:42:16.307', '2026-06-14 13:42:16.307'),
