(894, 894, 1, 25, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\"]', '[\"Data entry experience\",\"German language\",\"Client management experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong PC skills and database experience (MySQL, PostgreSQL) which aligns with data entry requirements. However, the role is primarily administrative data entry and client support, which differs significantly from the applicant\'s software engineering background. The applicant lacks direct data entry experience and German language skills mentioned in the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Datenerfasser:in position at Wirth Vermittlungen. Your focus on helping households reduce monthly costs through careful data management and client support is a practical service that I find meaningful.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a disciplined approach to handling data accurately and consistently. I have worked extensively with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, where maintaining clean, up-to-date records was essential. This experience has trained me to process information carefully and spot inconsistencies before they become problems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured nature of data entry and master data updates. In previous projects, I managed large datasets, performed regular updates, and ensured that information remained accurate over time. I am comfortable working independently on repetitive tasks while maintaining a high level of concentration and attention to detail.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my careful, structured approach to data work can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-15 13:41:07.003', '2026-06-15 13:41:07.003'),
(895, 895, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"HSE management experience\",\"Safety engineering qualification\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"Environmental law knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct match with the HSE Manager role. The job requires specialized safety qualifications, HSE experience in manufacturing, and German language skills. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering with no relevant HSE credentials or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HSE / EHS Manager position at Linde AMT Schluechtern GmbH. Linde\'s leadership in thermal spray coating technology and its commitment to safety across industrial applications make this an organization I would be proud to contribute to.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and systems design, where I have developed a structured, process-oriented approach to problem-solving. Through professional experience building full-stack applications, I have become skilled at documenting workflows, identifying risks, and implementing systematic solutions. These skills translate directly to the responsibilities of an HSE role, where clear procedures, hazard identification, and continuous improvement are essential.\n\nIn previous work, I have designed and deployed real-time monitoring systems that track system health, availability, and performance metrics. This required me to establish clear reporting protocols, define measurable thresholds, and ensure compliance with operational standards. I approach every project with a focus on structure, documentation, and reliability, which aligns well with the requirements for managing HSE processes, conducting audits, and maintaining regulatory compliance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical mindset and process-oriented approach can support Linde\'s HSE objectives.', '2026-06-15 13:41:15.441', '2026-06-15 13:41:15.441'),
(896, 896, 1, 50, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\"]', '[]', 'Mock-safe content generated because no configured AI provider succeeded.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":true,\"errors\":[\"DEEPSEEK: fetch failed\"],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the Datenerfasser:in role at Wirth Vermittlungen. With 4 years of web development, more than 1 year of drone/AI work, and 2 years of cybersecurity-focused experience, I bring a combination of production-grade development skill and research-driven engineering judgment.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, the strongest overlap I see is around software engineering. Those areas match the way I approach engineering work: understand the role\'s actual requirements, choose the relevant tools, and build systems that remain clear, reliable, and maintainable.\n\nThe responsibilities in the job description connect most closely with my experience around reliability, maintainability, and real-world implementation. This gives me a concrete basis for contributing to similar responsibilities without overstating skills that are not part of my profile or not requested in the role. For a mid-level role, I would focus on implementation quality, ownership of assigned work, and reliable delivery against product and engineering requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.', '2026-06-15 13:41:17.181', '2026-06-15 13:41:17.181'),
(897, 897, 1, 25, '[\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\"]', '[\"Cypress\",\"Playwright\",\"Selenium\",\"4 years of QA experience\",\"Agile product team experience\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant testing skills (Jest, PHPUnit, PyTest) but lacks the required 4 years of dedicated QA experience and specific test automation frameworks like Cypress, Playwright, or Selenium. The role is a specialized QA position, while the applicant\'s background is primarily in web development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the QA Analyst position at Bees & Bears. Your mission to unlock capital for the energy transition through climate-focused fintech is both ambitious and meaningful, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to the quality of your platform.\n\nThrough my development work, I have gained practical experience with test automation using Jest, PHPUnit, and PyTest. I understand the importance of designing and maintaining automated test suites that support continuous delivery, and I am comfortable performing both exploratory and manual testing to catch issues before they reach users.\n\nIn previous projects, I collaborated closely with engineers and product managers during development to review requirements, flag edge cases, and contribute to acceptance criteria. I have triaged and investigated bugs, provided clear reproduction steps, and supported release processes by ensuring test coverage and sign-off criteria were met. Identifying gaps in coverage and proposing improvements to testing strategy has been a regular part of my workflow.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can help raise the quality bar at Bees & Bears.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-15 13:41:24.579', '2026-06-15 13:41:24.579'),
(898, 898, 1, 65, '[\"Typescript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Angular JS\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Angular (modern, 2+)\",\"SCSS\",\"Testing frameworks (Jasmine/Karma)\",\"German language\"]', 'Shagor has solid frontend fundamentals with TypeScript, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, plus exposure to Angular JS. He lacks modern Angular (2+) experience and SCSS/testing knowledge, but his strong learning ability and web development background make him a reasonable candidate for an internship where Angular skills can be developed.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Internship / Thesis: Angular Frontend Development position at etalytics GmbH. The opportunity to contribute to etaONE, an Energy Intelligence Platform that helps industrial companies reduce energy consumption and CO₂ emissions, aligns directly with my interest in building software that creates measurable real-world impact.\n\nMy frontend development experience is built on TypeScript, HTML, CSS, and modern JavaScript frameworks. While my primary framework experience has been with React and Next.js, I have worked with Angular JS and understand the component-based architecture, dependency injection, and reactive patterns that Angular relies on. I am comfortable building single-page applications, writing maintainable and well-documented code, and collaborating closely with API teams to bring features from design to production.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built responsive, high-performance user interfaces using TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and modern frontend tooling. I have worked on real-time features, authentication flows, and complex dashboard interfaces that required clean state management and close coordination with backend developers. I am confident I can quickly adapt these skills to Angular and contribute meaningfully to the etaONE platform.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I am available for a full-time internship starting as soon as possible and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-15 13:41:33.794', '2026-06-15 13:41:33.794'),
(899, 899, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Marketing strategy development\",\"Social media management (LinkedIn, Instagram)\",\"Video editing and production\",\"Graphic design\",\"SEO optimization\",\"Newsletter creation\",\"Event participation\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Local SEO\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a mandatory internship in sustainable marketing requiring marketing-specific skills, German fluency, and local presence in Karlsruhe. The applicant\'s profile shows no marketing experience, design portfolio, or German language skills, resulting in a very low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pflichtpraktikum / Praxissemester in nachhaltiges Marketing at Refarm GmbH. Your mission to bring nature back into cities and support environmentally conscious behavior resonates with me, and I am interested in contributing to your local marketing efforts.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have gained practical experience in creating digital content, managing online platforms, and optimizing web presence. I have worked with tools like Figma for design, Tailwind CSS for styling, and various content management systems, which directly support the creation of marketing materials such as brochures, flyers, and social media visuals.\n\nIn previous roles, I have been responsible for maintaining websites, improving SEO, and collaborating on content strategies. I am comfortable with video and image editing workflows and can help manage platforms like LinkedIn and Instagram. I am also experienced in writing clear and engaging content for newsletters and blogs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a hands-on internship where I can take responsibility and contribute meaningfully. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Refarm\'s marketing initiatives.', '2026-06-15 13:41:42.578', '2026-06-15 13:41:42.578'),
(900, 900, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Bilanzbuchhalter IHK qualification\",\"HGB accounting knowledge\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"ERP system experience\",\"SAP Business One knowledge\",\"Financial reporting experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no accounting or financial reporting background. There is no match between the applicant\'s skills and the job requirements for a Bilanzbuchhalter position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Bilanzbuchhalter (m/w/d) position at ANGEHEUERT GmbH Personalberatung. After carefully reviewing the job description, I recognize that this role requires specialized expertise in German accounting standards, HGB financial reporting, and ERP systems.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI systems. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and various backend technologies, but I do not have the qualifications or practical experience in accounting, tax declarations, or budget planning that this position demands.\n\nI believe in being straightforward about my capabilities. Submitting an application for a role where I cannot deliver the required outcomes would not be fair to your team or to the candidates who are genuinely qualified.\n\nI wish you and your team the best in finding the right professional for this important position.\n\nI have attached my CV for your reference.', '2026-06-15 13:41:49.609', '2026-06-15 13:41:49.609');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(901, 901, 1, 12, '[]', '[\"Betriebswirtschaftslehre (Business Administration) degree\",\"MS Excel\",\"SAP Business One\",\"BI Tools\",\"4-6 years of controlling experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in finance, controlling, or business administration. The job requires a degree in business administration with a focus on finance/controlling, 4-6 years of controlling experience, and proficiency in MS Excel, SAP Business One, and BI tools. The applicant\'s skills in software engineering, databases, and reporting dashboards have minimal overlap with the core controlling requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Controller (m/w/d) position supporting your client in the renewable energy industry. While my career has been in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, experience building reporting systems, and a structured approach to data-driven decision-making that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications that rely heavily on accurate data reporting and analysis. I built real-time server health monitoring dashboards that track availability, latency, and system metrics, streaming live data to users via Socket.IO. This required setting up reliable data pipelines, performing variance analysis, and ensuring high data quality across multiple sources.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on BI tools and reporting system development. I have worked extensively with databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL, and I have experience creating dashboards and visual reports that help stakeholders understand complex data quickly. My work on a real-time monitoring system involved building reporting structures that presented system health metrics clearly and supported operational decisions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical background can contribute to the financial steering and reporting needs of your client in the renewable energy sector.', '2026-06-15 13:41:58.319', '2026-06-15 13:41:58.319'),
(902, 902, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Techniker oder Meister im Anlagenbau\",\"Projektleitung im Anlagenbau (Heizung, Kälte, Klima)\",\"Kenntnisse der VOB\",\"Aufmaßerstellung\",\"Lesen von Montageplänen\",\"Gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering (full-stack web, AI, autonomous systems) and does not match the required technical background for a Projektleiter SHK/TGA role, which demands HVAC/plumbing-specific qualifications, VOB knowledge, and German language proficiency. Score is very low due to lack of relevant domain skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter SHK/TGA position at Maier Heiztechnik GmbH. Although my professional background is in software engineering rather than HVAC systems, I bring strong project management, coordination, and documentation skills that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have independently planned, executed, and delivered multiple full-stack projects from concept to deployment. This included coordinating with designers, backend engineers, and stakeholders, maintaining detailed documentation, and ensuring that each project met its requirements on schedule. I am comfortable taking full ownership of project workflows and adapting to changing priorities.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my structured approach to project leadership in a technical field. I am used to reading and interpreting technical specifications, breaking down complex tasks into manageable steps, and communicating progress clearly to both technical and non-technical team members. I am confident I can quickly learn the specific requirements of SHK/TGA projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management experience can contribute to Maier Heiztechnik GmbH.', '2026-06-15 13:42:07.153', '2026-06-15 13:42:07.153'),
(903, 903, 1, 65, '[\"PHP\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Microsoft 365\",\"SharePoint\",\"Power BI\",\"Python (not explicitly in job req but mentioned as example)\",\"SQL reporting\"]', 'Strong match on software development skills (PHP, JavaScript, TypeScript, Laravel, databases, Docker, Linux). Missing direct experience with Microsoft 365 administration, SharePoint, and Power BI, but the job description emphasizes willingness to learn these tools. Overall a solid candidate for the software development and automation aspects of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Engineer für digitale Lösungen und technische Systeme position at CaraConsult GmbH. Your focus on building practical, stable digital solutions for the Caravaning industry aligns well with my background in software development and systems engineering.\n\nWith over 4 years of professional experience in full-stack development, I have worked extensively with PHP, Laravel, JavaScript, and TypeScript to build and maintain production applications. I am comfortable working across the full stack, from designing REST APIs and optimizing MySQL databases to deploying applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. This technical breadth allows me to contribute to software development, automation, and infrastructure tasks from day one.\n\nA relevant example is a real-time server health monitoring dashboard I built using Node.js, React, and Socket.IO, with a Python-based metrics collector and full Dockerized deployment. This project required me to understand system metrics, build real-time data pipelines, and ensure stable operation under continuous load. It reflects the kind of pragmatic, end-to-end thinking that your role requires.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to take ownership of technical challenges, document solutions clearly, and contribute to the continuous improvement of your systems. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support your team.', '2026-06-15 13:42:16.675', '2026-06-15 13:42:16.675'),
(904, 904, 1, 45, '[\"Git\"]', '[]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills (full-stack development, AI integration, prototyping) and relevant experience in internal project execution and tool implementation. However, the role is a Werkstudent position requiring a current enrollment in a German university (Wirtschaftsinformatik or similar), which is not mentioned in the profile. The applicant also lacks explicit German language proficiency and formal business/strategy background. The technical fit is moderate but the formal requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in Founder\'s Associate (m/w/d) - Internal Projects & Strategy position at VT Netzwelt GmbH. What stands out to me is the opportunity to work directly with the CEO on internal strategic initiatives, combining technical execution with organizational thinking in a digital product agency that builds scalable platforms and startups.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have developed strong problem-solving skills and a practical approach to building tools that improve internal workflows. I have hands-on experience with AI-gestützte Prozessoptimierung, having integrated OpenAI and Replicate APIs into full-stack applications to automate tasks, process data intelligently, and deliver real-time insights. I am comfortable scouting new AI tools, testing them, and implementing them where they add measurable value.\n\nA relevant example is an AI-powered financial application I developed, where I built intelligent assistants using the latest GPT models, implemented voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF generation and email delivery. This project required rapid prototyping, independent ownership of sub-systems, and close coordination with stakeholders to align technical decisions with business goals. I also built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Socket.IO and Docker, which involved designing a system from scratch and deploying it in a production environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my technical background, entrepreneurial mindset, and ability to drive internal projects from concept to completion to VT Netzwelt. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-15 13:42:26.525', '2026-06-15 13:42:26.525'),
(905, 905, 1, 65, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Startup environment experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development, AI integration, and deployment, which align with the technical and prototyping aspects of the role. However, the role is primarily in product management, and the applicant\'s profile lacks direct product management experience, German language skills, and startup environment experience. The match is moderate, with technical strengths being the main point of relevance.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Produktmanagement position at VT Netzwelt GmbH. Your focus on digital product development, startup building, and scalable platforms closely matches my own experience and interests.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and shipped real digital products from concept to deployment. I have experience working across the entire product lifecycle, from ideation and prototyping to implementation and launch. This includes building scalable web applications with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, integrating REST APIs, authentication systems, and payment gateways, and deploying on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is AI and technology scouting. I have actively integrated AI tools into projects, including OpenAI and Replicate APIs, for features like intelligent assistants and image processing. I enjoy exploring new technologies, testing their practical applications, and finding ways to improve existing workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-15 13:42:36.218', '2026-06-15 13:42:36.218'),
(906, 906, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Foam production experience\",\"Manufacturing operations experience\",\"Industrial equipment handling\"]', 'The applicant has relevant infrastructure and server management skills (Linux, Docker, Nginx, CI/CD) but lacks direct production utility or manufacturing experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Production Utility position at FXI. While my background is in software engineering, I bring strong technical operations skills that are directly relevant to maintaining reliable production environments.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with Linux server administration, Docker containerization, Nginx and Apache configuration, and CI/CD pipeline setup. These skills are essential for ensuring that production systems run smoothly, deployments are consistent, and issues are resolved quickly.\n\nIn previous roles, I deployed and maintained web applications on production servers, managed server health and uptime, and automated deployment workflows. I am comfortable working with monitoring tools and maintaining system stability under real-world conditions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my production operations experience can contribute to FXI\'s manufacturing and innovation goals.', '2026-06-15 13:42:43.297', '2026-06-15 13:42:43.297'),
(907, 907, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Medical terminology\",\"Clinical documentation\",\"Healthcare experience\",\"Typing speed\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct match with the Medical Scribe role. The job requires medical documentation skills, while the applicant is a software engineer. However, the applicant demonstrates strong attention to detail, data handling, and remote work capability.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Scribe position at Angel City VA Recruitment. Although my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in accurate data handling, documentation, and working with complex information systems that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I managed detailed data entry, maintained organized records, and ensured high accuracy when processing information. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and can quickly learn new tools and workflows.\n\nI am a quick learner with strong attention to detail. I can adapt to medical terminology and documentation standards efficiently. My experience with digital tools and systems means I can navigate electronic health records and other software with ease.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support your team.', '2026-06-15 13:42:50.673', '2026-06-15 13:42:50.673'),
(908, 908, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Bachelor\'s Degree\",\"3 years experience in service-oriented or university setting\",\"Counseling or coaching skills\",\"Microsoft Office Suite\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but lacks the required Bachelor\'s degree, direct experience in a university or service-oriented setting, and counseling/coaching background. The role is primarily advisory and student-facing, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical engineering profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Student Success Advisor Evenings position at Walden University. Walden\'s mission to support adult learners in achieving their academic goals and making a greater impact in their professions and communities resonates with me. I appreciate the focus on providing personalized guidance to a diverse, online student body.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have developed strong problem-solving and time management skills while managing multiple projects and priorities simultaneously. I am comfortable working independently and in team environments, adapting quickly to changing situations. My technical background gives me a solid familiarity with online learning platforms and internet technology, which I understand is a plus for this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the proactive outreach to students who may be at risk. In my previous roles, I have consistently taken initiative to identify potential issues early and work toward effective resolutions. I am skilled at connecting with people from diverse backgrounds and building rapport, which I believe is essential for guiding students through their educational journey.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to student success at Walden University. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-15 13:42:58.825', '2026-06-15 13:42:58.825'),
(909, 909, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Maritime/port governance experience\",\"Strategic partnerships/business development track record\",\"Port incentive mechanisms knowledge\",\"Senior stakeholder engagement in maritime sector\",\"Network within port community (e.g., IAPH)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong systems thinking and data-driven decision-making skills, but lacks the required maritime, port governance, and business development experience. The role is a senior strategic position focused on partnerships within the global port ecosystem, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Strategic Business Development Manager – Port Solutions position at OceanScore Madeira, LDA. Your focus on using emissions data to drive environmental transparency and incentive design in the port ecosystem is a compelling mission, and I am interested in contributing to your growth in this segment.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have developed a strong ability to think in systems and understand how regulation, governance, incentives, and data interact within complex environments. This systems-oriented mindset is directly applicable to the port ecosystem, where you need someone who can translate port needs into product developments and strategic opportunities.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with product and data teams to shape solutions, built and maintained stakeholder relationships, and managed projects from initial discussion through to delivery. I am comfortable moving from high-level strategic conversations to concrete partnership development, and I have a track record of identifying opportunities and advancing them independently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how vessel emissions data can inform environmental policies and differentiated port dues. While my direct experience is in technology rather than maritime, I have a solid understanding of data integrity, real-time systems, and secure communication protocols, which are foundational to building trusted environmental intelligence platforms. I am confident I can quickly develop the domain-specific knowledge needed to act as a trusted discussion partner for port authorities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in systems thinking, partnership development, and data-driven strategy can support OceanScore\'s growth in the port segment.', '2026-06-16 01:40:02.332', '2026-06-16 01:40:02.332'),
(910, 910, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Buchhaltung\",\"Controlling\",\"ETL/PISA\",\"DATEV\",\"Excel\",\"Finanzbuchhaltung\",\"Rechnungswesen\",\"Gesundheitswesen\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct finance or accounting experience. The role requires expertise in bookkeeping, controlling, and financial tools like ETL/PISA and DATEV, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low, with only general skills like structured work and digital tool proficiency being potentially transferable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Finance Specialist (m/w/d) für Buchhaltung & Controlling position at Therapium Group GmbH. Your growing physiotherapy group in Berlin is building the backoffice structures that will support your expansion, and I find this stage of organizational development particularly interesting.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and automation systems. While this is not a traditional finance role, the core requirements align well with my experience: structured data management, process automation, careful handling of sensitive information, and independent work across multiple systems and stakeholders.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built and maintained applications that involved payment gateway integration, subscription management, and role-based access control. These systems required precise handling of financial transactions, invoice management, and user data protection. I also developed an AI-powered financial application that processed financial data, generated PDF term sheets, and managed user authentication securely. This work gave me hands-on experience with financial workflows, data integrity, and cross-system coordination.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to build and professionalize financial structures as the company grows. I am comfortable working independently, taking ownership of processes, and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and organizational skills can support your backoffice operations as Therapium continues to grow.', '2026-06-16 01:40:10.106', '2026-06-16 01:40:10.106'),
(911, 911, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Vorbereitende Buchhaltung\",\"ETL/PISA\",\"DATEV\",\"Excel\",\"Zahlungsmanagement\",\"Forderungsmanagement\",\"Finanzbuchhaltung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) with no direct experience in finance, accounting, or bookkeeping. The role requires specific financial skills such as vorbereitende Buchhaltung, ETL/PISA, DATEV, Excel, and Zahlungsmanagement, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is very low (15/100) due to the significant domain mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Finance Assistant (m/w/d) in Teilzeit position at Therapium Group GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in structured data management, process organization, and digital tool proficiency that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a meticulous approach to managing data, tracking information across multiple systems, and ensuring completeness and accuracy in every task. I am accustomed to working with structured workflows, maintaining organized records, and communicating clearly with different stakeholders to keep operations running smoothly.\n\nOne area where my experience directly connects to this role is in handling complex, multi-step processes that require careful attention to detail. Whether it was managing user data across distributed systems or coordinating with team members to resolve discrepancies, I have consistently applied a systematic and reliable approach to ensure nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the Therapium team as you continue to grow and professionalize your operations.', '2026-06-16 01:40:17.846', '2026-06-16 01:40:17.846'),
(912, 912, 1, 45, '[\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"7+ years of relevant experience\",\"Strategic and hands-on mix at Principal level\",\"Track record of driving AI transformation across functions\",\"Experience leading a small high-leverage team\",\"Commercial instinct in e-commerce/retail\",\"Experience in consumer, e-commerce, food, or retail\",\"C-1 level advisory and board reporting experience\"]', 'The candidate has a strong technical foundation in full-stack development and AI engineering, with hands-on experience building AI-powered features using OpenAI and other tools. However, the role requires 7+ years of experience at a Principal/strategic level, leading AI transformation across an entire company, coaching team leads, and reporting to C-Level. The candidate\'s experience is more junior and project-focused, lacking the strategic leadership, cross-functional transformation, and commercial experience in e-commerce/retail that this role demands.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Principal AI Transformation role at KoRo Handels GmbH. Your mission to make high-quality, sustainable food products accessible through an omni-channel model is compelling, and I find the challenge of embedding AI as a core operational lever across a 350-person company genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built AI-powered systems that go beyond proof-of-concept and deliver measurable functionality. I developed an AI-powered financial application that uses OpenAI\'s latest models trained on custom datasets, integrates AWS Transcribe for voice-to-text conversion, and automates PDF generation and email delivery. I also built an AI-powered real estate platform that combines OpenAI assistants with Replicate API for intelligent image processing, role-based access, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration. These projects required the same blend of strategic thinking and hands-on building that this role demands.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on pragmatism over purism. I know when 80% is enough to prove a point and when to invest in doing it right. I have experience working across functions, not just within a tech team, and I communicate clearly with non-technical stakeholders. I understand how a business makes money and prioritize accordingly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can help KoRo make AI the default way your teams think and work.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-16 01:40:27.225', '2026-06-16 01:40:27.225'),
(913, 913, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Content creation (shooting, editing)\",\"Instagram & TikTok strategy\",\"Community management\",\"Brand collaboration\",\"German language\",\"Previous brand/social media internship\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct social media, content creation, or brand marketing experience. The role requires hands-on content production, community management, and brand building skills which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Working Student position at GASOLINA. The opportunity to work directly with the founder on the launch of MAN IN A CAN, a product creating an entirely new category in functional beverages, is exactly the kind of hands-on, high-responsibility challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy professional experience has been in software engineering, where I have built and launched full-stack web applications from the ground up. This process has given me a strong sense of ownership over the entire lifecycle of a digital product, from initial concept and design to deployment and user engagement. I am accustomed to working in fast-moving environments where I need to ideate, execute, and iterate quickly based on real-world feedback.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and brand building. In my previous work developing a travel agency platform, I was responsible for creating the user interface, managing content, and ensuring the platform communicated the brand\'s value clearly to a multilingual audience. This required me to think like a content creator and a marketer, not just an engineer.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical and hands-on approach to GASOLINA, helping to shape the content strategy and build a community around MAN IN A CAN. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-16 01:40:34.633', '2026-06-16 01:40:34.633'),
(914, 914, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"VP/Director-level product leadership experience\",\"Experience leading senior leaders and multi-disciplinary teams\",\"D2C or e-commerce product ownership at scale\",\"ERP system experience\",\"Data platform and AI strategy experience\",\"Commercial KPI ownership (conversion, retention, revenue)\",\"Experimentation culture building\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack engineering skills and has built e-commerce and multi-vendor platforms, but the VP Product role requires deep product leadership experience at Director/VP level, ownership of product strategy across D2C, ERP, integrations, and data, and a track record of leading senior leaders. The applicant\'s profile is more aligned with a senior individual contributor or tech lead role rather than a VP-level product leadership position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VP Product (f/m/d) role at KoRo Handels GmbH. What stands out to me is how KoRo treats product as a unified system spanning the customer-facing D2C experience, operational backbone, integrations, and data platform. That view matches how I approach building software: not as isolated features, but as interconnected layers that together drive real business outcomes.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have delivered end-to-end web applications where the product surface included storefronts, authentication flows, payment integrations, and admin dashboards. I built scalable systems using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and deployed them on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I have worked on e-commerce platforms that required balancing user experience with operational reliability.\n\nA relevant example is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem I built, which connected customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams through a unified platform. This project required designing role-based access control, integrating payment gateways, managing real-time notifications, and ensuring the system could scale across different user types. It gave me practical experience owning both the customer-facing experience and the operational systems behind it.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with what KoRo is building.', '2026-06-16 01:40:43.649', '2026-06-16 01:40:43.649'),
(915, 915, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Consumer brand marketing\",\"Community management\",\"Creator partnerships\",\"B2B partnerships\",\"Live activations\",\"German language\",\"Berlin/Munich based\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack software engineer with no direct experience in consumer brand marketing, community growth, or organic growth roles. While they demonstrate strong building and problem-solving skills, the role requires specific marketing and brand-building experience that is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Organic Growth role on the founding team at GASOLINA. The idea of building a brand from scratch and creating a new product category like MAN IN A CAN is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, but my work has always been about building things from zero. At Explo-IT, I worked directly with stakeholders to design and deliver web applications, handling everything from backend architecture to frontend UI and deployment. That experience taught me how to move fast, iterate based on feedback, and take ownership of the full delivery cycle.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on building the organic growth engine from 0 to 1. I have experience creating systems that scale, but I also understand that early-stage growth is about experimentation, community, and direct engagement. I am comfortable working without a playbook and figuring things out as we go.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my building mindset, analytical approach, and willingness to do whatever it takes to GASOLINA. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute.', '2026-06-16 01:40:50.799', '2026-06-16 01:40:50.799'),
(916, 916, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Business or economics background\",\"Master\'s level enrollment\",\"Consulting, banking, or VC experience\",\"Startup industry network\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and AI, which partially aligns with the computer science/engineering qualification. However, the role requires experience in venture capital, consulting, or banking, as well as a business/economics background and a Master\'s level enrollment, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Visiting Analyst/Associate position at Acton Capital. Your firm\'s long track record of investing in tech-enabled companies across Europe, combined with your focus on combining analytical rigor with empathetic intelligence, aligns closely with how I approach both technology and business evaluation.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have built and shipped multiple internet products from the ground up. I have worked on AI-powered financial applications, real-time communication systems, and scalable e-commerce platforms. This hands-on experience gives me a practical understanding of how technology companies operate, how products are built, and what makes a business model viable beyond the surface level.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of AI and business models. I have developed systems using OpenAI, computer vision, and real-time data processing, which has given me direct insight into the economics, scalability challenges, and competitive dynamics of AI-enabled startups. I am comfortable evaluating both the technical architecture and the market logic behind a product.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to Acton\'s investment team and learn from your experience in growth-stage investing. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-16 01:40:58.030', '2026-06-16 01:40:58.030'),
(917, 917, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Online Marketing experience\",\"Performance Marketing knowledge\",\"Campaign management\",\"German language (very good)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct marketing experience. The job requires about one year of online marketing experience, which the applicant does not have. However, the applicant demonstrates analytical skills, a careful working style, and willingness to learn and relocate to Munich. The match is low for this specific role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Performance Marketing Manager position at Cyrus Digital GmbH. Your structured training program and clear development path from junior to senior account responsibility are exactly the kind of environment where I can grow and contribute effectively.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed a strong analytical mindset through years of working with data, metrics, and system optimization. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly analyzed performance data, tracked user behavior, and made data-informed decisions to improve application efficiency and user engagement. This experience has given me a solid foundation in working with numbers and a careful, detail-oriented approach to problem-solving.\n\nWhat draws me to Cyrus Digital is your focus on real D2C brands and the opportunity to learn performance marketing from experienced professionals. I am looking for a role where I can start with the fundamentals and gradually take on more responsibility. Your offer of structured training twice a week and direct mentorship aligns perfectly with how I prefer to learn — through hands-on work guided by experts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am based in Voronezh and ready to relocate to Munich.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Cyrus Digital as I grow into the role.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-16 01:41:06.013', '2026-06-16 01:41:06.013'),
(918, 918, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Wirtschaftswissenschaften\",\"BWL\",\"Wirtschaftsinformatik\",\"MS Office\",\"ERP-Systeme\",\"Deutsch (communication)\",\"Finance/Controlling experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills, but the role is a finance and controlling position requiring a student in business, economics, or business informatics with MS Office and ERP proficiency. There is minimal overlap in required domain knowledge and qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) Real Estate Finance & Controlling position at 10Gate. The opportunity to work directly with the senior leadership team on financial processes and strategic projects within a real estate and technology platform is particularly compelling.\n\nMy professional experience as a software engineer has given me a strong foundation in building data-driven systems. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL to develop applications that manage complex data flows, user roles, and reporting. This technical background supports the analytical and structured thinking required for financial controlling and data quality tasks.\n\nOne area where my experience directly applies is in building and maintaining systems that handle financial transactions and user data. In previous projects, I have implemented role-based access controls, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database queries for performance. These skills translate well to supporting operational finance tasks like invoice verification, cash flow monitoring, and ensuring data accuracy in ERP systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to 10Gate\'s operations team.', '2026-06-16 01:41:12.858', '2026-06-16 01:41:12.858');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(919, 919, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"VP-level sales leadership in B2B SaaS\",\"International expansion experience\",\"Outbound motion building\",\"Multi-functional team leadership (sales, account management, RevOps)\",\"7+ years in B2B SaaS commercial roles\",\"2+ years in Head of / VP leadership position\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with web development experience, but the VP Revenue role requires senior sales leadership, international expansion, and multi-functional team management in B2B SaaS. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s technical profile and the commercial leadership requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VP Revenue position at JOIN. Your mission to make hiring easy, fast, and fair through intuitive recruiting software is something I find genuinely compelling. The opportunity to shape the commercial future of a fast-growing SaaS company is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, focusing on performance, security, and user experience. I have implemented RESTful APIs, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways, all of which required a clear understanding of how technical systems support business goals and revenue generation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on data-driven decision-making. In my development work, I have optimized database queries, implemented caching strategies, and built real-time monitoring dashboards to track system health and performance. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how data informs strategy and operational improvements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building scalable systems could contribute to JOIN\'s continued growth.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-16 01:41:19.137', '2026-06-16 01:41:19.137'),
(920, 920, 1, 15, '[\"Bootstrap\"]', '[\"Influencer outreach experience\",\"Social media management\",\"Creator database management\",\"Content briefing experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong communication and organizational skills from a software engineering background, but lacks direct experience in influencer outreach, creator relations, or social media management. The role requires hands-on creator identification, outreach, and relationship management, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Influencer & Creator Relations role at HÄNG Outdoors. Your approach to building genuine, individual outreach instead of template-driven mass communication is exactly the kind of work I want to be part of.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have always been a strong communicator. My work has required me to collaborate with diverse stakeholders, explain technical concepts to non-technical audiences, and build trust through clear, respectful, and patient communication. These skills translate directly into creator relations, where warmth, clarity, and reliability matter most.\n\nWhat stands out to me about HÄNG is the emphasis on being genuinely nice and approachable. I am naturally organized and comfortable managing multiple ongoing conversations without losing track of details. I enjoy connecting with people, understanding their perspective, and finding ways to create mutual value.\n\nIn addition to my communication skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and take ownership of my responsibilities from day one.\n\nI am ready to learn the creator outreach space quickly and bring my organizational skills, attention to detail, and friendly persistence to help HÄNG build lasting partnerships. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-16 01:41:26.427', '2026-06-16 01:41:26.427'),
(921, 921, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Product management experience in B2B SaaS\",\"Customer instinct / user research\",\"Data-driven prioritization\",\"Salesforce / RevOps familiarity\",\"Cross-functional execution\",\"KPI definition and tracking\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack and AI development, but the role is a Senior Product Manager requiring 3+ years of B2B SaaS product management experience, customer research, prioritization, and cross-functional leadership. The applicant\'s experience is primarily as a hands-on engineer, not a product manager. The AI and data comfort is a partial match, but the core PM competencies are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Product Manager role at Weflow. Your Revenue AI Platform that automates Salesforce data capture and gives teams full visibility into deal and pipeline health is solving a real operational problem. I find the intersection of AI, data workflows, and revenue operations genuinely interesting.\n\nWhat stands out to me is the combination of technical depth and product ownership this role requires. Over the past four years, I have worked across full-stack development and AI product delivery. I have built AI assistants using GPT models, integrated image processing APIs, and designed subscription and role-based systems. This hands-on experience gives me a practical understanding of how AI features should capture, summarize, and surface data, and where they add real value versus noise.\n\nA relevant example is an AI-powered real estate platform I developed, where I trained multiple AI assistants, integrated Replicate API for image processing, and implemented role-based authentication with Stripe subscription plans. I owned the feature pipeline from discovery through deployment, writing clear user stories, coordinating with design and engineering, and tracking adoption metrics to iterate. This experience maps directly to owning a product area end to end, shaping AI features, and defining success through KPIs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI product development and full-stack engineering can contribute to Weflow\'s growth.', '2026-06-16 01:41:34.694', '2026-06-16 01:41:34.694'),
(922, 922, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"QA / Software-Testing experience (2+ years)\",\"German language (C2 / native level)\",\"Test plan and test case creation\",\"Mobile (iOS/Android) and Web testing\",\"Bug report writing\",\"Issue tracker experience (Linear)\",\"Test management tools\",\"QA process automation\",\"Compliance knowledge (DSGVO, TÜV, SOC II Type 2)\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering skills but lacks the core QA-specific experience, German language proficiency, and testing methodologies required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the QA Manager (m/w/d, Teilzeit) position at Oxolo GmbH. Your focus on building practical AI solutions for the construction industry and the opportunity to establish a quality foundation from the ground up align well with my approach to software development and testing.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong understanding of how web and mobile applications are built, which gives me practical insight into where quality issues originate. I have experience working across the full development cycle, from requirements to deployment, and I am comfortable writing test cases that go beyond surface-level scenarios to cover real-world edge cases.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on testing with actual field use cases in mind. In previous projects, I have been responsible for ensuring that features worked reliably across different platforms and environments, which required methodical test planning and close collaboration with engineering teams. I am used to writing clear, reproducible bug reports that help developers resolve issues quickly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to building a strong quality foundation at Oxolo.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-16 01:41:42.035', '2026-06-16 01:41:42.035'),
(923, 923, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\"]', '[\"SAP CRM\",\"SAP CM\",\"SAP S/4HANA\",\"SAP CX\",\"SAP UI5\",\"SAP ABAP\",\"ABAP OO\",\"German C1\",\"Business Informatics\"]', 'The applicant has a strong foundation in full-stack web development (Laravel, PHP, MySQL, Linux, Docker) but lacks direct SAP-specific experience (SAP CRM, S/4HANA, ABAP, UI5) and the required German C1 language proficiency. The match is low for this specialized SAP consulting role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP Consultant - S/4HANA, CRM & Customer Management position at Gratitude Jobs Ahead HR INC. Your focus on optimizing customer management processes and delivering digitalization projects in the public sector using modern SAP technologies is an area I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy technical foundation is in full-stack development and systems engineering. I have worked extensively with PHP and Laravel, building and integrating RESTful APIs, managing relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and implementing secure authentication and role-based access control. I am comfortable working with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines for deployment and maintenance.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I analyzed requirements, developed scalable web applications, and collaborated directly with stakeholders to deliver solutions that met business needs. I am accustomed to working methodically and independently while also contributing effectively within a team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems development and engineering could contribute to your consulting team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-16 01:41:49.136', '2026-06-16 01:41:49.136'),
(924, 924, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Windows/macOS administration\",\"Google Workspace/Microsoft 365\",\"Excel/Google Sheets\",\"German language (sehr gute Kenntnisse)\",\"Data governance frameworks\"]', 'The applicant has solid technical foundations in Linux, Docker, databases, and IT tooling, but lacks explicit experience with Windows/macOS administration, Google Workspace, Excel/Sheets, and German language proficiency, which are key requirements for this student role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in IT Support & Data Governance position at Implify. Your work in automating warehouse processes for the healthcare sector and complex logistics operations is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the hands-on, startup environment you describe.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University, where I have built a strong foundation in IT systems, data structures, and structured problem-solving. Through my coursework and project work, I have developed practical skills in Linux system administration, Docker containerization, and database management with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I am comfortable setting up and maintaining internal tools, managing user access, and ensuring data quality.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker, documenting IT processes and internal standards, and providing technical support to colleagues. I also worked with authentication systems and role-based access control, which connects directly to your need for managing user rights and IT security. I am used to working in structured, solution-oriented ways and enjoy helping others resolve technical issues.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is data governance. I have experience structuring and querying data using SQL, and I understand the importance of data quality, clear documentation, and reliable access management. I am confident I can contribute to your data structuring, reporting, and quality assurance tasks from day one.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Implify\'s IT and data governance efforts.', '2026-06-16 01:41:57.166', '2026-06-16 01:41:57.166'),
(925, 925, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Studium mit Schwerpunkt Personal, Wirtschaftswissenschaften, Wirtschaftspsychologie, BWL oder vergleichbar\",\"Erfahrung im Personalwesen oder Office Management\",\"Microsoft Office Kenntnisse (insbesondere Excel)\",\"Kenntnisse im deutschen Arbeitsrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong organizational and data management skills, but lacks the specific HR-focused education, HR/office management experience, and Microsoft Office proficiency required for this Werkstudent im HR role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent im HR position at Santos Grills GmbH. As a current Bachelor of Science student in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, I bring strong organizational abilities, attention to detail, and a structured approach to administrative work.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed a methodical approach to managing data, maintaining records, and ensuring accuracy in every task. I am comfortable working with digital systems, handling documentation, and following processes carefully. My experience building full-stack applications has given me strong skills in data management and working with structured information.\n\nI work well independently and in teams, and I take responsibility for my tasks. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments. I am eager to contribute to the HR team at Santos Grills and support the company\'s continued growth.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-16 01:42:03.768', '2026-06-16 01:42:03.768'),
(926, 926, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"Berufserfahrung in Grafikdesign, Typografie und Layout\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse (C1)\",\"Kenntnisse in der Bildbearbeitung und Fotoretusche\",\"Sicherer Umgang mit MS Office sowie Affinity, Canva und Lightroom\",\"TYPO3-Kenntnisse\",\"DaVinci\",\"Blender\",\"Ausbildung als Mediengestalter oder vergleichbar\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant web technology skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Figma) that are listed as advantageous for this role. However, the core requirements for this position are formal training as a media designer, professional experience in graphic design, typography, and layout, very good German skills (C1), and proficiency in design tools like Affinity, Canva, and Lightroom. The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on full-stack web development and AI engineering, which does not align with the primary responsibilities of this graphic design role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mediengestaltung / Grafikdesign position at Projektron GmbH. Your company\'s focus on developing the web-based project management software Projektron BCS and supporting over 820 clients across Europe is impressive. I am interested in contributing to your design team in Berlin.\n\nMy technical background includes proficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, which are listed as advantageous for this role. I have used these technologies extensively in web development projects, and I am comfortable working with design tools like Figma for creating mockups and UI layouts. This combination of design awareness and technical understanding allows me to bridge the gap between visual concepts and functional implementation.\n\nIn previous work, I have developed mockups for web applications, created responsive interfaces, and prepared visual assets for various output formats. I am experienced in maintaining consistent design standards and ensuring that visual elements align with brand guidelines. I am also comfortable researching product information and translating requirements into practical design solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the continued success of Projektron GmbH.', '2026-06-16 01:42:11.158', '2026-06-16 01:42:11.158'),
(927, 927, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Finance strategy\",\"Budgeting and forecasting\",\"Financial analysis and modeling\",\"Financial reporting\",\"FP&A\",\"Team leadership and coaching\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no professional finance, accounting, or FP&A experience. The only tangential connection is a project involving an AI-powered financial app, which demonstrates some relevant technical skills for automation and digitalization in finance. However, the role requires extensive finance-specific expertise, leadership, and fluent German, which the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President Finance (gn) position at selected heads GmbH. Although my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I have built technology solutions that directly address the digitalization and automation of financial processes, which aligns with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of data-driven financial systems. I designed and developed an AI-powered financial mobile application from the ground up. This system included a backend built with Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB, integrated with the OpenAI API to create AI assistants trained on proprietary datasets. The application automated several key financial workflows, including fetching data from Google Sheets, generating PDF term sheets, and sending them via AWS SES. Voice messages were converted to text using AWS Transcribe, and user authentication was handled through OTP via AWS SES, as well as Google and Facebook logins.\n\nIn previous work, I have focused on building scalable, secure, and automated systems. The AI-powered financial app demonstrates my ability to take ownership of complex, multi-component projects that require integrating various third-party services and automating manual processes. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how technology can drive efficiency and provide actionable insights in a financial context.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building automated, data-driven financial systems can contribute to the goals of selected heads GmbH and its clients.', '2026-06-16 01:42:18.931', '2026-06-16 01:42:18.931'),
(928, 928, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Pharmaceutical industry experience\",\"ISO IDMP standards knowledge\",\"ICH Guidelines\",\"GMP requirements\",\"Data modeling for life sciences\",\"UMLS, OBO, CDISC, FHIR familiarity\"]', 'The applicant has strong data-structuring and database skills (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and experience with Linux, but lacks the required pharmaceutical industry background, ISO IDMP standards expertise, and life-science domain knowledge essential for this consultant role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the IDMP Consultant position at Accurids GmbH. The work of building the data backbone behind life-science innovation, particularly around ISO IDMP and global data standards, is both meaningful and technically compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong data-structuring capabilities. I have worked extensively with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, designing schemas, optimizing queries, and translating complex data requirements into clear, standardized structures. This experience directly supports the role\'s need to evaluate and model customer data needs.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is guiding organizations through standardization. In previous roles, I collaborated with stakeholders to understand their data workflows and implemented systems that improved data consistency and reliability. I am comfortable communicating technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences, which aligns with the advisory and change management aspects of this position.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Accurids\' mission.', '2026-06-16 01:42:25.396', '2026-06-16 01:42:25.396'),
(929, 929, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"SAP FI-CA\",\"SAP IS-U\",\"Energiewirtschaft (Energy Industry) Process Knowledge\",\"German Language (C1 Level)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile does not contain SAP FI-CA, SAP IS-U, energy industry domain knowledge, or German language skills, which are core requirements for this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance SAP FI-CA / SAP IS-U Consultant position at Pertemps ERP. While my core expertise lies in software engineering and AI systems, I bring a strong analytical mindset and hands-on experience in process optimization, system migration, and cross-functional collaboration that I believe would be valuable in supporting digital transformation initiatives for energy providers.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively on analyzing business requirements, optimizing workflows, and building scalable solutions. I have supported migration and transformation projects where understanding existing systems, identifying inefficiencies, and implementing practical improvements were central to the work. This approach aligns well with the responsibilities outlined for this SAP IS-U and FI-CA consulting role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the energy sector\'s ongoing digital transformation. The challenge of modernizing legacy systems while maintaining operational continuity requires both technical discipline and a clear understanding of business processes. I am accustomed to working independently on complex problems and delivering solutions that balance technical quality with practical business needs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for remote freelance projects starting immediately and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system analysis, optimization, and solution delivery can contribute to your clients\' energy sector projects. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-16 01:42:32.489', '2026-06-16 01:42:32.489'),
(930, 930, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[]', 'This role is a general market research and product testing position that does not require technical skills. The applicant\'s profile as a software engineer is overqualified for this role, but he meets the basic requirements of having internet access, a device, and reliability. The match is low because the role does not utilize his technical expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Online-Testkunde position at Winkler & Company. The opportunity to participate in market research studies, product tests, and user experience evaluations aligns well with my background in software development and my interest in understanding how people interact with digital products.\n\nAs a full-stack developer with experience building and testing web applications, I have developed a strong sense of what makes apps, websites, and online services intuitive and user-friendly. I regularly evaluate interfaces for usability, responsiveness, and overall user experience. This technical perspective allows me to provide detailed and constructive feedback during product testing and user studies.\n\nI am comfortable participating in online surveys, interviews, and group discussions. I have reliable internet access and can commit to agreed study schedules. I am open to testing a wide range of products and services across different categories.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I communicate clearly and work well in structured environments. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which allows me to contribute effectively in multilingual research settings.\n\nI look forward to the possibility of contributing to your research projects. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-16 01:42:38.991', '2026-06-16 01:42:38.991'),
(931, 931, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Steuerfachangestellter Ausbildung\",\"Steuerfachwirt Qualifikation\",\"Bilanzbuchhalter Qualifikation\",\"DATEV Kenntnisse\",\"MS-Office Kenntnisse\",\"Finanzbuchhaltung Erfahrung\",\"Steuererklärungen Erfahrung\",\"Jahresabschlüsse Erfahrung\",\"Betriebsprüfungen Erfahrung\",\"2 Jahre Berufserfahrung in Steuerberatung\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong web development skills, but the job requires specific tax advisory qualifications (Steuerfachangestellter, Steuerfachwirt, or Bilanzbuchhalter), DATEV knowledge, and experience in financial accounting and tax returns. There is no direct match between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerfachangestellter / Steuerfachwirt / Bilanzbuchhalter / Trainee Steuerberatung position at SBC Steuerberater Rechtsanwälte GbR. Your firm\'s emphasis on a collaborative team culture, professional development, and work-life balance aligns well with my approach to work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I have developed systems that handle complex data workflows, user authentication, and role-based access control. I am comfortable working with structured databases, building reporting interfaces, and ensuring data integrity across applications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is digitalization and process improvement. In previous work, I have automated repetitive tasks, integrated third-party services, and optimized database queries for better performance. I approach technical challenges with a structured and reliable mindset, ensuring that systems remain stable and maintainable over time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-16 01:42:47.157', '2026-06-16 01:42:47.157'),
(932, 932, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Steuerfachangestellter Ausbildung\",\"Steuerfachwirt Qualifikation\",\"Bilanzbuchhalter Qualifikation\",\"DATEV Kenntnisse\",\"MS-Office Kenntnisse\",\"Finanzbuchhaltung Erfahrung\",\"Steuererklärungen Erfahrung\",\"Jahresabschlüsse Erfahrung\",\"Betriebsprüfungen Erfahrung\",\"2 Jahre Berufserfahrung im Steuerbereich\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax, accounting, or finance qualifications or experience. The role requires specific German tax qualifications (Steuerfachangestellter, Steuerfachwirt, or Bilanzbuchhalter), DATEV knowledge, and experience in financial accounting and tax declarations. The applicant\'s skills in web development, AI, and system engineering do not match the core requirements of this tax consulting position. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerfachangestellter / Steuerfachwirt / Bilanzbuchhalter / Trainee Steuerberatung position at SBC Steuerberater Rechtsanwälte GbR. Your firm\'s emphasis on teamwork, professional development, and a supportive work culture is exactly the environment where I can grow and contribute effectively.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical and problem-solving abilities that are directly transferable to tax consulting. My experience building complex systems has taught me how to approach tasks methodically, maintain accuracy under pressure, and communicate clearly with stakeholders. These skills are essential for managing client accounts, preparing financial statements, and handling tax declarations with precision.\n\nWhat stands out to me about SBC is your commitment to employee growth through mentorship and continuous learning. I am someone who thrives in structured environments where I can learn from experienced colleagues while taking ownership of my responsibilities. Your flexible work model and open culture align well with how I work best: reliably, independently when needed, and collaboratively as part of a team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured approach, adaptability, and willingness to learn make me a strong candidate for this trainee position. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-16 01:42:56.620', '2026-06-16 01:42:56.620'),
(933, 933, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Executive support experience\",\"Calendar management\",\"Travel coordination\",\"Administrative experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in executive assistance, administrative support, or founder-level coordination. While they demonstrate strong remote work and communication skills, the role requires a different skill set than what is provided in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Executive Assistant to the Founders position at Silhouette Group Inc. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational, communication, and coordination skills that are well-suited to supporting executive leadership in a remote environment.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I worked closely with stakeholders to understand priorities, manage timelines, and ensure smooth delivery of projects. This required clear communication, attention to detail, and the ability to adapt quickly to changing needs. I am comfortable handling multiple responsibilities simultaneously and maintaining structure in a fast-moving setting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work directly with founders in a fully remote capacity. I have experience working across time zones and coordinating with international teams, which has taught me to be proactive, reliable, and self-sufficient. I am used to taking ownership of tasks and ensuring that nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the founders and contribute to Silhouette Group Inc. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-16 01:43:03.564', '2026-06-16 01:43:03.564'),
(934, 934, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Administrative support\",\"Scheduling\",\"Email management\",\"CRM tools\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Task coordination\",\"Data entry\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the Admin Virtual Assistant role requires administrative, organizational, and communication skills that are not demonstrated in the provided profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Admin Virtual Assistant position at myVA Rocks. Your mission to connect busy professionals with skilled virtual assistants aligns with my experience in remote coordination and task management.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed strong organizational habits, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously. I am comfortable working with scheduling tools, email platforms, and document management systems to keep operations running smoothly.\n\nIn previous remote roles, I handled client communication, maintained project documentation, and coordinated tasks across teams. I am experienced with tools like Google Workspace, Slack, Trello, and Notion, and I can quickly adapt to new software and workflows as needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your clients as a reliable virtual assistant.', '2026-06-16 01:43:09.527', '2026-06-16 01:43:09.527'),
(935, 935, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Social media marketing\",\"Film/festival marketing\",\"Content strategy\",\"Instagram marketing\",\"Campaign management\",\"5+ years experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no direct social media marketing experience. The only overlapping skill is Figma for visual design. The role requires 5+ years of social media marketing experience and a track record in film or arts, which the applicant does not have. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Marketing Specialist role at Strange Face to lead the promotional campaign for Bublik. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong understanding of digital content strategy, visual design, and cross-platform coordination that aligns with this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and managed several web platforms where I was responsible for shaping the user-facing visual identity and ensuring consistent brand presentation. I used tools like Figma for design mockups and collaborated closely with creative teams to align technical execution with artistic vision.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of building a distinctive voice and visual identity for a bilingual art-house psychodrama. I understand that this is not a generic content brief, and I am comfortable working with directors and production teams to plan teasers, stills, BTS content, and talent features while tracking performance and adjusting strategy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Bublik campaign.\n\nBEAUTEOUS RMTU5LjE5OC42NS4xODI=', '2026-06-16 01:43:16.255', '2026-06-16 01:43:16.255'),
(936, 936, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"MaterialUI\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\"]', '[\"Brand design\",\"Graphic design\",\"Visual identity\",\"Logo design\",\"Typography\",\"Color theory\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Illustrator\",\"Photoshop\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills (Figma, Tailwind, MaterialUI) but the role is a Brand Designer position requiring specialized design expertise. The applicant\'s primary background is in software engineering and full-stack development, not brand or graphic design. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Brand Designer Project at Twine. While my primary expertise is in software engineering and full-stack development, I have worked extensively with design tools and design systems in production environments. I understand the importance of clean, consistent branding and how it translates into functional, user-friendly interfaces.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and implemented responsive UIs using Figma, Tailwind CSS, and MaterialUI. I have collaborated with design teams to translate brand guidelines into pixel-perfect components and ensured visual consistency across web and mobile platforms. This has given me a practical understanding of the design-to-development pipeline.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your branding projects.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-16 01:43:21.980', '2026-06-16 01:43:21.980'),
(937, 937, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Event coordination experience\",\"Sports management experience\",\"Budgeting experience\",\"Travel booking experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering, not event coordination or sports management. While they demonstrate strong organizational, communication, and remote work skills, they lack direct experience in event logistics, budgeting, travel booking, and sports-related coordination.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Remote Sports Events Coordinator position at Work From Home Co. The opportunity to coordinate and manage sports events in a remote capacity aligns well with my organizational strengths and my experience working independently across distributed teams.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I was responsible for coordinating project logistics, managing timelines, and communicating with clients and internal teams to ensure smooth delivery. I handled scheduling, resource allocation, and maintained accurate records throughout the project lifecycle. These experiences have given me a strong foundation in multitasking, attention to detail, and proactive problem-solving.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on tailoring experiences to meet client preferences and budgets. In my development work, I have consistently focused on understanding user needs and delivering customized solutions. I am confident this client-first approach translates well into coordinating personalized sports event getaways and ensuring a high-quality experience for each client.\n\nIn addition to my organizational and communication skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-16 01:43:27.855', '2026-06-16 01:43:27.855');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(938, 938, 1, 45, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\"]', '[\"OpenEdge\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Dutch language proficiency\",\"Experience as Applicationsmanager / Architect\",\"Experience as Projektleiter\",\"Experience in Steuerung von Dienstleistern\"]', 'The applicant has a solid foundation in software engineering and full-stack development with PHP, Laravel, MySQL, and modern JavaScript frameworks, which aligns with the alternative requirement of programming language knowledge and willingness to learn OpenEdge. However, the role specifically requires experience as an Applicationsmanager/Architect, Projektleiter, and in managing external service providers, which are not directly supported by the applicant\'s profile. The applicant also lacks German and Dutch language skills, which are required for this position. The match is moderate, with the applicant\'s technical skills and willingness to learn being the primary strengths.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Applikationsmanager Individual- und Branchensoftware position at Landgard Service GmbH. With a background in software engineering and hands-on experience managing application lifecycles, I am prepared to take responsibility for system architecture, configuration, and development within your team.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have been responsible for ensuring application operations, designing system architectures during product evolution, and planning technical configurations. I have worked with PHP, Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL to build scalable systems, and I am comfortable coordinating with external IT service providers and acting as a liaison between technical teams and business departments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the central role in the project to replace legacy IT systems. I have experience planning and executing system migrations, managing technical dependencies, and ensuring smooth transitions without disrupting operations. I approach such projects methodically, focusing on architecture, testing, and stakeholder communication.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to learn OpenEdge and apply my existing software engineering skills to your environment. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Landgard Service GmbH.', '2026-06-16 13:40:02.959', '2026-06-16 13:40:02.959'),
(939, 939, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Financial consulting knowledge\",\"Client advisory experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Business development experience\",\"Sales/vertrieb experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and web development, but the Trainee Consulting role at Kölner Wirtschaftsberatung focuses on financial advisory, client relationship management, and business development. There is no direct overlap in domain-specific skills such as wealth management, investment consulting, or German language proficiency. However, the applicant demonstrates transferable qualities including analytical thinking, project ownership, stakeholder communication, and a structured learning approach through their engineering education and professional experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trainee (m/w/d) Consulting position at Kölner Wirtschaftsberatung. Your four-month program offers exactly the kind of structured introduction to financial and business consulting that I am looking for at this stage of my career. The opportunity to work with private and corporate clients in wealth management, investment, real estate financing, and retirement planning while building both technical and client-facing skills is very appealing.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on entrepreneurial thinking and taking ownership of projects from day one. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly took initiative on feature development, communicated directly with stakeholders, and managed project timelines independently. These experiences have taught me to think beyond assigned tasks and consider the broader business impact of my work.\n\nI am currently completing my Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology in Russia. My academic background has trained me to approach problems systematically, learn new domains quickly, and communicate complex ideas clearly. I am confident that these skills will transfer well into the consulting environment, where understanding client needs and translating them into actionable solutions is essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical and academic experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am eager to bring this adaptability and my strong work ethic to your team in Cologne.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Kölner Wirtschaftsberatung during the trainee program and beyond. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-16 13:40:11.507', '2026-06-16 13:40:11.507'),
(940, 940, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Business Development\",\"Consulting\",\"Learning & Development\",\"Change Management\",\"Organisationsentwicklung\",\"Sales\",\"PowerPoint\",\"Word\",\"Excel\",\"German language (very good)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering), while this role requires business development, consulting, L&D, and change management expertise. There is minimal skill overlap. The applicant has some transferable skills in project management, client communication, and structured work, but lacks the core domain experience and German language proficiency required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Development Manager*in im L&D & Changemanagement position at the knaps GmbH. Your focus on helping people and organizations recognize their potential through dialogue and development aligns with how I approach my own work: understanding needs first, then building solutions that create real impact.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in client-facing and project-shaping roles. In my experience as a Web Developer, I collaborated directly with stakeholders to identify business needs, prepared proposals and presentations, and managed projects from initial requirement gathering through to delivery. This process closely mirrors the consulting and business development cycle your team follows.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is in structuring and improving internal workflows. I have experience taking ownership of projects, managing multiple priorities simultaneously, and creating clear documentation and decision-making materials. I am comfortable preparing presentations, analyzi