(942, 942, 1, 78, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"MySQL\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"PHPUnit\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Alpine.js\",\"PestPHP\",\"German language (professional fluency)\"]', 'Strong match for a Junior Full-Stack role. The applicant has professional Laravel and PHP experience, along with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, MySQL, and Tailwind CSS. They have built full-stack projects with Laravel and have experience with PHPUnit. The main gaps are Alpine.js and PestPHP, which are listed as nice-to-haves, and German language fluency is required. The applicant\'s structured thinking and learning ability align well with the company\'s junior-friendly approach.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Full-Stack Web Entwickler position at eigens.net. Your work building digital tools for independent pharmacies in Germany is practical and meaningful, and I appreciate your emphasis on structured onboarding and collaborative growth.\n\nMy professional experience centers on full-stack web development with Laravel and modern frontend technologies. Over the past few years, I have built and maintained production applications using Laravel on the backend and JavaScript frameworks on the frontend. I am comfortable working with PHP, MVC architecture, RESTful APIs, and relational databases, and I approach problems by understanding the underlying logic before writing code.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js. I implemented authentication, role-based access control, and payment integrations, and optimised database queries for better performance. I also created responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces w