(943, 943, 1, 45, '[\"MySQL\",\"Linux\",\"C#\",\"Web APIs\"]', '[\"MS SQL\",\"SSIS\",\"T-SQL\",\"German language\",\"Windows (advanced)\",\"Automotive domain experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in MySQL, Linux, C#, and web APIs, which partially match the job requirements. However, the role requires specific expertise in MS SQL, SSIS, T-SQL, and advanced Windows administration, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. Additionally, the job requires very good German language skills, which the applicant does not list. The automotive domain experience is also missing. The match is moderate but lacks several critical technical and language qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the E-Commerce Integration Specialist / Automotive Data Integration Specialist position at BPW Aftermarket Group Deutschland GmbH. The opportunity to work at the intersection of data systems, e-commerce platforms, and automotive aftermarket services aligns well with my technical background and interests.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with databases, APIs, and system integration. I have hands-on experience with MySQL for structured data management, and I am comfortable working with Linux systems for server administration, deployment, and maintenance. My work has involved building and maintaining database-driven applications, managing data transfers between systems, and ensuring reliable data flow across different platforms.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of connecting PIM, ERP, and webshop systems to maintain consistent and accurate data. In previous roles, I have built RESTful APIs and integrated thi