(944, 944, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"abgeschlossenes naturwissenschaftliches oder ingenieurtechnisches Studium\",\"Langjährige Berufserfahrung im Genehmigungsverfahren für den Windenergiebereich\",\"Verhandlungssicheres Deutsch\",\"Führerschein der Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile does not match the core requirements of this role. The position requires a background in natural sciences or engineering, long-term experience in wind energy approval processes, fluent German, and a driving license. The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant domain experience, qualifications, or language skills for this specific project management role in wind energy.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager (m/w/d) Windenergie mit dem Schwerpunkt Genehmigungsverfahren position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. Your focus on advancing the energy transition through wind power projects across Germany is an area where I believe my technical and analytical skills can contribute meaningfully.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong capabilities in data analysis, process coordination, and structured problem-solving. I am experienced in evaluating measurement data, creating forecasts, and developing systematic methods to improve project outcomes. These skills translate directly to the responsibilities of coordinating approval processes, preparing energy yield prognoses, and supporting the development of efficient workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination between multiple stakeholders and external consultants during complex project phases. In my professional experience, I have regularly collaborated with cross-functional teams, managed communicati