(946, 946, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Amazon PPC\",\"Amazon Sponsored Ads\",\"Amazon DSP\",\"Amazon Marketing Cloud\",\"Excel/Google Sheets\",\"BI Tools\",\"Helium 10\",\"Keepa\",\"German language\",\"E-commerce marketplace experience\",\"Advertising strategy\",\"Budget management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and full-stack development, with no direct experience in Amazon advertising, PPC campaign management, or e-commerce marketplace advertising. The role requires 5+ years of relevant experience, deep knowledge of Amazon Sponsored Ads, and proficiency in German, none of which are present in the applicant\'s background. The match score is very low due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Amazon Advertising Manager position at ADDVANCE Consumer Health Group GmbH. Your company\'s focus on health and wellbeing products through brands like Achterhof, BodyLab, and Gymqueen is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your marketplace advertising strategies.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and strategic thinking skills. I have experience building dashboards and monitoring systems that track key performance indicators, which directly relates to the KPI monitoring and optimization responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nIn previous work, I have designed and implemented real-time monitoring dashboards that track system health, availability, and latency metrics. This experience has given me a solid foundation in data analysis, reporting, and deriving actionable insights from performance data, skills that are essential for managing Amazon advertising