and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented authentication, role-based access control, and payment gateways. This required me to understand not only the technical architecture but also how each feature would be perceived and adopted by end users. I contributed to product launches and feature rollouts, ensuring that technical decisions aligned with market needs.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of sales enablement materials and messaging frameworks. In my previous role, I created documentation and collaborated on knowledge-sharing sessions that helped both technical and non-technical teams understand product capabilities. I also optimized application performance through query tuning and caching strategies, which directly improved user experience and adoption metrics. This hands-on approach to measuring and improving product performance aligns with your focus on pipeline quality, conversion rates, and feature adoption.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-16 13:41:32.126', '2026-06-16 13:41:32.126'),
(950, 950, 1, 65, '[\"API\",\"AI\",\"Automation\",\"Laravel\",\"Next.js\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"REST API\"]', '[\"No-Code/Low-Code tools (n8n, Zapier, Make.com, Airtable)\",\"ERP (WeClapp)\",\"CRM (HubSpot)\",\"E-Commerce (WooCommerce/Shopify)\",\"Microsoft Intune\",\"Azure Active Directory\",\"CleverReach\",\"Power Automate\",\"IT-Projektmanagement experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has a solid foundation in software engineering, API development, and AI integration, which partially aligns with the role\'s requirements for automation, digitalization, and IT project management. He brings strong technical skills in backend and full-stack development, but lacks direct experience with specific no-code/low-code tools (n8n, Zapier, Make.com), ERP/CRM systems (WeClapp, HubSpot), and Microsoft Azure/Intune mentioned in the job description. His experience in building AI-powered applications and automated workflows is relevant, but the role also requires IT project management experience which is not evident in his profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Wirtschaftsinformatiker / IT-Projektmanager position at Steamulation Jobs. Your focus on process optimization, digitalization, and AI-driven automation within a growing e-commerce environment aligns directly with the work I have been doing across software engineering and intelligent system development.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, with a strong emphasis on API development, system integration, and workflow automation. I have worked extensively with RESTful APIs, authentication systems, and third-party services, and I am comfortable designing automated flows that connect ERP, CRM, and e-commerce platforms. My technical foundation in Linux, Docker, and cloud deployment (AWS, Google Cloud) supports reliable infrastructure management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is applying AI to create measurable business value. I developed an AI-powered financial application that uses OpenAI for intelligent assistance, automates document generation, and integrates with AWS services for real-time data processing. This project required designing automated workflows, managing API integrations, and ensuring system reliability, which directly maps to the automation and AI responsibilities described in your role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in automation, API integration, and AI can contribute to Steamulation\'s continued growth and operational excellence.', '2026-06-16 13:41:42.067', '2026-06-16 13:41:42.067'),
(951, 951, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Zweites juristisches Staatsexamen\",\"Mehrere Jahre Berufserfahrung als Steuerberater oder Rechtsanwalt\",\"Fundiertes steuerliches, betriebswirtschaftliches und juristisches Wissen\",\"Umwandlungs(steuer)recht\",\"Erbschaftsteuerrecht\",\"DATEV-Kenntnisse\",\"MS-Office-Kenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax, legal, or Gestaltungsberatung qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant or lawyer with deep expertise in restructuring and succession planning. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Gestaltungsberater für Restrukturierung und Unternehmensnachfolge position at AWP Wirtschaftstreuhand GmbH within the LKC network. Your focus on digital and efficient processes, combined with a personal and collaborative work environment, is particularly appealing.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax or legal consulting, I bring strong analytical and problem-solving skills developed through years of building complex systems. My experience in designing scalable architectures, optimizing databases, and implementing secure authentication systems has trained me to understand intricate requirements and deliver structured, reliable solutions.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked on full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I built RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. These projects required careful planning, attention to detail, and the ability to translate business needs into functional systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-16 13:41:49.789', '2026-06-16 13:41:49.789'),
(952, 952, 1, 35, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Product Management experience\",\"User Story writing\",\"Jira/Confluence\",\"German language\",\"Business Analysis\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development and AI integration, which are relevant to the technical aspects of the role. However, the role is a Product Manager position requiring 1-3 years of direct PM experience, user story writing, Jira/Confluence proficiency, and German language skills. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct Product Management experience, no mention of Jira/Confluence, and no German language proficiency. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Manager (m/w/d) position at BoniSoft Technologies GmbH. Your B2B SaaS platform for digital transformation and performance management addresses a real operational challenge, and I find the opportunity to shape product strategy and integrate AI into workflows genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have worked directly with product owners, engineering teams, and clients to define requirements, prioritize features, and deliver scalable web applications. This has given me a practical understanding of how to translate business goals into clear epics, user stories, and acceptance criteria that development teams can execute efficiently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI into product and documentation processes. I have hands-on experience building AI-powered features using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, including training assistants and automating workflows. I can help bring structure to how AI tools, prompts, and agents are embedded into your PM and development cycles.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to BoniSoft\'s product development and roadmap.', '2026-06-16 13:41:57.534', '2026-06-16 13:41:57.534'),
(953, 953, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Windows Server Administration\",\"ISO 27001\",\"NIS 2\",\"Network Engineering\",\"First-Level Support\",\"Ticketsystem\",\"Equipment Setup\",\"User Account Management\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux server administration, Docker, CI/CD, and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana) which partially align with the server administration and IT operations aspects of the role. However, the job requires specific experience in Windows/Linux server administration, network engineering, IT security compliance (ISO 27001, NIS 2), first-level support, and hands-on equipment setup for a telemedicine environment. The applicant\'s background is more development-focused (web/full-stack) rather than system administration or IT support, resulting in a moderate match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Systemadministrator position at RKT Rettungsdienst gGmbH. Your work in building the largest telemedicine emergency physician center in Germany is genuinely impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the IT infrastructure that supports this innovative healthcare service.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux server administration, including managing Nginx and Apache web servers, containerizing applications with Docker, and setting up CI/CD pipelines for reliable deployments. I have worked with backup and recovery processes, monitored system health using Prometheus and Grafana, and maintained secure server environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is IT security and compliance. I have practical experience implementing authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure communication protocols. I understand the importance of documentation, process optimization, and adhering to security standards in production environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system administration and IT security can support the Telenotarzt operations at RKT Rettungsdienst.', '2026-06-16 13:42:05.208', '2026-06-16 13:42:05.208'),
(954, 954, 1, 45, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"C++\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\"]', '[\"PDM/PLM systems experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"2nd level support experience\",\"Budget planning experience\"]', 'The applicant has solid software development skills in object-oriented languages (PHP, C++, TypeScript) and experience with full-stack development, databases, and deployment. However, the role specifically requires PDM/PLM system experience and German language proficiency, which are not present in the profile. The match is moderate for general software development but weak for the specialized PDM domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the PDM Application Developer position at K-tronik GmbH. The opportunity to work on application development and system integration within the defense and security sector aligns well with my technical background and interest in building reliable, secure software systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong object-oriented programming skills using languages such as PHP, C++, and TypeScript. I have worked on full-stack web applications where I was responsible for requirement analysis, system design, implementation, and testing. This experience has given me a solid foundation in the software development lifecycle and the ability to work independently on complex tasks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of applications into existing IT landscapes. In previous projects, I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, configured databases, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I am comfortable working with both frontend and backend systems, and I approach each task with attention to detail and a focus on maintainability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team at K-tronik.', '2026-06-16 13:42:12.766', '2026-06-16 13:42:12.766');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(955, 955, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Elektrotechnik degree\",\"FPGA development\",\"VHDL\",\"DDR Memory\",\"High-Speed Digital Interfaces\",\"Power Supply design\",\"Oscilloscope\",\"Network Analyzer\",\"Signal Generator\",\"Receiver design\",\"HF-Frontends\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational skills (C++, Linux) relevant to embedded systems but lacks the core hardware engineering qualifications required for this role, including an electrical engineering degree, FPGA/VHDL experience, high-speed digital design, and professional hardware development experience. The role requires a dedicated hardware engineer, while the applicant\'s background is primarily in software engineering and web development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Hardware Entwickler Digital position at K-tronik GmbH. Your work on high-performance directional radio communication systems for the wireless and communications sector is technically compelling, and I am interested in contributing to the development of digital hardware for these systems.\n\nThrough my research and development work in autonomous systems, I have gained practical experience with embedded platforms including NVIDIA Jetson Nano, Raspberry Pi, and ESP32 microcontrollers. I have worked on integrating digital components, defining interfaces between processing units and sensors, and implementing low-level communication protocols. My familiarity with C++ and Linux-based development environments supports the design and testing of digital hardware subsystems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of digital and analog hardware components. In previous projects, I designed systems that required careful selection of digital components, signal routing, and performance validation through measurements. I am comfortable working with oscilloscopes and test equipment to characterize component behavior and verify system-level performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in embedded systems and digital hardware development can contribute to K-tronik\'s projects.', '2026-06-16 13:42:20.646', '2026-06-16 13:42:20.646'),
(956, 956, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Finance experience\",\"Controlling\",\"Reporting\",\"Budgeting\",\"Excel/Google Sheets\",\"Covenant tracking\",\"KPI systems\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering, full-stack development, and AI. The Business Controller role requires finance, controlling, reporting, and budgeting experience. There is no overlap in skills or experience. The applicant\'s analytical and process-oriented approach from software development is a very weak match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Controller (m/w/d) position at SafeDriver Group GmbH. Ennoo Rental\'s work in scaling fleet and rental models in the car rental industry is an interesting domain, and I appreciate the opportunity to contribute to a growing finance team.\n\nMy professional experience has involved building data-driven systems and reporting structures for web applications. I have worked with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL to track key metrics, and I have used monitoring tools like Grafana and Prometheus to visualize performance data. This has given me a practical understanding of how to structure KPIs, monitor trends, and report variances to stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the hands-on nature of this role. In previous work, I have optimized workflows between development and operations teams, improving data quality and streamlining reporting processes. I am comfortable working independently to build reporting structures from the ground up and collaborating closely with management to ensure transparency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and process-oriented approach can support the finance team at SafeDriver Group.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-16 13:42:28.105', '2026-06-16 13:42:28.105'),
(957, 957, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Python\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"API\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Low-code tools (Make, Zapier, n8n, Airtable)\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has solid JavaScript and Python skills, API development experience, and a strong problem-solving mindset. While direct low-code tool experience is not listed, the technical foundation and AI integration experience are relevant. The role requires German bureaucracy knowledge and low-code platform familiarity, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikum Automatisierungen & Low-Code position at GOVORA. Your mission to automate public administration processes with AI is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of, and I appreciate that this role offers real responsibility from day one.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built a strong foundation in JavaScript and Python, which directly supports the low-code and automation work described in this role. I have experience designing and integrating RESTful APIs, working with webhooks, and connecting systems to move data seamlessly between services. I am comfortable with logical problem-solving and breaking down manual processes into structured, automated workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of LLMs into automation chains. In my project work, I have used OpenAI APIs to build AI-powered features, including training assistants and processing unstructured data. I am confident I can contribute to developing prompts and automation pipelines for handling complex administrative data.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to GOVORA\'s growth and help scale your automation efforts.', '2026-06-16 13:42:35.984', '2026-06-16 13:42:35.984'),
(958, 958, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Business/Management/Economics enrollment\",\"German C1/C2\",\"GTM operations experience\",\"Dashboard maintenance\",\"KPI tracking\",\"Cross-functional coordination\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills, but the role requires enrollment in a Business/Management/Economics program, German fluency, and GTM-specific operational experience. There is no direct skill overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student Go-to-Market position at 1KOMMA5°. Your mission to build the energy system of the future with Heartbeat AI is exactly the kind of real-world impact I want to contribute to. The idea of expanding intelligent energy optimization beyond your existing customers to anyone with solar and battery assets is a compelling challenge.\n\nAs a software engineering student with hands-on experience in full-stack development and system monitoring, I bring a structured, data-oriented approach to operational work. I have built and maintained real-time dashboards that track server health, latency, and availability metrics, consolidating data into clear, decision-ready updates for the team. This experience directly aligns with keeping performance tracking reliable and maintaining reporting cadences for launch KPIs and activation metrics.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I worked closely with product and operations teams to identify bottlenecks in customer-facing workflows and drive concrete fixes. I am comfortable breaking complex workstreams into clear tasks, flagging dependencies early, and ensuring alignment across functions. I follow through on action items end-to-end and make sure progress doesn\'t stop at the meeting room door.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am enrolled in a Bachelor\'s program in Software Engineering and looking for a working student role with real responsibility. I\'ve attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the GTM team during this pivotal phase.', '2026-06-16 13:42:42.961', '2026-06-16 13:42:42.961'),
(959, 959, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"SQL\",\"Node.js\",\"React\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"AWS\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Business Analytics experience\",\"Product Analytics experience\",\"Tableau/Looker\",\"Mobile gaming domain knowledge\",\"ROAS/LTV/CPI fluency\",\"5+ years analytics experience\"]', 'The candidate has strong technical skills in Python, SQL, and dashboarding, but lacks direct experience in business/product analytics, BI tools like Tableau/Looker, and mobile gaming domain knowledge required for this senior role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Analyst - Strategy & Insights position at exmox GmbH. The role sits at the intersection of data, strategy, and business impact, which aligns with how I approach analytical work: building systems that turn raw data into clear, actionable decisions.\n\nWhile my primary background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked on data-intensive projects that required performance monitoring, dashboarding, and automation. I built a real-time server health monitoring system using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Python that streamed live metrics to a React-based dashboard. This involved designing data pipelines, setting up role-based access, and deploying the full stack with Docker and Nginx. I am comfortable working with SQL and Python for data manipulation and have used tools like Prometheus and Grafana for observability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on problem framing and converting ambiguous business questions into structured investigations. In my work developing an AI-powered financial application, I regularly translated vague stakeholder needs into scoped technical plans, built API endpoints, integrated third-party services like AWS SES and OpenAI, and ensured data integrity across the system. I approach unclear problems by breaking them into testable hypotheses and building decision-ready outputs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to exmox\'s growth. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-16 13:42:50.989', '2026-06-16 13:42:50.989'),
(960, 960, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"kaufmännische Ausbildung\",\"Berufserfahrung im Lebensmittelbereich\",\"MS Office Kenntnisse\",\"Navision\",\"Qualitätsmanagement Kenntnisse\",\"Importbereich Kenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for this quality management role in the fruit and vegetable sector. The job requires commercial training, food industry experience, MS Office skills, and quality management knowledge, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter (m/w/d) Qualitätsmanagement Obst & Gemüse position at Landgard Service GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a structured approach to documentation and data management, and the ability to quickly learn and adapt to new domains.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for managing data flows, ensuring accuracy in documentation, and coordinating with multiple stakeholders to meet quality standards. These responsibilities required careful attention to detail, systematic tracking of information, and clear communication across teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with international producers and suppliers. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and am comfortable communicating across cultural boundaries. I am confident I can quickly learn the specific quality standards, certifications, and documentation processes relevant to the fruit and vegetable import sector.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can contribute to your quality management team in Munich.', '2026-06-16 13:42:58.421', '2026-06-16 13:42:58.421'),
(961, 961, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Pharmaceutical/commercial assistant training (PTA/PKA)\",\"Accounts receivable/debtor accounting experience\",\"Knowledge of SGB V billing regulations (§300, 302, 129a)\",\"German language proficiency (implied)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) with no matching pharmaceutical, commercial assistant, or accounts receivable experience. The job requires a PTA/PKA background and knowledge of German healthcare billing regulations. The applicant has strong IT skills which partially align with the \'gute EDV-Kenntnisse\' requirement, but the core qualifications for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pharmazeutisch kaufmännische Assistenten (50%) für Debitoren Buchhaltung position at KÖNIG Gesellschaft für Image- & Dokumentenverarbeitung mbH. Your company\'s focus on optimizing IT services in the e-health sector, particularly in prescription processing and billing, is an area where I believe my technical and analytical skills can contribute.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong IT skills and a disciplined approach to data management and process optimization. In my previous roles, I worked extensively with databases, financial transactions, and automated workflows, which has given me a solid foundation for handling accounts receivable, reconciling accounts, and managing payment processes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to collaborate on the further development of billing software. My experience building and maintaining web applications, including payment gateway integration and role-based access control, has prepared me to contribute meaningfully to software improvements in a healthcare billing context.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how my skills can support your team.', '2026-06-16 13:43:05.540', '2026-06-16 13:43:05.540'),
(962, 962, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"IT project management experience\",\"Workplace redesign project leadership\",\"M365/Windows workplace expertise\",\"Endpoint management experience\",\"Agile team leadership experience\",\"Stakeholder management at C-level\",\"Risk and budget management experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in Linux, Docker, Git, Nginx, and CI/CD which are relevant to the technical environment mentioned in the job description. However, the role is a Senior IT Project Manager position requiring extensive experience in leading complex IT infrastructure projects, managing cross-functional teams, stakeholder communication at C-level, and risk/budget management. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct project management experience, workplace redesign expertise, or M365/Windows workplace knowledge. The match is low for this specific senior management role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior IT Projekt Manager position at K-tronik GmbH. The role\'s focus on coordinating global IT workplace redesign projects, balancing diverse stakeholder requirements, and ensuring security compliance aligns with my experience in managing complex technical initiatives from planning through delivery.\n\nMy professional background includes leading full-stack development projects where I was responsible for structuring requirements, prioritizing features, and coordinating between business stakeholders, security teams, and technical contributors. I have practical experience managing agile project setups, including workshop facilitation, backlog management, and iteration planning to keep cross-functional teams aligned and delivering consistently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of translating very different requirements from various user groups into unified technical concepts. In previous projects, I regularly acted as the bridge between business needs and technical implementation, ensuring that security and compliance requirements were integrated into every stage of development. I am comfortable preparing decision templates and management briefings that make complex technical topics accessible to C-level stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management experience can contribute to K-tronik\'s team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-16 13:43:13.530', '2026-06-16 13:43:13.530'),
(963, 963, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Executive Administrative Assistance\",\"Expense Reporting\",\"Executive Support\",\"Scheduling\",\"Travel Coordination\",\"Office Administration\",\"Office Software Proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (Full-Stack & AI Engineer) with no direct experience in executive assistance, administrative support, expense reporting, or office management. While the applicant demonstrates strong organizational skills and remote work capability through software project management, the core qualifications for this Executive Assistant role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant role at Triwill Group. Your company\'s global presence across 39 countries and commitment to quality in the printing and packaging industry is impressive. I am interested in contributing to your team\'s operational efficiency.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills through managing complex projects and coordinating with diverse stakeholders. I am accustomed to working independently in remote settings and handling multiple responsibilities simultaneously.\n\nIn my previous roles, I regularly managed schedules, coordinated team workflows, and maintained clear documentation for project tracking. These experiences have given me the discipline and attention to detail needed for executive support tasks such as calendar management, travel coordination, and expense reporting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and remote work experience align with the needs of your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-16 13:43:20.101', '2026-06-16 13:43:20.101'),
(964, 964, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\"]', '[\"Investment banking experience\",\"Management consulting experience (McKinsey, Bain, BCG)\",\"Private equity experience\",\"M&A experience\",\"MBA or advanced degree\",\"C-Suite advisory experience\",\"Fintech/financial services background\"]', 'The candidate has strong technical skills in full-stack development, cloud infrastructure, and system deployment, but lacks the required 4+ years at a top-tier investment bank, management consulting firm, or private equity fund. The role is heavily focused on strategic initiative leadership, M&A, and executive support rather than software engineering. While the candidate demonstrates ownership mentality and cross-functional collaboration through technical projects, the core requirements for this Chief of Staff position are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff Operating Partner CEO Office position at Stableton. Your firm\'s position as a tech- and data-driven institutional investor in private blue-chip companies is compelling, and the opportunity to work directly with the CEO on strategic initiatives aligns with my career goals.\n\nMy background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer has equipped me with strong analytical and problem-solving skills. I have experience building scalable web applications, integrating complex systems, and optimizing processes for performance. This technical foundation allows me to quickly understand new domains, identify operational bottlenecks, and drive initiatives forward with clarity.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have taken ownership of multiple high-stakes projects from conception to deployment. I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, implemented secure authentication and payment gateways, and deployed systems on cloud infrastructure. I am comfortable working across teams, translating business requirements into technical solutions, and ensuring alignment between stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my ability to synthesize complex information, drive execution, and adapt quickly would make me a valuable addition to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to Stableton\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-16 13:43:28.217', '2026-06-16 13:43:28.217'),
(965, 965, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Investment banking experience\",\"Management consulting experience (McKinsey, Bain, BCG)\",\"Private equity experience\",\"M&A experience\",\"MBA or advanced degree\",\"CEO/C-Suite advisory experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the Chief of Staff role at Stableton Financial AG requires 4+ years at a top-tier investment bank, management consulting firm, or private equity fund, along with M&A and C-suite advisory experience. The applicant\'s profile does not match these requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Chief of Staff Operating Partner CEO Office role at Stableton Financial AG. Stableton\'s position as a tech-driven institutional investor reshaping private market investing is compelling, and the opportunity to work directly with the CEO on high-impact strategic initiatives is exactly the kind of challenge I seek.\n\nMy professional experience centers on building scalable systems and driving cross-functional projects from concept to delivery. As a full-stack engineer, I have developed and deployed production applications using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and cloud infrastructure on AWS and Linux environments. This technical foundation allows me to understand product architecture deeply, communicate effectively with engineering teams, and bridge the gap between technical execution and business strategy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational and strategic dimension of this role. In my previous work, I have taken ownership of multiple high-stakes projects, collaborated with stakeholders to define priorities, and ensured initiatives moved forward with clear accountability. I am comfortable synthesizing complex information, identifying roadblocks, and driving resolutions with speed and efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in technology, project execution, and cross-functional collaboration can contribute to Stableton\'s continued growth. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-16 13:43:35.798', '2026-06-16 13:43:35.798'),
(966, 966, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Creative strategy\",\"UGC coordination\",\"Content marketing\",\"Social media management\",\"Brand strategy\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack development, AI engineering) with no direct experience in creative strategy, UGC coordination, or content marketing. The role requires skills in creative direction and user-generated content management, which are not present in the applicant\'s background. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Junior Creative Strategist & UGC Coordinator role at Elavate Superfoods. The opportunity to contribute to a brand focused on health and wellness through creative content coordination is genuinely interesting to me.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer and AI engineer, I have built platforms that manage user-generated content, automate workflows, and integrate third-party services. These projects required careful coordination between technical systems and content strategies, which aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn previous professional experience, I developed and maintained web applications where I implemented role-based access controls, real-time updates, and responsive interfaces. I also collaborated with stakeholders to translate content requirements into functional features, ensuring smooth delivery across teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my background can support Elavate Superfoods\' creative and content goals.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-16 13:43:41.676', '2026-06-16 13:43:41.676'),
(967, 967, 1, 15, '[\"PHP\"]', '[\"SMSF Operations\",\"SMSF Administration\",\"Superannuation Administration\",\"Fund Administration\",\"Financial Services Operations\",\"BGL Simple Fund 360\",\"Class Super\",\"SuperMate\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Australian financial services experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this AP Operations Analyst role, which demands 2+ years of SMSF administration, superannuation operations, and experience with Australian financial platforms like BGL Simple Fund 360 or Class Super. No direct overlap in skills or experience was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the AP Operations Analyst (Australian SMSF) position at D2B. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in data reconciliation, transaction processing, and structured workflow management through building complex financial systems and real-time data platforms.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have designed and built full-stack applications that handle high-volume data processing, secure transactions, and financial record management. For example, I developed an AI-powered financial application that processes user data, integrates with Google Sheets, generates PDF term sheets, and manages automated email delivery via AWS SES. This required careful attention to data integrity, reconciliation of inputs and outputs, and adherence to structured operational workflows.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I implemented role-based access control, authentication systems, and payment gateway integrations. These systems demanded precision, confidentiality, and the ability to manage multiple concurrent tasks while maintaining accuracy. I am comfortable working within SOP-driven environments and following structured processes to ensure consistent and reliable outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application for this role.', '2026-06-16 13:43:48.956', '2026-06-16 13:43:48.956'),
(968, 968, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Banking/finance knowledge\",\"MS Excel proficiency\",\"Customer support experience\",\"Transaction monitoring experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack development, AI engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this Operations Executive role, which focuses on transaction monitoring, client query handling, banking operations, and MS Excel proficiency. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Executive position at EFICYENT. Your focus on transaction monitoring, client query handling, and cross-team coordination aligns with my background in managing complex workflows and maintaining operational accuracy.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong attention to detail and systematic problem-solving skills. I regularly coordinated with internal teams and external partners to resolve issues, track progress, and ensure timely delivery. Maintaining accurate records and documentation was a core part of my daily work, which directly relates to the tracking and resolution responsibilities in this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on client communication and follow-up. I have experience responding to client queries professionally, sending status updates, and ensuring that all issues are documented and resolved. My ability to manage multiple tasks while maintaining accuracy and confidentiality has been consistently demonstrated in my previous roles.\n\nIn addition to my operational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to EFICYENT\'s operations team.', '2026-06-16 13:43:55.120', '2026-06-16 13:43:55.120'),
(969, 969, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Google Sheets / Excel proficiency\",\"Data entry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is an entry-level administrative assistant role. While the applicant demonstrates attention to detail, organization, and remote work capability through their development experience, they lack direct administrative or data entry experience. The match is low due to the role being outside the applicant\'s core technical domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at RecruitLytixs Hire. Your focus on structured processes, data management, and remote collaboration aligns well with my approach to work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed strong organizational habits and attention to detail. I regularly maintained accurate records, updated documentation, and tracked task progress across multiple projects. These skills transfer directly to administrative support work.\n\nI am comfortable working with spreadsheets, digital files, and internal tracking systems. I follow instructions carefully and can manage repetitive tasks with consistency. I also communicate clearly in writing and am comfortable using remote collaboration tools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to support your team with reliable administrative assistance. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to RecruitLytixs Hire\'s operations.', '2026-06-16 13:44:01.238', '2026-06-16 13:44:01.238'),
(970, 970, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Learning and development expertise\",\"Competency framework design\",\"Instructional design\",\"Training delivery\",\"Curriculum development\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (Full-Stack & AI Engineer) with no direct experience in Learning and Development, instructional design, or competency frameworks. While the applicant has mentoring and documentation experience from software engineering roles, the core requirements of this L&D Specialist role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learning And Development Specialist position at DTI (Diversified Technology Inc.). My background in software engineering has given me extensive experience in structuring technical knowledge, mentoring peers, and building systems that support continuous learning.\n\nThroughout my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD., I have been responsible for more than just writing code. I regularly conducted code reviews, wrote clear technical documentation, and facilitated knowledge-sharing sessions with team members. These responsibilities required me to break down complex technical concepts into understandable components, assess skill levels, and provide constructive feedback.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the design of learning pathways and competency frameworks. In my previous roles, I helped onboard new developers by creating structured learning materials and establishing best practices for our tech stack, which included Laravel, Next.js, and various database systems. I understand how to identify skill gaps and design progressive learning paths that build competence incrementally.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in technical training and development could contribute to DTI\'s learning initiatives.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-16 13:44:08.142', '2026-06-16 13:44:08.142'),
(971, 971, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"ISO 27001 knowledge\",\"Business analysis experience\",\"Consulting experience\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Regulatory compliance (NIS2, BCMS)\",\"Project coordination (agile/Scrum)\",\"Process analysis and structuring\"]', 'The applicant has a strong interest in cybersecurity and some relevant research experience in secure communications and encryption for UAV systems. However, the role requires specific business analysis, consulting, and regulatory compliance skills (ISO 27001, NIS2, BCMS) that are not present in the profile. The applicant also lacks professional experience in client-facing consulting or regulated industries, and does not have the required German language proficiency. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Analyst (m/w/d) Cyber Security & Compliance position at EWERK GROUP. The opportunity to work on real security challenges in regulated industries like energy, finance, and the public sector aligns directly with my technical background and research focus.\n\nThrough my academic research in secure UAV systems, I have developed a practical understanding of cybersecurity principles that apply directly to the responsibilities of this role. My work has involved designing secure communication protocols using encryption (AES), implementing data integrity mechanisms to prevent malicious command injection, and building fault-tolerant system architectures that remain resilient under adversarial conditions. These experiences have given me a strong foundation in risk analysis, security strategy, and the structured thinking required to support ISMS development according to frameworks like ISO 27001.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is translating complex security requirements into clear, actionable documentation and processes. In my research, I have documented system architectures, threat models, and mitigation strategies in a way that is precise enough for technical implementation while remaining accessible to non-specialist stakeholders. This skill maps directly to creating guidelines, policies, and operational procedures that are practically applicable in a consulting environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cybersecurity and structured analysis can contribute to EWERK GROUP\'s consulting work.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 01:40:03.187', '2026-06-17 01:40:03.187'),
(972, 972, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"CRM software experience\",\"Payroll industry knowledge\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct sales experience, CRM skills, payroll industry knowledge, or fluent German. The match is very low for this Sales Manager role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Manager position at LohnDialog Abrechnungsgesellschaft mbH. Your company\'s long-standing expertise in payroll and software solutions, combined with a collaborative and supportive work culture, makes this an appealing opportunity.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and client-facing skills through years of direct collaboration with stakeholders. I am comfortable presenting technical solutions, conducting consultations, and guiding clients through decision-making processes. These experiences have prepared me well for a sales role that requires clear communication and relationship building.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for understanding client requirements, presenting project proposals, and managing expectations throughout the delivery cycle. I learned to translate complex technical details into clear, accessible language for non-technical audiences. This ability to communicate effectively and build trust with clients is directly relevant to the sales process described in your job posting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your sales team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 01:40:10.322', '2026-06-17 01:40:10.322'),
(973, 973, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"HubSpot CRM proficiency\",\"Outbound prospecting\",\"Cold calling\",\"Full-cycle sales\",\"Deal closing\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no B2B sales, CRM, or outbound prospecting experience. The role requires 3+ years of full-cycle B2B sales, hunter mentality, and HubSpot mastery. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Account Executive (Full Cycle) role at ScholarshipOwl. Your mission to make education financing more accessible through AI-powered technology is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on connecting brands with the next generation of students.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in client-facing and stakeholder-driven environments. At Explo-IT, I collaborated directly with business teams to understand requirements, present technical solutions, and ensure successful delivery. This experience has given me strong communication skills, the ability to manage expectations, and a disciplined approach to follow-through.\n\nI am comfortable with outbound communication and relationship building. I have experience presenting ideas clearly, managing multiple priorities, and taking ownership of processes from start to finish. I am also fluent in English and Bengali, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me communicate effectively across diverse teams and markets.\n\nI am drawn to the high-ownership, results-oriented culture at ScholarshipOwl. I am confident I can contribute to your revenue growth by combining disciplined execution with a genuine interest in understanding customer needs.\n\nI\'ve attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 01:40:17.932', '2026-06-17 01:40:17.932');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(974, 974, 1, 55, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Terraform\",\"ArgoCD\",\"GitLab CI\",\"Elasticsearch\",\"Keycloak\",\"ISO 27001\",\"IAM\",\"EKS\",\"RDS\",\"S3\",\"GitOps\",\"Incident Response\",\"Vulnerability Scanning\",\"Security Compliance\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational cloud and DevOps skills including AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Linux, Nginx, CI/CD, Prometheus, Grafana, and PostgreSQL. However, he lacks direct experience with Terraform, ArgoCD, GitLab CI, Elasticsearch, Keycloak, and formal security compliance frameworks like ISO 27001. His background is more aligned with full-stack development and deployment rather than dedicated DevOps/platform engineering at a senior level.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior DevOps/ Cloud Engineer position at Accurids GmbH. Your work in building the data backbone for life-science innovation, standardizing critical enterprise data in compliance with ISO IDMP, is an area where I see strong alignment with my technical background.\n\nMy experience spans cloud infrastructure, containerization, CI/CD, and observability. I have worked with AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Prometheus, and Grafana in production contexts. I am comfortable managing Linux servers, configuring Nginx, and setting up CI/CD pipelines. I also have experience with PostgreSQL and have used Infrastructure as Code principles in my deployments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is operating and scaling AWS infrastructure, including multi-account environments, EKS, and RDS. In my previous work, I deployed full-stack applications on AWS EC2, configured Docker containers, and used Nginx for reverse proxying and load balancing. I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which involved streaming live metrics and managing containerized services. This project gave me practical experience with the kind of observability and platform automation that Accurids relies on.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Accurids\' infrastructure and platform goals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:40:26.914', '2026-06-17 01:40:26.914'),
(975, 975, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Real estate sales experience\",\"Client acquisition\",\"Property valuation\",\"Negotiation\",\"German language (implied)\",\"Drivers license and car\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack developer with strong technical skills, but the Handsvertrer role is a real estate sales position requiring experience in property acquisition, valuation, and client negotiation. There is no direct match in skills or experience. The only potential overlap is comfort with digital tools, but this is insufficient for the core responsibilities of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Handsvertrer position at EXTRA Immobilien Gruppe GmbH. Your company\'s approach of combining modern PropTech technology with personal advisory services is a compelling model. The idea of using smart digital tools and data-driven marketing to make property sales faster and more transparent is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI engineering, with over four years of professional experience building and maintaining web applications. I have worked extensively with technologies like Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and I am very comfortable using digital platforms and tools to manage workflows, data, and client interactions. The role\'s emphasis on using a digital Makler-Plattform for acquisition, marketing, and communication is a direct match for my technical skill set.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have developed and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and built responsive, user-friendly interfaces. I have also worked on projects involving real-time features, database optimization, and third-party service integration. This technical foundation means I can quickly become proficient with your internal systems and use them effectively to support the sales process.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and independent work style can contribute to the success of the EXTRA Immobilien Gruppe.', '2026-06-17 01:40:36.011', '2026-06-17 01:40:36.011'),
(976, 976, 1, 75, '[\"React\",\"Typescript\",\"Next JS\",\"RESTful APIs\",\"Microservices\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Tailwind\",\"Javascript\"]', '[\"Remix\",\"Nuxt\",\"Salesforce integration\",\"LLM-powered tooling\"]', 'Strong match for the Senior Full Stack Engineer role. The applicant has solid experience with React, TypeScript, Next.js, RESTful APIs, microservices, Docker, and Kubernetes. Professional experience includes full-stack development, API integration, authentication, real-time features, and deployment. Missing experience with Remix, Nuxt, Salesforce integration, and LLM-powered tooling, but the core technical requirements are well covered.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Full Stack Engineer - Sidekick role at SumUp. The work the Sidekick team does building a progressive web app that directly empowers field sales agents to create offers, sign up merchants, and track commissions in real time is exactly the kind of product I want to contribute to. I have been building full-stack web applications professionally for over four years, and I am drawn to the ownership and stakeholder engagement this role offers.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on React, TypeScript, and Next.js, which I have used to ship scalable, maintainable applications in production. I also have hands-on experience building and consuming RESTful APIs within microservice architectures, and I am comfortable deploying and managing applications in cloud-native environments using Docker and Kubernetes. These are the core technologies the Sidekick team relies on, and I have applied them across multiple real-world projects.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I owned features end-to-end from scoping through to production. I built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, delivered real-time features using WebSockets, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I also worked closely with stakeholders to understand requirements and propose practical solutions, which aligns directly with how the Sidekick team collaborates with sales stakeholders.\n\nOne project that reflects the kind of work this role requires is the Smart Finance platform, a full-stack personal finance management application I built with Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. It features secure server-side authentication, role-based admin controls, real-time updates via Server-Sent Events, and Docker-based deployment. The architecture was designed for scalability and maintainability, and I took full ownership of the feature delivery from design to deployment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Sidekick team at SumUp.', '2026-06-17 01:40:45.376', '2026-06-17 01:40:45.376'),
(977, 977, 1, 25, '[\"SQL\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Snowflake\",\"Looker\",\"Airflow\",\"DBT\",\"Tableau\",\"Power BI\",\"Data Warehousing (specific experience)\",\"5+ years as Analytics Engineer/BI Developer\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in SQL, databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL), cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), and DevOps tools (Docker, CI/CD, Linux) that are relevant to the role. However, the role requires specialized experience in analytics engineering tools (Snowflake, Looker, Airflow, DBT) and a specific focus on data warehousing, data modeling, and business intelligence, which are not evident in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s experience is primarily in web development and full-stack engineering rather than dedicated analytics engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Analytics Engineer, Merchant position at Wolt. Wolt\'s work in building a complex delivery platform that handles real-time geolocational and temporal data across hundreds of cities is genuinely interesting to me, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to the Merchant Analytics Engineering team.\n\nMy technical experience centers on building and maintaining data-driven systems. I have worked with SQL, MySQL, and PostgreSQL to design schemas, write optimized queries, and manage data pipelines. I have also deployed and monitored applications using Docker, Nginx, and cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud, which has given me practical experience with the infrastructure that supports analytics workflows.\n\nA relevant example from my work is the Real-Time Server Health Monitoring project. In that system, I designed a full-stack dashboard that tracked the availability and latency of multiple target URLs simultaneously. The backend, built with Node.js and Express, used Socket.IO to stream live metrics to the frontend. This required building a data pipeline that collected, processed, and visualized system health data in real time, which aligns closely with the data integration and dashboard responsibilities described in this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Wolt\'s analytics engineering goals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:40:54.644', '2026-06-17 01:40:54.644'),
(978, 978, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Maschinenbau / Elektrotechnik / Mechatronik background\",\"Fertigungsplanung experience\",\"Prozessentwicklung experience\",\"Meister / Techniker qualification\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this production planning / project management role in manufacturing. The job requires a technical degree or apprenticeship in mechanical/electrical engineering, experience in production planning and process development, and strong organizational skills in a manufacturing context. The applicant\'s skills are in software development, web technologies, and AI, with no relevant manufacturing or production planning experience. The match score is low at 25.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager / Projektleiter position for Fertigungsplanung / Arbeitsvorbereitung at AS-Talentbridge. Your focus on connecting talent with opportunities in the DACH region and your commitment to innovation align with my approach to structured project delivery and cross-team coordination.\n\nThrough my professional experience in software development, I have developed strong organizational skills and a practical approach to planning and resource management. I have worked closely with production, logistics, and client-facing teams to coordinate task assignments, manage documentation, and ensure that all operational resources are aligned for smooth project execution. This has given me hands-on experience in optimizing workflows and maintaining clear communication across departments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the implementation of efficient Arbeitsvorbereitungsprozesse. In previous work, I have been responsible for creating and updating technical documentation, testing process changes, and acting as a reliable point of contact for both team members and external stakeholders. I am comfortable supporting specialized departments and ensuring that custom requirements are properly implemented and tracked.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to bring my coordination skills and technical understanding to AS-Talentbridge. My CV is attached for your review.\n\nSincerely,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 01:41:03.585', '2026-06-17 01:41:03.585'),
(979, 979, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Impact investing or venture capital experience\",\"Business or economics degree\",\"CRM system management\",\"Pitch deck and financial plan evaluation\",\"Transaction process management\",\"German language proficiency\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Workshop and webinar facilitation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI automation. However, this Transaction Manager role at FASE requires a business/finance background, 3+ years in venture capital, impact investing, or corporate finance, and experience managing fundraising transactions. The applicant\'s profile shows no relevant experience in these areas. The only partial overlap is an affinity for AI and automation tools, which is a minor aspect of the role. Overall fit is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Transaction Manager position at FASE. The opportunity to work at Europe\'s leading impact finance advisor, helping social and environmental startups scale their impact through better access to capital, is exactly the kind of mission-driven work I want to be part of.\n\nMy motivation for working in impact finance comes from a deep interest in building systems that create measurable positive change. Through my engineering background, I have seen how technology and automation can amplify the reach of organizations working on social and environmental challenges. I want to apply that same thinking to help impact startups grow and attract the right funding partners.\n\nOne area where I can contribute directly is in the selection and implementation of automation tools and artificial intelligence across the pipeline and transaction process. I