(980, 980, 1, 72, '[\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Firebase\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Python\",\"C++\",\"REST API\",\"JWT\",\"Stripe\"]', '[\"Shopify\",\"Klaviyo\",\"Supabase\",\"Google Workspace APIs\",\"LangGraph\",\"n8n\",\"Claude Code\",\"Cursor\",\"Codex\",\"Anthropic\",\"Gemini\",\"E-commerce domain experience\"]', 'Strong match for the AI engineering and full-stack delivery aspects. Shagor has built and deployed multiple AI-powered applications using OpenAI, AWS, and Google Cloud, with end-to-end ownership. He is missing specific e-commerce platform experience (Shopify, Klaviyo) and some AI workflow tools, but his demonstrated ability to build production systems from scratch aligns well with the role\'s requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer / AI Systems role at Strictly Boring GmbH. Your approach of building production-grade AI and automation systems that actually run during Black Week, rather than delivering demos, is exactly the kind of engineering environment I want to work in.\n\nMy work combines full-stack development with practical AI integration. I have built and deployed multiple AI-powered applications from scratch, including a financial assistant that uses OpenAI for conversational support and AWS Transcribe for voice processing, and an AI-driven real estate platform with role-based access, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration. These projects required me to handle architecture, LLM integration, cost control, and deployment independently.\n\nI have deployed production applications on AWS and Google Cloud with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable with monitoring, secrets management, and keeping systems reliable under load. My experience building real-time features with Socket.IO and managing databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL means I can handle the data flow and orchestration challenges your customers face.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can own customer projects from problem understanding to go-live, and help shape the technical foundation of a growing team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Strictly Boring.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 01:41:22.491', '2026-06-17 01:41:22.491'),
(981, 981, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Communication/PR/Marketing degree\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Canva\",\"Social media platform expertise\",\"Content creation experience\",\"Campaign conception experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct background in PR, content, or social media. While he demonstrates analytical thinking, AI tool familiarity, and cross-functional teamwork, he lacks the required degree field, German language skills, and direct experience in communications or marketing. This is a significant mismatch for a role specifically designed for communications graduates.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trainee (m/w/d) PR, Content & Social Media position at Contegy. Your focus on B2B technology and industrial clients, combined with the structured 12-month traineeship, is exactly the kind of environment where I want to start my career in communications.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Contegy is the emphasis on learning from the ground up through a defined training plan, external certifications, and regular coaching. As someone with a strong analytical and technical background, I am eager to develop my skills in PR, content creation, and campaign conception while working with experienced consultants.\n\nThrough my previous work as a Web Developer, I have gained practical experience collaborating in cross-functional teams, communicating with external partners, and delivering projects with precision and reliability. I am comfortable working with complex topics and turning them into clear, structured outputs. I am also proficient with AI tools such as ChatGPT and Claude, and I am confident in my ability to quickly learn design tools like Canva or Adobe Creative Suite.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take responsibility, contribute to a small team, and grow into a junior consultant role. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Contegy.', '2026-06-17 01:41:30.799', '2026-06-17 01:41:30.799'),
(982, 982, 1, 45, '[\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"CRM project management experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Marketing automation experience\",\"IT business analyst experience\",\"Industry knowledge (Energy, Utilities, Banking, Insurance, Retail)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and web development, with experience delivering complex projects. However, the role specifically requires 2-3 years of CRM/software project management experience, German language skills, and industry knowledge, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial, with technical skills being relevant but the core project management and language requirements not being met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CRM IT Projekt Manager position. Your client\'s focus on CRM/CX software, marketing automation, and machine learning aligns with my background in software engineering and project delivery.\n\nMy technical foundation in computer science and software engineering provides the analytical thinking and structured approach needed for managing CRM-related IT projects. I have experience leading full-stack development projects from concept to deployment, which has given me practical insight into software lifecycle management, requirement analysis, and cross-functional coordination.\n\nIn my professional experience, I delivered a multi-vendor e-commerce platform that required coordinating between customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams. This project involved managing technical requirements, implementing role-based access control, integrating real-time communication, and ensuring smooth deployment. The experience taught me how to balance technical complexity with business needs while keeping stakeholders aligned throughout the project.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management experience and technical background can contribute to your client\'s CRM software initiatives.', '2026-06-17 01:41:39.118', '2026-06-17 01:41:39.118'),
(983, 983, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Content creation and editorial planning\",\"SEO and GEO optimization\",\"Social media management\",\"Creative strategy and campaign development\",\"German language proficiency (written and spoken)\",\"Experience with content management systems\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and software engineering, but the Content Manager role requires specific expertise in content strategy, SEO, social media, and German language proficiency. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Content Manager (Teilzeit) position at Ecoturn GmbH. Your platform Elektrovorteil serves a clear and growing market in the German THG-Quoten space, and I find the focus on digital content strategy and organic growth particularly interesting.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have built and managed content-heavy web platforms where structure, clarity, and user experience directly impact performance. I understand how technical decisions affect content discoverability and how to align editorial workflows with platform capabilities.\n\nIn my work as a Web Developer, I have planned site architectures, implemented SEO-friendly metadata and internal linking structures, and developed responsive interfaces using Next.js and Laravel. These projects required me to think about how content is organized, presented, and optimized for both users and search engines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali a