(984, 984, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"B2B-SaaS-Marketing\",\"Marketing Automation (Salesforce, HubSpot)\",\"CRM management\",\"SEO strategy\",\"Content strategy\",\"Team leadership (5-8 years)\",\"German native\",\"SaaS metrics (ARR, CAC, LTV)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no marketing, leadership, or B2B SaaS experience. The role requires 5-8 years of marketing leadership, deep expertise in CRM/marketing automation, and native German. The applicant\'s technical skills (web development, AI) do not match the core marketing requirements. Score is low due to fundamental role mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Marketing position at orderbird GmbH. Your mission to simplify daily operations for hospitality professionals through intuitive technology resonates with my own approach to building practical, user-focused systems.\n\nAs a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I bring a technical perspective to marketing operations. I have hands-on experience developing and optimizing web platforms, including SEO-friendly interfaces, content management systems, and performance monitoring. My work with Next.js, Laravel, and Tailwind CSS has involved building responsive, fast-loading websites that directly impact user engagement and search visibility.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I have delivered full-stack applications end-to-end, from API integration and database optimization to deployment on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I have also worked with analytics and monitoring tools such as Grafana and Prometheus, which aligns well with the data-driven marketing approach orderbird values. My experience integrating third-party services and managing cloud deployments on AWS and Google Cloud gives me a solid foundation for overseeing website performance and LLMO visibility.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and problem-solving approach can contribute to orderbird\'s marketing leadership team.', '2026-06-17 01:41:54.724', '2026-06-17 01:41:54.724'),
(985, 985, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Go\",\"Nginx\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Rust\",\"ONNX\",\"TensorRT\",\"WASM\",\"WebSocket\",\"WebRTC\",\"DSP\",\"Real-time audio processing\",\"FFI design\",\"C API design\"]', 'Shahanur has foundational systems programming skills in C++ and Python, with experience deploying ML models on edge devices and working with Linux, Docker, and CI/CD. However, the role requires deep expertise in Rust, real-time audio/DSP, ML inference runtimes (ONNX, TensorRT), and cross-platform SDK development, which are not present in his profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systems Software Engineer (Rust, ML Inference) role at ai-coustics. Your work on building the reliability layer for Voice AI, combining real-time audio processing with production-grade SDKs, is exactly the kind of infrastructure challenge I want to be part of.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and optimized real-time ML inference systems that run on constrained hardware. One example is a wireless vision-aid system that uses YOLOv8n for object detection, with a custom UDP streaming protocol to maintain ultra-low latency. This required careful memory management, performance profiling, and ensuring deterministic behavior under strict timing constraints. I also developed a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, where I worked on secure communication protocols and cryptographic data integrity using C++ and Python.\n\nWhat stands out to me about ai-coustics is the focus on making neural audio models run fast and reliably outside of research environments. I have experience bridging that gap. In my work on the