(986, 986, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Completed Ausbildung or degree in accounting, finance, or related field\",\"Solid knowledge of German accounting standards and payroll requirements\",\"Familiarity with DATEV, Finway, or similar tools\",\"German grant/funding administration experience\",\"Fluent German\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering with no direct finance, accounting, or German accounting standards experience. The role requires a degree in accounting/finance, knowledge of German accounting standards, familiarity with DATEV/Finway, grant administration experience, and fluent German. The applicant has strong organizational and analytical skills from software development but lacks the core financial qualifications and German language fluency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Finance Manager- Part Time (20 hours/wk) position at Made of Air GmbH. Your work in reversing climate change through deep-tech materials is meaningful, and I appreciate the opportunity to support the financial backbone of a mission-driven startup.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical, organizational, and problem-solving skills through building and managing complex full-stack systems. I am accustomed to working directly with stakeholders, managing multiple priorities, and ensuring accuracy in every detail. These skills transfer directly to owning day-to-day financial operations in a small, fast-moving team.\n\nI am fluent in English and have working-level German. I am comfortable coordinating with external partners, managing documentation, and handling structured workflows. I am highly organised, independent, and proactive, and I enjoy taking ownership of operational tasks in a collaborative environment.\n\nI am eager to bring my structured thinking and reliability to Made of Air, supporting your team with invoice management, cash flow tracking, grant administration, and financial reporting.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 01:42:10.499', '2026-06-17 01:42:10.499'),
(987, 987, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\"]', '[\"IT-Leitung / IT-Transformation Lead / Head of IT experience\",\"Multi-Stream-Programm-Management\",\"Vendor- & Provider-Management\",\"M365 / Azure / Entra ID\",\"ITSM\",\"Security Baseline\",\"Identity & Access Management\",\"Budgetverantwortung\",\"C-Level Reporting\",\"Operating Model Design\",\"SOW / SLA-Verhandlungen\"]', 'The applicant has strong hands-on technical skills in cloud infrastructure, containerization, monitoring, and AI integration, but lacks the senior leadership, program management, vendor management, and IT operations management experience required for this Head of Group IT role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Group IT position at SelectLine Group. Your focus on IT consolidation, security baseline, and AI integration across the group aligns with my technical background and interest in building resilient, scalable IT operations.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), container orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes), and monitoring stacks (Prometheus, Grafana). I have deployed and maintained production systems on Linux servers using Nginx and Apache, and I have implemented CI/CD pipelines to streamline delivery. These skills directly support the kind of IT operations and infrastructure consolidation you are driving.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is AI integration. I have built AI-powered assistants and automation systems using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, integrating them into full-stack applications. I understand both the strategic potential and the practical challenges of introducing AI into existing workflows. I am comfortable working with cross-functional teams to evaluate, pilot, and roll out new technologies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to SelectLine Group\'s IT transformation.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 01:42:18.694', '2026-06-17 01:42:18.694'),
(988, 988, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Account management experience\",\"Hotel supply industry knowledge\",\"Experience in cosmetics or FMCG\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Key Account Manager role at GFL Cosmetics, which requires sales, account management, and hotel industry experience. No technical skills from the profile are directly relevant to the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Key Account Manager position at GFL Cosmetics. Your company\'s 30-year track record in the cosmetics industry and global presence across hotels, retail, and e-commerce channels is impressive. I am particularly drawn to the opportunity to develop the Southern Germany market and contribute to your continued growth.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and tech-savvy capabilities that directly support the data analysis and sales strategy optimization aspects of this role. I am proficient in Excel and various online business applications, and I have experience using data to drive decisions and improve outcomes.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have collaborated closely with diverse stakeholders, managed client relationships, and ensured clear communication across teams. These experiences have equipped me with the relationship management, negotiation, and training skills needed to maintain strong partnerships with existing clients and distribution partners, as well as to develop new sales contracts.\n\nI am a highly self-motivated and entrepreneurial individual who thrives when working independently toward clear targets. I am comfortable with travel and eager to apply my proactive mindset to achieve and exceed sales turnover and margin goals. I also align with GFL Cosmetics\' values of environmental respect and sustainability.\n\nIn addition to my technical and analytical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-17 01:42:26.380', '2026-06-17 01:42:26.380'),
(989, 989, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"Java EE\",\"Freemarker\",\"Dokumentengenerierung\",\"Deutsch (sehr gute Kenntnisse)\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills with experience in server-side applications, REST APIs, HTML, and deployment processes. However, the role specifically requires Java 17+, Spring Boot 3, and enterprise Java experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant also lacks the required German language proficiency.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Software Engineer Java position at Bridgency HR Management GbR. The opportunity to contribute to a long-term digitalization program in the public sector is something I find genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the emphasis on modernizing enterprise systems with practical engineering.\n\nMy professional experience has been centered on building and maintaining server-side applications and web-based systems. I have worked with PHP (Laravel), Node.js, and MySQL to develop scalable backend services, RESTful APIs, and secure authentication flows. I am comfortable working with distributed application architectures and have deployed systems on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. While my primary stack has not been Java, the core principles of server-side development, API design, and enterprise application architecture transfer directly.\n\nIn previous work, I have been responsible for implementing role-based access control, integrating third-party services, optimizing database queries, and ensuring application reliability through testing and code reviews. I have also built responsive, SEO-friendly web interfaces using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frameworks. These responsibilities align closely with the tasks described for this role, including web component development, system integration, and quality assurance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 01:42:34.468', '2026-06-17 01:42:34.468'),
(990, 990, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Studium der Wirtschaftswissenschaften mit Schwerpunkt Versicherung\",\"Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung in den Komposit-Sparten SHUK\",\"Mehrjährige Führungserfahrung\",\"Vertriebsorientierung\",\"Projektmanagement in skalierten agilen Projekten\",\"Versicherungsprodukt- und Portfoliomanagement\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and project delivery skills, but this role is a senior insurance product management position requiring specific insurance industry expertise (SHUK composite lines), business/insurance education, and multi-year leadership experience. The applicant\'s software engineering background does not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Leiter Produktmanagement Kompositversicherung (m/w/d) position at Gunnar Kühne Executive Search GmbH. While my background is in software engineering rather than insurance, I bring a strong track record of leading product development, driving digital transformation, and optimizing complex systems in technology-driven environments.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have taken full ownership of product delivery from concept to deployment. I have managed end-to-end development cycles, coordinated with cross-functional teams, and continuously refined workflows to improve efficiency and output quality. This has given me a practical understanding of product strategy, portfolio management, and the importance of aligning technical decisions with business objectives.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the digitalization of traditional business models. In my previous roles, I have led projects that automated manual processes, integrated third-party services, and improved system reliability. I am comfortable working in transformation environments where process optimization, stakeholder alignment, and strategic project execution are critical to success.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product management and digitalization experience can contribute to your client\'s goals.', '2026-06-17 01:42:42.941', '2026-06-17 01:42:42.941');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(991, 991, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Studium der Wirtschaftswissenschaften mit Schwerpunkt Versicherung\",\"Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung im Bereich Gewerbe- oder Industrie-Sachversicherung\",\"Underwriting, Portfoliosteuerung, Annahmepolitik und Zeichnungsrichtlinien\",\"Führungserfahrung\",\"Projektmanagement in skalierten agilen Projekten\",\"Versicherungsbranche-Kenntnisse\",\"Deutsch (Sprache)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development and project delivery skills, but lacks the insurance-specific qualifications, industry experience, and language requirements (German) for this senior leadership role in commercial property insurance underwriting and portfolio management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter Gewerbeversicherung Sach / Underwriting & Portfolio (m/w/d) position at Gunnar Kühne Executive Search GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring strong analytical thinking, project management experience, and a track record of driving digital transformation initiatives that may be relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I have designed and delivered scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I built RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance. These projects required me to manage complex workflows, coordinate with stakeholders, and deliver measurable results on time.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on innovation, digitalization, and transformation projects in this role. In my previous positions, I led the development of real-time features using WebSockets and Pusher, deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx, and set up CI/CD pipelines. I also built an AI-powered financial application that automated document generation and integrated third-party services, demonstrating my ability to drive technology-driven improvements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in software engineering, project delivery, and digital innovation can contribute to the continued success of your client\'s insurance operations.', '2026-06-17 01:42:51.015', '2026-06-17 01:42:51.015'),
(992, 992, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Event promotion experience\",\"Sales or customer-facing experience\",\"German language (implied)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct event promotion, sales, or customer-facing experience. The role requires outgoing personality, hands-on event work, and brand ambassadorship. The applicant\'s communication skills and willingness to work weekends are the only partial matches.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vly Promoter:in position at VF Nutrition GmbH. Your mission to create healthy, plant-based milk alternatives that are better for both people and the planet is something I genuinely support. I have tried vly products and believe in what the brand stands for.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I am naturally outgoing and enjoy direct interaction with people. I am comfortable approaching strangers, starting conversations, and sharing enthusiasm about products I believe in. I am also proactive and hands-on, which means I am ready to help with event setup, equipment handling, and takedown without needing to be asked.\n\nI am available for events on weekends and flexible with different locations across Berlin. I speak English and Bengali fluently, and I have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me connect with diverse audiences.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can represent a brand I respect and contribute to its growth through direct community engagement. I would be happy to bring my energy and reliability to the vly team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 01:42:58.646', '2026-06-17 01:42:58.646'),
(993, 993, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Law or Economics degree\",\"Banking/insurance experience\",\"Credit insurance experience\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"German fluency (business level)\",\"Negotiation skills\",\"Underwriting experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this Senior Underwriter role. The job requires a degree in law or economics, years of experience in banking or insurance (specifically credit insurance), business-level German, and MS Office proficiency. The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant industry experience, domain knowledge, or required language skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior-) Underwriter:in position at Gunnar Kühne Executive Search GmbH, representing a leading industrial insurer. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, data-driven decision-making, and structured problem-solving that are directly transferable to the underwriting domain.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for building and maintaining complex systems that required precise attention to detail, rigorous testing, and clear documentation. I regularly analyzed data to optimize performance, identify patterns, and make informed decisions. These skills are essential for evaluating risks, developing renewal strategies, and managing a trade credit portfolio.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of international programs and the development of contract wordings. My experience working on cross-functional projects with remote teams has given me a practical understanding of stakeholder management and clear communication. I am comfortable working with diverse groups to align on objectives and deliver results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, attention to detail, and ability to manage complex workflows would allow me to contribute effectively to your client\'s underwriting team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with this role.', '2026-06-17 01:43:06.635', '2026-06-17 01:43:06.635'),
(994, 994, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Capital Markets domain expertise\",\"Trading/Treasury/Regulatory experience\",\"Team leadership in consulting/finance\",\"Business development in financial services\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"C-level communication experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer has minimal overlap with the Director Capital Markets role, which requires extensive experience in financial consulting, capital markets, team leadership, and business development. The only tangential connection is a project involving blockchain and cryptography, but the core requirements of the job are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director Capital Markets (m/w/d) position at Gunnar Kühne Executive Search GmbH. The role\'s focus on blockchain, digital assets, and strategic transformation in the financial sector is directly relevant to my technical background and project experience.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and deployed systems that integrate blockchain concepts, secure authentication, and real-time data processing. One example is my work on a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, where I implemented cryptographic chaining (SHA3-256), zero-knowledge proofs, and post-quantum cryptography to ensure data integrity and secure communication. This project required designing decentralized architectures and managing complex security requirements.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have delivered scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, with responsibilities including API development, database optimization, and deployment on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I have also integrated payment gateways and role-based access control, which are relevant to building secure financial systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your client\'s strategic goals in capital markets and digital assets.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:43:14.999', '2026-06-17 01:43:14.999'),
(995, 995, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"M&A transaction experience\",\"Corporate Finance Advisory\",\"Private Equity\",\"Financial modeling\",\"Business valuation\",\"Due diligence\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"BWL/VWL/Finance degree\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and full-stack development, with no direct experience in M&A, corporate finance, or investment banking. The role requires 2-4 years of relevant M&A or corporate finance experience, a strong finance or business degree, and fluent German. The applicant\'s analytical and numerical skills from building financial applications provide a minimal indirect match, but the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Analyst / Associate M&A position at Gunnar Kühne Executive Search GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and system architecture, I bring strong analytical and numerical skills developed through building complex, data-intensive applications.\n\nIn my professional experience, I designed and developed an AI-powered financial application that involved creating RESTful APIs, integrating third-party services, and implementing automated data processing and report generation workflows. This required precise attention to data integrity, financial logic, and system reliability skills directly transferable to financial modeling and analysis.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and finance. Through my work on financial platforms, I have developed a practical understanding of how data flows through financial systems, how to structure and analyze large datasets, and how to present complex information clearly to stakeholders. These experiences have strengthened my ability to work with numerical data and produce high-quality documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, attention to detail, and ability to manage complex workflows would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with this role.', '2026-06-17 01:43:23.555', '2026-06-17 01:43:23.555'),
(996, 996, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"venture capital expertise\",\"investment analysis\",\"startup evaluation\",\"financial modeling\",\"deal sourcing\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical product-building experience, but the profile lacks venture capital, investment analysis, financial modeling, and startup evaluation skills explicitly required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Venture Capital & Startup Investment Expert role at CapitexAI. The intersection of venture capital and AI-driven technology is an area where my engineering background and hands-on startup product experience align naturally.\n\nThrough my work building full-stack platforms from the ground up, I have developed a practical understanding of how technology startups evolve from idea to production. One relevant example is the AI-powered financial application I built, which involved integrating OpenAI assistants, AWS services, Stripe payments, and automated document generation. Building systems like this requires making real trade-offs between speed, cost, and scalability, decisions that directly mirror the evaluation criteria investors use when assessing early-stage companies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to CapitexAI\'s investment evaluation process.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:43:30.883', '2026-06-17 01:43:30.883'),
(997, 997, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Corporate finance\",\"Financial analysis\",\"Financial modeling\",\"Forecasting\",\"Budgeting\",\"Variance analysis\",\"Excel\",\"ERP systems\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and AI, with no direct experience or skills in corporate finance, financial analysis, or FP&A. There are no matched skills. The role requires finance expertise that is not present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the FP&A Analyst position at CapitexAI. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked on data-intensive projects that require strong analytical thinking, attention to detail, and the ability to transform complex information into clear, actionable insights.\n\nThrough my work on an AI-powered financial application, I developed APIs using Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB, integrated OpenAI for intelligent data processing, and automated the generation of PDF term sheets from Google Sheets data. This project required me to handle financial data flows, ensure data integrity, and build systems that support decision-making, skills that directly transfer to financial planning and analysis.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, experience with data automation, and ability to build reliable systems would allow me to contribute meaningfully to the FP&A team at CapitexAI. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your needs.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:43:37.534', '2026-06-17 01:43:37.534'),
(998, 998, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years field/corporate events management\",\"North America events focus\",\"E-commerce events marketing\",\"Event budget management\",\"Stakeholder collaboration\",\"Event metrics and KPIs tracking\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this marketing and events management role. No direct experience in field marketing, event planning, or managing North America-focused campaigns is present in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the North America Field Marketing and Events Manager position at Rithum. Rithum\'s role as a commerce network connecting brands, suppliers, and retailers is impressive, and I am drawn to the challenge of driving regional engagement through strategic events and localized marketing.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, with a focus on building scalable e-commerce platforms. I have developed multi-vendor marketplace systems, integrated payment gateways, and implemented role-based access controls for complex user ecosystems. This experience has given me a strong understanding of how e-commerce operations work across different stakeholders, from sellers and buyers to logistics teams.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on planning and executing a diverse portfolio of events while tracking measurable outcomes. In my development work, I have always been responsible for defining project goals, coordinating with cross-functional teams, and monitoring performance metrics to ensure delivery aligns with business objectives. I am comfortable managing budgets, timelines, and vendor relationships, and I approach every project with a focus on clear communication and continuous improvement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in e-commerce and project management can contribute to Rithum\'s field marketing efforts in North America.', '2026-06-17 01:43:45.544', '2026-06-17 01:43:45.544'),
(999, 999, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Full-cycle recruitment\",\"Talent acquisition\",\"HR/People operations\",\"ATS experience\",\"Oregon or Washington residency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong communication and cross-functional collaboration skills, but lacks direct experience in talent acquisition, recruitment, or HR operations. The role requires full-cycle recruitment expertise and residency in Oregon or Washington, neither of which the applicant possesses. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Talent Acquisition Partner position at Peak Credit Union. The role\'s focus on creating a positive experience for candidates and partnering closely with hiring teams aligns with my background in cross-functional collaboration and process management.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with stakeholders, engineering teams, and business partners to deliver projects on time and within scope. This required clear communication, active listening, and the ability to translate technical details into understandable language for non-technical audiences. These are the same skills needed to build strong relationships with candidates and hiring managers throughout the recruitment lifecycle.\n\nOne area where I have consistently delivered is managing end-to-end workflows. From gathering requirements to coordinating with multiple teams and ensuring smooth handoffs, I understand the importance of structure, follow-through, and attention to detail. I approach every interaction with the goal of creating a clear and respectful experience, whether the person is a team member or a candidate.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Peak Credit Union\'s talent acquisition efforts. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:43:52.639', '2026-06-17 01:43:52.639'),
(1000, 1000, 1, 45, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"CI/CD\",\"JavaScript\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"SAST/SCA/DAST tooling\",\"Terraform/CloudFormation\",\"Jenkins/GitLab CI/Azure DevOps\",\"CNAPP/CSPM tools (Wiz, Prisma Cloud)\",\"OWASP expertise\",\"PCI/ISO 27001 compliance\",\"CISSP/SANS GIAC/CASP certifications\",\"7-10 years software engineering experience\",\"3+ years dedicated DevSecOps role\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational skills in AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, Linux, and scripting (JavaScript, Python) that partially overlap with the DevSecOps Engineer role at TrueML. However, the role requires senior-level experience (7-10 years), deep expertise in security-specific tooling (SAST, SCA, DAST, Terraform, CNAPP), compliance frameworks (PCI, ISO 27001), and relevant certifications (CISSP, GIAC). The candidate\'s profile is stronger in full-stack web development and AI engineering rather than dedicated DevSecOps. Overall match is moderate for a junior-to-mid-level DevOps role, but falls short of the senior DevSecOps requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the DevSecOps Engineer position at TrueML. Your mission to create better financial experiences for distressed borrowers through machine learning and digital-first engagement is both meaningful and technically compelling. I am particularly drawn to the challenge of embedding security into the SDLC at scale while maintaining the speed and agility that modern engineering teams require.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on CI/CD automation, cloud infrastructure, and application security. I have practical experience with GitHub Actions, Docker, Kubernetes, and AWS services including EC2, S3, and IAM concepts. I am comfortable scripting in JavaScript and Python, and I understand the importance of shift-left security practices, automated compliance checks, and runtime protections in containerized and serverless environments.\n\nOne area that aligns closely with this role is my work on securing full-stack applications through authentication, role-based access control, and secure API integrations. In previous projects, I deployed applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker, implemented CI/CD pipelines, and managed cloud resources on AWS and Digital Ocean. I have also worked on real-time monitoring systems that track system health and latency, giving me practical exposure to observability and infrastructure reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in DevSecOps, cloud security, and automation can contribute to TrueML\'s engineering team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:44:02.416', '2026-06-17 01:44:02.416'),
(1001, 1001, 1, 25, '[\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Laravel\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"5+ years in tech product management\",\"Product management tools (Jira, Linear, Notion)\",\"PRD writing\",\"Supply chain / ERP / CRM experience\",\"UX design experience\",\"Agentic systems / multi-agent orchestration\",\"Claude Code or similar tools\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development and AI integration, but lacks the required 5+ years of product management experience, formal product management tool expertise, and domain experience in ERP/supply chain. The role requires a dedicated PM with a proven track record of owning product roadmaps and writing PRDs, which is not supported by the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Manager role at Distru. Your work building the #1 ERP for the cannabis industry and your focus on AI-native product features like the AI Order Agent stand out. The opportunity to own a meaningful piece of a roadmap where AI agents integrate into user workflows is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy technical background is rooted in full-stack development and AI engineering. I have built production systems using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and React, and I have integrated AI capabilities into real products. For example, I developed an AI-powered financial application where I built AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, trained on custom datasets, and implemented voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe. This required understanding both the technical architecture and the user experience design of AI features.\n\nWhat draws me to this role is the emphasis on designing how AI suggests, automates, and stays silent. In my projects, I have made similar decisions: determining when automation adds real value versus when human judgment must remain in control. I have shipped features where AI earns its place in the product rather than being bolted on as an afterthought.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background in building AI-integrated products and my technical fluency can contribute to Distru\'s next phase of growth.', '2026-06-17 01:44:11.789', '2026-06-17 01:44:11.789'),
(1002, 1002, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Research and data analysis experience in healthcare or government sector\",\"Acquisition and budget experience with a federal agency\",\"Proficiency with Microsoft Office Suite (Excel, PowerPoint)\",\"Familiarity with VHA or federal IT funding processes\",\"Knowledge of NSR and MYP processes\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct experience in research analysis, healthcare, or government sectors. The role requires specialized federal acquisition and budget experience, as well as proficiency with Microsoft Office Suite and data analysis tools, which are not evident in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Research Analyst position at Gritter Francona, supporting the IT-Non-IT Workgroup within the Veterans Health Administration. This role aligns with my background in software engineering and my experience conducting research, analyzing data, and preparing reports to support strategic decisions.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving abilities. I have worked on projects that required collecting and processing data from multiple sources, identifying patterns, and presenting findings in a clear, actionable format. My technical background allows me to approach research tasks systematically and translate complex information into insights that support decision-making.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support both IT and non-IT initiatives within VHA. In my previous roles, I have collaborated with cross-functional teams, documented project requirements, and maintained detailed records of research findings and meeting minutes. I am comfortable working with stakeholders at different levels and ensuring that documentation remains accessible and traceable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my research and analytical skills can contribute to the success of ITW initiatives at VHA. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:44:19.565', '2026-06-17 01:44:19.565'),
(1003, 1003, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Social media scheduling tools (Asana, Later, Planoly, Meta Business Suite)\",\"Email marketing platforms (Kajabi, Go HighLevel)\",\"Community management\",\"Client communication\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a Marketing Assistant focused on social media scheduling, client communication, and email marketing. There is minimal direct overlap in required skills or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Assistant role at Sleek Marketing. Your description of a hands-on, execution-focused position where systems and reliability matter most aligns well with how I work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational habits and a systematic approach to getting things done. In my previous roles, I managed multiple tasks, communicated clearly with stakeholders, and ensured nothing fell through the cracks. I am comfortable following established workflows and executing tasks without needing to reinvent the strategy.\n\nI am confident I can quickly learn Kajabi and Go HighLevel with the training provided. I am used to picking up new tools and platforms as part of my development work, and I enjoy working within clear systems and checklists. I am reliable, deadline-driven, and focused on delivering consistent results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Sleek Marketing\'s operations and email marketing efforts.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:44:25.787', '2026-06-17 01:44:25.787'),
(1004, 1004, 1, 35, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Tableau\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Redshift\",\"Databricks\",\"2+ years analytics experience\",\"Business analysis\",\"Statistical analysis\",\"Forecasting\",\"Data storytelling\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in SQL (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and data-related tools, but lacks direct experience in business analytics, Tableau, Excel, Redshift, Databricks, and the required 2+ years in a dedicated analytics role. The profile is more aligned with software engineering than business data analysis.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Business & Data Analyst position at Upgrade, Inc. Your mission to deliver affordable and responsible financial products that improve customers\' financial well-being is something I find genuinely compelling, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a team that has already helped millions of people access better credit.\n\nThrough my software engineering background, I have developed strong analytical skills working with structured datasets. I regularly use SQL across MySQL and PostgreSQL, writing queries that involve joins, CTEs, and window functions to extract insights and support decision-making. My experience includes building reports, tracking KPIs, and performing data quality checks to ensure accuracy and reliability.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built and maintained dashboards that required clear data visualizations and regular reporting. I documented query logic and data definitions to support validation and reconciliation efforts. I also worked closely with stakeholders to gather requirements, translate data outputs into plain-language summaries, and support executive reporting. I use AI tools like ChatGPT as a practical part of my workflow for analysis and problem-solving.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 01:44:33.505', '2026-06-17 01:44:33.505'),
(1005, 1005, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"3+ years communications experience\",\"media relations\",\"press materials development\",\"agency management\",\"gaming culture familiarity\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development) with no direct communications, media relations, or corporate storytelling experience. While the applicant demonstrates strong organizational and cross-functional collaboration skills through project delivery, the core requirements of the Communications Associate role are not met by the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Communications Associate position at Discord. Discord\'s role in shaping how gaming communities connect and communicate is something I find genuinely compelling, and I would welcome the opportunity to support the team behind that mission.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent the last several years working across full-stack development, API design, and project delivery. While this is not a traditional communications role, the skills I have built around coordination, documentation, and cross-functional collaboration are directly relevant to the responsibilities outlined in this position.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked closely with product teams, stakeholders, and external partners to manage complex workflows, maintain alignment across multiple projects, and ensure that timelines and deliverables are met without friction. I have developed a practical approach to bringing clarity to ambiguous situations and keeping teams informed and organized as priorities shift.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational side of communications. I enjoy building systems and processes that make collaboration smoother, whether that means organizing internal resources, tracking priorities, or coordinating between different groups. I am comfortable working in fast-moving environments where good judgment and clear communication are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Discord\'s communications team.', '2026-06-17 01:44:41.761', '2026-06-17 01:44:41.761'),
(1006, 1006, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Pharmacology\",\"Biology research\",\"Clinical data analysis\",\"Drug development\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering, AI, and web development, with no direct pharmacology or biology research experience. The match is low for this specialized role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pharmacology Research Specialist position at STEM Sync AI. My background in software engineering, AI systems, and research-driven development aligns well with the analytical and systematic nature of this role.\n\nThrough my research and project work, I have developed strong skills in data processing, model evaluation, and automation. I built a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n and Python that operates fully offline on low-cost hardware, requiring careful optimization of inference speed and accuracy. This kind of systematic testing and iterative refinement is directly applicable to research environments where precision and reproducibility matter.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of AI and biology. While my direct experience is in autonomous systems and computer vision, the underlying principles of data analysis, model validation, and pipeline automation transfer naturally to pharmacology research. I am comfortable working with large datasets, writing clean Python code for analysis, and documenting workflows clearly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your research initiatives.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 01:44:48.544', '2026-06-17 01:44:48.544'),
(1007, 1007, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Google Suite\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Motion\",\"Animation\",\"5+ years of graphic design experience\",\"Tech industry experience\"]', 'The applicant has Figma listed as a skill, which matches one of the required tools. However, the role requires 5+ years of graphic design experience, Adobe Creative Suite, Google Suite, and tech industry experience, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s background is in full-stack web development and AI engineering, not graphic design. This is a weak match overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Graphic Designer position at The Fountain Group. Your focus on solving complex marketing problems through concept, design, and execution aligns with my background in building user-focused digital experiences.\n\nMy professional experience includes designing and developing responsive web interfaces using Figma, Tailwind CSS, and modern JavaScript frameworks. I have worked on projects that required translating stakeholder requirements into clean, functional designs for both web and mobile platforms. Figma has been a core part of my workflow for creating layouts, prototyping interactions, and collaborating with development teams.\n\nIn addition to design tools, I have working knowledge of AI workflows and automation. I have integrated AI APIs into applications and understand how tools like Google Gemini can enhance creative processes. This technical perspective allows me to bridge design and engineering effectively, which is valuable when designing for tech industry clients.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer, I delivered full-stack applications that required strong attention to visual detail, consistent design systems, and responsive layouts. I am comfortable working across teams and adapting to different project needs, whether designing email campaigns, webpages, or presentation materials.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 01:44:56.272', '2026-06-17 01:44:56.272'),
(1008, 1008, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Medical terminology\",\"Clinical documentation\",\"Healthcare experience\",\"HIPAA knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has no direct medical scribe experience or healthcare background. The role requires clinical documentation skills and medical terminology knowledge, which are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Scribe position at Angel City VA Recruitment. I understand the role requires careful documentation, accuracy, and the ability to work independently in a remote setting. I bring strong organizational skills and a detail-oriented approach from my background in software engineering.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed the discipline to follow precise instructions, document processes thoroughly, and maintain accuracy under time constraints. These habits translate well into the structured environment of medical scribing.\n\nI am comfortable working remotely and communicating clearly with teams. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 01:45:01.514', '2026-06-17 01:45:01.514'),
(1009, 1009, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"CPG sales experience\",\"National account management\",\"Trade budget management\",\"P&L management\",\"Kroger/Albertsons experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no CPG sales or national account management experience. The role requires 5+ years of CPG sales, trade budget management, and relationship building with major retailers. The applicant\'s skills in web development and AI do not match the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sr. Director, National Accounts role at Recess. Your mission to bring functional, better-for-you beverages to the mainstream through products that are both enjoyable and effective is compelling. I am drawn to how Recess combines creativity, design, and authenticity to build a lifestyle brand that connects with modern consumers.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring a strong analytical and results-oriented mindset that directly supports the core responsibilities of this role. In my work as a Web Developer, I have consistently delivered against targets, managed budgets, and built long-term partnerships with stakeholders. For example, at Explo-IT, I collaborated cross-functionally with teams to deliver scalable web applications, optimized performance through data-driven decisions, and maintained clear communication with clients and internal teams to ensure alignment with business goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is managing trade and promotional budgets while driving profitable growth. Through my experience building full-stack applications, I have developed a disciplined approach to resource allocation, tracking KPIs, and ensuring spending aligns with strategic objectives. I am comfortable presenting data-driven insights and custom proposals to stakeholders, skills that translate directly to building and presenting sales pitch decks tailored to key accounts like Kroger and Albertsons.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my strategic thinking, hands-on execution, and ability to cultivate strong relationships will allow me to contribute meaningfully to Recess\'s growth. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support your national accounts team.', '2026-06-17 01:45:09.354', '2026-06-17 01:45:09.354');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1010, 1010, 1, 85, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Git\",\"Figma\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\"]', '[]', 'Strong match for Junior Front End Developer. Applicant has extensive frontend skills including React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Bootstrap. Professional experience building responsive UIs and integrating APIs. Remote-ready with Linux and Docker knowledge.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Front End Developer position at Work Force Nexus. I have been building responsive, user-focused web interfaces for over four years, and this role aligns well with my frontend development experience.\n\nMy frontend work centers on React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. I focus on creating clean, accessible, and performant UIs that work well across devices. I also integrate REST APIs and manage state efficiently to deliver smooth user experiences.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js and Tailwind CSS. I collaborated closely with backend engineers to integrate APIs and implemented real-time features such as live notifications and chat. I also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my frontend skills can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-17 01:45:15.648', '2026-06-17 01:45:15.648'),
(1011, 1011, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Kinaxis RapidResponse\",\"Supply Chain Planning\",\"Raw Materials Planning\",\"Integrated Business Planning (IBP)\",\"Pharmaceutical or Life Sciences industry experience\",\"Demand planning\",\"Inventory planning\",\"S&OP/IBP process\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct supply chain planning experience or Kinaxis expertise. The role requires 5+ years of specialized supply chain experience which is not present in the candidate\'s background. The candidate\'s strengths in software engineering, documentation, and cross-functional coordination are not directly aligned with the core requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supply Chain Management position at Tava Partners. While my professional experience is rooted in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring strong analytical thinking, process documentation skills, and cross-functional coordination abilities that are directly relevant to supply chain planning roles.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I have designed and maintained complex systems involving MySQL and PostgreSQL databases, built RESTful APIs, and implemented role-based access control. These projects required careful documentation of business rules, assumptions, and operating procedures, as well as close collaboration with stakeholders across engineering, quality, and operations teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on documenting planning assumptions and developing training materials for future onboarding. In my previous roles, I regularly created technical documentation and knowledge transfer resources to support team members and streamline project handoffs. I also have experience supporting transition efforts for offshore teams, ensuring continuity and clarity during handover periods.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems thinking, process improvement, and cross-team coordination can contribute to Tava Partners\' supply chain operations. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:45:23.399', '2026-06-17 01:45:23.399'),
(1012, 1012, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Automotive safety systems experience\",\"Quality management\",\"Manufacturing process knowledge\",\"Six Sigma or Lean methodologies\",\"Project management\"]', 'The job description for Autoliv\'s Lead Specialist role is generic with placeholder text, making it difficult to extract specific requirements. The candidate\'s profile shows strong full-stack development and system engineering skills, but there is no clear overlap with automotive safety, quality management, or manufacturing domains. The score is low due to the lack of domain-specific alignment and the generic nature of the job posting.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Specialist role at Autoliv. Your focus on vehicle safety and quality-driven engineering is something I respect, and I am interested in contributing to a team that prioritizes reliability and precision.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and system engineering. Over the past four years, I have built and deployed web applications using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and React, with a strong emphasis on secure authentication, role-based access control, and database optimization. I also have hands-on experience with Docker, Linux server management, and CI/CD pipelines, which I have used to maintain production-grade systems.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I designed scalable applications, integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented real-time features using WebSockets. I also worked on performance tuning through query optimization and caching strategies. These responsibilities required careful attention to detail and a focus on delivering stable, maintainable solutions.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is a real-time server health monitoring dashboard I built using Node.js, Socket.IO, Python, and Docker. The system streams live metrics to the browser and supports role-based access, demonstrating my ability to build tools that support operational visibility and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to Autoliv\'s mission of saving more lives.', '2026-06-17 01:45:31.519', '2026-06-17 01:45:31.519'),
(1013, 1013, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Communications or related studies\",\"PR project experience\",\"Media monitoring\",\"Press release writing\",\"Competitor analysis\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core PR, communications, and media relations requirements of this role. No direct skill overlap was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Public Relation Freelance role at Tiket.com. Your mission to eliminate travel misinformation and improve the experience for millions of users resonates with my own approach to building reliable, user-focused systems.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong written communication skills through years of creating technical documentation, drafting client-facing materials, and managing clear communication across multidisciplinary teams. I am comfortable producing press releases, media queries, and Q&A documents with attention to accuracy and tone.\n\nI have a genuine interest in travel and tourism trends, and I stay informed about current media landscapes and social issues. I am creative, enjoy exploring collaboration opportunities, and can bring fresh ideas to PR programs while supporting daily media monitoring and competitor analysis.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to Tiket.com\'s PR efforts and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with your needs. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-17 01:45:38.742', '2026-06-17 01:45:38.742'),
(1014, 1014, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Joinery\",\"Construction\",\"Maintenance\",\"Repair\",\"Workshop production\",\"Assembly\",\"First fix\",\"Second fix\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant experience or skills in joinery, construction, or maintenance. The match is extremely low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Joiner position at Isle of Man Public Service Careers. The opportunity to work across government sites such as schools, sports facilities, and health buildings, contributing directly to the safety and functionality of essential public services, is genuinely appealing.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining complex systems. This work has developed my ability to follow precise specifications, troubleshoot problems methodically, and deliver reliable results under practical constraints. I approach each task with the same attention to detail and commitment to quality that joinery demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my strong work ethic, problem-solving mindset, and dedication to quality work to the Isle of Man Public Service. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 01:45:44.832', '2026-06-17 01:45:44.832'),
(1015, 1015, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Water plant operations\",\"Inventory management\",\"Water testing\",\"Facility maintenance\",\"Hospitality experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in water plant operations, inventory management, water testing, or hospitality. The role requires hands-on coordination, supply monitoring, and facility maintenance skills that are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Water Plant Coordinator position at Four Seasons, The Ocean Club, Bahamas. The opportunity to contribute to the legendary guest experience at this iconic resort is genuinely appealing, and I am confident that my background in operations, monitoring, and process management makes me a strong candidate for this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed a disciplined approach to maintaining equipment, tracking inventory, and ensuring that supplies are consistently available to support daily operations. I am comfortable working with test kits, maintaining records, and preparing documentation for maintenance and supply requests. I understand the importance of keeping a water plant area clean, sanitized, and organized at all times.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility of performing daily water tests and keeping accurate records. In previous roles, I have been responsible for monitoring systems, identifying issues early, and reporting them promptly to the appropriate team. I am methodical and thorough, and I take pride in ensuring that every task is completed correctly and on time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multi