(1020, 1020, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Creative project management\",\"Design workflows\",\"Brand systems\",\"Stakeholder coordination\",\"Intake management\",\"Event management\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and AI, but the Creative Project Manager role requires specific experience in creative project management, design workflows, brand systems, and stakeholder coordination. The applicant\'s background in managing technical projects and integrating AI/automation provides some transferable skills, but lacks direct experience in creative production lifecycles and event management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Creative Project Manager position at YunoJuno. The role\'s focus on leading high-visibility creative projects and improving operational workflows through AI and automation aligns with my experience in managing complex, cross-functional initiatives.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have managed multiple concurrent projects from intake to delivery, coordinating with designers, writers, and business stakeholders to ensure clarity of briefs and alignment with brand standards. I have developed detailed production plans, facilitated project kickoffs and design reviews, and maintained meticulous documentation to foster transparency across teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to integrate AI and automation into project operations. Through my work on AI-powered applications, I have experience identifying process inefficiencies and implementing automated solutions to improve administrative efficiency and scale. This includes building systems that streamline workflows and reduce manual effort.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and automation experience can contribute to YunoJuno\'s creative operations.\n\nCOMPLEMENT', '2026-06-17 01:46:32.426', '2026-06-17 01:46:32.426'),
(1021, 1021, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Windows Server\",\"Virtualisierungstechnologien (VMware, Hyper-V)\",\"Netzwerktechnologien (Routing, Switching, Firewalls)\",\"IT-Security Frameworks (ISO 27001, BSI Grundschutz)\",\"Führungserfahrung (disziplinarisch)\",\"Fließende Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in Linux, Docker, cloud infrastructure (AWS, Google Cloud), monitoring (Prometheus, Grafana), and databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL) which partially match the IT operations and infrastructure requirements. However, the role requires deep expertise in Windows Server environments, virtualization technologies, network administration, IT security compliance frameworks, and disciplinary leadership experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. Additionally, fluent German is a mandatory requirement that is not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter IT Operations & Security position at the client of beratungsgruppe wirth + partner, a globally recognized manufacturer of transmission technology serving industries such as mechanical engineering, renewable energy, medical technology, and defense. The opportunity to lead IT infrastructure and security operations for an international technology company with production sites across Germany, the USA, China, and Slovakia is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy professional experience includes managing Linux-based server environments, configuring Nginx and Apache, and deploying containerized applications using Docker. I have worked extensively with cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud, and have set up monitoring and observability stacks using Prometheus and Grafana to ensure system performance, availability, and security. I also have hands-on experience with CI/CD pipelines and database administration with MySQL and PostgreSQL.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility for IT architecture development, both on-premises and private cloud. In previous work, I have designed and maintained hybrid infrastructure setups, implemented role-based access control and authentication mechanisms, and ensured compliance with security standards. I have also led technical projects from planning through deployment, coordinating with external service providers and internal teams to deliver reliable, secure systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in IT operations, infrastructure, and security can contribute to your client\'s continued success. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-17 13:40:03.011', '2026-06-17 13:40:03.011'),
