(1023, 1023, 1, 65, '[\"Python\",\"APIs\",\"Databases\",\"HTML\",\"JavaScript\",\"CSS\",\"Frontend\",\"OpenAI\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"MySQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Express\",\"TypeScript\",\"Laravel\",\"Next.js\",\"Tailwind CSS\"]', '[\"N8N\",\"make.com\",\"LLMs\",\"No-Code/Low-Code platforms (WeWeb, Softr)\",\"Automation tools\"]', 'The applicant has strong programming experience with Python, APIs, databases, and frontend technologies, and has built AI-powered applications. However, the job specifically requires experience with N8N, make.com, LLMs, and No-Code/Low-Code platforms, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant has relevant skills in AI, web development, and system integration, making this a moderate match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entwickler für KI- & Automatisierungen position at Smarte Prozesse GmbH. The focus on building intelligent automation solutions and digital workflows aligns well with my background in software engineering and AI-driven development.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered applications that combine Python, API integration, and frontend technologies. One example is an AI-powered financial app where I developed the backend using Express, TypeScript, OpenAI, and AWS. The system included AI assistants trained on custom datasets, voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF generation from Google Sheets data. This experience directly applies to developing automation solutions and connecting external APIs and databases.\n\nI also have professional experience as a Web Developer where I built scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrated RESTful APIs, imp