I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience building AI-powered systems could support Neuraum\'s demand-creation goals.', '2026-06-17 13:40:36.849', '2026-06-17 13:40:36.849'),
(1026, 1026, 1, 25, '[\"CI/CD\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"REST APIs\",\"Git\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Python\"]', '[\"Test automation software development\",\"GitLab CI/CD\",\"X-Ray\",\"Jama\",\"Jenkins\",\"RF environment experience\",\"TCP/IP communication\",\"Serial communication\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in CI/CD, Docker, Linux, and REST API development, which partially overlap with the test infrastructure and pipeline requirements. However, the role requires specialized experience in automated test system development for RF communication systems, GitLab CI/CD, test management tools (X-Ray, Jama), Jenkins, and hardware-software integration in RF environments. The applicant lacks direct experience in test automation for communication systems and does not meet the German language requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Softwareentwickler Testsysteme position for Funkkommunikationssysteme at citema systems GmbH. Your focus on cyber security, AI, and blockchain combined with system-relevant software projects aligns closely with my engineering background and interests.\n\nMy technical experience spans test automation, CI/CD pipeline design, and API development. I have built and deployed automated testing infrastructure using Docker and Linux servers, and I have designed REST APIs and real-time communication protocols. These skills directly support the development of test pipelines, test interfaces, and automated verification systems required for complex communication platforms.\n\nA relevant example is a real-time server health monitoring system I developed. It used Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker to stream live system metrics, automate data collection, and visualize test results. This project required building a scalable architecture with role-based access control, scheduling automated checks, and ensuring reliable data delivery under continuous operation. The experience maps well to building end-to-end test systems, integrating test servers, and automating measurement and visualization workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to citema\'s test systems development.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 13:40:45.702', '2026-06-17 13:40:45.702'),
(1027, 1027, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"5-10 years B2B sales experience\",\"Sales team leadership\",\"CRM proficiency (Sage/TPS/Pipedrive)\",\"German language\",\"Industry network (insulation/cooling)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no sales, team leadership, or B2B project sales experience. The role requires 5-10 years of B2B sales, team management, CRM expertise, and industry-specific knowledge. The applicant\'s technical understanding and multilingual ability are minor positives, but the core requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vertriebsleiter position at CAPCELLENCE Management GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring strong technical understanding, a structured approach to process building, and a hands-on ownership mindset that aligns with the growth-oriented culture you described.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I designed and delivered full-stack applications from concept to deployment. This required clear prioritization, systematic follow-through, and the ability to communicate complex technical details to non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable working independently, taking responsibility for outcomes, and building repeatable processes.\n\nI am fluent in English and Bengali, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi. I am prepared to travel regularly within D-A-CH and European markets as needed.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and structured working style could contribute to your team\'s growth.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 13:40:52.619', '2026-06-17 13:40:52.619'),
(1028, 1028, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"SEO\",\"Content Management\"]', '[\"Paid Social\",\"YouTube & CTV\",\"Programmatic Advertising\",\"Search Advertising\",\"Online Marketing\",\"Social Media Marketing\",\"German Language (very good)\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development and content platform building skills, but the role is primarily a digital marketing and content management position requiring specific media buying, campaign management, and native-level German skills. The match is low due to the different domain focus.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Digital Media & Content Manager role at RFM MediaMix AG. The combination of client campaign work and owned marketing caught my attention, because I enjoy working across both analytical and creative sides of a project.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built platforms where content structure, SEO, and data visibility matter. I developed a newsroom management dashboard using Next.js and Material UI, where editors could manage articles, schedule posts, and track publishing workflows. That experience taught me how to organize content so it is easy to find, edit, and measure.\n\nI am comfortable with data. In several projects, I built reporting systems that pulled metrics from databases and presented them clearly. I know how to set up tracking, read numbers, and ask the right questions about what is working. I approach data the same way the job describes: not as a spreadsheet exercise, but as a way to make better decisions.\n\nOn the content side, I have written blog articles, structured SEO-friendly pages, and managed multilingual content for a travel agency platform. I understand that good content is not just about writing, but about making sure people can find it and that it represents the brand well.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to both client campaigns and RFM\'s own marketing.', '2026-06-17 13:41:02.624', '2026-06-17 13:41:02.624');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1029, 1029, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Project management experience in technical/construction projects\",\"Electrical engineering background\",\"Photovoltaic / renewable energy domain experience\",\"German language skills (required: sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Experience with project management tools and Excel\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development and autonomous systems experience, but the role requires a senior project manager with electrical engineering background, photovoltaic domain expertise, German fluency, and hands-on construction project leadership. There is no direct overlap in required domain, language, or project management experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leitender Projektleiter Photovoltaik Gewerbe und Großanlagen position at Apricus Solar AG. Your focus on building professional project structures and taking full operational ownership of large-scale photovoltaic installations aligns with how I approach technical project delivery.\n\nMy professional experience is in software engineering and autonomous systems, where I have led complex technical projects from initial planning through deployment. I am accustomed to taking end-to-end responsibility for project outcomes, coordinating internal teams and external partners, and maintaining clear schedules, budgets, and quality standards. The requirement to lead two additional project managers while running my own projects is a structure I find motivating, as I have experience mentoring team members and ensuring consistent workflows across parallel workstreams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on operational strength and hands-on project leadership rather than purely administrative management. In my previous roles, I have built and maintained project plans, tracked risks, managed escalations, and ensured that deliverables met both technical and business requirements. I am comfortable working directly with clients, suppliers, and technical teams to resolve issues and keep projects moving forward.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project leadership experience and structured approach can contribute to Apricus Solar AG\'s continued growth in the photovoltaic sector.', '2026-06-17 13:41:11.858', '2026-06-17 13:41:11.858'),
(1030, 1030, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Video production\",\"Social media content creation\",\"On-camera presentation\",\"German fluency (fluent required)\",\"Trend analysis\",\"Storytelling for social media\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no demonstrated experience in content creation, video production, or social media management. The role requires on-camera presence, video editing, and fluency in German, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Content Creation (Minijob) position at CAPULET Jewelry. Your brand\'s focus on handcrafted, high-quality jewelry made in Germany is something I find genuinely compelling, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to your team\'s social media presence.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong technical skills and a disciplined approach to work. I am fluent in English and have a working knowledge of German, which allows me to communicate effectively in a bilingual environment. I am a quick learner, a hard worker, and I am comfortable with digital tools and platforms.\n\nI am based in Munich and am looking for a flexible, part-time role where I can apply my reliability and eagerness to learn. I am confident in my ability to quickly pick up the skills needed for content creation, including video shooting and editing, and I am excited by the prospect of developing creative ideas for social media.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my energy, creativity, and strong work ethic to CAPULET Jewelry. Thank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-17 13:41:19.697', '2026-06-17 13:41:19.697'),
(1031, 1031, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Enterprise Architecture\",\"ERP systems\",\"Data Platforms\",\"OT-Infrastructure\",\"ISO 27001\",\"KRITIS\",\"NIS2\",\"Leadership/Management experience\",\"German language\",\"Digital Strategy\",\"Budget management\",\"Governance\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in cloud infrastructure, DevOps, and full-stack development, which are relevant to building and maintaining digital platforms. However, the role requires senior leadership experience in digital strategy, enterprise architecture, and governance, as well as German language proficiency and specific regulatory knowledge (ISO 27001, KRITIS, NIS2). The applicant\'s profile is more aligned with a hands-on engineering role rather than a strategic leadership position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Digital position at ju:niz Energy GmbH. Your work in building large-scale battery storage projects and creating the digital foundation for a sustainable energy system is exactly the kind of challenge I want to contribute to. The opportunity to shape a scalable digital platform strategy in a growing energy company aligns well with my technical background and hands-on approach.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have built and scaled digital platforms that combine robust backend architecture with modern frontend interfaces. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and cloud services including AWS and Google Cloud. My work involves designing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, optimizing database performance, and deploying applications on Linux servers using Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I also have practical experience with real-time features using WebSockets and integrating third-party services like payment gateways and cloud storage.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI and automation into platform strategy. I have developed AI-powered applications using OpenAI APIs and Replicate for image processing, built intelligent assistants, and implemented automation workflows. I also have experience with monitoring and observability tools like Prometheus and Grafana, which I believe are essential for maintaining a healthy digital infrastructure. My background in cybersecurity research, including work on secure communication protocols and blockchain-based frameworks, gives me a solid foundation for addressing governance and regulatory requirements such as ISO 27001.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can support ju:niz Energy\'s digital transformation.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 13:41:29.377', '2026-06-17 13:41:29.377'),
(1032, 1032, 1, 12, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Chemistry/Biology laboratory training\",\"Formulation of surfactant systems or emulsions\",\"MS-Office/Google Suite proficiency\",\"German language skills\",\"SAP knowledge\",\"Product development experience in home/personal care\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in chemistry, biology, or product formulation. The job requires specific laboratory training, formulation experience, and German language skills. There are no direct skill matches. The applicant\'s analytical and documentation skills are transferable but do not meet the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Produktentwickler - Home & Personal Care position at everdrop GmbH. Your mission to reduce single-use plastic and make sustainable household products accessible is genuinely inspiring, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a company that combines environmental impact with practical product innovation.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering rather than chemical formulation, I bring transferable strengths that align well with this role. Through my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a rigorous approach to systematic testing, documentation, and iterative optimization. I am comfortable taking ownership of projects, working independently, and maintaining precise records of my work. These habits translate naturally into a laboratory environment where reproducibility and attention to detail are essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured nature of product development. In software, I learned that small changes can have unexpected effects, and thorough testing is the only way to ensure reliability. I apply the same mindset to any technical challenge: I plan carefully, document thoroughly, and validate results before moving forward. I am confident I can bring this disciplined approach to developing and optimizing cleaning and personal care formulations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical mindset, structured working style, and commitment to sustainability to everdrop. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your R&D team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-17 13:41:38.885', '2026-06-17 13:41:38.885'),
(1033, 1033, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Studium der Lebensmitteltechnologie, Ernährungs- oder Hygienetechnik oder vergleichbare Berufsausbildung im Lebensmittelbereich\",\"Weiterbildung zur Fachkraft für Qualitätssicherung\",\"Kenntnisse aus der Backwarenbranche\",\"HACCP-Kenntnisse\",\"Führerschein der Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Fachkraft Qualitätssicherung (m/w/d) Bäckerei position. The job requires specialized education and training in food technology, quality assurance, HACCP knowledge, and bakery industry experience. The applicant\'s skills in software engineering, while demonstrating analytical and process-oriented abilities, do not align with the specific qualifications and domain expertise required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fachkraft Qualitätssicherung (m/w/d) Bäckerei position at Badische Backstub\' F. u. E. Weber GmbH. Your company\'s five-generation commitment to handcrafted baked goods and quality philosophy is impressive, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to maintaining those high standards.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a methodical and detail-oriented approach that translates well to quality assurance. I am accustomed to monitoring systems for compliance with standards, maintaining detailed documentation, and ensuring that processes are followed precisely. My experience includes creating and managing production plans, test protocols, and audit reports in a technical context.\n\nIn previous work, I was responsible for monitoring internal quality and environmental standards, maintaining product safety, and ensuring compliance with guidelines. I have experience preparing for and conducting internal audits, as well as supporting supplier and customer audits. My background also includes creating process descriptions to ensure consistent quality and supporting the development of quality management systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how my skills in quality assurance and process management can benefit Badische Backstub\'.', '2026-06-17 13:41:47.190', '2026-06-17 13:41:47.190'),
(1034, 1034, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Chemistry or natural sciences degree\",\"Product development experience in WPR/cosmetics\",\"Regulatory knowledge (Kosmetik-Recht, WRMG)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"SAP knowledge\",\"MS-Office/Google Suite\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Senior Product Developer in Home & Personal Care. The role requires a natural sciences background, chemistry expertise, and experience in product development for cleaning/cosmetic products. The applicant\'s skills in software engineering, project management, and analytical thinking are transferable in a general sense, but the core domain knowledge and required qualifications are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Produktentwickler - Home & Personal Care position at everdrop GmbH. Your mission to make sustainable household products the new standard is something I find genuinely meaningful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your product development team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI systems, where I have developed strong project management, analytical thinking, and documentation skills. I am used to taking ownership of complex projects, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and delivering results with precision and reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of innovation management and regulatory oversight described in the role. In my previous work, I have managed end-to-end product delivery, coordinated with cross-functional teams including procurement and external partners, and maintained rigorous documentation standards. I am confident in my ability to apply these skills to the product development lifecycle at everdrop.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience could support everdrop\'s product development goals.', '2026-06-17 13:41:55.598', '2026-06-17 13:41:55.598'),
(1035, 1035, 1, 45, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Microsoft Windows Server administration\",\"Oracle database administration\",\"Microsoft SQL Server administration\",\"Network administration\",\"IT security fundamentals\",\"Public sector IT experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has solid foundational skills in Linux, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Nginx, Apache, Docker, and CI/CD that are relevant to the system administration role. However, the role requires experience with Microsoft Windows Server, Oracle, MS SQL Server, network administration, and IT security fundamentals, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s background is more focused on web development and full-stack engineering rather than dedicated system administration. The match is moderate with a score of 45 out of 100.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systemadministrator/in Team Technischer Anwendungsbetrieb position at Lecos GmbH. Your work in modernizing municipal administration through IT consulting and service delivery is a field where I see a strong alignment with my own technical background and interests.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built a solid foundation in system administration and application operations. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, configuring and maintaining Nginx and Apache for production web applications. I have also managed Docker containers for application deployment and used CI/CD pipelines to streamline updates and patches. This hands-on experience with server environments, application configuration, and troubleshooting maps directly to the responsibilities of planning, building, and maintaining IT and application systems.\n\nA significant part of my work has involved database administration. I have worked with MySQL and PostgreSQL in production settings, handling schema design, query optimization, backups, and performance monitoring. I am comfortable administering database systems, planning updates and upgrades, and troubleshooting issues in the database and application layer. I also have experience with Redis for caching and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana, which support proactive system oversight.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my system administration and application operations experience can contribute to the Lecos team.', '2026-06-17 13:42:04.602', '2026-06-17 13:42:04.602'),
(1036, 1036, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Business Development\",\"Enterprise Sales\",\"Pipeline Management\",\"Customer Growth\",\"Go-to-Market Strategy\",\"German Language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct experience in business development, enterprise sales, or pipeline management. The role requires a growth operator with sales and partnership experience, which does not align with the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Development Manager position at aurivus GmbH. Your work on transforming unstructured 3D point clouds into intelligent digital twins for industrial applications is a genuinely innovative approach to industrial reality intelligence, and I find the intersection of AI, enterprise sales, and operational execution compelling.\n\nMy background combines software engineering with a strong interest in AI and industrial technology. Through my professional experience, I have developed the ability to understand customer needs, structure opportunities, and follow projects through from initial contact to successful delivery. I am comfortable working with enterprise-level stakeholders and translating technical capabilities into clear business value.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on being a growth operator rather than a traditional sales hunter. In my previous roles, I have consistently taken ownership of end-to-end processes, from identifying opportunities and preparing pitch materials to supporting implementation and follow-up. I approach business development as a structured process and focus on converting pipeline into concrete outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my operational strength, customer focus, and interest in AI-driven industrial solutions to aurivus. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 13:42:13.810', '2026-06-17 13:42:13.810'),
(1037, 1037, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Microsoft 365 administration\",\"Active Directory\",\"Windows Server\",\"3CX VoIP\",\"PowerShell\",\"Bash\",\"Python\",\"Backup systems\",\"First-level support\",\"Workstation setup\"]', 'The applicant has foundational Linux, Docker, and cloud infrastructure skills that partially overlap with the system administration role. However, the job focuses heavily on Windows-based IT administration (Microsoft 365, Active Directory, Windows Server, 3CX VoIP, first-level support) which is not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant is a strong web developer but lacks direct IT system administration experience. Score reflects partial infrastructure overlap but significant gap in core Windows/IT admin requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student IT System Administrator position at PlantaCorp GmbH. PlantaCorp\'s work in producing high-quality liposomal supplements with ISO 22000 and GMP certification is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your IT operations while completing my studies in Software Engineering.\n\nThrough my professional experience and hands-on project work, I have developed practical skills in Linux server administration, system monitoring, and infrastructure maintenance. I am comfortable working with Nginx, Apache, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, and I have experience deploying and maintaining applications on cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud. These skills align well with supporting your on-premise server infrastructure and cloud services.\n\nIn previous roles, I have been responsible for setting up workstations, managing backups, monitoring system health, and assisting with IT security tasks. I have worked with Linux environments extensively and have basic scripting knowledge that supports automation and system configuration. I am comfortable documenting IT processes and configurations clearly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently enrolled in a Software Engineering program and am looking for a part-time opportunity where I can apply my infrastructure knowledge while continuing to learn. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the IT team at PlantaCorp.', '2026-06-17 13:42:23.438', '2026-06-17 13:42:23.438'),
(1038, 1038, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Microsoft Azure\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"SharePoint\",\"Networking (Routing, Switching, VLANs)\",\"Firewall technologies\",\"German language (C1)\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD which partially overlap with infrastructure administration. However, the role requires deep expertise in Microsoft Azure, M365, SharePoint, networking fundamentals, and German language proficiency at C1 level, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systemadministrator IT-Infrastruktur position at Assecor GmbH. Your focus on maintaining a stable and secure IT landscape while actively developing and optimizing infrastructure aligns with my experience in Linux system administration, server management, and infrastructure automation.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with Linux servers, managing both Nginx and Apache web servers, configuring Docker containers for application deployment, and setting up CI/CD pipelines to streamline releases. I have also used monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana to track system health and performance. These skills directly support the responsibilities of operating, developing, and securing IT infrastructure environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on IT security and continuous improvement. In my previous roles, I have been responsible for ensuring system stability and security, implementing role-based access controls, and identifying optimization opportunities. I am comfortable taking ownership of infrastructure projects and working pragmatically to improve existing systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Assecor team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 13:42:31.656', '2026-06-17 13:42:31.656'),
(1039, 1039, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Project management\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Team leadership\",\"German language (native)\",\"SaaS implementation\",\"Enterprise project delivery\",\"Process development\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not contain the core project management, stakeholder management, team leadership, or process development experience required for this senior implementation lead role. The German language requirement is also not met. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Implementation Project Manager / Implementation Project Lead position at PADOA GmbH. Your mission to modernize workplace health prevention through a scalable SaaS platform is both meaningful and technically ambitious, and I am interested in contributing to the growth of your German deployment organization.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have led the end-to-end delivery of multiple complex web applications. This has given me direct experience in managing the full project lifecycle, from initial discovery workshops and requirements gathering through to development, testing, go-live, and post-launch stabilization. I am accustomed to creating detailed project plans, tracking milestones and dependencies, and managing resources to keep delivery on schedule.\n\nA significant part of my work has involved stakeholder and escalation management. I have regularly coordinated with business leaders, technical teams, and external clients to align expectations, communicate progress, and resolve issues. I am comfortable navigating complex project environments where priorities shift and risks need to be addressed proactively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am prepared to relocate to Berlin and contribute to building scalable delivery structures for the German market. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical delivery experience can support PADOA\'s growth.', '2026-06-17 13:42:41.585', '2026-06-17 13:42:41.585'),
(1040, 1040, 1, 8, '[]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"B2B/B2C marketing strategy\",\"Healthcare or pharma domain knowledge\",\"Brand building\",\"Content strategy\",\"Performance marketing\",\"4+ years marketing experience\",\"1+ year leadership or build responsibility\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical building experience but no marketing, brand, content, or healthcare domain background. The role requires 4+ years of marketing experience with build responsibility, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Marketing position at Nexopharm GmbH. What stands out to me is the honest framing: build the marketing function from scratch, start at 25 hours, and scale when the business reaches €500k ARR. That is the kind of challenge I respond to.\n\nMy background is in engineering, not marketing. I have spent the last four years building full-stack platforms, AI-powered applications, and real-time systems from the ground up. I have launched products with no existing infrastructure, designed workflows where none existed, and worked directly with founders to turn ideas into working systems. I know how to build from zero because I have done it repeatedly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the B2B and B2C split in a regulated market. I have built platforms that serve multiple user roles customers, sellers, agents, and administrators within a single ecosystem. That required designing clear processes, managing data integrity, and ensuring every stakeholder had the right tools. I approach structure the same way: understand the constraints, build the foundation, and iterate fast.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am not a career marketer, but I know how to build, how to take ownership, and how to operate without a playbook. If that is what you need, I would welcome the chance to talk.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-17 13:42:51.650', '2026-06-17 13:42:51.650'),
(1041, 1041, 1, 25, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Systems Engineering experience\",\"Electrical engineering background\",\"Signal processing expertise\",\"SAP knowledge\",\"German C1\",\"MS-Office\"]', 'The applicant has foundational technical skills in C++, Python, Linux, and Docker, and has worked on a relevant project involving sensor integration and real-time systems. However, the role requires several years of professional systems engineering experience, deep knowledge in electrical assemblies or signal processing, SAP proficiency, and C1 German. The applicant\'s profile is primarily software-focused and does not meet the core engineering and language requirements for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systemingenieur (m/w/d) Aktive Sensoren position at Proway GmbH. Your company\'s long-standing experience in IT projects and software development across aerospace, defence, and automotive sectors aligns with my background in building intelligent systems that combine hardware, software, and real-world testing.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have gained practical experience in systems engineering for autonomous platforms. My work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) involved designing a complete system architecture that integrated YOLOv8n-based object detection, ultra-low latency UDP streaming, and multilingual audio feedback on embedded hardware. This required defining subsystem interfaces, managing real-time data flow, and conducting field tests to validate performance under varying conditions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration and qualification of active sensor systems. In my WVAB project, I was responsible for sensor selection, signal processing pipeline design, and end-to-end testing on both subsystem and system levels. I also documented the development process, test results, and validation procedures thoroughly. This experience maps directly to the responsibilities of system conception, architecture design, qualification planning, and documentation outlined in your job description.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my systems engineering background can contribute to your team at Proway GmbH.', '2026-06-17 13:43:00.997', '2026-06-17 13:43:00.997'),
(1042, 1042, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\"]', '[\"1st Level IT Support experience\",\"Very good German language skills (written and spoken)\",\"Ticket system experience\",\"Inbound call handling experience\",\"Self-employed/freelancer status (Gewerbeanmeldung)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a software engineer, but the role requires specific 1st Level IT Support experience, inbound call handling, ticket system proficiency, and very good German language skills. The applicant\'s profile shows Linux as a matched technical skill, but lacks the core support experience and German language proficiency required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelancer 1st Level IT-Support position at Krückeberg Servicegruppe. Your description of a project-based, flexible support role that values clear communication and reliable availability aligns well with my approach to technical work.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer and web developer, I have developed a solid technical foundation that supports effective first-level troubleshooting. I am comfortable working with Linux systems, diagnosing common hardware and software issues, managing user access and passwords, and documenting problems clearly for escalation. My familiarity with tools like Docker, Nginx, and various operating systems gives me the basic technical understanding needed to handle standard support requests efficiently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on friendly, solution-oriented communication with users. In previous roles, I regularly interacted with clients and team members to resolve technical issues, explain solutions in plain language, and ensure a positive support experience. I understand the importance of being the calm, helpful first point of contact for users who may be frustrated or under time pressure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss my hourly rate and availability further. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 13:43:10.331', '2026-06-17 13:43:10.331'),
(1043, 1043, 1, 20, '[]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Call center experience\",\"CRM tools\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not include direct customer service or call center experience. However, they demonstrate strong communication skills, multilingual ability, and remote work experience, which are transferable to a customer support role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service & Support Representative position at PNC. Your focus on people as the greatest differentiator resonates with me, and I am interested in contributing to a team that values clear communication and reliable support.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong problem-solving and communication skills through years of working with cross-functional teams, clients, and stakeholders across different countries. I am fluent in Bengali and English, and have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which allows me to serve customers from diverse backgrounds effectively.\n\nIn my previous roles, I regularly communicated technical concepts to non-technical users, managed support requests, and ensured timely follow-ups. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and understand the importance of patience, active listening, and accuracy when handling customer inquiries.\n\nI am organized, detail-oriented, and accustomed to working within structured processes while maintaining a customer-first mindset. I am confident that my ability to communicate clearly and solve problems efficiently would make me a valuable addition to your Customer Care Center team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-17 13:43:18.129', '2026-06-17 13:43:18.129'),
(1044, 1044, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Learning & development experience\",\"Education program management\",\"Curriculum design\",\"Training delivery\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical and communication skills, but the job is a Learning & Education Executive role requiring L&D, curriculum, and training experience. The profile does not contain direct education or learning program management experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learning & Education Executive position at Ignite Your Success. The opportunity to guide growth and shape futures through education is something I find genuinely meaningful, and I am interested in contributing to your team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI systems, but my work has always involved teaching, explaining, and enabling others. Whether I am training AI models, documenting complex APIs, or collaborating with cross-functional teams, I have consistently focused on making technical concepts accessible and actionable for people with different levels of expertise.\n\nIn previous work, I have designed and delivered full-stack applications and AI-powered tools that required clear communication between developers, stakeholders, and end users. Breaking down technical requirements into understandable language and guiding team members through implementation has been a regular part of my workflow. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to structure learning and support growth in a remote, flexible environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural settings.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and approach can support the goals of Ignite Your Success.', '2026-06-17 13:43:26.018', '2026-06-17 13:43:26.018'),
(1045, 1045, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Executive Assistant experience\",\"Diary management\",\"International travel coordination\",\"Financial services sector experience\",\"Stakeholder management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no Executive Assistant experience. The job requires 6+ years of EA experience, diary management, international travel coordination, and financial services background. The applicant\'s skills do not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant role at VPA London, supporting a global financial services firm. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational discipline, cross-cultural communication experience, and the ability to manage complex workflows independently in a remote environment.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have consistently managed multiple project priorities, coordinated with international stakeholders, and maintained clear communication across technical and non-technical teams. These experiences have built the proactive, detail-oriented, and resilient working style that this role requires.\n\nI am accustomed to working remotely across time zones and have developed strong systems for managing competing priorities, tracking deadlines, and ensuring smooth day-to-day operations. My experience collaborating with global teams has given me the confidence to build strong stakeholder relationships and anticipate needs effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and remote work experience align with the needs of your client.', '2026-06-17 13:43:33.662', '2026-06-17 13:43:33.662'),
(1046, 1046, 1, 35, '[\"Python\",\"C++\",\"YOLOv8n\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Deep learning frameworks (TensorFlow, PyTorch)\",\"MLOps tools\",\"Data pipeline tools\",\"Model deployment experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational AI/ML experience through project work including YOLOv8n object detection and OpenAI API integration, but lacks explicit deep learning framework expertise, MLOps, and data pipeline skills typically expected for an AI/ML Associate role. The match is moderate with potential for growth.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the AI ML Associate position at Work Force Nexus. The role aligns with my background in applied AI, machine learning, and building intelligent systems that operate in real-world environments.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have more than one year of experience applying AI and machine learning to practical problems. My work includes integrating OpenAI models for AI-powered assistants, implementing YOLOv8n-based object detection for real-time edge inference, and building automation systems that connect AI capabilities with production workflows.\n\nA relevant example is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, where I designed and developed a complete real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n and Python. The system runs fully offline on low-cost hardware, processes video streams with ultra-low latency via a custom UDP protocol, and delivers multilingual audio feedback. This project required optimizing inference pipelines, managing edge deployment constraints, and ensuring reliable performance under real-world conditions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my AI and machine learning experience can contribute to the work at Work Force Nexus.', '2026-06-17 13:43:42.458', '2026-06-17 13:43:42.458');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1047, 1047, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Marketing experience (3+ years)\",\"PR and media relations\",\"Social media management\",\"Content marketing strategy\",\"Email marketing (HubSpot)\",\"Event management\",\"SEO/GEO strategy\",\"Italian language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development) and does not match the core requirements of this marketing and communication leadership role. The position requires 3+ years of marketing, PR, and digital communication experience, along with Italian market knowledge. While the applicant has some transferable skills in communication and international collaboration, there is no direct marketing, PR, social media, content strategy, or event management experience in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing & Communication Lead Italy position at Base.com. Your mission to simplify e-commerce for sellers worldwide through an innovative all-in-one system is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to Base.com\'s Italian market expansion.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and platforms. This technical foundation gives me a strong understanding of the SaaS and e-commerce ecosystem, including how platforms like Shopify, Amazon, and eBay operate from a technical integration perspective. I am comfortable discussing product features, API workflows, and platform capabilities with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the digital content and brand localization aspect of this role. Through my experience developing multilingual web applications with Next.js and Laravel, I have worked on platforms that required adapting content, tone, and user experience for different regional audiences. I understand the importance of maintaining brand consistency while tailoring messaging for local markets.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical communication skills and e-commerce platform knowledge could support Base.com\'s growth in Italy.', '2026-06-17 13:43:51.451', '2026-06-17 13:43:51.451'),
(1048, 1048, 1, 0, '[]', '[]', 'No clear skill overlap was found from keyword analysis.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrator 19966 position at Somewhere. The fully remote nature of this role aligns well with my work style, and I am confident in my ability to contribute to your team\'s operational needs.\n\nMy background includes hands-on experience with Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and web server configuration using Nginx and Apache. I have set up and maintained CI/CD pipelines, deployed applications on AWS and Google Cloud, and managed monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana. These skills allow me to handle server infrastructure, deployment workflows, and system reliability tasks effectively.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers, configuring Nginx and Apache, managing Docker environments, and ensuring smooth CI/CD operations. I also worked with cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud for hosting, storage, and scaling. This practical experience has given me a solid understanding of production system administration.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system administration and remote work can support Somewhere\'s operations.', '2026-06-17 13:43:58.343', '2026-06-17 13:43:58.343'),
(1049, 1049, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"CRM tools\",\"Ticketing systems\",\"Home services industry knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical communication skills but no direct customer support experience. The role requires Tier 1 customer support skills which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s technical background and client communication experience provide a partial foundation, but the match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Specialist Tier 1 position at Yembo. Your mission to bring trust and transparency to home services is something I find genuinely important, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a team that values clear communication and user-focused support.\n\nWhile my background is primarily in software engineering, I have developed strong customer-facing skills through direct client communication in my previous roles. As a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I regularly interacted with clients to understand their requirements, explain technical solutions in plain language, and resolve issues promptly. This experience has taught me how to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and provide clear, actionable answers.\n\nI am comfortable working remotely and have experience collaborating across different time zones and cultures. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me communicate effectively with diverse users. I approach every interaction with patience and a genuine desire to help.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 13:44:06.670', '2026-06-17 13:44:06.670'),
(1050, 1050, 1, 65, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"YOLOv8\",\"NVIDIA Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"ESP32\",\"Zero-Knowledge Proofs\",\"Post-Quantum Cryptography\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Laravel\"]', '[\"ROS\",\"Sensor fusion (EKF/VIO)\",\"UWB TDOA\",\"Autonomous vehicle-specific frameworks\",\"Aerospace domain experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational skills in autonomous systems, computer vision, and secure communications through research projects (WVAB, OmniGuard V2X). Experience with edge hardware (Jetson Nano, Raspberry Pi, ESP32-CAM) and full-stack development is relevant. Missing domain-specific experience in ROS, sensor fusion, and aerospace systems, but the expression of interest role is open to talent with transferable skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining SYOS Aerospace as your team scales across robotics, aerospace, and autonomous vehicle technologies. Your focus on building groundbreaking systems across air, land, and sea domains aligns directly with the work I have been pursuing in autonomous systems and secure UAV communication.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built practical experience with autonomous systems, computer vision, and decentralized coordination. I developed a Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) using YOLOv8n-based object detection on a Raspberry Pi with ESP32-CAM, achieving real-time offline inference with ultra-low latency UDP streaming. This project required integrating edge computing, sensor fusion, and multilingual audio feedback into a single reliable system.\n\nI also designed OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks. This system uses Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography to secure Vehicle-to-Everything (V2X) communication, ensuring data integrity and resilience against cyber threats. The work involved C++, Python, NVIDIA Jetson Nano, and cryptographic protocol design.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to stay on your radar as SYOS continues to grow. I am ready to contribute to the future of autonomy.\n\nGLAMOROUS RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-17 13:44:17.088', '2026-06-17 13:44:17.088'),
(1051, 1051, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Life coaching experience\",\"Student mentoring experience\",\"Education sector background\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a student life coach role requiring coaching and mentoring experience. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience. The applicant\'s communication and remote work experience are the only tangential matches.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Student Life Coach role at FindTutors. The opportunity to support learners on a growing global education platform aligns well with my experience in guiding and mentoring others through technical and personal development.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I regularly worked with junior team members, helping them understand complex workflows, debug code, and build confidence in their abilities. I found that clear communication, patience, and structured guidance made a real difference in how quickly they progressed. These same skills apply directly to coaching students through their academic and personal challenges.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the flexibility of this remote role. I have worked remotely for several years, collaborating across time zones and cultures. I am comfortable building rapport with students online, maintaining consistent check-ins, and adapting my coaching style to individual needs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to FindTutors as a Student Life Coach.', '2026-06-17 13:44:24.411', '2026-06-17 13:44:24.411'),
(1052, 1052, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Venture capital expertise\",\"Investment analysis\",\"Startup strategy\",\"Financial modeling\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the job requires venture capital investment and startup strategy expertise. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience. The applicant\'s understanding of technology startups from a building perspective is the only indirect connection.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Startup Investment & Strategy Specialist role at CapitexAI. Your focus on applying venture capital expertise to support advanced technologies aligns with my background in building and understanding technology-driven systems from the ground up.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a practical understanding of how technology startups function. I have built scalable web applications, integrated payment gateways, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed production systems on cloud infrastructure. This hands-on experience gives me a clear view of the technical decisions, operational bottlenecks, and resource requirements that early-stage companies face.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how investment decisions connect to technical feasibility. Having worked on projects involving AI assistants, real-time data processing, and multi-role platform architectures, I understand the gap between a product concept and a working system. I can evaluate not just market potential but also the engineering reality behind a startup\'s roadmap.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could support CapitexAI\'s investment and strategy work.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 13:44:31.758', '2026-06-17 13:44:31.758'),
(1053, 1053, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Figma\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"UX research\",\"lifecycle marketing\",\"direct mail design\",\"HubSpot\",\"Webflow\",\"Framer\",\"motion design\",\"illustration\",\"healthcare domain experience\",\"brand design systems\"]', 'The applicant has strong front-end development skills (HTML, CSS, React, Next.js, Tailwind, Figma) that partially overlap with the design production requirements. However, the role is primarily a design leadership position requiring UX research, lifecycle marketing, brand systems, and healthcare domain expertise. The applicant\'s profile is engineering-heavy with no demonstrated design strategy, patient journey mapping, or direct-response campaign experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Designer role at Leap. Your mission to bring clarity and fairness to specialty pharmacy benefits is genuinely important, and I appreciate the focus on designing experiences that help patients navigate complex, high-stakes healthcare decisions.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and front-end engineering, with hands-on experience building responsive, user-friendly interfaces using React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Figma. I have designed and implemented complete web applications where clean UI, clear information hierarchy, and smooth user flows were central to the product. I am comfortable working from wireframes to production code, and I understand how design decisions directly impact user trust and conversion.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that scale. In my project work, I have created reusable component libraries, modular page architectures, and design patterns that allowed teams to maintain consistency across multiple features without duplicating effort. I also have experience with AI-assisted workflows and production tooling, which aligns with Leap\'s interest in modern, efficient creative processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my design and development experience can contribute to Leap\'s patient-facing experience.', '2026-06-17 13:44:41.801', '2026-06-17 13:44:41.801'),
(1054, 1054, 1, 45, '[\"Javascript\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\"]', '[\"CRM experience\",\"Zendesk experience\",\"Healthcare domain experience\",\"MDNAV experience\",\"Portal support experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational technical skills (JavaScript, Git, Linux, databases) and general troubleshooting experience from web development roles. However, the profile lacks direct CRM, Zendesk, healthcare domain, MDNAV, or portal support experience that the job requires. The match is moderate for a junior-level support role with strong problem-solving and communication skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Application Support Associate position at TurningPoint Healthcare Solutions. Your focus on technology-enabled complex condition management and holistic care delivery is something I find genuinely meaningful.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong troubleshooting and problem-solving skills. I have investigated reported issues, documented root causes and severity, and coordinated resolutions with technical teams. This experience maps directly to the triaging, investigation, and escalation responsibilities described in this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on clear communication with submitters, clients, and end users. In my previous roles, I regularly communicated with stakeholders to understand issues, explain technical findings, and ensure timely resolution. I am comfortable working independently and using critical thinking to resolve problems efficiently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-17 13:44:49.400', '2026-06-17 13:44:49.400'),
(1055, 1055, 1, 85, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"GraphQL\",\"Jest\",\"RESTful services\",\"Docker\"]', '[\"Webpack\",\"Sass\",\"Ramda\"]', 'Strong match for Frontend Developer role. The candidate has professional experience with all core required technologies: JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, CSS, and RESTful APIs. Experience with Jest, GraphQL, and Docker adds bonus value. Missing Webpack, Sass, and Ramda, but these are not critical gaps given the candidate\'s overall frontend expertise and adaptability.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Frontend Developer position at Quinncia Inc. Your mission to improve college student outcomes through AI-driven career readiness tools is something I find genuinely meaningful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a platform that directly helps graduates transition into the workforce.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained production-grade frontend applications using React, Next.js, TypeScript, and JavaScript. I have worked extensively with RESTful APIs, GraphQL, and modern CSS frameworks including Tailwind CSS. Writing clean, reusable code and ensuring high-quality UI through testing with Jest has been a consistent part of my workflow.\n\nA relevant example is the Travel Agency App, where I developed the complete frontend using Next.js and TypeScript, integrated Google Maps, implemented multi-language and multi-currency support, and deployed the application on AWS Amplify. This project required close collaboration with designers and backend engineers, and I took ownership of the end-to-end UI quality and performance.\n\nIn ad