(1058, 1058, 1, 35, '[\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"PHP\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"REST API\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Git\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\",\"GraphQL\",\"Firebase\",\"AI-based projects\",\"automation\"]', '[\"CRM-specific experience (Salesforce, HubSpot, etc.)\",\"MarTech-specific experience (Adobe Experience Cloud, Contentful, etc.)\",\"E-commerce platform experience (Shopify Plus, commercetools, etc.)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Direct consulting or agency experience in MarTech/CRM\",\"Experience with CDP, CMS, or marketing automation tools\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in full-stack web development (Laravel, Next.js, Node.js) and cloud deployment, which provides a solid base for understanding digital system landscapes. However, the role specifically requires senior-level experience in MarTech and CRM consulting within a digital agency or consultancy context, along with German language proficiency. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct experience with CRM/MarTech platforms (Salesforce, HubSpot, etc.) or in a consulting/advisory capacity, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Technical Consultant MarTech & CRM position at Ilias Vassiliou & Team / headhunter.digital. The role combines technical consulting, digital transformation, and project steering, which aligns well with my background in full-stack development and technology advisory.\n\nWhat stands out to me is the focus on translating business requirements into technical concepts and guiding clients through complex digital decisions. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked directly with stakeholders to understand their goals, evaluate technology options, and deliver scalable platforms. I am comfortable bridging the gap between business needs and technical implementation.\n\nThrough my work with Laravel and Next.js, I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways and third-party services. I have also deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. These skills are directly relevant to evaluating and architecting MarTech and CRM system landscapes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your clients\' digital transformation projects.', '2026-06-18 01:40:24.180', '2026-06-18 01:40:24.180'),
(1059, 1059, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Buchhaltung (Accounting)\",\"Immobilienverwaltung (Property Management)\",\"Debitorenbuchhaltung\",\"Kreditorenbuchhaltung\",\"Mahnwesen\",\"Betriebskostenabrechnung\",\"Immoware24\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not match the accounting and property management focus of this role. There are no overlapping skills in accounting, property management software, or German language proficiency required for the position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sachbearbeiter Buchhaltung Immobilienverwaltung position at hoch²immobilien GmbH. Your description of a modern, fully digital property management company with flat hierarchies and a hands-on mentality aligns well with my working style.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong aptitude for structured work, data accuracy, and digital process optimization. My experience building and maintaining complex web applications has required meticulous attention to detail, systematic problem-solving, and a disciplined approach to managing data and workflows.\n\nIn previous roles, I have worked extensively with databases, financial data flows, and reporting systems. I am comfortable handling large datasets, ensuring data integrity, and generating accurate reports. My technical background gives me a natural affinity for digital tools and software solutions, which I believe would allow me to quickly adapt to your property management software and contribute to your digital-first workflow.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams