(1060, 1060, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Video editing (Premiere Pro, CapCut)\",\"Performance marketing / Meta Ads experience\",\"Generative AI tools (Runway, HeyGen, ElevenLabs)\",\"Direct-response frameworks (AIDA, PAS)\",\"UGC / VSL production\",\"Adobe After Effects\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI engineering and software development skills, but the role requires specialized video editing for performance marketing, hands-on experience with specific generative AI tools (CapCut, Runway, HeyGen), and knowledge of Meta Ads creative formats. The AI and automation mindset is a partial match, but the core video editing and ad creative skills are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Video Editor / AI Creative Cutter position at everydays. Your approach to scaling performance marketing through AI-driven creative iteration is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered systems that combine computer vision, real-time data processing, and automation. One example is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), where I designed a complete pipeline using YOLOv8n for object detection, optimized for low-latency inference on edge hardware. This required working with generative and AI-based tools to process visual data and produce meaningful output in real time. I approach AI as a practical multiplier for speed and quality, not just a theoretical concept.\n\nIn previous work, I have integrated APIs, automated workflows, and built systems that prioritize iteration speed and data-driven optimization. I am comfortable working with Python, Docker, and Linux-based environments, 