(1061, 1061, 1, 35, '[\"Python\",\"SQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"dbt\",\"Airflow\",\"Dagster\",\"ETL/ELT\",\"Embedding pipelines\",\"Vector databases\",\"Qdrant\",\"Weaviate\",\"pgvector\",\"LlamaParse\",\"Unstructuredio\",\"DataOps\",\"Knowledge Graphs\",\"Semantic Layer\",\"Text-to-SQL\",\"GDPR\",\"EU AI Act\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Python, SQL, PostgreSQL, Docker, and Linux that are relevant to the Data & AI Engineer role. However, the role requires 3+ years of specialized data engineering experience with modern data stack tools (dbt, Airflow, Dagster), embedding pipelines, vector databases, and unstructured data processing tools (LlamaParse, Unstructuredio), which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s AI experience is more focused on application-level AI integration (OpenAI API, YOLOv8) rather than data infrastructure and retrieval systems. The match is low due to significant gaps in core data engineering requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data & AI Engineer role at Team Passerelle. Your mission to build a bridge between technological progress and better working conditions, grounded in European democratic values, is exactly the kind of environment where I want to contribute my skills.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built AI-powered systems that process unstructured data and deliver real-time insights. One project involved developing an AI-powered financial application where I used OpenAI\'s API for assistant training, AWS Transcribe for voice-to-text conversion, and AWS SES for automated document delivery. This required designing data ingestion pipelines, managing metadata, and ensuring secure handling of sensitive information.\n\nA relevant example is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind system I developed, which uses YOLOv8n for real-time object detection on edge devices. This project required building a complete pipeline for processing video streams, generating structured metadata, and delivering audio feedback with low latency. I worked with Python, C++, and embedded hardware, and designed the system to operate fully offline with a focus on data efficiency and privacy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI engineering and data pipelines can support Team Passerelle\'s mission.', '2026-06-18 01:40:54.393', '2026-06-18 01:40:54.393'),
(1062, 1062, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"REST APIs\",\"Git\"]', '[\"LangChain\",\"LlamaIndex\",\"LangGraph\",\"MCP\",\"RAG architectures\",\"Multi-agent systems\",\"LLMOps\",\"MLOps\",\"Azure\",\"German language\",\"5+ years experience\",\"Consulting/client work experience\",\"Pre-sales experience\",\"EU AI Act knowledge\"]', 'Shahanur has foundational AI engineering skills (Python, AWS, Docker, Node.js) and has built AI-powered applications integrating OpenAI APIs. However, the role requires senior-level (5+ years) experience with specific GenAI frameworks (LangChain, LlamaIndex, LangGraph, MCP), RAG architectures, multi-agent systems, LLMOps, consulting/client-facing experience, and German language proficiency. The candidate\'s profile shows strong software engineering capability but lacks the depth in enterprise AI architecture and consulting required for this senior Solutions Architect position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the AI Solutions Architect role at Team Passerelle. Your mission to build a bridge between technological progress and better working conditions, grounded in digital sovereignty and ethical AI, is exactly the kind of challenge I want to contribute to.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built production-ready AI systems that combine software engineering with practical machine learning. One area that particularly interests me is designing scalable architectures for AI applications. I have hands-on experience integrating OpenAI APIs, building RAG-style assistants, and deploying real-time systems on AWS infrastructure. I am comfortable working across the full stack, from backend logic to cloud deployment.\n\nA relevant example is an AI-powered financial platform I developed, which uses OpenAI assistants, AWS Transcribe for voice processing, and automated PDF generation via AWS SES. The system handles authentication, role-based access, and real-time data pipelines. This project required the same kind of end-to-end thinking your role demands: translating complex requirements into working prototypes, evaluating technology trade-offs, and delivering a reliable product.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Team Passerelle\'s mission of building good AI for good work.', '2026-06-18 01:41:06.184', '2026-06-18 01:41:06.184'),
