(1151, 1151, 1, 35, '[\"PostgreSQL\",\"MySQL\",\"Python\"]', '[\"QGIS\",\"PostGIS\",\"Pandas\",\"GeoPandas\",\"Qlik Sense\",\"Power Query\",\"Statistics\",\"Energy sector domain knowledge\",\"GIS experience\",\"Data analysis tools (Qlik, Power BI)\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in PostgreSQL, MySQL, and Python which are relevant to the data analyst role. However, the profile lacks direct experience with GIS tools (QGIS, PostGIS), data analysis libraries (Pandas, GeoPandas), visualization tools (Qlik Sense), and domain knowledge in the energy sector. The match is partial and would require significant upskilling in data analysis and GIS-specific areas.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Analyst (m/w/d) position at BELKAW GmbH. Your focus on building data-driven decision foundations for business, customer, and process operations aligns with my experience in working with structured data, building reporting systems, and translating analytical insights into actionable recommendations.\n\nThrough my professional work as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with PostgreSQL and MySQL databases, designing schemas, writing optimized queries, and integrating data from multiple sources into unified systems. I have built dashboards and reporting interfaces that required careful attention to data quality, consistency, and clear visual presentation. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to handle heterogeneous data structures and ensure that analysis outputs are both accurate and interpretable.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of a Geoinformation system based on QGIS. While my direct experience is in web-based data systems, I have strong database skills and a structured approach to learning new tools. I am comfortable working with spatial data concepts and am prepared to quickly build proficiency in QGIS and PostGIS to support this initiative.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to BELKAW\'s data-driven initiatives.', '2026-06-19 01:40:30.753', '2026-06-19 01:40:30.753'),
