er pressure, managing deadlines, and adapting to changing priorities. My experience has taught me to communicate clearly, listen carefully to client needs, and take ownership of outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in client communication and project coordination can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 01:40:44.790', '2026-06-19 01:40:44.790'),
(1154, 1154, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Ads\",\"Performance Max\",\"SEA strategy\",\"Search Ads 360\",\"Merchant Center\",\"Tracking and Analytics\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"5+ years of full-funnel SEA experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development and AI integration skills, but lacks the core SEA-specific experience (Google Ads, PMax, Search Ads 360, Merchant Center) and the required German language proficiency that are central to this Senior SEA Manager role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior SEA Manager position at hurra.com. Your focus on combining deep performance marketing expertise with AI, automation, and proprietary technology development is a compelling approach. The opportunity to shape the next generation of paid search through data-driven strategies and new platforms like ChatGPT Ads aligns with my background in building intelligent, automated systems.\n\nMy professional experience has centered on developing scalable web applications and integrating AI-powered features to solve real-world problems. I have built systems that automate complex workflows, process data in real time, and deliver measurable outcomes. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how data, automation, and AI can create performance advantages in digital marketing environments.\n\nIn previous work, I developed an AI-powered financial application that integrated OpenAI assistants, automated data processing from Google Sheets, and generated PDF documents through AWS services. I also built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that streams live metrics using Socket.IO, demonstrating my ability to create systems that turn raw data into actionable insights. These projects required the same analytical thinking and systematic approach that effective SEA management demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 01:40:51.476', '2026-06-19 01:40:51.476'),
(1155, 1155, 1, 18, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Paid Search / SEA experience (5+ years)\",\"Performance Max / Smart Bidding\",\"Search Advertising strategy\",\"Customer consulting and pitching\",\"German language (C2 level)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI integration, but this role is a senior marketing leadership position requiring 5+ years of direct Paid Search, SEA, and Search Advertising experience, along with client consulting, team coaching, and native-level German. There is minimal skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Paid Search & AI Advertising role at hurra.com. The combination of AI, automation, and search advertising that you are building is exactly the kind of challenge I want to work on next.\n\nMy technical background is rooted in AI engineering and full-stack development. I have built AI-powered applications using OpenAI APIs, integrated automation pipelines, and developed platforms that handle real-time data processing and user interactions. I approach new AI capabilities with a practical mindset: evaluate, test, and turn them into scalable solutions that deliver measurable results.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how AI is reshaping search and advertising workflows. Through my project work, I have integrated third-party APIs, built role-based access systems, and deployed applications on cloud infrastructure using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable working across the stack and translating strategic goals into technical execution.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both te