(1156, 1156, 1, 72, '[\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Figma\",\"Vue JS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\",\"Linux\",\"MySQL\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Tailwind\",\"Javascript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\"]', '[\"Nuxt.js\",\"Effect-TS\",\"Claude Code / Terminal Agents\",\"Figma MCP\",\"OpenTelemetry\",\"Storybook\",\"Event analytics\"]', 'Strong match for full-stack engineering role. Applicant has 4 years of professional full-stack experience with TypeScript, React, Next.js, PostgreSQL, and Vue.js. Experience includes building and shipping production applications end to end, API design, database optimization, deployment with Docker and AWS, and real-time features. Missing Nuxt.js and Effect-TS which are nice-to-haves. Strong product ownership mindset demonstrated through project work.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full-Stack Developer role at Joy_. Your vision of a Universal Purchasing Infrastructure that makes every product on the internet instantly available is genuinely ambitious, and the way you are applying it to reinvent the gift card market in Germany is exactly the kind of product challenge I want to work on.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development with TypeScript, React, Next.js, and PostgreSQL. Over the past 4 years, I have built and shipped production web applications end to end, covering everything from database design and API architecture to responsive frontend interfaces and deployment. I have experience with Vue.js and am comfortable working across the entire stack, which aligns well with your core application development needs.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have owned features from discovery through production. At Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. I also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and delivered real-time features using WebSockets.\n\nOne project that reflects how I work is a full-stack travel agency platform I built for 2Expedition. I designed the PostgreSQL schema, built the API layer with NestJS and TypeScript, and created a responsive, multi-language, multi-currency UI using Next.js and Tailwind CSS. The platform handles tours, bookings, customer data, and regional support. I deployed the frontend on AWS Amplify and the backend on AWS EC2, and I monitored performance to ensure reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to building the gift card product at Joy_.', '2026-06-19 01:41:08.126', '2026-06-19 01:41:08.126'),
(1157, 1157, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"4+ years recruitment experience\",\"Engineering/technical recruiting in Space/Aerospace/Automotive/Robotics\",\"End-to-end recruitment in startups\",\"Stakeholder management with senior technical hiring managers\",\"Recruiting across Europe (Germany advantage)\",\"Advanced sourcing (LinkedIn Recruiter)\",\"ATS systems (Greenhouse nice to have)\",\"Defence/military/government environment experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical engineering skills but zero recruitment experience, which is the core requirement of this role. No matched skills in recruitment, sourcing, ATS, or stakeholder management. The role requires 4+ years of dedicated recruiting experience, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technical Recruiter – Engineering position at constellr GmbH. Your mission to deliver high-accuracy thermal intelligence from space for climate resilience and security is both ambitious and technically demanding. I am drawn to the challenge of helping a multidisciplinary team scale by finding the right engineering talent to build the world\'s first commercial thermal infrared constellation.\n\nAs a software engineer with experience across full-stack development, AI, and autonomous systems, I bring a strong technical lens to recruitment. I understand what it takes to evaluate candidates for complex engineering roles because I have worked alongside the very profiles you are hiring. This technical grounding allows me to assess not just skill alignment, but also communication style, motivation, and cultural fit with technical teams.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have collaborated closely with hiring managers and technical leads to define role requirements, review candidate suitability, and support structured hiring processes. I am comfortable navigating shifting priorities in a scaling organisation and maintaining a calm, professional approach under pressure. I also bring experience working in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical insight and recruitment approach can support constellr\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:41:16.218', '2026-06-19 01:41:16.218'),
