dge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to MediPulse\'s content marketing efforts. My CV is attached for your review.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:41:23.201', '2026-06-19 01:41:23.201'),
(1159, 1159, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Performance Marketing\",\"Paid Ads\",\"SEO\",\"Marketing\",\"German fluency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct marketing or paid ads experience. The role requires performance marketing skills, German fluency, and a marketing-related study background, none of which are present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in Performance Marketing position at MediPulse. Your mission to modernize healthcare through innovative software is compelling, and I appreciate the focus on measurable impact through data-driven campaigns.\n\nAlthough my primary experience is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical and technical capabilities that are directly relevant to performance marketing. I have worked extensively with data pipelines, reporting systems, and automation tools, which are essential for planning, executing, and optimizing paid ad campaigns. My ability to work with data, derive actionable insights, and iterate on strategies aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn my professional experience as a web developer, I built systems that required continuous monitoring, performance tracking, and optimization. I am comfortable with A/B testing, analyzing metrics, and making data-informed decisions to improve outcomes. I also have experience automating repetitive tasks, which can help streamline ad creative testing and reporting workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical mindset and technical skills to MediPulse\'s marketing team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your growth.', '2026-06-19 01:41:29.890', '2026-06-19 01:41:29.890'),
(1160, 1160, 1, 72, '[\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Node.js\",\"MongoDB\",\"Redis\",\"Docker\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Next.js\",\"JavaScript\",\"Git\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"React Native\",\"BigQuery\",\"Google Dataform\",\"Lightdash\"]', 'Strong match on core stack (TypeScript, React, Node.js, MongoDB, Redis, Docker, Google Cloud, Prometheus, Grafana) and end-to-end ownership experience. Missing React Native, BigQuery, Google Dataform, and Lightdash, but core engineering skills and AI/LLM workflow experience are relevant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Staff Software Engineer (m/w/d) position at Sharpist GmbH. The idea of building a hybrid coaching experience that combines human empathy with an AI Coach is genuinely interesting to me. I believe technology should enhance human connection, not replace it, and Sharpist\'s mission reflects that balance.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development with TypeScript, React, Node.js, and MongoDB, which matches the core of your stack. I have worked extensively with Next.js on the frontend and Express on the backend, building scalable APIs, real-time features, and role-based systems. I also use Docker for containerization and have deployed applications on Google Cloud and AWS. Monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana are familiar to me from maintaining production systems.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on end-to-end ownership: defining the problem, writing the PRD, shipping the solution, and measuring the outcome. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have owned features from concept to deployment. For example, I built an AI-powered financial application where I designed the API architecture, integrated OpenAI assistants, implemented OTP-based authentication via AWS SES, and deployed the system on EC2 with Nginx. I worked directly with stakeholders to scope requirements and iterated based on real feedback.\n\nI also use LLMs as a core part of my workflow. I prompt for specs, evaluate generated code for correctness and edge cases, and iterate quickly. I understand that the hard part is not the coding itself but knowing when an abstraction is wrong or when a shortcut will create problems later. That judgment comes from shipping real products and learning from what breaks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Sharpist\'s engineering team.', '2026-06-19 01:41:38.847', '2026-06-19 01:41:38.847'),
(1161, 1161, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Cloud\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Marketing-Verständnis\",\"Design-Software Grundverständnis\"]', 'The applicant has a technical background and familiarity with Figma, which partially matches the design tool requirement. However, the role is focused on graphic and content QA for Amazon listings, requiring strong German language skills, marketing understanding, and Adobe Creative Cloud experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in Quality Assurance – Grafik & Content position at Stacvalley. Your work helping brands like Clatronic, RedBull, and Purelei scale on Amazon is impressive, and I appreciate the emphasis on quality in a high-volume production environment.\n\nI have a technical background in full-stack development and a strong understanding of design tools like Figma. This combination allows me to review graphical outputs such as listings, A+ Content, and brand stores with precision. I can identify even small deviations from briefs and style guides and document them clearly.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked closely with design and content teams to ensure UI accuracy and brand consistency across projects. I am comfortable giving structured feedback and collaborating with account management and creative teams to maintain quality standards.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering, which gives me a structured approach to problem-solving and process improvement. I am available for at least 80 hours per month and can work fully remotely with flexible scheduling.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your QA processes.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:41:45.876', '2026-06-19 01:41:45.876'),
(1162, 1162, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Umweltmanagement\",\"Energiemanagement\",\"ISO 14001\",\"ISO 50001\",\"Gefahrstoffmanagement\",\"Arbeitssicherheit\",\"GefStoffV\",\"Audits\",\"Reporting (Umweltkennzahlen)\",\"Projektmanagement\",\"MS Office\",\"Deutsch (sehr gute Kenntnisse)\",\"Studium Umwelt-/Energiewissenschaften\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and web development, with no direct experience or education in environmental, energy, or sustainability management. The job requires domain-specific knowledge (ISO standards, hazardous materials, environmental reporting) and very good German language skills, which are not present in the profile. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analyst Umwelt-, Energie- & Nachhaltigkeitsmanagement position at Accenture. Your focus on environmental strategy, data-driven reporting, and continuous improvement of management systems aligns with my technical background in building scalable monitoring and reporting solutions.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and implemented systems that collect, process, and visualize real-time data. One relevant example is a real-time server health monitoring dashboard I built using React, Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker. This system streams live metrics to the browser, supports role-based access, and provides structured reporting on system availability and performance. The architecture required careful data handling, clear reporting interfaces, and reliable uptime.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, Russia, where I focus on building reliable, data-aware systems.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support Accenture\'s environmental and sustainability initiatives.', '2026-06-19 01:41:52.934', '2026-06-19 01:41:52.934');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1163, 1163, 1, 35, '[\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Typescript\",\"Go\",\"C++\",\"Python\",\"MySQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"Jest\"]', '[\"Solidity\",\"ERC-20\",\"wagmi v2\",\"viem\",\"Base blockchain\",\"smart contract deployment\",\"batch anchor jobs\",\"batch token distribution\",\"secrets manager\",\"load testing frameworks\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills with Next.js, Node.js, TypeScript, and Go, along with some blockchain-adjacent research experience through a privacy-preserving framework project. However, the role requires specific hands-on blockchain engineering skills (Solidity, ERC-20, wagmi, viem, Base chain) that are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s backend integration and security awareness are relevant, but the core blockchain expertise is missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Blockchain Developer - Base role at Spoon. Your platform combines AI-powered data extraction with a token-based incentive layer and on-chain verification, which is a compelling intersection of technologies. The opportunity to own the full blockchain integration scope for the MVP phase is exactly the kind of hands-on, additive work I seek.\n\nThrough research and development work, I designed a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks. This project involved building a tamper-proof communication layer using SHA3-256 cryptographic chaining, integrating Zero-Knowledge Proofs for anonymity, and implementing post-quantum cryptography for long-term resilience. While this was not a production blockchain deployment, it gave me a strong foundation in smart contract logic, cryptographic primitives, and secure distributed system design.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and worked extensively with Next.js, Node.js, TypeScript, and MySQL. I have deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and I am comfortable extending existing schemas and building new API endpoints without disrupting live pipelines. These skills directly apply to the backend integration and frontend wallet layer work described in your requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your MVP goals under NDA.', '2026-06-19 01:42:00.594', '2026-06-19 01:42:00.594'),
(1164, 1164, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Laufendes Studium in Wirtschaftswissenschaften, Marketing, Kommunikations-/Medienwissenschaften, Journalismus, Germanistik oder vergleichbar\",\"Exzellente Deutschkenntnisse\",\"CMS-Erfahrung (z.B. WordPress)\",\"Social-Media-Tools\",\"Design-Plattformen (z.B. Canva)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this is a Marketing/Content Management working student role requiring a relevant field of study (e.g., Marketing, Communications, Journalism) and excellent German language skills. The applicant\'s profile does not match the core qualifications for this specific role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Marketing-Kommunikation / Content-Management position at Labtagon GmbH. As a Software Engineering student with practical experience in full-stack development and content management, I am drawn to the opportunity to shape communication strategies in a growing IT company.\n\nThrough my work building web applications with Laravel, Next.js, and Strapi, I have developed a strong understanding of how content flows through digital platforms. I have managed content structures, built editorial interfaces, and ensured that technical information is presented clearly to end users. This background gives me a practical perspective on content management systems and the importance of structured, user-friendly communication.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is creating content that bridges the gap between technical complexity and audience understanding. In previous projects, I have written documentation, structured blog content, and collaborated with teams to maintain consistent messaging across web and social channels. I am comfortable working with CMS tools, planning editorial calendars, and analyzing content performance to guide improvements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to the Labtagon marketing team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:42:08.377', '2026-06-19 01:42:08.377'),
(1165, 1165, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Social Media Marketing\",\"Content Creation\",\"TikTok\",\"Instagram\",\"YouTube\",\"CapCut\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"Canva\",\"Community Management\",\"Campaign Analysis\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"German Language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) and does not match the core requirements of a Social Media Manager role. There is a minor overlap in design tools (Figma) and basic web technologies (CSS, HTML), but the candidate lacks the essential social media marketing, content creation, video editing, and community management experience required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager position at B:O:S Engergieberatung. Your work in renewable energy, particularly in photovoltaics and heat pumps, is an area I find genuinely important, and I would welcome the opportunity to help communicate your projects and successes to a wider audience.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but I have always worked at the intersection of technology and visual communication. Through my experience building full-stack applications, I have developed strong skills in content creation, UI/UX design using Figma, and video and image editing. I am comfortable producing and editing visual content for digital platforms.\n\nIn previous roles, I have been responsible for creating engaging interfaces, managing multimedia assets, and ensuring that digital content is both technically sound and visually appealing. I am confident in my ability to plan, film, and edit content for TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube, as well as manage community interactions and analyze engagement metrics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 01:42:15.639', '2026-06-19 01:42:15.639'),
(1166, 1166, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"Node JS\",\"Python\"]', '[\"Make.com\",\"Airtable\",\"ClickUp\",\"HubSpot\",\"No-Code/Low-Code Tools\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Apple MacBook support\"]', 'The applicant has solid technical infrastructure skills including Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, CI/CD, and cloud platforms. However, the role specifically requires experience with no-code/low-code tools (Make.com, Airtable, ClickUp), German language proficiency, and Apple MacBook support, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate for the system administration and automation aspects but weak for the specific tooling and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systemadministrator/-in position at Black Forest Production GmbH. Your focus on building efficient, scalable digital processes and automation aligns well with my technical background and approach to system administration.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and web server management using Nginx and Apache. I have set up CI/CD pipelines, configured monitoring tools, and maintained production environments on cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud. This technical foundation allows me to manage infrastructure reliably and troubleshoot issues efficiently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process automation and system monitoring. I have built real-time server health monitoring dashboards using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Python, which stream live metrics to the browser and provide instant visibility into system status. I also have experience with Docker Compose for containerized deployments and Nginx for reverse proxy configuration. These skills directly support the responsibilities of developing, maintaining, and optimizing digital processes and automation scenarios.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my hands-on experience with system administration, automation, and digital process optimization would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support Black Forest Production GmbH\'s digital infrastructure goals.', '2026-06-19 01:42:23.578', '2026-06-19 01:42:23.578'),
(1167, 1167, 1, 45, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"REST APIs\",\"WebSockets\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Firebase\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Make.com\",\"Airtable\",\"ClickUp\",\"HubSpot\",\"Google Sheets\",\"No-Code/Low-Code Tools\",\"Apple MacBook ecosystem\",\"German language (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"First-Level-Support experience\",\"Video/Performance Marketing domain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack web development, automation, and infrastructure (Laravel, Node.js, Docker, Linux, CI/CD) which partially overlap with the IT and process automation requirements. However, the role specifically requires experience with No-Code/Low-Code tools (Make.com, Airtable, ClickUp) and very good German language skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s background in building scalable systems and APIs is relevant, but the specific toolset and language requirements are significant gaps.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fachinformatiker/-in position at Black Forest Production GmbH. Your focus on building efficient, scalable digital processes and smart automation within a growing marketing agency resonates with my own approach to software engineering and process optimization.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed a strong foundation in building and optimizing digital systems. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js to create full-stack applications, and I have integrated various third-party services and APIs to automate workflows. My understanding of modern tools and my ability to think in terms of processes and automation align with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development and maintenance of automated scenarios and integrations between tools. In previous projects, I have built systems that connect databases, handle real-time data streaming, and automate notifications and reporting. I am comfortable working with APIs, setting up monitoring and troubleshooting pipelines, and ensuring that processes run reliably. I also have experience with Linux server administration, Docker, and Nginx, which supports the technical infrastructure side of the role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Black Forest Production GmbH\'s digital infrastructure and automation efforts.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:42:32.618', '2026-06-19 01:42:32.618'),
(1168, 1168, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"People Operations experience\",\"HR administration experience\",\"Office Management experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Event planning experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in People Operations, HR, Office Management, or Team Assistance. The role requires strong German language skills, organizational experience, and a hands-on administrative background, none of which are present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the People & Office Manager (m/w/d) position at Ordio GmbH. Your mission to build an all-in-one platform for deskless workers is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on practical tools that solve real operational problems.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational discipline, a structured approach to workflows, and a proven ability to automate repetitive tasks. I have hands-on experience with AI tools and process automation, which aligns well with your preference for someone who can identify recurring tasks and make them more efficient.\n\nIn previous work, I managed end-to-end project coordination, from equipment setup and deployment to team communication and documentation. I am comfortable handling administrative responsibilities, organizing logistics, and maintaining clear records. I work well independently and take ownership of tasks from day one.\n\nI am based in Voronezh, Russia, and I am ready to relocate to Cologne for this role. I speak English fluently and have working knowledge of German, which allows me to communicate effectively in your team\'s bilingual environment.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Ordio\'s operations as you continue to grow.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:42:39.314', '2026-06-19 01:42:39.314'),
(1169, 1169, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"SAP IS-U\",\"Billing (Abrechnung)\",\"Device Management (Geräteverwaltung)\",\"EDM\",\"Smart Metering\",\"MaKo\",\"5-10 years SAP IS-U consulting experience\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant has no SAP IS-U experience, no SAP background, and no German language skills. The role requires 5-10 years of specialized SAP IS-U consulting expertise in the energy/utilities sector, which is not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the SAP IS-U Consultant role at Pertemps ERP. Although my core expertise lies in full-stack and AI engineering, I bring strong software engineering fundamentals, project delivery experience, and a structured approach to problem-solving that can add value in enterprise consulting environments.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, with a focus on clean architecture, secure authentication, and database optimization. I have worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL, implemented RESTful APIs, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. These skills in building reliable, maintainable systems are directly applicable to the technical demands of SAP IS-U consulting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the energy and utilities sector. The opportunity to work with leading consulting firms on SAP IS-U projects, including billing, device management, EDM, and smart metering, aligns with my interest in building systems that handle complex operational logic and large-scale data processing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 01:42:45.691', '2026-06-19 01:42:45.691'),
(1170, 1170, 1, 40, '[\"Go\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Kafka\",\"Druid\",\"5+ years software development\",\"3+ years commercial Go\",\"distributed systems at scale\",\"event-driven architectures\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational Go skills and strong supporting backend technologies (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Docker, Kubernetes, Redis, microservices) but lacks the required 3+ years of commercial Go experience, Kafka expertise, and proven track record operating distributed systems at significant scale. The profile shows solid backend engineering capability but does not meet the seniority level required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Go Backend Developer position at the company you are partnering with in Hamburg. The opportunity to work on a large-scale data platform serving hundreds of millions of users globally aligns directly with my experience in building scalable backend systems.\n\nMy technical background includes Go, distributed systems, and microservices architecture. I have worked with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis for database optimization and have experience deploying cloud-native applications using Docker, Kubernetes, and AWS. I have also built real-time systems using Socket.IO and event-driven patterns.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I designed and developed scalable applications, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. I have deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers with Nginx and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is designing distributed systems that handle high concurrency and real-time data processing. My work with microservices and event-driven architectures has given me practical experience in building systems that scale reliably under load.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background fits this role.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-19 01:42:52.616', '2026-06-19 01:42:52.616'),
(1171, 1171, 1, 15, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"SAP ABAP\",\"ABAP Objects\",\"SAP Central Procurement\",\"SAP S/4HANA\",\"SAP Fiori\",\"OData\",\"CDS Views\",\"WebDynpro\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills with PHP, Laravel, and MySQL, but lacks the core SAP-specific technologies (ABAP, Central Procurement, S/4HANA, Fiori) and German language proficiency required for this Senior SAP Developer role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior SAP Developer position at Pertemps ERP. While my professional experience is rooted in full-stack web development using Laravel, PHP, and modern JavaScript frameworks, I bring strong software engineering fundamentals, database design skills, and a systematic approach to building and integrating complex systems.\n\nIn my work, I have developed and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel and MySQL, focusing on clean architecture, secure authentication, and role-based access control. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, optimized database queries, and implemented caching strategies to improve performance. These skills translate well into enterprise environments where structured development, integration, and system reliability are critical.\n\nI have experience working with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines for deployment and maintenance. I am comfortable analyzing requirements, writing technical documentation, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver solutions that meet business needs. I also have experience with third-party integrations, real-time features, and payment gateways.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in software development and systems integration can contribute to the SAP Central Procurement projects at Pertemps ERP.', '2026-06-19 01:43:00.043', '2026-06-19 01:43:00.043'),
(1172, 1172, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Procurement\",\"Supply chain management\",\"Vendor management\",\"Negotiation\",\"Contract management\",\"Property management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct procurement, supply chain, or property management experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Procurement Officer position at KAIZEN Asset Management Services. While my background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational, analytical, and system-building skills that are directly applicable to procurement operations.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and maintained systems that manage complex data flows, user roles, and secure transactions. These systems required careful coordination between multiple stakeholders, attention to detail, and the ability to track and verify information accurately, all of which are essential in procurement.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem, where I built a platform connecting customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams. This involved managing product listings, orders, payments, and role-based access, similar to managing supplier relationships and procurement workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to KAIZEN Asset Management Services.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 01:43:06.892', '2026-06-19 01:43:06.892'),
(1173, 1173, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer success experience\",\"Portuguese language\",\"CRM tools\",\"Account management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical and communication skills, but the role is a customer success position requiring domain-specific experience and Portuguese language skills. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Analista de Sucesso do Cliente Pleno position at ZENVIA. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a combination of technical expertise, clear communication, and a problem-solving mindset that aligns well with customer success.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I worked closely with stakeholders and clients to understand their needs, translate requirements into technical solutions, and ensure smooth delivery. This experience taught me how to communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical audiences, manage expectations, and resolve issues promptly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my technical understanding to improve customer outcomes. Having built and maintained applications, I can quickly grasp product functionality, troubleshoot issues, and provide meaningful guidance to customers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the ZENVIA team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:43:12.903', '2026-06-19 01:43:12.903'),
(1174, 1174, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Administração ou Psicologia (cursando 3º/4º período)\",\"Ferramentas ATS\",\"LinkedIn e Instagram para recrutamento\",\"Canva\",\"Google Meet\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Pacote Office (Word, PowerPoint)\",\"Noções de recrutamento e seleção\",\"Atendimento ao cliente\",\"Rotinas administrativas de RH\",\"Inglês avançado para entrevistas\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and organizational skills, but does not meet the core educational requirement (currently studying Administration or Psychology in 3rd or 4th semester) and lacks direct HR/recruitment experience and tools (ATS, LinkedIn recruiting, Canva, Google Workspace, Office). The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Estágio em Recrutamento e Seleção Remoto position at Talent\'s Club. Your focus on diversity, inclusion, and collaborative environments aligns with how I approach teamwork and problem-solving.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong analytical and organizational skills that transfer directly to recruitment. I am experienced in reviewing technical profiles, evaluating candidates against requirements, and producing structured assessments. My background in technology recruitment contexts gives me a practical understanding of screening processes and candidate evaluation.\n\nI am comfortable managing multiple priorities simultaneously while maintaining accuracy and attention to detail. In previous roles, I coordinated with stakeholders across different teams, scheduled and conducted online meetings, and maintained organized documentation for complex workflows. These experiences have prepared me to handle resume triage, interview scheduling, and administrative routines effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Talent\'s Club. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 01:43:21.681', '2026-06-19 01:43:21.681'),
(1175, 1175, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Executive assistance\",\"Calendar management\",\"Administrative support\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct executive assistant experience. The role requires administrative and organizational support skills which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant position at Spriggs Excavation, Inc. The opportunity to support the President in a fully remote capacity is appealing, and I am confident that my technical background, organizational discipline, and remote work experience will allow me to contribute effectively.\n\nWhile my career has been in software engineering, the skills I have developed translate directly into strong executive support. Working across multiple projects and teams has taught me how to prioritize tasks, manage competing deadlines, and communicate clearly with stakeholders at all levels. I am comfortable handling scheduling, coordinating communications, and ensuring that operations run smoothly behind the scenes.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I worked remotely with teams across different time zones and cultures. This required disciplined communication, reliable follow-through, and the ability to manage my own workflow without constant supervision. I am used to working independently while staying aligned with broader team goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 01:43:28.277', '2026-06-19 01:43:28.277'),
(1176, 1176, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"Social media content design\",\"Video production\",\"Graphic design software (e.g., Adobe Creative Suite)\",\"Content strategy\",\"Social media platform management\"]', 'The applicant has strong web development and UI design skills, but the role is primarily a social content designer/producer position. There is a partial match in design tools (Figma) and frontend technologies, but the core requirements of social media content creation, video production, and graphic design are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Content Designer & Producer position at Josie Maran. Your brand\'s focus on clean, natural beauty and creating engaging social content aligns with my interest in building visually compelling digital experiences.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong eye for design and user experience. I regularly use tools like Figma to create layouts and prototypes, and I implement responsive, polished interfaces using React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS. This combination of design thinking and technical execution allows me to produce content that is both visually appealing and technically sound.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is producing content that resonates with audiences across different platforms. In previous projects, I have built complete frontend systems from scratch, ensuring that every visual element, interaction, and layout is intentional and optimized for engagement. I understand how to balance creative direction with practical constraints like load times, accessibility, and cross-device consistency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Josie Maran\'s social content goals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 01:43:37.161', '2026-06-19 01:43:37.161'),
(1177, 1177, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Recruiting experience\",\"Applicant tracking systems\",\"Sourcing\",\"Interviewing\",\"HR processes\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct recruiting or HR experience. While they have strong communication and cross-cultural skills, the core recruiting responsibilities are not supported by their profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Recruiter position at Pavago. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong communication skills, cross-cultural experience, and a structured approach to managing relationships and workflows that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked remotely with teams and clients across Bangladesh, Russia, and the United States. This experience has taught me how to communicate clearly across time zones, adapt to different working styles, and build trust with people from diverse backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and am comfortable operating in international environments.\n\nIn my previous roles, I regularly coordinated with stakeholders, managed project timelines, and ensured that technical and non-technical teams stayed aligned. These responsibilities required strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to handle multiple priorities without losing focus. I approach every interaction with professionalism and a genuine interest in understanding people\'s needs.\n\nI am a quick learner and a problem solver by nature. I enjoy working in environments where clear communication, reliability, and a proactive mindset are valued. I am confident that my ability to build relationships and manage processes effectively would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your recruitment team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 01:43:44.711', '2026-06-19 01:43:44.711'),
(1178, 1178, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Business development experience\",\"CRM tools\",\"Lead generation\",\"Customer relationship management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Business Development Representative role requires sales, lead generation, and customer relationship management experience, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Development Representative role at Zyte. Your company\'s mission to help customers extract and utilize web data at scale is impressive, and I am drawn to the challenge of connecting technical solutions with business needs in a globally distributed team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, with a focus on full-stack development and AI-powered systems. Over the past four years, I have built and deployed web applications, integrated APIs, and worked on automation projects that required clear communication between technical and non-technical stakeholders. This experience has given me a strong ability to understand complex products and explain their value in practical terms.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated closely with clients and team members to translate requirements into working solutions. I learned how to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and present technical concepts in a way that makes sense to people without a technical background. These skills are directly relevant to understanding customer needs and articulating how Zyte\'s data solutions can address them.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Zyte\'s growth.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 01:43:52.430', '2026-06-19 01:43:52.430'),
(1179, 1179, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Industrial operations experience\",\"Physical labor experience\",\"Energy sector experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in industrial operations, physical labor, or the energy sector. The role requires hands-on industrial work, which does not align with the applicant\'s background in full-stack development and AI engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Industrial Operatives position at Denholm Energy Services. Your company\'s role in the energy sector is well-regarded, and I am interested in contributing to your operations.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and hardware integration, I have developed a practical, hands-on approach to solving technical problems. I have experience working with embedded systems such as Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano, which has given me a solid understanding of hardware-software interaction, system reliability, and structured troubleshooting.\n\nIn previous roles, I have worked both independently and as part of a team, consistently delivering results on time and following clear processes. I am comfortable in environments that require attention to detail, adherence to safety protocols, and the ability to adapt quickly to new tools or workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can contribute to the Denholm Energy Services team.', '2026-06-19 01:43:59.262', '2026-06-19 01:43:59.262'),
(1180, 1180, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Medical device manufacturing experience\",\"Regulatory compliance knowledge\",\"Specific MTM II technical requirements\"]', 'The MTM II role at Integer Holdings Corporation appears to be a manufacturing/technical position in the medical device industry. The applicant\'s profile is focused on software engineering, web development, and AI, which does not directly align with the job description. No specific technical skills from the job description matched the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the MTM II position at Integer Holdings Corporation. I understand that Integer values innovation, collaboration, and integrity, and I appreciate the company\'s commitment to creating better solutions and fostering an inclusive culture.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development and AI engineering, with hands-on experience building scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways. I also work with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and I am comfortable with deployment tools such as Docker, Nginx, and AWS.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I delivered end-to-end features including real-time communication, server monitoring dashboards, and multi-vendor e-commerce platforms. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and ensuring applications perform well under real-world conditions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 01:44:05.898', '2026-06-19 01:44:05.898'),
(1181, 1181, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Influencer marketing\",\"Campaign management\",\"Contract negotiation\",\"Client presentations\",\"10+ years industry experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not directly match the influencer marketing, campaign management, and client-facing requirements of this Junior Director role. There is a partial overlap in cross-team collaboration and communication skills, but the core domain expertise required for this position is not present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Director position at Newhouse. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring a strong foundation in cross-functional collaboration, clear communication, and meticulous attention to detail that aligns well with the responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nIn my experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD., I worked closely with diverse teams including product managers, designers, and senior engineers to deliver scalable web applications. This required coordinating across different perspectives, managing competing priorities, and ensuring every feature met quality standards before release. I built dashboards, reporting systems, and real-time monitoring tools that demanded precision and reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on building relationships and identifying key partners for campaigns. In my development work, I regularly integrated third-party services such as payment gateways, cloud storage, and authentication providers. Each integration required careful evaluation, clear rationale, and ongoing coordination with external vendors. This experience translates well into managing influencer outreach and contract negotiations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Newhouse\'s creative and communications work.', '2026-06-19 01:44:14.115', '2026-06-19 01:44:14.115');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1182, 1182, 1, 35, '[\"Python\",\"C++\",\"YOLOv8n\",\"OpenAI API\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"Jetson Nano\"]', '[\"Data Science\",\"Machine Learning\",\"Statistical Analysis\",\"Data Visualization\",\"Python libraries (NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn)\",\"SQL for data analysis\",\"A/B testing\",\"Experimental design\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant AI engineering experience (computer vision, YOLOv8, OpenAI integration) but lacks core data science skills such as statistical analysis, data manipulation libraries, and experimental design. The role is a Junior Data Scientist position, and the applicant\'s profile is more aligned with AI/software engineering than data science.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Data Scientist position at Why Hiring. Your focus on connecting talented individuals with remote opportunities aligns with my own experience working across international teams and delivering AI-driven solutions.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built practical AI systems that operate in real-world conditions. One example is WVAB (Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind), a system I designed that uses YOLOv8n for real-time object detection, custom UDP streaming for low-latency video transmission, and multilingual text-to-speech for audio feedback. The entire pipeline runs offline on edge hardware, demonstrating my ability to deploy machine learning models in constrained environments.\n\nIn addition to computer vision, I have worked on AI-powered applications that integrate large language models for intelligent assistance. I developed backend APIs using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI to power AI assistants trained on domain-specific datasets. These systems handled voice-to-text processing, automated document generation, and real-time data retrieval, giving me practical experience in building end-to-end AI workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI and software engineering can contribute to Why Hiring.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 01:44:22.715', '2026-06-19 01:44:22.715'),
(1183, 1183, 1, 30, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[]', 'This is a general future talent pool posting with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has a strong full-stack and AI engineering background, but the job description does not list any required skills, making a direct match score difficult to calculate. The score reflects the general nature of the posting rather than a lack of fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in future corporate positions at Weedmaps. As a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with experience building scalable web applications and intelligent systems, I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team as the company continues to grow and expand into new markets.\n\nMy technical foundation is in full-stack development, where I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Node.js to build production-grade applications. I have designed and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance using MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis. My work also includes real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO, as well as deployment on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I delivered scalable web applications and collaborated closely with stakeholders to translate requirements into working software. I built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, integrated payment gateways, and maintained applications on cloud infrastructure. Earlier, at DataSoft LTD, I contributed to Laravel-based projects, assisted with API development, and supported frontend implementation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would be glad to discuss how my background could align with future needs at Weedmaps. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 01:44:30.706', '2026-06-19 01:44:30.706'),
(1184, 1184, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Executive assistance\",\"Administrative support\",\"Calendar management\",\"Travel coordination\",\"Operations support\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct executive assistant or administrative support experience. The role requires operations and coordination skills, which are not demonstrated in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant position at GrowthAssistant. Your company connects top marketing and operations talent with fast-growing companies, and I am interested in contributing to a team that values efficiency and organization.\n\nMy professional experience has involved coordinating between technical and non-technical stakeholders, managing project timelines, and ensuring clear communication across teams. I have supported operations by organizing documentation, tracking deliverables, and maintaining structured workflows that keep projects moving forward.\n\nIn previous roles, I worked closely with clients and internal teams to align priorities, schedule meetings, and follow up on action items. I am comfortable handling multiple tasks simultaneously and adapting to changing needs in a remote work environment.\n\nIn addition to my organizational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support GrowthAssistant\'s operations and team coordination needs.', '2026-06-19 01:44:36.841', '2026-06-19 01:44:36.841'),
(1185, 1185, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Data entry tools\",\"Spreadsheet software\",\"Typing speed\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development skills, but the job is a Data Entry Specialist role. There is no direct overlap in required skills or experience. The applicant\'s background in database management and attention to detail may be tangentially relevant, but the core data entry skills are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Entry Specialist role at Somewhere. I understand this is a full-time remote position supporting a growing US-based company, and I am interested in contributing to your team with reliable and accurate data management.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong habits around data accuracy, organization, and consistency. I have worked extensively with databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL, where I regularly handled data entry, validation, and querying tasks. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to maintain clean, structured data in production environments.\n\nIn previous projects, I was responsible for managing large datasets, ensuring data integrity, and performing regular updates and corrections. I am comfortable working independently with minimal supervision and maintaining focus on repetitive tasks without compromising quality. I also have experience using tools like Git for version control and Linux for file management, which supports efficient workflow organization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in data management and software engineering can support the needs of your team.', '2026-06-19 01:44:43.760', '2026-06-19 01:44:43.760'),
