(1199, 1199, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Finanzbuchhaltung\",\"HGB Bilanzierung\",\"Jahresabschluss\",\"Umsatzsteuervoranmeldung\",\"Führungserfahrung\",\"Betriebswirtschaftslehre Studium\",\"Steuerfachangestellter Ausbildung\",\"Bilanzbuchhalter Qualifikation\",\"ERP-System Implementierung\",\"Controlling-Strukturen\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no accounting, finance, or tax qualifications. The role requires deep expertise in German financial accounting (HGB), team leadership, and ERP implementation. There is no direct skill overlap. The applicant\'s financial software development projects show some indirect relevance to process digitalization, but the core requirements of this role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter Finanzbuchhaltung / Rechnungswesen position at Trigon Gruppe GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed systems that directly address the digitalization and process optimization needs mentioned in your job description.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built financial applications that automate complex workflows, manage user data securely, and generate detailed reports. For example, I developed an AI-powered financial platform that handles authentication, data processing, PDF generation, and automated email delivery. This required designing scalable backend architectures and integrating multiple third-party services.\n\nI also created a personal finance management platform with features including transaction tracking, budgeting, savings monitoring, and real-time reporting. The system uses a modular architecture with server-side authentication, role-based admin controls, and live data updates. These projects demonstrate my ability to build systems that improve financial process efficiency and data accuracy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in building financial systems and digitalizing workflows could contribute to Trigon Gruppe GmbH.', '2026-06-19 13:40:22.533', '2026-06-19 13:40:22.533'),
(1200, 1200, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Project management experience (2+ years)\",\"Product management or product launch experience\",\"Cross-functional team coordination\",\"Stakeholder relationship management\",\"German language (C-level)\",\"Startup/scale-up environment experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer but lacks direct experience in business development, project management, product launches, and cross-functional team coordination that this role requires. The role is non-technical and focuses on project leadership, stakeholder management, and strategic execution from the CEO Office. While the applicant demonstrates some transferable skills in coordination and delivery from web development projects, the core requirements of 2+ years in project management, product introductions, and working directly with founders in a startup environment are not supported by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Associate Business Development - CEO Office position at 1KOMMA5°. Your mission to build an intelligent, integrated energy system using Heartbeat AI is exactly the kind of ambitious, real-world challenge I want to contribute to.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have consistently taken on project coordination and cross-functional leadership responsibilities. In my role at Explo-IT, I worked closely with stakeholders and engineering teams to deliver web applications from concept to deployment. This required managing timelines, coordinating between product and technical teams, and ensuring deliverables met quality standards.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the product launch and market entry aspect of this role. I have experience taking projects from initial planning through to go-live, including building project structures, roadmaps, and reporting frameworks for management. I am comfortable working in fast-growing environments where priorities shift and ownership matters.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the CEO Office in driving strategic projects at 1KOMMA5°.', '2026-06-19 13:40:31.752', '2026-06-19 13:40:31.752'),
(1201, 1201, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Immobilienkaufmann/-frau or comparable qualification\",\"Experience with VOB and contract law\",\"Very good German skills (written and spoken)\",\"Driver\'s license\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and full-stack development, which does not directly match the technical property management and construction maintenance requirements of this role. The applicant lacks the required German language skills, relevant vocational training in real estate or construction, and experience with VOB and contract law. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technischer Objektmanager - Bau & Instandhaltung position at Trigon Gruppe GmbH. Your company\'s established presence in Berlin\'s real estate market, managing a substantial portfolio of residential and commercial properties, is impressive. I am drawn to the responsibility of coordinating maintenance projects and ensuring the long-term quality of building assets.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining complex systems. This experience has given me a structured, analytical approach to project coordination, data management, and process optimization. I am accustomed to working with detailed specifications, tracking progress against budgets, and ensuring that deliverables meet quality standards.\n\nIn my previous roles, I was responsible for planning, coordinating, and delivering technical projects from start to finish. I maintained and updated structured data systems, monitored project budgets, and ensured timely communication with stakeholders. These responsibilities align closely with the tasks outlined for this position, including the coordination of maintenance measures, updating inventory data, and monitoring project realization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am currently based in Russia and am prepared to relocate to Berlin for this opportunity.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination and technical skills can contribute to the Trigon Gruppe team.', '2026-06-19 13:40:41.561', '2026-06-19 13:40:41.561');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1202, 1202, 1, 65, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Python for Data Analytics\",\"Jupyter Lab\",\"SCRUM\",\"Jira\",\"requirements engineering\",\"mobile working machines technologies\",\"German language fluency\",\"commercial and legal fundamentals of SaaS/web applications\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong technical skills in web service APIs, authentication/authorization protocols, cloud infrastructure (AWS, Google Cloud), and cybersecurity fundamentals. He has experience with Python and machine learning, though specific mention of Jupyter Lab and Data Analytics is not explicit in the profile. He lacks experience with mobile working machines technologies, SCRUM/Jira, and German language fluency. Overall, he is a moderate match with transferable skills in cloud implementation, API integration, and customer-facing project coordination.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Cloud Implementation Specialist (gn) position at Proemion. Your focus on delivering secure telematics solutions that give OEMs full control over their machine data aligns closely with my experience in building and integrating cloud-based systems for real-world applications.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with web service APIs, authentication and authorization protocols, and web-browser technologies. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs using Laravel, Node.js, and Express, implemented secure authentication flows with JWT and OAuth, and deployed applications on cloud infrastructure including AWS and Google Cloud. This technical foundation allows me to confidently handle the integration of cloud services with customer infrastructure.\n\nI also bring practical experience with Python for data analytics and machine learning. I have developed systems using YOLOv8 for real-time object detection and built data processing pipelines that run on edge devices. My understanding of cybersecurity fundamentals comes from research on secure communication protocols, blockchain-based frameworks, and privacy-preserving architectures for autonomous systems. These skills directly support the DataScience project coordination and security considerations mentioned in the role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in Proemion\'s mission to make machine data usable, reliable, and valuable across entire organizations. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your Field Application Engineering Team.', '2026-06-19 13:40:53.008', '2026-06-19 13:40:53.008'),
(1203, 1203, 1, 25, '[\"RBAC\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Scripting\",\"Automation\"]', '[\"Microsoft Entra ID / Azure AD\",\"Microsoft 365 Administration\",\"Jira Administration\",\"Confluence Administration\",\"SAML\",\"OIDC\",\"SCIM\",\"B2 German\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in RBAC, Git, Docker, Linux, CI/CD, and automation, which partially align with the platform engineering and identity management aspects of the role. However, the position requires deep, hands-on experience with Microsoft Entra ID / Azure AD, Microsoft 365, and Atlassian tools (Jira, Confluence), as well as IAM protocols (SAML, OIDC, SCIM) and B2-level German, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Platform Engineer - Identity & Access Management position at Muxon. The opportunity to manage and evolve the internal platform and identity landscape for a health-tech company that builds AI-driven clinical software used in hospitals is genuinely compelling to me.\n\nMy professional experience has centered on building secure, scalable systems with a strong focus on access control and automation. I have implemented role-based access control (RBAC) policies, authentication workflows, and audit-ready systems across multiple full-stack applications. This includes managing user provisioning, configuring secure API access, and enforcing policy through scripting and infrastructure-as-code practices.\n\nOne area that aligns closely with this role is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem, where I designed and deployed a role-based access control system spanning customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams. This involved managing user lifecycles, configuring permissions, and ensuring secure data access across different user tiers. I also administered Git-based platforms and collaborated on tooling and vendor management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in platform engineering and identity management can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 13:41:02.352', '2026-06-19 13:41:02.352'),
(1204, 1204, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Office management experience\",\"German language (C1)\",\"Formal business administration training\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"Recruiting or HR administration experience\",\"Bookkeeping or accounting knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and organizational skills, but this is a German-language apprenticeship in office management requiring C1 German, formal business administration training, and experience with office tools. The applicant\'s background does not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Duale Ausbildung Kaufmann/Kauffrau für Büromanagement at familie redlich. The opportunity to learn the inner workings of a creative communications agency from a central perspective is exactly the kind of hands-on training I am looking for.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the chance to gain foundational knowledge across People & Organization, Office Management, and Finance. I am a structured and organized person who enjoys understanding how processes fit together. Through my previous work experience, I have developed strong skills in task coordination, documentation, and using digital tools to keep workflows running smoothly.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I was responsible for managing project timelines, maintaining clear communication with team members and stakeholders, and ensuring that tasks were completed on schedule. I handled multiple responsibilities simultaneously, from preparing documentation to coordinating with different departments, which gave me a solid understanding of how back-office operations support overall business goals.\n\nI am comfortable working with digital tools and learning new software quickly. I bring a proactive attitude, a willingness to take on varied tasks, and a genuine interest in contributing to the team\'s daily operations. I am also fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to start my training in September 2026 and to grow within your agency. I have attached my CV and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to familie redlich.', '2026-06-19 13:41:12.965', '2026-06-19 13:41:12.965'),
(1205, 1205, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social Media Strategy\",\"Content Creation\",\"Community Management\",\"Performance Analysis\",\"Campaign Planning\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong technical skills, but the job is a mandatory internship focused on social media management and content strategy. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience. The applicant\'s project work in web development shows organizational and content workflow abilities, but lacks social media-specific experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pflichtpraktikum Social Media Management/Strategie position at Kurverwaltungsgesellschaft mbH Waldbronn. As a Software Engineering student with practical experience in building and managing digital platforms, I am interested in contributing to the development of your social media presence at Albtherme Waldbronn.\n\nThrough my project work, I have developed a structured approach to content planning and digital communication. While building the Travel Agency App, I implemented multi-language and multi-currency support, managed content workflows, and created user-friendly interfaces. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to organize, present, and adapt content for different audiences.\n\nWhat draws me to this internship is the opportunity to work on real social media strategy from the ground up. I am comfortable with creative ideation, content creation, and performance tracking. I work independently, take initiative, and am eager to bring my organizational skills and interest in digital trends to support your team in planning posts, managing community interactions, and evaluating campaign results.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I communicate clearly across teams and am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi. I enjoy collaborating in international environments and am motivated to contribute actively from day one.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your social media goals during my mandatory internship.', '2026-06-19 13:41:22.845', '2026-06-19 13:41:22.845'),
(1206, 1206, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Engineering degree (Produktions-, Maschinenbau- oder Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen)\",\"Production/manufacturing experience\",\"Lean/Six Sigma knowledge\",\"ERP system experience (e.g. ABAS)\",\"German language (C1)\",\"CNC/Composite/Electronics/Metalworking process knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Prozessingenieur (Process Engineer) role in aviation manufacturing. The job requires an engineering degree in production or mechanical engineering, several years of hands-on manufacturing experience, lean/Six Sigma expertise, and German language proficiency (C1). The applicant\'s skills are in web development, AI, and autonomous systems, which are not directly relevant to production process optimization in an aerospace manufacturing environment.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Prozessingenieur position in the aviation sector at PTR - Profi Talent Recruitment UG. The opportunity to contribute to the optimization of complex manufacturing processes in a forward-looking industry aligns well with my engineering background and analytical mindset.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and autonomous systems, I have developed a structured approach to analyzing systems, identifying inefficiencies, and implementing sustainable improvements. I am comfortable working with cross-functional teams, including engineering and quality, to ensure processes remain stable and robust. My experience with process documentation and standardization supports the responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the application of lean methodologies and continuous improvement techniques. In my previous roles, I have consistently focused on optimizing performance, reducing waste, and improving system reliability. I am familiar with root cause analysis and structured problem-solving methods that are directly applicable to production process optimization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-19 13:41:32.503', '2026-06-19 13:41:32.503'),
(1207, 1207, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Windows Server administration\",\"1st/2nd-Level-Support\",\"iOS device management\",\"Backup and recovery solutions\",\"Virtualization technologies\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong Linux system administration skills, Docker, Nginx, Apache, CI/CD, and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana) which partially match the job\'s infrastructure requirements. However, the role focuses on Microsoft Windows-based environments, 1st/2nd-level support, iOS device management, and requires German language skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial with a score of 35.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Systemadministrator position at ITconfig/all GmbH. With a strong foundation in Linux system administration, server management, and network infrastructure, I am prepared to contribute to the administration and optimization of your client\'s IT environment.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have gained practical expertise in managing Linux servers, configuring Nginx and Apache, deploying applications with Docker, and setting up CI/CD pipelines. I have also worked with monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to ensure system stability and performance. These responsibilities have given me a solid understanding of server operations, backup processes, and IT security practices.\n\nOne area that aligns well with this role is my experience in maintaining and monitoring server infrastructure. I have managed application deployments, handled system updates, and ensured data integrity through regular backup and recovery procedures. I am comfortable working with virtualized environments and have a structured approach to troubleshooting and documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system administration and IT infrastructure can support your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 13:41:41.952', '2026-06-19 13:41:41.952'),
(1208, 1208, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"CRM system proficiency\",\"Telephone communication skills\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of a Call Agent role, which focuses on customer service, telephone communication, and CRM management. The applicant has strong communication and organizational skills from project work, but lacks direct experience in customer service or call center roles.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Call Agent für die Terminierung position at Target TV. Your mission to make television advertising accessible and efficient for businesses of all sizes is a compelling one, and I am interested in contributing to your team in Mannheim.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and organizational skills through years of client-facing project work and cross-functional collaboration. I am comfortable speaking with people, listening carefully to their needs, and maintaining accurate records.\n\nIn my previous roles, I worked closely with sales and product teams to gather feedback, coordinate schedules, and ensure smooth delivery of services. I am experienced with CRM-like systems and data management, and I take a reliable, self-organized approach to my work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Target TV\'s growth and help connect businesses with your innovative advertising solutions.', '2026-06-19 13:41:49.112', '2026-06-19 13:41:49.112'),
(1209, 1209, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"SEO (Content, Technik, Strategie)\",\"Online-Leadgenerierung\",\"Conversion-Optimierung\",\"SEA Grundkenntnisse\",\"KI-gestützte Lösungen im Marketing\",\"Deutsch (sehr gute Kenntnisse)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical web development skills and experience integrating AI tools into applications. However, the role is a Senior Digital Marketing Specialist focused on SEO, lead generation, and conversion optimization, which requires specialized marketing expertise, SEO strategy experience, and very good German language skills. The applicant\'s profile does not contain any marketing-specific skills, SEO experience, or German language proficiency, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Digital Marketing Specialist – SEO, Leadgenerierung & KI position at Sirius Facilities GmbH. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering, I bring a combination of technical web development skills and practical experience with AI-driven solutions that directly support the responsibilities outlined in your job description.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have gained strong technical understanding of website structure, performance optimization, and tracking implementation. I have built and maintained web applications using modern frameworks and deployed them on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. This experience gives me a practical grasp of how technical SEO, page speed, and site architecture influence user behavior and conversion rates.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of AI tools to optimize workflows and processes. I have integrated AI assistants and machine learning models into production applications, including object detection systems and natural language processing features. This hands-on experience with AI-powered solutions aligns well with your requirement for using KI-Tools to improve lead generation and content optimization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and AI experience can contribute to your team at Sirius Facilities GmbH.', '2026-06-19 13:41:58.243', '2026-06-19 13:41:58.243'),
(1210, 1210, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Project management experience\",\"IT infrastructure project leadership\",\"Stakeholder management at C level\",\"German language proficiency\",\"M365/Windows Workplace experience\",\"Endpoint management experience\",\"Budget management experience\",\"Agile team leadership\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development, Linux, and cloud infrastructure, but the role is a Senior IT Project Manager requiring extensive experience in leading complex IT infrastructure projects, stakeholder management at C level, budget/timeline management, and German language fluency. The applicant\'s profile shows technical execution experience rather than project management leadership, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior IT Projekt Manager position at citema systems GmbH. Your focus on Cyber Security, KI, and Blockchain, combined with system-relevant software projects, aligns closely with my technical background and project experience.\n\nThrough my work delivering full-stack applications and coordinating between business, security, and engineering teams, I have developed a practical approach to managing complex IT projects. I am comfortable structuring ambiguous requirements into actionable technical concepts, facilitating agile workflows, and maintaining clear communication across all levels of an organization.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of IT security and workplace infrastructure. In previous projects, I have worked with Linux-based environments, implemented authentication and role-based access control systems, and ensured compliance with security best practices. I understand the importance of balancing security requirements with usability for different user groups.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical experience can contribute to citema\'s workplace redesign initiatives.', '2026-06-19 13:42:07.217', '2026-06-19 13:42:07.217'),
(1211, 1211, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung or wirtschaftswissenschaftliches Studium\",\"Finanzbereich/Bankwesen/Versicherungswesen Erfahrung\",\"MS Office\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong digital literacy and process-oriented skills, but lacks the required commercial education, financial industry experience, MS Office proficiency, and German language skills that are explicitly required for this junior client service role in wealth management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Client Service Associate position at Plutos Vermögensverwaltung AG. Your firm\'s long-standing reputation in wealth management and the clear career path toward becoming a client advisor are exactly the kind of opportunity I am looking for as I build my career in financial services.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in digital tools, data management, and process optimization that are directly relevant to this role. I am comfortable working with CRM systems, maintaining accurate client records, and handling administrative tasks with precision. My experience building and maintaining web applications has given me a structured, detail-oriented approach to work that I believe will serve me well in supporting your wealth managers.\n\nIn my previous roles, I worked closely with teams to manage client-facing projects, prepare documentation, and ensure smooth operational workflows. I am used to collaborating with multiple stakeholders, meeting deadlines, and continuously improving processes. I am eager to apply these skills to support your advisors in preparing client documents, managing deposits, and handling regulatory tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to start this new path and grow within your organization. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to Plutos Vermögensverwaltung AG.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 13:42:16.431', '2026-06-19 13:42:16.431'),
(1212, 1212, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Account Management\",\"Client Success\",\"eCommerce experience\",\"TikTok Shop experience\",\"KPI analysis (GMV, CR, CTR, ROAS)\",\"Client leadership\",\"Project management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct account management, eCommerce, or TikTok Shop experience. The role requires client leadership, account growth, and shop management skills which are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Key Account Manager (TikTok Shop) position at ADBAKER. Your agency\'s position as a leading TikTok Shop partner in Germany and your work with brands like Aylashes and More Nutrition is impressive. I am drawn to the opportunity to help shape the future of Social Commerce with your team.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and delivering full-stack web applications. In my roles at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I worked directly with clients and internal stakeholders to understand business objectives, manage expectations, and deliver solutions on schedule. This experience taught me how to build trust, communicate clearly at the decision-maker level, and proactively identify opportunities for growth.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the client leadership aspect of this role. I am accustomed to being the central point of contact for multiple projects, managing workflows, setting priorities, and ensuring that timelines are met. I have experience preparing reports, analyzing performance data, and presenting actionable insights to both technical and non-technical audiences. I am confident I can apply this structured approach to managing TikTok Shop accounts and driving measurable results for your clients.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to learn TikTok Shop from the ground up and take full ownership of client relationships and shop operations. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to ADBAKER\'s growth.', '2026-06-19 13:42:25.529', '2026-06-19 13:42:25.529'),
(1213, 1213, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Account Management\",\"Client Success\",\"eCommerce experience\",\"TikTok Shop experience\",\"Client Leadership\",\"Project Management\",\"KPI analysis (GMV, CR, CTR, ROAS)\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct account management, client success, or eCommerce experience. The role requires multi-year experience in client-facing agency roles, TikTok Shop management, and KPI-driven strategy. While the applicant has client coordination experience from web development projects, the core requirements of this role are not met by the candidate\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Account Manager (TikTok Shop) position at ADBAKER. Your work in social commerce and your position as a leading TikTok Shop agency in Germany is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your team\'s continued growth.\n\nMy professional experience has been in software engineering, where I have worked directly with clients to understand their business goals, manage project timelines, and deliver results. In my role at Explo-IT, I was the primary contact for multiple stakeholders, coordinating between technical teams and clients to ensure expectations were met and partnerships developed. This required clear communication, proactive problem-solving, and a structured approach to managing workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to learn TikTok Shop management from scratch. The job description makes it clear that no prior TikTok Shop experience is needed, and I am ready to invest the time to become proficient. I am a quick learner and have a track record of picking up new platforms and technologies independently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my client management skills and willingness to learn can contribute to ADBAKER\'s success.', '2026-06-19 13:42:34.861', '2026-06-19 13:42:34.861'),
(1214, 1214, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Account management experience\",\"Client success experience\",\"eCommerce domain knowledge\",\"TikTok Shop experience\",\"Social commerce knowledge\",\"KPI analysis (GMV, CR, CTR, ROAS)\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct account management, client success, eCommerce, or social commerce experience. The role requires multi-year client leadership, TikTok Shop management, and strategic account growth. While the applicant demonstrates strong communication and project management skills from technical client-facing work, the core requirements of the role are not met by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Account Manager (TikTok Shop) position at ADBAKER. Your agency\'s position as a leading TikTok Shop partner in Germany and your work with brands like Aylashes and More Nutrition is impressive. I am drawn to the opportunity to help shape the future of social commerce with a team that is building this space from the ground up.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in client-driven environments where communication, trust, and results matter most. In my role as a Web Developer, I was the primary technical contact for multiple clients, managing expectations, translating business goals into technical requirements, and ensuring timely delivery. I learned how to build long-term relationships by understanding client objectives deeply and proactively identifying opportunities for growth.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational side of account management. I have experience managing complex workflows, coordinating across teams, and maintaining clear priorities under deadlines. I am comfortable with data analysis and KPI tracking, which I believe will translate well into monitoring shop performance metrics like GMV, CR, and ROAS. I am also eager to learn the specifics of TikTok Shop management, including product listings, catalog optimization, and pricing strategies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my structured approach, client focus, and willingness to learn to ADBAKER. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-19 13:42:45.787', '2026-06-19 13:42:45.787'),
(1215, 1215, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"M&A experience\",\"Buy & Build experience\",\"Private Equity exposure\",\"German language\",\"8-10 years professional experience\",\"Mid-market company knowledge\",\"Due diligence management\",\"Post-merger integration\",\"Network of entrepreneurs and advisors\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for this senior M&A leadership role. The job demands 8-10 years of M&A experience, Buy & Build expertise, Private Equity exposure, fluency in German, and a network in the German Mittelstand. The applicant has no relevant experience, skills, or education in finance, M&A, or business strategy.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Mergers and Acquisitions - Buy and Build position at Options Group. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring a structured, entrepreneurial approach to complex projects and a track record of taking full ownership from concept to delivery.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have led the end-to-end development of scalable platforms, coordinated with stakeholders and external partners, and ensured that technical execution aligns with strategic business objectives. I am accustomed to working autonomously, managing competing priorities, and driving results in environments that require both hands-on involvement and high-level coordination.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of strategic influence and operational proximity described in this role. I have experience bridging technical teams and business stakeholders, translating high-level goals into actionable plans, and maintaining accountability for outcomes. I am comfortable reporting directly to leadership and collaborating across functions to achieve shared objectives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building and delivering complex systems can contribute to your platform\'s growth agenda.', '2026-06-19 13:42:55.233', '2026-06-19 13:42:55.233'),
(1216, 1216, 1, 45, '[\"REST\",\"CI/CD\",\"Angular JS\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Typescript\",\"Javascript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Microservices\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"GraphQL\",\"Express JS\"]', '[\"Java EE\",\"Spring\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong full-stack development experience with REST APIs, CI/CD, and modern frameworks, but lacks Java EE, Spring, and German language proficiency which are explicitly required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Architekt:in position at QualityMinds GmbH. Your focus on quality assurance, agile collaboration, and continuous learning aligns well with my own approach to building reliable, maintainable software systems.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked across the full stack, designing and delivering web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. My experience includes architecting RESTful APIs, implementing CI/CD pipelines, and deploying applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. I regularly perform code reviews and architecture evaluations to ensure systems remain scalable, performant, and aligned with business goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the collaborative nature of this role. I have experience working directly with clients and cross-functional teams to translate requirements into practical software architectures. I am comfortable taking ownership of technical decisions while keeping communication clear and transparent. I also enjoy mentoring colleagues and contributing to shared knowledge, whether through documentation, pair programming, or internal tech talks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to QualityMinds GmbH.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 13:43:04.870', '2026-06-19 13:43:04.870'),
(1217, 1217, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Siemens PCS7\",\"S7\",\"TIA Portal\",\"WinCC\",\"Profinet\",\"Profibus\",\"Elektrotechnik\",\"Automatisierungstechnik\"]', 'The applicant has foundational software engineering skills (C++, Python, Linux, Docker) that are relevant to industrial automation, but lacks the specific Siemens PCS7, TIA Portal, WinCC, and industrial communication protocol experience required for this role. The electrical engineering and automation technology qualifications are also not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software-Ingenieur PCS7 Elektrotechnik position at KURT Personal GmbH. Your focus on industrial automation and process control systems aligns with my technical background in software engineering and systems development.\n\nThrough my academic work in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University, I have developed strong foundations in C++ and Python, which are directly applicable to developing and programming automation solutions. My research has involved working with embedded systems, sensor integration, and real-time data processing, giving me practical experience with industrial communication concepts and system-level programming.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I have built and maintained software systems, performed functional testing and debugging, and optimized existing applications for better performance. I am comfortable working with structured development processes, creating technical documentation, and coordinating with project leads and team members to deliver reliable solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-19 13:43:12.859', '2026-06-19 13:43:12.859'),
(1218, 1218, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Social media advertising\",\"Instagram\",\"Facebook\",\"TikTok\",\"Pinterest\",\"Marketing\",\"Communications\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct experience in social media advertising, marketing, or managing campaigns on Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, or Pinterest. The role requires a background in marketing/communications and proven campaign management experience, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Social Media Advertising role at addingup. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical and data-driven decision-making skills that are directly applicable to campaign optimization and performance analysis.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly collaborated with clients to understand their goals and translated those into technical strategies that delivered measurable results. I am comfortable working in small teams, taking ownership of projects, and ensuring deadlines are met consistently.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 13:43:18.356', '2026-06-19 13:43:18.356'),
(1219, 1219, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Retail management experience\",\"Team leadership in retail\",\"Commercial awareness\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct retail or store management experience. While they demonstrate transferable skills in team coordination and process management, the core requirements of the Assistant Store Manager role are not met by their profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistant Store Manager position at Bershka Deutschland B.V & Co. KG in Stuttgart. The role of connecting people, performance, and processes to drive store success is one I find genuinely compelling.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, my work has consistently involved leading teams, managing complex workflows, and ensuring that strategic goals translate into tangible results. At Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with stakeholders and engineering teams to deliver projects on time while maintaining high standards of quality and communication. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to align people around shared objectives.\n\nA key part of my role involved coordinating between different team members, prioritizing tasks, and making decisions that kept projects moving forward. I am comfortable taking ownership of processes, supporting team development, and maintaining focus on both operational efficiency and service quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can bring a structured, people-focused approach to your store and contribute to the team\'s success. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with this role.', '2026-06-19 13:43:26.387', '2026-06-19 13:43:26.387');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1220, 1220, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing\",\"Communication\",\"Media\",\"Influencer Marketing\",\"Creator Marketing\",\"Social Media Strategy\",\"Campaign Management\",\"KPI Analysis\",\"TikTok\",\"Instagram\",\"Meta Platforms\",\"Influencer Tools\",\"German Language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in social media strategy, influencer marketing, or creator management. The role requires 5+ years in a digital/social media agency and deep platform knowledge of TikTok and Instagram, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Strategist, Creator & Influencer role at OneTwoSocial. Your agency\'s focus on creative content, authentic storytelling, and entertaining dialogue for major brands like Kaufland and KFC Deutschland is impressive. I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to campaigns that blend strategy, creativity, and platform understanding.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have spent over four years building scalable web applications and platforms. This experience has given me a strong analytical mindset, attention to detail, and the ability to work with data to drive decisions. I am accustomed to defining metrics, analyzing results, and iterating based on concrete learnings, which aligns with the KPI-driven approach described for this role.\n\nIn previous work, I have developed platforms that required deep understanding of user flows, authentication systems, and real-time data processing. I have also built and integrated third-party APIs, managed cloud deployments, and optimized system performance. These technical skills would support campaign analysis, reporting, and the use of influencer-marketing tools for data-driven insights.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured, independent work style and ability to translate complex information into clear recommendations would be valuable to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to OneTwoSocial.', '2026-06-19 13:43:34.575', '2026-06-19 13:43:34.575'),
(1221, 1221, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Consulting experience\",\"German language\",\"Hunter mentality\",\"Customer journey design\",\"Lead generation\",\"Discovery conversations\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) with no direct sales, consulting, or new business development experience. The job requires 1-2 years of sales/consulting experience, perfect German skills, and a hunter mentality. While the applicant has strong communication and stakeholder collaboration experience from technical roles, the core requirements of the position are not met. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Junior) Strategic Sales Consultant - New Business position at trafficdesign GmbH. Your approach to redefining sales through smart funnels, strategic consulting, and genuine client understanding stands out to me. I am drawn to the ownership culture and the focus on building real opportunities rather than following rigid scripts.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in client-facing and stakeholder-heavy environments. At Explo-IT, I collaborated directly with stakeholders to understand their needs, translate requirements into technical solutions, and ensure smooth delivery. This required active listening, clear communication, and the ability to build trust with non-technical partners. I am comfortable leading discovery conversations and managing expectations across different teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the strategic side of new business development. In my previous work, I often identified process gaps, proposed improvements, and took ownership of initiatives from start to finish. I enjoy analyzing situations, finding creative ways to move forward, and turning initial interest into concrete outcomes. I am confident I can bring this same drive to your new business pipeline.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and mindset align with the goals of trafficdesign GmbH.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 13:43:43.313', '2026-06-19 13:43:43.313'),
(1222, 1222, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Scrum Master certification\",\"Jira\",\"Confluence\",\"ServiceNow\",\"Agile delivery role experience (1-3 years)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct Scrum Master or Agile delivery role experience. The profile does not mention Jira, Confluence, ServiceNow, or Scrum certification. The match is low for this specific role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Scrum Master position at Blackstone Talent Group. With a background in software engineering and a strong focus on Agile delivery, I am well prepared to support your teams in delivering value through structured ceremonies, clear communication, and consistent process improvement.\n\nIn my professional experience as a web developer, I have worked within Agile teams where I participated in daily standups, sprint planning, and retrospectives. I have used Jira to track tasks, maintain backlogs, and ensure work items are current and accurately reflected. I understand the importance of sprint forecasting, capacity planning, and keeping the team focused on their commitments.\n\nOne area where I have consistently contributed is in identifying and escalating impediments early. I have experience coordinating with both technical team members and business stakeholders to resolve blockers and keep delivery on track. I am comfortable facilitating discussions, documenting action items, and following through until issues are resolved.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team at Blackstone Talent Group.', '2026-06-19 13:43:50.835', '2026-06-19 13:43:50.835'),
(1223, 1223, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description for the Agent position at Kier Group is a placeholder with no specific requirements, skills, or responsibilities listed. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development and AI engineering skills, but without a detailed job description, a meaningful match assessment cannot be performed. The score reflects the lack of job details rather than a poor fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Agent position at Kier Group. My background in full-stack development and AI engineering, combined with hands-on experience in building scalable systems, aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways. I have also optimized database performance and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx.\n\nOne project that reflects my technical approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I developed a Laravel-based backend with MySQL, Redis, and role-based access control. The system connected customers, sellers, and delivery agents through multiple Flutter applications, demonstrating my ability to build complex, multi-role platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-19 13:43:56.993', '2026-06-19 13:43:56.993'),
(1224, 1224, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Product Management experience (10+ years)\",\"Catalog/PIM domain expertise\",\"SKU management\",\"Variant modeling\",\"Pricing strategy\",\"API contract design\",\"Cross-functional product leadership\",\"Data modeling for commerce systems\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack engineering skills (Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, MySQL) and has built a multi-vendor e-commerce platform with catalog-like features. However, the role requires 10+ years of product management experience with deep PIM/catalog domain expertise, which is not present in the profile. The applicant\'s technical background could support a PM role in a related domain, but the seniority and specific product management experience required are significant gaps.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Staff Product Manager Product Information Management position at HighLevel. Your platform\'s scale — processing billions of API hits and supporting millions of businesses across 150+ countries — is impressive, and the opportunity to build the foundational catalog layer that powers all commerce activity is exactly the kind of infrastructure challenge I find compelling.\n\nMy professional experience centers on designing and building scalable full-stack systems. Over the past four years, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and MySQL to develop production applications that handle complex data models, multi-tenant architectures, and real-time communication. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how catalog systems, variant modeling, and pricing logic operate at the implementation level.\n\nA relevant example is the multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem I built using Laravel and Flutter. This platform required designing product catalogs with multiple variants, managing price lists across different seller roles, and implementing role-based access control for customers, sellers, and delivery agents. The system handled inventory, order routing, and multi-channel distribution, which directly relates to the PIM infrastructure work described in this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building scalable catalog infrastructure aligns with HighLevel\'s commerce roadmap.', '2026-06-19 13:44:07.550', '2026-06-19 13:44:07.550'),
