cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your programme and beginning a career in data analysis.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-19 13:44:15.003', '2026-06-19 13:44:15.003'),
