(1228, 1228, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Ciências Contábeis degree\",\"COSIF experience\",\"Accounting routines\",\"Office package\",\"CRC certification\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no accounting education or experience. The job requires a degree in Accounting, experience with COSIF, and accounting routines. There are no matching skills. The applicant\'s background in financial app development shows some analytical overlap but does not meet the core requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistente Contábil position at Sicoob. Your cooperative\'s mission to connect people for financial justice and prosperity resonates with me, and I am interested in contributing to the back-office operations that support credit products.\n\nThrough my work developing financial technology systems, I have built a strong foundation in data reconciliation, financial data processing, and automated reporting. I designed and developed an AI-powered financial application that handles complex data workflows, including reconciliation of financial records, automated PDF term sheet generation, and secure data processing via AWS services. This experience required meticulous attention to detail and a systematic approach to managing financial data.\n\nIn previous work, I have developed systems that process transactions, manage user data, and generate financial reports. I am comfortable working with structured data, ensuring accuracy in calculations, and maintaining organized records. My technical background has taught me to approach problems methodically and to verify data integrity at every step.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and attention to detail can support Sicoob\'s back-office operations.\n\nREGARD RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-19 13:44:38.178', '2026-06-19 13:44:38.178'),
(1229, 1229, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Cosmetology training\",\"Facial treatments\",\"Apparative procedures\",\"Medical foot care\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in cosmetology, medical treatments, or the aesthetic industry. The role requires a certified cosmetologist with experience in medical-cosmetic procedures, which the applicant does not have. The only transferable skills are general PC proficiency and documentation ability, which are minor requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kosmetiker:in position at Medical Skin Center Dr. David Bacman. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong technical skills that directly support the operational and documentation needs of your MEDISPA.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is the careful documentation of treatments and management of patient data in practice software. In my previous work as a web developer, I maintained accurate records, managed databases, and ensured data integrity across systems. I am comfortable with PC applications and can quickly adapt to your specific software environment.\n\nI also have experience working within structured workflows and collaborating with teams to ensure smooth daily operations. Whether preparing treatment rooms according to hygiene standards or supporting the scheduling and check-out process, I bring a methodical and reliable approach to every task.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am genuinely interested in the medical-cosmetic field and eager to learn the specific treatments and devices used at your MEDISPA. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-20 01:40:00.905', '2026-06-20 01:40:00.905'),
(1230, 1231, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Hair washing\",\"Customer service in salon\",\"German language (implied)\"]', 'The applicant has no direct experience or skills related to salon assistance, hair washing, or customer service in a hair salon. The role requires availability, teamwork, and a positive attitude, which the applicant possesses, but lacks the specific domain experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Team-/Salonassistenz position at HAUBER - The Organic Hair Salon in Munich. Your focus on plant-based products and modern salon environment sounds like a great place to contribute.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I am a quick learner and enjoy working with people. I am looking for a part-time role where I can support a team, help with daily tasks, and bring a positive attitude.\n\nI am available Tuesday through Friday from 15:00 to 20:00 and am ready to assist with hair washing and any other tasks that need attention. I work well in teams and am comfortable communicating in English and German.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would be happy to discuss how I can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 01:40:08.557', '2026-06-20 01:40:08.557'),
(1231, 1232, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Wirtschaftsprüferexamen\",\"Jahres- und Konzernabschlussprüfungen\",\"Betriebswirtschaftliche Analysen\",\"Unternehmensbewertungen\",\"Steuerberatung\",\"Rechtsberatung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in auditing, tax, or legal advisory. There is no direct skill match for the core requirements of the Wirtschaftsprüfer/in role, such as a Wirtschaftsprüferexamen or experience with financial audits. The applicant\'s structured and analytical approach, along with an affinity for digital tools, are soft skills that could be relevant, but the fundamental professional qualifications are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Wirtschaftsprüfer/in position at Pickel & Partner. Your firm\'s reputation as one of the largest interdisciplinary practices in the region, with over 50 years of experience in auditing, tax, and legal advisory, is impressive. I am drawn to your emphasis on creating an environment where individuals can develop their own career paths while working collaboratively.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building complex, data-driven systems. This work has required a structured and meticulous approach to problem-solving, strong analytical capabilities, and the ability to communicate complex information clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am accustomed to taking ownership of tasks, working independently, and ensuring accuracy in every detail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your focus on a structured and careful working style, combined with an affinity for digital tools. In my professional experience, I have designed