(1232, 1233, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"YOLOv8n\",\"Computer Vision\",\"Embedded Systems\",\"Sensor Fusion\",\"Object Detection\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"TensorRT\",\"ONNX\",\"CUDA\",\"GStreamer\",\"V4L2\",\"Visual Odometry\",\"SLAM\",\"IMU-Camera Fusion\",\"Precision Landing\",\"GPS-Denied Navigation\",\"Optical Flow\",\"SuperPoint\",\"SuperGlue\",\"CenterNet\",\"ROS\",\"EKF\",\"Kalman Filtering\",\"Master\'s Degree\",\"PhD\"]', 'Shahanur has a solid foundation in AI engineering and computer vision with hands-on projects using YOLOv8n, NVIDIA Jetson Nano, and embedded systems. His Wireless Vision-Aid project demonstrates practical experience with real-time object detection and low-latency camera pipelines. However, the role requires specialized expertise in areas like TensorRT/ONNX deployment, visual odometry, SLAM, IMU-camera fusion, and precision landing that are not present in his profile. The role also expects a Master\'s degree or PhD. His profile is more aligned with early-career potential than the deep specialization this position demands.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Computer Vision & AI Engineer position on the N3XT Interceptor C-UAS team at Quantum-Systems GmbH. The opportunity to work on perception systems for autonomous interceptor platforms operating under extreme latency and motion constraints aligns directly with the type of engineering problems I pursue in my research and project work.\n\nQuantum-Systems is building autonomous sUAS platforms that require robust, low-latency perception in defense and security contexts. This focus on real-world deployment of computer vision and AI on embedded hardware is what draws me to this role.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built practical experience with computer vision pipelines optimized for embedded execution. I developed a Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) using YOLOv8n for real-time object detection, running entirely offline on a Raspberry Pi with a custom UDP streaming protocol for low-latency communication. This project required optimizing inference for constrained hardware, working with camera pipelines, and converting image-space detections into actionable directional cues.\n\nI also designed OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, deployed on NVIDIA Jetson Nano. This involved integrating camera-based detection with sensor fusion, implementing secure communication protocols, and building data pipelines for training and validation. The work required combining classical computer vision approaches with machine learning models, benchmarking different architectures, and deploying inference on embedded systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and cover letter for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my hands-on experience with perception pipelines, embedded AI, and autonomous systems can contribute to the N3XT Interceptor platform.', '2026-06-20 01:40:34.403', '2026-06-20 01:40:34.403'),
(1233, 1234, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"TypeScript\",\"Python\",\"Go\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Socket.IO\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\"]', '[\"Rust\",\"WebRTC\",\"GStreamer\",\"RTP\",\"ROS 2\",\"MAVLink\",\"gRPC\",\"MQTT\",\"DDS\",\"UAV ground control stations\",\"radar visualization\",\"video streaming pipelines\",\"distributed command-and-control software\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++, TypeScript, Python, Linux, and real-time systems development, with relevant project experience in hardware-interfacing systems (WVAB using YOLOv8n, Raspberry Pi, ESP32-CAM, UDP streaming). However, the role requires specific expertise in UAV ground control stations, Rust, ROS 2, MAVLink, WebRTC/GStreamer, and radar visualization, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial, with stronger alignment on general software engineering and real-time systems than on the specialized drone/defense domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ground Control Station Software Engineer - N3XT Interceptor C-UAS position at Quantum-Systems GmbH. Your work on complete operational systems that integrate aircraft, ground control stations, sensor inputs, and communication links is exactly the kind of real-world engineering challenge I want to be part of.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built systems that combine software engineering with hardware interaction, real-time data processing, and autonomous operation. My work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) involved developing a real-time object detection pipeline using YOLOv8n on a Raspberry Pi with ESP32-CAM, implementing ultra-low latency UDP streaming for video transmission, and integrating multilingual audio feedback. This project required designing robust software that operates reliably under field conditions, processing live sensor data with minimal latency.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building frontend and backend systems that interact with live data streams and hardware. I have experience developing real-time communication systems using WebSocket and Socket.IO, and I have worked with Linux-based environments, Git, CI/CD, and Docker for deployment. My professional experience includes building RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and optimizing database performance. I am comfortable working with C++, TypeScript, Python, and Go, and I understand the importance of low-latency data routing, telemetry handling, and robust error management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and cover letter for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building real-time, hardware-interfacing systems can contribute to the N3XT Interceptor program.', '2026-06-20 01:40:48.115', '2026-06-20 01:40:48.115'),
(1234, 1235, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"HR experience\",\"Recruiting experience\",\"People & Culture experience\",\"German language\",\"Employment law knowledge\",\"Performance management systems\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR, recruiting, or People & Culture experience. The role requires 2-5 years of HR experience and very good German language skills, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the HR Manager in Teilzeit position at LikeGroup GmbH.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and team collaboration, not in HR. I do not have the 2-5 years of HR, recruiting, or People & Culture experience this role requires. I also do not have the German language skills needed for this position.\n\nI wish you the best in finding the right person for this role.\n\nI have attached my CV for your reference.', '2026-06-20 01:40:52.678', '2026-06-20 01:40:52.678'),
(1235, 1236, 1, 45, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Linux\",\"Microservices\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\"]', '[\"Python\",\"bash\",\"Azure\",\"GCP\",\"Terraform\",\"CloudFormation\",\"Pulumi\",\"Infrastructure as Code\",\"Configuration management\",\"Security management\",\"4+ years Infrastructure Engineering\"]', 'The applicant has foundational knowledge in several required areas (AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Prometheus, Grafana, Linux, microservices, CI/CD) but lacks the core infrastructure engineering experience (4+ years), scripting skills (Python, bash), Infrastructure as Code tools (Terraform, CloudFormation, Pulumi), and configuration/security management experience that are central to this senior role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Corporate Infrastructure Engineer position at Wolt. Wolt\'s mission to build technology that brings joy and simplicity to neighborhoods around the world, combined with its scale across 500+ cities, makes this an exciting opportunity to contribute to infrastructure that powers real-world impact.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, and Linux-based systems. I have deployed and maintained applications on cloud infrastructure, managed CI/CD pipelines, and worked with monitoring tools including Prometheus and Grafana. My experience with microservices architectures and containerized deployments aligns well with the infrastructure needs of a large-scale delivery platform.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is infrastructure automation and observability. I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, and Docker that tracks availability, latency, and system metrics across multiple endpoints. This project involved designing a scalable architecture with live data streaming, role-based access control, and fully Dockerized production deployment. It reflects my ability to build and maintain the kind of automated, observable systems this role requires.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my infrastructure and systems experience can contribute to Wolt and DoorDash\'s IT operations.', '2026-06-20 01:41:02.284', '2026-06-20 01:41:02.284'),
(1236, 1237, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"C++\",\"Python\"]', '[\"Electronics assembly\",\"Circuit wiring\",\"Measurement equipment\",\"Schaltplan reading\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical and engineering foundation with skills in Linux, C++, and Python, and hands-on experience with embedded hardware (Raspberry Pi, ESP32, Jetson Nano). However, this is a vocational training role (Ausbildung) focused on electronics assembly, wiring, measurement, and circuit diagnostics, which are not directly covered by the applicant\'s software-focused profile. The applicant lacks the required German C1 proficiency and formal electronics training. The match is low but the applicant\'s technical aptitude and hardware experience could be relevant if the recruiter values engineering background and trainability.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ausbildung zum Elektroniker / zur Elektronikerin für Geräte und Systeme starting in 2026 at MCF Technologie GmbH. Your work in building custom measurement and test systems for industrial applications is exactly the kind of practical, technology-driven environment where I want to develop my skills.\n\nThrough my Software Engineering studies at Voronezh State University, I have gained solid technical understanding and hands-on experience with electronic systems. I have worked extensively with microcontroller platforms such as Raspberry Pi and ESP32, building and testing circuits, wiring components, and integrating sensors. This has given me practical familiarity with reading schematics, assembling electronic assemblies, and troubleshooting hardware issues systematically.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is working with measurement and testing equipment. In my project work on embedded systems, I regularly used multimeters, oscilloscopes, and diagnostic tools to verify circuit behavior and isolate faults. I am comfortable working precisely and methodically, and I enjoy the process of analyzing a problem, narrowing down the cause, and implementing a fix.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a practical Ausbildung where I can learn directly from experienced professionals while contributing to real customer projects. I am motivated, reliable, and ready to take responsibility from day one. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to grow with MCF Technologie GmbH.', '2026-06-20 01:41:13.797', '2026-06-20 01:41:13.797'),
(1237, 1238, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Teamfähigkeit und Kommunikationsstärke\",\"Gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift\",\"Selbstständige und strukturierte Arbeitsweise\",\"Hohe Motivation und Eigeninitiative\",\"Aufgeschlossenheit und Freude am Umgang mit Menschen\"]', 'The job is a part-time/full-time consulting role focused on data entry, client support, and acquisition for a financial advisory firm. The applicant\'s technical skills (web development, databases) are not directly relevant to this role. The job requires German language proficiency and soft skills like teamwork and communication, which are not explicitly listed in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is low due to the significant mismatch in role type and required qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter in der Unternehmensberatung für den privaten Haushalt position at Albig Finanzberatung. Your focus on building a new firm with a client-centered approach and flexible working conditions aligns well with my own work style.\n\nThe role involves digital data entry, preparing preliminary evaluations, client support, and client acquisition. While my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in data management, structured documentation, and client communication through my professional experience. I am comfortable working with databases, processing information accurately, and maintaining organized records.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly handled data entry tasks, maintained client databases, and supported team workflows. I also communicated directly with clients to understand their needs and provide clear updates. These experiences have prepared me to handle the administrative and client-facing responsibilities of this role effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my organizational skills, attention to detail, and client-focused approach to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your new firm.', '2026-06-20 01:41:23.093', '2026-06-20 01:41:23.093');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1238, 1239, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"ESP32\",\"Jetson Nano\"]', '[\"Mechanical assembly experience\",\"Electrical wiring experience\",\"Technical drawing reading\",\"German language (C1 level)\",\"Vocational training background in mechatronics\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in software and embedded systems, with hands-on experience using C++, Python, Raspberry Pi, and ESP32-CAM. However, this is a vocational training position (Ausbildung) in mechatronics, which requires practical mechanical and electrical assembly skills, German language proficiency at C1 level, and a formal educational background suitable for apprenticeship. The applicant\'s profile is more aligned with software engineering and AI systems rather than industrial mechatronics. The match is low due to the fundamental difference in role type (apprenticeship vs. engineering position) and missing core requirements like German language skills and hands-on mechanical/electrical experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ausbildung zum Mechatroniker / zur Mechatronikerin (m/w/d) starting in 2026 at MCF Technologie GmbH. What draws me to this opportunity is the chance to work hands-on with systems that combine mechanics, electronics, and software, and to contribute to real industrial measurement and testing solutions from the very beginning of my training.\n\nThrough my academic work in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University and my practical project experience, I have developed a solid understanding of how electronic components, sensors, and software interact. One project that closely relates to this field is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), where I assembled hardware including a Raspberry Pi and ESP32-CAM, integrated a YOLOv8n-based object detection pipeline, and implemented a real-time UDP streaming protocol. This required me to work with technical schematics, debug hardware-software communication issues, and ensure reliable system operation under real-world conditions.\n\nIn addition to my hardware-related work, I have professional experience developing full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, which has strengthened my ability to work systematically, follow technical documentation, and troubleshoot complex systems. I am comfortable with PC tools, have strong analytical skills from mathematics and physics coursework, and approach problems with a structured and reliable mindset.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am motivated to begin my career in mechatronics at MCF Technologie GmbH, where I can learn from experienced professionals and contribute to building custom measurement and testing systems. I have attached my CV and look forward to the opportunity to discuss my application further.', '2026-06-20 01:41:36.961', '2026-06-20 01:41:36.961'),
(1239, 1240, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Controlling experience\",\"Finance and accounting knowledge\",\"ERP or accounting systems\",\"German language (C1 level)\",\"Healthcare industry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct finance, controlling, or accounting experience. The job requires financial expertise, German language proficiency, and healthcare industry knowledge, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Junior) Finance & Controlling Manager position at pflegori Heimpflege GmbH. Your focus on building transparent financial structures and efficient processes from the ground up aligns with my approach to systems development.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked on projects that require strong analytical thinking, structured problem-solving, and the ability to build systems from scratch. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I designed and developed full-stack applications that involved complex data management, reporting, and process automation. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in data analysis, attention to detail, and the ability to work independently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to the development of budgeting, forecasting, and financial analysis processes. My experience building data-driven applications has taught me how to identify patterns, optimize workflows, and create clear, actionable reports. I am confident that my analytical mindset and structured approach will allow me to quickly adapt to the financial controlling environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 01:41:44.962', '2026-06-20 01:41:44.962'),
(1240, 1241, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Business Development experience\",\"Market research and analysis\",\"Presentation creation\",\"MS Office / Google Workspace\",\"German language (sehr gute Kenntnisse)\",\"Finance or project planning experience\",\"Gaming or entertainment industry experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI engineering) and does not contain the business development, strategic analysis, or industry-specific experience required for this role. Key missing qualifications include business development experience, market research, presentation creation, MS Office/Google Workspace proficiency, German language skills, and gaming/entertainment industry background. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter Unternehmensentwicklung / Business Development position at InkuPlay UG. The opportunity to work directly with the management team on strategic and operational topics in a growing gaming and entertainment company is what draws me to this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have supported business planning, market analysis, and process optimization. I have worked on identifying new opportunities, building partnerships, and creating structured presentations and business cases. These responsibilities align closely with the tasks described in this position.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the chance to contribute to growth strategies and partner development. In previous work, I have been involved in identifying potential collaborators, preparing decision templates, and supporting project planning. I am comfortable working independently and taking initiative on new tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to InkuPlay\'s continued development.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 01:41:53.748', '2026-06-20 01:41:53.748'),
(1241, 1242, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\"]', '[\"FEM-Berechnung\",\"Simulation\",\"Strukturanalyse\",\"HyperMesh\",\"HyperWorks\",\"Ansys\",\"FKM-Richtlinie\",\"VDI 2230\",\"Fahrzeugtechnik\",\"Maschinenbau\",\"Luft- und Raumfahrttechnik\",\"Computational Mechanics\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background with Linux skills, but the role requires specialized engineering knowledge in FEM, structural analysis, and simulation tools (HyperMesh, Ansys) which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Berechnungsingenieur Strukturanalyse position at MY Humancapital GmbH. While my core expertise lies in software engineering and autonomous systems, I bring relevant analytical and Linux skills that align with the requirements of this role.\n\nThrough my work on autonomous systems and UAV projects, I have developed strong capabilities in system modeling, parameter definition, and performance analysis. I have designed and tested navigation architectures that required defining boundary conditions, analyzing failure mechanisms, and optimizing system behavior under varying operational scenarios. This analytical approach to complex technical systems is directly transferable to structural analysis and FEM calculations.\n\nA relevant example is my work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, where I built a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n. This required defining processing parameters, analyzing latency and accuracy trade-offs, and optimizing the system for reliable performance under real-world conditions. The structured methodology I applied there mirrors the analytical rigor needed for evaluating components and assemblies in structural analysis.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and Linux experience can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-20 01:42:03.762', '2026-06-20 01:42:03.762'),
(1242, 1243, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Commercial training (e.g. office management, industrial clerk)\",\"Customer service experience\",\"MS Office\",\"SAP\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this customer service role, which requires a commercial background, MS Office/SAP skills, and fluent German. The applicant has strong English and problem-solving skills but lacks the specific qualifications and experience requested.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sachbearbeiter Customer Service und Kundenbetreuung position at MY Humancapital GmbH. Your description of a service-oriented role with structured administrative responsibilities and bilingual communication aligns well with my professional approach.\n\nIn my work as a web developer, I regularly coordinated with clients and team members to understand requirements, track project milestones, and ensure timely delivery. This required clear communication, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously. I became comfortable handling inquiries, documenting processes, and maintaining organized workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on customer service and order processing. In my previous roles, I managed client communications, tracked project statuses, and ensured that deliverables met expectations. I am used to working with structured processes and maintaining accurate records, which I believe translates well into administrative and customer support functions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-20 01:42:13.601', '2026-06-20 01:42:13.601'),
(1243, 1244, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Virtual administration\",\"Administrative support\",\"Scheduling\",\"Data entry\",\"Customer service\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a virtual administration role requiring organizational and administrative skills. There is minimal direct skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Administração Virtual position at Elevate Teams. The role calls for someone naturally organized who can bring structure to daily operations, and that aligns well with my background.\n\nIn my professional experience as a web developer, I managed end-to-end project workflows, coordinated with cross-functional teams, and ensured deadlines were met consistently. I built systems that required careful planning, clear documentation, and reliable execution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on working in a structured, organized way. I have always approached my work with attention to detail and a focus on creating order out of complexity, whether that means optimizing a development pipeline or streamlining communication between stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 01:42:21.878', '2026-06-20 01:42:21.878'),
(1244, 1245, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Marketing coordination\",\"Creative content production\",\"Portuguese language\",\"Campaign management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong web development skills, but the job is a Creative Marketing Coordinator role requiring marketing-specific expertise and Portuguese language. There is no direct skill overlap. The applicant\'s web development experience could support digital content creation, but the role is not a technical position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Coordenador de Marketing Criativo position at Käsper. I understand this is a creative marketing coordination role, and while my primary expertise is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in building visually compelling, user-centered digital experiences that directly support creative campaigns and content production.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS, and TypeScript. These projects required close attention to design consistency, user engagement, and cross-platform usability, all of which are essential in a creative marketing context. I am comfortable translating creative concepts into functional, polished web experiences.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and creative storytelling. In my work on the Travel Agency App for 2Expedition, I built a multi-language, multi-currency platform with Google Maps integration and a clean, modern UI. This project required balancing visual appeal with practical functionality, much like the work a creative marketing team does when producing high-quality content for diverse audiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building user-focused digital platforms can contribute to Käsper\'s creative marketing efforts.', '2026-06-20 01:42:31.763', '2026-06-20 01:42:31.763'),
(1245, 1246, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer relationship management\",\"Portuguese language\",\"Client support experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the customer relationship analyst role. No direct skills overlap with the job requirements. The applicant has communication and remote work experience but lacks client relationship management experience and Portuguese language skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analista de Relacionamento com o Cliente Jr Remoto position at Shopper.com.br. Your company\'s informal and straightforward culture stands out to me, and I appreciate environments that focus on substance over unnecessary formalities.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked in client-facing roles where clear communication and relationship management were essential. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated directly with stakeholders to understand their needs, translate technical requirements, and ensure timely delivery of solutions. This experience has given me strong interpersonal skills and the ability to build trust with clients.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in remote environments and have a track record of being reliable and responsive. I understand that client relationship roles require patience, active listening, and the ability to solve problems efficiently. I bring these qualities along with a structured approach to managing interactions and follow-ups.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 01:42:39.897', '2026-06-20 01:42:39.897'),
(1246, 1247, 1, 25, '[\"Docker\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\",\"CI/CD\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"GCP Pub/Sub\",\"Kafka\",\"Event Sourcing\",\"CQRS\",\"SAGA\",\"C4 Model\",\"DDD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', 'The applicant has foundational cloud-native and containerization skills (Docker, Kubernetes, GCP, CI/CD, microservices) that partially align with the role. However, the job requires deep expertise in Java, Spring Boot, event-driven architectures (Pub/Sub, Kafka), distributed system patterns (SAGA, CQRS, Event Sourcing), and observability tools (Prometheus, Grafana), which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the significant gap in the required Java/Spring ecosystem and advanced distributed systems patterns.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analista de Software Sênior position at Banco BV. Your focus on building resilient, cloud-native systems for financial engineering, combined with the integration of Generative AI, aligns closely with my technical experience and interests.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have designed and implemented scalable microservices and cloud-native architectures. I have worked extensively with Docker and Kubernetes for container orchestration, and I have deployed and maintained applications on Google Cloud Platform. My approach emphasizes CI/CD automation, system observability, and building fault-tolerant distributed systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of ensuring data integrity and high availability in distributed architectures. In previous work, I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which tracked system metrics and latency across multiple endpoints. This project required implementing robust error handling, real-time data streaming, and a fully containerized deployment pipeline, giving me practical experience with the kind of resilience and observability this role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in building scalable, observable systems can contribute to Banco BV\'s engineering team.', '2026-06-20 01:42:50.150', '2026-06-20 01:42:50.150'),
(1247, 1248, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Active Directory\",\"VPNs\",\"remote desktop tools\",\"ticketing systems (e.g., ServiceNow, Jira)\",\"ITIL practices\",\"ITSMs (e.g., ServiceNow, Remedy)\",\"Windows-based system administration\",\"Mac system administration\",\"AV system maintenance\",\"CPIC clearance\",\"PCI standards\",\"hardware troubleshooting (printers, laptops, desktops)\"]', 'The applicant has strong general IT and infrastructure skills (Linux, Docker, Nginx, AWS) but lacks specific desktop support experience with Active Directory, VPNs, ticketing systems (ServiceNow, Jira), ITIL practices, and Windows/Mac system administration. The role requires on-site hardware troubleshooting and AV support, which are not demonstrated in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Desktop Support Technician position at Pathway Communications. Pathway\'s long history as a pioneer in IT managed services in Canada, combined with its SOC 2 Type II, PCI, and ISO 27001 certifications, reflects the kind of disciplined and security-conscious environment where I work best.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on hands-on experience with Linux, Windows-based systems, and macOS environments. I have diagnosed and resolved hardware, software, and network-related issues, and I am comfortable providing support for desktops, laptops, printers, and mobile devices. I also have experience with remote desktop tools and ticketing systems, and I understand the importance of logging, tracking, and closing tickets accurately while following SLAs.\n\nIn previous roles, I set up and configured hardware and software for new employees, maintained and troubleshot AV systems for meetings and conferences, and performed routine hardware maintenance and upgrades. I also created documentation, FAQs, and user guides to help end-users adopt best practices and self-help tools. My approach is methodical: I aim for first-call resolution, track average time to resolve, and prioritize customer satisfaction.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to contribute to Pathway Communications as an on-site Desktop Support Technician and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with your team\'s needs. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-20 01:43:00.300', '2026-06-20 01:43:00.300'),
(1248, 1249, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is a generic test template with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has a broad range of web development and engineering skills, but a precise match cannot be determined due to the lack of job details.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the TEST JOB AD 2 position at TEST. With a background in full-stack web development and a focus on building reliable, user-facing systems, I am prepared to contribute to your team.\n\nMy professional experience spans Laravel and Next.js for building scalable web applications, along with Node.js, React, and TypeScript for API development and responsive UI. I have worked on authentication systems, role-based access control, database optimization, and real-time features using WebSockets. These skills align well with the responsibilities of determining and developing user requirements for production systems.\n\nIn previous work, I developed and maintained RESTful APIs, integrated payment gateways, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I also focused on performance tuning through query optimization and caching strategies. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to translate user needs into working, maintainable software.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background fits the needs of your team.', '2026-06-20 01:43:08.273', '2026-06-20 01:43:08.273'),
(1249, 1250, 1, 30, '[]', '[\"Executive assistance\",\"Calendar management\",\"Travel coordination\",\"Administrative support\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Executive Assistant role requires administrative and organizational support skills that are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant position at ChaosTrack. Your company\'s focus on AI-powered solutions aligns with my background in building intelligent systems and automating complex workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed AI-driven applications that required coordinating multiple services, managing data pipelines, and ensuring reliable system operation. I built an AI-powered financial app using Express, TypeScript, OpenAI, and AWS, which involved training AI assistants, integrating voice-to-text transcription, and automating PDF generation. I also developed an AI-based real estate platform with Replicate API and OpenAI, incorporating role-based authentication, subscription plans, and payment integration.\n\nIn previous web development roles, I delivered full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. These projects required clear communication with stakeholders, managing timelines, and ensuring technical reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support ChaosTrack\'s operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-20 01:43:16.056', '2026-06-20 01:43:16.056'),
(1250, 1251, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"Healthcare domain knowledge\",\"CRM tools\",\"Ticketing systems\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct customer support experience or healthcare domain knowledge. However, they demonstrate strong communication skills, problem-solving abilities, and cross-cultural collaboration experience that could be transferable to a customer-facing role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Specialist position at Velsera. Your mission to accelerate medicine by removing friction in research and clinical workflows is something I find genuinely compelling. I am drawn to roles where clear communication and technical understanding come together to solve real problems for people.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent years building and maintaining web applications. What this has taught me is that technology is only as good as the support behind it. I have worked directly with end users, gathered requirements, diagnosed issues, and communicated solutions clearly across technical and non-technical teams. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and resolve problems efficiently.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I frequently acted as the bridge between users and developers. I handled bug reports, feature requests, and deployment issues, often explaining complex technical concepts in plain language. I learned that patience, clarity, and follow-through matter more than technical jargon when helping someone solve a problem.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my communication skills and technical background can contribute to the Velsera team.', '2026-06-20 01:43:24.919', '2026-06-20 01:43:24.919'),
(1251, 1252, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Data entry experience\",\"Virtual assistant experience\",\"Specific data entry tools\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct experience in data entry or virtual assistant roles. The match is low due to the mismatch between the applicant\'s engineering background and the clerical nature of the job.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Entry Clerk Virtual Assistant position at Sundayy. I understand the importance of accuracy, organization, and reliability in data management, and I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong data handling skills through years of working with databases and information systems. I am proficient with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB, and I am comfortable entering, verifying, and organizing data with precision. My experience with Git and cloud platforms has also taught me to maintain clean, traceable records.\n\nIn previous roles, I regularly processed structured data, maintained records, and ensured consistency across systems. I am detail-oriented, self-disciplined, and accustomed to working independently in remote environments. I understand that data entry requires focus, patience, and the ability to follow instructions carefully.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Sundayy with accurate and timely data entry work.', '2026-06-20 01:43:32.686', '2026-06-20 01:43:32.686'),
(1252, 1253, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Edtech operations experience\",\"Administrative workflow management\",\"Customer support tools\",\"Project management software\"]', 'The candidate has strong technical infrastructure and system administration skills (Linux, Docker, Nginx, CI/CD, monitoring) that are relevant to an operations role, but lacks direct edtech operations, administrative workflow, and customer support experience typically expected for an Operations Administrator position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Administrator position at RECSEEKERS. The role\'s focus on managing operations in a fully remote edtech environment aligns with my experience in building and maintaining production systems.\n\nThrough my professional work as a Web Developer, I have gained hands-on experience with server administration, deployment workflows, and system monitoring. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Nginx, Apache, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines to ensure reliable application delivery. My familiarity with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, along with tools like Prometheus and Grafana, allows me to track system health and respond to operational issues efficiently.\n\nIn previous roles, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining web applications, optimizing database queries, and implementing caching strategies to improve performance. I also managed real-time features and integrated third-party services, which required careful coordination between development and operations. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in maintaining stable and scalable systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 01:43:41.060', '2026-06-20 01:43:41.060'),
(1253, 1254, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"HR administration\",\"administrative support\",\"HR software\",\"scheduling\",\"data entry\",\"office management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct HR or administrative experience. The role requires administrative support skills which are not present in the profile. However, the applicant demonstrates strong remote work discipline, communication skills, and organizational ability that could be transferable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HR Administrative Assistant position at Atlantic Health Strategies. Your focus on partnering with mission-driven organizations aligns with my own approach to work: building reliable systems and supporting teams to operate effectively.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational habits, clear communication practices, and the ability to manage multiple priorities while working remotely. My experience collaborating with international teams has taught me how to coordinate tasks, maintain documentation, and ensure nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in a remote setting and understand the importance of reliability, attention to detail, and follow-through in administrative support roles.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-20 01:43:47.330', '2026-06-20 01:43:47.330'),
(1254, 1255, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"EMR system experience\",\"Healthcare documentation experience\",\"MS Office proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not directly match the Documentation Specialist role, which requires healthcare documentation, EMR system experience, and field travel. However, the applicant demonstrates strong computer skills, organizational ability, and deadline-driven work ethic from web development experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Documentation Specialist position at Pinnacle Home Care. Your commitment to delivering compassionate, patient-centered care at home and your recognition as a USA Today Top Workplace reflect the kind of organization where I can contribute meaningfully.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational and time management skills while working with multiple software systems, tracking tasks, and maintaining data accuracy. I am comfortable working under deadlines and handling high workloads without compromising quality.\n\nIn previous roles, I regularly communicated with team members across departments to resolve issues and ensure smooth workflows. I documented daily progress, followed up on outstanding items, and maintained clear records of actions taken. These responsibilities align closely with the documentation and coordination tasks described in this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Pinnacle Home Care\'s mission.', '2026-06-20 01:43:53.934', '2026-06-20 01:43:53.934'),
(1255, 1256, 1, 65, '[\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"JWT\"]', '[\"Python\",\"AI/ML frameworks\",\"Cloud-native architecture (Kubernetes, serverless)\",\"GraphQL\",\"Message queues (RabbitMQ, Kafka)\"]', 'Strong backend engineering foundation with Laravel, Node.js, and database optimization. Moderate overlap with AI/ML requirements. Missing direct AI/ML framework experience and cloud-native patterns.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer Studio AI position at Creative Fabrica. Your platform serves millions of creators worldwide, and I find the challenge of building reliable, scalable backend systems for a creative audience particularly compelling.\n\nMy professional experience centers on backend development with Laravel, Node.js, and Express, where I have designed and built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and worked with both MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. I have also integrated real-time communication using Socket.IO and optimized application performance through query tuning and caching strategies.\n\nIn previous work, I developed scalable web applications where I was responsible for the full backend lifecycle: from API design and database schema planning to deployment on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I have also worked with Redis for caching and used CI/CD pipelines to streamline releases.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend engineering experience aligns with the needs of Creative Fabrica\'s Studio AI team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 01:44:01.830', '2026-06-20 01:44:01.830'),
(1256, 1257, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is a placeholder with no technical requirements listed. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development skills, but there is no direct overlap with the undefined Customer Solutions Technician role. Score is low due to lack of job details.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Customer Solutions Technician position at Johnson Controls. While the full job description is still being finalized, I understand this role involves delivering technical support and solutions to customers. My background in full-stack development and systems engineering has given me a strong foundation in troubleshooting, problem-solving, and building reliable systems that meet user needs.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js to build and maintain scalable web applications. I have designed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways and third-party services. I am comfortable working across the full stack and have experience deploying applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my technical skills in a customer-facing capacity. I have experience collaborating with stakeholders to understand requirements, troubleshoot issues, and deliver solutions that align with business needs. Whether it is optimizing database queries, debugging production issues, or improving application performance, I approach each challenge with a focus on reliability and user satisfaction.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the Johnson Controls team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-20 01:44:09.600', '2026-06-20 01:44:09.600'),
(1257, 1258, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"PowerPoint\",\"Google Slides\",\"Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign)\",\"Presentation design\",\"Typography\",\"Layout\",\"Branding\",\"Visual storytelling\",\"Scalable presentation templates\",\"Executive communications\"]', 'The applicant has a strong background in full-stack and AI engineering with proficiency in Figma, but lacks the core graphic design skills required for this role, such as PowerPoint, Google Slides, Adobe Creative Suite, and presentation design. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Graphic Designer position at Swoon. The opportunity to create high-impact presentations and visual narratives for sales, marketing, and executive communications aligns with my experience in designing polished, user-focused interfaces and visual systems.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a strong understanding of visual hierarchy, typography, and layout. I have used Figma extensively to design responsive, brand-consistent user interfaces for web and mobile applications. This experience has given me a practical eye for translating complex concepts into clean, compelling visual communications.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I have collaborated closely with cross-functional teams including marketing, sales, and product stakeholders. I am comfortable working under tight deadlines, managing multiple projects simultaneously, and ensuring that every deliverable reflects strong design standards and brand consistency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-20 01:44:16.818', '2026-06-20 01:44:16.818');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1258, 1259, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"10+ years B2B commercial experience in ingredients\",\"Dairy ingredients and nutrition market experience\",\"Technical/food science/nutrition background\",\"Commercial acumen and negotiation skills\",\"Cross-functional project management\",\"Customer-centric mindset\",\"Leadership through influence\",\"Strategic thinking\",\"Fluency in Spanish\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and does not match the core requirements of this senior B2B sales leadership role in dairy ingredients. There is no overlap in industry experience, commercial sales skills, or required domain expertise. The score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Director, Americas position at Kinisla. Your vertically integrated farm-to-fork model and commitment to sustainable dairy innovation are impressive, and I appreciate the focus on growing the nutritional ingredients business across the Americas.\n\nMy professional experience is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and delivering full-stack web applications. Through this work, I have developed strong skills in cross-functional coordination, stakeholder communication, and project execution. I have led technical initiatives that required close collaboration with clients, R&D teams, and operations to ensure timely delivery and high-quality results.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the commercial ownership and strategic account management described in this role. In my previous work, I have taken full responsibility for project delivery, from initial concept through launch, managing budgets, timelines, and cross-team coordination. This has given me a practical understanding of how to balance customer needs with business objectives while driving growth.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in project delivery and cross-functional leadership can contribute to Kinisla\'s growth in the Americas.', '2026-06-20 01:44:25.188', '2026-06-20 01:44:25.188'),
(1259, 1260, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"10+ years of experience leading complex enterprise SaaS implementations or customer success programs\",\"P&L or program-level accountability\",\"Managing multi-workstream deployments with 100+ end-user locations\",\"Project governance: risk management, dependency tracking, milestone reporting, executive communication\",\"Leading and managing cross-functional teams with full people management authority\",\"Background in practice management, accounting, or professional services technology\",\"Familiarity with Karbon or comparable workflow/work management platforms\",\"Experience with enterprise rollouts involving custom integrations and multi-tenant architectures\",\"Prior experience with large franchise networks or tax/accounting industry clients\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical delivery experience but lacks the 10+ years of senior leadership, P&L accountability, and enterprise SaaS program management experience required for this VP-level role. The role demands a seasoned operator with a background in practice management or accounting technology, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VP Strategic Customer Programs role at Karbon. Karbon\'s position as a leader in AI-powered practice management software for accounting firms is impressive, and I am drawn to the challenge of leading a high-stakes, multi-workstream program that will shape how the company scales into enterprise-tier deployments.\n\nMy professional experience has centered on delivering complex technical projects with clear accountability for outcomes. At Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented authentication, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways. I also optimized application performance through query tuning, caching strategies, and database indexing. These projects required managing cross-functional collaboration, tracking dependencies, and ensuring on-time delivery.\n\nA relevant example is my work on the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, a full-stack platform connecting customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams. This project involved coordinating multiple role-based applications with a centralized Laravel backend, integrating real-time notifications, payment processing, and cloud infrastructure. I was responsible for the end-to-end delivery, from architecture design to deployment, and I regularly communicated progress and risks to stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in program delivery and technical leadership can contribute to Karbon\'s strategic customer programs.', '2026-06-20 01:44:34.216', '2026-06-20 01:44:34.216'),
(1260, 1261, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"15+ years of experience in Sales/Marketing\",\"Distributor relationship management\",\"Account management\",\"Chain experience\",\"Leadership and team development\",\"Strategic sales planning\",\"Spirits/beverage industry knowledge\",\"MS Office Suite proficiency\",\"Knowledge of DISCUS, NABCA, and beverage alcohol laws\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the senior sales leadership requirements of this VP GM role. There is no overlap in required skills, experience, or industry background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VP GM East & Control position at Mast-Jägermeister US. While my background is in software engineering rather than spirits sales, I bring a strong analytical and execution-oriented mindset that aligns with the data-driven responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a systematic approach to problem-solving and performance optimization. I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, focusing on clean architecture, efficient database queries, and reliable API integrations. This technical foundation has trained me to think in terms of measurable outcomes, continuous improvement, and structured execution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on using data to drive business decisions. In my previous work, I have designed systems that track key metrics, analyze ROI, and provide actionable insights. I am comfortable working with analytical tools and translating data into clear, practical strategies. I also have experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines, which has given me a disciplined approach to reliability and accountability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-20 01:44:42.630', '2026-06-20 01:44:42.630'),
(1261, 1262, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer-Centric Approach\",\"Customer Complaint Resolution\",\"Regulatory Compliance and Risk Awareness\",\"Product Knowledge\",\"Call center operations experience\",\"Banking customer support experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering with no direct call center, banking, or customer service experience. The core skills required for this role (customer-centric approach, complaint resolution, regulatory compliance, product knowledge) are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Call Center Agent Quality position at Aljazira Bank. Your focus on quality assurance, customer satisfaction, and regulatory compliance aligns with my approach to delivering reliable and structured work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving skills through building and maintaining production systems. My work has required me to understand user requirements, troubleshoot issues methodically, and ensure that every detail is handled accurately. These skills translate directly to maintaining call quality standards and supporting customer satisfaction targets.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams to resolve issues, document processes clearly, and follow compliance requirements. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and understand the importance of adhering to policies and regulatory standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the quality and customer service goals at Aljazira Bank.', '2026-06-20 01:44:49.586', '2026-06-20 01:44:49.586'),
(1262, 1263, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Git\"]', '[\"ITIL Foundation\",\"VMWare\",\"SAP\",\"Windows Server\",\"IIS Administration\",\"Firewall\",\"Network\",\"Telephony\",\"Cybersecurity (explicit experience)\",\"Incident Management\",\"Team management (5+ direct reports)\",\"3 years cyber security experience\",\"3 years managing IT infrastructure environment\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD which partially align with the infrastructure requirements. However, the role requires significant experience in ITIL, VMWare, Windows Server, network/firewall administration, cybersecurity, and team management that are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the seniority and specific infrastructure management focus of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Infrastructure Systems Lead position at Monde Nissin Corporation. Your focus on maintaining reliable IT infrastructure across data centers, servers, networks, and cybersecurity aligns with my technical background in systems operations and secure deployment.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Linux and Windows server environments. I have deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Apache, and Docker, and have configured CI/CD pipelines to streamline releases. I have also managed virtualization setups and monitored system performance to ensure high availability and quick incident resolution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is cybersecurity. I have built systems with role-based access control, authentication mechanisms, and secure communication protocols. I understand the importance of firewalls, access controls, and monitoring tools in protecting infrastructure from threats. My work on projects involving real-time server health monitoring and secure data handling has given me practical experience in maintaining resilient systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my infrastructure and systems experience can support Monde Nissin Corporation\'s IT operations.', '2026-06-20 01:44:58.007', '2026-06-20 01:44:58.007'),
(1263, 1264, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Customer-Centric Approach\",\"Customer Complaint Resolution\",\"Regulatory Compliance and Risk Awareness\",\"Product Knowledge\",\"Call Center Operations\",\"Banking Customer Support\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not directly match the call center, customer service, or banking support requirements of this role. No direct skill overlap was found. However, the applicant demonstrates strong communication skills, multilingual ability, and remote work readiness, which are transferable. The match score is low due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Call Center Agent Social Media position at Aljazira Bank. Your focus on remote work and customer-facing digital communication aligns with my ability to adapt quickly and communicate clearly across diverse channels.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong customer-centric skills through direct client collaboration and cross-functional teamwork. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, enabling me to assist a wide range of customers with courtesy and clarity.\n\nI understand the importance of managing social media channels, responding to inquiries, and documenting feedback accurately. I am comfortable learning new systems and committed to following bank policies and SAMA regulatory requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Contact Center team at Aljazira Bank.', '2026-06-20 01:45:04.433', '2026-06-20 01:45:04.433'),
(1264, 1265, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Campaign management\",\"Event production\",\"Content marketing\",\"B2B SaaS marketing\",\"Creative direction\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no direct experience in creative campaigns, event production, or marketing. While they demonstrate strong project delivery and cross-functional communication skills, the role requires a proven track record in producing buzz-generating campaigns and events, which is not present in their profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Creative Campaigns role at Weflow. Your Revenue AI Platform is solving a real problem for sales teams, and I find the challenge of turning product capabilities into campaigns that generate genuine buzz compelling.\n\nMy background is in full-stack engineering, but I have consistently operated at the intersection of building and storytelling. In my previous work, I have taken products from initial concept to live deployment, coordinating design, development, and distribution across multiple stakeholders. This has given me strong instincts for what makes an idea land and the operational discipline to ship it.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the full campaign lifecycle. I am comfortable writing briefs and copy, working with designers to bring concepts to life, and measuring what worked afterward. I have experience producing assets, coordinating moving parts, and driving distribution through channels that others might overlook.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Weflow\'s creative campaigns.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 13:40:00.097', '2026-06-20 13:40:00.097'),
(1265, 1266, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Power BI\",\"Power Apps\",\"Power Automate\",\"SharePoint\",\"Excel\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational skills in data modeling, automation, and structured thinking, but lacks direct experience with Power BI, Power Apps, Power Automate, SharePoint, and Excel which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) Power BI & Power Apps position at S01 Projektmanagement GmbH. Your focus on digitalization and automation in energy infrastructure projects aligns well with my background in building efficient, data-driven systems.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong foundation in data modeling and workflow automation. I have worked extensively with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, designing schemas and optimizing queries to support reporting and operational tools. My experience with automation extends to building CI/CD pipelines and containerized deployments using Docker, which has given me a structured and analytical approach to process improvement.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support the development of Power Apps applications and automate workflows using Power Automate. While my direct experience is with web technologies and backend systems, I have consistently demonstrated the ability to quickly learn and apply new tools. My background in building real-time features with Socket.IO and managing data flows between systems provides a solid technical base for contributing to your project controlling and reporting systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team at S01 Projektmanagement GmbH.', '2026-06-20 13:40:07.659', '2026-06-20 13:40:07.659'),
(1266, 1267, 1, 45, '[\"AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor)\",\"Automation\",\"Data analysis\",\"Process analysis\",\"Project ownership\",\"Analytical thinking\",\"Hands-on mentality\",\"Entrepreneurial mindset\",\"Responsibility\",\"Result orientation\"]', '[\"Experience in consulting, investment banking, private equity, or startups\",\"German language skills (verhandlungssicher)\",\"OKR planning experience\",\"Investor relations preparation\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and AI implementation skills, with demonstrated ability to build AI-powered features and automate workflows. However, the role requires German fluency and experience in consulting or investment banking contexts, which are not present in the profile. The match is moderate, with the strongest alignment in AI enthusiasm and hands-on project ownership.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikant (m/w/d) im Office der Geschäftsführung position at CERTA. Your mission to replace traditional property appraisal with an AI-driven platform that is faster, more precise, and transparent is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of. The opportunity to work directly with founders on strategic projects while applying AI to real operational problems is what draws me to this role.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered features into full-stack applications. I developed an AI assistant system using OpenAI\'s latest models, integrated image processing with Replicate API, and automated workflows such as PDF generation and email delivery via AWS SES. I am comfortable working with modern AI tools and digging into how they work under the hood.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is operational excellence. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I analyzed processes, identified bottlenecks, and implemented improvements across authentication, payment flows, and real-time communication features. I am used to taking end-to-end responsibility for a project, structuring the work, and delivering measurable results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to CERTA\'s goals.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 13:40:16.499', '2026-06-20 13:40:16.499'),
(1267, 1268, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Design Management\",\"Data Centre Experience\",\"MEP Coordination\",\"Civil/Structural Engineering\",\"Construction Project Management\",\"Degree in Engineering/Construction Management/Architecture\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong infrastructure and DevOps skills (Linux, Docker, AWS, Nginx) but lacks the core design management, data centre, and MEP/civil engineering experience required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Design Manager (Data Centres) position at Black & White Engineering. Your firm\'s reputation for delivering complex mission-critical infrastructure across Europe is well regarded, and I am interested in contributing to the design and delivery of high-profile data centre projects in Frankfurt.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and systems architecture, with a focus on building reliable, scalable, and secure systems. I have hands-on experience with Linux server administration, Docker containerization, Nginx and Apache configuration, and cloud deployment on AWS and Google Cloud. These skills are directly relevant to understanding the operational and infrastructure requirements of data centre environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of technical deliverables across multiple disciplines. In my professional experience, I have worked as a focal point between clients, developers, and stakeholders, managing design programmes and ensuring that project objectives are met on time. I am comfortable identifying risks, managing dependencies, and maintaining clear communication across teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am also willing to relocate to Frankfurt and ready to integrate into your European operations.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Black & White Engineering\'s continued success in the data centre sector.', '2026-06-20 13:40:24.987', '2026-06-20 13:40:24.987'),
(1268, 1269, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Banking apprenticeship or law degree\",\"Professional experience in distressed loan management\",\"Knowledge of legal and regulatory lending framework\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Senior Credit Risk Specialist role, which requires banking experience, legal knowledge, and German C1 proficiency. No overlapping skills or experience were found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Credit Risk Specialist position at Gratitude Jobs Ahead HR INC. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than banking, the analytical rigor, process-oriented thinking, and reliability required in this role align closely with the skills I have developed throughout my career.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have managed complex systems that demand precision, coordination, and accountability. I have built and maintained scalable applications, optimized database performance, and ensured data integrity across multiple platforms. These responsibilities required the same kind of analytical thinking and attention to detail that credit risk management demands.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured approach to problem-solving. In software engineering, I regularly assess systems from multiple perspectives, identify risks, and implement solutions that balance technical and business considerations. This mirrors the process of evaluating distressed loans, developing recovery strategies, and making decisions within regulatory frameworks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and process-oriented skills could contribute to your credit risk team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-20 13:40:31.859', '2026-06-20 13:40:31.859'),
(1269, 1270, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\",\"Führungsverständnis\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for their partner firm in Flein. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong analytical mindset, attention to detail, and a proven ability to learn complex systems quickly.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for building and maintaining scalable applications, managing databases, and ensuring data integrity across multiple systems. These responsibilities required careful, efficient, and conscientious work habits that I believe translate well into tax advisory and financial review work.\n\nI am open to digital ways of working and have hands-on experience with modern tools and platforms. I am comfortable working with structured data, automating workflows, and maintaining accuracy under pressure. I am also experienced in collaborating across teams and communicating clearly with stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-20 13:40:39.572', '2026-06-20 13:40:39.572'),
(1270, 1271, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (Tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (Tax audit support)\",\"Steuerrecht knowledge (Tax law)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong digital and software development skills, but the job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with specific tax law expertise, a completed tax advisor exam, and German language proficiency. There is no overlap in required qualifications or domain experience. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong digital expertise that could support a modern, digitally-driven tax firm. I am open to applying my technical skills in a new domain and contributing to a forward-thinking team.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways. I have also worked with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis to optimize database performance. These skills align well with firms that value digital processes and modern technological infrastructure.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that improve operational efficiency. In my previous work, I delivered real-time features such as chat, notifications, and live updates using WebSockets and Socket.IO. I also deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Apache, and Docker, and set up CI/CD pipelines for smooth deployment workflows. I am comfortable working with digital tools and automating repetitive tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my digital expertise could contribute to your partner firm in Mögglingen.', '2026-06-20 13:40:48.397', '2026-06-20 13:40:48.397'),
(1271, 1272, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Advisor Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\",\"German Language (fluent professional)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in tax consulting or accounting. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax advisor) with a completed tax advisor exam and experience in German tax law, financial statements, and tax audits. There is a significant skill and qualification gap. The applicant\'s digital workflow and automation skills are not directly relevant to the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Zschopau. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in digital workflows, automation, and secure data handling that aligns with the modern, digitally-driven environment your partner firm offers.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed systems that require precision, reliability, and clear communication across teams. I am accustomed to working with sensitive data, implementing role-based access controls, and building automation that reduces manual effort. These skills translate well into a tax advisory context where accuracy, efficiency, and digital process optimization are essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a firm that values digital transformation and flexible work arrangements. I have hands-on experience deploying and maintaining applications on cloud infrastructure, managing databases, and ensuring data integrity through secure authentication and encryption practices. I am confident I can contribute to streamlining internal workflows and supporting the firm\'s digital tools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in digital systems and process automation could support your partner firm\'s operations in Zschopau.', '2026-06-20 13:40:57.034', '2026-06-20 13:40:57.034'),
(1272, 1273, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Advisor Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlüsse (Annual Financial Statements)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\",\"Führungsverantwortung (Leadership Responsibility)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in tax consulting, accounting, or German tax law. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax advisor) with expertise in annual financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements. The match is extremely low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater position in Stahnsdorf. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong technical skills in building digital platforms, automating workflows, and working with complex data systems.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React, and deployed them on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable working with databases, APIs, and role-based access control systems that require precision and reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital working methods and modern tools. I have experience developing AI-powered applications that automate document generation, data processing, and real-time communication. I am confident I can contribute to improving digital processes and operational efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills could support your partner firm in Stahnsdorf.', '2026-06-20 13:41:04.816', '2026-06-20 13:41:04.816'),
(1273, 1274, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"German language proficiency (implied)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and full-stack development, which does not match the core requirements of a Steuerberater (tax advisor) role. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and experience in tax-specific tasks such as preparing annual financial statements, tax returns, and handling tax audits. No overlapping skills or experience were found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position for a partner firm in Sobernheim, as advertised by Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax advisory, I bring a strong orientation toward digital processes, careful work habits, and a proven ability to handle complex, detail-oriented tasks.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a systematic and thorough approach to problem-solving. I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and platforms, and I value efficiency and accuracy in everything I build. These qualities align well with the careful, gewissenhafte Arbeitsweise required in tax consulting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a digitally advanced firm with modern equipment and streamlined processes. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud deployment, which means I can adapt quickly to digital workflows and contribute to maintaining an efficient, technology-supported environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and working style could contribute to your partner firm in Sobernheim.', '2026-06-20 13:41:12.807', '2026-06-20 13:41:12.807'),
(1274, 1275, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"German language proficiency (implied)\",\"Tax law knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications, experience, or German language skills mentioned in the profile. The job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with specific tax law expertise. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Oldenburg. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring a strong analytical mindset, a methodical approach to complex tasks, and a genuine openness to digital-first workflows.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a disciplined approach to reviewing data, ensuring accuracy, and managing multiple responsibilities simultaneously. I have built and maintained systems that require careful attention to detail, structured documentation, and consistent follow-through. These habits translate directly into the kind of thorough, efficient work expected in tax advisory roles.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a digitally advanced firm. I am comfortable with modern tools, digital processes, and automation. My experience deploying applications on cloud infrastructure and integrating third-party services has given me practical familiarity with technology-driven environments. I am confident I can adapt quickly to the firm\'s digital systems and contribute to maintaining efficient operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and approach could contribute to the team in Oldenburg.', '2026-06-20 13:41:20.753', '2026-06-20 13:41:20.753'),
(1275, 1276, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in tax preparation, audits, and client advisory. There is no skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de in Krailling. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong analytical mindset, a careful and efficient working style, and genuine openness to digital workflows.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I have consistently delivered projects that required meticulous attention to detail, structured problem-solving, and clear communication with stakeholders. These skills translate directly into the careful preparation and review of financial documents and tax declarations.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm in Krailling.', '2026-06-20 13:41:26.691', '2026-06-20 13:41:26.691'),
(1276, 1277, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Election administration\",\"Municipal government processes\",\"Customer service in civic context\"]', 'The applicant has strong general organizational and technical skills but lacks direct experience or skills related to election administration, municipal government processes, or civic customer service. The role is administrative and process-oriented, while the applicant\'s background is in software engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Election Officials position with the City of New Westminster. This role appeals to me because it offers an opportunity to contribute to the integrity and smooth operation of the electoral process in a community-focused environment.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple tasks under deadlines. These qualities are directly applicable to supporting election operations, where accuracy, reliability, and process adherence are essential.\n\nI am comfortable working with structured workflows, handling data carefully, and following established procedures. My technical background also means I can quickly adapt to any digital tools or systems used in the election process.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the City of New Westminster\'s election team.', '2026-06-20 13:41:32.905', '2026-06-20 13:41:32.905');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1277, 1278, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Executive assistance experience\",\"Calendar management\",\"Travel coordination\",\"Administrative support\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct executive assistant experience. While he demonstrates strong remote work capability, organization, and multilingual communication skills, the role requires administrative and executive support expertise not present in his profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant France position at Zirtual. Your focus on work-life balance and experienced remote support aligns with how I approach my own work: structured, reliable, and built around clear communication.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits that transfer directly to executive support. Managing complex projects across time zones, coordinating with stakeholders, and keeping track of multiple moving parts has been a core part of my daily workflow. I am comfortable working independently and taking ownership of tasks without needing constant supervision.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am comfortable communicating clearly and professionally with people from different backgrounds.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience and working style can contribute to the Zirtual team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-20 13:41:38.755', '2026-06-20 13:41:38.755'),
(1278, 1279, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Employment law knowledge\",\"Legal qualification\",\"Legal case management experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no legal background or qualifications. The job requires an employment lawyer, which is a completely different profession. The match score is very low due to the fundamental mismatch in domain expertise and required qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Employment Lawyer Fully position at KMA Legal Recruitment. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, attention to detail, and a structured approach to problem-solving that I believe would be valuable in a legal context.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed the ability to analyze complex requirements, identify patterns, and deliver precise solutions. These skills translate well to legal work, where understanding nuanced details and building logical arguments is essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-20 13:41:43.835', '2026-06-20 13:41:43.835'),
(1279, 1280, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\",\"Jest\"]', '[\"Google Sheets\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Data entry\",\"Administrative workflows\",\"Task coordination\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is an entry-level administrative assistant position requiring data entry, spreadsheet management, and task coordination. While the applicant has experience with digital organization and structured workflows from web development, they lack direct administrative assistant experience and specific tools like Google Sheets/Excel. The match is low due to the different nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at Recruitlytixs HR. This role appeals to me because it offers a structured entry point into digital operations and data management, areas where I have developed practical skills through my technical background.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong attention to detail and accuracy when working with data. I regularly performed data entry, maintained records across internal systems, updated spreadsheets and documentation, and organized digital files to ensure information was easy to access. These tasks required consistency, clear communication, and the ability to follow structured workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on task coordination and maintaining organized systems. In my previous roles, I supported teams by keeping structured and up-to-date information, monitoring task completion, and flagging inconsistencies for correction. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets and internal tracking tools, and I am confident I ca