(1280, 1281, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Figma\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Graphic design software (e.g., Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign)\",\"Typography\",\"Color theory\",\"Layout design\",\"Branding\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills (HTML, CSS, Figma, Bootstrap, Tailwind) that overlap with graphic design, but lacks core graphic design tools and formal design training. The role is a Junior Graphic Designer, and the applicant\'s background is primarily in full-stack development, not design.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Graphic Designer role at Work Force Nexus. The position caught my attention because it combines creative design with practical execution, an area where my development background offers a strong foundation.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built responsive and visually consistent interfaces using tools like Figma, Tailwind CSS, and Bootstrap. I understand how design translates into code and how user experience decisions affect real applications. This perspective allows me to contribute not just to visual design but also to how designs function across devices.\n\nIn previous projects, I designed and implemented complete UI systems for web applications, ensuring consistency, accessibility, and clean layout structures. I am comfortable iterating on designs based on feedback and working within brand guidelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my design and development experience can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-20 13:41:58.461', '2026-06-20 13:41:58.461'),
