(1286, 1287, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Accounting\",\"Controlling\",\"Financial reporting\",\"SAP\",\"MS Office\",\"Excel\",\"Business administration\",\"Energy industry knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) with no direct experience or education in accounting, controlling, finance, or business administration. The job requires a financial controller with expertise in accounting, budgeting, cost controlling, and financial reporting, ideally with SAP and energy industry knowledge. While the applicant has built a financial application, this is a technical development project rather than professional financial controlling experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Financial Controller (Accounting & Controlling) position at BELKAW GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical, process-oriented, and data-driven skills that are directly applicable to financial controlling and accounting coordination.\n\nThrough my work on an AI-powered financial application, I designed and built the complete backend system using Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB. This involved architecting secure data flows, integrating OpenAI for intelligent financial analysis, and automating document generation and delivery via AWS SES. The project required a deep understanding of financial data structures, cost tracking, and automated reporting workflows.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I regularly analyzed system performance metrics, optimized database queries, and developed dashboards that provided clear visibility into operational an