(1290, 1291, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Automotive domain experience (AUTOSAR, ADAS)\",\"Test automation frameworks\",\"German language at C1 level\",\"Degree in Mathematics, Physics, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, or Mechatronics\",\"3-6 years of professional experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has programming skills in C++ and Python, which match the job\'s requirement for object-oriented programming. He also has experience with IT concepts like cloud services (AWS, Google Cloud) and software architectures. However, he lacks specific automotive domain experience (AUTOSAR, ADAS), test automation frameworks, German language proficiency at C1 level, a degree in a directly relevant engineering field, and the required 3-6 years of professional experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systems V&V Engineer - Testautomatisierung im Rahmen vernetzter Funktionen position at Verolt Technology Solutions GmbH. Your focus on next-generation automotive software, connectivity, and cybersecurity aligns with my technical background and research interests in autonomous systems and secure communications.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed strong programming skills in C++ and Python, both of which are object-oriented languages you require. I have designed algorithms for test data generation and automation routines, and I have experience executing tests and evaluating results to ensure functionality and quality. My systematic and structured approach to problem-solving supports the test design and automation responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is th