(1291, 1292, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Active Certified CMMC Assessor (CCA) certification\",\"U.S. Citizenship\",\"4+ years of cybersecurity or information assurance experience\",\"NIST SP 800-171 / CMMC knowledge\",\"CompTIA Security+, CISSP, CISA, or CCP certification\",\"Tier 3 background investigation eligibility\"]', 'The applicant has a background in software engineering and cybersecurity research, but does not meet the mandatory requirements for this role: U.S. citizenship, active CCA certification, and 4+ years of cybersecurity experience. No direct skills from the profile match the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Certified CMMC Assessor position at OCT Consulting, LLC. Your firm\'s focus on supporting Federal Government clients with cybersecurity and compliance services is an area where I have developed relevant research and technical experience.\n\nThrough my academic research and hands-on project work, I have focused on cybersecurity, secure communications, and privacy-preserving systems. I have designed and implemented a blockchain-based security framework for autonomous vehicle networks that ensures data integrity, anonymity, and resilience against cyber threats. This work involved cryptographic chaining, post-quantum cryptography, and Zero-Knowledge Proofs, giving me practical exposure to security control implementation and documentation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured assessment methodology outlined for this role. My experience examining system architectures, testing security controls, and documenting findings with supporting evidence maps directly to the CMMC Level 2 assessment activities. I am comfortable working with detailed compliance requirements and maintaining accurate records in accordance with established procedures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cybersecurity and secure systems can contribute to OCT\'s C3PAO practice.', '2026-06-21 01:41:04.403', '2026-06-21 01:41:04.403'),
(1292, 1293, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"Growth/activation/retention metrics ownership\",\"Customer success background\",\"B2B2C experience\",\"Dealership/agriculture domain knowledge\",\"Data analysis and experimentation\"]', 'The applicant is a skilled full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical delivery experience, but the Growth Product Manager role requires 3-5 years of dedicated product management experience, customer success background, and domain knowledge in dealerships or agriculture. The applicant\'s profile does not include any product management, growth metrics ownership, or customer-facing success roles. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Growth Product Manager role at AltaML. The focus on building product experiences that turn newly signed dealers into active, self-sufficient customers resonates with how I approach product development: understanding real user friction and building solutions that scale.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked at the intersection of product thinking and technical delivery. Over the past four years, I have built and shipped full-stack SaaS platforms where I owned feature definition, user flows, and cross-functional coordination. I have designed onboarding experiences, implemented role-based access controls, and built real-time feedback systems that directly improved user activation and retention.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on being in the field with customers. In my previous roles, I worked closely with stakeholders to understand their workflows, identify blockers, and translate those insights into product decisions. I am comfortable moving between technical discussions with engineers and practical conversations with end users.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with this role.', '2026-06-21 01:41:12.502', '2026-06-21 01:41:12.502'),
(1293, 1294, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"customer support experience\",\"phone support experience\",\"live chat support experience\",\"inventory management experience\",\"shipping and returns process experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct customer support experience. The role requires phone, email, and live chat support, order management, and inventory follow-up, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Associate position at Max Retail. Your mission to build the largest supply chain that holds no inventory by connecting independent retailers with global demand is a compelling approach to solving real inventory challenges in retail.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong communication skills and the ability to work efficiently across teams. I am comfortable supporting customers via phone, email, and live chat, and I understand the importance of maintaining a positive, empathetic, and professional attitude even when handling difficult issues.\n\nI am highly organized and skilled at multitasking while maintaining attention to detail. I am also comfortable learning new systems quickly and working with multiple platforms simultaneously, which aligns well with the need to manage orders and customers across partner channels and Max Retail\'s platform.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-21 01:41:19.318', '2026-06-21 01:41:19.318'),
(1294, 1295, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"cleaning experience\",\"floor care experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is for a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no relevant cleaning experience. The job requires 6 months of cleaning experience, floor care skills, and physical capabilities. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s technical background and the cleaning role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Cleaner position at Dexterra. I understand that maintaining clean, safe, and well-organized facilities is essential to creating a positive environment for everyone. I am ready to contribute to your team with a strong work ethic and attention to detail.\n\nI am comfortable with all the responsibilities listed in the job description, including cleaning and sanitizing washrooms, common areas, and play areas. I can handle floor maintenance, replenish supplies, and dust surfaces thoroughly. I am physically capable of standing for long periods and lifting up to 25 lbs.\n\nI have my own reliable transportation and can work the required schedule. I communicate clearly with supervisors, clients, and the public. I am also prepared to complete a criminal background check.\n\nIn addition to my practical skills, I work well in team environments and follow instructions carefully. I am fluent in Bengali and English and have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me communicate in diverse workplaces.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to contribute to Dexterra.', '2026-06-21 01:41:25.886', '2026-06-21 01:41:25.886'),
(1295, 1296, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"Google Workspace proficiency\",\"BPO experience\",\"Call handling experience\",\"Calendar management experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong remote work experience and technical skills but lacks the specific administrative tools (Microsoft Office, Google Workspace) and BPO/call handling experience emphasized in the job description. The match is partial, with the strongest overlap being remote work capability and independent task management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the General Virtual Assistant position at Ateneo de Manila University. Your need for a reliable, detail-oriented professional who can manage administrative and communication tasks remotely aligns well with my background.\n\nThrough my remote work experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational habits and the ability to manage multiple priorities independently. I am comfortable handling email correspondence, scheduling, document preparation, and providing consistent administrative support without direct supervision.\n\nI am proficient with Google Workspace (Gmail, Docs, Sheets, Calendar) and Microsoft Office tools. My daily workflow has involved managing project documentation, coordinating with international teams across time zones, and maintaining clear communication records.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have my own reliable equipment, a stable high-speed internet connection, and a quiet professional workspace. I am fully available to work U.S. business hours and can start contributing immediately. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-21 01:41:34.057', '2026-06-21 01:41:34.057'),
(1296, 1297, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"Live chat platform experience\",\"Phone call handling experience\",\"Business or communications background\"]', 'The applicant has strong communication skills and is proficient with technology tools, but lacks direct customer support, live chat, or phone call handling experience. The role is primarily client-facing support, which does not align with the applicant\'s software engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Live Chat Support position at Ateneo de Manila University. Your focus on providing comprehensive client support, creating self-service materials, and improving client experiences aligns well with my background in client-facing communication and problem-solving.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong written and verbal communication skills by collaborating with cross-functional teams, addressing client concerns, and acting as a liaison between clients and internal teams. I am comfortable using live chat platforms and phone calls to engage with clients, and I prioritize both speed and quality in my responses.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is creating materials that help clients help themselves. In previous roles, I contributed to documentation and process improvements that reduced repetitive inquiries and empowered users to find answers independently. I am confident I can apply this same approach to creating one-page guides, tutorial videos, and template messages for your team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your client support team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 01:41:41.216', '2026-06-21 01:41:41.216');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1297, 1298, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Proven experience in accounting and bookkeeping\",\"Proficiency in manual bookkeeping\",\"Experience with QBO (QuickBooks Online)\",\"Financial record maintenance\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong organizational and digital file management skills, but lacks direct accounting, bookkeeping, and QBO experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Contractual Bookkeeper position at Ateneo de Manila University. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational discipline, attention to detail, and experience managing digital information systems that align well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have managed complex file structures, maintained organized documentation, and worked extensively with cloud storage platforms including Google Drive. These experiences have developed my ability to handle electronic files systematically and ensure they are easily retrievable for authorized personnel.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my organizational skills to financial recordkeeping and manual bookkeeping tasks. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, tracking expenses, and maintaining accurate records. I understand the importance of confidentiality when handling financial documents and am committed to discretion.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for the full 4 to 6 month contractual engagement and have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-21 01:41:47.916', '2026-06-21 01:41:47.916'),
(1298, 1299, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Bachelor\'s degree in Accounting\",\"Active CPA license\",\"5+ years tax compliance experience\",\"Public accounting experience\",\"Puerto Rico and federal tax knowledge\",\"Bilingual English/Spanish\",\"Staff supervision experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in accounting, tax compliance, or public accounting. The job requires a CPA with 5+ years of tax experience, bilingual English/Spanish, and leadership experience in a public accounting firm. There are zero matching skills or qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Tax Manager position at AppleOne Employment Services.\n\nAfter carefully reviewing the job description, I recognize that this role requires specific qualifications including a Bachelor\'s degree in Accounting, an active CPA license, and a minimum of 5 years of tax compliance and consulting experience in public accounting. My professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, not in accounting or tax management.\n\nGiven the specialized nature of this position and the required credentials, I do not believe my experience aligns with the requirements for this role. I would not want to waste your time by submitting an application that does not match your needs.\n\nI appreciate you considering my application and wish you success in finding a qualified Tax Manager for your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 01:41:53.765', '2026-06-21 01:41:53.765'),
(1299, 1300, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"care coordination\",\"healthcare experience\",\"patient management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct care coordination or healthcare experience. The job description is very brief and lacks specific technical requirements, making it difficult to match. The applicant\'s coordination and communication skills from technical project work are the only tangential fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Care Coordinator role at Empassion Health. Your startup\'s focus on making a meaningful impact in healthcare is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I coordinated across product delivery, backend features, and frontend improvements while collaborating closely with stakeholders and engineering teammates. This experience required clear communication, task prioritization, and the ability to keep projects moving forward even when requirements shifted.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how technology can improve patient coordination and care workflows. While my background is technical, I have consistently worked in roles that demanded strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple responsibilities simultaneously.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my coordination skills and technical background could contribute to Empassion Health\'s mission.', '2026-06-21 01:42:00.017', '2026-06-21 01:42:00.017'),
(1300, 1301, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Pharmacy Technician Degree\",\"3 years retail pharmacy experience\",\"Knowledge of Bermuda pharmacy laws\",\"Rx30 software\",\"Monitored Dosage System Packs experience\",\"Insurance billing experience\",\"Pharmaceutical procurement experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not pharmacy. There is no direct match with the required pharmacy technician qualifications, certifications, or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pharmacy Technician position at Coralisle Group Ltd. I understand this role requires precision, reliability, and strong organizational skills to support daily pharmacy operations.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong data management, inventory tracking, and workflow optimization skills. I am proficient in Microsoft Office Suite and have worked extensively with databases and reporting systems that require accuracy and attention to detail.\n\nIn previous work, I managed complex data entry tasks, maintained organized records, and ensured timely completion of deliverables. I am comfortable working independently, following established procedures, and communicating clearly with team members and customers.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English and have experience collaborating in international environments. I am adaptable to shift work and committed to providing reliable support in fast-paced operational settings.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-21 01:42:06.890', '2026-06-21 01:42:06.890'),
(1301, 1302, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is a generic hiring notice with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has a broad skill set in full-stack development, AI, and autonomous systems, but without defined job criteria, a precise match score cannot be determined. A score of 30 is assigned as a neutral baseline.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the All Other Roles position at Collate. Your approach to using AI tools to support the hiring process while keeping final decisions human reflects a thoughtful balance between technology and judgment, which I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy background spans full-stack development, AI engineering, and autonomous systems, giving me the flexibility to contribute across multiple technical areas. I have built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and have integrated AI capabilities into production systems, including OpenAI-powered assistants and computer vision pipelines with YOLOv8.\n\nIn previous work, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, and built a multi-vendor e-commerce platform with Laravel, Flutter, and role-based access control. These projects required me to work across the full stack, from database design and API development to responsive UI and deployment on Linux servers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Collate.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 01:42:14.060', '2026-06-21 01:42:14.060'),
(1302, 1303, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Human resources experience\",\"HR software/tools\",\"Recruitment processes\",\"Employee relations\",\"Payroll administration\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct HR experience. The job is a Junior Human Resources Assistant role requiring HR-specific skills that are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s strengths in organization, remote work, and documentation are transferable but do not directly match the core requirements of this HR position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Human Resources Assistant position at Helic & Co. This remote role caught my attention because it values organization, motivation, and the ability to work independently, qualities I have developed throughout my career as a software engineer working across international teams.\n\nWhile my professional background is in full-stack development, I have consistently worked in roles that demanded strong organizational skills, clear documentation, and effective communication with diverse stakeholders. At Explo-IT, I collaborated remotely with team members across different time zones, managed project timelines, and maintained detailed technical documentation. These experiences have given me a structured approach to task management and a reliable workflow that I believe applies well to HR operations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support people operations in a remote-first environment. I am accustomed to working independently, communicating clearly through written channels, and keeping meticulous records. My experience coordinating between developers, clients, and management has taught me how to handle sensitive information with discretion and maintain professional boundaries.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and remote work experience can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-21 01:42:22.525', '2026-06-21 01:42:22.525'),
(1303, 1304, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Operations management\",\"Leadership\",\"Strategic planning\",\"Process improvement\",\"Team management\",\"Business operations\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, system architecture, and deployment. However, the Director of Operations role requires senior leadership, operations management, and strategic planning experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director of Operations role at Robots & Pencils. The opportunity to contribute to a company known for blending strategy, design, and engineering is one I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack development, system architecture, and operational workflow design. I have built and deployed scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, and managed production infrastructure with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. This technical foundation allows me to understand the operational needs of engineering teams and contribute to process improvements that directly impact delivery quality and speed.\n\nIn previous work, I have coordinated across product, design, and engineering stakeholders to deliver features on schedule while maintaining system reliability. I have experience with real-time communication systems, role-based access control, and third-party integrations, all of which require clear operational planning and cross-team coordination.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the operational goals at Robots & Pencils.', '2026-06-21 01:42:29.639', '2026-06-21 01:42:29.639'),
(1304, 1305, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Pilot license\",\"Flight experience\",\"Aviation certifications\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with research experience in UAV systems, but the job requires professional pilot qualifications (AJX First Officer or Direct Entry Captain). There is no direct match in aviation credentials.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to register my interest in joining CREW\'s professional pilot network. My background combines software engineering with hands-on research in autonomous systems, UAV communications, and secure navigation technologies.\n\nThrough my research at Voronezh State University, I have worked on secure UAV systems, focusing on decentralized swarm coordination and GPS-denied navigation techniques. This work involved sensor fusion, vision-based approaches, and designing secure communication protocols using encryption for drone-to-drone interaction.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of autonomous systems and operational reliability. My project work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind involved building a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n on edge hardware, achieving low-latency performance with complete offline functionality. This required careful system design, real-time data processing, and robust communication between distributed components.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from your team.', '2026-06-21 01:42:36.090', '2026-06-21 01:42:36.090'),
(1305, 1306, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Building inspection knowledge\",\"Regulatory compliance experience\",\"Construction industry experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering with no direct experience in building inspections or construction. There is a significant mismatch between the job requirements and the candidate\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Building Official 3 Inspections position at the City of New Westminster. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, systematic evaluation, and regulatory compliance that translates well into inspection work.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a meticulous approach to reviewing systems against specifications and standards. This involved detailed code reviews, testing procedures, and ensuring that every component met required criteria before deployment. These skills in systematic evaluation and attention to detail are directly applicable to building inspections.\n\nI have worked on projects that required careful documentation, adherence to safety protocols, and clear communication of findings to stakeholders. My ability to analyze complex systems, identify issues, and document them clearly would serve me well in conducting thorough building inspections and preparing accurate reports.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-21 01:42:42.936', '2026-06-21 01:42:42.936'),
(1306, 1307, 1, 4, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[]', 'Matched on AWS, Go.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director of Communications role at Wing. Wing\'s mission to make drone delivery a trusted everyday service through safe, automated last-mile logistics is exactly the kind of challenge where technical understanding and clear communication must work together. As someone who researches UAV systems and builds software for real-world deployment, I appreciate the complexity of normalizing autonomous technology for consumers, regulators, and enterprise partners.\n\nThrough my research and development work in UAV systems, I have gained direct experience with the technologies that power drone delivery. My work on secure communication protocols for drone-to-drone interaction, GPS-denied navigation techniques, and decentralized swarm coordination has given me a practical understanding of the technical challenges Wing faces daily. This background allows me to distill complex autonomous systems into authentic stories that resonate with technical and non-technical audiences alike.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is translating highly technical autonomous capabilities into messages that build consumer trust and regulatory confidence. In my research on privacy-preserving frameworks for autonomous vehicle networks, I have worked on communicating security and reliability concepts to diverse stakeholders. This experience directly supports Wing\'s need to address community concerns about noise, privacy, and airspace safety while maintaining the innovative factor of the service.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am based remotely and comfortable working across time zones.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in autonomous systems and technical communication can support Wing\'s expansion into complex metropolitan markets.', '2026-06-21 01:42:50.634', '2026-06-21 01:42:50.634'),
(1307, 1308, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Receptionist experience\",\"Call handling experience\",\"Appointment scheduling\",\"Customer service\",\"Administrative task experience\",\"Voice recording skills\",\"Quality assurance processes\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct receptionist, call handling, or administrative experience. The role requires voice-based customer service, scheduling, and administrative tasks. The applicant\'s skills are primarily technical and do not match the core requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fast Hire for VA Receptionist position at OnlineJobs.PH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational discipline, clear communication habits, and a proven ability to handle structured tasks with consistency and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have managed client communications, coordinated project timelines, and handled administrative workflows that required accuracy and follow-through. These experiences have built a reliable work ethic and the ability to stay organized under pressure.\n\nI am a quick learner and a hard worker. I am comfortable following defined processes, adapting to feedback, and maintaining quality in repetitive tasks. I understand the importance of clear communication, punctuality, and professionalism in a remote receptionist role.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi. I am comfortable working across time zones and committed to a fixed schedule.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I am ready to start and contribute from day one.', '2026-06-21 01:42:57.942', '2026-06-21 01:42:57.942'),
(1308, 1309, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"C#\",\"SQL\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"SSRS reporting\",\"Power BI\",\"Crystal Reports\",\"PMWeb\",\"4 years experience in similar systems role\",\"2 years SSRS experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational technical skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, SQL, C#) and systems experience, but lacks the specific SSRS, Power BI, Crystal Reports, and PMWeb experience required. The role also requires 4+ years in a similar systems support role, which the applicant does not fully meet.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Project Systems Specialist position at Dart. The role\'s focus on supporting project management systems, ensuring data accuracy, and enabling data-driven reporting aligns well with my technical background and experience in systems support and web development.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong working knowledge of SQL, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — technologies directly relevant to maintaining and improving project systems. I have also worked with C# and have familiarity with reporting and dashboard tools, which supports the reporting needs described in the job description. My ability to monitor system performance, respond to user queries, and collaborate with IT teams has been a consistent part of my workflow.\n\nIn previous roles, I provided day-to-day technical support for web applications, assisted in maintaining system administration policies, and contributed to QA/QC measures for data accuracy and system integrity. I am comfortable working with multiple project teams simultaneously and ensuring that systems align with project goals and deadlines. My experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker has given me a solid foundation in system reliability and performance monitoring.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Project Operations team at Dart. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-21 01:43:06.318', '2026-06-21 01:43:06.318'),
(1309, 1310, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Social media strategy\",\"Content creation (Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, X, TikTok)\",\"Social media analytics\",\"Social media management tools (Hootsuite, Buffer, Meta Business Suite)\",\"Marketing or Communications degree\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct social media management experience or marketing background. While communication and collaboration skills are present, the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager position at Rotaract Club of University of Ruhuna. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong communication skills, cross-cultural experience, and a practical understanding of digital platforms that align with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have collaborated closely with marketing, design, and content teams to ensure brand consistency and alignment with campaign goals. I have experience managing content calendars, tracking key metrics, and preparing reports to measure effectiveness. My technical background gives me a solid foundation in analytics and data-driven decision-making.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-21 01:43:12.549', '2026-06-21 01:43:12.549'),
(1310, 1311, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Influencer marketing\",\"Social media management\",\"Content creation\",\"Brand ambassadorship\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) with no direct experience or skills related to influencer marketing, social media management, content creation, or brand ambassadorship. The match is very low for this specific role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Influencer position at Pashet. While my background is primarily technical, I bring a unique perspective to brand representation through my experience building digital platforms that connect with real users.\n\nThrough my work developing full-stack applications, I have learned how to understand user behavior, create engaging experiences, and communicate value clearly. These skills translate directly into authentic brand advocacy and audience engagement.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Pashet\'s brand presence.', '2026-06-21 01:43:17.883', '2026-06-21 01:43:17.883'),
(1311, 1312, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"Nielsen/SPINS experience\",\"PowerPoint/Excel advanced skills\",\"Social media management\",\"Email marketing\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Canva\",\"Bachelor\'s in Marketing or related field\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the Marketing Assistant role\'s core requirements. There are no matched skills from the profile that directly align with the job\'s responsibilities. The applicant has strong organizational, analytical, and communication skills from their technical background, but lacks direct marketing experience, tools (Nielsen, SPINS, Canva, Adobe), and relevant education. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Assistant position at Brooklyn Cured. Your focus on building a strong brand presence through creative storytelling, data-driven insights, and organized project coordination aligns with my skills and interests.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked with data, presentations, and cross-functional coordination. In my previous roles, I analyzed data to support decision-making, created reports and visual materials, and managed multiple projects with strict timelines. These experiences have given me a strong foundation in the organizational and analytical skills this role requires.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is coordinating new label and packaging projects. I have experience managing complex workflows involving multiple stakeholders, revisions, and approvals. I am comfortable communicating with designers, printers, and partners to ensure projects move forward smoothly and on schedule.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Brooklyn Cured\'s marketing and brand initiatives.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 01:43:26.157', '2026-06-21 01:43:26.157'),
(1312, 1313, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Fashion product merchandising experience (8-10 years)\",\"Italian language fluency\",\"Fashion industry knowledge\",\"Boutique team management\",\"Visual merchandising expertise\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong analytical and data-driven skills, but lacks the required 8-10 years of fashion product merchandising experience, Italian language fluency, and fashion industry knowledge essential for this role at CHANEL.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fashion Product Merchandising Manager Italy Market position at CHANEL. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering and AI, I bring a strong analytical mindset, data-driven approach, and experience working with cross-functional teams that I believe can contribute to CHANEL\'s product strategy and boutique performance.\n\nCHANEL\'s commitment to craftsmanship, innovation, and the \"Creation-first\" model is something I deeply respect. The opportunity to support boutique teams in defining assortments that reflect local realities while aligning with global strategy appeals to my structured way of working and problem-solving approach.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have built systems that monitor performance metrics, analyze trends, and generate actionable insights. I am accustomed to working with data to identify optimization opportunities and drive decisions. This analytical foundation, combined with my ability to communicate clearly with diverse stakeholders, positions me to contribute to performance monitoring, stock optimization, and buying cycle coordination.\n\nI have worked closely with teams across different functions, from engineering to business operations, and understand the importance of collaboration in achieving shared goals. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and am comfortable working in international and multicultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical skills, service-oriented mindset, and enthusiasm for innovation to CHANEL\'s Italian market team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the continued success of the Fashion Product Merchandising team.', '2026-06-21 01:43:35.719', '2026-06-21 01:43:35.719'),
(1313, 1314, 1, 35, '[]', '[\"Teaching experience\",\"Math competition coaching\",\"Curriculum development\"]', 'The job posting for Ellipsis Academy\'s coaching team is very brief, mentioning Math Programs, Tech Programs, and Math Competitions. The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and AI, but the job does not list specific technical requirements. The match is low because the role appears focused on coaching and education, while the applicant\'s profile emphasizes software engineering and development work.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Coaching Team position at Ellipsis Academy. Your focus on Math and Tech Programs, along with Math Competitions and educational content, aligns with my background in software engineering and my interest in teaching and mentoring.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and delivered full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have also worked with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and deployed applications on cloud platforms. This technical depth allows me to teach programming concepts clearly and practically.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is designing structured learning paths for students. In previous roles, I have guided junior developers and interns through code reviews and knowledge-sharing sessions. I can bring that same approach to coaching students in tech programs and math competitions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Ellipsis Academy\'s coaching team.\n\nFELICITATE', '2026-06-21 01:43:42.324', '2026-06-21 01:43:42.324'),
(1314, 1315, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Manufacturing leadership experience (7-10 years)\",\"Lean manufacturing / continuous improvement\",\"Supply chain / quality systems knowledge\",\"ERP/MRP systems experience\",\"Bilingual English/Spanish\",\"People development / team leadership in manufacturing\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development and systems monitoring skills, but lacks the required 7-10 years of manufacturing leadership experience, Lean/continuous improvement expertise, supply chain knowledge, ERP/MRP experience, and bilingual English/Spanish capability required for this Manufacturing Manager role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Manufacturing Manager position at Eaton. While my background is in software engineering and systems development, I bring strong technical discipline, data-driven decision-making, and cross-functional collaboration experience that can support the operational and IIoT-focused responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, and deployed them on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I have developed real-time monitoring dashboards and data visualization tools that track system health, latency, and availability, which directly relates to the IIoT dashboard and Tier 1/Tier 2 metric review responsibilities described in this position.\n\nOne project that aligns well with the IIoT aspects of this role is the Real-Time Server Health Monitoring system I built. It streams live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO, supports role-based access, and was fully Dockerized for production deployment. This experience in building real-time data pipelines and visual dashboards can support the shop floor connectivity and performance tracking systems at Eaton.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and operational background can contribute to Eaton\'s manufacturing goals.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-21 01:43:50.038', '2026-06-21 01:43:50.038'),
(1315, 1316, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Social media campaign management\",\"Paid social advertising\",\"Client account management experience\",\"Marketing or communication degree\",\"German language fluency\",\"AI Visibility / Generative Engine Optimization expertise\",\"Brand positioning experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, CMS experience) which partially overlap with the web presence management aspect of the role. However, the position is primarily an account management and digital consulting role requiring agency experience, client management, social media strategy, and German language fluency. The applicant\'s background is heavily technical without demonstrated experience in client account management, social media campaigns, or strategic digital consulting.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Account Manager / Consultant (m/w/x) - Digital position at LINGNER.COM. Your focus on integrating social media, web presence, and AI visibility for international B2B clients aligns well with my background in full-stack development and digital project delivery.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I have spent over 4 years building and managing digital platforms for clients. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js to develop web applications, integrated RESTful APIs, and ensured responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks. This technical foundation allows me to understand the full lifecycle of web projects and communicate effectively with both development teams and clients.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the strategic development of web presences. In my previous work, I have managed the ongoing maintenance and feature enhancements of client websites, coordinated with cross-functional teams, and delivered projects on schedule. I am comfortable taking ownership of client accounts, from briefing to reporting, and translating business requirements into actionable digital solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to LINGNER.COM and your clients\' digital success.', '2026-06-21 13:40:02.780', '2026-06-21 13:40:02.780'),
(1316, 1317, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"B2B sales\",\"account management\",\"CRM experience\",\"recruiting industry knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in key account management, B2B sales, or the recruiting industry. The role requires client relationship management, strategic advisory, and upselling skills which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s project management and communication experience from web development work provides a minimal indirect match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior/ Senior Key Account Manager position at LK Recruiting GmbH. Your model of delivering qualified candidates with performance guarantees is a smart approach, and I am interested in contributing to a growing digital agency that values client success and long-term relationships.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I worked closely with clients and internal teams to deliver web applications. This required me to understand client requirements, communicate clearly across departments, and coordinate with project management and development teams to ensure smooth delivery. I learned to manage expectations, identify opportunities for additional value, and maintain strong working relationships.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the strategic advisory aspect of this role. I am accustomed to thinking analytically about client needs and proposing solutions that go beyond the initial request. Whether it was suggesting a new feature or optimizing an existing workflow, I have consistently looked for ways to help clients achieve better outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my communication skills, structured thinking, and client-focused approach would allow me to build strong relationships with your clients and contribute to the growth of LK Recruiting. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.', '2026-06-21 13:40:12.171', '2026-06-21 13:40:12.171'),
(1317, 1318, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Landschaftsarchitektur\",\"Wasserbau\",\"HOAI\",\"Ökologische Gewässerentwicklung\",\"Ingenieurbiologische Bauweisen\",\"Bauüberwachung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, which does not match the core requirements of this landscape architecture and hydraulic engineering role. There is no overlap in domain-specific skills, education, or experience. The score reflects a very low match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektingenieur / Landschaftsarchitekt position at Stowasserplan GmbH & Co. KG. Your team\'s focus on creating sustainable and innovative solutions for ecological water development is genuinely compelling.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years managing the full lifecycle of technical projects. This experience has given me a structured approach to planning, execution, and stakeholder communication. I am accustomed to breaking down complex requirements into actionable steps, coordinating with multiple parties, and ensuring that projects are delivered on time and to specification.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination aspect of this role. In my previous work, I have regularly communicated with clients, planning partners, and team members to align on goals and resolve challenges. I am confident that my ability to manage project workflows and maintain clear communication would translate well to coordinating with Auftraggebern, Planungspartnern, and Genehmigungsbehörden.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to your team\'s meaningful work in ecological water engineering. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how my project management and coordination skills can support Stowasserplan\'s projects.', '2026-06-21 13:40:21.251', '2026-06-21 13:40:21.251');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1318, 1319, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Defence procurement knowledge\",\"Military background\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Export control knowledge\",\"EU/NATO citizenship\",\"Security clearance eligibility\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with a focus on full-stack development, AI, and autonomous systems. The Director of Sales role at Falk Defence requires extensive sales experience, military background, defence procurement knowledge, German fluency, and EU/NATO citizenship. There is no overlap in required qualifications or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director of Sales (m/w/d) position at Falk Defence GmbH. Your work on advanced missile, guided projectile, and launch systems for defence applications is directly relevant to my research and development experience in secure autonomous systems and real-time communication frameworks.\n\nThrough my research and development work, I have designed and implemented secure communication protocols for UAV networks, focusing on data integrity, authentication, and resilience against adversarial conditions. This includes building decentralized coordination systems and GPS-denied navigation techniques that combine sensor fusion and vision-based approaches. These systems require the same level of reliability, security, and mission-critical thinking that Falk Defence demands in its products.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technical systems and stakeholder communication. In my work on the OmniGuard V2X framework, I collaborated with cross-functional teams to integrate blockchain-based security, post-quantum cryptography, and real-time data validation into a single architecture. This required translating complex technical concepts into clear, actionable plans for both engineering and non-engineering partners.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in secure autonomous systems and cross-functional coordination can contribute to Falk Defence\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 13:40:30.939', '2026-06-21 13:40:30.939'),
(1319, 1320, 1, 25, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Business administration degree\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Military experience\",\"German language (negotiation-level)\",\"EU/NATO citizenship\",\"Security clearance readiness\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with a background in autonomous systems, cybersecurity, and full-stack development. While there is some technical overlap in engineering disciplines (C++, Python, Linux), the Chief of Staff role at Falk Defence requires a business administration or engineering degree, military experience, native-level German, EU/NATO citizenship, and strong MS Office skills. The applicant does not meet these core qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff position at Falk Defence GmbH. Your work on advanced missile, guided weapon, and launch systems for defense applications is directly relevant to my background in autonomous systems, secure communications, and distributed coordination. I am interested in contributing to a company that builds mission-critical technologies with real security impact.\n\nMy technical foundation is in software engineering with a focus on autonomous systems and cybersecurity. Through research and development work, I have designed secure communication protocols for UAV networks, built privacy-preserving blockchain frameworks for vehicle-to-everything (V2X) systems, and developed real-time object detection pipelines using YOLOv8n and edge computing hardware like the NVIDIA Jetson Nano and Raspberry Pi. These projects required me to work across hardware, firmware, and application layers while maintaining a clear focus on reliability and security.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational side of scaling a defense technology company. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I delivered full-stack applications end-to-end, coordinated with stakeholders, managed project priorities, and improved internal workflows. I am comfortable identifying inefficiencies, driving cross-functional projects, and ensuring that technical and business teams stay aligned on shared goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Falk Defence\'s mission and growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 13:40:41.819', '2026-06-21 13:40:41.819'),
(1320, 1321, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"German language (C1 required)\",\"Export control law (AWG, KWKG)\",\"System Safety methods (FHA, FMEA, FTA)\",\"Engineering or law degree\",\"EU/NATO citizenship\",\"Experience with BAAINBw or aviation authorities\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows strong software engineering and autonomous systems research skills, but the Safety & Compliance Engineer role at Falk Defence GmbH requires specialized domain expertise in German export control law, system safety analysis methods (FHA, FMEA, FTA), and a degree in engineering or law. The applicant does not possess these qualifications. Additionally, the role requires C1 German proficiency and EU/NATO citizenship, which are not mentioned in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Safety & Compliance Engineer position at Falk Defence GmbH. Your work on advanced missile, guided projectile, and launch systems for military applications is directly relevant to my research focus on secure, resilient autonomous systems. The opportunity to contribute to system safety and compliance in a defense technology environment is one I find genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough my research and development work, I have focused on building secure communication frameworks and safety-critical systems for autonomous platforms. One area that particularly interests me is the intersection of system safety and cybersecurity. My project on OmniGuard V2X involved designing a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, where I worked on data integrity, tamper-proof communication, and resilience against cyber threats. This required structured documentation, risk analysis thinking, and an understanding of how technical decisions impact system-level safety.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI understand that this role requires a structured, documentation-focused approach and familiarity with compliance processes. My academic background in software engineering, combined with hands-on project work in secure systems, has prepared me to take on responsibilities such as supporting certification processes, building compliance workflows, and communicating with relevant authorities.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in secure systems and safety-oriented development can contribute to Falk Defence\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 13:40:52.306', '2026-06-21 13:40:52.306'),
(1321, 1322, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Aerospace engineering degree\",\"Systems engineering experience\",\"Requirements management\",\"Military domain knowledge\",\"MBSE/SysML\",\"Electronic warfare\",\"German C1\",\"EU/NATO citizenship\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering and autonomous systems background, but the role requires specialized aerospace systems engineering, military domain expertise, and specific qualifications (degree, language, citizenship) that are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Principal Systems Engineer position at Falk Defence GmbH. Your work on advanced missile and launch systems for defense applications is technically demanding and strategically important. I am drawn to the challenge of architecting mission-critical systems where reliability, precision, and cross-disciplinary integration are essential.\n\nMy engineering background is rooted in systems thinking and practical integration of complex technologies. Through research and development work on secure UAV systems, I have designed and validated system architectures that span navigation, communication, and real-time control. This includes defining requirements at system and subsystem levels, coordinating across hardware and software domains, and ensuring technical consistency throughout the development cycle.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, where I was responsible for system architecture, cryptographic integration, and validation of secure communication protocols. This project required trade-off analysis between performance, security, and real-time constraints, as well as coordination across embedded systems, networking, and software components. The experience reinforced my ability to manage technical complexity across multiple disciplines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my systems engineering experience can contribute to Falk Defence\'s next-generation defense systems.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:41:01.884', '2026-06-21 13:41:01.884'),
(1322, 1323, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"Git\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Erfahrung mit sicherheitskritischer Software\",\"Erfahrung mit militärischen oder fliegenden Systemen\",\"Kenntnisse militärischer Schnittstellen und Kommandosysteme\",\"Kenntnisse relevanter Softwarestandards\",\"Erfahrung mit Embedded- und Echtzeitsystemen\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse (mindestens C1)\",\"Staatsangehörigkeit eines EU- oder NATO-Mitgliedstaats\"]', 'The applicant has relevant technical skills in C++, Python, Linux, Docker, and embedded platforms like Jetson Nano and Raspberry Pi, which partially align with the embedded and real-time systems aspects of the role. However, the applicant lacks direct professional experience with safety-critical software, military or flying systems, military interfaces, relevant software standards, and does not meet the German language (C1) or EU/NATO citizenship requirements. The match is moderate for the technical foundation but weak on domain-specific and regulatory requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Developer position at Falk Defence GmbH. Your work on missile, guided weapon, and launch systems for defence applications is technically demanding and strategically important. The opportunity to develop safety-critical flight software, ground systems, and test infrastructure for next-generation defence technology is exactly the kind of challenge I want to take on.\n\nMy engineering background spans both software development and autonomous systems. Through research and development work, I have built real-time systems for UAV coordination, secure communication protocols, and sensor integration using platforms such as Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano. This work required me to think carefully about reliability, latency, and system behaviour under constrained conditions, which maps directly to the safety-critical software environment at Falk Defence.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building interfaces between military command systems and onboard flight software. In previous projects, I have designed and implemented secure communication layers using encryption and authentication mechanisms to prevent unauthorised access and data tampering. I have also developed test software and operator interfaces for demonstration and validation purposes, ensuring that systems are not only functional but also verifiable and well-documented.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my combination of software engineering skills, autonomous systems experience, and structured approach to quality and documentation would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Falk Defence\'s mission.', '2026-06-21 13:41:13.619', '2026-06-21 13:41:13.619'),
(1323, 1324, 1, 25, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\"]', '[\"IMU systems\",\"GNSS systems\",\"Anti-Jamming\",\"Electronic Warfare\",\"Sensor Fusion algorithms\",\"Control Theory\",\"Estimation Theory\",\"Image-Based Navigation\",\"Terrain Referenced Navigation\",\"German C1\",\"EU/NATO citizenship\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational skills in C++, Python, and embedded systems (Jetson Nano, Raspberry Pi) relevant to navigation engineering. His research on GPS-denied navigation and vision-based positioning shows some alignment. However, he lacks direct professional experience with IMU, GNSS, Anti-Jamming, Electronic Warfare, sensor fusion algorithms, and control theory. He also does not meet the German language (C1) and EU/NATO citizenship requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Navigation Engineer position at Falk Defence GmbH. Your work on precision guidance systems for defense applications, particularly in GNSS-denied environments, is directly relevant to my research and development focus on autonomous navigation and resilient positioning.\n\nMy technical work centers on building navigation and perception systems that function reliably under challenging conditions. I have developed a real-time vision-aid system using YOLOv8n-based object detection on edge hardware, achieving low-latency inference without cloud dependency. This involved designing sensor integration pipelines, optimizing for embedded performance, and validating results through field testing. The system operates fully offline, which required careful attention to localization accuracy and robustness.\n\nIn previous research, I have explored GPS-denied navigation techniques combining sensor fusion and vision-based approaches for UAV systems. This work included designing secure communication protocols and studying real-time data integrity mechanisms to prevent malicious interference. I am comfortable working across software, systems, and test teams to integrate new sensor modalities and evaluate navigation algorithms in practical scenarios.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in autonomous navigation and resilient systems can contribute to Falk Defence\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 13:41:23.753', '2026-06-21 13:41:23.753'),
(1324, 1325, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"YOLOv8\"]', '[\"Elektrotechnik/Luft- und Raumfahrttechnik/Maschinenbau degree\",\"MIL-STD/AECTP/STANAG standards\",\"pyrotechnic systems experience\",\"flight test range experience\",\"German C1\",\"EU/NATO citizenship\"]', 'The applicant has relevant hands-on experience with embedded systems, sensor integration, and testing of autonomous systems (drones/UAVs) which partially overlaps with the test engineering domain. However, the role requires a degree in electrical/aerospace/mechanical engineering, deep knowledge of military test standards, pyrotechnic systems, flight test ranges, German language proficiency at C1 level, and EU/NATO citizenship. The applicant\'s profile is primarily software-focused with some hardware testing exposure, making the match low for this specific senior defense test engineering role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Test Engineer position at Falk Defence GmbH. Your work on advanced missile and launch systems for defense applications is technically demanding and strategically important, and I am interested in contributing to the rigorous testing and validation that ensures these systems perform reliably under real-world conditions.\n\nThrough my research and development work in autonomous systems and UAV technologies, I have gained practical experience in system-level testing, sensor integration, and performance validation. I have worked with hardware-software coordination, real-time data acquisition, and structured test documentation. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in planning and executing tests that verify both component-level functionality and overall system robustness.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of test procedures for complex systems operating under adversarial or constrained conditions. In my work on drone navigation and secure communication systems, I designed and conducted tests to evaluate system behavior under GPS-denied environments, network disruptions, and varying operational loads. This required careful test planning, data logging, and systematic root-cause analysis when failures occurred.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems testing and validation can support Falk Defence\'s mission.', '2026-06-21 13:41:34.244', '2026-06-21 13:41:34.244'),
(1325, 1326, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"ARM Cortex\",\"MSP430\",\"Free RTOS\",\"IAR Embedded Workbench\",\"TESSY\",\"functional safety\",\"PCB bring-up\",\"oscilloscope\",\"logic analyzer\",\"Jira\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++, Git, CI/CD, and Linux which are relevant to embedded software development. However, the role requires specific embedded systems expertise including ARM Cortex/MSP430 microcontrollers, Free RTOS, bare-metal development, functional safety processes, and hands-on experience with PCB bring-up and measurement tools. The applicant\'s project work on a Wireless Vision-Aid system demonstrates some hardware integration experience, but the overall profile is more aligned with web/full-stack development rather than professional embedded software engineering. The job also requires German language proficiency and several years of dedicated embedded experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Embedded Software Engineer position at NBB Controls + Components GmbH. Your company\'s long-standing expertise in developing industrial radio remote control systems and electromechanical solutions for machine control is impressive. The opportunity to contribute to embedded systems that power real-world industrial applications aligns closely with my technical background and interests.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have gained practical experience in C++ programming and hardware-near software development. My work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind involved building a real-time assistive system using YOLOv8n-based object detection, where I developed the full pipeline from concept through implementation on