(1326, 1327, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Swift\",\"SwiftUI\",\"Fastlane\",\"iOS Development\",\"Multithreading Programming\"]', 'The applicant has foundational software engineering skills (Git, CI/CD, Linux) but lacks the core iOS-specific skills (Swift, SwiftUI, Fastlane) and iOS development experience required for this Senior iOS Engineer role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer, iOS Core Product role at Speechify. Your mission to remove reading barriers through accessible text-to-speech technology is genuinely impactful, and I appreciate the focus on building products that serve diverse learning needs.\n\nWhile my professional background is in full-stack and backend development, I bring strong software engineering fundamentals that translate well into iOS development. I have hands-on experience with Git and CI/CD infrastructure, having deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and automated pipelines. I understand SOLID principles and multithreading from designing concurrent systems and real-time communication engines using WebSockets and Socket.IO.\n\nIn previous work, I shipped production code regularly, maintained and enhanced complex application architectures, and participated in product discussions to shape roadmaps. I worked within dedicated product teams where clear communication and fast delivery were essential. I am comfortable making engineering decisions that balance speed with long-term maintainability.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my engineering approach can contribute to Speechify\'s iOS product.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:41:52.345', '2026-06-21 13:41:52.345'),
(1327, 1328, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"C#\"]', '[\"Windows App SDK\",\"WinUI\",\"XAML\",\"Windows desktop application development\",\"Microsoft UI Automation\",\"accessibility APIs\",\".NET\",\"Win32/WinRT/COM\",\"multi-threading\",\"asynchronous programming\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++ and C#, which are mentioned in the job description. However, the role requires deep, specific experience with Windows desktop technologies (Windows App SDK, WinUI, XAML, .NET, Win32/WinRT/COM) and accessibility APIs, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s experience is primarily in web and full-stack development, not native Windows desktop applications. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer, Windows/Desktop Applications role at Speechify. Your mission to remove reading as a barrier to learning is genuinely impactful, and I appreciate the focus on building accessible, inclusive software that reaches millions of users.\n\nMy engineering foundation includes C# and C++, which I have used in systems-level work and application development. I have experience designing responsive user interfaces, managing memory efficiently, and writing code that performs reliably under real-world conditions. These skills map directly to the Windows desktop development requirements outlined in this role.\n\nIn previous work, I have taken full ownership of features from initial design through deployment and maintenance. I have collaborated closely with designers, QA teams, and other engineers to shape product decisions and ensure quality across releases. I am comfortable diagnosing performance bottlenecks, resolving compatibility issues, and making architectural choices that balance short-term delivery with long-term maintainability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is accessibility. I understand that building software for users with disabilities requires more than compliance, it requires thoughtful design, careful testing, and a genuine commitment to inclusivity. I have experience working with diverse user requirements and am eager to contribute to Speechify\'s accessibility efforts on the Windows platform.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Windows team at Speechify.', '2026-06-21 13:42:02.460', '2026-06-21 13:42:02.460'),
(1328, 1329, 1, 35, '[\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Kotlin\",\"Kafka\",\"CQRS\",\"5+ years backend experience\"]', 'The applicant has relevant backend skills including PostgreSQL, AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, and Linux, which partially align with the job requirements. However, the role specifically requires 5+ years of backend engineering experience with Java and/or Kotlin, along with strong knowledge of Kafka and CQRS. The applicant\'s primary backend experience is with Laravel, Node.js, and PHP, and they do not have Java or Kotlin experience listed. The match is moderate for general backend engineering but weak for the specific tech stack required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer - Fiscalization role at SumUp. Your work in building compliant, scalable POS solutions for small businesses across Europe is something I find genuinely interesting, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to the Fiscalization team\'s mission.\n\nMy professional experience centers on backend development, API design, and building secure, reliable systems. I have worked extensively with PostgreSQL, AWS, Docker, and Linux servers, and I have designed role-based access control, integrated third-party services, and built real-time features using WebSockets. I also have practical experience with Kubernetes for container orchestration and deployment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building integrations with external services and ensuring data integrity across distributed systems. In my previous work, I developed RESTful APIs and optimized database performance using indexing and caching strategies. I have also deployed and maintained applications on AWS EC2 with Nginx and Docker, and I am comfortable working with CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 13:42:12.163', '2026-06-21 13:42:12.163'),
