(1330, 1331, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"Führungsverständnis (leadership understanding)\",\"German language fluency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax advisor) with expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax audits, and client communication. The applicant\'s digital skills are not directly relevant to the core responsibilities of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong digital expertise and a systematic approach to problem-solving that aligns with your emphasis on digital workflows and modern working environments.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained secure, scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and cloud infrastructure. I have implemented role-based access control, authentication systems, and payment integrations, all of which require a careful, precise, and security-conscious mindset. These skills translate directly to supporting a digitally advanced tax firm where accuracy and reliability are essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a firm that values digital processes and modern equipment. I have hands-on experience deploying applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable working with cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud. I am confident I can contribute to maintaining and improving the digital infrastructure of your partner firm.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-21 13:42:31.028', '2026-06-21 13:42:31.028'),
(1331, 1332, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax consultant exam)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Tax law knowledge\",\"Financial accounting\",\"Team leadership\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in tax consulting, accounting, or German tax law. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax consultant) with a completed tax consultant exam, which the applicant does not have. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Idar-Oberstein. Although my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong capabilities in digital process design, data integrity, and secure system management that align well with the modern, digitally-driven environment your partner firm offers.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL, focusing on reliable data handling, role-based access control, and secure authentication. These experiences have given me a disciplined approach to accuracy, system reliability, and efficient workflows, which are directly relevant to preparing and reviewing financial statements and tax declarations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on individually selectable responsibilities and a digital working style. I have experience deploying applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx, and I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and processes. My technical background allows me to quickly adapt to new software and optimize workflows for efficiency and precision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, attention to detail, and openness to digital processes would make me a valuable addition to your partner firm. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-21 13:42:40.136', '2026-06-21 13:42:40.136'),
