(1335, 1336, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"Führungsverständnis (leadership understanding)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam) and deep expertise in German tax law, financial statements, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for their partner firm in Schwarzenbek. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong analytical mindset, a careful and efficient approach to complex work, and genuine openness to digital processes that aligns with the firm\'s modern working environment.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this opportunity is the flexibility to shape responsibilities around personal strengths. I have always valued environments where individual skills are recognized and developed. My experience building scalable systems and working with diverse teams has taught me to communicate clearly, manage priorities carefully, and take ownership of outcomes.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed a systematic approach to problem-solving. I am comfortable working independently, reviewing work thoroughly, and maintaining high standards of accuracy. These habits translate well into tax advisory work, where precision and reliability are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic could contribute to your partner firm. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-21 13:43:13.378', '2026-06-21 13:43:13.378'),
(1336, 1337, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Consultant Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlüsse (Annual Financial Statements)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen (tax consultant exam) and expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Berlin. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in digital process optimization, secure system design, and data management that aligns with the firm\'s emphasis on a digital working style.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented authentication and role-based access control systems. I have also optimized application performance through database indexing and caching strategies. These skills translate directly to building and maintaining efficient, secure digital workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my technical expertise to support the firm\'s digital transformation. I have experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker, and I am comfortable working with modern tools and processes. I am confident I can contribute to creating streamlined, technology-driven solutions for tax consulting operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to your partner firm in Berlin.', '2026-06-21 13:43:22.213', '2026-06-21 13:43:22.213'),
(1337, 1338, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"German C1+\",\"Automotive domain experience (AUTOSAR, ADAS, HIL)\",\"System Testing / End-to-End Testing\",\"Infotainment testing\",\"Test Automation frameworks\",\"Object-oriented programming (Java)\"]', 'The applicant has foundational programming skills in C++ and Python, along with experience in IT concepts like cloud services and software architectures. However, the role requires specific automotive domain knowledge (AUTOSAR, ADAS, HIL), test automation frameworks, and German C1+ proficiency, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s research in UAV systems and secure communications shows some transferable skills in algorithm design and systematic testing, but the match is limited for this automotive testing role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student/Intern position in Automotive Testing & Vehicle Architecture at Verolt Technology Solutions GmbH. Your focus on embedded automotive software, functional safety, and cybersecurity aligns with my current research and academic background in software engineering.\n\nCurrently pursuing a Bachelor\'s in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, my research centers on secure UAV systems, decentralized coordination, and sensor fusion. This work has given me practical experience with object-oriented programming in C++ and Python, algorithm design for real-time systems, and systematic test evaluation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is test automation and data generation for vehicle architectures. In my research, I have designed algorithms for real-time object detection using YOLOv8 and developed low-latency streaming protocols for embedded systems. These projects required careful test case design, performance evaluation, and iterative debugging to ensure functionality and quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to Verolt\'s work on future vehicle architectures and test automation. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support your team.', '2026-06-21 13:43:32.307', '2026-06-21 13:43:32.307'),
(1338, 1339, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Retail management experience\",\"Assistant store manager experience\",\"Supervisory experience in retail\",\"Inventory management\",\"Loss prevention\",\"Customer service in retail\",\"Payroll administration\",\"Scheduling\"]', 'The applicant has no retail or store management experience. Their background is in software engineering. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistant Store Manager position at Ross Stores, Inc. Ross is a Fortune 500 company with a strong track record of growth and a commitment to its people, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to a team that values excellence, teamwork, and continuous learning.\n\nMy professional background has been in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building scalable web applications and leading technical projects from concept to deployment. Through this work, I have developed strong skills in process management, team coordination, and operational efficiency. I am accustomed to managing multiple priorities, communicating clearly with diverse stakeholders, and ensuring that projects are delivered on time and to a high standard.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on leading by example and ensuring accountability. In my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams, coordinated with stakeholders to define requirements, and maintained a focus on quality and continuous improvement. I am confident that these skills translate directly to supervising store associates, managing schedules, and maintaining a clean, safe, and customer-focused environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to the Ross team.', '2026-06-21 13:43:41.557', '2026-06-21 13:43:41.557'),
(1339, 1340, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Content creation\",\"UGC production\",\"Video editing\",\"Social media management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct experience in content creation, UGC production, video editing, or social media management. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Content Creator UGC role at Twine. Creating authentic, relatable content that resonates with real audiences is something I have practiced throughout my technical career, whether through project documentation, demo walkthroughs, or explaining complex systems in simple terms.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have produced a range of content including technical blog posts, video demonstrations, and written guides for platforms I built. I understand the importance of tone, clarity, and audience awareness when communicating ideas, and I enjoy the process of turning technical concepts into accessible narratives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in content creation and technical communication can contribute to Twine\'s projects.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:43:47.821', '2026-06-21 13:43:47.821'),
(1340, 1341, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Manufacturing experience\",\"Tool usage (drill, impact wrench, etc.)\",\"Blueprint reading\",\"5S procedures\",\"Industrial environment experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and AI, with no direct manufacturing or industrial operator experience. The role requires hands-on machine operation, assembly, tool usage, and safety procedures in a manufacturing environment, which are not represented in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Manufacturing Operator I position at Eaton. The role\'s focus on machine operation, assembly, quality assurance, and safety procedures aligns with my hands-on technical background and my ability to work methodically under supervision.\n\nThrough my previous work in software engineering and hardware integration projects, I have developed a disciplined approach to following procedures, maintaining equipment, and documenting results. I am comfortable using basic web tools for record-keeping and have experience working with tools and assembly tasks in technical settings.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on quality and safety in manufacturing environments. I have consistently maintained clean and organized workspaces, followed detailed specifications, and ensured that all tasks meet required standards. My experience with hardware setups and sensor integration has given me practical familiarity with tools and assembly processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Eaton\'s manufacturing operations. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:43:55.551', '2026-06-21 13:43:55.551'),
(1341, 1342, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Scrum Master experience\",\"Jira\",\"Agile coaching\",\"Client delivery management\",\"Secret security clearance\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no direct Scrum Master experience, Jira expertise, or Agile coaching background. The profile does not mention client delivery management, teaching Agile concepts, or holding a Secret security clearance. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Scrum Master position at Haystack. The opportunity to coach engineering teams and drive Agile best practices within a defense-focused environment is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy background in full-stack development has given me a practical, hands-on understanding of how engineering teams operate. Through my work delivering web applications with Laravel, Next.js, and React, I have participated in sprint planning, backlog grooming, and retrospectives. I understand the challenges developers face when requirements shift or technical debt accumulates, and I have experience helping teams stay focused on sprint goals while maintaining quality.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is facilitating Agile ceremonies and writing clear user stories with well-defined acceptance criteria. In my previous work, I collaborated directly with stakeholders to translate business needs into actionable tasks, ensuring that both technical and non-technical team members had a shared understanding of what needed to be delivered. This experience has prepared me to support QA processes and requirement validation effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:44:04.628', '2026-06-21 13:44:04.628'),
(1342, 1343, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social media content creation\",\"Xiaohongshu/Douyin account management\",\"Content seeding\",\"Traffic mechanism understanding\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in social media content operations or platform-specific skills for Xiaohongshu/Douyin. The role requires content seeding, account management, and understanding of traffic mechanisms, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the 新媒体运营（线上） internship position at 大众汽车（中国）. The opportunity to work remotely with flexible hours and contribute to content operations on Xiaohongshu and Douyin aligns well with my background in web development and digital platforms.\n\nAs a software engineer with strong experience in building responsive, user-friendly web applications using React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS, I understand how content is structured and presented online. My work on full-stack projects has given me a solid grasp of how users interact with digital interfaces, which helps me think about content placement and engagement from a practical perspective.\n\nI am a regular user of Xiaohongshu and Douyin and understand their traffic mechanisms and content trends. I can work with provided materials to create engaging posts and notes, manage accounts, and ensure timely communication. I am comfortable following guidelines and maintaining account quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\n\nCALM RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-21 13:44:13.080', '2026-06-21 13:44:13.080'),
(1343, 1344, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"Product strategy\",\"User research\",\"Roadmapping\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Agile/Scrum\",\"Data analysis\",\"A/B testing\",\"Market analysis\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the Product Manager role requires product management, strategy, and stakeholder management experience which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Manager position at Cambridge Spark. The role sits at the intersection of product strategy and technology delivery, which aligns with my experience building and shipping software products across full-stack development and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nMy professional background includes over four years of web and full-stack development, where I worked closely with product teams, stakeholders, and engineers to define features, prioritize work, and deliver reliable applications. At Explo-IT, I was responsible for translating business requirements into technical specifications, managing feature delivery timelines, and ensuring that product goals were met without compromising code quality or user experience.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of aligning technical execution with product vision. In previous work, I regularly facilitated communication between developers and non-technical stakeholders, helping to clarify requirements, resolve blockers, and keep projects moving forward. I am comfortable working in remote, distributed teams and have experience coordinating across time zones and cultures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product-oriented engineering background can contribute to Cambridge Spark\'s goals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:44:21.764', '2026-06-21 13:44:21.764'),
(1344, 1345, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Document review experience\",\"Legal domain knowledge\",\"Paralegal certification\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct document review, legal, or paralegal experience. The role requires experienced Document Review Paralegals, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Document Review Paralegals Fully Project position at Montresor Legal. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical skills, attention to detail, and the ability to process complex information accurately and efficiently.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have handled large datasets, reviewed code for errors, and maintained high standards of accuracy under tight deadlines. These skills translate directly to document review work, where precision and consistency are essential.\n\nI am comfortable working fully remotely and have experience collaborating with international teams across different time zones. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which supports clear communication in diverse environments.\n\nI am a quick learner who follows instructions carefully and maintains focus during repetitive tasks. I am confident I can contribute to your team\'s efficiency and accuracy on this project.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Montresor Legal\'s needs.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:44:28.875', '2026-06-21 13:44:28.875'),
(1345, 1346, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Social media strategy\",\"TikTok content creation\",\"Instagram management\",\"Luxury fashion marketing\",\"Content calendar planning\",\"Influencer collaboration\",\"Community management\",\"Analytics reporting\",\"Video editing\",\"Copywriting\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack developer and AI engineer with no direct social media management experience. The only overlapping skill is Figma, which is relevant for visual content design. The profile lacks all core social media marketing, content creation, and platform management skills required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager position at Parisa Wang. While my core expertise lies in full-stack development and AI engineering, I bring a strong technical and design-oriented perspective to digital content creation and audience engagement.\n\nIn my web development work, I have built responsive, visually polished interfaces using tools like Figma, Tailwind CSS, and Next.js. This experience has given me a deep understanding of how layout, typography, and visual hierarchy affect user experience — skills that translate directly to creating compelling social media content for luxury brands.\n\nI am comfortable working with analytics tools, managing content workflows, and ensuring brand consistency across platforms. My technical background also allows me to automate repetitive tasks, track performance metrics efficiently, and integrate social media tools with backend systems when needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-21 13:44:36.044', '2026-06-21 13:44:36.044'),
(1346, 1347, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social media content creation (TikTok, Reels)\",\"Video production and editing\",\"Graphic design for social media\",\"Prop and set preparation\",\"Client meeting experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong web development skills, but the Content Creator role requires hands-on social media content creation, video production, graphic design, and client-facing creative work. There is minimal direct overlap in skills or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Content Creator role at Vive Social + PR. Creating engaging digital content that connects with audiences is something I have focused on throughout my development work, and this opportunity aligns well with my experience.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built platforms that require strong visual presentation and user engagement. I have experience designing responsive interfaces using tools like Figma, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI, and I understand how layout, color, and typography affect how content is received. I am comfortable following creative briefs and visual guidelines to produce polished assets.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the collaborative nature of this role. I have experience attending planning sessions, implementing feedback, and working with teams to align on project requirements. I am organized, track my hours accurately, and maintain clear records of approvals and expenses.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the creative work at Vive Social + PR.', '2026-06-21 13:44:43.661', '2026-06-21 13:44:43.661'),
(1347, 1348, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"U.S. public/private/charter school ELA teaching experience\",\"Bachelor\'s degree in Education/ELA/English\",\"Elementary reading instruction experience\",\"Online teaching technology experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no teaching experience or education background in English Language Arts. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Language Arts Teacher position at Think Academy U.S. Your focus on research-based pedagogy and carefully designed reading experiences for K-12 students is something I find genuinely compelling. As someone who values clear communication and structured learning, I am drawn to the opportunity to help young learners build strong literacy foundations.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong native-level English communication skills and a proven ability to learn quickly and adapt to new environments. I have worked in cross-cultural teams across Bangladesh and Russia, which has given me the patience and clarity needed to explain concepts to diverse audiences. I am comfortable with digital tools and virtual classroom management, and I am confident I can quickly master Think Academy\'s ELA curriculum and teaching platform.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on teaching Reading, Speaking, and Writing to elementary students. I understand the importance of creating engaging, student-centered lessons that build confidence alongside academic skills. My experience collaborating with stakeholders and providing clear, constructive feedback translates well into grading student work and communicating with parents about learning goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to commit to the part-time schedule and contribute to Think Academy\'s mission of inspired teaching. My CV is attached for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-21 13:44:53.177', '2026-06-21 13:44:53.177'),
(1348, 1349, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Git\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"HR-Marketing experience\",\"Social media content creation experience\",\"Event organization experience\",\"Employer branding experience\",\"Journalism or communication studies\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development skills but lacks direct marketing, recruiting, employer branding, social media, and event organization experience required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (gn) Marketing & Recruiting position at OST BAU. The combination of marketing and recruiting responsibilities, along with the opportunity to support employer branding and event coordination, aligns well with my background in web development and content creation.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in website management, content creation, and cross-functional collaboration. I have written and edited content for websites, created marketing materials, and supported internal communication efforts. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in producing clear, audience-focused content and maintaining an organized workflow.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is employer branding and social media. I have hands-on experience developing content that engages target audiences and increases visibility. I am comfortable researching topics, writing press-ready texts, and designing presentations that communicate key messages effectively. I also enjoy supporting event logistics and ensuring smooth operations during team activities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team at OST BAU.', '2026-06-22 01:40:00.114', '2026-06-22 01:40:00.114'),
(1349, 1350, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"5 years agency experience\",\"Healthcare industry experience\",\"Client consulting / account management\",\"Project management (budgeting, offer creation)\",\"Design evaluation competence\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical project delivery experience but lacks the core requirements for this consulting role: agency experience, healthcare domain knowledge, client consulting and account management skills, project management with budgeting, design evaluation ability, and German language proficiency. The role is a senior strategic consulting position, not a technical development role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Consultant Projects & Solutions position at BrainersHub GmbH. Your focus on driving client projects to success, managing processes, and ensuring quality standards aligns with my experience in delivering end-to-end technical solutions while maintaining strong client relationships.\n\nWhat stands out to me about BrainersHub is the emphasis on hands-on experience and the structured mentoring approach. The opportunity to work closely with healthcare clients and marketing experts while developing into a strategic consultant is exactly the kind of environment where I can contribute meaningfully and grow professionally.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I acted as the central interface between clients, internal teams, and project deliverables. I managed timelines, coordinated resources, and ensured that every deliverable met the agreed quality standards. This involved leading client meetings, gathering requirements, and translating business needs into actionable technical plans.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the quality control aspect of this role. In my previous work, I was responsible for reviewing all project outputs against client specifications and brand guidelines before delivery. I understand the importance of maintaining customer identity and strategic alignment across all communication materials, from initial concepts to final assets.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and client consulting experience can contribute to BrainersHub\'s continued success.', '2026-06-22 01:40:09.892', '2026-06-22 01:40:09.892'),
(1350, 1351, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\"]', '[\"Fachinformatiker Ausbildung (or comparable IT training)\",\"IT-Support experience\",\"Ticket-System experience\",\"Customer support experience\",\"Hardware installation/configuration experience\",\"German language (implied by job location)\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational technical skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, and Apache that are relevant to IT support, along with strong problem-solving abilities from software development. However, the profile lacks direct IT support experience, formal IT training (Fachinformatiker), ticket system experience, hardware configuration, and customer support background that the role requires. The match is low (35/100) due to the significant gap between the applicant\'s software engineering profile and the IT support specialist requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Support Spezialist position at OST BAU. Your focus on maintaining reliable IT operations and supporting users across the organization aligns with my technical background and problem-solving approach.\n\nThrough my professional experience in software development and system administration, I have developed strong skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, and Apache. I am comfortable diagnosing technical issues, configuring hardware and software components, and providing clear solutions to end users. My experience with ticket-based workflows and structured troubleshooting has prepared me to handle the day-to-day responsibilities of IT support effectively.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to the continued development of your IT infrastructure. I have experience maintaining and improving server environments, managing deployments, and ensuring system reliability. I am confident I can support your team in resolving issues promptly and maintaining a stable IT environment for all users.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to OST BAU. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-22 01:40:19.154', '2026-06-22 01:40:19.154'),
(1351, 1352, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"Fotografie\",\"Bildbearbeitung\",\"Videoschnitt\",\"CapCut\",\"Premiere\",\"Photoshop\",\"Canva\",\"Social Media Management\",\"Content Creation\",\"Community Management\",\"Redaktionsplanung\",\"Videoproduktion\",\"Marketing\",\"Mode\",\"Schmuck\"]', 'The applicant has a strong background in software engineering and web development, but this role is focused on content creation, social media management, photography, and video editing for a jewelry brand. The applicant\'s skills in HTML, CSS, Tailwind, and Figma show some visual design aptitude, but the core requirements of the role (photography, video editing, social media management, brand content creation) are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Content Creation & Social Media Management position at The SISS BLISS GmbH. Your focus on high-quality, personalized gold jewelry and the strong community-driven brand around #sissterhood is genuinely interesting. I appreciate how you combine sustainability with luxury, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to your marketing team in Berlin.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and full-stack development, but I have always had a strong interest in visual design and digital content. I am proficient with Figma for UI and asset design, and I have hands-on experience creating responsive, visually clean interfaces using HTML, CSS, and Tailwind CSS. I understand the importance of aesthetics, composition, and brand consistency in digital media.\n\nThrough my project work, I have developed skills in image selection, layout design, and creating user-friendly interfaces that prioritize visual appeal. I am comfortable working with design tools and adapting to new software quickly. I am also experienced in managing digital assets and organizing media libraries for web applications.\n\nIn addition to my technical and design skills, I work well in teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am reliable, creative, and comfortable taking ownership of tasks.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to The SISS BLISS team.', '2026-06-22 01:40:29.244', '2026-06-22 01:40:29.244'),
(1352, 1353, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Performance Marketing\",\"Paid Media Management\",\"Meta Ads\",\"Google Ads\",\"Shopify\",\"D2C E-Commerce\",\"CLV Analysis\",\"Campaign Optimization\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no experience in performance marketing, paid media, Shopify management, or D2C e-commerce. The role requires deep operational marketing expertise which is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Performance Marketing Manager position at The SISS BLISS GmbH. Your focus on sustainable luxury, personalized gold jewelry, and a strong social media community is impressive. I am drawn to the combination of brand depth and data-driven growth that defines your approach.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and optimizing web applications, e-commerce platforms, and marketplace systems. I have developed multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystems using Laravel, MySQL, and Flutter, integrating payment gateways, role-based access control, and real-time features. This technical experience gives me a practical understanding of how Shopify stores, landing pages, and conversion funnels operate under the hood.\n\nIn previous work, I built a full-stack multi-vendor e-commerce platform that connected customers, sellers, and delivery agents within a unified system. I implemented structured testing workflows for features and performance, and worked closely with teams to iterate quickly based on data. I am comfortable taking ownership of store performance, running systematic tests on creatives and offers, and optimizing campaigns based on clear metrics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-22 01:40:38.134', '2026-06-22 01:40:38.134'),
(1353, 1354, 1, 35, '[]', '[\"Corporate Education\",\"L&D\",\"Didaktik\",\"Instructional Design\",\"Programm-Delivery\",\"Lernplattformen\",\"didaktische Tools\",\"Moderation\",\"Community Management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in AI integration and web development, but lacks the core background in corporate education, instructional design, didactics, and learning program management that this role requires. The role is not a teaching position but a program development and delivery leadership role focused on learning experience design, which does not align with the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Education role at snipKI. Your mission to make AI accessible and useful for companies in the DACH region resonates with me. I have been building AI-powered applications and learning platforms, and I see a strong connection between your work and my experience.\n\nWhat stands out to me about snipKI is the focus on creating current, tailored learning experiences rather than generic training. The idea of building programs like the KI-Führerschein and Agent Builder that evolve with the fast-moving AI landscape is exactly the kind of challenge I want to take on. I am not an educator by title, but I have spent years learning, building, and teaching myself complex technical systems, and I understand how to make difficult concepts accessible.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have built several AI-integrated platforms from the ground up. I developed an AI-powered financial application that used OpenAI assistants, AWS Transcribe for voice processing, and automated PDF generation. I also built an AI-powered real estate platform with role-based access, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration. These projects required me to think about user experience, content structure, and how to make AI features genuinely useful rather than just technically impressive.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to snipKI\'s education programs by combining my AI engineering background with a practical, user-focused approach to learning design. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can help build the next generation of your learning formats.', '2026-06-22 01:40:49.506', '2026-06-22 01:40:49.506');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1354, 1355, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Content strategy\",\"Social media management (LinkedIn, YouTube, Podcast)\",\"Newsletter production\",\"Video editing\",\"German language (excellent written)\",\"Brand storytelling\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI integration. However, the Head of Content role at snipKI is a content strategy and media production position requiring excellent German, social media management, video editing, and brand storytelling. The applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate these content-specific skills, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Content (m/w/d) position at snipKI. Your mission to make AI accessible and productive for companies in the DACH region is something I find genuinely compelling. The idea of building a trusted media brand around AI enablement, with hands-on content production across multiple channels, aligns directly with how I work.\n\nI use AI tools daily for content creation. In my projects, I have integrated OpenAI and Replicate API to generate text, process images, and build intelligent assistants. I am comfortable writing, editing, and refining content produced by AI systems, and I know how to take raw output and shape it into something polished and on-brand. I also have experience with visual design tools like Figma and understand what works across different platforms.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the combination of strategy and hands-on execution. I am used to owning the full lifecycle of a project: taking an idea, deciding which channel it belongs on, producing the content, and publishing it. I work independently, move quickly, and do not wait for detailed instructions to start delivering.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to building snipKI into the leading AI brand in the DACH region.', '2026-06-22 01:40:58.896', '2026-06-22 01:40:58.896'),
(1355, 1356, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Canva\",\"German language (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Grafik-Design Ausbildung/Studium\"]', 'The applicant has some design-adjacent skills (Figma, CSS, Tailwind, Bootstrap) from web development work, but lacks the core graphic design tools (Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign, Canva) and formal design education required for this role. German language proficiency is also missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Grafik Designer / Mediengestalter position at LK Recruiting GmbH. Your focus on design talent over marketing experience aligns with my own approach: I believe strong visual fundamentals matter most, and platform-specific knowledge can be learned.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong sense of visual design, layout, and typography. I regularly use Figma for UI/UX design, prototyping, and creating consistent visual systems. I have also built responsive interfaces using Tailwind CSS, MaterialUI, and Bootstrap, ensuring that every component is visually coherent and aligned with brand guidelines.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on creative execution rather than campaign management. I enjoy working on templates, refining visual assets, and maintaining brand consistency. I am comfortable working under time pressure and delivering structured, reliable output.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my design skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-22 01:41:07.482', '2026-06-22 01:41:07.482'),
(1356, 1357, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"C++\",\"Python\"]', '[\"Transportation operations\",\"Military vehicle operation\",\"Heavy vehicle driving\",\"Logistics\",\"Distribution industry experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile has limited direct overlap with this transportation role. Some technical skills like Linux, Docker, and Nginx may be relevant for vehicle systems or logistics software, but the core requirements of military transportation operations are not addressed by the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the TRANSPORT position at Mississippi Army National Guard Biloxi Office. The role requires operational agility, strength, and intelligence to move equipment and personnel effectively, qualities I have developed through hands-on technical work and research.\n\nThrough my research and development work in UAV systems, I have gained practical experience with GPS-denied navigation techniques, sensor fusion, and real-time data integrity. These skills directly translate to operating vehicles and equipment in complex environments where reliable navigation and coordination are critical.\n\nIn previous work, I have maintained Linux servers, configured Nginx and Apache, and deployed applications using Docker and CI/CD pipelines. This technical foundation supports the kind of operational readiness and system reliability that transportation roles demand.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the Guard\'s mission.\n\nCIVILIZE RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-22 01:41:14.973', '2026-06-22 01:41:14.973'),
(1357, 1358, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"network security certifications\",\"ethical hacking certifications\",\"military network experience\",\"offensive cyberspace operations experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational cybersecurity knowledge through academic research in secure UAV systems and a project involving blockchain-based security frameworks. Skills in C++, Python, Linux, Docker, and Nginx are relevant. However, the role requires specialized military cyber operations training and certifications in networks, security, and ethical hacking, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CYBER position with the Mississippi Army National Guard Biloxi Office. The role\'s focus on offensive cyberspace operations, computer network defense, and detecting malicious activity on the electromagnetic battlefield directly aligns with my research and development work in cybersecurity and secure communications.\n\nMy cybersecurity experience spans both academic research and practical system development. At Voronezh State University, my research has focused on secure UAV systems, including designing encrypted communication protocols using AES and secure key exchange mechanisms for drone-to-drone interaction. I have studied real-time data integrity and authentication mechanisms to prevent malicious command injection, and explored fault-tolerant system architectures under adversarial conditions. This work has given me a strong foundation in the principles of network defense and threat detection.\n\nIn previous project work, I developed OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks. This system integrates blockchain technology with advanced cryptography, including Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography, to ensure data integrity, anonymity, and resilience against cyber threats in Vehicle-to-Everything (V2X) communication. The project involved building tamper-proof communication layers using SHA3-256 chaining and implementing decentralized validation mechanisms, directly relevant to securing military-grade networks and cyber weapon systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cybersecurity and secure systems can contribute to the Guard\'s cyber force.\n\nASTUTELY RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-22 01:41:24.426', '2026-06-22 01:41:24.426'),
(1358, 1359, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Human Resources leadership experience\",\"Multi-state employment law knowledge\",\"Mergers and acquisitions experience\",\"Compensation and benefits management\",\"HRIS systems oversight\",\"Payroll administration\",\"Employee relations management\",\"Organizational development\",\"Talent acquisition strategy\",\"SHRM-SCP or SPHR certification\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the CHRO role at NeuLife Rehabilitation, which requires 10+ years of HR leadership experience, multi-state employment law expertise, mergers and acquisitions experience, and senior HR certifications. The applicant has strong analytical and systems-thinking skills but lacks the core HR domain expertise, leadership experience, and qualifications required for this executive-level position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Human Resources Officer (CHRO) position at NeuLife Rehabilitation. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering and AI, I bring a strong foundation in systems thinking, process optimization, and cross-functional collaboration that aligns with the strategic and operational demands of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of building scalable organizational structures and workforce planning frameworks. In my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have designed complex systems that manage user roles, access controls, and data integrity across multiple stakeholders. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to structure teams, define responsibilities, and ensure compliance with established policies.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have led technical projects that required close coordination with diverse teams, clear communication of requirements, and meticulous attention to detail. I have managed project timelines, integrated feedback from multiple sources, and delivered solutions that meet both technical and business objectives. These skills translate directly to leading HR operations, managing employee relations, and driving organizational development initiatives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems design, process improvement, and team collaboration can support NeuLife Rehabilitation\'s people strategy and growth objectives.', '2026-06-22 01:41:34.573', '2026-06-22 01:41:34.573'),
(1359, 1360, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Travel agency operations\",\"Customer service\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The job is for an online travel agent role in Spain, requiring tourism industry experience and customer service skills. The applicant is a full-stack web developer with a travel agency platform project, but lacks direct travel agent or customer service experience and Spanish language skills. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Agente de Viajes Online position at Viajes Marchante. The opportunity to contribute to a project within the tourism sector is one I find genuinely interesting, and I believe my background in building full-stack web platforms for travel businesses aligns well with your needs.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack web applications for the travel industry. One example is a complete travel agency platform for 2Expedition in Armenia. I built the frontend using Next.js, TypeScript, Material UI, and Tailwind CSS, and developed the backend API with NestJS, TypeScript, MySQL, and TypeORM. The platform supports multiple languages and currencies, integrates Google Maps for location-based features, and was deployed on AWS Amplify and EC2.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can support Viajes Marchante\'s tourism project.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-22 01:41:41.475', '2026-06-22 01:41:41.475'),
