and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the Twine team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-22 01:41:48.539', '2026-06-22 01:41:48.539'),
(1361, 1362, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Accounting\",\"Finance\",\"Human Resources\",\"Legal\",\"Marketing\",\"Sales\",\"Operations\",\"Postal Affairs\",\"Research Services\",\"Client Services\",\"Business Intelligence\"]', 'The job posting is a general corporate careers page for Valpak of Southeastern Wisconsin, listing multiple divisions (Accounting, ITSS, Marketing, etc.) without specifying a particular role. The applicant has strong technical skills relevant to the ITSS division, including full-stack development, cloud deployment, and system administration. However, the broad corporate nature of the posting means many required skills (accounting, finance, HR, legal, sales, marketing) are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate for ITSS-related roles but low for other corporate divisions.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Valpak of Southeastern Wisconsin in a corporate capacity. Your organization\'s commitment to empowering local businesses and communities through trusted connections resonates with my own approach to building technology that serves real people and solves practical problems.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have spent over four years building and maintaining full-stack web applications. My technical foundation includes Laravel and PHP for backend development, Next.js and React for frontend interfaces, and MySQL and PostgreSQL for database management. I have worked extensively with RESTful APIs, authentication systems, role-based access control, and payment gateway integrations in production environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the ITSS division at Valpak. In my previous roles, I deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD pipelines. I have experience with cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud, and I have implemented real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO. I also worked on server monitoring and health tracking systems that provided live metrics and alerts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background can contribute to Valpak\'s corporate operations and IT initiatives.', '2026-06-22 01:41:59.179', '2026-06-22 01:41:59.179'),
(1362, 1363, 1, 30, '[\"SQL\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"AI tools\"]', '[\"Power BI\",\"Snowflake\",\"dbt\",\"Fivetran\",\"DAX\",\"data warehousing\",\"ELT patterns\",\"2+ years as data analyst\"]', 'The applicant has foundational SQL and database skills with experience in MySQL, PostgreSQL, and cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud). However, the role requires specialized data warehousing tools (Power BI, Snowflake, dbt, Fivetran) and dedicated data analyst/BI experience, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Analyst Data Warehouse Analytics and BI role at OWL Services. Your work in building a modern data platform that drives company-wide reporting across operations, finance, dispatch, and inventory is exactly the kind of environment where I can contribute effectively.\n\nMy technical foundation includes strong SQL skills, experience with relational databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, and familiarity with cloud data platforms including AWS and Google Cloud. I have written and optimized complex queries involving CTEs, window functions, and performance tuning across large datasets. I also have hands-on experience using AI tools to accelerate analytics work, including model development and documentation.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on reconciling disparate source systems and producing a harmonized view across multiple ERPs. In my previous work, I regularly worked with varied data sources, built data models, and ensured consistency across different schemas. I am comfortable digging into messy data, identifying anomalies, and turning it into something trustworthy for business stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your Data Warehouse and BI team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-22 01:42:07.611', '2026-06-22 01:42:07.611'),
