ecuting color correction work. I am detail-oriented and accustomed to delivering high-quality results under tight deadlines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-22 01:42:15.188', '2026-06-22 01:42:15.188'),
(1364, 1365, 1, 45, '[\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Project management software experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong organizational and coordination skills from technical project work, but lacks direct administrative or project management experience. Good potential for growth into the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Remote Project Assistant position at Talentoma. The role\'s focus on supporting project teams with coordination, documentation, and milestone tracking aligns well with my experience in managing workflows and deliverables across technical projects.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated with project managers and team members to track deadlines, maintain project documentation, and prepare status reports. I supported administrative tasks such as scheduling meetings, organizing files, and ensuring clear communication between stakeholders. This hands-on involvement in project operations has given me a practical understanding of what it takes to keep teams aligned and on schedule.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to grow into project management. I am comfortable using project management software and have experience working in fully remote environments, where clear communication and self-discipline are essential. I am confident I can contribute to Talentoma\'s project teams from day one while developing further in this field.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowled