(1365, 1366, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"Phone communication skills\"]', 'The applicant has strong computer proficiency, self-motivation, and independent work habits, but lacks direct customer support experience mentioned in the job description. The role is entry-level with no prior experience required, making the applicant a reasonable candidate.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Remote Associate position at RG&T Solutions. This part-time remote opportunity aligns well with my background in independent project work and my ability to communicate clearly and manage tasks efficiently.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong self-discipline and organizational habits. I am comfortable working independently, managing my time across multiple responsibilities, and maintaining accurate records of my work. These skills transfer directly to providing reliable customer support and following company guidelines.\n\nI am proficient with computers and internet-based tools, which allows me to quickly adapt to new systems and workflows. I am also eager to participate in training sessions to build the specific skills needed for this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in this opportunity because it offers flexible remote work and the chance to gain valuable experience in a supportive team setting. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibil