(1368, 1369, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"UX research\",\"Usability testing\",\"A/B testing\",\"Interaction design\",\"Information architecture\",\"Adobe Creative Cloud\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in HTML, CSS, Figma, and Tailwind CSS, which are relevant to the UI implementation side of the role. However, the core UX/UI design competencies required for this senior position—such as UX research, usability testing, A/B testing, interaction design, information architecture, and Adobe Creative Cloud—are not present in the profile. The role also requires German language proficiency, which is not listed. The match is low for this specialized design role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior UX/UI Designer / Product Designer role at ALL4GOLF Golfversand Hannover GmbH. Your focus on creating intuitive, data-informed shopping experiences for golfers aligns with how I approach design: understanding user behavior, identifying friction points, and building interfaces that feel natural to use.\n\nThrough my work on full-stack web applications, I have developed a practical understanding of UX/UI design principles. I regularly use Figma to create wireframes, interactive prototypes, and component-based design systems. I am comfortable working with auto layout, variants, and prototyping to communicate interaction concepts clearly before development begins.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is optimizing conversion-focused flows like navigation, product pages, and checkout. In previous projects, I have built responsive e-commerce interfaces where I focused on simplifying user journeys and improving the overall shopping experience