(1489, 1491, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"HubSpot\",\"Revenue Operations\",\"Sales Operations\",\"CRM\",\"GTM\",\"Product-Led Growth\",\"PQL\",\"Customer Lifecycle Management\",\"Make\",\"Zapier\",\"n8n\",\"SQL\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in automation, databases, and system integration, but lacks direct experience in Revenue Operations, HubSpot, CRM management, and the specific GTM processes required for this role. The match is low due to the specialized nature of the position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Revenue Operations Manager role at clockin GmbH. The opportunity to build and optimize the operational backbone of a growing SaaS company aligns well with my technical background and problem-solving approach.\n\nMy experience as a full-stack developer has given me a strong foundation in automation, data integrity, and system integration. I have designed and implemented automated workflows, built RESTful APIs, and worked extensively with databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL. I understand the importance of clean, reliable data and have established data hygiene routines in previous projects to ensure consistency and trustworthiness in reporting.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a real-time server health monitoring dashboard. I built a system that streams live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO, with role-based access control and a fully Dockerized production setup. This project required careful attention to data quality, automated alerting, and scalable architecture, all of which are directly applicable to managing HubSpot pipelines, workflows, and dashb