(1490, 1492, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\"]', '[\"Mediengestaltung\",\"Medientechnik\",\"AV-Technik\",\"Veranstaltungstechnik\",\"Grafik- und Layout-Systeme\",\"Video- und Content-Management-Systeme\",\"Streaming-Formate\",\"LED-Wände\",\"Signalwege\",\"Displays\",\"Zuspieltechnik\",\"digitale Medienformate\",\"Printmedien\",\"Kundenberatung\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational technical skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Linux, Docker) that are relevant to digital media work, but lacks the core qualifications in mediengestaltung, medientechnik, AV systems, and event technology that this role requires. The role is 50% media design and 50% media technology, which does not align with the applicant\'s primary background in full-stack web development and AI engineering. German language skills are also required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mediengestalter & Medientechniker position at SIGMA System Audio-Visuell GmbH. Your work as a full-service provider for audiovisual solutions in conference rooms, event spaces, and working environments is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your team in Düsseldorf.\n\nThrough my professional experience in web development, I have gained solid skills in creating, editing, and preparing digital media for various output formats. I am comfortable working with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and content management systems to adapt content for displays, LED walls, and other digital media. I also have experience reviewing customer content for format, resolution, readability, and technical feasibility before deployment.\n\nIn previous roles, I have supported the technical setup and maintenance of digital systems, including testing, troubleshooting, and performing service tasks. I am familiar with managing playlists, updating content across platforms, and documenting technical changes. My experience with Linux servers, Docker, and monitoring tools has given me a practical understanding of maintaining reliable system operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 01:42:44.457', '2026-06-24 01:42:44.457'),
