My experience with Linux server administration, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines also supports the technical coordination aspects of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team\'s security coordination efforts.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 01:43:31.781', '2026-06-24 01:43:31.781'),
