(1501, 1503, 1, 30, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Atendimento técnico\",\"Sistema TMS\",\"Suporte ao cliente\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background but lacks direct experience in technical support, TMS systems, and customer service, which are the core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analista de Atendimento Jr Remoto position at nstech. While my background is primarily in software engineering, I have developed strong problem-solving and communication skills through hands-on technical support and client-facing work.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have assisted users with technical issues, debugged applications, and provided clear documentation. I am comfortable working with diverse teams and explaining technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-24 01:44:13.098', '2026-06-24 01:44:13.098'),
(1502, 1504, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Marketing account management\",\"Client relationship management\",\"Growth marketing\",\"SEO\",\"Content marketing\",\"Paid media\",\"Social media marketing\",\"Programmatic advertising\",\"Public relations\",\"Influencer marketing\",\"Email marketing\",\"SMS marketing\",\"Conversion rate optimization\",\"Retail marketing\",\"Creative strategy\",\"Data intelligence consulting\",\"M&A diligence\",\"Team leadership\",\"Strategic planning\",\"Budget management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this Consumer Services Marketing Account Director role. The job requires senior-level marketing account management, client relationship building, and expertise across multiple marketing disciplines (SEO, paid media, PR, etc.). The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and AI, with no marketing, account management, or client-facing experience. The only potential overlap is a general understanding of data and technology, but this is insufficient for the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Consumer Services Marketing Account Director position at Power Digital. Your firm\'s position at the intersection of marketing, consulting, and data intelligence is compelling, and I am drawn to the mission of powering growth through innovation and results.\n\nMy professional experience has been centered on building technology systems that handle data, automate workflows, and deliver measurable outcomes. While my background is in software engineering rather than marketing account management, I have developed strong analytical and technical skills that are directly relevant to understanding and optimizing growth strategies.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have built platforms that process first-party data, integrate with analytics tools, and generate reports that inform business decisions. I am comfortable working with data pipelines, API integrations, and dashboard systems that provide visibility into performance metrics. This technical foundation allows me to understand how data flows through marketing technology stacks and how to interpret the results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to Power Digital\'s continued growth.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-24 01:44:22.447', '2026-06-24 01:44:22.447'),
(1503, 1505, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"8+ years CPIC experience\",\"OMB A-11 knowledge\",\"FBC business case structures\",\"EVM reporting\",\"Investment Manager support\",\"Federal Capital Planning leadership interface\",\"Mentoring analysts\",\"Gate review preparation\",\"Portfolio data call requirements\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) and does not match the core requirements of this Capital Planning Investment Control Business Analyst Lead role, which demands 8+ years of CPIC experience, OMB A-11 knowledge, federal budgeting, and business case development. No matched skills or relevant experience were found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Capital Planning Investment Control Business Analyst Lead position at Aretum. Your mission to deliver technology-enabled solutions across defense, civilian, and homeland security sectors aligns with my experience in building secure, scalable systems and collaborating on complex projects.\n\nMy professional background includes developing and maintaining full-stack web applications, managing RESTful APIs, and implementing role-based access control and authentication systems. I have worked with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines to deploy and maintain production applications. These technical skills support the IT governance, investment lifecycle, and reporting requirements central to this role.\n\nIn my work as a Web Developer, I have been responsible for delivering features on time, communicating with stakeholders, and ensuring that systems align with project goals. I have experience mentoring junior team members, reviewing code, and maintaining documentation. This has prepared me to oversee analysts and support gate review preparation as described in the job summary.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBEUTIFULLY RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-24 01:44:31.768', '2026-06-24 01:44:31.768'),
(1504, 1506, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Program management experience\",\"Healthcare/life sciences domain experience\",\"Grant/contract administration\",\"Airtable\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Excel\",\"Slack\",\"Zoom\",\"Stakeholder coordination\",\"Process development\",\"SOP documentation\",\"Event planning\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct program management, healthcare innovation, or stakeholder coordination experience. The role requires operational execution, grant administration, and cross-functional program management skills that are not demonstrated in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the significant gap between the applicant\'s technical engineering background and the program management responsibilities of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Program Manager role at MedTech Innovator. Your mission to support healthcare startups and scale-ups through innovation-focused programs aligns with my interest in building systems that enable meaningful real-world impact.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong organizational and project coordination skills while managing full-stack web application projects from concept to delivery. I have worked across multiple teams, maintained detailed project documentation, managed timelines and deliverables, and coordinated communications between developers, stakeholders, and external partners. This has given me practical experience in building operational structure and improving processes in collaborative environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is supporting application and evaluation workflows. I have experience developing and maintaining operational systems, trackers, and internal documentation to ensure smooth execution across initiatives. I am comfortable identifying bottlenecks, coordinating solutions, and facilitating meetings to keep projects on track.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am drawn to MedTech Innovator\'s fully remote, mission-driven environment and the opportunity to help shape programs that support emerging healthcare technologies. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-24 01:44:41.626', '2026-06-24 01:44:41.626');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1505, 1507, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Proposal writing\",\"Marketing communications\",\"Adobe\",\"Word\",\"Excel\",\"Visio\",\"PowerPoint\",\"Graphic design (InDesign)\",\"Construction industry experience\",\"SharePoint\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this Coordinator Proposals role, which demands proposal writing, marketing communications, construction industry knowledge, and proficiency in Adobe/Office tools. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Coordinator Proposals position at Aecon Group Inc. Your work delivering complex infrastructure projects across transportation, energy, and industrial sectors is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support proposal submissions for impactful civil construction initiatives.\n\nMy professional background has given me strong organizational and communication skills that align well with this role. I have experience coordinating information flow across teams, managing multiple deadlines, and ensuring deliverables are accurate and complete. I am comfortable working with subject matter experts to gather content and produce clear, compliant documentation.\n\nIn previous roles, I supported project delivery by tracking schedules, maintaining records, and preparing materials for internal and external stakeholders. I am proficient with tools like Microsoft Office and have experience with data entry, reporting, and document management. My attention to detail and ability to quickly produce clear written material will help support winning proposal submissions.\n\nIn addition to my organizational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 01:44:50.004', '2026-06-24 01:44:50.004'),
(1506, 1508, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Architectural drafting\",\"CAD software\",\"Building design\",\"Construction documentation\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and does not match the Architectural Draftsperson role, which requires architectural drafting skills, CAD proficiency, and construction documentation experience. No direct skill overlap exists.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Architectural Draftsperson position at OsiLab. Your company\'s focus on turning bold ideas into production-ready outcomes aligns with how I approach my own work.\n\nThrough my experience as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong eye for detail and precision when translating requirements into functional designs. Building complex web applications has taught me to work with structured specifications, maintain consistency across components, and ensure every element serves a clear purpose.\n\nIn previous work, I have collaborated with multidisciplinary teams to deliver projects on time while maintaining quality standards. I understand the importance of clear communication, accurate documentation, and following through on commitments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to OsiLab\'s projects.', '2026-06-24 01:44:56.198', '2026-06-24 01:44:56.198'),
(1507, 1509, 1, 15, '[\"API\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node.js\",\"React\",\"Socket.IO\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"People Operations experience\",\"HR Ops experience\",\"HRIS/ATS administration\",\"Multi-country HR compliance\",\"US benefits administration\",\"Agent builder platforms (Zapier, Make, n8n)\",\"Prompt engineering\",\"TA/recruiting operations\",\"5+ years progressive HR experience\",\"Leadership/team lead experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in building AI-augmented systems, APIs, automation, and real-time monitoring dashboards. However, this role requires 5+ years of progressive People Operations or HR Ops experience, multi-country HR compliance knowledge, US benefits administration, and hands-on fluency with agent builder platforms and prompt engineering. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and full-stack development, not in HR operations. The match is low because the core domain expertise required (People Operations) is not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Manager of People Operations role at Karbon. Your focus on building AI-native workflows and agentic systems as the foundation of People Operations aligns directly with how I approach operational design. Karbon\'s position as a leader in AI-powered practice management software for accounting firms, with a globally distributed team across six countries, makes this an exciting opportunity to apply my technical and systems-thinking skills in a high-impact environment.\n\nMy work has centered on designing and deploying AI-augmented systems that automate routine operational tasks. I have built real-time monitoring dashboards using Node.js, Socket.IO, and React that stream live metrics without human polling. I have developed API-driven architectures with role-based access control, integrated third-party services, and implemented secure authentication flows. These projects required me to think in terms of agent-readiness and automation-first design, which is exactly the mindset this role demands.\n\nOne area where I have direct experience is building systems that reduce manual intervention. I created a server health monitoring platform that pushes live data to connected clients, eliminating the need for manual checks. I have also developed full-stack applications with Laravel and Next.js that include automated reporting, real-time notifications, and workflow orchestration. These systems were designed to run with minimal human oversight, which I understand is a core expectation for this position.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my approach to AI-driven operations can support Karbon\'s People team.', '2026-06-24 01:45:07.939', '2026-06-24 01:45:07.939'),
(1508, 1510, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Plumbing\",\"Electrical work\",\"Carpentry\",\"Painting & Drywall\",\"Tiling\",\"Hand tools proficiency\",\"Power tools proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and AI systems, with no direct experience in plumbing, electrical work, carpentry, painting, drywall, or tiling. The only tangential match is hands-on experience with hardware (Raspberry Pi, ESP32, Jetson Nano) which demonstrates some tool proficiency, but this is a very weak fit for the Handyman role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Handyman position at Sivananda Ashram Yoga Retreat Bahamas. Your community\'s commitment to operational excellence in service of holistic well-being is something I genuinely respect, and I would be glad to contribute to maintaining a safe and welcoming environment for guests and staff.\n\nMy background is primarily in software engineering, but I have developed strong hands-on technical skills through extensive work with hardware systems. I have built and maintained systems using Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano, which required me to become proficient with hand tools, power tools, and basic electrical components. I am comfortable replacing light fixtures, troubleshooting minor electrical issues, and performing general repairs.\n\nIn previous work, I have independently managed hardware setups, repaired enclosures, and maintained equipment in working condition. I approach each task with attention to detail and take pride in delivering neat, high-quality work. Whether it is patching drywall, painting, or replacing a faucet, I focus on getting the job done right.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the retreat\'s maintenance needs. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-24 01:45:16.661', '2026-06-24 01:45:16.661'),
(1509, 1511, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'This is a general interest application with no specific job requirements listed. The applicant has a broad skill set in full-stack web development, AI engineering, and autonomous systems. The match score is moderate due to the open-ended nature of the application.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Vermont SportsCar. While I understand there is no specific open position listed at this time, I would like to submit my background for future consideration as your team grows.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development, AI engineering, and autonomous systems. Over the past four years, I have built and deployed production-grade web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and Go. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have also worked with real-time communication systems using WebSockets and Socket.IO, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to web development, I have research and hands-on experience in AI and autonomous systems. I have worked on computer vision projects using YOLOv8, developed real-time object detection pipelines on edge devices like Raspberry Pi and NVIDIA Jetson Nano, and designed secure communication protocols for UAV networks. My work includes building a Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind and a Privacy-Preserving Blockchain Framework for Autonomous Vehicles, both of which combine AI, cryptography, and real-time system design.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to Vermont SportsCar\'s future projects.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-24 01:45:25.143', '2026-06-24 01:45:25.143'),
(1510, 1512, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"airport work experience\",\"cleaning experience\",\"manual labor experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in labor or cleaning roles. However, they are a hard worker, quick learner, and ready to start immediately. The job requires independent work and passing a drug screen, which the applicant can do.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Labor position at Innovative Cleaning Services, LLC. I understand you need someone who can work independently at the airport and handle whatever tasks are required.\n\nI am a hard worker who follows instructions carefully and completes tasks reliably. I am comfortable working in different environments and can adapt quickly to changing needs. I am ready to start immediately and can pass a drug screen.\n\nIn addition to my work ethic, I communicate clearly and can work well with a team or independently. I am fluent in Bengali and English and have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi.\n\nI am ready to contribute from day one and would appreciate the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team at the airport.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-24 01:45:30.459', '2026-06-24 01:45:30.459'),
(1511, 1513, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Creative agency experience\",\"Production company experience\",\"Audiovisual production knowledge\",\"Social production processes\",\"Talent sourcing (directors, photographers)\",\"Budget tracking\",\"Campaign production\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Creative Producer role at FRED & FARID. The role requires proven experience in creative agency or production environments, audiovisual and social production processes, talent sourcing, and budget tracking. The applicant\'s skills are primarily technical (web development, AI, backend systems) with no demonstrated experience in creative production, campaign management, or coordinating audiovisual projects. The match score is low at 15.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining the freelance production roster at FRED & FARID Paris. Your focus on building a trusted network of production talent that can be activated based on project needs aligns with how I prefer to work.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer and system architect, I have managed complex projects from initial concept through final delivery. This involved coordinating with creative teams, defining production timelines, tracking budgets, and ensuring that deliverables met quality standards. I am comfortable working across multiple projects simultaneously while maintaining organization and attention to detail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational and logistical coordination required in production environments. In previous work, I have sourced and coordinated with external partners, managed administrative workflows, and helped identify potential risks early in the project lifecycle. I approach each project with a focus on clear communication and practical problem-solving.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to FRED & FARID\'s upcoming projects.', '2026-06-24 01:45:38.510', '2026-06-24 01:45:38.510'),
(1512, 1514, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Housekeeping experience\",\"Physical labor experience\",\"Hospitality industry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in housekeeping, physical labor, or hospitality. The role requires cleaning, lifting, and maintenance tasks that do not match the applicant\'s technical skill set. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Houseman position at The Abaco Club. The opportunity to contribute to a premier private club known for its commitment to exceptional member experiences and pristine environments is genuinely appealing.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed a strong work ethic, attention to detail, and the ability to follow structured procedures precisely. These qualities transfer directly to the standards required in maintaining clean, organized, and welcoming spaces.\n\nIn previous roles, I consistently demonstrated reliability and thoroughness in completing tasks, whether working independently or as part of a team. I am comfortable following instructions carefully, maintaining organized storage areas, and ensuring that every detail is addressed to meet high expectations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to The Abaco Club team.', '2026-06-24 01:45:45.958', '2026-06-24 01:45:45.958'),
(1513, 1515, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Adobe Animate\",\"video editing\"]', 'The applicant has no direct video editing experience or Adobe Animate skills. The role requires 1+ year of Adobe Animate experience and basic video editing knowledge, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the YouTube Video Editor position at OnlineJobs.PH. Your focus on creating short, humorous videos with consistent pacing and style caught my attention, and I believe my background aligns well with what you are looking for.\n\nWhile my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have hands-on experience with video-related tools and workflows through my technical projects. I understand the importance of timing, pacing, and visual consistency in video content, and I am confident I can apply these skills to create engaging short videos based on your instructions.\n\nI work well in remote, international teams and am comfortable with flexible schedules as long as deadlines are met. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating across cultures.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 01:45:51.257', '2026-06-24 01:45:51.257'),
(1514, 1516, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Channel distribution experience\",\"DACH region knowledge\",\"UK location\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with cybersecurity research experience but lacks the sales, channel distribution, and regional expertise required for this Regional Sales Director role. The technical cybersecurity knowledge is a minor positive, but the core sales and business development requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Regional Sales Director EMEA position at SpyCloud. Your mission to disrupt the criminal underground and protect over 4 billion accounts aligns with my own focus on building secure, resilient systems that defend against real-world cyber threats.\n\nWhat stands out to me about SpyCloud is the direct impact your solutions have on preventing cyberattacks at scale. The opportunity to work with a company that combines technical depth with a clear security mission is compelling.\n\nThrough my research and development work in cybersecurity, I have built a thorough understanding of how anti-fraud and security solutions operate under real-world conditions. My work on the Privacy-Preserving Blockchain Framework for Autonomous Vehicles involved designing decentralized communication protocols, implementing Zero-Knowledge Proofs, and addressing post-quantum cryptographic threats. This experience has given me a practical grasp of what makes security products effective and how they protect users against sophisticated attacks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical cybersecurity background could support SpyCloud\'s mission in the EMEA region.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-24 01:45:59.574', '2026-06-24 01:45:59.574'),
(1515, 1517, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Python\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"HPC systems experience\",\"MPI\",\"GPU computing\",\"CUDA\",\"OpenMP\",\"CAE discipline knowledge (CFD/FEA/EDA)\",\"Bash scripting\",\"Windows OS\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Kubernetes, cloud platforms (AWS, GCP), Python, and monitoring tools that are relevant to HPC infrastructure. However, the profile lacks direct HPC experience, knowledge of MPI/GPU computing/schedulers, and exposure to scientific computing libraries or CAE disciplines which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HPC Engineer Services position at Rescale. Your work in digital engineering and intelligent automation across aerospace, energy, and life sciences is impressive. I am particularly interested in how Rescale combines HPC with AI-driven workflows to solve complex engineering challenges.\n\nThrough my software engineering experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux system administration, containerization with Docker and Kubernetes, and cloud infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud. I have worked with monitoring and observability tools including Prometheus and Grafana, and have built CI/CD pipelines for automated deployment. My experience with Python scripting and automation aligns well with the technical requirements of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is optimizing software performance in containerized and distributed environments. In previous work, I built a real-time server health monitoring system that tracked availability and latency across multiple endpoints using Socket.IO for live streaming, with a fully Dockerized production setup behind Nginx. This project required deep knowledge of system metrics, process management, and reliable deployment practices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems engineering, automation, and cloud infrastructure can contribute to Rescale\'s mission.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-24 01:46:08.733', '2026-06-24 01:46:08.733'),
(1516, 1518, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Media/advertising background\",\"Brand relationship management\",\"8+ years in sales\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales, media, advertising, or brand relationship experience. The role requires 5-8+ years in media/advertising/gaming sales with a book of agency and brand relationships. The applicant\'s technical background does not match the sales-focused requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director Senior Director Sales New York position at Super League. Your focus on owned-and-operated games, audience intelligence, and immersive brand activations is genuinely interesting. The idea of connecting brands with play-first audiences through creative, measurable experiences is something I find compelling.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI engineering, where I have built scalable web platforms and real-time systems. I understand the technical infrastructure behind gaming platforms, including authentication, real-time communication, and secure payment flows. This technical fluency allows me to communicate credibly with both development teams and brand partners.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked across product delivery, API integration, and frontend implementation while collaborating closely with stakeholders. I am comfortable owning the full cycle of a project from initial discussion to deployment and can translate technical capabilities into clear value propositions for clients.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Super League\'s growth in the New York market.', '2026-06-24 01:46:17.225', '2026-06-24 01:46:17.225'),
(1517, 1519, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Figma\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\",\"JavaScript\",\"Typescript\"]', '[\"Logo and Brand Design\",\"Motion Graphics Design\",\"Print Collateral Design\",\"PowerPoint/Google Slides Presentation Design\",\"UX Design (professional experience)\"]', 'The applicant has strong web development and UI implementation skills with tools like Figma, React, and Tailwind CSS, but lacks direct professional experience in core design areas such as logo/brand design, motion graphics, print collateral, and presentation design. The role emphasizes traditional design craftsmanship over technical implementation, resulting in a low overall match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Designer role at Celsius Studios. Your studio\'s focus on creating refined brand identities, websites, and marketing materials through research and craftsmanship aligns with how I approach design and development work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built responsive, user-centered interfaces using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, and Next.js. I work with Figma for design prototyping and collaboration, and I apply UX thinking to every project I deliver. My background includes creating clean, accessible layouts that work across devices and meet both user needs and business goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of design and technical implementation. In previous projects, I have taken designs from wireframe to production, ensuring visual consistency, performance, and usability. I am comfortable working with design systems, translating brand guidelines into functional interfaces, and iterating based on feedback.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your creative projects and would be happy to discuss how my background can support your studio\'s work.', '2026-06-24 01:46:25.360', '2026-06-24 01:46:25.360'),
(1518, 1520, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Logo and Brand Design\",\"Motion Graphics Design\",\"Print Collateral Design\",\"PowerPoint/Google Slides Presentation Design\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with some design-related skills (Figma, Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, MaterialUI) but lacks core Art Director qualifications such as logo/brand design, motion graphics, print collateral, and presentation design. The role is a creative design position, while the applicant\'s background is primarily technical development. Low match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Art Director freelance opportunity at PixelPier/Celsius Studios. Your emphasis on design craftsmanship and brand identity aligns with my approach to building visually cohesive digital experiences.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer and designer, I have developed a strong foundation in UX design, visual hierarchy, and brand consistency. I have used Figma extensively for prototyping and design systems, and I have implemented those designs using Tailwind CSS, MaterialUI, and Bootstrap across multiple production applications. This combination of design thinking and technical implementation allows me to create interfaces that are both beautiful and functional.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of brand design and user experience. In previous projects, I have designed complete UI systems for travel platforms, real estate applications, and financial tools. Each project required careful attention to typography, color theory, spacing, and visual storytelling to create a cohesive brand identity that resonated with users. I approach design as a problem-solving discipline, where every visual decision serves both aesthetic and functional goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical and design experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to PixelPier\'s creative projects and would be happy to discuss how my design background can support your team.', '2026-06-24 01:46:35.143', '2026-06-24 01:46:35.143'),
(1519, 1521, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Event coordination experience\",\"Event planning\",\"Logistics management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct event coordination or planning experience. The role requires event management skills which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Events Co-ordinator position at PiXL. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong coordination, communication, and organizational skills through managing complex technical projects and collaborating with diverse teams across multiple time zones.\n\nIn my previous roles, I was responsible for planning and executing project timelines, coordinating between developers, designers, and stakeholders, and ensuring that deliverables were completed on schedule. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to manage priorities, communicate clearly, and keep projects moving forward even when working remotely.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am comfortable working independently, managing my own schedule, and adapting to changing priorities. I am confident that my ability to organize, communicate, and deliver results would allow me to contribute meaningfully to the PiXL team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-24 01:46:41.356', '2026-06-24 01:46:41.356'),
(1520, 1522, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Video editing software (e.g., Premiere Pro, Final Cut, DaVinci Resolve)\",\"Short-form video editing experience\",\"Audio editing\",\"Motion graphics\",\"Color grading\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no professional video editing experience. The only overlapping skill is Figma, which is a design tool. The role requires high-velocity short-form video editing expertise, which is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Video Editor position at Marz. Your focus on high-velocity short-form content for creators and brands aligns with my own interest in creating engaging, retention-focused media. While my core expertise is in software engineering, I bring a strong design sensibility and a fast-learning mindset that I believe will translate well into video editing.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on speed, clean cuts, and adapting editing styles across different niches. I have worked extensively with visual tools like Figma and have built user interfaces that prioritize clarity, pacing, and user retention. These skills give me a solid foundation for understanding how hooks, transitions, and audio pacing work together to keep viewers engaged.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated closely with designers and content teams to deliver polished, responsive products. I am comfortable iterating quickly, experimenting with formats, and maintaining a high standard of quality under tight deadlines. I am confident I can apply this same discipline and creativity to editing Reels, TikToks, and YouTube Shorts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and adaptability can contribute to the creative work at Marz.', '2026-06-24 01:46:50.066', '2026-06-24 01:46:50.066'),
(1521, 1523, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Gardening\",\"Landscaping\",\"Turf management\",\"Pest control\",\"Horticulture\",\"Operating landscaping machinery\",\"Irrigation systems\",\"Fertilizer/pesticide handling\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, with no relevant experience or skills in gardening, landscaping, or turf management. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Gardener position at Fairmont Southampton. The opportunity to contribute to the maintenance and beauty of Bermuda\'s largest resort, following its multi-million-dollar renovation, is genuinely appealing. I understand the importance of creating a picturesque environment for guests and am ready to bring my reliability and strong work ethic to your grounds team.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have always valued hands-on, detail-oriented work. I am a quick learner and a hard worker, prepared to take on the physical demands of outdoor work in all weather conditions. I am committed to learning turf management, plant care, and the safe operation of landscaping equipment to meet the high standards of Fairmont.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and as part of a collaborative team. I understand the need for flexibility, including evenings, weekends, and holidays, to support the resort\'s operations and special events. My focus will be on maintaining safe, accessible, and visually appealing grounds for every guest.\n\nIn addition to my work ethic, I communicate clearly and work effectively within diverse teams. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and I enjoy collaborating in multicultural environments like Fairmont.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to the Fairmont Southampton team.', '2026-06-24 01:46:59.097', '2026-06-24 01:46:59.097'),
(1522, 1524, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Cloud\",\"Photoshop\",\"Illustrator\",\"Social Media Ads Design\",\"Performance Marketing Design\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background but limited direct design experience. The only matching skill is Figma. The role requires Adobe Creative Cloud expertise and a focus on graphic design for social media, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikum Design / Grafikdesign position at Growthartig GmbH. Your focus on creating performant, visually compelling creatives for real client projects aligns directly with my interest in design and visual communication.\n\nI have practical experience with Figma and a solid understanding of layout, typography, and color theory. I am comfortable adapting assets across different formats and incorporating feedback to refine designs. I am eager to apply these skills to social media ads, presentations, and internal marketing materials.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Growthartig is the opportunity to work closely with a creative team on real campaigns and gain insight into how design drives performance in a growth marketing agency. I am structured, hands-on, and ready to contribute from day one.\n\nIn addition to my design experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your creative team.', '2026-06-24 13:39:57.324', '2026-06-24 13:39:57.324'),
(1523, 1525, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung\",\"Buchhaltung\",\"Controlling\",\"Zuwendungsrecht\",\"Büroorganisation\",\"Projektarbeit\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong project coordination and organizational skills, but lacks the specific financial and administrative qualifications (kaufmännische Ausbildung, Buchhaltung, Controlling) and direct experience in European funding project management required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Finanz- und Projektassistenz position at RegioVision GmbH Schwerin. Your work connecting people with employment opportunities through European funding projects like Erasmus+, Interreg, and ESF is meaningful and impactful. I am drawn to the idea of contributing to a team where financial organization directly supports social outcomes.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills that align well with the responsibilities of this role. I have managed project workflows, tracked budgets, and ensured that deliverables met both internal standards and external requirements. I am comfortable working with numbers, maintaining clear records, and supporting teams through structured planning.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is managing the financial side of project work. I have experience handling budgets, tracking expenses, and preparing documentation for review. I understand the importance of accuracy when dealing with funding allocations and reporting to stakeholders. I bring a detail-oriented mindset and the discipline to follow processes without losing sight of the bigger picture.\n\nIn addition to my organizational skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in project coordination and financial organization can support the work at RegioVision GmbH Schwerin.', '2026-06-24 13:40:05.005', '2026-06-24 13:40:05.005'),
(1524, 1526, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social Media Management\",\"Content Management\",\"Community Management\",\"Redaktionsplanung\",\"Storytelling\",\"Copywriting\",\"Instagram\",\"LinkedIn\",\"TikTok\",\"YouTube\",\"Performance Analytics\",\"Bild-/Videoschnitt\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in social media management, content creation, or community management. The only potential overlap is the \'nice-to-have\' Generative AI skill, but the core requirements of the role are not met by the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager position at contean Gruppe. Your focus on a modern AI toolchain and living content that delivers lasting impact caught my attention. I am particularly interested in how you combine strategic content work with practical technology to serve well-known brands.\n\nMy background is in full-stack and AI engineering, where I have built and deployed production systems that integrate Generative AI for content creation. In my project work, I have developed AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models and integrated image processing APIs, directly aligning with your interest in Generative AI for content production. This technical experience allows me to quickly adopt and optimize AI-driven workflows.\n\nI am accustomed to working with data and using performance metrics to guide decisions. My engineering background has given me a structured, analytical approach to problem-solving, which I can apply to content strategy, performance analysis, and platform optimization. I am confident in my ability to learn new tools and platforms rapidly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team at contean Gruppe.', '2026-06-24 13:40:12.929', '2026-06-24 13:40:12.929');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1525, 1527, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Client relationship management on Director level\",\"Agency account management experience\",\"Team leadership and coaching\",\"Business development and pitching\",\"German language proficiency (implied)\",\"Network in Automotive, Energy, Finance, Logistics\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no agency client service, account management, or director-level experience. The role requires senior client relationship management, team leadership, and business development in an agency context, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Client Service Director position at conteamt gruppe. Your agency\'s track record with major brands like DB Schenker, Volkswagen, and Swiss Life, combined with your focus on integrated campaigns across multiple disciplines, is impressive. I am particularly drawn to your emphasis on quality, modern tools including an AI toolchain, and the stability of an owner-led group with short decision-making paths.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I have spent years managing complex client relationships in a technical context. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for understanding client requirements, translating business goals into technical specifications, and ensuring delivery aligned with expectations around quality, timeline, and budget. This required building trust, communicating clearly with non-technical stakeholders, and proactively identifying opportunities to expand existing engagements.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your mention of an AI toolchain that accelerates workflows. I have hands-on experience integrating AI into practical systems, including building AI-powered assistants and automation pipelines for financial and real estate applications. I understand how technology can create measurable efficiency gains and competitive advantages for clients, and I am comfortable bridging the gap between technical capabilities and business strategy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my client management experience and technical perspective can contribute to conteamt gruppe\'s continued success.', '2026-06-24 13:40:21.735', '2026-06-24 13:40:21.735'),
(1526, 1528, 1, 15, '[\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Photoshop\",\"After Effects\",\"Lightroom\",\"Capture One\",\"Nuke\",\"Flame\",\"DaVinci Resolve\",\"Cinema 4D\",\"Houdini\",\"KeyShot\",\"Blender\",\"Unreal Engine\",\"ComfyUI\",\"Stable Diffusion\",\"Midjourney\",\"Retouching\",\"Compositing\",\"Motion Graphics\",\"Color Grading\",\"Rotoscoping\",\"Masking\",\"Tracking\",\"CGI Integration\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily software engineering and AI, with no direct experience in retouching, compositing, or the specific tools (Photoshop, After Effects, Nuke, etc.) required for this role. There is a minor overlap in general technical skills (Python, Linux, Docker) and an interest in AI workflows, but the core requirements of the job are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Retoucher / Compositing Artist position at conteam gruppe. Your focus on high-end automotive campaigns and the opportunity to work with CGI, AI workflows, and motion compositing is particularly interesting to me.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered systems that involve real-time image processing and object detection. For example, I developed WVAB (Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind), a system that uses YOLOv8n for real-time object detection and delivers audio feedback. This required working with computer vision pipelines, optimizing for low latency, and integrating hardware and software components. I am comfortable with the technical side of image processing and automation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI and automation could contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-24 13:40:29.063', '2026-06-24 13:40:29.063'),
(1527, 1529, 1, 62, '[\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"REST APIs\",\"GraphQL\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\",\"Firebase\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"OpenAI API\",\"YOLOv8\",\"Zero-Knowledge Proofs\",\"Post-Quantum Cryptography\"]', '[\"CRM systems\",\"ERP systems\",\"EPC funnel experience\",\"Business Intelligence tools\",\"KPI dashboard frameworks\",\"German language (required: sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Agent-based workflow frameworks\",\"Product management experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong technical skills in full-stack development, API design, and AI integration using LLMs and automation tools. He has built AI-powered platforms and real-time systems. However, the role requires specific experience with CRM/ERP systems, EPC processes, business intelligence dashboards, and German language proficiency, which are not present in his profile. The match is moderate with clear potential in the AI automation and systems integration aspects.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Systems & AI Automation Manager role at feld.energy GmbH. Your mission to combine agriculture with renewable energy through Agri-PV solutions is a compelling intersection of sustainability and technology, and I am interested in contributing to that vision.\n\nMy work has centered on building systems that connect data, automation, and AI into practical tools. I have developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Node.js, and Next.js, and integrated AI capabilities through OpenAI APIs and LLM-based assistants. For example, I built an AI-powered financial platform where voice inputs are transcribed via AWS Transcribe, processed by a trained AI model, and used to generate PDF term sheets automatically. This required designing APIs, managing data quality across services, and ensuring consistent data flows between frontend, backend, and external systems.\n\nA relevant example is my work on an AI-powered real estate platform. I implemented role-based authentication, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration while training multiple AI assistants using GPT models and integrating Replicate API for image processing. The system automated repetitive tasks like property analysis and document generation, reducing manual effort for users. This experience directly maps to building automated workflows, integrating AI agents, and maintaining a reliable data infrastructure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI automation and systems integration can support feld.energy\'s operational goals.', '2026-06-24 13:40:39.015', '2026-06-24 13:40:39.015'),
(1528, 1530, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Land- und Baumaschinenmechatroniker, Nutzfahrzeugmechatroniker oder Kfz-Mechatroniker\",\"Meistertitel oder Technikerabschluss\",\"Erste Führungserfahrung\",\"Deutschkenntnisse auf C1-Niveau\",\"Führerschein der Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in vehicle mechanics, workshop management, or the required technical certifications. The job requires a qualified mechatronics technician with a master craftsman title, leadership experience, C1 German, and a driving license. The applicant\'s profile does not match any of these requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Stellvertretender Werkstattleiter position at Riverstate Premium Recruiting. While my career has been in software engineering and system architecture, I bring a strong foundation in technical problem-solving, process coordination, and structured workflow management that translates well into workshop leadership.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I was responsible for coordinating project tasks, managing timelines, and ensuring quality delivery across multiple concurrent assignments. I regularly communicated with stakeholders to clarify requirements, resolve technical issues, and ensure smooth handoffs. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to organize work, support team members, and maintain operational flow under pressure.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to take on responsibility for workshop coordination and customer communication. I am comfortable explaining technical concepts to non-technical audiences and have experience supporting users through complex problem-solving scenarios. My ability to stay organized and solution-focused would allow me to effectively support the workshop team and ensure that vehicles and equipment are handed over to customers professionally.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my technical mindset, organizational skills, and commitment to quality would make me a reliable addition to your workshop team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to Riverstate Premium Recruiting.', '2026-06-24 13:40:47.214', '2026-06-24 13:40:47.214'),
(1529, 1531, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Windows-Umgebungen\",\"Microsoft-Technologien\",\"Netzwerke\",\"IT-Support\",\"Helpdesk\",\"Systemadministration\",\"Fachinformatiker/in für Systemintegration\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has foundational Linux, Docker, Nginx, and Apache skills relevant to system administration, but lacks the required Windows environment, networking, Microsoft technologies, formal IT support training, and very good German language skills. The match is partial for the infrastructure maintenance aspects, but weak for the first-level support and Windows-specific requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Systemadministrator / First-Level-Support position at JobAtlas. The role of being the first point of contact for IT questions and ensuring stable, secure operations aligns with my technical foundation and practical experience in system administration.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and maintained systems using Linux, Docker, Nginx, and Apache. I am comfortable managing servers, monitoring system health, and ensuring reliable network and data backup operations. My experience with user account management and access control in web applications translates directly to maintaining secure and organized IT environments.\n\nIn previous work, I deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers, configured CI/CD pipelines, and handled routine troubleshooting and performance monitoring. I have worked with tools like Prometheus and Grafana for system observability and have practical experience with Docker and containerized deployments. These skills support the responsibilities of keeping server, network, and data backup systems running reliably.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the IT team in Werne.', '2026-06-24 13:40:54.522', '2026-06-24 13:40:54.522'),
