(1532, 1534, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Recruiting experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"HR/Personnel-related education\",\"Google Docs / MS Office proficiency\",\"Assessment center coordination\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this Junior Recruiter role, which demands recruiting experience, HR-related education, German language skills, and proficiency with Google Docs/MS Office. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Recruiter (m/w/d) position at momox. Your mission of promoting sustainability through second-hand products is something I genuinely value, and I would be glad to contribute to your recruiting team in Leipzig.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills through managing complex projects and collaborating across teams. I am comfortable handling multiple responsibilities, supporting people through processes, and maintaining clear communication under pressure.\n\nIn my previous roles, I coordinated with stakeholders, managed timelines, and ensured smooth workflows between technical and non-technical team members. I am used to supporting candidates and colleagues with patience and clarity, and I enjoy helping people navigate processes from start to finish.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy working in international environments. I am eager to learn, contribute to your team, and grow within momox.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-24 13:41:16.205', '2026-06-24 13:41:16.205'),
(1533, 1535, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"PR experience\",\"Media relations\",\"Journalist pitching\",\"German C2\",\"Client management in PR\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Junior PR Manager role requires PR-specific experience, media relations, journalist pitching, and German C2 proficiency. The only potential overlap is AI workflow experience, but the core PR qualifications are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior PR Manager position at getpress. Your approach to building a PR company that is outcome-driven, AI-first, and focused on individual media work rather than mass distribution stands out. The idea of combining automation with genuine human relationships is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have built AI-powered systems that integrate LLMs, automate workflows, and process data intelligently. I have developed AI assistants using OpenAI, implemented real-time features, and designed systems that handle research and content generation. I understand how to work with AI tools to save time on repetitive tasks and invest that time in what matters: substance, relationships, and creativity.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how you use AI for research, pitch preparation, and topic scouting. In my projects, I have built systems that automate data processing and content generation, giving teams more time for strategic thinking. I am comfortable working with AI stacks and eager to contribute to and help shape your internal system.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI-driven systems and hands-on problem-solving can contribute to getpress.', '2026-06-24 13:41:24.417', '2026-06-24 13:41:24.417'),
(1534, 1536, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"3 years of PR experience\",\"Journalist network in DACH region\",\"German C2 level\",\"Client management in PR\",\"Media pitching experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with AI experience, not a PR professional. While there is a conceptual overlap in AI workflow experience, the core requirements of PR strategy, journalist relationships, German fluency, and client management are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the PR Manager role at getpress. Your vision of building a KI-first, outcome-driven PR company is exactly the kind of environment where I can contribute meaningfully.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I have worked extensively with LLMs and AI workflows. Through hands-on project development, I have built systems that integrate OpenAI models, real-time data processing, and automated pipelines. I understand how to use AI as a tool to accelerate research, generate insights, and free up time for higher-value strategic work.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your internal AI stack. In my work, I have developed AI-powered assistants for financial analysis and real estate, trained models on custom datasets, and built automation workflows that reduce manual effort. I am comfortable working with AI systems not just as a user, but as someone who can shape and improve them.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can combine my technical skills with strategic thinking, and getpress offers exactly that opportunity. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-24 13:41:31.866', '2026-06-24 13:41:31.866'),
(1535, 1537, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Technische Gebäudeausrüstung (TGA) experience\",\"HOAI project management\",\"AutoCAD or Trimble Nova\",\"Heating, Sanitation, Climate, or Ventilation systems planning\",\"MS Excel proficiency\",\"Technical system planning education\"]', 'This role requires specialized technical building services engineering (TGA) experience, including HVAC/sanitation system planning, HOAI project management, and proficiency in AutoCAD/Trimble Nova. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI systems. There is no direct overlap in domain-specific skills, education, or experience. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systemplaner / Fachplaner position in Technische Gebäudeausrüstung with your client, a mid-sized engineering firm based in North Rhine-Westphalia. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than traditional HVAC or sanitation planning, I bring strong system design capabilities, structured project management experience, and a methodical approach to technical problem-solving that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have managed complex, multi-phase projects from concept through delivery. I am accustomed to creating detailed technical specifications, coordinating with stakeholders including clients and suppliers, and maintaining precise documentation throughout the project lifecycle. These skills in planning, specification writing, and cross-functional communication are directly applicable to the tasks outlined for this position, including the creation of detailed plans and coordination with builders and authorities.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on sustainable engineering, including heat recovery from industrial processes, hydrogen utilization, and CO2 reduction. My background in systems thinking and optimization, developed through building scalable software architectures, gives me a strong foundation for understanding and contributing to energy-efficient building system design. I am confident in my ability to quickly learn industry-specific software and apply my technical aptitude to TGA planning tools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am organized, detail-oriented, and accustomed to working both independently and as part of a team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical system design experience and structured approach can contribute to your client\'s industrial projects. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-24 13:41:41.641', '2026-06-24 13:41:41.641'),
(1536, 1538, 1, 45, '[\"Kubernetes\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Go\",\"Python\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Kubeflow\",\"Metaflow\",\"Terraform\",\"Helm\",\"Kustomize\",\"Argo CD\",\"Flux\",\"Crossplane\",\"Ansible\",\"Azure\",\"Telekom Cloud\",\"GCP\",\"OpenStack\",\"GPU-enabled Kubernetes\",\"MLOps workflows\",\"experiment tracking\",\"service mesh\",\"cluster federation\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational skills in Kubernetes, Docker, AWS, Linux, and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana) that partially align with the Senior Platform Engineer role. However, the role requires deep production expertise in Kubernetes, Kubeflow, Metaflow, infrastructure-as-code tools (Terraform, Helm, Argo CD), and MLOps workflows, which are not present in the candidate\'s profile. The candidate\'s experience is more focused on web development and full-stack projects rather than dedicated platform or ML infrastructure engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Platform Engineer – Cloud & ML Platform role at Quantum-Systems GmbH. Your work on intelligent unmanned systems and the cloud-native infrastructure that powers AI and autonomy at global scale is directly relevant to the kind of engineering challenges I enjoy solving.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and deployed containerized applications using Docker and Kubernetes, managed Linux-based servers with Nginx, and set up CI/CD pipelines for automated deployments. I have also worked with AWS for cloud infrastructure, including EC2, S3, and SES, and used monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to track system health and performance. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in operating and improving platform infrastructure for production workloads.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is enabling AI and data teams to run scalable workloads reliably. In a recent project, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which streamed live system metrics to the browser and supported role-based access control. This required designing a scalable architecture, managing containerized services, and ensuring observability through logging and alerting. The project reinforced my ability to build platform components that support data-intensive operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cloud infrastructure, containerization, and platform engineering can contribute to the Quantum-Systems team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-24 13:41:50.343', '2026-06-24 13:41:50.343'),
(1537, 1539, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Umwelt- oder geowissenschaftliches Studium\",\"Berufserfahrung in Altlastenbearbeitung\",\"Kenntnisse in potentieller Schadstoffe\",\"MS-Office\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no environmental science, geotechnical, or contaminated site assessment background. The role requires a completed degree in environmental or geosciences and specific expertise in contaminated site investigation. There is no direct skill overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter / Gutachter (m/w/d) position at clayton Umwelt-Consult GmbH. Your company\'s long-standing expertise in environmental consulting and geotechnical assessments is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your team.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong analytical and organizational skills that are directly relevant to this role. I have experience managing complex data sets, coordinating technical investigations, and ensuring accuracy in reporting. These skills translate well to the responsibilities of planning and coordinating environmental site assessments, evaluating analytical data, and preparing technical reports.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked closely with clients and project partners during project initiation and throughout delivery. I am comfortable communicating technical information clearly and maintaining reliable workflows under deadlines. I also have a solid foundation in MS-Office and data management tools, which supports efficient lab management and data evaluation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in growing within a stable, team-oriented environment like clayton and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support your projects. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-24 13:41:58.096', '2026-06-24 13:41:58.096'),
(1538, 1540, 1, 65, '[\"Python\",\"API\",\"LLM\",\"Automation\",\"Testing\"]', '[\"Deutsch fließend\",\"Make\",\"Zapier\",\"n8n\",\"Airtable\",\"Browser Automation\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI and automation experience through project work, including building AI assistants and integrating APIs. However, the role requires fluent German and specific low-code automation tools (Make, Zapier, n8n) which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s practical experience with LLMs and structured testing is a good foundation, but the language and tool gaps are significant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in / Praktikant:in (m/w/d) Product Testing & AI Automation position at Placed Technologies GmbH. Your focus on building AI software for recruitment teams and turning candidate profiles into actionable sales opportunities is a practical and interesting application of AI technology.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered systems that integrate LLM-based assistants, structured outputs, and automated workflows. In my AI-powered financial app project, I developed backend APIs using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI, trained custom AI assistants, and implemented voice-to-text processing with AWS Transcribe. I also built automation for generating PDF term sheets and sending them via AWS SES. This experience has given me a solid understanding of how to test AI outputs for consistency, data logic, and practical usability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building internal automations to improve testing and operational workflows. I have experience working with APIs, webhooks, and browser automation tools. In my real estate platform project, I in