(1541, 1543, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"HR/Recruiting experience\",\"BWL/Psychology/HR/Social Sciences studies\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Personio or ATS experience\",\"Active sourcing on LinkedIn\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong organizational and communication skills, but the role requires a student in HR, Psychology, or Social Sciences with German language proficiency and recruiting experience. The technical background does not directly align with the recruiting-focused responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent im Recruiting position at EMIL Group GmbH. Your focus on supporting the full recruiting process for tech and non-tech profiles, combined with the opportunity to work closely with a Senior Recruiter, is exactly the kind of hands-on learning environment I am looking for.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the chance to contribute to active sourcing, candidate experience, and end-to-end recruiting while gaining practical insight into modern recruiting strategies. As a Software Engineering student with strong organizational habits and a structured approach to work, I am comfortable managing multiple tasks, coordinating interviews, and maintaining accurate candidate data.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed reliable communication skills and the ability to work closely with team members across different functions. I am used to coordinating tasks, following processes carefully, and ensuring that nothing falls through the cracks even under time constraints. These habits translate naturally into supporting a recruiting workflow.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would be glad to discuss how I can support the EMIL Recruiting Team and contribute to your talent acquisition efforts.', '2026-06-24 13:42:29.944', '2026-06-24 13:42:29.944'),
(1542, 1544, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Deutschkenntnisse (C2)\",\"KFZ-Erfahrung\",\"Fahrzeugtechnisches Verständnis\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no driving license, KFZ experience, or German language skills listed in the profile. The job requires a driver\'s license, C2 German, and practical KFZ experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the KfZ-Prüfassistent & Fahrer für Hol- und Bringservice position at HolDeinePlakette. Your company\'s focus on bringing efficiency and digital innovation to vehicle inspection services is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nAlthough my professional background is primarily in software engineering, I bring a strong sense of responsibility, technical understanding, and a structured approach to operations. I hold a valid driving license and maintain a safe, careful driving style. I am comfortable working with digital tools and managing documentation workflows accurately.\n\nIn previous roles, I have worked with digital systems, managed data, and coordinated tasks efficiently. I am used to following structured processes, maintaining attention to detail, and working reliably under responsibility. These habits transfer well to supporting inspection workflows, managing vehicle logistics, and representing a company professionally.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and support the high standards HolDeinePlakette is known for. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-24 13:42:37.170', '2026-06-24 13:42:37.170'),
(1543, 1545, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Medical administration experience\",\"Medical terminology\",\"Healthcare administration background\",\"MS Outlook\",\"MS Word\",\"MS Excel\",\"Adobe\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong IT proficiency and organisational skills, but lacks direct healthcare administration or medical secretary experience. No direct skill overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Secretary position at Curaleaf International. Your mission to redefine healthcare administration in the medical cannabis sector and help patients access life-changing care resonates with me. I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to a supportive, remote team that values professionalism and patient focus.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organisational, multitasking, and communication skills that directly transfer to this role. I am highly IT proficient, confident using MS Outlook, Word, Excel, and Adobe, and I maintain a professional and courteous tone when handling sensitive information. I am accustomed to working in detail-oriented environments where accuracy and confidentiality are essential.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have supported teams by managing schedules, coordinating tasks, handling correspondence, and answering queries. I am comfortable working independently in a remote setting and am skilled at prioritising multiple responsibilities while maintaining a patient-focused approach. I am also experienced in maintaining clear and professional written and verbal communication.\n\nIn addition to my administrative capabilities, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the Curaleaf team.', '2026-06-24 13:42:44.439', '2026-06-24 13:42:44.439');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1544, 1546, 1, 25, '[\"MySQL\",\"SQL\"]', '[\"Business analysis experience\",\"Power BI\",\"Tableau\",\"Agile/Scrum\",\"Lean/Six Sigma\",\"Stakeholder management\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and analytical skills from software engineering but lacks direct business analysis experience and tools like Power BI and Tableau. Some foundational skills like SQL and process thinking are present.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Analyst position at Rotaract Club of Singapore Management University (SMU). The opportunity to support data-driven decision-making and improve business processes aligns with my analytical background and interest in translating complex needs into clear, actionable requirements.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a structured approach to problem-solving and process analysis. I have experience conducting research, mapping workflows, and identifying gaps in existing systems. My technical background allows me to understand both business objectives and the systems that support them, making me effective at bridging communication between stakeholders and development teams.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have collaborated with cross-functional teams to gather requirements, document processes, and implement solutions. I have used SQL for data analysis, prepared reports and dashboards for management review, and ensured that project outcomes aligned with business goals. This hands-on experience has given me a practical understanding of the full project lifecycle and the importance of clear documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and experience can contribute to the Rotaract Club of SMU.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 13:42:51.787', '2026-06-24 13:42:51.787'),
(1545, 1547, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Licenciatura en Educación Infantil\",\"Experiencia en educación inicial\",\"Experiencia en enseñanza virtual para primera infancia\",\"Implementación de programas Letras y Cifras de HyG\",\"Diseño de clases virtuales sincrónicas y asincrónicas\",\"Fortalecimiento de lectoescritura y pensamiento lógico-matemático\",\"Trabajo articulado con familias\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not early childhood education. There is no match for the required degree, experience, or pedagogical skills. The only potential overlap is English proficiency (B1 level) and general digital tool familiarity, but this is insufficient for the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Docente de Educación Infantil Virtual position at Colegio Cambridge International Education. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong technical and communication skills that are directly relevant to designing and delivering engaging virtual learning experiences for young children.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have built interactive platforms using React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS. These tools are well-suited for creating dynamic, visually appealing digital environments that can capture and hold the attention of young learners. I understand how to design interfaces that are intuitive and easy to navigate, which is essential for virtual classrooms.\n\nIn previous projects, I have collaborated closely with stakeholders to understand their needs and deliver solutions that work. This experience has taught me to communicate clearly, listen carefully, and adapt quickly, skills that are valuable when working with families and supporting the developmental goals of each child.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nEARNESTNESS\nRMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-24 13:42:59.304', '2026-06-24 13:42:59.304'),
(1546, 1548, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"Campaign management\",\"Social media management\",\"Content creation\",\"SEO/SEM\",\"Analytics tools\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI, and systems engineering) with no direct marketing experience or skills mentioned. The job is a Marketing Assistant role, which requires marketing-specific competencies not present in the profile. The match score is low due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Assistant Fully position at JazzUpCo. While my background is primarily technical, I bring strong organizational and automation skills that can directly support marketing workflows and operational efficiency.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built systems that streamline complex processes, automate repetitive tasks, and integrate third-party services. These skills translate well into marketing support, where managing data, coordinating campaigns, and maintaining digital assets require precision and reliability.\n\nIn previous professional experience, I developed and maintained web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, which involved managing content, user data, and real-time updates. I am comfortable working with analytics tools, databases, and cloud platforms to extract insights and maintain organized workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the JazzUpCo team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 13:43:05.852', '2026-06-24 13:43:05.852'),
(1547, 1549, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"VIP relationship management\",\"customer success\",\"account management\",\"private banking\",\"wealth management\",\"luxury hospitality\",\"fintech\",\"crypto\",\"payments\",\"event coordination\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not contain the required experience in VIP relationship management, customer success, or financial services. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the VIP Relationship Manager position at KAST. I understand that building and maintaining trusted relationships with high-value customers requires a combination of strong communication, organization, and a genuine commitment to understanding client needs.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I worked directly with stakeholders to gather requirements, provide regular updates, and ensure that delivered solutions met their expectations. This experience taught me how to listen carefully, communicate clearly, and follow through on commitments, skills that are directly relevant to managing VIP client relationships.\n\nI am comfortable working across teams, coordinating with product, operations, and support functions to resolve issues and improve the overall customer experience. I am also experienced in tracking metrics and using data to identify opportunities for deeper engagement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to KAST\'s VIP client experience.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-24 13:43:12.202', '2026-06-24 13:43:12.202'),
(1548, 1550, 1, 20, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Administrative support\",\"Calendar management\",\"Email management\",\"Data entry\",\"File and document organization\",\"Time management\",\"Communication skills\",\"Attention to detail\",\"Multitasking\",\"Problem-solving\",\"Microsoft Office and online productivity tools\",\"Remote collaboration\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is focused on software engineering and web development, with no direct experience in administrative support, virtual assistance, or the specific skills listed for this role. The match score is low because the required skills are not present in the applicant\'s portfolio.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Virtual Assistant position at Torentify. The opportunity to support daily business operations in a fully remote environment aligns well with my background in organized, independent work.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in managing communications, organizing digital files, and coordinating tasks across teams. I am comfortable using a variety of computer applications and online productivity tools to keep workflows efficient and accurate.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on attention to detail and confidentiality in this role. In my previous work, I handled sensitive project data and maintained clear records, ensuring information was organized and accessible only to authorized team members.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 13:43:18.618', '2026-06-24 13:43:18.618'),
(1549, 1551, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Formal Clinical Qualification in Physiotherapy\",\"HCPC Registration\",\"3 years postgraduate clinical experience\",\"UK healthcare system experience\",\"Clinical triage experience\",\"Clinical audit experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no clinical physiotherapy qualifications, HCPC registration, or UK healthcare experience. This role requires an HCPC-registered Physiotherapist with at least 3 years postgraduate clinical experience in the UK healthcare system. The applicant\'s skills in software development do not match the essential clinical requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the MSK Physiotherapist Virtual position at IPRS Health. After reviewing the job description, I understand this role requires an HCPC-registered Physiotherapist with UK healthcare experience. My background is in software engineering and AI systems, not clinical physiotherapy.\n\nI am a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with experience developing web applications, real-time communication platforms, and AI-powered systems. I have built projects involving Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and various databases including MySQL and MongoDB. My work includes developing a real-time server health monitoring dashboard and a wireless vision-aid system using computer vision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-24 13:43:24.541', '2026-06-24 13:43:24.541'),
(1550, 1552, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Digital marketing metrics\",\"Google Analytics\",\"Shopify\",\"Meta Business Suite\",\"TikTok Shop\",\"Amazon Seller Central\",\"Marketing coordination experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) and does not include direct marketing coordination experience or familiarity with the preferred digital marketing tools (Google Analytics, Shopify, Meta Business Suite, etc.). The role requires comfort with digital platforms, spreadsheets, dashboards, and reporting, which the applicant has demonstrated through technical project work, but the core marketing-specific skills are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Coordinator position at RESOLUTE HR CONSULTING. The role\'s focus on digital platform operations, performance tracking, and operational workflows aligns with my experience in managing data-driven systems and coordinating cross-functional tasks.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly supported backend operations across digital platforms, tracked performance metrics, and maintained accurate records. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, dashboards, and reporting tools to monitor conversion rates, engagement metrics, and traffic performance. My attention to detail and ability to follow structured workflows have been essential in delivering consistent results.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to assist with platform updates, content organization, and product listings. I have hands-on experience coordinating with team members to improve digital platform efficiency and preparing performance summaries for internal review. I am confident in my ability to identify trends and summarize insights clearly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-24 13:43:31.214', '2026-06-24 13:43:31.214'),
(1551, 1553, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Logistics coordination experience\",\"Bilingual (English and French)\",\"Supply chain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct logistics or supply chain experience. The role requires bilingualism (English and French) and logistics coordination skills, which are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Logistics Coordinator position at Altis Recruitment. While my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring a strong foundation in coordination, workflow management, and cross-functional communication that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated between clients, designers, and engineering teams to deliver projects on time and within scope. This required clear communication, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously—skills that are directly transferable to logistics coordination.\n\nI am fluent in English and Bengali, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, allowing me to communicate effectively across diverse teams and stakeholders. I am comfortable working fully remotely and am located in Canada.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 13:43:36.257', '2026-06-24 13:43:36.257'),
(1552, 1554, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\"]', '[\"Project coordination\",\"Project management\",\"Expediting\",\"Logistics management\",\"Inspection/quality control\",\"Fragrance/beauty industry experience\",\"Notion/Asana\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical project delivery experience from software engineering roles, including coordinating cross-functional teams, tracking milestones, and managing timelines. However, the role requires specific project management, logistics, and fragrance industry experience that are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low but the applicant\'s coordination and remote work skills are transferable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistant Project Manager Fragrance role at Slate Brands. Your approach to building fragrance brands through an omnichannel platform and your focus on innovation and long-term brand-building resonates with how I think about delivering complex projects from concept to completion.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have coordinated end-to-end product delivery across multiple teams. At Explo-IT, I managed timelines, tracked milestones, and communicated progress and risks to stakeholders across design, engineering, and operations. I am comfortable translating creative vision into actionable deliverables and keeping multiple workstreams aligned simultaneously.\n\nA relevant example is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem I developed, which required coordinating across customer, seller, delivery, and logistics modules. I managed the project calendar, tracked dependencies, and ensured quality standards were met across all components. This experience taught me to proactively identify bottlenecks and communicate delays before they impacted delivery.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination skills can support Slate Brands\' fragrance launches and product lines.', '2026-06-24 13:43:44.146', '2026-06-24 13:43:44.146'),
(1553, 1555, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Existing following/network in AI safety\",\"Prolific writing portfolio on AI safety\",\"Public speaking experience\",\"Policy awareness\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with AI engineering experience and technical understanding of LLMs, but lacks the specific public-facing writing portfolio, existing following in AI safety, and policy/advocacy background that this role requires.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Public Understanding role at NOPE. Your mission to build open-source safety layers for AI relationships is both timely and necessary. I share your view that the conversation about what AI is doing to people needs to happen in the right language and in the right places.\n\nAs a software engineer with hands-on experience building AI-powered systems, I understand how large language models work and where they fall short. I have developed applications using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, trained custom AI assistants, and worked on privacy-preserving frameworks for autonomous vehicle communication. This technical grounding gives me a clear-eyed view of what these systems can and cannot do, and what real safety looks like under the hood.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is making complex ideas legible to people who do not already live in the technical details. In my research on secure UAV systems and blockchain-based privacy frameworks, I have had to communicate nuanced security concepts to diverse audiences. I am comfortable writing for social channels, speaking at events, and engaging with policymakers and researchers. I can take NOPE\'s research and trackers and turn them into content that people actually read, debate, and act on.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can help NOPE build a public voice that makes AI safety impossible to ignore.\n\nAMICABILITY RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-24 13:43:52.408', '2026-06-24 13:43:52.408'),
(1554, 1556, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"SEO\",\"Content Strategy\"]', '[\"Webflow\",\"Copywriting\",\"Content Strategy Workshops\",\"Messaging Frameworks\",\"SEO/AEO Optimization\",\"Narrative Strategy\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills like Figma, HTML, CSS, and basic SEO understanding from web development work, but lacks direct copywriting, content strategy, and Webflow experience which are core to this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining N4 Studio\'s pool of freelance website copywriters and content strategists. Your approach to building a flexible, project-based relationship with trusted writers aligns well with how I prefer to work, and I appreciate the clarity in how you structure engagements.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, which gives me a practical understanding of how content and design interact on the page. I have written website copy for multiple projects, including a travel agency platform and a real estate application, where I developed messaging that matched each brand\'s voice while keeping SEO and user intent in mind. I am comfortable working in Figma alongside designers to produce content outlines and low-fidelity wireframes that support a smooth handoff.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the narrative and messaging strategy phase. I enjoy the process of distilling a client\'s value proposition into clear, compelling language that guides the rest of the site\'s content. I have experience presenting strategic recommendations and iterating on copy through revision rounds until it is polished and on-brand.\n\nIn addition to my technical and writing experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to N4 Studio\'s projects as they arise.', '2026-06-24 13:44:00.940', '2026-06-24 13:44:00.940'),
(1555, 1557, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Biology\",\"Molecular biology\",\"Cellular biology\",\"Experimental design\",\"Laboratory research\",\"Life sciences data analysis\",\"Scientific reporting\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no biology or life sciences background. The role requires professional experience in biology, molecular/cellular biology, experimental design, and laboratory research. None of the applicant\'s skills or experience match the core requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Biology Research Expert consulting opportunity at 24-MAG. This role\'s focus on structured scientific review, experimental workflow assessment, and evidence-based evaluation aligns well with my technical background in AI and autonomous systems.\n\nThrough my research and development work, I have built systems that require rigorous evaluation of experimental outputs, data interpretation, and technical documentation. For example, I developed WVAB (Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind), a real-time assistive system that uses YOLOv8n-based object detection and sensor fusion. This involved reviewing experimental scenarios, evaluating model outputs against ground truth data, and preparing structured written analyses of system performance.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I regularly reviewed technical documentation, evaluated outputs against source materials, and prepared clear written explanations for complex technical conclusions. These skills in structured review, attention to detail, and evidence-based reasoning transfer directly to the biology research evaluation workflows described in this opportunity.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in structured evaluation and technical analysis can contribute to your biology research projects.', '2026-06-24 13:44:07.880', '2026-06-24 13:44:07.880'),
(1556, 1558, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"Family services experience\",\"Client relationship management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not directly match the Family Success Specialist role, which focuses on customer support and relationship management. No direct skill overlap was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Family Success Specialist position at bina. The focus on helping others feel seen, heard, and supported resonates with me, and I am interested in contributing to a team that values meaningful human connection.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I collaborated closely with clients and stakeholders to understand their needs and ensure they felt supported throughout the project lifecycle. This experience taught me to listen carefully, communicate clearly, and build trust with people from diverse backgrounds.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-24 13:44:12.630', '2026-06-24 13:44:12.630'),
(1557, 1559, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Data analysis\",\"Data visualization\",\"Business intelligence\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong software engineering and data handling skills, but does not have explicit experience with Microsoft Excel as a primary data analysis tool or formal business intelligence platforms. The match is low for this specific Data Analyst Excel role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Analyst Excel contract position at YO IT Consulting. The opportunity to apply my analytical skills to help train next-generation AI systems is genuinely compelling, and I am confident my background in data-driven development and cross-functional collaboration makes me a strong fit for this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have worked extensively with data in production environments. I routinely reviewed, cleaned, and validated datasets to ensure accuracy, consistency, and integrity before integrating them into applications. This required meticulous attention to detail and a systematic approach to identifying inconsistencies and implementing corrective measures.\n\nIn addition to data validation, I developed clear reports and visualizations to communicate findings to both technical and non-technical audiences. I collaborated closely with project stakeholders to understand data requirements and translate them into meaningful analyses that supported decision-making across teams. My experience documenting methodologies and results with precision aligns directly with the responsibilities outlined for this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills can contribute to your team\'s work in training next-generation AI systems.', '2026-06-24 13:44:19.009', '2026-06-24 13:44:19.009'),
(1558, 1560, 1, 65, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"React\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"REST API\",\"Node.js\"]', '[\"Cypress\",\"React Native\",\"Claude Code\",\"AI-native testing workflows\",\"E2E test framework ownership\",\"Cross-functional quality partnership experience\"]', 'Strong technical foundation in the core stack (Laravel, PHP, React, MySQL) with professional web development experience and test automation exposure. Missing direct Cypress experience and formal QA engineering role history, but has transferable skills in automation, debugging, and full-stack development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Quality Engineer role at LawnStarter. Your platform serves a large, active marketplace for lawn care and home services, and the engineering team is rebuilding the stack with Laravel and React while integrating AI-powered features. That combination of scale, modern tooling, and proactive quality ownership is exactly the kind of environment where I work best.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with PHP (Laravel) and React across multiple production applications. I have built and maintained RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database queries in MySQL. I am comfortable reading and writing code across the full stack, which allows me to test meaningfully at every layer, not just the UI.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on automation ownership and process improvement. In previous work, I have written automated tests using Jest and PHPUnit, set up CI/CD pipelines, and deployed applications with Docker and Nginx on Linux servers. I approach quality the same way your team does: find the gap, automate the fix, and make sure it stays closed. I also actively use AI tools in my engineering workflow to reduce repetitive work and catch edge cases earlier.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to raising the quality ceiling at LawnStarter.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-24 13:44:28.157', '2026-06-24 13:44:28.157'),
(1559, 1561, 1, 45, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Cypress\",\"React Native\",\"Claude Code\",\"E2E testing\",\"integration testing\",\"QA automation strategy\",\"bug triage process\",\"cross-functional quality partnership\",\"exploratory testing\",\"AI-native testing workflows\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills with Laravel and React, which match the core stack. However, this is a Senior Quality Engineer role requiring deep expertise in Cypress, E2E/integration test automation, bug process ownership, and AI-native testing workflows. The applicant\'s background is primarily in web development rather than dedicated quality engineering, and they lack direct experience with Cypress, React Native, and formal QA automation strategy.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Quality Engineer role at LawnStarter. Your platform\'s scale, the cross-functional nature of this position, and the emphasis on proactive quality ownership align well with how I approach software engineering.\n\nLawnStarter operates a PHP (Laravel) and React/React Native stack, and you are actively using AI tools like Claude Code as a standard part of your workflow. In my professional experience, I have built and maintained full-stack web applications using Laravel and Next.js, and I regularly integrate AI tools into my development process for code generation, debugging, and test writing. I am comfortable reading and writing code across the stack, writing SQL queries, and debugging issues that span frontend, backend, and infrastructure layers.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the ownership of automated test coverage and the bug process. In previous work, I have designed and implemented RESTful APIs, built real-time features with WebSockets, and deployed applications using Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I approach quality the same way I approach development: by building systems that catch problems early, automating repetitive checks, and continuously refining processes rather than just reacting to failures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to raising the quality ceiling at LawnStarter.', '2026-06-24 13:44:37.774', '2026-06-24 13:44:37.774'),
(1560, 1562, 1, 45, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"React\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Typescript\",\"Javascript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\"]', '[\"Cypress\",\"React Native\",\"Claude Code\",\"browser MCPs\",\"agent workflows\",\"E2E test framework ownership\",\"dedicated QA automation role experience\"]', 'Shagor has strong full-stack development experience with Laravel and React, which matches the core stack at LawnStarter. He has experience with automated testing tools (Jest, PHPUnit) and uses AI in his workflow. However, he lacks direct experience with Cypress, React Native, and dedicated QA automation roles. The role requires a senior quality engineer who owns automation strategy, which is a shift from his current development-focused background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Quality Engineer role at LawnStarter. Your focus on proactive quality, automation ownership, and cross-functional partnership aligns directly with how I approach software delivery.\n\nYour stack is PHP (Laravel) and React, and you\'re scaling into new service verticals with AI-powered features. I have 4 years of professional full-stack development experience with Laravel and React, and I\'ve built automated test coverage using Jest and PHPUnit. I don\'t just write tests; I design test strategies that keep coverage strong as the product evolves.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on using AI tools like Claude Code to improve quality operations. I already integrate AI into my development workflow for writing test code, debugging, and automating repetitive tasks. I\'m comfortable with browser MCPs and agent workflows, and I actively explore new tools to catch coverage gaps before they reach production.\n\nIn my professional experience, I\'ve worked across frontend, backend, and deployment, which gives me the technical depth to debug issues across the full stack. I\'ve also collaborated directly with product and design teams to surface risks early and define what \"done\" means. I\'m direct, I speak plainly about what I find, and I push back when something isn\'t ready to ship.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI\'ve attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can help raise the quality ceiling at LawnStarter.', '2026-06-24 13:44:46.436', '2026-06-24 13:44:46.436'),
(1561, 1563, 1, 55, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Cypress\",\"React Native\",\"Claude Code\",\"E2E test automation\",\"formal QA process ownership\"]', 'Shahanur has strong technical depth in Laravel and React, matching LawnStarter\'s core stack. He has experience building full-stack applications, writing tests (Jest, PHPUnit, PyTest), and working with CI/CD, Docker, and Linux. However, the role specifically requires Cypress, E2E automation strategy, and formal QA process ownership, which are not evident in his profile. He is a solid engineer but would need ramp-up time on the testing-specific aspects of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Quality Engineer (Campinas) role at LawnStarter. Your platform is scaling into new service verticals and AI-powered features, and quality needs to stay proactive rather than reactive. That approach resonates with how I work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications using PHP (Laravel) and React/Next.js. I am comfortable reading and writing code across the stack, writing meaningful SQL queries, and debugging issues that span frontend, backend, and database layers. This technical breadth allows me to understand how features work end to end and where quality gaps are likely to appear.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is automation ownership. In previous work, I have designed and implemented real-time monitoring systems using Socket.IO and built test infrastructure for server health dashboards. I approach quality the same way: if a problem can be caught automatically, it should be. I am comfortable with CI/CD pipelines, Docker-based deployments, and Linux server management, which gives me the context to build automation that fits into the team\'s actual workflow.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to raising the quality ceiling at LawnStarter.', '2026-06-24 13:44:54.735', '2026-06-24 13:44:54.735'),
(1562, 1564, 1, 55, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\"]', '[\"Cypress\",\"React Native\",\"Claude Code\",\"E2E testing\",\"integration testing\",\"exploratory testing\",\"bug triage\",\"cross-functional quality partnership\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong technical foundations in Laravel, React, and PHP, which match LawnStarter\'s core stack. He has experience with automated testing tools (Jest, PHPUnit) and uses AI in his workflow. However, he lacks direct experience with Cypress, React Native, and formal quality engineering responsibilities like owning E2E test strategy, bug triage processes, and cross-functional quality partnerships. The role requires a dedicated quality engineering focus, while his background is primarily full-stack development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Quality Engineer role at LawnStarter. Your platform operates at significant scale across multiple brands, and the emphasis on proactive quality, automation ownership, and AI-integrated workflows aligns closely with how I approach software engineering.\n\nLawnStarter\'s marketplace model, spanning customer apps, Pro onboarding, job distribution, and data infrastructure, presents the kind of complex, cross-functional quality challenges that I find most engaging. The opportunity to shape the automation strategy and bug process from a position of influence, rather than simply executing test cases, is exactly the kind of responsibility I am looking for.\n\nMy professional experience includes building and maintaining full-stack applications with Laravel and React, which matches your core stack. I have written and maintained automated tests using PHPUnit and Jest, and I approach quality as an integral part of the development process, not a separate phase. I am comfortable reading and writing code across the stack, debugging issues from the database layer up to the UI, and writing meaningful SQL queries to validate data integrity.\n\nI actively use AI tools in my engineering workflow to write, review, and extend code. I see AI not as an experiment, but as a practical tool for increasing output quality, reducing repetitive work, and discovering edge cases that might otherwise be missed. This aligns directly with your expectation that the person in this role will explore AI-driven approaches to improve quality operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to raising the quality ceiling at LawnStarter.', '2026-06-24 13:45:04.238', '2026-06-24 13:45:04.238');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1563, 1565, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Microsoft Office\",\"Social Media\",\"Photo editing software\",\"German language (written and spoken)\",\"Marketing communication knowledge\",\"Event organization\",\"PR and direct marketing\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not align well with this marketing communication apprenticeship. The role requires German language proficiency, marketing knowledge, and office software skills which are not present in the profile. The applicant has strong digital literacy and organizational skills from web development work, but lacks the specific marketing, language, and administrative qualifications required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ausbildung Kauffrau/-mann für Marketingkommunikation position at reboVet Veterinär-Fachgroßhandel GmbH und Co. KG. Your company\'s 45-year history of serving veterinary practices with over 30,000 products and tailored solutions is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your marketing team while developing my skills in this field.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational skills and attention to detail. I have worked on creating and managing content, coordinating production processes, and ensuring quality control across multiple projects. These experiences have taught me to work reliably and flexibly, qualities that align well with the requirements of this apprenticeship.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to learn about developing communication concepts for campaigns and individual measures. My background in web development has given me practical experience with design tools and content creation, which I believe provides a solid foundation for working on catalogs, brochures, flyers, and advertisements. I am eager to apply my creativity and organizational skills to support reboVet\'s marketing efforts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a quick learner with strong problem-solving abilities and a genuine interest in economic contexts. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to reboVet\'s continued success while growing professionally through this apprenticeship. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-25 01:40:01.668', '2026-06-25 01:40:01.668'),
(1564, 1566, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Social Media Design\",\"Flyer Design\",\"Poster Design\",\"Photography\",\"Photo Editing\",\"Campaign Development\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant design-adjacent skills (Figma, Tailwind CSS) and is a currently enrolled student, but the role is specifically a graphic design internship focused on social media, flyers, posters, and photography. The applicant\'s core background is software engineering, not visual design or graphic arts.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Grafik Pflichtpraktikum 6 Monate position at SEVEN APICA GmbH. Your focus on building a growing brand with strong visual identity caught my attention, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to your design projects.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have developed a strong sense of design and aesthetics through years of building user interfaces. I regularly use Figma for design work and have created responsive, visually consistent layouts using Tailwind CSS and Material UI across multiple full-stack applications. I understand how design and functionality work together to create compelling user experiences.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the opportunity to work directly on real brand assets like social media designs, flyers, posters, and campaigns. I enjoy creative work and have experience making design decisions that balance visual appeal with practical usability. I am comfortable taking ownership of tasks and collaborating closely with a small team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently enrolled as a Software Engineering student and looking for a practical internship where I can apply my design skills and grow. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the SEVEN team.', '2026-06-25 01:40:10.711', '2026-06-25 01:40:10.711'),
(1565, 1567, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Swift\",\"SwiftUI\",\"Fastlane\",\"Multithreading Programming\"]', 'The applicant has some transferable skills in Git and CI/CD, but lacks the core iOS-specific technologies (Swift, SwiftUI, Fastlane) and mobile development experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer, iOS Core Product role at Speechify. Your mission to remove reading barriers and your recognition as Apple\'s 2025 Design Award winner for inclusivity are genuinely inspiring. I want to contribute to a product that impacts millions of users, including those with learning differences.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have shipped production code, maintained complex application architectures, and worked within dedicated product teams to deliver features that scale. I have experience with Git and CI/CD infrastructure, and I write code following SOLID principles to ensure maintainability and reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to participate in product discussions and shape the roadmap. In my previous roles, I collaborated closely with stakeholders and engineering teammates to make thoughtful product decisions, balancing speed with quality. I am comfortable working in a flat, distributed team and know how to stay focused while delivering results consistently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Speechify\'s iOS Core Product team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 01:40:18.279', '2026-06-25 01:40:18.279'),
(1566, 1568, 1, 25, '[\"Kotlin\",\"React Native\",\"Flutter\",\"Node JS\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"5+ years Android-specific experience\",\"Kotlin Coroutines\",\"Kotlin Flow\",\"Dagger 2\",\"MVVM\",\"Clean Architecture\",\"Background Services\",\"Music Player Service\",\"Android Animations\",\"Jetpack Navigation\",\"JUnit tests\",\"Jetpack Compose\",\"Room\",\"Custom Views\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills (Kotlin, mobile development with Flutter/React Native, testing experience) but lacks deep Android-specific expertise required for this senior role. Key missing technologies include Kotlin Coroutines, Dagger 2, MVVM, Clean Architecture, Jetpack Navigation, and JUnit. The role requires 5+ years of Android engineering experience, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Tech Lead, Android Core Product role at Speechify. Your mission to make reading accessible to everyone through text-to-speech technology is genuinely impactful, and I appreciate the focus on building products that support people with learning differences.\n\nThrough my software engineering work, I have built mobile and web applications using Kotlin, Flutter, and React Native. I have experience with Android components, real-time communication systems, and integrating APIs for authentication, payments, and data processing. I understand the importance of writing tests and maintaining clean, reliable code.\n\nIn previous projects, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using React, Node.js, and Socket.IO, and built a multi-vendor e-commerce platform with Laravel and Flutter. These experiences taught me how to own features end to end, work closely with design teams, and maintain reliability metrics under production conditions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Speechify\'s Android team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 01:40:26.685', '2026-06-25 01:40:26.685'),
(1567, 1569, 1, 45, '[\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Google Cloud\",\"AWS\",\"Python\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"5+ years industry experience\",\"Terraform\",\"Web crawlers\",\"Large-scale data processing\",\"BS/MS/PhD in CS\"]', 'Shahanur has relevant infrastructure skills (Docker, Linux, Google Cloud, AWS, Python, CI/CD) that match the role\'s core technical requirements. However, the job requires 5+ years of industry experience and a BS/MS/PhD in CS, which are not fully met. Experience with Terraform, web crawlers, and large-scale data processing is also missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer, Data Infrastructure & Acquisition role at Speechify. Speechify\'s mission to remove reading barriers through AI-powered text-to-speech technology is genuinely impactful, and the opportunity to contribute to the data infrastructure that powers next-generation models aligns directly with my engineering experience.\n\nMy background combines software engineering with infrastructure and automation. I have professional experience working with Docker, Linux environments, and cloud providers including Google Cloud and AWS. I am comfortable with bash scripting and Python for automating workflows and processing data. I have deployed and maintained production applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Apache, and Docker, with CI/CD pipelines for reliable releases.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building and extending ingestion pipelines. In previous work, I developed systems that involved real-time data streaming, API integration, and database optimization. I have worked with tools like Socket.IO for live data delivery and have experience managing cloud infrastructure for scalable applications. I am comfortable operating in environments where infrastructure, engineering, and research work closely together.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background in software engineering and infrastructure can support Speechify\'s data acquisition and model training operations.', '2026-06-25 01:40:35.579', '2026-06-25 01:40:35.579'),
(1568, 1570, 1, 45, '[\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"Javascript\",\"Google Cloud\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Kotlin\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP) experience\",\"SDK development experience\",\"Cross-platform mobile SDK experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong backend engineering skills with Node.js, TypeScript, and cloud platforms (AWS, GCP), and has experience with real-time systems, Docker, and microservices. However, the role specifically requires Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP) experience for building cross-platform SDKs, which is not present in the profile. The applicant\'s Kotlin knowledge is listed but without evidence of multiplatform or SDK development work. The match is partial, with transferable backend and systems skills but a gap in the core KMP requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer, Core Experiences role at Speechify. Your mission to make information accessible through audio is something I find genuinely compelling, and I appreciate the focus on building foundational services that directly improve user experience across platforms.\n\nMy technical background is rooted in full-stack development with an emphasis on backend systems, APIs, and real-time communication. I have worked extensively with Node.js, TypeScript, and Express to build scalable services, and I have experience deploying cloud functions and managing infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud. I also have familiarity with Kotlin and have worked with cross-platform development tools, which connects to your preferred tech stack.\n\nA relevant example is a real-time server health monitoring system I built, which involved designing a Node.js and Express backend with Socket.IO for live data streaming, JWT-based authentication, and a fully Dockerized deployment with Nginx. This project required systems thinking to optimize end-to-end performance and reliability, similar to the kind of work your Core Experiences team does with foundational services and SDKs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with the needs of your team.', '2026-06-25 01:40:45.424', '2026-06-25 01:40:45.424'),
(1569, 1571, 1, 35, '[\"Kotlin\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Kotlin Multiplatform\",\"SDK development\",\"cross-platform SDK experience\",\"Java (preferred but not required)\"]', 'The applicant has relevant backend engineering skills including Kotlin, Google Cloud, TypeScript, Node.js, and API development. However, the role specifically requires Kotlin Multiplatform and cross-platform SDK experience, which are not present in the profile. The match is partial with a score of 35 out of 100.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer, Core Experiences role at Speechify. Your mission to make information accessible through audio is genuinely impactful, and I appreciate the focus on building foundational services that directly improve user experience across platforms.\n\nMy background is in full-stack and backend engineering, with strong experience designing clear APIs and building scalable services. I have worked extensively with Node.js, Express, TypeScript, and Kotlin, and have deployed cloud functions and backend services on AWS and Google Cloud. I value simplicity in system design and understand the importance of end-to-end thinking when optimizing performance and reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building cross-platform SDKs and foundational services. In previous work, I developed real-time communication systems using WebSocket and WebRTC, and built scalable backend architectures with role-based access control, database optimization, and secure authentication. I also have experience shipping cloud functions and lightweight backend jobs, which