(1570, 1572, 1, 72, '[\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Microservices\",\"Redis\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Jest\"]', '[\"GCP (direct experience not explicitly detailed in profile)\",\"High availability Kubernetes deployments (preferred, not required)\"]', 'Strong backend engineering match with TypeScript/Node.js experience, cloud infrastructure knowledge (AWS, Google Cloud), and containerization skills (Docker, Kubernetes). Missing direct GCP experience and high-availability Kubernetes deployment expertise, but core backend skills align well with the Platform role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer, Platform role at Speechify. Your mission to remove reading barriers through text-to-speech technology is something I find genuinely impactful, and the work your Platform team does building and maintaining backend services like payments, subscriptions, and external APIs is exactly the kind of engineering challenge I enjoy solving.\n\nMy professional experience centers on backend development with TypeScript and Node.js, which aligns directly with your required stack. Over the past few years, I have designed and maintained RESTful APIs for authentication, payment processing, and data management, ensuring they remain performant and scalable as user demands grow. I have also worked with cloud infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud, deploying services that require reliability and uptime.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building internal and public APIs that other teams and products depend on. In previous work, I developed and maintained APIs for financial applications and real estate platforms, handling role-based access, subscription logic, and third-party integrations. These systems required careful attention to scalability, error handling, and clear documentation, which I understand is central to the Platform team\'s responsibilities at Speechify.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend engineering experience can contribute to Speechify\'s platform and product goals.', '2026-06-25 01:41:03.890', '2026-06-25 01:41:03.890'),
(1571, 1573, 1, 32, '[\"Python\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Pandas\",\"NumPy\",\"Scikit-learn\",\"XGBoost\",\"ClickHouse\",\"Churn Prediction\",\"Sentiment Analysis\",\"Member Segmentation\",\"Statistics fundamentals\",\"A/B testing\",\"Recommendation systems\",\"LLMs\"]', 'The applicant has foundational Python and SQL skills, plus experience with databases and deployment tools. However, the role requires specialized data science expertise (Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn, XGBoost, ClickHouse) and experience with churn prediction, sentiment analysis, and member segmentation, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s background is primarily in full-stack web development and AI engineering, not data science.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Scientist role on the Community Data Team at Atolls. The idea of working on applied ML problems that directly shape how millions of users discover deals every day is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and iterated ML models using Python and libraries like Pandas, NumPy, and Scikit-learn. One example is my Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, where I trained a YOLOv8n object detection model, optimized it for real-time inference on edge hardware, and evaluated its performance using precision, recall, and latency metrics. That project taught me how to define what \"good\" looks like when there is no clear benchmark, and how to validate results honestly.\n\nI am comfortable writing complex SQL queries and working with large datasets. In my full-stack development work, I have designed database schemas, written optimized queries with CTEs and window functions, and processed behavioral data across MySQL and PostgreSQL. I know how to translate raw data into actionable insights.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Community Data Team at Atolls.', '2026-06-25 01:41:12.070', '2026-06-25 01:41:12.070'),
(1572, 1574, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social media content creation\",\"Video shooting and editing\",\"Camera and Gimbal operation\",\"CapCut\",\"Event coverage\",\"Community management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical and AI skills, but the job is a social media content creation role requiring video production, camera work, and community management. There is minimal direct overlap in required skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media internship at SEVEN APICA GmbH. Your focus on creativity, hands-on content production, and direct collaboration with founders aligns well with how I like to work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring practical experience with AI tools and technologies that directly support modern content workflows. Through my project work, I have integrated AI APIs such as OpenAI and Replicate for image processing and intelligent automation. I am comfortable working with video and image processing pipelines and can quickly learn tools like CapCut, Gimbal, and camera equipment.\n\nWhat stands out to me about SEVEN is the emphasis on taking responsibility and shaping the brand actively rather than just following instructions. I work best when given ownership and trust, and I enjoy contributing to both creative and technical aspects of a project. My experience building full-stack applications has taught me to work independently, solve problems practically, and deliver results without needing constant supervision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a 6-month mandatory internship where I can apply my creativity, technical adaptability, and willingness to learn. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the SEVEN team.', '2026-06-25 01:41:20.373', '2026-06-25 01:41:20.373'),
(1573, 1575, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Active Sourcing\",\"Employer Branding\",\"People Operations\",\"ATS (Personio, JOIN, Greenhouse, Recruitee)\",\"LinkedIn Recruiter\",\"Copywriting\",\"HR KPIs\",\"Zapier/n8n\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR, recruiting, or people operations experience. The only potential overlap is the \'AI-first\' requirement, as the applicant has experience building AI-powered systems and automation. However, the core HR skills (active sourcing, employer branding, people ops, ATS, LinkedIn Recruiter) are entirely missing. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sr. Recruiter / HR Manager (Top1%) role at FINE DINE Verlags GmbH. Your focus on building a high-performance team through proactive sourcing, employer branding, and AI-first HR operations stands out to me.\n\nMy technical background is in software engineering, with a strong emphasis on AI and automation. Through hands-on project development, I have built systems that integrate AI for practical tasks such as data processing, real-time analysis, and automated workflows. This experience directly supports your goal of using AI as a scaling lever for HR, including sourcing list generation, outreach personalization, and CV pre-screening.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building data-driven systems. I have experience working with databases, APIs, and real-time data pipelines, which aligns with your need for a data-driven approach to HR KPIs like Time-to-Hire, eNPS, and Retention. I am comfortable building automated workflows that deliver measurable results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in AI automation and systems building can contribute to FINE DINE\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 01:41:29.558', '2026-06-25 01:41:29.558'),
(1574, 1576, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Pressearbeit\",\"PR\",\"Unternehmenskommunikation\",\"Social Media Management\",\"Content Strategy\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Media relations\",\"Krisenkommunikation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the role requires PR, communications, and social media expertise with German language proficiency. There is no direct overlap in required skills or experience. The applicant\'s understanding of digital communities and gaming culture is a minor positive, but the core qualifications for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter:in Presse- und Öffentlichkeitsarbeit / PR & Social Media role at InkuPlay. Your work at the intersection of eSports, gaming, community, and digital entertainment is exactly the kind of environment where I can contribute meaningfully.\n\nAlthough my core expertise is in software engineering, I have spent years working at the intersection of technology, content, and user communities. Building full-stack platforms has required me to think strategically about how information flows, how audiences engage, and how brands communicate clearly across digital channels. I understand the gaming and eSports space not just as a developer, but as someone who follows the culture, the platforms, and the communities that define it.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have managed end-to-end product communication for web platforms, including drafting clear documentation, coordinating with stakeholders, and ensuring that technical updates are communicated in accessible ways. I have also built content management systems and publishing dashboards that required careful attention to editorial workflows, content formatting, and user experience. These experiences have given me practical skills in structuring information, planning content, and maintaining consistency across digital touchpoints.\n\nWhat stands out to me about InkuPlay is the opportunity to build a brand presence from the ground up in a growing startup. I am comfortable working hands-on, taking initiative, and shaping communication structures that scale. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background in digital platforms and community-driven development can support InkuPlay\'s communication goals.', '2026-06-25 01:41:40.084', '2026-06-25 01:41:40.084'),
(1575, 1577, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Business Analysis\",\"Data Analytics\",\"Business Intelligence\",\"CRM systems\",\"Project Management Systems\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"PowerBI\",\"Tableau\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, but the Junior Business Analyst role requires skills in business analysis, data analytics, BI tools (PowerBI, Tableau), CRM/project management systems, and German language proficiency. The applicant\'s profile does not contain these specific business analysis skills or tools. The match score is low due to the significant gap between the applicant\'s technical engineering profile and the business analyst requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Business Analyst position at FASTR Energy (formerly EGC Energie und Gebäudetechnik GmbH) in Berlin. Your company\'s role as a decarbonization partner in the German energy transition is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the opportunity to contribute during this growth phase.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong analytical and process-oriented skills. I have worked on projects that required structured documentation, data quality management, and regular reporting to stakeholders. My work involved analyzing workflows, identifying inefficiencies, and implementing improvements to ensure smooth operations across teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of data analysis and project management. In my previous roles, I supported project management systems, maintained structured documentation of activities and budgets, and created regular performance reports. I am comfortable