(1576, 1578, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Microservices\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Scrum\",\"SAFe\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills with modern JavaScript frameworks (React, Next.js, TypeScript), cloud experience (AWS, Docker), and microservices knowledge. However, the role requires fluent German (C1), Java experience, and agile leadership experience (Scrum/SAFe), which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Cloud Fullstack Developer position at Pertemps ERP. The combination of cloud-native development, architectural responsibility, and hands-on technical work makes this role particularly interesting to me.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and delivered full-stack applications using modern JavaScript frameworks such as Next.js, React, and TypeScript, paired with Laravel on the backend. I have designed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways and third-party services into production systems.\n\nOne area that aligns well with this role is my work with cloud technologies and containerization. I have deployed applications on AWS (EC2, Amplify, S3), configured Nginx and Apache on Linux servers, and used Docker for containerized development and deployment. I have also worked with CI/CD pipelines to streamline releases and ensure application reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 01:41:57.506', '2026-06-25 01:41:57.506'),
(1577, 1579, 1, 35, '[]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Instagram content creation\",\"Reel editing in CapCut\",\"Trend analysis\",\"Brand building\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong AI tool experience (ChatGPT, Claude) and visual design skills from web development. However, the role requires direct social media management, Instagram content creation, reel editing, and trend analysis skills which are not present in the profile. The AI tool experience is relevant but secondary to the core social media requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager:in (Werkstudent/Minijob/Praktikum) - Instagram role at MindElevate. What you are building with MindElevate a mental fitness app that already has strong product-market fit with over 10,000 users and a 4.8/5 rating is genuinely impressive. I would welcome the chance to contribute to growing your organic reach and building Philipp\'s personal brand on Instagram.\n\nOne area where I can add value is the creative use of AI tools. I have built production systems using OpenAI\'s API and AWS Transcribe, and I regularly work with Claude and ChatGPT to accelerate development and content workflows. I do not just use these tools as a power user I understand how they work under the hood and how to push them beyond basic prompts. This means I can help you generate ideas faster, test more formats, and refine content with real efficiency.\n\nBeyond AI, I bring a strong visual and creative sense. I have designed and built full-stack web applications with polished UIs using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI. This experience gives me a sharp eye for layout, typography, and what looks good visually. I am comfortable editing in CapCut or similar tools and understand how sound, pacing, and visual rhythm make content work on Instagram.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can think independently, test ideas, and take real ownership. Your description of wanting a creative sparring partner rather than just an executor matches how I prefer to work. I have attached my CV for your review and would be happy to share content samples or ideas.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 01:42:09.167', '2026-06-25 01:42:09.167'),
(1578, 1580, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Operational role experience (3-5 years)\",\"VC, consulting, or investment banking background\",\"Advanced PowerPoint and Excel\",\"Quantitative analysis and financial modelling\",\"Fundraising or investor-facing work\",\"Industrial biotech or materials science background\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a non-technical Strategy & Operations Lead requiring 3-5 years of operational experience in startups, VC, consulting, or investment banking. There is minimal direct skill overlap. The applicant\'s structured thinking, ownership mentality, and interest in deep tech are relevant soft attributes, but the core required experience and tools (PowerPoint, Excel, financial modelling, investor relations) are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Strategy & Operations Lead position at Cambrium. What Cambrium is doing engineering molecules with precision using an AI engine to create sustainable performance chemicals is genuinely interesting. The chance to work at the centre of a deep-tech company\'s strategic and operational engine, reporting directly to the CEO, is exactly the kind of high-ownership role I am looking for.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, but my work has always extended beyond pure technical delivery. I have consistently taken ownership of cross-functional projects, coordinated with stakeholders across teams, and built systems that required structured thinking and clear documentation. Whether it was designing a full-stack platform from scratch or managing deployment pipelines, I have learned to break down complex problems into actionable steps and drive them to completion.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility around strategic projects and investor relations. In my previous roles, I prepared materials for internal and external stakeholders, managed project timelines, and ensured high-quality follow-through on decisions. I am comfortable with quantitative analysis and have used data to inform product and business decisions. I also have experience coordinating with leadership teams to align priorities and track progress.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am structured, detail-oriented, and comfortable with ambiguity. I do not wait to be told what to do.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:42:20.086', '2026-06-25 01:42:20.086'),
(1579, 1581, 1, 15, '[\"Python\",\"YOLOv8n\",\"AI\",\"English\"]', '[\"Videoproduktion\",\"Paid Ads\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"Video-Creatives\",\"Schnitt\",\"Motion-Design\",\"Deutsch (sehr gut)\",\"Dreh-Organisation\",\"Kamera-Erfahrung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily software engineering and AI-focused, with no direct experience in video production, paid social ads, or content creation. A few AI-related skills (Python, YOLOv8n) partially overlap with the \'experience with AI-supported work\' requirement, but the core qualifications for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Paid Social Content Creator position at Ordio GmbH. Your mission to build an all-in-one platform for deskless workers is a genuinely interesting problem, and I appreciate that you are looking for someone to own the video identity from the ground up.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, but I have consistently worked on projects that involve video processing, real-time streaming, and AI-powered content generation. Through my work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) project, I built a complete video pipeline using YOLOv8n-based object detection with ultra-low latency UDP streaming. This required me to think about frame rates, encoding, cutdowns, and real-time delivery across different formats, which maps directly to the production ownership you described.\n\nI also have experience with AI-assisted workflows. In my AI-powered financial and real estate projects, I trained custom AI assistants using OpenAI models and integrated them with voice processing, image analysis, and automated document generation. I understand how to use AI tools to speed up creative iteration and testing, which aligns with your requirement for experience with AI-supported work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and creative background can contribute to building Ordio\'s video presence.', '2026-06-25 01:42:29.940', '2026-06-25 01:42:29.940'),
(1580, 1582, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Wirtschaftswissenschaften Studium\",\"Jahresabschlussprüfung nach HGB\",\"Steuerrecht\",\"Genossenschaftsrecht\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in auditing, accounting, or tax law. The job requires a degree in economics/business with a focus on accounting, at least 3 years of HGB audit experience, tax law knowledge, and a driving license. There is no skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Teamleiter Wirtschaftsprüfung position at DOMUS Consult Wirtschaftsberatungsgesellschaft mbH. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than auditing, I bring strong analytical capabilities, experience with data integrity, and a proven ability to manage complex, detail-oriented work.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained systems that handle sensitive financial data, implemented role-based access controls, and ensured data accuracy across multiple platforms. I have worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases, designed reporting systems, and developed secure authentication workflows. These responsibilities required the same attention to detail, structured thinking, and commitment to quality that auditing demands.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on maintaining high quality standards and supporting the development of team members. In my previous roles, I have collaborated closely with colleagues, reviewed code, and contributed to knowledge-sharing sessions. I am comfortable taking ownership of tasks, communicating clearly with stakeholders, and ensuring that work is delivered reliably.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 01:42:38.570', '2026-06-25 01:42:38.570');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1581, 1583, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Sales/Account Management experience\",\"ERP/CRM system experience (e.g., SAP Business One)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Team leadership experience\",\"Commercial/business education\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no sales, account management, team leadership, or ERP/CRM experience. The role requires 5+ years of sales leadership, German language skills, and a commercial background, which the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Teamleiter Vertriebsinnendienst position at MR-Shop GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong process optimization, team coordination, and analytical skills that are directly transferable to leading an internal sales team.\n\nIn my work as a Web Developer, I have been responsible for structuring workflows, improving operational efficiency, and collaborating across departments such as logistics and accounting. I regularly analyze performance data, identify bottlenecks, and implement process improvements to meet delivery and quality targets.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to develop and optimize sales processes from order processing through customer follow-up. My experience building and maintaining complex systems has given me a structured, data-driven approach to problem-solving and a clear understanding of how to use KPIs to drive results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and look forward to the possibility of contributing to MR-Shop GmbH\'s continued success.', '2026-06-25 01:42:46.065', '2026-06-25 01:42:46.065'),
(1582, 1584, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"German language proficiency\",\"Consulting experience\",\"Client acquisition experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s technical background in software engineering and data management provides some transferable skills, but the role requires German language proficiency and consulting experience which are not present in the profile. The role explicitly states prior knowledge is not required and emphasizes training, which is positive.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter in der Unternehmensberatung position at Finanzberatung-Albig. Your focus on analyzing government funding programs and optimizing fixed costs for clients in energy, insurance, and banking sectors is particularly interesting to me. I appreciate the emphasis on thorough training and professional development for team members.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in digital data management, structured analysis, and client communication. I have worked with databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL, performed detailed data entry and maintenance, and created preliminary evaluations to support business decisions. These technical and analytical capabilities transfer well to the consulting support role you are looking to fill.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the client-facing aspect of this position. In my previous roles, I regularly communicated with clients both remotely and in person, managed their requirements, and ensured accurate data handling throughout project lifecycles. I am comfortable working independently and take a structured approach to tasks, which aligns with your need for self-sufficient team members.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical mindset, technical skills, and client-focused approach to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to Finanzberatung-Albig\'s success.', '2026-06-25 01:42:54.763', '2026-06-25 01:42:54.763'),
(1583, 1585, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Einzelhandelserfahrung auf großen Verkaufsflächen\",\"Mitarbeiterführung und -entwicklung\",\"Recruiting\",\"Führungspersönlichkeit\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no retail or store management experience. The only potential overlap is an \'affinity for modern technologies, software and systems\' mentioned in the job qualifications. The applicant has strong technical skills but lacks the core retail, team leadership, and recruiting experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Deputy Store Manager position at Reserved Store Hannover. Reserved\'s approach of combining fashion with modern technology is something I find genuinely interesting, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a store team that values both performance and people.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong affinity for technology, software systems, and data-driven processes. I am comfortable working with reports, KPIs, and benchmarks, and I understand how to use data to monitor performance, identify areas for improvement, and support operational decisions. This analytical mindset would help me contribute to the store\'s performance goals and quality standards.\n\nIn my previous roles, I worked closely with cross-functional teams, communicated clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders, and took ownership of tasks from planning through execution. I am used to working in structured environments where processes matter, but I also adapt quickly when situations require a hands-on approach. I believe this combination of process orientation and flexibility aligns well with the responsibilities of supporting store leadership and maintaining a positive shopping atmosphere.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to the Reserved team in Hannover.', '2026-06-25 01:43:04.248', '2026-06-25 01:43:04.248'),
(1584, 1586, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Einzelhandelserfahrung\",\"Mitarbeiterführung\",\"Recruiting\",\"KPIs und Benchmarks\",\"Prozessorientierung im Einzelhandel\"]', 'The applicant has strong technology affinity and process-oriented thinking, but lacks direct retail management experience, team leadership in a store environment, and familiarity with fashion retail KPIs. The match is low for this specific role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Deputy Store Manager position at Reserved Store Bremen. Your description of Reserved as a fast-growing fashion company that combines trends with technology caught my attention. I appreciate the emphasis on team development, performance, and process-oriented leadership.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and process-driven skills that translate well into retail management. In my previous roles, I worked with KPIs, performance reports, and benchmarks to track progress and make data-informed decisions. I am comfortable with modern software systems and digital tools, which aligns with your requirement for affinity to technology.\n\nThrough my experience working in cross-functional teams, I have learned to communicate clearly, support colleagues in their development, and maintain a focus on quality standards. I approach tasks with a hands-on mentality and think holistically about how different parts of a business connect. I am used to taking ownership of outcomes and ensuring that processes run smoothly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to bring my organizational skills, technology affinity, and team-oriented mindset to the Reserved team in Bremen. My CV is attached for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:43:14.280', '2026-06-25 01:43:14.280'),
(1585, 1587, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Cooking\",\"Menu planning\",\"Budget management\",\"Food preparation\",\"Kitchen management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering with no relevant experience or skills in kitchen management, cooking, or food service. There is a significant mismatch between the job requirements and the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Küchenleitung position at Empowerland gUG for the summer camp taking place from 16.08. to 22.08.2026 in Mödingen.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational, planning, and coordination skills through managing complex technical projects. I am accustomed to working within defined budgets, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and ensuring that operations run smoothly under time constraints.\n\nI am a quick learner and a hard worker, and I am confident I can apply these skills to manage the kitchen for 30-40 people. I am comfortable with menu planning, food preparation, and maintaining a clean and efficient workspace.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for the full duration of the camp and can assist with food shopping using my own vehicle. I look forward to the opportunity to contribute to a great camp experience for the teens.', '2026-06-25 01:43:21.494', '2026-06-25 01:43:21.494'),
(1586, 1588, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Einzelhandelserfahrung\",\"Mitarbeiterführung\",\"Recruiting\",\"Store Management\",\"KPIs und Benchmarks\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no retail or store management experience. The role requires multi-year retail experience, team leadership, and people development skills, which are not present in the profile. The only potential overlap is a general affinity for technology and process orientation, but this is insufficient for a store manager position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Filialleiter / Store Manager position at Reserved Store Bremen. Reserved\'s approach of combining modern fashion trends with forward-thinking technology is something I find genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the company\'s commitment to equal opportunity.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and managing full-stack web applications. This experience has given me a strong sense of process orientation, a hands-on mentality, and the ability to work with KPIs, reports, and structured workflows to drive performance. I am used to taking ownership of complex systems, ensuring quality standards are met, and continuously improving outcomes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the role\'s emphasis on technology affinity and modern systems. In my previous work, I have regularly used software tools, dashboards, and data-driven approaches to monitor performance, track progress, and make informed decisions. I am comfortable learning new systems quickly and applying them to improve operational efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my process-oriented mindset, hands-on approach, and ability to work with modern systems would allow me to contribute positively to your store team in Bremen. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support Reserved\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-25 01:43:30.866', '2026-06-25 01:43:30.866'),
(1587, 1589, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Product Marketing experience (2+ years)\",\"Go-to-market strategy\",\"Sales enablement materials creation\",\"Market and competitive analysis\",\"German language (native)\",\"B2B SaaS domain experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Product Marketing Manager role requires 2+ years of direct product marketing experience, go-to-market strategy, sales enablement, market analysis, and native German language skills. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct product marketing, sales, or marketing experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Marketing Manager position at Workist GmbH. The opportunity to build the product marketing function from the ground up, working at the intersection of AI, B2B SaaS, and go-to-market strategy, is what draws me to this role.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering with a strong focus on AI-powered applications. Through hands-on project development, I have built and launched platforms that integrate AI assistants, payment gateways, real-time communication, and role-based access control. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how complex products are architected, what makes them valuable to users, and how to communicate that value clearly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on positioning, messaging, and cross-functional collaboration. In my work developing AI-powered financial and real estate applications, I collaborated closely with product and engineering teams to define feature requirements, align on user workflows, and support go-to-market efforts. I am comfortable translating technical capabilities into clear, compelling narratives for different audiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to Workist\'s product marketing efforts.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 01:43:40.335', '2026-06-25 01:43:40.335'),
(1588, 1590, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Formação em Direito\",\"Experiência com monitoria pedagógica\",\"Domínio de Raciocínio Lógico como disciplina\",\"Domínio de Informática como disciplina\",\"Experiência com concursos públicos jurídicos\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong logical and technical skills, but the role requires specific legal education, exam preparation experience, and pedagogical monitoring background that are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Monitor de Concursos Raciocínio Lógico + Informática position at Vício. Your focus on adapting exam materials for public tender preparation in the legal field caught my attention, and I believe my technical background and logical approach to structuring information would be valuable for this role.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in logical reasoning and systematic problem-solving. My daily work involves analyzing complex requirements, identifying patterns, and breaking down information into clear, structured components. These skills transfer directly to the task of analyzing exam patterns and adapting content to match how topics are tested.\n\nI am proficient with Google Drive and Canva, and I regularly create visual materials such as slides and structured documents for technical documentation and project presentations. I understand the importance of clear, organized, and visually accessible content for effective learning.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:43:48.731', '2026-06-25 01:43:48.731'),
(1589, 1591, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Proven experience as a data entry clerk or similar role\",\"Excellent typing speed and accuracy\",\"Proficiency with MS Office Suite, especially Excel\",\"High school diploma or equivalent\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Data Entry Clerk role requires specific data entry experience, typing proficiency, and MS Office skills that are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Entry Clerk position at Mercer County Works. The role\'s focus on accuracy, data integrity, and remote collaboration aligns well with my work style and experience.\n\nThroughout my career as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits and a meticulous approach to handling information. Working with databases and data-driven applications has trained me to verify data for consistency, perform regular quality checks, and maintain confidentiality of sensitive information.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to streamline data processes and improve data integrity. In my previous work, I have consistently met deadlines and productivity targets while collaborating effectively with team members in remote settings. I am comfortable working independently and managing time efficiently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:43:54.860', '2026-06-25 01:43:54.860'),
(1590, 1592, 1, 10, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Construction estimating experience\",\"Knowledge of construction industry\",\"Estimating software (AutoCAD, Bluebeam, P6)\",\"Project controls knowledge\",\"Contract language knowledge\",\"Value engineering experience\",\"Quantity takeoff experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Senior Estimator role at Aecon Group Inc. The role requires 5-8 years of construction estimating experience, knowledge of construction industry technical matters, and proficiency with estimating software. The applicant has no construction or estimating experience in their profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Senior Estimator position at Aecon Group Inc. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than construction estimating, I bring a strong foundation in data analysis, project coordination, and technical problem-solving that can contribute to your estimating team.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed strong analytical skills working with complex data systems, databases, and cost-related calculations. I am experienced in reading and interpreting technical documentation, managing detailed project information, and maintaining accurate records. These skills translate well to the responsibilities of preparing cost estimates, analyzing project requirements, and maintaining historical cost data.\n\nI have worked on projects that required careful attention to budgets, timelines, and resource allocation. In my previous roles, I collaborated with cross-functional teams, communicated with stakeholders, and ensured that project deliverables met specifications. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, databases, and software tools to organize and analyze information.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and organizational skills can support Aecon\'s estimating operations.', '2026-06-25 01:44:03.186', '2026-06-25 01:44:03.186'),
(1591, 1593, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Film campaign leadership\",\"Kickstarter campaign management\",\"Social media content strategy for films\",\"Audience building for film releases\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in film campaign creative direction, Kickstarter management, or social media content strategy for films. The role requires a proven track record in film crowdfunding and audience building, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Creative Director role for BUBLIK at Strange Face. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I understand that launching a film requires a clear narrative, a strategic content rollout, and the ability to convert an audience into active backers. These are challenges I have tackled in building and launching digital products from the ground up.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have led the end-to-end creation of platforms where user engagement and conversion were the primary metrics. For example, I built a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem that required coordinating multiple stakeholder types, crafting a clear user journey, and ensuring the platform told a coherent story from onboarding to transaction. The same principles apply to a film campaign: knowing how to tease, reveal, and convert an audience.\n\nI have also developed AI-powered applications where the user experience and the narrative of the product were critical to adoption. Building the Smart Finance platform meant designing a system that users would trust and return to, which required a clear content strategy and a focus on how the product communicated its value. I approach every project as a story that needs to be told effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in building and launching products can contribute to a successful Kickstarter and social campaign for BUBLIK.', '2026-06-25 01:44:12.286', '2026-06-25 01:44:12.286'),
(1592, 1594, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Social media strategy\",\"Content creation\",\"Instagram management\",\"Brand storytelling\",\"Video editing\",\"Copywriting\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct social media management, content creation, or brand storytelling experience. The role requires owning Instagram, building brand presence, and creating engaging content — skills not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager role at Strange Face. What you\'ve described — a young agency that values story over noise, craft over volume — is exactly the kind of environment where I want to contribute.\n\nYou asked applicants to skip the generic cover letter and show the work. I respect that. So instead of listing qualifications, I\'ll share what I\'ve built. I developed Free Games Hub, a full-stack platform built with Laravel and Tailwind CSS that combines user authentication, KYC verification, a points economy, casino integrations, lottery systems, referral tracking, deposit and withdrawal flows, VIP rewards, two-factor authentication, real-time notifications, and a full administrative backend. It\'s a system designed to keep people engaged, not just logged in.\n\nI also built a multivendor e-commerce ecosystem connecting customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams through role-based Flutter applications and a Laravel backend. That project taught me how to shape user journeys across different touchpoints and ensure every interaction feels intentional.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI\'ve attached my CV for your review. I\'d welcome the chance to talk about how I can help Strange Face show up online in a way people actually remember.', '2026-06-25 01:44:19.889', '2026-06-25 01:44:19.889'),
(1593, 1595, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience via phone or call center\",\"Medical billing or insurance experience\",\"Electronic medical record systems (e.g., Athena, Epic)\",\"Google Suite proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct patient advocacy, medical billing, or healthcare customer service experience. The role requires 2-3 years of call center/customer service experience and 1-2 years of medical billing or insurance experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s strong technical skills do not align with the core requirements of this Patient Advocate position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Patient Advocate position at Cedar. Your mission to make healthcare more affordable and accessible through data science and personalization is something I find genuinely meaningful. The idea of helping patients navigate the complexity of medical billing and improving their overall experience resonates with me.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication, problem-solving, and client-facing skills through years of direct collaboration with stakeholders and end-users. I am comfortable handling inquiries via phone, chat, and email, and I know how to listen carefully, explain clearly, and follow through on commitments.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly interacted with clients to understand their needs, troubleshoot issues, and deliver solutions on time. I learned to manage multiple priorities, stay organized under pressure, and communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical people. These experiences have prepared me to handle the patient-facing responsibilities of this role.\n\nI am a self-motivated individual who works well independently in remote environments. I pay close attention to detail and am comfortable toggling between multiple systems and tools. I am also open to ambiguity and changing priorities, which I understand is part of working in a fast-growing healthcare technology company.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 01:44:28.700', '2026-06-25 01:44:28.700'),
(1594, 1596, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Executive support experience\",\"HR administration experience\",\"HRIS/payroll systems experience\",\"Benefits administration\",\"Onboarding coordination\",\"3+ years in similar role\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is an Executive Assistant & HR Administrator requiring 3+ years of experience in executive support, HR administration, and people operations. The applicant\'s profile does not contain any relevant HR, administrative, or executive support experience or skills. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Executive Assistant & HR Administrator role at People Architects. This position combines operational support, employee engagement, and coordination responsibilities that help leadership stay focused on growth and strategic priorities. I appreciate the emphasis on creating structure and improving communication within a fully remote organization.\n\nMy professional background has given me strong organizational and coordination skills. In my previous roles, I worked closely with company leadership, managed project timelines, coordinated team communications, and maintained documentation across multiple workstreams. I am comfortable handling details, prioritizing tasks, and ensuring that nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is supporting employee experience and culture in a remote setting. I have experience working with distributed teams and understand the importance of clear communication, structured processes, and consistent follow-through. I am confident in my ability to help maintain employee records, coordinate onboarding and offboarding activities, and support internal communications.\n\nIn addition to my operational experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:44:36.757', '2026-06-25 01:44:36.757'),
(1595, 1597, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Video editing\",\"After Effects\",\"Motion graphics\",\"Color grading\",\"Short-form content creation\",\"Social media video production\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct video editing or social media content creation experience. While they have built AI systems that process video (object detection), the core requirements of this role (short-form video editing, hooks, pacing, captions, sound design, brand consistency, high weekly output) are not present in their profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Video Editor role at Adoreal. Your focus on using AI-assisted workflows to scale short-form video production across multiple practice brands is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nMy background is in full-stack and AI engineering, but I have built systems that process video and image content at scale. One project that directly relates to this role is Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), a real-time assistive system I developed using YOLOv8n-based object detection. The system processes live video frames locally, applies ultra-low latency streaming, and delivers audio feedback in real time. This required me to optimize for speed, accuracy, and output quality while working within hardware constraints.\n\nIn that project, I treated AI tools as part of my daily workflow rather than a novelty. I used Python for the detection pipeline, C++ for performance-critical components, and custom UDP streaming to minimize latency. The system runs fully offline, which taught me how to compress processing time without making the output feel generic or low quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can bring speed, consistency, and a practical AI-assisted workflow to your video production pipeline. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Adoreal\'s marketing team.', '2026-06-25 01:44:46.650', '2026-06-25 01:44:46.650'),
(1596, 1598, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Social media content creation\",\"Video production\",\"On-camera experience\",\"Instagram/TikTok expertise\",\"Brand ambassadorship\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack, AI, backend) with no demonstrated experience in social media content creation, video production, on-camera work, or brand ambassadorship. The only overlapping skill is Figma for design. The location requirement (NY/NJ) is met, but the core qualifications for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Content Creator role with Wripple\'s retail grocery client. Although my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in visual communication, user engagement, and content creation that aligns well with this opportunity.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and built user interfaces that prioritize clarity, storytelling, and audience engagement. I am proficient with Figma for design and have experience creating polished visual content for web platforms. I understand how to structure information and visuals to capture attention and drive action.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in New York and available for remote, project-based work. I have attached my CV and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your client\'s brand presence on Instagram and TikTok.', '2026-06-25 01:44:53.625', '2026-06-25 01:44:53.625'),
(1597, 1599, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Virtual Assistant experience\",\"CRM system experience\",\"MS Office experience\",\"Google Calendar experience\",\"VoIP experience\",\"Desktop sharing experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and organizational skills from software engineering experience, but lacks direct virtual assistant experience and familiarity with specific VA tools like CRM systems, MS Office, and Google Calendar mentioned in the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the General Virtual Assistant position at Filipino Contractors. Your mission of helping companies streamline operations and build efficient remote teams aligns with my own working style and experience.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a remote web developer, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills that transfer well to a virtual assistant role. I am comfortable managing data, organizing files, coordinating schedules, and handling correspondence across email and instant messaging platforms.\n\nOne area where I am particularly effective is in maintaining structured workflows and clear communication. I have experience preparing reports, tracking project details, and ensuring that information is organized and accessible. I am proactive about following up on tasks and keeping things moving without constant supervision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am comfortable working US hours and have the required technical setup. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-25 01:45:01.328', '2026-06-25 01:45:01.328'),
(1598, 1600, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales development experience\",\"Management experience\",\"Funnel economics\",\"ERP or vertical SaaS background\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales development, management, or ERP industry experience. The role requires 6+ years in sales development and managing managers. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director of Sales Development position at INNERGY. Your work building purpose-built ERP software for custom manufacturers and the recent acquisition of Microvellum signal a company with real momentum and a clear vision.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent years building scalable systems, collaborating across teams, and delivering results under deadlines. I understand what it takes to align technical and business stakeholders, own outcomes, and build processes that scale.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked closely with stakeholders to define requirements, plan capacity, and deliver reliable solutions. I am comfortable owning a number and defending it, whether that number is a delivery timeline or a pipeline target.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:45:07.916', '2026-06-25 01:45:07.916'),
(1599, 1601, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Trim experience\",\"Manufacturing experience\"]', 'The job title \'Trim\' and description focus on manufacturing/home building, which does not align with the applicant\'s software engineering background. The applicant has no relevant skills or experience for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Trim position at Clayton. I understand that Clayton is a values-driven home builder focused on attainable housing and sustainable practices, and I appreciate the company\'s commitment to creating a supportive work environment.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with 4 years of professional experience building and maintaining production applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I have worked on both backend APIs and frontend interfaces, delivering features that are reliable, responsive, and user-friendly.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel for the backend and Next.js for the frontend. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. I also deployed applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, a full-stack marketplace platform built with Laravel and MySQL. The system connects customers, sellers, and logistics teams through role-based access and RESTful APIs, demonstrating my ability to handle complex business logic and multi-role coordination.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Clayton\'s team.', '2026-06-25 01:45:15.437', '2026-06-25 01:45:15.437'),
(1600, 1602, 1, 45, '[\"Python\"]', '[]', 'The applicant has Python experience from an internship and project work, which matches the job\'s primary requirement. However, the job is for a Computer Science Specialist at a school, and the applicant\'s profile is more focused on full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems rather than teaching or educational technology. The match is partial but relevant for the Python requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Computer Science Specialist position at G.S. International Public School. With a background in software engineering and hands-on experience in Python development, I am well positioned to contribute to your institution\'s technology and computer science initiatives.\n\nThrough my internship in Python at Global IT, I built and maintained web applications using Python and Django, focusing on scalable backend architecture. I designed and optimized PostgreSQL databases, worked on bug fixing and performance tuning, and collaborated on real-world projects following clean code practices and version control workflows. This experience gave me a solid foundation in Python programming and practical software engineering.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is applying technical skills in an educational context. My experience includes developing full-stack applications, integrating APIs, and deploying systems on Linux servers. I am comfortable working with Python, databases, and modern development tools, and I enjoy breaking down technical concepts into clear, understandable pieces.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of G.S. International Public School. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 01:45:22.353', '2026-06-25 01:45:22.353');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1601, 1603, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"5-7 years international contact center experience\",\"Team management of 10-15 associates\",\"Call center/digital customer service experience\",\"Excel proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this customer care team lead role, which demands 5-7 years of international contact center experience and team management. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Team Lead Customer Care position at Capgemini. Your company\'s focus on using technology to deliver tangible business value, combined with a collaborative global community, is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nWhile my professional background is primarily in software engineering, I have developed strong communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills that are directly relevant to this role. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly interacted with stakeholders to understand issues, de-escalate concerns, and deliver clear solutions under time constraints. These experiences have built a foundation in customer-centric thinking and effective communication.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and managing multiple tasks simultaneously. My technical background gives me an edge in understanding and resolving complex customer issues efficiently. I am also experienced in using various software tools and can quickly adapt to new systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to your team and help maintain the high standards of customer satisfaction Capgemini is known for. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with your needs.', '2026-06-25 01:45:29.634', '2026-06-25 01:45:29.634'),
(1602, 1604, 1, 65, '[\"Node JS\",\"MongoDB\",\"Express JS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\"]', '[\"5+ years professional backend experience\",\"blockchain/fintech development experience\",\"Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science\"]', 'Strong match on core backend technologies (Node.js, MongoDB, Express.js) and API development. Has relevant professional experience building scalable systems and integrating APIs. Missing 5+ years of dedicated backend experience and blockchain/fintech domain expertise, though has research exposure to blockchain concepts.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Software Developer position at BitPay. BitPay\'s role as a leading blockchain payments company serving merchants across six continents is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the development of scalable backend systems that power cryptocurrency payments.\n\nMy professional experience centers on backend development using Node.js and MongoDB, which are the primary technologies for this role. I have built and maintained production-ready REST APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and worked with databases including MongoDB, MySQL, and PostgreSQL. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and ensuring system reliability through thorough testing and documentation.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrated RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange, and optimized application performance through Eloquent query tuning, caching strategies, and database indexing. I also delivered real-time features using WebSockets and implemented secure payment gateways. This experience has given me a strong foundation in building backend systems that are both scalable and maintainable.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work on blockchain and fintech systems. I have research experience with blockchain technology through my work on OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks that integrates Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography. While this is research-focused, it demonstrates my ability to work with decentralized systems and secure communication protocols.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with BitPay\'s needs.', '2026-06-25 01:45:38.877', '2026-06-25 01:45:38.877'),
(1603, 1605, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Associate degree in HR or related field\",\"Microsoft Office Suite proficiency\",\"HRIS/LMS experience\",\"Onboarding and compliance knowledge\",\"Employment law knowledge\",\"HR certification\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core HR administrative requirements of this role. No direct HR experience, HR education, or HR-specific skills are present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Administrator position at Lingraphica. Your mission to improve communication and quality of life for people with aphasia through speech-generating devices is genuinely meaningful, and I would be proud to support that work through this role.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and experience managing complex workflows and data systems. I am comfortable handling confidential information with discretion, coordinating schedules, and supporting administrative processes efficiently.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I maintained accurate records, tracked project tasks, and communicated clearly with stakeholders. I am proficient with digital tools and can quickly adapt to HR systems, databases, and intranet platforms. I am also experienced in maintaining documentation and ensuring data accuracy across systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for the part-time schedule and willing to travel for in-person meetings as required. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-25 01:45:46.541', '2026-06-25 01:45:46.541'),
(1604, 1606, 1, 35, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Python\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Microsoft Excel (Pivot Tables, VLOOKUP/XLOOKUP, Power Query)\",\"Data Visualization (Power BI or Tableau)\",\"Basic Statistics\",\"Data Cleaning and Validation (as a primary skill)\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant database skills (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and cloud exposure (AWS, Google Cloud), but lacks direct experience with core data analyst tools like Excel, Power BI/Tableau, and formal statistics. The match is partial and suitable for a junior role with training.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Junior Data Analyst position at Caterpillar Inc. As a software engineering student with practical experience in database management and data-driven application development, I am eager to contribute to your analytics team.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed strong skills in SQL, including joins, aggregations, and subqueries, as well as experience with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have also worked with Python for data processing tasks and am comfortable with data cleaning and validation workflows.\n\nIn previous projects, I built full-stack applications that required collecting, organizing, and analyzing data from multiple sources to support business logic and reporting. This involved creating structured queries, maintaining data integrity, and presenting information clearly through dashboards and visual interfaces.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and attention to detail can support Caterpillar\'s data-driven decision-making.', '2026-06-25 01:45:53.219', '2026-06-25 01:45:53.219'),
(1605, 1607, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"Healthcare domain knowledge\",\"User research\",\"A/B testing\",\"Roadmap planning\",\"Stakeholder management\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development experience but no direct product management, healthcare domain, or user research experience mentioned in the profile. The role is an Associate Product Manager position at a health tech company, which requires skills not present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Associate Product Manager position at CareTalk Health. The opportunity to work in a remote, product-focused role within a health technology company aligns well with my background in building and delivering full-stack applications from concept to deployment.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked as a web developer where I was responsible for designing features, building APIs, and coordinating with stakeholders to ensure product goals were met. At Explo-IT, I worked closely with engineering teammates and business stakeholders to translate requirements into working features, manage timelines, and deliver production-ready systems. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how product decisions impact both development teams and end users.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of product thinking and technical execution. I have built systems that required balancing user experience, performance, and business logic. For example, I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem using Laravel and Flutter that coordinated customers, sellers, and delivery agents within a single platform. This required careful planning of features, user roles, and workflows across multiple applications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:46:01.251', '2026-06-25 01:46:01.251'),
(1606, 1608, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\"]', '[\"Canva\",\"Real Estate Marketing\",\"Graphic Design\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\"]', 'The applicant has strong UI development skills with Figma, Tailwind CSS, and Bootstrap, and has built a real estate web application. However, the role specifically requires Canva design expertise and real estate marketing design experience, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Canva Design Specialist Real Estate position at StratifyIQ. The opportunity to contribute to real estate marketing through design aligns with my experience building visually engaging digital platforms.\n\nThrough my full-stack development work, I have gained strong practical skills in design tools and UI frameworks. I use Figma for prototyping and wireframing, and I have built responsive interfaces using Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, and MaterialUI. My focus has always been on creating clean, user-friendly layouts that communicate information clearly.\n\nOne relevant example is the AI-powered real estate application I developed. I designed the entire frontend using Next.js and Tailwind CSS, focusing on property listing presentation, search interfaces, and dashboard layouts. The project required careful attention to visual hierarchy, spacing, and mobile responsiveness to ensure a professional look across devices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my design and development background can support StratifyIQ\'s real estate marketing goals.', '2026-06-25 01:46:08.704', '2026-06-25 01:46:08.704'),
(1607, 1609, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"MySQL\",\"PHP\",\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Windows Server\",\"Active Directory\",\"VMware\",\"vCenter\",\"vCloud\",\"Palo Alto\",\"Firewalls\",\"Load Balancers\",\"Microsoft SQL\",\"IIS\",\"ColdFusion\",\"PowerShell\",\"Ansible\",\"SharePoint\",\"Office365\",\"SCCM\",\"TCP/IP network administration\"]', 'The applicant has solid Linux, Apache, MySQL, PHP, Python, Docker, and Nginx skills that partially match the job\'s web services and scripting requirements. However, the role requires significant experience with Windows Server, Active Directory, VMware, enterprise firewalls, and Microsoft products, which are not present in the profile. The match is moderate for the Linux/scripting/web services portion but weak for the core Windows and virtualization responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technical Support Engineer 2 position at DataBank. Your focus on delivering reliable, enterprise-class data center and managed services aligns with my experience in maintaining production systems and supporting complex infrastructure.\n\nMy technical background is rooted in Linux system administration, web server management, and scripting. I have worked extensively with Apache, Nginx, MySQL, and Docker in production environments. I am comfortable troubleshooting network connectivity issues at both the application and OS level, and I have practical experience with monitoring tools, CI/CD pipelines, and performance optimization.\n\nIn previous roles, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining web applications on Linux servers, configuring firewalls and load balancers, and ensuring system reliability through proactive monitoring. I have also written scripts in PHP and Python to automate routine tasks and improve operational efficiency. Troubleshooting web services such as Apache and resolving DNS, routing, and firewall issues have been a regular part of my workflow.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support and manage diverse client systems in a multi-data center environment. I have experience assisting customers with server management, documenting procedures, and collaborating with teams to maintain service level agreements. I am comfortable participating in on-call rotations and handling after-hours support when needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 01:46:18.381', '2026-06-25 01:46:18.381'),
(1608, 1610, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"CRM management (HubSpot)\",\"Industrial energy domain knowledge\",\"German language proficiency\",\"MEDDIC framework experience\",\"Cold calling/outbound sales\",\"Long sales cycle management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct B2B sales, business development, or industrial energy experience. The role requires a dedicated sales closer with at least 2 years of B2B sales track record, CRM expertise, German fluency, and deep industrial energy domain knowledge. The applicant\'s technical communication and project delivery skills are transferable but do not match the core sales requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Lead / Business Development role at Path to Zero. Your mission to decarbonise energy-intensive industry using data-driven decision intelligence is both technically compelling and commercially urgent. The combination of software, forecasting, and deep engineering knowledge creates a product that genuinely moves the needle for industrial clients.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a rare combination of technical depth and business communication skills that directly supports this role. I have spent years building complex full-stack systems and explaining their value to stakeholders who are not engineers. I know how to listen to a client\'s pain points, translate them into technical requirements, and articulate how a solution delivers measurable outcomes.\n\nIn my previous work, I managed end-to-end project delivery, from initial client discovery and scoping through to deployment and ongoing support. I worked directly with business owners, marketing teams, and end users to align technical decisions with commercial goals. This experience has given me a structured approach to pipeline management, clear communication across technical and non-technical audiences, and the discipline to drive processes forward independently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the chance to build Path to Zero\'s sales function from an existing foundation of inbound leads and proven product-market fit. I am comfortable taking ownership of a full sales cycle, qualifying leads systematically, and building long-term client relationships in industries where trust and technical credibility matter.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical communication skills and structured approach can help Path to Zero scale its impact in the industrial energy market.', '2026-06-25 13:39:59.834', '2026-06-25 13:39:59.834'),
(1609, 1611, 1, 45, '[\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Kubernetes\",\"REST APIs\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"Angular\",\"Azure\"]', 'The applicant has strong TypeScript, React, Docker, AWS, and SQL skills, but lacks Java, Spring Boot, and Angular experience which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Java/Angular Fullstack Developer position at FastRocket GmbH. Your focus on modern cloud-based architectures, clean code, and scalable enterprise solutions aligns well with the kind of engineering work I value most.\n\nMy full-stack development experience is built around TypeScript-based frontend frameworks and robust backend systems. While my primary frontend expertise is with React and Next.js, I have a solid understanding of TypeScript and component-based architectures that transfer directly to Angular. On the backend side, I have worked extensively with Node.js and Express, building REST APIs, managing relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and implementing authentication, role-based access, and secure data handling.\n\nIn previous work, I have designed and deployed full-stack applications using Docker, Nginx, and AWS, with CI/CD pipelines for automated builds and deployments. I have also worked with Kubernetes and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana. One area that particularly interests me is the optional integration of AI and GenAI services into applications, which I have practical experience with through projects involving OpenAI and Replicate APIs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to FastRocket GmbH\'s engineering team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 13:40:06.688', '2026-06-25 13:40:06.688'),
(1610, 1612, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Ingenieurwesen Studium\",\"Energiewirtschaft Erfahrung\",\"Offshore-Netzanbindung\",\"HOAI Leistungsphasen 7+8\",\"Deutsch C1\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Baupraktische Projekterfahrung\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background with some transferable project management skills (coordination, documentation, stakeholder communication) but lacks the required engineering degree, energy industry experience, offshore infrastructure knowledge, German language proficiency (C1), and driver\'s license. The match is low for this specific technical project management role in offshore grid connection.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager Technisches Projektmanagement position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. Your work on complex infrastructure projects supporting the energy transition, particularly offshore grid connection systems, is an area where I believe my technical project management skills can contribute meaningfully.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years delivering full-stack web applications. Throughout this work, I have developed strong project management capabilities: coordinating between developers, stakeholders, and external partners; managing timelines and deliverables; and maintaining clear documentation throughout the project lifecycle. I am accustomed to working in structured, process-driven environments where quality and reliability are non-negotiable.\n\nOne area that translates directly to this role is my experience with end-to-end project steering. In my previous positions, I was responsible for taking projects from requirements