(1611, 1613, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Civil engineering or construction background\",\"Tiefbau or Straßenbau experience\",\"Windpark project coordination experience\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Knowledge of DIN18300, ZTV, RSA21, VOB regulations\",\"German language proficiency (fluent)\",\"Drivers license class B\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Bauleiter (Windparkbau) position. The role requires civil engineering/construction expertise, wind park project coordination, knowledge of German construction regulations, fluent German, and a driver\'s license. The applicant has no relevant construction experience, qualifications, or language skills for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Bauleiter (m/w/d) - Windparkbau position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. Your company\'s role as a growth champion in the renewable energy infrastructure sector is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the construction of complete wind farm infrastructure.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong project coordination and documentation skills. I have experience planning, coordinating, and monitoring multi-phase projects, ensuring quality control and efficient resource allocation. I am accustomed to serving as a bridge between different stakeholders, managing timelines, and maintaining clear documentation throughout project lifecycles.\n\nIn previous work, I have been responsible for overseeing the full delivery of web applications, from planning and coordination to quality assurance and final delivery. I have experience creating detailed specifications, monitoring progress, and ensuring that all deliverables meet required standards. These skills in project oversight, documentation, and quality control are directly transferable to managing construction Gewerke.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am willing to travel across Germany as required for this role.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination and quality management skills can contribute to your wind farm projects.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-25 13:40:21.942', '2026-06-25 13:40:21.942'),
(1612, 1614, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Tiefbau experience\",\"Straßenbau experience\",\"Windpark project coordination\",\"MS Office\",\"Knowledge of DIN18300, ZTV, RSA21, VOB\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Bauleiter (Windparkbau) position. The job requires civil engineering/construction expertise, German language fluency, and specific regulatory knowledge, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Bauleiter (m/w/d) - Windparkbau position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. Your company\'s role as a reliable partner in innovative construction projects across Germany, particularly in wind park infrastructure, is impressive. I am interested in contributing to the Energiewende through this position.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in project coordination, documentation, and quality assurance. I have experience planning and executing complex technical projects, coordinating between different teams, and ensuring that all deliverables meet specified requirements. I am accustomed to maintaining clear documentation and tracking progress against deadlines.\n\nIn my previous work, I was responsible for overseeing the full lifecycle of web application projects, from initial planning and resource allocation to deployment and maintenance. This involved creating detailed specifications, coordinating with stakeholders, monitoring progress, and ensuring quality standards were met. I am confident that these project management and coordination skills transfer well to the construction site environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I hold a valid driving license and am prepared for nationwide travel as required.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination and quality assurance experience can contribute to your wind park construction projects.', '2026-06-25 13:40:29.778', '2026-06-25 13:40:29.778'),
(1613, 1615, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Tiefbau\",\"Straßenbau\",\"Windparkprojekte\",\"MS Office\",\"DIN18300\",\"ZTV\",\"RSA21\",\"VOB\",\"Deutsch\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Reisebereitschaft\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, which does not match the civil engineering, construction management, and regulatory requirements of this Bauleiter (Windparkbau) role. There are no overlapping skills or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Bauleiter (m/w/d) - Windparkbau position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. Your focus on building the complete infrastructure for wind parks and driving the energy transition is impressive. I am interested in contributing to projects that have a tangible impact on renewable energy development in Germany.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have developed strong skills in project coordination, documentation, and quality control. I am experienced with Linux, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, which support efficient infrastructure management. I am also familiar with monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana, which help ensure system reliability and performance.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I managed full project lifecycles, coordinated with stakeholders, and ensured timely delivery. I have worked on projects involving real-time features, secure authentication, and payment integration, all of which required careful planning, documentation, and quality assurance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 13:40:36.796', '2026-06-25 13:40:36.796'),
(1614, 1616, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Oracle Primavera P6\",\"Infrastructure project planning experience\",\"German language (C1 level)\",\"Engineering or business degree in relevant field\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Projektplaner/Terminplaner role, which demands expertise in Oracle Primavera P6, infrastructure project planning, and German language proficiency. No direct skill overlap exists.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektplaner/Terminplaner position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. The role of coordinating complex infrastructure projects for the energy transition is both challenging and meaningful, and I am interested in contributing to your team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and system architecture, where I have developed strong project coordination and analytical skills. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have managed end-to-end project delivery, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, and maintained clear timelines across development cycles. I am accustomed to tracking progress, identifying bottlenecks, and adjusting plans to meet deadlines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured approach to planning and resource management. While I do not have direct experience with Oracle Primavera P6, I have worked with project tracking tools and understand the importance of critical path analysis, resource allocation, and risk mitigation. My technical background enables me to quickly learn new software systems and apply them effectively in complex project environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination skills can contribute to your infrastructure projects.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 13:40:43.894', '2026-06-25 13:40:43.894'),
(1615, 1617, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Project management experience in energy sector\",\"Land securing / right-of-way processes\",\"Real estate or property law knowledge\",\"GIS (QGIS, ArcGIS)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Business or industrial engineering degree\"]', 'The applicant has strong project coordination and structured workflow management skills from software engineering, but lacks direct experience in land securing, right-of-way processes, the energy sector, GIS tools, German language, and the required degree background. This is a low match for the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager (m/w/d) Wegerecht und Flächensicherung position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. Your work in developing wind energy, photovoltaic, battery storage, and power line projects directly supports the energy transition, and I find that mission genuinely compelling.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent several years managing complex technical projects from planning through delivery. In my work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for coordinating with internal engineering teams, external clients, and stakeholders to ensure projects were delivered on time and within scope. This required structured planning, clear communication, and consistent monitoring of progress against milestones.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of land securing and right-of-way processes. While my domain has been technology rather than real estate, the core project management skills are directly transferable: creating detailed project plans, tracking deadlines and renewals, maintaining registers, preparing status reports and KPI dashboards for