(1616, 1618, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Jetson Nano\"]', '[\"Assembler\",\"ARM architectures\",\"QNX\",\"Windows Embedded\",\"Hardware driver development\",\"Microcontroller firmware\",\"Hardware-near software development experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++, Python, and Linux, and has worked with embedded hardware (Raspberry Pi, ESP32, Jetson Nano) in project contexts. However, the role requires professional experience in hardware-near embedded software development, microcontroller firmware, driver development, and ARM architectures, which are not present in the applicant\'s professional experience. The applicant\'s background is primarily in full-stack web development with some embedded project work, resulting in a partial match for this specialized embedded role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Embedded-Softwareentwickler position at beratungsgruppe wirth + partner. Your work developing on-board electronics and display systems for rail and special-purpose vehicles is technically interesting, and I appreciate the focus on safety-critical embedded solutions.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built embedded systems combining C++, Python, and Linux on platforms such as Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano. One project involved developing a real-time object detection pipeline using YOLOv8n on a Raspberry Pi with an ESP32-CAM, where I implemented a custom UDP streaming protocol for low-latency communication and optimized inference for offline operation. This required close work with hardware interfaces, firmware logic, and system-level performance tuning.\n\nIn addition to C++ and Python, I have experience configuring and maintaining Linux-based systems, writing Bash scripts for automation, and developing validation tools for internal testing. I am comfortable working across the software-hardware boundary and enjoy building reliable, efficient systems that function well under real-world constraints.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my embedded systems experience aligns with your team\'s needs.', '2026-06-25 13:40:59.874', '2026-06-25 13:40:59.874'),
(1617, 1619, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Wohnsitz in Deutschland\",\"Zuverlässige und sorgfältige Mitarbeit\",\"Smartphone oder Computer mit Internetzugang\",\"Bereitschaft zur Teilnahme an langfristigen Verbraucherprojekten\"]', 'The job is a flexible consumer panel role requiring no technical skills. The applicant has the basic requirements (smartphone/computer, internet access, reliability) but the role is not a software engineering position. The match is low because the job is for documenting purchases and media usage, not for software development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in participating as a panelist for the Haushalts- & Verbraucherpanel at Finanzmaxx. This flexible opportunity to document everyday purchases and media usage while earning rewards fits well with my current schedule and my interest in contributing to market research projects.\n\nI have a reliable smartphone and computer with internet access, and I am comfortable using apps and digital tools to record information accurately. I understand the importance of careful documentation and consistent participation in long-term research projects.\n\nIn my daily life, I already track various types of information digitally, which has built a habit of attention to detail and reliability. I am comfortable providing feedback on products, media, and usage patterns in a structured way.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across different tasks and communicate clearly. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to participate in your current or future consumer research projects.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-25 13:41:06.472', '2026-06-25 13:41:06.472'),
(1618, 1620, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Influencer Marketing\",\"Retail/Wholesale Experience\",\"Campaign Management\",\"Budget Planning\",\"KPI Frameworks\",\"German Language\",\"Berlin-based\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but no direct experience in influencer marketing, retail, campaign management, or budget planning. The role requires 3-6+ years of influencer marketing experience, fluency in German, and being based in Berlin. The match is low due to a completely different professional domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Influencer Marketing Manager – Digital Retail position at salted GmbH. Your focus on building measurable retail impact through influencer marketing and data-driven campaign management aligns with my experience in building systems that track performance, automate workflows, and deliver actionable insights.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years developing full-stack web applications and data-driven platforms. I have built systems that handle user engagement tracking, real-time analytics, and automated reporting. These skills give me a strong foundation for managing KPI frameworks, analyzing campaign performance, and optimizing marketing spend based on data.\n\nIn previous work, I developed platforms that required close collaboration with cross-functional teams, including product, design, and business stakeholders. I am comfortable working with tracking tools, interpreting data, and translating insights into practical recommendations. My experience with performance optimization and process automation directly supports the analytical and strategic demands of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and marketing. I have built systems that manage user journeys, track conversions, and automate communication workflows. This technical perspective allows me to approach influencer marketing with a data-first mindset, focusing on measurable outcomes rather than just awareness.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how my background can contribute to salted\'s growth.', '2026-06-25 13:41:14.413', '2026-06-25 13:41:14.413');
