(1619, 1621, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Windparkplanung\",\"CAD\",\"GIS\",\"WindPRO\",\"Windographer\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Studium in Architektur/Geografie/erneuerbare Energien/Bauingenieurwesen\",\"Ausbildung als Bauzeichner\",\"Genehmigungsverfahren\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Windparkplaner role, which requires specialized education and experience in wind park planning, CAD/GIS software, and German language proficiency. The applicant has strong project management and organizational skills but lacks the domain-specific qualifications and experience required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Windparkplaner position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering and AI systems, I bring strong project management, organizational, and technical documentation capabilities that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my experience delivering full-stack web applications, I have developed a structured approach to managing complex projects from initial concept through to deployment. I am comfortable handling multiple project phases simultaneously, coordinating with cross-functional teams, and maintaining clear documentation throughout the project lifecycle.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my organizational skills to wind energy projects. In my previous work, I was responsible for client consultation, requirement gathering, and presenting technical solutions to stakeholders. I am accustomed to being the point of contact for technical questions and maintaining thorough project records.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and organizational skills can contribute to your wind energy projects.', '2026-06-25 13:41:21.622', '2026-06-25 13:41:21.622'),
(1620, 1622, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Project development experience in wind or PV\",\"Knowledge of German planning law (BauGB, BImSchG, etc.)\",\"GIS experience\",\"German language proficiency (negotiation level)\",\"Degree in Geography, Engineering, or Economics\",\"German driver\'s license class B\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and does not match the core requirements for this renewable energy project development role. Key missing qualifications include relevant industry experience, knowledge of German planning law, GIS skills, German language proficiency, and a suitable academic background. The match score is low at 15/100.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektentwickler position at Deutscher Bauservice GmbH. Your focus on driving renewable energy projects in wind and solar aligns with my interest in contributing to meaningful infrastructure development in Germany.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong project management capabilities that are directly relevant to this role. I have experience managing full project lifecycles, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and ensuring delivery within defined timelines and budgets. My technical background has given me a structured approach to problem-solving, risk assessment, and reporting.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have regularly coordinated with clients, team members, and external service providers to deliver complex projects. I am comfortable with regular travel, engaging with landowners and authorities, and preparing clear reports for management. My ability to analyze requirements and optimize processes translates well to managing project portfolios in the renewable energy sector.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my project management skills and structured approach to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your renewable energy projects.', '2026-06-25 13:41:29.344', '2026-06-25 13:41:29.344'),
(1621, 1623, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"HLA\",\"DIS\",\"C#\",\"Java\",\"Distributed Simulation\",\"Network Communication\",\"Real-time Systems\",\"System Integration\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++ and Python, along with experience in Linux, Docker, and real-time systems from project work. However, the role requires specific expertise in distributed simulation standards (HLA/DIS), C# or Java, and several years of professional experience in distributed simulation, which are not present in the profile. The match is partial and suitable for a junior or entry-level consideration.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer (m/w/x) – Distributed Simulation & Interoperability position at K-tronik GmbH. The role focuses on developing and integrating components of distributed simulation systems, ensuring interoperability and consistent data processing across platforms. This aligns directly with my experience in building real-time, distributed systems and my interest in defense and security technologies.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built systems that combine C++ and Python for real-time data processing, sensor integration, and low-latency communication. One area that particularly interests me is the design of interfaces between distributed components and ensuring reliable data flow across heterogeneous systems. My work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project involved creating a UDP-based streaming protocol for ultra-low latency video transmission, which required careful attention to synchronization, packet handling, and real-time constraints.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my experience in distributed systems, real-time communication, and system integration to the team at K-tronik. I have attached my CV for your consideration and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your projects.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 13:41:36.656', '2026-06-25 13:41:36.656'),
(1622, 1624, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Performance Marketing (Meta, Google, LinkedIn, TikTok)\",\"Funnel Management (Acquisition, Conversion, Retention)\",\"Brand & Content Strategy\",\"Team Leadership (Marketing)\",\"Sales Collaboration\",\"Budget Management with ROI focus\",\"EdTech / Weiterbildung experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical AI integration skills, but the CMO role requires marketing leadership, funnel management, and growth strategy experience which are not present in the profile. The AI affinity is a partial match, but the core marketing and leadership qualifications are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Marketing Officer (CMO) position at STARTPLATZ AI Academy. Your mission to build Germany\'s leading address for AI Weiterbildung resonates with my own focus on combining software engineering with practical AI applications.\n\nWhat stands out to me is your emphasis on using AI as a lever to make content, campaigns, and processes faster and more cost-effective. As a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have hands-on experience integrating AI directly into production systems. I have built AI-powered features using OpenAI, Replicate, and AWS Transcribe, and I understand how to deploy these tools to automate workflows and reduce operational overhead.\n\nIn my professional experience, I developed the backend for an AI-powered financial application that used OpenAI assistants trained on custom datasets, voice-to-text conversion via AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF generation sent through AWS SES. I also built an AI-based real estate platform that integrated GPT models for intelligent property analysis and Replicate API for image