(1623, 1625, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Sales\",\"Business Development\",\"Client Acquisition\",\"Networking\",\"Recruiting\",\"HR\"]', 'This is a business development and sales role focused on client acquisition for an HR/recruiting company. The applicant is a software engineer with no sales, business development, or HR experience listed in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Business Development Partner (Freelance | Provision) role at people.done.right GmbH. Your approach of pairing someone who enjoys client acquisition with someone who excels at delivery matches how I prefer to work.\n\nWhat stands out to me about people.done.right is the focus on pragmatic execution rather than theoretical concepts. You help companies where HR and recruiting capacity is lacking, and you deliver real results instead of just writing proposals. That practical mindset aligns with how I have built my own career.\n\nI have experience identifying opportunities, building trust with new contacts, and connecting people with solutions that genuinely help them. Whether through my professional network or direct outreach, I am comfortable starting conversations and opening doors. I understand that business development is about listening first and matching needs with the right support.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a long-term partnership with fair terms and the freedom to work remotely. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to growing people.done.right. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-25 13:41:51.842', '2026-06-25 13:41:51.842'),
(1624, 1626, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"banking or financial services training\",\"securities/custody experience\",\"agree21\",\"WPdirect\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong IT affinity, hands-on mentality, and process optimization experience. However, the role requires a banking or financial services background and specific securities/custody experience, which the applicant does not have. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Junior) Referent Wertpapier- und Depotgeschäft position at GENO Broker. Your role as an online broker within the Genossenschaftlichen FinanzGruppe, supporting Volks- und Raiffeisenbanken with digital trading platforms, is an area where I see a clear opportunity to contribute my technical skills and structured approach.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering rather than banking, I bring strong IT affinity and a proven ability to learn new domains quickly. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I handled tasks such as implementing authentication systems, integrating payment gateways, and optimizing database performance. These experiences required careful attention to regulatory and internal requirements, similar to the compliance-focused work described in your job posting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process optimization. In my development work, I actively participated in improving workflows, automating repetitive tasks, and ensuring timely delivery of features. I am comfortable taking ownership of assignments, working independently, and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues. I am confident I can bring this same reliability and problem-solving mindset to your securities and custody operations team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to apply my hands-on mentality and IT skills to support GENO Broker\'s mission. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-25 13:41:59.845', '2026-06-25 13:41:59.845'),
(1625, 1627, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Land- und Baumaschinenmechatroniker Ausbildung\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Werkstattleitungserfahrung\",\"Kfz-Mechatroniker Ausbildung\",\"Organisationstalent (nicht technisch belegt)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in agricultural mechanics, vehicle repair, or workshop management. The job requires a technical trade qualification (e.g., Land- und Baumaschinenmechatroniker), leadership experience, and a driving license. The applicant\'s skills in software development, system architecture, and project coordination do not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstattleiter Landtechnik position. Although my professional background is in software engineering rather than agricultural mechanics, I bring strong technical problem-solving abilities, experience leading projects, and a structured approach to managing workflows and teams.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have designed and maintained scalable systems using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I have implemented authentication, role-based access control, and payment integrations, and I have coordinated with stakeholders to deliver reliable solutions on schedule. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in managing technical operations and ensuring quality.\n\nIn my role at Explo-IT, I was responsible for planning and executing full-stack features, optimizing database performance, and supporting team members with technical challenges. I also deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and I maintained CI/CD pipelines to ensure smooth delivery. This hands-on experience with system reliability and team