(1626, 1628, 1, 0, '[]', '[\"Land- und Baumaschinenmechatroniker Ausbildung\",\"Kfz-Mechatroniker Ausbildung\",\"Nutzfahrzeugmechatroniker Ausbildung\",\"Meistertitel\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Werkstattleitung Erfahrung\",\"Landtechnik Erfahrung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant qualifications or experience in agricultural machinery mechanics, workshop management, or the required technical certifications for this Werkstattleiter Landtechnik role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstattleiter Landtechnik position at Riverstate Premium Recruiting. After reviewing the job description, I recognize that this role requires specific qualifications in agricultural machinery mechanics and workshop leadership that I do not possess.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering and full-stack web development, with experience building scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked on authentication systems, RESTful APIs, database optimization, and deployment pipelines. While these skills are valuable in the technology sector, they do not translate to the hands-on mechanical and technical requirements of a Landtechnik Werkstatt.\n\nThe position calls for an experienced Land- und Baumaschinenmechatroniker or similar trained professional with a Meistertitel or equivalent practical experience. I do not have this training, nor do I hold a Führerschein der Klasse B, which is listed as a requirement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI appreciate your consideration and have attached my CV for your reference. I wish you the best in finding a qualified candidate for this position.', '2026-06-25 13:42:14.077', '2026-06-25 13:42:14.077'),
(1627, 1629, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Land- und Baumaschinenmechatroniker Ausbildung\",\"Meistertitel\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Werkstattführung\",\"Landtechnik Erfahrung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in agricultural mechanics, workshop management, or the specific qualifications required for this role (e.g., Mechatroniker training, Meister title, or Führerschein Klasse B). The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstattleiter Landtechnik position at Riverstate Premium Recruiting. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than agricultural mechanics, I bring strong organizational skills, technical problem-solving ability, and a proven track record of leading projects and coordinating teams effectively.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have been responsible for planning workflows, managing schedules, and ensuring that deliverables meet quality standards. I have experience coordinating between team members and stakeholders, handling administrative tasks such as documentation and task tracking, and stepping in to support technical questions when needed. These responsibilities align closely with the day-to-day requirements of leading a workshop team.\n\nI am comfortable taking ownership of operational processes and guiding a team toward consistent, high-quality output. I approach problems systematically, communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical people, and adapt quickly to new environments. I am confident I can grow into the leadership responsibilities of this role with structured onboarding and hands-on support.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational and technical background can contribute to your workshop operations.', '2026-06-25 13:42:21.625', '2026-06-25 13:42:21.625'),
(1628, 1630, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\"]', '[\"Video editing\",\"Social media management\",\"Graphic design\",\"YouTube channel management\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background but limited direct experience in video editing, social media management, and graphic design. The role requires hands-on video production and social media expertise, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s technical skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) are relevant for minor website adjustments, but the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Videoeditor und Social Media Manager position at MachsDirSelbst.Solar. Your mission to help people build their own PV systems is practical and impactful, and I appreciate the hands-on, learning-focused culture you describe.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong technical foundation, a fast learning curve, and genuine interest in content creation and digital marketing. I have experience building and adjusting websites using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frameworks, which directly supports the \"kleine Anpassungen an unserer Website\" responsibility in your job description. I am also comfortable working with AI tools and can quickly adapt to your video editing, graphic design, and social media workflows.\n\nWhat stands out to me is your emphasis on learning on the job and taking ownership. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly took initiative to learn new technologies independently and delivered features across frontend, backend, and deployment. I am confident I can bring that same mindset to video editing, content scheduling, thumbnail creation, and social media management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and look forward to the opportunity to contribute to your team and grow with MachsDirSelbst.Solar.', '2026-06-25 13:42:29.025', '2026-06-25 13:42:29.025'),
(1629, 1631, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"CI/CD\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"C++\",\"Python\"]', '[\"Sicherheitstechnik (security technology) experience\",\"VdS-Zertifizierung\",\"Elektrotechnik background\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Project management certifications\",\"Brandmeldesysteme experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong IT systems foundation with Linux, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD experience, plus project delivery skills from web development roles. However, the role requires specific security technology domain knowledge (access control, video surveillance, fire alarm systems) and certifications (VdS) that are not present in the profile. The match is partial, focusing on the IT-systems aspect of the position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the technical project manager position in security technology at wabcon. The role combines IT systems, project leadership, and technical solution development, which aligns with my engineering background and hands-on project experience.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have planned and delivered technical projects from concept to deployment. I designed system architectures, integrated third-party services, and coordinated with cross-functional teams to meet project milestones. This involved selecting appropriate technologies, managing dependencies, and ensuring reliable delivery within deadlines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of complex system architectures, including video, access control, and alarm systems. In previous work, I built real-time monitoring dashboards that tracked system health across multiple endpoints, using Socket.IO for live data streaming and Docker for containerized deployment. This required understanding both hardware interfaces and software communication protocols.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical project experience can contribute to wabcon\'s security technology solutions.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 13:42:37.208', '2026-06-25 13:42:37.208'),
(1630, 1632, 1, 35, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Data entry experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong PC skills and a structured work style, but lacks direct data entry, customer service, and German language experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Nebenjob mit Perspektive position at DieProfiberater. Your description of a flexible, people-oriented role involving data entry and customer contact fits well with my background and working style.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong PC skills and a structured approach to managing data. I have worked extensively with databases, ensuring accuracy, consistency, and careful documentation of information. These habits translate directly to the data capture and maintenance tasks described in your listing.\n\nI enjoy working with people and communicating clearly. Whether collaborating with colleagues or assisting clients, I maintain a professional and patient manner. I am comfortable working independently and organizing my own schedule, which aligns well with your mix of home office and field assignments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am motivated to learn your systems and processes, and I value the opportunity to grow with your company over the long term. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-25