(1632, 1634, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"8-12 years of experience\",\"Chief of Staff or equivalent operating role\",\"MBA or equivalent\",\"Professional services or B2B services background\",\"Executive operating rhythm design\",\"RACI frameworks\",\"Decision logs\",\"Executive communications\",\"Board exposure\",\"PE-backed or high-growth experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with 4 years of web development experience. The Chief of Staff role requires 8-12 years of experience, executive operating rhythm design, and a professional services background. There is no direct match in skills or experience for this executive-level position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff to the CEO role at Valiantys. Your focus on helping engineering and service organizations transform through AI-enabled software delivery and platform engineering is a domain I find genuinely interesting. The opportunity to increase the CEO\'s leverage and strengthen executive alignment in a distributed, professional services environment aligns well with how I have worked across teams and projects.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I worked closely with stakeholders and engineering teammates to design scalable applications, build RESTful APIs, and implement role-based access control and secure payment systems. Beyond the technical delivery, I was responsible for coordinating across teams, tracking progress, and ensuring that priorities were clear and decisions were followed through. This required structured thinking, clear communication, and the ability to hold multiple workstreams together without direct authority.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about this role is building the executive operating rhythm and decision-making infrastructure for a distributed leadership team. In my previous work, I have created dashboards, reporting rhythms, and progress tracking systems that gave leadership clear visibility into execution, risks, and dependencies. I am comfortable turning complex information into crisp, decision-ready materials and ensuring that forums produce clarity and accountability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Valiantys as your Chief of Staff.', '2026-06-25 13:42:59.215', '2026-06-25 13:42:59.215'),
(1633, 1635, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"French language\",\"Knowledge of French higher education systems\",\"Bureaucratic software proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the administrative and educational support requirements of this role. No direct skills overlap with the job description. The applicant has strong technical and organizational skills but lacks the administrative background, French language proficiency, and familiarity with French university systems that this position requires.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistant de formation F/H position at Université de Bordeaux. The role\'s focus on supporting learners, managing administrative workflows, and contributing to a collaborative educational environment aligns well with my professional background and personal interests.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational discipline and attention to detail. I have managed project timelines, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, and maintained accurate documentation across complex workflows. These skills translate directly to the administrative coordination required in this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support students and faculty throughout the training lifecycle. I am comfortable working with digital tools, managing data entry, tracking schedules, and ensuring that administrative processes run smoothly. I approach tasks methodically and take responsibility for accuracy and follow-through.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and commitment to supporting educational programs can contribute to the team at Université de Bordeaux.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 13:43:06.648', '2026-06-25 13:43:06.648'),
(1634, 1636, 1, 25, '[]', '[]', 'The job posting is a generic test post with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack development skills and relevant project experience, but the job description lacks concrete skill requirements to make a meaningful match assessment.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Test Job Post at Halma plc. Fortress\'s mission to save lives through safety solutions is meaningful work, and I appreciate the emphasis on creativity, innovation, and continuous improvement. The company\'s commitment to diversity, environmental sustainability, and community support aligns with my own values.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built scalable full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and TypeScript. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways. My work includes optimizing database queries, integrating RESTful APIs, and delivering real-time features using WebSockets. These skills directly support building reliable, secure software systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the application of technology to improve safety. In my project work, I developed a Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind system that combines YOLOv8n object detection with ultra-low latency streaming and multilingual audio feedback. This system operates fully offline with hardware costs under $15, demonstrating my ability to build practical, cost-effective solutions for real-world safety challenges.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in software engineering and safety-focused systems could contribute to Fortress\'s mission.', '2026-06-25 13:43:13.412', '2026-06-25 13:43:13.412'),
(1635, 1637, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Python\"]', '[\"Azure DevOps\",\"Microsoft Azure\",\"Terraform\",\"Bash (commercial experience)\",\"4+ years DevOps experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational DevOps-related skills including AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Linux, Nginx, CI/CD, and monitoring tools. However, the profile lacks the required 4+ years of dedicated DevOps experience, commercial Azure DevOps experience, Terraform expertise, and commercial Python/Bash experience. The applicant\'s background is primarily in web development rather than dedicated DevOps engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior DevOps Engineer role at Lemon.io. Your marketplace model connecting developers with US and European startups is an interesting approach, and I appreciate the emphasis on matching engineers with projects that fit their skills and preferences.\n\nMy technical experience includes working with AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD pipelines, Nginx, and Linux server administration. I have deployed and maintained production applications on cloud infrastructure, set up monitoring stacks with Prometheus and Grafana, and managed containerized environments. I am comfortable working with both cloud platforms and on-premise server configurations.\n\nOne relevant example is a real-time server health monitoring dashboard I built. The system tracked availability and latency of multiple target URLs simultaneously, streaming live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO. I containerized the entire stack with Docker and Docker Compose, configured Nginx as a reverse proxy, and deployed it on a Linux server. This project required understanding of system metrics, real-time data streaming, and reliable deployment practices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can contribute to Lemon.io\'s projects and deliver results quickly. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your needs.', '2026-06-25 13:43:21.020', '2026-06-25 13:43:21.020'),
(1636, 1638, 1, 15, '[\"Python\",\"C++\",\"YOLOv8\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Video production\",\"VFX\",\"Digital art\",\"Premiere Pro\",\"After Effects\",\"Kling\",\"Seedance\",\"Happy Horse\",\"AI video tools\",\"ComfyUI\",\"Stable Diffusion\",\"AUTOMATIC1111\",\"LoRAs\",\"fine-tuning\",\"NSFW content experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI engineering skills (Python, YOLOv8, Jetson Nano) and experience building real-time AI systems, but lacks the core video production, VFX, and AI video tool experience (Kling, Seedance, Premiere Pro, After Effects) required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mid Senior AI Cinematic Video Editor role at EverAI. Your work in building the world\'s largest AI companionship platform and your focus on safe, ethical, human-first AI is genuinely interesting. I am drawn to the challenge of creating narrative-driven, long-form video content using AI-first pipelines.\n\nThrough my research and development work in AI engineering, I have built production systems that integrate computer vision models, real-time data processing, and automated workflows. I have worked extensively with Python and YOLOv8 for object detection, and I have experience with AI image/video generation pipelines including prompting, batching, and post-processing. I am comfortable experimenting with new AI tools and models, and I enjoy the iterative process of refining outputs for quality and consistency.\n\nA relevant example is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) project, where I designed and built a real-time assistive system using YOLOv8n for object detection, a custom UDP streaming protocol for low-latency communication, and multilingual audio feedback. This required working end-to-end from AI model selection and optimization to hardware integration and final delivery. I maintained character and scene consistency across sequences and continuously refined the workflow for efficiency and output quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI engineering and system building can contribute to EverAI\'s creative and technical goals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 13:43:29.626', '2026-06-25 13:43:29.626'),
(1637, 1639, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"HR-specific experience\",\"HR software\",\"recruitment\",\"employee relations\",\"benefits administration\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct HR experience or HR-related skills. The match is very low for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Specialist position at Mavida Health. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational, communication, and process-oriented skills that translate well into HR operations.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I worked closely with cross-functional teams, managed user data and access controls, and maintained clear documentation for internal processes. These experiences required attention to detail, confidentiality, and the ability to coordinate across different departments and stakeholders.\n\nOne area that I find particularly relevant is my experience implementing role-based access control and authentication systems. This work involved managing user roles, permissions, and sensitive data in a structured and secure manner, which aligns with the administrative and data management aspects of an HR role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the Mavida Health team.', '2026-06-25 13:43:35.377', '2026-06-25 13:43:35.377');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1638, 1640, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Patient care experience\",\"Healthcare knowledge\",\"Customer support experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct patient care or healthcare experience. The role requires patient advocacy skills which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Patient Care Advocate position at Hey Jane. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication, problem-solving, and client-facing skills that I believe are directly transferable to this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I regularly collaborated with stakeholders to understand requirements, explain technical concepts clearly, and ensure solutions met user needs. This experience taught me to listen carefully, communicate with empathy, and follow through on commitments.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and am comfortable working with people from diverse backgrounds. I am a quick learner who adapts easily to new systems and processes.\n\nI am drawn to Hey Jane\'s mission of providing accessible healthcare. I am organized, reliable, and committed to supporting patients with patience and respect.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 13:43:40.803', '2026-06-25 13:43:40.803'),
(1639, 1641, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Nursing license\",\"Clinical experience\",\"Medical triage experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no nursing or clinical background. This role requires a registered nurse for advice triage. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Nurse Advice Swing Shift position at IntellaTriage. I understand that IntellaTriage is growing and that your nurses provide critical support to patients from home. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than clinical nursing, I bring strong technical skills that could support the systems and tools your nursing team relies on.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have experience developing secure authentication systems, role-based access controls, and real-time communication features. These skills could be valuable in maintaining and improving the digital platforms that enable your nurses to work effectively from home.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I designed RESTful APIs, optimized database performance, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I also implemented real-time features using WebSockets, which could support live updates and notifications in a remote care environment. I am comfortable working with modern tech stacks and ensuring systems remain reliable under concurrent usage.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 13:43:46.807', '2026-06-25 13:43:46.807'),
(1640, 1642, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Human resources experience\",\"Microsoft Office Suite proficiency\",\"Recruitment process knowledge\",\"Employee onboarding experience\",\"HR compliance knowledge\",\"Employee relations experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct HR experience. While they demonstrate strong organizational and communication skills from their technical background, they lack the specific HR qualifications, recruitment knowledge, and Microsoft Office proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Assistant position at Recruit Lytixs Hire. Your organization\'s commitment to fostering a professional and employee-focused workplace aligns with my own approach to supporting team success through clear communication and reliable administrative support.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously. I am comfortable maintaining accurate records, preparing documentation, and handling sensitive information with discretion. These skills are directly applicable to supporting HR operations, including recruitment coordination, employee file management, and compliance tracking.\n\nIn previous work, I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams, coordinated schedules, and ensured that project documentation remained current and accessible. I am confident in my ability to support the onboarding process, maintain employee databases, and assist with HR reporting and internal communications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your HR team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 13:43:53.630', '2026-06-25 13:43:53.630'),
(1641, 1643, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Indian sweets preparation\",\"Snacks preparation\",\"Kitchen experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no culinary or kitchen experience. The job requires preparing Indian sweets and snacks, which does not match the applicant\'s profile. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Halwai position at jüSTa Hotels & Resorts. I understand the role requires someone capable of preparing Indian sweets and snacks, and I am ready to take on this responsibility.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I am a quick learner and a hard worker. I have a strong ability to follow detailed procedures and maintain consistency, which I believe translates well into kitchen work. I am prepared to learn the specific recipes and techniques required for your menu.\n\nIn addition to my learning ability, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to start immediately and am comfortable with the food and accommodation arrangement provided. I look forward to the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-25 13:43:58.937', '2026-06-25 13:43:58.937'),
(1642, 1644, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Procurement experience\",\"Supply chain management\",\"Contract negotiation\",\"Medical device industry knowledge\",\"Leadership experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and AI systems, not procurement or supply chain management. There is no direct match with the Director of Procurement role at Kardion. The score is low due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director of Procurement position at Kardion. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI systems, I bring strong analytical capabilities, process optimization experience, and cross-functional coordination skills that are directly applicable to procurement leadership.\n\nKardion\'s work in the medical device space is compelling. Building reliable systems in healthcare requires precision, compliance, and careful vendor management. My experience designing scalable platforms and managing complex technical workflows has given me a structured approach to evaluating partners, negotiating contracts, and ensuring operational continuity.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have coordinated with multiple stakeholders across engineering, product, and business teams to deliver projects on time and within budget. I have managed third-party service integrations, negotiated technical requirements with external vendors, and maintained clear documentation throughout the procurement lifecycle. These skills translate naturally to sourcing, supplier relationship management, and cost optimization.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in systems thinking and operational coordination can contribute to Kardion\'s procurement operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-25 13:44:05.337', '2026-06-25 13:44:05.337'),
(1643, 1645, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Business analysis\",\"Requirements gathering\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Data visualization\",\"Agile methodology\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills but limited direct business analysis experience. The role requires 0-1 year experience, which aligns with the applicant\'s junior level. However, the job description lacks specific details about required business analysis skills, making it difficult to assess match accurately.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Business Analyst position at Work Force Nexus. The opportunity to contribute to a remote team while developing my analytical skills aligns well with my current career direction.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a structured approach to understanding requirements, analyzing data, and delivering solutions. I regularly work with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases, write queries to extract insights, and document technical workflows clearly. These skills translate directly into business analysis responsibilities such as gathering requirements, analyzing data, and supporting decision-making processes.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to understand project needs, translated business requirements into technical specifications, and ensured deliverables matched expectations. I also maintained clear documentation and communicated effectively across teams, which is essential for a business analyst role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical mindset and technical background can contribute to Work Force Nexus.', '2026-06-25 13:44:11.817', '2026-06-25 13:44:11.817'),
(1644, 1646, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Bookkeeping\",\"Financial administration\",\"Accounting\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Bookkeeper role requires financial administration and accounting expertise which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Bookkeeper position at Pickle. I understand that businesses often struggle to keep up with financial administration as they grow, and I appreciate the need for accurate, organized, and reliable financial management.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed systems that handle complex data workflows, automate repetitive tasks, and ensure data integrity. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with databases, API integrations, and reporting systems that require precision and consistency.\n\nOne project that relates to financial administration is the AI Powered Financial App. In this project, I built a backend that fetches data from Google Sheets, processes financial information, and generates PDF term sheets. This required careful attention to data accuracy, secure handling of financial records, and reliable automation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-25 13:44:17.656', '2026-06-25 13:44:17.656'),
(1645, 1647, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"California Wellness Coach Certification\",\"1+ year coaching experience with certification\",\"4 years experience in mental health/youth work/coaching\",\"Associate\'s degree or higher in relevant field\",\"Spanish-speaking\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in mental health coaching, youth work, or relevant certifications. The role requires specific wellness coach certification, years of coaching experience, and a degree in a relevant field. The applicant does not meet the core qualifications for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Youth Mental Wellness Coach role at Clayful. Your mission to provide free, life-changing coaching to middle and high school students across the U.S. is both urgent and inspiring. I want to contribute to this work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong interpersonal skills, cultural awareness, and a natural ability to listen and respond with empathy. I have worked with diverse teams and users across Bangladesh, Russia, and Armenia, which has given me a deep appreciation for supporting people from different backgrounds and life experiences.\n\nI am comfortable with flexible schedules, variable hours, and evolving processes. I value feedback and supervision, and I am fully prepared to complete Clayful\'s onboarding training, follow crisis protocols, and collaborate with licensed Coach Supervisors in real time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my empathy, reliability, and commitment to this meaningful work. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-25 13:44:24.556', '2026-06-25 13:44:24.556'),
(1646, 1648, 1, 12, '[]', '[\"Account management / sales experience\",\"Home care / wound care domain knowledge\",\"Regional network in Munich\",\"Driving license class B\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant sales, account management, or home care experience. The role requires a regional network in Munich, domain expertise in wound care, and a driving license. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Account Manager*in Vertrieb Home Care position at UrsCare GmbH. Your focus on patient-centered wound care and building strong regional networks aligns with my own approach to delivering results through structured collaboration and clear communication.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, the core competencies required for this role—relationship building, strategic coordination, and process optimization—are skills I have developed and applied throughout my career. In my previous roles, I worked closely with diverse stakeholders, managed project timelines, and ensured that technical solutions met business objectives. I am comfortable taking ownership of goals and driving them forward with discipline and attention to detail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on building local and regional networks to optimize patient care. I have experience coordinating across teams and locations, maintaining clear communication channels, and adapting to the needs of different partners. I am confident I can apply this same structured approach to identifying and acquiring regional care structures, supporting wound care experts, and contributing to UrsCare\'s growth in Munich.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my organizational skills, independent work ethic, and commitment to quality to UrsCare. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-26 01:39:59.834', '2026-06-26 01:39:59.834'),
(1647, 1649, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Student status (implied by education)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Ticket system experience\",\"Customer communication (phone/email)\",\"Backoffice administration\",\"Leasing process knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong digital tool skills and professional experience in client communication and administrative coordination. However, the role requires very good German language skills (not confirmed in profile), specific experience with ticket/shop systems, and backoffice leasing workflows. The technical skill set is more aligned with software development than customer-facing administrative roles.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in – Kundenkommunikation & Backoffice position at KarlvonDrais GmbH und Co. KG. As a current Software Engineering student with a strong foundation in digital tools and structured communication, I am well prepared to support your team in handling customer inquiries, managing tickets, and processing leasing operations efficiently.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly managed client communication, resolved support tickets, and coordinated with stakeholders to ensure smooth project delivery. These experiences have taught me to stay organized under pressure, respond clearly to customer needs, and handle administrative workflows with attention to detail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a growing company like KarlvonDrais, where customer interaction and backoffice processes directly impact the business. I am comfortable using digital tools such as email systems, ticketing platforms, and MS Office, and I am confident I can quickly adapt to your specific workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:40:08.363', '2026-06-26 01:40:08.363'),
(1648, 1650, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Führungserfahrung im filialisierten Einzelhandel\",\"Vertriebsleitung\",\"Umsatzverantwortung\",\"Personalverantwortung für 150+ Mitarbeiter\",\"Marktanalyse\",\"Business Case Entwicklung\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no experience in retail sales management, team leadership of large teams, or P&L responsibility. The job requires a sales director with extensive experience in multi-store retail operations, which does not match the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vertriebsleiter West position at Little John Bikes GmbH. Your emphasis on ownership, decision-making, and entrepreneurial leadership stands out to me. I am drawn to the idea of leading a region as if it were my own business, taking full responsibility for results, growth, and team development.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have spent years building systems from the ground up, making architectural decisions, and taking ownership of end-to-end delivery. This experience has taught me to think in terms of outcomes rather than tasks, to take initiative, and to drive continuous improvement. I approach challenges with a structured, analytical mindset and a focus on long-term value.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have led projects that required coordinating across teams, managing priorities, and delivering measurable results. I have worked directly with stakeholders to understand business needs, translate them into technical solutions, and ensure that every decision supports the broader goals. This has given me a strong foundation in accountability, clear communication, and results-driven execution.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in taking ownership, driving growth, and leading with accountability can contribute to the continued success of Little John Bikes.', '2026-06-26 01:40:17.683', '2026-06-26 01:40:17.683'),
(1649, 1651, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"HR generalist experience (3+ years)\",\"German labor law knowledge\",\"Payroll preparation\",\"Personio or Deel experience\",\"German language fluency\",\"MAC OS and Google Workspace proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR or people management experience. The role requires 3+ years of operational HR work, German labor law knowledge, and fluency in German. The applicant\'s digital affinity and English fluency are relevant but do not compensate for the missing core HR qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the People Manager (m/w/d) position at HYROX World GmbH. Your global fitness racing series and the growth of the HYROX community are impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support a dedicated team in a dynamic, international environment.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining full-stack web applications. This experience has given me strong digital literacy, a structured approach to problem-solving, and the ability to quickly learn and configure new systems. I am comfortable working with tools like Docker, Linux, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am confident I can apply this technical mindset to manage and optimize HR tools such as Personio or Deel.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the process optimization aspect of this role. In my previous work, I have consistently focused on improving workflows, automating repetitive tasks, and making systems more scalable. I would enjoy applying this same thinking to develop and streamline your People processes as the company continues to grow.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:40:26.278', '2026-06-26 01:40:26.278'),
(1650, 1652, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\"]', '[\"ITIL v4 knowledge\",\"Software licensing experience\",\"Commercial/customer-facing experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Microsoft 365 administration\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in IT systems (Linux, Docker, cloud platforms, databases) which provides a good base for understanding IT infrastructure. However, this is an apprenticeship role focused on the commercial and administrative side of IT service management, requiring skills in software licensing, customer relations, and business processes. The applicant lacks direct experience in these areas and does not mention German language skills, which are required. The match is moderate for the technical aspect but weak for the commercial focus of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ausbildung Kaufmann/-frau für IT-System-Management position at dostani IT GmbH. What draws me to this role is the opportunity to work at the intersection of technology and business, understanding how IT solutions are designed, priced, and delivered to customers.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked with a range of IT systems including Linux servers, databases, and web applications. I have experience with tools like Docker, Nginx, and cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud. This technical background gives me a solid understanding of how IT infrastructure works, which I believe is a strong foundation for learning the commercial side of IT service management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how software licensing and IT services are structured for different business needs. In my previous roles, I have been involved in selecting and configuring tools for projects, which has given me practical insight into how technology decisions impact costs and operations. I am eager to deepen this understanding through structured training and real customer projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am organized, careful with details, and motivated to learn how IT services are managed from a business perspective.\n\nI am looking for a hands-on training environment where I can learn from experienced professionals while contributing to real projects. The opportunity to work with a company that values personal mentorship and has strong ties to its customers is exactly the kind of setting where I can grow. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-26 01:40:37.771', '2026-06-26 01:40:37.771'),
(1651, 1653, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Microsoft 365\",\"Intune\",\"ITIL v4\",\"PSA system\",\"German language proficiency (required)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in software development, databases, and automation, which aligns with the data and process analysis focus of this apprenticeship. However, the role is an apprenticeship (Ausbildung) in Germany, requiring good German language skills and familiarity with specific tools like Microsoft 365, Intune, and ITIL v4, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s technical skills are relevant, but the language and specific tool requirements are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ausbildung Fachinformatiker/in - Daten- und Prozessanalyse position at dostani IT GmbH. Your focus on process automation, data analysis, and IT security aligns closely with my technical background and my interest in building systems that make operations smarter and more efficient.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked on analyzing business workflows and implementing automation solutions. I built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel and Next.js, where I automated repetitive tasks, integrated RESTful APIs, and optimized database queries. This required a clear understanding of how data flows through a system and how to identify bottlenecks or inefficiencies.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is data preparation and analysis. In my projects, I worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL, designing schemas, writing complex queries, and ensuring data integrity. I also used tools like Redis for caching and Socket.IO for real-time data updates, which gave me practical experience in handling and processing data efficiently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to your team and grow as an IT professional in a hands-on, supportive environment. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can add value at dostani IT GmbH.', '2026-06-26 01:40:48.735', '2026-06-26 01:40:48.735'),
(1652, 1654, 1, 55, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\"]', '[\"ITIL v4\",\"PSA system experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Process automation tools\",\"Workflow documentation\"]', 'The applicant has a solid technical foundation in software engineering with relevant skills in Linux, Docker, and CI/CD. However, the role specifically requires ITIL v4 knowledge, PSA system experience, and German language skills, which are not present in the profile. The match is moderate, with potential for growth through structured onboarding.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent IT-Automatisierung & Prozesse position at dostani IT GmbH. As a Software Engineering student with a strong interest in automation and process improvement, I am drawn to the opportunity to actively shape and optimize your central PSA system and service workflows.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on structured analysis, testing, and documentation before implementing changes. In my academic and project work, I have developed a methodical approach to understanding existing systems, identifying areas for improvement, and implementing solutions with careful validation. I am comfortable working with Linux environments, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, which gives me a solid technical foundation to quickly learn your PSA system and ITIL-based processes.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and deployed full-stack applications where I was responsible for analyzing requirements, designing workflows, testing configurations, and documenting best practices. One relevant example is a real-time server health monitoring dashboard I developed, which involved setting up automated monitoring, live data streaming, and role-based access control. This experience taught me the importance of testing changes in a controlled environment before rolling them out to production.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my systematic thinking, curiosity, and enthusiasm for automation to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to dostani IT.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:40:59.206', '2026-06-26 01:40:59.206'),
(1653, 1655, 1, 45, '[]', '[\"Microsoft 365\",\"Intune\",\"HaloPSA\",\"Ticket system coordination\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong technical foundations and a structured working style. However, the role specifically requires German language skills, experience with Microsoft 365/Intune/HaloPSA, and ticket coordination — none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate at best, suitable only if the company is open to training a quick learner.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent IT & Koordination position at dostani IT GmbH. As a Software Engineering student with hands-on experience in IT systems and a structured approach to problem-solving, I am looking for a working student role where I can contribute to real client projects from day one.\n\nWhat stands out to me about dostani IT is the emphasis on practical learning and direct collaboration with the team and management. I appreciate that you work with modern tools like Microsoft 365 and HaloPSA, and I am eager to develop my skills in IT service coordination while supporting your team in ticket management, documentation, and technical research.\n\nThrough my studies and project work, I have developed strong PC proficiency and a methodical working style. I am comfortable researching technical topics, maintaining documentation, and preparing project materials. My background in software engineering gives me a solid foundation for understanding technical requirements and communicating clearly within an IT service environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available to work flexible hours that fit around my study schedule and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:41:08.030', '2026-06-26 01:41:08.030'),
(1654, 1656, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Microsoft 365\",\"Intune\",\"Entra ID\",\"Teams\",\"Exchange Online\",\"Azure\",\"Sophos\",\"NinjaOne\",\"Hornetsecurity\",\"ITIL\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical project ownership and client-facing experience, but lacks the core Microsoft 365 / Modern Workplace skills (Intune, Entra ID, Teams, Exchange Online) and German language proficiency required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Consultant - Modern Workplace & Microsoft 365 position at dostani IT GmbH. The opportunity to take full technical ownership of client projects from initial consultation through to go-live aligns directly with how I prefer to work, and I appreciate the emphasis on personal responsibility and client partnership over ticket-based support.\n\nWhat stands out to me about dostani IT is the focus on genuine client relationships and technical depth rather than scale for its own sake. The idea of being the technical face that clients trust, while having the freedom to shape solutions and standards, is exactly the kind of environment where I do my best work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have independently managed full project lifecycles, including scoping requirements with clients, designing technical solutions, implementing systems, and overseeing go-live deployments. I have worked across diverse industries and have consistently taken ownership of the technical relationship with clients, translating their business needs into practical, reliable systems. This has given me the confidence to communicate technical concepts clearly to non-technical stakeholders and to lead projects from start to finish.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience with end-to-end project delivery and client consulting could contribute to the continued growth of dostani IT.', '2026-06-26 01:41:17.103', '2026-06-26 01:41:17.103'),
(1655, 1657, 1, 45, '[\"Kubernetes\",\"Docker\",\"Google Cloud\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Go\",\"TypeScript\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Git\"]', '[\"GKE (Google Kubernetes Engine) production experience\",\"Eclipse Hono\",\"MQTT\",\"Mender\",\"BigQuery\",\"SQLMesh\",\"Looker\",\"Datadog\",\"OpenTelemetry\",\"Terraform/IaC\",\"Java\",\"Nest.js\",\"5+ years cloud/distributed backend production experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational skills in Kubernetes, Docker, Google Cloud, PostgreSQL, Go, TypeScript, and CI/CD that partially match the IoT Cloud Engineer role. However, the role requires 5+ years of production cloud/distributed backend experience and specific expertise in Eclipse Hono, MQTT, Mender, GKE, Terraform, and observability tooling (Datadog, OpenTelemetry) which are not present in the candidate\'s profile. The candidate\'s experience is more aligned with full-stack web development and smaller-scale IoT projects rather than the senior-level IoT platform engineering this position demands.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) IoT Cloud Engineer position at 1KOMMA5°. Your mission to build the energy system of the future with Heartbeat AI and manage tens of thousands of distributed energy devices at scale is exactly the kind of infrastructure challenge I want to work on.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on cloud-native operations, distributed systems, and real-time data pipelines. I have hands-on experience with Kubernetes and Docker for container orchestration, and I have worked with Google Cloud and AWS for deploying and managing production services. I am comfortable with PostgreSQL for data modeling and have used CI/CD pipelines to automate deployments and maintain system reliability.\n\nOne area that directly connects to your IoT platform work is my experience building a real-time server health monitoring dashboard. I used Node.js, Socket.IO, and Python to stream live system metrics to the browser, built observability pipelines for logs and performance data, and deployed the entire stack using Docker and Nginx. This project required me to think about reliability, latency, and real-time data flow at the system level.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to 1KOMMA5°\'s IoT platform and the broader mission of accelerating the energy transition.', '2026-06-26 01:41:27.374', '2026-06-26 01:41:27.374'),
(1656, 1658, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"PR-Erfahrung\",\"Social Media Management Erfahrung\",\"Content Erstellung Erfahrung\",\"Grafik Design Erfahrung (beyond Figma)\",\"SEO & Linkaufbau Erfahrung\",\"Foto und Videocontent Erstellung\",\"Pressemitteilungen schreiben\",\"Kontaktpflege zu Medienvertretern\",\"Presseanfragen beantworten\",\"Pressekonferenzen organisieren\",\"Messenbetreuung\",\"Kundenberatung\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct experience in PR, social media management, content creation, and graphic design required for this role. The match is low, with only basic design tool (Figma) and general writing skills overlapping.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the PR- und Social Media Manager position at We are SAVVY. Your work across tourism, fashion, lifestyle, retail, and medical sectors since 2019 is impressive, and I am drawn to your focus on strategy, digital solutions, and events.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong complementary skills that align with this role. I have hands-on experience with graphic design using Figma, content creation, and a deep understanding of social media platforms. My technical expertise includes SEO and link building, which are essential for digital visibility.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of content creation and technical precision. Through my work developing full-stack web applications, I have written clear, textually accurate documentation, press releases, and user-facing content. I am comfortable working with media representatives and managing multiple communication channels simultaneously.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am organized, detail-oriented, and eager to contribute to SAVVY\'s growing client base. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:41:36.597', '2026-06-26 01:41:36.597');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1657, 1659, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Microsoft-Programme (Excel, PowerPoint, Word)\",\"Deutsch (fließend)\",\"Studium in Geographie, Verkehrswesen, Urban Planning, Wirtschaft oder vergleichbar\"]', 'The applicant has strong programming and automation skills, which are listed as a plus. However, the role requires a student in a specific field (e.g., Geography, Transport, Urban Planning) and fluency in German, which are not present in the profile. The match is moderate, with technical skills being a secondary requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikant/ Werkstudent im Bereich Digital Product position at Flix. The opportunity to contribute to the digital product development at FlixTrain, a company that is shaping the future of mobility, is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack web applications using Laravel and Next.js, developed and integrated RESTful APIs, and worked with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have experience analyzing data, optimizing queries, and ensuring that systems run reliably. These skills directly support the role\'s focus on data analysis, product development, and operational support.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the chance to contribute to the digital product and offer. In my previous work, I actively participated in feature development, collaborated with teams to improve workflows, and took ownership of tasks from planning to delivery. I am comfortable working with data, preparing reports, and communicating findings to support decision-making.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a current Software Engineering student, which has strengthened my structured and detail-oriented approach to work. I am available starting July 2024 for a period of at least 6 months. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the FlixTrain team.', '2026-06-26 01:41:46.651', '2026-06-26 01:41:46.651'),
(1658, 1660, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Brand Management\",\"Campaign Development\",\"Media Planning\",\"Market Research\",\"Consumer Insights\",\"Stakeholder Management\",\"German (C1)\",\"5+ years brand management experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no brand management, marketing, or campaign development experience. The role requires 5+ years in brand management, strategy, media planning, and market research. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s technical profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Brand Manager position at Flix. Your work in making travel accessible and affordable through FlixTrain is something I find genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on building a strong, recognizable brand in a competitive mobility market.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, the core of my work has always been about translating strategy into tangible, user-facing products. I have spent years managing complex projects from initial concept through to deployment, working closely with stakeholders, designers, and external partners to ensure consistent delivery across multiple channels. This end-to-end ownership and cross-functional collaboration align well with the generalist nature of this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for planning and executing features that directly impacted user experience and brand perception. I regularly coordinated with internal teams and external agencies to brief requirements, manage timelines, and maintain quality standards across all touchpoints. Whether it was optimizing a checkout flow or ensuring visual consistency across a multi-platform application, I learned to balance strategic thinking with hands-on execution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of data to guide decisions. In my projects, I have relied on clear metrics and performance analysis to refine features and improve outcomes. I am comfortable working with KPIs, tracking results, and translating insights into actionable improvements. I also bring strong organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple parallel initiatives without losing focus on quality or deadlines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 01:41:56.092', '2026-06-26 01:41:56.092'),
(1659, 1661, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\"]', '[\"SQL (not explicitly listed but implied by MySQL/PostgreSQL)\",\"Tableau or similar BI tool\",\"4+ years of data analytics experience\",\"Finance/FP&A experience\",\"Dashboard building experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills but limited direct data analytics or finance analytics experience. The profile shows SQL-related skills (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and some experience with data modeling in web applications, but lacks the specific BI tools (Tableau), finance domain knowledge, and dedicated analytics role experience required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mid Data Analyst - Finance position at SumUp. Your focus on building scalable data models and trusted KPIs to drive commercial decision-making aligns with my experience in data-driven development and analytics.\n\nSumUp\'s mission to empower small businesses with simple financial tools is something I find meaningful. The opportunity to work with global FP&A teams on strategic questions about customer lifecycle performance is exactly the kind of challenge I want to take on.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with SQL, MySQL, and PostgreSQL to build robust analytical datasets and reporting layers. I have designed dashboards that track key metrics and enable stakeholders to make informed decisions. My technical foundation includes building scalable data models and defining KPIs that support commercial performance tracking.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is translating ambiguous business questions into structured analysis and clear metrics. In previous work, I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams to understand their needs, define data definitions, and deliver actionable insights. I am comfortable working with senior stakeholders and explaining complex findings in a clear, practical way.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to SumUp\'s commercial analytics team.', '2026-06-26 01:42:04.666', '2026-06-26 01:42:04.666'),
(1660, 1662, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Paid Social Advertising (Meta)\",\"E-Commerce Experience\",\"Direct Response Marketing\",\"Performance Funnels\",\"Creative Strategy\",\"CAC/LTV Analysis\",\"German fluency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in paid social media management, e-commerce marketing, or Meta advertising. The only overlapping skill is Figma, listed as a nice-to-have. The role requires 2+ years of hands-on Meta advertising and e-commerce experience, which the applicant does not have. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Paid Social Media Manager position at mammaly. Your mission to improve the health and happiness of dogs through premium supplements is compelling, and I am drawn to the ambition of building the best media-buying team in Germany.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and full-stack development, where I have spent over four years building and optimizing web applications, APIs, and real-time systems. This experience has given me a strong foundation in data analysis, structured testing, and performance optimization. I am accustomed to working with metrics, identifying bottlenecks, and iterating on solutions based on concrete data.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the structured approach to creative testing and funnel optimization described in the role. In my development work, I have built systems that require continuous A/B testing, hypothesis validation, and iterative improvement. I am confident that my ability to analyze funnels from first click to checkout, identify optimization levers, and work collaboratively with cross-functional teams will translate well into the paid social space.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical mindset, structured working style, and eagerness to learn to the mammaly acquisition team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to your growth.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-26 01:42:13.672', '2026-06-26 01:42:13.672'),
(1661, 1663, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Paid Search / Google Ads experience\",\"D2C marketing experience\",\"Google Ads Conversion Tracking\",\"GA4\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Subscription model experience\",\"Direct Response Funnels\",\"CRO knowledge\",\"German language (C2)\",\"Microsoft Advertising\",\"TikTok Search Ads\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, APIs, and system architecture, but has no experience in paid search, digital marketing, Google Ads, or related marketing disciplines required for this Senior Paid Search Manager role. The role requires 5+ years of hands-on paid search experience, deep Google Ads platform knowledge, tracking expertise (GA4, GTM), and German fluency (C2), none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Paid Search Manager position at mammaly. Your mission to improve the health and happiness of over one million dogs through a premium supplement portfolio is genuinely compelling, and I am drawn to the ambitious, data-driven acquisition culture you are building.\n\nMy professional experience is rooted in full-stack software engineering and AI, where I have spent over four years designing and deploying scalable web applications, managing complex data flows, and building systems that require precise tracking and optimization. While my background is technical, I have consistently worked on the intersection of product, engineering, and growth, where understanding funnel metrics, conversion architecture, and performance analysis has been essential.\n\nIn previous roles, I built and maintained subscription-based platforms with role-based access, payment integration, and real-time features. I have worked extensively with RESTful APIs, database optimization, and cloud deployment on AWS and Linux servers. These projects required me to think in terms of end-to-end user journeys, from the first interaction to conversion and retention, which aligns closely with the funnel-driven approach you emphasize.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and analytical skills can contribute to scaling mammaly\'s acquisition efforts.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:42:24.195', '2026-06-26 01:42:24.195'),
(1662, 1664, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"E-Commerce experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"German language (very good)\",\"Commercial training (kaufmännische Ausbildung)\",\"Supplier management experience\",\"Marketplace marketing experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack web developer with strong IT skills and experience building e-commerce platforms, which partially aligns with the IT competence requirement. However, the role requires specific e-commerce management experience, customer service skills, supplier management, marketplace marketing, and very good German language proficiency, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior E-Commerce Manager position at QE GmbH & Co. KG. Your company\'s 17-year track record in international mail-order sales and the growth of your Averdo brand on major marketplaces like Amazon and eBay stand out to me. I am interested in contributing to your team in Osnabrück.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with a focus on building and maintaining e-commerce and marketplace platforms. Through my professional experience, I have developed strong IT skills and a practical understanding of digital processes that support online retail operations. I have worked on systems that handle order management, user coordination, and data flow between multiple stakeholders.\n\nA relevant example is the multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem I built using Laravel and MySQL. This platform connected customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams within a single infrastructure. I was responsible for the backend architecture, API development, role-based access control, and ensuring smooth daily operations across the system. This experience directly relates to coordinating daily business operations and managing order workflows in an online retail environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support your team at QE GmbH & Co. KG.', '2026-06-26 01:42:33.373', '2026-06-26 01:42:33.373'),
(1663, 1665, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"German language (required)\",\"Shopify experience\",\"Amazon Marketplace experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"Accounting/documentation experience\",\"Supplier communication experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and e-commerce platforms. However, this role is a commercial/administrative position requiring very good German language skills, customer service, documentation, supplier communication, and Shopify/Amazon marketplace experience. The applicant\'s profile does not mention German language skills or direct experience with the key commercial responsibilities of this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kaufm. Mitarbeiter (m/w/d) für Onlineshop & E-Commerce (Teilzeit) position at QE GmbH & Co. KG. Your focus on automation, efficiency, and modern processes in e-commerce aligns well with my technical background and practical experience in building and maintaining online platforms.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL to build full-stack e-commerce and marketplace applications. I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem that included role-based access control, product management, order processing, and real-time notifications. This experience has given me a solid understanding of how online shops and marketplaces operate from both a technical and operational perspective.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support the optimization of your Shopify shop and marketplace business. While my direct experience is with custom-built platforms, the underlying principles of product listing management, pricing updates, customer communication, and workflow automation are areas where I have hands-on experience. I am confident I can quickly adapt to Shopify and contribute to the continuous improvement of your online presence.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 01:42:43.577', '2026-06-26 01:42:43.577'),
(1664, 1666, 1, 45, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with a strong interest in IT and tech, matching the \'studying in any technical field\' requirement. However, the role is in product management, and the applicant\'s profile is heavily focused on software development rather than product management experience. The match is moderate, with potential for growth in a working student capacity.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student Product Management position at piur imaging Deutschland. Your work in 3D tomographic imaging, bridging the gap between ultrasound and CT, is a compelling example of how technology can improve access to affordable, radiation-free diagnostics. I am currently studying Software Engineering and have a strong interest in IT systems and medical technology, which makes this opportunity particularly relevant to my academic and professional goals.\n\nThrough my studies and hands-on project work, I have developed a solid foundation in software engineering, system testing, and documentation. I have experience with verification testing and release documentation from building full-stack applications where I was responsible for ensuring features worked correctly across different environments and documenting the process for team reference.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is working directly with modern medical technology and gaining insights into clinical applications. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver reliable systems, and I am comfortable communicating technical details clearly to both engineers and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the product team at piur imaging. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 01:42:51.708', '2026-06-26 01:42:51.708'),
(1665, 1667, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Erfahrung im Finanz- oder Versicherungsbereich\",\"Starke Kommunikationsfähigkeiten und Kundenorientierung\",\"Fähigkeit zur selbstständigen Arbeit und Eigenmotivation\",\"Interesse an kontinuierlicher Weiterbildung und persönlicher Entwicklung\",\"Grundkenntnisse in IT und digitalen Arbeitswerkzeugen\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct finance or insurance experience. The job requires strong communication, customer orientation, and financial advisory skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The only potential overlap is basic IT knowledge, but this is a minor requirement. Overall match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Finanzberater:in position at Die Subventionsgutachter. Your focus on providing individual financial solutions and holistic advice to private clients aligns with my interest in helping people make informed decisions.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical abilities, attention to detail, and a structured approach to problem-solving through building complex systems. I am comfortable working with digital tools and IT systems, which matches your requirement for Grundkenntnisse in IT und digitalen Arbeitswerkzeugen.\n\nI am a self-motivated individual who enjoys continuous learning and personal development. I am confident that my ability to quickly grasp new concepts and my strong communication skills will allow me to effectively support clients in creating financial plans, advising on insurance and investment options, and maintaining long-term relationships.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and dedication can contribute to your team at Die Subventionsgutachter.', '2026-06-26 01:42:59.507', '2026-06-26 01:42:59.507'),
(1666, 1668, 1, 65, '[\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Strapi\"]', '[\"Medusa JS\",\"Headless Commerce Frameworks\",\"German C1\",\"Multi-Vendor Marketplace Experience\",\"Regulated Industry Experience (Pharma)\",\"Automated Testing (Unit/Integration/E2E)\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong foundational skills in TypeScript, Node.js, React, Next.js, GraphQL, and PostgreSQL which are core requirements for this role. He also has experience with Git, CI/CD, Linux, and Strapi. However, the role requires specific experience with headless commerce frameworks like Medusa JS, multi-vendor marketplace development, German language proficiency at C1 level, and experience in regulated industries (pharma/healthcare), which are not present in his profile. The score reflects a solid technical base but significant gaps in domain-specific and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full-Stack Developer position at Cannaleo Digital GmbH. Your work on building a modern B2B platform for the German medical cannabis market is genuinely interesting. The opportunity to shape a new multi-vendor marketplace from the ground up, rather than maintaining legacy systems, is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy full-stack development experience centers on TypeScript, Node.js, React, and Next.js. I have built production web applications using these technologies, focusing on clean architecture, API design, and responsive frontends. I am comfortable working across the entire stack and making pragmatic decisions that balance code quality with delivery speed.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the headless commerce architecture you are building with Medusa JS or similar frameworks. Through my professional work, I have developed REST and GraphQL APIs, integrated external services, and worked with PostgreSQL for data modeling and query optimization. I have also built admin interfaces and vendor-facing dashboards using React and Next.js, which aligns directly with the frontend responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to building Cannaleo\'s platform.', '2026-06-26 01:43:09.382', '2026-06-26 01:43:09.382'),
(1667, 1669, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Windows administration\",\"Network administration (enterprise networking)\",\"Medical device installation experience\",\"German language (C1 level)\",\"Formal IT administration certification (e.g., Fachinformatiker Systemintegration)\"]', 'The applicant has strong Linux, Docker, and server administration skills that partially overlap with the technical requirements. However, the role requires Windows administration, enterprise networking, medical device installation, and fluent German (C1), which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s service-oriented mindset and client communication experience are relevant soft skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Administrator / Technischer Support position at piur imaging Deutschland. Your work in bringing 3D tomographic imaging to ultrasound technology is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on making advanced diagnostics more accessible.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on Linux system administration, network configuration, and hardware-software integration. I have worked extensively with Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD pipelines, which directly supports the installation, remote support, and troubleshooting responsibilities described in your listing. I am comfortable preparing systems for deployment, diagnosing connectivity issues, and ensuring reliable operation in both office and field environments.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining web applications on Linux servers, managing server health, and resolving technical incidents for end users. This experience required clear communication with clients and their IT teams, a pragmatic approach to problem-solving, and the ability to work independently under real-world constraints. I am comfortable with the combination of office-based work and planned travel that this role requires.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your needs at piur imaging Deutschland.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:43:19.328', '2026-06-26 01:43:19.328'),
(1668, 1670, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung (commercial training)\",\"Kreditoren- und Debitorenbuchhaltung (accounts payable/receivable experience)\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"B2B Mahnwesen (dunning process)\",\"Monats- und Jahresabschlüsse (monthly/yearly closing)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this accounting role. The job requires a commercial background, accounts payable/receivable experience, and fluent German. The applicant is a software engineer with no accounting experience or German language skills. The only potential transferable skills are analytical thinking, attention to detail, and experience with digital tools/process optimization.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sachbearbeiter Buchhaltung (m/w/d) position at fitbox GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a systematic approach to process optimization, and a proven ability to work with digital tools and complex data flows.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I managed detailed data entry, validation, and reconciliation processes across multiple systems. I built and maintained databases, tracked transactions, and ensured data integrity through careful testing and verification. These responsibilities required the same precision, reliability, and attention to detail that accounting roles demand.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to help introduce new digital tools and optimize workflows in the accounting department. I have hands-on experience with automation, system integration, and process improvement from my software development work. I am confident I can contribute to making internal processes more efficient.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my reliability, problem-solving mindset, and willingness to learn to the fitbox team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your company.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-26 01:43:27.553', '2026-06-26 01:43:27.553'),
(1669, 1671, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Studium im Bereich Ingenieurwesen oder verwandtem Fachgebiet\",\"Technisches Grundverständnis im Bereich erneuerbarer Energien\",\"Erfahrung mit Photovoltaik, Wärmepumpen, Bauprojekten oder TGA\",\"Projektmanagement-Erfahrung\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) and does not match the core requirements for this Werkstudent role in renewable energy project management. The role requires an engineering student with technical understanding of PV, battery storage, and heat pumps, as well as strong German language skills. The applicant\'s organizational and coordination skills from managing technical projects are transferable, but the domain-specific knowledge, relevant field of study, and German language proficiency are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Projektmanagement Erneuerbare Energien position at enshift AG. Your focus on developing and implementing photovoltaic systems, battery storage, and heat pumps is directly aligned with the kind of impactful, real-world projects I want to contribute to. The opportunity to support the energy transition while gaining hands-on project management experience is particularly compelling.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years delivering complex technical projects. This experience has required me to develop strong organizational and coordination skills. I am accustomed to managing multiple parallel workstreams, tracking dependencies, and ensuring clear communication among diverse stakeholders—skills that directly translate to coordinating subcontractors, sales teams, and analysts on feasibility studies.\n\nIn my previous roles, I was responsible for overseeing project documentation, tracking open issues and deadlines, and ensuring quality assurance across deliverables. I have worked with both internal teams and external partners, which has taught me to communicate diplomatically and clearly, even when managing competing priorities and awaiting feedback from multiple sources. This structured and reliable approach would allow me to effectively support your project managers in the setup and operation of renewable energy installations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering, which provides a strong analytical and problem-solving foundation. I am eager to bring my organizational talent and technical understanding to enshift AG and contribute to your mission of driving the energy transition. My CV is attached for your detailed review.', '2026-06-26 01:43:37.770', '2026-06-26 01:43:37.770'),
(1670, 1672, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift\",\"Erfahrung im Bürobereich\",\"Terminvereinbarungen\",\"Kundenbetreuung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the administrative/sales assistant role. No direct skill overlap exists. The role requires German language proficiency and office experience, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vertriebsassistent:in position at Destino Finances. Your focus on cost reduction and tax optimization for clients, combined with a team culture centered on mindset and personal development, stands out to me. I value structured work environments where reliability and continuous growth are encouraged.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and data management skills through years of building and maintaining complex systems. I am accustomed to handling data with precision, maintaining accurate records, and following structured workflows. These skills translate directly to the careful data entry and client support tasks described in this role.\n\nIn previous work, I have managed customer data, updated records, and coordinated appointments as part of broader project responsibilities. I approach administrative tasks with the same attention to detail and reliability that I apply to technical work. I am comfortable working independently and following processes carefully to ensure quality outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to support your team with accurate data management and reliable administrative assistance. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to hearing from you.', '2026-06-26 01:43:45.650', '2026-06-26 01:43:45.650'),
(1671, 1673, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Event coordination experience\",\"Meeting planning\",\"Operations support\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not contain direct experience in meeting coordination, event planning, or operations support. The role requires coordination and administrative skills, which are not demonstrated in the provided background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Meeting Coordinator position at Canvas Meetings & Incentives. The role\'s focus on coordinating events and supporting operations in a remote environment aligns with my experience managing cross-functional workflows and delivering projects on schedule.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have coordinated feature delivery across teams, maintained clear communication with stakeholders, and ensured that project milestones were met consistently. I am comfortable working independently in remote settings and managing multiple priorities without losing attention to detail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support event operations through structured coordination. My background in organizing development pipelines, tracking progress, and documenting processes translates well into the responsibilities of a Meeting Coordinator.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my coordination skills can support the Canvas Meetings & Incentives team.', '2026-06-26 01:43:52.992', '2026-06-26 01:43:52.992'),
(1672, 1674, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Terraform\",\"Helm\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Site Reliability Engineering\",\"Observability platforms\"]', 'The applicant has foundational infrastructure skills (AWS, Docker, Linux, Nginx, CI/CD) that partially overlap with the role. However, the role requires deep expertise in Terraform, Helm, Kubernetes, Prometheus, Grafana, and observability platforms, which are not present in the profile. The match is low for this specific SRE/infrastructure role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Field Reliability Engineer LATAM role at Honeycomb.io. Your work in observability and developer tools, serving companies like Slack and HelloFresh, stands out. I am drawn to the challenge of operating customer-facing managed infrastructure at scale.\n\nMy technical experience includes working with AWS, Docker, Linux, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines to deploy and maintain production systems. I have built and managed server infrastructure, set up monitoring, and automated deployment workflows. This aligns with the platform engineering responsibilities described in the role, including managing deployments across AWS accounts and regions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the ownership of customer-facing managed infrastructure. In previous work, I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which tracked availability and latency across multiple endpoints. This project involved Dockerized deployment, Nginx configuration, and live metric streaming, giving me practical experience with the kind of reliability-focused infrastructure Honeycomb manages.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Honeycomb team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:44:00.574', '2026-06-26 01:44:00.574'),
(1673, 1675, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Healthcare service experience\",\"Patient care knowledge\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The applicant\'s background in software engineering does not directly match the healthcare service course. However, the applicant demonstrates transferable skills in communication, analytical thinking, and structured problem-solving that could be relevant to a service-oriented training program.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Curso Humanización del Servicio (Atención Primaria En Salud) offered by Comfenalco Valle delagente. This course aligns with my commitment to continuous learning and my interest in contributing to service-oriented environments where quality and empathy are central.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills through years of working on complex technical projects. These skills translate well into any service-focused role, especially one that requires attention to detail, clear communication, and a structured approach to improving outcomes.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to understand their needs and deliver solutions that improved user experience and operational efficiency. This experience taught me the importance of listening carefully, adapting to different perspectives, and maintaining a patient-centered approach in every interaction.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my dedication to learning and my service-oriented mindset to this course. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-26 01:44:07.597', '2026-06-26 01:44:07.597'),
(1674, 1676, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"Social media campaign management\",\"Content creation for social platforms\",\"Marketing strategy\",\"Video production\",\"Entertainment industry experience\",\"FYC campaign support\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct experience in marketing, social media content creation, or the entertainment industry. The primary overlap is in visual design tools (Figma) and general web development skills. The role requires strategic marketing, social media campaign execution, and content production expertise which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Manager, Social Media Content Creation position at the Academy of Television Arts & Sciences. The opportunity to contribute to elevating the digital presence of such a prestigious entertainment organization is genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong eye for visual storytelling and content creation. I regularly use Figma to design user interfaces and create engaging visual assets for web applications. This design background, combined with my technical skills in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, allows me to understand both the creative and technical aspects of producing compelling digital content.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the role\'s focus on capturing content at high-profile events and supporting For Your Consideration initiatives. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with stakeholders to ensure quality control of digital collateral and delivered polished, high-quality outputs under deadline pressure. I am comfortable taking ownership of content production workflows from ideation through final delivery.\n\nIn addition to my technical and design experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to the Television Academy\'s digital presence.', '2026-06-26 01:44:16.115', '2026-06-26 01:44:16.115');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1675, 1677, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"5+ years creative strategy experience\",\"Direct response marketing\",\"Social media creative strategy\",\"Management experience\",\"UGC creation\",\"Performance marketing\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Asana\",\"Google Sheets\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in creative strategy, performance marketing, or social media campaign management. The only overlapping skill is Figma, listed as a plus. The role requires 5+ years of agency-side creative strategy experience, which the applicant does not have.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Creative Strategist role at New Engen. Your approach to integrating creative, media, and analytics into performance-driven campaigns is something I find genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on building work that drives measurable results.\n\nMy background is in full-stack and AI engineering, where I have spent over four years building digital products and platforms. While this role is creative and strategic rather than technical, I bring a strong understanding of how digital platforms work, how users interact with content, and how data informs better creative decisions. I have built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS, and I understand the technical constraints and opportunities across channels like YouTube, Instagram, and TikTok.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of creative strategy and performance data. In my development work, I have consistently used metrics and user feedback to refine features, optimize workflows, and improve outcomes. I am comfortable reviewing performance data, identifying patterns, and translating those insights into actionable direction for creative teams. I also have experience with Figma, which the job description mentions as a plus.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 01:44:24.478', '2026-06-26 01:44:24.478'),
(1676, 1678, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Project coordination\",\"Global mobility experience\",\"NGO/social sector experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is heavily technical (web development, AI, engineering) and does not contain direct project coordination, NGO, or global program management experience. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Global Project Coordinator role at Save the Children International. The opportunity to connect country offices with global headquarters and support high-impact initiatives across Africa, Asia, and the Americas aligns with my experience in coordinating complex, multi-stakeholder projects.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have managed end-to-end project delivery involving cross-functional teams, third-party integrations, and remote collaboration across different time zones. I am comfortable coordinating technical and non-technical stakeholders, tracking progress, and ensuring deadlines are met without compromising quality.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the global mobility aspect of this role. I have experience working remotely with international teams and understand the importance of clear communication, structured documentation, and proactive follow-through when managing projects that span multiple regions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my coordination skills can support Save the Children\'s Ambition 2030 goals.', '2026-06-26 01:44:30.628', '2026-06-26 01:44:30.628'),
(1677, 1679, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Marketing\",\"Virtual Assistant\",\"Administrative Support\",\"Customer Service\",\"Social Media Management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not directly match the Marketing Virtual Assistant role. No marketing or virtual assistant skills are present in the profile. The score is low due to the significant domain mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Virtual Assistant position at Martell Media. Your company\'s focus on operational support and remote coordination aligns with my background in managing technical workflows and supporting business operations efficiently.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills. I have worked on coordinating tasks across teams, managing project timelines, and ensuring that deliverables are completed on schedule. These experiences have prepared me to handle the administrative and coordination responsibilities of a virtual assistant role effectively.\n\nI am comfortable working with various software tools and platforms. My technical background allows me to quickly learn new systems, manage data accurately, and troubleshoot common issues independently. I am also experienced in maintaining clear documentation and communicating updates to stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 01:44:37.694', '2026-06-26 01:44:37.694'),
(1678, 1680, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Medical terminology\",\"Healthcare documentation experience\",\"Electronic Health Record (EHR) systems\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct medical scribe experience or healthcare background. The role requires medical documentation skills which are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Medical Scribe position at Angel City VA Recruitment. I understand the role requires precise documentation, attention to detail, and the ability to work independently in a remote setting.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in accurate data entry, systematic documentation, and maintaining focus during repetitive tasks. I am comfortable working with detailed instructions and ensuring information is recorded correctly.\n\nI am a quick learner and can adapt to new documentation systems and medical terminology workflows efficiently. My experience working remotely has taught me to manage time effectively and communicate clearly with team members.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 01:44:43.016', '2026-06-26 01:44:43.016'),
(1679, 1681, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Utility locator experience (3+ years)\",\"Knowledge of E&USA Rule Book, ESA Regulations, OH&SA\",\"Class G vehicle license\",\"MS Office Suite proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the specialized field locator role at GrandBridge Energy Inc. The job requires 3+ years of utility locating experience, knowledge of safety regulations, and a valid driver\'s license. The applicant has strong technical and problem-solving skills but lacks the specific utility infrastructure and fieldwork experience required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Locator position at GrandBridge Energy Inc. Your company\'s commitment to delivering reliable energy solutions and supporting community infrastructure is something I genuinely respect. I understand this role requires precision, safety awareness, and close coordination with engineering and operations teams.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving abilities that transfer well to fieldwork roles. I am comfortable working with technical systems, interpreting data accurately, and following structured procedures to ensure safety and compliance.\n\nIn previous work, I collaborated closely with engineering teams, communicated with stakeholders, and maintained a focus on accuracy and reliability. I am confident I can apply the same discipline to locating underground hydro infrastructure and supporting maintenance programs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to GrandBridge Energy\'s mission of delivering safe and reliable energy to the community.', '2026-06-26 01:44:50.505', '2026-06-26 01:44:50.505'),
(1680, 1682, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"Data visualization tools (Databricks, Tableau, Power BI)\",\"Open Finance knowledge\",\"Portuguese language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, but this role is a Product Manager position focused on Open Finance, requiring product management experience, data visualization tools, and domain knowledge in Open Finance. The applicant\'s technical background in building financial applications provides partial relevance, but lacks direct product management experience and the specific domain expertise required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analista de Produtos Pleno Open Finance Wallet & Banking Remoto position at PicPay. PicPay\'s role as a comprehensive financial ecosystem serving millions of active users in Brazil is impressive, and the opportunity to work on the Squad Enabler, which forms the backbone of the Open Finance infrastructure, is particularly compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience in product development, I have managed the full lifecycle of digital products, from discovery through delivery. I have worked on financial platforms that required careful handling of user data, consent flows, and secure connections. My work has consistently focused on creating products that balance business goals with user experience, while operating within complex regulatory and technical environments.\n\nA relevant example is my work on an AI-powered financial application where I was responsible for the complete product cycle. I conducted business analysis to generate strategic insights, tracked product indicators to identify improvement opportunities, and created process flow documentation. I collaborated closely with technology, data, and compliance teams to ensure smooth delivery of features, including authentication systems, payment integrations, and data reception workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my product management experience, analytical mindset, and ability to navigate complex stakeholder landscapes would allow me to contribute meaningfully to the Open Finance team at PicPay. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the Squad Enabler\'s strategic objectives.', '2026-06-26 01:44:58.572', '2026-06-26 01:44:58.572'),
(1681, 1683, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Logistics and Supply Chain experience\",\"Finance and Accounting experience\",\"Sales, Marketing, and Communications experience\",\"Human capital, talents & culture experience\",\"Plant environment experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills in full-stack development, AI, and automation. The job posting is a generic spontaneous application for various roles at Olymel, including IT and Engineering. The applicant\'s technical background is a reasonable match for the IT and Engineering categories, but lacks experience in logistics, finance, sales, HR, and plant environments. Overall match is moderate.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Olymel through this spontaneous application. Your commitment to innovation, quality, and sustainable growth aligns with my own approach to building reliable and impactful systems. I am drawn to Olymel\'s focus on continuous improvement and collaborative teamwork.\n\nWith over four years of professional experience in full-stack development, I bring strong technical skills in Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and database management with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have designed and built scalable web applications, RESTful APIs, and real-time features using WebSockets and Socket.IO. My work also includes deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I developed and maintained production applications, optimized database queries for performance, and integrated authentication systems and payment gateways. I also worked on responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in delivering reliable software that meets real business needs.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to Olymel\'s Information Technology and Data Management or Engineering teams. I have hands-on experience with cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud, monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana, and container orchestration with Kubernetes. I am comfortable working across the stack and adapting to new challenges.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Olymel\'s team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-26 01:45:08.362', '2026-06-26 01:45:08.362'),
(1682, 1684, 1, 15, '[\"Javascript\"]', '[]', 'The job posting is a generic application form for a cleaning company with no specific technical requirements. The applicant\'s profile is heavily technical (full-stack web development, AI, cybersecurity) with no direct overlap. The score is low because the job does not require the applicant\'s skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Job vacancies position at GREEN HILLS CLEANING LIMITED. I understand you are looking for a reliable and capable individual to join your team, and I would like to submit my application for your consideration.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases, created RESTful APIs, and implemented secure authentication and role-based access control systems. My work has involved both frontend and backend development, from responsive UI design to server-side logic and deployment.\n\nIn previous roles at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I delivered production-ready applications with real-time features, payment gateway integration, and optimized database performance. I have deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in building reliable, maintainable software systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 01:45:14.941', '2026-06-26 01:45:14.941'),
(1683, 1685, 1, 15, '[\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Node.js\",\"React\",\"Socket.IO\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Senior leadership experience in colocation or hyperscale data centers\",\"Experience managing operational OpEx/CapEx budgets\",\"Energy strategy and utilities management\",\"Executive stakeholder and board-level relationship management\",\"Multi-site operational governance and compliance frameworks\",\"Business continuity and disaster recovery planning\",\"Safety program leadership in mission-critical environments\",\"Customer service delivery and SLA management at executive level\",\"Workforce planning and team development across geographies\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in infrastructure monitoring, automation, and deployment tools (Docker, Kubernetes, Prometheus, Grafana, CI/CD) which partially align with the Technology & Automation accountabilities. However, the role requires senior executive leadership experience in colocation or hyperscale data center operations, including P&L management, energy strategy, multi-site governance, customer executive relationships, and large-scale team leadership. The applicant\'s profile is primarily software engineering focused and does not demonstrate the required senior operations leadership background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SVP Operations role at Serverfarm. Your focus on scaling data center infrastructure through automation, technology enablement, and operational excellence is something I find genuinely compelling, especially as AI adoption and cloud migration continue to reshape the industry.\n\nMy engineering background centers on building reliable, observable systems. I have worked extensively with Docker, Kubernetes, Prometheus, and Grafana to deploy and monitor production environments. I also have experience with CI/CD pipelines, Linux server administration, and Nginx configuration, which gives me a practical understanding of the infrastructure layer that underpins large-scale operations.\n\nOne area where my experience directly connects to your needs is in real-time monitoring and incident response. I built a full-stack server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and React that tracked availability, latency, and system metrics across multiple targets simultaneously. The system pushed live data to the browser, enabling immediate visibility into system status and supporting faster escalation and resolution. This kind of tooling is essential for maintaining uptime and service continuity in multi-site environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in automation, monitoring, and infrastructure technology could contribute to Serverfarm\'s operational goals.', '2026-06-26 01:45:24.974', '2026-06-26 01:45:24.974'),
(1684, 1686, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Commercial real estate underwriting\",\"Investment analysis\",\"Mortgage banking\",\"Loan origination\",\"Financial modeling (Excel)\",\"CRE financial analysis\",\"Deal sourcing and negotiation\",\"Due diligence and closing coordination\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is focused on full-stack software engineering and AI, with no direct experience in commercial real estate finance, underwriting, or lending. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Investment & Lending Associate position at LBC Mortgage. Your focus on structuring and closing high-value commercial real estate deals across multiple asset classes is impressive, and I appreciate the emphasis on combining analytical rigor with relationship-driven deal execution.\n\nMy professional experience has been in full-stack software engineering and AI, where I have designed and developed data-intensive financial platforms. For example, I built an AI-powered financial application that integrates OpenAI, AWS services, and automated PDF term sheet generation. I also developed an AI-powered real estate platform with subscription plans, role-based access, and Stripe payment integration. These projects required strong analytical thinking, data modeling, and the ability to translate complex requirements into working systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the underwriting and financial modeling aspect of this role. In my previous work, I have built systems that process financial data, generate projections, and automate reporting. I am comfortable working with structured data, building models, and presenting recommendations clearly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical background could contribute to LBC Mortgage\'s investment and lending operations.', '2026-06-26 01:45:32.965', '2026-06-26 01:45:32.965'),
(1685, 1687, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"7+ years product management\",\"funnel and conversion fluency\",\"consumer UX instincts\",\"B2B2C fluency\",\"proptech experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, AI, and system integration. However, the role is a Principal Product Manager requiring 7+ years of dedicated product management experience, deep funnel/conversion expertise, and B2B2C fluency. The applicant\'s profile shows no product management experience, making this a significant mismatch. The technical skills in AI and automation are relevant but insufficient for this senior PM role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Principal Product Manager Acquisition Products role at ButterflyMX. Your mission to automate property access, operations, and security from a single platform is a compelling intersection of real-world infrastructure and intelligent systems. I am drawn to the challenge of owning a product area that serves both a consumer-facing audience and an operator-facing one, especially in a domain where trust, clarity, and conversion are critical.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on AI-driven workflow automation and the builder\'s mindset. In my work, I have designed and developed systems that connect end-user experiences with administrative backends, integrating third-party platforms, role-based access controls, and real-time data synchronization. I think in terms of user journeys, drop-off points, and what it takes to earn the next step, whether that is a sign-up, a configuration, or a completed transaction.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built full-stack applications where I owned the end-to-end experience across multiple user groups. For example, in a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem, I architected a system that served customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams from a single Laravel backend with role-specific Flutter frontends. This required navigating complex integration landscapes, managing data flow across stakeholders, and ensuring that each user group had a clear, trustworthy experience.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building connected, automation-driven products can contribute to ButterflyMX\'s acquisition product area.', '2026-06-26 01:45:42.000', '2026-06-26 01:45:42.000'),
(1686, 1688, 1, 40, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Figma\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"UX research methods\",\"User testing\",\"Design systems\",\"Prototyping tools (e.g., Sketch, Adobe XD)\",\"Portfolio of design work\"]', 'The applicant has strong frontend development skills and familiarity with Figma, which partially overlaps with UI design. However, the role is focused on UX/UI design, and the applicant\'s background is primarily in development rather than dedicated design work. Missing skills include UX research, user testing, design systems, and a design portfolio.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior UX UI Designer role at Work Force Nexus. This position interests me because it combines user experience thinking with hands-on interface design, which aligns with how I approach building digital products.\n\nThrough my work on full-stack web applications, I have developed a strong foundation in creating responsive, accessible, and visually consistent user interfaces. I regularly use HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS to turn design concepts into functional frontend code. I also work with Figma to collaborate on design prototypes and ensure alignment between visual design and implementation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is designing interfaces that are not only clean and modern but also performant and user-friendly across devices. In previous projects, I focused on building responsive layouts, optimizing component structure, and maintaining design consistency throughout the development process. I am comfortable iterating on designs based on user feedback and technical constraints.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in frontend development and UI design can contribute to the Work Force Nexus team.', '2026-06-26 01:45:49.906', '2026-06-26 01:45:49.906'),
(1687, 1689, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Partnership management\",\"Content strategy\",\"Campaign management\",\"Influencer marketing\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of a Social Media & Partnerships Manager role. No direct skills or experience in social media management, partnerships, or lifestyle marketing are present.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Social Media & Partnerships Manager Lifestyle position at Caramel Talent. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong cross-functional communication skills, international collaboration experience, and a structured approach to managing relationships and workflows.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated with stakeholders, clients, and engineering teams to deliver projects on time. This required clear communication, active listening, and the ability to translate business needs into actionable plans. I am comfortable working across different teams and cultures, which I believe is essential for managing partnerships effectively.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. These language skills have helped me build trust and clarity with diverse teams and clients.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 01:45:55.608', '2026-06-26 01:45:55.608'),
(1688, 1690, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Lean Principles\",\"Kaizen\",\"Value Stream Mapping\",\"Process Documentation\",\"Microsoft Office 365 / Visio\",\"Project Management\",\"Operations or Quality experience\",\"3+ years of Continuous Improvement experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not directly align with the Continuous Improvement Specialist role, which requires Lean/Kaizen expertise, process documentation, and operations/quality experience. No direct skill matches were found in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Continuous Improvement Specialist position at InProduction. Your company\'s role in the events industry, providing temporary seating, staging, and scenic production, is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your operational excellence.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a structured approach to process improvement. I have documented standard work instructions, created process maps, and collaborated with cross-functional teams to identify and implement operational improvements. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to drive continuous improvement in a team setting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of Kaizen events to drive process standards. In my previous work, I have supported similar initiatives by preparing documentation, extracting operational data to set metrics, and following up with stakeholders to ensure alignment. I am comfortable facilitating improvement events and supporting rollout plans for new processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in process improvement and cross-functional collaboration can support InProduction\'s continuous improvement goals.', '2026-06-26 01:46:03.156', '2026-06-26 01:46:03.156'),
(1689, 1691, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\".NET\",\"C#\",\"AgenticCoding tools (specific)\"]', 'The applicant has solid Python and cloud infrastructure experience, which partially matches the backend and cloud requirements. However, the role specifically requires .NET and C# expertise, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The AI/automation experience is a partial match for the AgenticCoding aspect. Overall, the match is moderate for the Python and cloud portions, but weak for the .NET requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Python & .NET Entwickler position at hubside - Die Recruitingwerkstatt. The role\'s focus on building modern backend solutions, scalable cloud architectures, and integrating AgenticCoding tools aligns well with my technical background and interests.\n\nMy professional experience includes backend development using Python, where I have worked on designing APIs, optimizing database performance, and building systems that handle real-world data flows. I have also worked with cloud platforms and containerization tools, which has given me practical experience in deploying and maintaining scalable applications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI-assisted development tools into engineering workflows. Through my project work, I have used AI APIs and automation techniques to build intelligent features, including AI assistants and image processing pipelines. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how AI can enhance development processes and product capabilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:39:58.842', '2026-06-26 13:39:58.842'),
(1690, 1692, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Figma\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Content creation\",\"Marketing strategy\",\"Instagram/Facebook/TikTok management\",\"Photography/videography\",\"Storytelling\",\"German language\",\"Shopify\",\"E-commerce\",\"Newsletter tools\",\"Print production\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development skills but lacks direct experience in social media marketing, content creation, and marketing strategy required for this role. The role requires German language proficiency, which is not mentioned in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Marketing Manager:in position at Gasthaus Zur Kanne. Your combination of a traditional guesthouse with a modern wine brand is interesting, and I appreciate the focus on authentic storytelling rooted in real restaurant and wine experiences.\n\nMy professional background is in web development, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining digital platforms. This experience has given me a strong understanding of website content management, online campaigns, and creating user-friendly interfaces that communicate brand identity effectively.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support both Gasthaus Zur Kanne and Gesprächsstoff Weinwerk with website content, newsletters, and online campaigns. I have hands-on experience with website maintenance, content updates, and digital communication tools, which aligns well with the responsibilities outlined for this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my skills can contribute to your marketing efforts.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:40:08.113', '2026-06-26 13:40:08.113'),
(1691, 1693, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"C++\",\"Python\"]', '[\"IT-Forensik\",\"Forensik-Software\",\"Sicherheitstools\",\"Microsoft M365\",\"Netzwerkprotokolle (detailed)\",\"Deutschkenntnisse (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant has a foundational background in software engineering and cybersecurity research, with skills in Linux, Docker, and secure system design. However, the role requires specialized IT forensic analysis, hands-on experience with forensic software and security tools, deep knowledge of Microsoft/M365 environments, and fluent German. The match is low due to the specialized nature of the role and missing core forensic and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Forensiker / Analysten position at your client, a specialized cybersecurity consultancy based in the Frankfurt area. The opportunity to work alongside experienced professionals in Security Incident Response, IT forensics, and crisis management aligns closely with my academic focus and hands-on research in secure systems.\n\nMy background in Software Engineering, combined with dedicated research in cybersecurity and secure communications, has given me a solid foundation in the principles that underpin IT forensics. I have studied and worked with various operating systems including Linux, and I am familiar with network protocols, file systems, and the importance of maintaining data integrity during analysis. My work has involved identifying potential attack vectors and understanding how to isolate and secure compromised systems.\n\nIn my research on privacy-preserving frameworks for autonomous vehicle networks, I developed a decentralized security system using blockchain and advanced cryptography. This project required me to analyze communication protocols, implement tamper-proof data logging, and design systems resilient to cyber threats. I also worked on secure UAV communication protocols, where I focused on preventing spoofing, jamming, and unauthorized control. These experiences have given me practical insight into forensic methods, evidence handling, and the reconstruction of security incidents.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to your client\'s mission of protecting sensitive data and systems. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.', '2026-06-26 13:40:19.494', '2026-06-26 13:40:19.494'),
(1692, 1694, 1, 65, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Firebase\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"German language (not explicitly listed in profile, but profile mentions working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, not German)\",\"Berlin residence (not confirmed in profile)\",\"Currently enrolled in informatics/business informatics (profile shows Software Engineering, which is related)\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong hands-on experience with Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), and CI/CD, which directly supports IT operations, system administration, and cloud monitoring tasks. He has professional web development experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers. He is studying Software Engineering (related to informatics) and is fluent in English. However, German language proficiency and Berlin residence are not confirmed in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student IT-Systems position at Home & Co Management GmbH. Your focus on supporting IT operations, managing cloud systems, and enabling team members to drive their own projects matches the kind of practical, hands-on work I enjoy most.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, Apache, and cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud. I have set up workstations, managed user access, deployed applications, and maintained CI/CD pipelines. These tasks have given me a solid foundation in system administration and IT operations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to take ownership of IT projects from idea to implementation. I have independently built and deployed full-stack applications, including a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker. That project involved designing the architecture, setting up the infrastructure, and ensuring reliable monitoring of multiple services.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently studying Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, Russia, which keeps me connected to both academic theory and practical system design. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:40:29.345', '2026-06-26 13:40:29.345'),
(1693, 1695, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Accounting/bookkeeping experience\",\"ERP system experience\",\"Excel proficiency\",\"German language (job is in German)\",\"HGB accounting knowledge\",\"Umsatzsteuervoranmeldung experience\"]', 'This is a finance/accounting role requiring German-language accounting expertise, ERP systems, and Excel skills. The applicant is a software engineer with no matching finance or accounting experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Financial Accountant position at Vexcash AG. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and data-management skills through building financial technology systems that require precision, accuracy, and structured workflows.\n\nIn my recent work, I designed and developed an AI-powered financial application that handles complex data processing, automated document generation, and secure financial communications. This involved building APIs with Express and TypeScript, managing financial data in MongoDB, integrating AWS SES for secure email delivery, and automating PDF term sheet generation from Google Sheets. These projects required careful attention to data integrity, reconciliation logic, and regulatory compliance.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is Vexcash\'s position as a leading online short-term credit provider in Germany. The financial operations behind such a service demand accurate bookkeeping, timely payment processing, and reliable reporting. My experience building systems that handle financial data securely and efficiently aligns well with these requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and experience with financial systems can contribute to the Vexcash finance team.', '2026-06-26 13:40:38.773', '2026-06-26 13:40:38.773');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1694, 1696, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Node JS\",\"Git\",\"VS Code\"]', '[\"Deutsch fließend\",\"Erfahrung in der Arbeit mit Jugendlichen\"]', 'Strong technical match on JavaScript, Node.js, and Git. Missing fluent German and direct youth teaching experience, but has mentoring and project guidance experience from professional work.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Workshopleiter:in Programmieren position at MINT-Zentrum Hirschaid gGmbH. The idea of guiding young people through hands-on coding projects and helping them build confidence with technology resonates with my own experience as both a developer and a mentor.\n\nThrough my professional work as a Web Developer, I have spent over four years building full-stack applications using JavaScript, Node.js, and Git — the same tools mentioned in your requirements. I know these technologies well enough to explain them clearly and help others apply them in real projects.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on practical learning and creative problem-solving. In previous work, I have guided junior developers through debugging sessions, helped them understand core programming concepts, and encouraged them to experiment rather than follow rigid instructions. I believe this approach fits well with your workshop model.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and help young people discover what they can build with code. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-26 13:40:47.300', '2026-06-26 13:40:47.300'),
(1695, 1697, 1, 10, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Payroll administration\",\"German labor law\",\"Tax and social security law\",\"MS Office (Excel)\",\"HR/Payroll systems\",\"Commercial training\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and does not match the core requirements of an HR Payroll Specialist role, which demands commercial training, payroll experience, and knowledge of German labor law. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HR Payroll Specialist position at LeySelect GmbH. Although my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, a structured approach to data management, and a proven ability to learn new domains quickly. I am confident these strengths will allow me to contribute effectively to your payroll and HR administration team.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I regularly handled complex data processing, database management, and system integrations. These tasks required precision, attention to detail, and the ability to work with large datasets, skills that are directly transferable to payroll administration and data preparation for accounting.\n\nI am accustomed to working with structured data, maintaining accurate records, and ensuring compliance with defined processes. My experience with tools like MySQL and Excel has given me a strong foundation for managing time accounts, leave balances, and personnel files with accuracy and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support LeySelect GmbH. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-26 13:40:54.544', '2026-06-26 13:40:54.544'),
(1696, 1698, 1, 78, '[\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Typescript\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Express JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"WordPress\"]', 'Strong match for the Full Stack Node.js/React role. The applicant has extensive professional experience with the core tech stack (JavaScript, React, Node.js, HTML, CSS) and has built multiple full-stack applications. The only missing skill from the job description is WordPress, which is a minor requirement. The applicant\'s experience with fintech-related projects (AI-powered financial app) is a direct plus.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full Stack Entwickler (m/w/d) position at FinMent GmbH. Your mission to democratize access to institutional investment strategies through technology is something I find genuinely compelling, and I would like to contribute to building the platform that makes this possible.\n\nMy professional experience as a full-stack developer has been centered on the same technologies you use: JavaScript, React, Node.js, HTML5, and CSS. Over the past four years, I have built and maintained production web applications where clean code, performance, and reliability were non-negotiable. I am comfortable working across the entire stack and taking responsibility for features from concept to deployment.\n\nIn my previous work, I developed full-stack applications that required building RESTful APIs, implementing secure authentication and role-based access control, and creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces. One relevant example is an AI-powered financial application where I built the backend using Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB, integrated OpenAI for intelligent assistants, and handled file processing and email delivery through AWS services. This project required the same kind of end-to-end ownership and technical precision that your role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to FinMent\'s product development team.', '2026-06-26 13:41:04.278', '2026-06-26 13:41:04.278'),
(1697, 1699, 1, 78, '[\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Typescript\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\"]', '[\"WordPress\",\"German C1 Level\"]', 'Strong match for the Junior Webentwickler role. The applicant has professional experience with the core tech stack (JavaScript, React, Node.js, HTML, CSS) and has built full-stack applications. Missing WordPress experience and German C1 proficiency, but the job posting notes that not all requirements need to be met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Webentwickler (m/w/d) position at FinMent GmbH. Your mission to democratize access to institutional investment strategies through technology is a compelling direction, and I am interested in contributing to your product development team.\n\nMy professional experience centers on full-stack web development using JavaScript, React, and Node.js. I have built production applications with Next.js and React on the frontend, paired with Node.js and Express on the backend. I work with TypeScript, HTML5, CSS, and Tailwind CSS to create clean, responsive interfaces, and I follow clean coding practices in my daily work.\n\nIn previous roles, I was involved in the full development lifecycle of web platforms. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, optimized database queries, and developed real-time features. I also have experience deploying applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker, and working within agile team workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that handle data and user interactions reliably. Through my work on a full-stack personal finance platform, I designed a modular architecture with reusable components, integrated real-time updates, and implemented secure server-side authentication. This project required careful attention to performance, data integrity, and user experience.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to FinMent\'s product development.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:41:14.359', '2026-06-26 13:41:14.359'),
(1698, 1700, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"German C2 level\",\"Performance marketing\",\"Growth marketing\",\"Campaign management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical skills but lacks direct marketing experience, German language proficiency at C2 level, and specific marketing domain expertise required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Content Marketing position at FinMent GmbH. Your mission to democratize access to institutional investment strategies through innovative technology is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on combining financial expertise with modern digital tools.\n\nAs a software engineer with experience building full-stack applications, I bring strong analytical thinking and structured problem-solving skills to the table. I am comfortable working with data, identifying patterns, and optimizing processes based on measurable outcomes. These skills translate directly into analyzing campaign KPIs, optimizing funnels, and reporting on performance.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of AI and modern technology to create high-quality content and landing pages. In my development work, I have integrated AI assistants and automated workflows to improve efficiency and output quality. I am confident I can contribute to creating strong creatives and targeted content as part of your interdisciplinary team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical mindset, structured approach, and willingness to take ownership to FinMent. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-26 13:41:22.572', '2026-06-26 13:41:22.572'),
(1699, 1701, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"M365-Produkte\",\"Netzwerkadministration\",\"Mobile Device Management\",\"Client Management\",\"Windows Administration\",\"Mac Administration\",\"Second Level Support\"]', 'The applicant has foundational Linux and server administration skills (Docker, Nginx, Apache, CI/CD) that partially match the IT-Administrator role. However, the role requires specific experience with M365 products, network administration, mobile device management, client management, and second-level support in Windows and Mac environments, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial and would require significant upskilling in enterprise IT administration tools and workflows.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Administrator position at LeySelect GmbH. Your client\'s focus on cybersecurity, incident response, and IT forensics aligns with my technical background in Linux systems, infrastructure management, and secure system operations.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux server administration and IT infrastructure support. I have worked extensively with Nginx, Apache, and Docker to deploy and maintain production systems, ensuring high availability and reliable performance. I am comfortable handling second-level troubleshooting, analyzing system errors, and resolving technical incidents both on-site and remotely.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is maintaining stable IT operations across diverse environments. In previous work, I managed server setups, monitored system health, and optimized infrastructure for performance and security. I have experience with CI/CD pipelines, system monitoring, and ensuring that client and server landscapes run smoothly. My familiarity with Linux and web server technologies directly supports the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in IT administration and system operations can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-26 13:41:31.495', '2026-06-26 13:41:31.495'),
