(1701, 1703, 1, 62, '[\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"AWS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"REST APIs\",\"Node.js\",\"Next.js\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Python\",\"Django\",\"Vue.js\",\"5+ years professional backend experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong full-stack web development skills with TypeScript, React, Node.js, and AWS, along with AI integration experience. However, the job specifically requires Python/Django backend stack and Vue.js frontend, which are not in his profile. He also has less than 5 years of professional experience. His AI and cloud skills are relevant, but the core tech stack mismatch lowers the match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer Full Stack position at Code Gaia. The opportunity to work on sustainability compliance software and integrate AI features into a web application aligns well with my background in full-stack development and AI engineering.\n\nMy professional experience includes building full-stack web applications with TypeScript, React, Next.js, and Node.js, and deploying them on AWS. I have worked extensively with REST APIs, relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and have implemented authentication, role-based access control, and real-time features. I am comfortable working across the entire stack and taking ownership of features from design through deployment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI into web applications. In previous projects, I have worked with OpenAI APIs and built AI-powered assistants and image processing features into production systems. I am familiar with the practical challenges of deploying AI features alongside traditi