technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am motivated to build my expertise in sustainability frameworks like the GHG Protocol and am confident I can quickly learn the domain-specific knowledge required for this role.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in customer management and technical support can contribute to Code Gaia\'s growth.', '2026-06-26 13:41:57.224', '2026-06-26 13:41:57.224'),
(1703, 1705, 1, 65, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"JavaScript\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"AI\"]', '[\"Microsoft Dynamics 365\",\"Low-Code/No-Code platforms\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational skills in web development (PHP, Laravel, JavaScript, MySQL) and experience with AI tools, which partially matches the job requirements. However, the role specifically requires Microsoft Dynamics 365 expertise and low-code/no-code platform experience, which are not present in the profile. The applicant is a good fit for the general software development aspects of the internship and demonstrates a willingness to learn new technologies.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praxissemester Praktikum Fachinformatiker Anwendungsentwicklung position at 360 Consulting GmbH. As a Software Engineering student with practical development experience, I am interested in contributing to your work with Microsoft Dynamics 365 and business application development.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have built a solid foundation in software development. I have experience with PHP, Laravel, JavaScript, and MySQL, which I have used to develop full-stack web applications. I am comfortable with the full cycle of development: analyzing requirements, designing solutions, writing code, performing unit tests, and managing source code with Git.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is using AI tools to improve development workflows. In my projects, I have integrated AI APIs for features like intelligent assistants and image processing. I am eager to apply this experience to code generation, optimization, and error analysis, as well as automating repetitive processes using low-code or no-code platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a practical internship where I can learn, contribute, and grow as a developer. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-26 13:42:05.648', '2026-06-26 13:42:05.648'),
(1704, 1706, 1, 35, '[\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"Javascript\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Python (FastAPI, Pydantic)\",\"LLM/agent production experience (RAG, function calling, guardrails)\",\"8+ years experience\",\"Technical leadership at Staff level\",\"dbt\",\"Terraform\",\"Async programming in Python\",\"Product mindset evidence\"]', 'Shagor has strong backend engineering skills with Node.js, PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, AWS, and CI/CD, and has built AI-integrated systems using OpenAI APIs. However, the role requires deep Python (FastAPI/Pydantic) expertise, production-grade LLM/agent experience, 8+ years of experience, and Staff-level technical leadership, which are not present in the profile. The match is partial and primarily at the mid-level backend engineering layer.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Staff AI Backend Engineer position at paretos GmbH. Your focus on building a Decision Intelligence platform with agentic workflows, semantic data layers, and AI-first engineering aligns with the kind of systems I enjoy building.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built production-grade backend services that integrate AI models, real-time data pipelines, and cloud infrastructure. I designed and developed the backend for an AI-powered financial application using Express, TypeScript, OpenAI, and AWS. The system included AI assistants trained on custom datasets, voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe, PDF generation, and secure authentication with OTP, Google, and Facebook login. This required clean API design, database modeling with MongoDB, and deployment o