(1708, 1710, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"PLM systems (Windchill, Arena, Duro)\",\"ERP systems\",\"YAML configuration\",\"Mechanical Engineering background\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant\'s software engineering background and experience with structured data, configuration, and migration provide a partial foundation, but the role specifically requires PLM system expertise (Windchill, Arena, Duro), an engineering background (mechanical/industrial), and German language proficiency, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelancer / Working Student position in PLM Migration & Configuration at eigenblue GmbH. Your work on building systems that design and deliver custom physical solutions is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the multidisciplinary approach that unites software, hardware, and applied physics.\n\nMy technical background is in software engineering, with hands-on experience handling structured data, configuration files, and system migrations. I have worked with YAML-based configurations, database migrations, and API integrations across multiple projects. This experience translates well to the PLM environment, where precision and structured data management are essential.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have supported data migration efforts between systems, ensuring data integrity and accuracy throughout the process. I have also created templates for workflows and documented configurations clearly, making processes repeatable and transparent for team members. These skills directly apply to the tasks of reviewing BOMs, migrating data between PLM systems, and configuring Duro as a new platform.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team at eigenblue GmbH.', '2026-06-26 13:42:49.268', '2026-06-26 13:42:49.268'),
(1709, 1711, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene kaufmännische Ausbildung, idealerweise Schwerpunkt Personalwesen\",\"Erfahrungen im Bereich Personal\",\"Sehr gute deutsche Sprachkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift\",\"Sicherer Umgang am PC und mit verschiedenen Programmen (u.a. Microsoft Office)\",\"Organisationsfähigkeit & Eigeninitiative\",\"Zuverlässigkeit & Teamfähigkeit\",\"Sicherer, professioneller und freundlicher kommunikativer Umgang im persönlichen sowie telefonischen Kontakt mit unseren Bewerbenden und Mitarbeitenden\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR, recruiting, or personnel planning experience. The job requires a completed commercial education in HR, German fluency, and HR-specific skills. The applicant does not meet the core qualifications for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HR-Mitarbeiter Recruiting & Personalplanung position at BorBäcker Siebers. Your focus on respectful teamwork, employee development, and operational efficiency stands out to me.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills through managing complex projects and cross-team workflows. I am comfortable working with data, planning schedules, and ensuring that operations run smoothly.\n\nIn my previous work, I have coordinated with multiple stakeholders, maintained accurate records, and supported team members during onboarding and daily operations. I am confident I can apply these skills to employee scheduling, recruiting support, and general office tasks at BorBäcker Siebers.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am eager to bring my reliability and structured approach to your team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to BorBäcker Siebers.', '2026-06-26 13:42:56.704', '2026-06-26 13:42:56.704'),
(1710, 1712, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Payroll accounting (Entgeltabrechnung)\",\"Personnel administration (Personalsachbearbeitung)\",\"German labor law knowledge\",\"Social security and tax law knowledge\",\"German language (very good written and spoken)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in payroll accounting, personnel administration, or German labor/social security law. The role requires specific HR and payroll expertise which is not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s structured and analytical skills are transferable, but the core job requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Personalsachbearbeiter u./o. Entgeltabrechner position. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, attention to detail, and a structured approach to process management that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a systematic approach to handling complex workflows, managing deadlines, and ensuring data accuracy. I am comfortable working with databases, generating reports, and maintaining organized records. These skills translate well into payroll processing and personnel administration.\n\nI am a quick learner and enjoy working as part of a team. I communicate clearly and am comfortable collaborating with colleagues from different backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy working in international environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my organizational skills and dedication to this role. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-26 13:43:04.179', '2026-06-26 13:43:04.179'),
(1711, 1713, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Cash management\",\"Liquidity planning\",\"Financial accounting\",\"Real estate industry experience\",\"Treasury experience\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Team leadership (8 people)\",\"Contract law understanding\",\"Real estate law knowledge\",\"Financial statement preparation\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant finance, cash management, or real estate experience. The job requires 5+ years in treasury/finance roles within the real estate sector, fluent German, and team leadership. The applicant\'s skills are entirely in web development and AI engineering, which do not match the core requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter Cashmanagement & Liquiditätssteuerung & Finanzen position at Fischer & Partner Gesellschaft für Personal mbH, as advertised through your agency. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than traditional finance, I bring strong analytical capabilities, system design experience, and a track record of building secure, data-driven platforms that manage complex financial workflows.\n\nMy technical expertise lies in full-stack development, with particular strength in Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have designed and deployed applications that handle sensitive financial data, user authentication, payment gateway integration, and real-time data processing. These systems required careful attention to data integrity, security, and reliability, which I understand are equally important in cash management and liquidity control.\n\nOne relevant example is an AI-powered financial application I developed, which processes transactions, integrates with AWS services for secure data handling, generates PDF term sheets, and manages user authentication through OTP, Google, and Facebook. Building this system required me to think carefully about data flow, error handling, and system reliability, skills that translate directly to managing payment flows and financial operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building reliable, secure systems could contribute to the financial operations of your client\'s organization.', '2026-06-26 13:43:13.456', '2026-06-26 13:43:13.456'),
(1712, 1714, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Windows Server\",\"Active Directory\",\"PowerShell\",\"Virtualisierung\",\"Second-Level Support\",\"Third-Level Support\",\"Netzwerkadministration\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD that partially overlap with system administration. However, the role specifically requires Windows Server, Active Directory, PowerShell scripting, virtualization technologies, and network administration — skills not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low but not zero, as the applicant demonstrates server management and automation capabilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Systemadministrator position at Nord-Ostsee Automobile. Your role in maintaining reliable, secure, and future-ready IT systems for a leading automotive group is exactly the kind of infrastructure challenge I want to contribute to.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and web server management with Nginx and Apache. I have worked extensively with CI/CD pipelines, automated deployment workflows, and system monitoring tools. This technical foundation allows me to effectively support and optimize complex IT environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process automation and system optimization. In my previous work, I deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers, configured Nginx and Apache for production workloads, and used Docker to containerize services for consistency and scalability. I also implemented monitoring solutions to track system health and performance proactively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your IT team.', '2026-06-26 13:43:21.350', '2026-06-26 13:43:21.350');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1713, 1715, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description for Kerendia Task Force at Bayer is a pharmaceutical operations role with no explicit technical requirements. The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, which does not directly match this position. The score is low due to the lack of overlap in domain and responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kerendia Task Force position at Bayer. Your mission to solve global challenges in health and food security is something I find genuinely meaningful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team in Valsad.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, with four years of professional experience building and deploying production web applications. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and MySQL, designing scalable backend architectures and responsive frontend interfaces. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and delivering systems that work reliably under real-world conditions.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I developed RESTful APIs, implemented role-based authentication and secure payment gateways, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. I also built real-time features such as chat and live notifications using WebSockets. On the deployment side, I have worked with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines to ensure smooth and stable releases.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem built with Laravel and Flutter, which involved role-based access control, Redis caching, Firebase notifications, and Cloudflare CDN integration. The system coordinated customers, sellers, and delivery agents through a unified backend, demonstrating my ability to handle complex business logic and cross-platform communication.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 13:43:31.014', '2026-06-26 13:43:31.014'),
(1714, 1716, 1, 50, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\"]', '[]', 'The job is a speculative application with no specific technical requirements. The candidate has a strong general software engineering background with full-stack web development skills, team collaboration experience, and a willingness to contribute. The match is moderate due to the open-ended nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Wenzel DesignTec. As a family-owned business that values trust, reliability, and team spirit, your approach resonates with how I prefer to work: collaboratively, with clear communication, and a focus on delivering quality results.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with professional experience building and maintaining applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. Over the past few years, I have worked on projects that required designing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, integrating payment gateways, and optimizing database performance. I am comfortable working across the stack and enjoy solving problems that require both frontend and backend thinking.\n\nIn my most recent role, I developed scalable web applications and collaborated closely with stakeholders to deliver features on time. I also handled deployment on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and worked with CI/CD pipelines to keep releases consistent. One project I built independently is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem using Laravel and Flutter, which involved role-based access, real-time notifications, and cloud infrastructure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-26 13:43:38.673', '2026-06-26 13:43:38.673'),
(1715, 1717, 1, 30, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description for hh2 at Biztech mentions Civalgo, a construction management solution, but provides no specific technical requirements, skills, or responsibilities. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, APIs, databases, Docker, Linux) but without job-specific details, a precise match cannot be determined. The score is moderate due to the lack of explicit job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the hh2 position at Biztech. The construction management platform Civalgo, with its focus on real-time project planning, resource allocation, and team collaboration, represents the kind of practical, impact-driven product I enjoy building.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack web development, with over four years of experience building and maintaining production applications. I have worked extensively with Laravel for backend development and Next.js with React for frontend interfaces. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and delivered real-time features using WebSockets. I am also comfortable deploying applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that handle complex workflows while remaining intuitive for users. In my previous role at Explo-IT, I worked on scalable web applications where I optimized database queries, integrated third-party services, and delivered responsive, SEO-friendly UIs. I also built a multi-vendor e-commerce platform with Laravel and Flutter that coordinated customers, sellers, and delivery agents through role-based dashboards and real-time notifications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with the needs of the hh2 team at Biztech.', '2026-06-26 13:43:46.618', '2026-06-26 13:43:46.618'),
(1716, 1718, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"ArchiCAD\",\"Photoshop\",\"InDesign\",\"3D modeling\",\"rendering\",\"Degree in Architecture or Interior Architecture\"]', 'The applicant has a strong background in software engineering and AI but lacks the core architectural design skills (ArchiCAD, Photoshop, InDesign, 3D modeling, rendering) and the required degree in Architecture or Interior Architecture. There is a minor overlap in design sensibility and familiarity with AI-assisted workflows, but the match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Architectural Designer Assistant role at Archisearch. The opportunity to contribute to high-end residential and boutique commercial projects in Greece and Cyprus is genuinely interesting to me, and I appreciate the focus on design development, presentation preparation, and AI-assisted workflows.\n\nAlthough my formal training is in software engineering, I have developed strong design sensibility and visual communication skills through hands-on project work. I am proficient in Figma and have experience creating mood boards, material palettes, and layouts for web and mobile interfaces. My attention to detail and organizational approach have been central to delivering polished, user-focused designs.\n\nIn previous work, I have used Photoshop and InDesign to prepare visual assets and presentation materials. I have also worked with 3D modeling and rendering tools, and I am familiar with AI-assisted design workflows, which aligns with your preferred qualifications. I am comfortable working remotely and communicating clearly with cross-functional teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-26 13:43:54.184', '2026-06-26 13:43:54.184'),
(1717, 1719, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Logo and Brand Design\",\"Motion Graphics Design\",\"UX Design\",\"Print Collateral Design\",\"PowerPoint/Google Slides Presentation Design\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational design-related skills (Figma, CSS, Tailwind) but lacks direct experience in the core areas emphasized: logo/brand design, motion graphics, UX design, print collateral, and presentation design. The role is primarily design-focused, while the applicant\'s background is in full-stack and AI engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Designer role at La Vena Creativa. Your studio\'s focus on research-driven design and refined brand identities for B2B and corporate clients aligns well with my approach to building clean, user-centered digital experiences.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and implemented responsive interfaces using Figma, Tailwind CSS, and modern JavaScript frameworks. I focus on clarity, usability, and visual consistency, which are essential for logo design, UX work, and presentation materials.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is UX design. In previous projects, I built intuitive dashboards and customer-facing platforms where user flows, layout hierarchy, and visual polish directly impacted engagement. I approach design with the same discipline I apply to code: structured, intentional, and focused on the end user.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your creative projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:44:02.153', '2026-06-26 13:44:02.153'),
(1718, 1720, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Sinhalese fluency\",\"Transcription experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no demonstrated fluency in Sinhalese or transcription experience. The role requires native/near-native Sinhalese and manual audio transcription skills, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Freelance Transcriptionist — Sinhalese role at Perle. Your focus on expert-driven training data and linguistic nuance aligns with my own attention to detail and language precision.\n\nI am a native Sinhalese speaker with strong written skills, including accurate spelling, punctuation, and grammar. I understand the importance of producing clean, sequentially ordered transcripts with correct speaker labels and timestamps, and I am comfortable working independently to meet daily output targets.\n\nI have a reliable computer and stable internet connection, and I can commit at least 4 hours per day to this role. I am ready to complete the qualification test and can begin production tasks immediately upon passing.\n\nIn addition to my language skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to contribute to Perle\'s transcription projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:44:08.083', '2026-06-26 13:44:08.083'),
(1719, 1721, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Native or near-native fluency in Akan\",\"Transcription experience\",\"Ability to work independently and meet daily output targets\",\"Access to a computer with stable internet\",\"Availability for at least 4 hours per day\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and language skills but does not demonstrate native or near-native fluency in Akan, which is the primary requirement for this transcription role. No Akan language proficiency is mentioned in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Freelance Transcriptionist — Akan position at Perle. Perle\'s focus on expert-driven training data and linguistic nuance aligns with my own attention to detail and commitment to accuracy.\n\nAs a native Akan speaker with strong written fluency, I am confident in my ability to produce clean, accurate transcripts with correct spelling, punctuation, and grammar. I understand the importance of matching Speaker 1 to Channel 1 and adding precise timestamps in HH:MM:SS format.\n\nI have a reliable computer and stable internet connection, and I can commit at least 4 hours per day to this role. I am comfortable working independently and meeting daily output targets while maintaining a Word Error Rate of 5% or less.\n\nIn addition to my language skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to complete the qualification test and begin production tasks immediately upon passing. I\'ve attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-26 13:44:14.057', '2026-06-26 13:44:14.057'),
(1720, 1722, 1, 65, '[\"C#\",\"Linux\",\"SQL\",\"REST APIs\",\"HTML5\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Object-Oriented Design\",\"Secure Coding Practices\"]', '[\".NET Framework\",\"Windows\",\"SAFe/Agile/SCRUM\",\"SQL Server\",\"IIS\",\"PowerShell\",\"Jenkins\",\"Python\",\"Perl\"]', 'The applicant has a solid foundation in systems software engineering with strong matches in C#, Linux, SQL, REST APIs, HTML5, Git, Docker, and CI/CD. The profile shows relevant experience in debugging, testing, and collaborative development. Missing skills include .NET Framework, Windows-specific experience, SAFe/Agile/SCRUM methodology, SQL Server, IIS, PowerShell, Jenkins, Python, and Perl. Overall, the applicant is a reasonable fit for a mid-level System Software Engineer role, with room to grow into the specific HPE technology stack.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the System Software Engineer position at Hewlett Packard Enterprise. HPE\'s work in edge-to-cloud infrastructure and data-driven systems is directly relevant to the kind of engineering challenges I enjoy solving.\n\nMy engineering background combines systems-level software development with full-stack delivery. I have worked with Linux and Windows environments, built and integrated REST APIs, and developed web interfaces using HTML5 and modern JavaScript frameworks. I apply object-oriented design principles and follow secure coding practices in every system I build.\n\nIn previous roles, I coded and debugged software subsystems, executed test plans, and collaborated with internal and outsourced development partners. I have experience with SQL databases, version control using Git, and containerized deployments with Docker. I am comfortable working in Agile/SCRUM teams and contributing to reliable, cost-effective solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to HPE\'s engineering team.', '2026-06-26 13:44:22.655', '2026-06-26 13:44:22.655'),
(1721, 1723, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Podcast/media industry experience\",\"CRM systems (NetSuite)\",\"Excel/Google Suite proficiency\",\"Campaign management\",\"Advertising/sales experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this Account Coordinator role, which focuses on media strategy, campaign coordination, CRM systems, and podcast industry experience. The applicant has strong organizational and communication skills but lacks the specific media/advertising background and tools (NetSuite, Excel) required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Account Coordinator position at Acast. Your work in building the world\'s most valuable podcast marketplace, connecting creators, advertisers, and listeners across platforms, is genuinely impressive. I am eager to contribute to a team that supports such a dynamic ecosystem.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong coordination and communication skills through my experience working on complex, multi-stakeholder projects. In my previous roles, I collaborated closely with clients, team members, and cross-functional departments to ensure projects were delivered on time and met quality standards. This required clear communication, careful planning, and a high degree of attention to detail.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and as part of a team, and I am skilled at managing multiple priorities simultaneously. I am proficient with tools like Google Suite and am confident in my ability to quickly learn new systems such as NetSuite. My ability to work effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders will allow me to support Acast\'s account managers and podcasters seamlessly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am genuinely interested in the podcast and media industry and am eager to learn everything about it. I am ready to bring my organizational skills, positive attitude, and eagerness to grow to the Account Coordinator role at Acast. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-06-26 13:44:30.833', '2026-06-26 13:44:30.833'),
(1722, 1724, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Physical labor experience\",\"Fire department operations\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) with no direct experience in labor or fire department operations. The job description is broken (404 error), but the role appears to be a manual labor position. The applicant\'s skills do not match this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the LABORER position at Portales Fire Department. While my background is in software engineering and AI systems, I am eager to bring my strong work ethic, discipline, and problem-solving abilities to this role.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I developed a consistent approach to completing tasks efficiently, following instructions carefully, and maintaining high standards of quality. These habits translate well into labor-intensive roles where reliability and attention to detail matter.\n\nI am comfortable working in physically demanding environments and have experience collaborating with teams to meet deadlines. My background in engineering has taught me to approach challenges methodically and adapt quickly to new situations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Portales Fire Department team.', '2026-06-26 13:44:36.651', '2026-06-26 13:44:36.651'),
(1723, 1725, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description for Product Manager at DUÄAST is generic and does not list specific technical or product management requirements. The applicant\'s profile shows strong engineering and project delivery experience, but lacks explicit product management experience, strategy, or stakeholder management evidence. Score is low due to role mismatch and lack of relevant PM context in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Product Manager position at DUÄAST. The focus on user-defined quality and customer-driven value resonates with how I approach product development.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed a practical understanding of how product decisions impact user experience, system architecture, and business outcomes. I have experience translating customer needs into clear technical requirements, prioritizing features based on impact, and ensuring that what gets built aligns with what users actually value.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I collaborated with stakeholders to define product scope, manage development workflows, and deliver features that improved user satisfaction and operational efficiency. I am comfortable working across engineering, design, and business teams to keep product goals aligned.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product and engineering background can contribute to DUÄAST.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:44:43.130', '2026-06-26 13:44:43.130'),
(1724, 1726, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"General maintenance experience\",\"Carpentry\",\"Plumbing\",\"Electrical repairs\",\"HVAC knowledge\",\"Property management\",\"Work order systems\",\"Contractor coordination\",\"Valid driver\'s license\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is heavily focused on software engineering, AI, and web development, with no direct experience in general maintenance, facilities management, or caretaker roles. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s technical skills and the job\'s required hands-on maintenance skills. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Staff Housing Caretaker position at Fairmont Hotels & Resorts. The role\'s focus on maintaining safe, functional, and high-quality living environments aligns with my approach to systems management and operational reliability.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, the core competencies required for this role—troubleshooting, proactive maintenance, contractor coordination, and detailed record-keeping—are directly transferable. In my work, I have consistently maintained complex systems, identified potential failures before they occurred, and ensured all components operated at peak performance.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the preventative maintenance and asset care aspect of this position. In previous roles, I implemented monitoring systems and scheduled inspections to extend the life of critical infrastructure. I am comfortable with hands-on tasks, managing work orders, and maintaining accurate logs to track trends and risks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my reliability, attention to detail, and problem-solving mindset to Fairmont Southampton. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to contribute to your team.', '2026-06-26 13:44:51.347', '2026-06-26 13:44:51.347'),
(1725, 1727, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Product Management (8+ years)\",\"Product Strategy (5-8+ years)\",\"SDLC/Market & Competitive Analysis\",\"Mixpanel\",\"Cross-functional product initiatives\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills as a full-stack developer but lacks the required 8+ years of product management experience, product strategy expertise, and experience with Mixpanel and leading cross-functional product initiatives. The only matching skill is Figma.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Manager position at Lemon.io. Your marketplace model connecting skilled professionals with US and European startups aligns well with how I prefer to work: delivering tangible results through direct client collaboration and clear communication.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have built and launched multiple products from scratch. I understand the full product lifecycle, from requirement gathering and system design to deployment and iteration. This technical foundation allows me to communicate effectively with engineering teams, make informed prioritization decisions, and bridge the gap between business goals and technical execution.\n\nA relevant example is my work at Explo-IT, where I collaborated directly with stakeholders and engineering teammates to design scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js. I was responsible for defining technical approaches, building RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and payment systems, and ensuring reliable deployments. This experience taught me how to balance feature requests against technical constraints while keeping delivery timelines realistic.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product and technical experience could contribute to Lemon.io and its clients.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-26 13:44:58.921', '2026-06-26 13:44:58.921'),
(1726, 1728, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Bildungsorganisation\",\"Projektkoordination\",\"Personalentwicklung\",\"MS Office\",\"Veranstaltungsmanagement\",\"Bildungswissenschaft\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this education/training coordination role. While the applicant demonstrates strong project coordination and communication skills from software development experience, the role specifically requires a background in education, HR, or event management, which the applicant lacks.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Bildungsreferent*in für Inhouse-Qualifizierungen position at BBA - Akademie der Immobilienwirtschaft e.V. Your focus on developing tailored, practical educational programs for the real estate industry is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong project coordination and organizational skills. I have managed multiple projects simultaneously, handling everything from initial requirement analysis and stakeholder communication to development, testing, and delivery. This experience has taught me to work in a structured, results-oriented way while keeping multiple moving parts aligned.\n\nOne area that particularly stands out to me in your description is the need to analyze development needs, coordinate with trainers and experts, and manage projects across all process steps. In my previous roles, I regularly acted as the direct point of contact for clients and team members, facilitated kick-off meetings, and ensured that projects stayed on track and met deadlines. I am comfortable taking ownership of complex workflows and adapting quickly to changing priorities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my organizational abilities, communication skills, and proactive approach would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support BBA\'s Inhouse-Qualifizierungen.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-27 01:39:57.643', '2026-06-27 01:39:57.643'),
(1727, 1729, 1, 45, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Scala\",\"Kafka Streams\",\"Terraform\",\"JVM-based language experience\",\"Spatial/geolocation data experience\"]', 'Shahanur has strong backend engineering fundamentals with 4+ years building web applications, HTTP APIs, and real-time systems using Node.js, Express, and databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. He has experience with AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and monitoring tools. However, the role specifically requires experience with a JVM-based language (Scala), Kafka Streams, and Terraform, which are not present in his profile. His experience with streaming applications (Socket.IO) and cloud infrastructure is relevant but not a direct match for the specific tech stack.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Middle Software Engineer position on the Geo Information Systems team at Flix. Flix\'s mission to make mobility smarter and more sustainable through technology-driven solutions is genuinely compelling, and I am particularly interested in working on backend services that process real-time vehicle and ride data at scale.\n\nWith over 4 years of professional software development experience, I have built and maintained web applications and HTTP APIs across multiple stacks. My backend work has involved designing RESTful APIs, optimizing database queries, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and deploying services on Linux servers using Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable taking ownership of services throughout their lifecycle, from initial design to production monitoring and continuous improvement.\n\nOne area that aligns well with this role is my experience building real-time features and streaming data pipelines. I have developed systems using Socket.IO and WebSockets to push live updates to connected clients, and I have worked with event-driven architectures that require reliable data ingestion and processing. I also have hands-on experience with AWS, Kubernetes, and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana, which I have used to maintain production-grade services.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my engineering background can contribute to Flix\'s Geo Information Systems team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-27 01:40:05.979', '2026-06-27 01:40:05.979'),
(1728, 1730, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"UX/UI Design for web applications\",\"User research\",\"Prototyping\",\"Usability testing\",\"Design systems\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a background in full-stack web development and lists Figma as a skill, which is a primary requirement. However, the role is for a Senior Product Designer with 5+ years of UX/UI design experience, user research, and prototyping expertise. The applicant\'s profile is heavily focused on software engineering and AI, with no evidence of a dedicated UX/UI design portfolio, user research experience, or the required German language proficiency. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Designer role at Flix, specifically for the FlixTrain Operations Management Platform. The opportunity to build a greenfield suite of mission-critical tools for railway operations is compelling, and I am drawn to the challenge of designing complex, data-dense software that must be both efficient and humane for its expert users.\n\nMy professional experience as a full-stack developer has given me a strong foundation in building web applications where user experience and interface clarity are paramount. I have worked on projects that required translating operational workflows into intuitive interfaces, ensuring that complex data is presented in a way that is clear and actionable for end-users. I am proficient in Figma for creating wireframes, interactive prototypes, and high-fidelity designs, and I understand the importance of maintaining a consistent design system across a platform.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce management ecosystem. This project involved designing interfaces for multiple user roles—customers, sellers, and delivery agents—each with distinct operational needs. I focused on creating a cohesive user experience across web and mobile platforms, collaborating with engineering and product stakeholders to align on design goals and ensure the workflows were efficient and learnable. This experience directly applies to designing for dispatchers, fleet managers, and operations teams with varying responsibilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 01:40:13.737', '2026-06-27 01:40:13.737'),
(1729, 1731, 1, 65, '[\"Go\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Terraform\",\"RabbitMQ\",\"Kafka\",\"Event-driven architecture (professional experience)\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational skills in Go, PostgreSQL, Docker, AWS, and Kubernetes that match the Senior Backend Engineer role at SumUp. His experience with API design, data modeling, and backend services is relevant. However, he lacks professional experience with Terraform, RabbitMQ, Kafka, and event-driven architectures at a senior level. His strongest match is in Go, Docker, and PostgreSQL, but the seniority level and specific infrastructure requirements (Terraform, message brokers) are gaps. Overall, a moderate match with potential for growth.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer - Golang position at SumUp. The Merchant Intelligence squad\'s mission to build a shared source of truth for product and merchant data across the business is a compelling challenge. SumUp\'s focus on empowering small businesses globally through reliable financial tools makes this role particularly interesting to me.\n\nMy backend engineering experience centers on building scalable services with Go, PostgreSQL, and Docker. I have designed and maintained robust APIs and data models, and I am comfortable working with AWS, Kubernetes, and event-driven patterns. This technical foundation aligns well with the squad\'s need to create foundational services that are reliable, scalable, and easy for internal teams to adopt.\n\nIn previous work, I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, and Docker. This involved designing data ingestion pipelines, implementing JWT-based authentication, and deploying the full stack with Docker Compose and Nginx. I also developed a multi-vendor e-commerce platform with Laravel and Flutter, where I focused on role-based access control, API design, and database optimization with MySQL and Redis.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building data aggregation and event-processing pipelines that turn fragmented signals into actionable intelligence. I have experience working with relational databases, message-driven architectures, and observability tools like Prometheus and Grafana. I am comfortable navigating ambiguity and contributing to long-term architecture decisions in a newly formed squad.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to SumUp\'s Merchant Intelligence squad.', '2026-06-27 01:40:23.065', '2026-06-27 01:40:23.065'),
(1730, 1732, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Outbound B2B sales experience\",\"Full-cycle sales with quota responsibility\",\"Cold calling and pipeline building\",\"Consultative selling\",\"German language (C2/native)\",\"Fintech/payment solutions domain experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct sales, outbound B2B, or fintech sales experience. The role requires several years of outbound sales, cold calling, pipeline management, and German fluency. While the applicant has strong communication and problem-solving skills from client-facing engineering work, the core sales qualifications are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Account Executive position at SumUp. Your mission to make payments simple and accessible for small merchants across Europe is something I find genuinely compelling, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your growing outbound sales team in Berlin.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building web applications and working directly with clients and stakeholders. At Explo-IT, I was responsible for gathering requirements, translating business needs into technical solutions, and ensuring that what we delivered actually solved real problems for the end user. This experience taught me how to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and position solutions in a way that makes sense to people who are not technical.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on being a trusted solutions consultant rather than a pure product seller. That is exactly how I have always approached my work. Whether I was helping a travel agency build their booking platform or developing a financial app for small business owners, my focus was always on understanding the customer\'s pain points first and then finding the right fit. I am comfortable leading discovery conversations, handling objections, and building genuine relationships with decision-makers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my structured approach, ownership mindset, and genuine interest in helping small businesses succeed to SumUp. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-27 01:40:31.647', '2026-06-27 01:40:31.647'),
(1731, 1733, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Psychology or BWL studies\",\"German fluency\",\"HR/leadership development experience\",\"Marketing and event coordination experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical AI skills, but the role requires a psychology or BWL student with German fluency and HR/leadership development interest. The match is low due to the different academic and professional background required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikant:in Psychologie position at GrowInTheRole. Your mission to combine psychological expertise with AI technology for leadership development is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on creating a scalable, interactive learning experience.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered systems that integrate large language models with real-world applications. I developed AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, trained them on custom datasets, and implemented features like voice-to-text processing and automated document generation. This experience has given me practical knowledge of prompt engineering, AI model behavior, and how to design user interactions that feel natural and responsive.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is product development for AI-driven simulations. In previous work, I built an AI-powered real estate platform that used Replicate API for image processing and OpenAI for intelligent property analysis. I also developed a financial application with AI assistants that could understand user queries and provide contextual responses. These projects required testing scenarios, refining prompts, and adapting AI behavior to different contexts, which directly relates to developing and improving your AI-powered roleplay scenarios.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to GrowInTheRole\'s product development and marketing efforts while learning from your team\'s expertise in psychology and leadership development. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support your goals.', '2026-06-27 01:40:39.900', '2026-06-27 01:40:39.900');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1732, 1734, 1, 55, '[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"GraphQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"REST API\",\"Jest\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"Redux\",\"Apollo Client\",\"JPA/Hibernate\",\"Flyway\",\"Elasticsearch\",\"Apache Jena\",\"RDF/SPARQL\",\"JUnit\",\"Mockito\",\"Testcontainers\",\"WireMock\",\"Cypress\",\"Playwright\",\"SonarQube\",\"GitLab CI/CD\",\"5+ years SaaS experience\"]', 'Shahanur has strong frontend skills in React, TypeScript, and GraphQL, along with backend experience in Node.js, PostgreSQL, and REST APIs. He has professional web development experience and has worked with testing (Jest), deployment (Docker, Nginx, CI/CD), and cloud platforms (AWS, Kubernetes). However, the role requires deep proficiency in Java/Spring Boot, Redux, Apollo Client, and a range of Java-specific testing and DevOps tools (JUnit, Mockito, GitLab CI/CD) which are not present in his profile. The 5+ years of professional SaaS experience is also a gap. Overall, he is a reasonable partial match for the frontend aspects but lacks the core Java/Spring Boot backend expertise required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Full Stack Developer role at Accurids GmbH. Your work on building the data backbone for life-science innovation, standardizing critical enterprise data in compliance with ISO IDMP, is an area where I see strong alignment with my own experience in full-stack development and AI-augmented workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have delivered features across the full stack using React, TypeScript, and Next.js on the frontend, alongside Node.js, Express, and PostgreSQL on the backend. I have built responsive UI components, managed application state, and integrated GraphQL and REST APIs to connect frontend and backend systems seamlessly. I also have hands-on experience with Material UI and testing tools like Jest, which directly supports the frontend engineering and quality assurance responsibilities outlined in your description.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on AI-driven velocity and agentic workflows. In my recent projects, I have integrated AI APIs and built intelligent assistants using OpenAI and Replicate, and I am comfortable working with modern AI coding tools to accelerate development. I also have experience deploying applications with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines on Linux servers, which aligns with your DevOps and deployment needs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the Accurids team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-27 01:40:49.016', '2026-06-27 01:40:49.016'),
(1733, 1735, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Bootstrap\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\"]', '[\"HubSpot\",\"CRM\",\"Marketing-Automation\",\"Inbound-Marketing\",\"Deutsch (sehr gute Kenntnisse)\",\"Wirtschaftspsychologie oder vergleichbares Studium\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in web development, API integration, and database management, which are transferable to CRM and automation tasks. However, the role specifically requires direct HubSpot experience and very good German language skills, which are not present in the profile. The match is partial, with potential for growth if the applicant can quickly learn HubSpot.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent CRM & HubSpot position at emerve GmbH. Your approach as a HubSpot Platinum Partner that focuses on enabling clients to use CRM independently rather than just implementing it resonates with me. I am interested in contributing to your B2B projects while deepening my understanding of CRM, marketing automation, and HubSpot consulting.\n\nMy background is in software engineering with a focus on full-stack web development. Through my professional experience, I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database queries for performance. These skills translate well to CRM work, where understanding data structures, API integrations, and workflow automation is essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of forms, landing pages, and connected systems to ensure clean data flows. In my previous work, I have developed systems that handle form submissions, manage user data, and connect with third-party services. I am comfortable analyzing requirements, structuring data, and implementing solutions that improve operational efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering, which complements the technical and analytical aspects of this role. I am eager to learn HubSpot in depth and contribute to your client projects. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can add value to your team.', '2026-06-27 01:40:57.330', '2026-06-27 01:40:57.330'),
(1734, 1736, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"HubSpot\",\"CRM systems\",\"E-Mail-Marketing-Tools (Mailchimp, Klaviyo)\",\"Zapier\",\"WordPress\",\"TYPO3\",\"HubSpot CMS\",\"German language (native level)\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills but lacks direct experience with HubSpot, CRM systems, email marketing tools, and the specific CMS platforms mentioned in the job description. The role requires native-level German, which is not indicated in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CRM Manager & HubSpot Consultant position at emerve GmbH. Your focus on CRM, marketing automation, and clean B2B processes aligns with my experience in building and integrating systems that connect marketing, sales, and customer service workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js to build full-stack applications that manage user data, automate workflows, and integrate with third-party services. I have implemented role-based access control, authentication systems, and RESTful APIs that ensure clean data flow between frontend and backend systems. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how CRM systems operate under the hood.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is process optimization and automation. In previous work, I have built systems that automate repetitive tasks, integrate payment gateways, and manage real-time notifications. I have also worked with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL to structure and query data efficiently. While my direct experience is not with HubSpot specifically, my ability to quickly understand system architectures and data pipelines allows m