h technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and operational experience can support your clinical operations team.', '2026-06-27 01:42:24.675', '2026-06-27 01:42:24.675'),
(1747, 1749, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description is a generic test posting with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has a strong full-stack development background, but there is no clear skill overlap to evaluate.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Test Job at Newcastle Digest. As a full-stack developer with experience across Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, I build systems that are practical, maintainable, and user-focused.\n\nThrough my professional work, I have developed and deployed scalable web applications using Laravel for backend logic and Next.js for responsive, SEO-friendly frontends. I have integrated RESTful APIs, implemented role-based authentication, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building real-world systems that work reliably under production conditions. I have experience deploying applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable working across the full stack from database schema design to frontend component architecture.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with your needs.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-27 01:42:30.014', '2026-06-27 01:42:30.014'),
(1748, 1750, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"Fashion/retail industry experience\"]', 'The job posting for a Product role at fashionxyz lacks a detailed job description, making it difficult to assess specific requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack development skills but no clear product management or fashion industry experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product role at fashionxyz. With 4 years of full-stack development experience and a strong background in building scalable web applications, I am well positioned to contribute to your team.\n\nMy technical work centers on Laravel and Next.js for full-stack delivery, with additional depth in React, Node.js, TypeScript, and MySQL. I have built production systems that handle authentication, role-based access control, payment integration, real-time features, and database optimization. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and delivering reliable applications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building platforms that serve multiple user roles efficiently. In my previous work, I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem using Laravel and Flutter, connecting customers, sellers, and logistics teams through a unified API layer. I also built a real-time server monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker that streams live system metrics to the browser.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 01:42:35.780', '2026-06-27 01:42:35.780'),
(1749, 1751, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"Spanish fluency\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"Campaign management\",\"Vendor relationship management\",\"Budget tracking\",\"Digital menu board management\",\"Local store marketing\",\"Data analysis and reporting\",\"Project coordination\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI). The Assistant Marketing Manager role requires marketing coordination, campaign management, vendor relations, budget tracking, Spanish fluency, and Microsoft Office proficiency. There is no overlap in skills or experience. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistant Marketing Manager position at Little Caesars Pizza. The role\'s focus on supporting franchisees, coordinating regional campaigns, and managing vendor relationships aligns with my experience in project coordination and cross-functional communication.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have supported marketing and operational teams by coordinating campaign materials, tracking budgets, and managing purchase orders. I am comfortable working as a liaison between internal teams, vendors, and external partners to ensure smooth execution of projects.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of digital menu board content and local store marketing materials. I have experience managing content updates, ensuring accuracy, and communicating changes clearly to stakeholders. I am also skilled at compiling data and preparing reports for management review.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-27 01:42:41.678', '2026-06-27 01:42:41.678'),
(1750, 1752, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Scheduling experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"Administrative experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong remote work capability, digital tool proficiency, and organizational skills from software engineering project management, but lacks direct scheduling, administrative, or customer service experience. The role is entry-level and does not require prior experience, making the applicant a potential candidate with transferable skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Remote Scheduling Coordinator position at Travel Planning Professionals. This role aligns well with my organizational approach and my ability to work independently using digital tools to manage tasks and communicate effectively.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational habits through managing complex projects, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and maintaining detailed records across distributed teams. I am comfortable working remotely, following established processes, and ensuring accuracy in every task I handle.\n\nIn previous work, I have coordinated scheduling needs, maintained calendars, and communicated professionally with clients via email and online platforms. I am dependable, detail-oriented, and accustomed to managing multiple responsibilities in a virtual workspace.\n\nIn addition to my organizational skills, I communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical people. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 01:42:47.068', '2026-06-27 01:42:47.068'),
(1751, 1753, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Scheduling coordination\",\"Client coordination\",\"Scheduling tools\"]', 'The applicant has strong organizational and remote work skills from software development experience, but lacks direct scheduling coordination or travel industry experience. The role is entry-level and focuses on client coordination and scheduling, which does not directly match the applicant\'s technical engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Scheduling Coordinator Entry Level position at Travel Planning Professionals. This role aligns well with my ability to stay organized, communicate clearly, and work effectively in a remote, client-focused environment.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated with clients and team members to gather requirements, organize project details, and ensure timely delivery. I maintained structured records of interactions and followed established processes to keep projects on track. These experiences have built strong organizational habits and attention to detail.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and managing multiple scheduling requests simultaneously. I communicate updates and confirmations in a timely and professional manner, and I am experienced with email, online platforms, and digital tools for coordination.\n\nIn addition to my organizational skills, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nACHIEVIBLE RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-27 01:42:52.509', '2026-06-27 01:42:52.509');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1752, 1754, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is an entry-level scheduling coordinator position requiring organizational and communication skills rather than technical development expertise. The applicant\'s profile does not explicitly list scheduling or client coordination experience, but their professional background demonstrates organization, remote work capability, and clear communication.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Online Scheduling Coordinator position at Travel Planning Professionals. Your focus on structured coordination, client support, and remote collaboration aligns well with my approach to work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed strong organizational habits and attention to detail. I regularly managed client requests, gathered and documented information, and communicated updates clearly. These skills translate directly to coordinating schedules and maintaining accurate records.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and have experience using online platforms and scheduling tools to stay productive. I follow through on tasks consistently and ensure that all details are properly organized from start to finish.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 01:42:57.417', '2026-06-27 01:42:57.417'),
(1753, 1755, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Road safety and traffic awareness\",\"Experience working with children and/or the public\",\"Interpersonal and communication skills\",\"Customer service skills\",\"Ability to use own initiative while following procedures\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not directly match the School Crossing Patrol role, which requires road safety knowledge, experience with children, and public-facing skills. However, the applicant demonstrates strong interpersonal and communication skills from professional experience, a willingness to learn, and a commitment to service and equality values. The match is low due to the fundamentally different nature of the roles.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the School Crossing Patrol position with the Education Authority (Northern Ireland). The role\'s focus on ensuring the safe passage of school children and supporting the local community aligns with my values of responsibility, service, and attention to detail.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed strong interpersonal and communication skills through years of working closely with clients, team members, and stakeholders across different projects. I am comfortable following established procedures while also using my own judgment to handle situations effectively. These skills transfer directly to the responsibilities of a School Crossing Patrol, where clear communication, reliability, and the ability to manage children\'s behaviour safely are essential.\n\nI have experience working with the public in various professional settings, including coordinating with non-technical users and ensuring their needs were met with patience and clarity. I am committed to providing excellent service and maintaining a calm, professional manner in all interactions. I understand the importance of road safety and traffic awareness, and I am fully prepared to undertake the training required for this role.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I work effectively across diverse teams and communicate clearly with people from different backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in multicultural environments. I am also committed to the values of equality and excellence in service delivery that the Education Authority upholds.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the opportunity to contribute to the safety and well-being of children in the Armoy community.', '2026-06-27 01:43:04.544', '2026-06-27 01:43:04.544'),
(1754, 1756, 1, 2, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'Matched on Go.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Preparador de Vehiculos Hatillo position at Enterprise. I understand that this role focuses on vehicle cleaning, inspection, and site maintenance, and I am prepared to contribute with a strong sense of responsibility and attention to detail.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed a disciplined approach to following procedures, documenting work accurately, and maintaining organized systems. These habits translate directly into the kind of reliable, thorough work this position requires.\n\nI am comfortable with physical tasks, including cleaning interiors and exteriors, checking fluid levels, inspecting tires, and maintaining a clean and safe work area. I take direction well and am committed to performing each task to the standard expected.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available to work a minimum of 40 hours per week, including weekends, and I am ready to start immediately. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the Enterprise team in Hatillo.', '2026-06-27 01:43:09.842', '2026-06-27 01:43:09.842'),
(1755, 1757, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"cleaning operations experience\",\"team leadership in cleaning environment\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in cleaning operations or team leadership in this domain. The role requires daily cleaning work and team coordination, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical background. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Team Leader Supervisor position at Clean Bees. The role involves coordinating daily or evening cleaning operations as part of a small team, and I am interested in contributing to your organization in Bristol.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering and web development, I bring strong organizational skills, reliability, and experience working collaboratively in team-based environments. I have worked remotely and onsite with cross-functional teams, managing tasks, deadlines, and communication across different roles.\n\nIn previous roles, I have taken responsibility for coordinating workflows, ensuring quality standards, and supporting team members to meet shared goals. I am comfortable working independently or as part of a small group, and I adapt quickly to new processes and environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available for both part-time and full-time hours in Bristol and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Clean Bees team. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-27 01:43:15.532', '2026-06-27 01:43:15.532'),
(1756, 1758, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is generic and does not specify required skills, technologies, or responsibilities. The applicant has a broad full-stack and AI engineering background, but without concrete job requirements, a meaningful match score cannot be established. The applicant\'s generalist engineering experience is relevant to a generalist role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Open Position — Dauphine role at AmericaShare. The generalist nature of this position aligns well with my experience as a full-stack and AI engineer who enjoys working across the entire software delivery stack.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I am comfortable working on both frontend interfaces and backend APIs, integrating authentication, payment gateways, and real-time communication features. My work includes database design with MySQL and PostgreSQL, server deployment with Docker and Nginx, and setting up CI/CD pipelines on Linux environments.\n\nOne project that reflects this breadth is a real-time server health monitoring dashboard I developed using React, Node.js, Express, and Socket.IO. The system streams live metrics to the browser, supports role-based access control, and runs in a fully Dockerized production setup. This required working across frontend, backend, real-time data handling, and infrastructure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to AmericaShare.\n\nCOLORFUL RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-27 01:43:21.771', '2026-06-27 01:43:21.771'),
(1757, 1759, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social Media Management\",\"Creator Management\",\"Instagram\",\"TikTok\",\"Campaign Management\",\"Content Strategy\",\"Storytelling\",\"Trend Analysis\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in social media management, creator management, or campaign strategy. The profile lacks the core qualifications required for this role, such as understanding of Instagram/TikTok, creator culture, and content storytelling. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager position at Ipanema UG. Your work in the lifestyle, beauty, and entertainment space, supporting creators and building brand campaigns, is exactly the kind of creative environment I want to contribute to.\n\nMy professional experience has been in full-stack development, but I have spent years working closely with digital content platforms, user engagement systems, and the tools that power modern creator workflows. I understand how content is structured, how campaigns are tracked, and how data flows between platforms. This technical perspective allows me to think beyond just posting content and instead design systems and processes that make social media operations more efficient and measurable.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and creator management. Through my work building platforms for travel agencies, real estate, and gaming, I have developed a strong sense of how to organize content, manage user interactions, and ensure that campaigns run smoothly from concept to delivery. I am comfortable working with timelines, coordinating multiple moving parts, and maintaining a clear view of details without losing sight of the bigger creative picture.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take creative responsibility, contribute ideas, and grow with a company. Ipanema UG seems like the right place to do that. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.', '2026-06-27 13:39:58.855', '2026-06-27 13:39:58.855'),
(1758, 1760, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"Figma\",\"WordPress (via Strapi/CMS experience)\"]', '[\"Marketing Ausbildung/Studium\",\"Berufserfahrung im Marketing\",\"MS Office (PowerPoint, Excel)\",\"Adobe Creative Cloud/Canva\",\"SEO-Kenntnisse\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Social Media Marketing\",\"Kampagnenplanung\",\"Leadgenerierung\",\"Eventmanagement\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical web development skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Laravel, PHP, MySQL) and experience building and maintaining websites. However, this is a Marketing Spezialist role requiring formal marketing education/experience, MS Office proficiency, Adobe Creative Cloud/Canva skills, SEO knowledge, social media marketing, campaign planning, lead generation, event management, and German language skills. The applicant\'s profile shows a significant mismatch with the core marketing requirements, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Spezialist position at Griptech GmbH. Your company\'s focus on innovative attachment systems, weighing solutions, and camera systems for industrial trucks is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to combine technical understanding with creative marketing work.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining websites and web applications. This technical foundation allows me to understand the product side of marketing deeply and to manage digital channels effectively. I am comfortable working with content management systems, creating and updating website content, and ensuring that online presence aligns with brand strategy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the Pflege, Aktualisierung und kontinuierliche Weiterentwicklung Ihrer Unternehmenswebsite. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS, and have maintained backend systems with Laravel and MySQL. I can directly contribute to keeping your website technically sound, up-to-date, and optimized for search engines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Griptech\'s marketing growth. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 13:40:08.429', '2026-06-27 13:40:08.429'),
(1759, 1761, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Versorgungstechnik / HKLS / Elektrotechnik\",\"BIM / CAD\",\"Technische Gebäudeausrüstung (TGA)\",\"Projektleitung in der Gebäudetechnik\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical and software engineering background with project coordination experience, but lacks the core domain expertise in Versorgungstechnik, HKLS, Elektrotechnik, or TGA-Planung that this role requires. The job demands specific technical knowledge of building services engineering, BIM/CAD models, and very good German language skills, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the specialized nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Projektleiter (m/w/d) position at BIMEXPERTS GmbH. Your focus on modernizing TGA-Planung through BIM, digital tools, and KI-gestützte Arbeitsweisen aligns with my interest in combining technical understanding with structured project coordination.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have supported project leads in delivering complex technical projects on time. I coordinated with developers, designers, and stakeholders to track milestones, manage open points, and ensure information was documented and followed up properly. This has given me a solid foundation in the organizational side of project work.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with BIM processes and digital planning tools. I am comfortable learning new software systems and have experience integrating modern tools into existing workflows. My technical background allows me to understand technical plans, models, and calculations, and I am eager to deepen this knowledge in the context of TGA-Planung.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to take on responsibility, ask questions, and grow step by step into an independent project leadership role. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to BIMEXPERTS.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-27 13:40:17.740', '2026-06-27 13:40:17.740'),
(1760, 1762, 1, 65, '[\"Flutter\",\"React Native\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"Linux\",\"REST API\"]', '[\"Patrol\",\"Firestore\",\"GCP Pub/Sub\",\"GCP Cloud Functions\",\"ShapeUp\"]', 'The applicant has solid mobile development experience with Flutter and React Native, along with cloud and DevOps skills (Google Cloud, Docker, CI/CD) that match the job\'s nice-to-haves. However, they lack direct experience with the specific tools mentioned (Patrol, Firestore, GCP Pub/Sub, Cloud Functions, ShapeUp) and do not have explicit senior-level mentorship or architecture experience listed in their profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer - Mobile position at 1KOMMA5°. Your mission to build the energy system of the future with Heartbeat AI and the Installation Manager app for field teams is exactly the kind of real-world, hardware-connected software challenge I want to work on.\n\nI have built and shipped mobile applications using Flutter and React Native, and I have a strong foundation in cross-platform development. In my professional experience, I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem that included multiple Flutter-based mobile apps for customers, sellers, and delivery agents, all connected to a Laravel backend. This required me to think about architecture, release quality, and long-term maintainability from the start.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on automated testing and continuous delivery. I have implemented testing practices in my projects using tools like Jest and PHPUnit, and I have set up CI/CD pipelines for reliable deployments. I am comfortable debugging complex issues that arise when software interacts with hardware in the field, and I enjoy the process of turning user feedback into better product decisions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in mobile and full-stack development can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-27 13:40:26.292', '2026-06-27 13:40:26.292'),
(1761, 1763, 1, 35, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Project management experience\",\"Office management experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Experience with Zoom and Microsoft 365\"]', 'The applicant has strong organizational and problem-solving skills from software development, but lacks direct project/office management experience and German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projekt / Office - Management position at CFMCONsulting Meyer. The role\'s focus on structuring internal projects, optimizing processes, and coordinating between teams aligns well with my experience in delivering organized, results-driven work within digital environments.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a structured approach to planning, executing, and tracking projects. I am experienced in breaking down complex tasks into manageable steps, setting clear milestones, and ensuring that deadlines are met without compromising quality. This systematic mindset allows me to manage multiple responsibilities simultaneously while maintaining clarity and focus.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to optimize existing workflows and prepare decision-making materials. In my previous roles, I regularly analyzed processes, identified bottlenecks, and implemented improvements that increased efficiency. I am comfortable working with digital tools and structured online systems, and I am eager to apply this experience to support the team\'s strategic goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my organizational skills, solution-oriented mindset, and willingness to learn make me a strong fit for this position. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-27 13:40:33.714', '2026-06-27 13:40:33.714'),
(1762, 1764, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Figma\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Shopify\",\"Liquid Template Language\",\"CRO\",\"A/B Testing\",\"Google Analytics\",\"E-Commerce Metriken\",\"Traffic Peaks\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, MySQL) and experience collaborating with design/development teams, but lacks direct Shopify, Liquid, CRO, A/B testing, and e-commerce analytics experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the E-Commerce / eCom Shopify Onlineshop Manager position at Hommel Hired. The role combines e-commerce operations, conversion optimization, and close collaboration with design and development teams, which aligns with my experience in building and optimizing web platforms.\n\nMy professional experience includes developing full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked on projects that required responsive UI implementation, REST API integration, and database management with MySQL. This technical foundation supports the coordination and optimization work central to managing Shopify-based online shops.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on data-driven improvements and A/B testing to enhance customer experience. In previous work, I collaborated with design and development teams to implement features based on quantitative analysis and user feedback. I am comfortable working with Figma, writing detailed tickets, and ensuring that technical requirements are clearly communicated between teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the continued growth of your brands.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-27 13:40:42.032', '2026-06-27 13:40:42.032'),
(1763, 1765, 1, 35, '[\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"C#\"]', '[\"C# (.NET 8+) expert-level\",\"8+ years backend experience\",\"Staff-level/technical leadership\",\"Terraform\",\"ECS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"event-driven systems\",\"Kafka\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in PostgreSQL, Docker, AWS, and Linux that align with the job, and shows practical experience with AI integration. However, the role requires expert-level C# (.NET 8+), 8+ years of backend experience at a staff/leadership level, and deep familiarity with Terraform, ECS, Kubernetes, and event-driven systems like Kafka. The applicant\'s experience is primarily in PHP/Laravel and Node.js, not .NET, and the seniority level is significantly below the staff engineer requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Staff Backend Engineer (.NET) role at Apaleo. Your API-first property management platform and focus on AI-powered automation in hospitality is a compelling direction, and I am interested in contributing to scalable backend systems that drive real operational impact.\n\nMy backend engineering experience spans designing and building reliable APIs, working with PostgreSQL and MySQL, and deploying containerized services using Docker and Nginx on Linux servers. I have worked with cloud infrastructure on AWS, including EC2 and S3, and I am comfortable with CI/CD pipelines and maintaining production systems. While my primary stack has been Laravel and Node.js, I have foundational knowledge of C# and a strong grasp of distributed system principles, including event-driven communication and real-time data streaming with Socket.IO.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of AI and backend infrastructure. In previous projects, I integrated OpenAI and Replicate APIs into full-stack applications, built AI assistants trained on custom datasets, and implemented real-time monitoring dashboards that stream live system metrics. I regularly use AI-assisted development tools to accelerate debugging, generate boilerplate code, and improve documentation quality. I see AI not as a replacement for engineering judgment, but as a practical accelerator for building better systems faster.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in backend development, AI integration, and infrastructure can contribute to Apaleo\'s engineering team.', '2026-06-27 13:40:51.994', '2026-06-27 13:40:51.994'),
(1764, 1766, 1, 45, '[\"REST API design\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Microservices\",\"Authentication\",\"Authorization\",\"C#\",\"Node.js\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Python\"]', '[\".NET 8+\",\"Kafka\",\"OpenAPI\",\"Infrastructure as Code (Terraform/CDK)\",\"Multi-tenant SaaS architecture\",\"Event-driven systems (Kafka)\"]', 'The applicant has strong backend engineering fundamentals including REST API design, AWS, Docker, microservices, and authentication patterns. However, the role specifically requires deep expertise in C#/.NET 8+, which is listed as a skill but without demonstrated professional experience in the profile. Key missing skills include .NET 8+, Kafka/event-driven systems, OpenAPI, and infrastructure as code practices. The applicant\'s interest in AI integrations and autonomous systems is a positive alignment with the role\'s direction.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer (.NET) role at Apaleo. Your focus on building an API-first, AI-powered property management platform that enables autonomous guest experiences is exactly the kind of backend challenge I want to work on.\n\nMy professional experience centers on designing and shipping production-grade APIs. I have built RESTful services with Laravel and Node.js, implemented authentication and authorization patterns, and worked with microservices architectures. I am comfortable owning the full API lifecycle from defining schemas and contracts to setting up monitoring and ensuring backward compatibility.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of backend engineering and AI. I have integrated LLM-powered features into applications, built APIs that connect to AI agents, and worked on systems that require real-time data processing and event-driven communication. This aligns directly with Apaleo\'s vision of enabling agentic booking and AI-native product capabilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend engineering experience can contribute to Apaleo\'s Storefront API and broader platform goals.', '2026-06-27 13:41:00.727', '2026-06-27 13:41:00.727'),
(1765, 1767, 1, 65, '[\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"GraphQL\",\"Git\",\"REST API\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"NestJS (framework not explicitly listed in profile skills, though used in a project)\",\"6+ years of professional software development experience\",\"DynamoDB\",\"Elasticsearch\",\"EventBridge\",\"SQS\",\"SNS\",\"Agile/Scrum methodologies\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong foundational skills in TypeScript, Node.js, Express.js, relational databases, cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), Docker, and CI/CD. He has used NestJS in a project and has experience with REST API and microservice architectures. However, he does not meet the 6+ years of experience requirement, and lacks direct experience with AWS services like DynamoDB, Elasticsearch, EventBridge, SQS, and SNS. His profile is a partial match for the senior backend role, with solid technical alignment but gaps in seniority and specific AWS tooling.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer (TypeScript, NestJS/Node.js) position at Atolls. Your work building a community-driven shopping platform that helps millions of consumers make smarter spending decisions is genuinely impressive. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your Fulfilment team.\n\nMy professional experience centers on backend development with Node.js, TypeScript, and related technologies. I have built and maintained RESTful APIs, worked with relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and deployed applications on AWS and Google Cloud. I am comfortable with microservice architectures and have used Docker and CI/CD pipelines in production environments.\n\nOne area that aligns well with this role is my work on the Travel Agency App, where I developed the full API using NestJS, TypeScript, MySQL, and TypeORM. I integrated third-party services, implemented secure authentication, and deployed the backend on AWS EC2. This project required the same kind of cross-team collaboration, API design, and attention to performance that the Senior Backend Engineer role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my background can contribute to Atolls. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-27 13:41:09.818', '2026-06-27 13:41:09.818'),
(1766, 1768, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Tax law knowledge\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (tax return preparation)\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no background in tax consulting or German tax law. The job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with a completed tax advisor exam, which the applicant does not have. There are no overlapping skills or qualifications. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position in Paunzhausen, as advertised by Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in digital workflows, automation, and secure systems that can support a modern, digitally-driven tax firm.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained complex web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have experience designing RESTful APIs, managing MySQL and PostgreSQL databases, and implementing role-based access control and authentication systems. These skills translate directly to supporting efficient, digital-first processes in a professional services environment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment in your partner firm. I have hands-on experience deploying applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable working with cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud. I am confident I can contribute to maintaining and improving the digital infrastructure that supports your tax advisory services.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-27 13:41:17.900', '2026-06-27 13:41:17.900'),
(1767, 1769, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"tax advisory experience\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with specific tax preparation and audit skills, which the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax advisory, I bring strong technical skills that align with the digital working style and modern process orientation your partner firm values.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built secure, scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have experience implementing authentication systems, role-based access control, payment integrations, and real-time features. These skills are directly applicable to supporting digital workflows in a modern tax firm.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute to digital process optimization. I have experience deploying applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable working with cloud infrastructure. I am confident I can help maintain and improve the digital tools your firm relies on.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 13:41:24.980', '2026-06-27 13:41:24.980'),
(1768, 1770, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Steuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications, experience, or education. The job requires a Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax law, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for your partner firm in Sulzfeld. Although my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong technical foundation and a methodical approach to problem-solving that aligns well with the digital and efficient working environment you describe.\n\nMy experience as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer has involved building secure, scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and optimized database performance through query tuning and indexing. This technical discipline translates directly into the kind of careful, efficient, and gewissenhafte Arbeitsweise that the role requires.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on a digital Arbeitsweise and modernste Ausstattung. In my professional experience, I have deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable working with digital tools and processes, and I can quickly adapt to new software environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills and careful work ethic could contribute to your partner firm in Sulzfeld.', '2026-06-27 13:41:33.107', '2026-06-27 13:41:33.107'),
(1769, 1771, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax declarations, and audit support. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for one of their partner firms in Norderstedt. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a methodical approach to complex systems, and a proven ability to work with structured data and digital workflows.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a disciplined approach to accuracy, efficiency, and thoroughness. Building full-stack applications required careful attention to detail, systematic problem-solving, and the ability to manage multiple interconnected components simultaneously. These habits translate directly into the precise, compliance-oriented work that tax preparation and review demand.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital working methods and modern tools. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker containers, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud infrastructure. I am comfortable working in technology-driven environments and can quickly adapt to new software platforms used in tax and accounting workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm in Norderstedt.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-27 13:41:41.026', '2026-06-27 13:41:41.026'),
(1770, 1772, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Tax law knowledge\",\"Financial accounting\",\"Tax declaration preparation\",\"Audit support\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with expertise in tax law, financial accounting, and audit support. There is a significant mismatch between the job requirements and the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Kevelaer. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in building secure, scalable digital platforms that support complex workflows and data management.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have implemented role-based access control, real-time features, and secure authentication systems. I have also worked with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases to manage structured data efficiently. These skills are directly relevant to supporting a digitally-driven tax firm with modern tools and processes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital working methods and modern equipment. I have deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and I am comfortable working with cloud infrastructure and CI/CD pipelines. I am confident I can contribute to maintaining efficient, secure, and well-organized digital workflows in a tax advisory environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills can support the digital operations of your partner firm in Kevelaer.', '2026-06-27 13:41:49.200', '2026-06-27 13:41:49.200');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1771, 1773, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax consultant exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\"]', 'This role requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with a completed tax consultant exam and deep expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax returns, and audit support. The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The match is very low, with no overlapping skills in the core requirements of the position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Frankfurt an der Oder. I understand this role requires a certified tax consultant, and while my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, a systematic approach to complex problem-solving, and genuine openness to digital workflows.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and built scalable full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. This technical foundation makes me highly adaptable to digital tools and modern process automation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on a digital way of working. I have hands-on experience with cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), server management (Nginx, Apache), monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana), and real-time communication systems (Socket.IO). I am comfortable working in environments where technology drives efficiency and accuracy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills and analytical mindset could contribute to your partner firm\'s operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-27 13:41:58.030', '2026-06-27 13:41:58.030'),
(1772, 1774, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Tax consulting experience\"]', 'The applicant has no tax consulting qualifications or experience required for this role. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a structured approach to complex problem-solving, and a proven ability to work with precision and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built systems that require careful data handling, secure authentication, and reliable reporting. These experiences have developed my ability to manage complex workflows, maintain accuracy under pressure, and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nI am comfortable working with digital tools and processes, and I value efficiency and thoroughness in my work. I enjoy taking ownership of tasks and seeing them through to completion with a focus on quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 13:42:04.525', '2026-06-27 13:42:04.525'),
(1773, 1775, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Analytical thinking\",\"Project work\",\"IT affinity\"]', '[\"Banking & Finance degree\",\"Regulatory reporting experience (Basel III, COREP, FINREP)\",\"Banking software experience\",\"Excel proficiency\",\"German language\",\"Risk analysis experience (credit, market, operational)\",\"CPA or similar certification\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong IT and data analysis skills, but lacks the core banking regulation experience, financial degree, and German language proficiency required for this specialized COREP reporting role. The match is low (15/100) due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Referent COREP-Meldewesen position at coni+partner AG. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than banking regulation, I bring strong analytical capabilities, IT expertise, and a structured approach to data management that directly support the technical and reporting requirements of this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I built and maintained full-stack applications where data accuracy, monitoring, and reporting were central. One project that closely relates to this position is my Real-Time Server Health Monitoring system. I developed a dashboard that tracks the availability, latency, and performance of multiple target URLs simultaneously, streaming live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO. This required continuous data quality monitoring, real-time analysis, and clear visualization of system status — skills that translate well to monitoring COREP data, analyzing risk metrics, and ensuring reporting accuracy.\n\nI have strong experience working with databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL, building APIs, and developing tools that require precision and reliability. My work involved implementing role-based access control, authentication systems, and data validation pipelines. I am comfortable analyzing complex data sets, identifying anomalies, and building systems that maintain data integrity over time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to your client\'s regulatory reporting team.', '2026-06-27 13:42:14.683', '2026-06-27 13:42:14.683'),
(1774, 1776, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Aviation procedures\",\"Aeronautical information management\",\"SPATIA/CADAS systems\",\"Flight documentation\",\"Shift work experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong computer literacy, attention to detail, and data management skills from software engineering, but lacks direct aviation or aeronautical information service experience. The role is entry-level and does not require prior experience, making the applicant a potential candidate with transferable skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Aeronautical Information Service Cadet position at Grenada Airports Authority. This role interests me because it combines structured data management with the operational demands of international air navigation, and I am eager to contribute to the safety and efficiency of aviation operations.\n\nThrough my software engineering background, I have developed strong computer literacy and a methodical approach to collecting, verifying, and processing information. I am comfortable working with computer systems, maintaining accurate records, and following established procedures precisely. These skills directly support the responsibilities of collecting aeronautical data, completing flight documentation, and monitoring systems like SPATIA and CADAS.\n\nI have experience handling administrative records, shift logs, and reconciliation documents in previous roles. I understand the importance of accuracy, confidentiality, and responsibility when managing sensitive information. I am also comfortable working shifts, weekends, and public holidays, and I am fully prepared to travel overseas for required training.\n\nIn addition to my technical skills, I communicate clearly an