(1787, 1789, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"B2B platform experience\",\"chemical industry domain knowledge\"]', 'The job description is generic and lacks specific technical requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack development skills but no direct B2B or chemical industry experience. The match is low due to domain mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Guide position at Mixed Media Labs, Inc. I understand that ECHEMI is a global B2B platform serving the chemical industry, connecting manufacturers and suppliers worldwide. Building and maintaining a platform that supports complex B2B operations requires reliable, scalable, and well-structured systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained production web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, RESTful APIs, payment gateways, and real-time features. I am comfortable working across the entire stack, from database design and API development to responsive frontend interfaces and deployment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that handle complex business logic while remaining maintainable and performant. In previous work, I optimized database queries, implemented caching strategies, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I have also integrated third-party services including payment gateways, cloud storage, and social logins.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of Mixed Media Labs, Inc.', '2026-06-27 13:43:59.955', '2026-06-27 13:43:59.955'),
(1788, 1790, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Medical terminology\",\"Microsoft Office Suite\",\"Claims processing experience\",\"Customer service experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering/web development) and does not align well with the Claims Specialist role, which requires administrative, customer service, and claims processing skills. No direct skill matches were found. The applicant has general work experience and education but lacks the specific domain knowledge and tools required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Claims Specialist position at DTLA Benefits. The role involves reviewing and processing insurance claims, verifying policy details and medical documentation, and providing prompt customer service to policyholders and providers. I am interested in contributing to a company that values integrity, customer service, and accuracy.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in data management, attention to detail, and working with complex systems. I am comfortable interpreting information, maintaining accurate records, and following established procedures. My technical background has taught me to approach tasks methodically and ensure data integrity.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the customer service aspect of this role. I have experience communicating with diverse stakeholders and responding to inquiries clearly and professionally. I am skilled at listening carefully, asking the right questions, and following up to resolve issues.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 13:44:06.906', '2026-06-27 13:44:06.906'),
(1789, 1791, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years quota-carrying sales experience\",\"Consultative solution selling\",\"Senior stakeholder engagement\",\"CRM discipline\",\"Pipeline management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no sales or account executive experience. The role requires 5+ years of quota-carrying sales, consultative selling, and senior stakeholder engagement. There are no matched skills. The applicant\'s background in client communication and remote work is a very weak partial fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Account Executive role at Stern Strategy Group, working with Minds Worth Meeting Podcast. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong client-facing experience, structured communication skills, and a track record of managing complex projects from initial conversation through successful delivery.\n\nWhat draws me to Stern Strategy Group is the caliber of thought leaders you represent and the impact your work has on helping organizations navigate critical business challenges. The idea of connecting world-class expertise with organizations that need it aligns with my own approach to building solutions that solve real problems.\n\nIn my previous roles, I worked directly with clients and stakeholders to understand their needs, scope requirements, and manage expectations throughout the project lifecycle. I developed the ability to communicate technical concepts clearly to non-technical decision-makers and to build lasting professional relationships based on trust and reliable delivery.\n\nI am comfortable operating independently in a remote environment, managing multiple priorities simultaneously, and maintaining clear documentation and communication across teams. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural settings.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-27 13:44:14.325', '2026-06-27 13:44:14.325');
