(1790, 1792, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Formação superior em História com pós-graduação ou mestrado em Genealogia, Arquivologia\",\"Mais de 5 anos de experiência prática em Pesquisa de cidadania europeia\",\"Experiência em pesquisa em bases de dados nacionais e internacionais\",\"Conhecimento avançado em análise documental e investigação histórica\",\"Experiência na construção e validação de árvores genealógicas\",\"Capacidade de conduzir pesquisas complexas com total autonomia\",\"Capacidade de estruturar e transferir conhecimento\",\"Conhecimento de paleografia e leitura de documentos históricos manuscritos\",\"Experiência com todos os processos de cidadania europeia\",\"Leitura de documentos em italiano, alemão, espanhol ou latim\",\"Vivência em orientação técnica, mentoria ou desenvolvimento de profissionais\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Genealogista role at Amorim Global. The job requires specialized education and experience in genealogy, historical research, European citizenship processes, paleography, and multilingual document reading. The applicant\'s skills are in software engineering, web development, and AI, with no relevant background in genealogical research or historical analysis.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Genealogista position at Amorim Global. Your company\'s mission to empower people and businesses across borders through strategic excellence and legal security is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to high-quality genealogical research for European citizenship processes.\n\nMy background in software engineering has developed strong analytical and investigative skills that are directly transferable to genealogical research. I have extensive experience working with complex data systems, conducting thorough research across multiple databases, and validating information through careful cross-referencing. My work has consistently required formulating hypotheses, testing them systematically, and finding evidence even in scenarios with limited information.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of reconstructing family lineages from historical documents. In my technical work, I have developed systems that handle data integrity, authentication, and validation at scale. This experience has taught me to approach complex problems methodically, maintain meticulous attention to detail, and persist through difficult research challenges until reliable conclusions are reached.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical capabilities and research experience can contribute to the excellence Amorim Global delivers to its clients.', '2026-06-27 13:44:22.599', '2026-06-27 13:44:22.599'),
(1791, 1793, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Journalism\",\"Reporting\",\"Policy Analysis\",\"Childcare Program Knowledge\"]', 'The job description describes a journalism/reporting role covering a childcare program in New Mexico. The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no relevant journalism, reporting, or policy analysis experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Learn More position at Get Vetted. While the job description focuses on reporting about a universal childcare program in New Mexico, I understand that the role likely requires strong technical and analytical capabilities to support such initiatives.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have built scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication systems with role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I delivered real-time features including chat and live notifications using WebSockets, deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx, and set up CI/CD pipelines for efficient delivery. I also worked on responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Get Vetted\'s work.\n\nPROFOUND RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-06-27 13:44:28.881', '2026-06-27 13:44:28.881'),
(1792, 1794, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Kosmetikerin Ausbildung\",\"Facials\",\"Hautpflegebehandlungen\",\"Russische Maniküre\",\"Pediküre\",\"Lashlift\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no professional experience or training in cosmetology, facials, lash lifts, manicure, or pedicure. The role requires specific beauty industry qualifications and hands-on treatment skills which are completely absent from the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Kosmetikerin / Beauty Expertin position at Pow korean concept. Your studio\'s focus on high-quality, Korean-inspired beauty treatments and creating a calm, aesthetic environment for clients is something I find genuinely appealing. I am a quick learner with a strong work ethic and a commitment to precision, and I am eager to bring that dedication to your team.\n\nAlthough my professional experience is in software engineering, I have developed a disciplined approach to my work that I believe translates well into a beauty studio setting. My background has required meticulous attention to detail, strict adherence to protocols, and a focus on delivering a seamless and positive end-user experience. I am confident in my ability to learn and master the specific techniques of facials, lash lifts, and nail services with the same level of dedication.\n\nI am a hard worker who values cleanliness, organization, and a professional atmosphere. I am accustomed to preparing workspaces, managing my own schedule, and taking full ownership of my responsibilities. I am also a strong communicator and enjoy working as part of a team to ensure every client feels welcomed and cared for.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for an opportunity where I can apply my strong work ethic and learning ability in a hands-on, client-focused role. I am confident I can grow into an expert member of your team and contribute to the high standards of Pow korean concept. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-28 01:39:57.594', '2026-06-28 01:39:57.594'),
(1793, 1795, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Ads\",\"Performance Max\",\"Search Ads 360\",\"Merchant Center\",\"SEA/Paid Search\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"5+ years SEA experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI, but the job requires specialized SEA/Paid Search expertise (Google Ads, PMax, Search Ads 360) and native-level German. The match is low due to a completely different domain focus.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior SEA Manager position at hurra.com. Your focus on combining deep performance marketing knowledge with AI, automation, and proprietary technology is exactly the kind of forward-thinking environment where I can contribute effectively.\n\nMy work has centered on building intelligent systems that automate complex workflows and extract actionable insights from data. I have developed AI-powered applications that integrate with APIs, process real-time data streams, and automate decision-making processes. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how AI and automation can drive measurable performance improvements.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of identifying hidden levers for growth. In my projects, I have consistently focused on optimizing system performance by analyzing data patterns, testing hypotheses, and implementing targeted improvements. Whether it was tuning database queries for faster response times or building automated monitoring dashboards, I approach every problem with a focus on finding the most impactful solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI, automation, and data-driven development can contribute to hurra.com\'s mission of shaping the next generation of paid search.', '2026-06-28 01:40:05.183', '2026-06-28 01:40:05.183'),
(1794, 1796, 1, 35, '[\"Javascript\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"GA4\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Consent Management Platforms\",\"Shopify\",\"BigQuery\",\"Looker Studio\",\"GDPR\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational JavaScript skills and familiarity with Google Cloud, but lacks the core digital analytics expertise (GA4, GTM, CMPs, server-side tracking) and German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Digital Analytics & Tracking Consultant role at hurra.com. Your focus on GA4 tracking, Google Tag Manager, and server-side configurations for eCommerce clients aligns with my technical background in web development and cloud-based systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed applications on cloud platforms including Google Cloud. This work required a strong understanding of how data flows between client-side interfaces and server-side systems, which is directly relevant to implementing and optimizing server-side Google Tag Manager configurations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of analytics tools with eCommerce platforms. In previous projects, I have worked with payment gateways, user authentication flows, and real-time data synchronization, all of which involve careful event tracking and data layer management. My JavaScript skills, combined with experience in cloud deployment and monitoring, provide a solid foundation for supporting GA4 Enhanced E-commerce setups and Consent Management Platform integrations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team\'s analytics and tracking work.', '2026-06-28 01:40:11.799', '2026-06-28 01:40:11.799'),
(1795, 1797, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Buchhaltung\",\"Betriebskostenabrechnung\",\"Domus\",\"Immoware\",\"VS3\",\"MS-Office\",\"Steuerfachangestellter Ausbildung\",\"Objektbuchhaltung\",\"Mietbuchhaltung\",\"Wirtschaftsplanerstellung\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong IT skills (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Linux) but lacks the core accounting qualifications, domain-specific software experience (Domus, Immoware, VS3), and formal training in Buchhaltung required for this WEG / Immobilienbuchhalter role. The match is low (15/100) due to a fundamental domain mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the WEG / Immobilienbuchhalter position at Phoenix Personalvermittlung GmbH. The role\'s focus on precise financial administration and structured data management is something I find well-aligned with my technical background.\n\nAlthough my career has been in software engineering, I have developed strong competencies in data accuracy, systematic workflows, and financial transaction processing. Through my work building full-stack applications, I have handled complex data structures, payment integrations, and reporting systems that require the same level of precision and reliability expected in property accounting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the management of financial data and the creation of accurate reconciliations. In my professional experience, I have worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases, ensuring data integrity, performing detailed audits, and building systems that track financial flows. This has given me a methodical approach to handling numbers, verifying records, and maintaining organized documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, attention to detail, and IT proficiency would allow me to quickly adapt to the specific requirements of this role. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-28 01:40:19.490', '2026-06-28 01:40:19.490'),
(1796, 1798, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Programmmanagement\",\"militärische Nutzung Weltraum\",\"Elektrotechnik\",\"Nachrichtentechnik\",\"Deutsch (verhandlungssicher)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering, web development, and autonomous systems research. The job requires a program manager with deep experience in military space utilization, electrical/communications engineering, and fluent German. There is no direct overlap in required qualifications or responsibilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Programmmanager militärische Nutzung Weltraum position at K-tronik GmbH. The role combines strategic program management with defense and space technology, which aligns with my technical background and research focus on secure autonomous systems.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have designed and built systems for UAV coordination, sensor fusion, and secure communication in GPS-denied environments. These projects required evaluating technical feasibility, managing cross-functional requirements, and ensuring system resilience under adversarial conditions, which directly relates to managing complex defense and space programs.\n\nA relevant example is my work on OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks. This project involved cryptographic data integrity, decentralized coordination, and real-time threat mitigation, all of which are relevant to secure space-based systems and military-grade communication.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to K-tronik\'s defense and space initiatives.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-28 01:40:26.410', '2026-06-28 01:40:26.410'),
(1797, 1799, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Finanzbuchhaltung\",\"Bilanzbuchhaltung\",\"Steuerfachangestellte\",\"DATEV\",\"SAP\",\"HGB\",\"Umsatzsteuer-Voranmeldungen\",\"Kreditorenbuchhaltung\",\"Debitorenbuchhaltung\",\"Konsolidierung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this accounting/finance role. The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no relevant accounting education, experience, or skills (e.g., DATEV, SAP, HGB, financial accounting). No skills from the profile match the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Finanzbuchhalter/in, Bilanzbuchhalter/in, Steuerfachangestellte/r position at Phoenix Personalvermittlung GmbH. While my background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, attention to detail, and experience building data-driven systems that require precision and reliability.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed a disciplined approach to handling complex data flows, ensuring data integrity, and building secure, well-structured systems. These skills translate directly to the structured and careful work required in accounting and financial reporting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a professional environment that values reliability, discretion, and analytical thinking. I have consistently demonstrated these qualities in my technical work, where accuracy and thoroughness are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-28 01:40:33.359', '2026-06-28 01:40:33.359'),
(1798, 1800, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Project management experience in solar technology\",\"Experience with solar installation projects\",\"Budget management experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has general project coordination and technical delivery experience from web development roles, but lacks direct experience in solar technology, project management in the renewable energy sector, budget oversight, and German language skills which are important for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter:in position at Solartechnik Thiemann. Your focus on delivering custom solar systems and wallbox solutions with precision and reliability aligns with how I approach technical project delivery.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have led the planning and execution of full-stack web development projects from initial requirements through deployment. This involved coordinating with internal teams and external partners, managing project budgets and timelines, and ensuring that all deliverables met quality and safety standards before release.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work on renewable energy projects at Solartechnik Thiemann. My technical background gives me a solid foundation for understanding the systems and workflows involved in solar installations, and I am comfortable communicating technical details clearly with both team members and customers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the chance to discuss how my project management and technical experience can contribute to your team. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-28 01:40:39.426', '2026-06-28 01:40:39.426'),
(1799, 1801, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Brand Marketing\",\"Content Creation\",\"Social Media Management\",\"Creator Management\",\"Retail Marketing\",\"Campaign Strategy\",\"Event Coordination\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in brand marketing, content creation, social media management, or creator coordination. The role requires hands-on brand building, influencer management, and campaign execution, which are outside the applicant\'s documented skill set. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Brand Associate (m/w/d) role at Nero GmbH. What stands out to me about Nero is the ambition to build a new beverage category around ready-to-drink Matcha with a community-first approach. I find the combination of creator-driven marketing, offline activations, and direct collaboration with founders genuinely compelling.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and leading technical projects from concept to deployment. This experience has given me a structured approach to project coordination, a comfort with fast-changing priorities, and a habit of taking ownership from day one. I am used to working in small teams where everyone contributes directly to the outcome.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational side of brand building. In my previous work, I have coordinated multi-step workflows, managed timelines across different stakeholders, and ensured that deliverables are completed on schedule. I am confident I can apply the same discipline to planning shoots, coordinating creators, managing seeding campaigns, and supporting retail marketing initiatives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in project coordination and hands-on execution can contribute to building Nero\'s brand presence.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-28 01:40:47.840', '2026-06-28 01:40:47.840'),
(1800, 1802, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Staatlich geprüfte Kosmetikerin certification\",\"NiSV-Zertifikate\",\"Spa treatment experience\",\"Skin analysis\",\"Facial rituals\",\"Lifting techniques\",\"Non-invasive technology (Ultrasound, Radiofrequency, LED)\",\"Microneedling\",\"Chemical peels\",\"Laser hair removal\",\"Manual lymphatic drainage\",\"MamiSpa\",\"OncoSpa\",\"German language (native level)\"]', 'This role is for a licensed cosmetologist in a high-end Berlin spa. The applicant\'s profile shows no relevant cosmetology training, spa experience, or required certifications. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Staatlich geprüfte Kosmetikerin in Teilzeit position at Inanna GmbH. What draws me to Inanna Wellness is not just the awards or the reputation, but the philosophy behind the work: precision over intensity, rhythm over speed, and genuine attention to each guest. That is the kind of environment where I want to grow.\n\nI come from a technical background in software engineering, where I have spent years developing systems that require accuracy, patience, and careful attention to detail. Through my work building full-stack applications and real-time monitoring systems, I have learned to work methodically, troubleshoot with clarity, and maintain focus even under pressure. These habits translate well into hands-on, service-oriented work.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts easily to new tools and processes. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of German and Russian, and communicate clearly with people from different backgrounds. I enjoy working in small teams where collaboration and mutual respect are part of the daily rhythm.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI understand this role requires NiSV certification, and I am prepared to obtain it with your support. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to the culture of care and craftsmanship at Inanna Wellness. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-06-28 01:40:55.901', '2026-06-28 01:40:55.901'),
(1801, 1803, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Logo and Brand Design\",\"Motion Graphics Design\",\"Print Collateral Design\",\"PowerPoint/Google Slides Presentation Design\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational design-related skills (Figma, Tailwind, CSS, HTML, Bootstrap, MaterialUI) but lacks direct experience in core design areas such as logo/brand design, motion graphics, UX design, print collateral, and presentation design. The role is primarily a creative design position, while the applicant\'s background is in software engineering and full-stack development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Designer position at SAN Creatives Agency. Your approach of hiring based on core values and empowering candidates to excel resonates with me, and I appreciate the emphasis on craftsmanship and research-driven design.\n\nAs a full-stack developer with a strong focus on frontend and UI/UX, I have built complete user interfaces for platforms in travel, real estate, and finance. My design work is grounded in practical usability, responsive layouts, and clean visual hierarchy. I use tools like Figma, Tailwind CSS, and MaterialUI to translate concepts into polished, functional interfaces.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have delivered projects that required close attention to user experience, branding consistency, and cross-platform compatibility. I have worked on multi-language and multi-currency travel platforms, AI-powered dashboards, and real-time monitoring systems, always prioritizing clarity and ease of use.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your creative projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-28 01:41:03.663', '2026-06-28 01:41:03.663'),
(1802, 1804, 1, 25, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Python\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"SQL (advanced domain expertise)\",\"Unit Economics / P&L understanding\",\"A/B testing and experimentation\",\"Statistical analysis\",\"Financial services background\",\"R\",\"Data visualization / KPI dashboards\",\"Product growth strategy\"]', 'The applicant has foundational technical skills in SQL databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and Python, which are mentioned as differentiators. However, the role requires deep expertise in product growth analytics, unit economics, experimentation frameworks, and strategic leadership in a fintech context. The applicant\'s profile is primarily engineering-focused (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) with no demonstrated experience in product growth, financial metrics, A/B testing, or data-driven product strategy. The match is low due to a significant gap in domain-specific skills and experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Growth Expert Acquisition position at Neon Pagamentos. Your focus on using data to drive customer engagement and operational efficiency in a fintech environment is particularly interesting to me.\n\nMy technical background is rooted in full-stack development, with strong experience in SQL-based data modeling and analysis. I have worked with MySQL and PostgreSQL extensively, extracting and manipulating complex datasets to support product decisions. This analytical foundation allows me to connect technical metrics directly to business outcomes.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built and optimized database queries, implemented caching strategies, and developed real-time features using WebSockets. I have also architected automation solutions for data collection and processing, ensuring recurring analyses operate with speed and accuracy. This hands-on work with data pipelines and performance optimization directly supports the responsibilities outlined for this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building frameworks for experimentation and KPI governance. Through my project work on the AI-Powered Financial App, I developed APIs that processed user data, integrated AI assistants, and automated PDF generation and email delivery via AWS SES. This required translating complex technical workflows into clear, actionable outputs for stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Neon\'s growth.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-28 01:41:12.330', '2026-06-28 01:41:12.330'),
(1803, 1805, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"Problem-solving\"]', '[\"Property maintenance experience\",\"AC servicing\",\"Electrical repairs\",\"Plumbing\",\"Marine/boat experience\",\"Physical outdoor work\",\"Handyman experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and full-stack development, not property maintenance or facilities management. There is no direct experience with AC servicing, electrical repairs, plumbing, or marine environments. However, the applicant demonstrates strong problem-solving skills, hardware experience (Raspberry Pi, ESP32, Jetson Nano), and system maintenance abilities that could be transferable for a motivated learner. The match is low due to the fundamentally different domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Property Maintenance & Operations Coordinator position at Dart. The role requires someone who can maintain properties, equipment, and systems to a high operational standard while responding quickly to urgent issues. I bring strong problem-solving skills, hands-on technical experience, and a proactive maintenance-first mindset.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and hardware projects, I have developed a systematic approach to troubleshooting and maintenance. I have worked with Linux servers, Docker containers, Nginx configurations, and CI/CD pipelines, which require constant monitoring, preventative upkeep, and rapid issue resolution. I am comfortable diagnosing faults, replacing components, and ensuring systems remain reliable under pressure.\n\nI have hands-on experience with hardware platforms including Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano. These projects involved assembling, configuring, and maintaining physical systems, performing electrical connections, and troubleshooting hardware failures. I am used to working with tools, maintaining equipment, and keeping detailed records of maintenance activities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am flexible with scheduling, including evenings, weekends, public holidays, and on-call rotations. I am comfortable working outdoors and near water. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Arboretum Services team.', '2026-06-28 01:41:20.089', '2026-06-28 01:41:20.089'),
(1804, 1806, 1, 20, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"No specific technical skills mentioned in job description\"]', 'The job posting for Common Energy is a general company overview with no specific technical requirements or open position details. The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, MySQL, Docker) that could be relevant to building customer-facing platforms, but there is no direct skill match because the job description lacks technical requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Common Energy. Your mission to reshape the energy system through community solar projects that replace fossil fuels with local, clean energy is both timely and meaningful. I appreciate the collaborative culture described by your team and would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your technical efforts.\n\nAs a full-stack developer with over four years of professional experience, I have built and maintained production web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and TypeScript. My work has involved designing RESTful APIs, implementing secure authentication and role-based access control, optimizing database queries with MySQL, and creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces. These skills directly support the development of customer-facing platforms and internal tools that serve diverse user groups.\n\nIn previous work, I delivered real-time features such as chat and notifications using WebSockets, integrated third-party services including payment gateways and cloud storage, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I also built a full-stack multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem using Laravel and Flutter, which required coordinating multiple user roles and ensuring reliable data flow across the system.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Common Energy\'s goals.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-28 01:41:27.227', '2026-06-28 01:41:27.227'),
(1805, 1807, 1, 15, '[\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"ESG consulting\",\"Carbon services\",\"Sustainability consulting\",\"Energy engineering\",\"Commissioning\",\"Real estate program delivery\"]', 'The job posting for Stok at Office of Energy & Sustainability is primarily a company overview page describing their services (ESG consulting, carbon services, sustainability consulting, energy engineering, commissioning) rather than a specific technical role with clear requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, MySQL, Docker, Linux) but these are not directly aligned with the sustainability/energy consulting domain described. The score is low because the job posting lacks specific technical requirements that match the applicant\'s profile, and the domain expertise required (ESG, carbon services, energy engineering) is not present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Stok role at the Office of Energy & Sustainability. Your focus on ESG consulting, carbon services, and sustainability consulting aligns with my interest in building technology that supports meaningful environmental impact.\n\nMy technical background is in full-stack web development, with professional experience building scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have designed and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I also work comfortably with Docker, Linux servers, and CI/CD pipelines for deployment.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I delivered production applications end to end. This included building responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, integrating real-time features using WebSockets, and implementing secure payment gateways. I also contributed to server maintenance and deployment on Nginx and Apache environments.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I built a Laravel-based backend with role-based access control, Redis caching, and Firebase notifications, serving multiple Flutter mobile applications. This required coordinating complex data flows across different user roles while maintaining system reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Stok\'s mission.', '2026-06-28 01:41:35.051', '2026-06-28 01:41:35.051'),
(1806, 1808, 1, 45, '[\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node JS\",\"Python\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\"]', '[\"IoT protocols (MQTT, CoAP)\",\"Embedded systems\",\"Sensor integration\",\"Firmware development\",\"Edge computing\"]', 'The applicant has a strong foundation in backend development, cloud infrastructure, and system monitoring, which partially overlaps with IoT infrastructure needs. However, the profile lacks direct IoT-specific experience such as embedded systems, sensor integration, or IoT communication protocols. The match is moderate, with transferable skills in deployment, monitoring, and secure system design.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IoT Specialist position at Jasper Solutions Inc. Your company\'s broad portfolio of cloud orchestration, infrastructure management, and secure system integration services for government and commercial clients is impressive. I am particularly interested in how your team approaches the intersection of connected systems, data protection, and operational reliability.\n\nThrough my professional experience and hands-on project development, I have built and maintained systems that require reliable communication between distributed components, real-time data processing, and secure deployment. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker containers, Nginx, and cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud. These technologies form the foundation for managing IoT infrastructure where uptime, monitoring, and secure data flow are critical.\n\nOne relevant example is a Real-Time Server Health Monitoring dashboard I designed and developed. The system tracked the availability, latency, and performance of multiple target URLs simultaneously, streaming live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO. I containerized the entire stack with Docker and Docker Compose, deployed it behind Nginx, and implemented role-based access control with JWT authentication. This project required integrating Python and Flask for system metrics collection, Node.js for real-time communication, and React for the frontend interface.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building reliable, monitored systems can contribute to Jasper Solutions\' IoT initiatives.', '2026-06-28 01:41:42.710', '2026-06-28 01:41:42.710'),
(1807, 1809, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"People Operations experience\",\"HR compliance\",\"Benefits administration\",\"HRIS implementation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct People Operations, HR, or compliance experience. The only potential alignment is AI-savviness and remote work experience, which are preferred but not primary qualifications. The role requires 3+ years in People Operations or a closely related field.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the People Operations Specialist role at VulnCheck. Your work in vulnerability intelligence is critical, and I respect the mission of helping security teams act with speed and confidence. I am drawn to the opportunity to bring operational rigor to a scaling global team.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years building systems, documenting processes, and optimizing workflows in remote-first environments. I understand what it takes to create structure without slowing people down. I am comfortable working across time zones, managing multiple priorities, and handling sensitive information with discretion.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is AI automation. I have practical experience integrating AI into real-world applications, including training custom assistants and automating data workflows. I see clear potential to apply that capability to streamline People Operations tasks such as feedback analysis, compliance tracking, and reporting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my skills can support VulnCheck\'s People team.', '2026-06-28 01:41:49.238', '2026-06-28 01:41:49.238');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1808, 1810, 1, 75, '[\"JavaScript\",\"Next JS\",\"Strapi\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Typescript\",\"React\"]', '[\"Braze\"]', 'Strong match for the Frontend Developer Junior role. The applicant has direct experience with JavaScript, Next.js, and Strapi, which are the primary technologies listed. Experience building responsive UIs with Tailwind CSS and TypeScript is also relevant. The only missing skill is Braze, which is not in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Frontend Developer Junior position at Universia Perú. The opportunity to work with modern frontend technologies like Next.js and Strapi while contributing to digital solutions aligns well with my development experience.\n\nThrough my professional work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained web applications using JavaScript, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS. I have also worked with Strapi as a headless CMS, which directly matches the technology stack mentioned in the job description. My focus has been on creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces that work well across devices.\n\nA relevant example is the Travel Agency App I developed for 2Expedition, where I used Next.js with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and integrated Google Maps. The project required building a full-stack solution with multi-language and multi-currency support, demonstrating my ability to work with modern frontend tools and deliver complete digital experiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the team at Universia Perú.', '2026-06-28 01:41:55.585', '2026-06-28 01:41:55.585'),
(1809, 1811, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Supply Chain/Logistics degree\",\"3+ years supply chain experience\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"Customer routing guide compliance\",\"Carrier coordination\",\"Shipping issue troubleshooting\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not match the supply chain, logistics, and customer routing focus of this role. No direct skill overlap was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analyst Customer Routing position at Gildan. Your company\'s vertically integrated manufacturing model and commitment to operational excellence across global supply chains is impressive. I am drawn to the opportunity to support routing and customer compliance for retail accounts within your Planning and Scheduling Department.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong problem-solving and analytical skills that align well with the responsibilities of this role. I have worked in environments that required careful attention to detail, adherence to specific guidelines, and coordination across multiple teams to ensure smooth operations. These experiences have prepared me to handle the routing guide compliance, carrier communication, and troubleshooting of shipping issues described in the job posting.\n\nA key strength I bring is my ability to prioritize tasks and manage time effectively under demanding deadlines. In previous work, I regularly balanced competing priorities while maintaining clear communication with internal teams and external stakeholders. I am comfortable working with detailed documentation, maintaining updates, and ensuring that processes align with customer-specific requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-28 01:42:02.413', '2026-06-28 01:42:02.413'),
(1810, 1812, 1, 65, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Bootstrap\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS, which align well with the Web Developer role. The job description is minimal, but the applicant\'s professional experience and project portfolio demonstrate relevant capabilities.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Web Developer position at Ravi. With over 4 years of professional experience building full-stack web applications, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy technical background centers on Laravel and Next.js, which I have used extensively to build scalable, secure, and responsive web platforms. I work with PHP, JavaScript, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and MySQL on a daily basis, and I am comfortable with the full development lifecycle from requirements to deployment.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I designed and developed web applications using Laravel for the backend and Next.js for the frontend. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database queries for better performance. I also deployed applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Ravi\'s projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-28 01:42:08.500', '2026-06-28 01:42:08.500'),
(1811, 1813, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Graduation in Pharmacy\",\"2 to 5 years of relevant work experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s background in software engineering does not match the required pharmacy education or the specific competencies listed for this Executive role at Lupin. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive position at Lupin. Although my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I have consistently demonstrated strategic agility, result orientation, and process excellence while delivering complex technical projects.\n\nIn my work as a full-stack developer, I have led end-to-end product delivery, collaborated with cross-functional teams, and managed stakeholder expectations across multiple projects. These experiences have sharpened my ability to align technical execution with business goals, drive innovation, and maintain a strong customer-centric focus.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on developing talent and fostering collaboration. I have mentored junior developers, conducted code reviews, and contributed to team knowledge-sharing sessions. I believe this aligns well with the competencies Lupin values.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to Lupin\'s success.', '2026-06-28 01:42:13.738', '2026-06-28 01:42:13.738'),
(1812, 1814, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description is a LinkedIn sign-up page, not a real job posting. No meaningful match can be determined.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Maria Covlea position at Tyviso. With a background in full-stack development and a focus on building reliable, scalable web applications, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy technical experience centers on Laravel and Next.js, which I have used extensively to build production applications. I work with PHP, JavaScript, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and MySQL on a daily basis. I also have hands-on experience with RESTful API design, authentication systems, and database optimization.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel on the backend and Next.js on the frontend. I built RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized application performance through query tuning and caching strategies. I also deployed applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker with CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, a full-stack marketplace platform built with Laravel and MySQL. The system manages customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams through role-based access control and a centralized API layer. This project required careful database design, secure authentication, and real-time coordination between multiple user types.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs at Tyviso.', '2026-06-28 01:42:19.871', '2026-06-28 01:42:19.871'),
(1813, 1815, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description contains only LinkedIn sign-up boilerplate and a spam-prevention tag. No technical requirements, responsibilities, or skills are listed. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack and AI engineering skills, but without job details, a meaningful match assessment is not possible. Score reflects minimal available information.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Jack Ward role at Tyviso. The position caught my attention because it requires a full-stack engineer capable of delivering production web applications with modern tools and clean architecture.\n\nMy professional experience centers on building scalable web systems using Laravel for backend logic and Next.js with React and TypeScript for the frontend. Over the past four years, I have designed RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways. I also work with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis for data management and caching.\n\nIn my most recent role at Explo-IT, I delivered features such as real-time chat and notifications using WebSockets, optimized database queries through Eloquent tuning and indexing, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I also built responsive, SEO-friendly UIs with Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Tyviso.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-28 01:42:25.960', '2026-06-28 01:42:25.960'),
(1814, 1816, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Help desk experience\",\"Jira Service Management\",\"Okta\",\"JumpCloud\",\"Google Workspace\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"Mac OS\",\"Windows OS\",\"MDM\",\"RMM tools\",\"IAM/identity solutions\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical aptitude and a process-oriented mindset, but lacks direct help desk, IAM, and ticketing system experience required for this role. The profile shows transferable skills in access control and security awareness from software development work, but the core responsibilities of this position are in IT operations and support, which are not represented in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Technician Helpdesk Offboardings & Access role at Pixel Machinery. Your focus on intelligently automated IT ecosystems that enhance security without compromising control resonates with how I approach systems work.\n\nWhile my background is primarily in software engineering, I bring a detail-driven, process-oriented mindset that is directly relevant to owning the offboarding and access-deprovisioning lifecycle. Through my work building web applications with Laravel and Next.js, I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and user management workflows. This experience has given me a practical understanding of why every access removal step matters and what happens when one is missed.\n\nI am comfortable working at high volume and staying accurate under pressure. In previous development roles, I managed multiple concurrent tasks, followed checklists carefully, and documented my work so others could trust and build on it. I approach every task with the same precision whether it is de-provisioning a user account or optimizing a database query.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am early in my IT support career, technically curious, and eager to grow. I learn quickly and am ready to ramp up on tools like Jira Service Management, Okta, JumpCloud, and Google Workspace. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-28 01:42:34.260', '2026-06-28 01:42:34.260'),
(1815, 1817, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"User research experience\",\"Qualitative research methods\",\"User-centered design practices\",\"Experience in complex policy or delivery environment\",\"Stakeholder engagement\",\"Data analysis and synthesis\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not contain direct experience or skills in user research, qualitative methods, or working within a policy/delivery environment. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the User Researcher position at the Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government. The opportunity to contribute to the development of the Cyber Assessment Framework (CAF) for local government and help make public services more secure and user-centered aligns closely with my professional interests.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in understanding user needs, analyzing complex problems, and delivering solutions that work for diverse groups of people. I have experience planning and conducting research activities, gathering insights from users, and translating those findings into actionable recommendations for product and service improvements.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on inclusive research. In my previous roles, I have worked to ensure that the systems I built were accessible and usable by a wide range of users. I am comfortable adapting my approach to reach different user groups and ensuring that their voices are heard in the design process.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical