ing knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of DSIGNS AUSTRALIA.', '2026-06-28 01:43:00.943', '2026-06-28 01:43:00.943'),
