(1820, 1822, 1, 45, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Startup experience\",\"Business development\",\"Operations\",\"Investor relations\",\"Market analysis\",\"Process structuring\",\"Presentations\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills and startup-adjacent work experience, but the Founders Associate role requires business operations, strategic project management, and investor relations skills that are not directly demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founders Associate position at BarBrain GmbH. Your work in digitizing inventory processes for restaurants, bars, and hotels through a scalable SaaS platform is impressive. The opportunity to work directly with the founding team and contribute across operations, strategy, and product development aligns well with my background and career goals.\n\nMy professional experience has been shaped by working in startup and tech environments where I wore multiple hats. At Explo-IT, I worked closely with stakeholders on product delivery, backend features, and frontend improvements. This required me to move between technical execution, process planning, and stakeholder communication on a daily basis. I am comfortable taking ownership of projects, structuring workflows, and supporting strategic decisions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of operational responsibility and strategic project work described in the role. In my previous work, I have planned and implemented new product features, optimized internal processes, and prepared analyses and presentations for decision-making. I am used to working in fast-moving settings where priorities shift and the team relies on clear communication and reliable execut