(1821, 1823, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Market analysis\",\"Competitive analysis\",\"Marketing strategy\",\"Sales strategy\",\"Content creation\",\"Process optimization\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills, but the role is focused on venture development, market analysis, partnerships, and marketing/sales strategy — areas not directly covered by the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the non-technical, business-oriented nature of the internship.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikant Venture Development position at CKM Group. Your mission to reshape healthcare through preventive medicine, eHealth, and digital diagnostics resonates with my own interest in building technology that has real human impact. I am particularly drawn to the entrepreneurial nature of this role and the opportunity to contribute to a new HealthTech venture from an early stage.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer and my studies in software engineering, I have developed a practical, analytical approach to building products. I enjoy digging into data, identifying patterns, and translating those insights into actionable strategies. Whether it was optimizing database queries for a multi-vendor e-commerce platform or designing AI-powered features for a financial app, I have consistently focused on understanding user needs and delivering solutions that work in practice.\n\nOne area where I have gained relevant experience is in supporting go-to-market efforts. While developing a travel agency platform, I worked closely with the team to understand customer behavior, localize content for multiple languages and currencies,