(1855, 1857, 1, 75, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"REST APIs\",\"Microservices\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\"]', '[]', 'Strong match for this apprenticeship. The applicant has direct professional experience with PHP, Laravel, REST APIs, microservices, and frontend development, which are the core technical requirements. The applicant also demonstrates a willingness to learn and work in a team, which aligns with the apprenticeship profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ausbildung zum Fachinformatiker/in – Anwendungsentwicklung position at ituma. Your focus on network automation, software-defined networking, and intelligent enterprise solutions aligns well with my background in full-stack development and my interest in building reliable, data-driven systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with PHP and Laravel to build and maintain web applications. I have programmed business processes, developed RESTful APIs, integrated external APIs, and worked on microservices architecture. This directly matches the core responsibilities outlined in your training program.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of frontend solutions for end customers. In previous projects, I have built responsive, SEO-friendly user interfaces using Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS, ensuring a smooth experience across devices. I also have experience with quality management through testing tools like PHPUnit and Jest.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate