gic product development and direct customer engagement. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly acted as the bridge between client requirements and technical delivery. I led requirement discussions, created proposals, and ensured that the final product aligned with business goals. I am comfortable identifying market opportunities and translating them into actionable product roadmaps.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in cloud-based product development and AI systems can contribute to tecRacer\'s contact center portfolio.', '2026-06-29 13:40:41.706', '2026-06-29 13:40:41.706'),
(1857, 1859, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"React\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Figma\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media management (LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook)\",\"Content creation (Canva, video editing)\",\"WordPress experience\",\"SEO expertise\",\"Marketing/communication studies\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant web development and design skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Next.js, Tailwind, Figma) and experience with AI tools, which partially align with the website and content creation aspects of the role. However, the core requirements of the position are in social media management, content creation with Canva, WordPress maintenance, SEO, and marketing strategy. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering rather than marketing or communications, and there is no evidence of social media management, content marketing, or WordPress experience in the profile. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) Digital Marketing & Social Media position at BEH+ Partnerschaft mbB Wirtschaftsprüfer Steuerberater. Your focus on modernizing the digital presence of a forward-thinking tax firm is something I find genuinely interesting, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to that work.\n\nThrough my hands-on project development, I have built responsive, user-focused web interfaces using technologies like Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS, and JavaScript. These projects required me to think carefully about user experience, content structure, and visual consistency. I am comfortable creating and updating website content, and I understand how SEO and clean design work together to improve digital visibility