(1859, 1861, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"TikTok Shop management\",\"eCommerce KPIs (GMV, CR, CTR, ROAS)\",\"Creator management\",\"Social commerce strategy\",\"Pricing and promotion strategies\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and eCommerce platform building, but lacks direct experience in TikTok Shop management, social commerce, creator management, and eCommerce KPIs. The role is a trainee position that does not require prior TikTok Shop experience, so the applicant\'s technical eCommerce background and willingness to learn could be relevant, but the match is low due to the non-technical, marketing-focused nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trainee eCommerce Management (TikTok Shop) position at ADBAKER. Your position as one of the leading TikTok Shop agencies in Germany and the opportunity to learn social commerce from the ground up is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and managed full-stack eCommerce platforms from the ground up. One project I led was a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem using Laravel and MySQL, where I handled product listings, catalog management, role-based access control, and order workflows. This experience gave me a solid understanding of how online marketplaces operate and how to optimize product structures for better performance.\n\nI am comfortable working with data and KPIs. In my previous roles, I regularly analyzed application performance, identified bottlenecks, and implemented improvements. I am confident I can apply the same analytical mindset to eCommerce KPIs like GMV, CR, CTR, and ROAS, and translate them into actionable 