(1860, 1862, 1, 45, '[\"Typescript\",\"C++\",\"Linux\",\"REST APIs\",\"WebSockets\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Unit Testing (Jest, PHPUnit, PyTest)\"]', '[\"Angular\",\"gRPC\",\"TCP/UDP low-level programming\",\"Sensor integration\",\"Real-time data processing\",\"Video streaming\",\"Radar or camera systems\",\"Refactoring techniques (SOLID) explicitly demonstrated\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has foundational skills in TypeScript, C++, Linux, REST APIs, WebSockets, and unit testing that partially match the job requirements. However, the role specifically requires Angular (not in profile), gRPC, low-level TCP/UDP programming, sensor integration, real-time data processing, and experience with radar/camera systems — none of which are demonstrated in the provided profile. The match is moderate but lacks several core technical requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer (Angular / TypeScript / C++) position at K-tronik GmbH. Your work in the defense and aerospace sector, particularly on complex sensor systems and real-time data processing, aligns closely with the kind of technically demanding systems I enjoy building.\n\nThrough professional development work and hands-on projects, I have built a strong foundation in TypeScript and C++, combined with practical experience on Linux-based environments. I have developed frontend interfaces using modern web technologies and built backend components that handle real-time data streaming, API integration, and system-level communication. My work has consistently involved writing clean, maintainable code and applying SOLID design principles.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of heterogeneous sensor systems and