(1861, 1863, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Scrum/SAFe experience\",\"German language (C1)\",\"Technical leadership/mentoring experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong technical skills in modern JavaScript frameworks (React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js), backend development (Laravel, Express.js, PHP), cloud technologies (AWS, Google Cloud, Docker, Kubernetes), and microservices. He has 4 years of professional web development experience. However, the job requires Java knowledge, agile methodology experience (Scrum/SAFe), technical leadership/mentoring experience, and fluent German (C1 level), which are not present in his profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Full Stack Developer position at Pertemps ERP. Your focus on designing modern cloud-native applications and guiding development teams aligns with my experience in building scalable full-stack systems and collaborating on technical decisions.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with modern JavaScript frameworks including React, Next.js, and TypeScript for frontend development, and Node.js, Laravel, and Express.js for backend services. I have designed and implemented microservice architectures, containerized applications using Docker, and deployed them on cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud. This background directly supports your requirement for strong JavaScript framework knowledge and cloud-native development.\n\nA relevant example is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem I built using Laravel and Flutter, where I designed the entire REST API layer, implemented role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and deployed the system with Docker and Nginx on a cloud server. This project required coordinating between multiple frontend applications and a centralized backend, similar to the cross-team collaboration and architectural decisions this role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my full-stack development experience can contribute to Pertemps ERP\'s cloud-native projects.', '2026-06-29 13:41:26.896', '2026-06-29 13:41:26.896'),
(1862, 1864, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"SAP\",\"SAP S/4HANA\",\"SAP ERP\",\"Project Management\",\"Workshop Moderation\",\"Stakeholder Management\",\"Test Management\",\"Budget Planning\",\"Risk Management\",\"Agile Project Management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is focused on full-stack web development and AI engineering, with no SAP or project management experience. The match score is low because the job requires senior SAP project management expertise, which is not present in the candidate\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior SAP Project Manager position at Pertemps ERP. Your organization\'s role in driving SAP S/4HANA and ERP transformation projects across an international network is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the continued expansion of your project landscape in Germany.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have led the delivery of multiple full-stack applications from initial scoping through to production deployment. This has given me practical experience in defining project goals, managing deliverables, coordinating resources, and maintaining clear communication with stakeholders. I have worked in both agile and structured environments, adapting project management approaches to fit the specific needs of each engagement.\n\nA significant part of my work has involved moderating workshops to clarify requirements between business teams and technical teams, managing testing phases, and overseeing quality assurance until go-live and stabilization. I have also been responsible for risk identification, escalation management, and ensuring that documentation and governance standards are maintained throughout the project lifecy