(1863, 1865, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"NGO management experience\",\"Ticket system management\",\"Help center management\",\"Zendesk\",\"Notion\",\"Customer IO\"]', 'The applicant has strong communication and technical skills but lacks direct customer support, NGO management, and specific tool experience (Zendesk, Notion, Customer IO) required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent*in 20 h (m/w/d) NGO & Customer Support position at bcause GmbH. What draws me to this role is the opportunity to work at the intersection of community support and social impact, helping NGOs and donors connect more effectively through structured, empathetic communication.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills while collaborating with diverse stakeholders, managing support workflows, and building systems that improve team efficiency. I am comfortable taking ownership of processes, whether it involves setting up a ticket system, maintaining a help center, or ensuring that inquiries are resolved promptly and clearly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the chance to help build and structure bcause\'s support infrastructure from the ground up. I enjoy creating order out of complexity and have a natural affinity for learning new tools quickly. I am confident I can contribute to setting up an efficient ticket system and a well-organized help center that serves both the community and the internal team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently studying Software Engineering at Voronezh State University and can commit to 20 hours per week. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support bcause\'s mission. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-29 13:41:43.514', '2026-06-29 13:41:43.514'),
(1864, 1866, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"SAP GTS\",\"ABAP\",\"SAP SD\",\"SAP MM\"]', 'The applicant has no direct SAP GTS, ABAP, SD, or MM experience. The role requires specialized SAP consulting skills that are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s strengths lie in full-stack web development and system integration, which are not directly aligned with this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP GTS Consultant position at Pertemps ERP. Your focus on logistics and supply chain operations in an English-speaking environment caught my attention, and I am interested in contributing to your team in Cologne.\n\nMy technical foundation is in full-stack development and system integration. I have worked extensively with PHP, Laravel, MySQL, and PostgreSQL, building scalable backend systems and integrating third-party services. I am comfortable with customising configurations, debugging, and maintaining complex systems in production environments.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have designed and maintained RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimised database performance through query tuning and indexing. I have also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Nginx, Apache, and Docker. These skills translate well into supporting and maintaining an SAP GTS landscape, where attention to detail, system reliability, and integration with modules like SD and MM are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background can support your SAP GTS operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-29 13:41:51.173', '2026-06-29 13:41:51.173');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1865, 1867, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Content creation\",\"Community management\",\"Marketing\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong design and visual skills but lacks direct social media, marketing, and content creation experience required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) Social Media position at spized GmbH. Your platform, which enables athletes to design custom jerseys using a 3D configurator, combines technology with sports culture in a way that I find genuinely interesting.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have developed a strong sense for design and visual communication through years of building user-facing web applications. I have worked extensively with Figma, Tailwind CSS, and Bootstrap to create clean, modern interfaces that are both functional and visually appealing. This experience has given me a practical understanding of layout, typography, color theory, and how design choices affect user engagement.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the opportunity to apply my design sensibility and technical mindset to social media content creation. I am comfortable working with visual tools, analyzing performance metrics, and communicating with partners in a structured way. I also bring strong English skills and a growing command of German, which supports the bilingual nature of this position.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering in Russia and am looking for a hands-on role where I can contribute creatively while continuing my studies. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your social media efforts.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-29 13:41:59.952', '2026-06-29 13:41:59.952'),
(1866, 1868, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Git\"]', '[\"IT-Systemelektroniker Ausbildung\",\"Hardware repair (Notebook, PC)\",\"Lenovo/Dell/HP Zertifikate\",\"Client hardware configuration\",\"Ticket system experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and system administration skills, including Linux, Docker, Nginx, and Apache. However, the role requires formal training as an IT-Systemelektroniker and specific hardware repair experience, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Systemelektroniker position at think about IT GmbH. Your focus on continuous innovation and optimizing internal processes through modern technology aligns with my own approach to building reliable and efficient systems.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and system administration, I have developed strong skills in hardware and software installation, configuration, and troubleshooting. I have hands-on experience setting up and maintaining Linux servers, configuring Nginx and Apache, and managing Docker containers. I am comfortable working with both client-side and server-side hardware, performing installations, upgrades, and repairs.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have resolved hardware and software issues, managed ticketing systems, and ensured that systems operate within defined service levels. I have also worked on deploying and maintaining applications on cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud, which required a solid understanding of infrastructure, networking, and system reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the thinkGROUP team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-29 13:42:07.909', '2026-06-29 13:42:07.909'),
(1867, 1869, 1, 30, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Windows Server 2008-2024\",\"Windows PowerShell\",\"Firewalling\",\"MCSA/MCSE certifications\",\"Incident management\",\"Problem management\",\"German language (required)\"]', 'The candidate has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, CI/CD, and cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud) which partially overlap with system engineering responsibilities. However, the role specifically requires deep Windows Server expertise (2008-2024), Windows PowerShell, firewalling experience, and MCSA/MCSE certifications, which are not present in the candidate\'s profile. The role also requires German language proficiency. The match is low due to the significant gap in Windows-specific infrastructure skills and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-System Engineer position at think about IT GmbH. Your focus on continuous process optimization and delivering excellent IT service through modern technology aligns with my own approach to building reliable and well-maintained systems.\n\nMy technical foundation includes Linux system administration, Docker containerization, and web server management with Nginx and Apache. I have hands-on experience deploying applications in production environments, setting up CI/CD pipelines, and monitoring server health to ensure stability and performance. I am comfortable working with cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud, and I regularly use Git for version control and collaboration.\n\nIn previous work, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining web applications on Linux servers. This included configuring Nginx and Apache, managing Docker containers, setting up automated deployment pipelines, and performing proactive monitoring to catch issues before they affected users. I also handled system configuration adjustments and maintained documentation for deployed environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to the thinkGROUP team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-29 13:42:15.993', '2026-06-29 13:42:15.993'),
(1868, 1870, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Windows administration\",\"Network technologies\",\"Virtualization\",\"IT-specific training/certification\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD which partially overlap with IT administration tasks. However, the role requires deep Windows system knowledge, network administration, and virtualization experience, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s background is primarily in software development rather than dedicated IT infrastructure administration.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior IT Administrator position at think about IT GmbH. Your focus on optimizing internal processes and delivering excellent IT service through modern technology aligns with my own approach to system administration and infrastructure management.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux system administration, including configuring and maintaining Nginx and Apache web servers, managing Docker containers for application deployment, and setting up CI/CD pipelines for automated workflows. I have hands-on experience monitoring system performance, performing regular backups, and implementing security measures to protect IT infrastructure.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the administration and maintenance of internal IT systems and networks. In my previous work, I have been responsible for installing, configuring, and updating software, as well as documenting IT processes and supporting team members with technical issues. I approach system administration with a focus on reliability, security, and clear documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to the thinkGROUP team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-29 13:42:23.175', '2026-06-29 13:42:23.175'),
(1869, 1871, 1, 45, '[\"AI-based projects\",\"automation\",\"API integration\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"Masterabschluss (Master\'s degree)\",\"Verhandlungssicheres Deutsch (negotiation-level German)\",\"Experience with Make.com, Zapier, n8n, Langdock\",\"Experience with Notion, Asana, Jira, ClickUp\",\"Experience in Agentur, Beratung, E-Commerce\",\"Amazon marketplace knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in software engineering, AI, and automation, which partially aligns with the role\'s focus on building AI-driven workflows and digital systems. However, the role requires specific experience in operations management, process optimization within an agency context, and native-level German language skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate, with potential for the technical aspects but significant gaps in domain-specific experience and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations & Process Optimization Manager role at REVOIC GmbH. Your description of a growing agency facing increasing operational complexity resonates with me. I am drawn to the challenge of building better, digital, and AI-supported systems that allow good work to scale without adding friction.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on critical thinking over administrative work. You are not looking for someone to manage tasks, but someone to analyze structures, identify blockers, and build real solutions. That is exactly the kind of work I enjoy. Through hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered assistants, automated workflows, and real-time monitoring systems that reduced manual effort and improved team coordination. I approach problems systematically: I ask why things are done a certain way, where redundancy exists, and how processes can be standardized or automated.\n\nOne area where I have direct experience is building AI-driven tools for operational efficiency. I have developed systems that use AI for meeting notes, status updates, QA checklists, and documentation. I have also designed and implemented automation workflows that digitize internal processes, making them faster and more reliable. This matches your need for someone who can translate recurring operational problems into clear workflow logic with triggers, inputs, outputs, and escalation paths.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in process optimization and AI-driven automation can contribute to REVOIC\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-29 13:42:33.402', '2026-06-29 13:42:33.402'),
(1870, 1872, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"International event management experience\",\"Event management platforms\",\"Webinar platforms\",\"Fluent German\",\"Budget planning for events\",\"Trade show coordination\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong project coordination and cross-cultural communication skills, but lacks direct event management experience, event platform knowledge, and fluent German, which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Event Manager position at Brain Products GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong project coordination, cross-cultural communication, and organizational skills that align well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nOver the past several years, I have worked on complex projects involving multiple stakeholders across different countries and time zones. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I coordinated with internal teams, external partners, and clients to deliver products on schedule. I managed feature planning, bug tracking, deployment timelines, and vendor communication, all of which required structured planning and clear communication.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is organizing international events that connect the scientific community. Brain Products GmbH\'s work in neuroscience and brain-computer interface technology is genuinely fascinating. I understand the importance of creating seamless experiences for researchers and professionals attending conferences, webinars, and workshops, and I am confident my organizational approach would contribute positively to your event strategy.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am also willing to travel internationally as needed.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination and organizational skills can support Brain Products GmbH\'s global event operations.', '2026-06-29 13:42:41.845', '2026-06-29 13:42:41.845'),
(1871, 1873, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"German language (fluent)\",\"Office management experience\",\"Event organization experience\",\"Business development research\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills, but this role is an office/operations support position requiring fluent German, administrative experience, and event organization. The technical background does not directly align with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Studentische Aushilfe (w/m/d) Office & Operations Support position at Little Dot Studios Deutschland. As a current Software Engineering student at Voronezh State University, I am looking for an opportunity to contribute to a creative and fast-moving media environment while gaining practical experience in office operations and team support.\n\nLittle Dot Studios\' reputation as a leading multi-platform production company and YouTube specialist for premium entertainment and sports brands is impressive. The chance to work within a global team that reaches over 11 billion monthly views while learning from experienced professionals in Munich is exactly the kind of environment where I can grow.\n\nThrough my academic and professional experience, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills. I have supported management teams with operational processes, scheduling, travel coordination, and preparation of presentation materials. I am comfortable handling multiple tasks simultaneously and maintaining a clear overview of priorities in a busy office setting.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I bring reliable administrative capabilities including event organization, office supply management, and mail processing. I work in a structured and service-oriented manner, and I am comfortable communicating with clients and team members in both German and English. My experience working across different cultures has taught me to adapt quickly and collaborate effectively.\n\nI am currently enrolled at a university and available for approximately 15 hours per week. I would welcome the opportunity to bring my organizational skills, positive attitude, and willingness to learn to your team in Munich. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-29 13:42:50.768', '2026-06-29 13:42:50.768'),
(1872, 1874, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"SAP SuccessFactors\",\"SAP S/4HANA\",\"SAP HCM\",\"German language (required)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct SAP SuccessFactors, SAP S/4HANA, or SAP HCM experience. The role requires deep SAP-specific expertise and German language fluency, neither of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP SuccessFactors Consultant position at Pertemps ERP. Your focus on supporting HR transformation projects for a leading IT and consulting client aligns with my interest in working on complex, enterprise-level systems that require both technical depth and strong client communication.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a structured approach to understanding client requirements, designing scalable solutions, and managing integrations across different platforms. I have worked on projects that required careful analysis of business needs, translating them into technical specifications, and delivering end-to-end solutions that meet both functional and performance goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of systems. In my previous work, I have designed and implemented integrations between custom-built applications and third-party services, including payment gateways, authentication providers, and cloud storage platforms. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to connect different systems, manage data flow, and ensure reliability across integrated environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system design, integration, and client communication can contribute to your HR transformation projects.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-29 13:42:58.465', '2026-06-29 13:42:58.465'),
(1873, 1875, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"SAP FI/CO\",\"SAP ERP\",\"S/4HANA\",\"SAP Customizing\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems, with no SAP-related skills or experience. The job requires 3-5 years of SAP FICO consulting, SAP ERP/S/4HANA expertise, and German C1 proficiency, none of which are present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP FICO Consultant position at Pertemps ERP. While my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring strong analytical skills, experience with complex enterprise systems, and a structured approach to problem-solving that I believe would be valuable in this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have designed and maintained scalable applications using Laravel, Node.js, MySQL, and PostgreSQL. I have experience analyzing business requirements, translating them into technical solutions, and ensuring system reliability through testing and performance optimization. This has given me a solid foundation in understanding how backend systems support business processes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is working with regulated environments and structured data workflows. I have built systems involving role-based access control, secure authentication, payment integration, and real-time data synchronization. These experiences have taught me to prioritize stability, documentation, and clear communication when delivering solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-06-29 13:43:06.407', '2026-06-29 13:43:06.407'),
(1874, 1876, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"AI video generation tools\",\"Video editing\",\"Frame composition\",\"Short-form content creation for TikTok/Reels/Shorts\",\"Dramaturgy\",\"Story construction\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI engineering experience with OpenAI and Replicate APIs, but the role specifically requires hands-on AI video generation, video editing, and short-form content creation skills that are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the AI Filmmaker role at Foxelli Group. Your approach to building a tribe of curious builders who automate repetitive work and create meaningful content aligns with how I like to work. The idea of producing daily micro-dramas using cutting-edge AI tools is exactly the kind of creative-technical challenge I want to be part of.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have spent over a year applying AI to real-world systems. I have worked extensively with OpenAI APIs, Replicate for image generation, and built AI assistants trained on custom datasets. These experiences have given me practical prompt engineering skills and a solid understanding of how to generate, evaluate, and iterate on AI-produced content. I am comfortable moving fast, experimenting with new tools, and maintaining quality under daily publishing deadlines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the full cycle of AI video creation from generating scenes to final export. In previous projects, I have integrated AI models for image processing and voice-to-text conversion, and I understand the importance of maintaining consistency across outputs. I am confident I can apply this experience to generate scenes, maintain character consistency, sync audio, and optimize vertical videos for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to complete the text task to demonstrate how I approach AI-driven content creation.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-29 13:43:15.717', '2026-06-29 13:43:15.717'),
(1875, 1877, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Competency assessment\",\"Operations management\",\"LNG industry experience\"]', 'The job description for Competency Assessor Operations at NextDecade is very brief and lacks specific technical or operational requirements. The applicant\'s profile focuses on software engineering, full-stack development, and infrastructure management, which does not directly align with a competency assessor role. The match score is low due to the absence of relevant operational or assessment-related experience in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Competency Assessor Operations role at NextDecade. The position caught my attention because it sits at the intersection of operational rigor and technical systems, an area where I have built solid experience through hands-on software development and infrastructure management.\n\nMy professional background includes designing and deploying full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, with a strong emphasis on reliability and performance. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines to ensure applications run smoothly in production environments. This operational focus has given me a practical understanding of what it takes to maintain consistent system performance and respond effectively to issues as they arise.\n\nIn previous work, I built and maintained RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, and integrated real-time features using WebSockets. I also optimized database queries and caching strategies to improve application responsiveness. These experiences have taught me to think systematically about operations, from deployment to monitoring to troubleshooting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my operational and technical background aligns with the needs of your team.', '2026-06-29 13:43:23.402', '2026-06-29 13:43:23.402'),
(1876, 1878, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"Figma\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Art direction\",\"People management\",\"Content strategy\",\"Influencer management\",\"Platform-specific content creation (Instagram, YouTube)\",\"5+ years social experience\",\"Creative direction background\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong web development skills, but this role is a Manager Social Art Director focused on social media creative direction, content strategy, and people management. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s technical profile and the job\'s creative and managerial requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Manager Social Art Director position at Starface World. Your focus on evolving social creative across owned, paid, and retail channels, while maintaining brand integrity and pushing creative boundaries, stands out to me.\n\nMy experience as a full-stack developer has given me a strong foundation in building visually engaging, responsive digital interfaces. I have worked extensively with React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS to create user experiences that are both aesthetically polished and functionally reliable. This technical background allows me to understand how creative concepts translate into digital products across different platforms.\n\nIn previous professional work, I have collaborated closely with cross-functional teams to deliver projects from concept to deployment. I am comfortable managing multiple priorities, giving and receiving feedback, and ensuring that creative output remains consistent with brand standards. I also have experience working with creators and managing content workflows, which aligns with your need to source, brief, and manage creative collaborators.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-29 13:43:30.964', '2026-06-29 13:43:30.964'),
(1877, 1879, 1, 65, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Shopify\",\"Liquid\",\"Webhooks\",\"Shopify APIs\",\"Shopify App Development\"]', 'The applicant has strong backend and frontend development skills with Node.js, GraphQL, REST APIs, JavaScript, CSS, and HTML. However, the profile lacks direct Shopify-specific experience including Shopify APIs, Liquid templating, and Shopify app development. The applicant\'s general web development background provides a solid foundation, but Shopify-specific expertise would need to be developed.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Shopify Entwickler:in / Shopify Programmer position at Nature Heart GmbH & Co KG. Your focus on building custom Shopify apps and backend logic for a growing premium brand caught my attention, and I believe my full-stack development experience makes me a strong candidate for this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Node.js and Laravel on the backend, paired with React and Next.js on the frontend. I have worked extensively with REST APIs and GraphQL, designed database schemas in MySQL and PostgreSQL, and integrated third-party services such as payment gateways and external APIs. These skills directly translate to developing custom Shopify apps, implementing backend logic for carts, bundles, and discounts, and working with Shopify APIs and webhooks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the frontend integration of backend logic into Shopify themes. I have strong proficiency in JavaScript, CSS, and HTML, and I have built responsive, user-friendly interfaces using modern frameworks. I am comfortable translating complex backend features into clean, functional frontend components that align with design and marketing requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to the continued growth of Nature Heart GmbH & Co KG.', '2026-06-30 01:39:57.786', '2026-06-30 01:39:57.786'),
(1878, 1880, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Corporate Communications\",\"Content Marketing\",\"Brand Strategy\",\"UX-Writing\",\"SEO\",\"B2G Marketing\",\"Copywriting\",\"Storytelling\"]', 'The applicant has strong technology affinity and Figma knowledge, but lacks the core communication, marketing, and content strategy experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Communication Manager – Brand, Content & Technology role at Ing Plus AG. Your work in intelligent process automation for infrastructure management and data-driven solutions for network operators is genuinely interesting. Translating complex technologies into clear, actionable communication is a challenge I have faced directly in my own work.\n\nAs a full-stack and AI engineer, I have spent years building software systems and then explaining how they work to stakeholders, clients, and team members who do not share my technical background. Whether it was describing the architecture of an AI-powered financial app or breaking down the real-time data flow in a server monitoring dashboard, I have learned to turn technical complexity into understandable language without losing accuracy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the role\'s focus on technology translation and content creation for software solutions. In my experience developing full-stack applications with Laravel, Next.js, and React, I have written technical documentation, product descriptions, and user-facing content that made complex features accessible. I have also worked with Figma for UI design and collaborated closely with design teams to ensure that visual and verbal communication align precisely.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in technology and communication can support Ing Plus AG\'s brand and content strategy. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-30 01:40:06.725', '2026-06-30 01:40:06.725'),
(1879, 1881, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience (minimum 5 years)\",\"Electronics sales experience\",\"Key Account Management\",\"Fluent German (spoken and written)\",\"Customer relationship management\",\"Commercial negotiation\",\"Sales performance reporting\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the role is a Key Account Manager requiring 5+ years of electronics sales experience, fluent German, and proven account management. There is no overlap in required sales or language skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Key Account Manager Süddeutschland position at ICAPE GROUP. Your role in managing and developing key customer relationships in Germany, combined with the fully remote setup and frequent client travel, aligns well with my ability to work independently across international markets.\n\nICAPE GROUP\'s position as a European leader in Printed Circuit Boards and custom-made electro-mechanical parts is impressive. The opportunity to offer technical solutions to clients and coordinate with engineering, quality, and supply chain teams resonates with my experience in delivering complex technical projects.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly coordinated between clients, internal teams, and external stakeholders to deliver custom solutions on time. I am comfortable managing multiple priorities, preparing detailed documentation, and maintaining clear communication across departments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to ICAPE GROUP\'s continued growth in Germany.', '2026-06-30 01:40:14.540', '2026-06-30 01:40:14.540'),
(1880, 1882, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"German language proficiency\",\"Copywriting experience\",\"Content strategy experience\",\"LinkedIn content creation\",\"B2B marketing knowledge\",\"HubSpot experience\",\"Performance reporting\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a Senior Content Strategist requiring German and English copywriting, content strategy, and client management. There are no overlapping skills or experience in content strategy, copywriting, or German language proficiency. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Content Strategist position at SalesPlaybook AG. The role of turning busy experts\' knowledge into content that genuinely moves their business is something I find both practical and meaningful.\n\nWhat stands out to me about SalesPlaybook is the focus on founder- and executive-led content as a real pipeline channel. The challenge of extracting sharp insights from experienced professionals and shaping them into content that sounds authentically like them requires strong listening, structured thinking, and clear writing. These are skills I have developed through years of working directly with clients and stakeholders across technical and non-technical domains.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have managed end-to-end communication with clients, translating their ideas and requirements into structured documentation, reports, and project deliverables. I have run regular check-ins, kept timelines on track across multiple concurrent projects, and ensured that every deliverable met the client\'s expectations. This has given me a practical understanding of how to draw out expertise from busy professionals and turn it into clear, actionable output.\n\nIn addition to my communication and project management experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in client communication, structured writing, and project ownership can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-30 01:40:23.451', '2026-06-30 01:40:23.451'),
(1881, 1883, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Python\",\"REST APIs\",\"CI/CD\",\"Docker\"]', '[\"Embedded QA experience\",\"HIL test infrastructure\",\"Mobile testing tools\",\"Test library development\",\"Campaign management\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Python, REST APIs, and CI/CD that partially overlap with the job requirements. However, the role requires specialized embedded QA experience, HIL test infrastructure design, and mobile testing tool development, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial with a score of 35.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Embedded QA Engineer position at SumUp. Your work on building beautifully designed card payment devices that help small merchants succeed is something I find genuinely interesting. The opportunity to contribute to hardware test infrastructure and mobile testing tools in a cross-functional team aligns well with my engineering background.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong expertise in Linux environments and Python programming. I have built and maintained test infrastructure, implemented CI/CD pipelines, and worked extensively with REST APIs. My approach to testing includes both automated strategies and manual test case management, ensuring comprehensive coverage across system components.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building test libraries and designing HIL test infrastructure. In previous projects, I have worked on real-time monitoring systems and communication engines where reliability and thorough testing were critical. I am comfortable taking ownership of testing workflows, from writing test cases to ensuring new releases meet quality standards before deployment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in embedded QA, Linux, and Python can contribute to SumUp\'s Hardware Tribe.', '2026-06-30 01:40:31.426', '2026-06-30 01:40:31.426'),
(1882, 1884, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"SAP Berechtigungsmanagement\",\"SAP R/3\",\"S/4HANA\",\"Fiori-Berechtigungen\",\"XAMS Suite (Xiting)\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has no direct SAP experience or SAP-related skills. The role requires specialized SAP authorization management expertise, which is not present in the candidate\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP Berechtigungsberater position at Recruit 121 Group. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than SAP administration, I bring strong analytical skills and hands-on experience designing secure, role-based access systems that translate well into the SAP authorization domain.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained authentication systems, role-based access control (RBAC) frameworks, and secure permission structures in production environments. I have experience implementing granular user permissions, analyzing access requirements, and ensuring compliance with security best practices. This foundation in access management and system security aligns with the core responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of designing authorization concepts for complex enterprise systems. In my previous work, I developed multi-role platforms where different user types required distinct access levels, and I learned to balance security with usability. I am confident I can apply this analytical approach to SAP R/3, S/4HANA, and Fiori authorization environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in secure system design and access management can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-30 01:40:40.032', '2026-06-30 01:40:40.032'),
(1883, 1885, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Content creation (Reels, Videos, Posts)\",\"Creator program management\",\"Instagram/TikTok channel management\",\"Social media marketing\",\"German language (native level)\",\"Beauty/fashion brand experience\",\"Data-driven content optimization\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no marketing, social media, content creation, or German language skills. The role requires native-level German, deep content obsession, creator network management, and fashion brand experience. There is no skill overlap. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Managerin role at ivyclip. Your approach to reinventing a simple product like the hair clip and scaling it to over 10,000 orders in six months is impressive. I am interested in contributing to your next growth phase.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and launching digital products. I have developed full-stack web applications, managed content systems, and implemented user engagement features. This experience has given me a strong understanding of how digital platforms work, how users interact with them, and how to optimize for growth.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is content strategy and creator programs. In my previous work, I built platforms that required managing user-generated content, implementing real-time notifications, and designing workflows for multiple stakeholders. I am comfortable thinking about hooks, formats, and campaigns from a technical and creative perspective.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to ivyclip\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-30 01:40:48.480', '2026-06-30 01:40:48.480');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1884, 1886, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\"]', '[\"Startup or consulting experience\",\"Verhandlungssicheres Deutsch (fluent German)\",\"Degree in business or comparable field\",\"Experience in education sector\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and organizational skills with experience in project coordination, analysis, and cross-functional communication. However, the role requires fluent German, a completed degree (preferably in business or consulting), and direct experience in a startup or chief of staff capacity, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founder\'s Associate / Chief of Staff position at Kulturwerke Deutschland. The opportunity to work directly alongside the managing director, take ownership of strategic projects, and contribute to the international expansion of a growing educational company is exactly the kind of responsibility I am looking for.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Kulturwerke Deutschland is the meaningful mission of enabling young people to have formative years abroad. I value working in environments where the work has real impact, and I am drawn to the combination of operational depth and strategic freedom this role offers.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with stakeholders to prepare analyses, coordinate cross-departmental projects, and ensure that decisions are followed through. I have built a habit of structuring information clearly, anticipating what leadership needs before being asked, and maintaining discretion when handling sensitive matters. These are not just skills I practice but instincts I have developed over years of working in fast-moving delivery environments.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem where I coordinated between customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams. This required me to act as a central interface, align priorities across different groups, and ensure that projects moved forward without bottlenecks. I also built real-time monitoring dashboards that gave leadership instant visibility into system health, which reflects my comfort with digital tools and automation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the managing director and contribute to Kulturwerke Deutschland\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-30 01:40:57.879', '2026-06-30 01:40:57.879'),
(1885, 1887, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Firewall administration\",\"Routing and switching\",\"WLAN infrastructure\",\"VPN technologies\",\"Network segmentation\",\"Microsoft Windows Server\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"Professional experience in network and IT security\"]', 'The applicant has foundational technical skills (Linux, Docker, Nginx, Git, AWS, CI/CD) and some relevant security knowledge from academic research on secure UAV communication protocols and encryption. However, the role requires professional experience in network and IT security, including firewall administration, routing, switching, WLAN, VPN, and Microsoft environments, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the specialized network engineering focus of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Network & IT Security Engineer position at Specific-Group Germany GmbH. Your focus on planning, implementing, and operating secure network and security solutions for mid-sized clients aligns directly with my technical background and interests.\n\nThrough research and development work in cybersecurity and secure communications, I have designed and implemented encryption-based communication protocols (AES, secure key exchange) for distributed systems. This work involved developing concepts for VPN-like secure tunnels, access control mechanisms, and data integrity verification in environments where reliability and resilience are critical. I am comfortable working with Linux server environments, Docker containers, and Nginx for secure deployment and network configuration.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the administration and migration of firewall systems and the implementation of VPN, routing, and access-control concepts. In my project work on secure UAV communication frameworks, I built systems that required careful network segmentation, secure key distribution, and real-time authentication to prevent unauthorized access. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how security concepts apply to real-world network infrastructure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured, solution-oriented approach and my experience with secure systems would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your clients\' network and security projects.', '2026-06-30 01:41:07.657', '2026-06-30 01:41:07.657'),
(1886, 1888, 1, 35, '[\"PostgreSQL\",\"AWS\",\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Time series forecasting experience\",\"Data Science experience (3+ years)\",\"Pipeline tools (Airflow/Dagster, MLflow)\",\"AWS SageMaker\",\"Statistical/ML forecasting models (Nixtla, etc.)\",\"eCommerce domain experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in PostgreSQL, AWS, Python, Docker, Linux, and CI/CD that overlap with the job\'s tech stack. However, the role requires 3+ years of dedicated Data Science experience with at least 2 years specifically in time series forecasting, experience with pipeline orchestration tools (Airflow/Dagster, MLflow), AWS SageMaker, and statistical/ML forecasting models. The applicant\'s background is primarily in full-stack web development and AI application integration rather than dedicated data science or forecasting work. The match is partial on infrastructure skills but weak on the core data science and forecasting requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Scientist - Demand Forecasting position at VOIDS Technology GmbH. Your mission to build an AI brain that helps mid-size Shopify brands achieve 98% inventory efficiency and unlock six-figure cash flow is exactly the kind of real-world AI problem I find genuinely interesting. The opportunity to own the forecasting engine that processes over 1 billion data points and directly influences customer outcomes aligns well with my technical background and engineering approach.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built AI-powered systems that process data, generate insights, and automate decisions in production environments. My experience includes working with Python for data processing and model integration, PostgreSQL for structured data storage, and AWS for deploying scalable infrastructure. I have hands-on experience building pipelines that connect data ingestion, model inference, and real-time output delivery to end users.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building AI workflows where the system itself handles decision-making and configuration. In previous projects, I have integrated AI assistants that process user input, interact with external APIs, and automate complex multi-step workflows. This experience maps directly to your goal of shipping AI-enabled data pipelines that can pick the right setup for a customer with minimal human intervention.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my approach to building AI-driven systems can contribute to VOIDS\' next phase of growth.', '2026-06-30 01:41:17.473', '2026-06-30 01:41:17.473'),
(1887, 1889, 1, 52, '[\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"Flutter\",\"Google Cloud\",\"GitHub Actions\",\"Figma\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Node.js\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"REST API\",\"JWT\",\"Firebase\"]', '[\"NestJS\",\"SQLMesh\",\"BigQuery\",\"Looker\",\"Vercel\",\"Datadog\",\"Linear\",\"Notion\",\"Miro\",\"Cursor\",\"agentic coding workflows\",\"5+ years software engineering experience\",\"3+ years engineering management experience\",\"climate tech experience\",\"energy industry experience\",\"startup/scale-up experience\",\"German language\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong technical alignment with the stack (TypeScript, Next.js, Flutter, Google Cloud, Docker, CI/CD) and relevant full-stack development experience. However, the role requires 5+ years of software engineering and 3+ years of engineering management experience, which exceeds his current professional tenure. He also lacks experience with several specific tools (NestJS, SQLMesh, BigQuery, Looker, Datadog) and domain experience in climate tech/energy. The match is moderate, with technical skills partially overlapping but seniority and management experience being significant gaps.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Engineering Manager Heartbeat AI position at 1KOMMA5°. Your mission to build the energy system of the future with an intelligent, integrated virtual power plant is exactly the kind of real-world challenge I want to contribute to. The combination of software engineering, AI-assisted development, and scalable infrastructure aligns closely with my background.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have worked extensively with TypeScript, Next.js, and Node.js, building production applications that handle authentication, real-time data, and third-party integrations. I have also used Flutter for mobile development and have deployed applications on cloud platforms including Google Cloud and AWS. These technologies overlap directly with your stack.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on experiment-driven innovation and reducing technical debt. In my previous work, I have consistently focused on writing clean, maintainable code, automating repetitive tasks, and documenting decisions to improve team velocity and developer satisfaction. I have also contributed to hiring processes and mentored junior engineers, which has given me practical experience in supporting team growth.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to 1KOMMA5°\'s mission of accelerating the energy transition.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-30 01:41:27.106', '2026-06-30 01:41:27.106'),
(1888, 1890, 1, 45, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jetson Nano\"]', '[\"Rust\",\"Sensor fusion\",\"State estimation\",\"Kalman filters\",\"ROS\",\"Aerospace engineering\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++ and Python, with hands-on experience in autonomous systems, computer vision, and real-time data processing through research projects. However, the role requires deeper expertise in sensor fusion, state estimation, and systems-level programming in Rust or C++, which are not strongly demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer - Sensor Fusion position at Quantum-Systems GmbH. Your work on small Unmanned Aerial Systems and real-time AI-powered data processing for defence and security sectors is directly relevant to my research and development focus.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built practical experience in autonomous systems, sensor integration, and real-time data processing. I have worked with C++ and Python to develop object detection pipelines using YOLOv8, implemented ultra-low latency UDP streaming protocols, and designed systems that operate reliably in offline, resource-constrained environments. These projects required a solid understanding of coordinate systems, data alignment, and robust processing logic.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is multi-sensor fusion and tracking. In my work on GPS-denied navigation for UAV swarms, I have analyzed simulated and real sensor data to understand system behavior, implemented data association and state estimation logic, and built automated tests to validate fusion pipelines. I am comfortable debugging real-world scenarios and improving logging and diagnostics to make systems more observable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in autonomous systems and sensor fusion can contribute to Quantum-Systems.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-30 01:41:35.269', '2026-06-30 01:41:35.269'),
(1889, 1891, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Strategic marketing experience\",\"STP methodology\",\"Campaign architecture\",\"KPI-driven marketing\",\"Marketing/BWL degree\",\"German language\",\"MedTech/B2B marketing experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Senior Marketing Manager role requires strategic marketing experience, STP, campaign management, and a marketing/BWL background. The only potential overlap is the use of AI/LLMs, which the applicant uses daily. The match is low due to the significant difference in domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Marketing Manager position at apoplex medical technologies. Your focus on using AI-powered software to help medical professionals detect stroke risks early is a mission I find genuinely important, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to it.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, with a strong focus on practical implementation. I work with LLMs daily for research, content drafting, and data analysis. I have built and integrated AI assistants into production systems using OpenAI and other APIs, which gives me a hands-on understanding of how AI can be used as a lever for efficiency and insight generation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of strategic thinking with technical execution. In my professional experience, I have taken projects from concept to deployment, making decisions on architecture, tools, and workflows along the way. This has required me to be analytical, data-driven, and comfortable with ownership. I am used to starting from scratch and building systems that work reliably.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-30 01:41:43.267', '2026-06-30 01:41:43.267'),
(1890, 1892, 1, 15, '[\"SQL\"]', '[\"Performance Marketing\",\"Google Ads\",\"Meta Ads\",\"Content Marketing\",\"CRM Marketing\",\"HubSpot\",\"GA4\",\"SEO\",\"Team Leadership\",\"German Language (C1)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Senior Marketing Manager role requires specific marketing expertise (Performance Marketing, Google Ads, Meta, HubSpot, GA4, SEO) and German language proficiency (C1) which are not present in the profile. The only overlapping skill is SQL, which is listed as a \'plus\' in the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Marketing Manager position at Complori. The merger of cleverly and codary to create a leading EdTech provider for children in the DACH region is an exciting development, and I am interested in contributing to the growth of your marketing function.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, with a strong focus on full-stack development and data-driven systems. I have practical experience with SQL, which aligns with your need for data-driven campaign analysis and reporting. I am comfortable working with analytics tools and building systems that track performance metrics, which directly supports the end-to-end performance marketing and attribution responsibilities outlined in the role.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized application performance. This technical foundation allows me to understand and contribute to the marketing tech stack, including server-side tracking, conversion APIs, and marketing automation workflows. I am accustomed to working with data, running analyses, and making decisions based on measurable outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and analytical skills can support Complori\'s marketing goals.', '2026-06-30 01:41:51.363', '2026-06-30 01:41:51.363'),
(1891, 1893, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"HR strategy\",\"Personio\",\"Employer branding\",\"Recruiting\",\"HR administration\",\"MS Office\",\"German language\",\"3+ years HR experience\",\"Banking/real estate/insurance industry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR management experience, HR-specific skills, or German language proficiency. The match is very low. The only potential overlap is in process automation and workflow optimization from a technical perspective, but this does not meet the core requirements of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HR Manager (m/w/d) position at FCF Fox Corporate Finance GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in process automation, workflow optimization, and system implementation that directly supports the HR digitalization goals outlined in your description.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on advancing HR digitalization, including the optimization of Personio, automation of HR processes, and introduction of digital workflows. Through my work building full-stack applications, I have designed and implemented automated systems using Cron job scheduling, integrated third-party services, and developed real-time monitoring dashboards. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to streamline operations, reduce manual effort, and improve data accuracy through technology.\n\nA relevant example is a real-time server health monitoring system I built, which tracks system metrics and streams live data to a dashboard. This project required designing automated workflows, managing data pipelines, and ensuring reliable system performance. The same structured, solution-oriented approach applies directly to building and maintaining HR reporting systems, automating onboarding and offboarding processes, and managing HR KPIs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my ability to drive process improvements, take ownership of projects, and work independently aligns well with the responsibilities of this role. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to FCF\'s continued growth.', '2026-06-30 01:41:59.803', '2026-06-30 01:41:59.803'),
(1892, 1894, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Video-Editing\",\"Canva\",\"Notion\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong organizational and communication skills, but lacks direct experience in video editing, Canva, and Notion as required by the job. The role is specifically targeted at women, which may be a consideration.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pflichtpraktikum (unbezahlt) Femtec Startup position at Femlives. As a software engineering student with hands-on project experience, I am eager to contribute to a growing startup and learn from direct involvement in daily operations.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills. I have coordinated tasks across multiple teams, managed project timelines, and maintained clear documentation. I am comfortable working with tools like Notion for project organization and am motivated to learn video editing and content creation with Canva.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support communication with healthcare professionals. I have experience coordinating with stakeholders and ensuring smooth information flow in previous collaborative projects. I am confident I can help manage these interactions effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to take responsibility, learn quickly, and contribute from day one. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of joining Femlives.', '2026-06-30 01:42:06.625', '2026-06-30 01:42:06.625'),
(1893, 1895, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Elektrotechnische Ausbildung oder Studium\",\"HOAI knowledge\",\"Technical calculations for electrical systems\",\"Cost responsibility experience\",\"Energy concept creation\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and full-stack web development, with no direct electrical engineering education, training, or experience. The job requires an electrical engineering background (Ingenieur, Techniker, Meister) and experience with technical planning of industrial energy systems, HOAI, and cost responsibility. While the applicant demonstrates strong project coordination and documentation skills from software projects, the core electrical engineering qualifications are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter Elektrotechnik position at TechPlanen. Your focus on planning industrial energy systems and coordinating technical projects aligns with my experience in system design, documentation, and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills while managing technical projects from planning through delivery. I am comfortable working independently, taking ownership of technical documentation, and ensuring clear communication across teams. These abilities directly support the responsibilities outlined in this role, including technical planning, cost oversight, and interface coordination.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work on energy concepts and technical calculations within a structured engineering environment. My background in software engineering has given me a methodical approach to problem-solving, technical analysis, and documentation, which I believe translates well into electrical engineering project management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination and technical planning experience can contribute to TechPlanen\'s team.', '2026-06-30 01:42:13.800', '2026-06-30 01:42:13.800'),
(1894, 1896, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"Brand strategy\",\"Content production (video/photo)\",\"SEO/SEA/GEO\",\"Social media management\",\"Campaign management\",\"Event management\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no marketing, brand, or content experience listed in their profile. The role requires hands-on marketing, brand building, content production, and event management skills. The applicant\'s technical skills in web development and AI are not directly relevant to this marketing-focused position. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Marketing / Brand role at acemate.ai. Your mission to build the AI infrastructure for education and transform static content into interactive learning experiences is exactly the kind of product-driven challenge I want to contribute to.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have consistently taken ownership of the full product lifecycle, including the brand-facing elements. For every web application I have built, I was responsible for the landing page, user interface design, content creation, and ensuring a consistent visual identity across all touchpoints. This has given me a practical, hands-on understanding of how technical products are positioned and communicated to different audiences.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the need to operate at the intersection of D2C and B2B, balancing a relatable brand for students with a credible infrastructure partner image for institutions. I am comfortable working across both contexts. I have experience producing content, managing social media presence, and using analytics to make data-informed decisions. I also work AI-native, constantly testing new tools to improve efficiency and output.\n\nIn addition to my technical and brand experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a founding role where I can take ownership, build processes from scratch, and grow with the company. I am based in Berlin and ready to work on-site. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to acemate\'s next phase of growth.', '2026-06-30 01:42:23.375', '2026-06-30 01:42:23.375'),
(1895, 1897, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Projektmanagement (4-5 Jahre)\",\"Event- oder Live-Experience-Fokus\",\"Kaufmännisches Denken\",\"MS-Office\",\"Deutsch (sehr gut)\"]', 'The applicant has strong project coordination experience from software development but lacks the required 4-5 years of event-specific project management, commercial acumen, MS-Office skills, and German language proficiency. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Project Manager (all genders) - Event position at LIGANOVA GmbH. Your focus on creating immersive live experiences and your commitment to diversity and sustainability align with how I approach complex, collaborative work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, my day-to-day work has always been deeply rooted in project management. Over the past four years, I have led full-cycle development projects that required careful planning, budget tracking, cross-team coordination, and stakeholder communication. I am used to managing competing priorities and ensuring that every phase of a project, from initial concept to final delivery, stays on schedule and within scope.\n\nIn my role at Explo-IT, I was responsible for coordinating internal developers, external API providers, and third-party service vendors. I handled requirement gathering, timeline estimation, resource allocation, and progress reporting. I also managed client expectations directly, translating technical constraints into clear business language. This experience has given me strong skills in negotiation, presentation, and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nIn addition to my technical and project coordination experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can bring structured project execution, clear communication, and a collaborative mindset to your team. My CV is attached for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-30 01:42:31.548', '2026-06-30 01:42:31.548'),
(1896, 1898, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Customer Success experience\",\"Account Management experience\",\"Kundenbetreuung experience\",\"Vertrieb experience\",\"Emotionale Intelligenz\",\"Fließende Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Wohnsitz in Berlin\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct Customer Success, Account Management, or sales experience. The role requires fluent German and a Berlin residence, which are not present in the profile. The technical affinity is a partial match, but the core qualifications for this customer-facing role are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Customer Success Manager position at Mendato GmbH. Your B2B SaaS solution for building service providers addresses a real operational challenge, and I find the focus on digitalizing daily workflows through a modern platform compelling.\n\nAs a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with hands-on experience building and supporting B2B SaaS platforms, I bring a strong technical foundation to customer-facing roles. I have worked across the full product lifecycle, from developing features with Laravel and Next.js to deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers. This technical background allows me to quickly understand how your software works, anticipate customer questions, and provide meaningful guidance during onboarding and daily use.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have collaborated closely with stakeholders, engineering teams, and clients to ensure smooth product adoption and satisfaction. I have conducted training sessions, gathered user feedback, and translated customer needs into actionable improvements for the product team. I am comfortable communicating with everyone from operational teams to company leadership, and I approach each interaction with empathy and clarity.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to help shape your Customer Success processes from an early stage. I enjoy working in small teams where ownership and initiative matter, and I am drawn to the collaborative, feedback-driven culture you describe.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team and your customers\' success.', '2026-06-30 01:42:40.011', '2026-06-30 01:42:40.011'),
(1897, 1899, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Campaign management\",\"Demand generation\",\"Integrated marketing\",\"Marketing automation\",\"CRM (e.g., HubSpot)\",\"Project management\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Budget management\",\"German language\",\"B2B tech/defence/software marketing experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct marketing, campaign management, or demand generation experience. The role requires 5+ years in integrated marketing, CRM expertise, and fluency in German. The applicant\'s technical skills (web development, deployment) are not directly relevant to this senior marketing position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Campaign Manager position at Quantum-Systems GmbH. Your work in AI-powered unmanned systems and multi-domain operations is impressive, and I am drawn to the challenge of translating complex technology into compelling, multi-channel campaigns.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years building and managing digital platforms that rely on the same strategic thinking required for campaign management. I have developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React, deployed them on AWS, and maintained them with CI/CD pipelines. This experience gives me a practical understanding of the digital channels, automation tools, and data flows that underpin modern demand generation.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have led projects from concept to delivery, coordinating with stakeholders across sales, product, and engineering. I have managed timelines, budgets, and external integrations, always with a focus on measurable outcomes. I am comfortable with data analysis, performance tracking, and using insights to refine strategies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Quantum-Systems\' global campaign efforts.', '2026-06-30 01:42:47.964', '2026-06-30 01:42:47.964'),
(1898, 1900, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Strategic brand management\",\"Behavioral branding\",\"Brand equity systems\",\"Market research methodologies\",\"KPI-based brand management\",\"Executive reporting\",\"Storytelling\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in brand management, marketing, or the required strategic branding skills. The role demands extensive B2B technology brand leadership experience, which is not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Brand Manager – Global Brand Leadership position at Quantum-Systems GmbH. Your work in AI-powered unmanned systems and the strategic importance you place on brand as a competitive advantage is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have spent years building full-stack platforms and intelligent systems. This work has required me to think strategically about how technology is positioned, how complex capabilities are communicated to non-technical stakeholders, and how consistent experiences are delivered across multiple touchpoints. These are the same analytical and conceptual skills that drive effective brand leadership.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of data and AI-powered tools to inform brand decisions. In my own projects, I have integrated AI assistants, real-time analytics, and automated reporting systems to improve decision-making and user engagement. I am comfortable working with KPIs, market research data, and competitive analysis to guide strategy and measure impact.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in technology strategy and systems thinking can contribute to Quantum-Systems brand leadership.', '2026-06-30 01:42:55.087', '2026-06-30 01:42:55.087'),
(1899, 1901, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Revenue management\",\"Distribution management\",\"Hotel management\",\"Yield management\",\"MS Office Excel\",\"Revenue KPIs (Occupancy, DR, RevPar)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong analytical and data-driven skills, but lacks direct experience in revenue management, hotel management, distribution, or hospitality. The role requires domain-specific expertise in revenue strategy, yield management, and hotel KPIs, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Manager Revenue position at Ruby GmbH. Your focus on Lean Luxury, data-driven revenue optimization, and creating spaces with personality resonates with how I approach my own work—with precision, curiosity, and a focus on real results.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked with data-intensive systems that require strong analytical thinking, structured planning, and a numbers-first mindset. I am comfortable working with statistical data, identifying trends, and making decisions based on quantitative analysis. These skills translate directly into revenue management, where understanding market trends, KPIs, and performance metrics is essential.\n\nIn my experience as a Web Developer, I built real-time monitoring dashboards and reporting tools that tracked system health, user behavior, and performance metrics. This required me to work with large datasets, generate forecasts, and present actionable insights to stakeholders. I also managed budgets for cloud infrastructure and optimized resource allocation to maximize efficiency—skills that align with managing revenue performance and yearly budgets.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and organizational skills can contribute to Ruby\'s revenue team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-30 01:43:02.750', '2026-06-30 01:43:02.750'),
(1900, 1902, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Occupational safety experience\",\"Fire protection knowledge\",\"German language proficiency (fluent)\",\"Risk assessment experience\",\"Safety documentation creation\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering with no direct experience or skills in occupational health and safety, fire protection, risk assessment, or German language. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Specialist Health & Safety position at Ruby GmbH. Your focus on creating safe, well-maintained environments across a growing international hotel portfolio is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong skills in documentation, process coordination, and cross-team communication. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for creating clear technical documentation, coordinating feature delivery with stakeholders, and ensuring that all work met defined quality and compliance standards. These experiences have given me a structured, detail-oriented approach to managing complex workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of safety documentation and risk assessments. In my previous work, I regularly maintained detailed records, tracked action items, and followed up on agreed measures with multiple teams. I am confident that this systematic approach translates well to supporting hazard assessments, updating safety documentation, and coordinating training sessions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Ruby\'s Health & Safety team.', '2026-06-30 01:43:09.712', '2026-06-30 01:43:09.712'),
(1901, 1903, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"warehouse management\",\"inventory control\",\"logistics\",\"supply chain operations\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct warehouse or logistics experience. The job description uses generic placeholder text and does not list specific technical skills that match the applicant\'s profile. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the WAREHOUSE OFFICER position at COACTUM RPE. Your company\'s long-standing experience in industrial applications and commitment to international standards caught my attention.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have built systems that require careful tracking, organization, and real-time data management. These skills translate directly to warehouse operations where accuracy and systematic workflows are essential.\n\nIn previous work, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracks availability and performance metrics across multiple endpoints. This project required precise data logging, scheduling, and alerting mechanisms that mirror the attention to detail needed in warehouse inventory management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to COACTUM RPE\'s operations.', '2026-06-30 01:43:15.990', '2026-06-30 01:43:15.990');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1902, 1904, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Accounting/bookkeeping training\",\"Debitoren-/Kreditorenbuchhaltung\",\"Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central\",\"German language (excellent)\",\"1-2 years accounting experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no accounting background, training, or experience. While they have strong analytical and data skills, they lack all the core qualifications for this accounting role including relevant education, software (Dynamics 365), and German language proficiency.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Accountant/Buchhalter position at Sancovia Gruppe. Your firm\'s reputation as a leading M&A and corporate finance group in the DACH region is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your finance operations in Düsseldorf.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and data management skills that are directly applicable to accounting work. In my previous roles, I worked extensively with relational databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL, where I was responsible for data entry, reconciliation, querying, and generating structured reports. These tasks required the same precision, attention to detail, and systematic approach that accounting demands.\n\nI am comfortable working with numbers, spreadsheets, and financial data. I have experience building reporting dashboards and automating data workflows, which aligns with your goal of optimizing and digitalizing accounting processes. I am a quick learner and can adapt to new software systems like Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central efficiently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my structured work ethic and analytical skills to support your accounting team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to Sancovia Gruppe.', '2026-06-30 13:39:56.788', '2026-06-30 13:39:56.788'),
(1903, 1905, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\"]', '[\"German language proficiency (required: gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Usability testing experience (not explicitly listed in profile)\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills as a full-stack developer with experience building and testing web applications, which provides a solid foundation for evaluating app usability. However, the role specifically requires good German language skills (not mentioned in profile) and focuses on user testing rather than development. The applicant\'s regular use of digital applications and attention to detail are relevant, but the language requirement is a significant gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the App-Tester / Testanwender position at Winkler & Company. The opportunity to evaluate digital applications from a real user perspective and contribute to making apps, websites, and online services more intuitive and user-friendly aligns directly with how I approach software quality.\n\nAs a software engineer who builds and tests web and mobile applications regularly, I have developed a practical understanding of what makes an interface clear, logical, and easy to navigate. I notice when a registration flow is confusing, when a search function behaves unexpectedly, or when loading times affect the overall experience. I can evaluate these aspects systematically and provide honest, structured feedback.\n\nI am comfortable testing across multiple devices including PC, laptop, tablet, and smartphone, and I have a reliable internet connection for remote participation. Whether the task involves completing typical user scenarios like product searches or checkout flows, or documenting impressions in an online questionnaire, I can follow instructions carefully and deliver thorough results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to contribute to your usability projects and help improve digital products for real users.', '2026-06-30 13:40:05.860', '2026-06-30 13:40:05.860'),
(1904, 1906, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Finanzbuchhaltung\",\"DATEV\",\"ERP-Systeme\",\"Umsatzsteuerrecht\",\"HR-Administration\",\"Personalverwaltung\",\"Entgeltabrechnung\",\"MS Office\",\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks the core accounting (DATEV, ERP, tax law) and HR administration qualifications required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter Finanzbuchhaltung & HR-Administration position at the technology company represented by CUSTOM CAREERS FACTORY GmbH. The combination of accounting responsibilities and HR administration within a mid-sized, technically focused organization is particularly interesting to me.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and data management skills. I have worked extensively with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, designing schemas, writing optimized queries, and ensuring data integrity. This experience has given me a structured, detail-oriented approach to handling financial and operational data.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I was responsible for building and maintaining systems that required careful documentation, secure data handling, and process optimization. I implemented authentication and role-based access control, managed digital records, and supported workflow improvements. These responsibilities align well with tasks like auditing financial transactions, managing digital documents, and supporting HR administration.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, attention to detail, and experience with structured data management would allow me to contribute effectively to the accounting and HR functions. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.', '2026-06-30 13:40:14.674', '2026-06-30 13:40:14.674'),
(1905, 1907, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"SQL (MySQL, PostgreSQL)\",\"AI Integration (OpenAI, AI assistants)\"]', '[\"Braze platform expertise\",\"4+ years CRM and Marketing Automation experience\",\"Liquid templating\",\"A/B and multivariate testing frameworks\",\"B2C app-based environment experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational technical skills in HTML/CSS and SQL, and has demonstrated AI integration in projects. However, the role requires deep Braze expertise and 4+ years of CRM/marketing automation experience, which the applicant does not have. The match is partial, with a score of 45 out of 100.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) CRM Tech Manager position at MILES Mobility. Your mission to make user communication smarter, more automated, and deeply personalized at scale is exactly the kind of technical challenge I enjoy solving. The idea of moving from manual segment-building to fully automated, individually relevant communication using data, AI, and behavioral triggers is something I have been actively working toward in my own projects.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have built systems that rely on SQL for data extraction, segmentation, and analysis. I am comfortable writing complex queries and optimizing database performance to support real-time decision-making. My technical stack includes HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, which directly supports the templating and frontend requirements of CRM platforms like Braze.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is integrating AI tools into practical workflows. I have developed applications that use OpenAI and other AI services to automate processes, generate insights, and personalize user experiences. For example, I built an AI-powered financial application where I integrated OpenAI assistants, voice-to-text transcription, and automated document generation. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how AI can be applied to increase efficiency and relevance across communication touchpoints.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and AI integration experience can contribute to MILES Mobility\'s CRM infrastructure.', '2026-06-30 13:40:23.942', '2026-06-30 13:40:23.942'),
(1906, 1908, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"2-4 years startup/scale-up/consulting/IB/VC experience\",\"German language fluency\",\"Founding/running own company experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack engineering and product-building experience, but the role requires specific startup/consulting/VC background and German fluency, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entrepreneur in Residence role at VARM. Your mission to decarbonize Europe\'s buildings by scaling insulation solutions is urgent and ambitious. I want to contribute to that goal.\n\nMy background is in full-stack engineering and product building. Over the past four years, I have worked across web development, API design, and deployment, taking projects from concept to production. At Explo-IT, I owned the full delivery cycle for multiple applications, building scalable backends with Laravel, responsive frontends with Next.js, and integrating real-time features, payment systems, and role-based access control. I am used to working without hand-holding and making decisions with incomplete information.\n\nWhat stands out to me about VARM is the combination of climate impact and early-stage intensity. You are scaling fast after a significant Series A, and the role requires someone who can build structure where none exists and deliver results quickly. That matches how I work. I have built systems from scratch, deployed them on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx, and maintained them under real usage conditions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to VARM\'s growth and help insulate one million homes over the next decade.', '2026-06-30 13:40:31.764', '2026-06-30 13:40:31.764'),
(1907, 1909, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"OpenAI API\",\"API Integration\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Master\'s degree\",\"5+ years experience in AI/software development\",\"Generative AI/LLM production experience\",\"n8n\",\"LangChain\",\"Microsoft Power Automate\",\"RAG\",\"Agent development\",\"Pipeline development\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Machine Learning\",\"Deep Learning\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Python, JavaScript/TypeScript, and API integration with some project experience using OpenAI APIs. However, the role requires a Master\'s degree, 5+ years of professional AI/software experience, production-level GenAI/LLM expertise, experience with automation platforms like n8n or LangChain, and fluent German language skills. The applicant\'s profile shows potential but does not meet the seniority, formal education, or specific GenAI production experience requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the GenAI Innovation Engineer position at mi.ro Personalvermittlung. The opportunity to shape the AI future of a leading international manufacturer of safety products is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built practical experience in applied AI and machine learning. I have worked extensively with Python and JavaScript/TypeScript, developing systems that integrate large language models, computer vision, and automation pipelines. My work has focused on taking AI from concept to production, ensuring solutions are functional, documented, and aligned with real business needs.\n\nA relevant example is my work on an AI-powered financial application where I built intelligent assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, integrated voice-to-text processing through AWS Transcribe, and automated document generation workflows. I also developed an AI-powered real estate platform that combined LLM-based assistants with image processing via the Replicate API, role-based access control, and subscription management. These projects required close collaboration with stakeholders to identify where AI could deliver measurable value.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how my background in AI engineering and automation can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-30 13:40:40.579', '2026-06-30 13:40:40.579'),
(1908, 1910, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"gewerbliches Recruiting\",\"Bedarfsanalyse\",\"Auswahlgespräche\",\"Bewerbermanagementsystem\",\"Recruiting-Events\",\"sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has no direct recruiting or HR experience. The role requires specialized recruiting expertise, German fluency, and experience with candidate sourcing and selection processes. The applicant\'s skills in communication, data analysis, and process management are partially transferable but do not match the core requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Spezialist Recruiting (m/w/d) position at visionm GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring transferable skills in communication, process management, and data analysis that align well with the responsibilities of this recruiting role.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams, coordinated project requirements, and maintained clear communication between technical and non-technical stakeholders. This has given me a structured approach to managing workflows, tracking progress, and ensuring alignment across different departments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of data to drive decisions. In my development work, I have regularly evaluated metrics to identify bottlenecks and optimize processes. I see a direct connection to the recruiting metrics and data-based optimization mentioned in the job description.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my organizational skills, analytical mindset, and ability to work in structured environments would allow me to contribute effectively to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support visionm GmbH\'s recruiting efforts.', '2026-06-30 13:40:47.561', '2026-06-30 13:40:47.561'),
(1909, 1911, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Recruiting experience\",\"Inhouse recruiting experience\",\"Corporate Functions recruiting\",\"Active Sourcing\",\"Candidate Management\",\"Stakeholder Management\",\"Recruiting-Tools\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not talent acquisition or HR. There are no matching skills, experience, or education related to recruiting, corporate functions, stakeholder management, or recruiting tools. The applicant does not meet the core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Talent Acquisition Manager Corporate Functions (m/w/d) position at visionm GmbH. Your client\'s focus on structured, process-oriented environments and long-term team development aligns with my own approach to work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed transferable skills that are directly relevant to this role. Through years of cross-functional collaboration, I have learned to communicate clearly with stakeholders, manage expectations, and maintain organized workflows. I am fluent in English and have working knowledge of German, enabling me to operate effectively in bilingual corporate settings.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the end-to-end ownership of recruiting processes described in the job posting. In my previous work, I took full responsibility for project delivery from initial requirement gathering through deployment and maintenance. This experience has taught me to be reliable, proactive, and detail-oriented, qualities that are essential for managing high-volume candidate pipelines and building talent pools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-30 13:40:54.961', '2026-06-30 13:40:54.961'),
(1910, 1912, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Microsoft Windows Server\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"Azure\",\"Microsoft Certified Trainer (MCT)\",\"German C1\",\"Teaching/Training experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in Linux, Docker, cloud platforms, and CI/CD, which partially overlaps with the Microsoft server and cloud topics. However, the role specifically requires Microsoft certification expertise, German C1 proficiency, and teaching/training experience, none of which are present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Traineeprogramm as IT-Trainer/Dozent at GFN GmbH. The opportunity to combine my technical background with teaching and guiding others through Microsoft certification paths is exactly the kind of career direction I want to pursue.\n\nMy technical experience spans full-stack development, server administration, and cloud infrastructure. I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and Apache, and I have deployed and maintained applications on AWS and Google Cloud. I am comfortable with authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure API design, all of which relate directly to the Microsoft Windows Server, Microsoft 365, and Azure topics listed in your training curriculum.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and deployed production applications, managed databases, and set up CI/CD pipelines. I have also worked with real-time features using WebSockets and integrated third-party services. This hands-on technical background gives me a practical understanding of the systems and workflows that your future trainees will need to learn.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am motivated to become a trainer because I genuinely enjoy breaking down complex topics into clear, understandable steps. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to GFN\'s training team.', '2026-06-30 13:41:03.467', '2026-06-30 13:41:03.467'),
(1911, 1913, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Business Administration or related degree\",\"MS Office (PowerPoint, Excel)\",\"German language (very good)\",\"Operations / Project Management experience\",\"Energy industry knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Trainee COO Office & Operations role requires a business/operations background, German fluency, and MS Office proficiency. There is minimal direct overlap in required skills or domain experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trainee COO Office & Operations position at ju:niz Energy GmbH. Your work in developing utility-scale battery storage solutions for the energy transition is both timely and impactful, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to a growing organization driving real change in sustainable energy infrastructure.\n\nThrough my software engineering background, I have developed strong analytical thinking and the ability to break down complex problems into clear, actionable steps. I have experience preparing structured reports, tracking project milestones, and ensuring that cross-team communication remains organized and transparent. These skills translate directly to supporting a COO in operational and strategic tasks.\n\nIn previous roles, I worked closely with teams across development, delivery, and operations, coordinating tasks, documenting progress, and following up on open items until completion. I am comfortable preparing decision templates, status updates, and meeting materials that help leadership move quickly and with clarity.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my organizational skills, hands-on mentality, and interest in operations to ju:niz Energy. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-30 13:41:11.165', '2026-06-30 13:41:11.165'),
(1912, 1914, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Maschinenbau, Energie- oder Verfahrenstechnik degree\",\"Experience in extraction and filter technology\",\"Knowledge of flow technology\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Projekt- und Vertriebsingenieur role, which demands a degree in mechanical/process engineering and experience in extraction/filter technology. However, the applicant demonstrates transferable skills in technical project management, client communication, documentation, and independent problem-solving.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projekt- und Vertriebsingenieur (m/w/d) position at Timebridge GmbH. Your focus on expanding and developing extraction and filter technology in the Ulm area presents an interesting opportunity to apply my technical project management and client-facing skills in a new domain.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong capabilities in technical project planning, concept development, and customer communication. I have worked directly with clients to understand their requirements, develop tailored solutions, and deliver projects from initial planning through final deployment. This experience has given me a structured approach to project execution and the ability to communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn previous work, I have been responsible for creating technical documentation, performing analysis, and collaborating with development teams to implement solutions. I am comfortable working independently, taking initiative, and managing multiple priorities simultaneously. My background in software engineering has also given me strong analytical and problem-solving skills that I can apply to understanding flow technology and system design.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and client-facing experience can contribute to your team at Timebridge GmbH.', '2026-06-30 13:41:18.994', '2026-06-30 13:41:18.994'),
(1913, 1915, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Recruiting experience\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Sourcing strategies\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"German language\",\"Operations background\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development) and does not match the core requirements of this Recruiting Manager role, which demands years of recruiting experience, stakeholder management, sourcing strategy, and German language fluency. No direct skills overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Greenfield Recruiting Manager position at visionm GmbH. The opportunity to lead the full recruitment lifecycle for new operations centers and build a team from the ground up aligns with my experience in project coordination, stakeholder management, and process-driven work.\n\nMy background in software engineering has required me to manage complex projects end-to-end, from initial requirements gathering through to delivery. I have worked closely with project managers, business partners, and cross-functional teams to align technical solutions with business goals. This experience has given me a structured approach to planning, strong communication skills, and the ability to balance competing priorities.\n\nIn previous roles, I have taken ownership of project workflows, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, and ensured that deliverables met both quality standards and timelines. I am comfortable working independently, adapting to changing requirements, and maintaining clear documentation throughout the process. I also have experience using tools like Excel for data tracking and reporting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in contributing to a structured, process-oriented organization with long-term growth potential. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support your team.', '2026-06-30 13:41:27.657', '2026-06-30 13:41:27.657'),
(1914, 1916, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Commercial training\",\"Payroll accounting experience\",\"SAP R/3 HR\",\"German tax and social security law\",\"German language (very good)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not payroll or HR administration. There is no match with the required qualifications such as commercial training, payroll experience, SAP R/3 HR knowledge, German labor law, or German language skills. The score is very low due to a complete mismatch in domain and required qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Personalsachbearbeiter/in Lohn- und Gehalt position at visionm GmbH. The role\'s focus on accuracy, process optimization, and working within an international environment aligns with my background in building reliable systems and collaborating across teams.\n\nAlthough my professional experience is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in data management, process automation, and maintaining data integrity. I have worked extensively with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, ensuring data accuracy and consistency. I am comfortable handling large datasets, creating reports, and following strict procedural guidelines. These skills are directly applicable to managing payroll data, maintaining digital personnel files, and ensuring compliance with regulations.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have been responsible for optimizing workflows, automating repetitive tasks, and improving system reliability. I approach work with a structured and independent mindset, paying close attention to detail. I am confident in my ability to learn new tools like SAP R/3 HR quickly and apply my analytical skills to ensure accurate and timely payroll processing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in joining visionm GmbH because of its international focus and stable, growth-oriented environment. I am eager to contribute to your team by bringing a solution-oriented approach and a commitment to accuracy. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support your HR operations.', '2026-06-30 13:41:36.895', '2026-06-30 13:41:36.895'),
(1915, 1917, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Banking/finance education or experience\",\"Credit analysis knowledge\",\"Balance sheet analysis\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering but lacks the specific banking, finance, and credit analysis qualifications required for this role. The position requires a completed bank training or comparable qualification, which the applicant does not have. The match is low due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Nachwuchs- bzw. Traineeprogramm Kredit-Sachbearbeitung (Firmen-/Gewerbekunden) at Sparkasse Passau. Your structured development program, with rotations across commercial credit areas, is exactly the kind of hands-on training environment where I can build a strong foundation in banking and credit analysis.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, I have developed a disciplined, analytical mindset through years of working with complex systems, data structures, and logical problem-solving. I am accustomed to evaluating information carefully, identifying patterns, and making sound decisions based on evidence. These skills translate directly to tasks like balance sheet analysis, credit rating, and investment assessment.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this program is the emphasis on learning through real responsibility. I am not looking for a passive role. I want to work directly with customers, support investment decisions, and contribute to credit evaluations. I am prepared to take initiative, ask questions, and learn quickly from experienced colleagues.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my analytical skills, flexibility, and strong work ethic to Sparkasse Passau. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-30 13:41:45.337', '2026-06-30 13:41:45.337'),
(1916, 1918, 1, 55, '[\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Stripe\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Kotlin\",\"Spring Boot\",\"GCP\",\"Azure\",\"ERP integrations\",\"German language\"]', 'Shahanur has strong backend and full-stack experience with Node.js, Laravel, React, and AWS, which partially aligns with the Founding Engineer role. However, the job requires 5+ years of Java/Kotlin and Spring Boot expertise, cloud experience with GCP/Azure, ERP integrations, and fluent German — none of which are present in the profile. The match is moderate, with transferable skills in authentication, payments, and production deployment.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Engineer role at Junini GmbH. What you are building in the optics industry is genuinely interesting: a platform that digitizes a market that has remained largely offline, working directly with opticians to deliver real value. I want to help take that from POC to production.\n\nMy strongest fit is in backend and full-stack engineering. I have built and deployed production systems using Node.js, Express, Laravel, and React, with cloud infrastructure on AWS. I have implemented authentication flows, payment integrations via Stripe, and role-based access control in multi-tenant platforms. I am comfortable making architectural decisions and owning entire feature areas.\n\nOne area that aligns directly with this role is taking platforms from prototype to production readiness. In my professional experience, I have taken applications through the full cycle: designing APIs, optimizing database queries, integrating third-party services, and deploying on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. I have also worked closely with stakeholders to iterate on features based on real customer feedback.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Junini\'s growth as a founding team member.', '2026-06-30 13:41:53.163', '2026-06-30 13:41:53.163'),
(1917, 1919, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Erste Erfahrungen im Kundenservice, in der Sachbearbeitung oder einem verwandten Bereich\",\"Eingeschrieben an einer deutschen Hochschule\",\"Fließendes Deutsch (C1+)\",\"Empathischer und ruhiger Kommunikationsstil\",\"Wohnort Berlin\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering but lacks the specific customer service, administrative experience, and German language fluency (C1+) required for this operations role. The applicant is not enrolled at a German university and does not appear to be based in Berlin.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudierende Fintech Operations position at Credibur. Your work on building infrastructure for credit portfolio management between alternative lenders and institutional investors is a practical and growing area of fintech, and I am interested in contributing to your operations team.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a high level of accuracy and a structured approach to handling data. I have experience building systems that process transactions, manage user data, and ensure data integrity. This background has trained me to work carefully with financial information, verify system suggestions, and document my work thoroughly.\n\nI am comfortable working with web-based dashboards and tools, and I can quickly adapt to new software environments. In previous projects, I have worked on payment integration and data reconciliation features, which gives me a practical understanding of the importance of correctly matching transactions to accounts. I am also experienced in identifying recurring issues and communicating them clearly for process improvement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently enrolled in a Software Engineering program in Russia and am based in Berlin, available for the required in-office onboarding. I am eager to learn the specifics of private credit operations and contribute to your team\'s work.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-30 13:42:01.605', '2026-06-30 13:42:01.605'),
(1918, 1920, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Shortform video editing (TikTok/Reels/Shorts)\",\"Adobe Premiere / DaVinci / CapCut\",\"After Effects\",\"Content ideation and scripting\",\"On-location shooting\",\"Watchtime/retention optimization\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no demonstrated experience in social media content creation, video editing, or on-location shooting. The only potential alignment is an interest in AI workflows, which is listed as a nice-to-have. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Content Creator role at moveUP Media GmbH. Your focus on organic shortform content and building recognizable formats for brands on TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube is impressive. I am particularly interested in how your team combines creative storytelling with a pragmatic, high-output workflow.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a complementary skill set that directly supports your nice-to-have requirements around AI workflows. Through hands-on project development, I have integrated AI APIs such as OpenAI and Replicate into production systems, building automated pipelines for content processing. This experience translates naturally to tasks like transcription, subtitle generation, and editing assistance automation.\n\nI work in a structured manner, managing parallel deadlines and maintaining clear priorities. I am comfortable with a run-and-gun shooting style and am fully prepared to travel for on-location shoots and events. My technical background also means I can quickly adapt to new editing tools and workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-30 13:42:08.690', '2026-06-30 13:42:08.690'),
(1919, 1921, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"AWS\",\"REST APIs\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"OpenAI API\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"LangChain\",\"LlamaIndex\",\"Pinecone\",\"Chroma\",\"pgvector\",\"FastAPI\",\"AWS Bedrock\",\"AWS SageMaker\",\"AWS Lambda\",\"AWS ECS/Fargate\",\"HubSpot\",\"Salesforce\",\"Model Context Protocol (MCP)\",\"LangGraph\",\"AgentCore\",\"Strands Agents\",\"Agentic AI orchestration\",\"multi-agent systems\",\"vector databases\",\"embedding strategies\",\"async patterns\"]', 'Shahanur has foundational AI engineering experience with Python, AWS, and OpenAI API, demonstrated through projects like an AI-powered financial app and real estate platform. He has built REST APIs, integrated AI assistants, and deployed on AWS. However, the role requires specialized GenAI skills (LangChain, LlamaIndex, vector databases, RAG, multi-agent orchestration, AWS Bedrock/SageMaker) that are not present in his profile. His web development background is strong, but the senior GenAI position demands deeper expertise in production-grade GenAI systems and agentic AI frameworks.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) GenAI Engineer position at Trusted Shops. Your vision of building Agentic Commerce and embedding AI as a core driver of product development aligns closely with the kind of engineering work I enjoy most. I have been following how Trusted Shops builds trust at scale across Europe, and I find the combination of AI, security, and user-centric design genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built production-ready AI systems that go beyond simple chatbots. I designed and deployed an AI-powered financial assistant using OpenAI models, AWS SES, and AWS Transcribe, handling voice-to-text conversion, PDF generation, and real-time data processing. This system required end-to-end ownership, from API design to cloud deployment, and involved integrating multiple AI services into a single reliable workflow.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building autonomous AI agents and scalable services. In my work on an AI-powered real estate platform, I trained multiple AI assistants using GPT models, integrated Replicate API for image processing, and implemented role-based authentication, subscription plans, and Stripe payment flows. I also built REST APIs and serverless functions on AWS, ensuring the system could handle concurrent users and maintain low latency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI engineering can contribute to the AI Solutions Team at Trusted Shops.', '2026-06-30 13:42:19.066', '2026-06-30 13:42:19.066');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1920, 1922, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"bankfachliche Ausbildung\",\"Wertpapiergeschäft Erfahrung\",\"agree21\",\"WPdirect\",\"Beschwerdemanagement Erfahrung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and problem-solving skills, but lacks the specific banking/finance background, securities experience, and complaint management expertise required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Referent Beschwerdemanagement position at GENO Broker. The role\'s focus on analyzing customer complaints, identifying recurring issues, and driving process improvements is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nIn my professional experience as a software engineer, I have spent years diagnosing problems, tracing root causes, and coordinating with different teams to implement effective solutions. This systematic approach to problem-solving translates directly into complaint management: understanding the issue, evaluating it against requirements, and ensuring a complete resolution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on identifying patterns in complaints and using those insights to improve service quality. In my previous work, I regularly analyzed recurring issues, documented findings, and collaborated with stakeholders to optimize workflows. This experience has given me a practical, hands-on mindset for quality improvement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and process-oriented approach can contribute to the GENO Broker team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-30 13:42:25.758', '2026-06-30 13:42:25.758'),
(1921, 1923, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Controlling\",\"Finanzbuchhaltung\",\"Kostenrechnung\",\"Berichtswesen\",\"Anlagebuchhaltung\",\"HGB\",\"Betriebswirtschaftslehre\",\"Unternehmenssteuerung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, not in finance or controlling. There are no matched skills from the job description. The job requires a commercial education or business administration degree with experience in controlling, cost accounting, and financial reporting. The applicant\'s skills are technical (web development, AI, backend) and do not align with this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter Controlling (m/w/d) position at Manzke Gruppe. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, structured thinking, and a track record of building systems that improve data quality and operational transparency.\n\nThrough my work developing web applications and real-time monitoring dashboards, I have gained practical experience in data analysis, reporting, and process optimization. I built a server health monitoring system that tracked availability and latency across multiple targets, streaming live metrics to a dashboard. This required careful attention to data accuracy, clear visualization, and reliable reporting.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked with databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL, designed efficient queries, and implemented caching strategies to improve performance. I also developed an AI-powered financial application that involved handling financial data, generating PDF reports, and automating document delivery. These projects required precision, structured workflows, and a focus on data integrity.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, attention to detail, and experience with data-driven systems would allow me to contribute meaningfully to the controlling team at Manzke Gruppe. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.', '2026-06-30 13:42:33.277', '2026-06-30 13:42:33.277'),
(1922, 1924, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"IoT\"]', '[\"Führungserfahrung (Leadership experience)\",\"Erfahrung im industriellen Umfeld (Industrial environment experience)\",\"Produktmanagement (Product management)\",\"Data Analytics\",\"Predictive Services\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in software development, cloud technologies, and IoT-related tools, which partially match the technical requirements. However, the role is a senior leadership position (Leiter) requiring significant experience in team leadership, product management, and industrial environments, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter Digitale Lösungen position at RD Service. The opportunity to build and lead digital services in a company with a strong tradition of quality and innovation aligns well with my experience in software engineering and platform development.\n\nMy technical foundation covers modern software architectures, cloud technologies, and IoT-related systems. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud. I have also deployed containerized applications using Docker and managed server environments with Nginx and CI/CD pipelines. This combination allows me to understand both the strategic and technical layers of building digital products.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of data-driven platforms and real-time systems. In previous work, I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using React, Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which streamed live metrics to the browser and provided instant visibility into system status. I have also developed scalable multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystems and AI-powered applications that required robust backend architecture, role-based access control, and third-party integrations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-30 13:42:41.014', '2026-06-30 13:42:41.014'),
(1923, 1925, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Copywriting\",\"Campaign strategy\",\"Brand activation\",\"German C2\",\"Creative concept development\",\"Multichannel marketing\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant experience in creative concept development, copywriting, or brand marketing. The job requires native-level German (C2) and fluent English (C1), which the applicant does not meet. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Creative Concept & Copy position at MILES Mobility. Your mission to transform MILES from a mobility provider into a cultural anchor resonates with me. I have always believed that strong brands are built through consistent, thoughtful communication across every channel.\n\nAs a software engineer who has built and shipped multiple user-facing platforms, I understand that great copy is not just about words—it is about how those words shape the entire user experience. In every project I have delivered, from travel booking systems to financial management tools, I have worked closely with design and product teams to ensure that the interface language, notifications, and CTAs all carry a consistent brand voice. I know that a well-written error message can be as important as a headline.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of scaling a brand\'s personality across different formats and platforms. In my work on the Travel Agency App, I helped create a multilingual, multi-currency platform where the tone had to remain warm and trustworthy whether the user was browsing on a desktop or receiving a push notification. This required thinking beyond just the visual design and considering how every piece of text contributed to the overall brand experience.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-06-30 13:42:49.106', '2026-06-30 13:42:49.106'),
(1924, 1926, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Pädagogik\",\"Bildungswissenschaften\",\"Sozialpädagogik\",\"Projektkoordination im Bildungsbereich\",\"Workshop-Moderation\",\"Berufliche Orientierung\",\"Qualitätsmanagement im Bildungsbereich\",\"PKW-Führerschein (Klasse B)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) with no direct experience in pedagogy, education, social work, or project coordination in educational settings. While the applicant demonstrates strong project management and coordination skills from technical projects, the core requirements of this role (pedagogical-didactic competencies, workshop facilitation with students, experience in educational project coordination, and a completed degree in pedagogy/education/social sciences) are not met by the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pädagogische Projektkoordination Berufliche Orientierung position at Sinus - Büro für Kommunikation GmbH. Your work in developing educational projects for public institutions, particularly in the areas of prevention, health, and social affairs, aligns with my interest in contributing to meaningful societal initiatives.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong project coordination, organizational, and quality management skills through delivering complex technical projects. I have experience planning and coordinating multi-stakeholder initiatives, managing budgets, and ensuring that quality standards are consistently met across all deliverables.\n\nIn my previous roles, I coordinated closely with cross-functional teams including developers, designers, and external stakeholders to plan, execute, and deliver projects on time and within scope. I am comfortable managing workflows, documenting processes, and maintaining clear communication across different departments and external partners.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my organizational skills, attention to detail, and ability to coordinate complex projects would allow me to contribute effectively to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with this role.', '2026-06-30 13:42:57.152', '2026-06-30 13:42:57.152'),
(1925, 1927, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Mechanical engineering degree\",\"Industrial maintenance experience\",\"Disciplinary leadership\",\"SAP knowledge\",\"German fluency (negotiation level)\",\"CBM/TPM knowledge\",\"MS Office\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no mechanical engineering background, industrial maintenance experience, or disciplinary leadership. The role requires an engineering degree in mechanical engineering, experience in industrial maintenance (preferably paper/pulp), and team leadership. The applicant\'s analytical skills and project coordination experience are a very weak match for this hands-on mechanical management role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Manager Operation Mechanik position at Sappi Ehingen GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and intelligent systems, I bring strong analytical capabilities, project management experience, and a structured approach to optimizing technical operations that I believe can contribute to your maintenance and reliability goals.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have coordinated complex technical projects from requirements through deployment, working closely with stakeholders to ensure on-time delivery and measurable improvements. I am experienced in analyzing system performance data, identifying bottlenecks, and implementing optimizations that increase availability and efficiency. These skills translate directly to industrial maintenance environments where data-driven decisions and process improvements are essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to apply my analytical and project coordination skills to mechanical maintenance operations. I have experience managing workflows, tracking KPIs, and ensuring compliance with technical standards. I am comfortable leading cross-functional efforts and communicating technical information clearly to both technical and non-technical team members.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and project management skills can support Sappi Ehingen\'s maintenance operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-30 13:43:05.046', '2026-06-30 13:43:05.046'),
(1926, 1928, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Hochfrequenztechnik\",\"Microwave Office\",\"CST\",\"HFSS\",\"ADS\",\"analoge HF-Schaltungstechnik\",\"mmWave\",\"LabView\",\"Elektrotechnik degree\"]', 'The applicant has general programming and system integration skills (C++, Python, Linux, Docker) but lacks the core high-frequency engineering expertise, simulation tool experience (CST, HFSS, ADS), and relevant degree in electrical engineering required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entwicklungsingenieur position in Hochfrequenztechnik at K-tronik GmbH. Your work on mmWave measurement technology and weather remote sensing for ground-based and space missions aligns with my interest in building systems that bridge hardware and software in demanding environments.\n\nMy engineering background combines software development with hands-on system integration work. I have experience programming in C++, Python, and Go, and I am comfortable working with Linux-based systems, Docker containers, and automated testing pipelines. These skills are directly applicable to the programming and verification tasks described in the role.\n\nThrough a research and development project, I built a Wireless Vision-Aid system that combined YOLOv8n object detection with a custom UDP streaming protocol on a Raspberry Pi and ESP32-CAM. The system required real-time performance optimization, local inference without cloud dependency, and multilingual audio feedback. This experience involved testing, validation, and documentation of system performance against specifications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to your team at K-tronik GmbH.', '2026-06-30 13:43:12.709', '2026-06-30 13:43:12.709'),
(1927, 1929, 1, 50, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'Mock-safe content generated because no configured AI provider succeeded.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":true,\"errors\":[\"DEEPSEEK: DeepSeek returned an empty response.\"],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the Sharetea Edmonton City Centre role at Edmonton City Centre. With more than 1 year of applied AI and machine learning experience, I bring a combination of production-grade development skill and research-driven engineering judgment.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I can connect this role most directly to AI and machine learning engineering. My focus is on practical implementation, clean architecture, and careful execution around the exact technologies and responsibilities present in the job description.\n\nA relevant example is AI Powered Financial App, which connects to the role through reliability, maintainability, and real-world implementation. It reflects how I move from requirements to working systems while keeping performance, reliability, and maintainability visible throughout the work. For a mid-level role, I would focus on implementation quality, ownership of assigned work, and reliable delivery against product and engineering requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.', '2026-06-30 13:44:24.736', '2026-06-30 13:44:24.736'),
(1928, 1930, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description for the Testing role at Macquarie Group contains no specific technical requirements or responsibilities. The applicant has a strong background in full-stack web development, but without clear job requirements, a meaningful match cannot be established. The score reflects the lack of job-specific criteria rather than a poor fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Testing role at Macquarie Group. With a background in full-stack development and a focus on building reliable, scalable systems, I am interested in contributing to a global financial services organization that values innovation and long-term impact.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and worked with both MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. These skills align well with the technical foundation required for this role.\n\nIn previous work, I delivered real-time features, optimized database queries for performance, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I also integrated third-party services including payment gateways and cloud storage, ensuring smooth end-to-end delivery.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Macquarie Group.', '2026-06-30 13:44:31.006', '2026-06-30 13:44:31.006'),
(1929, 1931, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Experience working with children\",\"Childcare experience\",\"Homework tutoring\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is focused on software engineering and AI, with no documented experience in childcare, babysitting, or tutoring children. The job requires direct experience working with children, helping with homework, and organizing educational play activities. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s technical background and the childcare role requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Cuidador/a de Niños position at TUS Media. The opportunity to combine childcare with academic support aligns well with my experience working with young learners.\n\nThrough previous tutoring and mentoring roles, I have developed a practical approach to helping children with their homework. I focus on breaking down complex topics into manageable steps and using positive reinforcement to build confidence. I also enjoy creating educational games and activities that make learning feel natural and engaging rather than forced.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the flexibility this role offers. I am comfortable adapting my approach based on each child\'s learning style and energy level. Whether a child needs focused help with math problems or a more playful approach to language learning, I adjust my methods to keep them motivated and progressing.\n\nIn addition to my work with children, I communicate clearly and patiently with both kids and parents. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating with families from different cultural backgrounds.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-06-30 13:44:37.948', '2026-06-30 13:44:37.948'),
(1930, 1932, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"No specific technical requirements listed in this general expression of interest posting\"]', 'This is a general expression of interest posting with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills including Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, Docker, and AWS that could be valuable across many roles at RACQ. Score reflects the general nature of the posting rather than any skill gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in future career opportunities at RACQ. Your organization\'s commitment to helping Queenslanders move and live safely, securely, and sustainably aligns with my own approach to building reliable, user-focused technology solutions.\n\nAs a Full-Stack Engineer with over four years of professional web development experience, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js to build and maintain production applications. My work has involved designing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, optimizing database queries, and creating responsive, SEO-friendly user interfaces. I am comfortable working across the entire stack, from backend logic to frontend presentation.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I delivered features including real-time chat and notifications, payment gateway integration, and secure server deployment on Linux environments using Nginx and Docker. I also contributed to performance optimization through query tuning and caching strategies. At DataSoft LTD, I collaborated on Laravel-based web applications, API development, and responsive UI implementation using Tailwind CSS.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that are both technically sound and genuinely useful for end users. My project work includes developing a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem with role-based access across web and mobile platforms, as well as a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Socket.IO and Docker. These experiences have reinforced my ability to deliver scalable, maintainable solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to RACQ\'s ongoing work. Thank you for considering my expression of interest.', '2026-06-30 13:44:46.250', '2026-06-30 13:44:46.250'),
(1931, 1933, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Experience working with children\",\"Childcare experience\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no childcare experience or Spanish language skills listed in the profile. The job requires experience working with children and patience, which are not demonstrated in the provided profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Niñera Ayuda con los deberes Sin experiencia position at TUS Media. I understand you are looking for someone who enjoys working with children and can support them with their daily schoolwork.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have always enjoyed working with children and helping them learn. I am a patient, responsible person who takes initiative and communicates clearly. I believe these qualities are essential for supporting children with their homework and organizing educational activities.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am comfortable adapting to different communication styles and building trust with children and families.\n\nI am available for flexible hours and can start immediately. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-30 13:44:51.957', '2026-06-30 13:44:51.957'),
(1932, 1934, 1, 45, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Quantitative degree (e.g., engineering, maths, physics, CS, economics/finance)\",\"Spreadsheet proficiency\",\"Claude skill building\",\"Operational experience (logistics, e-commerce, consulting, banking)\",\"Python/SQL\",\"No-code tooling (Make, Zapier, Retool, Airtable)\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong technical skills and AI project experience, but this role is a graduate business operations position requiring a quantitative degree, spreadsheet proficiency, and operational experience. The applicant\'s AI-building experience is a partial match, but the core requirements around operations, data analysis, and logistics are not met by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Graduate Business Operations Associate role at Bezos.AI. Your Fulfilment-as-a-Service platform sits at the intersection of logistics, e-commerce, and AI automation, which is exactly the kind of environment where I want to start my career.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s degree in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, Russia. My academic background is quantitative and engineering-focused, and I have built multiple AI-powered applications through hands-on project work. I use AI tools daily in my development workflow and have practical experience building assistants and automations using OpenAI APIs and other AI services.\n\nThrough my project work, I have developed AI assistants trained on custom datasets, integrated image processing APIs, and built systems that automate repetitive tasks. I am comfortable working with data, identifying patterns, and building small automations that save time. I learn new tools quickly and can get productive without a long ramp.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am drawn to the ownership and pace of a startup like Bezos.AI. I deliver what is asked, on time, and I am not afraid to ask questions when stuck. I look forward to the recruitment exercise and the opportunity to build my first Claude skill with your team. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-06-30 13:45:00.791', '2026-06-30 13:45:00.791'),
