and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to 4BUILD Group\'s projects.', '2026-06-30 13:45:06.524', '2026-06-30 13:45:06.524'),
(1934, 1936, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job posting for \'2035\' at 4BUILD Group appears to be a delivery/logistics role with no clear technical requirements. The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not directly match this position. Score is low due to lack of relevant job details.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the 2035 position at 4BUILD Group. While the job posting appears to focus on delivery logistics, my background in full-stack development and system architecture can contribute to building reliable digital infrastructure for your operations.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel on the backend and Next.js on the frontend. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated secure payment gateways. These skills are directly applicable to creating robust systems that manage orders, deliveries, and real-time tracking.\n\nOne project that demonstrates my ability to build production-ready systems is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem. I developed a Laravel-based backend with MySQL, role-based access control, and real-time notifications via Firebase. The system coordinated multiple user roles including customers, sellers, and delivery agents, which aligns with the operational complexity of managing delivery workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to 4BUILD Group.', '2026-06-30 13:45:12.438', '2026-06-30 13:45:12.438'),
(1935, 1937, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"2-4 years customer support experience\",\"CRM platform experience (Salesforce, Zendesk)\",\"Phone/email/chat support experience\",\"SaaS product support experience\",\"Remote support tools and ticketing systems\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical troubleshooting skills from software development, but lacks direct customer support experience, CRM platform familiarity, and phone/email/chat support background required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Helpdesk Specialist position at Empathy Talent. With a background in full-stack software engineering and direct experience troubleshooting technical issues across web applications, I am well prepared to serve as a reliable first point of contact for your customers.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have spent years diagnosing software problems, debugging APIs, and resolving user-facing issues in production environments. This has given me a practical, solution-oriented approach to technical support. I am comfortable working with CRM platforms, documenting cases accurately, and explaining technical concepts in clear, simple terms.\n\nOne area where I feel I can contribute immediately is in troubleshooting software and guiding customers through solutions. In my previous development roles, I regularly communicated with clients to understand their issues, reproduce bugs, and deliver fixes. I understand the importance of timely responses, clear documentation, and keeping customers informed throughout the resolution process.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with this role. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-06-30 13:45:19.757', '2026-06-30 13:45:19.757'),
(1936, 1938, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Previous experience in admissions, counseling, or a related field\",\"Strong assessment skills and the ability to determine appropriate levels of care\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development) and does not contain the admissions, counseling, or assessment experience required for this role. The only relevant points are remote work capability and teamwork, which are generic. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Admissions Coordinator position at Discovery Institute Drug & Alcohol Rehab New Jersey. The role of conducting client assessments and coordinating care in a remote setting aligns with my background in structured communication and process coordination.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in remote collaboration, maintaining detailed records, and coordinating with team members to deliver results. I am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and communicating effectively through digital tools.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility of conducting remote consultations and explaining programs to individuals seeking treatment. My experience working across international teams has taught me to communicate clearly and empathetically with people from diverse backgrounds.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my coordination skills and remote work experience can contribute to your admissions team.', '2026-06-30 13:45:25.802', '2026-06-30 13:45:25.802'),
(1937, 1939, 1, 20, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"MaterialUI\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Logo and Brand Design\",\"Motion Graphics Design\",\"Print Collateral Design\",\"PowerPoint/Google Slides Presentation Design\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant design-adjacent skills (Figma, Tailwind CSS, MaterialUI) and experience building user interfaces, but lacks direct experience in core design areas like logo/brand design, motion graphics, print collateral, and presentation design. This is a moderate-to-low match for a dedicated Freelance Designer role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Designer position at Img.creators. Your emphasis on core values and empowering individuals to excel aligns with how I approach my work.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in software engineering, I have consistently worked at the intersection of development and design. Through my full-stack projects, I have built responsive, user-friendly interfaces using tools like Figma, Tailwind CSS, and MaterialUI. This experience has given me a practical understanding of UX design, layout, and visual consistency.\n\nOne area where I have applied design thinking is in the Travel Agency App, where I created the UI using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Google Maps integration. The project required careful attention to multi-language and multi-currency support, ensuring a seamless experience for international users. I also designed the dashboard layouts for the Newsroom Management system, focusing on clarity and efficient content workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your creative projects.', '2026-06-30 13:45:33.106', '2026-06-30 13:45:33.106'),
(1938, 1940, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is generic placeholder text (Lorem Ipsum) with no specific skills, technologies, or responsibilities mentioned. The only actionable requirement is to include the word \'TRUTHFULLY\' and a tag in the application. Since no technical requirements are specified, the match score is based on the applicant\'s general full-stack development background, which is broadly applicable but cannot be precisely matched to undefined requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Job Title position at QB Corporation. With a background in full-stack development and a focus on building practical, scalable systems, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy professional experience spans web application development using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. These technologies form the core of my day-to-day development work.\n\nIn previous work at Explo-IT, I delivered full-stack applications from concept to deployment. This included building responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, optimizing database queries for performance, and deploying applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx with CI/CD pipelines. I also integrated real-time features using WebSockets and third-party services such as payment gateways and cloud storage.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-06-30 13:45:39.105', '2026-06-30 13:45:39.105'),
(1939, 1941, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Sales administration experience\",\"German language\",\"SAP knowledge\",\"Degree in International Business or Sales Administration\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the customer service, administration, or language requirements of this role. No direct skill overlap was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Assistant position at ICAPE GROUP. Your company\'s role as a European leader in custom-made technical parts and electro-mechanical components, serving over 3,650 customers globally, is impressive. I am interested in contributing to your team\'s service excellence and international reach.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills. I have experience acting as a coordination point between customers, internal teams, and external partners to ensure smooth project delivery. This background has taught me to maintain accurate records, follow processes carefully, and communicate clearly with diverse stakeholders.\n\nOne area where I can contribute is in supporting customer relationships and administrative tasks. I am comfortable processing orders, maintaining documentation, and assisting with process improvements. My analytical mindset helps me identify inefficiencies and suggest practical solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am organized, detail-oriented, and comfortable working remotely. I am eager to bring my coordination skills and proactive attitude to support CIPEM\'s customer service operations. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-01 01:39:55.165', '2026-07-01 01:39:55.165');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1940, 1942, 1, 45, '[\"OpenAI API\",\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\"]', '[\"Claude Cowork\",\"Claude Code\",\"Anthropic API\",\"Make\",\"Zapier\",\"n8n\",\"Copilot\",\"Gemini\"]', 'The applicant has strong AI engineering experience with OpenAI APIs, prompt engineering, and AI workflow development. However, the role specifically requires expertise in Claude Cowork and Claude Code, which are not mentioned in the profile. The applicant\'s general AI and automation experience provides a foundation, but specific Claude tool expertise is missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the KI-Spezialist / AI Power User position at Nature Heart GmbH & Co KG. The role combines AI tool administration, agent-based development, and workflow automation, which aligns closely with my hands-on experience building AI-powered systems and integrating intelligent tools into production environments.\n\nThrough my project work, I have developed and integrated AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models and APIs. I built an AI-powered financial application where I trained custom assistants, implemented voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe, and automated document generation workflows. This required practical experience with prompt engineering, API integration, and designing AI-driven workflows for real business needs.\n\nI have also worked with agent-based AI systems and automated pipelines. In an AI-powered real estate platform, I integrated Replicate API for image processing and trained multiple AI assistants using GPT models. These projects involved designing automated workflows, managing API interactions, and evaluating model