(1941, 1943, 1, 45, '[\"Javascript\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\"]', '[\"Five9\",\"Genesys\",\"Salesforce\",\"Contact centre platform administration\",\"LLM APIs\",\"Conversational AI platforms\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong JavaScript and Node.js skills, experience with Docker, Nginx, AWS, and Linux, and has built AI-powered features using OpenAI APIs. However, he lacks direct experience with contact centre platforms (Five9, Genesys), Salesforce integration, and conversational AI platforms, which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Platform Engineer - Contact Centre role at SumUp. The opportunity to own the technical direction of a global contact centre platform and drive its evolution toward AI-powered support aligns directly with the kind of work I enjoy most: building practical, scalable systems that solve real operational problems.\n\nWhat stands out to me about SumUp is the scale and impact of the work. Supporting over 4 million merchants across 37 markets means the contact centre platform must be reliable, adaptable, and continuously improving. The focus on moving toward conversational AI agents, intelligent routing, and real-time agent assistance reflects a practical approach to technology that I find compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented real-time features using WebSockets, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. I have worked with JavaScript extensively across both frontend and backend systems, and I am comfortable in distributed environments