(1942, 1944, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"B2B enterprise sales experience\",\"Account management\",\"Business development\",\"CRM proficiency\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Marketing experience\",\"Operations experience\",\"Logistics experience\",\"Customer success experience\",\"Analytics & visualization tools (Excel, G Suite, Looker)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct sales, account management, business development, or B2B enterprise experience. The role requires senior-level enterprise sales expertise, CRM proficiency, and German language skills, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Enterprise Sales Manager, Wolt for Work position at Wolt. Your mission to bring the same great user experience Wolt is known for to business users around the world is something I find genuinely compelling. The opportunity to own the full sales cycle and drive growth in a rapidly-scaling B2B environment aligns well with my professional approach.\n\nWhile my core expertise is in software engineering, I have consistently operated with an entrepreneurial, ownership-driven mindset across every project I have delivered. At Explo-IT, I worked directly with stakeholders to understand their needs, formulate solutions, and ensure successful delivery. This required structured problem-solving, clear communication, and the ability to manage competing priorities. I am comfortable taking full responsibility for outcomes and working across teams to get things done.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the full end-to-end ownership of the acquisition funnel described in this role. In my previous work, I