atforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your consideration. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your marketing team at GRB.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-01 01:40:26.840', '2026-07-01 01:40:26.840'),
(1944, 1946, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Creative Strategy\",\"Social Media Trends\",\"Script Writing\",\"Campaign Optimization\",\"KPI Analysis\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the ECommerce Strategist role focuses on creative strategy, script writing, and campaign optimization for B2C brands. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the ECommerce Strategist (m/w/d) Direct Response position at RealStudio GmbH. Your work as a growth partner for over 100 top German B2C brands like AG1, AirUp, and Smilodox is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your creative strategy and campaign development.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development and AI integration, where I have built scalable platforms that combine clean frontend interfaces with robust backend systems. I have worked with technologies such as Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js to deliver production-ready applications that support business growth and user engagement.\n\nIn previous roles, I developed and maintained RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance. I also built responsive, SEO-friendly UIs using Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks. These skills directly support the creation of effective digital campaigns and asset optimization.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the ability to analyze KPIs and continuously improve assets based on performance data. I have experience working with real-time metrics and iterating on features to enhance user experience and conversion. I am comfortable collaborating