(1945, 1947, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Scriptwriting\",\"YouTube content strategy\",\"Storytelling\",\"Research methodology\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background and can explain complex topics clearly, but lacks direct experience in scriptwriting, YouTube content creation, and storytelling. The role requires a writer/researcher for tech documentaries, which is a different skill set from software engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Doku-Autor:in / Recherche & Skript position at TäglichTechnik. Your approach to tech storytelling — taking complex systems apart and making invisible mechanisms tangible — is exactly the kind of work I enjoy doing.\n\nWhat stands out to me about TäglichTechnik is the focus on substance over spectacle. No tutorials, no marketing fluff, just honest, well-researched documentaries that respect the viewer\'s intelligence. That philosophy aligns with how I think and write.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have spent years researching and understanding complex technical systems — from AI-powered applications and real-time communication engines to autonomous drone networks and privacy-preserving blockchain frameworks. Breaking down these systems into clear, simple explanations has been a natural part of my daily work. I know how to find reliable sources, dig into unexpected details, and structure information so it makes sense to people who are not specialists.\n\nI also understand the mechanics of YouTube content. I know what a hook does, how pacing affects retention, and why every sentence needs to earn its place. When I write, I think in short, rhythmic sentences with concrete images. I avoid jargon and empty phrases. I also consider how the script could be visualized, because good storytelling on YouTube is as much about structure as it is about words.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would be happy to send a writing sample as requested.', '2026-07-01 01:40:42.061', '2026-07-01 01:40:42.061'),
(1946, 1948, 1, 55, '[\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Typescript\",\"Go\",\"Microservices\",\"CI/CD\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"REST APIs\"]', '[\"8+ years of software engineering experience\",\"Experience leading an engineering team or squad\",\"Experience with CMS platforms like Builder.io or Contentful\",\"Experience with on-call rotations\",\"Experience with observability tools\",\"Experience with DORA metrics\",\"Experience in Growth, Lifecycle, or e-commerce domains\",\"Understanding of SEO, personalization, and experimentation frameworks\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in the core web stack (React, Next.js, TypeScript, Go, microservices) and relevant full-stack development experience. However, the role requires 8+ years of experience and proven team leadership/management experience, which the applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate. The applicant\'s experience is more hands-on individual contributor level rather than engineering management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Engineering Manager - Website position at SumUp. SumUp\'s mission to empower small businesses globally with simple financial tools is something I find genuinely meaningful, and the opportunity to lead the Website squad that shapes the merchant journey from first impression to purchase is particularly compelling.\n\nMy professional experience centers on building and delivering modern web platforms. Over the past four years, I have worked extensively with React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Go, alongside microservices architecture and API design. I have built scalable applications from the ground up, focusing on performance, clean architecture, and maintainable code