(1947, 1949, 1, 55, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"Python\",\"GraphQL\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Cypress\",\"Selenium\",\"Hibernate\",\"Ant\",\"Maven\",\"Test Case Management\",\"Issue Tracking\",\"Postman\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong software engineering experience with JavaScript, Python, and TypeScript, along with API testing (REST, GraphQL), Linux development, CI/CD, Docker, and Kubernetes. However, the role specifically requires Java, test automation frameworks like Cypress or Selenium, and tools like Hibernate, Ant, and Maven, which are not present in his profile. The match is moderate, with solid foundational skills but missing key Java and test automation requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Developer in Test II - Java position at Onapsis. The work Onapsis does in securing business-critical applications for global enterprises is genuinely important, and I find the intersection of cybersecurity, automation, and quality engineering particularly compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a software engineer, I have built a strong foundation in programming with JavaScript, Python, and TypeScript, and I have applied these skills across full-stack development, API integration, and test automation. I am comfortable designing and executing test procedures, working with CI/CD pipelines, and ensuring software quality through automated testing frameworks.\n\nOne area that aligns well with this role is my experience testing REST and GraphQL APIs using Postman, as well as working with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have also develop