(1948, 1950, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Influencer management\",\"Kooperationsmanagement\",\"Canva\",\"Video-Editing\",\"Redaktionsplanung\",\"Content-Scheduling\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this Creator Manager role, which focuses on influencer management, content coordination, and social media operations. There are no overlapping skills or relevant experience in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Creator Manager (m/w/d) Teilzeit position at Hebamme Isabelle. Your work in supporting families during pregnancy, birth, and the postpartum period is genuinely meaningful, and I would be proud to contribute to a team that reaches thousands of families every day.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong project coordination, independent work habits, and clear communication skills. In my previous roles, I managed end-to-end delivery of web applications, coordinated with clients and stakeholders, and maintained structured workflows under tight deadlines. I am comfortable working remotely and taking ownership of tasks without needing constant supervision.\n\nI am a quick learner and have experience with content creation tools. I am proficient with Canva for graphic design and have worked with video editing software. I am also familiar with scheduling and planning workflows, which I believe will translate well to managing a content calendar and coordinating posts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I a