(1952, 1954, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Fahrzeugvollfolierung\",\"Montage von Werbeanlagen\",\"Gebäudeglasbeschichtungen\",\"Ausbildung als Werbetechniker\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, which does not match the hands-on technical trade skills required for this Werbetechniker role. There are no overlapping skills or experience in vehicle wrapping, signage installation, or related production techniques.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werbetechniker/Folientechniker/Folierer position at Letus® Werbemanufaktur GmbH. I understand this role requires hands-on expertise in vehicle wrapping, signage installation, and working with modern production equipment.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, with a focus on full-stack web development and AI systems. I have worked with technologies like Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js to build scalable applications. I have also developed real-time systems and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-01 01:41:30.332', '2026-07-01 01:41:30.332'),
(1953, 1955, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Master\'s degree in Engineering or comparable technical discipline\",\"5+ years in product management or engineering role in powertrain/defense\",\"Solid understanding of powertrain systems\",\"Product lifecycle management experience\",\"Commercial acumen (pricing, margin management)\",\"Matrix organization experience\",\"Defense or regulated industrial market exposure\",\"Project planning tools (e.g., MS Project)\",\"Fluent German (C1) and English (C1)\",\"French at working level (B2)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows a strong technical foundation in software engineering and defense-related systems (UAV security, blockchain for autonomous vehicles), but lacks the required domain-specific experience in powertrain systems, product lifecycle management, commercial acumen, and the 5+ years of product management experience in defense or industrial environments. The role requires a Master\'s degree in Engineering and fluency in German, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Line Manager Defense Applications position at CONCAPE. The role\'s focus on end-to-end product ownership in the defense segment, combined with the opportunity to work at the intersection of engineering, commercial strategy, and key account management, aligns directly with my technical background and career direction.\n\nMy work has centered on building secure, resilient systems for defense and autonomous applications. I developed a Privacy-Preserving Blockchain Framework for Autonomous Vehicles (OmniGuard V2X), which integrates blockchain, Zero-Knowledge Proofs, and post-quantum cryptography to protect Vehicle-to-Everything (V2X) communication. This project required defining technical requirements, coordinating with research objectives, and ensuring the system met both security and performance targets. I also built a Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), a real-time assistive system using YOLOv8n object detection and low-latency UDP streaming, demonstrating my ability to take a product from concept to deployment.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have taken full ownership of product lifecycles, from defining specifications based on customer and R&D input to driving launches and monitoring performance. I have collaborated cross-functionally with engineering, marketing, and senior stakeholders to align product strategies with business objectives. This has given me a practical understanding of pricing decisions, cost control, and profitability management within matrix organizations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in defense-related systems and product lifecycle management can contribute to CONCAPE\'s growth in the defense segment.', '2026-07-01 01:41:38.812', '2026-07-01 01:41:38.812'),
(1954, 1956, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Führungserfahrung (leadership experience)\",\"Mechanik / Elektrotechnik / Produktionstechnik background\",\"Preventive maintenance systems\",\"TPM / Lean methods\",\"FMCG / food safety standards\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has relevant technical infrastructure skills (Linux, Docker, Nginx, CI/CD, monitoring) but lacks the required mechanical/electrical engineering background, production leadership experience, preventive maintenance expertise, TPM/Lean knowledge, and German language proficiency for this technical site manager role in a manufacturing environment.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter Technik / Technischer Standortleiter position at CONCAPE, supporting the recruitment for a traditional family-owned production company in the FMCG sector in the Lake Constance region.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed a strong foundation in Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and Nginx configuration. I have deployed and maintained production applications, managed CI/CD pipelines, and implemented monitoring systems using Prometheus and Grafana. These skills align well with the technical ownership and preventive maintenance responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to build and implement a Preventive-Maintenance strategy across multiple sites. In previous work, I have managed server health monitoring systems that tracked availability, latency, and system metrics in real time. I am comfortable with the hands-on, shopfloor-oriented approach required to maintain production reliability and drive continuous improvement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background can contribute to the operational excellence of your production sites.', '2026-07-01 01:41:45.956', '2026-07-01 01:41:45.956'),
(1955, 1957, 1, 45, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Project management experience\",\"Formal AI/ML certification\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Experience with EU AI Act / governance frameworks\"]', 'The applicant has strong hands-on AI engineering experience building production systems with LLMs and automation, which aligns with the technical AI content of the program. However, the role is a project management qualification position, and the applicant\'s profile lacks formal project management experience, German language skills, and familiarity with AI governance frameworks like the EU AI Act. The match is moderate, with potential for the applicant to benefit from the program as a participant rather than as a candidate for a project management role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager (m/w/d) - Zukunftsqualifikation für IT-Fachkräfte und Projektverantwortliche position at ZBID. The AI Ready program\'s focus on equipping IT professionals with practical AI competencies aligns directly with my technical background and career direction.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and deployed AI-powered applications that integrate large language models, generative AI, and automation into real production environments. My work includes developing AI assistants using OpenAI\'s latest models, implementing automated document generation, and creating systems that process natural language inputs to trigger intelligent workflows. These projects required understanding both the technical implementation and the practical business impact of AI.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the automation of IT and business processes. In previous work, I designed systems that automated repetitive tasks, from data extraction and processing to PDF generation and email delivery. I also implemented role-based access control, payment integrations, and real-time features, giving me a solid understanding of how AI can be embedded into existing IT project workflows to improve efficiency and reduce manual effort.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am interested in contributing to the AI Ready program and helping IT professionals build practical AI skills for modern project environments. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-07-01 01:41:54.267', '2026-07-01 01:41:54.267'),
(1956, 1958, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Go\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"OpenStack\",\"Ansible\",\"Terraform\",\"FluxCD/ArgoCD\",\"Python\",\"KVM\",\"Bare-metal provisioning\",\"Advanced compute-node tuning\",\"Self-healing systems\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Kubernetes, Go, and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana) that partially align with the SRE role. However, the profile lacks direct experience with OpenStack, Ansible, Terraform, GitOps workflows (FluxCD/ArgoCD), and production infrastructure management at scale, which are core requirements for this senior position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Site Reliability Engineer (m/f/d) position at gridscale GmbH. The opportunity to help build and operate OVHcloud\'s on-premise cloud platform, with a strong emphasis on automation, Kubernetes, and AI-assisted engineering, aligns directly with my technical background and interests.\n\nMy experience spans Linux system administration, container orchestration with Docker and Kubernetes, and infrastructure monitoring using Prometheus and Grafana. I have worked with CI/CD pipelines and understand the operational discipline required to maintain reliable, production-grade systems. I also have practical experience with Go, which I have used for backend services and automation tasks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the AI-substrate workstream described in the role. I have built real-time monitoring dashboards using Node.js and Socket.IO, and I regularly use AI-assisted coding tools in my daily workflow. I see AI tooling as a practical multiplier for engineering output, not just a trend, and I am keen to contribute to agentic prototypes for incident triage and capacity planning.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the gridscale and OVHcloud platform team.', '2026-07-01 01:42:01.133', '2026-07-01 01:42:01.133'),
(1957, 1959, 1, 45, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Generative KI\",\"Prompt Engineering\",\"ChatGPT\",\"EU AI Act\",\"Büro- und Verwaltungsprozesse\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background with some AI project experience (OpenAI, AI assistants, image processing), but the job is a training program for becoming an AI expert, not a role requiring existing AI expertise. The applicant\'s hands-on AI project work is a positive indicator, but the program is designed for career changers and those new to AI, making the match moderate.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the KI-Experte Weiterbildung program at ZBID. As a software engineer with hands-on experience in AI-powered systems, I am looking to deepen my expertise in artificial intelligence through your structured, practice-oriented program.\n\nMy work has involved building production systems that integrate generative AI, large language models, and automation pipelines. I developed an AI-powered financial application using OpenAI\'s latest models, AWS services, and voice-to-text processing. I also built an AI-based real estate platform that uses Replicate API for image processing and Stripe for payment integration. These projects required me to work with prompt engineering, model integration, and responsible data handling.\n\nWhat interests me about ZBID\'s program is its focus on practical, job-ready skills. The curriculum covers generative AI, prompt engineering, workflow automation, and the responsible use of AI tools like ChatGPT. These are areas I have already applied in real projects, and I want to build on that foundation with formal training. I am also interested in learning about the EU AI Act and regulatory requirements, which are increasingly important in this field.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to begin this training and apply what I learn to real business challenges. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your program.', '2026-07-01 01:42:09.149', '2026-07-01 01:42:09.149');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1958, 1960, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Vertriebs- und Führungserfahrung im deutschen Generikamarkt\",\"Strategisches Verständnis des Krankenkassen-Tendergeschäfts\",\"Erfahrung in Vertriebskanälen: Klinik, Großhandel, Versandhandel, Apotheke\",\"Track Record in Margenoptimierung\",\"Unternehmerisches Mindset\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Country Manager role in the German generics pharmaceutical market. The role requires deep domain expertise in pharmaceutical sales, tender business, and German healthcare market knowledge, none of which are present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Country Manager Generika Deutschland position at Andris Consulting GmbH.\n\nAfter reviewing the job description, it is clear that this role requires extensive experience in the German generics market, tender business, and pharmaceutical sales channel management. My professional background is in software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI systems, which does not align with the core requirements of this position.\n\nI respect the clarity of your requirements and appreciate the opportunity to apply. I have attached my CV for your reference, in case there are other positions within your organization where my technical skills could be more relevant.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-01 01:42:14.034', '2026-07-01 01:42:14.034'),
(1959, 1961, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Backoffice/Sachbearbeitung experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"CRM experience\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Credit/financing process experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a customer service and backoffice role requiring German language proficiency, CRM experience, and administrative skills. There is very little overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kundenbetreuung / Sachbearbeitung position at Enercapital - Solution GmbH. Your company\'s focus on simplifying and accelerating financing for renewable energy projects like photovoltaics, heat pumps, and e-mobility is genuinely impactful, and I would be glad to contribute to your service and backoffice operations.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a structured and detail-oriented approach to managing tasks and documentation. I am comfortable handling multiple cases in parallel, tracking statuses, and ensuring that every step of a process is completed accurately and on time. I bring the same reliability and follow-through to administrative and customer-facing work.\n\nIn my previous roles, I was responsible for maintaining clear records, managing project documentation, and communicating progress to stakeholders. I am confident in my ability to review documents for completeness, follow up on missing items, and keep CRM data accurate and up to date. I enjoy bringing order to processes and seeing cases through to a clean finish.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a reliable, structured, and friendly communicator who takes ownership of tasks and works well both independently and as part of a team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-01 01:42:21.669', '2026-07-01 01:42:21.669'),
(1960, 1962, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"Social media content creation\",\"Google Workspace\",\"MS Office\",\"German language (C1)\",\"Event planning\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI integration, but this is a marketing-focused Werkstudent role requiring marketing-specific experience, social media content creation, event planning, and native-level German. The technical overlap is minimal, and the applicant lacks the core marketing qualifications and German language proficiency required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) Marketing position at codemanufaktur GmbH. The opportunity to contribute to content creation, website management, and marketing strategy while studying aligns well with my technical background and hands-on project experience.\n\nMy work has involved building and maintaining websites and landing pages using Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS. I have experience creating structured content, managing site updates, and ensuring responsive, user-friendly interfaces. These skills directly support the content creation and website maintenance responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nI have worked with AI tools in several projects, integrating OpenAI APIs for intelligent assistants and using Replicate for image processing. This experience gives me a practical understanding of how AI can enhance content workflows and marketing automation. I am comfortable exploring new tools and applying them to real-world tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently studying Software Engineering and looking for a practical opportunity to apply my skills in a marketing context. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-01 01:42:29.370', '2026-07-01 01:42:29.370'),
(1961, 1963, 1, 85, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"REST API\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Vue JS\",\"LLM Integration\",\"Workflow Automation\"]', 'Strong match for Fullstack Developer role. Applicant has professional experience with Laravel and React/Next.js, REST APIs, relational databases, and deployment. Missing Vue.js experience is noted but React is explicitly accepted in the job description. Applicant also has relevant AI/automation project experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fullstack Developer Laravel & React/Vue position at MintCode Solutions GmbH. What stands out to me about your approach is the focus on building software that solves real problems without legacy baggage, combined with modern tooling and a culture that values clean code and fast iteration. That aligns directly with how I prefer to work.\n\nOver the past few years, I have been developing full-stack applications professionally using Laravel on the backend and React or Next.js on the frontend. I am comfortable with PHP and Laravel for building robust backend systems, and I work well with React for creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces. I also have experience with relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and I regularly work with RESTful APIs for integrating third-party systems and connecting frontend and backend services.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for designing and building scalable web applications from the ground up. I implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways in Laravel. I also optimized database performance through Eloquent query tuning and caching strategies. On the frontend side, I built responsive UIs with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, and I delivered real-time features such as chat and live notifications using WebSockets. I deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and I worked with CI/CD pipelines for smooth releases.\n\nOne project that reflects my full-stack capabilities is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I built a Laravel-based backend with role-based access control, RESTful APIs, and MySQL, paired with Flutter mobile apps for different user roles. This project required coordinating multiple stakeholders, integrating payment flows, and ensuring the system scaled reliably. I also have experience with AI integration and automation, having built AI-powered assistants using OpenAI and Replicate APIs in a real estate platform project.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team at MintCode Solutions GmbH.', '2026-07-01 01:42:38.249', '2026-07-01 01:42:38.249'),
(1962, 1964, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"HubSpot\",\"Canva\",\"Adobe Creative Cloud\",\"Campaign management\",\"SEO/SEM\",\"Content marketing\",\"ABM\",\"LinkedIn Ads\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI, but the Junior Marketing Manager role requires marketing-specific experience, tools (HubSpot, Canva), and domain knowledge that are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Marketing Manager position at Omnora GmbH. Your mission to help companies like DB, AOK, and ADAC secure and structure their knowledge using AI is genuinely interesting. I am drawn to the combination of technology, automation, and ownership that this role offers.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, with a strong focus on building AI-powered applications and automation systems. I have developed full-stack platforms that integrate AI assistants, process data intelligently, and automate repetitive tasks. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how AI tools can be applied to real-world problems, including content production, data analysis, and workflow automation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on data-driven decision-making and building scalable marketing infrastructure. In my projects, I have worked extensively with dashboards, KPIs, and real-time monitoring systems. I am comfortable interpreting data, identifying patterns, and using those insights to guide optimization. I also have experience with design tools and creating user interfaces that are both functional and visually appealing.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take ownership, learn quickly, and make a tangible impact. Omnora\'s startup environment and the opportunity to shape the marketing function from an early stage are exactly the kind of challenge I want. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-01 01:42:46.236', '2026-07-01 01:42:46.236'),
(1963, 1965, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Accommodation reservation experience\",\"Administration experience in a fast-paced team\",\"Inflight Accommodation system knowledge\",\"MS Office Suite proficiency\",\"Customer service experience\",\"Open C class Driver Licence\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development) and does not match the core requirements of this Accommodation Administrator role, which demands hospitality, accommodation reservation, administration, and customer service experience. No direct skills from the job description are present in the applicant\'s profile. The score is low due to the fundamental mismatch in role type and required experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Accommodation Administrator position at Sodexo, working across Far North Queensland sites on a 14/7 FIFO roster. Sodexo\'s role in supporting remote mining and energy communities through quality-of-life services is something I find genuinely meaningful, and I am keen to contribute to your team in this capacity.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and data management skills through years of building and maintaining complex systems. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I managed databases, handled large volumes of data entry, and maintained accurate records across multiple projects. These experiences have given me the discipline and attention to detail needed for administrative roles.\n\nI am comfortable working in structured, fast-paced environments and have experience coordinating tasks across teams. My work on real-time monitoring dashboards and multi-user platforms required clear communication, documentation, and the ability to prioritize effectively under pressure. I am confident these skills transfer well to accommodation administration, flight bookings, and receptionist duties.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI hold a valid Open C class Driver\'s Licence and am ready to work on a FIFO basis from Cairns. I am organized, self-motivated, and eager to support Sodexo\'s mission of creating a home away from home for remote site workers. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-01 01:42:55.849', '2026-07-01 01:42:55.849'),
(1964, 1966, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"cleaning and hygiene management\",\"health and safety monitoring\",\"site security oversight\",\"supervision of cleaning staff\",\"school caretaking experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant experience in school caretaking, cleaning, health and safety, or site security. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Caretaker position at Manor Park Primary School. The opportunity to contribute to a safe, clean, and welcoming environment where children can thrive is something I take seriously. I understand the responsibility that comes with maintaining high standards of cleanliness, health and safety, and site security, and I am ready to bring my reliability and attention to detail to this role.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, the skills I have developed translate well into this position. Over the years, I have learned to manage complex tasks independently, organize workloads efficiently, and take ownership of outcomes. I approach every responsibility with a methodical mindset, ensuring that nothing is overlooked and that systems run smoothly.\n\nI am comfortable working as part of a team and building positive relationships with colleagues, students, and visitors. I communicate clearly and respectfully, and I am used to collaborating with people from different backgrounds. I am also fluent in English and Bengali, which allows me to connect with a diverse school community.\n\nI am a quick learner and a practical problem solver. I do not wait for instructions when something needs to be done. I take initiative, use my judgment, and follow through until the job is completed properly. I understand that a school environment requires someone who is visible, reliable, and proactive.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the team at Manor Park Primary School. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-01 01:43:03.078', '2026-07-01 01:43:03.078'),
(1965, 1967, 1, 15, '[\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"private markets experience\",\"legal entity management\",\"compliance\",\"HR operations\",\"supplier management\",\"7+ years cross-functional operations leadership\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development, AI tools, and infrastructure (Docker, Linux, cloud) which partially matches the technology and AI enthusiasm requirement. However, the role requires 7+ years of cross-functional operations leadership in private markets, including legal, compliance, HR, and supplier management — experience not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President Operations role at Aventum Search, where a private markets alternative investment company is seeking a leader for technical operations, technology systems, and cross-functional delivery.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built and managed technology systems that support business operations across multiple functions. My work includes designing scalable web applications, integrating AI-powered tools, and optimizing operational workflows. I am process-oriented and comfortable working with technology, compliance-related systems, and cross-team coordination.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is structuring and optimizing operational infrastructure. In previous roles, I have deployed full-stack platforms using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, implemented role-based access control, and built real-time features using WebSockets. I have also worked with Docker, Linux servers, and cloud deployment to ensure reliable system performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in technology systems and operations can contribute to this role.', '2026-07-01 01:43:10.406', '2026-07-01 01:43:10.406'),
(1966, 1968, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"HR operations\",\"OKR implementation\",\"Benefits administration\",\"Employee engagement\",\"Compliance\",\"Performance management systems\",\"8+ years HR experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR-specific experience or skills. While they have experience building systems and working with teams, they do not meet the core requirements for this HR Lead role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the HR Lead position at Wowza. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years working closely with leadership, operations, and cross-functional teams to build systems that support people, process, and growth at scale.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Wowza is the emphasis on building a consistent employee experience and strong compliance foundations for a remote, global team. In my previous roles, I have been responsible for designing role-based access systems, implementing authentication and authorization workflows, and creating structured processes that ensure security, accountability, and smooth operations across distributed teams.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem where I built a full-stack platform with role-based access control for customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams. This required designing scalable systems that supported clear permissions, data integrity, and operational consistency across different user groups. The same principles apply to building HR systems that are fair, transparent, and scalable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nIMAGINATIVE RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-01 01:43:17.198', '2026-07-01 01:43:17.198'),
(1967, 1969, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description for the LEAD role at ABM Industries focuses on facility, engineering, and infrastructure solutions without listing specific technical requirements. The applicant\'s profile is heavily technical (full-stack web development, AI, cybersecurity, drone systems) with no direct overlap in domain. The match score is low due to the absence of job-specific technical requirements and domain alignment.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the LEAD position at ABM Industries. With a background in full-stack engineering and a focus on building scalable, secure systems, I am interested in contributing to ABM\'s mission of delivering integrated facility and infrastructure solutions through technology.\n\nABM\'s scale and commitment to innovation across commercial real estate, aviation, and mission-critical sectors stand out. The opportunity to work on systems that enhance operational efficiency and occupant experience aligns with my experience in developing robust, production-ready applications.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel and Next.js, built RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange, and implemented authentication and role-based access control. I have also optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies, ensuring applications remain responsive under load.\n\nOne relevant project I delivered is a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem powered by a Laravel backend and MySQL database, with role-based access control for customers, sellers, and logistics teams. This project involved building secure APIs, integrating Firebase notifications, and deploying on cloud infrastructure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to ABM\'s technology initiatives.', '2026-07-01 01:43:24.350', '2026-07-01 01:43:24.350'),
(1968, 1970, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Housekeeping experience\",\"Hospitality industry experience\",\"Physical stamina for cleaning tasks\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no relevant housekeeping or hospitality experience. The job requires cleaning, room preparation, and maintenance tasks which do not match the applicant\'s technical profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Housekeeper position at Kabannas. Your description of a vibrant, community-driven space where guests can feel at home resonates with me. I value creating environments that are clean, organised, and genuinely welcoming.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have always taken pride in maintaining high standards of cleanliness and order in every space I occupy. I am reliable, consistent, and pay close attention to the details that make a difference in how a room or shared area feels.\n\nI enjoy working as part of a team and communicating clearly with others to ensure everything runs smoothly. I am organised, manage my time effectively, and take ownership of my responsibilities. I understand that behind-the-scenes work is essential to creating a positive guest experience.\n\nIn addition to my work ethic, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with people from different backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to the Kabannas team and help create the spaces where guests can truly relax and recharge.', '2026-07-01 01:43:30.794', '2026-07-01 01:43:30.794'),
(1969, 1971, 1, 30, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\"]', '[\"Adobe CC Suite\",\"Motion design\",\"Video editing\",\"Typography expertise\",\"Layout design\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant design-adjacent skills (Figma, UI frameworks) and frontend development experience, but lacks core design-specific tools like Adobe CC Suite and explicit experience in typography, layout, and motion design required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Designer role at Haus. Your studio\'s focus on blending creativity with technology aligns with how I approach design and development.\n\nThrough hands-on project work, I have built a strong foundation in typography, layout, and visual communication. I use Figma regularly for wireframing and prototyping, and I bring an understanding of how UI, motion, and interaction shape user experiences. My background in frontend development gives me practical insight into how designs translate into working digital products.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is contributing to moodboards, style frames, and exploratory concepting. In previous work on web applications, I collaborated closely with teams to refine visual concepts and deliver production-ready assets. I am comfortable iterating based on feedback and pushing creative work forward alongside Art Directors and Senior Designers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Haus\'s upcoming projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-01 01:43:38.196', '2026-07-01 01:43:38.196'),
(1970, 1972, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Brand strategy\",\"Marketing leadership\",\"12+ years brand marketing experience\",\"Bachelor\'s in Marketing/Business/Communications\",\"Multi-brand portfolio management\",\"Integrated marketing campaigns\",\"Brand governance\",\"Consumer goods experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in brand marketing, brand strategy, or marketing leadership. The role requires 12+ years of brand marketing experience, expertise in brand architecture, integrated marketing, and team leadership. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s technical profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Director of Brand Marketing position at Coleto Brands. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong systems-oriented mindset, experience leading cross-functional technical initiatives, and a data-driven approach to decision-making that aligns well with the strategic and operational demands of this role.\n\nColeto Brands\' commitment to enhancing spaces through design and functionality, particularly through flagship brands like Kichler and Progress Lighting, is impressive. The opportunity to define and protect brand strategy across a multi-brand portfolio resonates with my experience in building scalable, consistent systems from the ground up.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with product, design, and business stakeholders to translate high-level goals into cohesive digital experiences. I have led the development of platforms that required strict adherence to brand guidelines, consistent messaging, and seamless user experiences across multiple touchpoints. This has given me a practical understanding of how brand strategy must be executed consistently across websites, content, and customer-facing interfaces.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the role\'s emphasis on brand stewardship and governance. In previous work, I have established technical standards, documentation, and review processes to ensure consistency across large-scale projects. I am comfortable balancing high-level strategy with hands-on execution, and I have a track record of using data and insights to refine approaches and measure impact.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-01 01:43:47.163', '2026-07-01 01:43:47.163'),
(1971, 1973, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Business administration experience\",\"Administrative tools\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and organizational skills from managing complex projects. However, the role is Business Administration, which does not directly align with the applicant\'s core technical background. The match is low due to the role being outside the applicant\'s primary domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Administration position at Brainkind. While my background is primarily technical, I have consistently taken on organizational and coordination responsibilities in my development work, which has given me practical experience in administration, workflow management, and cross-team communication.\n\nIn my role as a Web Developer, I managed project delivery timelines, coordinated with stakeholders, and ensured smooth communication between development teams and business units. I handled task prioritization, documentation, and deployment planning, which required strong organizational skills and attention to detail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and administration. I have experience managing multi-module platforms, overseeing data flow between systems, and maintaining clear documentation for both technical and non-technical audiences. These responsibilities have prepared me to handle administrative tasks efficiently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational and coordination skills can contribute to Brainkind\'s operations.', '2026-07-01 01:43:54.153', '2026-07-01 01:43:54.153'),
(1972, 1974, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Copywriting\",\"Social media content creation\",\"Beauty industry experience\",\"Editorial collaboration\",\"Brand voice management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no relevant copywriting, social media, or editorial experience. The role requires writing organic and paid social copy, collaborating with an editorial team, and staying current on product positioning. The applicant\'s skills are entirely technical (web development, AI, backend systems) and do not match the requirements of this copywriting position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Social Copywriter position at Milk Makeup. Your brand\'s focus on creativity, self-expression, and community-driven beauty aligns with how I approach communication and collaboration in my work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently relied on strong writing and editing skills to document complex systems, communicate with stakeholders, and craft clear, user-facing content. I understand the discipline of writing concisely and with purpose, whether for technical documentation or social copy.\n\nI am drawn to the collaborative nature of this role. Working closely with an editorial team to ensure copy aligns with brand strategy and product positioning requires both precision and adaptability. I am comfortable with feedback loops, tight deadlines, and the iterative process of refining content until it is right.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am available Monday-Friday with a flexible schedule and can commit up to 20 hours per week. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the Milk Makeup editorial team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-01 01:44:01.104', '2026-07-01 01:44:01.104'),
(1973, 1975, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"8-10+ years in luxury travel/hospitality/service leadership\",\"5+ years as a luxury travel advisor\",\"People leadership or team mentorship experience\",\"Escalation management and service recovery\",\"Travel industry partnerships and supplier relationships\",\"Sabre experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in luxury travel, hospitality, or service leadership. The Director of Service role requires 8-10+ years in luxury travel, 5+ years as a travel advisor, and deep experience in team leadership, escalation management, and supplier relationships. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director of Service position at Marchay. Marchay\'s model of delivering curated, high-touch travel experiences to sophisticated members is impressive, and I am drawn to the challenge of leading a service team that defines excellence in luxury hospitality.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering rather than luxury travel, I bring transferable strengths in team coordination, process design, and client-focused delivery. In my work as a Web Developer, I have collaborated closely with stakeholders, managed project timelines, and ensured that end-user needs are met with consistency and quality. These experiences have built a practical understanding of service standards, escalation handling, and cross-functional teamwork.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on training, mentorship, and performance management within the Service team. I have experience mentoring junior developers and contributing to team knowledge-sharing sessions. I am comfortable defining clear roles, supporting career development, and creating structures that help teams perform consistently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Marchay\'s service team and member experience.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-01 01:44:08.879', '2026-07-01 01:44:08.879'),
(1974, 1976, 1, 2, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"NVQ Level 2 or equivalent in a relevant trade\",\"Experience in domestic / social housing environment\",\"Driving license with eligibility to drive in the UK\",\"Painting and decorating skills\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant trade qualifications, painting experience, or UK driving license required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Painter position at Ian Williams Ltd. I understand you are looking for a skilled individual to carry out internal and external decorations in housing settings, and I am ready to bring my strong work ethic and commitment to quality to your team.\n\nWhile my professional experience is in software engineering, I have always valued hands-on, detail-oriented work. I am a quick learner and a hard worker, and I am fully prepared to develop the specific trade skills required for this role. I take pride in completing tasks thoroughly and safely.\n\nI enjoy working with people and understand the importance of delivering exceptional customer service in a domestic environment. I am comfortable working both as part of a team and independently, and I am committed to making a positive difference to residents\' homes.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-01 01:44:14.347', '2026-07-01 01:44:14.347'),
(1975, 1977, 1, 2, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'Matched on Go.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pengajar Biologi Online position at Ruangguru for Business. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and teaching abilities through years of explaining complex technical concepts to diverse audiences.\n\nRuangguru\'s mission to make quality education accessible across Indonesia is something I genuinely admire. The platform\'s reach and impact on students from various backgrounds align with my interest in using technology to create meaningful real-world change.\n\nThrough my experience as a web developer, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams, mentored junior developers, and presented technical solutions to non-technical stakeholders. These experiences have sharpened my ability to break down complex topics into clear, understandable explanations, which I believe is essential for effective online teaching.\n\nI am comfortable teaching online, proficient with Google Meet and Zoom, and have the necessary equipment including a laptop, headphone, and stable internet connection. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in multicultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my communication skills, adaptability, and enthusiasm for education to the Ruangguru team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to contribute to your mission.', '2026-07-01 01:44:19.901', '2026-07-01 01:44:19.901'),
(1976, 1978, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer support experience\",\"Administrative/accounting experience\",\"German language proficiency (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, which provides a good foundation for understanding software products. However, the role is primarily a customer support and administrative position requiring very good German language skills, which are not mentioned in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s technical skills are not directly relevant to the core responsibilities of ticket handling, bug documentation, and administrative tasks.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Vergabepilot AI (Minijob) position at ciconia Systems GmbH. Your platform helps companies navigate public procurement in Germany using AI, and I find the combination of GovTech, AI, and practical user support genuinely interesting.\n\nAs a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have developed a strong technical understanding of software products and how they work under the hood. I am comfortable navigating complex systems, identifying issues, and communicating clearly with both users and development teams. This technical foundation allows me to quickly learn new tools and handle support tickets with precision.\n\nIn previous work, I have managed bug tracking, documentation, and user-facing communication. I am experienced in taking detailed bug reports, reproducing issues, and forwarding them to the right team members. I also have experience with administrative workflows, including managing user data and handling recurring tasks in a structured way.\n\nI work well independently and take ownership of my responsibilities. I am fluent in German and English, and I enjoy helping people solve problems in a clear and friendly manner. The remote and flexible nature of this role fits well with how I work best.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would be happy to discuss how I can support your team and your users.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-01 13:39:57.627', '2026-07-01 13:39:57.627'),
(1977, 1979, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"SAP HCM Payroll\",\"Employee Central Payroll\",\"ABAP\",\"German language (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Payroll process knowledge (German law)\",\"SAP configuration and customizing\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in database management, Linux, and DevOps tools, but lacks the core SAP HCM Payroll expertise, German payroll process knowledge, and German language fluency required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP HCM Payroll Consultant role at j&s-soft AG. Your focus on combining SAP expertise with practical, customer-oriented solutions and your openness to supporting individual growth caught my attention.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, with strong technical skills in system configuration, database management, and API integration. I have worked with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Linux server environments, and I understand how to build and maintain reliable, well-structured systems that support business operations.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have collaborated closely with stakeholders to analyze requirements, optimize processes, and implement custom solutions. I am comfortable working independently and enjoy being part of a team where knowledge sharing and practical problem-solving are valued.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and problem-solving approach could contribute to your team.', '2026-07-01 13:40:05.985', '2026-07-01 13:40:05.985');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1978, 1980, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Windows Server\",\"Active Directory\",\"DNS\",\"DHCP\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"Entra ID\",\"Intune\",\"Firewall\",\"Fortinet\",\"PowerShell\",\"Backup\",\"Hyper-V\",\"RDS\",\"Exchange Online\",\"Windows Autopilot\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux server administration, Docker, Nginx, Apache, CI/CD, and monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana). However, the role requires deep expertise in Windows-based infrastructure (AD, DNS, DHCP, M365, Entra ID, Intune, Hyper-V, RDS), firewall configuration, PowerShell automation, and backup systems. The applicant\'s profile is primarily web development focused, with limited direct IT administration experience. The match is low for this senior-level Windows-centric system administration role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior IT-Systemadministrator position at strategie:p personalberatung. The opportunity to contribute to the digital security infrastructure of a leading interdisciplinary group with over 200 employees is genuinely compelling.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on Linux server administration, containerization with Docker, and web server configuration using Nginx and Apache. I have practical experience managing server environments, setting up CI/CD pipelines, and deploying applications in production. I also work with monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to track system health and performance.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers, configuring Nginx and Apache for optimal performance, and managing Docker containers. I implemented CI/CD workflows to streamline deployments and ensure system reliability. This hands-on experience with server infrastructure, combined with my work on system monitoring and documentation, directly aligns with the responsibilities of administering and evolving IT infrastructure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in system administration and infrastructure management can support your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-01 13:40:15.033', '2026-07-01 13:40:15.033'),
(1979, 1981, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Firebase\"]', '[\"Windows Client/Server Administration\",\"Active Directory\",\"DNS\",\"DHCP\",\"DFS\",\"GPO\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"Entra ID\",\"Intune\",\"Exchange Online\",\"Hyper-V\",\"Fortinet\",\"PowerShell\",\"Backup Systems\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux server administration, Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD, which partially overlap with the IT-Administrator role. However, the role requires deep expertise in Windows-based infrastructure (Active Directory, DNS, DHCP, GPO, Microsoft 365, Entra ID, Intune, Hyper-V), Fortinet firewalls, PowerShell scripting, and backup system management — areas not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is limited to general server and network administration concepts.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Administrator position at strategie:p personalberatung. Your client\'s focus on data protection, information security, and cybersecurity aligns with my technical background in system administration and secure infrastructure management.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with Linux server administration, including configuration and maintenance of Nginx, Apache, and Docker-based environments. I have managed virtualized systems, set up CI/CD pipelines, and implemented monitoring solutions using tools like Prometheus and Grafana. These responsibilities have given me a solid foundation in system configuration, network management, and IT security practices.\n\nIn previous work, I have administered server environments, configured firewalls and VPN connections, and ensured the reliability of backup systems. I have also crea