(1984, 1986, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"SAP\",\"MDM\",\"Data Governance\",\"SAP ECC\",\"S/4HANA\",\"Jira\",\"MS Project\",\"Smartsheet\",\"10+ years IT project management\",\"5+ years MDM leadership\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in database management, cloud platforms, and DevOps, but lacks the required SAP, MDM, and data governance experience, as well as the 10+ years of IT project management and 5+ years of MDM leadership required for this senior managerial role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Manager - MDM Technology & Governance position at EVIDENT Europe GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring a strong technical foundation in data architecture, system integration, and cross-functional project delivery that aligns with the core responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have designed and built scalable applications using Laravel, Node.js, and Next.js, working extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and RESTful APIs, and have managed deployments on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. This experience has given me a practical understanding of enterprise data flows, system integration, and the importance of data quality and governance.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of enforcing data standards and driving alignment across business units. In my projects, I have collaborated closely with stakeholders to translate business requirements into technical solutions,