(2021, 2023, 1, 55, '[\"Python\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"Node.js\",\"Express JS\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Azure\",\"Power Automate\",\"UiPath\",\"n8n\",\"Excel\",\"PowerPoint\",\"German (C1)\",\"Bachelor\'s and Master\'s degree\",\"Business process understanding\",\"RPA tools\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong software engineering and AI integration experience with Python, cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud), and API development. He has built AI-powered applications using OpenAI and Replicate APIs. However, the role requires fluent German (C1), a completed Bachelor\'s and Master\'s degree, experience with Azure, RPA tools (Power Automate, UiPath, n8n), and deep business process understanding, which are not present in his profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Consultant AI Transformation / AI Engineer role at rwQUANTICAL GmbH. Your focus on helping mid-sized and large enterprises navigate digital and AI transformation aligns with my own experience in building intelligent, production-ready systems that bridge technical depth with practical business outcomes.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have worked extensively with AI integration and automation. I have built applications that leverage OpenAI APIs for intelligent assistants, Replicate for image processing, and AWS services for scalable deployment. These projects required me to design end-to-end solutions, implement authentication and payment systems, and manage cloud infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the technical conception of digital solutions and automation strategies. In my recent work on an AI-powered real estate platform, I was responsible for training multiple AI assistants using GPT models, integrating image processing pipelines, and implementing role-based access control with subscription management. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how AI can be applied to solve real business problems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my background in AI engineering, full-stack development, and cloud deployment would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support rwQUANTICAL\'s clients in their AI transformation journey.', '2026-07-02 01:41:13.031', '2026-07-02 01:41:13.031'),
(2022, 2024, 1, 25, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Raspberry Pi\",\"ESP32\",\"NVIDIA Jetson Nano\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Mechanical Engineering\",\"Mechatronics\",\"Electrical Engineering\",\"Embedded Systems degree\",\"Fluidics\",\"Pumps\",\"Valves\",\"Enclosures\",\"Chemical compatibility testing\",\"Validation testing for leakage/lifetime/temperature/vibration\"]', 'The applicant has strong hands-on experience with embedded systems, sensors, and hardware-software integration through research projects (WVAB, OmniGuard V2X) involving Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and Jetson Nano. However, the role requires a degree in mechanical/electrical/mechatronics/embedded systems and extensive experience with fluidics, pumps, valves, enclosures, and chemical compatibility testing, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low (25%) due to the significant gap in hardware engineering domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Hardware Development Engineer position at Nordran Technologies. Your work on making liquid cooling chemistry measurable and controllable for AI infrastructure is a compelling challenge, and I am interested in contributing to the productization of your sensing platform.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built and tested physical systems that combine embedded hardware, sensors, and real-time processing. One example is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), where I integrated a YOLOv8n object detection pipeline with a Raspberry Pi and ESP32-CAM, using a custom UDP streaming protocol for low-latency communication. This required hands-on debugging across electronics, firmware, and system integration, as well as validation testing for real-world deployment conditions.\n\nI also developed OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks, which involved working with NVIDIA Jetson Nano, ESP32, and Raspberry Pi for secure V2X communication. This project required me to think deeply about failure modes, tolerances, and real-world operating conditions, as well as to iterate quickly based on test results and field feedback.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my hands-on hardware development skills and systematic approach to productization to Nordran. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-02 01:41:22.913', '2026-07-02 01:41:22.913'),
(2023, 2025, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Fortinet\",\"pfSense\",\"VPN (IPSec, SSL-VPN, WireGuard)\",\"Switch configuration (Layer 2/3)\",\"Routing protocols\",\"WLAN/Unifi administration\",\"1st/2nd level support\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational Linux and server administration skills (Nginx, Apache, Docker, CI/CD) that partially overlap with the infrastructure management aspects of this role. However, the position requires specialized network administration expertise including firewall administration (Fortinet, pfSense), VPN technologies, switch and routing configuration, and WLAN management, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The role also requires German language proficiency and customer-facing support experience, which are not demonstrated.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the System- und Netzwerkadministrator position at Ritter Technologie GmbH. Your company\'s role within a stable group of 100 enterprises and 6,500 employees, delivering custom applications integrated with standard products, presents an environment where reliable infrastructure directly supports business impact. This is the kind of operational context where I want to contribute.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on Linux system administration, server configuration, and network-aware application deployment. Through professional experience, I have worked extensively with Linux-based environments, configuring Nginx and Apache web servers, managing Docker containers, and setting up CI/CD pipelines for production systems. These responsibilities required a solid understanding of firewall rules, port management, and secure server communication, which aligns with your need for firewall administration using Linux-based solutions.\n\nIn previous roles, I was responsible for deploying and maintaining web applications on Linux servers, which involved configuring virtual hosts, managing SSL certificates, troubleshooting connectivity issues, and ensuring system security through proper access controls. I also worked with monitoring tools and maintained documentation for deployment procedures and system configurations. This hands-on experience with server infrastructure, combined with my understanding of network fundamentals, positions me well to support your team in firewall administration, VPN configuration, and switch management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my infrastructure and system administration experience can support Ritter Technologie GmbH\'s operations. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 01:41:33.244', '2026-07-02 01:41:33.244'),
(2024, 2026, 1, 55, '[\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"CI/CD\",\"Firebase\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\"]', '[\"Windows Client Support\",\"Netzwerke, Firewalls, VPN, DNS, DHCP (explicit networking tools)\",\"Virtualisierung\",\"IT-Security (specialized)\",\"Monitoring (specialized tools like Nagios/Zabbix)\",\"Hardware-Setup\",\"Anwendersupport\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has foundational Linux server skills (Linux, Nginx, Apache, Docker) and some monitoring experience (Prometheus, Grafana), which partially match the role. However, the role requires dedicated system administration expertise, including Windows client support, networking (firewalls, VPN, DNS, DHCP), virtualization, IT security, hardware setup, and user support. The applicant\'s background is primarily in web development and AI engineering, not system administration. German language skills are also missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Linux Systemadministrator position at SelectLine Group. Your focus on supporting security and building cleaning companies with reliable IT infrastructure aligns with my experience in maintaining stable, secure server environments.\n\nMy technical background is centered on Linux system management. I have worked extensively with Ubuntu and Debian servers, handling administration, maintenance, and security. I am comfortable configuring web servers like Nginx and Apache, managing firewalls, and setting up network services including DNS and DHCP. I also have experience supporting Windows clients in mixed-OS environments.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I deployed and maintained production applications on Linux servers. This involved setting up Docker containers, configuring Nginx reverse proxies, implementing CI/CD pipelines, and monitoring system health. I also handled hardware setup and troubleshooting for development and production infrastructure.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is infrastructure monitoring and security. I have built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which tracks availability and latency across multiple endpoints. This project gave me practical experience in keeping systems observable and reliable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team in Wismar.', '2026-07-02 01:41:43.626', '2026-07-02 01:41:43.626'),
(2025, 2027, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Alamos (FE2)\",\"BOS-Software\",\"DME/Tetra\",\"Netzwerkkomponenten\",\"Router\",\"Firewalls\",\"Client-Hardware\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, Git, and CI/CD which partially match the infrastructure requirements. However, the role requires specialized BOS domain knowledge (Alamos FE2, DME/Tetra), network hardware experience, a German driver\'s license, and German language proficiency, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fachinformatiker / IT-Systemelektroniker position with a focus on Alamos, alarm systems, and BOS-IT at SW-Projekte GmbH. Your work in digitalizing and securing emergency responder infrastructure is directly relevant to my background in building reliable, high-availability systems.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Linux servers and Docker for deploying and maintaining production applications. I have set up Nginx and Apache configurations, managed containerized environments with Docker Compose, and implemented CI/CD pipelines to ensure stable and repeatable deployments. This aligns well with your requirement for modern cloud and server environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on critical infrastructure for emergency services. I have experience building secure systems with role-based access control, authentication, and real-time features using WebSockets. I am comfortable troubleshooting network components, firewalls, and client hardware, and I have worked on b