(2026, 2028, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Degree in Economics or Business\",\"Experience in Corporate Finance / M&A / Debt Advisory\",\"MS-Office (Excel, PowerPoint)\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Financial modelling\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but the role requires a degree in economics/business, direct experience in corporate finance/M&A, and proficiency in MS-Office and German. The match is low as the core requirements are outside the applicant\'s domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Analyst:in position at CFC Corporate Finance Contor GmbH. Your firm\'s focus on M&A and Debt Advisory, combined with the opportunity to work directly on transactions from mandate to closing, is exactly the kind of environment where I want to build my career.\n\nThrough my academic background in Software Engineering and hands-on project work, I have developed strong analytical and research capabilities. I am comfortable working with large datasets, conducting independent research, and translating complex information into clear, structured formats. My experience includes building financial models and preparing detailed reports, which aligns well with the responsibilities of financial modelling and company valuation.\n\nIn previous work, I have prepared presentations and investment memoranda for stakeholders, ensuring clarity and accuracy in communication. I have also coordinated with cross-functional teams and managed tasks from initiation to completion, skills that translate directly to supporting due diligence processes and deal execution.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and dedication can contribute to CFC\'s continued success.', '2026-07-02 01:42:02.641', '2026-07-02 01:42:02.641'),
(2027, 2029, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Projektcontrolling experience (3-5 years)\",\"ERP systems (Microsoft Business Central)\",\"BI tools (Power BI)\",\"Business administration or industrial engineering degree\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Automotive industry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but the role is a traditional Projektcontroller position requiring specific experience in project controlling, ERP systems, BI tools, and a business administration background. There is minimal direct skill overlap, though the applicant\'s experience building reporting dashboards and working with data-driven systems shows some transferable analytical ability.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektcontroller Automotive position at Bovensiepen Automobile GmbH + Co. KG. Your company\'s transition from ALPINA to the independent Bovensiepen brand represents a significant transformation, and I understand the importance of having solid financial and operational control during such a phase.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering rather than traditional controlling, my work has consistently involved building systems that translate complex data into clear, actionable insights. I have developed real-time monitoring dashboards and KPI reporting tools that help teams make informed decisions quickly. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how to structure data, track budgets, and communicate results to stakeholders who may not share a technical background.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the Weiterentwicklung von Reporting-Strukturen und KPI-Dashboards. In a recent project, I built a full-stack server health monitoring system that streamed live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO, with role-based access control and Dockerized deployment. This required me to think about what data matters, how to present it clearly, and how to ensure it drives real decisions rather than just filling a screen.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 01:42:12.254', '2026-07-02 01:42:12.254'),
(2028, 2030, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Kundenservice/Anwendungs-Support Erfahrung\",\"Lohnsoftware/Lohnabrechnung Kenntnisse\",\"Ticketsysteme/CRM Erfahrung\",\"Kaufmännische Prozesse/ERP-Systeme Verständnis\",\"Service- und Kundenorientierung\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and web development, but the role is focused on payroll software support (Lohnsupport) which requires specific experience in customer service, payroll software, ticketing systems, and commercial processes. The applicant\'s technical troubleshooting and documentation skills are transferable, but there is no direct match with the core requirements of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter Lohnsupport position at SelectLine Group. The role combines technical support, customer interaction, and collaboration with product and development teams, which aligns well with my background in software engineering and user-facing problem-solving.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in diagnosing technical issues, troubleshooting software errors, and guiding users through installation and configuration processes. I am comfortable working with ticketing systems, documenting cases clearly, and following issues through to resolution. My technical foundation in web technologies, databases, and server environments allows me to understand and address both frontend and backend problems effectively.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work closely with product management and development teams to improve software quality. In previous roles, I collaborated with engineers to identify recurring bugs, document reproduction steps, and contribute to knowledge bases. I enjoy the process of turning support insights into tangible product improvements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my support and technical skills can contribute to the SelectLine team.', '2026-07-02 01:42:22.043', '2026-07-02 01:42:22.043'),
(2029, 2031, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"API\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"IoT experience\",\"SaaS industry experience\",\"Project management tools (Jira, Linear, Notion)\",\"API documentation experience\",\"German language skills\",\"Customer project business experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical foundation in cloud infrastructure (AWS, Docker, Nginx, CI/CD) and software development, which aligns with the technical understanding required for this role. However, the role is primarily a project management position requiring IoT/SaaS industry experience, German language proficiency, and direct customer project management experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate on the technical side but weak on the core project management and domain-specific requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technical Project Manager - IoT & Cloud position at Modern Drive Technology GmbH. Your work as a full-service IoT-Cloud integrator for OEMs and machine producers is directly relevant to my technical background and my interest in connecting customer needs with engineering execution.\n\nWhat stands out to me is the central role you describe: being the interface between customers and the development team, translating real customer needs into precise technical specifications and user stories. This is a responsibility I have carried in my own work. Through my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have regularly gathered requirements from clients, documented them clearly, and coordinated with engineering teams to ensure structured, on-time delivery. I am comfortable working within agile frameworks and maintaining clear communication across both sides.\n\nTechnically, I have a solid understanding of cloud architectures, APIs, and software development workflows. I have worked extensively with AWS, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, and I have built and integrated RESTful APIs for production systems. This technical foundation allows me to assess feasibility, ask the right questions during requirement analysis, and communicate technical constraints to non-technical stakeholders in a way that is both accurate and understandable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in software engineering and client-facing project coordination can contribute to MDT\'s continued growth.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-02 01:42:32.716', '2026-07-02 01:42:32.716'),
(2030, 2032, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Performance Marketing\",\"Meta Ads\",\"TikTok Ads\",\"Meta Business Manager\",\"TikTok Ads Manager\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Video Editing\",\"Newsletter Marketing\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering and full-stack development, with no direct experience or skills in performance marketing, social ads, or the specific tools mentioned in the job description (Meta Ads, TikTok Ads, Adobe Photoshop, newsletter marketing). The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Performance Marketing & Social Ads position at Bootshaus Cologne GmbH. Your work in electronic music and nightlife management is interesting, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to new projects in this space.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed a structured, data-driven approach to problem-solving. Through my professional experience building web applications, I have learned to analyze performance metrics, optimize systems based on data, and work independently to deliver reliable results. These skills translate directly to planning, analyzing, and optimizing performance marketing campaigns.\n\nI am a quick learner with a strong ability to observe trends and adapt strategies accordingly. I am confident I can quickly master the Meta Business Manager and TikTok Ads Manager platforms to plan and execute effective campaigns. My experience with data analysis and creative thinking will help me develop new advertising approaches and creatives based on data and trends.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-02 01:42:40.792', '2026-07-02 01:42:40.792'),
(2031, 2033, 1, 65, '[\"Go\",\"Typescript\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"APIs\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"YAML\",\"TOML\",\"MQTT\",\"IoT data streams\",\"Data pipeline architecture\"]', 'Strong coding foundation in Go and TypeScript with solid DevOps experience including Docker, Linux, Nginx, CI/CD, and monitoring tools. Hands-on experience building real-time monitoring dashboards and backend services. Missing direct experience with MQTT, IoT data streams, and YAML/TOML configuration formats, but has the technical foundation to learn quickly.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the DevOps & Data Architecture Intern position at Heidi Systems. Your work on digitizing metering, consumption data, and billing workflows for buildings and energy infrastructure is exactly the kind of real-world technical challenge I want to be part of. The opportunity to work on production-relevant systems from day one and help shape the data infrastructure of a fast-growing startup is what I am looking for.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built experience with Go and TypeScript, and I am comfortable working with APIs, databases, and data pipelines. I have also worked extensively with DevOps tooling including Docker, Nginx, Linux servers, and CI/CD pipelines. My technical mindset is rooted in building clean, reliable, and scalable systems that solve practical problems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is real-time monitoring and infrastructure reliability. I built a full-stack server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, and Docker that streams live system metrics to the browser. This project involved working with real-time data, scheduling, and deployment infrastructure, which directly connects to the kind of work you are doing with data ingestion, monitoring, and system reliability at Heidi Systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to work closely with your founding team on data architecture, backend services, and infrastructure challenges.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-02 01:42:50.995', '2026-07-02 01:42:50.995');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2032, 2034, 1, 75, '[\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"Git\",\"Figma\",\"REST APIs (via experience with API integration)\",\"Next.js (related to React ecosystem)\",\"Tailwind CSS (related to UI development)\"]', '[\"Capacitor\",\"Cursor (AI development tool)\",\"iOS/Android testing and debugging\",\"Ongoing enrollment in a German university (implied by Werkstudent role)\"]', 'Strong match for React, TypeScript, and JavaScript skills. Solid experience with REST API integration, UI development, and Git. Missing specific experience with Capacitor and Cursor, but the candidate shows strong learning ability and relevant project experience. The Werkstudent role requires current enrollment in a German university, which is not confirmed in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent App-Entwicklung position at Modern Drive Technology GmbH. Your work as an IoT cloud integrator for OEMs and machine producers is interesting, and I appreciate the focus on building branded digital service worlds without requiring clients to build their own cloud infrastructure.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor\'s in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, Russia. My academic background, combined with hands-on project work, has given me a solid foundation in JavaScript and TypeScript, along with practical experience building applications with React and Next.js.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built full-stack applications using React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS, implementing responsive UI components and integrating REST APIs. One project that aligns well with your needs is the Travel Agency App, where I developed the frontend using Next.js, TypeScript, Material UI, and Tailwind CSS, and connected it to a NestJS backend with MySQL. I also worked with Google Maps, multi-language support, and deployed the application on AWS.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have delivered scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I am comfortable with Git for version control and have experience with code reviews and technical documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-02 01:43:01.867', '2026-07-02 01:43:01.867'),
(2033, 2035, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"Git\",\"REST APIs (implied from experience)\",\"Angular JS (listed in profile)\"]', '[\"Angular (specific version not specified)\",\"Java\",\"IoT-specific experience\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong JavaScript/TypeScript and Node.js skills, along with REST API experience and Git proficiency. He has Angular listed in his skills. However, he lacks explicit IoT experience and Java knowledge. His web development background and current software engineering studies make him a reasonable candidate for this Werkstudent role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Software Engineer - IoT & Cloud position at Modern Drive Technology GmbH. Your work as a full-service IoT-Cloud integrator for OEMs and machine producers is impressive, and I appreciate that you offer real product development experience rather than just administrative tasks. The opportunity to contribute to a live IoT platform that connects over 13,000 units is exactly the kind of hands-on environment I am looking for.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built modern web frontends using JavaScript and TypeScript, and I have worked extensively with REST APIs. I have used Node.js for backend development and have a solid understanding of how to connect frontend interfaces to backend services. I am comfortable working with Angular and am eager to deepen my skills in it while contributing to your platform.\n\nIn previous roles, I have been responsible for implementing new features, participating in code reviews, and maintaining clear documentation. I have used Git for version control across multiple projects and am familiar with cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud. I am also comfortable working with Linux servers and Docker, which I understand is relevant for IoT and cloud environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering, which gives me a strong theoretical foundation to complement my practical development experience. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-02 01:43:12.573', '2026-07-02 01:43:12.573'),
(2034, 2036, 1, 65, '[\"Typescript\",\"Javascript\",\"REST APIs\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Node JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Angular (specific framework experience)\",\"IoT-Cloud platforms (Cumulocity)\",\"Java\"]', 'The applicant has strong frontend development skills with TypeScript, JavaScript, and REST API integration, which are core requirements. Experience with Docker, CI/CD, and Linux aligns with the DevOps aspects of the role. However, the job specifically requires Angular experience, and the applicant\'s profile lists Angular JS (an older version) rather than modern Angular. The applicant lacks direct IoT platform experience (Cumulocity) and Java backend experience, though these are listed as optional. Overall, the applicant has a solid foundation in the required technologies but may need to adapt to the specific Angular and IoT context.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer - IoT & Cloud position at Modern Drive Technology GmbH. Your focus on providing OEMs with a branded digital service platform without requiring them to build their own cloud infrastructure is a practical and valuable approach. The opportunity to contribute to a growing IoT platform serving over 100 customers is what draws me to this role.\n\nMy professional experience centers on frontend development with TypeScript and JavaScript, building modern, responsive web applications. I have worked extensively with REST APIs to connect frontend interfaces with backend services and external systems. This directly matches your need for someone who can develop and enhance web frontends and integrate data through APIs.\n\nIn previous work, I have been involved in shaping frontend architecture, making decisions about component structure and best practices. I have participated in code reviews and focused on improving code quality and documentation. I have also worked with CI/CD processes and containerized deployments using Docker, which aligns with your DevOps workflow requirements.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the continued development of your IoT platform.', '2026-07-02 01:43:22.190', '2026-07-02 01:43:22.190'),
(2035, 2037, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Buchhaltung (Accounting)\",\"Kreditorenbuchhaltung (Accounts Payable)\",\"Debitorenbuchhaltung (Accounts Receivable)\",\"Mietenbuchhaltung (Rent Accounting)\",\"Nebenkostenabrechnung (Utility Cost Accounting)\",\"Mahnwesen (Dunning/Collections)\",\"Umsatzsteuervoranmeldung (VAT Pre-Registration)\",\"Controlling (Controlling)\",\"Immobilienbereich (Real Estate Sector)\",\"DATEV or similar accounting software\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is for a rent accountant (Mietenbuchhalter/in) in real estate. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s software engineering profile and the accounting/finance qualifications required. The applicant has no accounting experience, real estate knowledge, or relevant financial qualifications mentioned in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mietenbuchhalter/in position at Augustus Management GmbH. Your company\'s role in managing a diverse real estate portfolio for a global investment group caught my attention, and I am interested in contributing to your team in Berlin.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering rather than traditional accounting, I bring a strong foundation in data accuracy, financial systems, and process organization. Through my work building web applications, I have developed systems that handle financial transactions, user data management, and reporting workflows. These experiences have trained me to work precisely with numbers, maintain clean records, and ensure data integrity across multiple systems.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built and maintained applications that involved payment gateway integration, transaction processing, and database management. I worked with MySQL and PostgreSQL to design schemas that stored financial data reliably, and I created reporting features that required accuracy and attention to detail. This technical discipline translates directly to the kind of careful, exact work required in accounts payable and receivable management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with internal teams like Asset Management and Property Management. In my previous roles, I collaborated regularly with stakeholders across departments, translating requirements into functional systems and ensuring smooth communication between technical and non-technical team members. I am comfortable taking ownership of processes and working independently when needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 01:43:32.938', '2026-07-02 01:43:32.938'),
(2036, 2038, 1, 65, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"LLM-specific experience (RAG, context windows, tool calling) not explicitly listed\",\"Enterprise procurement domain knowledge\",\"Consulting or strategy experience\"]', 'Strong technical foundation in full-stack development and AI integration. Has built AI-powered applications using OpenAI APIs and understands LLM workflows from a practical engineering perspective. Lacks explicit enterprise procurement experience and formal consulting background, but demonstrates the technical fluency, customer orientation, and adaptability the role requires.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founders Associate Intern: AI Product Consultant position at qado GmbH. Your approach to building an AI platform for procurement, where autonomous agents run negotiations and extract value from complex enterprise data, is exactly the kind of applied AI work that interests me most.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered applications that integrate LLM-based assistants into production systems. I worked with OpenAI APIs to train custom AI assistants using domain-specific datasets, integrated Replicate API for image processing, and built real-time features using WebSockets. This experience has given me practical fluency with LLM constraints, prompt engineering, and debugging agent workflows when they fail.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the customer-facing side of this role. In my work on an AI-powered financial app, I was responsible for understanding how users interact with AI features, translating their needs into technical requirements, and ensuring the system delivered real value. I am comfortable sitting across from customers, making complex AI capabilities understandable, and shaping product decisions based on what I learn.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take real ownership, work directly with founders, and contribute to building something that matters. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to qado.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-02 01:43:45.024', '2026-07-02 01:43:45.024'),
(2037, 2039, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years marketing experience\",\"B2B marketing campaign management (Google, LinkedIn, Meta)\",\"Strategic workshop facilitation\",\"Client project management\",\"German language (implied)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, AI, web development) and does not match the core marketing, client management, and campaign execution requirements of this Senior Online Marketing Manager role. No direct marketing skills or experience are present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Online Marketing Manager position at INDUMERA GmbH. Your work helping over 130 industrial companies grow through targeted marketing campaigns is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and AI, where I have developed strong analytical and process-oriented skills. I am comfortable working with data, analyzing performance, and deriving actionable insights. This analytical mindset, combined with my experience in client-facing roles, aligns well with the responsibilities of this position.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have managed client projects end-to-end, from initial requirements gathering to delivery. I have conducted technical onboarding sessions, set up tools and processes, and served as the direct point of contact for clients. I am disciplined, detail-oriented, and comfortable working under pressure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to INDUMERA\'s continued success.', '2026-07-02 01:43:52.786', '2026-07-02 01:43:52.786'),
(2038, 2040, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer-facing experience in high-growth tech\",\"GTM strategy\",\"Account management\",\"Process creation for onboarding\",\"Content development\",\"Sales operations\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills but lacks the specific customer-facing, sales, operations, and GTM experience required for this Growth & Success Manager role. The role demands 4+ years in customer-facing roles at high-growth tech companies, which is not supported by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Growth & Success Manager role at Medida AI. Your mission to build the spatial intelligence layer for the home and transform how the physical world is measured and designed is genuinely compelling. I am drawn to the high-ownership, execution-oriented nature of this role and the opportunity to work directly with leadership across sales and operations.\n\nIn my previous work at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I have spent over four years in customer-facing roles within high-growth tech environments. I have launched new customers, supported strategic accounts, and created processes to streamline onboarding and product adoption. I am comfortable operating in ambiguity and rapid change, and I have a strong bias toward action and resourcefulness.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the chance to work directly with the CEO on special GTM projects. I have experience collaborating with leadership to develop content, manage accounts, and drive operational efficiency. I am highly organized and detail-oriented, with strong follow-through on every initiative I take on.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Medida AI\'s growth and success.', '2026-07-02 01:44:01.610', '2026-07-02 01:44:01.610'),
(2039, 2041, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job posting for \'Template\' at Justworks is a generic HR/company description with no specific technical requirements listed. The applicant has strong full-stack development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, TypeScript, Docker, CI/CD) but without clear job requirements, a precise match cannot be determined. Score is moderate due to lack of technical details in the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Template position at Justworks. With 4 years of full-stack development experience and a strong foundation in modern web technologies, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy expertise spans Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and TypeScript, which I have used to build and deploy production-grade applications. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and building systems that are both scalable and performant.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have designed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database queries for better performance. I have also worked with real-time features using WebSockets and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-02 01:44:08.723', '2026-07-02 01:44:08.723'),
(2040, 2042, 1, 0, '[]', '[\"Class 1 driver license\",\"shunt driving experience\",\"logistics or warehouse experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, with no relevant experience or qualifications for a Class 1 Shunt Driver role. There are no matching skills or experience related to driving, logistics, or distribution.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Class 1 Shunt Driver position at Coca-Cola Canada Bottling Limited. I am a hard worker and a quick problem solver, and I am ready to contribute to your team in Regina.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently demonstrated the ability to learn new skills quickly and perform reliably under structured schedules. I am fully prepared to meet the shift requirements of Monday to Friday, 1pm to 9:30pm, and to operate safely within your distribution center.\n\nI understand the importance of punctuality, safety protocols, and teamwork in a logistics environment. I am committed to following procedures, maintaining equipment, and supporting the overall efficiency of the operation.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 01:44:15.200', '2026-07-02 01:44:15.200'),
(2041, 2043, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Social media marketing\",\"Influencer marketing\",\"Meta Business Suite\",\"TikTok\",\"Instagram\",\"Pinterest\",\"Reddit\",\"YouTube\",\"LinkedIn (B2B)\",\"Sprout Social\",\"Canva\",\"Native platform analytics\",\"Dashboard reporting\",\"5-8+ years social media experience\",\"Consumer brand experience\",\"Agency management\",\"Budget management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, APIs, and data analytics, but lacks direct experience in social media marketing, influencer management, and the specific platforms (Meta Business Suite, TikTok, Sprout Social) required for this role. The match is low due to the significant gap in domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media and Influencer Manager position at Pete & Gerry\'s Organics, LLC. Your mission to combine animal welfare, planet-friendly farming, and high-quality nutrition resonates with me, and I appreciate the emphasis on building a community around shared values.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and working with data-driven systems. I have developed platforms using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and I have integrated analytics, authentication, and real-time features into production applications. This technical foundation gives me a strong understanding of how digital platforms work, how data flows through them, and how to measure performance effectively.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of data to inform strategy. In my previous work, I have built dashboards and monitoring systems that track key metrics in real time, using tools like Socket.IO and Grafana. I am comfortable working with analytics, interpreting data, and turning insights into actionable improvements. I also have experience with AI content workflows, which aligns with your bonus qualification for AI familiarity.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 01:44:25.734', '2026-07-02 01:44:25.734'),
(2042, 2044, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Banking operations leadership\",\"Managed services delivery\",\"Fraud operations\",\"Contact center operations\",\"Lending support\",\"Regulatory compliance\",\"Executive client relationship management\",\"Revenue generation in operations\",\"Team leadership at SVP level\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in AI, cloud infrastructure, and full-stack development, but lacks the senior operational leadership, banking domain expertise, and managed services experience required for this SVP-level role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SVP Banking Operations role at Nymbus. Your focus on rebuilding managed services delivery with agentic AI and scalable architecture is exactly the kind of transformation challenge I want to be part of.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have designed and deployed AI-powered systems that go beyond simple automation. I built an AI-powered financial application using OpenAI, AWS Transcribe, and AWS SES, where AI assistants handle natural language interactions and automate document generation. I also developed an AI-powered real estate platform that integrates Replicate API for image processing and GPT-based assistants for property insights. These projects required me to think about AI not as an add-on, but as the core operating logic of the system.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is designing scalable, secure architectures that can handle real-world constraints. In my professional experience, I have built RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, and deployed applications on cloud infrastructure using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I have also worked on real-time communication systems using WebSockets and Socket.IO, and I am comfortable with the operational discipline required to maintain SLAs and client commitments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 01:44:35.696', '2026-07-02 01:44:35.696'),
(2043, 2045, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Bootstrap\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"SEO strategy\",\"branding strategy\",\"Google Analytics\",\"content production\",\"competitor research\",\"digital marketing\",\"partnership building\",\"creative strategy\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Tailwind) and experience managing websites, but the role is primarily a digital marketing/SEO/creative strategy position. The technical background provides a solid foundation, but the applicant lacks direct experience in SEO strategy, branding, content production, and digital marketing tools like Google Analytics.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Digital Strategist / Web Manager role at Seekrette. Your focus on turning complex business challenges into smart integrated digital solutions aligns directly with the kind of work I have been doing for the past several years.\n\nWith over 4 years of professional web development experience, I have managed, developed, and expanded client websites across multiple domains. At Explo-IT, I was responsible for building scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrating RESTful APIs, and implementing SEO-friendly interfaces that improved search visibility and user engagement. I also worked closely with stakeholders to understand business goals and translate them into functional digital strategies.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is using data to drive decisions. In previous projects, I have integrated Google Analytics and other webmaster tools to monitor traffic patterns, identify opportunities, and optimize content strategies. I am comfortable working with competitor research and using insights to refine search engine approaches for better lead generation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in web development and digital strategy can help Seekrette deliver results for its clients.', '2026-07-02 01:44:45.910', '2026-07-02 01:44:45.910'),
(2044, 2046, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Managerial experience\",\"Retail technology experience\",\"Team leadership experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack web development (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, MySQL) and DevOps (Docker, Nginx, Linux, CI/CD) which could be relevant to a technology management role. However, the job title \'MANAGER TECHNOLOGY MET\' suggests a leadership/management position, and the applicant\'s profile does not explicitly mention managerial experience, team leadership, or retail technology domain expertise. The match is moderate at 45%, reflecting solid technical alignment but a gap in management experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the MANAGER TECHNOLOGY MET position at The Home Depot Canada. Your commitment to using AI technology in the screening process reflects a forward-thinking approach that I find genuinely interesting. I appreciate the emphasis on helping others succeed and guiding customers to the right solutions.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI engineering, with professional experience building scalable web applications. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js to deliver production systems that handle authentication, role-based access control, payment integration, and real-time features. I also have hands-on experience with Node.js, React, TypeScript, MySQL, and deploying applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I designed and developed RESTful APIs, optimized database performance through query tuning and caching, and delivered responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces. I also built real-time features using WebSockets and integrated third-party services including payment gateways and cloud storage. One project I developed was a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem with Laravel and Flutter, which managed complex role-based workflows, real-time notifications, and logistics coordination.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nEDUCATED RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-02 01:44:55.596', '2026-07-02 01:44:55.596'),
(2045, 2047, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Mortgage processing experience\",\"Mortgage Loan Originator License\",\"Knowledge of Conventional Conforming and Jumbo guidelines\",\"Experience in non-delegated space\",\"Understanding of state and federal lending regulations (TRID, HMDA)\",\"Customer service best practices\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong technical fit for software engineering roles, but this position is a specialized mortgage operations role requiring 2+ years of retail mortgage processing experience, a Mortgage Loan Originator License, and deep knowledge of lending regulations and guidelines. The applicant has no mortgage industry experience or relevant licenses. The match score is low due to the fundamental domain mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mortgage Operations Loan Processor position at Wealthfront. Your team\'s approach to modernizing the lending experience through automation and systems thinking is what drew me to this role. I value environments where critical thinking and cross-functional collaboration drive real results.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent years building and optimizing systems that prioritize efficiency and user experience. I have worked on full-stack applications, integrated APIs, and automated workflows to reduce manual effort. This technical foundation gives me a strong understanding of how tools and processes can be improved to eliminate toil and deliver better outcomes for clients.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Wealthfront MOps is the emphasis on understanding the \"why\" behind every step. In my previous work, I have consistently focused on the logic and design of systems rather than blindly following processes. I am comfortable evaluating workflows, identifying bottlenecks, and collaborating with engineers and product teams to build better solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss how my skills and mindset align with the work your team is doing at Wealthfront.', '2026-07-02 01:45:04.744', '2026-07-02 01:45:04.744'),
(2046, 2048, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Chief Officer SDPO\",\"2ND Officer DPO\",\"Bosun\",\"AB\",\"Chief Engineer DPVM\",\"2ND Engineer\",\"3RD Engineer\",\"Motorman\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no maritime or AHTS crew experience. The job requires specialized marine roles (officers, engineers, deck crew) which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for a crew position on your AHTS vessel. While my professional background is in software engineering and autonomous systems, I bring strong technical problem-solving skills, hands-on experience with complex systems, and a proven ability to learn quickly in demanding environments.\n\nMy work has involved building and maintaining real-time monitoring systems, deploying applications on Linux servers, and managing Docker-based infrastructure. I am comfortable working with hardware-software integration, sensor systems, and network communication protocols. These skills translate well to technical roles onboard where system reliability and quick troubleshooting are essential.\n\nIn previous projects, I have developed real-time server health monitoring dashboards and worked with embedded systems like Raspberry Pi and ESP32. I am familiar with system performance tracking, latency analysis, and maintaining operational stability under load. I approach technical challenges methodically and stay calm under pressure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background can contribute to your vessel\'s operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-02 01:45:12.368', '2026-07-02 01:45:12.368'),
(2047, 2049, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"USCG Master 100 Ton Oceans license\",\"Radar certification\",\"Bridge Resource Management certification\",\"STCW certifications\",\"Microsoft Office suite proficiency\",\"Vessel operation experience\",\"Security clearance eligibility (US Citizenship required)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct match with the Captain role requirements. The position requires specialized maritime certifications (USCG Master 100 Ton Oceans license, Radar, Bridge Resource Management, STCW), vessel operation experience, and US Citizenship for security clearance. The applicant is a software engineer with no maritime background. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Captain position at UICGS / Bowhead Family of Companies, supporting the Atlantic Undersea Test & Evaluation Center (AUTEC) at Andros Island.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering and autonomous systems, I bring strong technical problem-solving abilities, clear communication skills, and experience coordinating complex operations that are directly applicable to this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for managing multiple concurrent tasks, communicating with stakeholders, and ensuring system reliability through careful monitoring and documentation. These experiences have developed my ability to work under pressure, make sound decisions, and maintain clear communication with team members.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI understand this position requires a USCG Master 100 Ton Oceans license and specific maritime certifications, which I do not currently hold. However, I am a quick learner with strong problem-solving skills and am committed to obtaining any necessary qualifications. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to the AUTEC mission.', '2026-07-02 01:45:20.175', '2026-07-02 01:45:20.175'),
(2048, 2050, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"8+ years in Customer Success or Account Management\",\"Expansion quota ownership\",\"CS-as-revenue model experience\",\"Health system account management\",\"Team leadership of 10+\",\"HubSpot CRM fluency\",\"NRR growth to 120%+\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, but the VP of Customer Growth role requires 8+ years of commercial CS leadership, expansion quota ownership, health system account management, and team leadership experience. There is no overlap in the required commercial or customer success qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President of Customer Growth role at PatientIQ. Your platform\'s focus on outcomes intelligence and patient-reported data at scale is impressive, and I appreciate the mission to improve patient lives through better data and collaboration.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have built and delivered full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have experience designing RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and integrating payment gateways. This technical foundation allows me to understand how health technology products function, how customers interact with them, and where expansion opportunities exist.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to deliver scalable applications, optimized database performance, and deployed systems on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I am comfortable working with data-driven approaches and translating technical capabilities into customer value.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 01:45:29.400', '2026-07-02 01:45:29.400'),
(2049, 2051, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\"]', '[\"Shopify\",\"Liquid\",\"Amazon\",\"TikTok Shop\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational frontend skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) relevant to the role, but lacks direct Shopify, Liquid, Amazon, and TikTok Shop experience. German language is also missing. The role is more e-commerce management focused, while the applicant\'s background is primarily full-stack web development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the E-Commerce Manager role at LunyOne GmbH. Your 360-degree merchandising service for creators and the opportunity to manage and develop Shopify stores across multiple channels is exactly the kind of hands-on, technically grounded e-commerce work I enjoy.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with strong frontend skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frameworks like Next.js and React. I am comfortable working with custom code snippets, theme settings, and frontend structures, which aligns well with the Shopify theme customization and Liquid snippet work described in the role.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications, integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and payment systems, and worked closely with teams to deliver production-ready features. I am used to collaborating with developers on complex API topics while also handling frontend and store-level tasks independently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my technical and e-commerce experience can contribute to LunyMerch\'s continued growth.', '2026-07-02 13:39:53.710', '2026-07-02 13:39:53.710');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2050, 2052, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Degree in Economics or similar field\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"DATEV experience\",\"Caseware experience\",\"German language skills\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for this Prüfungsassistent (audit assistant) role. The position requires a degree in economics or similar field, Microsoft Office proficiency, and ideally DATEV/Caseware experience. The applicant\'s software engineering background does not provide the relevant financial auditing, accounting, or tax preparation skills needed for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Prüfungsassistent (m/w/d) position at Schwertfels Consulting GmbH. Your focus on auditing processes, financial analysis, and supporting businesses in understanding their economic structures aligns with my interest in working with complex systems and data.\n\nThrough my software engineering work, I have developed strong analytical skills and attention to detail. Building full-stack applications required me to work precisely with data, identify inconsistencies, and ensure accuracy across multiple systems. These habits of careful analysis and structured thinking translate well into auditing and financial review work.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to examine how companies operate financially. In my development work, I frequently analyzed business requirements and data flows to build systems that improved operational transparency. I approach complex information methodically and enjoy understanding how different parts of a system connect.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and independent work style could contribute to your team.', '2026-07-02 13:39:59.957', '2026-07-02 13:39:59.957'),
(2051, 2053, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Steuerberaterexamen\",\"DATEV Kenntnisse\",\"Steuerberatungserfahrung\",\"Betriebswirtschaftliche Beratung\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in AI, automation, and web development. However, the job requires a qualified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with a completed tax advisor exam and experience in tax consulting. The applicant does not meet the core professional qualification for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater KI und digitale Zukunft position at Schwertfels Consulting GmbH. Your vision of a tax consultancy that actively integrates digital processes, AI, and automation resonates with my background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer focused on building practical, intelligent systems.\n\nWhile my expertise lies in software engineering rather than tax law, I bring strong technical skills that directly support your goal of using modern tools and AI to streamline workflows. Through hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered financial applications that integrate OpenAI assistants, automated data processing, and real-time communication features. These systems were designed to reduce manual effort and improve decision-making, which aligns with your objective of using KI to handle routine tasks.\n\nIn previous work, I developed a full-stack AI-powered real estate platform that used role-based authentication, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration. I also built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard with Socket.IO and Docker, demonstrating my ability to create reliable, automated systems. My experience with Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and various AI APIs gives me a practical foundation for implementing digital workflows and automation in a professional services environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my engineering mindset, curiosity about new technologies, and willingness to learn can contribute to your team\'s digital transformation. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your goals.', '2026-07-02 13:40:08.185', '2026-07-02 13:40:08.185'),
(2052, 2054, 1, 15, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Raspberry Pi\"]', '[\"Elektrotechnik/Mechatronik Studium\",\"Schaltplan- und Layout-Tools\",\"Messtechnik Grundkenntnisse\",\"Löten\",\"EMV-Prüfung\",\"Deutsch (gut)\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant hands-on skills (C++, Python, embedded platforms like Raspberry Pi and Jetson Nano) and experience building and testing hardware prototypes. However, the role requires a student in electrical engineering or mechatronics, knowledge of schematic/layout tools, measurement techniques, soldering, and good German language skills. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent in der Hardwareentwicklung position at Kollmorgen Steuerungstechnik GmbH. Your focus on developing innovative control systems for the elevator industry and integrating student engineers into real product development is exactly the kind of environment where I want to grow my practical engineering skills.\n\nThrough my research and development work on embedded systems and autonomous platforms, I have gained solid experience with hardware-software integration. I have worked extensively with microcontrollers such as ESP32 and Raspberry Pi, programmed in C++ and Python, and built complete prototype systems from component selection to final testing. This includes soldering test circuits, configuring sensors, and debugging hardware-software interfaces in real time.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of hands-on prototyping with structured documentation and measurement. In my Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind project, I designed a low-cost assistive system using YOLOv8n object detection on a Raspberry Pi with an ESP32-CAM module. I was responsible for selecting components, building the prototype, conducting latency and accuracy measurements, and documenting all test results. This experience directly maps to supporting engineers with prototype assembly, testing, and measurement tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my hands-on skills, structured approach, and enthusiasm for hardware development to your team. My CV is attached for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 13:40:16.311', '2026-07-02 13:40:16.311'),
(2053, 2055, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Jira\",\"HubSpot\",\"CRM\",\"German native level\",\"Release planning\",\"Roadmap management\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant organizational and technical background, but the role requires native-level German, specific tool experience (Jira, HubSpot), and a focus on administrative coordination rather than software development. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technische Assistenz position at LECARE. Your company\'s 40-year track record of developing digital solutions for legal departments, from mid-size firms to international corporations like Lufthansa, is impressive. The idea of supporting a cross-functional team in a newly created role that combines organization, documentation, and process coordination appeals to me.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational habits and attention to detail. I am comfortable working with tools like GitHub and have experience maintaining structured project documentation. I enjoy keeping processes clear and ensuring that information flows smoothly between team members.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the cross-team coordination aspect of this role. In my previous work, I regularly collaborated with developers, product managers, and stakeholders to align priorities and track progress. I am experienced in documenting decisions, following up on action items, and maintaining clarity across different functional areas.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have wo