(2055, 2057, 1, 35, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"InDesign\",\"Grafikdesign degree (current student)\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational design-related skills (Figma, CSS, HTML) and experience with AI tools, which are a plus. However, the role specifically requires a current student in graphic/communication/fashion design and expert-level Adobe Creative Suite skills, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in Grafikdesign position at Vermas Distribution. Your focus on developing merchandise, corporate wear, and fashion products with character and quality aligns with my own approach to design: thoughtful, detail-oriented, and driven by real-world usability.\n\nThrough my design and development work, I have built a strong sense of visual composition, typography, and color theory. I am proficient with Figma and have experience creating mock-ups, presentations, and production-ready assets. I understand the importance of preparing druckfertige Dateien and coordinating material specifications, print techniques, and placements.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI tools into design workflows. I have hands-on experience using AI for image processing and creative tasks, which can help streamline repetitive work and explore new design possibilities. I am comfortable working independently on structured tasks while also contributing ideas during the creative development of collections.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical st