(2062, 2064, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Personalberatung experience\",\"Recruiting experience\",\"Geschäftsführung experience\",\"Senior Recruiting experience\",\"Talent Acquisition experience\",\"Fach- und Führungspositionen experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, AI, and system architecture. However, this role is for a self-employed personnel consultant (Personalberater) focused on recruitment, consulting, and business development. The applicant\'s profile does not show any experience in personnel consulting, recruiting, talent acquisition, or general management. While the job mentions openness to modern tools, KI, CRM, and digital processes, the core requirement is recruitment and consulting expertise, which the applicant lacks. The match score is low because the primary domain of the job (personnel consulting) is not represented in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining the Karriereweg Netzwerk as a selbständiger Personalberater. Your approach to building a modern network that combines personal consulting expertise with KI-Technologie, CRM, and automated processes stands out. The idea of moving beyond traditional franchise models toward a technology-enabled, partnership-based structure is exactly the kind of forward-thinking environment I want to be part of.\n\nWhat draws me to this opportunity is the emphasis on combining human judgment with modern digital infrastructure. As a software engineer who has built AI-powered platforms and full-stack applications, I understand how technology can enhance recruitment workflows, candidate management, and client relationships. I am not