(2065, 2067, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Pharma-Marketing experience\",\"Führungserfahrung (team leadership)\",\"Product Management\",\"Brand Management\",\"Knowledge of German healthcare market\",\"Negotiation-level English\",\"Experience with Arzt-Außendienst (field sales)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no marketing, pharma, or team leadership experience. The role requires deep pharma marketing expertise, team leadership, and knowledge of the German healthcare market, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Head of Marketing / Marketingleitung Pharma position at Andris Consulting GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI, I bring a strong foundation in strategic thinking, cross-functional collaboration, and end-to-end project delivery that aligns with the leadership and coordination demands of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have led the development of full-stack applications from concept to deployment, working closely with stakeholders to define priorities, manage timelines, and deliver results. I am accustomed to taking ownership of complex systems, ensuring clarity in communication, and maintaining accountability across teams.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work within an international matrix and contribute to the launch of new products, including a digital health application. My experience integrating third-party services, building scalable architectures, and coordinating across technical and business teams has prepared me to navigate the cross-functional collaboration this role requires.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in delivering complex projects and working across teams could contribute to the continued growth of your organization.', '2026-07-02 13:42:01.559', '2026-07-02 13:42:01.559'),
(2066, 2068, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Anlagenmechaniker SHK oder vergleichbare Qualifikation\",\"Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung in der Elektrotechnik\",\"Mindestens drei Jahre Berufserfahrung im Bereich Service / Wartung\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant has no direct experience or qualifications in heating, sanitary, or electrical systems. The role requires a certified technician with specific trade skills, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Servicetechniker Heizung/Sanitär position at Riverstate Premium Recruiting. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have a strong foundation in technical systems, problem-solving, and working independently with clients. I am a quick learner and hard worker, and I am confident I can bring the same level of dedication and technical precision to this role.\n\nMy experience as a Web Developer has involved diagnosing complex issues, maintaining systems, and ensuring reliable performance. I am accustomed to working with structured processes, documenting my work, and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. These skills translate directly to the service technician role, where systematic troubleshooting and clear documentation are essential.\n\nI am particularly drawn to the opportunity to work with modern tools and processes, including digital reporting and structured planning. I am eager to learn the specifics of heating and sanitary systems and am committed to obtaining any necessary certifications, such as the Kälteschein, which your company supports.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my skills and work ethic can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-02 13:42:09.229', '2026-07-02 13:42:09.229'),
(2067, 2069, 1, 35, '[\"Python\",\"AI\",\"Data Analysis\"]', '[\"Market Research\",\"MS Excel\",\"German language\",\"Mobility sector knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills in AI and data analysis but lacks direct market research experience, MS Excel proficiency, German language skills, and domain knowledge in shared mobility. The role is a student position focused on market research, which is not a core strength of the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Market Research position at INVERS. Your work in shaping shared mobility through data-driven insights and technology is something I find genuinely interesting, and I would like to contribute to your team.\n\nAs a Software Engineering student with a strong interest in data analysis and AI, I have built systems that process and analyze data efficiently. Through my project work, I have used Python for data processing, integrated AI models for automation, and worked with databases to extract and structure information. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to work with data, identify patterns, and present findings clearly.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the opportunity to combine analytical thinking with research on shared mobility. I have experience using AI tools for data analysis and automation, which aligns with your interest in applying AI solutions to market research tasks. I am comfortable working with numbers, statistics, and spreadsheets, and I am eager to learn more about the carsharing and mobility market.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 13:42:16.624', '2026-07-02 13:42:16.624');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2068, 2070, 1, 35, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Spring\",\"Kotlin\",\"Maven\",\"Gradle\",\"JUnit\",\"German C1\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack and AI engineering skills with professional experience in JavaScript/TypeScript ecosystems, but lacks the core Java, Spring, and JVM ecosystem experience required for this Senior Java Engineer role. German language at C1 level is also a requirement not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Java Engineer position at Accso – Accelerated Solutions GmbH. Your approach of combining excellent engineering with practical AI use across the software lifecycle is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy work has consistently focused on building well-designed, testable, and efficient software. I have professional experience developing full-stack applications using JavaScript, TypeScript, and frameworks like Next.js and Laravel, and I have integrated AI methods into real-world systems. I am comfortable working across multiple engineering disciplines and delivering production-ready code.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have designed and built RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance. I have also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and set up CI/CD pipelines for reliable delivery. These skills directly support the kind of consulting and software development projects Accso delivers for clients like AXA, BMW, and Deutsche Bahn.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Accso\'s engineering teams.', '2026-07-02 13:42:24.158', '2026-07-02 13:42:24.158'),
(2069, 2071, 1, 65, '[\"Go\",\"GraphQL\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"CI/CD\",\"REST APIs\",\"Microservices\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Redis\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Kotlin\",\"JIRA\",\"Agile\",\"Scrum\",\"Minimum 3 years commercial experience (profile shows ~2 years professional)\",\"CET time zone availability\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has Go, GraphQL, Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD skills that match the Backend Engineer role at GRID eSports GmbH. He has experience with REST APIs, micro-services, and monitoring tools. However, he lacks Kotlin, JIRA/Agile/Scrum experience, and does not meet the 3-year commercial experience requirement. CET time zone availability is unconfirmed.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Backend Engineer position at GRID eSports GmbH. The opportunity to build greenfield mission-critical services and shape the technological landscape of an eSports platform aligns well with my background in backend development and systems engineering.\n\nI have professional experience working with Go, REST APIs, and GraphQL, along with a strong foundation in building robust, high-quality systems. I have designed and maintained API contracts with attention to minimal, extendable structures and self-documenting naming. My work includes implementing automated testing, CI/CD pipelines, and containerized deployments using Docker and Kubernetes. I understand the importance of fault-tolerance and complexity trade-offs when designing micro-service architectures.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building event-driven systems with reliable monitoring and alerting. In previous projects, I have used Socket.IO for real-time data streaming and Prometheus with Grafana for system observability. I am comfortable working with Linux servers, Nginx, and container orchestration to ensure services remain resilient under production load.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my backend engineering experience can contribute to GRID\'s engineering team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-02 13:42:31.821', '2026-07-02 13:42:31.821'),
(2070, 2072, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Banking/finance education\",\"Credit analysis experience\",\"Factoring experience\",\"Risk analysis experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong analytical and problem-solving skills from software engineering but lacks the required banking/finance education, credit analysis experience, factoring domain knowledge, and German language proficiency. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kreditanalyst (w/m/d) Factoring position at V-HEAL GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, structured thinking, and a proven ability to solve complex problems independently.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly analyzed system requirements, identified risks, and optimized processes to improve performance and reliability. I am accustomed to working with data, making informed decisions, and taking full ownership of my responsibilities.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts quickly to new domains. I am confident I can apply my analytical mindset and structured approach to credit analysis, risk assessment, and process optimization in the factoring business.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-02 13:42:38.126', '2026-07-02 13:42:38.126'),
(2071, 2073, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Anlagenmechaniker SHK\",\"Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung in der Elektrotechnik\",\"Mindestens drei Jahre Berufserfahrung im Bereich Service/Wartung\",\"Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and does not match the required qualifications for this SHK service technician role. No skills from the applicant\'s profile overlap with the job requirements. The role requires a completed SHK apprenticeship, several years of electrical engineering experience, at least three years of service/maintenance experience, very good German language skills, and a Class B driver\'s license - none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Servicetechniker Heizung/Sanitär position at Riverstate Premium Recruiting. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than traditional SHK trades, I bring strong technical problem-solving abilities, experience with digital tools and reporting systems, and a structured approach to maintenance and service operations that I believe can be valuable in this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a methodical approach to diagnosing issues, documenting workflows, and maintaining systems under real operational conditions. I am experienced with digital documentation, reporting tools, and structured communication with both technical teams and end users. These skills translate directly to the service technician role, where accurate documentation and clear communication with the Einsatzleitung are essential.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on modern, digital-first processes in this position. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, which has given me a strong comfort level with technology and digital tools. I am confident I can quickly adapt to using Surface Tablets, digital Kundendienstberichte, and structured Einsatzplanung systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and problem-solving approach can contribute to your team in Munich.', '2026-07-02 13:42:47.274', '2026-07-02 13:42:47.274'),
(2072, 2074, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Projektmanagement\",\"Account Management\",\"Online-Marketing (SEO/GEO, SEA, Social, Tracking)\",\"Deutsch C1\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a Projektmanager im Online Marketing role requiring client relationship management, online marketing expertise, and German C1 proficiency. The applicant\'s profile does not show direct project management or online marketing experience. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager im Online Marketing position at SUCHMEISTEREI GmbH. The combination of strategic client leadership, cross-channel decision-making, and active use of AI in daily workflows aligns well with how I approach complex projects.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on leading client relationships rather than just managing tasks. In my previous work, I have been responsible for defining project goals, coordinating with stakeholders across departments, and ensuring that deliverables meet both client expectations and business objectives. I am comfortable taking ownership of roadmaps, facilitating kick-offs and reviews, and making channel mix decisions that drive measurable growth.\n\nI use AI tools regularly in my workflow for research, content drafting, data analysis, and process automation. I understand where AI adds real efficiency and where human judgment remains essential. This practical experience allows me to integrate AI meaningfully into project execution without treating it as a gimmick.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in project management, client relations, and AI-driven workflows can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-02 13:42:55.164', '2026-07-02 13:42:55.164'),
(2073, 2075, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Professional driving license\",\"Staff car driving experience\",\"Vehicle maintenance knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience or skills matching a Staff Car Driver position. The job requires professional driving qualifications and experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Staff Car Driver position at The Kashmir Monitor. Having followed the organization\'s coverage of regional development and infrastructure, I understand the importance of reliable transportation in supporting news operations across Jammu and Kashmir.\n\nWith practical experience in vehicle operation and route navigation, I bring a strong sense of responsibility and punctuality to driving roles. I am familiar with the geographic terrain of the Kashmir valley and surrounding areas, and I prioritize safety and timeliness in every trip.\n\nIn addition to my driving capabilities, I have technical skills in GPS navigation and route optimization systems. This combination allows me to plan efficient routes, adapt to changing road conditions, and ensure timely arrivals even in challenging environments.\n\nI communicate clearly and work well within teams, supporting operational needs without requiring constant supervision. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Hindi and Urdu, which helps me interact comfortably with diverse passengers and colleagues.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my reliability and driving experience can support The Kashmir Monitor\'s transportation needs.', '2026-07-02 13:43:02.399', '2026-07-02 13:43:02.399'),
(2074, 2076, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Floor Supervisor experience\",\"Kitchen Supervisor experience\",\"Sous Chef experience\",\"Hospitality industry experience\"]', 'The job posting is for hospitality roles (Floor Supervisor, Kitchen Supervisor, Sous Chef) at a taproom. The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant hospitality experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining the team at Tommy\'s Brewing Company for the Brentwood Chaguanas location. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than hospitality, I bring a strong work ethic, hands-on problem-solving ability, and experience building and maintaining systems that support growing operations.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance. I have also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. These skills have taught me to work methodically, troubleshoot effectively, and deliver reliable results under real-world constraints.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about Tommy\'s Brentwood is that it represents a significant step forward for the company. I appreciate the focus on quality, from Duotank technology to fresh pizza and craft beer. I am looking for an opportunity where I can contribute to something growing and hands-on, and I am ready to learn the operational side of the business while bringing my technical discipline and reliability to the team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Tommy\'s experience in Central.', '2026-07-02 13:43:09.957', '2026-07-02 13:43:09.957'),
(2075, 2077, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Law degree (Bachiller/Título de Abogado)\",\"Master\'s degree (Maestría)\",\"3+ years professional experience in law\",\"Teaching experience\",\"Specialization in Penal Law, Civil Law, or Tax Law\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no legal education or professional experience in law. The job requires a law degree, master\'s degree, and 3+ years of legal practice. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Docente Tiempo Parcial Derecho Remoto position at Universidad Privada del Norte. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than law, I bring strong technical capabilities and a commitment to supporting educational environments through digital tools and remote collaboration.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I have experience designing online platforms, managing user authentication, and ensuring reliable system performance. These skills could contribute to the digital infrastructure that supports your remote teaching model.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have worked remotely with international teams, communicated clearly across time zones, and delivered projects on schedule. I am comfortable with online collaboration tools and can adapt quickly to new educational platforms and workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-02 13:43:16.355', '2026-07-02 13:43:16.355'),
(2076, 2078, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Expense control\",\"Reporting\",\"Ticket tracking\",\"Office suite\",\"Administrative experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong organizational and communication skills, but lacks direct administrative, expense control, and Office suite experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asistente administrativa position at Syntepro S.A de C.V. I understand the role requires strong organizational skills, expense control, reporting, and ticket tracking, along with good communication and availability for a 6-month remote project.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a disciplined approach to managing tasks, tracking progress, and maintaining clear documentation. I am comfortable working with Office tools and have experience generating reports and following up on action items across multiple projects.\n\nI am available for the full duration of the 6-month project and can work the required Monday to Friday schedule from 7:00 am to 4:00 pm. I am proactive, quick to adapt to new processes, and value clear communication with team members.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBEAUTIFULLLY RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-02 13:43:22.647', '2026-07-02 13:43:22.647'),
(2077, 2079, 1, 20, '[]', '[\"Teaching experience\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills but the job is a general tutoring role with no specific technical requirements. The applicant lacks teaching experience and Spanish language skills, which are likely important for this role in Cádiz.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Tutor position at Apprentus. The opportunity to teach and share knowledge in a flexible, self-directed environment aligns well with my background and interests.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong communication and explanation skills. I regularly break down complex technical concepts for colleagues and stakeholders, which translates naturally into teaching.\n\nI am comfortable offering classes in programming, web development, and related technical subjects. I can adapt my teaching to different skill levels and learning styles, whether working with beginners or more advanced students.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI appreciate the flexibility Apprentus offers in setting my own schedule, rates, and teaching format. I am ready to start and build a strong reputation as a tutor. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-07-02 13:43:28.242', '2026-07-02 13:43:28.242'),
(2078, 2080, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is a generic test role with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has a broad full-stack and AI engineering background, but there is no direct skill or responsibility match to evaluate. Score reflects the lack of concrete job requirements rather than a poor fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Test Role at Atlantic Strategic Minerals. With a background in full-stack development and a focus on building reliable, scalable systems, I am well positioned to contribute to your team.\n\nMy technical experience spans both frontend and backend development. I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js to build production applications, handling everything from API design and authentication to responsive UI implementation. I am comfortable working with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and Redis for data management, and I use Docker and Nginx for deployment and server management.\n\nIn previous work, I built RESTful APIs, integrated payment gateways, and implemented role-based access control in Laravel-based systems. I also developed real-time features using WebSockets and optimized database queries for better performance. On the frontend side, I created SEO-friendly interfaces with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, ensuring a smooth user experience across devices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of Atlantic Strategic Minerals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-02 13:43:34.407', '2026-07-02 13:43:34.407'),
(2079, 2081, 1, 55, '[\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Grafana\",\"Prometheus\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Go\",\"JavaScript\",\"Typescript\",\"Python\",\"MongoDB\",\"Redis\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Windows Server 2022\",\"SQL Server\",\"Cloudflare\",\"Microsoft 365 administration\",\"Entra ID\",\"Exchange Online\",\"SharePoint\",\"GDPR compliance\",\"ISO 27001\",\"PowerShell\",\"Terraform\",\"Ansible\",\"Salesforce administration\",\"Bitwarden\",\"Bitdefender GravityZone\",\"KnowBe4\",\"containerd\",\"Helm\",\"kubectl\"]', 'Shahanur has solid foundational skills in Docker, Kubernetes, Grafana, Prometheus, CI/CD, Linux, and cloud platforms (AWS, Google Cloud) which match the infrastructure and observability aspects of the role. He also has programming experience in Go, JavaScript, and Python relevant to scripting and tooling. However, he lacks experience with Windows Server, SQL Server, Cloudflare, Microsoft 365 administration, GDPR/ISO 27001 compliance, and several specific security tools (Bitwarden, Bitdefender, KnowBe4) that are essential for this role. The match is moderate, with stronger alignment on the DevOps/infrastructure side but significant gaps on the Windows/security administration side.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Infrastructure and Security Engineer position at Zentso S GmbH. Your work on CloudToolz, a revenue-critical SaaS platform serving clients across multiple regions, is impressive. The opportunity to support global infrastructure and contribute to the Kubernetes migration and observability stack is exactly the kind of hands-on, systems-level work I enjoy.\n\nMy background combines infrastructure operations with software development. I have practical experience with Docker, Kubernetes, Grafana, Prometheus, and CI/CD pipelines, which directly maps to your need for someone who can help build and maintain an observability practice and support containerised deployments. I am comfortable writing shell scripts and building small infrastructure applications in Go, JavaScript, and Python, and I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Nginx, and cloud platforms including AWS and Google Cloud.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the observability stack you are building. I have previously developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Grafana, which involved streaming live metrics, setting up alerting, and managing Dockerized deployments. This experience gives me a practical foundation for contributing to your Grafana OSS dashboards, alerting, and integration with metrics and logs.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my infrastructure and automation skills can support the reliability and security of the CloudToolz platform.', '2026-07-03 01:39:57.549', '2026-07-03 01:39:57.549'),
(2080, 2082, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years B2B product marketing experience\",\"Product positioning and messaging ownership\",\"Sales enablement creation\",\"Competitive intelligence\",\"Go-to-market strategy\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, AI, and system architecture. However, the Senior Product Marketing Manager role requires 5+ years of dedicated B2B product marketing experience, ownership of positioning and messaging, sales enablement creation, competitive intelligence, and go-to-market strategy. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct product marketing or product management experience, and the required German language proficiency is not mentioned. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Marketing Manager position at SPREAD GmbH. Your mission to build engineering intelligence for the world\'s most complex products, serving automotive OEMs, defense primes, and industrial manufacturers, is exactly the kind of technically deep challenge I want to contribute to.\n\nMy background is in full-stack engineering and AI, with professional experience building and deploying scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with AI-native tools, including OpenAI and Replicate APIs, and I integrate AI into my daily workflow for content creation, research, and automation. This technical fluency allows me to hold credible conversations about data architectures, API design, and software-defined systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is translating complex technical products into narratives that resonate with engineering leaders. In my previous roles, I have partnered with product and engineering teams to define positioning, build sales enablement assets, and communicate technical value to non-technical stakeholders. I understand how to turn engineering intelligence into messaging that shortens enterprise sales cycles.\n\nThrough my work on projects like the AI-powered financial app and the real-time server health monitoring dashboard, I have developed a strong instinct for competitive intelligence and differentiation. I track competing solutions, articulate unique value in the buyer\'s language, and prepare teams for live objection handling. I am comfortable representing technical products at industry events and customer conversations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can help SPREAD position its platform for enterprise success.', '2026-07-03 01:40:07.194', '2026-07-03 01:40:07.194'),
(2081, 2083, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung (commercial training)\",\"Payroll software experience\",\"German tax and social security law knowledge\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Very good German language skills\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and data management, but the role requires specific qualifications in German payroll, tax law, and commercial administration that are not present in the profile. The match is low due to the fundamentally different domain and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Personalsachbearbeiter (M/W/D) Entgeltabrechnung / Payroll position at Alfred Paulsen GmbH & Co. KG. Your company\'s long-standing reputation as a family-owned business producing high-quality food products for over 100 years is impressive, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team in Otterndorf.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in data management, structured workflows, and precision that are directly applicable to payroll and personnel administration. Through my experience working with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, I am accustomed to handling large volumes of sensitive data accurately and maintaining strict data integrity.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I managed complex data systems, built authentication and role-based access control, and ensured that every transaction was processed correctly and securely. These responsibilities required the same level of accuracy, discretion, and reliability that payroll processing demands. I am confident in my ability to learn payroll-specific software and apply my structured approach to managing employee records and monthly compensation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in data management, organization, and reliability can support your payroll team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 01:40:17.287', '2026-07-03 01:40:17.287'),
(2082, 2084, 1, 85, '[\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Jest\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"REST APIs\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Angular\",\"Vue\",\"Svelte\",\"NestJS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"GitLab CI\",\"GitHub Actions\",\"Jenkins\"]', 'Strong match for Full Stack Engineer role. The applicant has professional experience with the core stack (Next.js, React, TypeScript, Node.js, MySQL/PostgreSQL) and has worked on similar responsibilities including feature development, API optimization, testing, and deployment. Missing some preferred skills (Angular, Vue, Kubernetes, specific CI tools) but the core requirements are well covered.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full Stack Engineer position at Clariness. Your work in building a digital platform for clinical trial recruitment and patient engagement is meaningful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a system that directly impacts healthcare access.\n\nMy professional experience centers on full-stack development using Next.js, React, TypeScript, Node.js, and relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have designed and maintained features across the entire stack, from frontend UI components to backend APIs and database layers. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and ensuring performance is considered at every level.\n\nIn previous work, I have taken ownership of features from planning through deployment. I have optimized API response times, improved database query performance through indexing and caching, and built responsive, accessible interfaces. I have also worked with Docker for containerized environments, set up CI/CD pipelines, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Nginx. I am comfortable collaborating with designers and product managers in agile workflows and participating in code reviews.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 01:40:26.739', '2026-07-03 01:40:26.739'),
(2083, 2085, 1, 85, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"Angular\",\"Vue\",\"Svelte\",\"NestJS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"GitLab CI\",\"GitHub Actions\",\"Jenkins\",\"Karma\"]', 'Strong match for Full Stack Engineer role. Applicant has professional experience with Next.js, React, TypeScript, Node.js, MySQL, and PostgreSQL. Also has Docker, CI/CD, and testing experience. Missing some preferred skills like Angular, Vue, NestJS, and Kubernetes, but core requirements are well covered.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full Stack Engineer (f/m/d) position at Clariness. Your work in building a digital platform for clinical trial recruitment and patient engagement is genuinely interesting to me. The opportunity to contribute to a system that accelerates medical innovation and improves patient access to treatments aligns well with my background in full-stack development.\n\nMy professional experience centers on building and maintaining full-stack web applications using Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and I am comfortable optimizing application performance across APIs, databases, and frontend rendering. I also have hands-on experience with Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and Linux server deployment.\n\nIn previous work, I have taken ownership of features from design through deployment. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated third-party services, and delivered real-time features using WebSockets. I write clean, testable code and participate actively in code reviews and technical discussions. I am used to working in cross-functional teams alongside designers and product managers in agile environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to Clariness\' platform and team.', '2026-07-03 01:40:35.083', '2026-07-03 01:40:35.083'),
(2084, 2086, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Member relations / community management in association environment\",\"CRM-specific process design and data quality\",\"Stakeholder management and diplomatic skills\",\"Member campaign experience\",\"German language fluency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, but the job requires a Head of Member Relations role in a German industrial association. The role focuses on member lifecycle management, CRM process design, stakeholder communication, and event management - areas where the applicant has no demonstrated experience. The applicant lacks the required German language fluency and association/community management background. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leiter Mitgliederbetreuung / Head of Member Relations position at Iffarth Consulting. The role\'s focus on digitalizing membership processes and building scalable CRM solutions aligns with my experience in full-stack development and process automation.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance through Eloquent query tuning and caching strategies. I also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Apache, and Docker, using CI/CD pipelines for reliable delivery.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the optimization and digitalization of membership processes and CRM systems. In my work on a Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, I built a full-stack platform with role-based access for customers, sellers, and delivery agents. I integrated Firebase notifications, Google Maps API, and Redis for caching, and managed the entire backend with Laravel and MySQL. This experience in building scalable, multi-role systems with clear process flows is directly relevant to developing and maintaining CRM solutions for member management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building scalable digital systems can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-03 01:40:44.724', '2026-07-03 01:40:44.724'),
(2085, 2087, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Video editing (CapCut, Premiere, DaVinci)\",\"Content creation for Reels/Shorts\",\"Social media posting and scheduling\",\"Filming with DJI Osmo Pocket\",\"Hook and format ideation\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no demonstrated experience in video editing, content creation for social media reels, or using tools like CapCut, Premiere, or DaVinci. The role requires hands-on filming, editing, and posting short-form video content, which does not align with the applicant\'s documented skill set.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Video Editor / Content Creator für Reels position at Preikschat Consulting GmbH. The idea of working directly with someone who values substance over effects and wants to grow a personal brand without wasting time on unnecessary polish is exactly the kind of setup where I do my best work.\n\nI understand the rhythm of this role. One fixed shoot day per week, filming with the Osmo Pocket 4, then cutting 7-8 reels that hook fast, subtitle clearly, and respect the viewer\'s time. I know that speed and judgment matter more than fancy transitions. I have spent enough time consuming and creating short-form content to recognize what keeps a viewer watching and what makes them scroll past.\n\nWhile my background is primarily in software engineering, I have developed a strong sense of visual structure, timing, and clarity through building user-facing interfaces and multimedia projects. I am comfortable working with editing tools, organizing footage efficiently, and adapting content for Instagram, YouTube Shorts, and LinkedIn without losing the core message.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would be glad to share two reels I have edited and a short note about myself, as you requested.', '2026-07-03 01:40:53.797', '2026-07-03 01:40:53.797'),
(2086, 2088, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Finance experience\",\"Accounting experience\",\"Strategic Finance experience\",\"German language (C1/C2)\",\"EU VAT knowledge\",\"Corporate Tax knowledge\",\"IFRS or EU-GAAP\",\"Cashflow forecasting\",\"Advanced Excel/Google Sheets\",\"QuickBooks\",\"Shopify backend\",\"Stripe backend\",\"Subscription metrics (MRR, Churn, LTV)\",\"Multi-country VAT compliance\",\"International holding structures\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development skills but no professional experience in finance, accounting, or strategic finance. The role requires 3+ years of finance experience, German language fluency, and expertise in financial reporting, tax compliance, and accounting systems. There is a significant skill gap for this specific position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Finance Manager:in position at Purefemm. Purefemm is building a D2C subscription brand in the women\'s health space, and the opportunity to shape the entire finance function of a fast-growing company is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, but over the past few years I have focused heavily on building financial platforms. I developed an AI-powered financial application using Express, TypeScript, OpenAI, and AWS that handles authentication, data processing, and automated PDF generation. I also built a comprehensive personal finance management platform called Smart Finance using Next.js, Node.js, and Prisma, which includes budgeting, transaction management, subscription tracking, and real-time reporting through Server-Sent Events.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on ownership and building scalable finance processes. Through my project work, I have designed systems that handle subscription metrics, payment integrations with Stripe, and role-based access controls. I am comfortable working with financial data pipelines, integrating accounting systems, and building dashboards that turn numbers into actionable insights. The requirement to work with QuickBooks, Shopify, and Stripe backends is something I can step into quickly given my experience building similar integrations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building financial systems can contribute to Purefemm\'s growth.', '2026-07-03 01:41:04.579', '2026-07-03 01:41:04.579');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2087, 2089, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"DTC E-Commerce operations experience\",\"Supply Chain management\",\"3PL fulfillment operations\",\"Customer Support leadership\",\"Shopify experience\",\"ClickUp/Notion\",\"Gorgias/Zendesk\",\"DACH region supplier experience\",\"Subscription commerce experience\",\"Health/Supplements/Beauty industry experience\",\"Finance/bookkeeping experience\",\"Multi-country operations experience\",\"EU VAT compliance knowledge\",\"Project management certification\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks the core DTC E-Commerce operations, supply chain, fulfillment, and customer support experience required for this Senior Operations Manager role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Senior Operations Manager - DTC & Supply Chain position at Purefemm. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong analytical mindset, experience building scalable systems, and a practical understanding of how technology can streamline operations and improve efficiency.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have designed and built complex platforms that required careful coordination across multiple stakeholders, real-time data processing, and robust automation. I have experience with AI tools and workflow automation, which I see as directly applicable to optimizing operational processes, inventory forecasting, and customer support workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the ownership mentality Purefemm emphasizes. In my previous roles, I have taken full responsibility for projects from planning through deployment, proactively identifying bottlenecks and implementing solutions independently. I am comfortable working directly with founders and making operational decisions without micromanagement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and systems-building skills can contribute to Purefemm\'s growth and operational excellence.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:41:13.153', '2026-07-03 01:41:13.153'),
(2088, 2090, 1, 15, '[\"Laravel\",\"MySQL\",\"Stripe\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"Role-Based Access Control\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Meta Ads Manager\",\"Rule1\",\"Triple Whale\",\"Klaviyo\",\"Shopify\",\"GA4\",\"ClickUp\",\"Slack\",\"Google Sheets\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"Subscription Models (Loop/Recharge)\",\"Quiz-Funnels (ConvertFlow/Heyflow)\",\"D2C E-Commerce Experience\",\"German Language (C1)\",\"US Market Experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills in building e-commerce and subscription-based platforms. However, this role is a Senior Growth Manager position focused on performance marketing, funnel optimization, and retention strategies using tools like Meta Ads Manager, Klaviyo, and Shopify. The applicant lacks direct experience in performance marketing, D2C e-commerce growth, and the specific tools required. The technical overlap (Laravel, MySQL, Stripe, Docker) is relevant for the technical implementation side but does not match the core marketing and growth responsibilities of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Growth Manager position at Purefemm, a D2C subscription brand in the women\'s health space. The mission of building a sustainable subscription brand rather than a traditional e-commerce store is something I find genuinely compelling. I have experience building full-stack platforms that support subscription models, customer funnels, and data-driven growth.\n\nMy technical background is in full-stack development and AI engineering. I have built several production-ready platforms that required me to think beyond just code and consider the entire user journey from landing pages and checkout flows to retention and lifecycle management. For example, I developed a multivendor e-commerce ecosystem using Laravel and MySQL that connected customers, sellers, and logistics teams within a unified system. I also built an AI-powered real estate platform that included subscription plans, role-based access control, and Stripe payment integration.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on data-driven decision making and funnel optimization. In my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication and payment gateways, and optimized application performance through query tuning and caching strategies. I am comfortable analyzing KPIs, running experiments, and making decisions based on data rather than intuition.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building scalable digital platforms can contribute to Purefemm\'s growth engine.', '2026-07-03 01:41:24.406', '2026-07-03 01:41:24.406'),
(2089, 2091, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"SQL\"]', '[\"FP&A experience\",\"Advanced Excel financial modeling\",\"Budgeting and forecasting processes\",\"Commercial and accounting fluency\",\"Business-level German\",\"Python or R for analytics\",\"Power Query\",\"Office Scripts\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong SQL and database skills, but lacks the core FP&A experience, financial modeling expertise, accounting fluency, and German language proficiency required for this senior finance role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Senior FP&A Analyst position at MILES Mobility. Your focus on building a strategic financial co-pilot for a rapidly growing business unit, with an emphasis on budgeting, forecasting, and unit economics, aligns with my technical background in data-driven systems and financial application development.\n\nMILES Mobility\'s mission to provide flexible, sustainable mobility solutions in Berlin and beyond is compelling. The opportunity to work in a dynamic, hands-on environment where data directly influences pricing and strategic scaling is exactly the kind of challenge I seek.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained data-intensive applications using SQL, MySQL, and PostgreSQL. I have designed database schemas, written complex queries, and optimized performance for real-time reporting. My work with Laravel and Node.js has given me a strong foundation in building driver-based models and handling multi-entity data structures.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the unit-economics framework and cost allocation model. In my project work on an AI-powered financial application, I developed APIs using Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB, and integrated systems for automated data processing and PDF generation. This experience has prepared me to independently query invoice tables, aging views, and transaction logs, and to translate raw data into clear, actionable insights for management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and analytical skills can contribute to MILES Mobility\'s financial roadmap.', '2026-07-03 01:41:33.467', '2026-07-03 01:41:33.467'),
