contribute consistently and reliably. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your HR team.', '2026-07-03 01:41:41.065', '2026-07-03 01:41:41.065'),
(2091, 2093, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Community management\",\"Call center experience\",\"E-commerce customer support\",\"Freshdesk\",\"CRM systems\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of a Customer Service Manager role, which focuses on customer care, communication, and German language skills. There is a minor overlap in the mention of AI chatbot development, but the overall match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Manager position at brandnooz Media GmbH. Your D2C platform for FMCG innovations, delivering monthly boxes to thousands of consumers and serving over 600 brands, is an impressive model. I am interested in contributing to your customer service team and helping to maintain the high-quality experience your Noozies expect.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining web applications. I have developed full-stack platforms using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and I am comfortable working with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I have also integrated payment gateways such as Stripe and PayPal, which is directly relevant to handling customer inquiries about orders, subscriptions, and payment issues.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your AI hotline and website chatbot. I have hands-on experience building AI-powered features, including developing a financial app that used OpenAI\'s API for an intelligent assistant and a real estate platform that integrated AI for image processing and user interaction. I am confident I can support the maintenance and further development of these tools to improve your service quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 01:41:49.992', '2026-07-03 01:41:49.992'),
(2092, 2094, 1, 20, '[]', '[\"Projektmanagement\",\"Influencer Marketing\",\"Eventorganisation\",\"Guest Management\",\"Trello\",\"Kundenkommunikation\",\"Präsentationen\"]', 'The applicant has strong organizational and coordination skills from software project delivery, but lacks direct experience in project management, influencer marketing, event organization, and client success roles. The profile shows transferable skills in structured work, client communication, and deadline management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektkoordination & Client Success role at Social Food Collective. Your work at the intersection of food, hospitality, and community building stands out to me, and I appreciate that you value responsibility and initiative over a perfect resume.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, my day-to-day work has always involved strong coordination and client communication. In my role at Explo-IT, I was responsible for gathering requirements, managing project timelines, and serving as the bridge between clients, partners, and the development team. I kept Trello boards updated, prepared meeting materials, and ensured that all stakeholders were aligned on deliverables and deadlines.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and taking ownership of tasks. I bring a structured approach to project coordination, whether it is preparing presentations, following up with clients, or keeping project plans current. I enjoy bringing clarity to creative workflows and making sure nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a flexible freelance arrangement where I can contribute meaningfully while growing with a small team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your projects.', '2026-07-03 01:41:58.755', '2026-07-03 01:41:58.755'),
(2093, 2095, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Process automation and tooling (Make/n8n/Zapier)\",\"No-code/low-code platform experience\",\"Business process optimization\",\"German language proficiency\",\"CRM/ERP system experience (Odoo, Webflow)\"]', 'The applicant is a skilled full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical abilities in web development, API integration, and AI-powered features. However, this role is a Business Development Manager focused on process automation, tool evaluation, and workflow optimization using no-code/low-code platforms and LLMs. The applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate experience in business process design, no-code tooling, CRM/ERP systems, or German language proficiency, which are key requirements for this position. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Development Manager role at Severin Travel GmbH. Your focus on transforming manual, high-touch processes into scalable, automated systems is exactly the kind of challenge I look for. The idea of building a modular offer engine, integrating AI into daily workflows, and creating measurable efficiency gains aligns directly with how I approach engineering.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI integration. I have built production systems that combine backend logic, real-time data pipelines, and AI services. For instance, I developed an AI-powered financial application that uses OpenAI models, AWS services, and automated PDF generation to replace manual workflows. I also built a real-time server monitoring dashboard that streams live metrics using Socket.IO, with a fully Dockerized deployment. These projects required me to think in systems, not just features.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on building a modular offer system, automating the customer journey, and using LLMs and no-code tools to reduce manual effort. I have experience integrating AI assistants, building automated pipelines, and deploying applications on cloud infrastructure. I am comfortable evaluating tools, making build-vs-buy decisions, and implementing solutions that deliver measurable time savings.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can help build the systems that let your team scale.\n\nThank you for your time.', '2026-07-03 01:42:08.824', '2026-07-03 01:42:08.824'),
(2094, 2096, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Banking/finance qualification\",\"Portfolio management experience\",\"Wealth advisory experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"WpHGMaAnzV certification\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant experience or qualifications in portfolio management, wealth advisory, or banking. The job requires specific banking certifications and years of client-facing advisory experience, which the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Spezialist Portfoliomanagement position at Foxio Consulting GmbH, supporting the Deutsche Apotheker- und Ärztebank (apoBank). While my professional background is in software engineering rather than banking, I bring strong analytical skills, experience building secure systems, and the ability to work with complex data and client-facing solutions.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built systems that require careful attention to user needs, data integrity, and security. I have developed applications with role-based access control, authentication workflows, and real-time data processing. These skills translate well into portfolio management environments where accuracy, confidentiality, and structured decision-making are essential.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built and integrated RESTful APIs, and implemented secure payment gateways. I also optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies, and deployed applications on Linux servers with CI/CD pipelines. This experience has given me a strong foundation in building reliable, user-focused systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to the team at Foxio Consulting GmbH.', '2026-07-03 01:42:17.562', '2026-07-03 01:42:17.562'),
(2095, 2097, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Refrigeration and cooling technology expertise\",\"ERP system knowledge\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Technical sales experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Technical Sales Support role, which demands specialized knowledge in refrigeration and climate technology, ERP systems, and technical sales support. The applicant has strong general technical skills but lacks the domain-specific experience and qualifications required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technical Sales Support position at BEIJER REF Deutschland GmbH. Your company\'s role as a subsidiary of a European market leader in refrigeration and climate technology, combined with your focus on customer proximity and team collaboration, makes this an opportunity I find genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong technical problem-solving skills and the ability to communicate complex information clearly. I have worked on designing scalable web applications, building and integrating RESTful APIs, and managing databases using MySQL and PostgreSQL. These experiences have given me a solid foundation in understanding technical systems and supporting end-users effectively.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the technical support and coordination aspect of this role. In previous positions, I collaborated closely with stakeholders and engineering teammates to deliver features, resolve issues, and ensure smooth project workflows. I am comfortable handling technical inquiries, supporting customers, and working across functions to maintain organized operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my hands-on approach, reliability, and willingness to learn new skills would allow me to contribute positively to your team in Munich. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support BEIJER REF Deutschland GmbH.', '2026-07-03 01:42:26.186', '2026-07-03 01:42:26.186'),
(2096, 2098, 1, 65, '[\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"WebSocket\",\"Socket.IO\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Git\"]', '[\"C#\",\".NET\",\"Entity Framework\",\"Vue.js 3\",\"Nuxt.js\",\"MQTT\",\"Vector-Datenbanken\",\"Agent-Frameworks\",\"Swagger/OpenAPI\",\"MLOps-Grundkenntnisse\",\"DSGVO/EU AI Act knowledge\",\"RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)\",\"Embeddings\"]', 'Shahanur has solid software engineering fundamentals with hands-on AI project experience using OpenAI APIs, strong backend skills with Node.js/Express and relational databases, and DevOps knowledge with Docker, Linux, and CI/CD. The main gaps are in the specific tech stack (C#, .NET, Vue.js, Nuxt.js) and some advanced AI concepts like RAG, embeddings, and vector databases. However, his practical AI integration experience and full-stack development background make him a reasonable candidate for this role, especially given the company\'s openness to candidates who are willing to learn.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Softwareentwickler (m/w/d) mit KI-Fokus position at MySpa Service GmbH. Your focus on integrating AI capabilities into existing software systems while maintaining stability in 24/7 production environments aligns directly with the kind of engineering work I find most meaningful.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered applications that combine OpenAI APIs with production-grade backend systems. In one project, I developed an AI-powered financial app using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI, where I trained custom AI assistants on domain-specific datasets and integrated voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe. This experience