(2097, 2099, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"SQL\",\"C++\",\"Docker\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\"]', '[\"PyTorch\",\"TensorFlow\",\"Recommendation Systems (RecSys)\",\"Ranking Algorithms\",\"Personalisation Models\",\"7+ years Data Science/ML experience\",\"Large-scale production datasets\",\"Experimentation & model evaluation\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Python, SQL, and some experience with AI/ML projects (e.g., YOLOv8-based object detection). However, the role requires 7+ years of experience in Data Science/ML, deep learning frameworks (PyTorch/TensorFlow), recommendation systems, and production ML workflows, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Data Scientist position at Pertemps ERP. The focus on building deep learning models for recommendation, ranking, and personalisation at scale aligns directly with my technical background and research interests.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built production-ready AI systems that combine deep learning with real-world deployment. One example is WVAB (Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind), where I designed and implemented a YOLOv8n-based object detection pipeline optimized for real-time inference on edge hardware. This required working with large datasets, tuning model performance, and ensuring the system operated reliably without cloud dependency.\n\nIn addition to deep learning, I have strong Python and SQL skills, which I have applied across multiple projects involving data processing, API integration, and backend development. I am comfortable designing experiments, evaluating model outputs, and iterating on approaches to improve accuracy and relevance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to your team\'s work on large-scale deep learning systems.', '2026-07-03 01:42:44.680', '2026-07-03 01:42:44.680'),
(2098, 2100, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"SAP EWM\",\"Customizing\",\"German B2\"]', 'The applicant has no direct SAP EWM experience or German language skills, which are mandatory for this role. However, he has strong software engineering fundamentals, database expertise, and a willingness to relocate and learn German.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP EWM Consultant position at Pertemps ERP. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring strong analytical skills, system customization experience, and a proven ability to master complex enterprise platforms quickly.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and optimized large-scale applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. These projects required deep understanding of database architecture, role-based access control, API integration, and performance tuning. I am confident that this technical foundation, combined with my systematic approach to problem-solving, will allow me to contribute effectively to SAP EWM customization and implementation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of adapting complex systems to meet specific business needs. In previous projects, I have customized authentication workflows, payment integrations, and real-time communication modules. I approach each system with a focus on understanding its core logic before making modifications, which has helped me deliver reliable and maintainable solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in Voronezh, Russia, and am prepared to relocate to the Ems-Land area for this position. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-03 01:42:53.100', '2026-07-03 01:42:53.100'),
(2099, 2101, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Influencer management experience\",\"Social media content creation\",\"German fluency (fluent required)\",\"MS Office proficiency\",\"Marketing/brand communication experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical, organizational, and communication skills, but lacks direct experience in influencer management, social media content creation, marketing, and fluent German — all key requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikum Talent & Influencer Management position at haebmau AG. Your focus on strategically developing creators and matching them with the right brand partnerships caught my attention. I am interested in contributing to your Digital Communications team while gaining hands-on experience in the influencer and talent management space.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational and analytical skills that translate well into this role. Building full-stack applications required me to research requirements, identify the right tools and partners, track performance metrics, and present clear findings to stakeholders. These skills directly support the tasks of researching brand opportunities, preparing pitch materials, and analyzing talent performance data.\n\nI am comfortable working with data and performance metrics, which would help me support the analysis of content performance and the development of new marketing approaches for your talents. My experience creating structured reports and presentations means I can contribute meaningfully to client meetings and partnership development from day one.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I communicate clearly across teams and with external partners. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and I am actively learning German. I enjoy collaborating in international environments and adapt quickly to new workflows.\n\nI am eager to bring my research skills, initiative, and structured thinking to haebmau AG. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 01:43:01.467', '2026-07-03 01:43:01.467'),
(2100, 2102, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Kaufmännische Berufsausbildung\",\"Buchhaltung\",\"SAP\",\"MS Office (Excel)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no commercial or educational background in accounting, finance, or administrative roles. The job requires a completed commercial training or equivalent experience, MS Office proficiency (especially Excel), and ideally SAP knowledge. None of these skills or experiences are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kaufmännischer Sachbearbeiter (m/w/d) Kita-Finanzen position at Dussmann KulturKindergarten in Berlin. Your focus on providing high-quality, culturally enriched childcare across Germany is meaningful, and I would welcome the opportunity to support your administrative team in managing financial operations efficiently.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical thinking, structured workflows, and a high level of accuracy to financial and administrative tasks. I am proficient in MS Office, particularly Excel, and have experience working with databases, reporting tools, and data validation processes that require careful attention to detail.\n\nI am comfortable working independently and within small teams. I value clear communication, organized task management, and the ability to quickly learn new systems. I am confident I can apply my methodical approach to invoice processing, cash book reviews, and funding documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English