(2101, 2103, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Business Operations\",\"Analytics\",\"KPI Analysis\",\"Process Optimization\",\"Training & Development\",\"Sales Support\",\"German (C2)\",\"English (C1)\",\"Bachelor/Master in Economics/Business\"]', 'The Operations Trainee role is a business operations and management program requiring analytical skills, process optimization, cross-functional collaboration, and fluency in German and English. Md Shahanur Islam Shagor\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI). While he demonstrates analytical thinking, project ownership, and communication skills through his technical work, he lacks the specific business operations, analytics, training, sales, and language (German C2) qualifications emphasized in the job description. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Trainee (m/w/d) position at Yoummday. Your 18-month program offers a direct path into operations management, and the opportunity to work across operations, training, talent, and sales is exactly the kind of hands-on, cross-functional experience I am looking for.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Yoummday is the structured yet high-impact nature of the program. The idea of rotating through core business areas, taking ownership of real projects from day one, and building a 360-degree understanding of a scaling platform is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked on operational aspects of product delivery. I analyzed KPIs related to application performance, identified deviations in system behavior, and implemented targeted improvements to optimize service performance and resource utilization. This required structured problem-solving, data-driven decision-making, and clear communication with stakeholders.\n\nI am comfortable working in dynamic environments where priorities shift and initiative matters. I have consistently taken ownership of my work, managed projects with clear timelines, and maintained focus on measurable outcomes. I communicate clearly and precisely with team members and stakeholders, and I am committed to delivering high-quality results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Yoummday\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 01:43:19.597', '2026-07-03 01:43:19.597'),
(2102, 2104, 1, 15, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Civil Engineering degree\",\"CAD software (BricsCAD/AutoCAD)\",\"HOAI knowledge\",\"Infrastructure planning\",\"BIM experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no civil engineering background. The job requires a degree in civil engineering and experience with CAD, BIM, and infrastructure planning. The applicant\'s IT skills (Linux, Docker, CI/CD) are marginally relevant but do not match the core requirements of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Tiefbauingenieur position at a2Plan Ingenieure GmbH. Although my formal education is in software engineering rather than civil engineering, I am drawn to this opportunity because of the clear emphasis on digital transformation and the structured team environment described in the posting. I am eager to contribute my technical skills to support your transition toward BIM and model-based planning.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built a strong foundation in IT systems, including Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and CI/CD pipeline management. These skills are directly relevant to the digital tools and workflows that modern engineering offices rely on. I am comfortable working with complex software environments and learning new platforms quickly.\n\nOne area where I can add immediate value is in supporting your team\'s adoption of BIM and CAD-based workflows. I have experience integrating third-party APIs, managing databases, and automating repetitive tasks. I am confident I can quickly become proficient with BricsCAD or AutoCAD and help streamline your planning processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am motivated to grow within a supportive team and take on increasing responsibility over time. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to a2Plan Ingenieure GmbH.', '2026-07-03 01:43:28.721', '2026-07-03 01:43:28.721'),
(2103, 2105, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Canva\",\"Meta Ads\",\"Shopify\",\"E-Mail-Marketing\",\"German language (professional)\"]', 'The applicant has some design-related skills (Figma, CSS, HTML) and familiarity with AI tools like ChatGPT, which are mentioned as nice-to-haves. However, the core requirements of the role — professional Adobe Photoshop and InDesign skills, German language proficiency, and direct marketing experience — are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Allrounder position at EQUUSIR Germany GmbH. Your work in developing innovative health products for horses, dogs, and people caught my attention. I appreciate the focus on sustainability and the hands-on, collaborative approach your team values.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong sense for design, layout, and visual consistency. I have used tools like Figma and Tailwind CSS to create clean, responsive interfaces, and I am comfortable preparing graphics, editing images, and structuring content for different formats. I enjoy working independently on creative tasks and taking responsibility for delivering polished results.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of AI tools for content creation. I have practical experience using ChatGPT and similar AI applications to support text generation, image processing, and workflow automation. I am genuinely curious about exploring new tools and finding practical ways to apply them in marketing contexts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to bring my design sense, independent work ethic, and interest in AI tools to your marketing team. My CV is attached for your review.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 01:43:37.401', '2026-07-03 01:43:37.401'),
(2104, 2106, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Trade qualification in cabinet making, joinery, timber or metal fabrication\",\"Forklift licence\",\"Experience in a trade or industrial setting\",\"Knowledge of prison industry procedures\",\"Understanding of Lean manufacturing principles\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and does not match the trade/industrial requirements of this role. No relevant skills or experience align with the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Industry Officer role at the Department of Justice and Community Safety, Victoria. The opportunity to help people build practical skills for life after prison through hands-on training in real workplace settings is meaningful work that I would be proud to contribute to.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong discipline, attention to safety protocols, and the ability to work effectively within structured operational environments. I have experience monitoring production workflows, maintaining equipment, and meeting targets through systematic processes. These skills translate well to an industrial setting where safety, supervision, and continuous improvement are central.\n\nI am a quick learner with proven resilience. In previous roles, I have adapted quickly to new tools, procedures, and team dynamics while maintaining focus on quality and efficiency. I understand the importance of following security and operational procedures, and I am comfortable working in environments where every day brings different challenges.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 01:43:45.485', '2026-07-03 01:43:45.485');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2105, 2107, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Call center experience\",\"CRM systems proficiency\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI, autonomous systems) and does not contain direct customer service, call center, or CRM experience. While the applicant demonstrates strong communication and problem-solving skills from project work, the core requirements of the role are not met by the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Service Representative position at Nestlé Health Science. Your mission to merge nutrition, science, and wellness to empower healthier lives is genuinely impactful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a team that supports patients and consumers through exceptional service.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills through years of client-facing project work. I am comfortable handling inquiries via email and other channels, documenting interactions accurately, and collaborating across teams to resolve issues efficiently. I approach every task with attention to detail and a commitment to quality.\n\nIn my previous roles, I worked closely with stakeholders to understand requirements, communicate progress, and ensure timely delivery. This experience taught me how to manage multiple priorities, maintain professionalism under pressure, and follow established procedures consistently. I am confident these skills translate directly to delivering excellent customer service.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Nestlé Health Science\'s customer-focused team.', '2026-07-03 01:43:52.989', '2026-07-03 01:43:52.989'),
(2106, 2108, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job posting is a general article about high-paying jobs without a degree, not a specific job listing. It does not list any required skills, technologies, or responsibilities. Therefore, a meaningful match score cannot be calculated. The applicant has strong web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, etc.) but there is no job to match against.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Web Developer / Full-Stack Developer role at Bluefield Daily Telegraph. With 4 years of professional experience building and deploying web applications, I am confident I can contribute to your team\'s technical goals.\n\nMy core expertise lies in full-stack development using Laravel and Next.js. I have built scalable backend systems with Laravel, including RESTful APIs, authentication, role-based access control, and payment gateway integration. On the frontend, I work with Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS to create responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I delivered web applications end to end. I optimized database performance through Eloquent query tuning and caching, integrated real-time features using WebSockets, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. I also collaborated closely with stakeholders to translate requirements into working software.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is a multivendor e-commerce ecosystem I built using Laravel and MySQL. The system manages customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams through role-based access control, with Firebase notifications and Google Maps integration for real-time tracking.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of Bluefield Daily Telegraph.', '2026-07-03 01:44:00.488', '2026-07-03 01:44:00.488'),
(2107, 2109, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Clinical proofreading/editing experience\",\"Healthcare industry experience\",\"Knowledge of TruCare or similar clinical systems\",\"MS SharePoint\",\"Utilization Management experience\",\"Government healthcare programs experience\",\"Managed care processes experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong communication and organizational skills, but lacks the clinical, healthcare, and regulatory editing experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Clinical Proofreader Editor position at 4 Corner Resources. The role\'s focus on ensuring accuracy, compliance, and quality in member and provider correspondence aligns with my own commitment to precision and clear communication.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong written and verbal communication skills through years of technical documentation, client communication, and cross-team collaboration. My experience includes reviewing complex system outputs, identifying gaps, and providing actionable feedback to improve quality and reduce errors.\n\nIn previous work, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to ensure that all communications met regulatory and branding standards. I am comfortable working with templates, managing correspondence lifecycles, and maintaining consistency across large volumes of content. My ability to think critically and solve problems methodically has been essential in delivering accurate results under deadlines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my attention to detail, organizational skills, and adaptability make me a strong fit for this role. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-03 01:44:07.226', '2026-07-03 01:44:07.226'),
(2108, 2110, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Social media management (Sprout Social, etc.)\",\"Content creation for social platforms\",\"Community management\",\"Social media analytics\",\"Marketing communications\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) with no direct social media, marketing, or content creation experience. The role requires daily social media publishing, community management, content coordination, and familiarity with platforms like Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, and tools like Sprout Social and Canva. The applicant has strong project coordination and cross-functional collaboration skills, which are transferable, but lacks the core social media and marketing qualifications. Overall match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Coordinator position at The Nature Conservancy. Your mission to protect lands and waters through science-based solutions resonates with me, and I appreciate the focus on cultivating a global community connected by a shared love of nature.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong project coordination and cross-functional collaboration skills. In my previous roles, I regularly sourced, organized, and prepared content from internal stakeholders, ensuring assets were properly tagged, tracked, and scheduled for publishing. I am comfortable maintaining content calendars and making real-time adjustments based on shifting priorities.\n\nI have experience editing copy, proofreading business documents, and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical teams. I am familiar with tools like Canva and Asana and can quickly learn social media management platforms. I understand the importance of brand voice and engagement guidelines when responding to comments and messages.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to TNC\'s social media efforts and help advance your mission.', '2026-07-03 01:44:15.354', '2026-07-03 01:44:15.354'),
(2109, 2111, 1, 15, '[\"Google Cloud\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Executive support experience\",\"Calendar management\",\"Travel booking\",\"Expense reporting\",\"AI-powered email tools (Superhuman, Fyxer)\",\"Enterprise ERP systems (Maconomy)\",\"Google Workspace advanced proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct executive assistant, calendar management, travel booking, or administrative support experience. The match is low (15%) as the role requires specific EA competencies not present in the profile. However, the applicant\'s technical proficiency, remote work experience, and proactive work style are transferable strengths.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Executive Assistant role supporting the leadership team at your client, a creative technology agency working with brands like Google, Amazon, and Meta. The opportunity to contribute to a company that builds transformative digital and AI-driven experiences is genuinely compelling.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, the core strengths required for this role align closely with how I work. I am naturally proactive, organized, and comfortable taking full ownership of tasks without waiting for direction. In my previous roles, I managed complex project timelines, coordinated across multiple stakeholders, and ensured nothing fell through the cracks. I bring the same structured, reliable approach to executive support.\n\nI am technically fluent and comfortable with AI-powered tools, Google Workspace, and cloud platforms like Google Cloud. I have experience auditing cloud resources and coordinating technical information across teams, which maps directly to the special project work described in this role. I am also experienced working remotely across time zones and communicating clearly with diverse teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical and organizational skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can bring the reliability, foresight, and low-ego support this team needs. My CV is attached for your review, and I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute.', '2026-07-03 01:44:24.757', '2026-07-03 01:44:24.757'),
(2110, 2112, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"Machine Learning\",\"AI\",\"SQL\"]', '[\"Power BI\",\"Snowflake\",\"Data Warehousing\",\"Cloud-based Data Platforms\",\"Predictive Analytics\",\"Statistical Analysis\",\"Feature Engineering\",\"Data Pipelines\",\"Model Evaluation\",\"AI Workflows\",\"End-to-End Models\",\"Business Process Integration\",\"ERP Systems\",\"IOT Data\",\"Data Storytelling\",\"Dashboard Development\",\"Stakeholder Decision Support\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Python, machine learning, and AI, which partially align with the Data Scientist role. However, the job requires specific expertise in Power BI, Snowflake, data warehousing, predictive analytics, and cloud-based data platforms, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s experience is more focused on web development and embedded AI systems rather than enterprise data science and analytics. The match is low due to the significant gap in required tools and domain experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Data Scientist position at New Flyer. Your work in heavy-duty transit and sustainable mobility solutions is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to data-driven projects that support manufacturing, quality, and supply chain operations.\n\nMy technical background is centered on applied AI and machine learning. I have worked with Python for building and evaluating models, and I am comfortable with SQL for data exploration and analysis. Through hands-on project work, I have developed a solid understanding of machine learning workflows, feature engineering, and model performance evaluation.\n\nOne relevant example is the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) project, where I designed a real-time object detection system using YOLOv8n. This involved data preprocessing, model training, performance tuning, and deploying the model on edge hardware for offline inference. The project required working across the full AI pipeline, from data collection to production integration.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support New Flyer\'s data science initiatives.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:44:33.923', '2026-07-03 01:44:33.923'),
(2111, 2113, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Event planning experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"Hospitality or travel industry background\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development, AI engineering) with no direct event planning, coordination, customer service, or hospitality experience. However, the applicant demonstrates strong organizational, communication, and remote work skills that could transfer to the role. The match is low due to the lack of relevant industry experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Event Planning Assistant position at Professional Travel Planners LLC. Your focus on supporting event coordination, managing logistics, and ensuring smooth execution from start to finish aligns well with my background in organizing complex workflows and delivering results in remote settings.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed strong organizational and multitasking skills. I regularly coordinated project timelines, tracked tasks across multiple teams, and maintained detailed records to ensure nothing fell through the cracks. This required clear communication, attention to detail, and the ability to work independently while staying aligned with broader goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support event planning logistics and client communication. In my previous work, I was responsible for gathering requirements from clients, confirming details, and providing timely follow-ups to keep projects on track. I am comfortable using online tools and scheduling platforms to manage tasks efficiently in a fully remote environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:44:41.253', '2026-07-03 01:44:41.253'),
(2112, 2114, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"12+ years operations experience\",\"site management\",\"P&L management\",\"planning & forecasting\",\"capital and expense budgeting\",\"supply chain management\",\"multi-site leadership\",\"business administration degree\"]', 'The candidate\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the senior operations leadership requirements of this Vice President of Operations role. The position requires 12+ years of operations experience, site management, P&L management, supply chain expertise, and multi-site leadership - none of which are present in the candidate\'s software engineering background. The candidate\'s skills in web development, deployment, and project delivery do not align with the executive operations responsibilities described.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President of Operations role at Vestcom, a business of Avery Dennison. Your focus on technology-driven shelf-edge solutions for retailers and CPGs is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the operational excellence that supports these data-integrated media systems.\n\nMy professional experience spans full-stack web development and product delivery, where I have been responsible for designing scalable applications, managing API integrations, and ensuring reliable deployments. I have worked closely with engineering teams and stakeholders to align technical execution with business objectives, which has given me a practical understanding of how operations, technology, and customer experience connect.\n\nIn previous work, I have built and maintained production systems using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and MySQL, with a focus on performance optimization, real-time features, and secure authentication. I have deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, and I have experience managing cloud infrastructure on AWS. These responsibilities have required consistent planning, cross-team coordination, and a focus on delivering quality results on time.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in technology-driven operations and delivery can support Vestcom\'s goals.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:44:49.869', '2026-07-03 01:44:49.869'),
(2113, 2115, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"12+ years operations experience\",\"P&L management\",\"Supply chain management\",\"Site management\",\"Business Administration degree\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no operations leadership, P&L management, or supply chain experience required for this Vice President of Operations role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vice President of Operations position at Avery Dennison. Your company\'s work in materials science and digital identification solutions, particularly through the Vestcom business, is impressive. The focus on technology-driven shelf-edge solutions that connect physical and digital experiences aligns with my own interest in building systems that bridge real-world operations with software.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have delivered full-stack applications that required coordinating multiple stakeholders, managing delivery timelines, and maintaining quality across releases. I have worked on projects involving authentication systems, payment integrations, real-time features, and database optimization. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how technical execution connects to broader business goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on on-time delivery and year-to-year improvement of operations results. In my previous work, I have been responsible for deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers, setting up CI/CD pipelines, and ensuring system reliability. I am comfortable working with cross-functional teams to align technical work with operational targets.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 01:44:57.267', '2026-07-03 01:44:57.267'),
(2114, 2116, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer service experience\",\"Portuguese language\",\"Call center tools\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack and AI engineering) with no direct customer service or call center experience. The job requires Portuguese language skills, which are not listed. The match is low, but the applicant demonstrates strong communication, teamwork, and problem-solving abilities that could be transferable.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistente de Atendimento ao Cliente position at Stone. The opportunity to work within the Vitta health and insurance vertical, part of a Nasdaq-listed group focused on transforming healthcare in Brazil, is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy professional background has consistently involved direct communication, problem resolution, and cross-functional collaboration. In my previous roles as a web developer, I worked closely with clients and internal teams to understand needs, track requests, and deliver solutions within defined timelines. This experience taught me how to listen carefully, communicate clearly, and follow through until issues are fully resolved.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on customer experience and team collaboration at Stone and Vitta. I value working in environments where clarity, responsibility, and continuous improvement are part of daily practice. I am comfortable handling multiple communication channels and staying organized under pressure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Vitta team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:45:04.406', '2026-07-03 01:45:04.406'),
(2115, 2117, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Influencer marketing experience\",\"Creator partnerships experience\",\"TikTok/Instagram platform expertise\",\"Shopify, Superfiliate, ShopMy experience\",\"Campaign tracking and reporting\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in influencer marketing, creator partnerships, or social media campaign management. While they demonstrate strong organizational and cross-functional collaboration skills from software development, they lack the core marketing-specific requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Influencer Marketing Coordinator position at Nello. Your focus on scaling creator partnerships and managing influencer campaigns behind the scenes caught my attention.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills through managing complex, multi-stakeholder projects. I am comfortable tracking performance metrics, maintaining detailed records, and ensuring that nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I regularly coordinated with cross-functional teams including creative, content, and growth stakeholders to keep projects on track. I managed timelines, deliverables, and communication across multiple parties, which translates well into the influencer coordination workflow.\n\nI am a self-starter who thrives in remote, independent work environments. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical teams.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 01:45:10.929', '2026-07-03 01:45:10.929'),
(2116, 2118, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing\",\"Business\",\"Influencer marketing\",\"Campaign development\",\"Contract negotiation\",\"Budget management\",\"Data analysis tools\",\"Google Slides\",\"Social media trends\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no marketing, influencer, or campaign management experience. The job requires a Bachelor\'s in Marketing/Business and 1+ year of agency/brand influencer marketing experience. The applicant\'s skills do not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Manager of Influencer Marketing position at Newhouse. Your agency\'s work across entertainment, automotive, finance, and DTC verticals is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to campaigns for well-known brands.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong analytical and organizational skills. I am comfortable working with data, managing complex workflows, and ensuring that projects meet defined standards. These skills translate directly to campaign development, creator discovery, and budget management.\n\nIn previous work, I have coordinated with multiple stakeholders, maintained clear documentation, and communicated effectively across teams. I am detail-oriented and comfortable managing timelines, onboarding processes, and quality checks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support Newhouse\'s influencer marketing efforts.', '2026-07-03 01:45:17.430', '2026-07-03 01:45:17.430'),
(2117, 2119, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"motion design\",\"social content design\",\"UX design\",\"3+ years digital/interaction design experience\"]', 'The applicant has some foundational design-related skills (Figma, HTML, CSS, Tailwind) but lacks core requirements for this Designer role: professional digital/interaction design experience, motion design, Adobe Creative Suite proficiency, and social content design expertise. The profile is heavily engineering-focused, not design-focused.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Designer role on the Multiplatform Content Design team at Forbes. The opportunity to craft compelling, user-focused brand experiences at a globally recognized media brand is something I find genuinely motivating.\n\nMy design work is grounded in practical front-end development and a strong sense of visual hierarchy. I have experience using Figma to create layouts, wireframes, and UI components, and I bring a solid understanding of typography, color, and responsive design. I am comfortable working across the full design-to-development pipeline, ensuring that what is designed can be built efficiently and consistently.\n\nIn previous projects, I have built polished landing pages, interactive features, and platform-native interfaces using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI. I have worked closely with content teams to translate editorial goals into clear visual concepts, balancing creative ambition with practical execution. I am also experienced in managing multiple concurrent projects and iterating based on feedback and performance data.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my design and development experience can contribute to the Forbes Content & Design Studio.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:45:25.250', '2026-07-03 01:45:25.250'),
(2118, 2120, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Legal knowledge\",\"Court system experience\",\"Registrar experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in legal, court, or registrar roles. The job requires legal and administrative expertise which is not present in the candidate\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Registrar role at Queensland Government. The opportunity to contribute to the modernisation and improvement of the court system, with a focus on safety, innovation, efficiency, and enhanced access to justice, is one I find genuinely compelling.\n\nAs a software engineer with experience in system design and process automation, I understand how technology can transform complex workflows into more responsive and user-friendly experiences. My work has consistently focused on building systems that are reliable, scalable, and easy for people to use.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, integrating RESTful APIs, authentication systems, and real-time features. I have also built monitoring dashboards that stream live system metrics, giving teams instant visibility into operational health. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to improve efficiency and reliability in service delivery.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 01:45:32.045', '2026-07-03 01:45:32.045'),
(2119, 2121, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Facilities maintenance experience\",\"Handyman experience\",\"Grass cutting\",\"Snow clearing\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct facilities maintenance or handyman experience listed in the profile. The job requires practical, hands-on maintenance skills which are not present in the applicant\'s background. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Handy Person position at CAN Group. The role involves conducting routine checks, responding to maintenance requests, performing basic repairs and DIY tasks, seasonal grass cutting, and ensuring work areas remain safe and operational. I am a practical, reliable individual who takes a methodical approach to every task.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have always been a hands-on person. I am confident carrying out basic repairs, minor fixes, and practical tasks around buildings. I understand the importance of keeping work areas tidy, safe, and fully operational at all times.\n\nI am organised and proactive by nature. I do not wait for problems to escalate. I prefer to spot issues early, address them directly, and ensure everything is in good working order. Whether it is responding to a maintenance request or clearing paths of snow, I approach each job with the same level of care and attention to detail.\n\nIn addition to my practical skills, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical people. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a quick learner and a reliable worker. I am ready to contribute to CAN Group\'s facilities team and help maintain a safe, clean, and well-functioning environment. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:45:39.223', '2026-07-03 01:45:39.223'),
(2120, 2122, 1, 20, '[]', '[\"Resource mobilisation\",\"Commerce\",\"Finance\"]', 'The job is a Resource mobiliser role open to engineering backgrounds but focused on mobilisation, commerce, and finance. The applicant has strong software engineering skills but no direct experience in resource mobilisation, commerce, or finance. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Resource mobiliser position at Vrindavan Chandrodaya Mandir. The role\'s openness to candidates from engineering backgrounds aligns well with my experience in software development and project coordination.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked on full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React, building RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, and integrating third-party services. I have also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Apache, and Docker, using CI/CD pipelines for reliable delivery.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to contribute beyond pure technical work. I have experience collaborating with stakeholders, managing development priorities, and communicating clearly across teams. I am comfortable adapting to different responsibilities and working toward shared goals in a structured environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the team at Vrindavan Chandrodaya Mandir.', '2026-07-03 01:45:45.606', '2026-07-03 01:45:45.606'),
(2121, 2123, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Cryptocurrency trading experience\",\"Technical analysis\",\"Risk management\",\"Trading platform proficiency\",\"Financial market knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong analytical and problem-solving skills from software engineering, plus remote work experience and English fluency. However, the profile shows no direct experience or skills in cryptocurrency trading, financial markets, technical analysis, or risk management. The role is entry-level and provides training, so the applicant\'s learning ability and analytical mindset are relevant, but the match is low due to the domain difference.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Crypto Trader position at ATOM PARTNERS LIMITED. Your focus on digital asset markets, trading technologies, and data-driven research aligns with my interest in cryptocurrency and analytical problem-solving. I am eager to build practical trading knowledge in your structured environment.\n\nThrough my software engineering background, I have developed strong analytical and decision-making skills. I am comfortable working with data, identifying trends, and maintaining discipline in technical environments. These skills translate directly to monitoring markets, analyzing charts, and executing trades according to established strategies.\n\nI am a quick learner who thrives in remote, international teams. I am fluent in English and experienced with tools that require focus and precision. I am ready to follow your comprehensive training program, use professional trading platforms, and continuously improve my market knowledge under mentorship.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to ATOM PARTNERS LIMITED as a Junior Crypto Trader.', '2026-07-03 01:45:52.320', '2026-07-03 01:45:52.320'),
(2122, 2124, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Event coordination experience\",\"Marketing operations experience\",\"Project management tools (Asana, etc.)\",\"Travel logistics coordination\",\"Healthcare/pharma industry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct event coordination, marketing operations, or travel logistics experience. While they demonstrate strong organizational and coordination skills from technical project management, they do not meet the core qualifications for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Events & Experiences Coordinator role at BlinkRx. Your work in making prescriptions accessible and affordable through technology is genuinely impactful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to the team that brings these products to life through well-executed events.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years coordinating complex technical projects across multiple teams and stakeholders. This experience has taught me how to manage competing priorities, track detailed logistics, and communicate clearly under pressure. I am comfortable adapting to fast-moving situations and keeping things running smoothly when plans change.\n\nIn previous work, I have been responsible for coordinating timelines, managing vendor communications, and ensuring that deliverables are completed on schedule. I have built and maintained detailed documentation, tracked project milestones, and flagged risks early to keep projects moving forward. These skills translate directly to event coordination, where precision and adaptability are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 01:45:59.823', '2026-07-03 01:45:59.823'),
(2123, 2125, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description for Agency Core 1 at Caterpillar Inc. is very generic, focusing on operations and company culture without listing specific technical requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack development skills, but there is no clear technical match to the role based on the provided description. The score is low due to lack of job-specific technical details to match against.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Agency Core 1 position at Caterpillar Inc. Your company\'s focus on building stronger, more sustainable communities through innovation and problem-solving aligns with how I approach my own work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack developer, I have spent over four years building and maintaining scalable web applications. My technical foundation includes Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and TypeScript, along with MySQL, PostgreSQL, and REST API development. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and delivering systems that work reliably in production.\n\nIn previous work, I have handled responsibilities that include implementing authentication and role-based access control, integrating payment gateways, optimizing database queries for performance, and deploying applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. I have also built real-time features using WebSockets and managed CI/CD pipelines to streamline deployment workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Caterpillar\'s operations team. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 01:46:07.631', '2026-07-03 01:46:07.631'),
(2124, 2126, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Legal knowledge\",\"Court system experience\",\"Registrar experience\",\"Case management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in legal, court, or registrar roles. The job requires domain-specific knowledge and experience that the applicant does not possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Registrar role at the Department of Justice QLD. The opportunity to contribute to the modernisation and improvement of the court system, with an emphasis on safety, innovation, efficiency, and enhanced access to justice, aligns with my experience in building systems that improve reliability and user experience.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have focused on designing and delivering scalable web applications and real-time monitoring systems. I have worked on projects that required careful attention to process optimisation, data integrity, and secure access. These skills translate well to a role that values innovation and efficiency in a complex operational environment.\n\nIn previous work, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that streams live system metrics to users, enabling proactive issue detection and improved uptime. I also built full-stack applications with role-based access control, secure authentication, and database optimisation. These projects required clear documentation, cross-team coordination, and a focus on delivering reliable, user-friendly systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 01:46:15.322', '2026-07-03 01:46:15.322');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2125, 2127, 1, 30, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Figma\"]', '[\"UX research methods\",\"WCAG accessibility\",\"Design systems experience\",\"Agile/scrum experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in HTML, CSS, and Figma, which align with the preferred qualifications. However, the role is primarily a product design position requiring UX research, design systems, and user empathy skills that are not demonstrated in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s background is heavily technical (full-stack development, AI, robotics) with no direct product design or UX research experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Product Designer position at WealthCounsel, LLC. Your focus on building clear, well-crafted experiences for attorneys and your recognition as a 2025 Best Place to Work in the Cloud reflect a commitment to quality and collaboration that I find genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built a strong foundation in user-centered design and front-end technologies. I am proficient in Figma for wireframing, prototyping, and creating design documentation. My understanding of HTML and CSS allows me to collaborate effectively with engineers, ensuring designs are implemented accurately and efficiently. I am comfortable working within design systems and contributing to iterative improvements.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on design thinking and problem framing. In my previous work, I have participated in discovery sessions, learned to distinguish user requests from underlying needs, and delivered designs that account for various states and viewport sizes. I am eager to apply this structured approach at WealthCounsel, working within the Discovery Trio to create intuitive and accessible software experiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and curiosity can contribute to the WealthCounsel product design team.', '2026-07-03 01:46:24.064', '2026-07-03 01:46:24.064'),
(2126, 2128, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Figma\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Motiondesign\",\"Grafik- oder Kommunikationsdesign Studium\",\"Art Director Erfahrung\",\"B2B Kommunikationserfahrung\",\"Video- und Filmprojekte\",\"Social Media Kampagnen\",\"Print Design\"]', 'The applicant has strong frontend and UI development skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Tailwind, Bootstrap, Figma, MaterialUI) which partially overlap with the UI design aspect of the role. However, the role is primarily a graphic design and art director position requiring formal design education, motion design, print design, social media campaign experience, and B2B communication expertise. The applicant\'s profile is more technical/engineering-focused rather than design/creative-focused, resulting in a low overall match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Grafikdesigner / Art Director position at WEISS GmbH. Your focus on visual brand management across both online and offline channels, combined with UI design for web applications, aligns with my experience in design and frontend development.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked on UI/UX design and implementation for corporate websites and web applications. I have used Figma for design prototyping and have translated those designs into responsive, accessible interfaces using Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap, and MaterialUI. I understand the importance of maintaining consistent visual branding across all communication channels, both online and offline.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the development of UI designs for web applications in coordination with developers. In previous projects, I have designed and built dashboards, travel platforms, and e-commerce interfaces where I was responsible for the visual language, layout structure, and overall user experience. I am comfortable working with cross-functional teams to ensure that design concepts are implemented accurately and efficiently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my design and development experience can contribute to WEISS GmbH\'s creative team.', '2026-07-03 13:39:56.053', '2026-07-03 13:39:56.053'),
(2127, 2129, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Ads\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Tag Manager\",\"Merchant Center\",\"PPC campaign management\",\"SEA experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but has no direct experience with Google Ads, PPC campaign management, or the specific tools mentioned in the job description (Google Ads, Google Analytics 4, Tag Manager, Merchant Center). The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Google Ads Specialist position at digitalbakery GmbH. Your focus on data-driven strategy and transparent performance for e-commerce shops is something I find genuinely compelling. The opportunity to work with a team that values measurable growth and continuous optimization aligns well with how I approach technical work.\n\nMy background is in full-stack and AI engineering, where I have spent years building systems that rely on data analysis, performance monitoring, and iterative improvement. I have developed real-time server health monitoring dashboards using React, Node.js, and Socket.IO, and deployed AI-powered applications on cloud infrastructure including AWS and Google Cloud. These experiences have trained me to think in terms of metrics, efficiency, and systematic optimization rather than just features.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on testing new strategies and optimizing campaigns based on ROAS and conversion data. In my professional experience, I have built and maintained scalable web applications where I continuously tested API integrations, database queries, and frontend performance to improve user outcomes. I approach every project with a structured, data-informed mindset, prioritizing what drives the most impact.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to the continued success of digitalbakery GmbH.', '2026-07-03 13:40:04.240', '2026-07-03 13:40:04.240'),
(2128, 2130, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Degree in Electrical Engineering or certified technician\",\"Experience in electrical system planning (high-current, low-current, security)\",\"Knowledge of HOAI and VOB\",\"Knowledge of ALPI Caneco, Dialux, Simaris, HagerCad, iTWO, Orca AVA, Revit, or AutoCAD\",\"Very good German language skills\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this electrical engineering project management role. The job requires a degree in electrical engineering or equivalent, experience in planning electrical systems for buildings, and knowledge of German construction regulations (HOAI, VOB) and specialized CAD/engineering software. The applicant\'s skills are in web development, AI, and software engineering, with no overlap in the required domain-specific qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter/Projektingenieur für HLS oder Elektro position at peil und partner ingenieure GmbH. Your firm\'s long-standing focus on energy-efficient and sustainable building technology, particularly your work on the decarbonization of the building sector, is impressive. I am interested in contributing to your team in Halle.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have spent over four years designing, planning, and delivering complex technical systems. In this work, I have been responsible for the full project lifecycle from initial concept and technical planning through to implementation, testing, and final handover. This experience has given me a structured approach to managing technical projects, coordinating with diverse stakeholders, and maintaining clear oversight of timelines and deliverables.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem, which required coordinating between customers, sellers, delivery agents, and logistics teams. I was responsible for planning the system architecture, defining technical requirements, and ensuring all components were delivered on schedule. This involved close communication with different user groups to align the technical solution with operational needs, similar to coordinating with clients, specialist planners, and project participants in building projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical planning skills can contribute to your team in Halle.', '2026-07-03 13:40:13.651', '2026-07-03 13:40:13.651'),
(2129, 2131, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Elektrotechnik degree\",\"HOAI knowledge\",\"VOB knowledge\",\"Electrical engineering planning experience\",\"German language (required)\"]', 'The applicant has strong project coordination and technical planning skills from software engineering, but lacks the required electrical engineering degree, HOAI/VOB knowledge, and German language proficiency needed for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter/Projektingenieur für HLS oder Elektro position at peil und partner ingenieure GmbH, as advertised through Exzellente Jobs. Your company\'s 30-year track record in energy-efficient building services and commitment to decarbonization is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your project teams in Kiel.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years delivering technical projects from concept to completion. In my most recent role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for planning, coordinating, and delivering full-stack applications while managing timelines, budgets, and stakeholder expectations. This experience has given me a structured approach to project management and a strong ability to track progress across multiple work streams.\n\nOne area that translates directly to this role is my experience with technical documentation and cross-functional coordination. I regularly created planning documents, technical specifications, and progress reports, and I coordinated with clients, designers, and other developers to ensure smooth project delivery. I am comfortable with MS Office and have a track record of quickly learning new tools and systems as project requirements evolve.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project coordination and technical planning skills could support your team in Kiel.', '2026-07-03 13:40:21.228', '2026-07-03 13:40:21.228'),
(2130, 2132, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Customer Success experience\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Startup experience\",\"Support experience\",\"Building cleaning industry knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Customer Success Manager role requires customer-facing experience, German fluency, and startup/CS background. The match is low due to the role being non-technical and focused on customer onboarding and retention.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Success Manager role at PlanD. Your focus on building the leading AI-ERP solution for the building cleaning industry in DACH is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your next phase of scaling.\n\nMy background as a software engineer who has built and supported SaaS platforms gives me a practical understanding of what drives user adoption and retention. I have worked directly with users and stakeholders, onboarded them onto new systems, and translated their feedback into product improvements. This experience has taught me how to listen carefully, communicate clearly, and ensure customers see real value from the software they use.\n\nWhat draws me to this role is the opportunity to shape customer success processes in an AI-first environment. I am genuinely curious about how automation and AI tools can improve the customer experience, and I enjoy working in small teams where good ideas can be implemented quickly. I am comfortable taking ownership, learning new industries, and contributing to scalable processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to PlanD\'s growth.', '2026-07-03 13:40:29.315', '2026-07-03 13:40:29.315'),
(2131, 2133, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Online Marketing\",\"SEA\",\"Paid Social\",\"SEO\",\"Content Marketing\",\"CRO\",\"Web Analytics\",\"GA4\",\"Customer Advisory\",\"Campaign Management\",\"German Language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks direct experience in online marketing, campaign management, and marketing-specific tools like GA4 or Ads platforms. The role requires 1-3 years of marketing experience, client advisory, and cross-channel strategy, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Online Marketing Manager / Digital Marketing Consultant role at Klickkonzept by Cosmo5. Your approach to building data-driven, cross-channel marketing ecosystems for brands resonates with how I think about systems and strategy.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Klickkonzept is the emphasis on T-Shaped marketers who combine deep strategic thinking with a broad understanding of how channels like SEA, Paid Social, SEO, Content, and CRO work together. As a software engineer who builds data-driven platforms, I am used to thinking across layers — from user experience and frontend performance to backend analytics and reporting. I see marketing strategy in a similar way: not as isolated tactics, but as an interconnected system designed to drive measurable outcomes.\n\nThrough my professional experience developing full-stack applications, I have worked extensively with data analysis, reporting, and optimization. I have built systems that track user behavior, monitor KPIs, and generate actionable insights. I am comfortable working with metrics like conversion rates, CPA, and ROAS, and I know how to translate raw data into clear recommendations for stakeholders. My technical background also means I can work effectively with AI tools and automation to streamline workflows and improve decision-making.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can grow my strategic skills while contributing to real business outcomes. I believe Klickkonzept offers that environment. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-03 13:40:38.381', '2026-07-03 13:40:38.381'),
(2132, 2134, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Amazon Advertising\",\"Sponsored Products\",\"Sponsored Brands\",\"ACOS/TACOS/ROAS management\",\"Amazon Marketing Cloud\",\"Retail Media\",\"Paid Social\",\"SEA\",\"Web Analytics\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks direct experience in Amazon Advertising, retail media management, and the specific marketing KPIs (ACOS, TACOS, ROAS) required for this role. No matching skills were found in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Amazon Advertising Manager / Retail Media Manager role at Klickkonzept by Cosmo5. Your approach to building T-shaped marketers who understand the full retail ecosystem rather than just campaign mechanics resonates with me. I am interested in contributing to a team that values strategic thinking and data-driven decision-making.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed strong analytical skills and a data-oriented mindset. I regularly work with metrics, identify patterns in complex datasets, and translate those insights into clear recommendations. My experience building AI-powered applications has given me practical exposure to using generative AI tools to optimize workflows and iterate on solutions efficiently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the cross-channel perspective your team emphasizes. In my previous projects, I have built systems that integrate multiple data sources and require understanding how different components interact. This has taught me to think holistically about performance rather than focusing on isolated metrics.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical approach and technical foundation could contribute to your team\'s success.', '2026-07-03 13:40:46.218', '2026-07-03 13:40:46.218'),
(2133, 2135, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"SEO (On-Page, Off-Page, Technical)\",\"GEO / Generative Engine Optimization\",\"Google Search Console\",\"GA4\",\"Sistrix\",\"Ahrefs\",\"Screaming Frog\",\"Content-SEO\",\"SEA\",\"CRO\",\"Web Analytics\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and AI, but lacks direct SEO, GEO, and marketing analytics experience required for this role. No SEO-specific tools or strategies are present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SEO/GEO Manager / Organic Visibility Manager position at Klickkonzept by Cosmo5. Your approach to building a T-shaped marketing team that combines deep SEO expertise with cross-channel thinking and AI enablement is exactly the kind of environment where I can contribute meaningfully.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI engineering, with hands-on experience building AI-powered applications that process data, generate insights, and improve user experiences. I have worked extensively with OpenAI and Replicate APIs to create intelligent assistants and image processing systems, which directly relates to the GEO and AI visibility work your team is pioneering. I understand how generative AI models surface information and how structured data, content quality, and technical foundations influence visibility in AI-driven search environments.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and optimized full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React, with a strong focus on performance, structured data implementation, and responsive design. I regularly analyzed application metrics, optimized database queries, and collaborated with content and development teams to ensure technical foundations supported business goals. This cross-functional approach mirrors the integrated SEO, content, and development workflow you described.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and curiosity about GEO can contribute to your team\'s success.', '2026-07-03 13:40:55.479', '2026-07-03 13:40:55.479'),
(2134, 2136, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Salesforce project management\",\"Salesforce Sales/Service/Experience Cloud\",\"PRINCE2 or Scrum certification\",\"German C1\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Agile/SCRUM\",\"Resource and budget planning\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and project coordination skills from web development roles, but lacks direct Salesforce project management experience, Salesforce platform knowledge, formal project management certifications, and German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Salesforce Project Manager position at InfoTip Service GmbH. Your work digitizing service, sales, and CRM processes for over 25 years, serving clients from mid-market companies to international brands, stands out to me. I am interested in contributing to a team that values active project shaping over simple administration.\n\nMy professional experience includes coordinating project teams, planning resources and budgets, and managing timelines across multiple workstreams. I have worked closely with developers, consultants, and stakeholders to ensure alignment between technical delivery and business goals. I am comfortable moderating status meetings, identifying project risks early, and implementing corrective measures to keep projects on track.\n\nIn previous roles, I managed full project lifecycles from kick-off to deployment, maintaining clear communication with clients and internal teams throughout. I worked within agile frameworks, iterating on deliverables while ensuring transparency on progress, budget, and potential roadblocks. This experience has given me a structured, solution-oriented approach to project management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management experience and collaborative approach can support InfoTip\'s client projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:41:03.260', '2026-07-03 13:41:03.260'),
(2135, 2137, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years in social media/digital/creative agency\",\"Social media strategy development\",\"Campaign and narrative creation\",\"Trend analysis and platform mechanics (TikTok, Instagram)\",\"New business pitch experience\",\"Workshop facilitation\",\"PowerPoint and storytelling skills\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no direct experience in social media strategy, creative direction, or agency work. While they have strong technical skills in web development and AI, the job requires 5+ years of agency experience, deep platform knowledge (TikTok, Instagram), strategic campaign development, and German language fluency. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Creative Strategist Social Media position at OneTwoSocial. Your focus on developing strategies and narratives that truly reach audiences in the DACH region stands out to me. I appreciate the emphasis on combining brand understanding, platform logic, and strategic creativity.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years building digital platforms that require a deep understanding of user behavior, content presentation, and platform mechanics. Developing responsive, SEO-friendly web applications has given me practical insight into how content is discovered, consumed, and shared across digital channels. This technical perspective allows me to approach social media strategy with a clear understanding of the systems that drive engagement.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the ability to translate trends and insights into compelling concepts and campaigns. In my work delivering full-stack applications, I have consistently analyzed user requirements, market context, and competitive landscapes to inform product decisions. I am comfortable moving from research and analysis to clear, actionable strategies that teams can execute.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:41:12.323', '2026-07-03 13:41:12.323'),
(2136, 2138, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Paid Social Campaign Management (Meta, TikTok, Pinterest, LinkedIn)\",\"Meta Ads Manager\",\"ROAS, CPA, CTR, Customer Lifetime Value\",\"SEA, CRO, Web Analytics, Tracking\",\"German Language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong analytical and data-driven skills, and experience with AI integration. However, the role requires 1-3 years of hands-on Paid Social campaign management experience (Meta, TikTok, Pinterest, LinkedIn), deep knowledge of advertising KPIs (ROAS, CPA, CTR), and familiarity with adjacent marketing disciplines (SEA, CRO, Web Analytics). The applicant\'s profile does not contain any of these specific marketing or advertising skills, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Advertising Manager / Paid Social Manager position at Klickkonzept by Cosmo5. Your focus on data-driven, AI-enabled performance marketing and the collaborative, T-shaped team culture resonates with how I approach complex problems.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed a strong analytical mindset and a data-first approach to decision-making. I am comfortable working with KPIs, identifying patterns in data, and translating those patterns into clear, actionable recommendations. I have hands-on experience integrating AI tools into workflows to automate tasks and improve efficiency, which directly supports your KI-Enablement initiative.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of creative performance and technology. I understand that the best ad creative is useless without a well-optimized landing page and a cohesive user journey. In my previous projects, I have built systems that connect user-facing interfaces with backend analytics, ensuring that every part of the funnel works together toward a common goal. This cross-channel perspective aligns with your emphasis on holistic, revenue-generating journeys.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Klickkonzept\'s innovative team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:41:21.363', '2026-07-03 13:41:21.363'),
(2137, 2139, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social media content creation\",\"Instagram expertise\",\"Video production\",\"Interviewing skills\",\"Event coverage experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is heavily focused on software engineering, web development, and AI systems. The job requires social media reporting, Instagram content creation, and event coverage skills, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Reporter*in position for the Reeperbahn Festival 2026. The opportunity to cover live concerts and conference events on Instagram sounds like a dynamic and engaging role, and I would be glad to contribute.\n\nAlthough my professional background is primarily in software engineering, I have a strong practical understanding of Instagram and its content creation tools. I regularly use the platform and am comfortable creating posts, stories, and short-form video content that captures the energy of live events.\n\nI am available for the full duration of the festival from September 16 to 19, 2026. I am flexible, work well under pressure, and enjoy collaborating with a team. I also have my own smartphone with a high-quality camera suitable for producing clear, engaging visuals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-03 13:41:28.481', '2026-07-03 13:41:28.481'),
(2138, 2140, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Windows software development\",\"WPF\",\"MFC\",\"Visual Studio\",\"C++20\",\"Boost\",\"STL\"]', 'The applicant has foundational C++ and C# skills, along with Git and CI/CD experience, but lacks professional Windows software development experience, WPF/MFC UI development, Visual Studio expertise, and specific modern C++ (C++17/20) and Boost library experience required for this role. The match is partial with significant gaps in Windows-specific technologies.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer C++ (Windows) - Digital Microscopy position at EVIDENT Europe GmbH. The work your team does on the SLIDEVIEW VS200 system, combining precise hardware control with advanced image analysis for life-science research and medical diagnostics, is genuinely impressive. I am interested in contributing to a product that sits at the intersection of software engineering, hardware integration, and real-world scientific impact.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on C++ and modern software engineering practices. I have worked with C++ across multiple projects, including systems that require real-time performance, low-level hardware communication, and efficient data processing. I am comfortable with modern C++ standards and have used STL extensively in my development work. I also have practical experience with C# and understand the Windows desktop application ecosystem.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of building software that controls complex hardware while processing large volumes of image data. Through my work on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB) project, I developed a real-time assistive system using C++ and Python on embedded platforms like Raspberry Pi and ESP32-CAM. The system performed YOLOv8n-based object detection locally, streamed video over a custom UDP protocol for ultra-low latency, and provided audio feedback to users. This required careful hardware/software integration, image processing pipeline design, and performance tuning on resource-constrained devices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in C++ development, hardware integration, and software engineering can contribute to the continued success of the SLIDEVIEW VS200 system at EVIDENT Europe GmbH.', '2026-07-03 13:41:38.208', '2026-07-03 13:41:38.208'),
(2139, 2141, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Studium der Betriebswirtschaftslehre, Wirtschaftswissenschaften, Wirtschaftsrecht, Wirtschaftsinformatik oder eines vergleichbaren Studiengangs\",\"Interesse an Interner Revision, Risikomanagement, Compliance oder Governance\",\"MS Office (Excel, Word, PowerPoint)\",\"Kenntnisse in interner Revision oder Prüfungsmethodik\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with a Software Engineering background does not directly match the core requirements of this Internal Audit student position. The role requires a business, economics, or law student with an interest in audit, risk management, and compliance, along with MS Office skills. While the applicant demonstrates strong analytical and problem-solving abilities from their technical background, they lack the specific academic field, domain knowledge, and tools (MS Office) explicitly requested. The match is low, but transferable skills in analysis, documentation, and structured work are present.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent/in Internal Audit position at flatexDEGIRO SE. As a Software Engineering student with a strong foundation in analytical thinking and structured problem-solving, I am drawn to the opportunity to support internal audit processes at Europe\'s leading online brokerage platform.\n\nThrough my academic work and professional experience, I have developed a methodical approach to evaluating systems and processes. My background in software engineering has trained me to analyze complex workflows, identify potential risks or inefficiencies, and document findings clearly. These skills translate directly to supporting audit planning, reviewing internal controls, and assessing compliance with regulatory requirements.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I regularly worked with data analysis, process documentation, and cross-functional collaboration. I am comfortable preparing reports, organizing information, and communicating findings to different stakeholders. My experience with structured problem-solving and attention to detail would allow me to contribute effectively to audit preparation, testing, and reporting tasks.\n\nI am currently pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Software Engineering, which has strengthened my ability to think analytically and work independently. I communicate clearly in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international teams. I value integrity and confidentiality, which I understand are essential in an internal audit environment.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to the flatexDEGIRO team.', '2026-07-03 13:41:48.436', '2026-07-03 13:41:48.436'),
(2140, 2142, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"React\",\"AI Proficiency\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Photoshop\",\"Illustrator\",\"InDesign\",\"Social Media Advertising\",\"Motion Ads\",\"Google Display Ads\",\"3-5 years graphic design experience\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills (Figma, front-end development, AI proficiency) but lacks the core graphic design experience, Adobe Creative Suite expertise, and social media ad creation background that this Senior Marketing Designer role requires.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Marketing Designer position at Onepage GmbH. Your mission to bridge the gap between Vibe Coding and no-code with AI-assisted page building is a genuinely interesting problem, and I appreciate the focus on keeping layouts fully controllable after generation.\n\nMy background combines design tool proficiency with hands-on front-end development. I have experience using Figma for UI design and prototyping, and I am comfortable translating visual concepts into responsive, functional interfaces using HTML, CSS, Tailwind, and React. This dual perspective allows me to understand both the creative and technical sides of landing page creation.\n\nI have also worked with AI assistants in practical projects, integrating OpenAI and Replicate APIs into web applications to generate content and process images. I am comfortable using AI to draft concepts and visuals, and I see it as a tool to accelerate creative workflows rather than replace them.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Onepage\'s marketing design efforts.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:41:56.737', '2026-07-03 13:41:56.737'),
(2141, 2143, 1, 0, '[]', '[]', 'No clear skill overlap was found from keyword analysis.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kaufmann/-frau für IT-System-Management position at GastroSoft GmbH. Your company\'s focus on developing tailored POS software for gastronomy and retail businesses is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your customer-facing IT support team.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong IT skills across Linux system administration, server configuration with Nginx and Apache, Docker containerization, and database management with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I am comfortable working with both software and hardware components, which directly aligns with the installation, configuration, and support responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the combination of technical support and customer consultation. In my previous roles, I regularly assisted users with software setup, diagnosed and resolved technical issues, and created clear system documentation. I am confident in my ability to handle first and second level support for your POS systems, guide customers in selecting appropriate hardware and software, and conduct user training sessions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my IT knowledge and customer service orientation can support the GastroSoft team. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-07-03 13:42:03.833', '2026-07-03 13:42:03.833'),
(2142, 2144, 1, 72, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"TypeScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Node JS\",\"MySQL\",\"Docker\",\"Redis\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"REST API\",\"JWT\"]', '[\"Symfony\",\"TanStack\",\"Java\",\"Kotlin\",\"Elasticsearch\",\"TiDB\",\"MinIO\",\"German language\"]', 'Strong match on core PHP, TypeScript, React, Node.js, and MySQL skills with professional Laravel and Next.js experience. Missing Symfony framework experience (uses Laravel instead), JVM languages (Java/Kotlin), and German language proficiency which is required. Solid foundation for a senior role with room to grow into the specific stack.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Software Engineer (PHP, TypeScript, Node.js) position at easybill GmbH. Your platform serves over 22,000 businesses with invoicing, process automation, and integrations, and I find the challenge of building reliable, scalable systems for that scale genuinely interesting.\n\nMy professional experience centers on full-stack development with PHP and TypeScript. Over the past four years, I have worked extensively with Laravel and Next.js, building backend features, RESTful APIs, and modern frontend interfaces. I am comfortable working across the stack and taking ownership of features from design through deployment.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I developed and maintained web applications using Laravel on the backend and Next.js on the frontend. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and worked extensively with MySQL for query optimization and data modeling. I also deployed applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker, and integrated real-time features using WebSockets. This experience aligns well with your stack of PHP, TypeScript, React, Node.js, and MySQL.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on using AI as a productivity tool in engineering workflows. I have integrated AI APIs into production systems before, including OpenAI and Replicate, and I am comfortable working with AI tools to accelerate development and debugging.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience could contribute to easybill\'s engineering team.', '2026-07-03 13:42:14.361', '2026-07-03 13:42:14.361');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2143, 2145, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung im kaufmännischen, medizinisch-, pflegerischen oder serviceorientierten Bereich\",\"Erfahrung im Kundenkontakt\",\"Organisationsfähigkeit\",\"Empathie\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with no direct background in hearing acoustics, administration, or customer service roles. The job requires a completed commercial, medical, or service-oriented vocational training and customer-facing experience, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Teamassistenz Hörakustik position at audibene GmbH in Munich. The opportunity to enter the hearing acoustics field and contribute directly to improving people\'s quality of life is something I find genuinely meaningful.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational skills, a structured approach to work, and proven experience in customer-facing environments. Through my work as a web developer, I regularly coordinated with clients, managed project timelines, and ensured smooth communication between technical and non-technical stakeholders. These skills translate well into administrative and coordination roles.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts easily to new domains. The structured training and qualification pathway offered by audibene aligns with my approach to professional growth. I am comfortable learning new processes, managing inventory and scheduling, and providing attentive support to customers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:42:22.571', '2026-07-03 13:42:22.571'),
(2144, 2146, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung im kaufmännischen, medizinisch-, pflegerischen oder serviceorientierten Bereich\",\"Erfahrung im Kundenkontakt\",\"Hörakustik-Kenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this hearing acoustics career-entry role, which requires a commercial, medical, or service-oriented vocational training background and direct customer service experience. No skills from the applicant\'s profile directly match the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Quereinstieg Hörakustik position at audibene GmbH. The opportunity to enter a new field focused on improving people\'s quality of life through better hearing is genuinely appealing to me. I am ready to make a meaningful career change and bring my strong organizational and communication skills to your team.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed transferable skills that align well with this role. In my previous positions, I acted as a communication hub, coordinating with clients, team members, and external partners to ensure smooth operations. I am comfortable managing schedules, handling administrative workflows, and maintaining organized systems. These experiences have prepared me to take on the customer-facing and administrative responsibilities described in this position.\n\nI am particularly drawn to the structured training and qualification pathway that audibene offers. The opportunity to learn hearing acoustics through hands-on experience and formal education, including the Handwerkskammer certification, is exactly the kind of career development I am looking for. I am a quick learner and have consistently demonstrated the ability to master new technical domains throughout my career.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to start this new chapter and contribute to your partner stores with dedication and a genuine desire to help customers hear better. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can grow with audibene.', '2026-07-03 13:42:32.279', '2026-07-03 13:42:32.279'),
(2145, 2147, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung im kaufmännischen Bereich\",\"Erfahrung im Kundenkontakt\",\"Organisationsfähigkeit\",\"Empathie\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in retail, customer service, or hearing aid administration. The job requires a commercial or service-oriented background, which the applicant does not have. However, the applicant demonstrates strong organizational skills, quick learning ability, and customer coordination experience from software project management, which could be relevant for a career change role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Alternative zum Einzelhandel position at audibene GmbH. The opportunity to work directly with customers in the hearing aid industry and contribute to improving their quality of life is something I find genuinely meaningful.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational and communication skills. I regularly coordinated with clients, managed schedules, and handled administrative tasks such as order processing and inventory tracking. These responsibilities have given me a solid foundation in customer service and workflow management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the chance to learn a completely new field. I am a quick learner who adapts well to unfamiliar environments. The structured training program offered by audibene aligns well with my approach to mastering new skills through hands-on practice and theoretical study.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my organizational skills, customer focus, and willingness to learn make me a strong candidate for this role. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-03 13:42:40.828', '2026-07-03 13:42:40.828'),
(2146, 2148, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene kaufmännische Ausbildung (e.g., Industriekaufmann/-frau, Steuerfachangestellte/r)\",\"Mehrjährige Berufserfahrung in der Finanzbuchhaltung\",\"Kenntnisse in Dealer-Management-Systemen (DMS)\",\"Kenntnisse in DATEV\",\"Debitoren-, Kreditoren- und Anlagenbuchhaltung\",\"Abwicklung des Zahlungsverkehrs\",\"Verbuchung von Leasing- und Finanzierungsgeschäften\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no accounting education or experience. The job requires a completed commercial training and several years of accounting experience, ideally in the automotive industry. There is no skill overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Buchhalter (m/w/d) position at ZYOX for the Autohaus Hallekamp in Rosendahl-Holtwick. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and organizational skills that are directly applicable to accounting and financial administration.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have consistently managed complex data sets, tracked transactions, and maintained accurate records across multiple projects. My experience with database systems like MySQL and PostgreSQL has given me a structured approach to data integrity and monitoring, which aligns well with the responsibilities of accounts payable, accounts receivable, and asset accounting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with Dealer-Management-Systemen (DMS) and DATEV. My technical background means I can quickly adapt to new software platforms and leverage my understanding of system workflows to contribute efficiently from day one.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured work style, attention to detail, and ability to work independently make me a strong candidate for this role. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to the team at Autohaus Hallekamp.', '2026-07-03 13:42:49.796', '2026-07-03 13:42:49.796'),
(2147, 2149, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Marketing experience\",\"Social media platform expertise\",\"German C1\",\"MS Office 365\",\"KPI analysis\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong analytical and technical skills, but lacks direct marketing experience, social media expertise, German language proficiency (C1), and familiarity with MS Office 365 required for this Werkstudent Marketing role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Marketing (m/w/d) position at PHW-Gruppe. As a Software Engineering student with strong analytical skills and experience in digital project coordination, I am interested in contributing to the marketing team for the NutriQM brand.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed a methodical approach to data analysis and reporting. I regularly work with KPIs, performance metrics, and data-driven decision-making in my development projects. This analytical mindset translates well to evaluating digital marketing campaigns and conducting market analyses.\n\nIn previous project work, I coordinated with external service providers and managed multi-step workflows, ensuring timely delivery and clear communication. I am comfortable using MS Office 365 and various digital platforms for planning, tracking, and reporting tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a enrolled student in Software Engineering and can offer flexible, study-friendly working hours. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to PHW-Gruppe\'s marketing efforts.', '2026-07-03 13:42:57.885', '2026-07-03 13:42:57.885'),
(2148, 2150, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"ISO/IEC 27001 knowledge\",\"BSI-Grundschutz experience\",\"NIS2 knowledge\",\"DORA knowledge\",\"MaRisk knowledge\",\"ISMS experience\",\"Risk analysis experience\",\"Security auditing experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"ISMS-tools experience\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering and some cybersecurity-related project work (secure communication protocols, blockchain-based security frameworks). However, the role requires specific expertise in information security consulting, including hands-on experience with ISO/IEC 27001, BSI-Grundschutz, NIS2, DORA, ISMS implementation, risk analysis, security auditing, and very good German language skills. None of these core requirements are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Berater für Informationssicherheit (w|m|d) position at DOMUS Consult Wirtschaftsberatungsgesellschaft mbH. Your focus on supporting clients in regulated industries with practical information security implementation aligns with my background in building secure, resilient systems.\n\nMy work in cybersecurity has involved designing privacy-preserving frameworks and secure communication protocols. Through research and development, I have worked with encryption methods (AES, secure key exchange), blockchain-based data integrity using SHA3-256 chaining, and Zero-Knowledge Proofs for anonymity. These projects required understanding threat models, implementing cryptographic protections, and building systems resilient against spoofing, jamming, and unauthorized access.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the practical application of security standards and organizational measures. In my project OmniGuard V2X, I developed a decentralized framework for secure Vehicle-to-Everything communication that addressed data integrity, privacy, and resilience against cyber and post-quantum threats. This involved risk analysis, security policy design, and implementing technical and organizational measures similar to what you describe for ISMS support.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am keen to bring my cybersecurity knowledge and engineering approach to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your clients\' information security needs.', '2026-07-03 13:43:08.380', '2026-07-03 13:43:08.380'),
(2149, 2151, 1, 45, '[\"Laravel\",\"Next JS\",\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\",\"MySQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"PHP\",\"Node JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"AWS\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Projektmanagement\",\"Product Ownership\",\"Change Management\",\"Stakeholder Management\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack web development (Laravel, Next.js, React) and experience delivering IT projects, which aligns with the technical understanding required. However, the role is primarily a project management/product owner position, and the applicant\'s profile lacks explicit experience in project management, product ownership, change management, and stakeholder coordination.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter IT/Product Owner position at Der OnlineSteuerberater. Your focus on digital transformation in tax consulting and your vision of building a more efficient, user-friendly platform for clients is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked across the full software development lifecycle, from initial concept and architecture to deployment and maintenance. My technical background spans Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and modern JavaScript, and I have delivered production systems that handle authentication, payment integration, real-time features, and role-based access control. I am comfortable making technical decisions, coordinating with stakeholders, and ensuring that projects stay aligned with business goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to drive change and improve internal workflows. At Explo-IT, I was responsible for delivering features end to end, working directly with stakeholders to translate requirements into working software. I also managed deployments on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, which gave me a solid understanding of the operational side of product delivery. I am used to balancing technical depth with clear communication across teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:43:18.823', '2026-07-03 13:43:18.823'),
(2150, 2152, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Master\'s degree (Maestro)\",\"Teaching experience in higher education\",\"Spanish language proficiency\",\"Experience in Communication field\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and research skills relevant to guiding student projects, but lacks the required Master\'s degree, formal teaching experience, Spanish proficiency, and direct background in Communication studies.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Docente a Tiempo Parcial position at Universidad Católica Santo Toribio de Mogrovejo for the Escuela de Comunicación. The opportunity to guide students through their research projects in a virtual environment aligns with my academic and professional background.\n\nThrough my research and development work at Voronezh State University, I have built a strong foundation in project methodology and structured investigation. My research focuses on secure UAV systems, decentralized coordination, and cybersecurity protocols, which has required me to design experiments, collect and analyze data, and document findings systematically. These skills directly support the supervision of student research projects.\n\nIn addition to my academic work, I have over four years of professional experience as a full-stack developer. I have built and deployed web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and have worked extensively with databases, REST APIs, and cloud infrastructure on AWS and Linux servers. This hands-on technical experience allows me to teach students how to integrate ICT tools effectively into their research workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to the academic mission of USAT.', '2026-07-03 13:43:29.210', '2026-07-03 13:43:29.210'),
(2151, 2153, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"MongoDB\",\"C++\"]', '[\"LangChain\",\"Vector Databases (Pinecone/Weaviate)\",\"RAG\",\"vLLMs\",\"Multi-agent systems architecture\",\"AI agent orchestration\",\"AI telemetry\",\"Workflow Automation (Make.com/n8n/Zapier)\",\"Webhooks\",\"Claude Cowork\",\"3+ years commercial AI experience\"]', 'The applicant has foundational AI project experience (OpenAI API, computer vision with YOLOv8) and strong full-stack engineering skills, but lacks the specific commercial AI experience, LangChain, vector databases, RAG, multi-agent systems, and workflow automation tools required for this Senior AI Engineer/Architect role. The match is low for the specific AI requirements listed.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior AI Engineer Architect role at Lemon.io. Your marketplace model connecting engineers with US and European startups is a compelling approach, and I appreciate the emphasis on matching developers with projects that fit their actual skills and preferences.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered applications that integrate large language models, computer vision, and automation into practical systems. My work includes developing an AI-powered financial app using OpenAI, Express, and MongoDB, where I implemented AI assistants trained on custom datasets, voice-to-text transcription via AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF generation. I also built an AI-powered real estate platform that uses the Replicate API for image processing and OpenAI for intelligent property analysis, with role-based authentication, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration.\n\nIn addition to AI-specific work, I have strong software engineering fundamentals. I have designed and deployed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and PostgreSQL, with experience in RESTful API design, authentication, real-time features via WebSockets, and production deployment on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx. This combination of AI engineering and full-stack development allows me to build complete, production-ready systems from the ground up.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with your current AI-related projects.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:43:39.590', '2026-07-03 13:43:39.590'),
(2152, 2154, 1, 65, '[\"React\",\"Typescript\",\"Flutter\",\"React Native\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"Javascript\"]', '[\"Ruby on Rails\",\"Ruby\",\"iOS native development\",\"Android native development\",\"UK-based with right to work without sponsorship\"]', 'The applicant has strong React, TypeScript, and mobile app experience (React Native, Flutter) which partially matches the job requirements. However, the job specifically requires Ruby on Rails experience, which is not in the applicant\'s skill set. The applicant also lacks iOS/Android native development experience and UK-based work authorization. The match is moderate, with the strongest alignment being React frontend skills and mobile development experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Full Stack Developer role at Better Futures Multi Academy Trust. The opportunity to shape ARC and Swaya, two products that directly impact leadership development and student feedback, is exactly the kind of product ownership I look for in a role.\n\nMy professional experience centers on full-stack development with React, TypeScript, and Laravel, where I have built responsive interfaces and scalable backend systems. I have also worked with React Native and Flutter for mobile app development, which maps directly to managing the iOS and Android updates for Swaya. I am comfortable inheriting an existing codebase, improving it, and shipping meaningful updates.\n\nIn previous work, I have taken ownership of full application delivery from API design and database optimization to deployment and real-time feature integration. I have worked directly with stakeholders to define product direction and have consistently focused on solving real UX problems rather than just completing tickets. This product-minded approach aligns well with what you are looking for.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to ARC and Swaya.', '2026-07-03 13:43:48.859', '2026-07-03 13:43:48.859'),
(2153, 2155, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'The job description lacks specific technical requirements, making it difficult to assess a precise match. The applicant has a strong full-stack development background with Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL, which could be relevant for an Engineer 2 role, but without detailed job requirements, the match is uncertain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Engineer 2 position at Catalyst Brands India. With a background in full-stack development and a focus on building scalable, secure, and maintainable systems, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your engineering team.\n\nMy professional experience spans four years of full-stack web development, where I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, and MySQL. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. These skills align well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn previous work at Explo-IT, I delivered real-time features using WebSockets, integrated third-party services such as payment gateways and cloud storage, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I also contributed to frontend development with responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and skills can support the work at Catalyst Brands India.\n\nSincerely,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-03 13:43:55.665', '2026-07-03 13:43:55.665'),
(2154, 2156, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, which does not directly match the Multi Skilled Operative role at Tarmac. The job description focuses on operational tasks, benefits, and company culture rather than technical skills. The applicant has strong problem-solving, adaptability, and communication skills that could be transferable, but there is no direct overlap in required experience or qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Multi Skilled Operative position at Tarmac. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in problem-solving, adaptability, and a commitment to learning new skills quickly. I am drawn to Tarmac\'s reputation as an industry leader and its focus on building a supportive, inclusive culture where people can grow.\n\nIn my previous roles as a web developer, I worked across multiple domains, from backend API development to frontend UI implementation and server deployment. This required me to learn new tools and workflows rapidly, collaborate with cross-functional teams, and take ownership of tasks from start to finish. I approach every new challenge with the same discipline: understand the requirements, ask the right questions, and deliver reliable results.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about this role is the emphasis on training and development. I am someone who thrives when given the opportunity to build new skills. Whether it was transitioning from Python to Laravel or learning deployment workflows with Docker and Nginx, I have consistently invested time in mastering unfamiliar tools and processes. I am confident I can bring that same learning mindset to the operational environment at Tarmac.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can contribute to Tarmac\'s team.', '2026-07-03 13:44:03.628', '2026-07-03 13:44:03.628'),
(2155, 2157, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is mostly in Chinese and lacks specific technical requirements, responsibilities, or domain details. The applicant has a strong full-stack and AI engineering background, but without clear job criteria, a precise match cannot be determined. The score reflects the limited information available.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the P0005148 position at 捷成集团. With a strong foundation in full-stack development and AI engineering, I bring practical experience building scalable web applications and intelligent systems that solve real-world problems.\n\nThrough my professional work as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and optimized database performance with MySQL and Redis. I also have experience deploying applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne project that reflects this capability is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I built a Laravel backend with role-based access control, Firebase notifications, and Google Maps API integration, paired with Flutter mobile apps for customers, sellers, and delivery agents. This project required coordinating multiple user roles, real-time updates, and scalable database design.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-03 13:44:10.417', '2026-07-03 13:44:10.417'),
(2156, 2158, 1, 50, '[]', '[]', 'This is a spontaneous application with no specific technical requirements listed. The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong web development skills, which could be relevant to a tech company like HomeExchange. The match score is moderate due to the open-ended nature of the application.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining HomeExchange. As a full-stack and AI engineer with four years of professional web development experience, I build systems that are practical, scalable, and maintainable. I prefer working on platforms that solve real problems for real people, and HomeExchange\'s community-driven model aligns with that approach.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js to build full-stack applications. I design RESTful APIs, implement authentication and role-based access control, integrate payment gateways, and optimize database performance. I also work with MySQL, PostgreSQL, Docker, and Linux servers for reliable deployment and maintenance.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is the multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem I built using Laravel and Flutter. The system connects customers, sellers, and delivery agents through a unified backend with role-based access, real-time notifications, and secure API communication. It required careful architecture planning to ensure scalability across web and mobile platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to HomeExchange. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-03 13:44:17.345', '2026-07-03 13:44:17.345'),
(2157, 2159, 1, 75, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Vue JS (optional)\",\"Corporate governance domain knowledge\"]', 'Strong match for foundational front-end skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React). Has practical experience building responsive UIs and dashboards. Lacks Vue.js experience and corporate governance domain knowledge, but the role is junior-level and emphasizes willingness to learn.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior UI Engineer position at Arabian Private Holdings. The idea of building clear, professional digital interfaces that support high-level corporate governance work is something I find genuinely interesting. Your focus on functional clarity over unnecessary complexity aligns with how I approach front-end development.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built responsive user interfaces using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React. I have worked with Next.js and Tailwind CSS to create clean, consistent layouts that prioritize readability and information structure. I pay close attention to typography, spacing, and how content is organized on screen, because I believe good UI design is about making complex information easy to understand.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is transforming static diagrams into interactive digital components. In previous projects, I have developed dashboards and data-driven interfaces that required translating structured information into functional, user-friendly components. I am comfortable debugging front-end issues across browsers and devices, and I write clean, documented code that is easy to maintain.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-03 13:44:24.646', '2026-07-03 13:44:24.646'),
(2158, 2160, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The job description is generic placeholder text with no specific technical requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack development skills, but without concrete job requirements, a meaningful match assessment is not possible.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Heading role at bankari.sk. With a strong background in full-stack development and a focus on building reliable, scalable systems, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your team.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, delivering production-grade web applications that prioritize performance, security, and user experience. My work includes building RESTful APIs, implementing authentication and role-based access control, integrating payment gateways, and optimizing database queries for speed and reliability.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel on the backend and Next.js on the frontend. I built real-time features using WebSockets, deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx, and maintained CI/CD pipelines. I also developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem that coordinated customers, sellers, and delivery agents through a Laravel backend and Flutter mobile apps.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of bankari.sk.', '2026-07-03 13:44:31.217', '2026-07-03 13:44:31.217'),
(2159, 2161, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Call center experience\",\"Microsoft Office proficiency\",\"Critical customer management\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a call center role requiring Spanish, call center experience, and Microsoft Office proficiency. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asesor call center Remoto lima o provincia position at Shalom. The role requires strong communication skills, computer proficiency, and the ability to handle customer inquiries effectively, which aligns well with my background.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed strong computer literacy and problem-solving abilities. I am comfortable working with various software tools and can quickly adapt to new systems. My work has required clear and patient communication with clients and team members to understand requirements and deliver solutions.\n\nI have experience managing multiple tasks simultaneously and maintaining a professional and courteous approach when addressing questions or concerns. I am accustomed to working remotely with a reliable setup and am available to work flexible schedules, including weekends and rotating shifts.\n\nIn addition to my technical skills, I communicate effectively across teams and with customers. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Shalom team.', '2026-07-03 13:44:38.144', '2026-07-03 13:44:38.144'),
(2160, 2162, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"4+ years in creative role\",\"ideation and copywriting\",\"brand building\",\"US account experience\",\"campaign concept development\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Creative role at The Elites requires 4+ years of agency/in-house creative experience, ideation, copywriting, brand building, and campaign development. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s software engineering background and the creative role requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Creative role at The Elites. Your agency\'s focus on building employer brands that move candidates and employees to action resonates with how I approach my own work: with purpose, clarity, and a focus on real impact.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but I have always approached development as a creative discipline. Building a platform from scratch requires the same kind of thinking that goes into a campaign: understanding the audience, defining the message, and crafting an experience that feels intuitive and engaging. I have designed and built full-stack applications including an AI-powered financial platform, a travel agency system with multi-language and multi-currency support, and a real-time communication engine. Each of these projects started with a problem and required creative ideation to turn it into a working solution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of technology and storytelling. In my work on the Travel Agency App for 2Expedition, I was responsible for the entire user experience from UI design using Next.js and Tailwind CSS to backend architecture with NestJS and MySQL. The platform needed to present destinations and tours in a way that inspired travelers while handling complex booking workflows behind the scenes. That balance between creative presentation and functional reliability is something I enjoy and do well.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to the creative work at The Elites.', '2026-07-03 13:44:46.237', '2026-07-03 13:44:46.237'),
(2161, 2163, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"University degree in Psychology, Pedagogy, Labor Relations, HR, Business Administration, or Education\",\"Professional experience in career counseling, talent consulting, HR, employability departments, or career management\",\"Previous experience providing training support, tutoring, mentoring, or career advising\",\"Native or bilingual fluency in Spanish\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the core requirements for this career advisor/mentor role. The role requires a university degree in fields like Psychology, HR, or Education, professional experience in career counseling or talent consulting, and native/bilingual Spanish fluency. The applicant has some mentoring experience from technical roles, but lacks the formal education, domain-specific professional experience, and Spanish language fluency required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Orientador a Laboral Freelance Remoto position at Ironhack. The opportunity to guide students through their career preparation and help them successfully enter the job market is something I find genuinely meaningful.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent a significant amount of time mentoring and supporting junior developers and bootcamp students. I have guided them through technical challenges, reviewed their project work, and helped them build the confidence needed to pursue new career opportunities. This experience has given me a strong understanding of how to support learners in achieving their professional goals.\n\nIn previous roles, I worked closely with team members to help them develop both technical and soft skills. I provided regular feedback, tracked progress, and adjusted my approach based on individual needs. I am comfortable working in both live and asynchronous settings, and I understand the importance of creating a supportive environment where students feel encouraged to grow.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my mentoring experience can support Ironhack\'s students during this bootcamp program.', '2026-07-03 13:44:54.934', '2026-07-03 13:44:54.934');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2162, 2164, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Video editing (CapCut, Premiere, DaVinci)\",\"Social media management (Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn)\",\"Content strategy and hook creation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no demonstrated experience in video editing or social media management. The job requires hands-on reel editing, content planning, and platform posting skills that are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Video Editor / Social Media Manager role at Preikschat Consulting GmbH. I understand the need for fast, clean editing, strong hooks, and reliable remote work, and I am ready to contribute directly to building your personal brand on Instagram, YouTube, and LinkedIn.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed a strong sense for content structure, user engagement, and visual clarity through years of building user-facing interfaces and multimedia projects. I work independently, meet deadlines without supervision, and communicate clearly.\n\nI am comfortable working with raw footage, cutting it down to tight, hook-driven reels, and adapting content per platform. I understand that substance matters more than effects, and I can deliver 7-8 reels per week consistently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and can provide two reel links as requested. I look forward to the possibility of working directly with you.', '2026-07-04 01:39:52.402', '2026-07-04 01:39:52.402'),
(2163, 2165, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Betriebswirtschaft\",\"Rechnungswesen\",\"Controlling\",\"MS Excel\",\"Business Intelligence\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong technical skills in data processing, reporting, and digitalization, but lacks the required business administration, accounting, and controlling background. The role specifically requires a student in Betriebswirtschaft with knowledge of Rechnungswesen and Controlling, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (gn) Controlling & Projekte position at OST BAU. The combination of operational business, financial administration, and IT-driven project work described in the role matches my interest in working where data, analysis, and technology meet practical business needs.\n\nAs a Software Engineering student with hands-on experience in data processing and reporting systems, I am comfortable working with structured data, preparing it for analysis, and building tools that make information useful for decision-making. I have developed full-stack applications that involve real-time data pipelines, dashboards, and API integrations, which have given me a solid foundation in handling data flows and supporting analytical workflows.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the preparation and transformation of data for intelligence systems. In previous projects, I have worked on systems that collect, process, and visualize data in real time, enabling teams to monitor performance and identify trends. I am eager to apply this experience to support your reporting and controlling processes, and to contribute to the digitalization of your business steering tools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and interests align with the needs of your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 01:39:59.949', '2026-07-04 01:39:59.949'),
(2164, 2166, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"German language\",\"Client acquisition\",\"CRM systems\",\"KPI-driven sales processes\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no sales experience or German language skills. This role requires senior-level sales consulting in Munich with German fluency. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Sales Consultant position at David Untermann. After reviewing the job description, I recognize that my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, not in sales consulting. I do not have the sales experience, client acquisition background, or German language proficiency that this role requires.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-04 01:40:04.448', '2026-07-04 01:40:04.448'),
(2165, 2167, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Reels production\",\"Community management\",\"Canva\",\"German fluency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this social media and community management role. No direct skills in content creation, video editing, community building, or German fluency are present.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media & Community Manager:in role at Your Proven Impact Agency GmbH. Your work at the intersection of creator management, coaching, and content development is exactly the kind of environment where I can contribute meaningfully.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong communication skills, a disciplined work ethic, and fluency in German. I understand the importance of daily content creation, community interaction, and trend monitoring for building a visible brand. I am comfortable working independently and managing multiple tasks reliably.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-04 01:40:09.630', '2026-07-04 01:40:09.630'),
(2166, 2168, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years client-facing experience\",\"Contract negotiation\",\"Commercial growth strategy\",\"HR/C-level relationship management\",\"German language (implied for Germany role)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct client success, account management, or commercial experience. While they have some client interaction from their web development role, it does not match the seniority or specific responsibilities of this Client Success Senior Manager position. The role requires 5+ years of dedicated client relationship management, contract negotiation, and commercial growth experience, which are not present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Client Success Senior Manager position at Wellhub. Your mission to make workplace wellness universal through a connected platform resonates with me, and I am interested in contributing to a company that prioritizes employee health and engagement.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I managed client relationships throughout the project lifecycle, from understanding their business objectives to delivering tailored solutions. I led meetings, presented progress updates, and collaborated with cross-functional teams including design, backend, and QA to ensure successful product launches and high user adoption.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is driving client engagement and growth. I have experience analyzing user data, identifying trends, and developing strategies to improve adoption rates. I am comfortable presenting findings to both technical and non-technical stakeholders and enjoy working with clients to align their goals with product capabilities.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my client management and analytical skills can contribute to Wellhub\'s success in Germany.', '2026-07-04 01:40:17.199', '2026-07-04 01:40:17.199'),
(2167, 2169, 1, 25, '[\"Laravel\",\"Next.js\",\"Node.js\",\"Express.js\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"OpenAI API\",\"REST API\",\"Authentication\",\"WebSockets\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"B2B experience\",\"Developer tooling experience\",\"Build systems experience\",\"5+ years in product management\",\"Go-to-market strategy\",\"Market research\",\"Competitive analysis\",\"Customer interviews\",\"Product roadmap management\",\"Agentic AI tools in daily workflow\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and AI implementation skills that partially overlap with the technical understanding required for this role. However, the role is a Senior Product Manager position requiring 5+ years of B2B product management experience, developer tooling expertise, and go-to-market strategy skills. The applicant\'s profile shows no product management experience, making this a low match overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Manager role at Develocity. Your work on the context-engineering layer for AI-driven software delivery is directly relevant to the problems I have been solving as a software engineer and AI practitioner.\n\nDevelocity sits at the intersection of developer tooling, build efficiency, and AI-powered intelligence. My experience building full-stack applications with Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js has given me a practical understanding of the SDLC and the challenges enterprise teams face with build and test workflows. I have worked with CI/CD pipelines, Docker, and Linux server deployments, which aligns with your focus on toolchain efficiency.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I designed and developed scalable web applications, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance. I also delivered real-time features using WebSockets and deployed applications on Nginx and Apache servers. This hands-on engineering background allows me to understand both the technical constraints and the product opportunities in developer tooling.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is AI integration. I have built AI-powered features including assistants using OpenAI\'s models, image processing with Replicate API, and automation pipelines. For example, in the AI Powered Financial App project, I developed APIs using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI, integrated AWS SES for authentication, and built a system that converts voice messages to text using AWS Transcribe. This experience aligns with your need to establish product direction for AI agents and autonomous workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Develocity\'s mission.', '2026-07-04 01:40:26.585', '2026-07-04 01:40:26.585'),
(2168, 2170, 1, 20, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Operational development initiatives\",\"Data analysis and dashboarding\",\"Cross-functional stakeholder alignment\",\"AI fluency (Claude Code, Cursor)\",\"Spreadsheet modeling and visualization\"]', 'The candidate\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI, autonomous systems) and does not directly match the operational, analytical, and cross-functional stakeholder management focus of this Senior Operations Specialist role. While the candidate has strong project ownership and analytical skills from a technical context, the role requires specific operational experience in delivery logistics, data-driven decision making, and cross-functional alignment without formal authority. The match score is low due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Operations Specialist, New Verticals & Drive Operations role at Wolt. The opportunity to shape the future of delivery operations for a company that is expanding from restaurant food to almost everything is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy professional experience has been rooted in owning projects from idea to measurable impact. As a Web Developer, I regularly took initiatives from hypothesis to scale: identifying opportunities, designing solutions, running tests, and rolling out changes across multiple environments. I am comfortable with data analysis, building dashboards, and using insights to drive decisions.\n\nOne area where I see a direct connection is in optimizing operational workflows. In my development work, I have built systems that track real-time metrics, monitor performance, and surface actionable recommendations. I approach problems by separating assumptions from facts, testing hypotheses, and iterating until the solution is clear and effective.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my analytical mindset and project ownership experience can contribute to Wolt\'s New Verticals and Drive Operations team.', '2026-07-04 01:40:34.491', '2026-07-04 01:40:34.491'),
(2169, 2171, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social media management experience (1-2 years)\",\"Content marketing experience\",\"Personal branding experience\",\"Canva\",\"CapCut\",\"Notion\",\"German language (C1 or better)\",\"Community management\",\"Content strategy and storytelling\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong AI tool proficiency (ChatGPT, Claude) and Figma skills, which partially align with the job\'s tool requirements. However, the role requires 1-2 years of social media, personal branding, or content marketing experience, as well as German language proficiency (C1+), Canva, CapCut, Notion, and community management skills. The applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate these core qualifications, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Junior) Social Media & Personal Brand Manager:in position at DH Personal Branding Agency GmbH. Your focus on building personal brands with substance for founders and executives is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nAs a software engineer who works extensively with AI tools like ChatGPT and Claude, I bring a practical understanding of how to use these technologies for content creation, research, and workflow automation. I also use Figma regularly for designing visual assets and have hands-on experience with digital content platforms.\n\nIn my previous work, I have coordinated content production, managed project timelines, and communicated directly with clients to understand their needs and deliver results. I am comfortable taking ownership of tasks, working independently, and bringing fresh ideas to the team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-04 01:40:41.182', '2026-07-04 01:40:41.182'),
(2170, 2172, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Community building\",\"Content creation\",\"LinkedIn marketing\",\"Event organization\",\"German language\",\"Marketing campaigns\",\"PR\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Werkstudent Marketing & Community role requires social media management, community building, content creation, and German language proficiency. The applicant\'s technical background in AI and software engineering provides some contextual interest in Legal Tech, but there is no direct overlap in marketing, community, or content creation skills or experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Marketing & Community position at Nulegal GmbH. Your work in automating legal and regulatory processes with autonomous AI agents is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on building something that makes legal work faster, more precise, and more accessible.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the combination of community building and content creation within a technology-driven company. I am currently studying Software Engineering at Voronezh State University, and I have developed a strong understanding of AI and how it applies to real-world problems. This technical background allows me to translate complex product concepts into clear, engaging content that resonates with professional audiences.\n\nI am active on LinkedIn and understand what makes a post successful in terms of structure, timing, and audience engagement. I have experience writing and editing content, managing schedules, and measuring performance. I am comfortable taking ownership of social media channels, building a community around events and online formats, and collaborating with a marketing team on campaigns and PR.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Nulegal\'s community and marketing efforts.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 01:40:49.130', '2026-07-04 01:40:49.130'),
(2171, 2173, 1, 45, '[]', '[\"Finance/Accounting experience\",\"Legal knowledge\",\"Event planning experience\",\"German language (negotiation-level)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical and AI experimentation skills, but the role is a generalist Founder\'s Associate position focused on finance, legal, ops, and events. The applicant\'s technical background is not directly aligned with the core responsibilities, though their proactive, problem-solving mindset and English proficiency are relevant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founder\'s Associate (Working Student) position at Nulegal GmbH. What stands out to me about Nulegal is the clear focus on building an AI-first LegalTech company where people concentrate on thinking and decision-making while AI handles execution. That philosophy aligns with how I approach my own work.\n\nAs a software engineering student with hands-on experience across full-stack development, AI integration, and system automation, I am used to taking ownership of projects from start to finish. I have built AI-powered applications using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, developed real-time monitoring dashboards with Socket.IO, and deployed production systems on AWS and Docker. I experiment proactively with new tools and find practical ways to apply them.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked directly with stakeholders on special projects, coordinated cross-functional requirements, and delivered features end to end. I have supported growth efforts by building customer-facing platforms and internal dashboards. I am comfortable managing operational tasks, tracking financial flows, and keeping initiatives on track without needing constant supervision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Nulegal\'s growth and operations.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-04 01:40:56.941', '2026-07-04 01:40:56.941'),
(2172, 2174, 1, 75, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Node JS\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Python\",\"Angular (listed as Angular JS in profile, job mentions Angular)\",\"KI-Tools (modern AI tools for development process)\"]', 'Strong match for full-stack development with extensive experience in JavaScript/TypeScript, React, Next.js, Laravel, Node.js, and multiple databases. Lacks Java and Python which are mentioned as preferred OOP languages, but has strong alternatives. Has relevant professional experience exceeding the 3-year requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Software Developer Fullstack position at TEQYARD. Your focus on building custom software solutions, from intelligent chatbots to powerful platforms, for industrial clients in their digital transformation is exactly the kind of environment where I want to contribute my full-stack development experience.\n\nWith over four years of professional experience in full-stack development, I have built and delivered production applications using JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, Laravel, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with SQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB, and I am comfortable making technology decisions around system architecture, server-side logic, and database interactions.\n\nIn my professional experience at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel for the backend and Next.js for the frontend. I built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated secure payment gateways. I also created responsive, SEO-friendly user interfaces and delivered real-time features using WebSockets. I deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker, and set up CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne project that reflects this skillset is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I built a full-stack marketplace platform using Laravel and MySQL for the backend, with role-based access control for customers, sellers, and delivery agents. I also developed multiple Flutter-based mobile apps and integrated Firebase notifications and Google Maps API.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support TEQYARD\'s client projects.', '2026-07-04 01:41:04.831', '2026-07-04 01:41:04.831'),
(2173, 2175, 1, 35, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Machine Learning\",\"Deep Learning\",\"Neural Networks\",\"Data Analytics\",\"5+ years KI experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background with some AI project experience (OpenAI, Replicate), but lacks the deep machine learning, neural network, and data analytics expertise required for a Senior Data & KI Architect role. The 5+ years of professional KI experience and German language requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Data & KI Architekt position at TEQYARD. Your focus on building intelligent solutions for industrial clients, from chatbots to powerful platforms, aligns directly with the kind of work I enjoy most: designing and implementing AI systems that solve real business problems.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built AI-powered systems that go beyond simple prototypes. One area that particularly interests me is designing AI services and architectures that can be integrated into existing applications. In my project work, I developed an AI-powered financial application that used OpenAI models trained on custom datasets, integrated AWS services for authentication and document generation, and handled real-time voice processing. This required identifying business requirements, designing the AI architecture, and delivering a production-ready solution.\n\nA relevant example is my work on an AI-powered real estate platform, where I integrated the Replicate API for image processing and trained multiple AI assistants using GPT models. The system included role-based authentication, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration. This project gave me hands-on experience in developing prototypes, implementing AI into existing application flows, and continuously improving AI processes based on real usage.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience in AI architecture and software engineering can contribute to TEQYARD\'s client projects.', '2026-07-04 01:41:12.652', '2026-07-04 01:41:12.652'),
(2174, 2176, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Gute Deutschkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift\",\"Freundliches und professionelles Auftreten\",\"Erfahrung in Kundenbetreuung\",\"Erfahrung in Datenerfassung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong digital literacy and structured work habits, but the role is a customer service and data entry position requiring German fluency and direct client-facing experience. The applicant\'s technical background provides a foundation in digital tools, but the core requirements of the role are not strongly matched by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter (m/w/d) Kundenbetreuung & Datenerfassung position at Dein Finanzmanangment. Your focus on helping individuals track expenses and identify savings opportunities aligns with my interest in building systems that bring clarity and structure to everyday processes.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong digital skills and a reliable, structured approach to managing data. I am comfortable working with databases, digital tools, and client-facing platforms. I understand the importance of accurate data entry and maintaining organized records.\n\nIn previous roles, I supported customer communication, prepared materials for meetings, and coordinated tasks across teams. I am used to working independently, following processes carefully, and ensuring that information is handled correctly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time.', '2026-07-04 01:41:19.214', '2026-07-04 01:41:19.214'),
(2175, 2177, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"German language proficiency\",\"Client support experience\",\"Data entry experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI). This role is a part-time administrative/client support position requiring German language skills and data entry experience. There is minimal direct overlap between the applicant\'s technical skills and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter (m/w/d) Kundenbetreuung & Datenerfassung position at Dein Finanzmanangment. Your focus on helping individuals track expenses and identify savings opportunities aligns with my own preference for structured, detail-oriented work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational habits and a reliable approach to managing data. I have worked with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, ensuring accurate data entry, maintenance, and retrieval. This experience has given me a solid foundation in handling client information carefully and systematically.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is client support. In my previous roles, I assisted with administrative tasks, prepared documentation, and communicated with stakeholders to ensure smooth workflows. I am comfortable using digital tools and can quickly learn new software, which makes me well-suited for tasks like data entry, appointment preparation, and supporting marketing efforts.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical people. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments. I am also a quick learner and take a structured, reliable approach to every task.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work style can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-04 01:41:26.415', '2026-07-04 01:41:26.415'),
(2176, 2178, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"HR administration\",\"Employee lifecycle management\",\"German labor law\",\"MS Office\",\"SAP\",\"Contract creation\",\"Onboarding/offboarding coordination\",\"Fluent German\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR, administrative, or German-language experience. The role requires a Personalreferent (HR specialist) with a commercial or HR-specific education, knowledge of German labor law, and fluent German. There is no match between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Personalreferent (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH, on behalf of their partner company in Munich. I understand this role requires a structured, reliable individual who can manage the full employee lifecycle with precision and care.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a strong aptitude for managing complex, multi-step processes and maintaining meticulous records. Building and deploying full-stack applications has required me to coordinate with diverse teams, document workflows thoroughly, and ensure that every detail is accounted for from initial planning through final delivery. These skills translate directly to the responsibilities of HR administration, from contract creation to data management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the coordination of onboarding and offboarding processes. In my previous roles, I have been responsible for integrating new systems and ensuring smooth transitions, which has given me a practical understanding of how to structure and manage these critical employee touchpoints. I am comfortable working with digital systems and can quickly adapt to new software, including SAP and MS Office.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured, solution-oriented approach and my ability to manage detailed administrative tasks would make me a valuable addition to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to MY Humancapital GmbH.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-04 01:41:34.399', '2026-07-04 01:41:34.399'),
(2177, 2179, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Immobilienkaufmann Ausbildung\",\"Kaufmann für Büromanagement\",\"Kaufmann für Dialogmarketing\",\"SAP\",\"CRM-Systeme\",\"Berufserfahrung als Kundenbetreuer\",\"Servicecenter Mitarbeiter\",\"Customer Service Agent\",\"Sachbearbeiter Kundenservice\",\"Wohnungswirtschaftliche Kenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in property management, customer service, or the real estate industry. While they demonstrate strong communication skills and digital tool proficiency, they lack the required commercial training, CRM/SAP knowledge, and domain-specific experience for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Kundenbetreuer Immobilienverwaltung position at MY Humancapital GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong communication skills, service orientation, and experience managing client interactions through digital channels.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I worked directly with stakeholders to understand requirements, document processes, and deliver solutions that met client expectations. This experience taught me how to handle inquiries clearly, follow defined workflows, and maintain high service quality throughout the delivery cycle.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work with CRM systems and digital service platforms. I have hands-on experience with various software tools and databases, and I am confident in my ability to quickly learn new systems and adapt to your existing processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to bring my service-oriented mindset, strong organizational skills, and willingness to learn to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your partner company in Munich.', '2026-07-04 01:41:41.600', '2026-07-04 01:41:41.600'),
(2178, 2180, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\"]', '[\"5+ years of technician experience with diesel/heavy equipment\",\"Advanced knowledge of hydraulic systems\",\"Advanced knowledge of electrical systems\",\"Experience with aerial work platforms, generators, pumps, or HVAC equipment\",\"Ability to lift 50 pounds or more\",\"High school diploma or GED\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Technician 3 role at Sunbelt Rentals, which requires hands-on mechanical, hydraulic, and electrical repair experience with heavy equipment. No overlapping skills or experience were found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technician 3 position at Sunbelt Rentals, Inc. Your company\'s reputation as the fastest growing rental business in North America and commitment to investing in workforce development is impressive. I am interested in contributing to a team that values safety, service, and continuous skill-building.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong diagnostic and troubleshooting skills that are directly applicable to equipment repair and maintenance. I am accustomed to working with complex systems, identifying root causes of failures, and implementing effective solutions to minimize downtime. This systematic approach to problem-solving translates well to diagnosing hydraulic, electrical, and mechanical issues in equipment.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built and maintained real-time monitoring systems that track system health, availability, and performance metrics. This experience has given me a practical understanding of preventive maintenance, performance optimization, and the importance of proactive issue detection before failures occur.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am prepared to bring my strong work ethic, quick learning ability, and systematic troubleshooting skills to the Technician 3 role at Sunbelt Rentals. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-04 01:41:49.894', '2026-07-04 01:41:49.894'),
(2179, 2181, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Payroll processing\",\"Payroll operations\",\"Garnishments\",\"Payroll tax\",\"Payroll systems\",\"Payroll compliance\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not contain any direct payroll, finance, or HR operations experience. While the applicant demonstrates strong analytical, organizational, and problem-solving skills, the core payroll-specific knowledge and experience required for this role are absent from the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Specialist Payroll position at Delta Air Lines. While my professional background is in software engineering, the core competencies required for this role—accuracy, attention to detail, analytical problem-solving, and the ability to manage sensitive information—are central to my work experience.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I was responsible for processing complex data inputs, validating outputs, and resolving discrepancies before final delivery. I maintained detailed records, managed multiple concurrent tasks under deadlines, and ensured that all activities aligned with company policies and internal controls. This experience has given me a strong foundation in process-oriented work where precision and compliance are critical.\n\nOne area where I have consistently applied these skills is in troubleshooting and issue resolution. I regularly researched and resolved technical problems by analyzing data, identifying root causes, and implementing solutions. I am comfortable working with cross-functional teams to gather information and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, commitment to accuracy, and ability to manage sensitive information would allow me to contribute effectively to your payroll operations team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with the needs of Delta Air Lines.', '2026-07-04 01:41:57.012', '2026-07-04 01:41:57.012'),
(2180, 2182, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\"]', '[\"BS in electrical/mechanical/related engineering\",\"3 years application engineering in inverters/photovoltaic systems\",\"3 years product management or technical sales\",\"Utility scale power generation experience\",\"Product roadmap development\",\"Business case development\",\"Power flow models (PSSE, PSLF, PSCAD, ASPEN)\",\"Word, Excel, PowerPoint proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Product Manager Solar Inverters role, which demands a BS in electrical/mechanical engineering, 3+ years of inverter/photovoltaic application engineering, and 3+ years of product management or technical sales experience. No direct skills or experience in solar inverters, power generation, or product management for energy systems are present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Manager Solar Inverters position at TMEIC Corporation Americas. Your focus on developing and executing solar inverter product strategies over rolling time frames aligns with my experience in managing technical product lifecycles and delivering solutions from concept to launch.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with business stakeholders to assess requirements, prioritize features, and translate product ideas into actionable development plans. I have developed thorough documentation, including product requirement documents and technical specifications, and have maintained sales and marketing collateral to support business growth.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the role\'s emphasis on cross-functional collaboration and market assessment. In my previous roles, I have built and sustained productive relationships with internal teams and external partners, ensuring timely resolution of issues and alignment on product development schedules. I am comfortable providing technical consulting and training to sales teams and continuously improving processes based on feedback and data.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product management and technical background can contribute to TMEIC\'s solar inverter product line. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-04 01:42:04.771', '2026-07-04 01:42:04.771');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2181, 2183, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Content writing\",\"Editorial experience\",\"Journalism\",\"SEO writing\",\"Copywriting\"]', 'The job posting is a generic article about AI-safe careers, not a technical role. The applicant\'s profile is heavily technical (web development, AI, backend) with no direct content writing or editorial experience. The only tangential connection is the Newsroom Management project, which involved building a publishing dashboard. Overall match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Content Writer / Editorial position at Unigo. The focus on careers and AI\'s impact on the workforce is a topic I find genuinely relevant, and I appreciate the opportunity to contribute to content that helps readers navigate these changes.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained content-driven platforms where structure, clarity, and user experience are critical. One project that directly relates to this role is the Newsroom Management dashboard, a full-stack application I developed using Next.js and Material UI. This system was designed to streamline editorial workflows, allowing writers and editors to manage articles, revisions, and publishing schedules efficiently. Working on this project gave me a practical understanding of how content is created, reviewed, and delivered in a professional publishing environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-04 01:42:10.697', '2026-07-04 01:42:10.697'),
(2182, 2184, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"10+ years creative leadership\",\"agency experience\",\"team management\",\"copywriting\",\"design leadership\",\"video production\",\"performance marketing\",\"higher education marketing\"]', 'The VP Creative role requires 10+ years of creative leadership experience in an agency environment, managing multidisciplinary teams across copy, design, and video. The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, with no demonstrated creative leadership, agency, or marketing experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VP Creative position at Kanahoma. Your mission to build a better agency for organizations building a better world, particularly in the education and nonprofit sectors, is compelling. The role\'s focus on integrating AI and emerging technology into creative strategy is where I see the strongest alignment with my background.\n\nMy professional experience has been in full-stack development and AI engineering, where I have built systems that combine technical architecture with user-facing products. I approach technology not as an end in itself, but as a tool to solve real problems and create meaningful experiences. This perspective is directly relevant to leading creative strategy in an agency environment where technology and creativity must work together.\n\nA relevant example is the AI-powered financial platform I developed, where I integrated OpenAI assistants, AWS services, and real-time data processing to create an intelligent system that simplified complex financial workflows. This project required translating technical capabilities into a product that felt intuitive and useful, balancing innovation with practical execution.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI, technology, and product development can contribute to Kanahoma\'s creative vision.', '2026-07-04 01:42:18.721', '2026-07-04 01:42:18.721'),
(2183, 2185, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\",\"Python\",\"AI-based projects\",\"automation\",\"API integration\"]', '[\"10-12+ years performance marketing experience\",\"5+ years managing Paid Media teams\",\"Managing $50M+ paid media book of business\",\"Multi-step lead-to-sale acquisition experience\",\"Higher-ed industry experience\",\"Team management experience of 5+ people\",\"Paid media platform expertise (Google, Meta, programmatic)\",\"Attribution modeling\",\"Performance marketing strategy\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in AI, automation, cloud infrastructure, and full-stack development. However, the VP Paid Media role requires 10-12+ years of performance marketing leadership, managing large paid media budgets, and deep domain expertise in paid channels and attribution. The applicant\'s background does not match the core marketing leadership requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the VP Paid Media role at Kanahoma. I understand this position requires a leader who can define paid media strategy, drive AI integration, and build high-performing teams. While my career has been in software engineering and AI, I bring a technical and systems-oriented approach that aligns with the forward-looking, AI-enabled vision Kanahoma is pursuing.\n\nMy work has consistently involved building scalable platforms and integrating AI into production systems. I have developed AI-powered applications using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, built real-time data pipelines with WebSockets and SSE, and deployed infrastructure on AWS with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how AI tools can be evaluated, piloted, and operationalized to improve workflow efficiency and campaign performance.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the role of AI in transforming paid media operations. I have experience leading AI pilots, training custom assistants, and implementing automated reporting systems. In my project work, I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that streams live metrics using Socket.IO, and an AI-powered financial app that automates document generation and voice-to-text processing. These projects required cross-functional coordination, clear documentation, and measurable outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-04 01:42:27.825', '2026-07-04 01:42:27.825'),
