di, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.', '2026-07-04 01:42:33.951', '2026-07-04 01:42:33.951'),
(2185, 2187, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Lived experience with pregnancy/postpartum\",\"Peer support experience\",\"Maternal health background\",\"Bilingual Spanish/English\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (Full-Stack & AI Engineer) and does not match the core requirements of this Peer Specialist role, which demands lived perinatal experience, peer support skills, and a non-clinical caregiving background. No technical skills from the profile are directly relevant to this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Peer Specialist Maternal Health position at Canopie. The work you are doing to build a more inclusive and responsive model of perinatal care is meaningful, and I appreciate the emphasis on lived experience alongside clinical expertise.\n\nWhat draws me to this role is the focus on peer support grounded in real understanding rather than direction. I have strong interpersonal and communication skills, and I approach conversations with warmth and without judgment. I am comfortable working in a fully virtual environment and can build genuine connections through phone, video, and secure messaging.\n\nI am reliable, organized, and responsive in remote settings. I can follow structured workflows while keeping interactions authentic. I also have experience working with diverse and underserved populations, and I am fluent in Bengali and English with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, which helps me connect with individuals from different backgrounds.\n\nI understand the importance of recognizing when additional support is needed and following defined escalation pathways. I am committed to helping members feel seen, heard, and empowered to make decisions that align with their own values and circumstances.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and approach align with the needs of your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 01:42:40.463', '2026-07-04 01:42:40.463'),
(2186, 2188, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"SaaS or marketplace industry experience\",\"CRM usage\",\"Portuguese language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct B2B sales or business development experience. While they have client-facing and communication skills from their web development roles, they lack the core sales experience, industry background, and CRM proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Business Development Executive position at Fresha. Your platform\'s role as an AI-powered operating system for the beauty and wellness industry is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to help grow a marketplace that connects millions of consumers with local businesses.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years working directly with clients and stakeholders. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I regularly communicated with partners to understand their business objectives, presented technical solutions, and managed the full delivery cycle from initial requirements to deployment. This experience has given me strong skills in relationship building, active listening, and clear communication.\n\nI am comfortable with outreach and sales processes. I have experience managing inbound leads, documenting outcomes, and collaborating across departments to ensure a seamless partner experience. I am naturally curious and enjoy learning about new industries, which makes the beauty and wellness sector an exciting area to grow into.\n\nIn addition to my technical and client-facing experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Fresha\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-04 01:42:47.232', '2026-07-04 01:42:47.232'),
(2187, 2189, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Medical classification systems (CHOP, ICD, etc.)\",\"Medical documentation/indexing\",\"Healthcare domain knowledge\",\"Project management in healthcare context\",\"German/French/Italian language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and project management skills, but the role requires specialized medical classification expertise, healthcare domain knowledge, and fluency in a Swiss national language. The match is low because the core requirements are in medical information science and healthcare terminology, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Capoprogetto position for the revision of the Swiss Classification of Surgical Interventions (CHOP) at the Bundesamt für Statistik (BFS). The opportunity to lead a structured revision of a national medical classification system, while contributing to the DigiSanté digital transformation program, is directly aligned with my experience in managing complex, data-driven projects.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have planned and executed full-cycle software projects that required clear documentation, stakeholder coordination, and traceable workflows. I have managed communication with internal teams and external partners, ensuring that project milestones were met and that all decisions were properly recorded. This background in structured project delivery and cross-functional collaboration maps directly to the responsibilities of planning and implementing the CHOP revision.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is working with classification systems and structured medical data. While my technical foundation is in software engineering and information systems, I have a strong interest in how data is organized, indexed, and maintained for accuracy and usability. I am comfortable working with terminologies, nomenclatures, and structured documentation, and I am eager to apply this interest to the medical classification domain.\n\nIn addition to my technical and project management experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and technical background can contribute to the successful revision of the CHOP classification.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 01:42:55.344', '2026-07-04 01:42:55.344'),
(2188, 2190, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Multifamily real estate experience\",\"Financial modeling in Excel\",\"Yardi or property management systems\",\"NOI and multifamily metrics\",\"Finance or accounting background\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong AI and full-stack development skills, but the Asset Management Analyst role requires real estate finance expertise, financial modeling in Excel, and familiarity with multifamily operating metrics. The AI process optimization aspect is a partial match, but the core financial responsibilities are not supported by the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asset Management Analyst position at Bluecore Residential. Your approach to combining real estate investment with data analytics and AI-driven process optimization is something I find genuinely interesting, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering rather than traditional real estate finance, I bring strong analytical and technical skills that align well with the AI and process optimization aspects of this role. I have built multiple AI-powered systems from the ground up, including a full-stack real estate platform that integrated OpenAI assistants for property analysis and Replicate API for image processing. That project also involved role-based authentication, subscription management, Stripe payment integration, and Cron job scheduling, giving me practical experience building systems that handle complex workflows and data.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your focus on using AI tools like Claude and ChatGPT to streamline underwriting, reporting, and recurring analyses. In