(2189, 2191, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Account coordination experience\",\"Client services experience\",\"Marketing or agency support experience\",\"Project management platforms (e.g., Asana)\",\"Creative production workflows\",\"Paid media or content marketing experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but limited direct experience in account coordination, client services, or agency support roles. The only directly matched skill is Figma, which is listed as a bonus qualification. The applicant\'s background in web development and project delivery demonstrates organizational and communication abilities, but the role requires 1-2 years of specific account coordination or agency experience that is not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Associate Account Strategist position at Donut Studios, part of New Engen. Your focus on integrating media, creative, and analytics into performance-driven campaigns for ambitious brands is something I find genuinely compelling. I am eager to bring my organizational skills and client-focused approach to support your enterprise client engagements.\n\nWhile my technical background is in software engineering, the core of my work has always been about coordination, communication, and delivery. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I worked directly with stakeholders and engineering teams to scope requirements, track progress, and ensure projects moved from brief to delivery without friction. This experience taught me how to keep projects organized, maintain clear documentation, and proactively communicate blockers before they impact timelines.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediat