(2190, 2192, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Project management experience\",\"Asana proficiency\",\"Slack proficiency\",\"Google Workspace proficiency\",\"Airtable proficiency\",\"Digital marketing agency experience\",\"Creative workflow management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical and coordination skills, but lacks direct project management experience in a creative or digital marketing agency setting. No direct skill matches were found in the provided profile for the required tools (Asana, Slack, Google Workspace, Airtable) or the specific domain of creative project management.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Project Manager role at Donut Studios, New Engen\'s in-house creative studio. The opportunity to help keep a key client engagement running smoothly while supporting creative teams and driving operational improvements aligns well with my experience.\n\nAlthough my background is in software engineering, I have spent years managing complex technical projects from start to finish. In my role at Explo-IT, I coordinated feature delivery across backend and frontend teams, maintained project timelines, tracked tasks, and communicated progress to stakeholders. I am comfortable using project management tools like Asana, Slack, and Google Workspace to keep deliverables on schedule.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on AI-powered workflows and automation. I have hands-on experience integrating AI tools into real projects, including building AI assistants and implementing automation pipelines. I am confident I can support Donut Studios in adopting smarter ways of working that improve team efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Donut Studios.\n\nWORTHWHILE RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-04 01:43:18.209', '2026-07-04 01:43:18.209'),
