(2192, 2194, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Healthcare operations experience\",\"Team leadership in field-based setting\",\"People management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct healthcare operations or team leadership experience. However, they demonstrate organizational skills, cross-functional collaboration, and a tech-savvy approach that could be transferable. The role requires field-based team management and healthcare domain knowledge, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Supervisor Healthcare Atlanta position at Belle. Your mission to bring joy to healthcare through in-home preventive care is genuinely inspiring, and I admire how Belle combines community health work with data science to improve outcomes for seniors.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong operational and coordination skills through managing end-to-end project delivery. In my previous roles, I worked closely with cross-functional teams, tracked performance metrics, ensured documentation accuracy, and supported team members in meeting compliance and quality standards. These experiences have prepared me to oversee field operations and drive team development effectively.\n\nI am highly organized and tech-savvy, with hands-on experience using scheduling, monitoring, and communication tools. I am comfortable working remotely while staying connected to field teams, and I am based in Atlanta with the ability to travel locally to support Belle Technicians as needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to Belle\'s growth and help deliver life-changing care to seniors in Atlanta. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nDECISIVENESS', '2026-07-04 01:43:32.713', '2026-07-04 01:43:32.713'),
