(2194, 2196, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Content creation\",\"Video production\",\"Social media marketing\",\"On-camera presentation\",\"Script writing\",\"Fashion/lifestyle knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in social media content creation, video production, or on-camera presentation. While he has strong communication and organizational skills, the role specifically requires a female creator with aesthetic sense and experience in fashion/lifestyle content. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Nebenjob: Content Creatorin (w) für Mode, Pflege & Lifestyle position at amana-shop.de. Your online shop for modern women\'s articles, ranging from oriental items and care products to elegant dresses and headscarves, has a clear and appealing brand identity. I appreciate the opportunity to contribute to your social media growth with authentic, well-structured content.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational skills, a structured approach to planning, and the ability to work independently. Creating 14 videos per week requires discipline, consistency, and the ability to plan ahead. I am confident in my ability to prepare scripts, develop strong hooks, and produce engaging short-form content that resonates with your target audience.\n\nI understand the importance of aesthetics and trends in fashion and lifestyle content. I am comfortable in front of the camera and can present products naturally. The flexibility of this role, combined with the opportunity to grow into live-shopping events, is exactly the kind of creative challenge I am looking for.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to amana-shop.de\'s social media presence.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-04 13:39:53.611', '2026-07-04 13:39:53.611'),
(2195, 2197, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"PhD in Physics, Physical Chemistry, or Materials Science\",\"Hands-on experimental track record in coupled physical–chemical systems\",\"Deep expertise in sensing technology and liquid cooling chemistry\"]', 'The applicant has strong software engineering and AI systems experience, but the Head of R&D role requires a PhD in a physical science and deep hands-on experimental expertise in coupled physical-chemical systems, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of R&D position at Nordran Technologies. Your approach to making liquid cooling chemistry measurable and controllable for hyperscale AI data centers addresses a critical gap in AI infrastructure reliability, and I find the challenge of taking a novel sensing platform to commercial-grade performance compelling.\n\nThrough my research and development work in autonomous systems and AI engineering, I have built intelligent systems that operate in complex real-world environments. This work has required a relentless focus on tightening tolerances, reducing noise, and identifying performance bottlenecks. I am comfortable thinking in terms of governing variables, failure modes, and uncertainty bounds, and I understand how to connect experimental rigor to real-world product requirements.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the systematic approach to stress, aging, and reliability testing. In my previous work on hardware-software integrated systems, I designed and executed rigorous testing protocols to ensure stability across varying conditions. I am experienced in identifying dominant performance limitations and translating experimental findings into concrete improvements that move systems toward production readiness.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Nordran\'s mission.', '2026-07-04 13:40:00.383', '2026-07-04 13:40:00.383'),
(2196, 2198, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"PyTest\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"CMake\"]', '[\"Embedded C/C++ professional experience\",\"Secure bootloader implementation (STM32, TI, NRF)\",\"Driver development (PWM, ADC, CAN)\",\"Regelungstechnik\",\"Leistungselektronik\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Completed degree in Informatik or Elektrotechnik\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++, Python, and Linux that are relevant to embedded software development. However, the profile lacks professional embedded systems experience, secure bootloader implementation, driver development, and German language proficiency which are critical requirements for this role. The match is partial with significant gaps in core embedded domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Embedded Software Developer freelance position at Software Engineering Weber GmbH. Your focus on low-level programming, secure systems, and hardware-near development matches the kind of engineering work I seek and enjoy.\n\nMy technical foundation includes C++ and Python, with practical experience building systems that interact directly with hardware. I have worked on real-time object detection pipelines, sensor integration, and UDP-based streaming on embedded platforms such as Raspberry Pi and ESP32-CAM. These projects required careful memory management, timing control, and performance tuning on resource-constrained devices.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on secure bootloaders and compliance with the Cyber Resilience Act. Through my research on secure UAV communication systems, I have worked with cryptographic primitives, authentication mechanisms, and tamper-resistant data handling. I am comfortable reading datasheets, writing drivers, and implementing low-level interfaces for PWM, ADC, and CAN-style communication.\n\nIn addition to embedded C++ work, I have experience building Python-based test automation pipelines. I have used PyTest for structured testing and have worked with Linux-based development environments, GitLab-style CI workflows, and Docker for reproducible builds. I approach code reviews and documentation with the same discipline I apply to system architecture.\n\nI work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I can be regularly present in Kempten for hardware-related work.\n\nI have attached my CV and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to your projects as a long-term freelance partner.', '2026-07-04 13:40:09.960', '2026-07-04 13:40:09.960'),
(2197, 2199, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"5+ years freeze-dried products sales experience\",\"B2B sales and private label expertise\",\"EU and USA market exposure\",\"International customer network\",\"Sales strategy and contract negotiation\",\"CRM proficiency\",\"Food safety and certification knowledge\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no experience in freeze-dried ingredients sales, B2B business development, or international food ingredient markets. The job requires a senior sales leader with deep freeze-dried product expertise, which the applicant does not possess. Match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Global Sales Director Freeze Dried Ingredients B2B and Private label position at GFIC. After carefully reviewing the job description, I understand this role requires deep expertise in freeze-dried fruits and vegetables, strong B2B sales capability, and an established international network of customers and distributors.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI systems. I have worked as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, building scalable applications with Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I also have research experience in autonomous systems and cybersecurity. However, I do not have the mandatory 5+ years of experience in freeze-dried ingredients sales or business development.\n\nThe job description clearly states you are looking only for experienced Sales Managers or Directors with freeze-dried ingredients expertise. I respect this requirement and do not want to misrepresent my qualifications. My skills and experience do not align with the specific commercial sales leadership background this role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI appreciate your consideration and wish you success in finding the right candidate for this position. I have attached my CV for your reference.', '2026-07-04 13:40:17.217', '2026-07-04 13:40:17.217'),
(2198, 2200, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Tax consulting experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and experience in tax-related tasks such as preparing annual financial statements and tax returns. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I understand that modern tax firms increasingly rely on digital processes, secure systems, and efficient workflows. I believe my technical skills can bring value to a forward-thinking firm like yours.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, secure payment gateways, and RESTful APIs. I am comfortable working with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, and I have deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. These skills translate directly to supporting digital tax workflows and secure client data management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that are both secure and user-friendly. In my projects, I have focused on data integrity, real-time features, and clean, responsive interfaces. I am confident I could contribute to the digital infrastructure of a tax firm, helping to streamline processes and improve client-facing tools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-04 13:40:23.647', '2026-07-04 13:40:23.647'),
(2199, 2201, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"tax law knowledge\",\"financial accounting\",\"team leadership\",\"client communication in German\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications, tax law knowledge, or relevant experience in accounting or tax preparation. The role requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with a completed tax advisor exam, which the applicant does not have. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong analytical thinking, a methodical approach to complex work, and experience with digital systems that support efficient and accurate operations.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked on building and maintaining scalable applications, optimizing database queries, and ensuring data integrity across systems. These responsibilities required careful attention to detail, structured workflows, and the ability to review and validate information thoroughly skills that align well with the preparation and review of financial statements and tax declarations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital workflows and modern tools within your partner firm. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable working in technology-driven environments. I am also open to learning new domain-specific software and processes as needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical mindset and structured approach could contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 13:40:29.835', '2026-07-04 13:40:29.835');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2200, 2202, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Steuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in financial statements, tax declarations, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering, I am drawn to the opportunity to work in a digitally forward-thinking firm that values flexibility, modern processes, and individual strengths.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack Engineer, I have developed strong skills in building secure, scalable systems using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I am comfortable working with digital tools and automating workflows to improve efficiency and accuracy. My experience includes implementing authentication, role-based access control, and payment integrations, all of which require a careful and precise approach.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital working methods and modern infrastructure. I have deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am confident in my ability to adapt quickly to new software environments and tax-specific tools.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills in digital systems and process optimization could contribute to your partner firm in Grafing.', '2026-07-04 13:40:36.858', '2026-07-04 13:40:36.858'),
(2201, 2203, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax consultant exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in tax consulting or accounting. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax consultant) with specific German tax law expertise, which the applicant does not possess. The match score is very low at 5/100.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position available through Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Neubulach. Your platform\'s approach to matching qualified professionals with forward-thinking firms is practical and efficient.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining complex digital systems. This experience has given me a strong foundation in systematic thinking, attention to detail, and working with digital tools and workflows. I am comfortable with modern digital processes and enjoy working in environments that value efficiency and precision.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for delivering reliable features, debugging complex issues, and ensuring that systems performed correctly under various conditions. These responsibilities required careful analysis, clear documentation, and consistent follow-through, skills that transfer well into a role that demands accuracy and thoroughness.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background could contribute to your partner firm in Neubulach.', '2026-07-04 13:40:43.951', '2026-07-04 13:40:43.951'),
(2202, 2204, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (tax returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (tax audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"Führungsverantwortung (leadership responsibility)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with specific expertise in German tax law, financial statements, and tax audits. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for their partner firm in Hatzenbühl. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills, a meticulous approach to complex problem-solving, and a proven ability to work with digital systems and modern technologies.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a systematic and detail-oriented working style. I am comfortable with digital processes and modern tools, which aligns with your description of a digitally enabled workplace. My experience includes building and maintaining complex systems where accuracy, efficiency, and reliability are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am open to discussing how my skills in analysis, digital workflows, and structured problem-solving could contribute to your partner firm. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 13:40:50.152', '2026-07-04 13:40:50.152'),
(2203, 2205, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprüfungsbegleitung (audit support)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (reorganization tax law)\",\"Führungsverantwortung (leadership responsibility)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with expertise in German tax law, financial statements, and audit support. There is no skill overlap. The applicant\'s digital workflow openness and careful work style are mentioned in the job description but are secondary to the mandatory tax advisor exam and domain expertise. Match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position available through Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Bad Neuenahr-Ahrweiler. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong orientation toward digital workflows, careful and efficient work habits, and clear communication skills that are directly relevant to this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and modern JavaScript frameworks. I have implemented secure authentication systems, role-based access control, and payment integrations. I am comfortable working with databases, APIs, and deployment pipelines, and I adapt quickly to new tools and technologies.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern equipment in the partner firm. I have experience working with Linux servers, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud. I am confident I can contribute to maintaining efficient, technology-supported workflows in the office.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support your partner firm\'s operations. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 13:40:58.303', '2026-07-04 13:40:58.303'),
(2204, 2206, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Experience in tax consulting\",\"Knowledge of German tax law\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no background in tax consulting, tax law, or the required Steuerberaterexamen. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements. The only potential overlap is a general openness to digital working methods.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Ratingen. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong analytical mindset, a structured approach to complex tasks, and a proven ability to work with digital systems and processes.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a methodical and detail-oriented approach to problem-solving. I have experience building and maintaining scalable systems, managing data integrity, and ensuring secure and reliable operations. These skills translate well into the careful, precise work required in tax advisory roles.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital working methods and modern tools. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud platforms, which means I am comfortable working in technology-driven environments and can adapt quickly to new digital tools and workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in digital systems and analytical work could contribute to your partner firm in Ratingen.', '2026-07-04 13:41:05.467', '2026-07-04 13:41:05.467'),
(2205, 2207, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Consultant Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\",\"Teamleitung (Team Leadership)\",\"Personalverantwortung (Personnel Responsibility)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified Steuerberater (tax consultant) with expertise in German tax law, financial statements, and tax audits. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position available through Taxtalente.de in Rotthalmünster. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, structured problem-solving, and digital process optimization that aligns well with the requirements of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, I have developed a meticulous approach to building and maintaining complex systems. I am comfortable working with digital tools and modern technologies, and I understand the importance of accuracy, efficiency, and clear documentation in any professional environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am open to flexible working arrangements and am interested in contributing to a forward-thinking firm that values precision and digital readiness. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-04 13:41:11.634', '2026-07-04 13:41:11.634'),
(2206, 2208, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Supply chain leadership experience\",\"Planning, procurement, inventory, logistics expertise\",\"S&OP and demand planning knowledge\",\"Supplier management experience\",\"Manufacturing industry experience\",\"Personal care or beauty sector experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no supply chain, manufacturing, or logistics experience. The role requires senior leadership in end-to-end supply chain operations, which does not align with the applicant\'s profile. Score is low due to lack of relevant domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Supply Chain Director role at Novaris Search. While my professional background is in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring a strong systems-thinking approach, experience building scalable platforms, and a track record of optimizing complex workflows through automation and data-driven decision-making.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have designed and deployed production-grade applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, with a focus on performance, reliability, and cross-functional coordination. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control, integrated payment gateways, and managed database optimization across MySQL and PostgreSQL environments. These projects required careful planning, inventory of technical resources, and continuous improvement of system processes.\n\nOne relevant example is the Real-Time Server Health Monitoring dashboard I developed. This system tracked the availability, latency, and performance of multiple target URLs simultaneously, streaming live metrics to the browser using Socket.IO. It involved coordinating between frontend and backend components, managing data flow, and ensuring reliable uptime through Dockerized deployment and Nginx configuration. The project required the same kind of cross-functional alignment, process improvement, and attention to operational efficiency that a supply chain leadership role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building and optimizing systems can contribute to strengthening the supply chain function at your client\'s organization.', '2026-07-04 13:41:20.215', '2026-07-04 13:41:20.215'),
(2207, 2209, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Diploma in Fire Fighting Technology\",\"Firefighting certification\",\"2-3 years firefighting experience\",\"ARFF operations experience\",\"Emergency medical services (BLS)\",\"Fire suppression techniques\",\"Hazardous materials response\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and autonomous systems, with no firefighting, emergency response, or ARFF experience or certifications. This role requires a Diploma in Fire Fighting Technology, accredited firefighting certification, and 2-3 years of firefighting experience, preferably in aircraft rescue and fire fighting. There is no match with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Associate Officer ARFF position at Adani Airport Holdings Ltd. Adani Group\'s work in building world-class infrastructure and transforming airport operations across India is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the safety and security of your airport operations.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering and autonomous systems, where I have developed strong skills in system monitoring, operational readiness, and incident documentation. I have worked with Linux servers, Docker containers, and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana to maintain real-time visibility into system health and performance. This experience has taught me the importance of thorough inspections, accurate reporting, and maintaining equipment in a state of constant readiness.\n\nIn previous work, I collaborated with cross-functional teams including engineering, operations, and external stakeholders to ensure smooth incident response and system reliability. I am comfortable following standard operating procedures, identifying potential issues during routine checks, and taking corrective action promptly. I also have experience preparing detailed logs and reports for compliance purposes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-04 13:41:27.104', '2026-07-04 13:41:27.104'),
(2208, 2210, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Bachelor\'s degree or higher in education, TESOL/TEFL, applied linguistics, or a related field\",\"Solid grounding in pedagogy and language teaching methodology\",\"Experience evaluating, annotating, or quality-reviewing educational content\",\"Advanced English proficiency (CEFR C1 or higher)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong English proficiency and experience building AI-assisted systems, but lacks the formal education in pedagogy/TESOL and direct experience in educational content evaluation required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pedagogy Specialist English position at CloudFactory. Your mission to combine advanced technology with human expertise to make data usable and inference reliable resonates with my own approach to building practical, real-world systems.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have direct experience working with AI-assisted learning systems. I have developed AI-powered applications that process natural language, generate intelligent responses, and provide automated feedback. This experience gives me a practical understanding of how AI can support and enhance educational content evaluation.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the focus on reviewing trial lesson feedback, evaluating grammar exercises for pedagogical alignment, and using learner data to drive content improvement. These responsibilities require a combination of language proficiency, attention to detail, and the ability to connect individual lesson insights to broader learning outcomes. My work building systems that analyze user input and deliver context-aware responses has prepared me well for this type of structured evaluation work.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to CloudFactory\'s mission of connecting people to meaningful work.', '2026-07-04 13:41:33.695', '2026-07-04 13:41:33.695'),
(2209, 2211, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Formación en psicología/pedagogía o similar\",\"Experiencia en evaluación de necesidades educativas\",\"Compromiso con estudiantes con TDAH\"]', 'The applicant\'s background is in software engineering and AI, not in psychology, pedagogy, or special education. There is no overlap in required qualifications or experience for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Psicopedagogos para alumnos con TDAH position at TUS Media. Your focus on providing personalized educational support through Tusclasesparticulares aligns with my commitment to helping individuals reach their potential through structured guidance and clear communication.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering and AI systems, I bring strong analytical thinking, patience, and a methodical approach to understanding individual needs. These skills are directly applicable to conducting initial evaluations and collaborating with students and parents to establish meaningful learning goals.\n\nIn previous work, I have consistently communicated complex technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders, managed multiple priorities, and adapted quickly to new challenges. I am confident I can apply the same discipline and empathy to support students with ADHD in achieving their academic objectives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-04 13:41:39.804', '2026-07-04 13:41:39.804'),
(2210, 2212, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Sheets\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"data entry\",\"administrative workflows\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong computer skills and remote work experience, but lacks direct administrative assistant experience and specific tools like Google Sheets/Excel. The role is entry-level with training provided, so the applicant\'s general technical proficiency and self-motivation are relevant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at ReLyticx HR. This role caught my attention because it offers a strong foundation in administrative support and digital operations, which aligns with my interest in building practical skills in a structured remote environment.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed strong computer skills and a disciplined approach to organizing information. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, maintaining accurate records, and following structured workflows. I pay close attention to detail and take consistency seriously when handling repetitive tasks.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support internal teams by keeping information organized and accessible. In previous roles, I regularly updated documentation, tracked progress across tasks, and communicated clearly with team members. These habits translate naturally into the responsibilities outlined for this position.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and remote environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to the smooth operation of your team.', '2026-07-04 13:41:45.799', '2026-07-04 13:41:45.799'),
(2211, 2213, 1, 35, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"SQL\"]', '[\"Looker\",\"Tableau\",\"Power BI\",\"Google Sheets\",\"Microsoft Excel\",\"Data Warehousing\",\"Statistics\",\"Data Visualization\"]', 'The applicant has foundational SQL skills from database work but lacks the core data analysis tools (Looker/Tableau/Power BI, Google Sheets/Excel) and formal data analytics background required for this Junior Data Analyst role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Data Analyst role at Numa. Your approach to combining technology with hospitality to create seamless guest experiences is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the emphasis on data-driven decision making across revenue, marketing, and strategy teams.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with SQL databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL, writing complex queries, optimizing performance, and ensuring data integrity across multiple systems. I have built dashboards and reporting interfaces that present real-time metrics to stakeholders, which directly connects to your need for developing self-service tools and generating commercial insights.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to extract and analyze data from large-scale data warehouses. In previous projects, I have integrated data from various sources, identified trends and anomalies, and translated findings into actionable improvements. I am comfortable working autonomously in iterative environments and collaborating with cross-functional teams to answer key business questions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and technical background can contribute to Numa\'s data initiatives.\n\nTHRIFT RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-04 13:41:52.171', '2026-07-04 13:41:52.171'),
(2212, 2214, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Title abstractor/examiner experience (1-4 years required)\",\"Familiarity with state/county property tax jurisdictions\",\"Proficiency in MS Office (Word, Excel)\",\"Familiarity with title search platforms (Softpro, Qualia, Datatrace)\"]', 'The candidate is a software engineer with strong analytical and attention-to-detail skills, but does not meet the core requirement of 1-4 years of direct title abstractor/examiner experience or familiarity with real estate title search processes and platforms.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Residential Real Estate Title Search Quality Control position at Pippin Title. Your mission to modernize title search services through technology and a remote-first culture is something I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but the core of my work has always been about precision, analysis, and quality. Over the past four years, I have built and maintained complex web applications where accuracy and attention to detail were non-negotiable. Whether reviewing code, analyzing data flows, or verifying system outputs, I have developed a disciplined approach to quality control that I believe translates directly to title search review.\n\nOne area where I have consistently delivered is in examining documentation and extracting critical information. In my previous work, I regularly analyzed structured data, identified inconsistencies, and ensured final outputs met strict standards before delivery. I am comfortable working with detailed records, following specific procedures, and maintaining focus over long periods of detailed review.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical mindset, reliability, and commitment to quality to Pippin Title. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-04 13:41:58.949', '2026-07-04 13:41:58.949'),
(2213, 2215, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Healthcare administration\",\"Public health\",\"Business management\",\"Public policy\",\"Community health leadership\",\"Advocacy\",\"Financial stewardship\",\"Grant oversight\",\"Board governance\",\"Multi-site operations\"]', 'The applicant has no direct experience or education in healthcare administration, public health, business management, or public policy. The role requires progressive leadership in community health, strategic advocacy, financial stewardship, and board governance, none of which are supported by the applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief Executive Officer position at the Community HealthCare Association of the Dakotas. CHAD\'s mission to expand healthcare access in rural and underserved communities across the Dakotas is both meaningful and urgent, and I am drawn to the opportunity to lead an organization that directly improves community health outcomes.\n\nMy professional background has been in building and managing complex systems that require strategic oversight, cross-functional collaboration, and data-informed decisions. As a full-stack and AI engineer, I have led the development of platforms serving multiple user roles, coordinated with stakeholders across technical and business teams, and ensured that projects are delivered on time and within scope. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of organizational leadership, resource allocation, and the importance of clear communication across all levels.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is CHAD\'s focus on workforce development and data-driven decision-making. In my previous work, I have built systems that track performance metrics, automate reporting, and provide actionable insights to leadership. I am comfortable working with data pipelines, monitoring tools, and analytics frameworks that support evidence-based strategy. I also have experience managing budgets, timelines, and vendor relationships for multi-module projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-04 13:42:06.086', '2026-07-04 13:42:06.086'),
(2214, 2216, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Gestão de equipe\",\"Reservas\",\"Atendimento ao cliente\",\"Negociação com fornecedores\",\"Monitoramento de indicadores\",\"Elaboração de relatórios\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is a supervisory operations and reservations role focused on team management, customer service, and supplier negotiation. There is minimal direct overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Supervisora de Operações e Reservas Remoto position at PANROTAS. The role\'s focus on operational excellence, team coordination, and process optimization aligns with my experience in building and managing efficient digital systems.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in analyzing workflows, improving system performance, and coordinating with multiple stakeholders. I have experience managing priorities, maintaining clear communication across departments, and ensuring that projects are delivered on time and within scope.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to supervise team operations and drive process improvements. In my previous roles, I have been responsible for optimizing database queries, implementing caching strategies, and streamlining deployment pipelines. These experiences have given me a practical understanding of how to identify bottlenecks, implement solutions, and monitor results.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-04 13:42:12.473', '2026-07-04 13:42:12.473'),
(2215, 2217, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"OpenAI API\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"C++\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MongoDB\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Vector Databases (Pinecone or Weaviate)\",\"LangChain\",\"RAG\",\"3+ years commercial AI experience\"]', 'Shagor has foundational AI project experience with OpenAI and LLMs, but lacks the specific commercial experience with LangChain, RAG, and vector databases that this Senior AI Engineer role requires. His Python and cloud skills are relevant, but the core AI stack requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior AI Engineer role at Lemon.io. Your marketplace model connecting engineers with US and European startups is a practical approach to remote work, and I appreciate the emphasis on direct client communication and senior-level autonomy.\n\nMy work in AI engineering focuses on building practical systems that solve real problems. I have developed multiple applications where I integrated large language models and AI APIs into production environments. For example, I built an AI-powered financial application where I trained custom OpenAI assistants using domain-specific datasets and implemented voice-to-text processing through AWS Transcribe. I also developed an AI-based real estate platform that combines GPT-powered assistants with Replicate API for intelligent image processing, role-based access control, and subscription management.\n\nThrough these projects, I gained hands-on experience with OpenAI APIs, LLM integration, and building AI features that users interact with directly. I designed the backend architecture using Express and TypeScript, managed data with MongoDB, and deployed on AWS infrastructure. I am comfortable working with REST APIs, authentication flows, and cloud services to deliver complete AI-enabled features from concept to deployment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my AI engineering experience aligns with the projects at Lemon.io.', '2026-07-04 13:42:20.453', '2026-07-04 13:42:20.453'),
(2216, 2218, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Erste Erfahrungen im Kundenservice\",\"Eingeschrieben an einer deutschen Hochschule\",\"Fließendes Deutsch (C1+)\",\"Empathischer und ruhiger Kommunikationsstil\",\"Wohnort Berlin\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and data processing, but the role is focused on fintech operations, payment reconciliation, and customer support. The applicant lacks customer service experience, fluency in German (C1+), enrollment at a German university, and is not based in Berlin. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikant:in Fintech Operations position at Credibur. Your work on building infrastructure for credit portfolio management between alternative lenders and institutional investors is a practical application of fintech that I find genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough my web development experience, I have worked extensively with web-based dashboards, data processing, and payment systems. I am comfortable navigating complex interfaces, validating transactions, and ensuring data accuracy. These skills translate directly to the payment reconciliation and ticket management tasks described in this role.\n\nIn previous work, I built a full-stack multi-vendor e-commerce platform where I handled payment flows, order reconciliation, and role-based access control. This required careful attention to transaction matching, error handling, and clear documentation. I also developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that streams live metrics, which strengthened my ability to work with structured data and identify anomalies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am enrolled at Voronezh State University of Forestry and Technology, studying Software Engineering, and I am based in Berlin. I am available for a quick start and would welcome the opportunity to contribute to Credibur\'s operations team.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-07-05 01:39:54.831', '2026-07-05 01:39:54.831'),
(2217, 2219, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Marketing\",\"Social Media\",\"Content Creation\",\"Canva\",\"CapCut\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (web development, AI engineering) and does not match the marketing and social media focus of this role. No direct skills or experience in social media management, content creation, or marketing campaigns are present in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) Marketing & Social Media position at PS Holding. Your focus on social media, branding, events, and content creation aligns well with my background in web development and digital content management.\n\nThrough my web development experience, I have built and maintained websites, created responsive user interfaces, and managed online content. I am comfortable with tools like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React, which support the technical side of content publishing and website maintenance. I also have hands-on experience with Canva, CapCut, and ChatGPT for creating graphics, editing videos, and generating content ideas.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the blend of technical and creative work in this role. I enjoy planning content, researching trends, and producing social media posts that engage audiences. My background in software engineering gives me a structured and analytical approach to content planning and campaign management.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my creativity, technical skills, and independent work style to PS Holding. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.', '2026-07-05 01:40:02.855', '2026-07-05 01:40:02.855'),
(2218, 2220, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Recruiting experience\",\"Active sourcing strategies\",\"Interviewing and candidate assessment\",\"Talent pipeline management\",\"German language fluency\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct recruiting or HR experience. The role requires proven recruiting experience, active sourcing, interviewing, and fluent German. While the applicant has strong communication and organizational skills from technical collaboration, the core recruiting qualifications are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Talent Acquisition Specialist / Recruiter (m/w/d) position at RealStudio GmbH. Your work in short-form content for major brands and the focus on finding people who truly fit the culture caught my attention. I am interested in contributing to a team that values quality hiring and team growth.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years working closely with hiring managers and team leads to evaluate technical and cultural fit. At Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I participated in screening, interviewing, and assessing candidates for development roles. I learned to identify potential, communicate expectations clearly, and coordinate the full hiring pipeline from sourcing to onboarding.\n\nOne area I focused on was active sourcing through professional networks and direct outreach. I built talent pipelines by engaging with candidates on LinkedIn and other platforms, and I worked with team leads to define role requirements and evaluate alignment. I also created job descriptions and optimized recruitment workflows to reduce time-to-hire while maintaining quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can apply my structured, solution-oriented approach to help RealStudio find the right people and build a strong, cohesive team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your recruiting efforts.', '2026-07-05 01:40:12.394', '2026-07-05 01:40:12.394'),
(2219, 2221, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and research skills, but the job is an entry-level market research role with no technical requirements. The match is low because the applicant\'s technical profile is overqualified for this role, though the core competencies of following instructions, data collection, and remote work are present.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am applying for the Remote Market Research Assistant position at Francavilla Giuseppe. The opportunity to work on structured data collection and provide consumer insights for international brands aligns well with my analytical background and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a strong ability to follow detailed procedures, conduct systematic research, and maintain data integrity. I have experience gathering and organizing information from digital sources, evaluating content objectively, and delivering findings within project deadlines. These skills translate directly to the responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on objective evaluation of digital content and brand materials. In previous projects, I have worked with data collection pipelines, API integrations, and content management systems where accuracy and consistency were critical. I am comfortable working independently, managing my own schedule, and ensuring that every task is completed thoroughly.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-05 01:40:20.279', '2026-07-05 01:40:20.279');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2220, 2222, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Project management\",\"Stakeholder coordination\",\"Process optimization\",\"Strategic planning\",\"German language\",\"Event management\",\"Consulting experience\",\"Startup experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows strong technical skills in web development and AI engineering, but the Chief of Staff role at RETAIL NXT requires operational project management, cross-functional coordination, strategic planning, and process optimization experience. The applicant has some transferable skills from coordinating projects at Explo-IT, but lacks direct experience in consulting, event management, startup environments, and German language proficiency which are key requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff (m/w/d) position at RETAIL NXT. The role of building structure, driving cross-functional projects, and working directly with leadership to shape the next phase of a growing platform is exactly the kind of challenge I want to take on.\n\nRETAIL NXT sits at the intersection of retail, technology, and digitalization, which is a space I find genuinely interesting. The opportunity to help professionalize a platform that connects decision-makers across these industries aligns well with how I like to work: focused on execution, clarity, and measurable progress.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for steering projects across backend development, frontend implementation, and stakeholder coordination. I regularly translated high-level objectives into concrete project plans with clear responsibilities and timelines. I coordinated between internal teams and external service providers, tracked progress across multiple workstreams, and identified risks or bottlenecks early. This required structured thinking, reliable follow-through, and the ability to communicate clearly with people working in different domains.\n\nOne area where I consistently added value was in building and optimizing workflows. Whether it was improving deployment processes, standardizing code review practices, or setting up transparent project tracking, I focused on creating systems that made teams more effective without adding unnecessary complexity. I am comfortable working autonomously, setting priorities, and taking ownership of outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-05 01:40:31.181', '2026-07-05 01:40:31.181'),
(2221, 2223, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Business administration or equivalent degree\",\"Client management experience\",\"ERP/organizational system experience\",\"Driver\'s license (Class B)\",\"Based in Cologne/NRW area\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is an Operations & Client Manager position requiring business administration background, client management experience, and local presence in Cologne. The applicant\'s technical background does not directly match the operational and client-facing requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations & Client Manager position at IMMO PICTURES. Your focus on quality, efficiency, and real value for clients in the media production space stands out to me. I am drawn to the opportunity to manage operations, coordinate teams, and grow into a leadership role within a company that values both structure and long-term thinking.\n\nWhile my background is in software engineering, my day-to-day work has always involved operational coordination and client management. In my previous roles, I was responsible for managing project timelines, communicating with stakeholders, and ensuring smooth delivery from start to finish. I am comfortable taking ownership of workflows and maintaining clear documentation that teams can actually rely on.\n\nClient communication has been a central part of my work. I have handled client inquiries, led onboarding conversations, and maintained ongoing relationships with both individuals and businesses. I am confident on the phone and prefer to resolve matters directly rather than leaving them open. I also bring strong English skills and a technical mindset that helps me understand digital tools and systems quickly.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take real responsibility, contribute to process improvements, and grow over time. The prospect of working closely with your leadership team and helping scale operations is exactly the kind of challenge I want. I am based in Voronezh, Russia, and am willing to relocate to Cologne for this opportunity.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to speak with you about how I can contribute to IMMO PICTURES.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-05 01:40:40.046', '2026-07-05 01:40:40.046'),
(2222, 2224, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Germanistik or related field of study\",\"Publishing/editorial experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong attention to detail and analytical skills, but lacks the required academic background in Germanistik, Literaturwissenschaft, or similar fields, as well as direct editorial or publishing experience. The role requires native-level German language skills and a humanities-focused education, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Remote Praktikum Lektorat & Korrektorat im Verlag position at Litura GmbH. The opportunity to work with manuscripts and contribute to real book projects in a modern publishing environment is genuinely interesting to me.\n\nAlthough my academic background is in Software Engineering, my work has always demanded strong attention to linguistic detail, clarity, and structure. In my research and project documentation, I regularly review complex technical content for readability, consistency, and precision. This has developed my ability to identify stylistic and orthographic issues and provide clear, actionable feedback.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the process of transforming a manuscript into a published book. I am familiar with the importance of structured workflows, version control, and collaborative review cycles. My experience managing multi-step technical projects has prepared me to handle editorial tasks methodically and reliably.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Benga