(2224, 2226, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Bankausbildung (banking training)\",\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung (commercial training)\",\"Debit- und Kreditkartenbearbeitung (debit/credit card processing)\",\"Nachlassfallbearbeitung (estate processing)\",\"Kapitalertragssteuer (capital gains tax)\",\"FATCA/CRS (foreign tax reporting)\",\"AWV-Meldung (foreign trade reporting)\",\"Kontoverwaltung (account management)\",\"Auslandsgeschäft (international business)\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The job is a specialized banking operations role requiring formal banking/commercial training and specific knowledge of German financial regulations, tax processing, and account management. The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering with no banking experience or relevant qualifications. There are no matching skills between the profile and job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sachbearbeiter (gn) position in the Marktfolge Passiv department at Volksbank Raiffeisenbank Fürstenfeldbruck eG. Your cooperative bank\'s focus on innovation and long-term employee development aligns with my own approach to professional growth and reliable service.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering rather than banking, I bring a systematic and detail-oriented working style that is directly applicable to the responsibilities of this role. My experience developing full-stack applications has required me to manage complex data workflows, maintain accuracy across multiple concurrent tasks, and follow structured processes to ensure consistent results.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I handled tasks that demanded precision, organization, and the ability to work independently. I manag