(2238, 2240, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"HR experience\",\"HR operations\",\"HRIS systems\",\"employee lifecycle management\",\"onboarding/offboarding\",\"compliance tracking\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR experience. The role requires at least 2 years of HR operations and generalist work. There is no overlap in required skills. The applicant\'s organizational and communication skills are transferable but do not meet the core requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Temp HR Coordinator, People Operations role at Headspace. Your mission to provide accessible mental health support through evidence-based content and innovative technology is genuinely impactful, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to a team that values accuracy, care, and ownership.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and process-oriented skills through managing complex, multi-step projects. I am comfortable working in environments where not everything is predefined, and I know how to find answers, ask the right questions, and follow through until tasks are complete.\n\nIn previous work, I have maintained data integrity across systems, coordinated with multiple stakeholders, and documented workflows to ensure consistency and clarity. I am confident I can apply these same skills to support the employee lifecycle, manage People Ops inquiries, and assist with HR administrative tasks at Headspace.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of contributing to the Headspace team.', '2026-07-05 01:42:49.460', '2026-07-05 01:42:49.460'),
(2239, 2241, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Close CRM experience\",\"Lead scoring/prioritization\",\"Sales funnel understanding (B2B)\",\"RevOps workflow automation\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in automation, data processing, and workflow systems, but lacks direct experience with Close CRM, lead scoring, and B2B sales funnels which are core requirements for this RevOps role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance RevOps Expert (Close) position at ProviPanda GmbH. Your platform\'s rapid growth and the challenge of optimizing 8,000+ inbound leads into a structured, high-conversion pipeline is exactly the kind of problem I enjoy solving.\n\nAlthough my primary expertise is in full-stack engineering, I have built automation systems, data segmentation logic, and workflow engines that directly apply to RevOps. I understand how to analyze large datasets, define prioritization rules, and create automated sequences that reduce manual effort and improve team focus.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building lead-scoring logic. In previous work, I have designed systems that process high-volume data, apply conditional rules, and route information based on relevance. This experience translates directly to creating Smart Views, Tasks, and Reminders in Close that prioritize follow-ups by lead behavior and age rather than recency.\n\nI also have experience with reporting and analytics. I have built dashboards that track pipeline momentum, identify stalled deals, and surface actionable insights. I can help your team understand where deals lose momentum and what adjustments to the workflow can improve close rates.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I am available to start immediately and can work independently with minimal onboarding. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to ProviPanda\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-05 13:39:54.117', '2026-07-05 13:39:54.117'),
(2240, 2242, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Market research experience\",\"German language proficiency (very good)\",\"Consumer insights domain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong general professional skills (detail orientation, data integrity, remote work capability) but lacks specific market research experience, German language proficiency, and consumer insights domain knowledge required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mitarbeiter Marktforschung im Homeoffice position at Francavilla Giuseppe. Your focus on structured data collection and objective evaluation of digital content for global brands aligns with my approach to precise, detail-oriented work.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in following detailed project guidelines, maintaining data integrity, and delivering accurate results within deadlines. I am comfortable working independently in a remote setting and managing my own time effectively.\n\nIn previous work, I have handled tasks that require careful attention to instructions, systematic data handling, and clear reporting. I am confident I can apply the same discipline to your market research projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-05 13:40:00.418', '2026-07-05 13:40:00.418'),
(2241, 2243, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\",\"Führungsverständnis\",\"Personalverantwortung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in tax consulting or tax law. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen (tax consultant exam) and experience with annual financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Göllheim. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong analytical thinking, careful attention to detail, and a proven ability to work efficiently with digital systems.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this opportunity is the emphasis on a digital-first working environment and the flexibility to shape responsibilities based on individual strengths. I am comfortable working with modern digital tools and processes, and I approach tasks with a methodical and thorough mindset.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I was responsible for building and maintaining complex systems that required precision, clear documentation, and consistent communication with stakeholders. I am used to working independently while also coordinating effectively within teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and working style could contribute to your partner firm in Göllheim.', '2026-07-05 13:40:07.437', '2026-07-05 13:40:07.437'),
(2242, 2244, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Experience with annual financial statements (Jahresabschlüsse)\",\"Experience with tax declarations (Steuererklärungen)\",\"Experience with tax audits (Betriebsprüfungen)\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no qualifications or experience in tax advisory, accounting, or German tax law. The job requires a certified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with specific experience in financial statements, tax declarations, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap and the applicant does not meet the core qualification requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for your partner firm in Eggenstein-Leopoldshafen. I understand that you are looking for a professional who combines careful, efficient work with openness to digital processes, and I believe my background in software engineering and analytical problem-solving aligns well with this opportunity.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed a strong ability to work with structured data, build secure systems, and automate repetitive tasks. I am comfortable with digital tools and enjoy optimizing workflows for accuracy and efficiency. These skills translate naturally into the careful review and preparation of financial statements and tax declarations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital processes and modern tools in your partner firm. I have hands-on experience with Linux servers, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and database management, which means I can quickly adapt to any digital environment and contribute to maintaining efficient, paperless operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical approach and digital fluency could benefit your partner firm in Eggenstein-Leopoldshafen.', '2026-07-05 13:40:15.003', '2026-07-05 13:40:15.003'),
(2243, 2245, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax declarations, and tax audits. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s software engineering profile and the mandatory qualifications for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax advisory, I bring a strong orientation toward digital workflows, secure systems, and efficient process design.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js, with a focus on authentication, role-based access control, and real-time data handling. I am comfortable working with modern infrastructure tools including Docker, Nginx, and cloud platforms, and I approach each project with a careful, detail-oriented mindset.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a digitally enabled environment. I have experience designing systems that reduce manual overhead through automation and clear data flows. I believe this technical perspective can be valuable in a tax advisory setting where accuracy, efficiency, and secure handling of sensitive information are essential.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in software engineering and digital process design could contribute to your partner firm in Ebelsbach. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-07-05 13:40:22.385', '2026-07-05 13:40:22.385'),
(2244, 2246, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"steuerliche Sonderberatungsprojekte\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in tax-related tasks. There is no skill overlap. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong technical skills in digital workflows, secure systems, and process automation that can support a modern, digitally-driven tax practice.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built scalable full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I have implemented role-based access control, real-time features, and secure payment integrations. I am comfortable working with databases, APIs, and deployment pipelines on Linux servers.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital working methods and modern equipment. I have experience with Docker, Nginx, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud. I can help maintain and improve the digital infrastructure that supports efficient tax workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills can contribute to your partner firm in Sankt Georgen im Schwarzwald.', '2026-07-05 13:40:29.066', '2026-07-05 13:40:29.066'),
(2245, 2247, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Steuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in tax consulting or tax law. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and experience with financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. Although my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong analytical capabilities, a meticulous approach to complex work, and a proven ability to adapt to new domains quickly.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed systems that demand precision, reliability, and careful attention to detail. Building secure authentication flows, optimizing database queries, and deploying production-grade applications have all required the same thoroughness and accuracy that tax work demands. I am comfortable working with digital tools and processes, and I adapt quickly to new software environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a digitally forward-thinking firm. I have hands-on experience with modern web technologies, databases, and cloud infrastructure, which means I can contribute to maintaining efficient digital workflows from day one. I also value clear communication and collaborative teamwork, both of which are essential when working with clients and colleagues.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic could contribute to your partner firm in Ehrenfriedersdorf.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-05 13:40:36.937', '2026-07-05 13:40:36.937'),
