th technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills could contribute to your partner firm in Braunschweig.', '2026-07-05 13:40:44.490', '2026-07-05 13:40:44.490'),
