 and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills could contribute to your partner firm in Illingen.', '2026-07-05 13:40:51.410', '2026-07-05 13:40:51.410'),
(2248, 2250, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"tax law expertise\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungen\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The role requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in financial statements, tax returns, and client advisory. There is no skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I understand the importance of precision, structured processes, and digital efficiency in professional services.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a strong ability to analyze complex systems, identify patterns, and deliver accurate results under tight deadlines. I approach every task with thoroughness and a focus on quality, which I believe translates well into the careful review and preparation required in tax advisory work.\n\nI am open to digital ways of working and comfortable with modern tools and platforms. My experience building and maintaining web applications has given me a practical understanding of how technology can streamline workflows, reduce manual effort, and improve accuracy in data-intensive environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-05 13:40:57.279', '2026-07-05 13:40:57.279'),
(2249, 2251, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Arabic fluency\",\"Customer support experience\",\"CRM system familiarity\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack and AI engineering) with no demonstrated Arabic fluency or customer support experience. Basic computer skills and remote work readiness are present, but the core requirements for this role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Customer Support Specialist position at Recruitlytics Hiring. Your focus on delivering professional, empathetic support to Arabic-speaking customers aligns with my own approach to clear communication and problem-solving.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and interpersonal skills through years of client-facing work. In my previous roles as a web developer, I regularly collaborated with stakeholders, gathered requirements, explained technical solutions, and resolved issues. This experience taught me to listen carefully, communicate clearly, and handle inquiries with patience and professionalism.\n\nI am comfortable working independently in a remote environment and have reliable high-speed internet, a dedicated workspace, and strong computer skills. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and I enjoy collaborating in multilingual settings.\n\nI am a quick learner and detail-oriented. I approach every interaction with empathy and a genuine desire to help. I am confident I can contribute positively to your team and provide quality support to your customers.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can support Recruitlytics Hiring.', '2026-07-05 13:41:04.041', '2026-07-05 13:41:04.041'),
(2250, 2252, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Spreadsheet tools (Google Sheets / Excel)\",\"Administrative workflows\",\"Data entry experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the job is an entry-level administrative assistant role requiring spreadsheet proficiency, data entry, and task coordination. No direct administrative experience or spreadsheet tools are listed in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at Recruitlytics Hiring. The opportunity to support daily operations through data management, task coordination, and workflow organization aligns well with my background and work style.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a web developer, I have developed strong organizational habits and attention to detail. I regularly work with spreadsheets, databases, and internal tracking systems to maintain accurate records and ensure information is easy to access. I am comfortable updating documentation, following structured workflows, and flagging inconsistencies when they appear.\n\nOne area where I consistently deliver is managing repetitive tasks with precision. Whether updating project trackers, organizing digital files, or following up on assigned tasks, I maintain consistency and accuracy. I am self-motivated and able to work independently in a remote environment, which makes me well-suited for this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to learn and grow within your team. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Recruitlytics Hiring.\n\nBRAVERY', '2026-07-05 13:41:10.425', '2026-07-05 13:41:10.425'),
(2251, 2253, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Linux\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Records management experience\",\"Document control experience\",\"Clerical work experience\",\"Adobe Acrobat\",\"Jira/Asana/ServiceNow\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in cloud storage (AWS, Google Cloud) and basic computer proficiency, but lacks direct experience in records management, document control, or clerical work. The role is administrative/data entry focused, while the applicant\'s background is primarily software engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Data Entry File Clerk position at Recruitlytics Hiring. Your focus on maintaining organized digital records and ensuring data accuracy aligns with my approach to structured and reliable work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong skills in managing digital files, organizing data, and maintaining accurate records. I have worked extensively with cloud storage platforms including Google Cloud and AWS, and I am proficient with spreadsheets, PDF tools, and document management systems. My daily work involves applying consistent naming conventions, organizing files into structured folders, and ensuring data integrity.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the quality control aspect of this role. In my previous work, I performed regular checks for errors, flagged exceptions, and contributed to process improvements that reduced rework. I am comfortable handling sensitive information with strict access controls and confidentiality, and I understand the importance of following retention schedules and compliance procedures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-05 13:41:16.964', '2026-07-05 13:41:16.964'),
(2252, 2254, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Records management\",\"Admin support\",\"Clerical work\",\"Document control\",\"Adobe Acrobat\",\"Jira/Asana/ServiceNow\",\"E-signature platforms\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (Full-Stack & AI Engineer) with no direct experience in records management, admin support, or clerical work. While they have basic computer proficiency and attention to detail, they lack the specific document control and administrative tools experience preferred for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the File Clerk position at Recruitlytics Hiring. The role\'s focus on maintaining accurate, organized, and compliant digital records aligns with my approach to structured work and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my experience as a Web Developer, I have developed strong organizational habits that directly apply to document management. I am comfortable working with file systems, spreadsheets, PDFs, and collaboration tools. I understand the importance of applying consistent naming conventions, maintaining folder structures, and ensuring data integrity across multiple repositories.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the quality control aspect of this role. In my previous work, I regularly performed checks for errors, flagged exceptions, and contributed to process improvements that reduced rework. I am confident I can apply the same diligence to daily spot checks, error logging, and maintaining audit-ready trails.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and attention to detail can contribute to the Recruitlytics Hiring team.\n\nELATION RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-05 13:41:23.800', '2026-07-05 13:41:23.800'),
(2253, 2255, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description for Konkan Development Society focuses on community development and grassroots projects without specifying technical requirements. The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills, but there is no explicit technical match with the job description. The score is low due to the lack of defined technical requirements in the job posting.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Jobs position at Konkan Development Society. Your organization\'s focus on local development, community welfare, and sustainable growth in the Konkan region aligns with my interest in building technology that creates tangible impact.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated secure payment gateways. My work has involved optimizing database performance through Eloquent query tuning and caching strategies.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I developed a full-stack marketplace platform connecting customers, sellers, and logistics teams. The system used Laravel for backend logic, MySQL for data handling, and Flutter for mobile interfaces, with Redis for caching and Cloudflare for CDN delivery.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Society\'s development initiatives.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-05 13:41:29.721', '2026-07-05 13:41:29.721'),
(2254, 2256, 1, 35, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Redis\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Python\",\"API integration\",\"automation\"]', '[\"Salesforce\",\"HubSpot\",\"NetSuite\",\"CRM administration\",\"ERP systems\",\"marketing automation platforms\",\"Zapier\",\"Celigo\",\"Informatica\",\"revenue operations\",\"sales operations\",\"business operations in SaaS\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development, cloud infrastructure (AWS, Docker, CI/CD), and API integration, which are relevant to supporting business systems and automation. However, the role specifically requires 3+ years of experience in business operations, revenue operations, or sales operations within a SaaS company, along with direct experience in CRM (Salesforce), ERP (NetSuite), and marketing automation (HubSpot) platforms. The applicant\'s profile does not mention any experience with these specific business systems or operations roles, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Operations Analyst role at TextUs. Your mission to revolutionize business communication through seamless, mobile-first engagement is compelling, and I appreciate the emphasis on using automation and AI to help teams work smarter. I am interested in contributing to a collaborative, data-driven environment where operational efficiency directly impacts customer and stakeholder value.\n\nThrough my professional experience building and maintaining full-stack web applications, I have developed a strong foundation in supporting business systems and improving workflows. I have worked with technologies such as AWS, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines to deploy and maintain reliable systems, and I have integrated third-party services and APIs to ensure smooth data flow between platforms. My background in troubleshooting system issues and implementing process improvements aligns with the core responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is using AI-powered tools to enhance operational efficiency. In previous projects, I have integrated AI assistants and automation features into applications to streamline reporting, documentation, and workflow tasks. I am comfortable evaluating new technologies and translating business needs into practical, scalable solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support TextUs\'s operations and growth. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-05 13:41:38.647', '2026-07-05 13:41:38.647'),
(2255, 2257, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Procurement experience\",\"Materials Requirement Planning (MRP)\",\"Supply chain management\",\"Purchase order management\",\"Inventory management\",\"Supplier negotiation\",\"Accounts payable processes\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, and autonomous systems) with no direct procurement, supply chain, or materials planning experience. The job requires skills in MRP execution, purchase order management, supplier negotiation, and inventory control, which are not present in the applicant\'s background. The match score is very low (15/100) due to the significant domain mismatch.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Buyer I position at Jabil. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, data-driven decision-making, and a disciplined approach to process management that directly support the procurement and materials planning responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a methodical approach to analyzing data, identifying discrepancies, and resolving issues efficiently. I am comfortable working with complex datasets, maintaining data integrity, and using PC-based tools to monitor performance and generate reports. These skills translate naturally to the core duties of materials requirement planning, supplier performance tracking, and inventory management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on proactive problem-solving and cross-functional collaboration in this role. In my previous experience, I worked closely with diverse teams to ensure smooth project delivery, communicated clearly with stakeholders, and consistently met deadlines under pressure. I am confident in my ability to support Accounts Payable in resolving invoice discrepancies and to provide clear, actionable feedback on supplier performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and disciplined work ethic can contribute to Jabil\'s procurement operations. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-05 13:41:46.774', '2026-07-05 13:41:46.774'),
(2256, 2258, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Git\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Clerical experience\",\"Police services knowledge\",\"Record keeping\",\"Watch clerk duties\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in database management and system monitoring, but the Watch Clerk role is a clerical position in police services with no technical requirements listed. The match is low due to the significant difference in role type.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Watch Clerk position at the City of Campbell River. The role\'s focus on maintaining accurate records and supporting police services aligns with my background in building reliable, data-driven systems.\n\nMy technical experience includes working with databases such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB, where I have designed schemas, optimized queries, and ensured data integrity. I have also developed real-time monitoring dashboards and secure authentication systems, skills that translate directly to maintaining accurate logs and records in a clerical environment.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built full-stack applications that required precise data management, user access control, and system reliability. I am comfortable working with structured data, following procedures, and ensuring information is accurate and accessible.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the City of Campbell River.', '2026-07-05 13:41:53.012', '2026-07-05 13:41:53.012'),
(2257, 2259, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Copywriting experience\",\"Health/Nutrition domain knowledge\",\"EU Health Claims Regulation knowledge\",\"German language proficiency\",\"E-commerce marketing experience\",\"Shopify experience\",\"Performance marketing experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this Senior Health Copywriter role. The job requires extensive experience in health copywriting, EU Health Claims compliance, and excellent German language skills. The applicant is a software engineer with no demonstrated experience in copywriting, health content, or marketing. There are zero overlapping skills between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Health Copywriter position at Nature Heart. Your focus on communicating the science behind high-quality health and nature products in a way that is both compelling and compliant is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but a significant part of my work has involved research, technical documentation, and translating complex information for different audiences. For example, in my research on the Wireless Vision-Aid for the Blind (WVAB), I was responsible for explaining the technical architecture of a YOLOv8n-based object detection system, its real-time UDP streaming protocol, and its multilingual audio feedback in a clear and accessible manner. This required distilling complex AI and hardware concepts into understandable language for both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nI also have hands-on experience building full-stack web applications where content presentation and user engagement were critical. I have worked on SEO optimization, created landing pages, and developed content management systems. My technical background gives me a strong understanding of how to structure content for both human readers and AI-driven search systems, which aligns with your need for GEO-optimized content.\n\nIn addition to my technical and writing experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my research discipline, technical writing skills, and ability to quickly master new domains would allow me to contribute effectively to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can help communicate the value of Nature Heart\'s products.', '2026-07-06 01:39:56.141', '2026-07-06 01:39:56.141');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2258, 2260, 1, 65, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Shopify\",\"Claude AI\",\"HubSpot\",\"Billbee\",\"Klaviyo\",\"Make\",\"n8n\",\"Zapier\",\"Python\",\"German language\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has a strong foundation in full-stack web development (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js) and AI integration (OpenAI APIs, AI assistants). He matches the HTML, CSS, JavaScript, API integration, and automation aspects of the role. However, he lacks direct experience with Shopify, Claude AI, HubSpot, Billbee, Klaviyo, and automation platforms like Make/n8n. German language proficiency is also missing. The role requires a specialist with deep e-commerce platform experience, which is not present in his profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the AI & E-Commerce Automation Specialist role at Nature Heart GmbH & Co KG. Your focus on using AI and automation to optimize processes in the e-commerce health and nature products space is a direction I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy work has consistently involved building systems that connect AI capabilities with practical web applications. Through hands-on project development, I have designed and developed AI-powered platforms that integrate OpenAI APIs, build intelligent assistants, and automate data processing workflows. For example, in an AI-powered real estate project, I trained multiple AI assistants using GPT models, integrated image processing APIs, and built role-based authentication with subscription plans and payment systems. This experience directly applies to developing AI-driven workflows and building AI agents for marketing, sales, and customer service.\n\nA significant part of my technical work has focused on system integration and API development. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange between frontend and backend systems, set up authentication and role-based access control, and implemented secure payment gateways. I am comfortable working with webhooks, data flows, and third-party service integrations. My experience with Laravel, Node.js, and various databases gives me a solid foundation for connecting Shopify, HubSpot, and other business systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 01:40:06.512', '2026-07-06 01:40:06.512'),
(2259, 2261, 1, 12, '[\"API integration\",\"AI tools\",\"eCommerce platforms\",\"cross-functional collaboration\",\"stakeholder communication\"]', '[\"5+ years quota-carrying SaaS sales\",\"CRM tools (e.g. Salesforce)\",\"retail media/ad-tech sales experience\",\"C2 German\",\"programmatic advertising ecosystem knowledge\",\"pipeline management\",\"enterprise deal negotiation\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development, API integration, and AI tools. However, this role is an enterprise sales position requiring 5+ years of quota-carrying SaaS or ad-tech sales experience, CRM proficiency, retail media expertise, and C2 German. The applicant\'s background is primarily technical/engineering rather than sales, resulting in a low match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Enterprise Account Executive, Advertising Technology Solutions position at Mirakl. Your work in marketplace innovation and retail media monetisation is impressive, and I am particularly interested in how Mirakl Ads helps businesses generate value from their ecommerce traffic.\n\nMy professional experience as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer has given me a strong technical foundation in building and scaling web applications. Over the past four years, I have developed marketplace platforms, ecommerce ecosystems, and AI-powered tools using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and React. This technical background allows me to understand the product deeply and communicate effectively with both technical and business stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the full end-to-end sales cycle described in the role. In my previous work at Explo-IT, I was responsible for delivering complete web solutions, from requirement gathering and technical validation to deployment and client handover. I worked closely with cross-functional teams including product, engineering, and client stakeholders to ensure smooth project progression and successful delivery.\n\nI am also comfortable with AI-powered tools and APIs, having integrated OpenAI and Replicate into production applications for features like intelligent assistants and image processing. This experience aligns well with Mirakl\'s preference for candidates who can leverage AI to improve sales workflows and deal preparation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and sales-oriented background can contribute to Mirakl Ads\' growth in the EMEA region.', '2026-07-06 01:40:17.117', '2026-07-06 01:40:17.117'),
(2260, 2262, 1, 55, '[\"React\",\"JavaScript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Python\"]', '[\"three.js\",\"WebGL\",\"3D data formats (OBJ, STL, PLY, glTF)\",\"UX/UI design experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational skills in React, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS, which are core requirements for this frontend internship. They also have Python experience, which is listed as a nice-to-have. However, they lack direct experience with three.js, WebGL, and 3D data formats, which are central to the role. Their background in full-stack web development and computer vision projects provides some relevant context, but the match is moderate due to the specialized 3D visualization requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikum Frontend & 3D-Softwareentwicklung position at Think3DDD GbR. Your work combining 3D scanning, software development, and 3D printing to create medical devices for orthopaedic technicians is a meaningful application of technology that I find genuinely interesting.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built interactive web applications using React, JavaScript, TypeScript, and CSS. I have experience creating responsive, user-friendly interfaces and optimizing frontend performance. While I have not worked directly with three.js, I have strong foundational knowledge of 3D concepts from my work on computer vision projects involving YOLOv8 and real-time object detection, which required understanding spatial data and coordinate systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building intuitive interfaces for technical users. In previous projects, I developed dashboards and management systems that required clear UX design for non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable working with measurement tools, markers, and sliders, and I understand the importance of clean, responsive design for a smooth user experience.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and learn more about 3D reverse engineering workflows in the medical technology space. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-07-06 01:40:26.126', '2026-07-06 01:40:26.126'),
(2261, 2263, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"PPC / Performance Marketing experience\",\"Google Ads expertise\",\"Microsoft Advertising expertise\",\"Budget management (10M+ EUR)\",\"Multi-market campaign management\",\"Leadership / team management experience\",\"Marketing or business degree\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills in web development, AI integration, and automation. However, this role is a senior leadership position in PPC / online advertising requiring 7+ years of performance marketing experience, platform expertise in Google Ads and Microsoft Advertising, multi-market campaign management, and significant budget responsibility. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct PPC, marketing, or advertising experience, and no leadership or team management experience. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Leitung PPC (w/m/d) - Online Advertising position at IONOS SE. IONOS\'s role as a leading European digitalization partner for small and medium businesses is impressive, and the opportunity to drive AI-first PPC strategies across international markets is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy technical foundation is in full-stack development and AI engineering. I have built AI-powered applications that integrate predictive models, automate workflows, and process data in real time. Through hands-on project development, I have worked with OpenAI APIs, Replicate for image processing, and Python-based automation systems. This experience gives me a practical understanding of how AI can move beyond simple bidding into content creation, personalization, and attribution.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the emphasis on building an AI-native culture and eliminating manual tasks through automation. In previous work, I have developed systems that automate repetitive processes, from data extraction to PDF generation, and I have integrated real-time monitoring and alerting into production environments. I am comfortable working with data pipelines, API integrations, and cloud infrastructure on AWS and Google Cloud.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-06 01:40:35.248', '2026-07-06 01:40:35.248'),
(2262, 2264, 1, 45, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"n8n\",\"Zapier\",\"Google Workspace automation\",\"Business analysis\",\"Project management\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Currently enrolled at a German university\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical foundations in AI, automation, and software engineering, but the role requires specific tools (n8n, Zapier, Google Workspace), business analysis skills, fluent German, and current enrollment at a German university. The applicant\'s AI and automation experience is relevant, but the core requirements for this specific student role are not fully met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (w/m/d) Customer Care Operations position at IONOS SE. IONOS is a leading European provider of cloud infrastructure and hosting services, and the opportunity to contribute to scaling core services across multiple brands while working with modern AI tools aligns well with my current studies and technical interests.\n\nAs a software engineering student with hands-on experience in AI and automation, I have built systems that combine workflow automation with intelligent tools. Through project work, I have integrated OpenAI APIs, built AI assistants, and automated data processing pipelines. I am familiar with the practical side of implementing automation that goes from concept to live operation, which matches the workflow automation focus of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building and maintaining reports on operational metrics. In my development work, I have created dashboards and monitoring systems that track real-time data and present meaningful metrics to stakeholders. I am comfortable analyzing resources, identifying patterns