(2263, 2265, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Product Ownership experience\",\"E-commerce domain expertise\",\"Agile/Scrum methodology\",\"JIRA/Confluence\",\"German language\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"User story creation\",\"Backlog prioritization\",\"Conversion rate optimization\",\"UX/UI design knowledge\",\"Market analysis\",\"KPI reporting\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, MySQL) and experience building e-commerce platforms, but the Senior Product Owner role requires extensive product management, stakeholder management, agile methodology, and e-commerce domain expertise that are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The role is a senior product management position, not a development role, and the applicant\'s experience is primarily technical rather than product ownership focused.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Owner (w/m/d) E-Commerce position at IONOS SE. As a full-stack engineer with experience building and optimizing e-commerce platforms, I am drawn to IONOS\'s role as a leading European digitalization partner for small and medium businesses, and I see a strong connection between my technical background and the product ownership responsibilities described in this role.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL to build scalable web applications and online shop systems. I have been responsible for end-to-end feature delivery, from understanding user needs to implementing solutions that improve conversion rates and streamline checkout flows. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of what development teams