(2264, 2266, 1, 35, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"5+ years of dedicated web/digital analytics experience\",\"Adobe Analytics\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Matomo\",\"BI tools (Tableau, Looker)\",\"A/B testing and CRO experience\",\"Attribution modeling\",\"Customer journey analysis\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has foundational web development skills (HTML, CSS, JS, SQL) that are relevant to understanding web technologies and data flows. However, the role requires 5+ years of specialized experience in web/digital analytics, proficiency with analytics platforms (GA4, Adobe Analytics, Matomo), BI tools, A/B testing, and attribution modeling. The applicant\'s professional experience is in web development rather than analytics, and German language proficiency is not indicated. The match is low due to the senior specialized nature of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Senior) Website Analyst – E-Commerce Management position at IONOS SE. IONOS\'s role as a leading European digitalization partner for small and medium businesses is impressive, and the opportunity to work at the intersection of data, product, and business in a high-traffic e-commerce environment is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development, with a focus on building and optimizing data-driven web applications. I have a strong command of core web technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, which I have used extensively to create responsive, user-facing interfaces. This technical foundation gives me a practical understanding of how client-side and server-side tracking mechanisms work, and how data quality can be impacted at every stage of the user journey.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked on projects that required me to think analytically about user behavior and system performance. I have built RESTful APIs, optimized database queries with MySQL and PostgreSQL, and implemented real-time features using WebSockets. These experiences have taught me to approach data not just as numbers, but as indicators of user friction and opportunities for optimization. I am comfortable working with SQL for data extraction and analysis, and I understand the importance of clean, reliable data for making sound business decisions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical mindset and web development experience can contribute to the IONOS e-commerce team.', '2026-07-06 01:41:07.676', '2026-07-06 01:41:07.676'),
(2265, 2267, 1, 35, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"Digital Art Direction\",\"Visual Design\",\"UI/UX Design (as primary role)\",\"Motion Design\",\"Animation\",\"Typography (as specialized skill)\",\"Composition\",\"Creative Direction\",\"Team Leadership\",\"Design Systems (as primary responsibility)\"]', 'The applicant has relevant technical skills (Figma, frontend development) but the role is primarily a senior creative/design leadership position requiring years of specialized experience in Digital Art Direction, Visual Design, and UI/UX Design. The applicant\'s background is more technical (full-stack development) than design-focused, and lacks the required experience in motion design, animation, creative direction, and team leadership.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Digital Art Director (w/m/d) position at IONOS SE. As a full-stack and AI engineer with strong experience in frontend development and UI/UX design, I am drawn to the opportunity to shape the digital experience of the IONOS shop from concept to execution. IONOS\'s position as a leading European digitalization partner for small and medium businesses is particularly interesting, and I appreciate the focus on data-driven, user-centered design.\n\nMy professional experience has given me a strong foundation in visual design and frontend implementation. I have worked extensively with Figma for designing interfaces and prototyping, and I have built responsive, conversion-focused UIs using Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS. I have a strong sense of layout, typography, visual hierarchy, and digital aesthetics, and I am comfortable