(2266, 2268, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Excellent German language skills (written and spoken)\",\"Sales affinity and negotiation skills\",\"Customer relationship management experience\",\"Call center or customer service experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this customer retention role. The job requires excellent German language skills, sales affinity, and customer service experience, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant has strong English skills and general IT proficiency, but these are secondary requirements. The overall match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Call Center Mitarbeiter (w/m/d) Kundenbindung position at IONOS SE. IONOS is a leading European provider of cloud infrastructure and hosting services, and I appreciate the company\'s focus on building lasting customer relationships through high-quality service.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and interpersonal skills through years of client-facing work. In my previous roles as a Web Developer, I regularly communicated with stakeholders, gathered requirements, explained technical solutions, and addressed concerns. This experience has taught me how to listen actively, build trust, and clearly articulate value.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work directly with customers to maintain and strengthen relationships. I am comfortable communicating via phone, email, and chat, and I am confident in my ability to understand customer needs, present solutions clearly, and help retain their business. I am also proficient with various IT tools and can quickly adapt to new systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to the IONOS team.', '2026-07-06 01:41:29.491', '2026-07-06 01:41:29.491'),
(2267, 2269, 1, 35, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\"]', '[\"Canva\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Capcut\",\"Adobe Premiere\",\"Videoschnitt\",\"Design-Studium\",\"Deutsch fließend\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills (Figma, HTML, CSS, Tailwind) for UI design and web development, but the role specifically requires a current student in a design-related field, fluency in German, and proficiency with Adobe Creative Suite and video editing tools, which are not present in the profile. The match is partial and primarily in the technical implementation side rather than the core design/UX focus.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent UX/UI Grafiker position at Activate Media GmbH. Your work with clients like Nestlé, BMW, and Deutsche Bahn, combined with your award-winning digital solutions, makes this an environment where I want to grow and contribute.\n\nI bring practical experience with Figma for UI design, wireframing, and prototyping. Through hands-on project development, I have designed and built responsive interfaces using HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, and JavaScript. I understand that good UX is not decoration but function, and I approach design from the user\'s perspective.\n\nIn previous work, I have created screens and visual components for web applications, ensuring design consistency and usability. I have collaborated with development teams to translate design specifications into working interfaces, learning how to balance visual quality with technical feasibility.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English