(2268, 2270, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"WordPress (implied via web development experience)\"]', '[\"Marketing strategy experience\",\"Social media management experience\",\"Event/messe planning experience\",\"German language skills\",\"Marketing-specific education or certification\"]', 'The applicant has strong web development skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP, Laravel) which partially overlap with the website maintenance and content layouting aspects of the Marketing Manager role. However, the core marketing responsibilities (strategy creation, social media management, event planning, content marketing) and required German language proficiency are not supported by the applicant\'s profile. The match is low overall.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing Manager position at batch2 engineering GmbH. Your work in battery and hydrogen safety is technically demanding and highly relevant to the energy transition, and I find the combination of deep engineering knowledge with practical, no-bureaucracy operations genuinely compelling.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack web development, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining production web applications. I have hands-on experience with WordPress, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Laravel, and modern frontend frameworks. This technical foundation allows me to manage websites effectively, update content, and ensure that digital properties remain accurate, fast, and professional.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility for maintaining and updating your company websites. In my previous roles, I have managed the full lifecycle of web projects from UI design and content layout to deployment and ongoing maintenance. I am comfortable working with content management systems, optimizing page performance, and ensuring that technical and marketing teams stay aligned on web-related tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my web development and technical marketing support skills can contribute to batch2 engineering GmbH.', '2026-07-06 01:41:49.113', '2026-07-06 01:41:49.113'),
