(2270, 2272, 1, 85, '[\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"APIs\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"MySQL\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"AWS\"]', '[\"Vue JS (mentioned as alternative)\",\"Angular JS (mentioned as alternative)\"]', 'Strong match for this web development internship. The applicant has direct experience with the core stack (React, Next.js, Express.js, Tailwind CSS) and has built full-stack applications professionally. He also has Git, Linux server, and API fundamentals, and is open to AI-coding tools. He is currently studying Software Engineering and is available for a Pflichtpraktikum.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pflichtpraktikum Webentwicklung position at frechekoepfe GmbH. Your focus on building modern websites and complex webapps with React, Next.js, Express.js, and Tailwind CSS aligns directly with the technologies I use daily. I am particularly drawn to your approach of combining real client projects with mentorship and internal training, which matches the kind of practical learning environment I am looking for.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built full-stack web applications using React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. One relevant example is a Travel Agency App where I developed the entire frontend with Next.js, TypeScript, Material UI, and Tailwind CSS, integrated Google Maps, and built the backend API with NestJS, TypeScript, and MySQL. I also deployed the frontend on AWS Amplify and the backend on AWS EC2. This experience taught me how to build responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces and connect them to robust backend services.\n\nIn previous professional work as a Web Developer, I d