(2271, 2273, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Account Management\",\"Sales (Cold Calling)\",\"Recruiting (Interviews, Assessments, Profiling)\",\"Project Management (360-degree)\",\"German language (fluent)\",\"Drivers License\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in consulting, sales, recruiting, or account management. The role requires German fluency and a drivers license, neither of which are present in the profile. The match is low, but the applicant demonstrates discipline, English fluency, and a willingness to learn through structured onboarding.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the (Junior) Consultant role at SpotOn Solutions. Your focus on construction, trades, and engineering, combined with a structured onboarding program for career changers, aligns with what I am looking for in my next step.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack applications and working directly with clients. I am used to taking ownership of projects, communicating requirements clearly, and delivering results under pressure. These skills translate naturally into consulting, where understanding client needs and managing relationships is central.\n\nWhat stands out to me about SpotOn is the emphasis on learning by doing. The combination of account management, recruiting, and 360-degree project management is exactly the kind of hands-on environment where I thrive. I am disciplined, comfortable with cold starts, and motivated by clear goals and performance-based rewards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I a