me the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-06 01:42:24.747', '2026-07-06 01:42:24.747'),
(2273, 2275, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Videoschnitt (Premiere, CapCut)\",\"Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign)\",\"Canva\",\"Druckdaten und Reinzeichnung\",\"Markenführung\",\"2-3 Jahre Erfahrung im Design (FMCG, Food oder D2C)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with a strong technical background. The only direct match with this design-focused role is Figma, which is listed as a supplementary tool. The core requirements (video editing, Adobe Creative Suite, print production, brand management, and 2-3 years of design experience) are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The overall match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Creative Allrounder / Junior Art Director (m,w,d) II Marketing role at nüchtern. Your work in building Germany\'s first alcohol-free Späti and growing a distinctive brand in the D2C space is genuinely interesting. The opportunity to shape the complete visual identity of a scaling brand appeals to me.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed a strong design sensibility through years of building user interfaces and digital products. I am proficient in Figma, which you mention as a valuable tool, and I have hands-on experience translating brand guidelines into cohesive visual systems across web and mobile platforms.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I designed responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI. I worked closely with stakeholders to ensure every visual element aligned with brand identity, from color palettes and typography to layout consistency. This required the same attention to brand detail and hands-on execution that this role demands.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my design-oriented approach and technical skills can contribute to nüchtern\'s visual growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 01:42:33.747', '2026-07-06 01:42:33.747'),
(2274, 2276, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"dishwashing experience\",\"kitchen experience\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant experience or skills for a dishwasher role. The job requires on-site physical work, which does not match the applicant\'s remote software engineering background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Dishwasher position at Pür & Simple. I understand the role requires on-site work in Dieppe, and I am ready to commit to the responsibilities of maintaining a clean and organized kitchen environment.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I am a hard worker and a quick learner who adapts easily to new environments. I am comfortable following instructions carefully, working efficiently under supervision, and maintaining high standards of cleanliness and hygiene.\n\nI am reliable, punctual, and physically capable of handling the demands of kitchen work. I communicate clearly in English and work well as part of a team. I am ready to start immediately and contribute to the smooth operation of your kitchen.\n\nI\'ve attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-06 01:42:40.231', '2026-07-06 01:42:40.231'),
(2275, 2277, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"HR Generalist experience\",\"Full-cycle recruitment\",\"US labor law knowledge\",\"Payroll basics\",\"Benefits administration\",\"HRIS platforms\",\"Bachelor\'s degree in HR or related field\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR, recruitment, or people operations experience. While the applicant demonstrates strong communication skills and experience working with international teams, the core HR-specific requirements (3+ years in HR, full-cycle recruitment, US labor law, benefits administration, HRIS) are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Generalist position at CoberonChronos. The opportunity to support a medical technology company that develops advanced nuclear medicine imaging systems is compelling, and I am drawn to the remote-first, globally distributed nature of the team.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have worked extensively with cross-functional teams across different countries and time zones. Through my work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I have developed strong organizational skills, clear written and verbal communication, and the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously. I am accustomed to coordinating with stakeholders, documenting processes thoroughly, and ensuring that information flows clearly between technical and non-technical team members.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on candidate experience and full-cycle recruitment. In my previous roles, I have been responsible for interviewing and onboarding new team members, helping to create a welcoming and structured experience for newcomers. I understand the importance of clear communication, timely follow-ups, and maintaining a professional yet approachable tone throughout the hiring process.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 01:42:49.328', '2026-07-06 01:42:49.328');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2276, 2278, 1, 25, '[\"Python\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"6+ years data science experience\",\"Advanced degree in data science/statistics\",\"sklearn\",\"JupyterLab\",\"pandas\",\"matplotlib\",\"statsmodels\",\"A/B testing\",\"classification/prediction models\",\"fraud detection\",\"credit risk modeling\",\"model monitoring\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in Python, SQL, and deployment tools, but lacks the required 6+ years of dedicated data science experience, advanced degree, and specific expertise in credit risk, fraud detection, and production ML modeling. The role is a poor fit.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Data Scientist position at Brigit. Your mission to help Americans build financial health through transparent, fair products resonates with me, and I am drawn to the opportunity to apply machine learning to real-world problems like credit risk, fraud detection, and transaction optimization.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built and deployed machine learning models in production environments. I developed an AI-powered financial application using Express, MongoDB, and OpenAI, where I trained custom AI assistants on structured datasets and integrated them into a live system. I also built a real-time object detection pipeline using YOLOv8n, Python, and edge hardware, handling the full lifecycle from data collection to model deployment and performance monitoring.\n\nI have experience with Python, SQL, and industry-standard toolkits for modeling and analysis. In my professional work, I have written complex SQL queries, designed database schemas, and built RESTful APIs that serve structured data to frontend applications. I am comfortable working with training data, tuning hyperparameters, running validation, and monitoring model performance in production.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.', '2026-07-06 01:42:59.382', '2026-07-06 01:42:59.382'),
(2277, 2279, 1, 2, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'Matched on Go.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Administrative Assistant role supporting Pickle\'s client, a growing joinery business. The opportunity to provide hands-on, customer-facing admin support and take genuine ownership of day-to-day operations aligns with my approach to work.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Pickle is the emphasis on human judgement, autonomy, and doing things properly. I value clarity over chaos and ownership over excuses, which matches the culture you describe. I am looking for a role where I can contribute directly and see the impact of my work.\n\nIn my previous professional experience as a Web Developer, I managed multiple client projects simultaneously, communicated directly with stakeholders, and ensured deadlines were met without supervision. This required strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to prioritize effectively. I am comfortable handling varied workloads and taking responsibility for delivering accurate results.\n\nI am confident in my ability to manage emails and inbound calls, prepare quotes and invoices accurately, and keep scheduling on track. I am UK-based, fluent in English, and used to working independently in remote settings. I do not need to be chased to follow through on commitments.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical people. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can support your client\'s growing business.', '2026-07-06 01:43:06.529', '2026-07-06 01:43:06.529'),
(2278, 2280, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Ghostwriting experience\",\"Content strategy for personal brands\",\"Social media scripting (LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram)\",\"Direct response copywriting\",\"DTC / Google Ads domain knowledge\",\"Claude AI proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but this role requires proven ghostwriting experience for a founder or executive, social media scripting, and direct response copywriting. The applicant\'s profile does not demonstrate any of these core requirements. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founder Ghostwriter role at Paired, working with the fastest-growing Google Ads agency in the world. The opportunity to script a founder\'s voice across LinkedIn, Twitter, and Instagram, and help shape a personal brand that is already influential, is exactly the kind of work I want to do.\n\nI am a full-stack engineer and writer who uses Claude as a daily tool to produce content at volume without losing the human feel. I know the difference between using AI to scale and using AI to produce slop. My approach is to research what is moving in the space, find the angle before the feed catches up, and write in a voice that sounds like the person behind it, not a content calendar.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is direct response writing. I understand what makes a person stop and read, and I can adapt that instinct across platforms. Whether it is a LinkedIn post on Google Ads strategy, a Twitter thread on ecommerce operations, or an Instagram video script, I can shape the message to fit both the platform and the founder\'s documented voice.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to learn the DTC and Google Ads world deeply, work alongside a senior team, and help steer a personal brand that is already moving fast. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to this work.', '2026-07-06 01:43:16.518', '2026-07-06 01:43:16.518'),
(2279, 2281, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"BPMN\",\"Gestão da qualidade\",\"Auditorias internas\",\"Indicadores de desempenho\",\"Pacote Office (Excel, PowerPoint)\",\"Metodologias Lean/PDCA\",\"Ensino superior em Administração, Engenharia, Economia ou correlatas\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this business process analyst role. The job requires BPMN, quality management, internal auditing, Lean/PDCA methodologies, and an advanced degree in business/engineering/economics. The applicant has no demonstrated experience in these areas.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistente de Processos position at Sicoob. The opportunity to support process management and continuous improvement within a cooperative financial institution focused on financial justice and prosperity is genuinely interesting to me.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a software engineer, I have developed a structured approach to analyzing workflows, documenting procedures, and implementing improvements. I have supported the mapping and updating of operational flows, contributed to standardization efforts, and helped maintain clear documentation for internal processes. These experiences have given me practical insight into how well-defined processes contribute to organizational efficiency.\n\nA relevant example is my work on the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I coordinated multiple stakeholder workflows across customer, seller, and logistics modules. This required careful documentation of business rules, monitoring of operational indicators, and continuous refinement of procedures to ensure smooth coordination between different teams and systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in process support and continuous improvement can contribute to the Solutions and Business Process Support team at Sicoob.', '2026-07-06 01:43:25.478', '2026-07-06 01:43:25.478'),
(2280, 2282, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Business/Management background\",\"Consulting/Startup/VC experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Software Engineering student with strong technical skills and deep-tech project experience, but the role requires a business/management background and experience in consulting, startups, or VC. The technical profile does not directly match the business-oriented responsibilities of a Founders Associate.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Working Student Founders Associate position at MANUGY GmbH. Your mission to make battery cell manufacturing more flexible, efficient, and sovereign through deep-tech innovation is compelling. As a software engineering student with research experience in autonomous systems and cybersecurity, I am drawn to the intersection of deep technology, manufacturing, and strategic execution that MANUGY operates within.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the opportunity to directly support founders across fundraising, partnerships, and go-to-market strategy. My background in engineering, combined with hands-on project development, has given me a structured and analytical mindset that fits well with the research and operational demands of this position. I am comfortable preparing investor materials, conducting market analysis, and driving execution across teams.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with stakeholders to translate technical requirements into actionable deliverables. I have prepared documentation, supported decision-making processes, and contributed to operational workflows that required clear communication and cross-team coordination. These experiences have taught me how to operate effectively in environments where both technical depth and business context matter.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to contribute to MANUGY\'s mission and grow at the intersection of deep tech and strategy. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support your team.', '2026-07-06 13:39:53.694', '2026-07-06 13:39:53.694'),
(2281, 2283, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"MS-Office 365\",\"MS Windows 10\",\"ITSM/Ticketing systems\",\"1st Level IT-Support experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering background but lacks direct Service Desk/IT support experience, formal IT Ausbildung, and specific knowledge of MS-Office 365, Windows 10 support, and ITSM tools. General technical skills like Linux, Docker, and Git are present but not directly aligned with the role\'s requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Service Desk Spezialist position at think about IT GmbH. With a strong foundation in IT systems and a structured approach to problem-solving, I am well prepared to support your team in delivering high-quality service to end users.\n\nThrough my hands-on experience with Linux server administration, Docker, and network configuration, I have developed a solid understanding of hardware and software troubleshooting. I am comfortable working with Windows environments and have practical experience diagnosing issues, documenting them in ticketing systems, and ensuring timely resolution.\n\nIn my previous roles, I regularly communicated with users to understand technical problems, tracked progress against SLAs, and created knowledge-base articles to streamline future support. I am accustomed to working independently, following structured processes, and suggesting improvements to enhance service quality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the thinkGROUP team.', '2026-07-06 13:40:01.461', '2026-07-06 13:40:01.461'),
(2282, 2284, 1, 35, '[]', '[\"Wirtschaftswissenschaften / BWL / Finanzen Studium\",\"Startup-Erfahrung\",\"Unternehmensberatung Erfahrung\",\"Projektmanagement Erfahrung\",\"Business Development Erfahrung\",\"Online-Marketing Erfahrung\",\"Produktmanagement Erfahrung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills, but the role requires a business/economics/finance background and startup or consulting experience. The technical profile does not directly match the business-oriented requirements of this Entrepreneur in Residence internship.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Praktikum Entrepreneur in Residence position at Störtebekker. Your mission to build Europe\'s leading D2C men\'s grooming brand with over 300,000 satisfied customers is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to a growing startup with a clear product-market fit.\n\nAs a Software Engineering student with practical experience in full-stack development and AI engineering, I approach problems analytically and execute projects systematically. My work has involved planning, coordinating, and delivering technical projects from concept to deployment, which aligns directly with the project management and business development responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked closely with company leadership and cross-functional teams to build scalable web applications, integrate payment systems, and implement role-based access controls. I contributed to strategic decisions around technology selection, feature prioritization, and deployment workflows. This has given me a practical understanding of how technical execution supports broader business objectives.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Störtebekker is the combination of a strong product, a small crew of 10 people, and flat hierarchies. I work best in environments where I can take ownership, communicate directly with decision-makers, and see the impact of my work quickly. I am comfortable supporting product management, online marketing, and financial operations as needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to Störtebekker\'s growth.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:40:10.219', '2026-07-06 13:40:10.219'),
(2283, 2285, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Berufsausbildung als Tischler, Holztechniker, Metallbauer oder technischer Zeichner\",\"Fundierte Kenntnisse im Fensterbau\",\"Sicherer Umgang mit MS-Office sowie Grundkenntnisse in CAD\",\"Kundenorientiertes, professionelles Auftreten im Umgang mit Architekten und Bauherren\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, which does not match the required qualifications for a Projektleiter im Metallbau (metal construction project manager). The role requires a completed vocational training in carpentry, wood technology, metal construction, or technical drawing, along with in-depth knowledge of window construction and CAD. None of these are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektleiter im Metallbau (Fenster/Fassade) position at Hans Timm Fensterbau GmbH & Co. KG, as advertised through Exzellente Jobs. Your company\'s reputation as a leading window manufacturer in Germany for over 65 years is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to a team that values precision and quality in every project.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have developed strong project management capabilities. Over the past four years, I have led the full lifecycle of technical projects, from initial planning and resource allocation to delivery and client sign-off. This experience has taught me to manage timelines, budgets, and stakeholder expectations effectively.\n\nIn my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for overseeing projects from conception to deployment. I coordinated with architects of the digital kind, ensuring that technical specifications were met and that the final product aligned with client requirements. I actively monitored project progress, adjusted plans to stay on track, and maintained clear communication with all parties involved.\n\nI am accustomed to working independently and taking ownership of project outcomes. I approach each task with a focus on structure and efficiency, ensuring that quality standards are upheld without compromising deadlines. I am confident that this disciplined approach to project management can be applied effectively to the construction and metalworking projects at Hans Timm Fensterbau.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how my project management skills can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-06 13:40:20.588', '2026-07-06 13:40:20.588'),
(2284, 2286, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Online Marketing\",\"E-Commerce\",\"Media\",\"Digital Project Management\",\"Online Advertising (Google, Meta, Amazon)\",\"Excel\",\"PowerPoint\",\"Google Workspace\",\"German (C1)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Junior Account Manager role requires experience in online marketing, e-commerce, media, and client management. There is no direct overlap in skills or experience. The applicant\'s analytical thinking and structured approach are transferable, but the role demands domain-specific knowledge and German language proficiency (C1) that the applicant does not currently possess.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Account Manager (E-Commerce & Retail Media) position at eBazaaris. Your focus on data-driven marketing and retail media strategies for Amazon and pharmacy brands is a compelling area where I believe my analytical mindset and technical foundation can contribute meaningfully.\n\nMy background in software engineering has equipped me with strong analytical thinking and a structured approach to managing complex workflows. Through my work on full-stack web applications, I have developed a clear understanding of how e-commerce platforms function, how data flows between systems, and how performance metrics drive decision-making. This technical perspective allows me to grasp retail media concepts quickly and support campaign monitoring and reporting with precision.\n\nIn previous work, I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams including advertising, content, and operations. I am comfortable preparing client meetings, organizing timelines, and contributing to growth strategies. My experience building scalable systems has taught me to think in terms of efficiency, data integrity, and continuous improvement, skills that translate directly into supporting account management and client development.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and am actively improving my German. I enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my analytical skills, structured work style, and genuine interest in e-commerce and retail media to eBazaaris. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-06 13:40:29.709', '2026-07-06 13:40:29.709'),
(2285, 2287, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung (commercial training)\",\"HR/Administrative experience\",\"MS Office skills\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) with no direct HR, administrative, or commercial background. The job requires a completed commercial training, HR/administrative experience, MS Office skills, and strong German language skills, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Assistenz in der Personalabteilung position at Dr. Meindl u. Partner Verrechnungsstelle GmbH. Your company\'s long-standing reputation in healthcare billing and commitment to a supportive, family-oriented work environment is something I find genuinely appealing.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational and administrative capabilities through managing complex projects, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, and maintaining detailed documentation. I am accustomed to working in structured, process-driven environments where accuracy and reliability matter.\n\nIn my previous roles, I was responsible for preparing technical documentation, maintaining records, and ensuring that information was organized and accessible. I supported team onboarding processes, communicated clearly with colleagues across departments, and handled administrative tasks with discretion and attention to detail. These experiences have prepared me well for supporting your HR team with applicant management, personnel file preparation, and employee onboarding.\n\nI work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-06 13:40:38.361', '2026-07-06 13:40:38.361'),
(2286, 2288, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Online Marketing experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"E-commerce domain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong analytical and technical skills from software engineering, but lacks the required online marketing experience, German language proficiency, and e-commerce domain knowledge specified in the job description.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior E-Commerce Consultant position at Cyrus Digital GmbH. Your focus on performance marketing for D2C brands and the structured training path from junior to senior account responsibility is exactly the kind of environment where I want to grow.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical thinking, comfort with data, and a methodical approach to problem-solving. I have experience building and optimizing digital platforms, including e-commerce systems, where I worked on authentication, payment integration, and performance tuning. These projects required careful attention to detail, systematic testing, and continuous improvement.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work directly with real brands and gradually take ownership of accounts. In my previous work as a web developer, I collaborated closely with stakeholders, managed project delivery, and took responsibility for features from planning through deployment. I am used to working independently, learning new tools quickly, and communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in Voronezh and ready to relocate to Munich. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Cyrus Digital.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:40:46.763', '2026-07-06 13:40:46.763'),
(2287, 2289, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Online Marketing Experience\",\"Performance Marketing Knowledge\",\"Campaign Management\",\"German Language (Very Good)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and numerical skills but lacks direct online marketing or performance marketing experience. The role requires approximately one year of online marketing experience and very good German language skills. The applicant states they have very good German skills and are willing to relocate to Munich, which partially addresses location and language requirements. However, the core marketing qualifications are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Performance Marketing Specialist position at Cyrus Digital GmbH. Your structured training program and clear development path from junior to senior account responsibility align well with how I prefer to grow professionally.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and numerical skills through years of working with data, performance metrics, and optimization problems. In my previous roles, I regularly analyzed system performance, identified bottlenecks, and implemented data-driven improvements. This experience has given me a methodical, detail-oriented approach to problem-solving that translates directly to campaign analysis and optimization.\n\nWhat draws me to Cyrus Digital is the opportunity to learn performance marketing from the ground up under experienced mentors. I am comfortable working with numbers, taking ownership of tasks, and gradually building expertise through hands-on experience. The prospect of starting with campaign support and progressing to full account responsibility for real D2C brands is exactly the kind of growth I am looking for.\n\nIn addition to my technical and analytical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have very good German language skills, and enjoy collaborating in international environments. I am based in Voronezh and ready to relocate to Munich.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Cyrus Digital\'s team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:40:55.620', '2026-07-06 13:40:55.620'),
(2288, 2290, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Datev Lodas\",\"Entgeltabrechnung\",\"Steuerfachangestellte\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this payroll/accounting role, which demands specific experience in German payroll (Entgeltabrechnung), Datev Lodas software, and fluency in German. The applicant\'s skills are in software engineering, not in tax or payroll accounting.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Software Engineering position at Fischer & Partner Gesellschaft für Personal mbH. With a strong background in full-stack web development and a focus on building scalable, secure systems, I am confident I can contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy professional experience spans over four years of full-stack development, primarily using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance using MySQL and PostgreSQL. I am also experienced in deploying applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I delivered scalable web applications and real-time features using WebSockets. I also developed a full-stack multi-vendor e-commerce platform with Laravel and Flutter, which involved designing complex role-based workflows, integrating payment gateways, and optimizing database queries for performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my skills and experience align with the needs of your team.', '2026-07-06 13:41:03.518', '2026-07-06 13:41:03.518'),
(2289, 2291, 1, 45, '[\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Typescript\",\"REST APIs (via Laravel/Express)\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Java\",\"Spring Boot\",\"Apache Kafka\",\"Angular (version 18 or higher)\",\"RabbitMQ\",\"Message Brokers (Kafka/RabbitMQ)\",\"5+ years full-stack experience\",\"C1 German\"]', 'Shahanur has strong full-stack web development skills with React, Next.js, TypeScript, Laravel, Node.js, and databases. He has experience with Docker, Kubernetes, AWS, Google Cloud, CI/CD, and microservices concepts. However, the job requires Java, Spring Boot, Apache Kafka, Angular 18+, and 5+ years of experience, which are not present in his profile. German language at C1 level is also required but not indicated.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fullstack Softwareentwickler position at TecFox GmbH. Your focus on building scalable, high-quality digital solutions for diverse clients aligns well with my background in full-stack development and microservices-based architectures.\n\nThrough four years of professional full-stack development experience, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, and Node.js. I have built and maintained RESTful APIs, designed relational database schemas in MySQL and PostgreSQL, and deployed applications using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines on AWS and Google Cloud. I also have hands-on experience with Redis, Socket.IO, and Kubernetes, which supports the microservices-oriented work your team does.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building scalable systems that balance performance, security, and maintainability. In previous work, I developed a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem using Laravel and Flutter, implementing role-based access control, real-time notifications, and secure payment flows. I also built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which involved live data streaming and containerized deployment. These projects required close collaboration with UI/UX, frontend, and backend teams, as well as participation in code reviews and architectural decisions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to TecFox\'s projects. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-06 13:41:13.219', '2026-07-06 13:41:13.219'),
(2290, 2292, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Online Marketing experience\",\"Paid Ads experience\",\"Performance Marketing knowledge\",\"Campaign management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct online marketing or paid ads experience. While the role requires about one year of online marketing experience and very good German skills, the applicant\'s background is in full-stack development. The applicant is based in Munich and has German language skills, which partially matches the location and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Paid Ads Specialist position at Cyrus Digital GmbH. Your structured training program and clear development path from Junior to Senior performance marketer is exactly the kind of environment where I want to build my career in online marketing.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical skills and a data-driven mindset that directly align with performance marketing. In my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly analyzed metrics, optimized system performance, and made data-backed decisions to improve outcomes. I enjoy working with numbers and have a careful, detail-oriented approach to problem-solving.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Cyrus Digital is the commitment to training junior talent from the ground up. The opportunity to learn from experienced colleagues through twice-weekly internal training and gradually take on account responsibility for real D2C brands is exactly what I am looking for. I am ready to start as a hands-on executor and grow into a strategic sparring partner for your clients.\n\nI currently live in Munich and have very good German language skills, which allows me to communicate effectively with your team and clients. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Cyrus Digital\'s team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:41:21.668', '2026-07-06 13:41:21.668'),
(2291, 2293, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Online Marketing Experience\",\"German Language (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Campaign Management\",\"Performance Marketing\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and data-driven skills, but lacks direct experience in online marketing, campaign management, and German language proficiency which are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Digital Marketing Trainee position at Cyrus Digital GmbH in Munich. Your structured training program and focus on developing junior talent into independent account managers is exactly the kind of environment where I can grow quickly and contribute meaningfully.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently worked with data-driven systems that require the same analytical rigor and attention to detail that performance marketing demands. In my previous roles, I built and maintained web applications where I regularly monitored system metrics, optimized database queries, and analyzed user behavior patterns to improve application performance. This experience has given me a strong foundation in working with numbers, identifying trends, and making data-informed decisions.\n\nWhat particularly interests me about Cyrus Digital is your hands-on approach to training. I am someone who learns best by doing, and your model of gradually increasing account responsibility aligns well with how I have developed my technical skills over the past years. I am comfortable starting with campaign setup and optimization tasks, and I look forward to growing into full account ownership under the guidance of your experienced team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I currently reside in Munich and am ready to start immediately.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical skills and eagerness to learn can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:41:30.347', '2026-07-06 13:41:30.347'),
(2292, 2294, 1, 45, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"Git\"]', '[\"ERP systems experience\",\"CRM systems experience\",\"Microsoft 365 administration\",\"Atlassian tools experience\",\"Team leadership experience\",\"IT strategy development experience\",\"Budget planning experience\",\"Informationssicherheit experience\",\"Regulatory compliance experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in cloud infrastructure (AWS, Docker, Kubernetes), web development (Laravel, Next.js, React), and AI integration, which partially align with the IT infrastructure and digitalization aspects of the role. However, the position requires significant leadership experience, IT strategy development, ERP/CRM system management, and German language proficiency, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is moderate for the technical execution aspects but weak for the strategic leadership and management requirements of this Head of IT role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of IT and Digitalization position at Bösch Boden Spies. The opportunity to lead IT strategy, drive digital transformation, and implement AI-driven automation in a company with a clear focus on measurable business value is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy technical foundation spans full-stack development, cloud infrastructure, and AI integration. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and React to build scalable web applications, and I have deployed and maintained production systems on AWS, Google Cloud, and Digital Ocean using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. This experience gives me a practical understanding of modern IT infrastructure, cloud services, and the operational requirements needed to ensure stable and secure IT operations.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of AI and automation into business processes. I have developed AI-powered applications using OpenAI and Replicate APIs, built intelligent assistants, and implemented automated workflows. I understand how to structure data as a foundation for analytics and AI applications, which aligns with your goal of building a structured data basis for analysis and AI use cases.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have delivered projects that required close collaboration with stakeholders, clear communication across teams, and a pragmatic approach to problem-solving. I have worked with authentication systems, role-based access control, payment gateways, and real-time features, and I am comfortable managing both technical implementation and strategic planning.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Bösch Boden Spies.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:41:40.751', '2026-07-06 13:41:40.751'),
(2293, 2295, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"HR administration\",\"Arbeitnehmerüberlassung\",\"labor law\",\"SAP HCM\",\"MS Office\",\"personnel management\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR, administration, or German labor law experience. There is a significant mismatch with the required qualifications for this HR specialist role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Personalreferent HR Administration & Arbeitnehmerüberlassung (m/w/d) position at MY Humancapital GmbH in Munich. While my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong organizational, documentation, and process-management skills that are directly transferable to this HR role.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I was responsible for managing complex project workflows, coordinating with multiple stakeholders, maintaining detailed documentation, and ensuring that every step of a process was executed accurately and on time. These responsibilities required the same level of precision, discretion, and structured thinking that this HR position demands.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support the entire employee lifecycle, from onboarding to offboarding. My experience building and maintaining systems that handle user data, authentication, and role-based access has given me a deep appreciation for the importance of accurate record-keeping, data integrity, and confidentiality.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:41:48.287', '2026-07-06 13:41:48.287');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2294, 2296, 1, 45, '[\"Typescript\",\"Jest\",\"REST APIs (implied by Express JS, Laravel)\",\"Responsive Design (implied by Tailwind, Bootstrap, CSS)\"]', '[\"Angular (ab Version 18)\",\"PrimeNG\",\"Jasmine\",\"Micro-Frontend-Architekturen\",\"Deutsch (C1)\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational frontend skills in TypeScript, responsive design, and testing with Jest, which partially match the job requirements. However, the role specifically requires Angular (version 18+), which is not in the applicant\'s skill set. The applicant\'s frontend experience is primarily with React, Next.js, and Vue.js. Additionally, the job requires very good German language skills (C1), which the applicant does not mention. The match is moderate, with transferable skills but missing the core Angular requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Frontend Softwareentwickler position at TecFox GmbH. Your focus on building modern, high-performance user interfaces and single-page applications aligns with my background in frontend development and my commitment to writing clean, maintainable code.\n\nMy professional experience includes over four years of web development, with a strong emphasis on frontend technologies. I have worked extensively with TypeScript, React, and Next.js to build responsive, user-friendly interfaces. I am comfortable with modern frontend architectures and have a solid understanding of best practices for building scalable single-page applications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on code quality and testing. In my previous work, I have used Jest to write structured unit tests and have consistently focused on delivering robust, well-tested frontend code. I also have experience integrating REST APIs following an API-first approach, ensuring clean separation between frontend and backend layers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my frontend development skills can contribute to TecFox\'s projects.', '2026-07-06 13:41:57.622', '2026-07-06 13:41:57.622'),
(2295, 2297, 1, 35, '[\"C++\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CMake\",\"Jetson Nano\"]', '[\"ECAD/KiCad\",\"MCAD/Co-Design\",\"Cortex-M/STM32\",\"Analog circuit design\",\"SMD soldering/prototyping\",\"Low-power RF design\",\"German language (professional)\"]', 'The applicant has foundational skills in C++, Linux, and embedded platforms (Jetson Nano, Raspberry Pi, ESP32) which partially overlap with the firmware development requirements. However, the role requires deep electronics engineering expertise (ECAD, MCAD, Cortex-M microcontrollers, analog circuit design, SMD prototyping, low-power RF design) and professional German language skills, which are not present in the profile. The match is low overall, but the applicant\'s embedded systems research and C++ experience provide a starting point for discussion.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CTO position in Electronics and Product Design of Embedded Monitoring and Automation Systems at HOREICH GmbH. Your focus on developing sensor-based monitoring systems for infrastructure, water management, and bridge monitoring is directly relevant to my technical background and research interests.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built embedded systems that combine C/C++ firmware, real-time data processing, and wireless communication. I have experience programming low-level drivers, network stacks, MQTT, and HTTP services for resource-constrained devices. My work with platforms like Raspberry Pi, ESP32, and NVIDIA Jetson Nano has given me practical insight into the full embedded development lifecycle, from prototyping to deployment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the integration of embedded hardware with web-based data platforms. In previous work, I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, and I have built full-stack applications with Laravel and Next.js. This combination of embedded systems knowledge and web development experience allows me to contribute not only to firmware and electronics design but also to the web platform where your customers view and analyze sensor data.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in embedded systems, firmware development, and full-stack engineering can contribute to HOREICH\'s product development and technical direction.', '2026-07-06 13:42:08.046', '2026-07-06 13:42:08.046'),
(2296, 2298, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Microsoft Dynamics 365\",\"Power BI\",\"CRM consulting\",\"Project management\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills but lacks direct experience with Microsoft Dynamics 365, Power BI, CRM consulting, and project management. The role requires deep Dynamics 365 expertise and German language proficiency, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Dynamics 365 Consultant position at audius SE. Your focus on building custom business software on Microsoft Dynamics 365 and Power BI, combined with your commitment to digital transformation, aligns with my background in full-stack development and system integration.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and delivered scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and modern JavaScript frameworks. I have built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated payment gateways and third-party services. These skills are directly applicable to configuring and customizing CRM solutions that meet specific client needs.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the end-to-end project lifecycle described in the role. In previous work, I have taken projects from requirement analysis through implementation, collaborating with stakeholders to ensure solutions are both functional and maintainable. I have also optimized application performance through database indexing, caching strategies, and efficient query design, which supports the analytical and problem-solving demands of CRM consulting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:42:15.707', '2026-07-06 13:42:15.707'),
(2297, 2299, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"SAP MM\",\"SAP WM\",\"S/4HANA\",\"SAP Customizing\",\"Supply Chain Process Knowledge\",\"SAP Consulting Experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack and systems engineering skills but lacks any SAP-specific experience, certifications, or knowledge of MM/WM modules and S/4HANA customizing required for this senior consultant role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP Senior Consultant MM/WM S/4HANA position at STELACON GmbH. While my professional experience is rooted in full-stack and systems engineering rather than SAP consulting, I bring a strong foundation in technical problem-solving, process analysis, and system integration that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I designed and built scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, developed RESTful APIs, and implemented complex authentication and role-based access control systems. I also optimized database performance through query tuning and indexing, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. These experiences have given me a structured approach to understanding business requirements, designing technical solutions, and ensuring system reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to analyze and optimize logistics and supply chain processes. In my projects, I have worked on systems that required deep understanding of user workflows, data integrity, and integration between multiple modules. I am confident that my ability to grasp complex processes and translate them into technical implementations would allow me to quickly become effective in SAP MM and WM environments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I also value the transparent culture and professional development opportunities that STELACON offers.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and approach can contribute to your team\'s success.', '2026-07-06 13:42:24.832', '2026-07-06 13:42:24.832'),
(2298, 2300, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Affiliate marketing\",\"Digital marketing\",\"Client acquisition\",\"Negotiation skills\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct sales, affiliate marketing, or digital marketing experience. The role requires a commercial background and German language skills, which are not present in the profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Trainee Sales position at Firstlead GmbH. Your company\'s focus on technology, data, and innovation within the affiliate marketing space is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the growth of ADCELL.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed a strong foundation in communication, client management, and goal-oriented execution. In my previous roles as a Web Developer, I regularly collaborated with stakeholders, presented technical solutions, and managed the full cycle of project delivery from initial requirements to deployment. This experience has given me the ability to understand client needs, communicate clearly, and drive processes forward.\n\nI am a quick learner and a problem solver by nature. I am comfortable with direct communication, handling objections, and staying focused on achieving targets. I am looking to transition my skills into a sales environment where I can apply my structured approach and technical understanding to help acquire and retain business clients.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my energy, adaptability, and commitment to your sales team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can contribute to the continued success of ADCELL.', '2026-07-06 13:42:32.549', '2026-07-06 13:42:32.549'),
