ollaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Soy & Mochi\'s growth through creative content.', '2026-07-06 13:42:40.185', '2026-07-06 13:42:40.185'),
