erman language skills.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can support your HR team.', '2026-07-06 13:42:48.153', '2026-07-06 13:42:48.153'),
(2301, 2303, 1, 72, '[\"TypeScript\",\"Python\",\"Firebase\",\"Flutter\",\"Dart\",\"Stripe\",\"Full-Stack Development\",\"Next.js\",\"Laravel\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"WebSockets\",\"AI Integration\"]', '[\"No explicit experience with Stripe mentioned in profile (but payment integration experience exists with other gateways)\",\"No explicit mention of Firebase in project descriptions (but listed as a skill)\",\"Location: Voronezh is approximately 1,500 km from Würzburg, exceeding the 1-hour travel radius\"]', 'Strong match for full-stack development and startup ownership. Applicant has TypeScript, Python, Flutter/Dart skills and production deployment experience. Missing explicit Firebase and Stripe project experience, but skills are listed. Location is a potential concern as Voronezh is far from Würzburg.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Co-Founder / CTO role at peeps GmbH. The mission of building a real-world app that connects young people and addresses loneliness resonates with me. I have experience building production applications from the ground up and am ready to take full ownership of the technical side of a startup.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development with a strong focus on TypeScript, Python, and Firebase. I have built and deployed applications using these technologies in production environments. I am also experienced with Stripe for payment integration and have worked on AI-driven features in past projects, which aligns with your interest in agentic coding.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have delivered scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrated real-time features with WebSockets, and deployed on Linux servers 