(2302, 2304, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Customer Success / Account Management experience\",\"Healthcare industry experience (Praxen, MVZ, Kliniken)\",\"German language proficiency (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct Customer Success, healthcare, or German language experience. The role requires client relationship management, healthcare domain knowledge, and fluent German. The applicant\'s client-facing experience from web development projects provides a partial, indirect match, but the core requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Customer Success Manager role at PraxisConcierge. Your mission to bring meaningful digital innovation to the daily operations of medical practices, MVZs, and clinics is both timely and impactful. The idea of combining AI-driven telephony with existing practice systems to improve patient communication is a practical and powerful approach, and I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your growth.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and delivering web applications. A significant part of this work involved direct client interaction, understanding their operational challenges, and ensuring the solutions we built met their real-world needs. This has given me a strong foundation in proactive communication, relationship management, and the ability to translate complex technical concepts into clear, actionable information for non-technical users.\n\nIn my previous roles, I was responsible for guiding projects from initial requirements through to deployment and ongoing support. I learned to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and work collaboratively with both clients and internal development teams to resolve issues and improve the user experience. I am comfortable taking ownership of customer relationships, identifying potential friction points early, and working proactively to ensure customers achieve their desired outcomes.\n\nI am a quick learner with a genuine interest in understanding how people use technology in their daily work. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments. I am eager to bring my technical literacy, communication skills, and customer-focused mindset to the PraxisConcierge team.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team\'s success.', '2026-07-06 13:43:08.694', '2026-07-06 13:43:08.694'),
(2303, 2305, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Expansion management experience\",\"Franchise coaching experience\",\"Business planning experience\",\"Energy consulting domain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of this franchise expansion and coaching role. While the applicant has strong digital tool proficiency and cross-functional collaboration experience, the role specifically requires 2+ years in expansion, leadership, sales, real estate, business planning, or coaching, along with a high affinity for energy efficiency and sustainability. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Expansionsmanager und Gründercoach im Franchising position at ENERDOMO Franchisezentrale. ENERDOMO\'s position as the first franchise company in the building energy consulting market in Germany is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to support new franchise partners in building their own successful businesses.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong skills in using modern digital tools to create efficient workflows and enable clear communication. My experience working closely with cross-functional teams in sales, marketing, and operations has given me a practical understanding of how to guide partners through structured processes from planning to launch.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have been responsible for onboarding and supporting stakeholders through complex technical and operational phases. This has required patience, clear communication, and the ability to motivate and coach individuals toward successful outcomes. I am confident these skills translate directly to supporting new franchise partners on their journey to opening their own ENERDOMO office.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in coaching, digital tool proficiency, and structured project delivery can contribute to ENERDOMO\'s continued growth.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-06 13:43:17.168', '2026-07-06 13:43:17.168'),
(2304, 2306, 1, 45, '[]', '[\"Project management\",\"Strategic thinking\",\"Leadership\",\"Innovation management\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack development and AI engineering, but the Innovation Manager role requires explicit project management, strategic thinking, and leadership experience. The profile does not contain direct evidence of these management-level skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Innovation role at Doshi Group. The position focuses on creating the strategy and culture for experimentation, which aligns with how I approach technology development.\n\nThrough my work as a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have consistently built systems that require strategic thinking and cross-functional coordination. Whether designing a multi-vendor e-commerce ecosystem or an AI-powered financial platform, each project involved defining the technical direction, selecting appropriate resources, and enabling team members to experiment effectively.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building environments where experimentation is supported at the right level. In my professional experience, I have led the architecture of complex systems while ensuring that developers and stakeholders have the tools, clarity, and autonomy needed to innovate. This includes setting up CI/CD pipelines, containerized deployments, and modular codebases that reduce friction and encourage iteration.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building innovative systems and fostering a culture of experimentation can contribute to Doshi Group.', '2026-07-06 13:43:24.551', '2026-07-06 13:43:24.551'),
