stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:43:32.729', '2026-07-06 13:43:32.729'),
(2306, 2308, 1, 85, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Git\",\"Figma\",\"MySQL\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"WordPress\",\"Vue.js\",\"Adobe XD\",\"WCAG accessibility standards\",\"Arabic language\"]', 'Strong match for Junior Front End Developer role. Applicant has solid front-end skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Tailwind, Bootstrap) and professional web development experience. Missing WordPress, Vue.js, and Arabic language which are preferred but not required. Overall fit is good with room to grow into the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Front End Developer position at PULSEMEDIA. Your focus on building responsive, user-friendly digital experiences for healthcare and wellness brands is exactly the kind of work I want to grow into. I have been following PulseMedia\'s work and appreciate the combination of strategy, creativity, and technology in your approach.\n\nMy front-end development experience centers on HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, React, Next.js, and TypeScript. I have built responsive, mobile-first interfaces using Tailwind CSS and Bootstrap, converting UI/UX designs into clean, maintainable code. I also work with Figma for design collaboration and Git for version control. Performance optimization, cross-browser compatibility, and SEO-friendly development are part of my regular workflow.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel and Next.js. I developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I also worked on real-time features using WebSockets and integrated third-party services like payment gateways and cloud storage.\n\nOne project that reflects my front-end skills is the Travel Agency App, a full-stack platform built with Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Google Maps. I created the UI from scratch, ensured responsive performance across devices, and supported multiple languages and currencies. The project required close collaboration with designers and stakeholders to deliver a polished, user-friendly experience.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-06 13:43:41.851', '2026-07-06 13:43:41.851'),
(2307, 2309, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Copy editing\",\"Proofreading\",\"Headline writing\",\"Print newspaper page design\",\"News judgment\",\"Journalism background\",\"Sports editing\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in copy editing, proofreading, or print journalism. The role requires solid experience in newspaper page design, headline writing, and news judgment, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the temporary part-time Editor Paginator position at Pagemasters North America, a subsidiary of The Canadian Press. I understand the role requires precision, strong news judgment, and the ability to produce accurate headlines and page layouts under tight deadlines. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a complementary skill set that aligns well with the demands of this position.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I regularly managed complex projects that required meticulous attention to detail, clear communication, and the ability to meet strict delivery timelines. I designed and developed a Newsroom Management dashboard using Next.js and Material UI, which involved building interfaces for editors and writers to manage content workflows efficiently. This project gave me direct insight into the publishing process and the importance of accuracy and speed in a news environment.\n\nI am comfortable working independently during evening and weekend shifts, and I am fully capable of working remotely from within Canada. I have strong written and oral communication skills in English, and I am accustomed to collaborating with teams across different time zones and cultural backgrounds.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the PMNA team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-06 13:43:49.444', '2026-07-06 13:43:49.444'),
(2308, 2310, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Content creation\",\"Social media management\",\"Video editing\",\"Trend analysis\",\"Instagram/TikTok expertise\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in social media content creation, video editing, or trend analysis. The role requires creating and publishing content for Instagram and TikTok, which does not match the applicant\'s profile. The score is low due to the significant skill gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) Social Media & Content Creation position at TIGER Deutschland GmbH. The idea of giving a modern, human face to facility management through authentic content is exactly the kind of creative challenge I want to be part of.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but I have always been drawn to the intersection of technology and storytelling. Through my project work, I have built complete digital platforms from the ground up, which required me to think carefully about user experience, visual design, and how to communicate complex ideas clearly. These skills translate directly into creating content that resonates with an audience.\n\nI am comfortable in front of the camera and have experience filming, editing, and publishing content. I understand how to spot trends early and adapt them quickly to fit a brand\'s voice. I am also skilled at analyzing performance data to refine content strategy, which aligns with your need to evaluate and improve social media channels continuously.\n\nIn addition to my technical and creative experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have workin