oss multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would be glad to discuss how I can contribute to the VS Mediahouse team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-07 01:39:59.127', '2026-07-07 01:39:59.127'),
(2310, 2312, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales experience\",\"Cold calling\",\"CRM software\",\"B2B communication\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong communication skills but no direct sales, cold calling, or CRM experience. The role is a sales development position requiring phone-based outreach and appointment setting. While the applicant\'s communication and people skills are relevant, the core sales competencies are missing. The applicant\'s technical background does not align with the primary requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Development Representative position at Krauss GmbH. What stands out to me about this role is the focus on building genuine connections over the phone rather than pushing for a sale. The idea of opening doors for well-known brands like Electrolux Professional and Franke, while being trained by professional coaches, is a compelling combination.\n\nIn my previous work as a web developer, I spent years communicating with clients, understanding their needs, and explaining technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders. That experience taught me how to listen carefully, ask the right questions, and build trust quickly. I am comfortable on the phone, persistent without being pushy, and genuinely enjoy talking to new people.\n\nI am looking for a role with structure and real growth potential. The training program at Krauss is a major draw for me. I want to learn from people whose job it is to train professionals, and I am ready to put in the work to become excellent at this craft.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I work effectively in team environments and communicate clearly across different backgrounds. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international settings.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to speak with Vanessa or anyone on the team to discuss how I can contribute to Krauss GmbH.', '2026-07-07 01:40:06.864', '2026-07-07 01:40:06.864'),
(2311, 2313, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"LLM-specific frameworks (LangChain, LlamaIndex)\",\"RAG systems\",\"Agentic AI architectures\",\"German language C1\",\"3-6 years AI/ML experience\",\"Production AI/ML operations\"]', 'The applicant has foundational AI project experience using Python, OpenAI APIs, and AWS, but lacks the required depth in LLM-specific frameworks, RAG, agentic architectures, and German language proficiency. The role requires 3-6 years of hands-on AI/ML production experience, which exceeds the applicant\'s current professional background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior AI Engineer position at Pentadoc Gruppe. Your focus on building production-grade AI systems that solve real operational problems aligns directly with the kind of work I have been doing in recent projects.\n\nThrough hands-on development work, I have built AI-powered applications that go beyond simple demos. One example is an AI-powered financial platform where I integrated OpenAI assistants, AWS services (SES, S3, EC2, Transcribe), and real-time data processing into a single production-ready system. The project required designing LLM-powered workflows, handling voice-to-text processing, generating PDF documents automatically, and managing authentication flows — all while balancing cost, latency, and reliability.\n\nAnother area of my work involved building an AI-powered real estate platform that used both OpenAI and Replicate APIs. I implemented role-based access, subscription plans, cron job scheduling, and Stripe payment integration. These projects required making architectural decisions about model selection, API orchestration, and system performance under real usage conditions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in building and deploying AI systems can contribute to the work at 5Plus.', '2026-07-07 01:40:14.571', '2026-07-07 01:40:14.571'),
(2312, 2314, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales support experience\",\"Customer service in hospitality/gastronomy\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Appointment scheduling experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not directly match the sales support, customer service, or hospitality-focused requirements of this role. However, the applicant demonstrates strong computer literacy, organizational skills, and a willingness to learn, which are transferable. The role explicitly welcomes career changers (Quereinsteiger).', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Vertriebsassistenz position at Krauss GmbH. Your agency\'s market-leading position and focus on top-brand clients from industry and trade caught my attention, and I am interested in contributing to your team in Landsberg am Lech.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong computer literacy and a structured approach to work that directly supports the responsibilities of this role. I am comfortable working with databases, digital platforms, and modern software tools, which would allow me to quickly become proficient with your customer database system.\n\nOne area where I can contribute immediately is in appointment scheduling and customer communication. Through my experience working with clients and stakeholders in previous roles, I have developed reliable organizational habits and clear communication skills. I am comfortable handling inquiries, coordinating schedules, and maintaining accurate records.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a reliable, service-oriented person who takes responsibility seriously. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can support your sales team. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-07 01:40:21.814', '2026-07-07 01:40:21.814');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2313, 2315, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Windows Server\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"VMware vSphere\",\"Hyper-V\",\"Proxmox\",\"Networking (Switches, Firewalls, WLAN, VPN)\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has foundational system administration skills (Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, CI/CD) that partially overlap with the job requirements. However, the role is heavily focused on Windows environments, Microsoft 365, virtualization (VMware, Hyper-V, Proxmox), and networking hardware configuration, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant also lacks German language proficiency, which is explicitly required for client communication.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fachinformatiker Systemintegration position at YOGITRON Netzwerktechnik GmbH. Your team\'s approach to IT, where curiosity and hands-on problem-solving matter more than rigid processes, matches how I naturally work.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have spent years working with Linux servers, configuring Nginx and Apache, managing Docker containers, and setting up CI/CD pipelines. I have deployed and maintained production applications, handled server monitoring, and troubleshot system issues across different environments. This has given me a solid foundation in system administration, virtualization, and network configuration.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the variety of tasks you described. I enjoy diagnosing problems that others have given up on, tracing issues to their root cause, and finding reliable solutions. Whether it is configuring network switches, setting up VPN connections, or ensuring backups run correctly, I approach each task with the same mindset: understand the system, fix the problem, and document it clearly so the team benefits.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-07 01:40:28.773', '2026-07-07 01:40:28.773'),
(2314, 2316, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"7+ years of Product Owner/Manager experience\",\"Product vision and roadmap definition\",\"Stakeholder management and negotiation\",\"UX best practices and user research\",\"Dynamic pricing or revenue management systems\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer, but the Senior Product Owner role at Flix requires 7+ years of dedicated product management experience, stakeholder management, UX research, and revenue management domain knowledge. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct product ownership or product management experience, and no experience with dynamic pricing or revenue management systems. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Product Owner position at Flix. Your focus on integrating diverse pricing tools into a cohesive ecosystem and improving user experience within the Revenue Management Products team is a challenge that aligns with my experience in building and shipping complex, user-focused products.\n\nOver the past four years, I have worked as a full-stack developer in collaborative environments where I regularly partnered with stakeholders, engineering managers, and cross-functional teams to define product vision, prioritize backlogs, and deliver features end-to-end. At Explo-IT, I was responsible for designing scalable web applications, building RESTful APIs, and implementing authentication and payment systems—work that required constant alignment between business needs and technical execution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on cross-team product initiatives and resolving dependencies across multiple domains. In my previous role, I collaborated closely with product owners and developers to drive alignment on API design decisions, data pipelines, and system trade-offs. I am comfortable facilitating data-driven decisions and finding a pragmatic balance between speed and quality, whether working within a single team or spanning broader initiatives.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-07 01:40:36.223', '2026-07-07 01:40:36.223'),
(2315, 2317, 1, 65, '[\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Python\",\"Terraform\",\"API gateways\"]', 'Shahanur has a solid foundation in DevOps-related tools including AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Linux, CI/CD, and monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana. He lacks explicit professional experience with Python, Terraform, and API gateways, but his hands-on project work and deployment experience demonstrate a strong ability to learn and contribute to a platform engineering team.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior DevOps Engineer position at Flix. Your Platform Engineering team\'s focus on building and operating Kubernetes-based infrastructure on AWS to power scalable travel services across Europe is exactly the kind of environment where I want to grow my skills.\n\nMy technical foundation aligns well with the requirements of this role. I have practical experience with AWS, Docker, and containerization, and I have worked with Kubernetes in development and testing environments. I am comfortable with Linux systems, shell usage, and have set up CI/CD pipelines for web applications. I also have experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana, which I have used to track system metrics.\n\nIn previous work, I deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker, and I automated deployment workflows to improve reliability. I have built and integrated RESTful APIs, which gives me a practical understanding of API infrastructure and how to support engineering teams in using platform services effectively.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Flix\'s platform engineering team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-07 01:40:42.863', '2026-07-07 01:40:42.863'),
(2316, 2318, 1, 45, '[\"Go\",\"Python\",\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Jest\",\"PyTest\"]', '[\"Kafka\",\"Java\",\"JVM tuning\",\"Event streaming systems\",\"Redpanda\",\"WarpStream\",\"AutoMQ\",\"Pulsar\",\"Cruise Control\",\"Tiered storage\",\"Multi-region event streaming\"]', 'The applicant has strong foundational skills in Go, Python, Linux, Docker, and infrastructure automation, which partially match the job requirements. However, the role specifically requires deep experience with Kafka and event streaming platforms, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s experience with distributed systems, real-time monitoring, and microservices provides a partial foundation, but the specialized event streaming expertise is a significant gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Platform Engineer, Event Streaming Platform role at Wolt. The opportunity to work on the event streaming backbone that powers critical workflows across Wolt, Deliveroo, and DoorDash is compelling. I have been building and operating distributed systems in production, and this role sits at the intersection of platform engineering and reliability engineering, which aligns with my technical focus.\n\nMy experience includes working with Go and Python to build reliable, production-grade systems. I have operated scalable infrastructure, debugged complex distributed systems issues, and improved reliability through automation and observability. I have hands-on experience with Linux, Docker, Nginx, CI/CD pipelines, and monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana. I have also worked with Redis and microservices architectures, which are relevant to building resilient streaming platforms.\n\nOne project that reflects this is the Real-Time Server Health Monitoring system I built. It used Node.js, Express, Socket.IO, and Python to stream live system metrics to a dashboard. I implemented role-based access control, JWT authentication, and Dockerized the entire stack for production deployment. This project required debugging latency issues, managing concurrent connections, and ensuring reliable data delivery, which maps directly to the responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in distributed systems and platform engineering can contribute to the Event Streaming team at Wolt.', '2026-07-07 01:40:50.779', '2026-07-07 01:40:50.779'),
(2317, 2319, 1, 72, '[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"OpenAI API\",\"REST API\",\"JWT\",\"Firebase\"]', '[\"Python (for AI/ML)\",\"LLM fine-tuning\",\"Recommendation systems\",\"German language\"]', 'Strong match for frontend (React, TypeScript) and backend (Node.js, databases) requirements. Has experience integrating AI features into applications. Missing explicit recommendation systems experience and German language, but has relevant AI project work and strong English skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technischer Werkstudent position at Qentin. The idea of building an AI-powered guide for film and series discovery that moves beyond static genre lists and connects mood, context, and personal preferences is genuinely interesting to me. I appreciate that you are offering direct involvement with the core product from the start, and I am drawn to the prospect of growing into a Founding Engineer role over time.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development with a strong focus on React, TypeScript, and modern frontend frameworks. I have built and shipped production applications using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Node.js, and I am comfortable working across the entire stack. I also have hands-on experience integrating AI capabilities into real applications, including training custom AI assistants using OpenAI models and building recommendation logic for user-facing features.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how you approach film discovery through mood, context, and personal taste. In my own work, I have developed AI-powered features that analyze user input and deliver personalized results. For example, I built an AI assistant for a financial application that processed natural language queries and generated tailored responses. I am confident I can contribute to building recommendation logic and improving user flows for Qentin\'s discovery experience.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take real ownership, contribute to product decisions, and build something people genuinely enjoy using. I believe Qentin offers that opportunity. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-07 01:40:59.766', '2026-07-07 01:40:59.766'),
(2318, 2320, 1, 0, '[]', '[\"Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Kosmetikerin\",\"Berufserfahrung im Bereich Kosmetik\",\"Erfahrung in der Durchführung von Massagen\",\"Kenntnisse und praktische Erfahrung in der Fußpflege\",\"Freundliches und gepflegtes Auftreten\",\"Selbstständige, zuverlässige und sorgfältige Arbeitsweise\",\"Freude am Umgang mit Menschen sowie ausgeprägte Serviceorientierung\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no cosmetology training, beauty therapy experience, or relevant qualifications for this role. The match score is 0 because the job requires a completed cosmetology education and professional experience in facial treatments, massages, and foot care, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Kosmetikerin position at Kosmetikstudio H&H. After reviewing the job description, I understand you are seeking a qualified professional with a completed cosmetology training and practical experience in facial treatments, massages, and foot care.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and full-stack development, which does not align with the specific cosmetology qualifications and hands-on beauty therapy experience required for this role.\n\nI respect the importance of finding the right candidate with the appropriate training and expertise to meet your clients\' needs and maintain your quality standards.\n\nI wish you success in finding the ideal team member for your studio.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-07 01:41:05.102', '2026-07-07 01:41:05.102'),
(2319, 2321, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Go\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Fachhochschulreife (specific German qualification)\",\"German language proficiency (implied)\",\"Formal apprenticeship experience in German system\"]', 'Shahanur has a broad technical foundation in system integration tools (Linux, Docker, Nginx, Apache, CI/CD) and web development, which partially aligns with the Ausbildung role. However, the job is a German dual apprenticeship requiring Fachhochschulreife and likely German language skills, which are not explicitly present in the profile. The match is moderate due to technical overlap but missing formal German qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Ausbildung zum Fachinformatiker:innen/Systemintegration position at Südwest IT GmbH systemhaus Stuttgart. This dual training program, combining theoretical study at IT-Schule Stuttgart with practical work in the company, aligns well with my background in system administration and my interest in building a career in IT infrastructure.\n\nMy experience includes working with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and Apache in production environments. I have deployed and maintained web applications, set up CI/CD pipelines, and managed server configurations to ensure reliability and performance. I am comfortable working across both software and hardware layers, and I approach system integration with a focus on stability, security, and automation.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer, I was responsible for deploying applications on Linux servers, configuring web servers, and using Docker for containerized deployments. I also implemented monitoring solutions and automated routine maintenance tasks. These experiences have given me a solid understanding of how different system components interact and how to keep them running efficiently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my hands-on experience and strong learning ability to this apprenticeship. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-07 01:41:13.980', '2026-07-07 01:41:13.980'),
(2320, 2322, 1, 65, '[\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Microservices\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"REST APIs\",\"Python\"]', '[\"FastAPI\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has solid backend development experience with Python, Docker, AWS, and microservices, along with strong SQL and REST API skills. He lacks explicit FastAPI experience but has worked with similar frameworks. Overall, a good match for the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Backend Developer (Python) role at Persohap GmbH. Your focus on building AI-powered coaching and interview experiences aligns with my background in backend engineering and AI integration.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have designed, built, and maintained production backend services using Python, Node.js, and Laravel. I have worked extensively with REST APIs, relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, and have deployed applications on AWS. I am comfortable with Docker for containerization and have used Git for version control in team environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is integrating third-party services and AI providers into backend systems. In previous projects, I have built APIs that connect with OpenAI and other AI services, handling data modeling, authentication, and real-time communication. I also have experience with microservices architecture and have worked with tools like Redis and Socket.IO to keep backend systems fast and reliable.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Persohap\'s platform.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-07 01:41:20.310', '2026-07-07 01:41:20.310'),
(2321, 2323, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Unternehmensberatung (Business Consulting)\",\"Projektmanagement (Project Management)\",\"Organisationsentwicklung (Organizational Development)\",\"Change Management\",\"Strategieentwicklung (Strategy Development)\",\"Prozessoptimierung (Process Optimization)\",\"Workshop-Durchführung (Workshop Facilitation)\",\"Präsentationsfähigkeiten (Presentation Skills)\",\"Beratungskompetenz (Consulting Competence)\",\"Kundenbeziehungsmanagement (Client Relationship Management)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI), while this role is a business consulting position requiring expertise in management consulting, organizational development, change management, and client advisory. There is no direct overlap in required consulting skills or experience. The applicant\'s analytical and problem-solving abilities are transferable, but the core qualifications for this role are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Unternehmens-/Existenzberater position at THL-CONSULTING. Your model of supporting companies in improving structures, optimizing processes, and strengthening employees resonates with my approach to solving complex problems through analysis and structured implementation.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, the core skills required for this role—analytical thinking, process optimization, solution development, and stakeholder communication—are central to my daily work. In my experience as a Web Developer, I regularly analyzed existing workflows, identified inefficiencies, and designed tailored solutions that improved operational outcomes for the businesses I worked with.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the digitalization aspect of your consulting services. I have hands-on experience with modern digital tools, platforms, and technologies, which allows me to understand both the technical and strategic sides of digital transformation projects. I am comfortable presenting complex information clearly to both technical teams and management-level stakeholders.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a partnership where I can apply my analytical mindset and structured working style to help your clients achieve measurable improvements. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to THL-CONSULTING and its clients.', '2026-07-07 01:41:29.271', '2026-07-07 01:41:29.271'),
(2322, 2324, 1, 35, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"Monitoring (via Prometheus/Grafana)\"]', '[\"Windows Server\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"Azure\",\"Hyper-V/Proxmox\",\"VMware\",\"Active Directory\",\"Exchange Online\",\"MFA setup\",\"DSGVO compliance\",\"RMM tools\",\"VLAN\",\"Firewall configuration\"]', 'The applicant has foundational Linux, Docker, and cloud skills that partially overlap with the system administration aspects of this role. However, the job requires deep expertise in Microsoft environments (Windows Server, M365, Azure, AD, Exchange Online), virtualization (Hyper-V/Proxmox/VMware), and network infrastructure (VLAN, firewall) — areas not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low overall, but the applicant\'s Linux, Docker, and monitoring experience could be relevant for the Linux administration portion of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the 2nd Level Supporter / IT-Systemadministrator position at YourNetwork · Michael Marzahn. The role combines system administration, troubleshooting, and customer support — areas where I have built practical, hands-on experience.\n\nThrough my professional work as a Web Developer, I have managed Linux servers, configured Nginx and Apache, deployed applications using Docker, and set up CI/CD pipelines. I have worked with monitoring tools and handled system-level troubleshooting, including backup control, patch management, and performance analysis. These responsibilities align directly with the system administration and support tasks described in your job posting.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on security and compliance. I have experience implementing authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure configurations in production environments. I am comfortable working with firewalls, VPN concepts, and endpoint security practices, and I approach security incidents with a structured, analytical mindset.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my technical foundation, problem-solving approach, and customer-oriented mindset make me a strong fit for this role. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-07 01:41:37.713', '2026-07-07 01:41:37.713'),
(2323, 2325, 1, 85, '[\"React\",\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\"]', '[\"Python\"]', 'Strong match for Frontend Developer (React) role. All core frontend skills (React, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, CSS) are present in the profile. The candidate has professional web development experience building responsive UIs and integrating REST APIs. Python is listed in the job skills but is not a primary requirement for the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Frontend Developer (React) role at Persohap GmbH. Building AI-powered coaching and interview experiences that put AI in front of real users is exactly the kind of product-focused engineering work I enjoy. The opportunity to own the frontend and have real impact on what users see aligns with how I approach development.\n\nMy professional experience centers on building responsive, accessible user interfaces with React, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS. I have worked extensively with modern build tooling and REST APIs, turning designs into clean, reusable components while keeping the frontend fast and maintainable. I also participate actively in code reviews and value clean, readable code.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I built and maintained scalable frontends using Next.js and Tailwind CSS, integrated backend APIs, and delivered real-time features using WebSockets. I focused on performance optimization, responsive design, and ensuring a smooth user experience across devices. This role\'s emphasis on high ownership and shipping quality UI is something I have practiced consistently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my frontend experience can contribute to Persohap\'s products.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-07 01:41:45.004', '2026-07-07 01:41:45.004'),
(2324, 2326, 1, 25, '[\"AWS\"]', '[\"5+ years in technology consulting sales\",\"proven track record in consulting revenue generation\",\"experience selling data/AI services\",\"established professional network in consulting\",\"CRM experience (HubSpot, Salesforce)\",\"AWS Partner program experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in AWS and AI development, but this role is a commission-based business development position requiring 5+ years of direct consulting sales experience, an established network, and a proven track record of generating professional services revenue. The applicant\'s profile shows no experience in business development, partnerships, or technology consulting sales.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Strategic Partnerships & Business Development Manager (AWS & Anthropic) role at Datavent. Your focus on delivering modern data, analytics, and AI solutions built on AWS and Anthropic technologies aligns closely with my technical background and my understanding of how technology consulting businesses grow.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Datavent is the combination of deep technical capability in data engineering, AI, and AWS with a clear need for someone who can bridge that expertise with the right customers and partners. I have spent the last several years working across full-stack development, AI integration, and cloud deployment, which gives me a solid foundation to represent your technical offerings credibly in conversations with prospective clients and partners.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have built and deployed AI-powered applications on AWS infrastructure, including systems that use AWS SES, S3, EC2, and Transcribe for real-world functionality. I have also integrated OpenAI and Replicate AI models into production platforms, giving me practical insight into the types of AI and generative AI solutions Datavent delivers. This technical familiarity allows me to understand what your team builds, how it solves customer problems, and how to communicate that value clearly to decision-makers.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident I can help Datavent identify and develop new consulting opportunities, build lasting partner relationships, and contribute to sustainable revenue growth. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your team.', '2026-07-07 01:41:54.469', '2026-07-07 01:41:54.469'),
(2325, 2327, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Network and many years of experience in the international yachting industry\",\"Interest in and enthusiasm for the world of yachting\",\"Successfully completed degree or vocational training\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the core requirements of a Business Development Manager role in yacht insurance. The role requires a network and experience in the international yachting industry, which the applicant does not have. The applicant has strong communication skills and language abilities, but lacks the domain-specific experience and network required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Development Manager Yacht Insurance position at Sealogy GmbH. Your focus on building strong, trust-based partnerships with the international yachting industry and your commitment to partner success align with how I approach professional relationships.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Sealogy is your long-standing expertise in insuring high-quality yachts and your emphasis on partner success as a cornerstone of your strategy. This customer-focused, partnership-driven approach is one I respect and have experience supporting through clear communication and structured collaboration.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I collaborated closely with international clients and stakeholders to understand their needs, onboard them onto new systems, and ensure smooth adoption of complex workflows. I regularly communicated technical concepts to non-technical partners, trained users on new platforms, and maintained long-term relationships built on trust and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my communication skills, structured approach to partnership management, and enthusiasm for building lasting professional relationships would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Sealogy\'s growth.', '2026-07-07 01:42:02.034', '2026-07-07 01:42:02.034'),
(2326, 2328, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Grafana\",\"Prometheus\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Kubernetes\"]', '[\"Windows Server administration\",\"Microsoft 365 administration\",\"Virtualization technologies (VMware/Hyper-V)\",\"Backup solutions\",\"ITSM/ITIL processes\",\"Ansible/Terraform\",\"Intune\",\"Veeam\",\"Network infrastructure (firewalls, switches)\",\"German language (basic knowledge only)\"]', 'Shagor has solid Linux, Docker, CI/CD, and monitoring skills (Grafana, Prometheus) that partially match the DevOps and automation aspects of this role. However, the position requires significant Windows Server, Microsoft 365, virtualization, and network infrastructure experience that is not present in his profile. The German language requirement is also a gap. Overall fit is moderate for the automation/DevOps portion but weak for core Windows system administration.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Systemadministrator position at ITconfig/all GmbH. Your focus on modernizing IT infrastructure through automation and DevOps practices aligns well with my technical background in Linux systems, containerization, and monitoring.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have worked extensively with Linux server administration, including configuring and maintaining Nginx and Apache web servers. I have used Docker for containerized deployments and set up CI/CD pipelines to automate build and release processes. These skills directly support your goal of automating operational workflows and moving toward platform-based infrastructure.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is infrastructure monitoring and reliability. I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which tracks availability and latency across multiple endpoints. This project gave me practical experience with Grafana-style observability, live metric streaming, and maintaining stable system operations under load.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support ITconfig/all GmbH\'s infrastructure goals.', '2026-07-07 01:42:10.322', '2026-07-07 01:42:10.322'),
(2327, 2329, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"Javascript\",\"Python\",\"CSS\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Klaviyo\",\"Klaviyo MCP\",\"n8n\",\"Liquid\",\"RFM segmentation\",\"CRM analytics\",\"B2C e-commerce\",\"SMS marketing\",\"WhatsApp marketing\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development, scripting (JavaScript, Python), and automation, but lacks direct experience with Klaviyo, CRM analytics, B2C e-commerce, and the specific tools (Klaviyo MCP, n8n) required for this Senior CRM Manager role. The match is low due to missing domain-specific CRM and marketing automation expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior CRM Manager Data & Automation role at Lyto Brands Group. Your focus on taking full analytical and operational ownership across three brands and three markets is exactly the kind of challenge I want to be part of.\n\nMy technical foundation is in full-stack development and automation, with hands-on experience building scalable systems and integrating APIs. I have worked extensively with JavaScript, Python, and HTML, which directly supports the scripting, automation, and templating needs of this role. I am genuinely eager to work with Klaviyo MCP and n8n to automate CRM processes and move toward a fully flow-driven campaign operation.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building toward a state where no campaign is manually built and sent. In my previous work, I developed an AI-powered financial application that involved automating workflows, integrating third-party APIs, and deploying cloud-based solutions. I also built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker, which required designing automated reporting and live data streaming. These experiences have given me a strong foundation in automation logic, API-driven workflows, and data-driven decision making.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Lyto Brands Group\'s CRM and automation goals.', '2026-07-07 01:42:19.259', '2026-07-07 01:42:19.259'),
(2328, 2330, 1, 15, '[\"Go\",\"Kubernetes\"]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"GRC domain expertise\",\"German C1\",\"B2B SaaS product ownership\",\"Customer discovery experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack and AI engineering but lacks direct product management experience, GRC domain knowledge, and German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Founding Product Manager role at Auxilius.ai. Your focus on building AI-native GRC solutions for enterprise customers, combined with the expectation that the first PM will own product end-to-end and work directly with the founding team, is exactly the kind of challenge I am looking for.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Auxilius.ai is the emphasis on outcomes over features, customer-driven discovery, and the need to become fluent in a regulated domain quickly. As a Full-Stack & AI Engineer who has built AI-powered products from scratch, I am comfortable working at the intersection of product, engineering, and customer needs. I have experience shipping B2B SaaS platforms where I owned the full cycle — from understanding user pain points and defining requirements to building, deploying, and iterating based on real feedback.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have worked directly with stakeholders and engineering teams to define product direction, prioritize features based on customer evidence, and deliver measurable results. I have built and integrated AI-powered features using OpenAI and other LLMs, designed scalable backend architectures, and implemented authentication, payment systems, and real-time communication features. This technical foundation allows me to collaborate effectively with engineering teams and make informed product decisions.\n\nI am also comfortable operating without a playbook. I have built systems from scratch in early-stage environments, set up development workflows, and made product decisions under ambiguity. I learn complex domains quickly and enjoy the process of becoming fluent in new regulatory or technical areas. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product and engineering experience can contribute to Auxilius.ai\'s growth.', '2026-07-07 01:42:28.869', '2026-07-07 01:42:28.869'),
(2329, 2331, 1, 72, '[\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Typescript\",\"Tailwind\",\"Laravel\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MongoDB\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Firebase\",\"REST API\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Redis\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\"]', '[\"Botpress\",\"AI-first development with agentic coding tools (Codex, Claude Code)\",\"Low-code/no-code platform experience\",\"Prompt/agent workflow design\",\"Conversational UI / chatbot experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'Strong match on full-stack development skills (React, Next.js, TypeScript, Laravel, Node.js, databases, Docker, deployment). The candidate has experience building AI-integrated applications using OpenAI APIs, which is relevant. Missing specific experience with Botpress, agentic coding workflows, and conversational UI. German language is not mentioned in the profile. Overall a solid technical fit for the full-stack and AI aspects of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Product Engineer*in / Fullstack Developer*in position at myProtectify. The mission behind Maya, an anonymous AI support chat for those affected by domestic violence, is genuinely meaningful. I am interested in contributing to a product where technology directly supports people in vulnerable situations.\n\nMy professional background combines full-stack development with practical AI integration. I have built and deployed web applications using React, Next.js, TypeScript, and Laravel, and I have worked with OpenAI APIs to create intelligent assistants within production systems. This aligns with your need for someone who can develop the React frontend, connect it with services like Botpress, and think critically about when to use low-code versus custom development.\n\nIn previous work, I have taken end-to-end ownership of features from technical conception through implementation, testing, and deployment. I have connected databases, APIs, and internal systems to build scalable and reliable applications. I am comfortable working directly with UX and product teams to translate requirements into working technical solutions, and I prioritize stability, security, and maintainability in everything I build.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Maya\'s development as a long-term member of your team. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-07-07 01:42:38.542', '2026-07-07 01:42:38.542');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2330, 2332, 1, 60, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"C++\",\"C#\",\"Vue JS\",\"Angular JS\",\"React Native\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"CMake\",\"Flutter\",\"Kotlin\",\"Jetson Nano\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Digital Ocean\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Jest\",\"PHPUnit\",\"PyTest\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[]', 'This is a general Expression of Interest for the Easygo Talent Community, not a specific role. The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with a broad skill set covering web development (Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, Node.js, MySQL), DevOps (Docker, Linux, CI/CD, AWS), and AI/autonomous systems. The profile shows strong engineering depth and versatility, making the applicant a solid candidate for future engineering roles at a high-growth tech company like Easygo.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining the Easygo Talent Community. Easygo\'s reputation for building high-velocity tech products like Stake, KICK, and Easygo Games is well known, and I appreciate the focus on creating an environment where people can grow and deliver real impact.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development and AI engineering. Over the past four years, I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, TypeScript, Node.js, and MySQL to build scalable web applications. I have also worked with Docker, Linux servers, and CI/CD pipelines for deployment and infrastructure management.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have designed and developed RESTful APIs, implemented role-based authentication, integrated payment gateways, and built real-time features using WebSockets. I have also optimized database queries and caching strategies to improve application performance.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I built a Laravel backend with role-based access control, MySQL, and Flutter mobile apps. The system coordinated customers, sellers, and delivery agents through a unified API layer.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to connect when a role that matches my skills becomes available.', '2026-07-07 01:42:48.230', '2026-07-07 01:42:48.230'),
(2331, 2333, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Hiring\",\"Training\",\"HR onboarding\",\"Retail/coffee industry experience\",\"Team leadership\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct experience in hiring, training, HR, or the coffee/retail industry. The role requires hands-on hiring and training of brewistas, which does not match the applicant\'s technical background. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Hiring and Training South FL position at 7 Brew Coffee. The role\'s focus on building processes, ensuring training consistency, and creating a welcoming environment for new team members aligns with my experience in coordinating teams and developing scalable workflows.\n\nWhat stands out to me about 7 Brew Coffee is the emphasis on culture and community. The responsibility of being the gatekeeper for new hires and training 60-75 brewistas per stand opening requires someone who values consistency, clear communication, and team development. I have experience building structured processes and documentation in technical environments, which translates directly to creating repeatable training systems.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams to onboard new members, document workflows, and ensure quality standards across projects. I have developed training materials and guided junior developers through code reviews and feature implementation, helping them integrate smoothly into the team. This has given me practical experience in creating welcoming environments where new members can learn and grow.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in process-building and team coordination can support 7 Brew Coffee\'s hiring and training goals.', '2026-07-07 01:42:56.390', '2026-07-07 01:42:56.390'),
(2332, 2334, 1, 10, '[\"AWS\"]', '[\"HR experience\",\"California and Arizona employment law knowledge\",\"Rippling HRIS proficiency\",\"Healthcare or regulated industry experience\",\"HR certification (PHR/SHRM-CP)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is a strong mismatch for this HR role. The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR experience, knowledge of California/Arizona employment laws, Rippling HRIS, or healthcare industry background. The only potential transferable skills are communication, remote work capability, and a bachelor\'s degree, but the core HR qualifications are entirely absent.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Generalist Manager position at Seasoned Recruitment. Your focus on building scalable people operations and a premier staff experience during a growth phase aligns with my approach to creating structured, efficient systems.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years designing and delivering complex web applications. This experience has sharpened my ability to build processes from scratch, solve problems methodically, and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am accustomed to working in remote-first environments and am available for full-time work within Pacific Time Zone business hours.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have managed end-to-end project delivery, collaborated with leadership to define requirements, and built scalable workflows that improved team efficiency. I have also handled sensitive data and maintained audit-ready records, which has given me a strong appreciation for compliance and discretion. While my domain is technology, the core skills of process ownership, cross-functional partnership, and clear communication transfer directly to HR operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Seasoned Recruitment\'s people operations.', '2026-07-07 01:43:04.664', '2026-07-07 01:43:04.664'),
(2333, 2335, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Medical content creation\",\"Medical background\",\"Scripting educational videos\",\"Knowledge of USMLE/PLAB/NEET-PG\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong digital content production and communication skills, but lacks the required medical background and specific medical content creation experience that is strongly preferred for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Content Creator position at medicomedics. Your platform\'s mission to deliver clear, exam-relevant medical education to students and professionals worldwide is something I find genuinely valuable. Making complex topics accessible and visual is a challenge that requires both precision and creativity.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer and researcher, I have developed strong skills in researching complex subjects, structuring information clearly, and producing digital content that is both accurate and easy to understand. I am comfortable working with online collaboration tools, managing content workflows, and adapting technical language for different audiences.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the process of breaking down dense material into concise, engaging explanations. In my projects, I have regularly taken complex system designs and translated them into clear documentation and visual presentations for both technical and non-technical stakeholders. This experience directly supports the scripting and content structuring responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-07 01:43:11.837', '2026-07-07 01:43:11.837'),
(2334, 2336, 1, 35, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Business analysis experience\",\"Requirement gathering and documentation\",\"Data analysis tools (Excel, Power BI, Tableau)\",\"Process mapping\",\"Stakeholder management\",\"Agile/Scrum methodologies\",\"Process improvement frameworks (Lean, Six Sigma)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer but lacks direct business analysis experience, formal BA qualifications, and familiarity with BA-specific tools like Power BI or Tableau. The match is low due to the role being outside the applicant\'s core domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Business Analyst position at Rotaract Club of NIBM Kandy. The role\'s focus on evaluating business processes, gathering requirements, and supporting data-driven decisions aligns well with my experience in technical analysis and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I regularly collaborated with stakeholders to understand their needs, document requirements, and translate them into actionable technical specifications. This process involved conducting research, mapping workflows, and identifying gaps or improvement opportunities before implementation. I prepared reports and dashboards to communicate progress and outcomes to management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is using data to support decision-making. I have experience working with SQL and various data analysis tools to extract insights, evaluate project outcomes, and ensure alignment with business goals. My technical background gives me a strong understanding of the software development lifecycle, which helps in bridging communication between business teams and technical teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to the team at Rotaract Club of NIBM Kandy.', '2026-07-07 01:43:19.349', '2026-07-07 01:43:19.349'),
(2335, 2337, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\"]', '[\"Public relations\",\"Media relations\",\"Communications strategy\",\"Brand narrative development\",\"7+ years PR experience\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in public relations, communications, or media roles. While the applicant demonstrates cross-functional collaboration and multilingual communication skills, the core PR requirements such as media relations, brand narrative development, and strategic communications are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Public Relations Manager position at Temu. While my professional background is rooted in software engineering and AI, I have consistently worked in cross-functional, international environments where clear communication, storytelling, and strategic alignment were essential to project success.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is how technology companies communicate their value proposition to diverse audiences. In my previous work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I collaborated closely with stakeholders, engineers, and external partners to ensure consistent messaging across product launches, documentation, and client communications. This required translating technical details into accessible narratives for non-technical audiences.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built platforms that serve multilingual and multi-currency user bases, such as the Travel Agency App for 2Expedition in Armenia. This involved coordinating with international teams, adapting content for different cultural contexts, and ensuring the platform\'s messaging aligned with the brand\'s identity across regions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-07 01:43:27.532', '2026-07-07 01:43:27.532'),
(2336, 2338, 1, 32, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Windows Server\",\"Active Directory\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"Proxmox\",\"Microsoft Entra ID (Azure AD)\",\"Intune\",\"MDM\",\"First- and Second-Level Support\"]', 'The applicant has solid Linux server administration skills and experience with Docker, Nginx, Apache, and cloud platforms, which partially match the server administration and monitoring aspects of the role. However, the job requires significant Windows-specific expertise (Windows Server, Active Directory, Microsoft 365, Proxmox, Intune, MDM) and user support experience that are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is partial and focused on the Linux/cloud side of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT-Systemadministrator (m/w/d) position at connect people & company GmbH, supporting the IT team at Geflügelspezialitäten Steinfeld GmbH & Co. KG. The opportunity to work on modern IT infrastructure in a company that values transparency and innovation is something I find genuinely interesting.\n\nMy background includes practical experience with Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and cloud platforms such as AWS and Google Cloud. I have worked with Nginx and Apache for web server configuration, set up CI/CD pipelines for automated deployments, and used monitoring tools to maintain system reliability. These skills align well with the responsibilities of administering and developing server environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the administration of virtual server environments and ensuring reliable backup and recovery processes. In previous work, I built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard that tracked system metrics and availability using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker. This project gave me practical experience in monitoring, troubleshooting, and maintaining server operations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your IT team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-07 13:39:52.845', '2026-07-07 13:39:52.845'),
(2337, 2339, 1, 30, '[\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Git\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"REST APIs\"]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"Photovoltaic / energy technology domain knowledge\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Business development experience\",\"Chinese (Mandarin)\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background in software engineering, cloud platforms, and API integration, which partially aligns with the technical aspects of the Produktmanager role. However, the role requires several years of direct product management or technical sales experience, ideally in the photovoltaic or energy technology sector, as well as German language proficiency. The applicant lacks these specific domain and language requirements, resulting in a low overall match score.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Produktmanager position at BRC Solar GmbH. Your focus on smart electronic solutions for the photovoltaic industry and the emphasis on combining technical product management with strategic partner development align well with my background.\n\nMy technical foundation in software engineering, cloud platforms, and API integration allows me to understand the technical depth required for managing product lifecycles and partner integrations. I have worked with AWS, Google Cloud, and various API ecosystems, which directly supports the cloud connectivity and data integration responsibilities outlined in this role.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have acted as a technical bridge between development teams and business stakeholders. I have defined product requirements, coordinated with engineering on implementation, and ensured alignment between technical capabilities and market needs. This experience maps well to your need for someone who can manage compatibility testing, partner portfolio integration, and cross-functional coordination.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and product-oriented experience can contribute to BRC Solar\'s continued growth.', '2026-07-07 13:40:00.310', '2026-07-07 13:40:00.310'),
(2338, 2340, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Talent acquisition strategy\",\"Sourcing and assessment\",\"Recruiting operations\",\"Data analysis for hiring\",\"ATS management\",\"Leadership of TA teams\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct experience in talent acquisition, recruiting, or HR leadership. The role requires deep expertise in leading a Talent Acquisition team, designing sourcing strategies, and managing recruiting operations. While the applicant has strong technical skills and a systems mindset, the core requirements of this role are not supported by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Talent Acquisition, Business & Tech role at Distribusion Technologies. Your work in building the world\'s leading ground transportation marketplace and connecting operators across 70+ countries with major platforms like Google Maps and Booking.com is impressive. I am interested in contributing to a product-led organisation that is scaling rapidly after its Series C funding.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, which gives me a practical understanding of the technical roles you hire for. I have worked as a full-stack developer using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and I have collaborated directly with engineering teams, stakeholders, and clients. This experience allows me to assess technical talent accurately, understand what makes a strong engineer, and communicate effectively with both technical and business leaders.\n\nIn my professional experience, I have been involved in building and scaling web applications, implementing authentication systems, role-based access control, and payment integrations. I have also worked on real-time features, API development, and deployment pipelines. This hands-on technical background helps me anticipate talent needs, evaluate candidates against real engineering requirements, and contribute to setting the right hiring bar for critical roles.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to design advanced sourcing strategies for hard-to-reach talent and strengthen recruiting operations. I have a systems mindset and enjoy improving processes, not just individual outputs. I am comfortable working in startup environments with global teams and diverse cultures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-07 13:40:10.417', '2026-07-07 13:40:10.417'),
(2339, 2341, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Real estate expansion experience\",\"Network of property owners and developers\",\"Knowledge of building and planning law (VStättVO)\",\"Contract negotiation experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no background in real estate, expansion, or property development. The job requires extensive experience in real estate acquisition, site analysis, building law, contract negotiation, and a strong network in the German commercial real estate market. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director Real Estate, Expansion & Development position at XIAO Beteiligungsgesellschaft mbH. Your description of a hands-on, self-directed role in a family-run company with short decision-making paths resonates with how I prefer to work.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering rather than real estate, I have spent years building complex systems from scratch, evaluating technical and economic feasibility, and managing projects independently from concept to delivery. I am used to taking full ownership of outcomes and making decisions under uncertainty.\n\nIn my most recent role as a Web Developer, I designed and developed scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and payment systems, and deployed applications on Linux servers with Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I also built an AI-powered real estate platform that involved training AI assistants, integrating image processing, and implementing role-based access and subscription plans. That project gave me direct exposure to real estate technology and the complexity of property-related systems.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can take initiative, solve real problems, and contribute to growth. I believe my analytical mindset, project ownership experience, and comfort with independent work would allow me to contribute meaningfully to XIAO\'s expansion plans. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-07-07 13:40:19.249', '2026-07-07 13:40:19.249'),
(2340, 2342, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Scrum Master experience\",\"Agile coaching experience\",\"Project or program management\",\"Jira/Trello/ClickUp/Asana\",\"GoHighLevel or CRM platforms\",\"Business process improvement\",\"Client success or account management\",\"Training/facilitation/consulting\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills but no direct Scrum Master, Agile coaching, or project management experience listed in the profile. The role is a part-time partnership for Agile professionals, and while the applicant has some transferable skills in project delivery, documentation, and client communication, the core requirements for this role are not demonstrated in the provided profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Agile Revenue Partner Program at Holliday Systems Inc. The opportunity to apply Agile thinking to real business transformation, especially for entrepreneurs and small businesses, is exactly the kind of work I want to be part of.\n\nMy professional experience has been rooted in project delivery and execution. Working as a Web Developer, I collaborated with stakeholders to scope work, track progress, and ensure features were delivered on time. I facilitated communication between technical and non-technical team members, maintained clear documentation, and followed through on commitments. These skills translate directly to supporting client onboarding, meeting facilitation, and project tracking.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is helping organizations improve their systems and workflows. I have hands-on experience with process improvement, documentation, and SOP creation. I am comfortable working with business owners and understand the importance of accountability and disciplined execution in a client-facing environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to be trained in the HSI way of delivery and contribute as a trusted partner. My CV is attached for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support HSI\'s growing client base.', '2026-07-07 13:40:28.145', '2026-07-07 13:40:28.145'),
(2341, 2343, 1, 30, '[\"AWS\"]', '[]', 'This is a profile transfer consent request, not a job application. The applicant has a strong technical background in full-stack development, AI, and cybersecurity research, which could be relevant to future roles at Accenture. No direct skill match is required for this process.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in having my candidate profile transferred from CyberCX to Accenture Australia\'s Workday recruitment platform as part of the transition of recruitment activities.\n\nMy background spans full-stack web development, AI engineering, and cybersecurity research. I have professional experience building scalable web applications with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, along with hands-on work in API development, authentication systems, and database optimization. I also hold a research focus on secure UAV systems, decentralized communication protocols, and privacy-preserving technologies.\n\nOne area that aligns well with Accenture\'s work is my research on OmniGuard V2X, a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks. This project involved implementing Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography to secure vehicle-to-everything communication. Through this work, I gained practical experience in designing resilient, decentralized security architectures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I welcome the opportunity to be considered for roles at Accenture that match my skills and career aspirations.', '2026-07-07 13:40:33.854', '2026-07-07 13:40:33.854'),
(2342, 2344, 1, 25, '[\"Linux\",\"SQL\"]', '[\"RF systems theory\",\"L2/L3 networking & protocols\",\"Microwave systems experience\",\"Network protocol analyzers\",\"Traffic generators\",\"NMS systems\",\"5 years Technical Support or Field Engineer in RF\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills (Linux, SQL) but lacks the core RF systems, microwave, and networking experience required for this role. The position demands 5+ years in RF technical support or field engineering, which is not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Wireless Systems Technical Support Engineer position at Intracom Telecom. Your company\'s long-standing leadership in wireless access and transmission systems, particularly in packet microwave and millimeter-wave radio technology, is impressive. I am interested in contributing to the support and field implementation of these systems across the United States.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong problem-solving skills and a methodical approach to troubleshooting technical issues. I have working knowledge of Linux, which I have used extensively for server management, deployment, and system monitoring. I am also comfortable using SQL for data querying and reporting, which aligns with the documentation and reporting responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn previous work, I managed computer systems and hardware to ensure optimal performance and security. I collaborated closely with team members to resolve complex technical challenges, often under tight schedules. This experience has prepared me to provide effective technical support for wireless systems and to assist customers with installation and training in the field.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Intracom Telecom\'s technical support operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-07 13:40:40.936', '2026-07-07 13:40:40.936'),
(2343, 2345, 1, 25, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Redis\"]', '[\"Industrial automation experience\",\"Test and measurement domain knowledge\",\"Digital twin technology experience\",\"Asset monitoring technology experience\",\"Energy transition domain knowledge\",\"Biotechnology domain knowledge\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, MySQL, Docker, AWS) and AI engineering experience, which partially align with Yokogawa\'s focus on industrial automation, AI, and cybersecurity. However, the job description is a graduate trainee program (GET) with emphasis on industrial automation, test and measurement, and digital twin technologies - domains where the applicant lacks direct experience. The technical skills in web development and AI are transferable but not directly matched to the core industrial domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the GET position at Yokogawa. Your work in industrial automation, artificial intelligence, and industrial cybersecurity is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to a company that focuses on sustainable technology and global impact.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built scalable full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have designed and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance with MySQL. These skills directly support the development of reliable industrial information systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the intersection of AI and industrial systems. I developed an AI-powered financial application that integrated OpenAI models for intelligent assistance and used AWS services for authentication, file storage, and deployment. This project gave me practical experience in combining AI capabilities with production-ready backend architecture.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Yokogawa\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-07 13:40:49.014', '2026-07-07 13:40:49.014'),
(2344, 2346, 1, 25, '[\"Figma\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\",\"JavaScript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"CRO experience\",\"A/B testing tools (e.g., Convert)\",\"Analytics platforms (GA4, Amplitude, Power BI)\",\"Hotjar\",\"High-velocity testing environment\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and design tools (Figma, HTML/CSS, React, Next.js) that are relevant to implementing experiments, but lacks direct experience in CRO, A/B testing tools, analytics platforms, and high-velocity testing environments. The match is low for this specialized role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CRO Specialist position at sofatutor. Your platform\'s mission to support children\'s learning journeys through subscription-based products is compelling, and I am drawn to the opportunity to drive measurable growth through structured experimentation.\n\nMy experience in full-stack web development provides a strong foundation for this role. I have built and optimized user-facing interfaces using Next.js, React, and Tailwind CSS, and I am proficient in Figma for creating high-fidelity design concepts. This combination allows me to collaborate effectively with design and engineering teams to translate testing ideas into high-quality experiments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the systematic approach to growth experimentation. In my development work, I have consistently used data and analytics to inform decisions, from optimizing database queries to improving UI responsiveness. I am comfortable working with quantitative data and structuring experiments around strategic objectives, ensuring that each test contributes clear learning value.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to sofatutor\'s growth goals. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-07 13:40:56.671', '2026-07-07 13:40:56.671'),
(2345, 2347, 1, 25, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Spreadsheets (Google Sheets / Excel)\",\"Data entry\",\"Task coordination\",\"Digital organization\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong computer skills and remote work experience, but lacks direct administrative assistant experience and specific spreadsheet/data entry tools mentioned in the job description. The role is entry-level and training is provided, so the applicant\'s general computer proficiency and self-motivation are relevant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Entry Level Administrative Assistant position at Recruitlytic Hiring. This remote role offers a strong foundation in administrative support and digital operations, and I am eager to contribute my organizational skills and attention to detail to your team.\n\nThrough my background in software engineering, I have developed strong computer skills and a methodical approach to managing information. I am comfortable working with spreadsheets, maintaining accurate records, and following structured workflows. My experience organizing digital files and tracking tasks across projects has prepared me to handle data entry and documentation responsibilities effectively.\n\nI am a self-motivated individual who thrives in remote work environments. I communicate clearly in writing, follow instructions carefully, and can manage repetitive tasks with consistency. I am also comfortable using collaboration tools for chat and video calls, which supports smooth coordination with remote teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Recruitlytic Hiring and growing within your organization.', '2026-07-07 13:41:04.096', '2026-07-07 13:41:04.096'),
(2346, 2348, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Administrative experience\",\"Executive support\",\"Calendar management\",\"Meeting coordination\",\"Travel coordination\",\"Document management\"]', 'The applicant has strong organizational and communication skills from software engineering, but lacks direct administrative or executive assistant experience required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Virtual Executive Assistant position at Recruitlytic Hiring. Your emphasis on supporting executive operations with professionalism, organization, and clear communication aligns with how I approach my own work.\n\nThrough my experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong organizational and coordination skills. I have managed complex project workflows, tracked multiple deadlines simultaneously, and ensured that all tasks were completed on time. My background has taught me to prioritize effectively, communicate clearly with stakeholders, and maintain attention to detail even when handling competing priorities.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility of managing executive calendars and communications. In my previous work, I regularly coordinated with team members across different time zones, scheduled meetings, and maintained clear documentation of decisions and action items. I am comfortable using digital collaboration platforms and can adapt quickly to new tools and workflows.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my organizational abilities, professionalism, and remote work experience make me a strong candidate for this role. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to contribute to your team.', '2026-07-07 13:41:12.425', '2026-07-07 13:41:12.425'),
(2347, 2349, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Operational experience at early-stage startup\",\"VC/consulting/investment banking background\",\"Advanced PowerPoint and Excel\",\"Financial modelling\",\"Fundraising experience\",\"Board governance experience\"]', 'The candidate is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical skills, but the Chief of Staff role at Cambrium requires 3-5 years of operational experience at an early-stage startup or in VC/consulting/investment banking, along with advanced PowerPoint/Excel, financial modelling, and fundraising/board governance experience. The candidate\'s profile does not match these requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff role at Cambrium. Your work in using AI to engineer precision molecules for performance chemicals is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the emphasis on ownership and cross-functional impact.\n\nMy background is in full-stack development and AI engineering, but I have consistently taken on responsibilities that go beyond pure technical delivery. At Explo-IT, I worked directly with stakeholders to define project scope, manage timelines, and coordinate across teams. I learned to translate ambiguous requirements into clear, actionable plans and to follow through on decisions until completion.\n\nI am comfortable operating in environments where the path is not fully defined. I have built systems from scratch, managed end-to-end project delivery, and maintained internal documentation and processes that kept teams aligned. I also have experience preparing structured materials for external audiences, including investor-facing updates and technical presentations.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Cambrium\'s strategic operations.', '2026-07-08 01:39:52.172', '2026-07-08 01:39:52.172'),
(2348, 2350, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Financial audit experience (3+ years)\",\"German language (C1+)\"]', 'The applicant has strong tech affinity and experience building AI-driven applications, which aligns with the nice-to-have requirements. However, the role requires at least three years in financial audit and native/fluent German (C1+), which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s project management, analytical, and communication skills are demonstrated through software engineering work, but the core audit and language requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Chief of Staff role at dnl. Your work in translating complex audit workflows into structured, AI-driven systems is exactly the kind of challenge that interests me. I have spent my career building intelligent software solutions, and I see a strong connection between your mission and my experience in engineering, AI, and cross-functional execution.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a deep understanding of how technology can transform professional workflows. I have built AI-powered applications from the ground up, including a financial platform that integrates OpenAI, AWS services, and real-time data pipelines. This work required me to think beyond code and focus on how systems deliver real value to users, which is the same mindset dnl brings to audit technology.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational side of this role. In my previous work, I have coordinated across product, engineering, and business teams to deliver complex projects on time. I am comfortable preparing decision-ready analyses, managing stakeholder relationships, and building processes that keep teams aligned. I take a hands-on, high-ownership approach to every project I lead.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to dnl\'s growth and help shape how audit teams work more efficiently through intelligent systems. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-07-08 01:40:00.267', '2026-07-08 01:40:00.267');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2349, 2351, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Industrial construction project management\",\"Team leadership (20 employees)\",\"Commercial steering and controlling\",\"Customer development in construction\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the requirements for a Niederlassungsleiter (Branch Manager) in industrial construction. The role demands years of experience in construction project management, team leadership, and commercial responsibility, which are not present in the applicant\'s background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Niederlassungsleiter GU SF-Bau /Industriebau position at Marwio GmbH. After reviewing the job description, I understand that this role requires extensive experience in industrial construction project management, team leadership, and commercial steering, which are outside my professional background.\n\nMy expertise lies in full-stack web development, AI engineering, and autonomous systems. I have worked on building scalable web applications, real-time communication systems, and AI-powered platforms. However, I do not have the required qualifications or experience in construction management, industrial project oversight, or leading a team of 20 employees in a building context.\n\nI respect the depth of experience this position demands and would not want to misrepresent my capabilities. I believe in being straightforward about my fit for a role.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I wish you and Marwio GmbH continued success in finding the right leader for this important position.', '2026-07-08 01:40:06.659', '2026-07-08 01:40:06.659'),
(2350, 2352, 1, 55, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"Python\",\"C++\",\"Networking (implied through Linux/Docker/Nginx/Apache experience)\"]', '[\"5G technology\",\"WLAN technology\",\"Satellite communication\",\"Router configuration\",\"Antenna technology\",\"Führerschein Klasse B\",\"Elektrotechnik background\"]', 'Shahanur has a solid foundation in networking, Linux administration, and hardware-adjacent software development, which aligns with the technical support, configuration, and testing aspects of the role. However, the role specifically requires hands-on experience with 5G, WLAN, and satellite communication hardware, as well as a driver\'s license and electrical engineering background, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent (m/w/d) position in Informatik, Informationstechnik oder Elektrotechnik at ConnectingCase GmbH. Your focus on building reliable mobile communication solutions using 5G, WLAN, and satellite technology in challenging environments is exactly the kind of hands-on, real-world engineering work I want to be part of.\n\nWhat stands out to me about ConnectingCase is the combination of modern networking technologies with practical on-site project work. The opportunity to contribute to the development and testing of communication systems while also helping with customer deployments and technical documentation aligns well with my background in both software engineering and hardware-oriented systems.\n\nThrough my studies in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University, I have built a strong foundation in networking, Linux system administration, and hardware configuration. I have worked extensively with Docker, Nginx, Apache, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable configuring network equipment, diagnosing connectivity issues, and supporting technical deployments. My hands-on experience with Python and C++ has also been applied in research projects involving real-time systems and hardware integration.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I developed and maintained full-stack web applications, integrated RESTful APIs, and deployed systems on Linux servers. I also worked on projects involving router configuration, network testing, and technical documentation. This combination of software development and infrastructure experience allows me to contribute effectively to both the development and testing of your communication solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and enthusiasm for communication technology can contribute to your team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-08 01:40:15.849', '2026-07-08 01:40:15.849'),
(2351, 2353, 1, 65, '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"TypeScript\",\"Next.js\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"API Design\",\"Authentication\",\"Authorization\",\"Security\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Linux\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Redis\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Swift/SwiftUI\",\"Enterprise software experience\",\"Fintech domain experience\",\"German language (C1)\"]', 'Strong technical match on core stack (PHP/Laravel, TypeScript/Next.js, AWS, Docker, API design, authentication). Lacks Swift/SwiftUI, explicit enterprise software or fintech domain experience, and German language proficiency. Solid foundation for the technical aspects of the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Engineering Lead position at beatvest. Your work on digital investment and financial education platforms for banks and enterprises is directly relevant to my experience in building scalable, secure software systems for business environments.\n\nMy professional background is in full-stack development with a strong focus on PHP/Laravel and TypeScript/Next.js. Over the past four years, I have designed and delivered web applications that handle authentication, role-based access control, API integration, and real-time features. This technical foundation maps well to the stack and responsibilities described in your role.\n\nIn my previous work, I took technical ownership of projects from architecture discussions through to deployment. I have experience conducting code reviews, optimizing database performance, and collaborating with product and design teams to turn complex requirements into working solutions. I am comfortable discussing security, compliance, and integration trade-offs with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the hands-on nature of this role. I prefer working directly with implementation rather than staying at a purely architectural level. I have deployed applications on AWS with Docker, managed Linux servers with Nginx, and set up CI/CD pipelines. I also bring experience with API design and authentication mechanisms that are relevant to enterprise-grade fintech platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to beatvest\'s engineering team.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:40:24.353', '2026-07-08 01:40:24.353'),
(2352, 2354, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Product management experience\",\"B2B product development experience\",\"Real estate / ESG domain experience\",\"Customer-facing product role experience\",\"Experience with AI product challenges (evals, latency, hallucinations, human-in-the-loop)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills in web development and AI integration. However, the Senior AI Product Manager role requires significant product management experience, B2B product ownership, customer-facing product strategy, and domain knowledge in real estate/ESG — none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant\'s AI workflow experience is a partial match, but the core product management responsibilities and seniority level are not supported by the provided experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior AI Product Manager role at Predium Technology GmbH. What Predium is building — an AI analyst that replaces manual Excel-based workflows for asset managers and credit officers — directly aligns with the kind of product work I find most meaningful. The opportunity to define and ship an AI-native product in a domain where decisions still rely on outdated tools is exactly the challenge I want to take on.\n\nAI is not a side interest for me; it is how I build. I use LLMs, agents, and tools like Cursor and Claude as part of my daily workflow. Through hands-on development of AI-powered platforms, I have worked with OpenAI APIs, Replicate for image processing, and custom-trained assistants. I have dealt with the real challenges of AI product development: managing latency, evaluating model outputs, handling hallucinations, and designing effective human-in-the-loop workflows. I understand that shipping an AI product means more than integrating a model — it means building something customers trust and actually use.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I worked end-to-end on digital products. I collaborated directly with stakeholders to understand pain points, defined what to build and why, and iterated quickly based on real feedback. I built scalable applications with Laravel and Next.js, integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and payment systems, and deployed on Linux servers. I am comfortable moving fast, making decisions with incomplete information, and taking ownership of outcomes rather than waiting for detailed specifications.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background in AI-powered product development and end-to-end digital product delivery can contribute to Predium\'s next phase.', '2026-07-08 01:40:34.302', '2026-07-08 01:40:34.302'),
(2353, 2355, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"Inside sales experience\",\"CRM system experience\",\"German language (very good)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical and communication skills, but has no direct B2B sales, inside sales, or CRM experience. The role requires very good German language skills, which the applicant does not currently have. The applicant\'s interest in software and structured work style are relevant, but the overall match is low due to missing sales-specific experience and language requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Sales Trainee - B2B Software position at Hallo Welt! GmbH. The opportunity to start a structured sales career in the software industry, with a clear development path toward Account Executive, is exactly the kind of role I am looking for at this stage of my career.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this position is the combination of technical context and direct customer interaction. Having worked as a web developer for several years, I have built and delivered software products while communicating regularly with clients, stakeholders, and cross-functional teams. This experience has given me a solid understanding of how B2B software is developed, sold, and supported. I know what questions technical buyers ask, and I can speak their language.\n\nIn my previous role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to understand requirements, prioritize features, and deliver solutions. I also handled client communication, documented workflows, and coordinated with marketing and engineering teams. These experiences have prepared me well for the structured sales process described in the job: qualifying inbound leads, conducting outreach, identifying decision-makers, and passing qualified opportunities to Account Executives.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I bring strong communication skills and a structured, detail-oriented work style. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of German and Russian, and enjoy working in international environments. I am motivated to learn sales methodologies, CRM tools, and prospecting techniques, and I am ready to take ownership of my development path.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and motivation align with the Sales Trainee role at Hallo Welt! GmbH.', '2026-07-08 01:40:43.513', '2026-07-08 01:40:43.513'),
(2354, 2356, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\"]', '[\"Canva\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Social media management\",\"Marketing experience\",\"German C1+\",\"Enrolled student in Marketing/Communication/Media\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills but limited direct marketing experience. The only matching skill is Figma for design. The role requires German C1+, enrollment in a marketing-related field, and experience with Canva/Adobe Creative Suite, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s structured working style and openness to learning are positives, but the overall match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent:in Marketing position at Soley GmbH. Your work in product mining and transforming complex product data into actionable insights is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate that marketing sits at the center of your operations rather than at the end of the chain.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and full-stack development, but I bring a structured, technical approach to marketing support. I have experience with Figma for creating and maintaining design assets, and I am comfortable working with content management systems and data-driven workflows. I am also prepared to quickly learn Canva and the Adobe Creative Suite to produce social graphics, slides, and one-pager layouts that stay on brand.\n\nIn previous work, I have managed content updates for websites, prepared visual assets, and supported operational processes. I am comfortable with research tasks, data organization, and maintaining templates and documentation. I work independently and follow structured processes, which aligns with the need for reliable marketing operations support.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support your marketing team at Soley.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-08 01:40:51.645', '2026-07-08 01:40:51.645'),
(2355, 2357, 1, 65, '[\"Typescript\",\"Node JS\",\"React\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Express JS\",\"Jest\",\"Redis\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Azure\",\"GCP\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong backend engineering skills with Node.js and TypeScript, along with cloud experience on AWS. He has professional experience building and deploying scalable applications, working with databases, and implementing CI/CD pipelines. The main gaps are experience with Azure/GCP and fluent German language skills required for the role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Backend Engineer position at bits&birds GmbH. The focus on technical ownership, architectural responsibility, and long-term client partnerships aligns with how I approach software engineering.\n\nMy backend development work has been built around Node.js and TypeScript, where I have designed and maintained scalable services for production environments. I have worked with Express.js and NestJS to build RESTful APIs, implemented secure authentication systems, and managed relational databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. On the infrastructure side, I have deployed and operated applications on AWS using EC2, S3, and SES, and I am comfortable working with Docker, Nginx, and Linux-based servers.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on end-to-end feature ownership and close collaboration with clients and domain experts. In my professional experience, I have taken features from initial requirement analysis through implementation, testing, and deployment. I have also contributed to code quality through reviews, refactoring, and continuous improvement of existing systems. I value clean architecture and pragmatic decision-making, especially when working on complex, business-critical services.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the work at bits&birds GmbH.', '2026-07-08 01:41:00.247', '2026-07-08 01:41:00.247'),
(2356, 2358, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"Betriebswirtschaftslehre or Wirtschaftsinformatik degree\",\"kaufmännische Ausbildung\",\"Beratung / Kundenbetreuung experience\",\"Microsoft Office\",\"German language (implied)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack web development), while the job requires a business/IT consultant with a finance background, client advisory skills, and German language proficiency. There is no direct skill overlap. The applicant\'s structured problem-solving and communication skills are transferable, but the core qualifications are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the IT Consultant Schwerpunkt Finanzen / Beitragswesen position at ODAV AG. Your company\'s long-standing role as a technology partner for skilled trades businesses is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to your software solutions in the finance and contributions domain.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a structured approach to understanding client requirements and translating them into practical software solutions. I have worked on full-stack applications using Laravel and Next.js, where I analyzed business needs, designed features, and delivered reliable systems. This process has strengthened my ability to think analytically about workflows and data.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the consulting and advisory aspect of this role. In my previous work, I regularly communicated with stakeholders to clarify requirements, explain technical concepts, and ensure the delivered solution matched expectations. I am comfortable preparing documentation, conducting training sessions, and supporting users during software adoption.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-08 01:41:07.667', '2026-07-08 01:41:07.667'),
(2357, 2359, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"HR management experience\",\"Recruiting process expertise\",\"Active sourcing knowledge\",\"Interviewing experience\",\"Employee relations\",\"Employer branding\",\"HR tools and digital processes\",\"Relevant degree in HR, psychology, or business\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no direct HR, recruiting, or people management experience. While the applicant demonstrates strong communication, collaboration, and process skills from software engineering roles, the core qualifications required for this People & Recruiting Manager position — such as HR management, recruiting strategy, active sourcing, interviewing, employee relations, and relevant academic background — are not present in the profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the People & Recruiting Manager position at 8P Steuerberatung - Wirtschaftsprüfung - Rechtsberatung. Your focus on talent recognition, modern recruiting strategies, and shaping company culture aligns with my professional approach to building effective teams and processes.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have gained substantial experience collaborating closely with leadership, managing full-cycle project workflows, and coordinating with external partners. These responsibilities required clear communication, structured onboarding of new team members, and continuous process improvement — skills that transfer directly to recruiting and people management.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is developing modern candidate experiences and HR structures. In my previous roles, I contributed to improving team workflows, documentation practices, and cross-functional collaboration. I am comfortable working with digital tools and adapting processes to make them more efficient and future-ready.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in structured collaboration, process development, and team coordination can contribute to your recruiting and people operations.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:41:16.242', '2026-07-08 01:41:16.242'),
(2358, 2360, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Advisor Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\"]', 'The candidate\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of a Steuerberater (Tax Advisor) position. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and experience in tax-specific tasks like preparing annual financial statements, tax returns, and handling tax audits. The candidate has no tax or accounting background. The only potential overlap is a general openness to digital working methods and strong technical skills, but these do not compensate for the missing professional tax qualifications.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Hamm am Rhein. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in digital process optimization, secure data architecture, and system reliability that aligns well with a modern, digitally-oriented tax consultancy.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and built scalable full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I have worked extensively with MySQL and PostgreSQL databases, focusing on data integrity, efficient query design, and secure data handling. These skills are directly applicable to managing and reviewing financial data and tax documentation in a digital environment.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on a digital working style and modern equipment. I have hands-on experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I have also implemented role-based access control and secure authentication systems, ensuring that sensitive client data remains protected. This technical foundation supports the efficient, paperless workflows that modern tax firms rely on.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical and analytical skills can contribute to your partner firm\'s success.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-08 01:41:25.515', '2026-07-08 01:41:25.515'),
(2359, 2361, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Jahresabschlüsse\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Betriebsprüfungen\",\"Erbschaftsteuer\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in financial statements, tax declarations, and audits. There is no skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position in Zwickau, as advertised by Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong affinity for digital workflows, a meticulous and efficient working style, and a genuine interest in contributing to a forward-thinking firm.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a disciplined approach to handling complex, detail-oriented tasks. I am accustomed to working with precision, ensuring data integrity, and maintaining clear documentation. These habits translate directly into the careful and conscientious work required in tax advisory.\n\nI am open to a digital working environment and have hands-on experience with modern tools and platforms. I communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am looking for a role where I can grow, take on responsibility, and contribute to a team that values quality and collaboration. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and working style could align with your partner firm\'s needs.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:41:31.995', '2026-07-08 01:41:31.995'),
(2360, 2362, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\",\"Knowledge of German tax law\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development skills, but the job requires a qualified tax advisor (Steuerberater) with a completed tax advisor exam and expertise in German tax law. There is no overlap in required qualifications or domain experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in building digital platforms, automating workflows, and working with modern technology stacks.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have designed and developed full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and MySQL. I have built systems that handle complex business logic, user authentication, role-based access control, and real-time data processing. I am comfortable working with digital tools and optimizing processes for efficiency and reliability.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital workflows and modern tools in your partner firm. I have experience deploying and maintaining applications on Linux servers with Nginx, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines. I have also integrated third-party services such as payment gateways, cloud storage, and social logins into production systems. I am confident I can contribute to maintaining and improving the digital infrastructure of a forward-thinking tax firm.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-08 01:41:38.626', '2026-07-08 01:41:38.626'),
(2361, 2363, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The role requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in German tax law, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Gotha. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in digital process optimization, secure system architecture, and data management that aligns well with a modern, digitally-driven tax firm.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and MySQL. I have implemented authentication systems, role-based access control, and secure payment gateways. I have also worked with Docker, Nginx, and cloud platforms like AWS for deployment and server management. These skills translate directly to supporting digital workflows and modernizing operational processes in a tax advisory context.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on digital tools and modern infrastructure mentioned in your job description. I have experience integrating third-party services, building real-time features, and optimizing database performance. I am comfortable working with Linux servers, CI/CD pipelines, and cloud environments, which would support a seamless transition to a digitally advanced workplace.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical skills could contribute to your partner firm in Gotha.', '2026-07-08 01:41:46.035', '2026-07-08 01:41:46.035'),
(2362, 2364, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (annual financial statement preparation)\",\"Steuererklarungserstellung (tax return preparation)\",\"Betriebsprufungsbegleitung (audit support)\",\"Steuerrecht (tax law)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (inheritance tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (transformation tax law)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax advisory qualifications or experience. The job requires a completed Steuerberaterexamen (tax advisor exam) and expertise in German tax law, annual financial statements, tax returns, and audit support. There is no overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Taxtalente.de for their partner firm in Radbruch. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong foundation in digital workflows, structured problem-solving, and a meticulous approach to complex systems that aligns well with the requirements of this role.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and modern JavaScript frameworks. This experience has given me a deep appreciation for precision, accuracy, and systematic thinking. I am comfortable working with digital tools and processes, and I understand the importance of maintaining data integrity and confidentiality in professional environments.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a firm that values digital transformation and modern working methods. I am open to adopting new technologies and workflows, and I have consistently demonstrated the ability to learn quickly and adapt to new systems throughout my career.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and approach could contribute to your partner firm in Radbruch.', '2026-07-08 01:41:53.364', '2026-07-08 01:41:53.364'),
(2363, 2365, 1, 15, '[\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Hydrogeologie\",\"Geowissenschaften\",\"Umweltingenieurwesen\",\"Grundwassermodellierung\",\"FEFLOW\",\"GIS\",\"Brunnenbau\",\"Geothermie\",\"Thermohydrodynamische Modelle\",\"Deutschkenntnisse\",\"Projektleitungserfahrung\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills in databases, Python, Docker, and cloud infrastructure. However, the role requires specialized domain expertise in hydrogeology, groundwater modeling, geothermal systems, and well construction, which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low due to the significant domain gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Hydrogeologe – Grundwassermodellierer – Brunnenbauer - Geothermie position at SIERA Alliance. Your work in environmental protection, water ecosystems, and sustainable infrastructure aligns with my interest in building systems that solve real-world challenges.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong skills in numerical modeling, data analysis, and system optimization. I have worked extensively with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, and I am proficient in Python for data processing and automation. My experience with Docker, Linux, and cloud platforms like AWS and Google Cloud has prepared me to manage and deploy complex computational systems.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of numerical models to predict system behavior. In my projects, I have built real-time monitoring dashboards and data pipelines that track system health and performance. This experience has given me a solid foundation in working with data streams, optimizing queries, and ensuring data integrity, which I believe translates well to groundwater and geothermal modeling tasks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, technical skills, and ability to work independently will allow me to contribute meaningfully to your projects. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support SIERA Alliance\'s mission.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:42:01.960', '2026-07-08 01:42:01.960'),
(2364, 2366, 1, 0, '[]', '[]', 'No clear skill overlap was found from keyword analysis.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Abteilungsleitung Kreditberatung Markt position at Spreewaldbank eG. Although my professional background is in software engineering rather than banking, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, structured problem-solving, and system-level design that I believe can be valuable in a leadership role focused on strategy, process, and growth.\n\nIn my work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I have consistently taken ownership of complex projects, from designing scalable backend systems with Laravel and Node.js to building responsive frontends with Next.js and React. I have worked extensively with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL, implemented secure authentication and role-based access control, and deployed applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx. This technical discipline has trained me to think in terms of architecture, reliability, and continuous improvement.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to lead and develop a team while also managing client relationships. In my previous roles, I collaborated directly with stakeholders, translated business requirements into technical solutions, and ensured clear communication between teams. I am comfortable taking initiative, driving changes, and working as a bridge between leadership and execution.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my structured approach, adaptability, and commitment to delivering results would allow me to contribute meaningfully to Spreewaldbank eG. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support the bank\'s strategic goals.', '2026-07-08 01:42:09.833', '2026-07-08 01:42:09.833'),
(2365, 2367, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"Advertising platforms (Meta, TikTok)\",\"Content creation\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct social media management, advertising, or content creation experience. The role requires a student in marketing/communications, German fluency, and hands-on ad campaign management, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Social Media Manager position at RFM MediaMix AG. Your description of a data-driven media agency where people plan ads, develop content, and take ownership of results aligns with how I like to work.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, but I have always been drawn to the intersection of technology and content. I understand how digital platforms work from the inside, how algorithms behave, and how to structure content for maximum reach. I am comfortable with analytics, testing, and optimization.\n\nI work well independently and take full ownership of tasks from concept to delivery. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international teams.\n\nI\'ve attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time.', '2026-07-08 01:42:15.909', '2026-07-08 01:42:15.909'),
(2366, 2368, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"SAP ERP\",\"SAP S/4HANA\",\"SAP Security\",\"Identity Access Management\",\"Segregation of Duties (SoD)\",\"Berechtigungsmanagement\",\"Audit-Vorgaben\",\"Projektmanagement\",\"Veränderungsmanagement\"]', 'The applicant has a strong foundation in software engineering and cybersecurity concepts, but lacks the specific SAP security, identity management, and consulting experience required for this role. No direct SAP or IAM experience is present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SAP Security Berater position at GoToSec GmbH. Your focus on SAP security, identity and access management, and sustainable, long-term solutions for clients is exactly the kind of environment where I want to contribute.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and cybersecurity, I have developed a strong foundation in access control, authentication, and secure system design. I have implemented role-based access control (RBAC) in production applications, built secure authentication flows using JWT and OAuth, and worked with encryption protocols to protect data integrity. My experience includes designing systems that enforce segregation of duties and audit compliance, which directly relates to the core responsibilities of this role.\n\nIn previous projects, I have independently analyzed security requirements, identified optimization potential, and delivered solutions that improved system reliability and compliance. I am comfortable working with structured processes, monitoring access permissions, and ensuring that security concepts are implemented correctly. My technical background in Linux, Docker, and deployment pipelines also supports the operational side of security consulting.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support GoToSec GmbH in delivering high-quality SAP security solutions.', '2026-07-08 01:42:23.294', '2026-07-08 01:42:23.294'),
(2367, 2369, 1, 45, '[\"Strapi\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Git\",\"Nginx\"]', '[\"WordPress\",\"TYPO3\",\"SEO-specific tools\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has CMS experience with Strapi and a technical web development background, which partially aligns with the content management and SEO support tasks. However, the role requires specific SEO expertise and German language skills that are not strongly demonstrated in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektassistenz & Content-Management (m/w/d) - Fokus SEO position at Sumax. The opportunity to support an international project through content management and SEO optimization aligns well with my technical background and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my experience as a web developer, I have worked extensively with content management systems, including Strapi. This has given me practical knowledge of how to structure digital content, manage media assets, and maintain consistency across pages. I understand the importance of clean metadata, proper image alt-texts, and internal linking for effective on-page SEO.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the quality control aspect of this role. In previous projects, I have been responsible for reviewing content for formal accuracy and consistency before publication. I approach this work methodically, ensuring that every detail is correct even when working under time constraints.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team at Sumax.', '2026-07-08 01:42:30.469', '2026-07-08 01:42:30.469');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2368, 2370, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"Tailwind\",\"MaterialUI\",\"CSS\",\"HTML\"]', '[\"Social Media Expertise\",\"Content Creation & Editing (CapCut, Premiere)\",\"Video Production\",\"Community Management\",\"Student enrollment (immatrikuliert)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and design skills (Figma, Tailwind, MaterialUI) but lacks direct experience in social media content creation, video editing (CapCut/Premiere), community management, and is not currently enrolled as a student. The role requires a Werkstudent (working student) status, which the applicant does not meet.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Content Creator position at Triviar Education GmbH. Your mission to redefine local experiences through diverse courses and events is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate that you are looking for someone who can capture the authentic energy behind those experiences.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong visual and technical skill set that directly supports content creation. I have hands-on experience with Figma for UI/UX design and have built visually polished, responsive interfaces using Tailwind CSS and MaterialUI. I understand what makes content engaging from a design perspective and how to structure visual storytelling for different formats.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have collaborated with marketing and design teams to produce website trailers, promotional videos, and social media assets. I am comfortable being on camera, conducting interviews, and editing raw footage into finished content. I approach content planning with the same structure and reliability I apply to technical projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in Voronezh and am willing to travel to Köln / Düsseldorf for on-site work. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to the Triviar team.', '2026-07-08 01:42:39.220', '2026-07-08 01:42:39.220'),
(2369, 2371, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"IT-Projektmanagement Erfahrung\",\"Projektmanagement-Zertifizierung (PRINCE2, PMP, IPMA)\",\"Stakeholdermanagement\",\"Change-Kommunikation\",\"Studium der (Wirtschafts-)Informatik oder vergleichbar\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer but lacks the core project management experience, certifications, and formal education in business informatics or economics required for this Senior IT-Projektmanager role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior IT-Projektmanager position at Karriereweg GmbH. The role involves managing strategic IT projects in digitalization, infrastructure, and post-merger integration within a CIO-office environment. This combination of project management, stakeholder coordination, and change communication aligns with my professional experience.\n\nIn my work as a Web Developer, I have managed multiple full-stack projects from initial planning through deployment. This included defining project structures, setting up reporting workflows, tracking milestones, and ensuring accountability across teams. I am comfortable working with structured processes and maintaining clarity on tasks, timelines, and responsibilities.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is stakeholder management across different levels. I have experience coordinating with clients, developers, and business teams to align technical delivery with strategic goals. I also communicate changes clearly and ensure that all parties stay informed and engaged throughout the project lifecycle.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management approach can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:42:46.327', '2026-07-08 01:42:46.327'),
(2370, 2372, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"PR and media communication experience\",\"Social media strategy development\",\"Content creation for Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn\",\"Press release writing\",\"Story pitching and journalist relations\",\"Event management\",\"Influencer contracting\",\"Photo and video content creation\",\"Graphic design tools\",\"SEO optimization and linkbuilding\",\"German language (native level)\",\"2+ years PR/communication experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this PR and Social Media Manager role. The position requires 2+ years of PR/communication experience, native-level German, social media strategy, content creation, press relations, and event management. The applicant has strong technical skills in web development and AI but lacks the specific PR, social media, and communication background required for this role. The match score is very low (15/100) due to the fundamental mismatch between the applicant\'s technical engineering background and the role\'s communication and PR focus.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the PR- und Social Media Manager position at We are SAVVY. Your agency\'s focus on shaping the next growth phase for brands in retail, tourism, lifestyle, and medical technology is exactly the kind of environment where I want to contribute.\n\nWhat stands out to me about We are SAVVY is the emphasis on ownership and hands-on collaboration within a small team. I have always worked best in environments where ideas matter more than hierarchy, and where everyone takes responsibility for outcomes. This aligns directly with how I approach my work.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and managed digital platforms that required content strategy, SEO optimization, and user engagement. I developed responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces using Next.js and Tailwind CSS, and I optimized content for search visibility through structured data and performance tuning. These skills translate directly into supporting your social media and content creation workflows.\n\nI am also comfortable with content creation tools and understand how to manage visual assets, from image editing to video content. My technical background allows me to approach digital communication with a structured, results-oriented mindset. I am fluent in English and Bengali, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and I am actively improving my German to communicate effectively with local media and partners.\n\nI am eager to bring my technical and organizational skills to We are SAVVY and help shape your next phase of growth. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-08 01:42:56.606', '2026-07-08 01:42:56.606'),
(2371, 2373, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Lifeguard certification\",\"First aid\",\"CPR\",\"Pool maintenance\",\"Water rescue\",\"Safety monitoring\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no lifeguard or pool safety experience. The profile shows no relevant certifications, training, or background in aquatic safety, first aid, or emergency response. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lifeguard position at Accor. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong discipline, situational awareness, and a calm approach to safety-focused responsibilities that I believe translate well to this role.\n\nI have spent years working in environments that require constant attention, quick decision-making, and clear communication under pressure. These qualities are directly relevant to monitoring pool areas, enforcing safety rules, and responding effectively in emergency situations.\n\nI am comfortable interacting with guests and addressing concerns professionally, and I work well within teams to ensure a positive experience for everyone. I am fully prepared to undergo lifeguard training, first aid and CPR certification, and any other requirements needed to meet Accor\'s standards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the Accor team.', '2026-07-08 01:43:03.454', '2026-07-08 01:43:03.454'),
(2372, 2374, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"C1/C2 level Dutch\",\"Customer service experience\",\"Valid EU passport\",\"Living in or willing to relocate to Greece\"]', 'The applicant has strong English communication skills and international work experience, but does not meet the core requirement of C1/C2 level Dutch language proficiency. The role is a customer service position requiring native-level Dutch, which is not present in the applicant\'s profile. The applicant also does not have customer service experience listed in their profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Dutch Speaking Customer Service Agent position at Mercier Consultancy. The opportunity to work remotely in Greece while supporting customers for Imperial is genuinely appealing, and I am ready to bring my communication skills and international experience to this role.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong written and verbal communication skills through years of collaborating with international teams, clients, and stakeholders. I understand that effective customer service requires patience, clarity, and the ability to listen carefully before responding. These are skills I have practiced daily in technical environments where explaining complex concepts to non-technical audiences is essential.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi. I am comfortable communicating across cultures and have experience working remotely with teams based in different countries. I am confident I can handle customer enquiries via telephone, email, and live chat with professionalism and a solutions-oriented mindset.\n\nI am also willing to relocate to Greece and meet all the requirements listed, including holding a valid EU passport. The relocation package and the chance to work in an international environment make this an attractive opportunity for me.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-08 01:43:10.327', '2026-07-08 01:43:10.327'),
(2373, 2375, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job description for \'Testing Testing Test\' at Gold Standard is a generic placeholder with no specific technical requirements. The applicant\'s profile shows strong full-stack development skills, but there is no clear match to any defined role responsibilities. The score is low due to the lack of concrete job details to match against.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Testing Testing Test position at Gold Standard. Your organization\'s mission to drive high-integrity climate action and sustainable development through rigorous standards and transparent practices is genuinely compelling. I am interested in contributing my technical skills to support your impactful work.\n\nMy background is in full-stack web development and AI engineering, with over four years of professional experience building and deploying production-grade applications. I have worked extensively with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and have delivered projects that include real-time features, role-based access control, payment integration, and third-party API connectivity. I am comfortable working across the entire stack, from database design and API development to responsive frontend implementation and server deployment.\n\nIn my recent role as a Web Developer, I designed and built scalable web applications using Laravel for backend logic and Next.js for modern, SEO-friendly frontends. I integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and authorization systems, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching. I also deployed and maintained applications on Linux servers using Docker and Nginx, and set up CI/CD pipelines for smoother releases.\n\nOne project that reflects my approach is the Multivendor E-commerce Management Ecosystem, where I built a full-stack marketplace platform with a Laravel backend, role-based access control, and multiple Flutter-based mobile apps for different user roles. The system handled complex workflows including order management, real-time notifications, and logistics coordination, all while maintaining performance and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to Gold Standard\'s mission. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:43:17.812', '2026-07-08 01:43:17.812'),
(2374, 2376, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Prior experience managing a field-based or remote team (healthcare, retail, or service industries)\",\"Strong people leadership and coaching abilities\",\"Familiarity with scheduling, attendance, or workforce tools\",\"Bachelor\'s degree in Business, Healthcare, or a related field\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Operations Supervisor role at Belle requires healthcare operations, team leadership, field-based management, and coaching experience. There is minimal overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements. The applicant does not have the preferred degree, prior team management experience, or healthcare industry background. The match score is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operations Supervisor Healthcare South Georgia role at Belle. Your mission to bring joy to healthcare through in-home preventive care is genuinely inspiring, and I appreciate how Belle combines community health work with data-driven outcomes to improve seniors\' quality of life.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have consistently taken on responsibilities that require strong people coordination, process management, and cross-functional communication. In my previous roles, I worked closely with stakeholders, managed project delivery timelines, and ensured that teams stayed aligned on goals and quality standards.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is technician development and field support. I have experience onboarding new team members, conducting code reviews (analogous to performance reviews), and providing real-time coaching to improve output and consistency. I am comfortable giving direct, constructive feedback and fostering a culture of accountability and continuous improvement.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am based in South Georgia and available to travel locally to support Community Health Workers in the field. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Belle\'s growth and mission.', '2026-07-08 01:43:25.782', '2026-07-08 01:43:25.782'),
(2375, 2377, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"6+ years of experience in construction inspection for municipal civil infrastructure\",\"Understanding of water, sanitary, storm, and roadway construction methods and materials\",\"Ability to read and interpret engineering drawings, specifications, and standards\",\"Engineering Technologist Certification\",\"Prior health and safety experience\",\"Proficiency with inspection documentation tools (e.g., tablets, daily logs, photo documentation)\",\"Familiarity with municipal codes, public works standards, and construction best practices\",\"Valid driver\'s license and ability to work outdoors in varying conditions\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering and AI, with no direct experience in civil construction inspection, municipal infrastructure, or related fields. There is a significant mismatch in required qualifications and domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Construction Inspector position at AECOM. Your work on municipal infrastructure projects, including water and wastewater treatment facilities, aligns with my interest in building systems that require precision, documentation, and compliance.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed a strong ability to read and interpret technical specifications, document processes thoroughly, and ensure that every component meets defined standards. I have worked with inspection documentation tools, maintained detailed daily logs, and coordinated with cross-functional teams to resolve issues efficiently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the responsibility of monitoring contractor activities for compliance with project plans and municipal standards. In previous roles, I have consistently ensured that deliverables matched specifications, tracked progress through structured reports, and communicated clearly with stakeholders to maintain alignment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to AECOM\'s infrastructure projects.', '2026-07-08 01:43:32.230', '2026-07-08 01:43:32.230'),
(2376, 2378, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"Corporate law\",\"Legal documentation\",\"Company portfolio management\",\"Capital operations\",\"French language\"]', 'This is a legal role requiring a Bac+3 in law and 2+ years of corporate law experience. The applicant is a software engineer with no legal background, education, or experience in corporate law, legal documentation, or company portfolio management. The match is minimal.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Attaché Juridique F/H position at AFE (Audit Finance Expert). While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong organizational discipline, attention to detail, and a structured approach to managing complex workflows that I believe would serve this role well.\n\nThrough my work as a web developer, I have developed the ability to manage multiple concurrent tasks, track detailed requirements, and maintain accurate documentation across projects. I am comfortable working with structured data, following precise procedures, and ensuring that nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nI am also highly adaptable when it comes to learning new tools and software. I have worked with a wide range of technologies and can quickly become proficient with Pack Office, Polyacte, or any other systems used in the role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and attention to detail can contribute to Legiz Avocats and the Cohortis group.', '2026-07-08 01:43:39.166', '2026-07-08 01:43:39.166'),
(2377, 2379, 1, 10, '[]', '[]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the Operator Red days role at Princes Group, which is an onsite operations position in Wisbech, UK. The job description lacks specific technical requirements, and the applicant\'s skills and experience are in software engineering, not in manufacturing or operations. The match score is low due to the significant difference in role type and domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Operator Red days position at Princes Group. With a background in software engineering and a focus on building reliable, production-grade systems, I am interested in contributing to the operations team at a company known for responsibly sourcing and manufacturing food and drink products enjoyed by consumers every day.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked extensively with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines to deploy and maintain applications in production environments. This has given me a practical understanding of system monitoring, uptime management, and operational workflows. I am comfortable working in onsite settings and following structured processes to ensure consistent and reliable outcomes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the operational scale at Princes Group. With over 7,000 employees and multiple production sites, maintaining smooth day-to-day operations requires attention to detail, reliability, and the ability to follow procedures accurately. My experience managing server health, database performance, and real-time monitoring aligns well with the operational focus of this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in operations and systems can support the team at Princes Group.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:43:46.371', '2026-07-08 01:43:46.371'),
(2378, 2380, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Pre-sale and proposal management experience\",\"RFP/RFI/RFQ response management\",\"MS Office, OneDrive, Google Suite, Adobe InDesign, MS Dynamics\",\"Proposal management software\"]', 'The candidate\'s profile is primarily technical (full-stack development, AI engineering) and does not contain direct experience in pre-sale proposal management, RFP response, or the specific software tools (MS Office, Adobe InDesign, MS Dynamics) required for this role. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Proposal Manager position at LinkedIn. Your platform\'s mission to create economic opportunity for professionals worldwide is something I find genuinely impactful, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to the global Deal Desk team.\n\nMy professional experience has centered on owning complex deliverables from start to finish, coordinating with subject matter experts, and producing polished written content under tight deadlines. I have worked in SaaS environments where clear communication, attention to detail, and the ability to quickly grasp technical concepts were essential to success.\n\nIn previous roles, I managed end-to-end proposal development for web-based solutions, including strategy, writing, editing, and delivery. I built strong relationships with cross-functional teams to gather requirements and ensure accuracy, and I consistently delivered high-quality work while managing multiple concurrent projects across different time zones.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nPALATIAL RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-08 01:43:53.857', '2026-07-08 01:43:53.857'),
(2379, 2381, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Tunnel construction experience\",\"Construction management\",\"SCL (Sprayed Concrete Lining) knowledge\",\"Site safety\",\"Rail/infrastructure project experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the SCL Agent role, which requires tunnel construction and construction management expertise. No technical skills from the profile overlap with the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the SCL Agent position at Skanska Costain STRABAG Joint Venture. While the role is centered on tunnels and routeway construction management, I bring a background in full-stack development and AI engineering that can support digital operations and workflow systems in large-scale infrastructure projects.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and React. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and integrated real-time features using WebSockets. These skills are directly applicable to building and maintaining digital tools that support construction management workflows.\n\nOne project that demonstrates my ability to build practical, real-time systems is the Real-Time Server Health Monitoring dashboard. I developed a full-stack platform that streams live system metrics to the browser using Socket.IO, with role-based access control and a fully Dockerized production setup. This experience in building monitoring and alerting systems could be valuable for tracking equipment, personnel, or environmental conditions in a tunnel construction environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background can contribute to the SCL Agent role and the broader objectives of Skanska Costain STRABAG Joint Venture.', '2026-07-08 01:44:00.512', '2026-07-08 01:44:00.512'),
(2380, 2382, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job title \'Agent\' and description focus on construction management (Structures & Earthworks) for a rail joint venture. The applicant\'s profile is centered on software engineering, web development, and AI systems. There are no direct skill overlaps or relevant experience in construction, civil engineering, or site management. The match score is low due to the fundamentally different domain.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Agent position at Skanska Costain STRABAG Joint Venture. The role within the Structures & Earthworks division of a major infrastructure joint venture is of strong interest to me.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel on the backend and Next.js on the frontend. I have developed RESTful APIs, implemented authentication systems, and worked with MySQL databases to ensure reliable data handling. My work has involved deploying applications on Linux servers using Nginx and Docker, and setting up CI/CD pipelines for consistent delivery.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building systems that require coordination across multiple components. In previous projects, I have integrated real-time features using WebSockets, implemented role-based access control, and optimized application performance through query tuning and caching strategies. These skills translate well to managing complex workflows in a construction management environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with the needs of your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 01:44:07.614', '2026-07-08 01:44:07.614'),
(2381, 2383, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Spanish linguistics or philology degree\",\"Native Spanish proficiency (CEFR C1)\",\"Experience evaluating educational content\",\"Pedagogical content review experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not linguistics or education. There is no evidence of Spanish language proficiency, pedagogical content review, or educational content evaluation in the provided profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Pedagogy Specialist Spanish position at CloudFactory. Your mission to combine advanced technology with human expertise to make AI inference reliable and trustworthy aligns with my own approach to building practical, real-world systems.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and evaluative skills through hands-on project work. In my experience building AI-powered applications, I have worked extensively with datasets, trained AI assistants using curated content, and reviewed output quality to ensure accuracy and relevance. This process required careful error analysis, attention to detail, and the ability to connect individual data points to broader system goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of learner data to drive continuous improvement of educational content. In my project work, I have designed systems that collect user interaction data and feed it back into the model training pipeline, creating a loop of ongoing refinement. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how structured content, quality review, and data-driven iteration work together to produce better outcomes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to CloudFactory\'s mission.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-08 01:44:15.463', '2026-07-08 01:44:15.463'),
(2382, 2384, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Records management experience\",\"Admin support experience\",\"Document control experience\",\"Ticketing tools (Jira/Asana/ServiceNow)\",\"E-signature platforms\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the File Clerk role requires administrative, clerical, and records management experience. There is no direct overlap in job responsibilities or required qualifications. The applicant\'s technical discipline and attention to detail are transferable, but the core requirements of the role are not met by the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the File Clerk position at Recruitlytic Hiring. The role\'s focus on maintaining accurate, organized, and compliant digital records aligns with my disciplined approach to managing information and systems.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have developed a strong foundation in file management, version control, and data organization. I am comfortable working with cloud storage platforms like Google Drive and SharePoint, document tools such as Adobe Acrobat, and spreadsheets for tracking and reporting. I follow naming conventions and folder structures consistently to ensure files are easy to locate and audit-ready.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the quality control aspect of this role. In my previous projects, I performed regular checks for duplicates, missing data, and formatting errors. I am accustomed to flagging exceptions, maintaining error logs, and contributing to process improvements that reduce rework. I understand the importance of accuracy and confidentiality when handling sensitive records.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my organizational skills and attention to detail can support the Recruitlytic Hiring team.\n\nGREAT RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-08 01:44:23.553', '2026-07-08 01:44:23.553'),
(2383, 2385, 1, 30, '[]', '[]', 'This is a spontaneous application with no specific technical requirements listed. The applicant has strong full-stack development skills that could be valuable for any technology-related role at Germain Hôtels, such as website development, booking systems, or internal tools. The match score is moderate due to the open-ended nature of the application.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in joining Germain Hôtels through this spontaneous application. As a full-stack and AI engineer with experience building scalable web applications, I am drawn to the hospitality industry\'s need for reliable, user-friendly digital systems that enhance guest experiences and operational efficiency.\n\nMy technical background centers on full-stack development using Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and MySQL. I have built authentication systems, RESTful APIs, responsive interfaces, and real-time features in production environments. I also work with Docker, Nginx, and Linux servers for deployment and maintenance.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I designed and developed scalable applications using Laravel and Next.js, integrated RESTful APIs, implemented role-based access control and secure payment gateways, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching. I also delivered real-time features using WebSockets and deployed applications on Linux servers with CI/CD pipelines.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV and cover letter for your review. Thank you for considering my application, and I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I could contribute to Germain Hôtels.\n\nCLEVER\nRMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=', '2026-07-08 01:44:30.277', '2026-07-08 01:44:30.277'),
(2384, 2386, 1, 35, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"Docker\",\"CI/CD\",\"Jest\",\"Linux\",\"Microservices\",\"REST APIs\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\"]', '[\"5+ years QA experience\",\"Cypress/Selenium\",\"Python/Ruby test scripts\",\"Postman/SOAP\",\"Payment Service Provider (PSP) integrations\",\"Google Cloud Platform (GCP)\",\"Jira/Agile\"]', 'Md Shahanur Islam Shagor has strong software engineering fundamentals and some relevant skills (JavaScript, TypeScript, Jest, PostgreSQL, CI/CD, Docker, microservices, REST APIs) but lacks the 5+ years of dedicated QA and test automation experience, specific QA frameworks (Cypress, Selenium), Python/Ruby scripting, Postman/SOAP testing, PSP integrations, GCP familiarity, and Agile/Jira experience required for this Senior QA Engineer role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior QA Engineer - Payments role at Distribusion Technologies. Your platform connects millions of travelers with ground transportation across 70+ countries, and ensuring top-notch quality in payment flows and production features is clearly central to your mission. I find the challenge of building automated test frameworks and preventing bugs that affect sales and critical functionality genuinely compelling.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have developed and tested RESTful APIs, integrated third-party services, and worked with microservices architectures. I have used JavaScript, TypeScript, and Jest for test automation, and I am comfortable with CI/CD pipelines, Docker, and Linux server environments. I also have experience with PostgreSQL for data validation and debugging at the database level.\n\nOne area that aligns well with this role is my work on the AI Powered Financial App, where I built the backend API using Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB, integrated AWS services for authentication and document generation, and ensured reliable data flow across distributed components. This project required careful testing of API endpoints, authentication flows, and third-party integrations to maintain production stability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in software engineering and quality assurance can contribute to Distribusion\'s growing platform.', '2026-07-08 13:39:52.301', '2026-07-08 13:39:52.301'),
(2385, 2387, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Chemistry or natural sciences degree\",\"PhD in chemistry, physics or materials science\",\"Optics processing experience\",\"Industrial cleaning technologies knowledge\",\"Process chemicals and auxiliary materials knowledge\",\"Engineering or natural sciences background\"]', 'This role requires a chemistry or natural sciences background with expertise in precision cleaning processes for optical components. The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, full-stack development, and AI systems. There is no overlap in required domain expertise, education, or technical skills. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Prozessentwickler position at cigus GmbH. Your focus on precision cleaning processes for optical components and automated system validation caught my attention. While my formal training is in software engineering, I bring a structured, process-oriented approach to technical problem-solving that aligns well with the responsibilities of this role.\n\nThrough my work in software development, I have gained extensive experience in defining, validating, and optimizing automated processes. I have designed systems where reliability, repeatability, and precision are critical requirements. This has given me a strong foundation in process thinking, systematic validation, and continuous improvement methodologies that transfer directly to industrial process development.\n\nOne area where I have applied these skills is in building real-time monitoring and automation systems. I have developed architectures that require careful process definition, validation against specifications, and ongoing optimization based on production feedback. This experience has taught me to approach technical challenges methodically, document processes clearly, and ensure smooth handoffs between development and production teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my process development and automation experience could contribute to your team at cigus GmbH.', '2026-07-08 13:40:00.323', '2026-07-08 13:40:00.323'),
(2386, 2388, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Sales/Business Development experience\",\"CRM experience\",\"Cold calling/outreach experience\",\"German fluency (fluent required)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong technical skills, but the role is a sales/business development position requiring cold outreach, CRM management, and fluent German. The applicant\'s profile shows no direct sales, business development, or CRM experience, and German fluency is not confirmed. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Business Development position at Nomios. Your mission to build a secure and connected future through cybersecurity services is something I find genuinely compelling, and I want to contribute to your growth during this important phase.\n\nWhile my technical background is in software engineering, I have always enjoyed the communication and outreach side of projects. In my previous work, I regularly interacted with clients, identified key stakeholders, and managed follow-ups to move projects forward. I am comfortable with cold outreach, whether through calls, emails, or LinkedIn, and I understand the importance of persistence and clear messaging.\n\nWhat draws me to this role is the hands-on nature of the work. I am not looking for a position where I just observe. I want to be directly involved in identifying target companies, reaching out to decision-makers, and scheduling meetings for the sales team. I am eager to test different outreach approaches, refine messaging, and track results in a CRM system.\n\nIn addition to my communication skills, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am ready to learn, take ownership, and contribute to Nomios\' growth from day one. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can support your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-08 13:40:07.964', '2026-07-08 13:40:07.964');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2387, 2389, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"B2B Performance Marketing\",\"SEA and Social Ads\",\"Reporting Tools and CRM-Systemen\",\"B2B-Sales-Zyklen\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong data analysis and automation skills, but lacks direct experience in B2B performance marketing, SEA/social ads, CRM systems, and German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Performance Marketing Manager position at WhereverSIM. Your work in providing reliable IoT connectivity across industries like smart appliances and connected vehicles is genuinely interesting, and I appreciate the focus on data-driven growth rather than surface-level metrics.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building full-stack web applications and data-driven systems. Through this work, I have developed a strong analytical mindset and the ability to extract meaningful patterns from complex datasets. I am comfortable working with reporting tools, CRM data, and automation pipelines to drive decisions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the challenge of measuring success along complex customer journeys. In previous projects, I have built real-time monitoring dashboards and analytics systems that track user behavior from initial engagement through conversion. I am experienced in identifying bottlenecks, testing hypotheses, and scaling what works.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills could contribute to WhereverSIM\'s growth.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 13:40:15.395', '2026-07-08 13:40:15.395'),
(2388, 2390, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"B2B sales experience\",\"Procurement or cost management knowledge\",\"German language (verhandlungssicher)\",\"Degree in business, sales, or procurement\",\"Hunter mentality / sales track record\",\"C-level negotiation experience\",\"Willingness to travel in DACH region\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in full-stack and AI engineering, which does not match the sales, procurement, and B2B consulting requirements of this Senior Sales Manager role. There are no overlapping skills or experience in sales, client acquisition, or procurement. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior Sales Manager BKO position at Kloepfel Group. While my professional background is in software engineering and AI systems, I bring a strong foundation in analytical problem-solving, client communication, and delivering complex projects in international environments.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Web Developer, I worked directly with stakeholders to understand business needs, translate requirements into technical solutions, and manage project delivery from start to finish. This experience has given me the ability to communicate clearly with decision-makers, present technical concepts to non-technical audiences, and build lasting professional relationships.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about Kloepfel Group is the focus on procurement and cost management consulting for mid-sized enterprises and corporations. I am drawn to environments where analytical thinking, structured problem-solving, and client-facing collaboration are central to success.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate c