(2389, 2391, 1, 25, '[\"C++\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Embedded C++\",\"Windows (Visual Studio)\",\"Linux-Realtime-Erweiterungen\",\"Cyber Security\",\"STIG Listen\",\"Medizintechnik\",\"Scrum\",\"Unit Testing\",\"Integration Testing\",\"Deutsch\"]', 'The applicant has foundational C++ and Linux skills, but lacks the specialized embedded C++ development experience, medical imaging domain knowledge, Windows (Visual Studio) development, real-time Linux extensions, cyber security expertise, STIG list experience, and German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Softwareentwickler Embedded C++ (m/w/d) position at ASTRUM IT GmbH. Your focus on developing software for medical imaging in an agile Scrum environment aligns well with my technical background and interest in building reliable, high-performance systems.\n\nThrough my academic and project work, I have developed strong proficiency in C++ and Linux system development. I have experience working with embedded systems, writing efficient code, and performing thorough testing and debugging. My work has involved designing modular software components, implementing unit and integration tests, and ensuring code quality through systematic review processes.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the hardening and security aspect of embedded systems. I have practical experience with Linux system administration, OS updates, and security best practices. I am comfortable working with existing codebases, understanding their architecture, and contributing to their improvement while maintaining stability and performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my C++ and Linux expertise to your medical imaging project and grow within ASTRUM IT\'s collaborative and innovative environment. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-08 13:40:29.791', '2026-07-08 13:40:29.791'),
(2390, 2392, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"HR Business Partner experience (5+ years)\",\"German labor law knowledge\",\"Works council experience\",\"Employee lifecycle management\",\"Recruiting and talent management\",\"HR operations and reporting\",\"German language (fluent)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR, People & Culture, or German labor law experience. The role requires 5+ years as an HR Business Partner, deep knowledge of German labor law, works council collaboration, and fluent German. There is a significant skill and experience gap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the HR Business Partner (m/w/d) in VZ position at AXS Germany GmbH. Your work as a global ticketing provider for major venues and events is impressive, and I am drawn to the opportunity to contribute to a growing international People & Culture function.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering rather than HR, I bring strong cross-functional collaboration skills and experience working effectively across international teams. In my previous roles, I have worked closely with stakeholders at different levels to understand business needs, translate them into clear action plans, and deliver results in structured, organized ways. This has given me a practical understanding of how to support teams through change and align local priorities with broader organizational goals.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is culture development and integration. Through my work with diverse teams across Bangladesh, Russia, and Europe, I have learned how to navigate cultural differences, communicate clearly across time zones, and build trust with colleagues from varied backgrounds. I am comfortable working independently, managing multiple priorities, and maintaining a solutions-oriented approach even under pressure.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience could support AXS Germany GmbH in achieving its People & Culture objectives.', '2026-07-08 13:40:38.041', '2026-07-08 13:40:38.041'),
(2391, 2393, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\"]', '[\"Social Media Management (Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn)\",\"Content Creation (Photo, Video, Reel)\",\"Google Ads\",\"Meta Ads\",\"Canva\",\"Recruiting Campaigns\",\"Marketing Strategy\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical web development skills (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Laravel, Next.js) which partially align with the \'website maintenance and development\' aspect of the role. However, the core requirements of the Marketing-Allrounder position focus on social media management, content creation, and advertising (Google Ads, Meta Ads), which are not present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Marketing-Allrounder position at TR31 Ventures GmbH. The opportunity to actively shape and develop multiple companies across different brands appeals to me, and I appreciate the emphasis on taking responsibility and bringing ideas to life.\n\nMy professional background includes over four years of web development experience, where I have focused on building, maintaining, and optimizing websites. This directly relates to your need for someone who can care for and further develop your companies\' web presences. I have a strong eye for detail and can identify errors and improvement potential on websites, ensuring they remain effective and professional.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have worked with technologies like Laravel, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS to create responsive, user-friendly interfaces. I have also integrated third-party services and optimized application performance. This technical foundation allows me to manage website updates, troubleshoot issues, and implement new features independently.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the chance to discuss how my skills can contribute to the growth and visibility of your companies. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-07-08 13:40:45.484', '2026-07-08 13:40:45.484'),
(2392, 2394, 1, 55, '[\"Docker\",\"Kubernetes\",\"AWS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\",\"Python\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"TypeScript\",\"Javascript\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"MySQL\",\"Redis\",\"Prometheus\",\"Grafana\",\"Git\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"LLM-specific frameworks (vLLM, Ollama)\",\"Knowledge Graphs\",\"Agent-based architectures\",\"RAG approaches\",\"Observability stacks for AI\",\"Human-in-the-loop systems\",\"German language (C1)\",\"Regulated industry experience (finance)\",\"EU AI Act / GDPR AI context\",\"Architecture workshop facilitation\",\"C-level consulting experience\"]', 'The applicant has a solid foundation in AI engineering with hands-on experience building production AI systems using OpenAI, AWS, and related tools. They have relevant infrastructure skills including Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD. However, the role requires specific expertise in LLM deployment frameworks (vLLM, Ollama), knowledge graphs, agent-based architectures, and RAG approaches that are not present in the profile. The role also requires German language proficiency (C1) and experience in regulated industries, which the applicant does not currently demonstrate. The seniority level and consulting/architecture workshop expectations may exceed the applicant\'s current experience level.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Senior AI Architect & Consultant role at MAI Group. The opportunity to design and bring productive AI systems to life for regulated industries aligns directly with the kind of engineering work I pursue.\n\nThrough research and development work, I have built production-oriented AI systems that integrate LLMs, computer vision, and backend services. One example is an AI-powered financial application where I developed the API using Express, TypeScript, OpenAI, and AWS, and implemented AI assistants trained on custom datasets. Another project involved an AI real estate platform where I integrated Replicate API for image processing and Stripe for payments, with role-based access control and subscription management. These experiences have given me practical understanding of architecting AI solutions that go beyond prototypes and operate reliably in real environments.\n\nA relevant example of my work with scalable infrastructure is a real-time server health monitoring dashboard I built using React, Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker. The system streams live metrics to the browser and runs in a fully containerized production setup. I have also worked with Kubernetes, Prometheus, and Grafana for observability, and I am comfortable deploying and optimizing AI workloads on container orchestration platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI engineering and system architecture can contribute to MAI Group\'s growing AI portfolio.', '2026-07-08 13:40:54.886', '2026-07-08 13:40:54.886'),
(2393, 2395, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Maschinenbau (Mechanical Engineering) degree\",\"Technical leadership experience in a manufacturing/industrial setting\",\"Experience in Konstruktion (construction/design), Produktion (production), or technischem Projektmanagement (technical project management) in mechanical engineering\",\"German language proficiency (sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse)\",\"Experience in Fertigungs- und Qualitätsprozesse (manufacturing and quality processes)\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with full-stack development experience, but the job requires a technical leadership role in mechanical engineering (Maschinenbau) with a focus on manufacturing, production, and quality processes. The applicant lacks the required engineering degree, industry-specific experience, and German language skills. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Technische Leitung position at Franke + Pahl Fachkräfte GmbH. The opportunity to take technical ownership, lead a team, and drive product and process improvements in an international industrial environment aligns with my professional experience and career direction.\n\nMy technical background is in software engineering, where I have worked across the full stack using Laravel, Next.js, Node.js, and React. Over the past four years, I have delivered production applications, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and deployed systems on Linux servers using Docker and CI/CD pipelines. I have experience coordinating technical projects from planning through deployment, working closely with stakeholders to identify improvements and deliver reliable solutions.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I led the development of scalable web applications and collaborated with engineering teams and business stakeholders. I was responsible for optimizing application performance through query tuning and caching strategies, integrating third-party services including payment gateways and cloud storage, and ensuring smooth deployment and maintenance on Nginx and Apache servers. This experience has given me a practical understanding of managing technical workflows and delivering results in a team environment.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical leadership and project management experience can contribute to the continued success of your team.', '2026-07-08 13:41:04.276', '2026-07-08 13:41:04.276'),
(2394, 2396, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"HR management\",\"German labour law\",\"social security law\",\"recruiting\",\"personnel administration\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"healthcare industry experience\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no HR, personnel management, or German labour law experience. The role requires deep HR expertise, knowledge of German regulations, and ideally healthcare industry background. There is a significant mismatch between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Fachkraft für Personalmanagement position at Plenus Care GmbH. Your focus on providing personalized, high-quality intensive care in patients\' own homes, supported by digital tools like iPad documentation and real-time physician access, is a modern and human-centered approach that I find genuinely compelling.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and optimizing digital systems. This experience has given me a strong foundation in structured thinking, process design, data accuracy, and the ability to manage complex workflows with multiple moving parts. I am comfortable working independently, taking ownership of tasks, and ensuring that every detail is handled correctly.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the digitalization and continuous improvement of HR processes mentioned in your description. In my previous work, I have been directly involved in optimizing workflows, implementing new tools, and ensuring that systems operate reliably and efficiently. I approach process improvements with a practical, solution-oriented mindset and am confident I can contribute t