(2396, 2398, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Copywriting experience\",\"Corporate communications experience\",\"Editorial work experience\",\"Native German speaker\",\"Brand voice expertise\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical and AI tool experience, but lacks the core copywriting, editorial, corporate communications experience, and native German language proficiency required for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Copywriter Corporate Communications (gn) position at Bikeleasing-Service GmbH & Co. KG. The role\'s focus on clear, brand-consistent language across internal and external channels, combined with the thoughtful use of AI and digital tools, aligns well with how I approach communication in technical environments.\n\nIn my work as a software engineer, I have regularly translated complex technical concepts into clear, actionable messages for diverse audiences. Whether writing API documentation, project briefs for stakeholders, or internal updates for cross-functional teams, I prioritize clarity, consistency, and audience awareness. I understand how to adapt tone and structure depending on the channel and the reader.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is using AI and digital tools to support text processes without replacing editorial judgment. I have practical experience integrating AI assistants into workflows, training models on domain-specific data, and ensuring output quality through careful review. I apply the same principle here: technology supports the work, but human judgment drives the final result.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with bo