(2397, 2399, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Kaufmännische Ausbildung oder betriebswirtschaftliches Studium\",\"Berufserfahrung im Rechnungswesen oder Accounting\",\"Kenntnisse in Konditions-, Bonus- oder Lieferantenabrechnung\",\"Excel-Kenntnisse\",\"Führungserfahrung oder fachliche Koordination\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, web development, AI) and does not match the core requirements of this accounting and billing management role. There are no matched skills from the profile that align with the job\'s qualifications. The applicant lacks commercial training, accounting experience, Excel expertise, and leadership experience required for this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Teamleitung Abrechnung & Konditionsmanagement position at Franke + Pahl Fachkräfte GmbH. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical capabilities, process optimization experience, and a structured approach to problem-solving that I believe would be valuable in managing complex billing and condition management workflows.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a systematic approach to handling complex data, identifying discrepancies, and building reliable reporting systems. I regularly worked with databases, financial data flows, and reporting tools that required careful attention to accuracy, consistency, and clarity. These skills translate directly to the responsibilities of steering billing processes, reviewing contractual conditions, and creating meaningful reports.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to analyze and optimize existing commercial processes. In my previous roles, I frequently evaluated workflows, identified inefficiencies, and implemented improvements that increased transparency and reduced errors. I am comfortable working across departments, coordinating with different teams, and ensuring that processes run smoothly and reliably.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and process-oriented skills could contribute to your team in Kiel.', '2026-07-08 13:41:33.528', '2026-07-08 13:41:33.528'),
(2398, 2400, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Social media content creation\",\"TikTok/Instagram/YouTube production\",\"Video editing (CapCut, Premiere)\",\"Scriptwriting\",\"On-camera experience\",\"Trend analysis\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no demonstrated experience in social media content creation, short-form video production, scriptwriting, or on-camera work. The role requires hands-on content production for TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical software engineering background. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Praktikant/Werkstudent position at Teaching Finance GmbH & Co. KG. Teaching Socials\' approach to building personal brands in the finance and real estate space through high-impact content is exactly the kind of environment where I want to contribute and grow.\n\nI understand that creating content that stops people from scrolling requires more than just technical skill. It requires a feel for timing, format, and audience psychology. I have spent time studying why certain hooks, storylines, and formats perform well on TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube. I am comfortable writing scripts, developing new content ideas, and working on shoots. I am also ready to appear in front of the camera when needed.\n\nWhat draws me to this role is the emphasis on real responsibility from day one. I am not looking for a position where I simply follow instructions. I want to contribute ideas, test formats, and see what actually drives engagement and growth. I work best in environments where creativity and ownership are encouraged, and where the team moves fast and learns from what works.\n\nIn addition to