(2399, 2401, 1, 15, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"Figma\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\"]', '[\"Go-to-Market experience\",\"Product Marketing experience\",\"Digital Marketing experience\",\"B2B/SaaS experience\",\"PPC experience\",\"Social Media management experience\",\"Content Creation experience\",\"Video editing (Premiere, Photoshop)\",\"Copywriting\",\"Fluent German\"]', 'The applicant has a strong technical background as a full-stack developer and AI engineer, but the Go-to-Market Manager role is primarily a marketing and product launch position requiring experience in go-to-market strategy, digital marketing, content creation, and fluent German. The applicant\'s technical skills (web development, design tools like Figma) provide limited overlap, but the core marketing and language requirements are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Go-to-Market Manager position at Mendato GmbH. Your mission to help cleaning businesses digitize and streamline their operations through smarter software is a compelling challenge. I am drawn to the opportunity to drive market launches and shape how your product reaches its target audience.\n\nMy professional experience as a full-stack developer has given me a strong understanding of how software features are built, tested, and prepared for release. I have worked on planning and implementing feature rollouts for web applications, coordinating between development and business needs to ensure smooth launches. This technical perspective allows me to bridge the gap between product teams and marketing efforts effectively.\n\nIn previous work, I have been responsible for creating content across multiple channels, including writing copy for websites, ads, and newsletters. I have also produced video and image assets for social media platforms, using tools like Figma for design and layout. I am comfortable managing social media accounts and developing content strategies that align with product goals.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background in software product launches and content creation can support Mendato\'s growth.', '2026-07-08 13:41:49.292', '2026-07-08 13:41:49.292'),
(2400, 2402, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Go-to-Market experience\",\"Product Marketing experience\",\"Digital Marketing experience\",\"PPC experience\",\"Social Media management\",\"Content Creation (Video, Image, Text)\",\"Bild- und Videobearbeitung (Canva, Photoshop, Premiere)\",\"Copywriting\",\"Fließende Deutschkenntnisse\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development) and does not match the marketing, content creation, and go-to-market requirements of this role. There is no overlap in required skills such as PPC, social media management, video/image editing, or copywriting. The applicant also lacks the required fluent German language skills.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Go-to-Market Manager position at Mendato GmbH. Your mission to help cleaning companies digitize their operations through smarter workforce planning, invoicing, time tracking, and controlling is a practical and valuable use of technology. I find it interesting how you are applying software solutions to a traditional industry.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and launching digital products. I have experience planning feature rollouts, creating documentation, and supporting go-to-market campaigns for new software releases. I understand the full lifecycle of a product from development to market introduction.\n\nIn previous work, I collaborated with stakeholders to plan and execute launches for new software features. I created technical and non-technical content for websites, newsletters, and social media channels. I also supported lead generation efforts by producing clear, targeted copy for ads and marketing materials.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my product launch and content creation experience can support Mendato\'s growth in Berlin.', '2026-07-08 13:41:56.672', '2026-07-08 13:41:56.672'),
(2401, 2403, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Sales management\",\"B2B sales\",\"CRM management\",\"Business administration\",\"Go-to-market strategy\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no direct B2B sales, account management, or CRM experience. The role requires a sales-oriented background with a focus on client acquisition, product demonstrations, and go-to-market strategies. While the applicant demonstrates strong communication skills and client-facing experience from technical project delivery, the core sales qualifications and domain knowledge are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Account Manager B2B position at SalesViewer GmbH. Your approach to transforming anonymous website traffic into measurable sales opportunities is a genuinely intelligent product, and I find the intersection of sales intelligence and go-to-market strategy compelling.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have spent years working directly with clients and stakeholders in a B2B context. In my role as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I was responsible for understanding client requirements, presenting technical solutions, managing expectations, and ensuring successful delivery. This experience has given me a solid foundation in professional communication, active listening, and relationship building.\n\nWhat draws me to this role is the structured learning curve you offer. I am someone who learns best by doing, and I am ready to start with qualifying inquiries, conducting initial conversations, and learning how to deliver product demonstrations that address real business needs. I am intellectually curious about how companies operate and what drives their purchasing decisions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and motivation align with what you are looking for. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-08 13:42:05.550', '2026-07-08 13:42:05.550'),
(2402, 2404, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Sales/coaching experience\",\"CRM experience (Salesforce)\",\"Telephone sales or SDR experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the sales/coaching focus of this role. There is no overlap in required skills such as sales experience, CRM usage, or telephone communication. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Coach position at Erschaffe dich neu. Your company\'s track record of over a decade in the personal development space and its ambitious vision for global growth stand out to me. I am drawn to the high-performance, results-driven culture you have built.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong communication and relationship-building skills through years of client-facing project work. I am comfortable engaging with people, building trust, and managing structured follow-ups. I am also highly organized and experienced in maintaining clear documentation and tracking progress using digital tools.\n\nI work well in remote, autonomous environments and am used to taking ownership of my responsibilities. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international teams.\n\nI am confident that my structured approach, communication skills, and ability to work independently would allow me to contribute effectively to your team. I have attached my CV for your review.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 13:42:12.479', '2026-07-08 13:42:12.479'),
(2403, 2405, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Ads\",\"Google Merchant Center\",\"GA4\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Performance Marketing\",\"SEA\",\"Microsoft Ads\",\"Web Analytics\",\"Feed Management\",\"Team Leadership\",\"Client Management\",\"German language\",\"5+ years SEA experience\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack software engineer with no direct experience in SEA, Google Ads, or performance marketing. The role requires 5+ years of SEA experience, deep knowledge of Google Ads tools, team leadership, client management, and fluent German. There is no skill overlap with the core requirements of this position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Unit-Lead SEA / Google Ads position at anocus GmbH. Your focus on helping e-commerce companies reach their full potential through Google Ads and web analytics is a compelling mission, and I appreciate the emphasis on personal development, operational excellence, and transparency within your team.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have spent over four years building and maintaining web applications. I have strong experience with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js, and I am comfortable working with databases like MySQL and PostgreSQL. I also have hands-on experience with automation, API integration, and deployment workflows using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the technical side of campaign management and analytics. I am comfortable working with scripts, data analysis, and technical implementations. In my professional experience, I have built systems that handle real-time data, role-based access control, and third-party service integration, which gives me a solid foundation for understanding the technical requirements of SEA tools and web analytics platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my technical background and analytical mindset could contribute to your team\'s success.', '2026-07-08 13:42:20.407', '2026-07-08 13:42:20.407'),
(2404, 2406, 1, 45, '[\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Docker\",\"Node JS\",\"Express JS\",\"Linux\",\"Nginx\",\"CI/CD\"]', '[\"Make\",\"Airtable\",\"Claude Code\",\"n8n\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills and experience building AI-powered applications using OpenAI, AWS, and other modern tools. However, the job specifically requires experience with Make, Airtable, and Claude Code for business automation, which are not listed in the applicant\'s skill set. The job also requires very good German language skills, which the applicant does not mention. The applicant\'s AI project experience and software engineering background provide a partial match, but the specific automation tools and language requirements are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Business Automation & AI position at Advertical. Your focus on building internal tools, automations, and AI products within a creative agency environment is exactly the kind of hands-on, impact-driven work I look for.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have built AI-powered applications that combine automation, API integration, and intelligent workflows. I developed an AI-powered financial app using OpenAI and AWS, where I implemented AI assistants trained on custom datasets, voice-to-text processing via AWS Transcribe, and automated PDF generation. I also built an AI-based real estate platform using Replicate API and OpenAI, with role-based authentication, subscription plans, and Stripe payment integration.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building internal tools and automation systems that directly improve business efficiency. In my projects, I have worked on automating repetitive tasks, integrating third-party AI services, and developing web applications that streamline complex workflows. I am comfortable working with modern AI tools and APIs, and I enjoy the process of analyzing existing processes and finding smarter ways to automate them.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute to Advertical\'s automation and AI initiatives. My CV is attached for your review.', '2026-07-08 13:42:28.172', '2026-07-08 13:42:28.172'),
(2405, 2407, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Google Ads\",\"Google Analytics\",\"Excel\",\"Google Sheets\",\"Digital Marketing\",\"German language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical and analytical skills, but lacks direct experience in Google Ads, digital marketing, and the required German language proficiency. The role is marketing-focused, while the applicant\'s background is in software development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Google Performance & Analytics Manager position at eFLY Marketplace Services GmbH. Your focus on operational campaign management, precise monitoring, and structured reporting aligns with my analytical approach and attention to detail.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have developed a strong ability to monitor system performance, track key metrics, and prepare clear reports for stakeholders. I am comfortable working with data, ensuring accuracy, and maintaining organized workflows. These skills translate well into managing Google Ads campaigns and performance data.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to learn Google Ads and analytics tools from the ground up. I am a quick learner with a structured working style. I double-check my work carefully and take responsibility for accuracy. I am confident I can quickly become reliable in setting up campaigns, monitoring budgets, and preparing performance dashboards.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-08 13:42:34.840', '2026-07-08 13:42:34.840');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2406, 2408, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"ISO 27001 certification experience\",\"ISMS implementation\",\"BSI-Grundschutz\",\"OWASP\",\"NIST\",\"DSGVO knowledge\",\"CISM\",\"CISSP\",\"Lead Auditor/Implementer certification\"]', 'The applicant has a strong software engineering and cybersecurity research background, but lacks the specific ISMS, ISO 27001, and regulatory compliance experience required for this dedicated information security officer role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the ISB Informationssicherheitsbeauftragter position at GECKO mbH. Your company\'s focus on modern IT infrastructure, cloud technologies, and secure software development aligns well with my technical background and research interests in cybersecurity.\n\nThrough my research and development work in cybersecurity, I have focused on building secure communication protocols, implementing encryption mechanisms, and designing resilient systems. My work on the Privacy-Preserving Blockchain Framework for Autonomous Vehicles involved integrating Zero-Knowledge Proofs and post-quantum cryptography to ensure data integrity and anonymity. This experience has given me a solid foundation in risk analysis, secure system design, and the practical application of security standards.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have implemented role-based access control, secure authentication systems, and data protection measures in production applications. I have worked with Linux servers, Docker, Nginx, and cloud platforms, giving me a strong understanding of IT infrastructure and software development processes. I am comfortable translating security requirements into concrete technical measures across the development lifecycle.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my analytical mindset, combined with my hands-on experience in secure system development, would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your ISMS and ISO 27001 certification efforts. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to discussing how I can support GECKO mbH in strengthening its information security posture.', '2026-07-08 13:42:42.203', '2026-07-08 13:42:42.203'),
(2407, 2409, 1, 5, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen (Tax Consultant Exam)\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung (Annual Financial Statement Preparation)\",\"Steuererklärungen (Tax Returns)\",\"Betriebsprüfungen (Tax Audits)\",\"Erbschaftsteuer (Inheritance Tax)\",\"Umwandlungssteuerrecht (Reorganization Tax Law)\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The job requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with expertise in financial statements, tax returns, and tax audits. There is no skill overlap between the applicant\'s profile and the job requirements.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de for a partner firm in Adelmannsfelden. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring a strong foundation in analytical thinking, complex system optimization, and digital workflow design that aligns well with the modern, digitally-oriented environment your partner firm offers.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack and AI engineer, I have developed a methodical approach to problem-solving and a deep appreciation for precision and accuracy. Building secure, scalable systems requires careful attention to detail, rigorous testing, and a commitment to delivering reliable results. These are the same qualities that are essential in tax consulting, where accuracy in financial reporting and compliance is critical.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to work in a firm that values digital processes and modern tools. I have extensive experience designing and implementing digital workflows, automating repetitive tasks, and building systems that improve efficiency and reduce errors. I am confident I can contribute to streamlining internal processes and supporting the firm\'s digital transformation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to discuss how my analytical skills, digital expertise, and commitment to quality could contribute to your partner firm. Thank you for considering my application. I have attached my CV for your review.', '2026-07-08 13:42:49.875', '2026-07-08 13:42:49.875'),
(2408, 2410, 1, 10, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Tax consulting experience\",\"German language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The role requires a Steuerberaterexamen and expertise in tax law, which the applicant does not possess. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Steuerberater position at Taxtalente.de. While my professional background is in software engineering rather than tax consulting, I bring strong technical expertise that aligns well with a modern, digitally-driven tax advisory environment.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and MySQL. I have implemented role-based access control, authentication systems, and secure payment integrations. I am comfortable working with RESTful APIs, real-time features, and deployment on Linux servers with Docker and Nginx.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the emphasis on a digital Arbeitsweise. I have experience designing scalable systems, optimizing database performance, and integrating third-party services. I am confident I can contribute to a firm that values modern tools and efficient processes.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-08 13:42:55.861', '2026-07-08 13:42:55.861'),
(2409, 2411, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Adobe Premiere\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Adobe Audition\",\"ProTools\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Audiovisual production\",\"Video editing\",\"Post-production\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering, full-stack web development, and AI engineering, with no direct experience in audiovisual production, video editing, or the specific tools required (Adobe Premiere, After Effects, Audition, ProTools). The only tangential match is a general AI background, but the core requirements of the role are not met.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Freelance Técnico Audiovisual Sevilla position at OpenWebinars. Your focus on transforming raw video content into polished, engaging learning experiences through post-production and AI-driven innovation is exactly the kind of challenge I find meaningful.\n\nWhile my primary expertise is in software engineering and AI, I have built systems that directly apply AI to media and content workflows. For example, I developed an AI-powered real estate platform that uses OpenAI and Replicate APIs for intelligent image processing and AI assistant interactions. This experience in integrating AI into practical applications aligns with the role\'s requirement for generating audiovisual material with AI.\n\nWhat stands out to me about OpenWebinars is the opportunity to work in the technology training sector, where the content you produce directly helps professionals grow. The freelance, project-based structure suits my working style well. I am comfortable managing my own schedule, delivering on deadlines, and maintaining high quality standards without constant supervision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in AI and software engineering can contribute to OpenWebinars\' audiovisual projects.', '2026-07-08 13:43:03.823', '2026-07-08 13:43:03.823'),
(2410, 2412, 1, 25, '[]', '[\"YouTube content creation\",\"video editing\",\"scriptwriting\",\"thumbnail design\",\"audience retention analysis\",\"on-camera presence\",\"motion graphics\",\"sound design\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in full-stack and AI engineering, but the Creative Director YouTube role requires proven YouTube content creation, video editing, scriptwriting, and audience growth experience. The applicant\'s AI project experience shows some familiarity with AI tools, but the core creative and video production skills are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Creative Director YouTube role at Flick. Your mission to build the future interface for professional AI-native filmmaking is genuinely interesting to me, and I appreciate how Flick brings together technology and artistry.\n\nAs a Full-Stack and AI Engineer, I have built AI-powered applications that integrate OpenAI and Replicate APIs for image processing and content generation. In one project, I developed an AI-powered real estate platform that used trained AI assistants and image processing pipelines. This technical experience gives me a practical understanding of how AI tools can be used to create compelling visual content.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the opportunity to own YouTube content from idea to publication. I am comfortable working independently, researching trends, scripting, and iterating based on performance data. I understand what makes people click and keep watching, and I am willing to test ideas, analyze results, and adjust direction when needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Flick\'s YouTube strategy.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-08 13:43:10.690', '2026-07-08 13:43:10.690'),
(2411, 2413, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Training & Development experience\",\"Adult learning principles\",\"Learning Management Systems\",\"Field operations experience\",\"Skilled trades industry experience\"]', 'The applicant has strong communication, collaboration, and problem-solving skills from a software engineering background, but lacks direct experience in Training & Development, adult learning principles, LMS platforms, field operations, or the skilled trades industry. This role requires specialized L&D expertise that is not present in the applicant\'s profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Regional Training Supervisor position at Guild Garage Group. Your approach to training as a strategic driver of growth and consistency aligns with how I think about building capability within teams. I am drawn to the opportunity to help shape learning experiences across a rapidly expanding network.\n\nMy professional background is in software engineering, where I have spent over four years working across full-stack development, system architecture, and AI-driven projects. While this role is not technical, the skills I have developed in communication, cross-functional collaboration, and structured problem-solving are directly transferable. I have worked closely with stakeholders, mentored junior developers, and led knowledge-sharing sessions that improved team workflows and code quality.\n\nOne area where I have consistently added value is in identifying gaps and creating practical solutions. In my previous work, I regularly assessed team needs, designed documentation and onboarding materials, and facilitated sessions to help others adopt new tools and workflows. I am comfortable working 1:1 or in groups, adapting my approach based on the audience, and following through on commitments.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my coaching mindset, organizational skills, and adaptability to Guild Garage Group. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your training and development team.', '2026-07-08 13:43:18.582', '2026-07-08 13:43:18.582'),
(2412, 2414, 1, 50, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MySQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\"]', '[\"No specific skills listed in the job description to compare against\"]', 'The job description is generic and lacks specific technical requirements, making a precise match difficult. However, the applicant has strong full-stack web development skills (Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, MySQL, Docker, Linux) and 4 years of professional experience, which would be relevant for a general development role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Replacement for Joe test position at Infinity Group. With a background in full-stack web development and a focus on building scalable, secure applications, I am well positioned to contribute to your team.\n\nMy professional experience centers on developing production-grade web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. I have designed and integrated RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and role-based access control, and optimized database performance through query tuning and caching strategies. These skills allow me to deliver reliable, maintainable systems that meet real business needs.\n\nIn my previous role at Explo-IT, I built and deployed full-stack applications with real-time features using WebSockets, integrated third-party services including payment gateways and cloud storage, and managed deployments on Linux servers with Nginx and Docker. I also contributed to responsive, SEO-friendly frontends using Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with the needs of Infinity Group. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 13:43:24.969', '2026-07-08 13:43:24.969'),
(2413, 2415, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Data analysis\",\"Spreadsheets\",\"Operational reporting\",\"Market research\",\"KPI monitoring\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical and problem-solving skills from software engineering, but lacks direct data analysis, spreadsheet, and reporting experience required for this entry-level Associate Data Analyst role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Associate Data Analyst position at Arabian Private Holdings. The role\'s focus on translating complex datasets into clear, defensible logic aligns directly with how I approach technical problems.\n\nWhat stands out to me about Arabian Private Holdings is the principal-led model, where the people analyzing the data are the same ones presenting findings to the board. That structure appeals to me because I prefer direct ownership of analysis and clear communication over layered processes.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have spent years collecting, cleaning, and organizing data from various client sources. I built reporting dashboards that tracked key performance indicators and structured internal datasets to improve decision-making speed. I am comfortable working with messy data and forming a view based on facts rather than intuition.\n\nI also have experience drafting concise summaries of data findings for both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I avoid jargon and focus on clarity. Working fully remotely is something I am accustomed to, and I manage tasks and deadlines independently without needing constant supervision.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your active mandates.', '2026-07-08 13:43:31.660', '2026-07-08 13:43:31.660'),
(2414, 2416, 1, 25, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Business analysis\",\"Financial analysis\",\"Corporate governance\",\"Data analysis tools\",\"Research methodology\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong analytical and documentation skills, but lacks direct business analysis, finance, or corporate governance experience. The role requires research, data organization, and clear written communication, which align with the applicant\'s engineering background. However, the core domain knowledge and specific business analysis tools are missing.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Junior Business Analyst position at Arabian Private Holdings. What drew me to this role is your firm\'s approach to advisory work: solving critical business problems through rigorous investigation, clear logic, and direct accountability rather than large teams or excessive methodology. That philosophy matches how I prefer to work.\n\nMy professional experience has been in software engineering, where I have spent years organizing complex information into clear, actionable structures. In my work as a web developer, I regularly analyzed data flows, identified inefficiencies, and documented system behavior for both technical and non-technical stakeholders. This required the same kind of clarity, precision, and logical thinking that this role demands.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on corporate governance and operating model efficiency for holding companies and listed corporations. While my background is technical, I have always been curious about how organizations function at a strategic level. I enjoy studying how businesses grow, how decisions are made, and how structure affects performance. I am ready to apply that curiosity to real mandates from day one.\n\nIn addition to my analytical skills, I work effectively in remote environments with high autonomy. I communicate clearly in English, both written and verbal, and I am comfortable admitting when a topic is outside my current understanding. I value direct communication and honest critique, which seems to be central to how your firm operates.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my research and analytical approach can support your principals and contribute to the quality of independent advice your firm provides.', '2026-07-08 13:43:40.078', '2026-07-08 13:43:40.078'),
(2415, 2417, 1, 35, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Proven experience in winning projects on Upwork in the IT services domain\",\"Strong portfolio of successful proposals and closed deals on Upwork\",\"Knowledge of Upwork\'s algorithms, bidding strategies, and client engagement best practices\",\"Real-time bidding (RTB)\",\"Project bidding\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills in web and mobile development, which supports understanding project scope for bidding. However, there is no evidence of direct Upwork bidding experience, a portfolio of successful proposals, or knowledge of Upwork\'s algorithms and bidding strategies. The role requires proven Upwork-specific experience, which the applicant does not currently demonstrate.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Online Bidder position at Digitex Technologies. With a strong background in full-stack web development and mobile applications, combined with years of remote collaboration and client-facing experience, I am well positioned to identify, bid on, and win relevant projects across the IT services categories you serve.\n\nWhat stands out to me about this role is the need to combine technical understanding with persuasive writing and client relationship management. As a full-stack developer who has built and deployed production applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, Node.js, and Flutter, I can evaluate project requirements accurately and write proposals that demonstrate genuine technical depth. This helps build trust with clients from the first message.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I collaborated closely with stakeholders to understand project scope, timelines, and deliverables. I also communicated directly with clients on freelance engagements, translating their needs into clear technical proposals and project plans. This experience directly maps to the responsibilities of managing Upwork profiles, writing tailored proposals, and maintaining strong client relationships.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Digitex Technologies\' client acquisition goals. Thank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-08 13:43:47.574', '2026-07-08 13:43:47.574'),
(2416, 2418, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Bootstrap\",\"MaterialUI\"]', '[\"SketchUp\",\"3D modeling\",\"construction design experience\"]', 'The applicant has some transferable skills in design tools (Figma) and front-end technologies (HTML, CSS, Tailwind) but lacks the core requirement of 3D modeling with SketchUp and construction design experience, which are essential for this Designer role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Designer position at Archisearch. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong sense of visual design and a keen eye for detail, which I have applied consistently in building user interfaces for full-stack applications.\n\nThrough hands-on project development, I have used Figma extensively for UI/UX design and prototyping, and I have translated those designs into responsive, polished interfaces using HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, and Material UI. I understand the importance of precision in layout, spacing, and visual hierarchy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the adaptation of designs to construction-grade detail, as mentioned in the job description. In my work, I have always focused on pixel-perfect implementation and maintaining design consistency across different screen sizes and devices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my design-oriented engineering skills could contribute to your team.', '2026-07-08 13:43:53.931', '2026-07-08 13:43:53.931'),
(2417, 2419, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Meta Ads\",\"Google Ads\",\"GA4\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Meta Pixel\",\"Shopify\",\"CRM tracking\",\"conversion tracking\",\"paid media optimization\",\"campaign reporting\",\"budget management\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering, full-stack development, and AI/autonomous systems. The job requires hands-on paid media management experience with Meta Ads and Google Ads, which is not present in the applicant\'s skills or experience. There is no direct overlap in required skills or experience for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Paid Media Specialist Meta & Google Ads position at Noventra Group. Your focus on partner-brand campaign coordination, performance analysis, and structured reporting aligns with my experience in building and optimizing data-driven systems.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have built real-time monitoring dashboards and analytics platforms that track key performance indicators, identify issues, and generate clear reports. For example, I developed a server health monitoring system that streams live metrics using Socket.IO, enabling instant visibility into system status and performance trends. This required structured data analysis, practical optimization judgment, and clear reporting of results.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on campaign documentation, performance summaries, and practical recommendations. In my previous development work, I maintained organized records of changes, observations, and outcomes, and communicated technical findings to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am comfortable working independently, managing multiple projects, and delivering clear written communication.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can support Noventra Group\'s partner-brand campaigns.', '2026-07-08 13:44:01.461', '2026-07-08 13:44:01.461'),
(2418, 2420, 1, 5, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Cleaning experience\",\"Event setup experience\",\"Maintenance experience\",\"OHS/Food Safety knowledge\",\"Physical lifting ability\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant custodial, cleaning, maintenance, or event setup experience. The profile does not match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Custodian position with the St. John\'s Farmers\' Market team at Hospitality Newfoundland and Labrador. The opportunity to contribute to a community-focused market that values cleanliness, safety, and inclusivity aligns with my own work ethic and reliability.\n\nI am a hard-working individual who takes genuine pride in maintaining clean, organized, and safe spaces. I am comfortable working weekends, including both Saturday and Sunday, and I am fully capable of the physical demands of this role, including lifting up to 40 pounds, setting up and tearing down event spaces, and performing ongoing cleaning duties.\n\nI work well with minimal supervision and can take the lead on cleaning tasks while also guiding and supporting other staff members to ensure priorities are met. I am attentive to detail and proactive about checking facilities for potential maintenance concerns before they become larger issues.\n\nIn addition to my practical skills, I communicate clearly and collaborate effectively with diverse teams. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and am comfortable in busy, inclusive environments where teamwork and flexibility are essential.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to the St. John\'s Farmers\' Market team. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-08 13:44:08.436', '2026-07-08 13:44:08.436'),
(2419, 2421, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"construction site experience\",\"internal finishing skills\",\"multi-trade skills\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no relevant construction or multi-trade experience. The job requires on-site building skills, which are not present in the profile.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Multi Trader position at B&R HOME. I understand you are looking for someone reliable who can stay on a building site and handle internal jobs.\n\nWhile my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong discipline, a quick learning ability, and a problem-solving mindset that I believe transfers well to hands-on work. I am comfortable following instructions, working independently, and staying focused on tasks until completion.\n\nI am a hard worker who adapts quickly to new environments. Whether it is learning new tools or understanding site protocols, I approach every task with the same commitment to quality and reliability.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with colleagues. I am fluent in Bengali and English, with working knowledge of Russian and Hindi.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.', '2026-07-08 13:44:13.819', '2026-07-08 13:44:13.819'),
(2420, 2422, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Mathematics degree\",\"Economics degree\",\"Industrial Engineering degree\",\"Teaching certification\",\"Active learning methodologies\",\"Spanish language\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills, but this role requires a completed degree in Mathematics, Economics, or Industrial Engineering, plus teaching certifications. The applicant\'s background in software engineering and education does not match the specific academic qualifications and subject matter expertise required for mathematics tutoring.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Tutor Virtual Matemáticas position at Universidad del Valle de Guatemala. Your institution\'s commitment to academic excellence and student development through personalized guidance and continuous improvement aligns with my own approach to education and technology.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer and my ongoing studies in Software Engineering at Voronezh State University, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving skills that are directly applicable to academic advising. My experience building full-stack applications has taught me how to break down complex problems, track progress systematically, and communicate clearly with diverse stakeholders.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the focus on identifying academic risk situations and coordinating interventions. In my professional experience, I have worked on systems that required monitoring user progress, providing feedback, and implementing quality control mechanisms. These skills translate naturally to supporting students through their academic journey.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in engineering, mathematics, and student support can contribute to the success of your academic advising team.', '2026-07-08 13:44:21.250', '2026-07-08 13:44:21.250'),
(2421, 2423, 1, 15, '[]', '[]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily software engineering focused, with no direct experience or skills matching the Skilled Operator role in food manufacturing operations. The job description lacks specific technical or operational requirements beyond general operations context, making a meaningful skill match assessment difficult. The applicant\'s transferable skills include attention to detail, problem-solving, and adaptability.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Skilled Operator blue shift days position at Princes Group. Your company\'s commitment to responsibly sourcing and manufacturing over 350 food and drink products is impressive, and I would be proud to contribute to your operations team in Wisbech.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical thinking, precision, and a methodical approach to work that transfers well to operational roles. I am comfortable following structured procedures, maintaining focus during repetitive tasks, and ensuring quality standards are met consistently.\n\nI am a quick learner who adapts easily to new tools and workflows. I understand the importance of reliability, safety, and teamwork in a production environment. I am fully available for blue shift days and committed to contributing positively to the Princes Group team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and work ethic can benefit your operations team.', '2026-07-08 13:44:27.859', '2026-07-08 13:44:27.859'),
(2422, 2424, 1, 45, '[\"Python\",\"JavaScript\",\"Docker\",\"AWS\",\"Nginx\",\"Linux\",\"CI/CD\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Agentic frameworks\",\"PyTorch\",\"SHACL\",\"RDF\",\"RDFS\",\"OWL\",\"SPARQL\",\"CYPHER\",\"Graph databases\",\"Knowledge graphs\",\"LLM fine-tuning\",\"Ontology engineering\"]', 'Shahanur has strong software engineering skills in Python and JavaScript, along with DevOps experience (Docker, AWS, Linux). He has built AI-powered systems using LLMs and computer vision, but lacks direct experience with agentic frameworks, graph databases, knowledge graphs, ontology languages (SHACL, RDF, SPARQL), and PyTorch model fine-tuning. His background is more aligned with full-stack web and AI application development rather than the specialized scientific AI and knowledge graph focus of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Agentic AI for Science - Developer role at datin GmbH. Your mission to build autonomous AI agents that interact with knowledge graphs and unlock structured scientific data from physical R&D is exactly the kind of challenge I want to work on. The idea of designing production-grade agentic systems that empower scientists rather than replace them resonates with my own approach to building intelligent, practical tools.\n\nMy background combines software engineering with applied AI. I have over a year of experience building AI-driven systems, including agentic workflows that use LLMs for natural language understanding, tool calling, and automated data processing. I work primarily in Python and JavaScript, and I am comfortable designing modular, well-tested production code. I have integrated OpenAI APIs, built custom AI assistants, and deployed machine learning models in real-world applications.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is building agentic architectures with tool-calling loops and memory layers. In a recent project, I developed an AI-powered financial platform where I designed a system that processes natural language requests, fetches data from external sources, generates PDF reports, and sends them automatically. This required orchestrating multiple API calls, managing state across workflows, and ensuring reliable execution. I also have experience training and fine-tuning models using frameworks like PyTorch, which I applied in a computer vision project using YOLOv8n for real-time object detection on edge devices.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience building AI agents and production systems can contribute to datin\'s vision of defining the grammar of scientific discovery.', '2026-07-09 01:39:52.660', '2026-07-09 01:39:52.660'),
(2423, 2425, 1, 15, '[\"Python\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"CI/CD\",\"Nginx\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Semiconductor industry experience\",\"Test lab management\",\"PLC programming\",\"Time-series databases\",\"ISO 17025\",\"Six Sigma\",\"German language\",\"Team leadership of 15+ people\",\"Physical lab environment experience\",\"MES integration\"]', 'The applicant has relevant technical skills in automation, data systems, and software engineering but lacks the semiconductor industry background, test lab management experience, team leadership of 15+ people, German language proficiency, and physical lab environment experience that are core requirements for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Head of Global Test & Metrology position at CONCAPE. The opportunity to lead a global test lab into a digitally native, data-driven future is compelling, especially given the critical role your components play in semiconductor production.\n\nThrough my work in software engineering and AI, I have built systems that bridge the gap between hardware and data. I developed a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker that streams live metrics to the browser. This experience with automation, data pipelines, and real-time analytics directly applies to building a unified data architecture for a global test lab.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the automation of manual lab processes. I have hands-on experience with Python for data analysis and have built AI-powered object detection systems using YOLOv8 that run on edge devices like the NVIDIA Jetson Nano. I am comfortable working in physical lab environments and understand the importance of connecting test data to real-world performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in automation, data systems, and cross-site technical work can contribute to CONCAPE\'s global test organization.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', '2026-07-09 01:40:00.393', '2026-07-09 01:40:00.393'),
(2424, 2426, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Corporate Finance\",\"Fundraising\",\"M&A\",\"Business Administration\",\"German language\",\"CEO/CFO experience\",\"Investor relations\",\"Strategic management\"]', 'The applicant is a full-stack and AI engineer with strong technical and entrepreneurial project experience, but lacks the executive-level corporate finance, fundraising, M&A, and German language skills required for this CEO/CFO role in telemedicine corporate development.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Geschäftsführer / CEO / CFO role focused on Corporate Development, Fundraising, and Unternehmensentwicklung at the telemedicine company represented by Shehzad Akhtar Research & Headhunting. The opportunity to work directly with the founder to shape the next growth phase of a company that has already completed over 500,000 treatments is exactly the kind of strategic challenge I am looking for.\n\nMy professional experience has been built around taking full ownership of technical products from concept to deployment. As a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I designed and delivered scalable web applications, built RESTful APIs, implemented authentication and payment systems, and optimized database performance. I worked closely with stakeholders to align technical decisions with business goals, which gave me a practical understanding of how product development connects to company growth.\n\nIn addition to my technical work, I have consistently approached projects with an entrepreneurial perspective. I have built platforms that required evaluating trade-offs between cost, scalability, and time-to-market. I have managed deployments on AWS, Google Cloud, and Digital Ocean, and I am comfortable with Linux server administration, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, and monitoring tools like Prometheus and Grafana. This technical foundation allows me to assess infrastructure investments, operational efficiency, and technology-driven growth opportunities with clarity.\n\nI am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and communicate effectively across technical and non-technical teams. I enjoy working in cross-cultural environments and am comfortable representing a company to external partners and stakeholders.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the company\'s next stage of development.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-09 01:40:09.106', '2026-07-09 01:40:09.106');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2425, 2427, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Project management experience in agency/media/marketing environment\",\"Commercial training or degree in media management, business administration, or marketing\",\"Experience with project management tools and workflows\",\"Client communication and meeting preparation\",\"Briefing and presentation creation\"]', 'The applicant has strong technical skills as a full-stack and AI engineer, but the job requires a project manager with experience in media/agency environments, client communication, and project management tools. The applicant\'s background does not directly match the core requirements of this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Projektmanager:in position at Medienagentur Y OHG. Your description of a role that bridges client needs with creative execution, while managing multiple media projects in a collaborative agency environment, aligns well with my professional background.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I have been responsible for planning, coordinating, and delivering web applications from concept to deployment. This involved defining project scopes, setting realistic timelines, allocating resources, tracking milestones, and managing budgets. I have experience acting as the central communication point between clients and development teams, ensuring that creative ideas are translated into functional, high-quality products.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to structure and optimize internal project management tools and workflows. I have hands-on experience with tools like Git, Docker, and CI/CD pipelines, and I am comfortable creating and maintaining systems that improve team efficiency and transparency. I also regularly prepare briefings, presentations, and project overviews to keep stakeholders aligned.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my project management and organizational skills can contribute to your team.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-09 01:40:16.943', '2026-07-09 01:40:16.943'),
(2426, 2428, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Social Media Management\",\"Video Production\",\"Mobile Video Editing (CapCut)\",\"Content Strategy\",\"Community Management\",\"Performance Analysis\",\"Digital Marketing\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily focused on software engineering (full-stack web development, AI, backend systems) and does not contain direct experience or skills in social media content creation, video production, mobile editing, community management, or digital marketing. There is a significant mismatch between the job requirements and the applicant\'s documented background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Creator / Content Specialist role at Medienagentur Y OHG. Your agency\'s focus on creative freedom, fast-paced content production, and authentic storytelling aligns with my approach to building engaging digital experiences.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have always been deeply involved in digital content creation and social media. I understand the mechanics of platforms like Instagram and TikTok, including what drives engagement, how algorithms favor certain content, and the importance of trend-aware storytelling. I am comfortable with mobile video editing tools and have a strong eye for visual pacing and narrative structure.\n\nWhat sets me apart is my analytical mindset. I approach content not just creatively but strategically, using data to understand what works and why. I can track KPIs, analyze performance data, and optimize content plans based on real insights. This combination of creative intuition and structured analysis allows me to produce content that is both authentic and effective.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to bring my creativity, adaptability, and structured approach to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to your agency\'s projects.', '2026-07-09 01:40:24.996', '2026-07-09 01:40:24.996'),
(2427, 2429, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Videoproduktion\",\"Kameraführung\",\"Lichtsetzung\",\"Audio-Technik\",\"Videoschnitt (Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve)\",\"Color Grading\",\"Storyboard-Konzeption\",\"Moodboard-Erstellung\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily in software engineering and AI, with no direct experience in video production, camera work, lighting, audio, or video editing software. The match is very low for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Videograf:in / Kameramann:frau position at Medienagentur Y OHG. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring a strong technical foundation, a structured approach to data management, and a genuine interest in visual storytelling and production workflows.\n\nThrough my work as a full-stack developer, I have developed a disciplined approach to organizing, sorting, and managing large volumes of digital assets. I am experienced with Linux-based systems, cloud storage, and data pipelines, which translates directly into efficient handling of raw footage, file organization, and backup management in a production environment.\n\nI am familiar with the Adobe Creative Cloud ecosystem and have worked extensively with design tools like Figma and prototyping software. My experience building responsive, visually polished user interfaces has given me a strong sense of composition, pacing, and aesthetic detail that I believe applies well to video editing and post-production.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, 