(2428, 2430, 1, 5, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Steuerberaterexamen\",\"Steuerrecht\",\"DATEV\",\"MS Office\",\"Betriebswirtschaft\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no tax consulting qualifications or experience. The role requires a certified tax consultant (Steuerberater) with deep knowledge of German tax law and DATEV software. There is no skill overlap.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerberater (m/w/d) position at Börsing Pohl & Partner Steuerberater Rechtsanwälte in Berlin. Your firm\'s 50-year history and commitment to digitalization in tax consulting caught my attention. I am particularly interested in how you combine traditional expertise with modern, flexible working conditions.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have focused on building scalable web applications and automating internal processes. I have worked with Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js to develop full-stack systems that handle authentication, role-based access control, payment gateways, and real-time features. This technical foundation has given me a practical understanding of how digital tools can reduce manual work and improve operational efficiency.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is your emphasis on automation in accounting to reduce monotonous tasks. In my previous work, I developed an AI-powered financial application that automated data processing, integrated with external services, and generated PDF reports. This project required building secure APIs, managing cloud infrastructure on AWS, and ensuring reliable data flow between systems. I believe this experience directly supports your goal of further digitalizing internal processes.\n\nIn addition to my technic