(2430, 2432, 1, 45, '[\"Typescript\",\"Tailwind\",\"Git\",\"Linux\",\"Jest\"]', '[\"SvelteKit\",\"oRPC\",\"DaisyUI\",\"Vitest\",\"JSDom\",\"Bun\"]', 'Shahanur has solid frontend fundamentals with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and testing experience (Jest). However, the job specifically requires SvelteKit, Vitest, JSDom, and Bun, which are not in his profile. His experience with Next.js and SSR concepts is transferable but not a direct match.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Software Engineer (Frontend) - Intern position at Heidi Systems. Your work on building the data infrastructure layer for buildings and energy is tackling a genuinely important and underserved market, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to that mission.\n\nMy frontend development experience is built on a foundation of TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and modern JavaScript frameworks. I have worked extensively with Next.js, which shares core concepts with SvelteKit including server-side rendering, routing, and load functions. I write strict, idiomatic TypeScript and am comfortable working in Unix-based environments. I also have experience with testing tools like Jest and PHPUnit, and I am quick to adapt to new testing frameworks like Vitest.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack applications where I owned features from UI implementation to API integration. I have worked with real data, debugged issues across the full stack, and focused on delivering reliable, performant interfaces. I am used to collaborating closely with teams and taking ownership of what I build.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and c