(2433, 2435, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Steuerfachangestellter Ausbildung\",\"Steuerfachwirt Qualifikation\",\"Bilanzbuchhalter Qualifikation\",\"DATEV Kenntnisse\",\"MS Office Kenntnisse\",\"Jahresabschlusserstellung\",\"Steuererklärungserstellung\",\"Mandantenberatung\",\"Steuerstrategie\",\"Deutsch (sehr gut in Wort und Schrift)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this tax advisory role. The job requires a completed vocational training as a tax specialist (Steuerfachangestellter, Steuerfachwirt, or Bilanzbuchhalter), in-depth knowledge of DATEV and MS Office, and several years of professional experience in German tax law and accounting. The applicant\'s skills are in software engineering, web development, and AI, which are not relevant to the primary responsibilities of this position. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Steuerfachangestellter / Steuerfachwirt / Bilanzbuchhalter position at CONSULTIA STEUERBERATUNGSGESELLSCHAFT MBH. Your focus on digital processes and paperless work, combined with a commitment to high-quality advisory services, stands out to me. I am interested in contributing to a team that values efficiency and modern working methods.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have built and maintained full-stack web applications using Laravel, Next.js, and Node.js. I have worked extensively with databases such as MySQL and PostgreSQL, and have integrated RESTful APIs for seamless data exchange. This technical foundation supports the kind of digitalization and process optimization that Consultia prioritizes.\n\nA relevant example is my work on a multi-vendor e-