(2439, 2441, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Steuerrecht\",\"Buchhaltung\",\"Jahresabschluss\",\"MS Office (Word, Excel)\",\"Finanzbuchhaltung\",\"Steuererklärungen\",\"Recherche\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineering student with strong digital skills and analytical thinking, but lacks the specific tax, accounting, and MS Office experience required for this apprenticeship. The role is a vocational training position in tax accounting, which does not align with the applicant\'s technical background.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Auszubildender zum Steuerfachangestellten position at Kohnle & Partner. Your firm\'s commitment to modern technology, digital processes, and thorough training caught my attention. I am looking for a structured apprenticeship where I can develop practical skills in tax and accounting while contributing to a professional team.\n\nAs a software engineering student with a background in building full-stack applications, I bring strong analytical thinking, attention to detail, and comfort with digital tools. I have worked with databases, spreadsheets, and reporting systems in my projects, which has given me a solid foundation for handling financial data accurately.\n\nI am particularly interested in the digital transformation aspect of this role. In my previous work, I have supported process improvements and adopted new technologies quickly. I am confident I can assist your team with digitizing workflows and maintaining high-quality standards in tax preparation and bookkeeping.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am eager to learn from experienced professionals at Kohnle & Partner and contribute to your team\'s success. I have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss my application further.', '2026-07-09 01:42:05.408', '2026-07-09 01:42:05.408'),
(2440, 2442, 1, 15, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Tax preparation\",\"Financial bookkeeping\",\"MS Office (Word, Excel)\",\"German language (implied)\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not tax or accounting. There are no direct skill matches. The applicant is a quick learner with strong analytical skills and digital literacy, but lacks the specific tax, accounting, and MS Office skills required. The role is an apprenticeship, so willingness to learn is valued, but the mismatch is significant.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Auszubildender zum Steuerfachangestellten position at Kohnle & Partner. Your firm\'s reputation for combining modern technology with traditional tax expertise is particularly appealing to me. I am looking to build a long-term career in tax and accounting, and I believe your structured apprenticeship program offers the ideal foundation.\n\nAlthough my professional background is in software engineering, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving abilities through my technical work. I am comfortable with numbers, enjoy working systematically, and have a high standard for accuracy in everything I do. These skills transfer directly to tasks like preparing tax returns, handling financial bookkeeping, and reviewing official correspondence.\n\nWhat draws me to Kohnle & Partner is your emphasis on digital processes and modern technology. Having worked extensively with digital tools and systems, I am well-prepared to support your digital transformation initiatives. I am confident I can quickly adapt to your workflows and contribute meaningfully from an early stage.\n\nI am a communicative person who enjoys working with people and takes initiative. I am open to learning new fields, and I am ready to apply the same discipline and attention to detail that I used in software development to mastering tax and accounting procedures.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team during this apprenticeship.', '2026-07-09 01:42:14.004', '2026-07-09 01:42:14.004'),
(2441, 2443, 1, 45, '[\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Javascript\",\"Typescript\",\"React\",\"Next JS\",\"Tailwind\",\"MongoDB\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\",\"Git\",\"AWS\",\"Bootstrap\",\"Docker\",\"Go\",\"Figma\",\"Firebase\",\"MaterialUI\",\"Nginx\",\"Strapi\",\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"Express JS\",\"Node JS\",\"GraphQL\",\"Linux\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"Redis\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Microservices\"]', '[\"Jira\",\"Confluence\",\"Scrum/Kanban\",\"SDLC documentation\",\"German language fluency\",\"WealthTech domain knowledge\",\"Market analysis\",\"User research\"]', 'The applicant has strong full-stack development skills and product-oriented experience from building and shipping web applications. However, the role is a working student position requiring enrollment in a German university, fluency in German, and experience with product management tools (Jira, Confluence) and agile methodologies. The applicant\'s location (Russia) and lack of German language skills are significant gaps. The technical foundation is solid, but the role is more product-focused than engineering-focused.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Product Development position at Ginmon GmbH. Your work at the intersection of scientific wealth management and high-performance technology, particularly with the apeiron platform, is genuinely interesting. The opportunity to contribute to product strategy while working directly with the CTO aligns well with my background in full-stack development and product thinking.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer at Explo-IT, I have spent over four years building and shipping scalable web applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and TypeScript. In that role, I worked closely with business stakeholders to translate strategic goals into technical requirements, maintained product backlogs, and delivered features on schedule. This experience has given me a practical understanding of how product roadmaps connect to engineering execution.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the product development lifecycle itself. In previous work, I contributed to defining user stories, acceptance criteria, and feature prioritization in cross-functional teams. I also conducted performance monitoring of existing features and identified optimization opportunities for both backend performance and user experience. This matches directly with the responsibilities outlined for this role.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the chance to discuss how I can contribute to Ginmon\'s product development efforts.', '2026-07-09 01:42:23.402', '2026-07-09 01:42:23.402'),
(2442, 2444, 1, 45, '[\"Linux\",\"Docker\",\"Nginx\",\"Apache\",\"CI/CD\",\"AWS\",\"Google Cloud\",\"Git\"]', '[\"Windows systems\",\"Microsoft 365\",\"DATEV systems\",\"IT-Security (formal)\",\"Networking (formal)\"]', 'The applicant has solid Linux, Docker, and cloud infrastructure skills, which partially match the system administration and IT support aspects of the role. However, the job specifically requires Windows system expertise, Microsoft 365 experience, and ideally DATEV knowledge, which are not present in the profile. The applicant\'s AI and automation experience is a plus but not the primary requirement.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Inhouse IT Consultant / Systeminformatiker position at Kohnle & Partner. Your firm\'s focus on digitalization, automated workflows, and in-house IT solutions aligns well with my background in system administration and infrastructure management.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong skills in Linux server administration, Docker containerization, and web server configuration with Nginx and Apache. I have set up and maintained CI/CD pipelines, managed cloud deployments on AWS and Google Cloud, and ensured system stability and security. I am comfortable working with network configurations, monitoring tools, and providing 2nd-level technical support.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of AI tools to optimize IT and support processes. I have hands-on experience integrating AI capabilities into applications, including building AI-powered assistants and automation workflows. I am confident I can contribute to your goal of using innovative tools to improve efficiency.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Kohnle & Partner\'s IT landscape.', '2026-07-09 01:42:30.190', '2026-07-09 01:42:30.190'),
(2443, 2445, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"6+ years in client service/account management/consulting\",\"Very good German (written and spoken)\",\"Client relationship ownership experience\",\"Commercial growth / account management experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, full-stack development) and does not match the core requirements of this client-lead, account management role. The role requires 6+ years in client service/account management, a strategic mindset for digital topics, and very good German language skills. The applicant has client-facing experience from developer roles but lacks the seniority, commercial growth ownership, and German proficiency this position demands.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Client Partner / Senior Account Director Digital Solutions position at Virtual Identity AG. The role\'s focus on owning client relationships, driving commercial growth, and acting as a trusted advisor for digital transformation aligns directly with how I have worked throughout my career.\n\nWhat draws me to this opportunity is the emphasis on building genuine client partnerships rather than managing operational delivery. In my previous roles as a Web Developer at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD., I was never just a developer executing tickets. I worked closely with stakeholders to understand their business challenges, translated technical complexity into clear value propositions, and consistently helped clients turn their digital goals into working solutions. I am comfortable being the person clients call first.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the requirement to uncover real business challenges along a client\'s digital journey. Through my work building full-stack platforms using Laravel, Next.js, React, and cloud services, I have developed a strong ability to listen closely, identify what truly matters to a client, and align technical delivery with commercial outcomes. I understand that growth comes from trust, not just from delivering projects.\n\nIn addition to my technical and client-facing experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in client relationships and digital solutions can contribute to Virtual Identity AG\'s continued success.', '2026-07-09 01:42:38.754', '2026-07-09 01:42:38.754');
INSERT INTO `job_matches` (`id`, `jobPostId`, `cvProfileId`, `score`, `matchedSkills`, `missingSkills`, `summary`, `aiAnalysis`, `coverLetter`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(2444, 2446, 1, 25, '[\"Git\"]', '[\"Social media management\",\"PR and press relations\",\"Content creation for Instagram/TikTok/LinkedIn\",\"Canva design\",\"Marketing and communication studies\",\"Event management\",\"Media research\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but this role is a Werkstudent position focused on Social Media, PR, and Communication. The applicant\'s profile lacks direct experience in social media management, PR, content creation for specific platforms (Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn), and formal communication/marketing studies. The only potential overlap is a basic understanding of AI tools (ChatGPT) and general technical communication skills, which is insufficient for this role.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Werkstudent Social Media Kommunikation & PR position at rlvnt GmbH. Your focus on integrating artificial intelligence into strategic communication is particularly interesting to me, as I have been working at the intersection of software engineering and AI-driven solutions.\n\nWhat stands out to me about rlvnt AI is the combination of long-standing communication expertise with practical technological implementation. As a Full-Stack and AI Engineer with experience using tools like ChatGPT and other AI models, I understand how to leverage these technologies to create effective content, presentations, and communication workflows. My technical background allows me to not only use AI tools but also understand their underlying mechanisms and limitations.\n\nThrough my project work, I have developed platforms that require clear, audience-specific communication. For example, building the Travel Agency App involved creating multi-language, multi-currency interfaces and content management systems that serve diverse user groups. This required a strong sense of language, tone, and how to present information clearly for different channels and audiences.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am a reliable, structured worker who takes ownership of tasks and thinks proactively. I am eager to bring my understanding of AI, design, and communication to support your team in social media, PR, and client projects. I have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to rlvnt AI.', '2026-07-09 01:42:48.472', '2026-07-09 01:42:48.472'),
(2445, 2447, 1, 15, '[\"Figma\",\"HTML\",\"CSS\",\"Tailwind\",\"Javascript\"]', '[\"Adobe Creative Cloud (Photoshop, Illustrator, After Effects, Premiere Pro)\",\"Videoschnitt und Motion Design\",\"Mediengestalter Ausbildung oder vergleichbares Studium\",\"Erfahrung in Agenturumfeld\"]', 'The applicant has some relevant skills in Figma, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for digital asset creation, but lacks the core Adobe Creative Cloud tools, video editing/motion design experience, formal design education, and agency background that the role requires.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Mediengestalter Digital position at StraightAds Marketing GmbH. Your focus on data-driven performance marketing and strong creatives aligns with my experience building digital assets that balance visual quality with measurable results.\n\nThrough my work as a Web Developer, I have designed and implemented responsive landing pages, hero visuals, and web assets using Figma, HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, and JavaScript. I understand that in a performance context, design must serve conversion goals, not just aesthetics. I have iterated on UI components based on user feedback and performance data, similar to the A/B testing approach your team uses.\n\nI have practical experience using AI tools to accelerate design workflows. I use image generation and language model tools to speed up routine tasks like creating mockups, generating design variations, and refining copy, while keeping full creative control over the final output.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to StraightAds\' creative team.', '2026-07-09 01:42:55.424', '2026-07-09 01:42:55.424'),
(2446, 2448, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"ISO 13485\",\"MDR (EU 2017/745)\",\"Medical device industry experience\",\"Quality management systems\",\"Auditing experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile does not match the core requirements for this Quality Management and Regulatory Affairs role. The position requires several years of experience in medical technology, deep knowledge of ISO 13485 and MDR regulations, and direct auditing experience. The applicant\'s background is in software engineering with no medical device industry experience or regulatory affairs expertise. The match score is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Qualitätsmanager/in und Regulatory Affairs position at Hänsler Medical GmbH. Your company\'s long-standing reputation in manufacturing high-quality medical devices for complementary medicine, combined with a science-driven approach to product development, is genuinely impressive.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a software engineer, I have developed strong project management skills and a disciplined approach to documentation, process improvement, and cross-team coordination. I have worked closely with quality assurance, production, and development teams, ensuring that technical documentation remains accurate, up-to-date, and audit-ready.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the preparation and execution of audits. In my previous work, I have supported internal and external audit processes by maintaining clear records, tracking corrective actions, and ensuring compliance with documented procedures. I am comfortable working as a liaison between quality management, production, and regulatory bodies.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in structured project management and quality-focused documentation can contribute to Hänsler Medical\'s regulatory and quality objectives.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.', '2026-07-09 01:43:02.434', '2026-07-09 01:43:02.434'),
(2447, 2449, 1, 15, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"Utility industry experience\",\"CMMS systems knowledge\",\"Asset inventory management\",\"Maintenance coordination\",\"Facilities support\",\"5+ years utility experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile as a Full-Stack & AI Engineer does not match the core requirements of this Asset Management Specialist role, which demands 5+ years of utility industry experience with CMMS systems, asset inventory, and maintenance coordination. No direct overlap in required skills or domain experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Asset Management Specialist Water Wastewater Treatment position at Woodard & Curran. Your work in clean water, environmental stewardship, and employee ownership creates a compelling mission, and I am interested in contributing to your Operations & Management team.\n\nMy background is in software engineering and data analysis, with a focus on building systems that require careful data collection, organization, and reporting. I have experience working with databases, analyzing performance data, and identifying trends to support decision-making. These skills align with the analytical and system-oriented responsibilities of this role.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the use of data to drive asset lifecycle strategies and maintenance forecasting. In my previous work, I have built systems that track and analyze operational data, generate reports, and support planning processes. I am comfortable working with complex datasets and translating them into actionable insights for cross-functional teams.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-09 01:43:11.893', '2026-07-09 01:43:11.893'),
(2448, 2450, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[]', 'The job posting is a general article about high-paying jobs without a degree, not a specific technical role. The applicant has strong full-stack web development skills and professional experience, but the job description does not list any specific technical requirements to match against. The match score is low because the job is not a technical position.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the 12 jobs that pay well without a degree position at Unigo. The concept of accessible, high-paying career paths without traditional degree requirements aligns with my own professional journey and technical background.\n\nThrough 4 years of full-stack web development experience, I have built scalable applications using Laravel, Next.js, React, and Node.js. My work includes designing RESTful APIs, implementing secure authentication systems, and optimizing database performance with MySQL and PostgreSQL. I focus on delivering clean, maintainable code that performs well in production.\n\nIn previous roles at Explo-IT and DataSoft LTD, I developed and deployed web applications end to end. I built responsive, SEO-friendly interfaces with Tailwind CSS and modern JavaScript frameworks, integrated payment gateways and third-party services, and managed deployments on Linux servers using Docker, Nginx, and CI/CD pipelines. I also implemented real-time features using WebSockets and Pusher.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Unigo\'s goals.', '2026-07-09 01:43:18.421', '2026-07-09 01:43:18.421'),
(2449, 2451, 1, 5, '[\"AWS\",\"Go\"]', '[\"TikTok content creation\",\"social media strategy\",\"video editing (CapCut/Adobe)\",\"content strategy\",\"influencer management\",\"TikTok Shop management\",\"copywriting\",\"CPG/wellness brand experience\",\"on-screen presence\",\"vendor management\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong software development skills, but the role requires 4+ years of TikTok-specific content creation, social media strategy, video editing, and founder content production. There is no overlap in required skills or experience. The applicant does not meet the location requirement (must be based in LA, NYC, or SF).', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager TikTok and Founder role at Once Upon a Farm. Your mission to drive systemic improvement in childhood nutrition through organic, accessible food is meaningful, and I appreciate the focus on building authentic, platform-native content that resonates with Gen-Z and millennial families.\n\nMy professional experience is in software engineering, where I have designed and delivered full-stack web and mobile applications from concept to deployment. I have built platforms that serve multiple user roles, integrate real-time features, and handle complex workflows. This background has given me a strong sense of ownership, the ability to manage end-to-end product cycles, and the discipline to make data-informed decisions.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the dual mandate of this role: building Once Upon a Farm\'s TikTok presence while also developing content for the founders. In my work, I have created systems that serve both broad audiences and specific stakeholders, balancing brand consistency with authentic, individual voices. I am comfortable working directly with senior team members and adapting quickly to their communication styles and schedules.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-09 01:43:27.337', '2026-07-09 01:43:27.337'),
(2450, 2452, 1, 15, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"Creative strategy\",\"Performance marketing\",\"Paid social creative\",\"Meta advertising\",\"Video ad production\",\"Copywriting\",\"Consumer psychology\",\"DTC ecommerce\",\"Creator management\",\"Scriptwriting\",\"Ad testing frameworks\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with strong technical skills, but the Creative Strategist role at Ramen Bae requires 3+ years of experience in creative strategy, performance marketing, paid social creative, and DTC ecommerce. The applicant\'s profile does not contain any of the required creative strategy, marketing, or advertising skills. The match score is very low (15/100) because the role is fundamentally a marketing and creative position, while the applicant\'s background is entirely in software engineering.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Creative Strategist role at Ramen Bae. Your mission to build the next great ramen brand through a combination of product quality and performance-driven creative is something I find genuinely compelling. The way you have grown from a passion project to over 400,000 customers shows a team that understands both product and growth.\n\nMy background is in full-stack software engineering, where I have spent years building products from the ground up. This has trained me to think analytically about user behavior, performance data, and the feedback loops that drive growth. I am comfortable looking at metrics, understanding what is working and why, and using those insights to inform creative decisions. The same discipline that goes into optimizing a conversion funnel applies directly to developing ad concepts that resonate with specific audience segments.\n\nWhat draws me to this role is the intersection of data and creativity. In my previous work, I have built systems that required deep understanding of user pain points, testing multiple approaches, and iterating based on real performance data. I am used to working in small, fast-moving teams where everyone is hands-on and accountable. I am comfortable writing scripts, reviewing edits, and jumping into execution when needed.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and creative approach can contribute to Ramen Bae\'s growth.', '2026-07-09 01:43:36.115', '2026-07-09 01:43:36.115'),
(2451, 2453, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Ensino superior completo em Ciências Contábeis\",\"Experiência em conciliação financeira\",\"Experiência em rotinas contábeis\",\"Conhecimento do Pacote Office\",\"Vivência em serviços financeiros\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is in software engineering, not accounting or finance. The job requires a degree in Accounting, financial reconciliation experience, and Office package knowledge, none of which are present in the applicant\'s profile. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Assistente Financeiro position at Sicoob. While my professional background is in software engineering, I bring strong analytical, process-oriented, and problem-solving skills that are directly applicable to financial reconciliation and operational workflows.\n\nThrough my work developing an AI-powered financial application, I gained hands-on experience handling financial data, automating data processing, and ensuring accuracy in financial transactions. I built the backend using Express, TypeScript, and MongoDB, integrated AWS services for authentication and document generation, and worked with financial data flows that required precision and attention to detail.\n\nIn my professional experience as a Web Developer, I designed and maintained scalable web applications using Laravel and Next.js, built RESTful APIs, optimized database queries, and implemented secure authentication and payment systems. These projects required me to analyze processes, identify inconsistencies, and implement reliable solutions.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how my analytical and technical skills can contribute to the financial operations team at Sicoob.', '2026-07-09 01:43:42.240', '2026-07-09 01:43:42.240'),
(2452, 2454, 1, 5, '[]', '[\"10+ years paralegal experience\",\"personal injury law\",\"Spanish bilingual\",\"PST availability\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with no paralegal or legal operations experience. While the role requires 10+ years of paralegal experience, personal injury law, bilingual Spanish, and PST availability, the applicant\'s profile shows no relevant legal background. The match is extremely low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Lead Paralegal position at Finch. While my professional background is in software engineering, the core responsibilities of this role—managing attorney relationships, coordinating case progress, and ensuring proactive client communication—align closely with the organizational and coordination skills I have developed throughout my career.\n\nIn my previous work as a Web Developer, I served as the primary liaison between clients, stakeholders, and development teams. I managed project timelines, provided regular status updates, and proactively identified potential delays before they could affect delivery. This required clear communication, strong attention to detail, and the ability to build trust quickly with people from different backgrounds.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about Finch is the emphasis on combining precision, speed, and care within Legal Operations. I have experience working in environments where efficiency and client experience are equally important. I am comfortable coordinating across multiple teams, maintaining detailed records, and ensuring that everyone involved has the information they need to move forward.\n\nIn addition to my coordination experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.', '2026-07-09 01:43:48.845', '2026-07-09 01:43:48.845'),
(2453, 2455, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Talent acquisition experience\",\"Workforce strategy experience\",\"Campus recruiting experience\",\"External partnership development\",\"Automotive retail operations experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering, AI, web development) and does not match the core requirements of this Director-level educational partnerships role, which demands 3+ years in talent acquisition, workforce strategy, or campus recruiting. No direct overlap in skills or experience was found.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Director Educational Partnerships role at Sonic Automotive. Sonic\'s commitment to developing future leaders through structured early-career pathways aligns with my own experience in building systems that connect education with practical industry outcomes.\n\nThrough my work as a software engineer, I have designed and developed platforms that required close collaboration with academic and technical stakeholders. One example is the AI Powered Financial App, where I built API infrastructure using Express, TypeScript, and OpenAI, integrating authentication systems and automated workflows. This project involved translating complex requirements into functional systems, a skill directly applicable to designing educational partnership strategies.\n\nIn previous professional roles, I have worked across teams to deliver scalable web applications, implement role-based access control, and optimize performance through database tuning and caching. These experiences have given me a strong foundation in data-driven execution and continuous improvement, both of which are essential for tracking pipeline volume, conversion rates, and program effectiveness.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background can contribute to Sonic Automotive\'s talent pipeline strategy.', '2026-07-09 01:43:56.097', '2026-07-09 01:43:56.097'),
(2454, 2456, 1, 15, '[]', '[\"Supervisory experience\",\"Retail experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"French language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not directly match the supervisory retail role at Home Depot. There are no overlapping skills or relevant experience in retail, customer service, or team supervision. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Superviseur 26 27 position at The Home Depot Canada. Helping others succeed and guiding customers toward the right solutions is something I genuinely value, and I see this role as an opportunity to contribute meaningfully to your team.\n\nThrough my professional experience as a Web Developer, I have worked closely with cross-functional teams, coordinated project tasks, and communicated effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. These experiences have strengthened my ability to support team members, solve problems collaboratively, and ensure that goals are met efficiently.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about this role is the focus on guiding customers and helping them find the right solutions for their projects. I take pride in understanding needs, providing clear guidance, and ensuring a positive experience for those I assist.\n\nIn addition to my technical background, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nSincerely,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-09 01:44:01.880', '2026-07-09 01:44:01.880'),
(2455, 2457, 1, 10, '[]', '[\"Supervisory experience\",\"Retail experience\",\"Customer service experience\",\"French language proficiency\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile is primarily technical (software engineering) and does not match the supervisory retail role at Home Depot. No direct skills overlap. The applicant demonstrates general problem-solving and communication abilities but lacks the specific retail, supervisory, and customer-facing experience required.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to express my interest in the SUPERVISEUR 25 position at The Home Depot Canada. The opportunity to help customers find the right solutions for their projects and to grow within a company that values curiosity and continuous learning is exactly the kind of environment where I thrive.\n\nIn my previous professional experience as a Web Developer, I worked closely with teams and stakeholders to deliver solutions that met real user needs. I learned that success comes from understanding people\'s goals and guiding them toward the best outcome, whether that means troubleshooting a technical issue or helping a customer choose the right product for their home improvement project.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me about this role is the emphasis on helping others succeed and leaving your mark. Throughout my career, I have consistently taken ownership of challenges, communicated clearly with both technical and non-technical colleagues, and focused on delivering results that make a tangible difference for the people I work with.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI am confident that my problem-solving mindset, strong work ethic, and genuine interest in helping others would make me a valuable addition to your team. I have attached my CV for your review and look forward to the possibility of contributing to The Home Depot Canada.', '2026-07-09 01:44:08.951', '2026-07-09 01:44:08.951'),
(2456, 2458, 1, 15, '[\"React\",\"Node JS\",\"Socket.IO\",\"Docker\",\"Linux\",\"C++\",\"Python\",\"Git\",\"MySQL\",\"PostgreSQL\"]', '[\"Compliance experience\",\"Financial services experience\",\"Derivatives or prediction markets experience\",\"Trade surveillance platforms\",\"Knowledge of futures exchange operations\",\"Degree in Economics/Finance/Math/JD\"]', 'The applicant is a software engineer with strong technical skills in real-time systems, data analysis, and secure architectures. However, the role requires 4+ years of compliance experience in financial services, familiarity with trade surveillance platforms, and knowledge of derivatives/futures markets. The applicant\'s background is primarily technical and does not include the required financial compliance domain expertise.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Compliance Market Surveillance Analyst position at Crypto.com. Your work in building a secure, compliant cryptocurrency platform that serves over 150 million customers is impressive, and I am interested in contributing to the Market Regulation team\'s mission of enforcing exchange rules and maintaining market integrity.\n\nMy background is in software engineering, with a focus on building real-time systems, secure architectures, and data-driven applications. While my experience is technical rather than financial, I bring strong analytical skills, a methodical approach to investigation, and hands-on experience with the kind of monitoring and security infrastructure that supports market surveillance operations.\n\nThrough my project work, I have built a real-time server health monitoring dashboard using React, Node.js, Socket.IO, and Docker that streams live system metrics and flags anomalies. This experience directly maps to the real-time market monitoring and anomaly detection responsibilities of this role. I also developed a privacy-preserving blockchain framework for autonomous vehicle networks using C++, Python, and post-quantum cryptography, which gave me practical experience with secure, decentralized systems and data integrity verification.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nBest regards,\nMd Shahanur Islam Shagor', '2026-07-09 01:44:16.419', '2026-07-09 01:44:16.419'),
(2457, 2459, 1, 15, '[\"Git\",\"Go\"]', '[\"HR & Payroll platforms\",\"Microsoft Office (Outlook, Word, PowerPoint, Excel)\",\"HR department experience\",\"HRIS systems\",\"Onboarding and orientation coordination\",\"Employee records management\",\"Background screening\",\"Learning Management Systems\",\"HR policy compliance\"]', 'The applicant is a Full-Stack & AI Engineer with no HR-specific experience or skills matching this HR Administrative Coordinator role. The profile focuses on software development, web technologies, and AI engineering, which are not relevant to the HR responsibilities listed. The match score is low due to the complete absence of HR domain skills and experience.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the Human Resources Administrative Coordinator position at Enstar Group. Your focus on supporting HR operations, maintaining accurate employee records, and delivering first-line support aligns with my experience in system coordination and process management.\n\nThrough my professional experience, I have developed strong organizational and analytical skills. I have worked with cross-functional teams, managed documentation, and supported user inquiries across multiple systems. I am comfortable handling administrative tasks, maintaining compliance with policies, and ensuring data accuracy.\n\nOne area that particularly interests me is the opportunity to support onboarding, training coordination, and HR system maintenance. I have experience assisting with user support, preparing documentation, and following up on tasks to ensure smooth operations. I am confident in my ability to contribute to the HR Shared Services Team.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can support Enstar Group\'s HR operations.', '2026-07-09 01:44:23.594', '2026-07-09 01:44:23.594'),
(2458, 2460, 1, 10, '[\"Go\"]', '[\"AutoCAD 2D\",\"Autodesk Revit 3D\",\"CAD software experience\",\"2-3 years of CAD experience\"]', 'The applicant\'s profile shows no direct experience with AutoCAD, Autodesk Revit, or CAD-related design work. The role requires 2-3 years of CAD-specific skills which are not present in the applicant\'s portfolio. The match is very low.', '{\"generatedBy\":\"job-agent-ai\",\"provider\":\"DEEPSEEK\",\"model\":\"deepseek-chat\",\"mocked\":false,\"errors\":[],\"profileContextSourceTablesUsed\":[\"Profile\",\"Skill\",\"Education\",\"Project\",\"Experience\",\"CvProfile optional notes\"],\"profileContextMissingFields\":[]}', 'I am writing to apply for the CAD Assistant (Part-time) position at RecruitGo Careers. Your focus on connecting global talent with meaningful remote opportunities aligns well with my own experience working across international teams and delivering precise technical work.\n\nAlthough my professional background is primarily in software engineering and full-stack development, I bring strong attention to detail, experience with technical documentation, and a methodical approach to revision management. I am comfortable working within structured workflows and collaborating closely with design teams to ensure accuracy across project life cycles.\n\nIn previous roles, I have worked extensively with version control, documentation, and iterative revision processes. These experiences have trained me to maintain clarity and precision in technical outputs, which I understand is critical for preparing system design drawings, transposing layouts, and creating As-Built documentation.\n\nIn addition to my technical experience, I work effectively across multidisciplinary teams and communicate clearly with both technical and non-technical stakeholders. I am fluent in Bengali and English, have working knowledge of Russian and Hindi, and enjoy collaborating in international and cross-cultural environments.\n\nI have attached my CV for your review and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills can support the RecruitGo design team.', '2026-07-09 01:44:29.333', '2026-07-09 01:44:29.333');
