nt aligns with established brand guidelines, tone of voice, and messaging frameworks. </li><li> Maintain consistency across terminology, formatting, and narrative structure. </li><li> Deliver concise content that meets defined consumption goals without sacrificing quality or clarity. <br><br></li></ul>Collaboration<br><br><ul><li> Participate in project briefings and stakeholder discussions. </li><li> Work closely with project leads, designers, learning specialists, and subject matter experts. </li><li> Identify risks, gaps, or ambiguities early and proactively recommend solutions. </li><li> Collaborate effectively using Google Workspace and shared documentation environments. <br><br></li></ul>Quality Assurance<br><br><ul><li> Incorporate feedback quickly and accurately. </li><li> Maintain high standards of quality across all deliverables. </li><li> Conduct final reviews to ensure: </li><li> Accuracy </li><li> Clarity </li><li> Consistency </li><li> Usability </li><li> Adherence to brief </li><li> Fact-checking and evidence-based claims <br><br></li></ul><strong>Requirements<br><br></strong>Essential Experience<br><br><ul><li> Proven experience creating learning, training, enablement, or educational content for enterprise or B2B audiences. </li><li> Exceptional writing, editing, and storytelling skills. </li><li> Experience translating complex information into accessible and engaging content. </li><li> Strong proficiency with Google Docs and Google Slides. </li><li> Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills. </li><li> Demonstrated experience incorporating AI tools into content creation workflows. <br><br></li></ul>Desirable Experience<br><br><ul><li> Sales enablement or customer enablement content development. </li><li> Learning &amp; Development (L&amp;D) experience. </li><li> E-learning script writing and LMS content development. </li><li> Experience working with technical products, software, AI, or digital transformation initiatives. <br><br></li></ul>What Success Looks Like<br><br>You are likely to thrive in this role if you are:<br><br><ul><li> Outcome-focused and able to connect content to measurable business impact. </li><li> Fast, organised, and able to work independently. </li><li> Detail-oriented with a strong eye for consistency and quality. </li><li> Curious and proactive when gathering information. </li><li> Collaborative, adaptable, and comfortable receiving feedback. </li><li> Committed to producing high-quality work with minimal supervision. <br><br></li></ul><strong>Benefits<br><br></strong>Why Join?<br><br>This is an opportunity to join a collaborative and ambitious team where you can make an immediate impact. Youâll work on meaningful projects, help drive operational excellence, and play a key role in ensuring successful delivery across the business.<br><br>Final Thoughts<br><br><ul><li>Contract Type: Freelance / Project-Based Location: Remote Engagement: Flexible, project-driven assignments with ongoing opportunities for successful contributors.<br><br></li></ul>Diversity &amp; Inclusion<br><br>FYXER recognises the benefits of a diverse workforce and strives to be an inclusive organisation. We are committed to treating everyone with dignity and respect regardless of race, culture, gender, disability, age, sexual orientation, religion or belief and we promote diversity of thought. We would appreciate your help to enable us to measure the diversity within our recruitment process. Completing this form is voluntary and the information provided will remain anonymous. Please submit your information here.<br/><br/>Please mention the word **INTRIGUINGLY** and tag RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0 when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-05 15:17:45.064', '2026-06-05 15:17:45.064', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-freelance-content-creator-pickle-1132846', '', '[]', 'pending', '', NULL);
