(179, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Courier', 'FedEx Australia', 'Darwin,', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-courier-fedex-australia-1132873', 'FedEx Darwin is growing and looking for Couriers.<br><br>Why You will Love Working with FedExâ¦<br><br><ul><li>Career Development: advancement opportunities within a global transport leader.</li><li>Job Security: Enjoy stable, full-time work with consistent weekday shifts. No weekends.</li><li>Competitive Pay: Weekly wages, 14% superannuation, and generous leave.</li><li>Support to Succeed: Company vehicle, safety-first culture, modern fleet &amp; facility, and structured onboarding.</li><li>Culture &amp; Recognition: Diverse teams, supportive leadership, and paid recognition programs.</li><li>Health &amp; Wellbeing: Access to employee assistance programs, flu shots, and onsite physiotherapy.</li><li>Discounts: Shipping, Retail, Healthcare, Hotel, Travel &amp; More (Subject to Change).<br><br></li></ul><strong>Role:</strong> Courier<br><br><strong>Location:</strong> East Arm<br><br><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Permanent Full-Time<br><br><strong>What Weâre Looking For<br><br></strong><ul><li>Full working rights in Australia</li><li>Transport industry experience</li><li>Valid MR licence with a clean driving history (maximum 6 demerit points in the past 3 years)</li><li>Ability to pass drug and alcohol screening, driving assessment, criminal history check, and fitness evaluation</li><li>Positive attitude and customer-focused mindset<br><br></li></ul><strong>Ready to Drive Your Career Forward?<br><br></strong>If you\'re seeking a stable, rewarding career with outstanding benefits, FedEx is the place for you. Apply now and take the next step in your professional journey.<br><br><strong>All applications are welcome. We look forward to having you on board.</strong><br/><br/>Please mention the word **HARMONIOUS** and tag RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0 when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'FedEx Darwin is growing and looking for Couriers.<br><br>Why You will Love Working with FedExâ¦<br><br><ul><li>Career Development: advancement opportunities within a global transport leader.</li><li>Job Security: Enjoy stable, full-time work with consistent weekday shifts. No weekends.</li><li>Competitive Pay: Weekly wages, 14% superannuation, and generous leave.</li><li>Support to Succeed: Company vehicle, safety-first culture, modern fleet &amp; facility, and structured onboarding.</li><li>Culture &amp; Recognition: Diverse teams, supportive leadership, and paid recognition programs.</li><li>Health &amp; Wellbeing: Access to employee assistance programs, flu shots, and onsite physiotherapy.</li><li>Discounts: Shipping, Retail, Healthcare, Hotel, Travel &amp; More (Subject to Change).<br><br></li></ul><strong>Role:</strong> Courier<br><br><strong>Location:</strong> East Arm<br><br><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Permanent Full-Time<br><br><strong>What Weâre Looking For<br><br></strong><ul><li>Full working rights in Australia</li><li>Transport industry experience</li><li>Valid MR licence with a clean driving history (maximum 6 demerit points in the past 3 years)</li><li>Ability to pass drug and alcohol screening, driving assessment, criminal history check, and fitness evaluation</li><li>Positive attitude and customer-focused mindset<br><br></li></ul><strong>Ready to Drive Your Career Forward?<br><br></strong>If you\'re seeking a stable, rewarding career with outstanding benefits, FedEx is the place for you. Apply now and take the next step in your professional journey.<br><br><strong>All applications are welcome. We look forward to having you on board.</strong><br/><br/>Please mention the word **HARMONIOUS** and tag RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0 when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNjkuNTcuMTYyLjE0). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-05 15:18:26.055', '2026-06-05 15:18:26.055', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-courier-fedex-australia-1132873', '', '[]', 'pending', '', NULL),
(180, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Venture Lending Associate', 'Banco Covalto', 'Remote', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-venture-lending-associate-banco-covalto-1132815', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Covalto is seeking a Senior Associate to join the Global Venture Lending team. This is a highly technical role focused on the analysis, structuring, and management of complex credit investments across the Americas. You will act as a key execution lead for the platform, responsible for driving deals from initial due diligence through to closing and portfolio monitoring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;In the short term, you will manage one direct report and assist the Managing Director in scaling the team by hiring and onboarding additional resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Deal Execution: Lead the development and rigorous review of financial and credit models, including detailed cash flow forecasting, scenario analysis, and stress testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Due Diligence: Coordinate comprehensive due diligence processes, interfacing directly with management teams and venture sponsors to evaluate business models and creditworthiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Structuring: Design and analyze transaction structures, including collateral packages, restrictive covenants, and risk mitigation strategies tailored to high-growth companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Investment Committee: Prepare and present high-conviction investment memorandums and credit papers to the Investment Committee.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Legal &amp;amp; Closing: Support the negotiation of legal documentation and the execution of transactions, collaborating closely with internal and external counsel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Portfolio Management: Oversee portfolio health, monitor covenant compliance, and evaluate ongoing performance against the original investment thesis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Team Leadership: Supervise and mentor junior analysts, ensuring high standards of technical output and supporting the recruitment of new team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience: 4â7 years of experience in Venture Debt, Structured Finance, Private Credit, or a related technical lending field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Technical Skills: Advanced proficiency in financial modeling and data analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ecosystem Knowledge: Strong understanding of the venture capital lifecycle and credit dynamics within the technology and fintech sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Languages: Native or professional fluency in both English and Spanish is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Education: Bachelorâs degree in Finance, Economics, or a related field; CFA or advanced degree preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Reporting: Reports to the Managing Director, Global Venture Lending.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Location: TBD (Mexico City or Remote Colombia).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Attributes: We are looking for a proactive &quot;business owner&quot; who operates with technical precision, humility, and a results-oriented mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt