ent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This is a 1099 contractor role offering a $9,000 monthly retainer and up to $120,000 in performance-based incentives (up to $228,000 total annual compensation). </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span></p>\n<img src=\"https://remotive.com/job/track/2090943/blank.gif?source=public_api\" alt=\"\"/>', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-05 15:18:51.896', '2026-06-05 15:18:51.896', '', 'contract', 'Remote', 'United States', '', 'Remotive', 'API', 'READY', 'Web%20Developer', '', '', 'api', 'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/head-of-sales-2090943', '', '[]', 'pending', '', NULL);
