sh-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-11 03:14:37.170', '2026-06-11 03:14:37.170', '', '', '', 'Europe', '', 'Arbeitnow', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/fynancy-gmbh/erp-entwicklerin-developer-hamburg-17977', '', '[]', 'pending', '', NULL),
