lls and ability to build relationships with candidates and hiring managers.</li><li>Ability to work independently, managing multiple recruitment projects efficiently.</li><li>Proficient with recruitment tools, job boards, and social media platforms for sourcing candidates.</li><li>Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail.</li><li>Adaptable, proactive, and willing to embrace new challenges and learning opportunities.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Work Remote Worldwide</li><li>Schedule Your Own Hours</li><li>Payment On Commission Per Hired Candidate</li><li>Access To All Our Open Positions</li><li>Full Backoffice Support</li><li>And More..</li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **EARNEST** and tag RNjguMjMxLjE4OS4zNA== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNjguMjMxLjE4OS4zNA==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-13 13:43:36.802', '2026-06-13 13:43:36.802', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-experienced-english-speaking-freelance-recruiter-mercier-consultancy-group-1133329', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-experienced-english-speaking-freelance-recruiter-mercier-consultancy-group-1133329', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-experienced-english-speaking-freelance-recruiter-mercier-consultancy-group-1133329\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL),
