 matter experts, and senior writers to develop high-quality content that performs well in both traditional search engines and emerging generative AI platforms. From long-form guides and thought-leadership blogs to optimized landing pages and case studies, your work will shape how students and families discover and engage with our services at critical decision-making moments.</p>\n<p>This role is best suited for someone who thrives on balancing creativity with structureâcrafting engaging, human-centered narratives while rigorously applying SEO and Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) best practices. As part of a fast-paced, rapid-growth team, youâll have the opportunity to experiment with new formats, expand your expertise in h<br/><br/>Please mention the word **SUCCESSES** and tag RNjguMjMxLjE4OS4zNA== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RNjguMjMxLjE4OS4zNA==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-14 01:41:26.234', '2026-06-14 01:41:26.234', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-seo-content-writer-inspira-education-1133357', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-seo-content-writer-inspira-education-1133357', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-seo-content-writer-inspira-education-1133357\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
