(998, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'North America Field Marketing and Events Manager', 'Rithum', 'United States', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-north-america-field-marketing-and-events-manager-rithum-1133458', 'Rithumâ¢ is the worldâs most trusted commerce network, accelerating how brands, suppliers, and retailers work together to deliver seamless e-commerce experiences. We provide an unmatched platform for brands and retailers, enabling them to accelerate growth, optimize operations across channels, scale product offerings and enhance margins.\n\nToday, more than 40,000 companies trust Rithum to grow their business across hundreds of channels, representing over $50 billion in annual GMV. Using our commerce, marketing, and delivery solutions, our customers create optimized consumer shopping journeys from beginning to end.\n\nOverview \nAt Rithum, we empower commerce growth by connecting brands, retailers, and suppliers. As the North America Field Marketing & Events Manager, you are responsible for designing and executing a dynamic portfolio of eventsâincluding client conferences, industry trade shows, internal company gatherings, executive dinners, and multi-city roadshowsâwhile driving localized marketing strategies to generate demand, accelerate the sales pipeline, and align with Rithumâs strategic business objectives. You collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver impactful events that inspire clients and engage industry leaders. In conjunction with senior marketing leadership, you develop regional strategies, optimize processes, and deliver high-impact experiences that elevate Rithumâs brand visibility and client engagement in North America.\n\nResponsibilities\n- Define and execute a North America field events plan to enhance brand visibility and achieve measurable business goals.\n- Develop and execute localized marketing strategies to drive demand, generate leads, and accelerate the sales pipeline in specific regions.\n- Build collaborativ