(1007, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Graphic Designer', 'The Fountain Group', 'San Francisco, San Francisco, California, United States', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-graphic-designer-the-fountain-group-1133453', '<strong>The Fountain Group </strong>is currently seeking a <strong>Graphic Designer </strong>for a prominent client of ours. This is a <strong>Hybrid Role in San Francisco, CA 94105 (1 or 2 days on-site / week)</strong>. Details for the position are as follows:<br><br><strong>Pay Rate - Upto $56/hr on W2<br><br></strong><strong>5 months assignment with HIGH possibility of extension<br><br></strong>We are looking for a Sr. Designerâa talented, thought-provoking person who must have the ability to help internal stakeholders define and solve complex marketing problems through concept, design, and execution.<br><br><strong>Who You Are:<br><br></strong>You have excellent design craft, a wealth of digital &amp; print experience, and impressive conceptual abilities. You\'re fearless in trying new directions or techniques in order to create something new. You have your finger on the pulse of industry trends and best practices, and you\'re frequently sought out by other designers for input on their work. You\'re both a sprinter and a long-distance runner.<br><br><strong>What You\'ll Do:<br><br></strong>During your contract, you\'ll flex between teams as needed. You\'ll concept everything from big campaign ideas and event experiences to cohesive design themes for email campaigns and web updates.<br><br><strong>You will design:<br><br></strong>Creative campaigns, e-books, email materials, and social campaigns.<br><br>Webpages and presentations.<br><br>Immersive experiences for our world-class events, including Dreamforce, the biggest software conference in the world.<br><br>Anything else our internal clients or the creative team at large needs.<br><br><strong>Technical Skill Requirements:<br><br></strong><strong>Portfolio Required<br><br></strong>Need some <strong>Tech industry</strong> experience (either direct or through an agency with tech industry clients).<br><br>5+ years of graphic design experience.<br><br>Must have skills: Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, Google Suite.<br><br>Teachable skills: Understanding of Salesforce products.<br><br>Optional skills: Motion, Animation.<br><br>Working knowledge of AI workflows, specifically Google Gemini and Nano Banana.<br><br>Familiarity/working knowledge of Adobe After Effects is a big plus.<br><br>If you are interested in hearing more about the position, please respond to this posting with your resume attached.<br><br>Please forward this posting to any friends or colleagues as we do offer a <strong>Referral Bonus</strong> for any candidate hired.<br><br><em>By applying for this job, you agree to receive calls, AI-generated calls, text messages, or emails from and its affiliates, and contracted partners. Frequency varies for text messages. Message and data rates may apply. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. You can reply STOP to cancel and HELP for help. You can access our privacy policy at </em><strong><em>Privacy Policy<br><br></em></strong><br/><br/>Please mention the word **DESERVEDLY** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', '<strong>The Fountain Group </strong>is currently seeking a <strong>Graphic Designer </strong>for a prominent client of ours. This is a <strong>Hybrid Role in San Francisco, CA 94105 (1 or 2 days on-site / week)</strong>. Details for the position are as follows:<br><br><strong>Pay Rate - Upto $56/hr on W2<br><br></strong><strong>5 months assignment with HIGH possibility of extension<br><br></strong>We are looking for a Sr. Designerâa talented, thought-provoking person who must have the ability to help internal stakehold