(1045, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Executive Assistant Fully Inside IR35', 'VPA London', 'London Area, London Area, United Kingdom', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-executive-assistant-fully-inside-ir35-vpa-london-1133498', '<p><strong>Executive Assistant | Fully Remote | Inside IR35</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Our client, a global financial services firm, is seeking an experienced Executive Assistant to support senior stakeholders within a fast-paced and international environment. This is a full-time, fully remote contract opportunity offering long-term stability and the chance to work closely with senior leadership across a global business.</p><p><br></p><p>This is a varied role requiring a proactive, highly organised and resilient EA who thrives on managing multiple priorities and building strong stakeholder relationships. The successful candidate will act as a trusted partner, providing seamless support across diary management, international travel and team coordination.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key responsibilities:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>â¢ Providing dedicated support to senior stakeholders</p><p>â¢ Managing complex and ever-changing diaries across multiple time zones</p><p>â¢ Coordinating international travel, meetings and logistics</p><p>â¢ Building strong relationships with internal and external stakeholders globally</p><p>â¢ Managing competing priorities and ensuring smooth day-to-day operations</p><p>â¢ Supporting with meeting preparation, communications and team coordination</p><p>â¢ Acting as a key point of contact and helping drive efficiency across the wider team</p><p>â¢ Providing proactive support and anticipating stakeholder needs</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key requirements:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>â¢ Minimum 6 years\' experience in an Executive Assistant or Personal Assistant role</p><p>â¢ Previous experience supporting senior executives within the financial services sector</p><p>â¢ Strong diary and international travel management experience</p><p>â¢ Highly organised, proactive and able to anticipate needs</p><p>â¢ Resilient, calm under pressure and confident managing senior stakeholders</p><p>â¢ Excellent communication and relationship-building skills</p><p>â¢ Ability to manage multiple priorities and work independently in a remote environment</p><p>â¢ Strong attention to detail and problem-solving skills</p><p>â¢ Experience supporting international teams is advantageous</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Must be UK-based and have the right to work in the UK.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>This is a full-time remote contract role, working Monday to Friday, 9:00amâ6:00pm (8-hour working day).</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Remote | Inside IR35 | Â£22 per hour take-home</strong></p><p><br></p><p>If this role is of interest, please apply directly or email jessica.gray@vpalondon.co.uk</p><br/><br/>Please mention the word **EXCITEDLY** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', '<p><strong>Executive Assistant | Fully Remote | Inside IR35</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Our client, a global financial services firm, is seeking an experienced Executive Assistant to support senior stakeholders within a fast-paced and international environment. This is a full-time, fully remote contract opportunity offering long-term stability and the chance to work closely with senior leadership across a global business.</p><p><br></p><p>This is a varied role requiring a proactive, highly organised and resilient EA who thrives on managing multiple priorities and building strong stakeholder relationships. The successful candidate will act as a trusted partner, providing seamless support across diary management, international travel and team coordination.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key responsibilities:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>â¢ Providing dedicated support to senior stakeholders</p><p>â¢ Managing complex and ever-changing diaries across multiple time zones</p><p>â¢ Coordinating international travel, meetings and logistics</p><p>â¢ Building strong relationships with internal and external stakeholders globally</p><p>â¢ Managing competing priorities and ensuring smooth day-to-day operations</p><p>â¢ Supporting with meeting preparation, communications and team coordination</p><p>â¢ Acting as a key point of contact and helping drive efficiency across the wider team</p><p>â¢ Providing proactive support and anticipating stakeholder needs</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key requirements:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>â¢ Minimum 6 years\' experience in an Executive Assistant or Personal Assistant role</p><p>â¢ Previous experience supporting senior executives within the financial services sector</p><p>â¢ Strong diary and international travel management experience</p><p>â¢ Highly organised, proactive and able to anticipate needs</p><p>â¢ Resilient, calm under pressure and confident managing senior stakeholders</p><p>â¢ Excellent communication and relationship-building skills</p><p>â¢ Ability to manage multiple priorities and work independently in a remote environment</p><p>â¢ Strong attention to detail and problem-solving skills</p><p>â¢ Experience supporting international teams is advantageous</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Must be UK-based and have the right to work in the UK.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>This is a full-time remote contract role, working Monday to Friday, 9:00amâ6:00pm (8-hour working day).</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Remote | Inside IR35 | Â£22 per hour take-home</strong></p><p><br></p><p>If this role is of interest, please apply directly or email jessica.gray@vpalondon.co.uk</p><br/><br/>Please mention the word **EXCITEDLY** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-17 13:43:26.041', '2026-06-17 13:43:26.041', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-executive-assistant-fully-inside-ir35-vpa-london-1133498', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-executive-assistant-fully-inside-ir35-vpa-london-1133498', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-executive-assistant-fully-inside-ir35-vpa-london-1133498\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
