kflow management with any external agencies / consultants dedicated to SEO/GEO strategies, social media, etc</li><li>External Resource Coordination: Management and technical coordination of external freelancers (e.g., graphic designers, copywriters, videomakers, social media consultants, etc.) for the production of Italian marketing materials</li><li>Employee Advocacy: Coordination of Italian colleagues to align personal communication on LinkedIn and amplify the brand voice</li><li>KPI Measurement &amp; Reporting: Constant monitoring and monthly reporting of main marketing KPIs for the Italian market<br><br></li></ul><strong>Requirements<br><br></strong><ul><li>Experience: Minimum 3 years of proven experience in marketing, digital communication, or PR roles</li><li>Industry Knowledge: Previous experience in the SaaS, e-commerce, or tech industry is highly preferred</li><li>Mindset &amp; Soft Skills: Highly proactive, hands-on approach, and resourceful. You have strong self-management skills and the ability to navigate a fast-paced environment independently</li><li>Drive: A genuine desire to learn, grow, and build the role from the ground up, taking true ownership of the Italian marketing operations<br><br></li></ul><strong>Benefits<br><br></strong><ul><li>Be a part of a global, fast-scaling e-commerce SaaS company with a leading tech product</li><li>Be a key player in Base.com\'s Italian market expansion</li><li>High autonomy and ownership of projects</li><li>Remote work model with full flexibility</li><li>Collaborate with international teams and work on high-impact projects</li><li>Participation in annual global company summits around the world</li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **MESMERIZE** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '20