ease mention the word **CLEVER** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-18 01:46:09.490', '2026-06-18 01:46:09.490', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-24-hr-review-va-virtual-receptionist-onlinejobs-ph-1133516', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-24-hr-review-va-virtual-receptionist-onlinejobs-ph-1133516', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-24-hr-review-va-virtual-receptionist-onlinejobs-ph-1133516\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
