years of experience required. We index on judgment, drive, and clarity of thought over credentials.<br><br><strong>Benefits<br><br></strong><strong>How We Work<br><br></strong><ul><li>Fully remote and globally distributed. We hire for talent, not timezone</li><li>High leverage, high trust. You get real responsibility early</li><li>Profitable and stable. Startup pace, without the funding-cliff fear</li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **WEALTHY** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-18 13:44:03.490', '2026-06-18 13:44:03.490', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-junior-customer-success-representative-mission-inbox-1133540', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-junior-customer-success-representative-mission-inbox-1133540', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-junior-customer-success-representative-mission-inbox-1133540\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
