(1522, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Video Editor', 'Marz', 'Fully,', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-video-editor-marz-1133894', '<strong>About The Role<br><br></strong>We\'re looking for a high-velocity video editor who lives and breathes Reels, TikToks, and YouTube Shorts. Youâll turn raw clips into scroll-stopping content with hooks, captions, transitions, and trending sounds â fast.<br><br>Youâll be great at this if you<br><br><ul><li>Know how to cut fast, clean, and for retention</li><li>Can adapt editing style to fit different niches (coaches, creators, brands)</li><li>Love experimenting with formats, audio, and pacing<br><br></li></ul><strong>About Influence<br><br></strong>Influence is a fully remote, global agency built for the creators, founders, and personal brands shaping the future of content. We craft short-form videos that donât just go viral â they drive real growth. We\'re a tight-knit team of editors, strategists, and creatives who care deeply about quality, speed, and outcomes.<br><br>What You Get<br><br><ul><li>Fully remote work with flexible hours</li><li>Work with fast-growing creators and brands</li><li>Monthly team growth sessions</li><li>Opportunity to grow into a lead or specialist role</li><li>A creative-first, ego-free culture</li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **BONNY** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', '<strong>About The Role<br><br></strong>We\'re looking for a high-velocity video editor who lives and breathes Reels, TikToks, and YouTube Shorts. Youâll turn raw clips into scroll-stopping content with hooks, captions, transitions, and trending sounds â fast.<br><br>Youâll be great at this if you<br><br><ul><li>Know how to cut fast, clean, and for retention</li><li>Can adapt editing style to fit different niches (coaches, creators, brands)</li><li>Love experimenting with formats, audio, and pacing<br><br></li></ul><strong>About Influence<br><br></strong>Influence is a fully remote, global agency built for the creators, founders, and personal brands shaping the future of content. We craft short-form videos that donât just go viral â they drive real growth. We\'re a tight-knit team of editors, strategists, and creatives who care deeply about quality, speed, and outcomes.<br><br>What You Get<br><br><ul><li>Fully remote work with flexible hours</li><li>Work with fast-growing creators and brands</li><li>Monthly team growth sessions</li><li>Opportunity to grow into a lead or specialist role</li><li>A creative-first, ego-free culture</li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **BONNY** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-24 01:46:41.378', '2026-06-24 01:46:41.378', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-video-editor-marz-1133894', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-video-editor-marz-1133894', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-video-editor-marz-1133894\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
