(1552, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Marketing Coordinator', 'RESOLUTE HR CONSULTING', 'Remote', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-marketing-coordinator-resolute-hr-consulting-1133917', '<h1>Marketing Coordinator â Digital Platform Operations</h1><p><strong>Location:</strong> Fully Remote<br /><strong>Country:</strong> United States<br /><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Part-time<br /></p><h2>About the Role</h2><p>We are looking for a detail-oriented Marketing Coordinator to support the backend operations of our digital platforms. This role is suitable for someone who is comfortable working with digital tools, performance data, content trends, and platform operations.</p><p>The position is fully remote and focuses on operational support, performance tracking, and digital marketing coordination. This is not a direct sales role.</p><h2>Key Responsibilities</h2><ul><li><p>Support backend operations across digital platforms and internal systems</p></li><li><p>Assist with platform updates, content organization, product listings, and operational workflows</p></li><li><p>Monitor product performance and identify relevant digital or viral trend patterns</p></li><li><p>Track conversion rates, engagement metrics, traffic performance, and user activity</p></li><li><p>Prepare basic reports and performance summaries for internal review</p></li><li><p>Coordinate with internal team members to improve digital platform efficiency</p></li><li><p>Help maintain accurate records, campaign information, and platform data</p></li><li><p>Support ongoing marketing projects and digital operations as needed</p></li></ul><h2>Qualifications</h2><ul><li><p>Experience or interest in digital marketing, platform operations, e-commerce, content performance, or data tracking</p></li><li><p>Comfortable working with online platforms, spreadsheets, dashboards, and basic reporting tools</p></li><li><p>Strong attention to detail and ability to follow structured workflows</p></li><li><p>Good written communication skills</p></li><li><p>Ability to work independently in a fully remote environment</p></li><li><p>Organized, reliable, and responsive during agreed working hours</p></li></ul><h2>Preferred Skills</h2><ul><li><p>Familiarity with digital marketing metrics such as conversion rate, engagement rate, click-through rate, traffic sources, and product performance</p></li><li><p>Experience using tools such as Google Sheets, Excel, Google Analytics, Shopify, Meta Business Suite, TikTok Shop, Amazon Seller Central, or similar platforms</p></li><li><p>Ability to identify trends and summarize performance insights clearly</p></li><li><p>Previous experience in marketing coordination, digital operations, content operations, or platform support is helpful but not required</p></li></ul><h2>What We Offer</h2><ul><li><p>Fully remote working arrangement</p></li><li><p>Training and guidance on internal workflows</p></li><li><p>Exposure to digital marketing operations and platform performance analysis</p></li><li><p>Opportunity to build practical skills in digital marketing, reporting, and online platform management</p></li><li><p>Supportive and organized remote working environment</p></li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **ENRICHMENT** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', '<h1>Marketing Coordinator â Digital Platform Operations</h1><p><strong>Location:</strong> Fully Remote<br /><strong>Country:</strong> United States<br /><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Part-time<br /></p><h2>About the Role</h2><p>We are looking for a detail-oriented Marketing Coordinator to support the backend operations of our digital platforms. This role is suitable for someone who is comfortable working with digital tools, performance data, content trends, and platform operations.</p><p>The position is fully remote and focuses on operational support, performance tracking, and digital marketing coordination. This is not a direct sales role.</p><h2>Key Responsibilities</h2><ul><li><p>Support backend operations across digital platforms and internal systems</p></li><li><p>Assist with platform updates, content organization, product listings, and operational workflows</p></li><li><p>Monitor product performance and identify relevant digital or viral trend patterns</p></li><li><p>Track conversion rates, engagement metrics, traffic performance, and user activity</p></li><li><p>Prepare basic reports and performance summaries for internal review</p></li><li><p>Coordinate with internal team members to improve digital platform efficiency</p></li><li><p>Help maintain accurate records, campaign information, and platform data</p></li><li><p>Support ongoing marketing projects and digital operations as needed</p></li></ul><h2>Qualifications</h2><ul><li><p>Experience or interest in digital marketing, platform operations, e-commerce, content performance, or data tracking</p></li><li><p>Comfortable working with online platforms, spreadsheets, dashboards, and basic reporting tools</p></li><li><p>Strong attention to detail and ability to follow structured workflows</p></li><li><p>Good written communication skills</p></li><li><p>Ability to work independently in a fully remote environment</p></li><li><p>Organized, reliable, and responsive during agreed working hours</p></li></ul><h2>Preferred Skills</h2><ul><li><p>Familiarity with digital marketing metrics such as conversion rate, engagement rate, click-through rate, traffic sources, and product performance</p></li><li><p>Experience using tools such as Google Sheets, Excel, Google Analytics, Shopify, Meta Business Suite, TikTok Shop, Amazon Seller Central, or similar platforms</p></li><li><p>Ability to identify trends and summarize performance insights clearly</p></li><li><p>Previous experience in marketing coordination, digital operations, content operations, or platform support is helpful but not required</p></li></ul><h2>What We Offer</h2><ul><li><p>Fully remote working arrangement</p></li><li><p>Training and guidance on internal workflows</p></li><li><p>Exposure to digital marketing operations and platform performance analysis</p></li><li><p>Opportunity to build practical skills in digital marketing, reporting, and online platform management</p></li><li><p>Supportive and organized remote working environment</p></li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **ENRICHMENT** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-24 13:43:24.563', '2026-06-24 13:43:24.563', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-marketing-coordinator-resolute-hr-consulting-1133917', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-marketing-coordinator-resolute-hr-consulting-1133917', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-marketing-coordinator-resolute-hr-consulting-1133917\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL),
