ent extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited.</p>\n<p>Explore career opportunities with us and join a team driven by collaboration, innovation, and a shared vision of creating a world where everyone can build a thriving business. Discover more about our vibrant and inclusive work culture and how we work on our <a href=\"https://www.sumup.com/careers/\">careers website</a>, and follow our journey on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/\">LinkedIn</a> and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/\">Instagram</a>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>Job Application Tip</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don\'t tick every box, it\'s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.</span></p></div><p>Find <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/\">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-27 01:40:13.773', '2026-06-27 01:40:13.773', '', '', '', 'Europe', '', 'Arbeitnow', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sumup/senior-backend-engineer-golang-berlin-101948', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sumup/senior-backend-engineer-golang-berlin-101948', '[{\"url\":\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sumup/senior-backend-engineer-golang-berlin-101948\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
