(1841, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Sales Assistant', 'Endureed by Global Innovation', 'USA', 'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/sales-assistant-2091038', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong> </strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: black; padding: 0in; border: 1pt none windowtext;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:16.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n6.0pt;margin-left:0in;border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #2E7D32 1.5pt;\r\npadding:0in;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 4.0pt 0in\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32;mso-no-proof:yes\"><!--[if !vml]--><img height=\"111\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"263\"><!--[endif]--></span></strong><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\"><p></p></span></strong></p><p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">This role may\r\nrequire you to be on site at times - please check with the employer first.<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Job\r\nTitle: Sales Assistant<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Company: Endureed<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Location: Lake\r\nCity, FL / Remote eligible<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Reports\r\nto: VP of Global Sales<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\">ABOUT\r\nTHE ROLE</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">The Sales Assistant is the operational backbone of the US\r\nsales team. You\'ll provide hands-on administrative, coordination, and customer\r\nsupport to the VP of Global Sales — keeping the department running smoothly,\r\naccurately, and on time across residential and Strategic Partner (SP) channels.</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"></p><p> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">This isn\'t a role for someone who wants to wing it, work\r\nindependently without structure, or stay at arm\'s length from the details. It\'s\r\na role for someone who finds real satisfaction in making sure nothing falls\r\nthrough the cracks someone who takes pride in accuracy, follows through without\r\nbeing asked twice, and genuinely enjoys being the person others can count on.</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"></p><p> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">If you\'re the kind of person who gets energized by\r\ncreating order, supporting a team, and doing the unglamorous-but-critical work\r\nthat makes everything else possible keep reading.</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"></p><p> </p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 7in; border-width: medium; border-style: none;\" width=\"672\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width: 240pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); background: rgb(232, 245, 233); padding: 8pt 10pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:5.0pt\"><strong><span style=\'font-family:\r\n  \"Arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\'>✓  You\'ll thrive here if you...</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Get genuine satisfaction from\r\n  organizing, tracking, and keeping things accurate</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Take ownership of tasks and\r\n  follow through without being reminded</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Prefer a defined role with clear\r\n  expectations over open-ended autonomy</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Are naturally calm, steady, and\r\n  don\'t rattle easily when things get busy</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Build trust by being dependable,\r\n  not by being loud</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Take pride in serving others and\r\n  helping your team look good</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Are bilingual in English and\r\n  Spanish and comfortable using both professionally</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Thrive in a structured,\r\n  process-driven environment with consistent routines</span></p><p></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 264pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background: rgb(255, 248, 248); padding: 8pt 10pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"352\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:5.0pt\"><strong><span style=\'font-family:\r\n  \"Arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-color:#C62828\'>✗  This role is NOT for you if you...</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Need to be the center of\r\n  attention or get credit to feel motivated</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Prefer creating your own process\r\n  over following an established one</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Dislike repetitive tasks or\r\n  detailed administrative work</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Get bored or frustrated when\r\n  you\'re not driving strategy or making big decisions</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Struggle to stay organized when\r\n  managing multiple people\'s priorities at once</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Want flexibility to define your\r\n  own schedule or work style without check-ins</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Move fast and loose, accuracy\r\n  and follow-through aren\'t your strong suits</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Are looking for a stepping stone\r\n  to a sales rep role as fast as possible</span></p><p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"></p><p> </p><p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\">KEY\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:2.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Day-to-day, you will:</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Provide administrative support to the VP of Global Sales, calendar\r\nmanagement, scheduling, travel coordination, and communications</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Prepare and update sales reports, presentations, and\r\ncustomer-facing materials for residential and SP accounts</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Own CRM data entry, lead tracking, and pipeline management,\r\ndata must be accurate and current at all times</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Coordinate between the sales team and the SP network,\r\nincluding onboarding new partners and managing ongoing communication</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Track SP territory coverage and ensure Basics product line\r\ndistribution aligns with current SP network policies</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Conduct market and competitor research to support US sales\r\nstrategy</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Help organize sales campaigns, trade shows, events, and\r\nclient meetings, logistics, materials, follow-up</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Ensure timely document and information flow between the\r\nsales team, operations, and other departments</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Support order processing and client onboarding across\r\nresidential and SP channels</span></p><p></p><p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\">WHAT\r\nYOU BRING</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Bilingual — English and Spanish required, written and\r\nspoken (non-negotiable)</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">2+ years in a sales support, coordinator, or\r\nadministrative role, you\'ve done this before and you\'re good at it</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">CRM experience required; NetSuite or similar ERP a strong\r\nplus</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Proficiency with Microsoft Office and/or Google Workspace,\r\nespecially Excel/Sheets and PowerPoint/Slides</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Exceptional organizational skills, you manage multiple\r\nmoving pieces without losing track of any of them</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">High attention to detail, errors bother you before anyone\r\nelse catches them</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Calm, professional communication style, written and verbal</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Experience in building materials, construction, or a\r\nproduct-based industry is a plus, not a requirement</span></p><p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in 4.0pt .5in;\">To apply, please complete our Culture Index survey before submitting your application:</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in 4.0pt .5in;\"><a href=\"https://go.cultureindex.com/p/dmxXuQJk6Y4WKDaTvN\" id=\"OWAc979f347-c4b8-055e-7923-19fd0130592f\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"border-style: none; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; background-color: #ffffff;\" title=\"https://go.cultureindex.com/p/dmxXuQJk6Y4WKDaTvN\">https://go.cultureindex.com/p/dmxXuQJk6Y4WKDaTvN</a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in 4.0pt .5in;\">Applications without a completed survey will not be considered.</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" style=\"\" type=\"1\">\n<li style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"border-style: none; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">Send an email to</span></strong><span style=\"border-style: none; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"> <a href=\"mailto:careers@endureed.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"border-style: none; font: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"mailto:careers@endureed.com\">careers@endureed.com</a> with the subject line: <strong>\"Sales Assistant Application, First and Last Name\"</strong> <em>(replace with your name)</em></span></li>\n</ol>\n<img src=\"https://remotive.com/job/track/2091038/blank.gif?source=public_api\" alt=\"\"/>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong> </strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: black; padding: 0in; border: 1pt none windowtext;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:16.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n6.0pt;margin-left:0in;border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #2E7D32 1.5pt;\r\npadding:0in;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 4.0pt 0in\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32;mso-no-proof:yes\"><!--[if !vml]--><img height=\"111\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"263\"><!--[endif]--></span></strong><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\"><p></p></span></strong></p><p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\">This role may\r\nrequire you to be on site at times - please check with the employer first.<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Job\r\nTitle: Sales Assistant<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Company: Endureed<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Location: Lake\r\nCity, FL / Remote eligible<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial\"> Reports\r\nto: VP of Global Sales<p></p></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\"> </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\">ABOUT\r\nTHE ROLE</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">The Sales Assistant is the operational backbone of the US\r\nsales team. You\'ll provide hands-on administrative, coordination, and customer\r\nsupport to the VP of Global Sales — keeping the department running smoothly,\r\naccurately, and on time across residential and Strategic Partner (SP) channels.</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"></p><p> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">This isn\'t a role for someone who wants to wing it, work\r\nindependently without structure, or stay at arm\'s length from the details. It\'s\r\na role for someone who finds real satisfaction in making sure nothing falls\r\nthrough the cracks someone who takes pride in accuracy, follows through without\r\nbeing asked twice, and genuinely enjoys being the person others can count on.</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"></p><p> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:4.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">If you\'re the kind of person who gets energized by\r\ncreating order, supporting a team, and doing the unglamorous-but-critical work\r\nthat makes everything else possible keep reading.</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"></p><p> </p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 7in; border-width: medium; border-style: none;\" width=\"672\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width: 240pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); background: rgb(232, 245, 233); padding: 8pt 10pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"320\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:5.0pt\"><strong><span style=\'font-family:\r\n  \"Arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\'>✓  You\'ll thrive here if you...</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Get genuine satisfaction from\r\n  organizing, tracking, and keeping things accurate</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Take ownership of tasks and\r\n  follow through without being reminded</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Prefer a defined role with clear\r\n  expectations over open-ended autonomy</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Are naturally calm, steady, and\r\n  don\'t rattle easily when things get busy</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Build trust by being dependable,\r\n  not by being loud</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Take pride in serving others and\r\n  helping your team look good</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Are bilingual in English and\r\n  Spanish and comfortable using both professionally</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Thrive in a structured,\r\n  process-driven environment with consistent routines</span></p><p></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 264pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204) rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background: rgb(255, 248, 248); padding: 8pt 10pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"352\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:5.0pt\"><strong><span style=\'font-family:\r\n  \"Arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-color:#C62828\'>✗  This role is NOT for you if you...</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Need to be the center of\r\n  attention or get credit to feel motivated</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Prefer creating your own process\r\n  over following an established one</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Dislike repetitive tasks or\r\n  detailed administrative work</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Get bored or frustrated when\r\n  you\'re not driving strategy or making big decisions</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Struggle to stay organized when\r\n  managing multiple people\'s priorities at once</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Want flexibility to define your\r\n  own schedule or work style without check-ins</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Move fast and loose, accuracy\r\n  and follow-through aren\'t your strong suits</span></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:2.0pt;margin-right:0in;\r\n  margin-bottom:2.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n  </span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"\r\n  mso-fareast-color:#3A3A3A\">Are looking for a stepping stone\r\n  to a sales rep role as fast as possible</span></p><p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"></p><p> </p><p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\">KEY\r\nRESPONSIBILITIES</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:2.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0in\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Day-to-day, you will:</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Provide administrative support to the VP of Global Sales, calendar\r\nmanagement, scheduling, travel coordination, and communications</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Prepare and update sales reports, presentations, and\r\ncustomer-facing materials for residential and SP accounts</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Own CRM data entry, lead tracking, and pipeline management,\r\ndata must be accurate and current at all times</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Coordinate between the sales team and the SP network,\r\nincluding onboarding new partners and managing ongoing communication</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Track SP territory coverage and ensure Basics product line\r\ndistribution aligns with current SP network policies</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Conduct market and competitor research to support US sales\r\nstrategy</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Help organize sales campaigns, trade shows, events, and\r\nclient meetings, logistics, materials, follow-up</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Ensure timely document and information flow between the\r\nsales team, operations, and other departments</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Support order processing and client onboarding across\r\nresidential and SP channels</span></p><p></p><p style=\"border-width: medium medium 1.5pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(46, 125, 50); padding: 0in 0in 4pt;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\"><strong><span style=\"\r\nmso-fareast-color:#2E7D32\">WHAT\r\nYOU BRING</span></strong></p><p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Bilingual — English and Spanish required, written and\r\nspoken (non-negotiable)</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">2+ years in a sales support, coordinator, or\r\nadministrative role, you\'ve done this before and you\'re good at it</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">CRM experience required; NetSuite or similar ERP a strong\r\nplus</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Proficiency with Microsoft Office and/or Google Workspace,\r\nespecially Excel/Sheets and PowerPoint/Slides</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Exceptional organizational skills, you manage multiple\r\nmoving pieces without losing track of any of them</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">High attention to detail, errors bother you before anyone\r\nelse catches them</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Calm, professional communication style, written and verbal</span></p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 16pt 0in 6pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; padding: 0in;\">\n</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n3.0pt;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-15.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->•<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal;  font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">      \r\n</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nArial;color:#3A3A3A\">Experience in building materials, construction, or a\r\nproduct-based industry is a plus, not a requirement</span></p><p></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in 4.0pt .5in;\">To apply, please complete our Culture Index survey before submitting your application:</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in 4.0pt .5in;\"><a href=\"https://go.cultureindex.com/p/dmxXuQJk6Y4WKDaTvN\" id=\"OWAc979f347-c4b8-055e-7923-19fd0130592f\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"border-style: none; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0px; background-color: #ffffff;\" title=\"https://go.cultureindex.com/p/dmxXuQJk6Y4WKDaTvN\">https://go.cultureindex.com/p/dmxXuQJk6Y4WKDaTvN</a></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in 4.0pt .5in;\">Applications without a completed survey will not be considered.</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" style=\"\" type=\"1\">\n<li style=\"\"><strong><span style=\"border-style: none; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\">Send an email to</span></strong><span style=\"border-style: none; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\"> <a href=\"mailto:careers@endureed.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"border-style: none; font: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"mailto:careers@endureed.com\">careers@endureed.com</a> with the subject line: <strong>\"Sales Assistant Application, First and Last Name\"</strong> <em>(replace with your name)</em></span></li>\n</ol>\n<img src=\"https://remotive.com/job/track/2091038/blank.gif?source=public_api\" alt=\"\"/>', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-28 13:42:10.092', '2026-06-28 13:42:10.092', '', 'full_time', 'Remote', 'United States', '', 'Remotive', 'API', 'READY', 'Web%20Developer', '', '', 'api', 'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/sales-assistant-2091038', 'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/sales-assistant-2091038', '[{\"url\":\"https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/sales-assistant-2091038\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
INSERT INTO `job_posts` (`id`, `sourceId`, `sourceType`, `externalId`, `title`, `company`, `location`, `sourceUrl`, `description`, `rawContent`, `status`, `receivedAt`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `emailSubject`, `jobType`, `workMode`, `region`, `experienceLevel`, `sourceName`, `importMethod`, `descriptionStatus`, `searchKeywordMatched`, `sourceEmail`, `sourceSubject`, `sourcePlatform`, `applyUrl`, `companyUrl`, `extractedUrls`, `contactDiscoveryStatus`, `contactDiscoveryError`, `lastContactDiscoveryAt`) VALUES
(1842, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Werkstudent (gn) Hochbau Schwerpunkt Kalkulation & Arbeitsvorbereitung', 'OST BAU; Osterburger Straßen-,Tief- und Hochbau GmbH', 'Magdeburg', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/ost-bau-osterburger-strassen-tief-und-hochbau-gmbh/werkstudent-gn-hochbau-schwerpunkt-kalkulation-arbeitsvorbereitung-magdeburg-180683', '<p><strong>Was wir Dir bieten:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Einblicke und Aufgaben in verschiedenen Projekten im Bereich Hochbau</li>\n<li>Einen zentralen Arbeitsplatz und ein dynamisches Team an unserem Standort Magdeburg</li>\n<li>Flexible Arbeitszeitgestaltung passend zu deinem Studium</li>\n<li>Berufliche Perspektive für den Berufseinstieg als Kalkulator/in oder weitere Positionen</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Deine Aufgaben:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Du unterstützt unser Team vorrangig in der Kalkulation und Mengenermittlung, ergänzend in der Abrechnungsvorbereitung, Baustellendokumentation und Bauleitung.</li>\n<li>Du führst eigenständig Mengenermittlungen aus Planunterlagen und Leistungsverzeichnissen durch, erstellst Voraufmaße und einfache Aufmaßunterlagen.</li>\n<li>Du unterstützt die Dokumentation von Baustellen, z.B. Foto- und Mengendokumentation.</li>\n<li>Du unterstützt die Bauleitung und Kalkulation bei organisatorischen und technischen Aufgaben, übernimmst kleinere Kalkulationsrechnungen und Preisermittlungen.</li>\n<li>Du sorgst für die nachvollziehbare Aufbereitung und strukturierte Ablage von Unterlagen.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Was Du mitbringen solltest:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Du bist eingeschriebene/r Student/in im Bereich Bauingenieurwesen und hast Lust, praktische Erfahrungen in einem Bauunternehmen zu sammeln.</li>\n<li>Du arbeitest engagiert, selbstständig und bist ein Teamplayer mit einer offenen, kommunikativen Art.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/\">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', '<p><strong>Was wir Dir bieten:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Einblicke und Aufgaben in verschiedenen Projekten im Bereich Hochbau</li>\n<li>Einen zentralen Arbeitsplatz und ein dynamisches Team an unserem Standort Magdeburg</li>\n<li>Flexible Arbeitszeitgestaltung passend zu deinem Studium</li>\n<li>Berufliche Perspektive für den Berufseinstieg als Kalkulator/in oder weitere Positionen</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Deine Aufgaben:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Du unterstützt unser Team vorrangig in der Kalkulation und Mengenermittlung, ergänzend in der Abrechnungsvorbereitung, Baustellendokumentation und Bauleitung.</li>\n<li>Du führst eigenständig Mengenermittlungen aus Planunterlagen und Leistungsverzeichnissen durch, erstellst Voraufmaße und einfache Aufmaßunterlagen.</li>\n<li>Du unterstützt die Dokumentation von Baustellen, z.B. Foto- und Mengendokumentation.</li>\n<li>Du unterstützt die Bauleitung und Kalkulation bei organisatorischen und technischen Aufgaben, übernimmst kleinere Kalkulationsrechnungen und Preisermittlungen.</li>\n<li>Du sorgst für die nachvollziehbare Aufbereitung und strukturierte Ablage von Unterlagen.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Was Du mitbringen solltest:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Du bist eingeschriebene/r Student/in im Bereich Bauingenieurwesen und hast Lust, praktische Erfahrungen in einem Bauunternehmen zu sammeln.</li>\n<li>Du arbeitest engagiert, selbstständig und bist ein Teamplayer mit einer offenen, kommunikativen Art.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/\">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-29 01:39:49.454', '2026-06-29 01:39:49.454', '', '', '', 'Europe', '', 'Arbeitnow', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/ost-bau-osterburger-strassen-tief-und-hochbau-gmbh/werkstudent-gn-hochbau-schwerpunkt-kalkulation-arbeitsvorbereitung-magdeburg-180683', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/ost-bau-osterburger-strassen-tief-und-hochbau-gmbh/werkstudent-gn-hochbau-schwerpunkt-kalkulation-arbeitsvorbereitung-magdeburg-180683', '[{\"url\":\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/ost-bau-osterburger-strassen-tief-und-hochbau-gmbh/werkstudent-gn-hochbau-schwerpunkt-kalkulation-arbeitsvorbereitung-magdeburg-180683\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL),
(1843, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Junior Ailance Ailance Application Support Specialist (m/w/d)', '2B Advice GmbH', 'Bonn', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/2b-advice-gmbh/junior-ailance-ailance-application-support-specialist-bonn-151809', '<p>2B Advice entwickelt mit Ailance eine moderne SaaS-Plattform für Datenschutz, Governance, Risk und Compliance. Unsere Kunden nutzen Ailance, um komplexe Prozesse, Daten, Workflows, Nachweise und Berichte im Alltag steuerbar zu machen.</p>\n<p>Für unser Team in Bonn suchen wir eine strukturierte, kommunikative und technisch interessierte Person, die unsere Kunden im täglichen Umgang mit Ailance unterstützt. Du bist erste Anlaufstelle für Supportanfragen, analysierst Probleme sauber, hilfst bei Standardfragen und wächst Schritt für Schritt tiefer in unsere Plattform, Konfiguration und Supportprozesse hinein.</p>\n<p>Diese Rolle passt zu dir, wenn du Software verstehen willst, gerne mit Kunden arbeitest und Probleme nicht nur weiterleitest, sondern sauber einordnest, dokumentierst und lösungsorientiert bearbeitest. hritt für Schritt tiefer in Produkt, Konfiguration und Lösungslogik hineinwächst.</p>\n<h2>Aufgaben</h2>\n<p>Du bearbeitest Supportanfragen unserer Kunden über Tickets, E-Mail und Telefon und sorgst dafür, dass Anliegen schnell, freundlich und nachvollziehbar geklärt werden.</p>\n<p>Du nimmst Anfragen strukturiert auf, stellst die richtigen Rückfragen, priorisierst Fälle und dokumentierst alle wichtigen Informationen sauber im Ticketsystem.</p>\n<p>Du unterstützt Kunden bei typischen Anwendungsthemen rund um Ailance, zum Beispiel bei Nutzerfragen, Rollen und Berechtigungen, Formularen, Ansichten, Workflows, Reports, Dokumenten und Grundeinstellungen.</p>\n<p>Du reproduzierst gemeldete Probleme, prüfst, ob es sich um Bedienungsfragen, Konfigurationsthemen, technische Störungen oder mögliche Bugs handelt, und bereitest komplexere Fälle für das Solution-Builder-, Produkt- oder Entwicklungsteam vor.</p>\n<p>Nach der Einarbeitung übernimmst du einfache Konfigurations- und Analyseaufgaben selbst und hilfst dabei, wiederkehrende Fragen in FAQ, Wissensartikeln und internen Supportleitfäden zu dokumentieren.</p>\n<p>Du arbeitest eng mit Solution Buildern, Produktmanagement und Entwicklung zusammen und unterstützt bei Tests, Release-Vorbereitungen und Hypercare-Phasen nach Kundeneinführungen.</p>\n<h2>Qualifikation</h2>\n<p>Du hast eine abgeschlossene Ausbildung, ein Studium oder erste praktische Erfahrung im Bereich IT, Software, SaaS, Kundenservice, Fachinformatik, Wirtschaftsinformatik, Datenschutz, Compliance oder Application Support.</p>\n<p>Auch Berufseinsteiger sind willkommen, wenn du strukturiert arbeitest, schnell lernst und technische Zusammenhänge klar erklären kannst.</p>\n<p>Du brauchst keine Programmiererfahrung. Wichtig sind analytisches Denken, sorgfältige Dokumentation, Serviceorientierung und die Fähigkeit, Probleme ruhig und systematisch einzugrenzen.</p>\n<p>Hilfreich sind erste Kenntnisse in Webanwendungen, Ticketsystemen, Microsoft 365, Rollen-/Rechtekonzepten, Datenstrukturen, Workflows oder SaaS-Produkten.</p>\n<p>Du kommunizierst sicher auf Deutsch und kannst auch englische Kundenanfragen oder interne technische Informationen verstehen und bearbeiten.</p>\n<p>Du arbeitest zuverlässig, fragst nach, wenn etwas unklar ist, und hast Lust, Ailance Schritt für Schritt wirklich zu verstehen.</p>\n<h2>Benefits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Du arbeitest an einer modernen SaaS-Plattform in einem wachsenden Unternehmen mit eigener Produktentwicklung.</li>\n<li>Du erhältst eine intensive Einarbeitung in Ailance, Supportprozesse, Datenschutz, Governance und Integrated Risk Management.</li>\n<li>Du hast klare Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten vom Application Support in Richtung 2nd Level Support, Product Support oder Solution Building.</li>\n<li>Dich erwarten 30 Urlaubstage, mobiles Arbeiten nach der Einarbeitung, ein moderner Arbeitsplatz in Bonn, hochwertige IT-Ausstattung und ein starkes Team mit kurzen Entscheidungswegen.</li>\n<li>Zusätzlich bieten wir ein attraktives Gehaltspaket mit Perspektive, betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Jobticket, monatliche 50-Euro-Aral-Supercard und regelmäßige Teamevents.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Wenn du Software nicht nur bedienen, sondern wirklich verstehen willst, bist du bei uns richtig. Wir suchen jemanden, der Kundenfragen ernst nimmt, sauber denkt und mit uns einen professionellen SaaS-Support für Ailance weiter aufbaut.</p>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/\">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', '<p>2B Advice entwickelt mit Ailance eine moderne SaaS-Plattform für Datenschutz, Governance, Risk und Compliance. Unsere Kunden nutzen Ailance, um komplexe Prozesse, Daten, Workflows, Nachweise und Berichte im Alltag steuerbar zu machen.</p>\n<p>Für unser Team in Bonn suchen wir eine strukturierte, kommunikative und technisch interessierte Person, die unsere Kunden im täglichen Umgang mit Ailance unterstützt. Du bist erste Anlaufstelle für Supportanfragen, analysierst Probleme sauber, hilfst bei Standardfragen und wächst Schritt für Schritt tiefer in unsere Plattform, Konfiguration und Supportprozesse hinein.</p>\n<p>Diese Rolle passt zu dir, wenn du Software verstehen willst, gerne mit Kunden arbeitest und Probleme nicht nur weiterleitest, sondern sauber einordnest, dokumentierst und lösungsorientiert bearbeitest. hritt für Schritt tiefer in Produkt, Konfiguration und Lösungslogik hineinwächst.</p>\n<h2>Aufgaben</h2>\n<p>Du bearbeitest Supportanfragen unserer Kunden über Tickets, E-Mail und Telefon und sorgst dafür, dass Anliegen schnell, freundlich und nachvollziehbar geklärt werden.</p>\n<p>Du nimmst Anfragen strukturiert auf, stellst die richtigen Rückfragen, priorisierst Fälle und dokumentierst alle wichtigen Informationen sauber im Ticketsystem.</p>\n<p>Du unterstützt Kunden bei typischen Anwendungsthemen rund um Ailance, zum Beispiel bei Nutzerfragen, Rollen und Berechtigungen, Formularen, Ansichten, Workflows, Reports, Dokumenten und Grundeinstellungen.</p>\n<p>Du reproduzierst gemeldete Probleme, prüfst, ob es sich um Bedienungsfragen, Konfigurationsthemen, technische Störungen oder mögliche Bugs handelt, und bereitest komplexere Fälle für das Solution-Builder-, Produkt- oder Entwicklungsteam vor.</p>\n<p>Nach der Einarbeitung übernimmst du einfache Konfigurations- und Analyseaufgaben selbst und hilfst dabei, wiederkehrende Fragen in FAQ, Wissensartikeln und internen Supportleitfäden zu dokumentieren.</p>\n<p>Du arbeitest eng mit Solution Buildern, Produktmanagement und Entwicklung zusammen und unterstützt bei Tests, Release-Vorbereitungen und Hypercare-Phasen nach Kundeneinführungen.</p>\n<h2>Qualifikation</h2>\n<p>Du hast eine abgeschlossene Ausbildung, ein Studium oder erste praktische Erfahrung im Bereich IT, Software, SaaS, Kundenservice, Fachinformatik, Wirtschaftsinformatik, Datenschutz, Compliance oder Application Support.</p>\n<p>Auch Berufseinsteiger sind willkommen, wenn du strukturiert arbeitest, schnell lernst und technische Zusammenhänge klar erklären kannst.</p>\n<p>Du brauchst keine Programmiererfahrung. Wichtig sind analytisches Denken, sorgfältige Dokumentation, Serviceorientierung und die Fähigkeit, Probleme ruhig und systematisch einzugrenzen.</p>\n<p>Hilfreich sind erste Kenntnisse in Webanwendungen, Ticketsystemen, Microsoft 365, Rollen-/Rechtekonzepten, Datenstrukturen, Workflows oder SaaS-Produkten.</p>\n<p>Du kommunizierst sicher auf Deutsch und kannst auch englische Kundenanfragen oder interne technische Informationen verstehen und bearbeiten.</p>\n<p>Du arbeitest zuverlässig, fragst nach, wenn etwas unklar ist, und hast Lust, Ailance Schritt für Schritt wirklich zu verstehen.</p>\n<h2>Benefits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Du arbeitest an einer modernen SaaS-Plattform in einem wachsenden Unternehmen mit eigener Produktentwicklung.</li>\n<li>Du erhältst eine intensive Einarbeitung in Ailance, Supportprozesse, Datenschutz, Governance und Integrated Risk Management.</li>\n<li>Du hast klare Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten vom Application Support in Richtung 2nd Level Support, Product Support oder Solution Building.</li>\n<li>Dich erwarten 30 Urlaubstage, mobiles Arbeiten nach der Einarbeitung, ein moderner Arbeitsplatz in Bonn, hochwertige IT-Ausstattung und ein starkes Team mit kurzen Entscheidungswegen.</li>\n<li>Zusätzlich bieten wir ein attraktives Gehaltspaket mit Perspektive, betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Jobticket, monatliche 50-Euro-Aral-Supercard und regelmäßige Teamevents.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Wenn du Software nicht nur bedienen, sondern wirklich verstehen willst, bist du bei uns richtig. Wir suchen jemanden, der Kundenfragen ernst nimmt, sauber denkt und mit uns einen professionellen SaaS-Support für Ailance weiter aufbaut.</p>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/\">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-29 01:39:57.651', '2026-06-29 01:39:57.651', '', '', '', 'Europe', '', 'Arbeitnow', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/2b-advice-gmbh/junior-ailance-ailance-application-support-specialist-bonn-151809', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/2b-advice-gmbh/junior-ailance-ailance-application-support-specialist-bonn-151809', '[{\"url\":\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/2b-advice-gmbh/junior-ailance-ailance-application-support-specialist-bonn-151809\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL),
(1844, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'AI Product Engineer - Internal Tools & Automation (m/w/d)', 'Lyto Brands Group', 'Düsseldorf', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/lyto-brands-group/ai-product-engineer-internal-tools-automation-dusseldorf-373777', '<p>Baue KI-gestützte Tools und Automationen, die unsere Marketing-, Creative-, Operations- und Engineering-Teams 10x schneller und besser machen. Dabei setzt du auf unserer proprietären Plattform Lyto.OS auf und entwickelst diese gemeinsam mit unserem Tech Team kontinuerlich weiter.</p>\n<h2>Aufgaben</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Du findest Automatisierungs- und KI-Chancen im ganzen Unternehmen – im direkten Austausch mit den Teams, nah am echten Workflow statt am Whiteboard.</li>\n<li>Du baust KI-gestützte Workflows für Marketing &#x26; Creative: Briefing-Generierung, Copy Review, Asset-QA und Ad-Performance-Summaries – entlang unseres Trend-to-Product-Zyklus von unter einer Woche.</li>\n<li>Du entwickelst Quality-Assurance- und Anomalie-Erkennungs-Tooling für unsere proprietäre Plattform LYTO.OS.</li>\n<li>Du shippst leichtgewichtige interne Agents, die repetitive Arbeit übernehmen – damit Menschen sich auf das konzentrieren, was wirklich sie braucht.</li>\n<li>Du verantwortest interne Operations-Automation end-to-end: Reporting-Pipelines, Approval Flows und systemübergreifende Daten-Syncs über unsere 15 Microservices.</li>\n<li>Du scopest, priorisierst, baust, shippst und iterierst – eigenverantwortlich, mit kurzem Weg von Idee zu Produktion.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Qualifikation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Du bist ein exzellenter Engineer und baust Software, die in Produktion echte Last trägt – sauber, pragmatisch, ohne Bloat.</li>\n<li>Unser Stack (PHP/Laravel &#x26; Python, Vue/React, MySQL, Docker, DigitalOcean) ist dir vertraut oder du eignest ihn dir mühelos an.</li>\n<li>Du hast LLM-Systeme nicht nur gebaut, sondern produktiv betrieben, mit allem, was das real bedeutet: Kosten, Latenz, Evals, Fehlerfälle, Monitoring.</li>\n<li>Hands-on Erfahrung mit Claude Code, dem Anthropic Agent SDK oder Multi-Step-AI-Agents in Produktion</li>\n<li>Du erweiterst AI-Tooling über MCPs und eigene Integrationen gegen reale Datenquellen</li>\n<li>Tiefe in LLM-Workflows: Prompt Engineering, Tool Use, Structured Outputs, RAG – und das Urteilsvermögen, das richtige Werkzeug für das jeweilige Problem zu wählen.</li>\n<li>Du denkst unternehmerisch und produktgetrieben: Du sprichst mit Nutzern, hinterfragst Anforderungen, schneidest Scope konsequent und unterscheidest KI-Spielerei von echtem Business-Impact.</li>\n<li>Du willst Ownership end-to-end, in einem kleinen, senioren Team, das mehr shipped als die meisten 20-Personen-Teams.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Benefits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Greenfield-Scope: Du definierst, was gebaut wird – auf Basis echter Team-Bedürfnisse, nicht vorgegebener Tickets.</li>\n<li>Direkter Zugang zu allen Funktionen: Marketing, Ops, Creative und Engineering – du arbeitest mit allen, statt isoliert im Silo.</li>\n<li>Kleines Team, schnelle Entscheidungen, echter Impact ab Woche eins.</li>\n<li>Zusammenarbeit &#x26; Spaß: ein ambitioniertes Team, das Humor, Kreativität und gemeinsame Erlebnisse schätzt – mit regelmäßigen Team-Events und Retreats.</li>\n<li>Hybrides Arbeiten aus unserem 400 m² Loft-Büro in Düsseldorf.</li>\n<li>Urban Sports Club Mitgliedschaft.</li>\n<li>Wettbewerbsfähige Vergütung.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Wir freuen uns über deine Bewerbung. Es ist kein Anschreiben notwendig. Bitte beschreibe uns kurz, warum du mit uns arbeiten möchtest und wo du einen Unterschied machst.</p>\n<p>Find more <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', '<p>Baue KI-gestützte Tools und Automationen, die unsere Marketing-, Creative-, Operations- und Engineering-Teams 10x schneller und besser machen. Dabei setzt du auf unserer proprietären Plattform Lyto.OS auf und entwickelst diese gemeinsam mit unserem Tech Team kontinuerlich weiter.</p>\n<h2>Aufgaben</h2>\n<