s aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate</li><li> Elit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur</li><li> Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse <br><br></li></ul>contact us here<br/><br/>Please mention the word **GLITZ** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-06-30 01:43:10.455', '2026-06-30 01:43:10.455', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-warehouse-officer-coactum-rpe-1134235', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-warehouse-officer-coactum-rpe-1134235', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-warehouse-officer-coactum-rpe-1134235\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
