something from Lemon should be visible where our buyers and candidates already are, until the market treats us as the category leader.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">This is a senior IC role, reporting directly to the founder. You\'ll personally do most of the writing and build systems for distribution.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">This is an intensive role. You\'ll be producing daily and running a content distribution engine that doesn\'t stop. And while we\'d typically expect 4+ years of experience, we\'re genuinely open to less experienced candidates who can demonstrate exceptional writing and judgment.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">Responsibilities:</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">1. Executive Communications</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Lead the creation and execution of founders\' personal brand platforms</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Produce and distribute day-to-day content across founders\' channels</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Support founders\' earned media: podcasts, panels, op-eds, and speaking opportunities</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">2. Internal News Scouting and Narrative Development</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Sit in product, customer success, sales, and ops syncs to identify newsworthy stories</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Identify and shape company moments worth telling publicly</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Translate internal milestones, launches, learnings, and customer wins into external content</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Distribute content via social and traditional media.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">3. Team Engagement</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Build and support an internal content program that engages employees across functions</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Equip team members to share their work publicly through ready-to-use content and templates</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Coordinate the team\'s participation in industry conversations across channels</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">4. Monitoring, Automation</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Build and maintain content and distribution workflows using AI tools</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Set up monitoring for brand mentions, press coverage, and audience growth across channels</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Track, grow and report on key communications metrics quarterly</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">What we\'re looking for:</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Native or fluent English with cultural fluency for the US tech audience</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- A genuinely strong writer. </span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- You\'ve been the voice behind someone else\'s posts. </span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Track record telling the story of a company, a product, or a movement</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Background in technology, B2B software, talent, recruiting, dev tools, or adjacent industries.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- You’re deeply immersed in the world of independent media: Substackers, podcasters, influencers on X or LinkedIn. </span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- AI is already part of how you work.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Comfortable operating in areas of genuine uncertainty.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Results-oriented, with a bias toward action and impact.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Want to be part of a small, fast-paced, and impactful team.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">What success looks like in the first 4 weeks:</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- You\'ve built systems to capture content from our team and product, and to manufacture news.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- You\'ve launched an amplification program by the team and outside voices, so every message travels.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- A repurposing workflow exists: one idea becomes a post, a thread, a clip, a newsletter line, without starting over each time.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- You\'ve identified the 3 to 5 narratives that everyone will repeat.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- You\'ve identified a few internal voices and enabled them to post regularly, with systems that feed them content ideas.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- By week 4, the founder\'s social posts go out 4 to 5 times a week.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Baseline metrics captured, so growth is measurable from a known starting point.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">Application Process</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">To apply, send us:</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Three writing samples that show range. At least one should be in a voice that isn\'t yours: something you ghost-wrote for an executive, a founder, or another public-facing operator.  </span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- A short note (200 words or fewer) telling us why this role and what you\'d want to ship in your first 90 days. The point isn\'t to summarize your resume. It\'s to give us a sense of how you think and what you\'d actually do.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"border-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(72, 65, 63);   font-weight: bold;\">What to expect:</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Application review within 7 days</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- 45-minute call with the hiring team</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Paid trial project (up to 10 hours)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Final 60-minute conversation with the founder</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">- Reference checks and offer</span><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><br style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \"><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 65, 63);  \">We aim to move from application to offer within 3-4 weeks.</span>\n<img src=\"https://remotive.com/job/track/2090985/blank.gif?source=public_api\" alt=\"\"/>', 'new', NULL, '2026-07-01 13:45:09.361', '2026-07-01 13:45:09.361', '', 'full_time', 'Remote', 'United States', '', 'Remotive', 'API', 'READY', 'Web%20Developer', '', '', 'api', 'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/communications/communications-manager-2090985', 'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/communications/communications-manager-2090985', '[{\"url\":\"https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/communications/communications-manager-2090985\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '',