nables everyone to belong, contribute, succeed, and demonstrate their full potential.<br><br>Are you being referred to one of our roles? If so, ask your connection at Yokogawa<br><br>about our Employee Referral process!<br/><br/>Please mention the word **PRUDENT** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', 'new', NULL, '2026-07-07 13:40:40.956', '2026-07-07 13:40:40.956', '', '', 'Remote', 'Europe', '', 'RemoteOK', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-get-yokogawa-1134535', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-get-yokogawa-1134535', '[{\"url\":\"https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-get-yokogawa-1134535\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
