ole Team- und Office-Events</p>\n<p>Find <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/\">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', 'new', NULL, '2026-07-08 01:40:43.539', '2026-07-08 01:40:43.539', '', '', '', 'Europe', '', 'Arbeitnow', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/soley-gmbh/werkstudentin-marketing-munich-152197', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/soley-gmbh/werkstudentin-marketing-munich-152197', '[{\"url\":\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/soley-gmbh/werkstudentin-marketing-munich-152197\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL);
