Antwort auf folgende drei Fragen:</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>Warum möchtest du bei We are SAVVY arbeiten?</li>\n<li>Was bedeutet für dich Ownership im Arbeitsalltag?</li>\n<li>Worauf bist du in deinem bisherigen Berufsleben besonders stolz?</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Find more <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>', 'new', NULL, '2026-07-08 01:42:46.353', '2026-07-08 01:42:46.353', '', '', '', 'Europe', '', 'Arbeitnow', 'API', 'READY', '', '', '', 'api', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/we-are-savvy/pr-und-social-media-manager-in-teilzeit-20-32h-frankfurt-am-main-390194', 'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/we-are-savvy/pr-und-social-media-manager-in-teilzeit-20-32h-frankfurt-am-main-390194', '[{\"url\":\"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/we-are-savvy/pr-und-social-media-manager-in-teilzeit-20-32h-frankfurt-am-main-390194\",\"type\":\"applyUrl\"}]', 'pending', '', NULL),
(2373, NULL, 'api', NULL, 'Lifeguard', 'Accor', 'Bardez,', 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-lifeguard-accor-1134547', '<strong>Company Description<br><br></strong>\"Why work for Accor?<br><br>We are far more than a worldwide leader. We welcome you as you are and you can find a job and brand that matches your personality. We support you to grow and learn every day, making sure that work brings purpose to your life, so that during your journey with us, you can continue to explore Accorâs limitless possibilities.<br><br>By joining Accor, every chapter of your story is yours to write and together we can imagine tomorrow\'s hospitality. Discover the life that awaits you at Accor, visit https://careers.accor.com/<br><br>Do what you love, care for the world, dare to challenge the status quo! #BELIMITLESS\"<br><br><strong>Job Description<br><br></strong><ul><li>Monitor pool areas and enforce safety rules to prevent accidents</li><li>Respond quickly and effectively to emergency situations</li><li>Perform water rescues and administer first aid and CPR when necessary</li><li>Maintain a clean and safe pool environment</li><li>Conduct regular equipment checks and report any issues</li><li>Assist with basic pool maintenance tasks</li><li>Interact professionally with guests and address their concerns</li><li>Participate in ongoing training to maintain and improve lifeguarding skills</li><li>Educate patrons about water safety and pool rules</li><li>Work collaboratively with other staff members to ensure a positive guest experience</li></ul><br/><br/>Please mention the word **FINEST** and tag RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTU5LjE5OC42Ni4xNjM=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they\'re human.', '<strong>Company Description<br><br></strong>\"Why work for Accor?<br><br>We are far more than a worldwide leader. We welcome you as you are a