ies independently.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000\">Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\";\"></p><p><strong>What you can expect:</strong></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000\">Make a global impact. Help shape how millions of people discover and book ground transportation worldwide. </span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000\">Own your work. Take responsibility from day one and see the direct impact of your contributions. </span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000\">Build with the best AI assistance models available. </span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000\">Work with industry leaders. Our partners include </span><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://Booking.com\">Booking.com</a><span style=\"color: #000000\">, Google Maps, Amtrak, Deutsche Bahn, Renfe, and SNCF. </span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"color: #000000\">Grow with exceptional people. Join an international team that will challenge, support, and inspire you every day.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\";\"></p><p><strong>Our hiring team for this role:</strong><br /><span style=\"color: #000000\">Your Talent Partner and point of contact is </span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000\">Juan Cruz Palau</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000\">, and the Hiring Manager (HM) i</span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000\">s</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color: #121317\">Darakshan Jahan.</span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000\">For any queries, please reach out to your Talent Partner at (</span><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" ---------- style=\"color: #000000\">).</span><br /></p><p style=\";\"></p><p><em>Do you want to work on a product that is used by millions of people daily with a high load, availability, scalability and the most advanced technology? </em>Come join us!</p><p>Find <a h